le":"操作"},{"parent":"534db56b-f647-416e-8399-fabf84d96e8a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b32205e7-e3f1-4e74-8364-6f617937dd9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"23271eb9-19c6-4b35-985a-8aa271c9df99","title":"1) 列表展示 ｜ 附件显示在输入框附件区并随消息发出"},{"parent":"b32205e7-e3f1-4e74-8364-6f617937dd9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"befdb365-4722-4797-bacd-989792df3313","title":"2) 按钮状态 ｜ 会话详情中附件卡片可点击查看"},{"parent":"b32205e7-e3f1-4e74-8364-6f617937dd9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c328455-9301-418c-90cd-4299c8cfe030","title":"3) 结果回传 ｜ Agent 基于附件内容回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b32205e7-e3f1-4e74-8364-6f617937dd9b","title":"预期"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"534db56b-f647-416e-8399-fabf84d96e8a","title":"🔴【P0】引用文件后发送〔NU-102〕"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"95a30d1d-1b29-40d0-ad64-6d37b7194fe2","title":"正常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"931bab09-a9f6-49cc-b798-2de547bf622e","title":"文件引用"},{"parent":"a008fc98-9638-4854-bfba-0361296dd697","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"82d825fa-a7e3-45a4-84f5-d1f9bb1c3dd7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"57cc8a6f-63d7-4591-a407-b17f57d2d076","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3cdd5230-ab91-4173-8d3c-1e5166df1c1f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1dd9a832-742d-4bd6-8e8c-21c41b2b8dea","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc4e2956-9296-4015-bb30-6a43d6a294e6","title":"进入房间，所选 Agent 可用；角色：房间成员；入口：连接器菜单"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1dd9a832-742d-4bd6-8e8c-21c41b2b8dea","title":"前置"},{"parent":"3cdd5230-ab91-4173-8d3c-1e5166df1c1f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"96ba70bf-63d9-4a2c-a987-27ab788dd8e4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3bd7c9e6-8789-4cf4-b101-d6863fcdb4fd","title":"1. 点击输入框下方连接器图标，查看列表；本地、云端分支分别核验。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"96ba70bf-63d9-4a2c-a987-27ab788dd8e4","title":"操作"},{"parent":"3cdd5230-ab91-4173-8d3c-1e5166df1c1f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b5a3687a-c639-414a-9196-fdb72ad02057","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"abadd0ce-e87b-4147-a2bb-9b42c28514be","title":"1) 列表展示 ｜ 列表顶部标明来源电脑"},{"parent":"b5a3687a-c639-414a-9196-fdb72ad02057","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dec44672-c47b-4419-8f24-b42045cc026e","title":"2) 权限授权 ｜ 未安装项显示安装，已安装未授权项显示授权，已就绪项提供启用开关"},{"parent":"b5a3687a-c639-414a-9196-fdb72ad02057","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"48463b9f-af90-486c-add9-3b7bd7daa371","title":"3) 结果校验 ｜ 底部提供查看更多连接器。条目与所选 Agent 及来源一致，不固定种类和数量"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b5a3687a-c639-414a-9196-fdb72ad02057","title":"预期"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3cdd5230-ab91-4173-8d3c-1e5166df1c1f","title":"🟠【P1】首次打开连接器列表〔NU-103〕"},{"parent":"57cc8a6f-63d7-4591-a407-b17f57d2d076","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f6b40b18-e98a-4d10-8e3f-af162b22fae2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e07e1218-d1bd-4a8e-b5e6-628e713d1722","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"36da1feb-2085-4f33-ad05-5e2337c960d3","title":"目标连接器未安装，所选 Agent 可用；具有目标服务账号和有权访问的测试数据；角色：房间成员；入口：连接器菜单"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e07e1218-d1bd-4a8e-b5e6-628e713d1722","title":"前置"},{"parent":"f6b40b18-e98a-4d10-8e3f-af162b22fae2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cf599b51-6fdc-4186-9bf6-b2c33b7a979c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"682f51fe-39f3-4c1d-93b5-8dce9ff54d81","title":"1. 从输入框连接器菜单点击安装，等待完成；需授权时点击授权，在第三方浏览器页面完成；返回启用连接器，发送需要读取该测试数据的请求并查看工具调用详情。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cf599b51-6fdc-4186-9bf6-b2c33b7a979c","title":"操作"},{"parent":"f6b40b18-e98a-4d10-8e3f-af162b22fae2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e2fbaf7d-2f7c-4a54-8525-b8977379a549","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eee73bb0-a56a-456a-a872-edc4fae25968","title":"1) 提示文案 ｜ 点击安装后直接开始，不要求先经过安装说明弹窗"},{"parent":"e2fbaf7d-2f7c-4a54-8525-b8977379a549","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ee85b0c1-a097-4138-a0c2-c0740c371c9c","title":"2) 副作用 ｜ 过程状态明确，重复点击不重复安装"},{"parent":"e2fbaf7d-2f7c-4a54-8525-b8977379a549","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e5b086d-a09f-4fad-83d9-8b789d37b764","title":"3) 权限授权 ｜ 需授权时提供授权入口并打开对应第三方页"},{"parent":"e2fbaf7d-2f7c-4a54-8525-b8977379a549","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2ebf98d8-9b7f-47bf-a005-65508e4606c4","title":"4) 权限授权 ｜ 完成后更新状态并可启用，安装不等于授权"},{"parent":"e2fbaf7d-2f7c-4a54-8525-b8977379a549","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"01a8e44a-9bfc-4d59-8c40-0b6d1191c858","title":"5) 跳转定位 ｜ Agent 成功调用该连接器并返回真实结果"},{"parent":"e2fbaf7d-2f7c-4a54-8525-b8977379a549","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3b5f9b3a-d7f3-444a-838e-f2d991890b84","title":"6) 结果校验 ｜ 工具调用详情中可见对该连接器的调用记录与参数"},{"parent":"e2fbaf7d-2f7c-4a54-8525-b8977379a549","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3d67b5f2-f17f-45c5-97d3-41c772aa3c44","title":"7) 结果校验 ｜ 任务正常完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e2fbaf7d-2f7c-4a54-8525-b8977379a549","title":"预期"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f6b40b18-e98a-4d10-8e3f-af162b22fae2","title":"🔴【P0】连接器安装授权启用至首次读取完整链路〔NU-104〕"},{"parent":"57cc8a6f-63d7-4591-a407-b17f57d2d076","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9c9dcf76-c40e-4317-b01a-acb3abe358e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9b4bbf07-cdf1-43c1-a08a-63bdeb307d1b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae6e732e-4deb-4155-b733-1d054facd8a9","title":"某连接器已授权但开关处于关闭；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9b4bbf07-cdf1-43c1-a08a-63bdeb307d1b","title":"前置"},{"parent":"9c9dcf76-c40e-4317-b01a-acb3abe358e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8c950b5f-954e-4590-ae3d-aebfd685c2af","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ffc54068-6efc-4a9c-848e-668e0e8a9c0c","title":"1. 发送同一条需要该连接器的任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8c950b5f-954e-4590-ae3d-aebfd685c2af","title":"操作"},{"parent":"9c9dcf76-c40e-4317-b01a-acb3abe358e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1f1a2d7d-ea31-4e3b-b56a-94196a59276d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"696afabb-488e-4f66-b26c-242526604beb","title":"1) 提示文案 ｜ Agent 不调用该连接器并明确说明该能力当前不可用或需先开启"},{"parent":"1f1a2d7d-ea31-4e3b-b56a-94196a59276d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e7ae8052-cb6d-4018-bd9d-168cfb00d406","title":"2) 结果校验 ｜ 不出现调用后长时间无响应"},{"parent":"1f1a2d7d-ea31-4e3b-b56a-94196a59276d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"53bd761d-3af6-429f-816b-9a495b912857","title":"3) 提示文案 ｜ 提示中指向开启该连接器的入口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1f1a2d7d-ea31-4e3b-b56a-94196a59276d","title":"预期"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9c9dcf76-c40e-4317-b01a-acb3abe358e3","title":"🟠【P1】关闭后 Agent 不再调用该连接器〔NU-105〕"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"57cc8a6f-63d7-4591-a407-b17f57d2d076","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"82d825fa-a7e3-45a4-84f5-d1f9bb1c3dd7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6a911e29-6e23-47fb-a41b-24ada7c2da42","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2ffcf728-5f89-4016-821e-75499e09d9ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8391015e-c86e-410f-af99-a84b5fdf43c3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f5cb9b34-b936-44f8-8a51-0dcac0b53a1d","title":"连接器已安装，处于授权进行中状态；角色：房间成员；入口：连接器菜单"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8391015e-c86e-410f-af99-a84b5fdf43c3","title":"前置"},{"parent":"2ffcf728-5f89-4016-821e-75499e09d9ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"87ef58bc-3d03-4e3f-b416-bd74080a8c51","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"08a6f347-9836-41e2-94ea-93c7e9d105f6","title":"1. 在应用内点击授权取消按钮或授权弹窗右上角关闭，再重新发起授权。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"87ef58bc-3d03-4e3f-b416-bd74080a8c51","title":"操作"},{"parent":"2ffcf728-5f89-4016-821e-75499e09d9ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"898fb587-407c-44a5-aa50-7065683783a3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6da626cb-80da-46aa-839f-99bf7a41c853","title":"1) 权限授权 ｜ 本次授权终止，连接器回到需要授权状态，不被误启用"},{"parent":"898fb587-407c-44a5-aa50-7065683783a3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1991e94a-031c-47ec-ab3e-e27c854fd411","title":"2) 权限授权 ｜ 可以重新发起授权。此条不包含仅关闭外部网页后的自动结束规则"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"898fb587-407c-44a5-aa50-7065683783a3","title":"预期"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2ffcf728-5f89-4016-821e-75499e09d9ac","title":"🟡【P2】取消连接器授权后可重新发起〔NU-106〕"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6a911e29-6e23-47fb-a41b-24ada7c2da42","title":"异常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"82d825fa-a7e3-45a4-84f5-d1f9bb1c3dd7","title":"连接器菜单"},{"parent":"a008fc98-9638-4854-bfba-0361296dd697","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"01511064-952b-47fc-ad19-2feec2c2581a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6b0bdde6-e97b-4d81-af51-aa1187499f3a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"30647484-2e06-4158-8e7c-b9c030bb86da","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e4693671-7c07-4a4f-89f2-425a19617d84","cal