],"id":"089a6347-b47b-4a90-9cc9-0148fbbbb1b5","title":"5) 输入框 ｜ 手动选择后显示正确项目名和选中状态"},{"parent":"89af67cb-57be-4723-b2a5-03e1a715deef","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"28ac138e-995d-491c-a3d3-8393ad427e91","title":"6) 上下文 ｜ Agent在所选目录执行，读取的测试文件内容一致；会话归入对应项目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"89af67cb-57be-4723-b2a5-03e1a715deef","title":"预期"},{"parent":"fe9fa132-0139-4be4-9279-cc58c5fb66f0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1323fe06-fbbb-4f2b-b62a-b33e2c4277cf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e80fa4b-a0fc-4313-ac3d-3ad76d1998f8","title":"已定口径：新建后需手动选择；原文自动选中规则不套用此本地流程。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1323fe06-fbbb-4f2b-b62a-b33e2c4277cf","title":"备注"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fe9fa132-0139-4be4-9279-cc58c5fb66f0","title":"🔴【P0】本地新建项目至首个项目会话完整链路〔NU-111〕"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"686d40d0-d9ac-4b1b-b407-55c5a91f856b","title":"正常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"29ee729f-9d3d-40eb-8e10-f9f3f964bc7b","title":"本地新建项目"},{"parent":"75a94da9-3f65-46db-8129-150ecc1818dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4e5d6200-f6bb-4f5a-b6c9-e203f23605c7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ab9430d9-cf5d-493a-9c72-83d46e035c99","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a471d0a2-7495-4afb-9ea5-6842d731a2f4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"71ccca3c-7929-41d4-bf61-aa4bfbcc6c66","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5e2e3984-33f5-4a5a-bfd8-1c3d2015c14d","title":"本地房间电脑在线且有可访问的测试目录；云端差异分支准备当前用户创建的云端目录；角色：房间成员；入口：关联项目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"71ccca3c-7929-41d4-bf61-aa4bfbcc6c66","title":"前置"},{"parent":"a471d0a2-7495-4afb-9ea5-6842d731a2f4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"51ba9390-c92c-4fa0-a830-c05dccfa5d8f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5a4a4b83-28f5-4327-8a2f-a790a3f88f44","title":"1. 本地主干从关联项目入口浏览、搜索或手动录入目录，选择并确认；云端分支从工作区选择自己的云端目录并确认。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"51ba9390-c92c-4fa0-a830-c05dccfa5d8f","title":"操作"},{"parent":"a471d0a2-7495-4afb-9ea5-6842d731a2f4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3449cbdb-f137-4167-af11-a4f4b5dd991c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b3c02535-b239-4156-9373-c0f900f66b1f","ti