ollapsed":true,"id":"f24d842c-26f8-45cd-bdd7-b5e3d1b51748","title":"操作"},{"parent":"7518506a-dba8-4eb4-82e1-b49a8ae068ca","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"148d07c1-4a63-4fb9-9b55-8e0e800529b5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4aaf9617-ea72-4544-b130-7757adcb6c7b","title":"1) 提示文案 ｜ 弹窗标题为“从本地/GitHub 导入”，说明将已有项目带入当前 Room"},{"parent":"148d07c1-4a63-4fb9-9b55-8e0e800529b5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b784e956-aa77-410e-b6ec-a194f426012c","title":"2) 提示文案 ｜ 展示 GitHub 与本地文件夹两个渠道，GitHub 说明支持公开或私有代码仓库"},{"parent":"148d07c1-4a63-4fb9-9b55-8e0e800529b5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7a30d9d1-a23c-4e47-a335-35d17bf8f9f5","title":"3) 跳转定位 ｜ 返回和关闭入口可见。不按原文旧“压缩包”描述预设此处要求上传 .tar.gz"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"148d07c1-4a63-4fb9-9b55-8e0e800529b5","title":"预期"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7518506a-dba8-4eb4-82e1-b49a8ae068ca","title":"🟠【P1】云端导入渠道入口〔NU-113〕"},{"parent":"2f39f3ab-18cd-42ce-b7ce-e6e9e7a3c146","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"907728c7-e094-4c5c-85f7-7cd78157138f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1d203ed9-49df-436c-be6a-9067784e0f7d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"14dfd949-d8ff-4815-a698-1b48ea74eb7f","title":"云端房间允许当前成员导入项目；本机有专用测试文件夹；同房间成员B的Agent可用；文件尚未另行分享或发布成产物；角色：房间成员；入口：从本地/GitHub 导入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1d203ed9-49df-436c-be6a-9067784e0f7d","title":"前置"},{"parent":"907728c7-e094-4c5c-85f7-7cd78157138f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0657225c-5ea8-4c6e-a1de-f6280df0424c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e8a3cd3-a7d1-45d6-9fd8-d8a133cbc888","title":"1. 选择本地文件夹渠道，查看未选择状态，通过系统选择器选测试目录，填写项目名称后导入；完成后在房间资产全部文件查找并打开目录；成员B查看同一项目并让自己的Agent读取已知测试文件。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0657225c-5ea8-4c6e-a1de-f6280df0424c","title":"操作"},{"parent":"907728c7-e094-4c5c-85f7-7cd78157138f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dea5fa2a-f214-4ace-b353-77dbf8de8e63","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a70ffeae-5bdf-41d7-a46b-af19b7fed04e","title":"1) 列表展示 ｜ 本地导入页有未选择状态、选择文件夹、项目名称和导入文件夹入口"},{"parent":"dea5fa2a-f214-4ace-b353-77dbf8de8e63","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"af7aa11a-2aa8-4c07-b44e-b34d233a5be4","title":"2) 按钮状态 ｜ 未选目录时导入按钮置灰"},{"parent":"dea5fa2a-f214-4ace-b353-77dbf8de8e63","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"78aad572-9896-40b8-a929-c560148a3f5d","title":"3) 提示文案 ｜ 说明文件夹内容直接导入项目，项目名称可独立修改"},{"parent":"dea5fa2a-f214-4ace-b353-77dbf8de8e63","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"62456c8b-0248-4dff-aca3-f19c382dcc81","title":"4) 跳转定位 ｜ 选择文件夹调用系统文件夹选择器"},{"parent":"dea5fa2a-f214-4ace-b353-77dbf8de8e63","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"815c6ac7-30b8-4008-9423-f2b40dbcc8e2","title":"5) 归属与顺序 ｜ 导入完成后项目出现在全部文件的room目录，名称与项目一致"},{"parent":"dea5fa2a-f214-4ace-b353-77dbf8de8e63","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4959211a-1b9f-49c7-806b-21d202be1ea9","title":"6) 可见范围 ｜ 仅导入不自动出现在Agent产物或已分享文件；同房间成员无需额外授权即可查看"},{"parent":"dea5fa2a-f214-4ace-b353-77dbf8de8e63","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6ba6185a-5b4a-4b8b-ae59-0652712b2c30","title":"7) 结果回传 ｜ 成员B自己的可用Agent可以读取导入项目，内容与测试文件一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dea5fa2a-f214-4ace-b353-77dbf8de8e63","title":"预期"},{"parent":"907728c7-e094-4c5c-85f7-7cd78157138f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"65a8c00b-d764-422d-84f8-725f1302a833","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0d84d65a-cd4b-47eb-916c-7d05c022464f","title":"已定口径：当前本地导入选择文件夹，不套用旧压缩包限制；只覆盖已明确的完成结果，不添加传输上限、失败清理或GitHub历史规则。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"65a8c00b-d764-422d-84f8-725f1302a833","title":"备注"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"907728c7-e094-4c5c-85f7-7cd78157138f","title":"🔴【P0】本地文件夹导入至归集和成员读取完整链路〔NU-114〕"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2f39f3ab-18cd-42ce-b7ce-e6e9e7a3c146","title":"正常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e6372be2-d86f-4ccc-b9c8-d038bc3ce772","title":"从本地/GitHub 导入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"75a94da9-3f65-46db-8129-150ecc1818dd","title":"项目侧栏"}],"id":"6ae8aaed-77af-4cbb-8db1-cd6b8ad98c8e","title":"房间"},{"parent":"c2b82107-c0e1-4db2-b244-534818432d60","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8737d33f-5380-4a9f-aa35-7ea246af3486","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"26d75b8c-cda4-491f-9628-7101e99cbdff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"783f63de-62e6-45b6-8b90-75bf39d316e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ef23fad2-56a7-4a4d-a9e5-cbd226bfe79c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f5e2fcd2-b761-433b-8d23-dce93829584b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6726ea50-6257-47fa-bf2d-896a435d1b89","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"792762a8-6db1-47c8-9800-df0625f4f7c2","title":"新用户已登录，设备未安装或连接Computer；角色：账号所有者；入口：本地房间配置→连接电脑"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6726ea50-6257-47fa-bf2d-896a435d1b89","title":"前置"},{"parent":"f5e2fcd2-b761-433b-8d23-dce93829584b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dacdf251-0be2-494d-bf67-7bba9e7e3834","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1aa7fd26-625b-42dc-ab69-3a204dc28d6d","title":"1. 查看空态，打开连接引导，按当前设备支持的方式安装Computer；完成登录授权并返回本地房间配置。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dacdf251-0be2-494d-bf67-7bba9e7e3834","title":"操作"},{"parent":"f5e2fcd2-b761-433b-8d23-dce93829584b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"993b0292-c90f-45b4-a0fc-8c6fae282dca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"39c955ee-fd16-4323-9df8-449bc2fe5a23","title":"1) 提示文案 ｜ 空态说明“Agent 直接在电脑上运行，能用电脑里的文件和工具”，显示“先连接你的电脑”“连接后，电脑上的 Agent 会显示在这里。”"},{"parent":"993b0292-c90f-45b4-a0fc-8c6fae282dca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"984eef39-dab4-4034-9b38-3f59bd04fecd","title":"2) 按钮状态 ｜ 提供“连接电脑”入口并打开“连接这台电脑”引导"},{"parent":"993b0292-c90f-45b4-a0fc-8c6fae282dca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9c745bcf-2b1a-4f26-bd26-ed75d5443db6","title":"3) 列表展示 ｜ 当前引导提供macOS（Apple芯片）和Windows（x64）选项，以及交给已有Agent安装、手动在终端安装的说明；按设备选择，不跨系统套用命令"},{"parent":"993b0292-c90f-45b4-a0fc-8c6fae282dca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"317dffc9-85b9-4d10-80ea-f46e5c56b189","title":"4) 权限授权 ｜ 安装后完成产品账号登录授权，连接归属当前账号"},{"parent":"993b0292-c90f-45b4-a0fc-8c6fae282dca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bbe61f89-19ce-4ac4-8163-a887f8860417","title":"5) 设备状态 ｜ 返回后显示正确设备名称；当前操作设备显示“当前电脑”，连通设备显示在线"},{"parent":"993b0292-c90f-45b4-a0fc-8c6fae282dca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d3e8ce74-1fc4-4ce8-9d82-17e76f4ec398","title":"6) 列表展示 ｜ 设备卡片展示本地Agent区域，未登录或未就绪状态不等同于设备未连接"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"993b0292-c90f-45b4-a0fc-8c6fae282dca","title":"预期"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f5e2fcd2-b761-433b-8d23-dce93829584b","title":"🔴【P0】未连接电脑时从本地入口完成连接〔NU-115〕"},{"parent":"ef23fad2-56a7-4a4d-a9e5-cbd226bfe79c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"35965033-b73e-4547-a474-087570c3313f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"700cef83-0836-4d0b-b64d-939fad5a93c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0ce6e1d8-3f1d-44b5-b826-9feef249da00","title":"Computer已安装；另准备已授权连接的设备；角色：账号所有者；入口：本地房间配置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"700cef83-0836-4d0b-b64d-939fad5a93c0","title":"前置"},{"parent":"35965033-b73e-4547-a474-087570c3313f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"667b05ed-9b89-44a0-9fbc-539713db5dce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"534aa5b9-7982-4c12-b64c-e7b75d005d31","title":"1. 进入我的Agent，检查已有设备；对已安装未连接设备继续登录授权，已连接设备直接查看Agent区域。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"667b05ed-9b89-44a0-9fbc-539713db5dce","title":"操作"},{"parent":"35965033-b73e-4547-a474-087570c3313f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f902f020-d781-48d3-8d3b-93a069f275d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"25eacc14-9c7d-4ade-9910-85c267ffd3c6","title":"1) 设备状态 ｜ 正确识别已有设备和连接状态；已连接在线设备可继续准备Agent"},{"parent":"f902f020-d781-48d3-8d3b-93a069f275d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5896f071-79a2-43d0-8ce1-efe8ea625bab","title":"2) 安装状态 ｜ 不将重新安装Computer作为已安装设备的强制前置"},{"parent":"f902f020-d781-48d3-8d3b-93a069f275d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0798302d-d178-4e7d-b89a-9dd38869c64d","title":"3) 权限授权 ｜ 已有有效授权可复用，缺少授权时完成当前账号连接，不串账号"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f902f020-d781-48d3-8d3b-93a069f275d1","title":"预期"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"35965033-b73e-4547-a474-087570c3313f","title":"🟠【P1】已安装或已连接Computer时识别并复用〔NU-116〕"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ef23fad2-56a7-4a4d-a9e5-cbd226bfe79c","title":"正常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"783f63de-62e6-45b6-8b90-75bf39d316e9","title":"连接电脑"},{"parent":"26d75b8c-cda4-491f-9628-7101e99cbdff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"718c883d-6efe-43a5-9037-c03b25acd062","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2aa76194-11fc-454e-937c-b036cc320358","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9a3103a2-8c74-485b-b14a-cfe498e53c09","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"81e9de4a-8156-4377-b07c-1dbe6fd71e05","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7de90873-8f2e-46a3-ad46-6a0db452a6fe","title":"Computer在线；目标为当前支持本地使用的Agent，持对应官方账号；角色：账号所有者；入口：本地房间配置→目标Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"81e9de4a-8156-4377-b07c-1dbe6fd71e05","title":"前置"},{"parent":"9a3103a2-8c74-485b-b14a-cfe498e53c09","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"093dfea9-4066-4db9-8646-06745387fbac","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cdecb96e-6272-445f-8b32-2fe8e4915f61","title":"1. 检查目标Agent是否已安装；已安装则复用；尚未安装时按经确认的本地接入流程准备，完成后从登录入口授权，返回并进入对应本地房间发送消息。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"093dfea9-4066-4db9-8646-06745387fbac","title":"操作"},{"parent":"9a3103a2-8c74-485b-b14a-cfe498e53c09","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c48874ff-7e39-4af9-8050-3bb7fa8d5096","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2d78c051-b5f8-4b54-8e8c-5d32eb6a9c9d","title":"1) 安装状态 ｜ 已安装Agent被识别并复用，不要求重复安装；未就绪时不显示为已可用"},{"parent":"c48874ff-7e39-4af9-8050-3bb7fa8d5096","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8dd6ce8a-6bf2-46c3-91b2-bd00345a876d","title":"2) 列表展示 ｜ 当前页面Claude Code及WorkBuddy未登录时显示“登录后即可使用”和登录入口；Codex按实际官方订阅状态展示"},{"parent":"c48874ff-7e39-4af9-8050-3bb7fa8d5096","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cfc911de-a140-4350-bb2b-e4d932db41f4","title":"3) 登录状态 ｜ 对实际支持官方账号的目标Agent完成对应授权，返回后更新正确账号及登录状态"},{"parent":"c48874ff-7e39-4af9-8050-3bb7fa8d5096","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"113e5a70-7133-4431-abbe-953809103071","title":"4) 跳转定位 ｜ 按“房间”章节创建或进入关联本地房间，选择已准备好的Agent"},{"parent":"c48874ff-7e39-4af9-8050-3bb7fa8d5096","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"03aa0677-10dd-4186-85ed-97426dcaa5b8","title":"5) 结果回传 ｜ 首次对话或任务获得回复；不能把Computer在线等同于Agent已完成登录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c48874ff-7e39-4af9-8050-3bb7fa8d5096","title":"预期"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9a3103a2-8c74-485b-b14a-cfe498e53c09","title":"🔴【P0】本地Agent识别及官方登录至首次使用〔NU-117〕"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2aa76194-11fc-454e-937c-b036cc320358","title":"正常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"718c883d-6efe-43a5-9037-c03b25acd062","title":"安装与官方账号"},{"parent":"26d75b8c-cda4-491f-9628-7101e99cbdff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3ae48fa3-a2ab-4f22-a78b-8e805fe75bb1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bb1b45f2-a1a0-400b-99f7-c915de04fbdd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"65aa20e5-f470-4aca-b406-eb4ee48c6caa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0106ed35-37cd-44ca-afcd-4555d697e6b2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6b04322e-aef1-42ab-b975-6220126e9b14","title":"Computer在线；角色：账号所有者；入口：本地房间配置→Agent区域"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0106ed35-37cd-44ca-afcd-4555d697e6b2","title":"前置"},{"parent":"65aa20e5-f470-4aca-b406-eb4ee48c6caa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8b46bcd8-9c46-4dd4-a402-760f24eead9e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f34ffdee-de36-40b7-952a-70df4128382f","title":"1. 查看当前可用Agent与即将支持说明。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8b46bcd8-9c46-4dd4-a402-760f24eead9e","title":"操作"},{"parent":"65aa20e5-f470-4aca-b406-eb4ee48c6caa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"be46509a-d419-42cb-b734-f517c09387db","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"80aef139-670a-449a-b04b-660c9a40a53f","title":"1) 列表展示 ｜ 当前即将支持说明包含Grok Build、OpenCode、Hermes Agent、Antigravity、DSH"},{"parent":"be46509a-d419-42cb-b734-f517c09387db","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc02a235-63a2-46cc-a3f1-af594a27d4fa","title":"2) 可用状态 ｜ 即将支持的条目不按已接入、可登录、可首次使用进行断言；不套用云端接入入口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"be46509a-d419-42cb-b734-f517c09387db","title":"预期"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"65aa20e5-f470-4aca-b406-eb4ee48c6caa","title":"🟡【P2】本地即将支持列表不进入当前使用链〔NU-118〕"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bb1b45f2-a1a0-400b-99f7-c915de04fbdd","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3ae48fa3-a2ab-4f22-a78b-8e805fe75bb1","title":"支持范围"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"26d75b8c-cda4-491f-9628-7101e99cbdff","title":"本地房间配置"},{"parent":"8737d33f-5380-4a9f-aa35-7ea246af3486","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"749a1f7c-5d54-4a44-82b0-ec80b14a8f0f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"27a4442a-424b-4f44-92ec-e8231dcd67ea","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dd67f247-4742-4586-939d-1feb910127d8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dc464500-ce65-4e6e-828f-6c78487d2238","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"af93b8db-a334-494d-87c5-f67c649989bb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a6475339-93f7-46ae-a7ba-25c0751377ca","title":"新用户已登录，尚无已连接Computer；角色：账号所有者；入口：云端房间配置→连接电脑"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"af93b8db-a334-494d-87c5-f67c649989bb","title":"前置"},{"parent":"dc464500-ce65-4e6e-828f-6c78487d2238","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b86b7b51-ad8b-4e04-aa9c-b3cb57838598","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f6b1d040-aea7-4372-a257-8e7d53d86bf1","title":"1. 检查云端空态并打开连接引导；安装Computer、登录授权后返回云端配置。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b86b7b51-ad8b-4e04-aa9c-b3cb57838598","title":"操作"},{"parent":"dc464500-ce65-4e6e-828f-6c78487d2238","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"49e5dccd-8eb3-4e58-89b4-3626c67faf56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"02badf03-9235-47e2-97dc-428ae0f83eb8","title":"1) 提示文案 ｜ 空态说明“让本地 Agent 与同伴在云端实时协作”，通过电脑上的Agent开始任务、账号和凭据留在本地"},{"parent":"49e5dccd-8eb3-4e58-89b4-3626c67faf56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e0fe3186-722c-47a9-9aa2-9ff57ea1c342","title":"2) 按钮状态 ｜ 提供“连接电脑”，进入Computer连接引导"},{"parent":"49e5dccd-8eb3-4e58-89b4-3626c67faf56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"638482f2-5198-4148-9f86-62c7531b35f3","title":"3) 等价性 ｜ 安装与账号授权复用本地连接主干，设备支持和命令按引导核验"},{"parent":"49e5dccd-8eb3-4e58-89b4-3626c67faf56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"db824d5c-e121-4915-ad1a-41bcd5370110","title":"4) 设备状态 ｜ 成功后设备卡片显示名称、当前电脑标识及在线状态"},{"parent":"49e5dccd-8eb3-4e58-89b4-3626c67faf56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd168eff-8b29-46de-bffa-39f3c7e5e945","title":"5) 列表展示 ｜ 云端配置说明Agent在电脑独立空间运行；展示云端Agent区域，不用本地列表替代"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"49e5dccd-8eb3-4e58-89b4-3626c67faf56","title":"预期"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dc464500-ce65-4e6e-828f-6c78487d2238","title":"🔴【P0】未连接电脑时从云端入口完成连接〔NU-119〕"},{"parent":"dd67f247-4742-4586-939d-1feb910127d8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b261f5f5-d502-4e23-8290-8eb0dcdd36a3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"84aabfd9-774c-4f84-a78b-d2bd6e04dcd8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4fa58dc-8f7f-4432-bbd6-d878328e8fdd","title":"Computer已连接在线，本地存在Agent或官方登录态；角色：账号所有者；入口：云端房间配置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"84aabfd9-774c-4f84-a78b-d2bd6e04dcd8","title":"前置"},{"parent":"b261f5f5-d502-4e23-8290-8eb0dcdd36a3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f159f5fb-44b8-4f22-9200-89d35a006446","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e380d41f-aaba-4d41-99be-ba9a355da04a","title":"1. 切换至云端配置检查同一电脑及云端Agent状态。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f159f5fb-44b8-4f22-9200-89d35a006446","title":"操作"},{"parent":"b261f5f5-d502-4e23-8290-8eb0dcdd36a3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9deae20c-3624-4e36-85c4-602c7e96dea9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"35f66688-3259-4075-96d9-f1c9b5306708","title":"1) 设备状态 ｜ 复用已连接设备，不强制重复安装Computer"},{"parent":"9deae20c-3624-4e36-85c4-602c7e96dea9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3e0734a2-523a-4562-bd41-d5a14b46830c","title":"2) 环境隔离 ｜ 云端Agent安装、账号及可用方式按云端状态展示，不因本地已登录就推定云端已就绪"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9deae20c-3624-4e36-85c4-602c7e96dea9","title":"预期"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b261f5f5-d502-4e23-8290-8eb0dcdd36a3","title":"🟠【P1】云端复用已连接电脑并单独识别Agent〔NU-120〕"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dd67f247-4742-4586-939d-1feb910127d8","title":"正常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"27a4442a-424b-4f44-92ec-e8231dcd67ea","title":"连接电脑"},{"parent":"749a1f7c-5d54-4a44-82b0-ec80b14a8f0f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c1037350-ec54-48e7-8574-7a6a37cf10e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ffb83c51-8c7f-41bc-a3d7-a7f1ebb37e95","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6c1c7132-d5e8-4fd3-98eb-61e65112ce87","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"346d6a5a-5ede-4ce3-9df3-c297408823ff","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0d500a85-d9a5-422c-98a3-0b280ac68018","title":"Computer在线；目标属于当前提供接入入口的Agent且还没添加；角色：账号所有者；入口：云端房间配置→接入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"346d6a5a-5ede-4ce3-9df3-c297408823ff","title":"前置"},{"parent":"6c1c7132-d5e8-4fd3-98eb-61e65112ce87","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"03eef182-4b6f-450d-b5f1-6e2f097f6b37","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3f99cdd0-907f-4a82-8d3c-0277b91162dc","title":"1. 以grok、Hermes或antigravity中的一个为主干，点击接入，依页面完成所需操作，查看过程反馈及完成状态，再进入该Agent支持的使用方式准备。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"03eef182-4b6f-450d-b5f1-6e2f097f6b37","title":"操作"},{"parent":"6c1c7132-d5e8-4fd3-98eb-61e65112ce87","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"08958072-a49d-4172-aef3-bf73208ab046","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4ef118fb-a5db-4888-a11b-18fec0ffe586","title":"1) 列表展示 ｜ 未添加时展示“还没添加”和对应“接入”入口"},{"parent":"08958072-a49d-4172-aef3-bf73208ab046","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3b05ee8-30b0-499f-bd7d-845bcbcdf831","title":"2) 归属与顺序 ｜ 接入操作对应所选电脑及所选Agent，不作用于其他条目"},{"parent":"08958072-a49d-4172-aef3-bf73208ab046","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0548261f-bd42-483e-883d-279e2a0e2bce","title":"3) 安装状态 ｜ 过程中反馈当前状态；完成后更新为已接入状态，不能提前显示完成"},{"parent":"08958072-a49d-4172-aef3-bf73208ab046","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"75365a15-e56b-494d-a010-60aab88c7655","title":"4) 可用状态 ｜ 接入成功与登录/使用方式就绪分别判断；完成接入后继续官方账号或支持的积分准备路径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"08958072-a49d-4172-aef3-bf73208ab046","title":"预期"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6c1c7132-d5e8-4fd3-98eb-61e65112ce87","title":"🔴【P0】云端接入目标Agent至可准备使用方式〔NU-121〕"},{"parent":"ffb83c51-8c7f-41bc-a3d7-a7f1ebb37e95","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"945ca35e-a02c-4683-8a09-926e6560eeb0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6d83d830-0a21-4e39-bec2-b7fcec8b788d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"41a878ee-d091-4725-a129-7c458699707a","title":"Computer在线，目标云端Agent已接入；角色：账号所有者；入口：云端房间配置→Agent区域"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6d83d830-0a21-4e39-bec2-b7fcec8b788d","title":"前置"},{"parent":"945ca35e-a02c-4683-8a09-926e6560eeb0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"31ab05e8-5b0f-4d64-abf7-f551315ab3b9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f79cfd2b-f608-4ea5-8b95-0e1718b14afb","title":"1. 刷新或重新进入配置页，查看已有Agent并继续准备其使用方式。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"31ab05e8-5b0f-4d64-abf7-f551315ab3b9","title":"操作"},{"parent":"945ca35e-a02c-4683-8a09-926e6560eeb0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"26f54e58-34f5-4d88-8da1-81