84f6b51be330","title":"🔴【P0】选择 WorkBuddy 并发送任务","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"8c497292-cd60-41a0-9a20-a15e89dc1d14","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4522d5dc-a6c0-48ec-aee0-72e392ee5a79","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e31bbd1-2cbc-4611-ad00-93bc69e1419d","title":"前置：账号所有者进入共享管理"},{"parent":"4522d5dc-a6c0-48ec-aee0-72e392ee5a79","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c902dab-817e-4d81-af78-ab8ddec8aef4","title":"操作：打开指定房间的 WorkBuddy 共享开关"},{"parent":"4522d5dc-a6c0-48ec-aee0-72e392ee5a79","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"30a0fbaa-0909-430e-9afa-bd022abc307f","title":"预期：开关持久化；房间成员可看到并使用 WorkBuddy；未共享房间不可见。<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4522d5dc-a6c0-48ec-aee0-72e392ee5a79","title":"🔴【P0】共享 WorkBuddy 到房间","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8c497292-cd60-41a0-9a20-a15e89dc1d14","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"fa8aaab3-45b7-4d8f-87ef-116cad74862b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dafddfb1-9e20-4dcf-8f5a-c5e2325d1d84","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8b36229a-c53f-4fa0-b851-ae82bf3ead7c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6097405f-1cc6-4d6e-aabf-9e008cfefd3e","title":"前置：成员未被授权使用 WorkBuddy"},{"parent":"8b36229a-c53f-4fa0-b851-ae82bf3ead7c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fda55bbb-a26e-4fda-afdc-90399160d1a3","title":"操作：进入房间并尝试选择或发送任务"},{"parent":"8b36229a-c53f-4fa0-b851-ae82bf3ead7c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"02d66ab4-224d-4d38-867f-5df6b1575206","title":"预期：WorkBuddy 不可见或不可选；不创建任务；提示权限不足。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8b36229a-c53f-4fa0-b851-ae82bf3ead7c","title":"🟠【P1】未共享成员调用 WorkBuddy","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"dafddfb1-9e20-4dcf-8f5a-c5e2325d1d84","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6e4d1ab6-d880-444b-8b4e-060c26a9c91e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1e7dc6ab-44cf-441d-a2c2-99e7221eb714","title":"前置：模拟共享接口失败"},{"parent":"6e4d1ab6-d880-444b-8b4e-060c26a9c91e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c3f8d63-d05b-41fe-9b4d-23ff230b7458","title":"操作：修改 WorkBuddy 房间共享开关"},{"parent":"6e4d1ab6-d880-444b-8b4e-060c26a9c91e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"678cd42c-b4e8-4941-a8a2-237c2019eabb","title":"预期：提示保存失败；开关回滚为服务端状态；共享数量不错误增加或减少。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6e4d1ab6-d880-444b-8b4e-060c26a9c91e","title":"🟠【P1】共享配置保存失败","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"dafddfb1-9e20-4dcf-8f5a-c5e2325d1d84","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bd0cda4c-f595-47ec-ac37-de9320d71478","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0ebe51f0-a130-4255-af3b-c77d64d69433","title":"前置：房间内 WorkBuddy 正在执行任务"},{"parent":"bd0cda4c-f595-47ec-ac37-de9320d71478","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8a1cd8d3-59dd-4433-92e0-0533a06bb30b","title":"操作：取消任务或断开 Computer 网络"},{"parent":"bd0cda4c-f595-47ec-ac37-de9320d71478","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"48086797-bdf3-4d47-8342-6b04141b31fc","title":"预期：会话状态明确收敛；不展示假成功；日志和已产生的产物按产品定义保留。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bd0cda4c-f595-47ec-ac37-de9320d71478","title":"🟠【P1】WorkBuddy 执行中取消或断网"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dafddfb1-9e20-4dcf-8f5a-c5e2325d1d84","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"fa8aaab3-45b7-4d8f-87ef-116cad74862b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"93d36268-5e9b-424f-81ac-7ce8026e7f00","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1f2f82d5-a9d6-44d3-821e-f6639812bd10","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"84df53df-2d41-408b-bd6a-f3cb913acdaa","title":"前置：多人房间已共享 WorkBuddy"},{"parent":"1f2f82d5-a9d6-44d3-821e-f6639812bd10","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"18dde64a-ae0f-4f82-8ecc-4a0e871ce200","title":"操作：多个成员同时发送任务"},{"parent":"1f2f82d5-a9d6-44d3-821e-f6639812bd10","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dbff85b2-43dc-498d-a4de-217243960775","title":"预期：成员、消息、回复和额度归属准确；不串会话、不重复执行。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1f2f82d5-a9d6-44d3-821e-f6639812bd10","title":"🟡【P2】多人同时调用 WorkBuddy"},{"parent":"93d36268-5e9b-424f-81ac-7ce8026e7f00","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0dd77a1f-59f5-4f75-859e-e4be818ba3ff","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e1bc37d-d317-411a-9604-fa2606e3a9