\n1) 持久化 ｜ B 刷新后出现该电脑\n2) 持久化 ｜ 实时同步则无需刷新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"871e8378-8d04-4dc3-b1db-ca9038bfafb3","title":"🔴【P0】多标签页同步","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"8dd98b7a-9595-4804-8696-30fc75c55acc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ad67e781-4e02-4d78-b3ad-4ee644aa74ef","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"03f6ed84-0cd3-450a-a70a-6cb78d1419a7","title":"前置：账号下已绑定 Computer；角色：账号所有者与其他房间成员；入口：电脑页与房间"},{"parent":"ad67e781-4e02-4d78-b3ad-4ee644aa74ef","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bcfb9264-43aa-49a2-895f-ab0f5602bde2","title":"操作：账号 A 绑定的电脑，用账号 B 登录查看"},{"parent":"ad67e781-4e02-4d78-b3ad-4ee644aa74ef","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"57ccfeef-96f1-474f-8253-a6106b6ea902","title":"预期：\n1) 设备状态 ｜ 账号 B 看不到账号 A 的电脑，电脑 ID 不可跨账号使用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ad67e781-4e02-4d78-b3ad-4ee644aa74ef","title":"🔴【P0】账号隔离","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"8dd98b7a-9595-4804-8696-30fc75c55acc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8d5bc042-be9d-4510-99b7-58a51cf7ce3e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"14c862a4-8b16-45c4-9aea-13a7d59e7553","title":"前置：账号下已绑定 Computer；角色：账号所有者与其他房间成员；入口：电脑页与房间"},{"parent":"8d5bc042-be9d-4510-99b7-58a51cf7ce3e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d73465e1-6049-4897-b8c9-67d83fbf0dd3","title":"操作：房间内其他成员打开电脑页"},{"parent":"8d5bc042-be9d-4510-99b7-58a51cf7ce3e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b7a67a2e-de3d-4c29-8640-bf3d426765c8","title":"预期：\n1) 绑定授权 ｜ 只看到自己账号绑定的设备，看不到我的任何 Computer，包括名称、电脑 ID 与重启升级解绑等操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8d5bc042-be9d-4510-99b7-58a51cf7ce3e","title":"🔴【P0】只能看到自己账号绑定的 Computer","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"8dd98b7a-9595-4804-8696-30fc75c55acc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"90c907cc-1636-49a5-9bc7-ec3623710a6c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0e612586-3319-4a98-a106-1044eeade0b6","title":"前置：账号下已绑定 Computer；角色：账号所有者与其他房间成员；入口：电脑页与房间"},{"parent":"90c907cc-1636-49a5-9bc7-ec3623710a6c","callout