个区块里"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e0160441-b290-401c-99a6-6fe26c035324","title":"🔴【P0】我共享的展示我已安装的 Agent"},{"parent":"7170b387-b126-4fe3-ab0b-901d5d73fdaa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f3a7aec8-b4b0-478a-a97c-efae7b887450","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8a487252-9b91-4df7-afde-3c8ba75fe10b","title":"前置：我已安装的 Agent 从未开启过共享；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：分享 Agent 页"},{"parent":"f3a7aec8-b4b0-478a-a97c-efae7b887450","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c839b196-c346-4b41-a3ad-3bd661998d36","title":"操作：查看各条的开关状态"},{"parent":"f3a7aec8-b4b0-478a-a97c-efae7b887450","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c60f380b-d5a3-4a63-806d-8be8e9d1e32d","title":"预期：<br>1) 按钮状态 ｜ 开关默认为关闭<br>2) 绑定授权 ｜ 关闭状态下其他成员看到的是请求共享状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f3a7aec8-b4b0-478a-a97c-efae7b887450","title":"🔴【P0】开关的默认状态"},{"parent":"7170b387-b126-4fe3-ab0b-901d5d73fdaa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ed35ed48-f1b0-4e82-a72f-5a70e71f565a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0306883a-47a7-48f3-ac2a-64bd4cae1e12","title":"前置：我的某个 Agent 已安装且已登录；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：分享 Agent 页的我共享的"},{"parent":"ed35ed48-f1b0-4e82-a72f-5a70e71f565a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5f958568-1d8e-4403-995d-7c5e2338f40c","title":"操作：打开该 Agent 的共享开关"},{"parent":"ed35ed48-f1b0-4e82-a72f-5a70e71f565a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e5cb2d02-c0cc-4177-9049-a091214b87ef","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 开关可正常打开并保持为开启态\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 房间内其他成员的列表中该 Agent 进入共享 Agent 分组\n3) 可用状态 ｜ 电脑在线时其他成员侧状态变为可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ed35ed48-f1b0-4e82-a72f-5a70e71f565a","title":"🔴【P0】已登录后可开启共享"},{"parent":"7170b387-b126-4fe3-ab0b-901d5d73fdaa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"207ab715-5fdb-433e-aa52-48a80118ece8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2eee2fcf-15e7-4d49-b6c2-e6d9498d79f5","title":"前置：成员 B 已开启两个 Agent 的共享；角色：房间成员；入口：分享 Agent 页"},{"parent":"207ab715-5fdb-433e-aa52-48a80118ece8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d48fd62a-4ac5-42e2-bbc1-9d1157bca416","title":"操作：查看「共享给我的」区块"},{"parent":"207ab715-5fdb-433e-aa52-48a80118ece8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ba90eaf3-a22e-