8133-f9d8ee0e235c","title":"操作：我关闭该 Agent 的共享开关，成员 B 观察其页面"},{"parent":"99a14440-10fc-4d62-acd2-054ccd4ef7d8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5aa3303-88f2-4b86-a35b-982d05ce9bac","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 该 Agent 从成员 B 的共享给我的区块中移除\n2) 性能 ｜ 实时生效，不需要刷新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"99a14440-10fc-4d62-acd2-054ccd4ef7d8","title":"🟠【P1】关闭共享后从他人页面移除"},{"parent":"7170b387-b126-4fe3-ab0b-901d5d73fdaa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1bfa0aef-0b4e-410a-ad20-4898621a1a86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f1742d89-3278-4347-869a-cdf9bab74fdd","title":"前置：共享给我的区块中有多条 Agent；角色：房间成员；入口：分享 Agent 页"},{"parent":"1bfa0aef-0b4e-410a-ad20-4898621a1a86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a46b8f16-87d3-41b7-8866-9bd003754ce1","title":"操作：查看并尝试操作这些条目"},{"parent":"1bfa0aef-0b4e-410a-ad20-4898621a1a86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"38d399f4-2930-4d18-801b-bb90983662e8","title":"预期：<br>1) 权限授权 ｜ 不提供开关，我不能替别人关闭或开启共享<br>2) 列表展示 ｜ 纯展示，显示{xxx} 的 {Agent} 和设备名"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1bfa0aef-0b4e-410a-ad20-4898621a1a86","title":"🟠【P1】共享给我的条目不可操作"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"7170b387-b126-4fe3-ab0b-901d5d73fdaa","title":"正常场景","summaries":[]},{"parent":"8136d43d-f9f5-4e8f-81f5-8b6b24b04fa9","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"d2ce2491-0431-4994-be25-303ae7460f33","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2893153c-db4a-40da-9466-f33d2cc4d6da","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e098ace-f897-4bb0-a528-f5958401d1c3","title":"前置：我的某个 Agent 已安装但未登录；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：分享 Agent 页的我共享的"},{"parent":"2893153c-db4a-40da-9466-f33d2cc4d6da","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5cefdf91-68c2-4639-b3de-cbe549b2be0f","title":"操作：尝试打开该 Agent 的共享开关"},{"parent":"2893153c-db4a-40da-9466-f33d2cc4d6da","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9231f078-453d-43c5-8620-7d195787e76b","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 开关置灰不可打开\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 说明需要先完成登录，与未安装的提示可区分"},{"parent":"2893153c-db4a-40da-9466-f33d2cc4d6da","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a23efe8b-befa-4d9c-8cb1-9c98852f725b","title":"备注：输入框上方的 Agent 列表展示房间内成员的 Agent，分「我的 Agent」「共享 Agent」「其他」三组；他人的 Agent 需要已安装才展示，我自己的 Agent 只要已添加 Computer 就展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2893153c-db4a-40da-9466-f33d2cc4d6da","title":"🔴【P0】未登录时不能开启共享"},{"parent":"d2ce2491-0431-4994-be25-303ae7460f33","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2ed9def1-e572-4592-9a6b-52e7db9bb1a0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fdc50841-44a5-4ab2-a942-fbbe3d30e223","title":"前置：我已添加 Computer 但一个 Agent 都没安装；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：分享 Agent 页"},{"parent":"2ed9def1-e572-4592-9a6b-52e7db9bb1a0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a6791a90-8ec9-4348-8aee-c2eab5f5c10e","title":"操作：查看「我共享的」区块"},{"parent":"2ed9def1-e572-4592-9a6b-52e7db9bb1a0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4629893f-df92-4ae7-84f9-8c41f17e7032","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 展示空态并说明需要先安装 Agent\n2) 跳转定位 ｜ 空态里提供去电脑页的入口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2ed9def1-e572-4592-9a6b-52e7db9bb1a0","title":"🔴【P0】未安装时我共享的为空"},{"parent":"d2ce2491-0431-4994-be25-303ae7460f33","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1e3ae279-6095-4e85-b420-9f584c75e050","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"964895f0-0965-49eb-868f-e432066599f8","title":"前置：我没有添加任何 Computer；角色：房间成员；入口：分享 Agent 页"},{"parent":"1e3ae279-6095-4e85-b420-9f584c75e050","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2bfa51a1-be19-4611-b678-c49f74df0f84","title":"操作：进入分享 Agent 页查看"},{"parent":"1e3ae279-6095-4e85-b420-9f584c75e050","customWidth":449.4,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e72b6bd0-cf7d-41ad-9747-1c38319c3030","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 我共享的区块展示空态并引导去添加 Computer\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 共享给我的区块不受影响，仍展示他人已共享的 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1e3ae279-6095-4e85-b420-9f584c75e050","title":"🔴【P0】未添加 Computer 时的分享页"},{"parent":"d2ce2491-0431-4994-be25-303ae7460f33","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"727c6378-5e45-435b-9c0d-5e25fc9e9f40","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8f6fee24-ba7f-41fe-ae88-f4c03527a2cc","title":"前置：房间内没有任何成员开启共享；角色：房间成员；入口：分享 Agent 页"},{"parent":"727c6378-5e45-435b-9c0d-5e25fc9e9f40","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"83c880ee-ebb0-4d80-bb28-e1502df37c40","title":"操作：查看「共享给我的」区块"},{"parent":"727c6378-5e45-435b-9c0d-5e25fc9e9f40","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e635e22c-2463-4fdb-8ba1-f824e40224bc","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 展示空态，不出现只有标题没有内容的区块"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"727c6378-5e45-435b-9c0d-5e25fc9e9f40","title":"🟠【P1】没有人共享给我时的空态"},{"parent":"d2ce2491-0431-4994-be25-303ae7460f33","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e0c82b8b-7fa6-4b51-8035-30877ef9f993","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c7563ccc-0e1b-4fcd-ba16-15b37b93138b","title":"前置：我的某个 Agent 已开启共享，随后其登录过期或退出登录；角色：Agent 所有者与其他成员；入口：分享 Agent 页与房间"},{"parent":"e0c82b8b-7fa6-4b51-8035-30877ef9f993","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eb01d08d-345f-4f94-a2f9-6c46ace54fa6","title":"操作：双方分别查看该 Agent 的共享状态与可用状态"},{"parent":"e0c82b8b-7fa6-4b51-8035-30877ef9f993","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"825f19c5-f279-49b3-81d6-371988e7ad92","title":"预期：\n1) 绑定授权 ｜ 共享状态按产品定义自动关闭或保持开启，结论唯一并有说明\n2) 可用状态 ｜ 其他成员侧状态变为不可用\n3) 会话状态 ｜ 正在用它跑的会话按既定规则中断并说明原因"},{"parent":"e0c82b8b-7fa6-4b51-8035-30877ef9f993","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"739ad058-2578-42ea-925a-72768e65e22a","title":"备注：掉登录后共享开关是自动关闭还是保持开启需产品定稿；输入框上方的 Agent 列表展示房间内成员的 Agent，分「我的 Agent」「共享 Agent」「其他」三组；他人的 Agent 需要已安装才展示，我自己的 Agent 只要已添加 Computer 就展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e0c82b8b-7fa6-4b51-8035-30877ef9f993","title":"🟠【P1】已共享的 Agent 掉登录态"},{"parent":"d2ce2491-0431-4994-be25-303ae7460f33","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"25cfbd45-cb98-4a41-b7c6-751fde2e8770","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"388bd881-1dd4-4e61-9f0f-d4739fbc88ed","title":"前置：我的某个 Agent 已开启共享，随后我在电脑页卸载了它；角色：Agent 所有者与其他成员；入口：分享 Agent 页与房间"},{"parent":"25cfbd45-cb98-4a41-b7c6-751fde2e8770","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cd1c052f-2bfe-4358-983e-5fbe9c68a37c","title":"操作：双方分别查看"},{"parent":"25cfbd45-cb98-4a41-b7c6-751fde2e8770","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"460db62b-403c-4d25-9ebe-0e156603aff2","title":"预期：\n1) 绑定授权 ｜ 共享随之失效，该 Agent 不再出现在他人的共享 Agent 分组\n2) 会话状态 ｜ 其他成员正在用它跑的会话按既定规则中断"},{"parent":"25cfbd45-cb98-4a41-b7c6-751fde2e8770","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1fb96eae-757a-4a17-a476-25f80f6792f9","title":"备注：输入框上方的 Agent 列表展示房间内成员的 Agent，分「我的 Agent」「共享 Agent」「其他」三组；他人的 Agent 需要已安装才展示，我自己的 Agent 只要已添加 Computer 就展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"25cfbd45-cb98-4a41-b7c6-751fde2e8770","title":"🟠【P1】已共享的 Agent 被卸载"},{"parent":"d2ce2491-0431-4994-be25-303ae7460f33","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"eefadfa2-8184-41f7-b052-4fa54dcd0c5c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bf8b5eeb-bf60-4929-9129-8284ff6033b7","title":"前置：我的某个 Agent 已开启共享，随后我解绑了它所在的电脑；角色：Agent 所有者与其他成员；入口：分享 Agent 页与房间"},{"parent":"eefadfa2-8184-41f7-b052-4fa54dcd0c5c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5a9a2538-e539-4449-bbbc-6cdfd5ec5f68","title":"操作：双方分别查看"},{"parent":"eefadfa2-8184-41f7-b052-4fa54dcd0c5c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4b0b592b-33a4-46cc-a494-e04b8a1ceebe","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 该 Agent 从他人的列表中移除\n2) 绑定授权 ｜ 共享记录同步清理，重新绑定后不自动恢复共享"},{"parent":"eefadfa2-8184-41f7-b052-4fa54dcd0c5c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1d98ecac-3b12-4163-81db-89aead41f62d","title":"备注：重新绑定后共享是否需要重新开启需产品确认；输入框上方的 Agent 列表展示房间内成员的 Agent，分「我的 Agent」「共享 Agent」「其他」三组；他人的 Agent 需要已安装才展示，我自己的 Agent 只要已添加 Computer 就展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"eefadfa2-8184-41f7-b052-4fa54dcd0c5c","title":"🟠【P1】已共享的电脑被解绑"},{"parent":"d2ce2491-0431-4994-be25-303ae7460f33","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e5e09c3c-05aa-4b83-9107-aa5b3c0eca06","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7cc4444b-e98d-4f99-85ec-4295c9eb359f","title":"前置：我的电脑离线且其上的 Agent 已安装；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：分享 Agent 页"},{"parent":"e5e09c3c-05aa-4b83-9107-aa5b3c0eca06","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f75528b4-2811-4490-913e-299718f512e9","title":"操作：查看我共享的区块与开关"},{"parent":"e5e09c3c-05aa-4b83-9107-aa5b3c0eca06","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d386a076-9b0c-4412-97b5-de1a6957ea42","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 该 Agent 仍展示在列表中\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ 开关按产品定义可操作或置灰，与电脑页的离线规则保持一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e5e09c3c-05aa-4b83-9107-aa5b3c0eca06","title":"🟠【P1】离线设备上的 Agent 在分享页的展示"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"d2ce2491-0431-4994-be25-303ae7460f33","title":"异常场景","summaries":[]},{"parent":"8136d43d-f9f5-4e8f-81f5-8b6b24b04fa9","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"23f8c634-8f8d-40a9-a455-ef9f2444555e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d173797c-f9bf-449b-a350-bc5fc17e37dd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d5d51608-6d5f-4f7d-b57a-a6275e6fff2b","title":"前置：我绑定了两台电脑且都安装了 Codex；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：分享 Agent 页"},{"parent":"d173797c-f9bf-449b-a350-bc5fc17e37dd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5ad1194-5254-4a24-80fd-98f767728dbe","title":"操作：查看我共享的区块"},{"parent":"d173797c-f9bf-449b-a350-bc5fc17e37dd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a30655a6-6cd4-46b5-8c87-c25907cae0cd","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 按电脑各展示一条，靠电脑名区分，两个开关互不影响\n2) 绑定授权 ｜ 只开启其中一台的共享时，他人列表中只出现那一台"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d173797c-f9bf-449b-a350-bc5fc17e37dd","title":"🟠【P1】多台电脑上的同名 Agent"},{"parent":"23f8c634-8f8d-40a9-a455-ef9f2444555e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"21c7e376-2c30-4508-9aa6-1aea51ec02c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"26913533-6b64-4501-938e-691bfd2808f1","title":"前置：我绑定多台电脑且共享给我的 Agent 数量较多；角色：房间成员；入口：分享 Agent 页"},{"parent":"21c7e376-2c30-4508-9aa6-1aea51ec02c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"017b65aa-feef-4ef6-bad9-8c3bd77f719b","title":"操作：查看两个区块并缩小窗口"},{"parent":"21c7e376-2c30-4508-9aa6-1aea51ec02c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"60e5f278-0274-47a3-888e-714830a5955f","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 卡片按栅格换行，不重叠不溢出\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 全部条目可完整浏览"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"21c7e376-2c30-4508-9aa6-1aea51ec02c1","title":"🟡【P2】条目很多时的布局"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"23f8c634-8f8d-40a9-a455-ef9f2444555e","title":"边界场景","summaries":[]},{"parent":"8136d43d-f9f5-4e8f-81f5-8b6b24b04fa9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bdff3ccc-ed6b-427c-a26d-a2e488a58e54","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b97a91c9-4a38-4ae1-aeb2-9702b0fec8ca","title":"说明：共享 Agent 全局 tab 改版：顶部常驻安全说明横幅，两个页签带计数","summaries":[]},{"parent":"bdff3ccc-ed6b-427c-a26d-a2e488a58e54","customWidth":99,"callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"78b67bbd-b5c5-4924-