-babe-f3a6e78fd741","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 直接列出我加入的全部房间，不需要展开操作\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 每行是房间头像、房间名与一个开关\n3) 归属与顺序 ｜ 各列展示的房间集合一致，顺序也一致","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2ca7d8dd-cba2-4113-a809-4f5fec8c6d38","title":"🔴【P0】房间列表直接平铺","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"e97aac25-d4f9-4599-9925-0143eb0d5eac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d88c0759-633f-41c1-8db0-8259653b5113","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c8c83e5c-7e6c-479c-85e4-f4646b5486ec","title":"前置：某个 Agent 在房间「zzy」中未共享；角色：账号所有者；入口：该行开关","summaries":[]},{"parent":"d88c0759-633f-41c1-8db0-8259653b5113","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e8216f9-267c-44b0-9152-d4095caa9308","title":"操作：打开该行开关","summaries":[]},{"parent":"d88c0759-633f-41c1-8db0-8259653b5113","customWidth":418.2,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6ebc2194-434a-48b4-81ed-f7e190fdc96f","title":"预期：<br>1) 按钮状态 ｜ 开关变为打开态，汇总文案的房间数加一<br>2) 列表展示 ｜ 该房间内其他成员的成员面板与 @ 面板出现这个 Agent<br>","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d88c0759-633f-41c1-8db0-8259653b5113","title":"🔴【P0】单个房间开启共享","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"e97aac25-d4f9-4599-9925-0143eb0d5eac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4da740c3-2083-4f31-bccc-7b23128cb815","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3e6aba0b-130a-4151-bc9d-9fa0a8bd4c18","title":"前置：某个 Agent 在某房间已共享；角色：账号所有者；入口：该行开关","summaries":[]},{"parent":"4da740c3-2083-4f31-bccc-7b23128cb815","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"28acb202-bd03-475b-ae71-09eab104bbc6","title":"操作：关闭该行开关","summaries":[]},{"parent":"4da740c3-2083-4f31-bccc-7b23128cb815","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f5e6946c-5566-457a-b63b-df795c65a0ac","title":"预期：<br>1) 列表展示 ｜ 汇总文案的房间数减一<br>2) 列表展示 ｜ 该房间内其他成员侧不再展示这个 Agent<br>","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4da740c3-2083-4f31-bccc-7b23128cb815","title":"🔴【P0】单个房间关闭共享","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"e97aac25-d4f9-4599-9925-0143eb0d5eac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2687f34c-65ff-4c88-9ed9-af24f5e6b69b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1b71ceff-43f2-4494-b586-524132c48c1a","title":"前置：某个 Agent 已在多个房间共享；角色：账号所有者；入口：该 Agent 列","summaries":[]},{"parent":"2687f34c-65ff-4c88-9ed9-af24f5e6b69b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0e38e3af-f22b-4475-9ee6-2e2da92c63da","title":"操作：关闭其中一个房间的开关","summaries":[]},{"parent":"2687f34c-65ff-4c88-9ed9-af24f5e6b69b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0efad6f6-961a-43d2-b007-97b8e09da13a","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 只有这个房间受影响，其余房间仍为已共享\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 验证共享按房间独立生效，不是全局一份","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2687f34c-65ff-4c88-9ed9-af24f5e6b69b","title":"🔴【P0】房间之间互不影响","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"e97aac25-d4f9-4599-9925-0143eb0d5eac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"442e2bdf-5f63-4b64-9e00-da84dc0533c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"73259900-e925-4de8-b39b-18003178af4f","title":"前置：同一张卡片下有三个 Agent，同一个房间在三列各有一个开关；角色：账号所有者；入口：该卡片","summaries":[]},{"parent":"442e2bdf-5f63-4b64-9e00-da84dc0533c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"be5b77d5-a6c7-457b-82cb-0c0449a16415","title":"操作：只打开其中一个 Agent 在该房间的开关","summaries":[]},{"parent":"442e2bdf-5f63-4b64-9e00-da84dc0533c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c2cbbc8d-dcf2-412d-b524-259ec0899d25","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 另外两列同一房间的开关保持关闭\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 该房间内其他成员只看到被开启的那一个 Agent","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"442e2bdf-5f63-4b64-9e00-da84dc0533c0","title":"🔴【P0】同一房间在不同 Agent 列间互不影响","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"e97aac25-d4f9-4599-9925-0143eb0d5eac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"afe7da75-f349-45b5-a613-cfecaa65c602","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13422d89-0593-4818-baf1-7bd4d3b27b37","title":"前置：我在某个房间的成员面板开启了共享；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享 Agent 页","summaries":[]},{"parent":"afe7da75-f349-45b5-a613-cfecaa65c602","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"abfc4a7c-d5da-448d-8b2b-99f027a8f089","title":"操作：打开本页查看对应 Agent 列的该房间那一行","summaries":[]},{"parent":"afe7da75-f349-45b5-a613-cfecaa65c602","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3d214fd1-d162-4bc3-9ec4-67910628ef83","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 两处开关状态一致\n2) 性能 ｜ 任一处修改，另一处实时同步","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"afe7da75-f349-45b5-a613-cfecaa65c602","title":"🔴【P0】与房间成员面板双向同步","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"e97aac25-d4f9-4599-9925-0143eb0d5eac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f65083bc-70c7-434f-b9a3-933848835fc7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea7131e7-ce57-4dbb-924c-7d72750d9457","title":"前置：房间 R 内有成员 M1、M2、M3；我在 R 中有一个可用的 Agent，该房间开关当前关闭；角色：Agent 拥有者与三名房间成员；入口：共享管理页 → 我的 Agent → 该 Agent 列下房间 R 那一行","summaries":[]},{"parent":"f65083bc-70c7-434f-b9a3-933848835fc7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6775ecfc-8001-40b7-85ad-739c6e06d3b6","title":"操作：打开 R 的开关，悬浮开关旁的「全部成员」文字，点说明卡上的编辑图标，在弹窗里选「部分成员」，只勾选 M1，点保存；随后回到房间 R 的共享 Agent tab 查看，再让 M1 与 M2 分别在 R 里新建会话选 Agent","summaries":[]},{"parent":"f65083bc-70c7-434f-b9a3-933848835fc7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"40092c5e-7f8b-4093-ad64-eafa7125f0fb","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 开关由关变开，开启后默认共享给全部成员\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 开关旁出现「全部成员」文字标签\n3) 视觉展示 ｜ 悬浮「全部成员」弹出说明卡，标题为「全部成员」，正文为「此房间的全部成员都可使用此 Agent。」，右上角有编辑图标\n4) 菜单展示 ｜ 点编辑图标打开「设置共享权限」弹窗，顶部展示该房间名与图标，下方「房间成员使用权限」为全部成员 / 部分成员两个单选项\n5) 列表展示 ｜ 选中「部分成员」后就地展开「选择允许使用的成员」勾选列表，列出 R 的全部成员，每人带头像与名称\n6) 按钮状态 ｜ 勾选 M1 后保存按钮由置灰变为可点\n7) 列表展示 ｜ 保存后弹窗关闭，开关旁标签变为「部分成员 · 1 人」\n8) 归属与顺序 ｜ 房间 R 的共享 Agent tab 里该 Agent 的范围标签同步变为「部分成员 · 1 人」，不需要刷新\n9) 权限授权 ｜ M1 在 R 中新建会话时能选到这个 Agent 并正常执行\n10) 权限授权 ｜ M2 与 M3 在 R 中选不到这个 Agent，列表里不出现，也无法通过任何入口调用","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f65083bc-70c7-434f-b9a3-933848835fc7","title":"🔴【P0】开启共享并把范围改为部分成员 · 全链路","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"e97aac25-d4f9-4599-9925-0143eb0d5eac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b80fe3db-f846-4c0a-a7b2-269130f07230","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e4d1679b-19d7-45f9-9810-ebe18a410ddb","title":"前置：我刚加入一个新房间 R2，此前从未为 R2 设置过共享；角色：Agent 拥有者；入口：共享管理页 → 我的 Agent","summaries":[]},{"parent":"b80fe3db-f846-4c0a-a7b2-269130f07230","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b29745a9-3619-4ee7-a866-1906910abeb8","title":"操作：加入 R2 后回到共享管理页，查看每个 Agent 列下 R2 那一行","summaries":[]},{"parent":"b80fe3db-f846-4c0a-a7b2-269130f07230","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2cb6b438-9ef7-448a-9e32-8ddb60b81f81","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ R2 出现在每个 Agent 列的房间列表中\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ R2 的开关一律为关闭状态，不继承其他房间的设置\n3) 列表展示 ｜ 开关关闭且从未设置过范围时，开关旁不展示任何范围标签\n4) 权限授权 ｜ R2 的成员此时选不到我的任何 Agent","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b80fe3db-f846-4c0a-a7b2-269130f07230","title":"🔴【P0】新加入房间默认关闭","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"e97aac25-d4f9-4599-9925-0143eb0d5eac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d6f6765f-2628-4d9e-a196-70a2b640eeac","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"af1a490a-cfec-4449-bb1e-0e375f6c7eea","title":"前置：某房间的共享范围已设为部分成员并勾选了 M1、M2；角色：Agent 拥有者；入口：开关旁的「部分成员 · 2 人」文字","summaries":[]},{"parent":"d6f6765f-2628-4d9e-a196-70a2b640eeac","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"965c9d89-7e23-4792-a74c-48fa8486e2fb","title":"操作：悬浮该文字查看说明卡","summaries":[]},{"parent":"d6f6765f-2628-4d9e-a196-70a2b640eeac","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"40530989-b877-41d3-b6f2-0a71f578348e","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 说明卡标题为「部分成员」，正文为「仅选中的房间成员可使用此 Agent。」，右上角有编辑图标\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 卡片内逐行列出已勾选的成员，带头像与名称，数量与标签上的人数一致\n3) 按钮状态 ｜ 点编辑图标能打开「设置共享权限」弹窗，弹窗里已勾选的正是这两人","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d6f6765f-2628-4d9e-a196-70a2b640eeac","title":"🟠【P1】悬浮部分成员标签查看已选成员","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"e97aac25-d4f9-4599-9925-0143eb0d5eac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1b307f4a-123a-4207-aa75-4cae71389cf0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"73c4a802-02ba-481a-a83d-248d5386c311","title":"前置：某房间的共享范围为部分成员 · 1 人；角色：Agent 拥有者与房间成员；入口：设置共享权限弹窗","summaries":[]},{"parent":"1b307f4a-123a-4207-aa75-4cae71389cf0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eade524d-a62b-440a-819b-ac1a8b122a6f","title":"操作：打开弹窗改选「全部成员」并保存，随后让原先未被勾选的成员在该房间选用这个 Agent","summaries":[]},{"parent":"1b307f4a-123a-4207-aa75-4cae71389cf0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bbb53759-6383-4499-bf74-0d145fc7c8cc","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 保存后标签由「部分成员 · 1 人」变为「全部成员」\n2) 权限授权 ｜ 原先被排除的成员现在能选到并使用这个 Agent\n3) 归属与顺序 ｜ 房间内共享 Agent tab 的范围标签同步更新","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1b307f4a-123a-4207-aa75-4cae71389cf0","title":"🟠【P1】范围从部分成员改回全部成员","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"e97aac25-d4f9-4599-9925-0143eb0d5eac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9513adce-4e4e-429b-b70a-be1b7c187d98","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fe69999c-609c-4ed0-b385-8a4944839859","title":"前置：准备两个房间：R3 范围为全部成员、R4 范围为部分成员 · 2 人，两者开关都已打开；角色：Agent 拥有者；入口：共享管理页","summaries":[]},{"parent":"9513adce-4e4e-429b-b70a-be1b7c187d98","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8bcad07e-7f99-41c5-a944-ed65627f52e3","title":"操作：分别关闭 R3 与 R4 的开关，观察两行的标签，再悬浮 R4 的标签并改一次勾选，最后重新打开 R4 的开关","summaries":[]},{"parent":"9513adce-4e4e-429b-b70a-be1b7c187d98","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f1f1c300-4d1f-451d-8718-b045ddffa3bb","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ R3 关闭后开关旁不再显示「全部成员」\n2) 列表展示 ｜ R4 关闭后仍显示「部分成员 · 2 人」\n3) 按钮状态 ｜ R4 关闭状态下仍可悬浮弹说明卡、点编辑打开弹窗、改勾选并保存\n4) 持久化 ｜ R4 在关闭状态下改成 3 人后，标签更新为「部分成员 · 3 人」\n5) 权限授权 ｜ R4 重新打开开关后按最新的 3 人生效，不是按关闭前的 2 人\n6) 权限授权 ｜ 开关关闭期间，即使范围里有人，该房间成员也一律选不到这个 Agent","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9513adce-4e4e-429b-b70a-be1b7c187d98","title":"🟠【P1】关闭开关后的标签保留规则","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"e97aac25-d4f9-4599-9925-0143eb0d5eac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ceea1934-c49e-471b-946c-9e78fbb6886c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b304ae07-cbef-4754-87c0-9a9bffa75b84","title":"前置：共享管理页 → 我的 Agent 下有多个房间行；角色：Agent 拥有者；入口：房间行上的房间名","summaries":[]},{"parent":"ceea1934-c49e-471b-946c-9e78fbb6886c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4146a234-53b3-4b97-99b2-2195951fb735","title":"操作：点击其中一个房间名","summaries":[]},{"parent":"ceea1934-c49e-471b-946c-9e78fbb6886c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1aa4ab8c-c792-475e-a2bf-ad14af8c0d22","title":"预期：\n1) 跳转定位 ｜ 跳转到该房间，落在房间内，房间名与点击的一致\n2) 会话状态 ｜ 跳转后不新建会话，也不改变任何共享开关状态","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ceea1934-c49e-471b-946c-9e78fbb6886c","title":"🟠【P1】点击房间名跳转到对应房间","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e97aac25-d4f9-4599-9925-0143eb0d5eac","title":"正常场景","summaries":[]},{"parent":"118d7996-9104-474a-ad9c-3048fab1c1c5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ecdb3ee1-f442-41ff-8e15-e73b4ce2fe11","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4cd2a976-cef0-46a1-a180-e59d97ea3475","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6368b5ec-cc5f-440a-b856-7d3b50631a4a","title":"前置：某个 Agent 未登录或登录已过期；角色：账号所有者；入口：该 Agent 列","summaries":[]},{"parent":"4cd2a976-cef0-46a1-a180-e59d97ea3475","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c2e9765-0622-4037-92ef-ae9b2ecdcb8c","title":"操作：尝试打开任意房间的开关","summaries":[]},{"parent":"4cd2a976-cef0-46a1-a180-e59d97ea3475","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"23357d34-0f29-4585-a2ac-3c8264e97cfa","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 该列所有房间的开关都不可打开\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 说明需要先完成登录，与未安装、电脑离线的原因都可区分","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4cd2a976-cef0-46a1-a180-e59d97ea3475","title":"🔴【P0】未登录时开关不可用","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"ecdb3ee1-f442-41ff-8e15-e73b4ce2fe11","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3db3bc39-eb7f-47b0-89b1-a65dab1d535b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e837528b-4c35-4672-8a8e-9642eef2f79a","title":"前置：该 Agent 所在电脑离线；角色：账号所有者；入口：该 Agent 列","summaries":[]},{"parent":"3db3bc39-eb7f-47b0-89b1-a65dab1d535b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"894d5357-85c9-4f3c-937c-f06839cfdd57","title":"操作：尝试操作各房间的开关","summaries":[]},{"parent":"3db3bc39-eb7f-47b0-89b1-a65dab1d535b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eafd4b56-ec27-4c14-a648-3a2f85475560","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 所有房间的开关都置灰不可操作\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 与成员面板、电脑页的离线规则一致，三处都不允许离线改开关","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3db3bc39-eb7f-47b0-89b1-a65dab1d535b","title":"🔴【P0】电脑 离线时不能改共享开关","summaries":[]},{"parent":"ecdb3ee1-f442-41ff-8e15-e73b4ce2fe11","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0e2ae016-5648-424d-9df9-f70f36867a7d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ed003fd2-93ff-481b-9113-b93df788d68e","title":"前置：某 Agent 列的房间列表中有该房间；角色：账号所有者；入口：我的 Agent 页签","summaries":[]},{"parent":"0e2ae016-5648-424d-9df9-f70f36867a7d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e65a887c-b405-4c66-a47b-cf631d6494de","title":"操作：退出该房间后回到本页","summaries":[]},{"parent":"0e2ae016-5648-424d-9df9-f70f36867a7d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"07857517-14a0-4104-84ae-34b485a17515","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 所有 Agent 列的房间列表中都移除该房间\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 若此前在该房间已共享，汇总的房间数同步减少","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0e2ae016-5648-424d-9df9-f70f36867a7d","title":"🟠【P1】退出房间后开关列表移除该行","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"ecdb3ee1-f442-41ff-8e15-e73b4ce2fe11","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6c687c31-7339-417b-8590-3aff6205dbd5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"98013127-588c-4114-8291-8cf762913c0c","title":"前置：某房间共享范围为部分成员且未勾选 M2；角色：成员 M2；入口：新建会话的 Agent 选择、成员面板、他人会话","summaries":[]},{"parent":"6c687c31-7339-417b-8590-3aff6205dbd5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e5355091-fee4-4e90-b6af-d50a1895fb46","title":"操作：M2 依次尝试：在新建会话的 Agent 列表里找该 Agent、在房间成员面板里找、用之前留存的会话或链接进入并发送指令","summaries":[]},{"parent":"6c687c31-7339-417b-8590-3aff6205dbd5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"62e3c21b-af69-4f87-9164-829c757dd95e","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 三处都不出现这个 Agent\n2) 权限授权 ｜ 用旧入口触发时被拦截并给出无权限提示，不执行任务\n3) 副作用 ｜ 不产生任何消耗 Agent 拥有者额度的调用","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6c687c31-7339-417b-8590-3aff6205dbd5","title":"🟠【P1】未被选中的成员无法绕过范围使用","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"ecdb3ee1-f442-41ff-8e15-e73b4ce2fe11","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c92fb3c8-6ea7-48fd-ba59-3e24a1c99e9d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8483f376-9dde-4d6d-bc49-1b7f3b303159","title":"前置：某房间共享范围为部分成员，已勾选 M1 与 M2；角色：Agent 拥有者与成员 M2；入口：共享管理页与设置共享权限弹窗","summaries":[]},{"parent":"c92fb3c8-6ea7-48fd-ba59-3e24a1c99e9d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"880d8c0b-e9d6-4059-9dc2-c49ea958cf44","title":"操作：M2 退出该房间，随后查看这一行的标签、开关与弹窗内容，再让 M1 在该房间选用这个 Agent","summaries":[]},{"parent":"c92fb3c8-6ea7-48fd-ba59-3e24a1c99e9d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dbe32b85-022a-467e-a533-232ac5c43058","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 标签人数自动减为「部分成员 · 1 人」，与实际还在房间里的被选中成员数一致\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ 开关保持打开，不因为少了一个人而自动关闭\n3) 列表展示 ｜ 弹窗的成员勾选列表里不再出现已退出的 M2，不留空白项或未知用户\n4) 权限授权 ｜ M1 仍能正常选用这个 Agent，其他未被勾选的成员仍然不能","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c92fb3c8-6ea7-48fd-ba59-3e24a1c99e9d","title":"🟠【P1】范围内的成员离开房间","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"ecdb3ee1-f442-41ff-8e15-e73b4ce2fe11","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ee9d4b80-432e-4006-b050-31522067290c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e12c2f67-5036-4a97-846d-2fc2ae79221b","title":"前置：某房间共享范围为部分成员且只勾选了 M1；角色：Agent 拥有者、成员 M1 与另一名成员 M3；入口：共享管理页","summaries":[]},{"parent":"ee9d4b80-432e-4006-b050-31522067290c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5c530ed-1a7d-40d8-8df4-eac51266e7d4","title":"操作：M1 退出该房间，观察这一行的标签与开关；随后让仍在房间里的 M3 尝试选用这个 Agent；再把 M1 重新加回房间","summaries":[]},{"parent":"ee9d4b80-432e-4006-b050-31522067290c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6f8be90b-1c9a-4d8f-8cbd-862c2fecc629","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 标签展示为「部分成员 · 0 人」\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ 开关仍保持打开，不自动关闭\n3) 权限授权 ｜ 此时房间内没有任何成员能使用这个 Agent，M3 在新建会话的 Agent 列表里选不到\n4) 视觉展示 ｜ 0 人状态下仍可悬浮弹说明卡、点编辑打开弹窗重新勾选，保存后立即恢复可用\n5) 权限授权 ｜ M1 重新加入房间后不自动恢复勾选，仍需拥有者重新在弹窗里选中","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ee9d4b80-432e-4006-b050-31522067290c","title":"🟠【P1】范围内所有成员都离开房间","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"ecdb3ee1-f442-41ff-8e15-e73b4ce2fe11","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c527084d-675e-486b-981c-da5d15c89915","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"87da1db1-1e87-43e7-8510-b79b0b11e853","title":"前置：某个 Agent 处于不可用状态（未登录、未安装、电脑离线或登录过期）；角色：Agent 拥有者；入口：共享管理页该 Agent 列","summaries":[]},{"parent":"c527084d-675e-486b-981c-da5d15c89915","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5745253-1159-445f-a4e7-69a6ff38f0a8","title":"操作：尝试点开该列下任意房间的开关，再尝试悬浮与点击范围标签","summaries":[]},{"parent":"c527084d-675e-486b-981c-da5d15c89915","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"daeed7b4-312a-4bff-9673-f44113433846","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 开关为禁用态点不动，不出现先打开再回弹\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 给出不可用的具体原因，指向去登录、去安装或让电脑上线\n3) 按钮状态 ｜ 范围标签与编辑入口一并不可用，不能在 Agent 不可用时先把人选好\n4) 恢复重试 ｜ 把该 Agent 恢复为可用后，开关与范围编辑立即可用，不需要刷新页面","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c527084d-675e-486b-981c-da5d15c89915","title":"🟡【P2】不可用的 Agent 开关不可点开","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"ecdb3ee1-f442-41ff-8e15-e73b4ce2fe11","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f41fbd75-52e6-4469-b7c8-10867dba5b10","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a8d39a8f-50d7-46d3-8d55-7110ba0e8cf1","title":"前置：设置共享权限弹窗已打开；角色：Agent 拥有者；入口：弹窗","summaries":[]},{"parent":"f41fbd75-52e6-4469-b7c8-10867dba5b10","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e1dfb6d0-602f-4656-8374-62d92fddb64f","title":"操作：选中「部分成员」但不勾选任何成员，观察按钮与提示，再勾选一人后取消勾选","summaries":[]},{"parent":"f41fbd75-52e6-4469-b7c8-10867dba5b10","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c012540-526a-4652-99d1-6e8ccd085853","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 保存按钮置灰不可点\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 列表下方展示「请至少选择一位成员」\n3) 按钮状态 ｜ 勾选一人后保存可点，再取消勾选后重新置灰，提示重新出现\n4) 副作用 ｜ 置灰期间点保存无任何反应，不关闭弹窗也不落库","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f41fbd75-52e6-4469-b7c8-10867dba5b10","title":"🟡【P2】部分成员未勾选任何人时保存置灰","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"ecdb3ee1-f442-41ff-8e15-e73b4ce2fe11","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"09070ff5-9cce-4ac1-adfb-554767622063","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5616589c-116b-45d3-ad14-6be8b0b47219","title":"前置：设置共享权限弹窗已打开且已改动勾选；角色：Agent 拥有者；入口：弹窗的完成按钮、关闭与保存","summaries":[]},{"parent":"09070ff5-9cce-4ac1-adfb-554767622063","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c5bb0969-981a-48d0-9d4a-41c2964d9089","title":"操作：第一轮改完勾选后点「完成」，第二轮改完后点右上角关闭，第三轮改完后点保存但让接口失败，每轮结束后都核对标签与成员的实际可用范围","summaries":[]},{"parent":"09070ff5-9cce-4ac1-adfb-554767622063","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"196b78d1-2734-4f66-9dea-95c537b3d644","title":"预期：\n1) 持久化 ｜ 未点保存就关闭时，改动不生效，标签与实际权限保持原样\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 保存失败时给出失败提示，标签回滚到保存前的值\n3) 权限授权 ｜ 两种情况下成员的实际可用范围都没有变化，不出现界面回滚了但后端已生效","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"09070ff5-9cce-4ac1-adfb-554767622063","title":"🟡【P2】弹窗的完成按钮与保存失败","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ecdb3ee1-f442-41ff-8e15-e73b4ce2fe11","title":"异常场景","summaries":[]},{"parent":"118d7996-9104-474a-ad9c-3048fab1c1c5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dc5e1d64-bee3-4f6a-b4ab-74694c282eb6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7c8e5084-6405-41e8-ac78-8f2f62ef07aa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f8b76648-4d8f-4853-addc-bd8213512232","title":"前置：某个 Agent 列的房间列表已展示；角色：账号所有者；入口：某行开关","summaries":[]},{"parent":"7c8e5084-6405-41e8-ac78-8f2f62ef07aa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"78a47905-e7a0-4f8b-99af-0ce4c97b2c10","title":"操作：对同一行连续快速开关多次","summaries":[]},{"parent":"7c8e5084-6405-41e8-ac78-8f2f62ef07aa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7b5dee9d-ba45-4c70-9d23-6c48c459bf9f","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 最终状态与最后一次操作一致\n2) 副作用 ｜ 房间群聊的系统消息不刷屏，汇总房间数正确","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7c8e5084-6405-41e8-ac78-8f2f62ef07aa","title":"🟡【P2】全局 tab 连续快速开关","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"dc5e1d64-bee3-4f6a-b4ab-74694c282eb6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d5e88860-a509-422e-9f6c-ce96e284ac1a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dc8d21b0-e87c-45be-81d9-266e3bfbf10f","title":"前置：我加入了几十个房间；角色：账号所有者；入口：某个 Agent 列","summaries":[]},{"parent":"d5e88860-a509-422e-9f6c-ce96e284ac1a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bc476750-1388-42b7-9f84-c666be289f15","title":"操作：查看共享到房间小节","summaries":[]},{"parent":"d5e88860-a509-422e-9f6c-ce96e284ac1a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"47a25e0c-0228-4a98-a636-2301e0f55441","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 按产品定义滚动或折叠展示，全部房间可达\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 超长房间名截断合理，开关不被挤出可视区","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d5e88860-a509-422e-9f6c-ce96e284ac1a","title":"🟡【P2】房间很多时的列表","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"dc5e1d64-bee3-4f6a-b4ab-74694c282eb6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f1fc04f0-1da4-44f7-97fc-bcf0a35688bb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f097d8cf-e3eb-4486-a131-11dff6aa9ca0","title":"前置：某房间有数十名成员；角色：Agent 拥有者；入口：设置共享权限弹窗","summaries":[]},{"parent":"f1fc04f0-1da4-44f7-97fc-bcf0a35688bb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd2bf49a-e61d-4a1c-bf5b-f4245a78a400","title":"操作：展开成员勾选列表滚动到底，勾选靠后的几位后保存","summaries":[]},{"parent":"f1fc04f0-1da4-44f7-97fc-bcf0a35688bb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"92495c61-4b95-4d4a-86b0-d14800db0a49","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 列表可滚动，弹窗高度不被撑破，勾选状态在滚动中不丢失\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 保存后标签人数与实际勾选数一致","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f1fc04f0-1da4-44f7-97fc-bcf0a35688bb","title":"🟡【P2】房间成员很多时的勾选列表","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"dc5e1d64-bee3-4f6a-b4ab-74694c282eb6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"76043ccf-cbb3-4fc4-a809-2d1887ac3189","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb4ddc9b-16f6-4a67-9975-547be1345014","title":"前置：在两个标签页同时打开共享管理页，同一 Agent 同一房间；角色：Agent 拥有者；入口：两个标签页的弹窗","summaries":[]},{"parent":"76043ccf-cbb3-4fc4-a809-2d1887ac3189","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"52d78a10-670c-48bb-acfd-36d8a67639ee","title":"操作：在 A 标签页改成部分成员 · M1 并保存，在 B 标签页几乎同时改成部分成员 · M2 并保存，随后刷新两边","summaries":[]},{"parent":"76043ccf-cbb3-4fc4-a809-2d1887ac3189","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a8aacb18-b3bf-49e1-a711-9326c3b583c4","title":"预期：\n1) 持久化 ｜ 最终以后保存的那次为准，两个标签页刷新后展示一致，不出现一边 M1 一边 M2\n2) 权限授权 ｜ 实际可用范围与最终展示一致","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"76043ccf-cbb3-4fc4-a809-2d1887ac3189","title":"🟡【P2】多处同时改同一个范围","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dc5e1d64-bee3-4f6a-b4ab-74694c282eb6","title":"边界场景","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"118d7996-9104-474a-ad9c-3048fab1c1c5","title":"共享到房间的开关","summaries":[]},{"parent":"8136d43d-f9f5-4e8f-81f5-8b6b24b04fa9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ffe7b42c-16fa-4f1e-bf1a-92f8c3610b47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e0ea129-6dfd-4b8e-ac5e-c883fd0b783f","title":"说明：每个 Agent 列底部的使用额度有三种态：有额度数据、用量检测失败、暂无额度信息","summaries":[]},{"parent":"ffe7b42c-16fa-4f1e-bf1a-92f8c3610b47","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"775a5e1b-c2ba-43d9-9606-9a231d940798","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"754b410a-d6a6-4eb1-8851-243cab199d80","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c292d14b-85c7-41e4-a72c-1193756ee0b6","title":"前置：某个 Agent 能读取到额度；角色：账号所有者；入口：该 Agent 列底部的使用额度","summaries":[]},{"parent":"754b410a-d6a6-4eb1-8851-243cab199d80","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"babd2434-38a2-42c6-9284-daa270e3657e","title":"操作：查看该区块","summaries":[]},{"parent":"754b410a-d6a6-4eb1-8851-243cab199d80","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"33a18d3c-0b3c-4915-8249-14b578a0af95","title":"预期：\n1) 用量 ｜ 展示套餐名、额度周期（如每周额度）、剩余百分比与进度条\n2) 用量 ｜ 展示重置时间，形如「重置于 9月15日 11:55」\n3) 视觉展示 ｜ 进度条长度与剩余百分比一致，不出现数值与图形不符","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"754b410a-d6a6-4eb1-8851-243cab199d80","title":"🔴【P0】有额度数据时的展示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"775a5e1b-c2ba-43d9-9606-9a231d940798","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1a8cd08e-793c-44d6-8165-c6df88c6dc73","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8a423d87-74b0-4c9b-8a39-be3cfa33d2dc","title":"前置：某个 Agent 使用的是API Key配置；角色：账号所有者；入口：该 Agent 列底部的使用额度","summaries":[]},{"parent":"1a8cd08e-793c-44d6-8165-c6df88c6dc73","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"23b9abfc-196a-45b7-9bd8-917a154cc81d","title":"操作：查看该区块","summaries":[]},{"parent":"1a8cd08e-793c-44d6-8165-c6df88c6dc73","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e9be5f7d-b8b1-4110-b97f-5d8346eae85a","title":"预期：<br>1) 用量 ｜ 显示暂无额度，标明API Usage Billing","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1a8cd08e-793c-44d6-8165-c6df88c6dc73","title":"🔴【P0】API Key配置的展示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"775a5e1b-c2ba-43d9-9606-9a231d940798","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5101245a-1050-4f27-b9df-ada82ca2ddb9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"49fd6eb4-1697-4afe-bb7f-3792273eb2cb","title":"前置：某个 Agent 有额度数据；角色：账号所有者；入口：使用额度区块底部","summaries":[]},{"parent":"5101245a-1050-4f27-b9df-ada82ca2ddb9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f860801d-9be9-403b-a18c-43583f1a6d71","title":"操作：查看底部的时效说明","summaries":[]},{"parent":"5101245a-1050-4f27-b9df-ada82ca2ddb9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"66e6f982-7ffb-4d6c-b6ab-d44d8a1f9085","title":"预期：<br>1) 提示文案 ｜ 展示数据的更新时间，形如「更新于 9月8日 20:52」<br>2) 提示文案 ｜ 数据不是实时的要标注出来，如「数据待更新」，不让人误以为是当前值","summaries":[]},{"parent":"5101245a-1050-4f27-b9df-ada82ca2ddb9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e502fe7-0296-45d1-990e-2d160706b1e0","title":"备注：每个 Agent 列底部的使用额度区块有三种态：有额度数据、读取失败、不支持","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5101245a-1050-4f27-b9df-ada82ca2ddb9","title":"🔴【P0】数据时效标注","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"775a5e1b-c2ba-43d9-9606-9a231d940798","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9effa5ef-c0a4-4c35-8b44-2b002307a313","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2ca4b4cc-5f2b-4563-ab44-c462ad472d78","title":"前置：某个 Agent 本身不提供额度信息；角色：账号所有者；入口：该 Agent 列的使用额度","summaries":[]},{"parent":"9effa5ef-c0a4-4c35-8b44-2b002307a313","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cb9a505e-dcdd-4353-9d2a-cce76c484737","title":"操作：查看Tutti Agent该区块","summaries":[]},{"parent":"9effa5ef-c0a4-4c35-8b44-2b002307a313","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5ddb95d1-ecd7-4395-9c6a-19c24cac7c95","title":"预期：<br>1) 提示文案 ｜ 展示「暂无额度信息」与「该 Agent 暂不提供额度信息」<br>2) 结果校验 ｜ 与「用量检测失败」的文案和图标都可区分，一个是不支持一个是读取失败","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9effa5ef-c0a4-4c35-8b44-2b002307a313","title":"🔴【P0】不支持额度的 Agent","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"775a5e1b-c2ba-43d9-9606-9a231d940798","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"035b813e-729a-4c7f-a934-d55b0eb3b005","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5d90729d-515a-4118-a76f-5fc329d72d96","title":"前置：同一张卡片下三个 Agent 分别处于有数据、检测失败、不支持三种态；角色：账号所有者；入口：该卡片","summaries":[]},{"parent":"035b813e-729a-4c7f-a934-d55b0eb3b005","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5c25fe24-c049-427b-a55c-3e1950f4f6f3","title":"操作：并排对照三列的使用额度区块","summaries":[]},{"parent":"035b813e-729a-4c7f-a934-d55b0eb3b005","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b533da39-2c34-41c5-8ba0-1ebd61a29793","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 三种态的图标、文案与布局各不相同，能一眼区分\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 不出现三种态共用一句笼统的暂无数据","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"035b813e-729a-4c7f-a934-d55b0eb3b005","title":"🔴【P0】三种态逐一对照","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"775a5e1b-c2ba-43d9-9606-9a231d940798","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"616a2111-58bd-436e-b827-6d7c087363e9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a8c5d354-84b7-4469-98e6-e3e5a7b08a23","title":"前置：某个 Agent 在电脑页的 Agents 表里也有用量列；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享 Agent 页与电脑页","summaries":[]},{"parent":"616a2111-58bd-436e-b827-6d7c087363e9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e4a9991b-cb6a-4f1c-9b74-b7d87ef6ff4a","title":"操作：对照两处的用量信息","summaries":[]},{"parent":"616a2111-58bd-436e-b827-6d7c087363e9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6f107bf9-c0e5-48b8-8c0b-0eb05ac3e06c","title":"预期：\n1) 用量 ｜ 两处口径一致，不出现一处有数值一处显示不支持\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 都以同一次检测结果为准","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"616a2111-58bd-436e-b827-6d7c087363e9","title":"🟠【P1】额度与 Agent 详情的一致性","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"775a5e1b-c2ba-43d9-9606-9a231d940798","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"575aa476-856e-4189-8fd7-03e21211c0bd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dc0ce713-2795-4f7f-be72-b8216521e82a","title":"前置：某个 Agent 的额度数据较旧；角色：账号所有者；入口：页面的刷新入口","summaries":[]},{"parent":"575aa476-856e-4189-8fd7-03e21211c0bd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c8ac308a-bf91-4e9e-96d8-36e171fe0558","title":"操作：触发刷新或重新检测后再看该区块","summaries":[]},{"parent":"575aa476-856e-4189-8fd7-03e21211c0bd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7da9ad06-9361-4d7f-a17b-388f2590adfd","title":"预期：\n1) 用量 ｜ 数值与记录时间更新到最新一次检测\n2) 性能 ｜ 刷新过程有加载态，不长时间停在旧值也不闪烁","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"575aa476-856e-4189-8fd7-03e21211c0bd","title":"🟠【P1】重新检测后额度更新","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"775a5e1b-c2ba-43d9-9606-9a231d940798","title":"正常场景","summaries":[]},{"parent":"ffe7b42c-16fa-4f1e-bf1a-92f8c3610b47","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cdd89e36-be36-4ead-85bb-d17426b1b725","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1e73bd17-1256-4463-87db-fec9c443f90b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1b601f5e-3ca8-432e-919c-f8c6ca400420","title":"前置：某个 Agent 的用量读取失败；角色：账号所有者；入口：该 Agent 列的使用额度","summaries":[]},{"parent":"1e73bd17-1256-4463-87db-fec9c443f90b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9238c0b7-d454-40fd-b7f9-101cad39ca3c","title":"操作：查看该区块","summaries":[]},{"parent":"1e73bd17-1256-4463-87db-fec9c443f90b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d133bc48-79b1-4ac3-a2c5-a87029502701","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 展示「用量检测失败」与「暂时无法读取该 Agent 的用量」\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 用警示图标区分于正常态\n3) 结果校验 ｜ 不展示为 0% 或空进度条，避免被误读成额度耗尽","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1e73bd17-1256-4463-87db-fec9c443f90b","title":"🟠【P1】用量检测失败","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"cdd89e36-be36-4ead-85bb-d17426b1b725","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b1042b73-3053-4437-a6a4-e0b438a180be","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d712decc-3f48-4c12-906b-552726513192","title":"前置：某个 Agent 的额度已用尽；角色：账号所有者；入口：该 Agent 列的使用额度","summaries":[]},{"parent":"b1042b73-3053-4437-a6a4-e0b438a180be","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8e3d96d1-7d3a-4ef1-b58a-413a98e5c6b5","title":"操作：查看该区块","summaries":[]},{"parent":"b1042b73-3053-4437-a6a4-e0b438a180be","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"077d5f64-c24f-44b1-9c78-fa2ae2390945","title":"预期：\n1) 用量 ｜ 剩余展示为 0% 且进度条为空，有可辨识的耗尽提示\n2) 可用状态 ｜ 按产品定义该 Agent 是否随之变为不可用，结论唯一","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b1042b73-3053-4437-a6a4-e0b438a180be","title":"🟠【P1】额度耗尽时的展示","summaries":[]},{"parent":"cdd89e36-be36-4ead-85bb-d17426b1b725","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0cfc4cca-b994-40dd-9386-4606ca9efe38","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"892c45e7-a07f-4abb-9856-53f0c4a2e152","title":"前置：该 Agent 所在电脑离线；角色：账号所有者；入口：该 Agent 列的使用额度","summaries":[]},{"parent":"0cfc4cca-b994-40dd-9386-4606ca9efe38","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"196fdad3-26e2-4bae-9273-c518fd883947","title":"操作：查看该区块","summaries":[]},{"parent":"0cfc4cca-b994-40dd-9386-4606ca9efe38","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"43653b02-ec2f-4fb3-b604-919b19204f40","title":"预期：\n1) 用量 ｜ 保留最近一次的数值并标注为过期或旧数据\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 不展示为检测失败，两者原因不同要能区分","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0cfc4cca-b994-40dd-9386-4606ca9efe38","title":"🟠【P1】电脑离线时的额度展示","summaries":[]},{"parent":"cdd89e36-be36-4ead-85bb-d17426b1b725","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1e027793-55a8-4569-85af-b5238c67fb1b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9ea316f4-6a53-4aef-a30d-8d117f410b5d","title":"前置：某个 Agent 此前用量检测失败；角色：账号所有者；入口：该 Agent 列","summaries":[]},{"parent":"1e027793-55a8-4569-85af-b5238c67fb1b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cc24632d-446f-4ab9-982a-78f7e5e230ad","title":"操作：恢复正常后触发刷新","summaries":[]},{"parent":"1e027793-55a8-4569-85af-b5238c67fb1b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c5866f00-cc38-4a1f-a4dd-021e52044982","title":"预期：\n1) 恢复重试 ｜ 区块从失败态恢复为正常的额度展示\n2) 用量 ｜ 数值正确，不残留失败态的提示","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1e027793-55a8-4569-85af-b5238c67fb1b","title":"🟠【P1】检测失败后恢复","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cdd89e36-be36-4ead-85bb-d17426b1b725","title":"异常场景","summaries":[]},{"parent":"ffe7b42c-16fa-4f1e-bf1a-92f8c3610b47","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"45938b4a-fa19-4648-9b2c-f769cc74e3be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a4317d74-52f2-4f5e-a804-d8a548656db7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"96bd6594-622d-43bb-b0f1-13e551e658e6","title":"前置：分别构造剩余 100%、1%、0% 的情况；角色：账号所有者；入口：使用额度区块","summaries":[]},{"parent":"a4317d74-52f2-4f5e-a804-d8a548656db7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eb24b75a-fce5-4e30-8cc9-34d627081c9a","title":"操作：逐个查看展示","summaries":[]},{"parent":"a4317d74-52f2-4f5e-a804-d8a548656db7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"81906dbd-038b-4c69-ad25-885e4af2a632","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 三种取值的进度条与数字都展示正确，不出现超出或负值\n2) 用量 ｜ 小数按固定规则取整或保留，前后一致","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a4317d74-52f2-4f5e-a804-d8a548656db7","title":"🟠【P1】剩余百分比的边界值","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"45938b4a-fa19-4648-9b2c-f769cc74e3be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0f351ed0-47ec-4952-9d33-20e81dfe3f5a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df685787-c351-42bf-8ab0-ab31abc272e6","title":"前置：重置时间恰好在次日或次月；角色：账号所有者；入口：使用额度区块","summaries":[]},{"parent":"0f351ed0-47ec-4952-9d33-20e81dfe3f5a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c3dc0d7a-d1b0-431e-97a3-2c7a46f5df48","title":"操作：查看重置时间的展示","summaries":[]},{"parent":"0f351ed0-47ec-4952-9d33-20e81dfe3f5a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"00ec537f-12b4-47b1-94ab-d4ea59c51511","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 日期与时间展示正确，跨月时月份正确\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 到达重置时间后额度按周期刷新，剩余回到满值","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0f351ed0-47ec-4952-9d33-20e81dfe3f5a","title":"🟠【P1】重置时间跨天与跨月","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"45938b4a-fa19-4648-9b2c-f769cc74e3be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aff82a7d-f81b-447c-a7c9-42b0f1a10b17","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fec574be-6c61-4c93-a86e-aba6b0c5982e","title":"前置：账号的套餐名很长，或该 Agent 没有套餐概念；角色：账号所有者；入口：使用额度区块","summaries":[]},{"parent":"aff82a7d-f81b-447c-a7c9-42b0f1a10b17","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09834c7f-4cbb-4bae-9fcb-f3ad0dbe11f5","title":"操作：查看右上角的套餐展示","summaries":[]},{"parent":"aff82a7d-f81b-447c-a7c9-42b0f1a10b17","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2fe43fb6-b08a-4802-b041-bdd804c20cf2","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 超长截断合理，不与「使用额度」标题重叠\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 没有套餐时不展示空标签或占位符","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aff82a7d-f81b-447c-a7c9-42b0f1a10b17","title":"🟡【P2】套餐名很长或为空","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"45938b4a-fa19-4648-9b2c-f769cc74e3be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2e585f02-af78-40b5-b37c-d7769fad6da0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4652b303-3a4c-4580-ae7e-37ce3e086d01","title":"前置：同一卡片下三列分别是三种额度态；角色：账号所有者；入口：该卡片","summaries":[]},{"parent":"2e585f02-af78-40b5-b37c-d7769fad6da0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"31afc535-60a9-42f2-b7a9-850c8035e879","title":"操作：查看三列的高度与对齐","summaries":[]},{"parent":"2e585f02-af78-40b5-b37c-d7769fad6da0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5f98a8e7-bd1f-4f47-bc28-9b4b34a839ae","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 三列底部对齐，不因为额度区块高度不同而错位\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 缩小窗口后各列内容不重叠","summaries":[]},{"parent":"2e585f02-af78-40b5-b37c-d7769fad6da0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"de390559-74a5-4999-84f0-677142166ae4","title":"备注：每个 Agent 列底部的使用额度区块有三种态：有额度数据、读取失败、不支持","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2e585f02-af78-40b5-b37c-d7769fad6da0","title":"🟡【P2】额度区块与卡片高度","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"45938b4a-fa19-4648-9b2c-f769cc74e3be","title":"边界场景","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ffe7b42c-16fa-4f1e-bf1a-92f8c3610b47","title":"使用额度区块","summaries":[]},{"parent":"8136d43d-f9f5-4e8f-81f5-8b6b24b04fa9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"56613964-eb70-4a38-ac03-792d53758bf2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"52ad5bfe-da36-480e-be35-8ebdbb547b13","title":"说明：共享给我的按房间分组，组标题右侧是该房间的 Agent 数量","summaries":[]},{"parent":"56613964-eb70-4a38-ac03-792d53758bf2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6ab7e1f6-edc8-4802-bfc3-ecbaf84b5702","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"010f70f2-483f-433e-8133-f12ce4f361e4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"96ddc840-5d81-47bf-99ec-a9c0129e643e","title":"前置：我加入的多个房间里都有他人共享的 Agent；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享给我的页签","summaries":[]},{"parent":"010f70f2-483f-433e-8133-f12ce4f361e4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"89acd3d8-27eb-48d9-9a7e-e61855b970a5","title":"操作：查看列表","summaries":[]},{"parent":"010f70f2-483f-433e-8133-f12ce4f361e4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2218faa1-b3ad-4fab-b8ad-4da34125d7af","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 按房间分组，组标题为房间名，右上角展示该房间的 Agent 数量\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 每条展示所属成员名、Agent 名、所在电脑名与状态","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"010f70f2-483f-433e-8133-f12ce4f361e4","title":"🔴【P0】共享给我的按房间分组展示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"6ab7e1f6-edc8-4802-bfc3-ecbaf84b5702","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3445efb5-4306-4537-a684-dcf44dbe4d7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6a88a178-7fd6-45f5-a260-2b42f2f33ef0","title":"前置：某房间内有可用与离线的共享 Agent；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享给我的页签","summaries":[]},{"parent":"3445efb5-4306-4537-a684-dcf44dbe4d7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5c6bd097-ad68-4a1f-9a3a-1277f74cadf8","title":"操作：对照这里的状态与该房间成员面板里的状态","summaries":[]},{"parent":"3445efb5-4306-4537-a684-dcf44dbe4d7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c578a799-cc3c-4051-98ba-49d1f13f90bc","title":"预期：\n1) 可用状态 ｜ 两处结论一致，可用与离线的判定口径相同\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 可用为绿点、离线为灰点，标识一致","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3445efb5-4306-4537-a684-dcf44dbe4d7e","title":"🔴【P0】状态取值与成员面板一致","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"6ab7e1f6-edc8-4802-bfc3-ecbaf84b5702","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2c3680c0-e84e-4418-bb7f-165fca4b589d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a9cefee2-b902-4dd9-9bbd-bb9fbbe7e725","title":"前置：某房间下展示了 4 条 Agent；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享给我的页签","summaries":[]},{"parent":"2c3680c0-e84e-4418-bb7f-165fca4b589d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7343aa83-e9af-4085-8ab6-a75f8b086c6e","title":"操作：核对组标题右侧的数量","summaries":[]},{"parent":"2c3680c0-e84e-4418-bb7f-165fca4b589d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c81d5bc-cb0c-4d34-8549-4dacf0144318","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 数量与该组下的条目数一致\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 各组数量之和与页签上的总数口径一致","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2c3680c0-e84e-4418-bb7f-165fca4b589d","title":"🔴【P0】组内数量与条目数一致","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"6ab7e1f6-edc8-4802-bfc3-ecbaf84b5702","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9c01aee4-800f-47d9-a778-e26f8ddd338e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8557cb6e-9ce6-40ce-b1c5-82d03ed65264","title":"前置：共享给我的页签下有多条 Agent；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享给我的页签","summaries":[]},{"parent":"9c01aee4-800f-47d9-a778-e26f8ddd338e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"99176857-949a-4777-8b0a-a7cceab9d834","title":"操作：尝试操作这些条目","summaries":[]},{"parent":"9c01aee4-800f-47d9-a778-e26f8ddd338e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e560f69d-b6c7-4a1b-89b9-2baba71759e7","title":"预期：\n1) 权限授权 ｜ 不提供开关，我不能替别人开启或关闭共享\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 按产品定义可点击查看详情或纯展示，结论一致","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9c01aee4-800f-47d9-a778-e26f8ddd338e","title":"🟠【P1】我不能操作他人共享的条目","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"6ab7e1f6-edc8-4802-bfc3-ecbaf84b5702","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"534a73b1-7508-4c46-8db6-c323e7ab3e93","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f583a915-9c22-491f-a961-a4a6c7d7f3d1","title":"前置：共享给我的 tab 下有三个以上房间分组；角色：房间成员；入口：共享管理页 → 共享给我的","summaries":[]},{"parent":"534a73b1-7508-4c46-8db6-c323e7ab3e93","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d55834c4-761b-4e76-8394-19f31429176c","title":"操作：悬浮某个房间行看手柄，按住手柄把最后一个房间拖到最前，松手后刷新页面，再点该房间名","summaries":[]},{"parent":"534a73b1-7508-4c46-8db6-c323e7ab3e93","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a32bc259-0578-4465-9f65-073af04415eb","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 悬浮房间行时左侧出现拖拽手柄，不悬浮时不占位也不跳动\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 拖拽过程中有明确的落位指示，其余房间顺势让位\n3) 归属与顺序 ｜ 松手后该房间排到最前，组内的 Agent 卡片跟随整组移动，卡片内容与状态不变\n4) 持久化 ｜ 刷新页面后顺序保持，换标签页打开也是同一顺序\n5) 跳转定位 ｜ 点击房间名跳转到该房间，落在房间内\n6) 可见范围 ｜ 该排序只影响我自己的视图，不影响其他成员看到的顺序","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"534a73b1-7508-4c46-8db6-c323e7ab3e93","title":"🟠【P1】拖拽调整房间顺序并跳转 · 全链路","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"6ab7e1f6-edc8-4802-bfc3-ecbaf84b5702","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5dbe1902-94e9-4a16-beda-f086879d3596","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"57508d09-9fff-447d-ab2a-187860d43133","title":"前置：两个 tab 下都有房间行；角色：房间成员；入口：两处的房间名","summaries":[]},{"parent":"5dbe1902-94e9-4a16-beda-f086879d3596","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2b47cac9-831d-461d-97d9-b0c620a87aa5","title":"操作：分别从「我的 Agent」下的房间行与「共享给我的」下的房间组标题点进同一个房间","summaries":[]},{"parent":"5dbe1902-94e9-4a16-beda-f086879d3596","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"519616c5-4597-4913-9523-4895c60e8d8f","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 两处点击后跳到同一个房间，落地位置一致\n2) 会话状态 ｜ 两处跳转都不新建会话、不改动共享状态","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5dbe1902-94e9-4a16-beda-f086879d3596","title":"🟠【P1】我分享的与共享给我的两侧跳转一致","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6ab7e1f6-edc8-4802-bfc3-ecbaf84b5702","title":"正常场景","summaries":[]},{"parent":"56613964-eb70-4a38-ac03-792d53758bf2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1257015d-cd42-43b7-b75e-6ac089e95620","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7db31181-901e-4ba6-83bd-3e5185229f4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"563ae94b-6b9a-48e2-a596-3dc0f8ee79f2","title":"前置：某成员共享的 Agent 被其卸载，另一个登录已过期；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享给我的页签","summaries":[]},{"parent":"7db31181-901e-4ba6-83bd-3e5185229f4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a6ef95c2-3782-42e6-bbee-4e47a825c769","title":"操作：查看这两条","summaries":[]},{"parent":"7db31181-901e-4ba6-83bd-3e5185229f4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6d0355df-2aa4-413c-8dbd-275489946ff7","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 两条都仍展示在对应房间下\n2) 可用状态 ｜ 状态为不可用，且原因说明与离线可区分","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7db31181-901e-4ba6-83bd-3e5185229f4b","title":"🔴【P0】对方卸载或登录过期后的展示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"1257015d-cd42-43b7-b75e-6ac089e95620","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ec07ecda-d366-479a-8455-fa60a6c409c3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6ee2f802-e5b2-4977-9611-2ee898563cf0","title":"前置：某成员解绑了共享 Agent 所在的电脑；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享给我的页签","summaries":[]},{"parent":"ec07ecda-d366-479a-8455-fa60a6c409c3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0c960c51-fd5e-453e-9026-80f9cc81104c","title":"操作：查看该房间分组","summaries":[]},{"parent":"ec07ecda-d366-479a-8455-fa60a6c409c3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3aacb6d7-1d74-42fc-a42c-cb620154e45f","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 该条从列表移除，不是展示为不可用\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 该房间的 Agent 数量与页签总数同步减少","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ec07ecda-d366-479a-8455-fa60a6c409c3","title":"🔴【P0】对方解绑电脑后条目移除","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"1257015d-cd42-43b7-b75e-6ac089e95620","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"165d21b8-d857-4ef4-bfb4-3677d2630371","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"181b6d87-37a9-4705-aa5d-fb4c8447c9e1","title":"前置：某成员关闭了某个 Agent 在这个房间的共享；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享给我的页签","summaries":[]},{"parent":"165d21b8-d857-4ef4-bfb4-3677d2630371","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2bcbfac3-ea99-4ba3-a482-10ca28e1ba41","title":"操作：查看该房间分组","summaries":[]},{"parent":"165d21b8-d857-4ef4-bfb4-3677d2630371","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"31e08b65-3444-4a90-95df-96336f5740a4","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 该条从这个房间的分组中移除\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 若该 Agent 在另一个房间仍共享，则那个房间的分组中仍然展示","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"165d21b8-d857-4ef4-bfb4-3677d2630371","title":"🔴【P0】对方关闭共享后条目移除","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"1257015d-cd42-43b7-b75e-6ac089e95620","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ec7b0b1c-4ce2-431d-9f0b-c2bf12233538","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cf68904d-354a-425d-9372-05fbe9fb0f51","title":"前置：共享给我的页签下有该房间的分组；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享给我的页签","summaries":[]},{"parent":"ec7b0b1c-4ce2-431d-9f0b-c2bf12233538","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"06a1ef63-05f6-48de-b3ea-08bd79fa6d9b","title":"操作：退出该房间后回到本页","summaries":[]},{"parent":"ec7b0b1c-4ce2-431d-9f0b-c2bf12233538","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d86b453a-044f-4912-aafc-a70e9eb1a067","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 该房间的整个分组从列表移除\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 页签上的数量同步减少","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ec7b0b1c-4ce2-431d-9f0b-c2bf12233538","title":"🟠【P1】我退出某个房间","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"1257015d-cd42-43b7-b75e-6ac089e95620","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f728a538-fe0d-4743-8b4b-495b0404f742","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"92e7ce34-be65-42ae-bcd4-e9f7c045d7dd","title":"前置：共享给我的下有多个房间；模拟排序保存接口失败；角色：房间成员；入口：房间行拖拽手柄","summaries":[]},{"parent":"f728a538-fe0d-4743-8b4b-495b0404f742","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb93a37e-0eb1-4bf0-80b7-721f9db7a38d","title":"操作：拖动一个房间后松手让保存失败；另一轮把房间拖到列表外或拖到某个 Agent 卡片上松手","summaries":[]},{"parent":"f728a538-fe0d-4743-8b4b-495b0404f742","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"17994622-1ba3-473c-87a3-f9fca183ed60","title":"预期：\n1) 恢复重试 ｜ 保存失败时顺序回滚到拖动前并给出提示，刷新后仍是原顺序\n2) 归属与顺序 ｜ 拖到非法位置松手时回到原位，不出现房间嵌进另一个房间或卡片错位","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f728a538-fe0d-4743-8b4b-495b0404f742","title":"🟡【P2】拖拽保存失败与拖到非法位置","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1257015d-cd42-43b7-b75e-6ac089e95620","title":"异常场景","icons":[],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"56613964-eb70-4a38-ac03-792d53758bf2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cb57a5e2-c582-4f42-8bf2-34a46370e8a1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cc41abf8-3d43-435a-95ee-0033db4dab82","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"94c8e96f-f6bb-43c9-9a9e-97d794ec1b13","title":"前置：我加入的某个房间里没有人开启共享；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享给我的页签","summaries":[]},{"parent":"cc41abf8-3d43-435a-95ee-0033db4dab82","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"461e5680-a050-4a48-bb24-0b6ec62654fa","title":"操作：查看该房间","summaries":[]},{"parent":"cc41abf8-3d43-435a-95ee-0033db4dab82","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"57778caf-7823-4c7a-9cb5-39d8a19b2bd6","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 该房间的分组不展示，或展示为 0 个 Agent 的空态，行为一致","summaries":[]},{"parent":"cc41abf8-3d43-435a-95ee-0033db4dab82","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc79c3b8-bc9e-4fc8-9ae0-121d00732f3e","title":"备注：共享 Agent 全局 tab：顶部是常驻的安全说明横幅，下面是「我的 Agent」与「共享给我的」两个页签并带计数。我的 Agent 按【电脑】分组成卡片，卡片内每个 Agent 一列，列内自上而下是可用状态、共享到房间的房间开关列表、使用额度区块；共享给我的按房间分组","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cc41abf8-3d43-435a-95ee-0033db4dab82","title":"🟡【P2】某房间没有任何共享 Agent","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"cb57a5e2-c582-4f42-8bf2-34a46370e8a1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f61ba329-5ff3-4020-b327-78ce7269a3cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"339f84f4-461b-4b64-a4e8-5c5e17ef74b8","title":"前置：第一轮共享给我的只有一个房间分组；第二轮拖拽过程中有人把新 Agent 共享给我产生新分组；角色：房间成员；入口：共享给我的","summaries":[]},{"parent":"f61ba329-5ff3-4020-b327-78ce7269a3cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dfc2570c-9424-461e-a761-65bf10713c08","title":"操作：第一轮尝试拖拽唯一的房间；第二轮在拖拽未松手时让新分组出现","summaries":[]},{"parent":"f61ba329-5ff3-4020-b327-78ce7269a3cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b40bcc0c-a450-4d80-8bed-071e372363af","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 只有一个房间时拖拽不报错，松手后位置不变\n2) 归属与顺序 ｜ 拖拽中新增的分组不打断当前拖拽，松手后新分组按默认位置插入，已有顺序不乱","summaries":[]},{"parent":"f61ba329-5ff3-4020-b327-78ce7269a3cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"89bf0992-c0d3-4cd3-955f-6a816ff3434e","title":"备注：「共享给我的」按房间分组，房间行左侧悬浮出现拖拽手柄，可拖拽调整房间顺序；房间名可点击跳转到对应房间","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f61ba329-5ff3-4020-b327-78ce7269a3cd","title":"🟡【P2】只有一个房间与拖拽中有新房间加入","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cb57a5e2-c582-4f42-8bf2-34a46370e8a1","title":"边界场景","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"56613964-eb70-4a38-ac03-792d53758bf2","title":"共享给我的 · 按房间分组","summaries":[]},{"parent":"8136d43d-f9f5-4e8f-81f5-8b6b24b04fa9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d4bf381a-9b0d-4190-87b5-087e13daaa1f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8cd16217-3314-44eb-aa9d-ac8d415e544c","title":"说明：共享 Agent 页、房间成员面板、电脑页三处的口径一致性","summaries":[]},{"parent":"d4bf381a-9b0d-4190-87b5-087e13daaa1f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9e07e718-12a6-461b-b48f-2d85dd46708c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"50b88e50-5b96-442f-aff2-91cd3ed279cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f4b418d0-9225-4a7d-bcde-e46b8ab0c505","title":"前置：共享给我的页签当前打开；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享给我的页签","summaries":[]},{"parent":"50b88e50-5b96-442f-aff2-91cd3ed279cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4f10afe6-0372-4a7d-9cbc-25ed410fd14c","title":"操作：某成员在某房间开启一个 Agent 的共享","summaries":[]},{"parent":"50b88e50-5b96-442f-aff2-91cd3ed279cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f62baa5d-aa6c-49b4-9c77-38f09e8f596d","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 该条实时出现在对应房间分组下\n2) 性能 ｜ 不需要点刷新或重进页面","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"50b88e50-5b96-442f-aff2-91cd3ed279cd","title":"🔴【P0】他人开启共享后实时出现","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"9e07e718-12a6-461b-b48f-2d85dd46708c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7e61edd0-c1b3-40e5-8626-83c2d67624ee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f5c33672-b7a6-4ffa-ae30-e022ab8e2a82","title":"前置：共享给我的页签中有一条可用的 Agent；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享给我的页签","summaries":[]},{"parent":"7e61edd0-c1b3-40e5-8626-83c2d67624ee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2782fc8d-a43c-47a8-a8ce-0fa82207b56f","title":"操作：对方电脑离线后再恢复在线","summaries":[]},{"parent":"7e61edd0-c1b3-40e5-8626-83c2d67624ee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cc175d51-cd17-40ed-aa95-506023260c36","title":"预期：\n1) 可用状态 ｜ 状态在合理时间内跟随变化\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 恢复在线后自动变回可用","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7e61edd0-c1b3-40e5-8626-83c2d67624ee","title":"🔴【P0】共享页对方电脑上下线的实时同步","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"9e07e718-12a6-461b-b48f-2d85dd46708c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7e564d1b-4aa7-43a8-8557-5e93861433a2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"42098919-e59e-4c0d-a80c-1a4c1d9f9f9e","title":"前置：同一个 Agent 同时出现在共享 Agent 页、房间成员面板与电脑页；角色：账号所有者；入口：三处","summaries":[]},{"parent":"7e564d1b-4aa7-43a8-8557-5e93861433a2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a6960fe5-cfff-4c1e-b4b3-873963065787","title":"操作：对照同一个 Agent 在三处的共享状态与可用状态","summaries":[]},{"parent":"7e564d1b-4aa7-43a8-8557-5e93861433a2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8c96946c-87dc-4d16-b11b-1b3f4877af61","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 三处的共享开关状态一致，可用状态判定口径一致\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 电脑名与 Agent 名的展示写法一致，不出现同一台电脑三种叫法","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7e564d1b-4aa7-43a8-8557-5e93861433a2","title":"🟠【P1】三处口径一致性抽检","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]},{"parent":"9e07e718-12a6-461b-b48f-2d85dd46708c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aae04220-4e0f-40f1-9df7-2d7f591e1a3a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"518d8a58-c449-47ca-ab7f-5d4c2d7692ad","title":"前置：我在两个标签页都打开了共享 Agent 页；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享 Agent 页","summaries":[]},{"parent":"aae04220-4e0f-40f1-9df7-2d7f591e1a3a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"51722ea5-a5b1-4943-8c3d-6ba589d055fb","title":"操作：在一个标签页里开关某个房间的共享","summaries":[]},{"parent":"aae04220-4e0f-40f1-9df7-2d7f591e1a3a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"35b29a0c-4564-436d-aae7-54ed7bbb6ea0","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 另一个标签页同步更新\n2) 持久化 ｜ 刷新后两个标签页结论一致","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aae04220-4e0f-40f1-9df7-2d7f591e1a3a","title":"🟠【P1】多标签页一致性","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}],"summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9e07e718-12a6-461b-b48f-2d85dd46708c","title":"正常场景","summaries":[]},{"parent":"d4bf381a-9b0d-4190-87b5-087e13daaa1f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8efc397a-5a7c-4c7f-986d-a4792f837b25","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5b2e7306-eedb-49b4-9893-c980943f32d7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1ea77a34-246b-4da0-9a47-828571159599","title":"前置：我加入了几十个房间且有多台电脑多个 Agent；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享 Agent 页","summaries":[]},{"parent":"5b2e7306-eedb-49b4-9893-c980943f32d7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4c694b8-96f1-456a-afef-711a7c19b56c","title":"操作：展开多条并滚动","summaries":[]},{"parent":"5b2e7306-eedb-49b4-9893-c980943f32d7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"447ce9c7-c49d-4e82-bbaf-469d1f7f7e59","title":"预期：\n1) 性能 ｜ 展开与滚动流畅，计数计算不卡顿\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 全部内容可完整浏览","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5b2e7306-eedb-49b4-9893-c980943f32d7","title":"🟡【P2】大量房间与 Agent","summaries":[]},{"parent":"8efc397a-5a7c-4c7f-986d-a4792f837b25","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d6476c60-a0ef-4f12-a147-89d04e779a1e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3627e0ac-126d-4f25-8bb5-88745d95951c","title":"前置：多名成员在短时间内反复开关共享；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享给我的页签","summaries":[]},{"parent":"d6476c60-a0ef-4f12-a147-89d04e779a1e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6574e3ab-43b3-4566-b759-b202b82f8fbf","title":"操作：持续观察列表","summaries":[]},{"parent":"d6476c60-a0ef-4f12-a147-89d04e779a1e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fadca8d2-9f26-4321-a55a-565e7b550f88","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 最终状态与实际一致，不出现条目闪烁或重复\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 各房间数量与页签总数最终正确","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d6476c60-a0ef-4f12-a147-89d04e779a1e","title":"🟡【P2】频繁变更时的稳定性","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8efc397a-5a7c-4c7f-986d-a4792f837b25","title":"边界场景","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d4bf381a-9b0d-4190-87b5-087e13daaa1f","title":"实时同步与一致性","summaries":[]}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"background":"#7F8B98","text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"8136d43d-f9f5-4e8f-81f5-8b6b24b04fa9","title":"共享管理","summaries":[]},{"parent":"688c0e9e-546d-4e6b-ab52-d776fa9a0c3b","customWidth":144.2,"callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d5b2b21c-3a66-4a53-aa30-30a423ab18e1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7c7f204c-68a0-435d-b83d-93c7d7e08f54","title":"说明：需求来源《Tutti API与自定义模型》（2026-10-13）。本模块包含模型来源弹窗、会话模型选择与执行、各 Agent 差异，以及与用量、使用概览、额度保护的联动。全部口径已与 Sun 确认，写在各分组说明里；用例按通用 Agent 写，差异集中在「各 Agent 差异」。"},{"parent":"d5b2b21c-3a66-4a53-aa30-30a423ab18e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"02615231-f2eb-45c0-8980-3fbf2ebd1c7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"93ea5275-c964-4be5-abee-4a9aacfdeb2a","title":"说明：从 Computer 页点击某个 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗，也可以从会话模型下拉的「配置自定义模型」打开。弹窗里有三块：厂商提供、Tutti API、API Key（自定义配置）。用例按通用 Agent 写，执行时对照「各 Agent 差异」每个 Agent 跑一遍；Tutti Agent 没有这个弹窗。"},{"parent":"02615231-f2eb-45c0-8980-3fbf2ebd1c7e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"31c2facb-ca08-4436-861f-e1dd592c6b8b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8cdef6a8-5b36-414c-ac34-d4dbff29c7e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a424a99f-077c-4b16-9416-f555c2a21e7d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4846d297-791c-4749-a5b0-50542c41dd8b","title":"前置：该电脑已绑定且在线，该 Agent 已安装；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"a424a99f-077c-4b16-9416-f555c2a21e7d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0757388b-0263-4a4b-a280-43b5bf1548c4","title":"操作：在 Agents 列表中点击一个非 Tutti Agent，查看弹窗"},{"parent":"a424a99f-077c-4b16-9416-f555c2a21e7d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"15238db9-0fb6-4b8b-8e45-82391ca51197","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 弹窗标题为「{Agent 名称} · 模型来源」，左侧带该 Agent 图标\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 自上而下依次为三块卡片：厂商提供（或官方订阅）、Tutti API、API Key\n3) 列表展示 ｜ API Key 卡片带「+ 新增」按钮和副标题「用你自己的 Key 接入更多模型」\n4) 结果校验 ｜ 依次打开其他已安装 Agent 的弹窗，标题和内容都对应各自的 Agent，不串用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a424a99f-077c-4b16-9416-f555c2a21e7d","title":"🔴【P0】从 Computer 页打开模型来源弹窗","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"8cdef6a8-5b36-414c-ac34-d4dbff29c7e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"07326ca2-6a72-4d04-8e5a-b3cef25f9e2b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c557e742-c89a-4927-a4be-e4eb297cf82e","title":"前置：房间会话已选中一个自己的非 Tutti Agent；角色：账号所有者；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉左下角「配置自定义模型」"},{"parent":"07326ca2-6a72-4d04-8e5a-b3cef25f9e2b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8016131a-75ff-4b7c-959c-feb6423d6bb3","title":"操作：展开模型下拉，点击「配置自定义模型」，再与 Computer 页打开的同一 Agent 弹窗对照"},{"parent":"07326ca2-6a72-4d04-8e5a-b3cef25f9e2b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae1ba178-0ea9-407f-ae22-d9d523e387ca","title":"预期：\n1) 跳转定位 ｜ 打开的是当前所选 Agent 的模型来源弹窗\n2) 等价性 ｜ 三块卡片的内容与 Computer 页入口打开的弹窗逐项一致，是同一份数据的两个入口\n3) 会话状态 ｜ 关闭弹窗后回到会话，已选模型和输入框中的内容都不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"07326ca2-6a72-4d04-8e5a-b3cef25f9e2b","title":"🟠【P1】从模型下拉的「配置自定义模型」打开同一弹窗","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8cdef6a8-5b36-414c-ac34-d4dbff29c7e3","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"31c2facb-ca08-4436-861f-e1dd592c6b8b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e3de12f0-bc5d-4ecd-bef6-4e90bedbcf1b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cb5b5808-4c7d-4eb3-8ad5-5850e685754a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c4fa156-d862-4518-ade1-c8e19fa11f48","title":"前置：模型来源弹窗已打开；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"cb5b5808-4c7d-4eb3-8ad5-5850e685754a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"25061bc9-e101-45e3-bc24-2cb631a6f743","title":"操作：分别用右上角 X、点击遮罩、按 Esc 关闭弹窗"},{"parent":"cb5b5808-4c7d-4eb3-8ad5-5850e685754a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a98c8dbf-d85b-4fec-aa6d-926e8121a8ae","title":"预期：\n1) 副作用 ｜ 三种方式关闭的行为一致，不丢失已保存的配置\n2) 持久化 ｜ 再次打开，内容与关闭前一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cb5b5808-4c7d-4eb3-8ad5-5850e685754a","title":"🟡【P2】三种关闭方式行为一致","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e3de12f0-bc5d-4ecd-bef6-4e90bedbcf1b","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"31c2facb-ca08-4436-861f-e1dd592c6b8b","title":"弹窗入口与整体框架"},{"parent":"02615231-f2eb-45c0-8980-3fbf2ebd1c7e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d073765d-fbae-4160-a952-aa7496887236","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ced4a3d3-598f-4c17-b421-cb7d491d0c3b","title":"说明：第一块卡片展示本机该 Agent 自己的配置，按本机实际情况分三种状态：本机配了 API Key（显示「厂商提供 · 已配置 API Key」）、已登录官方账号（显示「官方订阅」与账号、额度窗口）、无任何配置（显示「官方订阅 · 未登录」与「登录」按钮）。"},{"parent":"d073765d-fbae-4160-a952-aa7496887236","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f1cdd6e8-2156-4a50-b991-3ac19bfc010b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"06799c8b-9464-4185-bc87-80a09a8661ad","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"de17d6f1-23fe-46db-b1f5-203c0e7c216a","title":"前置：本机已通过 cc-switch 等方式为该 Agent 配置 API Key，未登录官方账号；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"06799c8b-9464-4185-bc87-80a09a8661ad","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a7d6fde4-5050-4428-a2a4-1b6aa3307ef0","title":"操作：查看第一块卡片"},{"parent":"06799c8b-9464-4185-bc87-80a09a8661ad","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"62143c4b-edb9-4718-8a81-bd04eb563499","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"97886f4e-90dc-4835-892b-f6a8b5cedd76","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"15751545-f4c0-4193-9dd9-a75081712d3d","title":"显示API但也仍显示了已登录和登录按钮","icons":[{"color":"rgb(248, 87, 103)","name":"other","index":"369"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"97886f4e-90dc-4835-892b-f6a8b5cedd76","title":"claude"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"62143c4b-edb9-4718-8a81-bd04eb563499","title":"预期：<br>1) 列表展示 ｜ 卡片标题为「厂商提供」，标签为「API Usage<b>&nbsp;Billing</b>」<br>2) 提示文案 ｜ 说明文字为「使用此电脑上 {Agent} 的配置」<br>3) 按钮状态 ｜ 不展示「登录」按钮<br>4) 结果校验 ｜ 模型下拉里「厂商提供」分类列出的模型与本机这套配置可用的模型一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"06799c8b-9464-4185-bc87-80a09a8661ad","title":"🔴【P0】本机已配置 API Key 时的展示"},{"parent":"f1cdd6e8-2156-4a50-b991-3ac19bfc010b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"87990e5d-a482-49a8-b1ba-e6e0492e785f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5cdcaefd-c82f-472f-89eb-3d1ed7b39e1f","title":"前置：本机已用官方账号登录该 Agent；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"87990e5d-a482-49a8-b1ba-e6e0492e785f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"deaedae1-f051-4bc5-9809-19867f3c17ea","title":"操作：查看第一块卡片"},{"parent":"87990e5d-a482-49a8-b1ba-e6e0492e785f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"584e0765-1c9a-4b10-8442-9573fcd82c63","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"01817351-4a09-432c-943d-4a049ecb0284","title":"codex","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"584e0765-1c9a-4b10-8442-9573fcd82c63","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 卡片标题为「官方订阅」，展示「账号邮箱 · 套餐」\n2) 用量 ｜ 展示额度窗口（如「每周」）、更新时间与剩余百分比，进度条与百分比一致\n3) 等价性 ｜ 账号与剩余额度与 Computer 页 Agents 列表、共享管理页展示的一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"87990e5d-a482-49a8-b1ba-e6e0492e785f","title":"🔴【P0】已登录官方账号时的展示"},{"parent":"f1cdd6e8-2156-4a50-b991-3ac19bfc010b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"955a0498-e0aa-4d4e-af88-8c7d28898e39","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"56d8d54d-6df0-4532-a2ff-eab7973731d5","title":"前置：本机该 Agent 已安装，无任何官方账号或 API Key 配置；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"955a0498-e0aa-4d4e-af88-8c7d28898e39","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7182992b-3218-45e6-8ae4-03f4b9300c14","title":"操作：查看第一块卡片，点击「登录」，在打开的网页中完成登录后回到弹窗，再到会话中用厂商提供的模型发一条消息"},{"parent":"955a0498-e0aa-4d4e-af88-8c7d28898e39","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76980cc9-354f-41c2-aaa1-565dc032ad0a","title":"预期：\n1) 登录状态 ｜ 登录前卡片显示「官方订阅 · 未登录」，说明文字含「请在这台电脑上登录 Agent 后继续使用。」，右侧有「登录」按钮\n2) 跳转定位 ｜ 点击「登录」打开该 Agent 的登录网页\n3) 登录状态 ｜ 完成登录后卡片切换为已登录态，展示账号与额度，「登录」按钮消失\n4) 列表展示 ｜ 模型下拉「厂商提供」分类出现该账号可用的模型，数量与右侧条数一致\n5) 结果回传 ｜ 选厂商提供的模型发送消息，正常收到回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"955a0498-e0aa-4d4e-af88-8c7d28898e39","title":"🔴【P0】未登录时点击登录并完成登录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f1cdd6e8-2156-4a50-b991-3ac19bfc010b","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"d073765d-fbae-4160-a952-aa7496887236","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3129f607-2fbb-45e4-b697-8250a5174051","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d6f1bc28-4cc2-4e00-8f3b-868214068390","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1d51e201-12c1-4c38-b75c-295b3068a3a1","title":"前置：卡片为未登录态；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"d6f1bc28-4cc2-4e00-8f3b-868214068390","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b73677a7-16eb-43c1-92a0-600b4b7a31e4","title":"操作：点击「登录」后不完成授权，直接关闭登录网页，回到弹窗后再次点击「登录」"},{"parent":"d6f1bc28-4cc2-4e00-8f3b-868214068390","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f282f208-9091-4448-b201-d5ed0aa8adaa","title":"预期：\n1) 登录状态 ｜ 卡片保持未登录态，不提前显示为已登录\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ 「登录」按钮可再次点击，第二次能正常拉起登录并完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d6f1bc28-4cc2-4e00-8f3b-868214068390","title":"🟡【P2】登录中途关闭网页"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3129f607-2fbb-45e4-b697-8250a5174051","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"d073765d-fbae-4160-a952-aa7496887236","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8c8c96ed-52a3-471d-b9a0-39d9a093beff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ceefa6e4-a995-43ae-adac-3897cabcdd18","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"07f0bab2-a271-406c-9004-b7597d5a803a","title":"前置：弹窗已打开，卡片为已配置 API Key 态；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"ceefa6e4-a995-43ae-adac-3897cabcdd18","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"87db4e7e-cbc0-47a9-8a14-87ecf9e59fb9","title":"操作：保持弹窗打开，在本机用 cc-switch 切到官方账号配置，然后关闭并重新打开弹窗"},{"parent":"ceefa6e4-a995-43ae-adac-3897cabcdd18","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e3260945-10d8-4de0-b652-1dfb18ee7c69","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 重新打开后卡片按本机当前配置展示为官方订阅态，不沿用旧状态\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 模型下拉「厂商提供」分类的模型随之刷新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ceefa6e4-a995-43ae-adac-3897cabcdd18","title":"🟡【P2】弹窗打开期间本机配置发生变化"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8c8c96ed-52a3-471d-b9a0-39d9a093beff","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d073765d-fbae-4160-a952-aa7496887236","title":"厂商提供卡片"},{"parent":"02615231-f2eb-45c0-8980-3fbf2ebd1c7e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3b173854-ffbe-4f55-b437-57b2f9c1b243","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4ddaa1b0-a7d1-47fb-9523-f93e5328b2fb","title":"说明：Tutti API 对所有 Agent 默认可用，卡片展示当前 Tutti 账号的积分。已定口径：点「&gt;」打开用量页（与头像菜单点积分的去处一致）；点「升级会员」跳转 https://tutti.sh/profile/plan。"},{"parent":"3b173854-ffbe-4f55-b437-57b2f9c1b243","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4e59c5af-6942-45cb-9b5e-617b983592a2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cefa9b4f-1a3b-4b9c-aacd-85a18e86e224","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c0daded7-29cd-4981-87ac-2d004188e76b","title":"前置：已登录 Tutti 账号且有积分余额；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"cefa9b4f-1a3b-4b9c-aacd-85a18e86e224","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b65fa075-c6e3-4973-9df9-205afd2813ea","title":"操作：查看 Tutti API 卡片，再依次打开其他 Agent 的弹窗，并对照左下角头像菜单"},{"parent":"cefa9b4f-1a3b-4b9c-aacd-85a18e86e224","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8f66f362-8c19-40e4-bb91-e00d9afc11f7","title":"预期：\n1) 用量 ｜ 卡片展示的积分与头像菜单中的积分一致\n2) 等价性 ｜ 所有 Agent 弹窗里的 Tutti API 积分都相同，积分是账号级的，不按 Agent 区分\n3) 按钮状态 ｜ 积分右侧有「&gt;」，右下角有「升级会员」按钮"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cefa9b4f-1a3b-4b9c-aacd-85a18e86e224","title":"🔴【P0】积分展示与账号一致","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"4e59c5af-6942-45cb-9b5e-617b983592a2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"14997b3c-01af-4267-b6c8-acf0c7124357","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9aeb6401-5ba0-4bff-babe-26b7734c8be7","title":"前置：已登录 Tutti 账号；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗的「升级会员」按钮"},{"parent":"14997b3c-01af-4267-b6c8-acf0c7124357","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9a7932e8-d903-470c-b242-5a017e10bdd3","title":"操作：点击「升级会员」，在打开的页面上选择一个套餐完成升级，再回到弹窗"},{"parent":"14997b3c-01af-4267-b6c8-acf0c7124357","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"952829b3-038e-484d-83af-b8de0a107e92","title":"预期：\n1) 跳转定位 ｜ 打开 https://tutti.sh/profile/plan\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 页面上可以选择套餐并完成升级\n3) 用量 ｜ 升级后重新打开弹窗，套餐与积分按升级结果刷新，并与头像菜单一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"14997b3c-01af-4267-b6c8-acf0c7124357","title":"🔴【P0】点击升级会员跳转套餐页并可升级","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"4e59c5af-6942-45cb-9b5e-617b983592a2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b379b45b-f20d-4a46-a577-da4306f7f09b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4654eb0c-3fae-4db6-a1a3-832b851d191d","title":"前置：已登录 Tutti 账号；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗积分右侧的「&gt;」"},{"parent":"b379b45b-f20d-4a46-a577-da4306f7f09b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"93cd4cee-b410-4db6-88d9-1d0c4594dfc0","title":"操作：点击「&gt;」"},{"parent":"b379b45b-f20d-4a46-a577-da4306f7f09b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc4fa938-2669-4ffe-8208-d563ff44876f","title":"预期：\n1) 跳转定位 ｜ 打开用量页面并展示该账号的积分明细，与头像菜单点击积分打开的页面一致\n2) 登录状态 ｜ 打开后仍是当前账号，不要求重新登录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b379b45b-f20d-4a46-a577-da4306f7f09b","title":"🟠【P1】点击积分旁的「&gt;」打开用量页","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4e59c5af-6942-45cb-9b5e-617b983592a2","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"3b173854-ffbe-4f55-b437-57b2f9c1b243","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"48eafb43-8e39-46eb-916f-c0f00dd010b2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7141b995-c588-4e48-9192-19fc2f4c5a41","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"78665638-c77a-42ac-ac36-b5c4687f2f0a","title":"前置：账号 A 积分带小数（如 351.1），账号 B 积分超过六位数；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"7141b995-c588-4e48-9192-19fc2f4c5a41","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0b864ad9-f679-4c34-a8f6-332380ef4e9d","title":"操作：分别登录两个账号查看 Tutti API 卡片"},{"parent":"7141b995-c588-4e48-9192-19fc2f4c5a41","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0e5b7067-1075-4cfc-a59f-a8b3e89bb5a0","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 小数按原值展示，不出现 351.0999999 这类浮点误差\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 大额积分完整展示，不把「升级会员」按钮挤出卡片\n3) 等价性 ｜ 与头像菜单中的展示一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7141b995-c588-4e48-9192-19fc2f4c5a41","title":"🟡【P2】Tutti API 卡片积分为小数与大额时的展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"48eafb43-8e39-46eb-916f-c0f00dd010b2","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3b173854-ffbe-4f55-b437-57b2f9c1b243","title":"Tutti API 卡片"},{"parent":"02615231-f2eb-45c0-8980-3fbf2ebd1c7e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cbd86bdb-92c8-4d2f-bb5f-6245c1e7c1c4","customWidth":507.2,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"07bf6c19-1291-4f0c-9235-49ad0aa90dec","title":"说明：点 API Key 卡片的「+ 新增」打开「新增自定义模型」。字段有：配置名称（占位「例如：我的中转服务」）、API 协议（只读，按当前 Agent 显示）、Base URL（占位「https://api.example.com/v1」）、API Key（占位「粘贴 API Key」，默认掩码，可点眼睛切换），以及「获取模型列表」按钮。已定口径：配置名称、Base URL、API Key 三项必填，并且至少要有一个模型（自动获取到的或手动填的模型 ID），否则不能保存；Base URL 不是网址时提示「请输入网址」；新增成功后默认已绑定，排在 API Key 列表最上面。"},{"parent":"cbd86bdb-92c8-4d2f-bb5f-6245c1e7c1c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ad8abf58-4ad3-466d-9b90-8770a1a3f4a0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9194a009-a321-43a0-9e1d-a08178f1034a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1d8a50a9-a285-4c86-b8c9-59e87442c759","title":"前置：持有一个可用的中转服务 Base URL 与 API Key，该服务支持当前 Agent 的协议；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗的 API Key 卡片「+ 新增」"},{"parent":"9194a009-a321-43a0-9e1d-a08178f1034a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13ee22ee-e9a4-4bd5-918d-bada9c64fcba","title":"操作：点「+ 新增」，填写名称、Base URL、Key，点「获取模型列表」后保存；随后查看同协议与不同协议的 Agent 弹窗，最后在会话中选这个配置里的模型发送消息"},{"parent":"9194a009-a321-43a0-9e1d-a08178f1034a","customWidth":481.2,"callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1c8e27c1-662f-4fc6-afc0-195cd0042e27","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e548533f-69c4-4612-830d-629c525bb1ea","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"51e1c4e9-70b0-44d9-b8d7-56badf3e4b3e","title":"minimax","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e548533f-69c4-4612-830d-629c525bb1ea","title":"codex"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1c8e27c1-662f-4fc6-afc0-195cd0042e27","title":"预期：<br>1) 面板开关 ｜ 进入「新增自定义模型」页面，左上角有「&lt;」返回，右上角有关闭按钮<br>2) 结果校验 ｜ API 协议只读，按当前 Agent 显示（对照「各 Agent 差异」里的协议表）<br>3) 按钮状态 ｜ 获取成功后按钮变为「刷新模型」，旁边显示「N 个模型」，下方逐个列出模型标签<br>4) 列表展示 ｜ 保存后回到模型来源弹窗，新配置在 API Key 列表最上面，显示配置名称、「已绑定」和 Base URL 的域名<br>5) 可见范围 ｜ 使用同一协议的其他 Agent 的弹窗里同步出现该配置，并且默认不绑定<br>6) 可见范围 ｜ 协议不同的 Agent 的弹窗与模型下拉里都不出现该配置<br>7) 列表展示 ｜ 当前 Agent 的模型下拉左侧新增一个以该配置名称命名的分类，右侧数量与获取到的模型数一致<br>8) 结果回传 ｜ 选这个分类里的模型发送消息，正常收到回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9194a009-a321-43a0-9e1d-a08178f1034a","title":"🔴【P0】新增自定义模型完整链路","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"ad8abf58-4ad3-466d-9b90-8770a1a3f4a0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fe1d29ea-b034-4fb0-93a5-8881eecc12e9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d234485a-3b8e-4ab0-a40f-2434d6d2cbd4","title":"前置：Base URL 和API Key 正确；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗的「+ 新增」"},{"parent":"fe1d29ea-b034-4fb0-93a5-8881eecc12e9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5a89f820-aa85-4e26-bac7-c8482b4e0547","title":"操作：点「获取模型列表」"},{"parent":"fe1d29ea-b034-4fb0-93a5-8881eecc12e9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9d9961b1-717e-4ba9-9b3a-37db87bed985","title":"预期：<br>1) 能正确获取到模型列表"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fe1d29ea-b034-4fb0-93a5-8881eecc12e9","title":"🟠【P1】Base URL和API Key 都正确时才能获取模型","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"ad8abf58-4ad3-466d-9b90-8770a1a3f4a0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4257f50b-d890-4304-93dc-e934aa2ff08e"