le":"操作：修改 Key 后点保存，失败后重试"},{"parent":"5689db7e-0c71-444f-a70e-04c69a31546c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"43aac18a-8172-4ff7-a7a3-8cd14b20f7b0","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示保存失败，已修改的内容保留，可以重试\n2) 副作用 ｜ 失败期间当前 Agent 与同协议 Agent 下的配置仍为原内容，用原配置发消息仍正常\n3) 结果校验 ｜ 重试成功后各处一起更新为新内容，不出现一处新一处旧"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5689db7e-0c71-444f-a70e-04c69a31546c","title":"🟡【P2】编辑保存失败不覆盖原配置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5544771d-142f-43d6-8af4-9b7e9416be6a","title":"异常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e6d0395f-cd2e-4c96-bbf5-4aef7403f02d","title":"API Key · 编辑"},{"parent":"02615231-f2eb-45c0-8980-3fbf2ebd1c7e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"30caec8f-1ed0-4fdd-ad99-cd4e7a551d85","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"336171d4-3598-4cb5-9cd3-3c26d1ed9689","title":"说明：已定口径：绑定与解绑按 Agent 各自独立。解绑后不显示「已绑定」，这个配置的模型也不再出现在该 Agent 的模型下拉里；重新绑定后恢复。"},{"parent":"30caec8f-1ed0-4fdd-ad99-cd4e7a551d85","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e8ff9d08-6ec3-4554-83b7-c032ec50a4ea","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"98c7b709-f904-4d62-bb69-cb88293be9be","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"421c5ed5-a0cb-4f93-b44e-a5efe37b9896","title":"前置：当前 Agent 下有已绑定的配置 Minimax；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗配置行的「…」"},{"parent":"98c7b709-f904-4d62-bb69-cb88293be9be","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4ee4e304-00ba-4df0-b015-620c0caf45e2","title":"操作：点「…」›「解绑」，查看列表与模型下拉；再点「…」›「绑定」，查看列表与模型下拉并发一条消息"},{"parent":"98c7b709-f904-4d62-bb69-cb88293be9be","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e8bd968f-812d-4705-b9b1-bb9daae61027","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 解绑后这一行不再显示「已绑定」，名称与域名仍在\n2) 菜单展示 ｜ 解绑后菜单变为「编辑」「绑定」「删除」\n3) 可见范围 ｜ 模型下拉左侧的 Minimax 分类消失，搜索也搜不到它的模型\n4) 列表展示 ｜ 重新绑定后恢复显示「已绑定」，菜单恢复为「编辑」「解绑」「删除」\n5) 可见范围 ｜ 模型下拉重新出现 Minimax 分类，数量与解绑前一致\n6) 结果回传 ｜ 选这个分类里的模型发送消息，正常收到回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"98c7b709-f904-4d62-bb69-cb88293be9be","title":"🔴【P0】解绑后重新绑定完整链路","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"e8ff9d08-6ec3-4554-83b7-c032ec50a4ea","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"99d11526-9ae1-4879-9ee3-3b4d3f86ede3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f242a88d-c4eb-451e-a4cd-db8efe6a4443","title":"前置：配置 X 同时出现在两个同协议的 Agent 下，且都已绑定；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"99d11526-9ae1-4879-9ee3-3b4d3f86ede3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1470ce2a-4baa-4dbb-a639-a890e5dc80c4","title":"操作：在 Agent 甲下解绑 X，再查看 Agent 乙"},{"parent":"99d11526-9ae1-4879-9ee3-3b4d3f86ede3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e249da08-99c9-41d0-9c0f-9ffe5e908b7b","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ Agent 甲的弹窗显示未绑定，模型下拉中没有 X\n2) 可见范围 ｜ Agent 乙的弹窗仍显示已绑定，模型下拉中仍有 X，可正常发消息\n3) 持久化 ｜ 重启应用后两边状态保持不变"},{"parent":"99d11526-9ae1-4879-9ee3-3b4d3f86ede3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ceea35b8-4e65-4cd4-afb1-254a3b279b39","title":"备注：已定口径：绑定与解绑按 Agent 独立，Agent 乙仍为已绑定不是缺陷"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"99d11526-9ae1-4879-9ee3-3b4d3f86ede3","title":"🔴【P0】解绑只影响当前 Agent","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"e8ff9d08-6ec3-4554-83b7-c032ec50a4ea","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d9112022-0094-42b5-81f2-8b312fd4b08f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"08288514-0c9e-4690-b7af-a719137b5f61","title":"前置：配置 X 同时出现在两个同协议的 Agent 下，且Agent 乙未绑定；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"d9112022-0094-42b5-81f2-8b312fd4b08f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"755541f9-bb34-47dc-88ab-b29232d64846","title":"操作：在 Agent 甲下解绑 后再重新绑定 X，再查看 Agent 乙"},{"parent":"d9112022-0094-42b5-81f2-8b312fd4b08f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8df7d43e-1a51-4b56-bd11-6dd38a1cf777","title":"预期：<br>1) 可见范围 ｜ Agent 甲的弹窗显示已绑定，模型下拉中显示 X，可正常发消息<br>2) 可见范围 ｜ Agent 乙的弹窗仍显示未绑定，模型下拉中没有 X<br>3) 持久化 ｜ 重启应用后两边状态保持不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d9112022-0094-42b5-81f2-8b312fd4b08f","title":"🔴【P0】重新绑定只影响当前 Agent","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e8ff9d08-6ec3-4554-83b7-c032ec50a4ea","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"30caec8f-1ed0-4fdd-ad99-cd4e7a551d85","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fa62fa70-8148-4a33-b014-91e65ea98a26","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"afe1a659-8a2a-430a-8ef8-4058e899c4cf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4f0b0e3e-fc00-451c-92c6-85091fde046a","title":"前置：配置已绑定；模拟解绑接口失败；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗配置行的「…」"},{"parent":"afe1a659-8a2a-430a-8ef8-4058e899c4cf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"158a98f3-b049-42d7-8f0e-0c2262043d52","title":"操作：点「解绑」，失败后再次解绑"},{"parent":"afe1a659-8a2a-430a-8ef8-4058e899c4cf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cf0f1f5c-231b-4796-ab37-d80c0354113c","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示解绑失败\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 仍显示「已绑定」，模型下拉中仍有该配置\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 再次解绑成功后，列表与模型下拉一起更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"afe1a659-8a2a-430a-8ef8-4058e899c4cf","title":"🟡【P2】解绑失败时保持原状态"},{"parent":"fa62fa70-8148-4a33-b014-91e65ea98a26","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"55cd6516-f0d0-4c08-a10d-5a0793fa882e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"147f2c89-2fb1-4c21-b91e-3126eff23f9a","title":"前置：当前 Agent 下有已绑定的配置 Minimax；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗配置行的「…」"},{"parent":"55cd6516-f0d0-4c08-a10d-5a0793fa882e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eb301105-467f-4e76-ab43-2ceb0bbf707d","title":"操作：选择该模型对话，点「解绑」，继续在之前的会话发送消息"},{"parent":"55cd6516-f0d0-4c08-a10d-5a0793fa882e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7677acba-cdd0-4820-9a21-e1354fad116b","title":"预期：<br>1) 消息无法发送出去，输入框上方提示selected model connection is unavailable; select another model<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"55cd6516-f0d0-4c08-a10d-5a0793fa882e","title":"🟡【P2】解绑后继续对话历史对话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fa62fa70-8148-4a33-b014-91e65ea98a26","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"30caec8f-1ed0-4fdd-ad99-cd4e7a551d85","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c4207747-1692-4eea-ab07-b217cc372b1b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"52343b67-d28a-4c5f-9eb4-7fb4bd4c811b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4dc77514-4207-4337-abea-2406d7e1a1ba","title":"前置：当前 Agent 下所有自定义配置都已解绑；角色：账号所有者；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"52343b67-d28a-4c5f-9eb4-7fb4bd4c811b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a3ea6391-a3ff-4b99-b5fa-bb4eb1efadc7","title":"操作：展开模型下拉"},{"parent":"52343b67-d28a-4c5f-9eb4-7fb4bd4c811b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c1dedaa7-72a0-4384-bd0f-d905900aac27","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 左侧只剩「厂商提供」和「Tutti API」两个分类，不出现数量为 0 的空分类\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ 左下角「配置自定义模型」仍然可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"52343b67-d28a-4c5f-9eb4-7fb4bd4c811b","title":"🟡【P2】全部解绑后的模型下拉","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c4207747-1692-4eea-ab07-b217cc372b1b","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"30caec8f-1ed0-4fdd-ad99-cd4e7a551d85","title":"API Key · 解绑与绑定"},{"parent":"02615231-f2eb-45c0-8980-3fbf2ebd1c7e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"85df6c0b-3b52-4abb-a580-9d40e5a2ec93","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"26b34da5-e205-40cf-9cc7-6feecf6dd0ce","title":"说明：已定口径：删除前有二次确认。Base URL 与 API Key 相同就算同一个配置（名称不论），删除时所有 Agent 下的这个配置一起删掉，协议不同的 Agent 也一样。"},{"parent":"85df6c0b-3b52-4abb-a580-9d40e5a2ec93","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f5a5683b-afe8-4dee-b21a-2b4181cf6ec4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dfa4fa2c-64a5-46e3-aace-79159eef6350","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d2fc6391-0179-43d5-9b05-bf4559542c86","title":"前置：配置 Minimax 出现在当前 Agent、同协议 Agent，以及协议不同、但 Base URL 与 Key 相同的 Agent 下；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗配置行的「…」"},{"parent":"dfa4fa2c-64a5-46e3-aace-79159eef6350","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aee69872-45b9-4ae8-9ad9-c29f0a45d27e","title":"操作：点「…」›「删除」，在确认框中确认；再查看三个 Agent 的弹窗与模型下拉"},{"parent":"dfa4fa2c-64a5-46e3-aace-79159eef6350","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1a23f7c2-d899-4514-92b3-4e12772b2ee9","title":"预期：<br>1) 提示文案 ｜ 先弹出二次确认，不直接删除<br>2) 列表展示 ｜ 确认后当前 Agent 的 API Key 列表里不再有这个配置<br>3) 副作用 ｜ 同协议 Agent 下的这个配置一起删除<br>4) 副作用 ｜ 协议不同、但 Base URL 与 Key 相同的 Agent 下不会一起删除<br>5) 可见范围 ｜ 三个 Agent 的模型下拉都不再有这个分类，搜索也搜不到它的模型<br>6) 持久化 ｜ 重启应用或换一台设备登录后仍然不显示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dfa4fa2c-64a5-46e3-aace-79159eef6350","title":"🔴【P0】删除配置完整链路","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"f5a5683b-afe8-4dee-b21a-2b4181cf6ec4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"366b08fa-d22c-4fd5-b944-1d2cf83e884b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea860dfb-6019-40ce-be78-ecd646aaaf31","title":"前置：配置已存在；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗配置行的「…」"},{"parent":"366b08fa-d22c-4fd5-b944-1d2cf83e884b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"47a1b443-17a9-4860-a5ce-accde300f9b9","title":"操作：点「删除」后在确认框中取消"},{"parent":"366b08fa-d22c-4fd5-b944-1d2cf83e884b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b9f924c2-13cf-4be9-ab19-fc5b07596e3c","title":"预期：\n1) 副作用 ｜ 配置不删除，绑定状态不变，各 Agent 下都不受影响\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 模型下拉照常显示这个配置，可以发消息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"366b08fa-d22c-4fd5-b944-1d2cf83e884b","title":"🟠【P1】取消删除自定义配置","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f5a5683b-afe8-4dee-b21a-2b4181cf6ec4","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"85df6c0b-3b52-4abb-a580-9d40e5a2ec93","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2db04a9a-620a-4938-aee4-12cf1c3f3bb4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5a60ae3f-e932-404c-8858-e29de13a301f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"36433fe9-327e-484a-8c9a-611317f52496","title":"前置：配置出现在多个 Agent 下；模拟删除接口失败；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗配置行的「…」"},{"parent":"5a60ae3f-e932-404c-8858-e29de13a301f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"526127e5-a3ce-466e-b22b-15ba4548baaa","title":"操作：确认删除，失败后再次删除"},{"parent":"5a60ae3f-e932-404c-8858-e29de13a301f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6f51d2c7-4f88-4402-87d4-3cac04507e97","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示删除失败\n2) 副作用 ｜ 所有 Agent 下的这个配置都还在，不出现一处删了一处还在\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 再次删除成功后各 Agent 下一起消失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5a60ae3f-e932-404c-8858-e29de13a301f","title":"🟠【P1】删除失败时不出现部分删除","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2db04a9a-620a-4938-aee4-12cf1c3f3bb4","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"85df6c0b-3b52-4abb-a580-9d40e5a2ec93","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"eece3fc4-24e2-4276-80d2-b1f32ebd358a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0a7596f2-54f9-4c39-9325-c09820ba64f9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"393112cb-fefd-4acd-9d4f-fed041b38059","title":"前置：Claude Code 下有配置「中转 A」，Codex 下有配置「中转 B」，两者 Base URL 与 Key 相同；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗配置行的「…」"},{"parent":"0a7596f2-54f9-4c39-9325-c09820ba64f9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"baed712c-8397-436c-a8f4-26031b647189","title":"操作：在 Claude Code 下删除「中转 A」，再查看 Codex"},{"parent":"0a7596f2-54f9-4c39-9325-c09820ba64f9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1187280d-2f28-4c95-9486-43cb9626c0ca","title":"预期：<br>1) 副作用 ｜ Codex 下的「中转 B」不会被删除<br>"},{"parent":"0a7596f2-54f9-4c39-9325-c09820ba64f9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76c3c490-b37b-484c-a43b-caef713d86ae","title":"备注：已定口径：同一配置只看 Base URL 与 API Key，不看名称"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0a7596f2-54f9-4c39-9325-c09820ba64f9","title":"🟡【P2】协议不同，名称不同但 Base URL 与 Key 相同，删除不会一起删","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"eece3fc4-24e2-4276-80d2-b1f32ebd358a","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"85df6c0b-3b52-4abb-a580-9d40e5a2ec93","title":"API Key · 删除"},{"parent":"02615231-f2eb-45c0-8980-3fbf2ebd1c7e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0e3a9e06-bac2-4dbb-84c9-1109b478aff6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13fb4ceb-00bc-4496-ba08-339c4bc0c134","title":"说明：已定口径：新增的配置会同步到同一 API 协议的其他 Agent，并默认已绑定；协议不同的 Agent 的弹窗和模型下拉都不显示它。需求文档的截图里，协议不同的 Agent 下会出现「补充 XX 接口后，可供此 Agent 使用」的提示行，那是旧版，以「不显示」为准。各 Agent 用哪种协议见「各 Agent 差异」。"},{"parent":"0e3a9e06-bac2-4dbb-84c9-1109b478aff6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1246b68a-06b0-405f-b7d5-e3e9eab07b5a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6104aa6c-4a6a-42a4-b1e5-356cddc5ad37","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"702e74ef-bc70-4156-9dce-91f79ff29bfe","title":"前置：本机已安装 WorkBuddy、OpenCode、Hermes、Grok Build、dsh（都用 OpenAI Chat Completions）；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"6104aa6c-4a6a-42a4-b1e5-356cddc5ad37","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ed8191c9-22ea-42a9-9333-1df515c08208","title":"操作：在 WorkBuddy 下新增配置 X，再依次打开其他四个 Agent 的弹窗，并分别在会话中选 X 的模型发消息"},{"parent":"6104aa6c-4a6a-42a4-b1e5-356cddc5ad37","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"42ac7806-a436-45d4-850d-f15f4f785d0b","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 四个 Agent 的弹窗里都出现 X，显示「已绑定」，名称与域名一致\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 四个 Agent 的模型下拉都出现 X 分类，数量一致\n3) 结果回传 ｜ 在每个 Agent 下选 X 的模型发消息都能正常收到回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6104aa6c-4a6a-42a4-b1e5-356cddc5ad37","title":"🔴【P0】同协议的 Agent 同步显示并可使用","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"1246b68a-06b0-405f-b7d5-e3e9eab07b5a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b8556ba7-aea5-41e4-b0eb-e1d8551857de","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"47a42bab-c85b-400f-b0a9-8d1b954f7ddf","title":"前置：本机已安装 Claude Code、Codex、WorkBuddy、Gemini CLI；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"b8556ba7-aea5-41e4-b0eb-e1d8551857de","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e57205f8-252d-4865-ba17-0cb086e5efd2","title":"操作：在 Codex 下新增配置 Y（OpenAI Responses），再查看其他三个 Agent 的弹窗与模型下拉，并用关键字搜索"},{"parent":"b8556ba7-aea5-41e4-b0eb-e1d8551857de","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb313b76-30d3-4fd6-b6c7-3a2ce3126fe6","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ Claude Code、WorkBuddy、Gemini CLI 的弹窗里都没有 Y，也没有「补充 XX 接口后可用」这类提示行\n2) 可见范围 ｜ 这三个 Agent 的模型下拉里没有 Y，搜索也搜不到 Y 的模型；出现即视为缺陷\n3) 结果校验 ｜ Codex 下的 Y 正常显示为已绑定，可以发消息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b8556ba7-aea5-41e4-b0eb-e1d8551857de","title":"🔴【P0】协议不同的 Agent 不显示"},{"parent":"1246b68a-06b0-405f-b7d5-e3e9eab07b5a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e20de61f-18f8-4220-b39c-720784520618","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c81650d5-115c-4bd1-8bc6-8f0b60007e70","title":"前置：账号下绑定了两台电脑，都安装了 Claude Code；角色：账号所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击该 Agent 打开的「{Agent} · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"e20de61f-18f8-4220-b39c-720784520618","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0c66db1d-fab2-4b38-a770-e0a57ed1c9cd","title":"操作：在电脑一的 Claude Code 下新增配置，再打开电脑二的 Claude Code 弹窗"},{"parent":"e20de61f-18f8-4220-b39c-720784520618","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b0db7af5-bb47-4440-9ed4-fd0241fd01f7","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 电脑二的 Claude Code 下同步出现这个配置，并且已绑定\n2) 结果回传 ｜ 在会话里切到电脑二的 Claude Code，选这个配置的模型能正常对话"},{"parent":"e20de61f-18f8-4220-b39c-720784520618","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0a2de89b-aa84-4400-aec6-b8fb14e9afbd","title":"备注：已定口径：另一台电脑上的同一 Agent 也算同协议 Agent，按「同协议即同步」处理"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e20de61f-18f8-4220-b39c-720784520618","title":"🟠【P1】多台电脑上的同一 Agent 同步"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1246b68a-06b0-405f-b7d5-e3e9eab07b5a","title":"正常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0e3a9e06-bac2-4dbb-84c9-1109b478aff6","title":"跨 Agent 同步与协议隔离"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"02615231-f2eb-45c0-8980-3fbf2ebd1c7e","title":"模型来源弹窗"},{"parent":"d5b2b21c-3a66-4a53-aa30-30a423ab18e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4d6379d8-e49d-4f01-bc14-fefd4d0e9807","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"62daf87a-d2ab-4e0b-a62b-433c251e5d80","title":"说明：房间 Agent GUI 输入框右下角的模型下拉，以及选了 Tutti API 或自定义配置之后的会话执行。会话执行是本轮重点，能力清单照搬「房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域」：自己的 Agent 是主干，每条主链路在两类来源下各挂一条；他人共享的 Agent 与续聊他人会话是差异支。用例按通用 Agent 写，执行时对照「各 Agent 差异」每个 Agent 跑一遍。"},{"parent":"4d6379d8-e49d-4f01-bc14-fefd4d0e9807","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"95d5aede-ec44-4a1b-a49e-542ae88d23d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"96494757-5265-4808-a572-6c7f4e84d391","title":"说明：选好 Agent 后点模型名打开「模型选择」。左侧是分类：厂商提供、Tutti API，以及每个已绑定的自定义配置各占一项，右侧都带数量；右侧按分类分组列出模型；右上角是搜索框和刷新按钮；左下角是「配置自定义模型」；右侧底部是「速度」。"},{"parent":"95d5aede-ec44-4a1b-a49e-542ae88d23d2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"34cec208-da68-4ee6-ac8d-7838fb849f30","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0267548f-4d9c-4078-97ca-879efd10a22f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cd8e8478-5057-49c6-97ba-4d245a51b15b","title":"前置：自己的非 Tutti Agent 已登录官方账号，并绑定了两个自定义配置；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"0267548f-4d9c-4078-97ca-879efd10a22f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8d5afea7-cb50-4b04-9bd6-39b3a261bc65","title":"操作：展开模型下拉，逐个点击左侧分类"},{"parent":"0267548f-4d9c-4078-97ca-879efd10a22f","customWidth":484,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ee9f9b00-7d3f-41c6-8ae7-60f571808bd6","title":"预期：<br>1) 列表展示 ｜ 左侧依次是「厂商提供」「Tutti API」以及所有自定义配置（用配置名称命名），每项右侧有数量<br>2) 结果校验 ｜ 每个分类的数量与右侧实际列出的条数一致<br>3) 跳转定位 ｜ 点击左侧某个分类，右侧定位到对应分组，分组标题与分类名一致<br>4) 视觉展示 ｜ 当前选中的分类高亮；当前使用的模型右侧有勾<br>5) 菜单展示 ｜ 左下角有「配置自定义模型」，右侧底部有「速度」并显示当前档位"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0267548f-4d9c-4078-97ca-879efd10a22f","title":"🔴【P0】分类与数量","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"34cec208-da68-4ee6-ac8d-7838fb849f30","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"76010349-0c93-4b11-9f9c-1bbd3ae2c8b8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"91977858-197a-4a37-823f-4e487ead8e86","title":"前置：模型下拉已展开；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"76010349-0c93-4b11-9f9c-1bbd3ae2c8b8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8aaf6d79-c785-4a8d-b9f4-694617c317ac","title":"操作：分别选中厂商提供、Tutti API、自定义配置中的一个模型，每次选完都发送一条消息并执行 /status"},{"parent":"76010349-0c93-4b11-9f9c-1bbd3ae2c8b8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"79046cbd-5d51-48d9-9e4b-ea6c65cfa3b7","title":"预期：\n1) 输入框 ｜ 选中后下拉关闭，输入框右下角显示所选模型名\n2) 结果回传 ｜ 回复由所选模型产生，/status 中的模型与所选一致\n3) 持久化 ｜ 新建会话时沿用上次选择的模型"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"76010349-0c93-4b11-9f9c-1bbd3ae2c8b8","title":"🔴【P0】选中模型后生效","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"34cec208-da68-4ee6-ac8d-7838fb849f30","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a3b7abb7-a1e1-43c3-8891-1a0c751f6f86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6f47d01c-1d78-426c-a291-b6beb4314de5","title":"前置：本机安装了多个非 Tutti Agent；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"a3b7abb7-a1e1-43c3-8891-1a0c751f6f86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"18a596c5-e370-4df8-8d8e-b530d1a9e7a2","title":"操作：依次切换 Agent，查看 Tutti API 分类"},{"parent":"a3b7abb7-a1e1-43c3-8891-1a0c751f6f86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3de1ab91-277b-4cff-a7b7-27ac7aeee84f","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 每个 Agent 的 Tutti API 分类数量和模型列表都相同（截图中为 12 个）\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 每个模型带各自厂商的图标"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a3b7abb7-a1e1-43c3-8891-1a0c751f6f86","title":"🟠【P1】Tutti API 分类在各 Agent 下一致","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"34cec208-da68-4ee6-ac8d-7838fb849f30","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0fabeb6b-2fdc-496f-8675-ed4495531c05","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d4dc487c-e32c-4b53-94c1-462dfd7da70f","title":"前置：本机该 Agent 已通过 cc-switch 配置 API Key；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"0fabeb6b-2fdc-496f-8675-ed4495531c05","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d3dde515-9286-46cd-b895-5586c9091936","title":"操作：查看厂商提供分类，再到本机切到官方账号配置后点刷新"},{"parent":"0fabeb6b-2fdc-496f-8675-ed4495531c05","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4114b4eb-e39a-443c-81c7-890de7b00c55","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 切换前列出本机 API Key 配置下可用的模型\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 刷新后按官方账号可用的模型更新，不残留切换前的模型"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0fabeb6b-2fdc-496f-8675-ed4495531c05","title":"🟠【P1】厂商提供分类与本机配置一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"34cec208-da68-4ee6-ac8d-7838fb849f30","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"95d5aede-ec44-4a1b-a49e-542ae88d23d2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0fb4cbe1-8c4b-4b37-95ee-76a213947a4b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3c899972-3a35-427b-ba08-04aa7a764efe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e2c0518d-0e6b-4f30-bb5b-ea0e939a1f50","title":"前置：模拟获取模型列表接口失败；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"3c899972-3a35-427b-ba08-04aa7a764efe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"db4dbe8c-7a6b-44b5-a59c-ef86db589007","title":"操作：展开模型下拉，恢复网络后点刷新"},{"parent":"3c899972-3a35-427b-ba08-04aa7a764efe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6584e536-8e80-4465-94a9-cfff98aaeed0","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 给出加载失败提示，不显示为空白，也不一直转圈\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 点刷新后正常列出各分类与数量"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3c899972-3a35-427b-ba08-04aa7a764efe","title":"🟡【P2】模型列表加载失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0fb4cbe1-8c4b-4b37-95ee-76a213947a4b","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"95d5aede-ec44-4a1b-a49e-542ae88d23d2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c980d958-0d81-426c-8171-cc2c7f3de014","callout":[],"children