,"children":[],"id":"0e6e8374-4800-44b7-91f8-c7565376d27d","title":"前置：会话已建立；账号有积分，模型下拉已选 Tutti API 分类下的模型；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"d0ad683f-1c9d-4008-890d-9bef2402b2d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b622dcab-c571-4283-9ec5-c53afaff7648","title":"操作：展开模型下拉，查看并切换推理强度与速度后发消息"},{"parent":"d0ad683f-1c9d-4008-890d-9bef2402b2d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1f313bd8-5369-4bdc-bd84-976846383e10","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 按所选模型支持的档位展示，不支持的档位置灰或不显示\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 切换后的档位实际生效，/status 中可以核对\n3) 会话状态 ｜ 整个过程中模型保持为所选的 Tutti API 模型，不会被悄悄换成其他来源\n4) 用量 ｜ Tutti 积分按本次消耗减少，模型来源弹窗与头像菜单中的积分一致；厂商额度不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d0ad683f-1c9d-4008-890d-9bef2402b2d2","title":"🟠【P1】推理强度与速度按模型生效（Tutti API）"},{"parent":"6214946d-e337-4cf1-8914-ace79cf2c427","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3bf2d98e-e31c-4a95-8d64-5f8a0efdcf03","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"45b79276-e03a-43b7-b538-f95675ab67fc","title":"前置：会话已建立；已绑定可用的自定义配置，模型下拉已选该配置里的模型；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"3bf2d98e-e31c-4a95-8d64-5f8a0efdcf03","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc3096ca-cc69-43ce-9505-413d72556808","title":"操作：展开模型下拉，查看并切换推理强度与速度后发消息"},{"parent":"3bf2d98e-e31c-4a95-8d64-5f8a0efdcf03","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f42b5d55-3f21-4d9d-bc70-0f04947820c9","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 按所选模型支持的档位展示，不支持的档位置灰或不显示\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 切换后的档位实际生效，/status 中可以核对\n3) 会话状态 ｜ 整个过程中模型保持为所选的 自定义配置 模型，不会被悄悄换成其他来源\n4) 用量 ｜ Tutti 积分与厂商额度都不变\n5) 结果校验 ｜ 中转服务后台能看到这些调用，用的是该配置的 Key"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3bf2d98e-e31c-4a95-8d64-5f8a0efdcf03","title":"🟠【P1】推理强度与速度按模型生效（自定义配置）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6214946d-e337-4cf1-8914-ace79cf2c427","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"4a96acb5-df12-4715-8907-4610b5eb469e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1b00f867-335d-43da-ae3c-8f5ca302a8ad","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b7c81f44-a7af-461b-a57f-a5bd9e73ebf5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e85aca2e-cace-4860-9ab3-3ef1f3bbc16f","title":"前置：同一 Agent 开了三个会话窗口，分别选厂商提供、Tutti API、自定义配置的模型；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"b7c81f44-a7af-461b-a57f-a5bd9e73ebf5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e388e82a-5c6c-47dd-b43d-162194ddc7f8","title":"操作：三个窗口同时发送任务"},{"parent":"b7c81f44-a7af-461b-a57f-a5bd9e73ebf5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4fe99082-a00f-454e-8d7d-64053d45f82f","title":"预期：\n1) 环境隔离 ｜ 三个会话各自用所选的模型来源，不被全局状态串改\n2) 用量 ｜ 只有 Tutti API 那一窗扣积分；自定义配置那一窗的调用出现在中转服务后台\n3) 会话状态 ｜ 三个任务都正常完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b7c81f44-a7af-461b-a57f-a5bd9e73ebf5","title":"🟡【P2】多个窗口用不同来源并行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1b00f867-335d-43da-ae3c-8f5ca302a8ad","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4a96acb5-df12-4715-8907-4610b5eb469e","title":"多会话与多 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e05f9fbb-5cd5-4d1f-a961-212975152fa2","title":"会话执行 · 自己的 Agent"},{"parent":"4d6379d8-e49d-4f01-bc14-fefd4d0e9807","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fbafa86a-ceff-4142-9870-40305c487c4d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c8a18880-88bd-4a7e-9e14-d90b4853102e","title":"说明：只写和模型来源有关的异常。已定口径：积分为 0 时下拉里仍可以选，发送时拦截；积分中途耗尽时中止当前轮并提示，已经输出的内容和已改动的文件保留，充值后可以继续。"},{"parent":"fbafa86a-ceff-4142-9870-40305c487c4d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3caea04c-9b6d-4e09-aae5-0f8f99b645fc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"56fcd08c-a997-455e-9269-d43d1b4aeded","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1196a90c-8c61-4e12-965f-2c93f67404b1","title":"前置：账号积分为 0；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"56fcd08c-a997-455e-9269-d43d1b4aeded","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d4bf5127-b695-4f9e-9035-8f68a0d8f173","title":"操作：选一个 Tutti API 模型后发送消息，点提示里的「升级会员」，升级后再发一次"},{"parent":"56fcd08c-a997-455e-9269-d43d1b4aeded","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5142a89d-cb17-4d11-adc1-e950bdec8286","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 下拉里 Tutti API 的模型仍然可以选\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 发送时被拦截，提示积分不足，并给出「升级会员」入口\n3) 副作用 ｜ 不发出请求，也不自动改用厂商提供的模型\n4) 跳转定位 ｜ 「升级会员」打开 https://tutti.sh/profile/plan\n5) 恢复重试 ｜ 积分到账后再次发送能正常回复"}],"id":"56fcd08c-a997-455e-9269-d43d1b4aeded","title":"🟡【P2】积分为 0 时发送被拦截","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"3caea04c-9b6d-4e09-aae5-0f8f99b645fc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"626deee9-bb75-4453-9ec3-5e84b4f7b74d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9c1c9666-4d5c-489e-ad79-2110d56352b1","title":"前置：账号积分只够跑一小段，选的是 Tutti API 模型；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"626deee9-bb75-4453-9ec3-5e84b4f7b74d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"640337bf-505e-4098-8296-7c5dc4611afd","title":"操作：发一个会写多个文件的长任务，等积分中途耗尽，充值后发「继续」"},{"parent":"626deee9-bb75-4453-9ec3-5e84b4f7b74d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"77e747cf-dbb4-4ba4-9214-1a93b2e0da7d","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 当前轮被中止，状态收敛为已中止，不会一直转圈\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 提示积分不足，并给出「升级会员」入口\n3) 文件落盘 ｜ 已经输出的内容和已改动的文件都保留，不回滚，也不丢失\n4) 恢复重试 ｜ 充值后发「继续」能接着完成任务"}],"id":"626deee9-bb75-4453-9ec3-5e84b4f7b74d","title":"🟠【P1】任务进行中积分耗尽","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"3caea04c-9b6d-4e09-aae5-0f8f99b645fc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"77c025ee-1aaf-436f-a3fa-9e88690b5bcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"32ce48fa-e638-46e1-a4c5-98c16646f08b","title":"前置：账号有积分；模拟 Tutti API 服务返回错误；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"77c025ee-1aaf-436f-a3fa-9e88690b5bcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b3e8a6a6-f1dc-4f43-9b3c-ad916481a4f1","title":"操作：用 Tutti API 模型发送消息，失败后恢复服务并重试"},{"parent":"77c025ee-1aaf-436f-a3fa-9e88690b5bcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"da9b1e07-b6fa-404a-a2f1-2ab353966d27","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 会话中显示看得懂的错误原因与重试入口，不显示 something went wrong\n2) 用量 ｜ 失败的那次请求不扣积分\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 重试成功后正常回复，只按成功的那次扣积分"}],"id":"77c025ee-1aaf-436f-a3fa-9e88690b5bcb","title":"🟠【P1】请求失败时不扣积分"},{"parent":"3caea04c-9b6d-4e09-aae5-0f8f99b645fc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"68a7a756-1b36-4611-8130-4c78a618d555","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"66107792-0966-4817-af96-2401655a4625","title":"前置：配置已绑定，但 Key 已在服务商那边作废或余额不足；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"68a7a756-1b36-4611-8130-4c78a618d555","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"869acac4-52a4-4e50-8258-e35dd0db64e7","title":"操作：选这个配置的模型发送消息，改用其他模型后重试"},{"parent":"68a7a756-1b36-4611-8130-4c78a618d555","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"917fd0db-4166-4460-b10b-459efc132415","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 会话中显示服务商返回的可读错误（如鉴权失败、余额不足），不显示 something went wrong\n2) 用量 ｜ 不扣 Tutti 积分\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 切到别的模型后能继续对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"68a7a756-1b36-4611-8130-4c78a618d555","title":"🟡【P2】Key 失效或服务商余额不足"},{"parent":"3caea04c-9b6d-4e09-aae5-0f8f99b645fc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e333aef0-b1bd-4732-a30d-8fd0153d1c0e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b9092d8a-56b5-47d7-bcf0-93de8a372b94","title":"前置：配置里有一个手动填写、服务商那边并不存在的模型 ID；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"e333aef0-b1bd-4732-a30d-8fd0153d1c0e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b719111f-05bc-49ba-b19f-859fec905cee","title":"操作：选这个模型发送消息"},{"parent":"e333aef0-b1bd-4732-a30d-8fd0153d1c0e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9977d5ad-9cea-43d7-8245-b98e71ef4f7a","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 显示可读的错误（模型不存在），并可以改选其他模型"}],"id":"e333aef0-b1bd-4732-a30d-8fd0153d1c0e","title":"🟡【P2】手动填写的模型 ID 不存在"},{"parent":"3caea04c-9b6d-4e09-aae5-0f8f99b645fc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"41ee81ed-d3fe-44f1-a38c-424510fe7649","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6da677fb-7187-410e-b0e8-43b924500ee3","title":"前置：自定义配置的中转服务返回 429 或长时间无响应；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"41ee81ed-d3fe-44f1-a38c-424510fe7649","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9cda22d3-2811-4d5d-b01b-e7b7b5f02644","title":"操作：选这个配置的模型发送任务，等服务恢复后重试"},{"parent":"41ee81ed-d3fe-44f1-a38c-424510fe7649","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"83702290-ece4-45bc-977a-b861a4eec7ad","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示限流或超时，不会一直停在运行中\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 服务恢复后重试能正常完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"41ee81ed-d3fe-44f1-a38c-424510fe7649","title":"🟡【P2】中转服务限流或超时"},{"parent":"3caea04c-9b6d-4e09-aae5-0f8f99b645fc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"53ce0601-64f8-45fb-b5a7-a35e96e77936","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"73a65c35-aaa7-4d4e-8401-ba5a5ee0cccc","title":"前置：一轮回复正在流式输出；账号有积分，模型下拉已选 Tutti API 分类下的模型；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"53ce0601-64f8-45fb-b5a7-a35e96e77936","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dc1f05f4-4a03-4d6a-9d33-b7f43936f0a9","title":"操作：断开网络，十秒后恢复"},{"parent":"53ce0601-64f8-45fb-b5a7-a35e96e77936","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea7dac69-7c5c-40a0-895f-543c0ac9ee9b","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 断开期间有明确的状态提示；恢复后续上或给出重试入口，不会一直卡住\n2) 消息渲染 ｜ 已经输出的内容保留，不会出现重复或乱序\n3) 会话状态 ｜ 整个过程中模型保持为所选的 Tutti API 模型，不会被悄悄换成其他来源\n4) 用量 ｜ Tutti 积分按本次消耗减少，模型来源弹窗与头像菜单中的积分一致；厂商额度不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"53ce0601-64f8-45fb-b5a7-a35e96e77936","title":"🟡【P2】流式输出中途网络断开（Tutti API）"},{"parent":"3caea04c-9b6d-4e09-aae5-0f8f99b645fc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e729eebf-e644-4565-9878-3030e01cca1d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6499a075-bd48-47bf-a9ba-633225f6490c","title":"前置：一轮回复正在流式输出；已绑定可用的自定义配置，模型下拉已选该配置里的模型；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"e729eebf-e644-4565-9878-3030e01cca1d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7dd79f1d-b93d-4a75-80d1-73467d1103b2","title":"操作：断开网络，十秒后恢复"},{"parent":"e729eebf-e644-4565-9878-3030e01cca1d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3cc21e3-7952-4f2a-856c-7d6581304f8c","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 断开期间有明确的状态提示；恢复后续上或给出重试入口，不会一直卡住\n2) 消息渲染 ｜ 已经输出的内容保留，不会出现重复或乱序\n3) 会话状态 ｜ 整个过程中模型保持为所选的 自定义配置 模型，不会被悄悄换成其他来源\n4) 用量 ｜ Tutti 积分与厂商额度都不变\n5) 结果校验 ｜ 中转服务后台能看到这些调用，用的是该配置的 Key"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e729eebf-e644-4565-9878-3030e01cca1d","title":"🟡【P2】流式输出中途网络断开（自定义配置）"}],"id":"3caea04c-9b6d-4e09-aae5-0f8f99b645fc","title":"异常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fbafa86a-ceff-4142-9870-40305c487c4d","title":"会话执行 · 异常与恢复"},{"parent":"4d6379d8-e49d-4f01-bc14-fefd4d0e9807","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d5608177-2197-486b-803f-d8b42e59e838","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4eda6d70-ee45-49f4-9ab1-1e6faed8a8a5","title":"说明：已定口径：会话正在用的自定义模型被解绑或删除后，已有会话里这个模型显示为不可用；发送时提示并引导切换模型，不会悄悄换成别的模型；当前正在跑的这一轮照常跑完。"},{"parent":"d5608177-2197-486b-803f-d8b42e59e838","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2b3089c7-3e30-4d76-8608-612d4665e9f3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2ca8595e-6f99-44bd-bcbf-08ae4f35ca9a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"938e31b3-6f02-445d-9fd6-d854a3c6d43f","title":"前置：会话正在用配置 X 的模型，且有一轮正在执行；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话"},{"parent":"2ca8595e-6f99-44bd-bcbf-08ae4f35ca9a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e27cb8f-76d5-4a5e-b064-eb68bc8d8888","title":"操作：在模型来源弹窗中解绑 X，等这一轮执行完后再发一条消息，然后按提示切换模型继续"},{"parent":"2ca8595e-6f99-44bd-bcbf-08ae4f35ca9a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1a769ece-8184-48a5-8b89-a36248446b82","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 正在执行的这一轮照常跑完\n2) 输入框 ｜ 会话的模型显示为不可用\n3) 提示文案 ｜ 发送时提示该模型不可用，并引导切换模型\n4) 副作用 ｜ 不会悄悄改用其他模型发出请求\n5) 恢复重试 ｜ 切换到可用模型后能继续对话，前面的上下文保留"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2ca8595e-6f99-44bd-bcbf-08ae4f35ca9a","title":"🟡【P2】正在使用的配置被解绑"},{"parent":"2b3089c7-3e30-4d76-8608-612d4665e9f3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"66ca67b9-438f-4294-aac1-8b6a2eadc38a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c8705e8f-c28a-4709-a712-122cf8c58a98","title":"前置：会话正在用配置 X 的模型；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话"},{"parent":"66ca67b9-438f-4294-aac1-8b6a2eadc38a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ba724449-03e3-40f9-9f64-cd0c9a0c1ef3","title":"操作：在模型来源弹窗中删除 X，回到会话发送消息，然后按提示切换模型继续"},{"parent":"66ca67b9-438f-4294-aac1-8b6a2eadc38a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9fe51df5-7909-47f2-ad0d-95bcadfa87ff","title":"预期：\n1) 输入框 ｜ 会话的模型显示为不可用\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 发送时提示该模型不可用，并引导切换模型\n3) 副作用 ｜ 不会悄悄改用其他模型发出请求\n4) 恢复重试 ｜ 切换后能继续对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"66ca67b9-438f-4294-aac1-8b6a2eadc38a","title":"🟡【P2】正在使用的配置被删除"},{"parent":"2b3089c7-3e30-4d76-8608-612d4665e9f3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"debe605b-c326-4345-9062-5f8ec9e5ed46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aac57600-f95a-41c3-815b-0bea4ab912a2","title":"前置：B 正在用 A 的共享 Agent 和 A 的配置 X 对话；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：共享 Agent 会话"},{"parent":"debe605b-c326-4345-9062-5f8ec9e5ed46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0601fe6d-e89f-4853-bd55-82e942398f18","title":"操作：A 解绑 X 后，B 再发送消息"},{"parent":"debe605b-c326-4345-9062-5f8ec9e5ed46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b4d80e09-f100-43f9-9634-8aa361eb22d0","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 表现与「正在使用的配置被解绑」一致\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 提示里不暴露 A 的 Key"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"debe605b-c326-4345-9062-5f8ec9e5ed46","title":"🟡【P2】共享会话中所有者解绑了正在使用的配置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2b3089c7-3e30-4d76-8608-612d4665e9f3","title":"异常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d5608177-2197-486b-803f-d8b42e59e838","title":"模型失效后的会话"},{"parent":"4d6379d8-e49d-4f01-bc14-fefd4d0e9807","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4c2631b3-be41-419b-bdd0-595d038f7277","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8ef51666-c2a3-4165-8098-a4c844a6a817","title":"说明：本轮重点关注项（需求点名）。这是「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」的差异支：不复制主干用例，只用主干的链路在「B 使用 A 共享的 Agent」这个身份下各跑一遍，第一条断言都是「与自己的 Agent 逐项一致」，后面只写不一样的地方。已定口径：Tutti API 扣 A 的积分；自定义配置列出 A 在这个 Agent 上已绑定的配置，用 A 的 Key 调用；B 这边不显示「配置自定义模型」入口，也看不到 A 的 Key。"},{"parent":"4c2631b3-be41-419b-bdd0-595d038f7277","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"540a9a3a-98ee-4db1-815b-1089079cd3a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5ee56269-8efc-4ef2-86e7-94ea314f8fb2","title":"前置：A 已把 Agent 共享到当前房间，并在上面绑定了自定义配置；A 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"540a9a3a-98ee-4db1-815b-1089079cd3a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09068dfd-ab6f-43c9-a0a8-a96f07201189","title":"操作：B 选 A 的共享 Agent 和 Tutti API 模型，发首条消息并连续多轮对话"},{"parent":"540a9a3a-98ee-4db1-815b-1089079cd3a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"07efc57f-e3e7-49ed-a718-0f8a1e50e911","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」中「发送首条消息并连续多轮对话（Tutti API）」逐项一致\n2) 环境隔离 ｜ 任务在 A 的电脑上执行\n3) 用量 ｜ 扣的是 A 的 Tutti 积分，B 的积分不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"540a9a3a-98ee-4db1-815b-1089079cd3a1","title":"🔴【P0】对话主干的等价性抽检（Tutti API）"},{"parent":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"54a7709a-7ba8-48d6-8029-b837b4f326da","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"90104c9c-19d6-4646-96df-d1f6a05e9725","title":"前置：A 已把 Agent 共享到当前房间，并在上面绑定了自定义配置；A 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"54a7709a-7ba8-48d6-8029-b837b4f326da","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0b1d9ae7-8571-4c7d-bc78-905931e8a0a4","title":"操作：B 选 A 的共享 Agent 和 自定义配置 模型，发首条消息并连续多轮对话"},{"parent":"54a7709a-7ba8-48d6-8029-b837b4f326da","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"374fcfa8-6af9-49da-a377-30c7f57cc9dd","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」中「发送首条消息并连续多轮对话（自定义配置）」逐项一致\n2) 环境隔离 ｜ 任务在 A 的电脑上执行\n3) 结果校验 ｜ 请求用 A 的 Key 发到 A 配置的 Base URL\n4) 用量 ｜ A 和 B 的 Tutti 积分都不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"54a7709a-7ba8-48d6-8029-b837b4f326da","title":"🔴【P0】对话主干的等价性抽检（自定义配置）"},{"parent":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4692e663-6c0b-4b16-932c-fdbceebaf489","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c19ec349-bb75-4aac-b307-d256ef70c8dc","title":"前置：A 已把 Agent 共享到当前房间，并在上面绑定了自定义配置；A 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"4692e663-6c0b-4b16-932c-fdbceebaf489","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ed188d0a-b5d9-4ecc-b031-d9c5e4255e9e","title":"操作：B 发一个需要多次工具调用的任务"},{"parent":"4692e663-6c0b-4b16-932c-fdbceebaf489","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea2bebde-726d-4eef-8722-e6c945899b10","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」中「流式输出、思考状态与工具调用折叠（Tutti API）」逐项一致\n2) 消息渲染 ｜ 工具调用详情里不出现 A 的 Key\n3) 用量 ｜ 扣的是 A 的 Tutti 积分，B 的积分不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4692e663-6c0b-4b16-932c-fdbceebaf489","title":"🔴【P0】工具调用与过程展示的等价性抽检（Tutti API）"},{"parent":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b994e4aa-96ea-4547-936b-628501d0af0d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1a3555ba-e3c5-4100-8970-75c4224eca4d","title":"前置：A 已把 Agent 共享到当前房间，并在上面绑定了自定义配置；A 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"b994e4aa-96ea-4547-936b-628501d0af0d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bde4a223-9460-4c16-a3f2-270c0c940994","title":"操作：B 发一个需要多次工具调用的任务"},{"parent":"b994e4aa-96ea-4547-936b-628501d0af0d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9a287dee-eba7-4115-90f5-99ead06641bc","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」中「流式输出、思考状态与工具调用折叠（自定义配置）」逐项一致\n2) 消息渲染 ｜ 工具调用详情里不出现 A 的 Key\n3) 结果校验 ｜ 请求用 A 的 Key 发到 A 配置的 Base URL\n4) 用量 ｜ A 和 B 的 Tutti 积分都不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b994e4aa-96ea-4547-936b-628501d0af0d","title":"🔴【P0】工具调用与过程展示的等价性抽检（自定义配置）"},{"parent":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"37147f8a-6d6d-4ed9-ab1c-846a7d144a30","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"00cb89ec-d9c7-457d-bb6e-735a0eefd1f4","title":"前置：A 已把 Agent 共享到当前房间，并在上面绑定了自定义配置；A 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"37147f8a-6d6d-4ed9-ab1c-846a7d144a30","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b08d2956-8dd5-4dff-adb9-c735b893d2a7","title":"操作：B 让 Agent 修一个 bug、写一个新功能、执行测试"},{"parent":"37147f8a-6d6d-4ed9-ab1c-846a7d144a30","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1d1d433c-363a-4422-a2d4-12869f2f6073","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」中「代码生成与修改（Tutti API）」逐项一致\n2) 文件落盘 ｜ 改动写在 A 电脑上的项目目录里\n3) 用量 ｜ 扣的是 A 的 Tutti 积分，B 的积分不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"37147f8a-6d6d-4ed9-ab1c-846a7d144a30","title":"🔴【P0】执行能力的等价性抽检（Tutti API）"},{"parent":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8810f7fd-21db-4163-b52f-2ef66c8ca25f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4b5ca7bd-819b-46bc-8f06-9af61a72c229","title":"前置：A 已把 Agent 共享到当前房间，并在上面绑定了自定义配置；A 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"8810f7fd-21db-4163-b52f-2ef66c8ca25f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0fede46d-d4a9-48f9-b13c-b33237e82821","title":"操作：B 让 Agent 修一个 bug、写一个新功能、执行测试"},{"parent":"8810f7fd-21db-4163-b52f-2ef66c8ca25f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7add7db2-0548-4847-a570-7ea3e6a31b8a","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」中「代码生成与修改（自定义配置）」逐项一致\n2) 文件落盘 ｜ 改动写在 A 电脑上的项目目录里\n3) 结果校验 ｜ 请求用 A 的 Key 发到 A 配置的 Base URL\n4) 用量 ｜ A 和 B 的 Tutti 积分都不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8810f7fd-21db-4163-b52f-2ef66c8ca25f","title":"🔴【P0】执行能力的等价性抽检（自定义配置）"},{"parent":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0228289c-104e-434f-922f-3c58c0baf532","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c865e52-25e9-44f4-98b6-be8e4be99d59","title":"前置：A 已把 Agent 共享到当前房间，并在上面绑定了自定义配置；A 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"0228289c-104e-434f-922f-3c58c0baf532","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e3e8287f-355f-42a8-86ed-c6fa32814016","title":"操作：B 让 Agent 产出一份文档并预览、下载"},{"parent":"0228289c-104e-434f-922f-3c58c0baf532","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"de688f15-e3d5-48e5-b2f8-f5d8ba4c8786","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」中「文档类：产出、卡片、预览、下载、分享（Tutti API）」逐项一致\n2) 可见范围 ｜ 产物归属本会话，B 与 A 都能在对应入口看到\n3) 用量 ｜ 扣的是 A 的 Tutti 积分，B 的积分不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0228289c-104e-434f-922f-3c58c0baf532","title":"🔴【P0】产物生成与产物列表的等价性抽检（Tutti API）"},{"parent":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2ec408e2-f97b-448f-b8ba-4097c95f3788","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"81395202-7ccf-447a-9775-e7f6a9f269b9","title":"前置：A 已把 Agent 共享到当前房间，并在上面绑定了自定义配置；A 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"2ec408e2-f97b-448f-b8ba-4097c95f3788","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2fa8a744-b632-4051-97fa-a176975e2309","title":"操作：B 让 Agent 产出一份文档并预览、下载"},{"parent":"2ec408e2-f97b-448f-b8ba-4097c95f3788","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"10e2ccf9-749d-4411-a4a7-67c2ef21cad0","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」中「文档类：产出、卡片、预览、下载、分享（自定义配置）」逐项一致\n2) 可见范围 ｜ 产物归属本会话，B 与 A 都能在对应入口看到\n3) 结果校验 ｜ 请求用 A 的 Key 发到 A 配置的 Base URL\n4) 用量 ｜ A 和 B 的 Tutti 积分都不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2ec408e2-f97b-448f-b8ba-4097c95f3788","title":"🔴【P0】产物生成与产物列表的等价性抽检（自定义配置）"},{"parent":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9d230e73-1ccc-43de-916f-d2ec9f1c8199","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b1bfecfd-d6a6-4e02-af93-de6080ae91cd","title":"前置：A 已把 Agent 共享到当前房间，并在上面绑定了自定义配置；A 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"9d230e73-1ccc-43de-916f-d2ec9f1c8199","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2fce300e-851f-4533-bf73-0d0fbdfe69b8","title":"操作：B 运行中取消，再发一条消息"},{"parent":"9d230e73-1ccc-43de-916f-d2ec9f1c8199","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e69a9a03-ba32-4933-af97-5df9c6de108d","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」中「运行中取消后再发消息（Tutti API）」逐项一致\n2) 权限授权 ｜ B 作为会话发起人可以取消自己发起的这一轮\n3) 用量 ｜ 扣的是 A 的 Tutti 积分，B 的积分不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9d230e73-1ccc-43de-916f-d2ec9f1c8199","title":"🟠【P1】停止与重试的等价性抽检（Tutti API）"},{"parent":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cd8e07ac-ecd8-4763-8789-688d22700556","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"33dd2870-c32e-44aa-b77d-59e189c58f4d","title":"前置：A 已把 Agent 共享到当前房间，并在上面绑定了自定义配置；A 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"cd8e07ac-ecd8-4763-8789-688d22700556","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"77b8853f-cc90-433f-9842-f2f83718baa6","title":"操作：B 运行中取消，再发一条消息"},{"parent":"cd8e07ac-ecd8-4763-8789-688d22700556","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c6057df0-6eba-4823-ad3c-450975080502","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」中「运行中取消后再发消息（自定义配置）」逐项一致\n2) 权限授权 ｜ B 作为会话发起人可以取消自己发起的这一轮\n3) 结果校验 ｜ 请求用 A 的 Key 发到 A 配置的 Base URL\n4) 用量 ｜ A 和 B 的 Tutti 积分都不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cd8e07ac-ecd8-4763-8789-688d22700556","title":"🟠【P1】停止与重试的等价性抽检（自定义配置）"},{"parent":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"da2193c3-2a48-4da4-9479-97dadaa06f30","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"424b54db-88cf-4ed1-a77e-a9e337c0f8e0","title":"前置：A 已把 Agent 共享到当前房间，并在上面绑定了自定义配置；A 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"da2193c3-2a48-4da4-9479-97dadaa06f30","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c734af36-a913-484a-ac09-d1888fa86dab","title":"操作：B 依次执行 /compact、/plan、/status"},{"parent":"da2193c3-2a48-4da4-9479-97dadaa06f30","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"840bedd8-b92c-4e9f-b02b-2e9735636a7b","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」中「/compact 压缩后继续对话（Tutti API）」逐项一致\n2) 命令执行 ｜ /status 中的模型名与所选一致，不出现 A 的 Key\n3) 用量 ｜ 扣的是 A 的 Tutti 积分，B 的积分不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"da2193c3-2a48-4da4-9479-97dadaa06f30","title":"🟠【P1】斜杠命令的等价性抽检（Tutti API）"},{"parent":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"42ed84db-55e9-42c8-abef-c39d5b227ee0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7ce63597-cfe3-4164-9343-bb8b0b34ca60","title":"前置：A 已把 Agent 共享到当前房间，并在上面绑定了自定义配置；A 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"42ed84db-55e9-42c8-abef-c39d5b227ee0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"578d1d39-a6b2-42b4-8e0c-218fa97902d1","title":"操作：B 依次执行 /compact、/plan、/status"},{"parent":"42ed84db-55e9-42c8-abef-c39d5b227ee0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a7c9915e-0319-4194-b3d9-abe7d646b1ed","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」中「/compact 压缩后继续对话（自定义配置）」逐项一致\n2) 命令执行 ｜ /status 中的模型名与所选一致，不出现 A 的 Key\n3) 结果校验 ｜ 请求用 A 的 Key 发到 A 配置的 Base URL\n4) 用量 ｜ A 和 B 的 Tutti 积分都不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"42ed84db-55e9-42c8-abef-c39d5b227ee0","title":"🟠【P1】斜杠命令的等价性抽检（自定义配置）"},{"parent":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"120f542d-e7d6-4890-ba48-488264624121","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e0693e41-4889-4384-a6ee-80c6b5c55edd","title":"前置：A 已把 Agent 共享到当前房间，并在上面绑定了自定义配置；A 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"120f542d-e7d6-4890-ba48-488264624121","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"643753b9-9674-46e2-ba0c-c780a6aa5514","title":"操作：B 让 Agent 派发子 Agent，再从中间消息 Fork 一个分支继续"},{"parent":"120f542d-e7d6-4890-ba48-488264624121","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"91aa5a4f-95c2-447c-8a22-34b65624fba8","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」中「子 Agent 派发与结果汇总（Tutti API）」逐项一致\n2) 用量 ｜ 子 Agent 与分支的用量也记到 A 那边，和主会话一致\n3) 用量 ｜ 扣的是 A 的 Tutti 积分，B 的积分不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"120f542d-e7d6-4890-ba48-488264624121","title":"🟠【P1】子 Agent 与 Fork 的等价性抽检（Tutti API）"},{"parent":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c17495f2-fec5-4307-a42d-1a839ac379a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cc527793-6f8a-42fc-830e-f80f0163fc5c","title":"前置：A 已把 Agent 共享到当前房间，并在上面绑定了自定义配置；A 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"c17495f2-fec5-4307-a42d-1a839ac379a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7f8815e4-6eec-4013-842e-de0c36927d68","title":"操作：B 让 Agent 派发子 Agent，再从中间消息 Fork 一个分支继续"},{"parent":"c17495f2-fec5-4307-a42d-1a839ac379a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"29c5b337-be31-40b3-88d8-ff3ff03a512f","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」中「子 Agent 派发与结果汇总（自定义配置）」逐项一致\n2) 用量 ｜ 子 Agent 与分支的用量也记到 A 那边，和主会话一致\n3) 结果校验 ｜ 请求用 A 的 Key 发到 A 配置的 Base URL\n4) 用量 ｜ A 和 B 的 Tutti 积分都不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c17495f2-fec5-4307-a42d-1a839ac379a4","title":"🟠【P1】子 Agent 与 Fork 的等价性抽检（自定义配置）"},{"parent":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"933fb986-2283-440c-8e48-37cffab7aa6e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b490d1bd-1228-4bea-bb96-60e2e61f9c99","title":"前置：A 在共享的 Agent 上绑定了配置 X，B 自己账号下有配置 Y；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"933fb986-2283-440c-8e48-37cffab7aa6e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bf0b14e6-0a33-4592-9f12-289c1a218808","title":"操作：B 选 A 的共享 Agent，展开模型下拉"},{"parent":"933fb986-2283-440c-8e48-37cffab7aa6e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"68e5c92a-6783-4ceb-b5b6-7317080d1fb4","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ Tutti API 分类的模型与 A 自己看到的一致\n2) 可见范围 ｜ 列出 A 已绑定的 X，B 自己的 Y 不出现\n3) 权限授权 ｜ 没有「配置自定义模型」入口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"933fb986-2283-440c-8e48-37cffab7aa6e","title":"🔴【P0】他人 Agent 的模型下拉与入口"},{"parent":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"29b3dc81-41dd-42a8-b340-75f2bf0284d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2ba0fff9-4aee-4adf-8dc1-72c04af489ce","title":"前置：B 正在用 A 的共享 Agent；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"29b3dc81-41dd-42a8-b340-75f2bf0284d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7f1ff7f7-82de-41b1-9f99-e053d2dca886","title":"操作：A 依次新增配置 Z、解绑 X、删除另一个配置，B 每次都点刷新查看"},{"parent":"29b3dc81-41dd-42a8-b340-75f2bf0284d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f23dc50f-9d48-44dc-af2b-097ffb1c37e5","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ B 的下拉依次出现 Z、X 消失、被删的配置消失，与 A 自己的下拉一致\n2) 结果回传 ｜ B 选 Z 的模型能正常对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"29b3dc81-41dd-42a8-b340-75f2bf0284d4","title":"🟠【P1】所有者修改配置后使用者这边同步"}],"id":"652e5ecb-8446-465a-b1e1-128fb284bdb7","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"4c2631b3-be41-419b-bdd0-595d038f7277","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7e00a786-6a49-4e42-96d7-1519dbf71f3c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a9657643-a26a-4e60-95d5-bb4f16db90d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a6c44231-7b0e-487f-aa33-25e601c7b9c6","title":"前置：A 的积分为 0，B 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"a9657643-a26a-4e60-95d5-bb4f16db90d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2b54bcee-11a3-4235-b98f-153a53efff47","title":"操作：B 用 A 的共享 Agent 选 Tutti API 模型发送消息"},{"parent":"a9657643-a26a-4e60-95d5-bb4f16db90d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8fa5c76d-b740-44d6-a374-91929202c47e","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示是 Agent 所有者的积分不足，并引导由所有者处理\n2) 用量 ｜ 不扣 B 的积分，也不会因为 B 有积分就放行\n3) 跳转定位 ｜ 不打开 B 自己账号的充值页，避免误导\n4) 副作用 ｜ 不发出请求"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a9657643-a26a-4e60-95d5-bb4f16db90d2","title":"🟠【P1】所有者积分为 0"},{"parent":"7e00a786-6a49-4e42-96d7-1519dbf71f3c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9b78d4ca-7165-4179-8099-9b9e61fc9cca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"03de6fc7-9454-4b07-a734-0cbb06be0d43","title":"前置：A 的积分只够跑一小段；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"9b78d4ca-7165-4179-8099-9b9e61fc9cca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"02487359-3da8-4553-8a7a-9d8dd8267127","title":"操作：B 用 A 的共享 Agent 和 Tutti API 模型发一个长任务，等积分中途耗尽"},{"parent":"9b78d4ca-7165-4179-8099-9b9e61fc9cca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"68bbbec8-b5e2-4972-9f68-567f017e7eee","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 表现与「任务进行中积分耗尽」一致\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 提示的是所有者积分不足\n3) 用量 ｜ B 的积分不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9b78d4ca-7165-4179-8099-9b9e61fc9cca","title":"🟠【P1】任务进行中所有者积分耗尽"},{"parent":"7e00a786-6a49-4e42-96d7-1519dbf71f3c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b42fcc0e-d5b4-4e18-9a46-5df3a23eae42","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"55bac535-7823-414b-8932-a323317ed306","title":"前置：B 正在用 A 的共享 Agent；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：B 能看到的所有入口：模型下拉、共享 Agent 页、Computer 页"},{"parent":"b42fcc0e-d5b4-4e18-9a46-5df3a23eae42","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4ef8ac87-c3e8-4abb-9217-18941ed49ccb","title":"操作：B 逐个尝试打开 A 这个 Agent 的模型来源弹窗，或编辑、解绑、删除 A 的配置"},{"parent":"b42fcc0e-d5b4-4e18-9a46-5df3a23eae42","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eaf984a9-496c-4140-9da0-8c814481f530","title":"预期：\n1) 权限授权 ｜ 所有入口都打不开 A 的模型来源弹窗，也没有编辑、解绑、删除的操作\n2) 可见范围 ｜ 接口返回和界面上都看不到 A 的 Key"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b42fcc0e-d5b4-4e18-9a46-5df3a23eae42","title":"🟠【P1】使用者无法查看或修改所有者的配置"},{"parent":"7e00a786-6a49-4e42-96d7-1519dbf71f3c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"43c35299-ae62-4838-8743-630bc0b144d9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"11705dc1-ef9a-4246-8925-ecb6c9a115bb","title":"前置：B 正在用 A 的共享 Agent 和 Tutti API 模型；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"43c35299-ae62-4838-8743-630bc0b144d9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"83201166-fdb7-4b5c-8d78-e5fcb6161656","title":"操作：A 的电脑断网后，B 再发消息"},{"parent":"43c35299-ae62-4838-8743-630bc0b144d9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb20883b-a108-429b-9888-48ed9d44b3b7","title":"预期：\n1) 可用状态 ｜ 与宿主库「共享 Agent 可用状态」一致：显示为不可用，不发出请求\n2) 用量 ｜ 不扣任何人的积分"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"43c35299-ae62-4838-8743-630bc0b144d9","title":"🟡【P2】所有者设备离线"}],"id":"7e00a786-6a49-4e42-96d7-1519dbf71f3c","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"4c2631b3-be41-419b-bdd0-595d038f7277","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"52396d1a-dbd3-4b62-879a-f47a54b19d02","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3cef02ec-2f8d-4954-aaff-e50789435894","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ddc1a77f-c611-42dc-8892-30f802365a3a","title":"前置：A 已把 Agent 共享到当前房间，并在上面绑定了自定义配置；A 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"3cef02ec-2f8d-4954-aaff-e50789435894","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f48effff-97f2-411a-9a63-71f547f5f35f","title":"操作：B 上传一个文件并 @ 一个会话后发送任务"},{"parent":"3cef02ec-2f8d-4954-aaff-e50789435894","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7ef888b4-8105-4486-afcd-f10040cd74ba","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」中「上传文件后引用发送（Tutti API）」逐项一致\n2) 结果回传 ｜ Agent 能读到 B 上传的文件\n3) 用量 ｜ 扣的是 A 的 Tutti 积分，B 的积分不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3cef02ec-2f8d-4954-aaff-e50789435894","title":"🟡【P2】提及与文件上传的等价性抽检（Tutti API）"},{"parent":"52396d1a-dbd3-4b62-879a-f47a54b19d02","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4f1d0ce2-aeaa-4b57-8d6f-9919155d2600","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"527a311f-2513-4900-9e5e-b08f97440dec","title":"前置：A 已把 Agent 共享到当前房间，并在上面绑定了自定义配置；A 有积分；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"4f1d0ce2-aeaa-4b57-8d6f-9919155d2600","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b8052f64-bb79-4fa4-bc03-56afc566be8a","title":"操作：B 上传一个文件并 @ 一个会话后发送任务"},{"parent":"4f1d0ce2-aeaa-4b57-8d6f-9919155d2600","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c3fe60bf-c8dd-4155-aa23-a4d75841ccb4","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」中「上传文件后引用发送（自定义配置）」逐项一致\n2) 结果回传 ｜ Agent 能读到 B 上传的文件\n3) 结果校验 ｜ 请求用 A 的 Key 发到 A 配置的 Base URL\n4) 用量 ｜ A 和 B 的 Tutti 积分都不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4f1d0ce2-aeaa-4b57-8d6f-9919155d2600","title":"🟡【P2】提及与文件上传的等价性抽检（自定义配置）"},{"parent":"52396d1a-dbd3-4b62-879a-f47a54b19d02","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8cd17a61-2459-41d8-9867-dad3851623ae","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df875dd9-e4e5-458f-810c-034143151a14","title":"前置：B 自己也装了同一种 Agent，并绑定了配置 Y；A 的共享 Agent 绑定了 X；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"8cd17a61-2459-41d8-9867-dad3851623ae","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9ea39df3-03b1-4fbc-9be1-e41a77f5b46c","title":"操作：B 在「我的」和 A 的共享 Agent 之间来回切换，查看模型下拉并各发一条消息"},{"parent":"8cd17a61-2459-41d8-9867-dad3851623ae","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b177fee9-1b6c-45e6-94fb-3816b4ee177c","title":"预期：\n1) 环境隔离 ｜ 自己的 Agent 只显示 Y，A 的共享 Agent 只显示 X\n2) 用量 ｜ 两边用 Tutti API 时分别扣 B 和 A 的积分"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8cd17a61-2459-41d8-9867-dad3851623ae","title":"🟡【P2】使用者自己的同类 Agent 与共享 Agent 不串"},{"parent":"52396d1a-dbd3-4b62-879a-f47a54b19d02","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"675387b7-9b61-4a0d-b1e0-087053b3443c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae6d50f9-cf99-4b3e-b8a1-c243962c98ac","title":"前置：同一种 Agent 有自己的和他人共享的两个；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"675387b7-9b61-4a0d-b1e0-087053b3443c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9b4b5e75-3390-48f2-b0f9-1e8f8c7593d1","title":"操作：按「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」的全部功能区逐项对照两边"},{"parent":"675387b7-9b61-4a0d-b1e0-087053b3443c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eda1ed00-a789-46ea-a11f-5190a8519a9f","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 除了「配置自定义模型入口」「扣谁的积分」「用谁的 Key」三项按口径不同，其余功能区都一致；有哪一项只在某一边缺失就是缺陷"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"675387b7-9b61-4a0d-b1e0-087053b3443c","title":"🟡【P2】自己与他人 Agent 的能力范围逐项对照"}],"id":"52396d1a-dbd3-4b62-879a-f47a54b19d02","title":"边界场景"}],"id":"4c2631b3-be41-419b-bdd0-595d038f7277","title":"会话执行 · 他人共享的 Agent"},{"parent":"4d6379d8-e49d-4f01-bc14-fefd4d0e9807","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a2e16cbf-dc48-43f4-a95d-10dba13115db","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"553f0d69-b090-45eb-b185-9f07ea27e728","title":"说明：本轮重点关注项。A 在自己的 Agent 上用 Tutti API 或自定义配置开了一条会话，B 进入这条会话续聊。已定口径：沿用会话当前的模型与来源；Tutti API 扣 A 的积分，自定义配置用 A 的 Key；B 可以在 A 的 Tutti API 与已绑定配置之间切换，但看不到 Key。在线判定、额度归属等其余规则沿用宿主库「进入他人的会话」。"},{"parent":"a2e16cbf-dc48-43f4-a95d-10dba13115db","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9e024a93-5899-4f34-a175-90af12e639fb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6336d7e2-a0db-4887-aa16-fd53f194fa38","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9371d684-4218-4f52-9171-4e1002de6f4d","title":"前置：A 的会话用的是 Tutti API 模型且已完成一轮，A 在线并有积分；角色：房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话列表中 A 的会话"},{"parent":"6336d7e2-a0db-4887-aa16-fd53f194fa38","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ce921c20-59b1-44bf-8f92-d6b51d2528ff","title":"操作：B 打开 A 的会话继续发两轮消息，其中一轮让 Agent 修改文件；然后双方查看会话、积分与模型选择"},{"parent":"6336d7e2-a0db-4887-aa16-fd53f194fa38","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5e7e7b90-3eee-48fe-8d98-22a6d222954b","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 续聊过程中的会话、工具调用与产物与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」一致\n2) 输入框 ｜ B 看到的模型仍为 A 选的 Tutti API 模型\n3) 用量 ｜ 扣的是 A 的 Tutti 积分，B 的积分不变\n4) 会话状态 ｜ A 在自己的会话里实时看到 B 的消息\n5) 权限授权 ｜ B 的模型下拉里没有「配置自定义模型」入口，也看不到 A 的 Key"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6336d7e2-a0db-4887-aa16-fd53f194fa38","title":"🔴【P0】续聊他人会话完整链路（Tutti API）","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"9e024a93-5899-4f34-a175-90af12e639fb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b42b60b7-2b60-4788-b38e-a6bb95314863","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4f4b346d-01a2-4a1d-ab13-f71df946e2e7","title":"前置：A 的会话用的是 自定义配置 模型且已完成一轮，A 在线并有积分；角色：房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话列表中 A 的会话"},{"parent":"b42b60b7-2b60-4788-b38e-a6bb95314863","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"861a72e6-d59e-44f1-99af-4b26f65c4143","title":"操作：B 打开 A 的会话继续发两轮消息，其中一轮让 Agent 修改文件；然后双方查看会话、积分与模型选择"},{"parent":"b42b60b7-2b60-4788-b38e-a6bb95314863","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f97e2764-e6b7-4fb5-9f4d-d03af7dc6e73","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 续聊过程中的会话、工具调用与产物与「会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」一致\n2) 输入框 ｜ B 看到的模型仍为 A 选的 自定义配置 模型\n3) 用量 ｜ 请求用 A 的 Key 发出，A 和 B 的 Tutti 积分都不变\n4) 会话状态 ｜ A 在自己的会话里实时看到 B 的消息\n5) 权限授权 ｜ B 的模型下拉里没有「配置自定义模型」入口，也看不到 A 的 Key"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b42b60b7-2b60-4788-b38e-a6bb95314863","title":"🔴【P0】续聊他人会话完整链路（自定义配置）","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"9e024a93-5899-4f34-a175-90af12e639fb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"27fbed1b-77c5-4409-8659-1d9321c38a56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ebd5463d-7c49-4fb1-b5b0-15fee37a91f6","title":"前置：A 的会话用的是 Tutti API 模型，A 绑定了配置 X；角色：房间成员（B）；入口：A 的会话里的模型下拉"},{"parent":"27fbed1b-77c5-4409-8659-1d9321c38a56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"24e5c12b-ff3d-4c3f-837b-c408d397fa14","title":"操作：B 把模型切到 X 的模型发一轮，再切回 Tutti API 发一轮"},{"parent":"27fbed1b-77c5-4409-8659-1d9321c38a56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"81543031-1ffe-4a3a-806d-2829b2cbca3c","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 下拉里有 A 的厂商提供、Tutti API 和 X，没有 B 自己的配置\n2) 结果回传 ｜ 两轮分别由所选模型回复\n3) 用量 ｜ X 那一轮不扣积分，Tutti API 那一轮扣 A 的积分"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"27fbed1b-77c5-4409-8659-1d9321c38a56","title":"🟠【P1】续聊时在所有者的模型之间切换","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9e024a93-5899-4f34-a175-90af12e639fb","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"a2e16cbf-dc48-43f4-a95d-10dba13115db","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c4ed6e37-b36b-40c3-b286-6d5b953cfb50","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f91719ad-3953-49c3-b4c0-8ece7808303a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"370f93aa-4a50-45d2-9a62-e6f2eada7a27","title":"前置：A 的积分为 0，会话用的是 Tutti API 模型，B 有积分；角色：房间成员（B）；入口：A 的会话"},{"parent":"f91719ad-3953-49c3-b4c0-8ece7808303a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"837ccef0-4c3f-4e4c-9189-1b1c924d142f","title":"操作：B 在 A 的会话里发消息"},{"parent":"f91719ad-3953-49c3-b4c0-8ece7808303a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"67cad768-e05f-4792-9239-bcac6fd72b6f","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示会话所属人的积分不足\n2) 用量 ｜ 不扣 B 的积分，也不会因为 B 有积分就放行\n3) 副作用 ｜ 不发出请求"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f91719ad-3953-49c3-b4c0-8ece7808303a","title":"🟠【P1】会话所属人积分为 0"},{"parent":"c4ed6e37-b36b-40c3-b286-6d5b953cfb50","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e0991c13-930e-4672-ab90-453c8c021897","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b04e26c7-fd1b-45f4-bb8d-a2c02fcf752c","title":"前置：A 的会话用的是配置 X 的模型；角色：房间成员（B）；入口：A 的会话"},{"parent":"e0991c13-930e-4672-ab90-453c8c021897","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ec1a781a-a2db-4b55-b279-aaab13b77f03","title":"操作：A 解绑 X 后，B 在会话里发消息"},{"parent":"e0991c13-930e-4672-ab90-453c8c021897","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"129e3d71-dec0-496b-b1c4-0a8bf907cc88","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 表现与「正在使用的配置被解绑」一致\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 提示里不暴露 A 的 Key"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e0991c13-930e-4672-ab90-453c8c021897","title":"🟡【P2】所有者解绑了会话正在用的配置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c4ed6e37-b36b-40c3-b286-6d5b953cfb50","title":"异常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a2e16cbf-dc48-43f4-a95d-10dba13115db","title":"会话执行 · 续聊他人会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4d6379d8-e49d-4f01-bc14-fefd4d0e9807","title":"会话模型选择与执行"},{"parent":"d5b2b21c-3a66-4a53-aa30-30a423ab18e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"44cd9a9d-111c-4559-a91a-e618d02b232c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d7ad47b9-c08b-401a-a4ad-d7fd76f1e309","title":"说明：后续会接入更多 Agent。前面两个子模块是通用主干，这里只写每个 Agent 不一样的地方；新接入的 Agent 在「协议与同步范围」下补一条即可。"},{"parent":"44cd9a9d-111c-4559-a91a-e618d02b232c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7d66e872-68a0-45da-b7e3-dc5f46f23c16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f5951160-39dd-475c-a06b-301c7b6795ef","title":"说明：各 Agent 的 API 协议按各自官方文档里自定义服务商的默认协议确定（已定口径：与市面一致）。Claude Code 用 Anthropic Messages；Codex 用 OpenAI Responses；WorkBuddy、OpenCode（@ai-sdk/openai-compatible）、Hermes（api_mode: chat_completions）、Grok Build（api_backend 默认 chat_completions）、dsh（api: openai-completions）都用 OpenAI Chat Completions；Gemini CLI 用 Google Gemini API（generateContent）；Tutti Agent 只有 Tutti API。每条用例的第一条断言都是与主干逐项一致，后面只写这个 Agent 的差异。"},{"parent":"7d66e872-68a0-45da-b7e3-dc5f46f23c16","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b1795268-0a0d-4235-b13e-fd2949820ff6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8ba56110-673b-467b-8f06-8fff2603f792","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4131853b-0aef-4402-917f-9e302572bf54","title":"前置：本机已安装 Claude Code 并可用；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击Claude Code 打开的「Claude Code · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"8ba56110-673b-467b-8f06-8fff2603f792","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76cb93e7-4d1e-4f70-bed6-4ce41cdec53e","title":"操作：按主干用例跑一遍新增配置、会话下拉与对话，重点核对协议与同步范围"},{"parent":"8ba56110-673b-467b-8f06-8fff2603f792","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"50743b9a-4a41-4fb4-a558-5e2138bababf","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 模型来源弹窗与会话模型下拉的全部能力，与主干用例逐项一致\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 「新增自定义模型」里 API 协议显示为「Anthropic Messages」，不可修改\n3) 可见范围 ｜ 当前对照表里没有其他用 Anthropic Messages 的 Agent，所以它新增的配置不会出现在其他任何 Agent 下\n4) 结果回传 ｜ 用这个协议的中转服务新增配置后，在会话中能正常对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8ba56110-673b-467b-8f06-8fff2603f792","title":"🟠【P1】Claude Code 的协议与同步范围"},{"parent":"b1795268-0a0d-4235-b13e-fd2949820ff6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"daf31625-3c01-4a89-9702-fefab4d48bd7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"afd7439d-f242-46f2-a989-50c0a6b79ccf","title":"前置：本机已安装 Codex 并可用；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击Codex 打开的「Codex · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"daf31625-3c01-4a89-9702-fefab4d48bd7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ece77884-913f-4770-bed9-b2ad0887487d","title":"操作：按主干用例跑一遍新增配置、会话下拉与对话，重点核对协议与同步范围"},{"parent":"daf31625-3c01-4a89-9702-fefab4d48bd7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"db509775-4e12-43bf-9878-040006bc4e70","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 模型来源弹窗与会话模型下拉的全部能力，与主干用例逐项一致\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 「新增自定义模型」里 API 协议显示为「OpenAI Responses」，不可修改\n3) 可见范围 ｜ 当前对照表里没有其他用 OpenAI Responses 的 Agent，所以它新增的配置不会出现在其他任何 Agent 下\n4) 结果回传 ｜ 用这个协议的中转服务新增配置后，在会话中能正常对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"daf31625-3c01-4a89-9702-fefab4d48bd7","title":"🟠【P1】Codex 的协议与同步范围"},{"parent":"b1795268-0a0d-4235-b13e-fd2949820ff6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7232d9f8-d64c-4f5c-9b3a-56654d82812a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5cf32194-f835-4bdc-bf2c-036d837e8f9b","title":"前置：本机已安装 WorkBuddy 并可用；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击WorkBuddy 打开的「WorkBuddy · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"7232d9f8-d64c-4f5c-9b3a-56654d82812a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6684b559-88eb-409a-a7e7-d50e38a08c19","title":"操作：按主干用例跑一遍新增配置、会话下拉与对话，重点核对协议与同步范围"},{"parent":"7232d9f8-d64c-4f5c-9b3a-56654d82812a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3436903e-65cf-44ea-b381-ad5e7a838feb","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 模型来源弹窗与会话模型下拉的全部能力，与主干用例逐项一致\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 「新增自定义模型」里 API 协议显示为「OpenAI Chat Completions」，不可修改\n3) 可见范围 ｜ 新增的配置同步到 OpenCode、Hermes、Grok Build、dsh\n4) 结果回传 ｜ 用这个协议的中转服务新增配置后，在会话中能正常对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7232d9f8-d64c-4f5c-9b3a-56654d82812a","title":"🟠【P1】WorkBuddy 的协议与同步范围"},{"parent":"b1795268-0a0d-4235-b13e-fd2949820ff6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"15b6093e-ca26-4700-898a-a86967f772d9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"48903f91-cf6a-4c4d-a00e-a7d36da480e9","title":"前置：本机已安装 OpenCode 并可用；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击OpenCode 打开的「OpenCode · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"15b6093e-ca26-4700-898a-a86967f772d9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"14a6f99e-0dfb-4389-9e46-2451abf2885d","title":"操作：按主干用例跑一遍新增配置、会话下拉与对话，重点核对协议与同步范围"},{"parent":"15b6093e-ca26-4700-898a-a86967f772d9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3b7ea076-8e6a-45d4-88e0-a85a3ce5d5b7","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 模型来源弹窗与会话模型下拉的全部能力，与主干用例逐项一致\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 「新增自定义模型」里 API 协议显示为「OpenAI Chat Completions」，不可修改\n3) 可见范围 ｜ 新增的配置同步到 WorkBuddy、Hermes、Grok Build、dsh\n4) 结果回传 ｜ 用这个协议的中转服务新增配置后，在会话中能正常对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"15b6093e-ca26-4700-898a-a86967f772d9","title":"🟠【P1】OpenCode 的协议与同步范围"},{"parent":"b1795268-0a0d-4235-b13e-fd2949820ff6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"751dd0a6-e299-4ae8-b148-79deeccabcba","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"822431bb-f90f-4499-9515-16e87c6aa5e2","title":"前置：本机已安装 Hermes 并可用；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击Hermes 打开的「Hermes · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"751dd0a6-e299-4ae8-b148-79deeccabcba","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44d18206-6c5c-403c-951c-73f8cde39ad5","title":"操作：按主干用例跑一遍新增配置、会话下拉与对话，重点核对协议与同步范围"},{"parent":"751dd0a6-e299-4ae8-b148-79deeccabcba","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df615834-27b7-47b6-83d9-e45aa21e6fd3","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 模型来源弹窗与会话模型下拉的全部能力，与主干用例逐项一致\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 「新增自定义模型」里 API 协议显示为「OpenAI Chat Completions」，不可修改\n3) 可见范围 ｜ 新增的配置同步到 WorkBuddy、OpenCode、Grok Build、dsh\n4) 结果回传 ｜ 用这个协议的中转服务新增配置后，在会话中能正常对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"751dd0a6-e299-4ae8-b148-79deeccabcba","title":"🟠【P1】Hermes 的协议与同步范围"},{"parent":"b1795268-0a0d-4235-b13e-fd2949820ff6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"69984aa4-d7e3-4490-ba25-83de56561cd4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"38879e7e-817c-48dc-8b52-036de743928e","title":"前置：本机已安装 Grok Build 并可用；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击Grok Build 打开的「Grok Build · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"69984aa4-d7e3-4490-ba25-83de56561cd4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cc74ac72-bd75-4bf6-b0ae-255986d7199a","title":"操作：按主干用例跑一遍新增配置、会话下拉与对话，重点核对协议与同步范围"},{"parent":"69984aa4-d7e3-4490-ba25-83de56561cd4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c0085d60-46a2-4e39-b727-d24a39370c80","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 模型来源弹窗与会话模型下拉的全部能力，与主干用例逐项一致\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 「新增自定义模型」里 API 协议显示为「OpenAI Chat Completions」，不可修改\n3) 可见范围 ｜ 新增的配置同步到 WorkBuddy、OpenCode、Hermes、dsh\n4) 结果回传 ｜ 用这个协议的中转服务新增配置后，在会话中能正常对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"69984aa4-d7e3-4490-ba25-83de56561cd4","title":"🟠【P1】Grok Build 的协议与同步范围"},{"parent":"b1795268-0a0d-4235-b13e-fd2949820ff6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e4ca9b93-667a-4518-9a2c-cfed54bf6d89","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"16b65371-9a84-4a56-85cb-b939e95fa133","title":"前置：本机已安装 dsh 并可用；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击dsh 打开的「dsh · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"e4ca9b93-667a-4518-9a2c-cfed54bf6d89","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6663ae9d-7b9b-4b1c-ad4d-9ab67266bf3c","title":"操作：按主干用例跑一遍新增配置、会话下拉与对话，重点核对协议与同步范围"},{"parent":"e4ca9b93-667a-4518-9a2c-cfed54bf6d89","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c395b543-0d3a-4916-a573-315dc397a100","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 模型来源弹窗与会话模型下拉的全部能力，与主干用例逐项一致\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 「新增自定义模型」里 API 协议显示为「OpenAI Chat Completions」，不可修改\n3) 可见范围 ｜ 新增的配置同步到 WorkBuddy、OpenCode、Hermes、Grok Build\n4) 结果回传 ｜ 用这个协议的中转服务新增配置后，在会话中能正常对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e4ca9b93-667a-4518-9a2c-cfed54bf6d89","title":"🟠【P1】dsh 的协议与同步范围"},{"parent":"b1795268-0a0d-4235-b13e-fd2949820ff6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7f25edc7-d96b-4f18-a9b3-792c6a68ecf3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a86f7190-be8c-41fb-adb2-277d6eb2ca21","title":"前置：本机已安装 Gemini CLI 并可用；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表中点击Gemini CLI 打开的「Gemini CLI · 模型来源」弹窗"},{"parent":"7f25edc7-d96b-4f18-a9b3-792c6a68ecf3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b436d217-55e6-4656-b4a7-e7f3cfaf4dad","title":"操作：按主干用例跑一遍新增配置、会话下拉与对话，重点核对协议与同步范围"},{"parent":"7f25edc7-d96b-4f18-a9b3-792c6a68ecf3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5e02ae0-ffa4-4ff5-b529-8165ffc50dda","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 模型来源弹窗与会话模型下拉的全部能力，与主干用例逐项一致\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 「新增自定义模型」里 API 协议显示为「Gemini generateContent」，不可修改\n3) 可见范围 ｜ 没有其他 Agent 用这个协议，其他 Agent 新增的配置都不会出现在它下面，它新增的也不会同步出去\n4) 结果回传 ｜ 用这个协议的中转服务新增配置后，在会话中能正常对话"},{"parent":"7f25edc7-d96b-4f18-a9b3-792c6a68ecf3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"520b0338-504c-4ce0-881b-9f0914a5c3af","title":"备注：协议在界面上显示的具体文案待产品确认"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7f25edc7-d96b-4f18-a9b3-792c6a68ecf3","title":"🟠【P1】Gemini CLI 的协议与同步范围"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b1795268-0a0d-4235-b13e-fd2949820ff6","title":"正常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7d66e872-68a0-45da-b7e3-dc5f46f23c16","title":"协议与同步范围"},{"parent":"44cd9a9d-111c-4559-a91a-e618d02b232c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9d997c8c-867f-4f39-9a26-ee6fe4d6e4c9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c9625b03-ed86-4767-b8e5-3dcd8977bd06","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e24ff7e4-d73c-4d6a-9a41-afebc6545a4f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f9c39424-5fec-47c5-923d-6742deaeae89","title":"前置：Tutti Agent 可用，账号有积分；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：Computer 页 Agents 列表，以及房间会话里选中 Tutti Agent 后的模型下拉"},{"parent":"e24ff7e4-d73c-4d6a-9a41-afebc6545a4f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c39ef029-e83d-4ce5-a0f3-0884e0ef1cc8","title":"操作：在 Computer 页点击 Tutti Agent，再到会话中选中 Tutti Agent 展开模型下拉，搜索、刷新后选一个模型发消息"},{"parent":"e24ff7e4-d73c-4d6a-9a41-afebc6545a4f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c606a0c-03ec-4eaf-9d84-b33998120c70","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ Computer 页点击 Tutti Agent 不打开模型来源弹窗\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 模型下拉左侧只有「Tutti API」一个分类，没有厂商提供，也没有自定义配置\n3) 菜单展示 ｜ 没有「配置自定义模型」入口\n4) 等价性 ｜ 搜索、刷新、选中生效与主干一致\n5) 用量 ｜ 对话扣 Tutti 积分，与其他 Agent 使用 Tutti API 时扣积分的规则一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e24ff7e4-d73c-4d6a-9a41-afebc6545a4f","title":"🟠【P1】Tutti Agent 只有 Tutti API"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c9625b03-ed86-4767-b8e5-3dcd8977bd06","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"9d997c8c-867f-4f39-9a26-ee6fe4d6e4c9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"07ea5e35-ca1b-4f15-b704-cab4cc6e066c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"31d9a4e8-ba15-4269-a570-fa6dcc400ec7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"acd771a9-9aaf-4cc6-aa9b-f2721748f248","title":"前置：其他 Agent 下已有多个自定义配置；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话里选中 Tutti Agent 后的模型下拉"},{"parent":"31d9a4e8-ba15-4269-a570-fa6dcc400ec7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2bd052f8-6440-4a11-a804-c50c1a7a00a1","title":"操作：展开 Tutti Agent 的模型下拉并搜索自定义配置里的模型名"},{"parent":"31d9a4e8-ba15-4269-a570-fa6dcc400ec7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"70d74072-e9f3-4e26-9d2c-7764989e0db4","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 搜不到任何自定义配置的模型；出现即视为缺陷"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"31d9a4e8-ba15-4269-a570-fa6dcc400ec7","title":"🟡【P2】其他 Agent 新增的配置不出现在 Tutti Agent 下"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"07ea5e35-ca1b-4f15-b704-cab4cc6e066c","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9d997c8c-867f-4f39-9a26-ee6fe4d6e4c9","title":"Tutti Agent"},{"parent":"44cd9a9d-111c-4559-a91a-e618d02b232c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5816f9ac-092e-4f5f-9587-186abedac66a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a62cf9a1-c643-435e-ab17-b28c2c6e205a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3b8576a2-30b0-4f96-867e-5862ba7930df","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"74365111-959d-470f-a86f-786cbf0f4975","title":"前置：本机安装了对照表里的全部 Agent；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：Computer 页与房间会话"},{"parent":"3b8576a2-30b0-4f96-867e-5862ba7930df","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a45b3699-1fef-42ea-8b01-8810955df09e","title":"操作：按以下维度对每个 Agent 逐项核对：模型来源弹窗、厂商提供卡片、Tutti API 卡片、新增、编辑、解绑与绑定、删除、同协议同步、三类分类、搜索、刷新、Tutti API 会话、自定义配置会话、共享给他人后使用"},{"parent":"3b8576a2-30b0-4f96-867e-5862ba7930df","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"83c85a10-b4f8-4a0b-82a9-9afd12c67b06","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 除了 API 协议与同步范围，以及 Tutti Agent 没有弹窗和自定义配置之外，其余各项每个 Agent 都具备；有哪一项只在某个 Agent 缺失就是缺陷"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3b8576a2-30b0-4f96-867e-5862ba7930df","title":"🟡【P2】各 Agent 的能力范围逐项对照"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a62cf9a1-c643-435e-ab17-b28c2c6e205a","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5816f9ac-092e-4f5f-9587-186abedac66a","title":"能力范围对照"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"44cd9a9d-111c-4559-a91a-e618d02b232c","title":"各 Agent 差异"},{"parent":"d5b2b21c-3a66-4a53-aa30-30a423ab18e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d5947396-ca82-46e6-aa90-5419b93bead8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1acd7e1a-6741-420b-874c-d989a423aa62","title":"说明：Tutti API 与自定义配置对已有用量能力的影响。上下文用量在房间 Agent GUI 里，使用概览和额度保护在共享管理页。宿主库原有的这几块用例都是按厂商提供写的，继续有效，这里只补新来源的口径。"},{"parent":"d5947396-ca82-46e6-aa90-5419b93bead8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e27b7b1c-b7ea-40da-ba63-bf9026fdd20e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2c3740ed-4488-4476-9c9d-14630a2f34e2","title":"说明：已定口径：Tutti API 模型的上下文上限沿用宿主库 Tutti Agent 的数值，与在哪个 Agent 里用无关：Kimi K2.6、Kimi K2.7 Code 为 230,400；GLM-5.1 为 180k；GLM-5.2、DeepSeek V4 Flash、MiniMax M3、Kimi K3、DeepSeek V4 Pro 为 1000k。自定义模型如果模型 ID 能对上已知模型，就用已知的上限；对不上时只显示已用 token，不编造上限。"},{"parent":"e27b7b1c-b7ea-40da-ba63-bf9026fdd20e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"376e2386-726f-408c-a153-2b38d3b08a3e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7b60e8f8-7b0a-4e02-902d-cdff12e47ff9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b67a1212-0d39-4e68-9e8a-dca992372a79","title":"前置：账号有积分；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话的上下文用量入口"},{"parent":"7b60e8f8-7b0a-4e02-902d-cdff12e47ff9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f2a76383-f04d-4868-b7c6-4b62f0d9d33e","title":"操作：在 Claude Code 中选 Kimi K2.6 发消息查看上限，再在 Codex 中选 GLM-5.1、在 WorkBuddy 中选 DeepSeek V4 Pro 各发一条"},{"parent":"7b60e8f8-7b0a-4e02-902d-cdff12e47ff9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd806a9a-9827-49da-9749-55e84ae1234b","title":"预期：\n1) 上下文 ｜ 三处分别显示 230,400、180k、1000k\n2) 上下文 ｜ 不沿用宿主 Agent 自己模型的上限（如 Claude Code 不显示 1,000,000）\n3) 用量 ｜ 已用 token 随对话轮次正确累加"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7b60e8f8-7b0a-4e02-902d-cdff12e47ff9","title":"🔴【P0】Tutti API 模型的上下文上限按模型显示"},{"parent":"376e2386-726f-408c-a153-2b38d3b08a3e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"79eb141e-77d7-42ff-93b8-103a6ede5d07","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"57496b83-237d-4ff6-b285-e678f1759b9b","title":"前置：自定义配置里有模型 ID 为 MiniMax-M3 的模型；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话的上下文用量入口"},{"parent":"79eb141e-77d7-42ff-93b8-103a6ede5d07","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"25b4bb45-0257-4495-97f0-8d427b225694","title":"操作：选这个模型发消息后查看上下文用量"},{"parent":"79eb141e-77d7-42ff-93b8-103a6ede5d07","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5058acfb-c088-4235-8632-bbf2d41d6b7b","title":"预期：\n1) 上下文 ｜ 上限与 Tutti API 的 MiniMax M3 一致，为 1000k"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"79eb141e-77d7-42ff-93b8-103a6ede5d07","title":"🟠【P1】自定义模型能对上已知模型时用已知上限"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"376e2386-726f-408c-a153-2b38d3b08a3e","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"e27b7b1c-b7ea-40da-ba63-bf9026fdd20e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c71de3fe-0fa8-4190-a4fc-a54a5a419351","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"99ca913b-75b3-44d6-9e53-70b179b89fcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"18b3df60-445a-4825-8fdc-def7a089c0ad","title":"前置：自定义配置里有一个不在已知列表里的模型 ID；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话的上下文用量入口"},{"parent":"99ca913b-75b3-44d6-9e53-70b179b89fcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9a37fec4-4c15-4916-b3d7-75394d44c0ba","title":"操作：选这个模型对话几轮后查看上下文用量"},{"parent":"99ca913b-75b3-44d6-9e53-70b179b89fcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d47c2f82-7ecf-4cfd-a9a5-61bd0ce2bef9","title":"预期：\n1) 上下文 ｜ 只显示已用 token，并且随轮次累加\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 不显示编造的上限，也不显示 undefined、0 或负数"},{"parent":"99ca913b-75b3-44d6-9e53-70b179b89fcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2ee45dfe-ebc2-448f-b95c-335ac6272b70","title":"备注：对不上时的具体展示文案待产品确认"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"99ca913b-75b3-44d6-9e53-70b179b89fcb","title":"🟡【P2】自定义模型对不上已知模型时只显示已用 token"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c71de3fe-0fa8-4190-a4fc-a54a5a419351","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e27b7b1c-b7ea-40da-ba63-bf9026fdd20e","title":"上下文用量"},{"parent":"d5947396-ca82-46e6-aa90-5419b93bead8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"998fbd1b-be37-4a6e-8fe2-0d837273ede5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"330f57fe-aa77-4f62-a93e-55f19df291b3","title":"说明：已定口径：B 用 A 共享的 Agent 走 Tutti API 或 A 的自定义配置时，这部分用量也计入 A 的「使用概览」，按使用者合并累计 token，不区分来源。"},{"parent":"998fbd1b-be37-4a6e-8fe2-0d837273ede5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ccd14389-3ce0-440c-9480-5c14c320a718","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1df5d313-56cc-4453-a423-fb5050201748","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3095c0ef-aee4-47df-b584-96ddd2dd7a27","title":"前置：A 已共享 Agent；B 依次用厂商提供、Tutti API、A 的自定义配置各完成一轮对话；角色：Agent 所有者（A）；入口：共享管理 › 我的 Agent › 该 Agent 的使用概览"},{"parent":"1df5d313-56cc-4453-a423-fb5050201748","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09887a88-2613-400b-92da-7ca13a5caa37","title":"操作：A 打开使用概览查看 B 那一行，并核对汇总数据"},{"parent":"1df5d313-56cc-4453-a423-fb5050201748","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aef69f43-f37c-489c-8280-b40822eb4959","title":"预期：\n1) 用量 ｜ B 的累计 token 等于三轮输入加输出 token 之和\n2) 列表展示 ｜ B 只有一行，不按来源拆成多行\n3) 用量 ｜ 顶部汇总数据同步包含这部分用量"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1df5d313-56cc-4453-a423-fb5050201748","title":"🔴【P0】Tutti API 与自定义配置的用量计入使用概览"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ccd14389-3ce0-440c-9480-5c14c320a718","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"998fbd1b-be37-4a6e-8fe2-0d837273ede5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ce0567fb-93aa-4920-aa33-005f0a35d87b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"158dd409-7f48-4609-8a6c-cefaea221b1f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"54fc2eae-7702-4634-b430-95d325e29ac7","title":"前置：成员 C 只用 A 共享的 Agent 走 Tutti API 对话过；角色：Agent 所有者（A）；入口：共享管理 › 我的 Agent › 该 Agent 的使用概览"},{"parent":"158dd409-7f48-4609-8a6c-cefaea221b1f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"395f3c7c-f510-4f7a-b41f-3f31816fc272","title":"操作：A 打开使用概览"},{"parent":"158dd409-7f48-4609-8a6c-cefaea221b1f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e01b2b33-2c25-4158-90dc-a35fad2228fc","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ C 出现在使用者明细里，累计 token 正确，并按累计 token 参与降序排列"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"158dd409-7f48-4609-8a6c-cefaea221b1f","title":"🟡【P2】只用 Tutti API 的使用者也出现在使用概览里"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ce0567fb-93aa-4920-aa33-005f0a35d87b","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"998fbd1b-be37-4a6e-8fe2-0d837273ede5","title":"使用概览"},{"parent":"d5947396-ca82-46e6-aa90-5419b93bead8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0881e374-055f-44ac-a69e-c92b1d2619d6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f0946f24-08aa-4e3a-917c-ed1115198797","title":"说明：已定口径：额度保护只管厂商提供（官方订阅的 5 小时与每周窗口）。触发后使用者那边只有厂商提供的模型不能用，Tutti API 和自定义配置照常可用；用 Tutti API 与自定义配置不占官方额度，也就不会触发额度保护。"},{"parent":"0881e374-055f-44ac-a69e-c92b1d2619d6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5b8d9612-fe37-4e05-9791-01b4a04c3f54","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aca86291-86bf-4339-af1f-442f1b2c539a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bb22637d-d2f8-40a3-9b60-c4a3cd2f13d1","title":"前置：A 开启了额度保护且已触发；A 的共享 Agent 绑定了自定义配置 X；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"aca86291-86bf-4339-af1f-442f1b2c539a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7ba9a27d-8017-42c6-9de0-aa5f4cb8acd1","title":"操作：B 选 A 的共享 Agent，依次用厂商提供、Tutti API、X 的模型发送消息"},{"parent":"aca86291-86bf-4339-af1f-442f1b2c539a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a4b9f74c-ccd9-4389-a572-f13e867e9f64","title":"预期：\n1) 可用状态 ｜ 用厂商提供的模型时被暂停，提示与宿主库额度保护的暂停提示一致\n2) 结果回传 ｜ 用 Tutti API 和 X 的模型都能正常对话\n3) 用量 ｜ Tutti API 扣 A 的积分\n4) 权限授权 ｜ A 本人使用厂商提供的模型不受影响"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aca86291-86bf-4339-af1f-442f1b2c539a","title":"🔴【P0】额度保护触发后，Tutti API 与自定义配置仍可用"},{"parent":"5b8d9612-fe37-4e05-9791-01b4a04c3f54","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"52af2b8a-51c0-4a7d-a37e-e0906b152ee7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a6459f97-f1b3-4924-a4a0-869ea03545af","title":"前置：A 开启了额度保护，官方额度剩余略高于阈值；角色：使用该共享 Agent 的房间成员（B）；入口：房间会话输入框右下角的模型下拉"},{"parent":"52af2b8a-51c0-4a7d-a37e-e0906b152ee7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"027b75b3-000b-40e0-b43a-11dd7e8039a4","title":"操作：B 用 Tutti API 和 A 的自定义配置连续对话多轮，A 再查看官方额度与额度保护状态"},{"parent":"52af2b8a-51c0-4a7d-a37e-e0906b152ee7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"77997841-4f2f-4002-8d57-926bc782fcdc","title":"预期：\n1) 用量 ｜ 官方额度窗口的剩余百分比不变\n2) 可用状态 ｜ 额度保护保持未触发，B 用厂商提供的模型仍然可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"52af2b8a-51c0-4a7d-a37e-e0906b152ee7","title":"🟠【P1】使用 Tutti API 与自定义配置不触发额度保护"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5b8d9612-fe37-4e05-9791-01b4a04c3f54","title":"正常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0881e374-055f-44ac-a69e-c92b1d2619d6","title":"额度保护"}],"id":"d5947396-ca82-46e6-aa90-5419b93bead8","title":"用量、使用概览与额度保护联动"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d5b2b21c-3a66-4a53-aa30-30a423ab18e1","title":"Tutti API 与自定义模型"},{"parent":"688c0e9e-546d-4e6b-ab52-d776fa9a0c3b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"df0be4cf-9b29-4f4f-8e65-41d9d5f74939","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"344ef134-e7ba-4bd3-8237-d3f4f8e6e5b8","title":"说明：云端电脑是 Tutti 托管的云端运行环境，账号创建后在云端房间中使用其上的 Claude Code、Codex。需求来源《云端Agent需求文档》（2026-10-24）与 tutti main 代码。本模块按页面拆为：页面入口与创建、重启、版本与升级、删除（云端电脑卡片头部与「…」菜单）；Agent 列表、Agent 详情 · 官方订阅 / Tutti 积分 / API Key / 移除 Agent（卡片下的 Agent 行与详情弹窗）；在云端房间里使用、共享给房间成员、会话能力 · 云端 Agent（差异）（云端房间内）；云端房间规格（新建云端房间弹窗与资源用量）。注意区分：「新用户流程 / 我的 Agent / 云端房间配置」〔NU-119～NU-127〕写的是本地电脑隔离虚拟机里的 Agent，不是本模块的云端电脑。实验开关「云端 Agent」不单独出用例，前置默认已开启。覆盖缺口：服务端已支持「把本地电脑的 Agent 配置导入云端电脑」，Web 端暂无入口，本批不写。"},{"parent":"df0be4cf-9b29-4f4f-8e65-41d9d5f74939","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2903624c-ce75-48b2-8b55-4f1d6f42860d","title":"说明：状态与操作矩阵（✓ 可操作，✗ 不可操作）\n状态 ｜ 发起任务 ｜ 重启 ｜ 删除 ｜ 检查更新 / 升级 ｜ 登录与安装\n正在连接（创建、启动、恢复） ｜ ✗ ｜ ✗ ｜ ✓ ｜ ✗ ｜ ✗\n在线（含空闲暂停） ｜ ✓ ｜ ✓ ｜ ✓ ｜ ✓ ｜ ✓\n升级中 ｜ ✗ ｜ ✗ ｜ ✗ ｜ ✗ ｜ ✗\n正在重启 ｜ ✗ ｜ ✗ ｜ ✗ ｜ ✗ ｜ ✗\n需要处理（可恢复的失败） ｜ ✗ ｜ ✓ ｜ ✓ ｜ ✗ ｜ ✗\n正在删除 ｜ ✗ ｜ ✗ ｜ ✗ ｜ ✗ ｜ ✗\n身份：只有账号所有者能管理云端电脑；共享后成员只能用被共享的 Agent 发起任务，用量记在主人名下。"},{"parent":"df0be4cf-9b29-4f4f-8e65-41d9d5f74939","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a95dc287-083e-4640-8852-31db8a07312f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"19510076-ba50-4a88-b54e-a18fed82c02c","title":"说明：「我的Agent」→「云端房间配置」页签。新用户（未连接电脑、未创建云端电脑）看到空态「让本地 Agent 与同伴 在云端实时协作」与「连接电脑」，底部是「云端电脑」卡片（「由 Tutti 托管，创建后就能在云端房间里使用。」+「创建云端电脑」）。创建后卡片头部为「云端电脑 ● 在线　云端电脑已是最新版本 / Tutti 托管」，右侧「…」；下方列出 Claude Code 与 Codex。云端电脑也可以不在这里创建：未创建时在云端房间直接选云端 Agent 发送，首次发送会自动准备，见「首次使用 · 在云端房间直接选云端 Agent」。状态取值：正在连接（创建、启动、恢复中）／在线（运行中，或空闲后被自动暂停）／正在重启云端电脑…／正在删除云端 Computer…／需要处理（失败）。已定口径：创建云端电脑不影响上方「连接电脑」的显示；空闲暂停后仍显示「在线」；创建与使用云端电脑本身不单独收费。来源：tutti-lab/tutti main@fddc82e640 的 apps/web modules/cloud-agent、room、computer 与中文文案，cmd/cloud-agent-worker、cmd/computer-daemon 的 cloud 实现；tutti-lab/tutti-server internal/biz/cloud_agent_*；相关 PR：tutti#3392 #3432 #3445 #3458 #3479"},{"parent":"a95dc287-083e-4640-8852-31db8a07312f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d0a31251-33f0-4c84-b235-8e6a1229b4bd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8bc0977c-4325-4723-833e-18155b70dc9c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d3e49c06-3f10-43cb-815e-761366c6efcf","title":"前置：新用户已登录，未连接电脑、未创建云端电脑；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」"},{"parent":"8bc0977c-4325-4723-833e-18155b70dc9c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"032acccd-4fe2-4324-bdd9-1f555793a58a","title":"操作：查看页签空态与底部卡片 → 点「创建云端电脑」→ 观察设置进度直到完成 → 查看页签内容与云端电脑卡片 → 刷新页面 → 在另一浏览器登录同一账号查看"},{"parent":"8bc0977c-4325-4723-833e-18155b70dc9c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6bce012f-c3a1-4ecc-a781-f6be7504c39e","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 空态标题为「让本地 Agent 与同伴 在云端实时协作」，说明「通过电脑上的 Agent 开始任务，并与同伴实时协作。账号和凭据留在本地。」，提供「连接电脑」\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 底部卡片标题「云端电脑」，说明「由 Tutti 托管，创建后就能在云端房间里使用。」，右侧「创建云端电脑」\n3) 按钮状态 ｜ 点击后按钮进入处理中，不能重复提交\n4) 视觉展示 ｜ 依次显示「正在设置云端 Agent：第 1 / 2 步」（创建云端环境）与「第 2 / 2 步」（启动并检测 Agent），已完成的步骤标为「（已完成）」\n5) 副作用 ｜ 设置过程中和完成后，上方「连接电脑」空态照常显示，不被云端电脑替换或遮挡\n6) 提示文案 ｜ 页签说明为「Agent 运行在云端电脑，或你电脑的独立空间里，不会碰到您的其他文件，仅协作相关指令上云。」\n7) 设备状态 ｜ 卡片头部显示「云端电脑」「● 在线」「云端电脑已是最新版本」与「Tutti 托管」，右侧有「…」\n8) 列表展示 ｜ 卡片下方列出 Claude Code 与 Codex，均显示「● 可用」「1 个模型来源」\n9) 持久化 ｜ 刷新页面、换浏览器登录同一账号后，看到的是同一台云端电脑，状态一致，不会重复创建"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8bc0977c-4325-4723-833e-18155b70dc9c","title":"🔴【P0】新用户创建云端电脑并完成设置 · 全链路"},{"parent":"d0a31251-33f0-4c84-b235-8e6a1229b4bd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0d309bfa-a770-4f68-829b-fc01873cb35c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9f461f84-da55-4255-8570-c17491387aa2","title":"前置：账号已连接一台本地电脑「Sun的MacBook Air」并已创建云端电脑；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」"},{"parent":"0d309bfa-a770-4f68-829b-fc01873cb35c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3b208c2c-2c49-4457-b1c6-f02b6cff8fc6","title":"操作：查看页签内容"},{"parent":"0d309bfa-a770-4f68-829b-fc01873cb35c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"35a469ff-896f-4c76-9e43-b314430215c4","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 云端电脑卡片在上，本地电脑卡片在下，各自列出自己的 Agent\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 本地电脑卡片显示电脑名称与「Tutti Computer 已是最新版本」，云端电脑卡片显示「云端电脑已是最新版本」，两者版本信息各自独立\n3) 环境隔离 ｜ 本地电脑上 Agent 的模型来源数与云端电脑上的各自统计，互不影响"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0d309bfa-a770-4f68-829b-fc01873cb35c","title":"🟠【P1】已连接电脑的用户页面布局"},{"parent":"d0a31251-33f0-4c84-b235-8e6a1229b4bd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b4712efb-eb6f-4a8c-8f27-98b75a4c49fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d684ec57-35f3-4fde-bbf4-ee4c20986eb5","title":"前置：账号已有云端电脑；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」"},{"parent":"b4712efb-eb6f-4a8c-8f27-98b75a4c49fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f1521623-9fbd-4dcf-a4a4-fe36f8d0ac70","title":"操作：分别在启动中、在线、空闲一段时间后、重启中、删除中、失败时查看卡片头部"},{"parent":"b4712efb-eb6f-4a8c-8f27-98b75a4c49fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ed816a48-fbe9-4a57-b1e4-116c22415c43","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 启动与恢复中显示「正在连接」并带动态指示\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 运行中显示绿色「在线」\n3) 设备状态 ｜ 空闲后被自动暂停时仍显示「在线」，不显示为离线或失败\n4) 视觉展示 ｜ 重启中显示「正在重启云端电脑…」，删除中显示「正在删除云端 Computer…」\n5) 视觉展示 ｜ 失败时显示红色「需要处理」，并给出失败原因与处理入口"},{"parent":"b4712efb-eb6f-4a8c-8f27-98b75a4c49fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b7a88fcf-8f01-4cda-8a52-470038215ff4","title":"备注：已定口径：空闲暂停显示「在线」是预期行为，不是缺陷"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b4712efb-eb6f-4a8c-8f27-98b75a4c49fd","title":"🟠【P1】云端电脑各状态的展示"},{"parent":"d0a31251-33f0-4c84-b235-8e6a1229b4bd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8a36d3bc-f7f4-4954-ba13-1611289341cb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dc21bba7-eb02-4aff-95aa-9518e5e5a064","title":"前置：已点「创建云端电脑」，设置停在第 1 / 2 步；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」"},{"parent":"8a36d3bc-f7f4-4954-ba13-1611289341cb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"36dd2a87-1e5a-4204-9265-65d335ab51b7","title":"操作：切到其他页面或刷新 → 回到页签继续观察直到完成"},{"parent":"8a36d3bc-f7f4-4954-ba13-1611289341cb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fcf0f206-eed4-4810-a7ac-87bd309631c4","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 回来后显示当前真实的设置步骤，不回到「创建云端电脑」初始态\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 设置正常完成，只有一台云端电脑"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8a36d3bc-f7f4-4954-ba13-1611289341cb","title":"🟠【P1】设置过程中离开页面后回来进度延续"},{"parent":"d0a31251-33f0-4c84-b235-8e6a1229b4bd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0b42c23e-3dbb-4c14-a03c-49ae95d3f9d6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ebf2950-8d6f-476b-94f5-c1c64734d915","title":"前置：同一账号在标签页 A、B 都打开了云端房间配置；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」"},{"parent":"0b42c23e-3dbb-4c14-a03c-49ae95d3f9d6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c88d9064-681a-4b10-8d16-e0f682ac6b76","title":"操作：在 A 创建云端电脑 → 观察 B → 在 A 重启 → 观察 B"},{"parent":"0b42c23e-3dbb-4c14-a03c-49ae95d3f9d6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8fede2b5-8bd6-4be8-8f98-df4d1ec9c91c","title":"预期：\n1) 设备状态 ｜ B 无需刷新即显示设置进度与最终「在线」\n2) 设备状态 ｜ A 重启后 B 同步显示「正在重启云端电脑…」并在恢复后显示「在线」\n3) 按钮状态 ｜ B 中同一时间不能再发起冲突操作（如重复创建、重复重启）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0b42c23e-3dbb-4c14-a03c-49ae95d3f9d6","title":"🟠【P1】多个标签页实时同步云端电脑状态"}],"id":"d0a31251-33f0-4c84-b235-8e6a1229b4bd","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"a95dc287-083e-4640-8852-31db8a07312f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f31b0c2d-6231-46d4-a38f-36702c9fe78c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d7721cc2-5c54-49b2-823b-5dc03c4bb836","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a93c88ff-53a2-4623-b454-bc7facb85d24","title":"前置：云端电脑创建或启动失败，状态为「需要处理」；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」"},{"parent":"d7721cc2-5c54-49b2-823b-5dc03c4bb836","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4e5b612-a31c-494c-a41c-256a4f6df63b","title":"操作：查看失败信息 → 到云端房间查看云端 Agent → 回到卡片点「重试」→ 等待完成 → 在云端房间发起任务"},{"parent":"d7721cc2-5c54-49b2-823b-5dc03c4bb836","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f700a38e-ce53-4333-ba00-0e44a6ebb585","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 显示「云端电脑启动失败」及错误码\n2) 可用状态 ｜ 失败期间云端房间中的云端 Agent 显示为不可用，不能发起任务\n3) 按钮状态 ｜ 「重试」点击后显示「启动中」，不可重复点击\n4) 恢复重试 ｜ 重试成功后状态回到「在线」，不产生第二台云端电脑\n5) 结果回传 ｜ 恢复后在云端房间发起任务能正常完成\n6) 提示文案 ｜ 重试请求本身失败时提示「无法重新启动云端 Agent。」，可再次重试"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d7721cc2-5c54-49b2-823b-5dc03c4bb836","title":"🟡【P2】云端电脑启动失败后重试"},{"parent":"f31b0c2d-6231-46d4-a38f-36702c9fe78c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6db9ade3-108a-46ea-b730-a44aa52af976","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"810252eb-e151-4ce2-baa3-78babf834367","title":"前置：模拟创建接口失败；角色：账号所有者；入口：「创建云端电脑」"},{"parent":"6db9ade3-108a-46ea-b730-a44aa52af976","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4cad62b4-3f8c-4d1c-9b03-08b94552bef1","title":"操作：点「创建云端电脑」→ 失败后再次点击"},{"parent":"6db9ade3-108a-46ea-b730-a44aa52af976","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7b9b4e34-a42f-47e5-813c-1eccf516e911","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示「无法创建云端环境。」\n2) 副作用 ｜ 失败后卡片回到可创建状态，不残留半创建的云端电脑\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 再次点击可正常创建并完成设置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6db9ade3-108a-46ea-b730-a44aa52af976","title":"🟡【P2】创建请求失败"},{"parent":"f31b0c2d-6231-46d4-a38f-36702c9fe78c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"07450a0e-d673-4f5c-ab65-2bae71faab44","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ff5e4d42-a3d7-4041-a007-01ff906aafca","title":"前置：模拟读取云端环境接口失败；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」"},{"parent":"07450a0e-d673-4f5c-ab65-2bae71faab44","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc85a46c-66ba-4064-abf2-920e399206e0","title":"操作：进入页签 → 恢复接口后点重试"},{"parent":"07450a0e-d673-4f5c-ab65-2bae71faab44","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7f725e20-cfb8-432f-8b12-00cedbe5430b","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示「无法读取云端环境。」并提供重试入口\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 重试后正确显示云端电脑的真实状态，不误显示为未创建，也不出现「创建云端电脑」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"07450a0e-d673-4f5c-ab65-2bae71faab44","title":"🟡【P2】读取云端环境失败"}],"id":"f31b0c2d-6231-46d4-a38f-36702c9fe78c","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"a95dc287-083e-4640-8852-31db8a07312f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"de0b6203-926b-4b6c-8cd5-961a2a788978","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"33920fe7-92e5-4704-b273-9dc638398c17","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"794e2053-819c-4432-a8b6-a9bd637c5e7d","title":"前置：账号未创建云端电脑；角色：账号所有者；入口：「创建云端电脑」"},{"parent":"33920fe7-92e5-4704-b273-9dc638398c17","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"249772c7-5ead-4880-80f2-75b6829bf665","title":"操作：连续快速点击创建，或在两个标签页同时点击"},{"parent":"33920fe7-92e5-4704-b273-9dc638398c17","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9a59748f-ac2a-4782-bf0c-11e6847738ad","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 最终只有一台云端电脑，设置进度只出现一次"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"33920fe7-92e5-4704-b273-9dc638398c17","title":"🟡【P2】快速重复点击创建"},{"parent":"de0b6203-926b-4b6c-8cd5-961a2a788978","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ca859d22-1100-467e-ba87-ce02b8ca66b5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3ee027d-bf93-450b-b2c9-4724d3c3a41b","title":"前置：账号已有云端电脑；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→「本地房间配置」"},{"parent":"ca859d22-1100-467e-ba87-ce02b8ca66b5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"79ad8eda-41db-4fcd-9ce5-c3b67427fa9e","title":"操作：查看页签内容"},{"parent":"ca859d22-1100-467e-ba87-ce02b8ca66b5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"19bdaadc-b436-4378-afd2-53b9053f48c0","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 不出现「云端电脑」卡片；出现即视为缺陷"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ca859d22-1100-467e-ba87-ce02b8ca66b5","title":"🟡【P2】本地房间配置页签不出现云端电脑"}],"id":"de0b6203-926b-4b6c-8cd5-961a2a788978","title":"边界场景"}],"id":"a95dc287-083e-4640-8852-31db8a07312f","title":"页面入口与创建"},{"parent":"df0be4cf-9b29-4f4f-8e65-41d9d5f74939","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ef7d4f73-02eb-4b19-9953-113b8224c2c4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"30308fcc-0afe-466c-976e-228dc85fb4bd","title":"说明：入口为云端电脑「…」→「重启」，需二次确认。已定口径：重启会中断运行中的任务，文件、Agent 登录凭据、配置和会话历史保留；被中断的任务状态收敛为已中断，不自动续跑，在原会话继续发送时上下文保留。重启影响这台云端电脑服务的所有云端房间，包括共享给他人使用的会话。只有在线（含空闲暂停）或特定可恢复的失败状态下可以重启；升级进行中不可重启。来源：tutti-lab/tutti main@fddc82e640 的 apps/web modules/cloud-agent、room、computer 与中文文案，cmd/cloud-agent-worker、cmd/computer-daemon 的 cloud 实现；tutti-lab/tutti-server internal/biz/cloud_agent_*；相关 PR：tutti#3392 #3432 #3445 #3458 #3479"},{"parent":"ef7d4f73-02eb-4b19-9953-113b8224c2c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8e8c25b4-500c-4c8c-b2ed-7171ab090e27","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dba40ec5-e74a-4d1d-8e32-b07f44c8c18b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"69f9ab4d-b4d8-4bc1-b598-ff25dd81b74a","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，Claude Code 已登录，云端房间 R 里有一条它的历史会话与产物文件；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」 →「…」→「重启」"},{"parent":"dba40ec5-e74a-4d1d-8e32-b07f44c8c18b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a64fc637-9c37-4a47-b894-1f83917f3754","title":"操作：点「重启」→ 查看确认弹窗 → 确认 → 观察卡片与房间 R 中的云端 Agent → 等待恢复 → 查看登录状态 → 在 R 继续历史会话并新开会话发起任务"},{"parent":"dba40ec5-e74a-4d1d-8e32-b07f44c8c18b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3a076dda-8ef3-47e8-9c94-4133f7b17a55","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 弹窗标题「重启云端电脑？」，内容「将重启云端 Agent 并中断正在运行的任务。文件、Agent 登录凭据、配置和会话历史会保留。」\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 确认后状态为「正在重启云端电脑…」，期间「…」与升级入口隐藏\n3) 可用状态 ｜ 重启期间 R 中的云端 Agent 显示为不可用，不能发起新任务\n4) 设备状态 ｜ 一段时间后自动回到「在线」，不需要重新创建或重新设置\n5) 登录状态 ｜ Claude Code 仍为已登录，账号信息不变\n6) 持久化 ｜ R 中的文件与历史会话完整保留\n7) 结果回传 ｜ 在历史会话继续发送和新开会话发起任务都能正常收到回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dba40ec5-e74a-4d1d-8e32-b07f44c8c18b","title":"🔴【P0】重启云端电脑后登录与数据保留 · 全链路"},{"parent":"8e8c25b4-500c-4c8c-b2ed-7171ab090e27","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0eddb0c9-ebad-4122-80fc-d14443194c20","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a1fa9e31-9b99-467d-a971-cc0e22940911","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，云端房间中有一个任务正在运行；角色：账号所有者；入口：「…」→「重启」"},{"parent":"0eddb0c9-ebad-4122-80fc-d14443194c20","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c56ae98a-6221-4470-a8c8-115472b7f6b2","title":"操作：打开确认弹窗后点取消"},{"parent":"0eddb0c9-ebad-4122-80fc-d14443194c20","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d4b7d7ac-1f08-4b01-9b23-bd366c4dd628","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 弹窗关闭，云端电脑仍为「在线」\n2) 会话状态 ｜ 运行中的任务继续执行并正常完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0eddb0c9-ebad-4122-80fc-d14443194c20","title":"🟠【P1】取消重启不执行"},{"parent":"8e8c25b4-500c-4c8c-b2ed-7171ab090e27","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"06db361b-4a97-4f4a-a509-5d682f944279","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d2aea718-17e4-4fff-89ef-685e5dc4d597","title":"前置：云端电脑因启动超时或连接失败处于「需要处理」；角色：账号所有者；入口：「…」→「重启」"},{"parent":"06db361b-4a97-4f4a-a509-5d682f944279","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"55baceb2-b392-4b9a-952e-8fe3a345fc6e","title":"操作：确认重启 → 等待完成 → 在云端房间发起任务"},{"parent":"06db361b-4a97-4f4a-a509-5d682f944279","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9314409a-c9c1-458c-95bf-03d5989a4fc2","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 此类可恢复的失败状态下「重启」可用\n2) 设备状态 ｜ 重启后回到「在线」，失败信息消失\n3) 结果回传 ｜ 恢复后任务能正常完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"06db361b-4a97-4f4a-a509-5d682f944279","title":"🟠【P1】失败状态下用重启恢复"}],"id":"8e8c25b4-500c-4c8c-b2ed-7171ab090e27","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"ef7d4f73-02eb-4b19-9953-113b8224c2c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"deba1a8f-08d7-4123-901a-ed33a8ea4615","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2080927f-b61c-4acc-bb85-aecbe24f4d18","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"73607c20-ff97-451a-a040-158dac309bef","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，云端房间中有一个 Claude Code 任务正在运行；角色：账号所有者；入口：「…」→「重启」"},{"parent":"2080927f-b61c-4acc-bb85-aecbe24f4d18","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4724af5-375c-4e61-9b57-6b8c8fea9a41","title":"操作：确认重启 → 观察该会话 → 恢复在线后在原会话继续发送"},{"parent":"2080927f-b61c-4acc-bb85-aecbe24f4d18","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b533bcc2-109a-4ff4-b099-5ebc449aba12","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 运行中的任务状态收敛为已中断，不长期停留在运行中，不自动续跑\n2) 副作用 ｜ 中断前已写入房间的文件与已输出的消息保留\n3) 上下文 ｜ 云端电脑恢复「在线」后，在原会话继续发送，Agent 能接着之前的上下文完成任务"},{"parent":"2080927f-b61c-4acc-bb85-aecbe24f4d18","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"40fd5ffc-d3c0-4724-97ef-f75dc987879d","title":"备注：已定口径：中断后不自动续跑，需要用户在原会话继续"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2080927f-b61c-4acc-bb85-aecbe24f4d18","title":"🟠【P1】重启中断自己运行中的任务后在原会话继续"},{"parent":"deba1a8f-08d7-4123-901a-ed33a8ea4615","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cfd5f210-e9af-4484-8e53-06484c69cdc8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"decac93c-0dd9-484f-a767-1fff3a16d6eb","title":"前置：主人已把云端 Codex 共享给云端房间 R，成员 M 在 R 中用它运行任务；角色：账号所有者、成员 M；入口：主人的「…」→「重启」"},{"parent":"cfd5f210-e9af-4484-8e53-06484c69cdc8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9c365f2b-e0c8-4950-9365-a0d76c14c098","title":"操作：主人确认重启 → M 观察自己的会话 → 云端电脑恢复后 M 在原会话继续发送"},{"parent":"cfd5f210-e9af-4484-8e53-06484c69cdc8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d95006d1-f7c8-4300-a26a-931dd566eaec","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ M 的任务状态收敛为已中断，M 能看到因云端电脑重启而中断的提示，不停留在运行中\n2) 可用状态 ｜ 重启期间 M 侧「<主人> 的云端 Codex」不可用，不能发起新任务\n3) 上下文 ｜ 恢复后 M 在原会话继续发送，上下文保留并正常完成\n4) 用量 ｜ 中断前后的用量都记在主人名下"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cfd5f210-e9af-4484-8e53-06484c69cdc8","title":"🟠【P1】重启中断成员正在使用的共享云端 Agent"},{"parent":"deba1a8f-08d7-4123-901a-ed33a8ea4615","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"90eb769f-a1c5-4971-8f2e-1fb210116249","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"94d219c3-378b-44ee-b3a6-98e6256744a3","title":"前置：云端任务运行中，用户在同一会话追加了一条排队消息；角色：账号所有者；入口：「…」→「重启」"},{"parent":"90eb769f-a1c5-4971-8f2e-1fb210116249","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cd8c4d7c-3066-4f47-8bc2-3929d4178ff4","title":"操作：确认重启 → 观察排队消息 → 恢复后继续"},{"parent":"90eb769f-a1c5-4971-8f2e-1fb210116249","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76c8eb99-180f-4b12-8747-63198e465530","title":"预期：\n1) 排队 ｜ 中断后排队消息仍保留在输入区或排队列表中，没有丢失也没有被自动发送\n2) 结果回传 ｜ 恢复后发送该排队消息，Agent 正常回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"90eb769f-a1c5-4971-8f2e-1fb210116249","title":"🟠【P1】重启时排队消息保留"},{"parent":"deba1a8f-08d7-4123-901a-ed33a8ea4615","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"68df87a1-41a6-457d-b83a-64603096ac56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"58dc25e1-9a3f-45ad-82e1-17462c0c5206","title":"前置：云端电脑正在重启；角色：账号所有者；入口：云端房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"68df87a1-41a6-457d-b83a-64603096ac56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76fe7881-c557-4e07-b5ff-9d3352be858c","title":"操作：选择云端 Agent 尝试新建会话并发送 → 等待恢复后再发"},{"parent":"68df87a1-41a6-457d-b83a-64603096ac56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4c739d4a-2f2b-468d-aa3b-3107e34d5cfa","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 重启期间发送不可用或给出云端电脑不可用的提示，不会生成卡住的空会话\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 恢复「在线」后可以正常新建会话并收到回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"68df87a1-41a6-457d-b83a-64603096ac56","title":"🟡【P2】重启期间不能发起新会话"},{"parent":"deba1a8f-08d7-4123-901a-ed33a8ea4615","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0dc17efc-cff8-4345-b418-bd132105d75c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"49c24b7b-fd79-430e-b2ca-80136f93ab30","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，模拟重启接口失败；角色：账号所有者；入口：「…」→「重启」"},{"parent":"0dc17efc-cff8-4345-b418-bd132105d75c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"be2a6a73-05de-4a8f-9e18-d0c2ffde1e7c","title":"操作：确认重启 → 失败后刷新状态再重试"},{"parent":"0dc17efc-cff8-4345-b418-bd132105d75c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a00924fc-d1ad-4457-91ac-e908b140f845","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示「无法重启云端电脑，请刷新状态后重试。」\n2) 设备状态 ｜ 状态不长期停留在「正在重启云端电脑…」，仍为原来的「在线」\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 刷新后再次重启可成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0dc17efc-cff8-4345-b418-bd132105d75c","title":"🟡【P2】重启请求失败"},{"parent":"deba1a8f-08d7-4123-901a-ed33a8ea4615","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0333f25b-47fe-477d-9034-7447492849d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df548438-dcad-4c6f-b234-eb4aedc1fc6c","title":"前置：云端电脑正在升级，或处于启动中；角色：账号所有者；入口：卡片右侧「…」"},{"parent":"0333f25b-47fe-477d-9034-7447492849d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"94b56489-e567-4680-be1c-fd6e3cd642c2","title":"操作：打开「…」菜单 → 等升级完成后再打开"},{"parent":"0333f25b-47fe-477d-9034-7447492849d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7d731ac-855c-459d-96c1-73ad036b969f","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 升级或启动期间「重启」不可点击，确认弹窗的确认按钮同样不可用\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 回到「在线」后「重启」恢复可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0333f25b-47fe-477d-9034-7447492849d4","title":"🟡【P2】不可重启时重启入口不可用"}],"id":"deba1a8f-08d7-4123-901a-ed33a8ea4615","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"ef7d4f73-02eb-4b19-9953-113b8224c2c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"de90751e-17c3-4083-93fa-fcfc5d87e5f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"eadc35d2-914d-4847-a203-a742e89391ec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"affda55e-a1e3-4bc2-9e90-44b2ccbbbaf5","title":"前置：云端房间 R1、R2 各有一个云端任务在运行；角色：账号所有者；入口：「…」→「重启」"},{"parent":"eadc35d2-914d-4847-a203-a742e89391ec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"18be668f-1ca3-49f0-9e81-3ba54b57f6cf","title":"操作：确认重启 → 分别查看 R1、R2 → 恢复后分别继续"},{"parent":"eadc35d2-914d-4847-a203-a742e89391ec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bcf7310a-9ee3-4194-bd91-c1d71c278bca","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ R1、R2 的任务都收敛为已中断\n2) 上下文 ｜ 恢复后两个房间各自在原会话继续，互不串上下文"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"eadc35d2-914d-4847-a203-a742e89391ec","title":"🟡【P2】多个房间同时有运行任务时重启"},{"parent":"de90751e-17c3-4083-93fa-fcfc5d87e5f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c2567c55-0334-4177-bd1a-48d6737fdd9f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e376d51d-aa63-4e0c-b711-5741bfd27c58","title":"前置：云端电脑正在重启；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」"},{"parent":"c2567c55-0334-4177-bd1a-48d6737fdd9f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"264dc702-5be4-40aa-a834-ff5b029956e3","title":"操作：关闭浏览器标签 → 重新打开页签"},{"parent":"c2567c55-0334-4177-bd1a-48d6737fdd9f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5c295e73-b42f-4bb6-a25a-ab727d7eb4d2","title":"预期：\n1) 设备状态 ｜ 显示当前真实状态（仍在重启或已「在线」），不需要重复操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c2567c55-0334-4177-bd1a-48d6737fdd9f","title":"🟡【P2】重启中关闭页面后重新打开"},{"parent":"de90751e-17c3-4083-93fa-fcfc5d87e5f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e70e6ad5-4e9e-4168-9f7b-f478d00357ea","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"14ed0d10-8187-45cb-a11c-d4439c561aef","title":"前置：云端电脑在线；角色：账号所有者；入口：重启确认弹窗"},{"parent":"e70e6ad5-4e9e-4168-9f7b-f478d00357ea","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"681a70ee-b175-49bd-95c2-3bad680926d4","title":"操作：在确认按钮上快速连续点击"},{"parent":"e70e6ad5-4e9e-4168-9f7b-f478d00357ea","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"484d38a2-b91c-4592-b3e5-a49eb199806d","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 只提交一次重启，确认按钮进入处理中状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e70e6ad5-4e9e-4168-9f7b-f478d00357ea","title":"🟡【P2】确认重启时连续点击"}],"id":"de90751e-17c3-4083-93fa-fcfc5d87e5f7","title":"边界场景"}],"id":"ef7d4f73-02eb-4b19-9953-113b8224c2c4","title":"重启"},{"parent":"df0be4cf-9b29-4f4f-8e65-41d9d5f74939","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fbd95d10-1ef1-4f89-beeb-23e59629e7c6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b6a5d689-681e-436c-9d66-4bd1d4ec541d","title":"说明：版本显示为「Cloud Program <版本号>」。升级分普通更新与强制更新：强制更新显示「将在 <截止时间> 前更新。届时运行中的任务会安全暂停。」，到期自动进行。升级阶段依次为：更新已安排 → 等待运行中的任务 → 正在结束运行中的任务 → 正在安装更新 → 正在准备更新后的 Agent → 正在启用新版本 → 正在完成更新 → 更新完成；失败时进入 正在恢复上一版本 → 正在准备上一版本 → 已恢复上一版本。已定口径：被升级结束或暂停的任务状态收敛为已中断，可在原会话继续；升级期间重启、删除、检查更新不可用。来源：tutti-lab/tutti main@fddc82e640 的 apps/web modules/cloud-agent、room、computer 与中文文案，cmd/cloud-agent-worker、cmd/computer-daemon 的 cloud 实现；tutti-lab/tutti-server internal/biz/cloud_agent_*；相关 PR：tutti#3392 #3432 #3445 #3458 #3479"},{"parent":"fbd95d10-1ef1-4f89-beeb-23e59629e7c6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"548d3272-45f9-4c6e-82ec-4aaa90e19155","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"048f938a-eb2f-43d2-962c-149451eb7fd6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3adb8999-109b-4249-9101-7c270dde53d2","title":"前置：云端电脑在线且为最新版本；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」 卡片「…」→「检查更新」"},{"parent":"048f938a-eb2f-43d2-962c-149451eb7fd6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d1e54aae-5032-4f1c-9d96-f3260bbd1f32","title":"操作：点「检查更新」"},{"parent":"048f938a-eb2f-43d2-962c-149451eb7fd6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fbac5445-b5a2-4d12-96c7-51c804502fe4","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 检查中显示「正在检查更新…」，按钮不可重复点击\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 完成后卡片头部显示「云端电脑已是最新版本」，不出现升级入口\n3) 视觉展示 ｜ 当前版本显示为「Cloud Program <版本号>」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"048f938a-eb2f-43d2-962c-149451eb7fd6","title":"🔴【P0】检查更新：已是最新版本"},{"parent":"548d3272-45f9-4c6e-82ec-4aaa90e19155","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4c1fbc64-83e6-48fa-bf5d-5848d4a0aa5e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"215aa8fc-1c17-4f7f-b81b-f9e32706e6e0","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，有普通更新可用，Claude Code 已登录，云端房间里有历史会话；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」"},{"parent":"4c1fbc64-83e6-48fa-bf5d-5848d4a0aa5e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1b42cfd0-958a-48de-b858-a44184ccfb0e","title":"操作：查看更新提示 → 点「升级云端电脑」→ 查看确认内容 → 确认 → 观察升级各阶段直到完成 → 查看版本与 Agent 登录状态 → 在云端房间继续历史会话并发起新任务"},{"parent":"4c1fbc64-83e6-48fa-bf5d-5848d4a0aa5e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a671da9c-8ba4-4c77-b0a1-10d2e939ab3e","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 显示「有可用的云端电脑更新」\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 确认浮层标题「升级云端电脑？」，内容「升级需要重启云端电脑，可能中断正在运行的任务。」，并显示当前版本与最新版本\n3) 视觉展示 ｜ 确认后显示「正在提交升级…」，随后按顺序显示各升级阶段\n4) 按钮状态 ｜ 升级期间重启、删除、检查更新不可用\n5) 提示文案 ｜ 完成后提示「云端电脑已升级到 <版本号>」\n6) 版本升级 ｜ 当前版本更新为新版本，再次检查更新后卡片头部显示「云端电脑已是最新版本」\n7) 登录状态 ｜ Claude Code 仍为已登录\n8) 持久化 ｜ 历史会话与文件完整保留\n9) 结果回传 ｜ 继续历史会话与新任务都能正常完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4c1fbc64-83e6-48fa-bf5d-5848d4a0aa5e","title":"🔴【P0】手动升级到新版本 · 全链路"},{"parent":"548d3272-45f9-4c6e-82ec-4aaa90e19155","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"51a41569-f270-4b80-a528-217c7d93d0d9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"73997a44-de20-4cd7-bb96-72c96f24c28a","title":"前置：有普通更新可用；角色：账号所有者；入口：「升级云端电脑」确认浮层"},{"parent":"51a41569-f270-4b80-a528-217c7d93d0d9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"25b841ad-2490-4179-b8ed-70bb6480eefe","title":"操作：打开确认浮层后取消"},{"parent":"51a41569-f270-4b80-a528-217c7d93d0d9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6959a502-e5e5-44c1-8484-97ae7850e4f0","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 浮层关闭，版本不变，仍提示有更新可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"51a41569-f270-4b80-a528-217c7d93d0d9","title":"🟠【P1】取消升级不执行"},{"parent":"548d3272-45f9-4c6e-82ec-4aaa90e19155","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b870e50f-0bcf-4396-a74f-8487af66b9d0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"32547eca-3769-47ca-9a71-d9e2c6976667","title":"前置：云端电脑有强制更新，截止时间临近；云端房间中有一个任务正在运行；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」"},{"parent":"b870e50f-0bcf-4396-a74f-8487af66b9d0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3f34a8b4-71a7-4f5a-84ab-ebe2f3fc4dbb","title":"操作：查看更新提示 → 等到截止时间 → 观察运行中的任务与升级过程 → 完成后在原会话继续"},{"parent":"b870e50f-0bcf-4396-a74f-8487af66b9d0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a432ec4c-b9d3-4cc3-b21b-6f015489900e","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 显示「将在 <截止时间> 前更新。届时运行中的任务会安全暂停。」，时间按本地时区显示\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 到期后无需用户确认自动开始升级\n3) 会话状态 ｜ 运行中的任务被安全暂停，状态收敛为已中断\n4) 版本升级 ｜ 升级完成后版本更新\n5) 上下文 ｜ 在原会话继续发送，上下文保留并能完成任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b870e50f-0bcf-4396-a74f-8487af66b9d0","title":"🟠【P1】强制更新到期自动执行"},{"parent":"548d3272-45f9-4c6e-82ec-4aaa90e19155","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a137c804-9f3b-4a38-8cf6-035fc24a0796","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e6ac391b-a0b6-4dcf-97ad-ce904544aae9","title":"前置：云端电脑正在升级到版本 A，期间又发布了版本 B；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」"},{"parent":"a137c804-9f3b-4a38-8cf6-035fc24a0796","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09b7808e-6657-4c6c-8d41-dab1f8e16fce","title":"操作：观察升级状态区直到完成 → 再次检查更新"},{"parent":"a137c804-9f3b-4a38-8cf6-035fc24a0796","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2255adea-faa8-4742-9fd3-bd3348a05e15","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 在升级状态旁显示「下一待更新版本：<版本 B>」\n2) 版本升级 ｜ 本次升级完成后为版本 A，并再次提示有更新可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a137c804-9f3b-4a38-8cf6-035fc24a0796","title":"🟠【P1】升级过程中又发布新版本"},{"parent":"548d3272-45f9-4c6e-82ec-4aaa90e19155","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0fd0ba2b-ee90-4b41-9c41-b3da0df991a8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"501e5882-f78b-4188-9d26-a738553f1593","title":"前置：云端电脑正在升级；角色：账号所有者；入口：云端房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"0fd0ba2b-ee90-4b41-9c41-b3da0df991a8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"03df1082-f254-4f8d-b5ea-f7140638036c","title":"操作：查看云端 Agent 状态并尝试发送 → 升级完成后再发送"},{"parent":"0fd0ba2b-ee90-4b41-9c41-b3da0df991a8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc015ea3-730d-4a92-9506-9a1e82ffe1d2","title":"预期：\n1) 可用状态 ｜ 升级期间云端 Agent 显示不可用，发送被拦截并给出提示，不生成卡住的会话\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 升级完成后发送正常收到回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0fd0ba2b-ee90-4b41-9c41-b3da0df991a8","title":"🟠【P1】升级期间房间里的云端 Agent"}],"id":"548d3272-45f9-4c6e-82ec-4aaa90e19155","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"fbd95d10-1ef1-4f89-beeb-23e59629e7c6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"211fcdaa-f483-41e1-88dc-6b9695bf0044","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e9396bde-27d0-4e21-8b0c-dd81d28ce6ba","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bd34e5e0-6ad7-44d8-894c-918fa31f6921","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，有更新可用；模拟新版本启动失败；角色：账号所有者；入口：「升级云端电脑」"},{"parent":"e9396bde-27d0-4e21-8b0c-dd81d28ce6ba","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8139e48b-35a2-447f-9258-df85010d84ca","title":"操作：确认升级 → 观察失败后的恢复过程 → 在云端房间发起任务 → 点重试 → 等待完成"},{"parent":"e9396bde-27d0-4e21-8b0c-dd81d28ce6ba","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"743dbec5-c790-4f56-bcbe-8dd7487ce55b","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 失败后依次显示「正在恢复上一版本」「正在准备上一版本」「已恢复上一版本」\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 提示「云端电脑升级未完成」并显示错误码\n3) 设备状态 ｜ 恢复后云端电脑回到「在线」，版本仍为升级前版本，Agent 登录与文件不受影响\n4) 结果回传 ｜ 恢复后任务能正常完成\n5) 恢复重试 ｜ 可重试时提供重试入口，重试成功后升级到新版本"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e9396bde-27d0-4e21-8b0c-dd81d28ce6ba","title":"🟠【P1】升级失败自动恢复上一版本并重试"},{"parent":"211fcdaa-f483-41e1-88dc-6b9695bf0044","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"833f4750-bac8-4969-bc82-635561a126b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d3289dcb-e9fa-47ef-a3fd-33d70bf97c46","title":"前置：云端房间中有一个任务正在运行，并有一条排队消息；角色：账号所有者；入口：「升级云端电脑」"},{"parent":"833f4750-bac8-4969-bc82-635561a126b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ff043c76-41cc-4c1c-a3ae-b769d45f54e9","title":"操作：确认升级 → 观察「等待运行中的任务」「正在结束运行中的任务」阶段与该会话 → 升级完成后在原会话继续并发送排队消息"},{"parent":"833f4750-bac8-4969-bc82-635561a126b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"19c536a1-a675-472a-a8e1-dd3825b15955","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 运行中的任务状态收敛为已中断，不长期停留在运行中，不自动续跑\n2) 副作用 ｜ 中断前已写入房间的文件与已输出的消息保留\n3) 排队 ｜ 排队消息保留，没有丢失也没有被自动发送\n4) 上下文 ｜ 云端电脑恢复「在线」后，在原会话继续发送，Agent 能接着之前的上下文完成任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"833f4750-bac8-4969-bc82-635561a126b4","title":"🟠【P1】升级结束自己运行中的任务后可继续"},{"parent":"211fcdaa-f483-41e1-88dc-6b9695bf0044","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ce1c7265-bbe8-4775-ae1a-941e05fb105a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ecfe35ed-ff90-4ddf-a29b-0ee1c3c3f702","title":"前置：主人的云端 Claude Code 共享给云端房间 R，成员 M 正在用它运行任务；角色：账号所有者、成员 M；入口：主人的「升级云端电脑」"},{"parent":"ce1c7265-bbe8-4775-ae1a-941e05fb105a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b9afc7a4-6229-4cd8-a38d-56cc1ff02644","title":"操作：主人确认升级 → M 观察会话 → 升级完成后 M 在原会话继续"},{"parent":"ce1c7265-bbe8-4775-ae1a-941e05fb105a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4ace7ad2-58ab-4338-be6b-3a039d2c3efb","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ M 的任务状态收敛为已中断，并能看到中断原因\n2) 上下文 ｜ 升级完成后 M 在原会话继续，上下文保留\n3) 用量 ｜ 用量仍记在主人名下"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ce1c7265-bbe8-4775-ae1a-941e05fb105a","title":"🟠【P1】升级结束成员正在使用的共享云端 Agent"},{"parent":"211fcdaa-f483-41e1-88dc-6b9695bf0044","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"364ebe83-6a9b-484e-9f2d-dc3ba3600cc9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eb2cca02-ed42-4afa-86dd-aaeea28ecbe6","title":"前置：模拟检查更新接口失败；角色：账号所有者；入口：「检查更新」"},{"parent":"364ebe83-6a9b-484e-9f2d-dc3ba3600cc9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ba72724e-8533-47d5-8b00-95e759841948","title":"操作：点「检查更新」→ 恢复后再次检查"},{"parent":"364ebe83-6a9b-484e-9f2d-dc3ba3600cc9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a3737d78-968c-48b8-9ae0-568a28cb9ec0","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示「无法检查云端电脑更新。」\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 再次检查可正常得到结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"364ebe83-6a9b-484e-9f2d-dc3ba3600cc9","title":"🟡【P2】检查更新失败"},{"parent":"211fcdaa-f483-41e1-88dc-6b9695bf0044","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4037399c-f428-48fd-89ca-f5817fc96cb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"208c05c0-b397-4d4a-a58a-b92c64201827","title":"前置：打开升级确认后，云端电脑状态或可用版本在服务端已发生变化；角色：账号所有者；入口：升级确认浮层"},{"parent":"4037399c-f428-48fd-89ca-f5817fc96cb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ace5495d-60a0-47d0-ba32-0a85fe884769","title":"操作：确认升级 → 刷新 → 重新升级"},{"parent":"4037399c-f428-48fd-89ca-f5817fc96cb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"736a08d4-8724-49fe-845d-a8727c938bb3","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 升级不执行并提示需要刷新后再试\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不残留进行到一半的升级，云端电脑保持「在线」\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 刷新后按最新版本重新发起升级可成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4037399c-f428-48fd-89ca-f5817fc96cb7","title":"🟡【P2】提交升级时版本已变化"}],"id":"211fcdaa-f483-41e1-88dc-6b9695bf0044","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"fbd95d10-1ef1-4f89-beeb-23e59629e7c6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"356e05f0-4528-46fa-9ab9-a8318fc4bbb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"99ccf239-6850-41d1-8b63-8fda3199eba1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09d51fe1-33a2-4748-b6ac-62092bf0a3fb","title":"前置：云端电脑刚创建尚未上报版本，或当前环境无法确认最新版本；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」"},{"parent":"99ccf239-6850-41d1-8b63-8fda3199eba1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0418a645-5476-48d8-bd43-6b27e6e05235","title":"操作：查看版本区并检查更新"},{"parent":"99ccf239-6850-41d1-8b63-8fda3199eba1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ceb8dd3c-71dc-47bf-92df-1d7bde1a8423","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 未上报时显示「版本尚未上报」\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 无法确认最新版本时显示「尚无法确认当前泳道的最新版本。」，不显示升级入口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"99ccf239-6850-41d1-8b63-8fda3199eba1","title":"🟡【P2】版本信息暂不可用"},{"parent":"356e05f0-4528-46fa-9ab9-a8318fc4bbb7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8a40da0d-7548-46cc-b5fd-662de3c521c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"166ce327-4e7f-4d3e-89e4-d6bff242e224","title":"前置：有更新可用；角色：账号所有者；入口：升级确认浮层"},{"parent":"8a40da0d-7548-46cc-b5fd-662de3c521c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9c3e203b-bdb6-4a7d-b6f7-aaf5e67a236e","title":"操作：在确认按钮上快速连续点击"},{"parent":"8a40da0d-7548-46cc-b5fd-662de3c521c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dc92e340-b697-4bdf-a700-c3593695d8d7","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 只提交一次升级，进入「正在提交升级…」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8a40da0d-7548-46cc-b5fd-662de3c521c1","title":"🟡【P2】确认升级时连续点击"}],"id":"356e05f0-4528-46fa-9ab9-a8318fc4bbb7","title":"边界场景"}],"id":"fbd95d10-1ef1-4f89-beeb-23e59629e7c6","title":"版本与升级"},{"parent":"df0be4cf-9b29-4f4f-8e65-41d9d5f74939","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d5ba1b09-e025-44b6-aeb9-073564529153","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e64a41f1-0801-482f-b1d7-15a7d46a5a50","title":"说明：入口为云端电脑「…」→「删除」，需二次确认。已定口径：删除会停止运行中的任务，永久删除云端环境、Agent 登录和设置；房间、聊天记录和本地电脑不受影响；用云端 Agent 跑过的历史会话可以查看但不能继续，重新创建云端电脑也不会接上旧会话；共享出去的云端 Agent 随之从成员侧消失。来源：tutti-lab/tutti main@fddc82e640 的 apps/web modules/cloud-agent、room、computer 与中文文案，cmd/cloud-agent-worker、cmd/computer-daemon 的 cloud 实现；tutti-lab/tutti-server internal/biz/cloud_agent_*；相关 PR：tutti#3392 #3432 #3445 #3458 #3479"},{"parent":"d5ba1b09-e025-44b6-aeb9-073564529153","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b78a9c38-4334-4eb9-be57-847a74f842b6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"859ad581-dee3-4bb7-9309-69eb8e2d25a6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ac3790a0-9014-4e97-8456-4ab549bbc8b2","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，Codex 已登录并共享给云端房间 R，R 里有 Codex 的历史会话 S 与产物文件；成员 M 在 R 中；角色：账号所有者、成员 M；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」 →「…」→「删除」"},{"parent":"859ad581-dee3-4bb7-9309-69eb8e2d25a6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8e2fa6a0-8cad-4b24-aeff-bd13c3473c03","title":"操作：点「删除」→ 查看确认弹窗 → 确认 → 等待删除完成 → 打开 R 查看会话 S 并尝试继续发送 → M 查看 Agent 列表 → 重新创建云端电脑 → 再查看会话 S"},{"parent":"859ad581-dee3-4bb7-9309-69eb8e2d25a6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"04b4d5fc-d008-45c7-8711-2acf42720118","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 弹窗标题「删除云端电脑？」，内容「会停止正在运行的云端任务，并永久删除云端环境、Agent 登录和设置。房间、聊天记录和你的电脑不受影响。删除后可以重新创建。」\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 确认后显示「正在删除云端 Computer…」，完成后设备列表不再有云端电脑，回到「创建云端电脑」卡片\n3) 副作用 ｜ 房间 R、群聊记录与本地电脑及其 Agent 都不受影响\n4) 可见范围 ｜ 会话 S 的内容与产物文件仍可查看\n5) 会话状态 ｜ 在会话 S 继续发送时提示该 Agent 不可用，不能继续\n6) 列表展示 ｜ M 的 Agent 列表中不再出现「<主人> 的云端 Codex」\n7) 登录状态 ｜ 重新创建后是全新的云端电脑，Codex 需要重新登录\n8) 会话状态 ｜ 重新创建并登录后，会话 S 仍不能继续，不会自动接上新云端电脑"},{"parent":"859ad581-dee3-4bb7-9309-69eb8e2d25a6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7d052c85-3e62-448a-81db-ea0634d58929","title":"备注：已定口径：删除后历史会话只读、重建后也不接续，不是缺陷"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"859ad581-dee3-4bb7-9309-69eb8e2d25a6","title":"🔴【P0】删除云端电脑后重新创建 · 全链路"},{"parent":"b78a9c38-4334-4eb9-be57-847a74f842b6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2c519fe1-3154-4b57-bb00-b8bcc19609fe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cc95026b-63c1-4b67-a81e-402c1af2c594","title":"前置：云端电脑在线；角色：账号所有者；入口：「…」→「删除」"},{"parent":"2c519fe1-3154-4b57-bb00-b8bcc19609fe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"47071c83-9910-4539-a572-d0ddbbf60afe","title":"操作：打开确认弹窗后点取消"},{"parent":"2c519fe1-3154-4b57-bb00-b8bcc19609fe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"879fa51c-092e-4160-90ad-8f3418480cb6","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 弹窗关闭，云端电脑仍为「在线」，登录、文件、共享都不受影响"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2c519fe1-3154-4b57-bb00-b8bcc19609fe","title":"🟠【P1】取消删除不执行"}],"id":"b78a9c38-4334-4eb9-be57-847a74f842b6","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"d5ba1b09-e025-44b6-aeb9-073564529153","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cd5af6e7-8bea-482f-956c-75c747b1dda3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e9ab3ad8-5504-4396-b48c-4a3ead691c80","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0b80bcdd-dc49-4875-acae-687bee12c3a0","title":"前置：主人自己和成员 M（使用共享的云端 Agent）各有一个任务在运行；角色：账号所有者、成员 M；入口：「…」→「删除」"},{"parent":"e9ab3ad8-5504-4396-b48c-4a3ead691c80","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"91f4db0e-df52-4b6b-9f91-ccbcb15f804e","title":"操作：确认删除 → 分别查看两个会话"},{"parent":"e9ab3ad8-5504-4396-b48c-4a3ead691c80","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7d90f9db-79a3-48cf-8490-8f490f07ad8d","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 两个任务都停止，状态收敛为已中断，不停留在运行中\n2) 副作用 ｜ 已写入的文件与已输出的消息保留\n3) 会话状态 ｜ 两个会话之后都不能继续"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e9ab3ad8-5504-4396-b48c-4a3ead691c80","title":"🟠【P1】删除时停止运行中的任务"},{"parent":"cd5af6e7-8bea-482f-956c-75c747b1dda3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fd741ce0-7a6a-4020-bea6-a651c3911d7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"903c1aad-74bc-4092-bf42-965489fb3f15","title":"前置：模拟删除过程中云端环境清理失败；角色：账号所有者；入口：「…」→「删除」"},{"parent":"fd741ce0-7a6a-4020-bea6-a651c3911d7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3642ef97-1065-4c5c-8704-dd2bfcc29521","title":"操作：确认删除 → 观察删除状态直到完成 → 重新创建"},{"parent":"fd741ce0-7a6a-4020-bea6-a651c3911d7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1318b1f3-2d1e-4232-aa55-f0a84bc0d395","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 删除中显示「正在删除云端 Computer…」及「正在自动重试清理。」\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ 删除完成前不显示「创建云端电脑」入口\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 自动重试完成后回到可创建状态，重新创建得到全新的云端电脑"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fd741ce0-7a6a-4020-bea6-a651c3911d7e","title":"🟡【P2】删除时清理失败自动重试"},{"parent":"cd5af6e7-8bea-482f-956c-75c747b1dda3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ae8c03be-f0b4-49f4-b712-ecd94c7e4d12","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd94a59e-de5b-4591-9110-1130b40fe579","title":"前置：模拟删除接口失败；角色：账号所有者；入口：「…」→「删除」"},{"parent":"ae8c03be-f0b4-49f4-b712-ecd94c7e4d12","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4c0a8ec-5e8d-4ba3-b971-37b2e542bc0a","title":"操作：确认删除 → 失败后再次删除"},{"parent":"ae8c03be-f0b4-49f4-b712-ecd94c7e4d12","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bf1ea8df-6c83-4b5d-9567-612499bbdf03","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示「无法删除云端 Computer。」\n2) 设备状态 ｜ 云端电脑保持原状态，登录与共享不受影响\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 再次删除可成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ae8c03be-f0b4-49f4-b712-ecd94c7e4d12","title":"🟡【P2】删除请求失败"}],"id":"cd5af6e7-8bea-482f-956c-75c747b1dda3","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"d5ba1b09-e025-44b6-aeb9-073564529153","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d08a5f47-97f7-41b5-82e3-fea4db2a75b0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b6b4fdd1-5698-48e2-ba8a-2dabaf168b8d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1130aace-6e19-4dbf-88ca-c00dbffd5e65","title":"前置：云端电脑正在删除；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」"},{"parent":"b6b4fdd1-5698-48e2-ba8a-2dabaf168b8d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9c30bae0-cbd1-4034-87ff-784eff753bf8","title":"操作：刷新页面"},{"parent":"b6b4fdd1-5698-48e2-ba8a-2dabaf168b8d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"156fcd2c-caff-4d37-b9e7-379f0531dd1f","title":"预期：\n1) 设备状态 ｜ 仍显示「正在删除云端 Computer…」直到完成，不出现可创建入口或旧的在线状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b6b4fdd1-5698-48e2-ba8a-2dabaf168b8d","title":"🟡【P2】删除中刷新页面"},{"parent":"d08a5f47-97f7-41b5-82e3-fea4db2a75b0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c6c58ee2-1883-4095-8f90-cddc3ab51539","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9eb247ea-7580-44d6-9577-2084b248b3e7","title":"前置：云端电脑在线；角色：账号所有者；入口：删除确认弹窗"},{"parent":"c6c58ee2-1883-4095-8f90-cddc3ab51539","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e181084-6ced-497a-8170-970d96e8471c","title":"操作：在确认按钮上快速连续点击"},{"parent":"c6c58ee2-1883-4095-8f90-cddc3ab51539","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9f6e1c5e-5742-4533-90f5-a224353b962d","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 只提交一次删除，确认按钮进入处理中状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c6c58ee2-1883-4095-8f90-cddc3ab51539","title":"🟡【P2】确认删除时连续点击"}],"id":"d08a5f47-97f7-41b5-82e3-fea4db2a75b0","title":"边界场景"}],"id":"d5ba1b09-e025-44b6-aeb9-073564529153","title":"删除"},{"parent":"df0be4cf-9b29-4f4f-8e65-41d9d5f74939","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ed85f4f3-5255-4f45-af3f-e35d52ee6f4f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"240d7d01-112d-45d9-9a37-97ea7f404c46","title":"说明：云端电脑卡片下列出 Claude Code 与 Codex。每行显示 Agent 名称、「N 个模型来源」与状态（● 可用）；未安装的 Agent 行只显示名称与「安装」按钮。已定口径：设置完成后两个 Agent 默认以内置的 Tutti 积分可用，显示「1 个模型来源」；即使本地电脑上的同名 Agent 已登录，云端仍需单独登录；配置了几种模型来源就显示「N 个模型来源」。来源：tutti-lab/tutti main@fddc82e640 的 apps/web modules/cloud-agent、room、computer 与中文文案，cmd/cloud-agent-worker、cmd/computer-daemon 的 cloud 实现；tutti-lab/tutti-server internal/biz/cloud_agent_*；相关 PR：tutti#3392 #3432 #3445 #3458 #3479"},{"parent":"ed85f4f3-5255-4f45-af3f-e35d52ee6f4f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4b3bb1b4-4c7b-4f41-93ec-693eaa5ed877","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b523abb5-4013-4da6-accc-d51220e73402","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd760288-b304-4ed3-8819-64ea1246c3bd","title":"前置：新创建的云端电脑，未配置任何来源；本地电脑上的 Claude Code 已用官方订阅登录；账号有 Tutti 积分；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」"},{"parent":"b523abb5-4013-4da6-accc-d51220e73402","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"50404f1e-fbc2-4e38-8e5b-7574911ab286","title":"操作：查看两个 Agent 行 → 打开 Claude Code 详情弹窗 → 关闭后到云端房间选「我的云端 Claude Code」发起任务"},{"parent":"b523abb5-4013-4da6-accc-d51220e73402","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a9d839dc-a8da-4797-b10d-ef367ad5ab69","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ Claude Code 与 Codex 都显示「● 可用」「1 个模型来源」\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 弹窗中 Tutti 积分显示「✓ 内置」与余额，官方订阅显示「登录」，API Key 显示「新建」\n3) 环境隔离 ｜ 虽然本地 Claude Code 已登录官方订阅，云端官方订阅仍为未登录\n4) 结果回传 ｜ 默认来源为 Tutti API，任务正常完成\n5) 用量 ｜ 积分按本次用量从当前 Tutti 账号扣除，弹窗与模型下拉中的余额同步更新"},{"parent":"b523abb5-4013-4da6-accc-d51220e73402","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1b9bbb64-ba6e-45ae-af99-7fd985b981fe","title":"备注：已定口径：本地已登录、云端仍需登录，不是缺陷"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b523abb5-4013-4da6-accc-d51220e73402","title":"🔴【P0】设置完成后默认用 Tutti 积分即可使用"},{"parent":"4b3bb1b4-4c7b-4f41-93ec-693eaa5ed877","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"66f7f827-1fd0-4ef2-83b8-d0be06935c68","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"36e61983-2adc-49db-bbd1-bcdcdc609953","title":"前置：云端 Claude Code 只有内置 Tutti 积分；有可用的官方账号与服务密钥；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」 卡片 → 点「Claude Code」行打开详情弹窗"},{"parent":"66f7f827-1fd0-4ef2-83b8-d0be06935c68","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c019052c-b4cf-447e-bb13-47c3414a3419","title":"操作：完成官方订阅登录 → 关闭弹窗查看行 → 再新建一个 API Key → 关闭弹窗查看行 → 移除该 API Key → 查看行"},{"parent":"66f7f827-1fd0-4ef2-83b8-d0be06935c68","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"97a70fdc-df11-4b45-aa5a-dd72f4ad7de0","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 登录官方订阅后显示「2 个模型来源」\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 新建 API Key 后显示「3 个模型来源」\n3) 列表展示 ｜ 移除 API Key 后回到「2 个模型来源」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"66f7f827-1fd0-4ef2-83b8-d0be06935c68","title":"🟠【P1】配置多种来源后模型来源数增加"},{"parent":"4b3bb1b4-4c7b-4f41-93ec-693eaa5ed877","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"501a9cae-3f21-4687-af79-060bc5806295","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7780233d-6591-4256-9243-fc736ff73547","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，Codex 行显示「安装」；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」 → Codex 行"},{"parent":"501a9cae-3f21-4687-af79-060bc5806295","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0b56bd1d-20dc-41e7-835d-17703c8ea057","title":"操作：点「安装」→ 等待完成 → 到云端房间选「我的云端 Codex」发起任务"},{"parent":"501a9cae-3f21-4687-af79-060bc5806295","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"43d9e74d-3372-4f51-bb82-eef0c009c284","title":"预期：\n1) 安装状态 ｜ 安装过程中有进度反馈，不会提前显示完成\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 完成后 Codex 行显示「● 可用」「1 个模型来源」\n3) 结果回传 ｜ 用默认的 Tutti API 发起任务正常完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"501a9cae-3f21-4687-af79-060bc5806295","title":"🟠【P1】安装云端 Agent"}],"id":"4b3bb1b4-4c7b-4f41-93ec-693eaa5ed877","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"ed85f4f3-5255-4f45-af3f-e35d52ee6f4f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"166514ff-a0a4-4a56-a7e1-aab1296e176f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b48d86a5-7b97-400b-9cf0-48ffc6e49dd1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"633e0f46-21aa-4cf1-aba4-537166acb9c0","title":"前置：模拟 Codex 安装失败；角色：账号所有者；入口：Codex 行「安装」"},{"parent":"b48d86a5-7b97-400b-9cf0-48ffc6e49dd1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"efdd36c6-6243-4c0c-b414-53a8223d6fda","title":"操作：点「安装」→ 失败 → 再次安装"},{"parent":"b48d86a5-7b97-400b-9cf0-48ffc6e49dd1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4d1d8351-1c5c-44f7-8733-4e1c05fbdda2","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 给出安装失败的提示，行仍显示「安装」，不显示为可用\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 再次安装成功后显示「● 可用」「1 个模型来源」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b48d86a5-7b97-400b-9cf0-48ffc6e49dd1","title":"🟡【P2】安装失败后重试"},{"parent":"166514ff-a0a4-4a56-a7e1-aab1296e176f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b0d792d7-6edf-4afd-b7ef-0832f22940e0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"af43e182-9f88-48d2-a8fa-971c8be96ce8","title":"前置：模拟管理状态接口失败；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」"},{"parent":"b0d792d7-6edf-4afd-b7ef-0832f22940e0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4be373cc-9176-4db6-992c-7ea10c16076d","title":"操作：查看 Agent 列表 → 恢复后刷新"},{"parent":"b0d792d7-6edf-4afd-b7ef-0832f22940e0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a35847de-f050-4894-b8d0-9634408fe14f","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示「无法读取 Provider 管理状态。」\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 恢复后刷新可正确显示各 Agent 状态，不误显示为未安装"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b0d792d7-6edf-4afd-b7ef-0832f22940e0","title":"🟡【P2】读取 Agent 状态失败"}],"id":"166514ff-a0a4-4a56-a7e1-aab1296e176f","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"ed85f4f3-5255-4f45-af3f-e35d52ee6f4f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"eec2f4d8-7baa-4098-a8c6-fd2181bf585d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"52a2a72c-680a-4eef-9ac6-8218a33c17cb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b1aa25bc-2b80-4228-aa8e-25cabfde586c","title":"前置：云端电脑在线；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」"},{"parent":"52a2a72c-680a-4eef-9ac6-8218a33c17cb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f54264a6-0487-4f0c-a0d2-13a553f49394","title":"操作：查看卡片下的 Agent"},{"parent":"52a2a72c-680a-4eef-9ac6-8218a33c17cb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"424358ff-256d-4af8-bb20-1e951db4e828","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 只列出 Claude Code 与 Codex，不出现本地电脑才有的 grok、Hermes 等 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"52a2a72c-680a-4eef-9ac6-8218a33c17cb","title":"🟡【P2】云端电脑只提供 Claude Code 与 Codex"}],"id":"eec2f4d8-7baa-4098-a8c6-fd2181bf585d","title":"边界场景"}],"id":"ed85f4f3-5255-4f45-af3f-e35d52ee6f4f","title":"Agent 列表"},{"parent":"df0be4cf-9b29-4f4f-8e65-41d9d5f74939","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e00eca5e-66f0-4407-acbf-db1d0a2247b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1aa65b87-b662-4829-a85a-5a470bbb8c92","title":"说明：详情弹窗「模型来源」第一块。未登录时显示「登录」；点后显示「○ 在浏览器中完成登录」、用户协议提示与登录步骤，可点「取消」中止。Claude Code：「1 打开授权页并登录 [打开]」「2 [粘贴授权码] [提交]」，在官方页面复制「身份验证码」粘贴提交。Codex：显示一次性设备码，「在授权页输入此代码」「复制」「打开」，在 OpenAI 页面「输入终端上显示的 9 位代码」后自动完成。登录后显示「<账号邮箱> · <套餐>」与「每周」用量进度；用量获取不到时不显示用量这一行。官方订阅也可以以 API Key 方式配置，此时卡片显示 API Key 配置、不显示「登录」，同样计为一种模型来源。本组以 Claude Code 为主干，Codex 为差异支，末尾一条两者逐项对照。来源：tutti-lab/tutti main@fddc82e640 的 apps/web modules/cloud-agent、room、computer 与中文文案，cmd/cloud-agent-worker、cmd/computer-daemon 的 cloud 实现；tutti-lab/tutti-server internal/biz/cloud_agent_*；相关 PR：tutti#3392 #3432 #3445 #3458 #3479"},{"parent":"e00eca5e-66f0-4407-acbf-db1d0a2247b1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0f8d0ecb-15a1-4067-8318-43446202d49e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"097d03c1-ceb2-4c1d-99b4-f1fa26eab296","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"331cb0a0-5ea3-4cea-9f81-50ffb65bd4ba","title":"前置：云端 Claude Code 官方订阅未登录，有可用的 Claude 官方账号；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」 卡片 → 点「Claude Code」行打开详情弹窗"},{"parent":"097d03c1-ceb2-4c1d-99b4-f1fa26eab296","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"49193945-b60d-4190-9fcd-68fcffad0a8e","title":"操作：点官方订阅「登录」→ 查看登录面板 → 点「打开」完成官方登录 → 在「身份验证码」页复制代码 → 回到弹窗粘贴并提交 → 等待完成 → 查看官方订阅卡片 → 到云端房间发起任务 → 刷新与重启后复查"},{"parent":"097d03c1-ceb2-4c1d-99b4-f1fa26eab296","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1b21bcf8-5fc6-4c06-a0d0-e11b8c707088","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 点击后显示「○ 在浏览器中完成登录」\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 显示「云端 Agent 运行在远端沙盒环境，使用时请遵循 Claude Code 的用户协议。」，「用户协议」链接到 Anthropic 消费者条款\n3) 视觉展示 ｜ 显示步骤「1 打开授权页并登录」「打开」与「2」授权码输入框（占位「粘贴授权码」）「提交」，以及「取消」\n4) 跳转定位 ｜ 「打开」在新标签页打开 Claude 官方登录页，登录后显示「身份验证码 · 将此粘贴到 Claude Code 中」与「复制代码」\n5) 按钮状态 ｜ 未粘贴时「提交」不可点\n6) 登录状态 ｜ 提交正确代码后登录成功，卡片显示「<账号邮箱> · <套餐>」与「每周」用量进度\n7) 列表展示 ｜ 关闭弹窗后「Claude Code」行的模型来源数随之更新\n8) 环境隔离 ｜ 本地电脑上 Claude Code 的模型来源与登录状态不受影响\n9) 结果回传 ｜ 在云端房间选「我的云端 Claude Code」，模型下拉选「厂商提供」下的模型发起任务，正常收到回复\n10) 用量 ｜ 用量计入该官方账号的订阅额度，弹窗「每周」用量随之变化，不扣 Tutti 积分\n11) 持久化 ｜ 刷新页面、换浏览器后弹窗中的状态不变\n12) 登录状态 ｜ 云端电脑重启后仍保持，无需重新配置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"097d03c1-ceb2-4c1d-99b4-f1fa26eab296","title":"🔴【P0】Claude Code 官方订阅登录 · 全链路"},{"parent":"0f8d0ecb-15a1-4067-8318-43446202d49e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0ae52294-0477-43e7-ad42-96e72af3d9af","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0c4b2004-d700-4689-898a-e5ba0911e3fa","title":"前置：云端 Codex 官方订阅未登录，有可用的 OpenAI 官方账号；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」 卡片 → 点「Codex」行打开详情弹窗"},{"parent":"0ae52294-0477-43e7-ad42-96e72af3d9af","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bbf085ea-66b9-4429-88a7-e6a0e89b44ce","title":"操作：点官方订阅「登录」→ 复制设备码 → 点「打开」在 OpenAI 页面输入 9 位代码并继续 → 回到弹窗等待 → 到云端房间发起任务 → 刷新与重启后复查"},{"parent":"0ae52294-0477-43e7-ad42-96e72af3d9af","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2222bb13-8840-4151-ba1d-46d768fadc9c","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 除下列差异外，逐项与「Claude Code 官方订阅登录 · 全链路」一致\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 用户协议提示中的名称为 Codex，链接到 OpenAI 使用条款\n3) 视觉展示 ｜ 显示形如「XXXX-XXXXX」的设备码与「在授权页输入此代码」「复制」「打开」，没有授权码输入框\n4) 结果校验 ｜ 复制得到的内容与页面上的设备码一致\n5) 跳转定位 ｜ 「打开」进入「使用你的设备代码以授予对 Codex CLI 的访问权限」页面，提示输入 9 位代码\n6) 登录状态 ｜ 在 OpenAI 页面完成后无需回 Tutti 提交，弹窗自动更新为「<账号邮箱> · <套餐>」与「每周」用量\n7) 列表展示 ｜ 关闭弹窗后「Codex」行的模型来源数随之更新\n8) 环境隔离 ｜ 本地电脑上 Codex 的模型来源与登录状态不受影响\n9) 结果回传 ｜ 在云端房间选「我的云端 Codex」，模型下拉选「厂商提供」下的模型发起任务，正常收到回复\n10) 用量 ｜ 用量计入该官方账号的订阅额度，弹窗「每周」用量随之变化，不扣 Tutti 积分\n11) 持久化 ｜ 刷新页面、换浏览器后弹窗中的状态不变\n12) 登录状态 ｜ 云端电脑重启后仍保持，无需重新配置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0ae52294-0477-43e7-ad42-96e72af3d9af","title":"🔴【P0】Codex 官方订阅设备码登录（差异）"},{"parent":"0f8d0ecb-15a1-4067-8318-43446202d49e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4408bc74-878a-493d-8b41-eeaff20d8183","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5f2db8ff-4a08-49be-b87e-9156631d9eac","title":"前置：云端 Claude Code 的官方订阅来源以 API Key 方式配置（未走官方账号登录）；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」 卡片 → 点「Claude Code」行打开详情弹窗"},{"parent":"4408bc74-878a-493d-8b41-eeaff20d8183","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b290d02b-2ccc-46e0-8df4-c3fd31291a02","title":"操作：打开详情弹窗查看官方订阅卡片 → 关闭后查看 Claude Code 行 → 到云端房间打开模型下拉 → 选该来源的模型发起任务 → 刷新与重启后复查 → 对云端 Codex 同样执行一遍"},{"parent":"4408bc74-878a-493d-8b41-eeaff20d8183","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"90f885a5-4d0e-4a2a-95cd-417b43517389","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 官方订阅卡片显示 API Key 配置信息，不显示「登录」按钮，也不出现登录面板\n2) 可用状态 ｜ 该方式作为一种可用的模型来源，计入「N 个模型来源」\n3) 列表展示 ｜ 关闭弹窗后「Claude Code」行的模型来源数随之更新\n4) 环境隔离 ｜ 本地电脑上 Claude Code 的模型来源与登录状态不受影响\n5) 结果回传 ｜ 在云端房间选「我的云端 Claude Code」，模型下拉选「厂商提供」下的模型发起任务，正常收到回复\n6) 用量 ｜ 用量计入该服务密钥，不扣 Tutti 积分\n7) 持久化 ｜ 刷新页面、换浏览器后弹窗中的状态不变\n8) 登录状态 ｜ 云端电脑重启后仍保持，无需重新配置\n9) 等价性 ｜ 云端 Codex 以 API Key 方式配置官方订阅时，表现与 Claude Code 一致"},{"parent":"4408bc74-878a-493d-8b41-eeaff20d8183","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"adcd58fb-c215-42a9-8967-dc48ff6cf070","title":"备注：已定口径：官方订阅以 API Key 方式配置是其中一种模型来源，卡片显示 API Key 配置、不显示「登录」（需求文档）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4408bc74-878a-493d-8b41-eeaff20d8183","title":"🔴【P0】官方订阅以 API Key 方式配置 · 全链路"},{"parent":"0f8d0ecb-15a1-4067-8318-43446202d49e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1d672997-ef84-4bb8-a71c-5cb4331e12be","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"63d29f3b-baff-41a5-916c-b0c54ed77a96","title":"前置：云端 Claude Code 与 Codex 官方订阅都未登录；角色：账号所有者；入口：两个 Agent 的详情弹窗"},{"parent":"1d672997-ef84-4bb8-a71c-5cb4331e12be","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8a7025f4-76bc-44ee-ba7f-8a89376a254c","title":"操作：分别点「登录」进入登录面板后点「取消」→ 再次点「登录」完成登录"},{"parent":"1d672997-ef84-4bb8-a71c-5cb4331e12be","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b6563fbf-c2dc-4b4e-9810-089fafa8b903","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 取消后登录面板收起，回到「登录」按钮，登录流程中止\n2) 副作用 ｜ 取消后不残留进行中的登录，已获取的设备码或授权码作废\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 再次点「登录」开始新的登录流程，并能正常完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1d672997-ef84-4bb8-a71c-5cb4331e12be","title":"🟠【P1】登录过程中取消"},{"parent":"0f8d0ecb-15a1-4067-8318-43446202d49e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2f157ac6-bc1c-44eb-a0a6-d2d91fe3c92b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bb423ff1-756c-4a2c-911a-f34173544261","title":"前置：云端 Codex 已登录官方订阅，模拟用量接口获取不到数据；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」 卡片 → 点「Codex」行打开详情弹窗"},{"parent":"2f157ac6-bc1c-44eb-a0a6-d2d91fe3c92b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bf7aacb9-f33f-42c6-86e7-8a9514113050","title":"操作：查看官方订阅卡片 → 恢复后重新打开弹窗"},{"parent":"2f157ac6-bc1c-44eb-a0a6-d2d91fe3c92b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c9301c4-8ad0-4990-bc8e-58836e2db59b","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 只显示「<账号邮箱> · <套餐>」，不显示「每周」用量行，也不显示 0% 或报错\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 恢复后重新打开显示「每周」用量进度"},{"parent":"2f157ac6-bc1c-44eb-a0a6-d2d91fe3c92b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6f9958fc-57fd-4395-b13f-440f8549953a","title":"备注：已定口径：用量获取不到不展示，不是缺陷"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2f157ac6-bc1c-44eb-a0a6-d2d91fe3c92b","title":"🟠【P1】官方订阅用量获取不到时不展示"}],"id":"0f8d0ecb-15a1-4067-8318-43446202d49e","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"e00eca5e-66f0-4407-acbf-db1d0a2247b1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e69b94fb-5164-4bb4-be71-67d2ebbd6350","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0506a14b-2427-435b-97bc-a4e01dbc1689","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3fa27b60-ad92-4e8b-87b7-f91d64399f9a","title":"前置：云端 Claude Code 处于等待授权码状态；角色：账号所有者；入口：授权码输入框"},{"parent":"0506a14b-2427-435b-97bc-a4e01dbc1689","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ee891cd4-9d62-4349-85ae-6f98893d90f3","title":"操作：粘贴错误的代码提交 → 重新登录并提交正确代码"},{"parent":"0506a14b-2427-435b-97bc-a4e01dbc1689","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c3ccaa68-2575-4117-9d05-a76d8b46c339","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示「Provider 登录失败：<错误码>」\n2) 登录状态 ｜ 失败后仍为未登录，不显示账号信息\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 重新登录后提交正确代码可成功，并能在云端房间完成任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0506a14b-2427-435b-97bc-a4e01dbc1689","title":"🟡【P2】Claude Code 提交错误代码后重新登录"},{"parent":"e69b94fb-5164-4bb4-be71-67d2ebbd6350","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b529ffe3-1426-40dc-a1b0-6aec246dc8f2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e873aecb-e1bc-47af-af8c-021a4a15d8e6","title":"前置：云端 Codex 已显示设备码；角色：账号所有者；入口：OpenAI 设备码页面"},{"parent":"b529ffe3-1426-40dc-a1b0-6aec246dc8f2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"be53da67-81ce-4578-94b4-b101e69f6402","title":"操作：在 OpenAI 页面输入错误的代码 → 回到弹窗取消并重新登录 → 输入正确代码"},{"parent":"b529ffe3-1426-40dc-a1b0-6aec246dc8f2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7a7105dd-2d6c-4988-a32e-018c4750a22a","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ OpenAI 页面提示无法授权成功\n2) 登录状态 ｜ 弹窗不显示为已登录\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 取消后重新登录，用新设备码可成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b529ffe3-1426-40dc-a1b0-6aec246dc8f2","title":"🟡【P2】Codex 输入错误设备码"},{"parent":"e69b94fb-5164-4bb4-be71-67d2ebbd6350","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2330cec5-f54f-419c-89df-8199d3bf8bdd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9b3a801b-98e5-4585-a650-3479b8503175","title":"前置：云端 Codex 已显示设备码，在有效期内未完成授权；角色：账号所有者；入口：Codex 详情弹窗"},{"parent":"2330cec5-f54f-419c-89df-8199d3bf8bdd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0ddb5ea4-0b1c-4ec2-99eb-69918e50bfd6","title":"操作：等待超过有效期 → 再输入设备码 → 重新登录并按时完成"},{"parent":"2330cec5-f54f-419c-89df-8199d3bf8bdd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"15153bea-03f4-4a65-99e5-8b86c2480b93","title":"预期：\n1) 登录状态 ｜ 超时后本次登录失败，不长期停留在「在浏览器中完成登录」\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 重新登录得到新的设备码，按时完成后登录成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2330cec5-f54f-419c-89df-8199d3bf8bdd","title":"🟡【P2】授权超时后重新登录"},{"parent":"e69b94fb-5164-4bb4-be71-67d2ebbd6350","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ad815b8f-9e19-43d2-9a49-e98b25897d4e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb369b5c-150a-460a-b870-47ee186ec804","title":"前置：模拟发起登录的接口失败；角色：账号所有者；入口：Claude Code 官方订阅「登录」"},{"parent":"ad815b8f-9e19-43d2-9a49-e98b25897d4e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"679a25c2-d670-4ce0-8fcb-46ee0ff752b6","title":"操作：点「登录」→ 恢复后再点"},{"parent":"ad815b8f-9e19-43d2-9a49-e98b25897d4e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ba1c0022-8ff5-4f46-a8b7-3b7ddff77a79","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示「Provider 登录请求失败。」\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 再次点击可正常进入登录面板并完成登录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ad815b8f-9e19-43d2-9a49-e98b25897d4e","title":"🟡【P2】登录请求失败"},{"parent":"e69b94fb-5164-4bb4-be71-67d2ebbd6350","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1d035f85-1812-4af6-b86d-e92b8d085a0d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"650c03f0-72e3-464f-91c9-52fc30332e27","title":"前置：云端 Codex 已显示设备码，尚未完成授权；角色：账号所有者；入口：当前页面"},{"parent":"1d035f85-1812-4af6-b86d-e92b8d085a0d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ab4c6fea-dda9-4959-8012-a3f80aef14fc","title":"操作：刷新页面 → 重新打开 Codex 详情弹窗 → 完成授权"},{"parent":"1d035f85-1812-4af6-b86d-e92b8d085a0d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"274a7fa5-e2c4-46da-a433-a093bc9f0c48","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 刷新后仍显示同一次登录的设备码，可继续完成，不需要重新发起\n2) 登录状态 ｜ 完成授权后显示账号信息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1d035f85-1812-4af6-b86d-e92b8d085a0d","title":"🟡【P2】等待授权时刷新页面可继续"},{"parent":"e69b94fb-5164-4bb4-be71-67d2ebbd6350","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"064c6596-a6b1-4ed6-94ef-a0f9622ea4ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2ef2dd7e-92d5-4aca-92f2-d22936459a4f","title":"前置：浏览器剪贴板写入被拒绝；角色：账号所有者；入口：Codex 设备码旁的「复制」"},{"parent":"064c6596-a6b1-4ed6-94ef-a0f9622ea4ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2c1bf009-0194-4752-8bf4-d3469231f308","title":"操作：点「复制」→ 手动选择设备码复制并完成授权"},{"parent":"064c6596-a6b1-4ed6-94ef-a0f9622ea4ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d774e861-1b70-43f4-9d99-d88ef2ec7263","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示「复制失败，请手动选择代码复制」，不提示复制成功\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 手动复制设备码同样能完成登录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"064c6596-a6b1-4ed6-94ef-a0f9622ea4ce","title":"🟡【P2】复制设备码失败"}],"id":"e69b94fb-5164-4bb4-be71-67d2ebbd6350","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"e00eca5e-66f0-4407-acbf-db1d0a2247b1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"051d10e2-f38c-447f-bb93-8bfc14dfc3ba","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"61042686-4039-442b-96b9-3d566f9ed315","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"83826f71-122d-41fa-9378-7d7c5781ea8e","title":"前置：云端两个 Agent 都已安装；角色：账号所有者；入口：两个 Agent 的详情弹窗"},{"parent":"61042686-4039-442b-96b9-3d566f9ed315","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e98f150-5067-4918-9fbb-063feee4aaf3","title":"操作：逐项对照：登录入口 / 登录面板 / 用户协议提示 / 取消 / 登录后展示 / 用量行 / API Key 方式配置时的展示 / 用量归属 / 重启后保持 / 与本地隔离"},{"parent":"61042686-4039-442b-96b9-3d566f9ed315","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"67f20bdd-de71-4dfa-86bc-9518b338ce2d","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 除登录交互（授权码与设备码）外，其余各项两者一致\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 任何一项只在其中一个 Agent 缺失，即视为缺陷"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"61042686-4039-442b-96b9-3d566f9ed315","title":"🟡【P2】Claude Code 与 Codex 官方订阅逐项对照"}],"id":"051d10e2-f38c-447f-bb93-8bfc14dfc3ba","title":"边界场景"}],"id":"e00eca5e-66f0-4407-acbf-db1d0a2247b1","title":"Agent 详情 · 官方订阅"},{"parent":"df0be4cf-9b29-4f4f-8e65-41d9d5f74939","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ff6b961a-a0fd-4be3-ba0d-a449e4355b6a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b9637339-71e0-48b5-ac69-13cb0947c272","title":"说明：详情弹窗「模型来源」第二块，标注「✓ 内置」，显示「余额 <积分>」与「升级会员」。模型下拉右侧同样显示 Tutti API 余额与「>」。已定口径：「升级会员」跳转 https://tutti.sh/profile/plan，可选择套餐升级；模型下拉中余额旁的「>」跳转 https://tutti.sh/profile/usage。计费规则见「Tutti API 与自定义模型」。来源：tutti-lab/tutti main@fddc82e640 的 apps/web modules/cloud-agent、room、computer 与中文文案，cmd/cloud-agent-worker、cmd/computer-daemon 的 cloud 实现；tutti-lab/tutti-server internal/biz/cloud_agent_*；相关 PR：tutti#3392 #3432 #3445 #3458 #3479"},{"parent":"ff6b961a-a0fd-4be3-ba0d-a449e4355b6a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0d348691-fe2d-404a-8341-176370d3fc74","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"46c9a182-443c-4668-b309-58378868ae6d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9127ac3a-0266-4cf2-a952-1e52d7066820","title":"前置：云端 Codex 只用内置 Tutti 积分，账号有积分；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」 卡片 → 点「Codex」行打开详情弹窗"},{"parent":"46c9a182-443c-4668-b309-58378868ae6d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ad07ad20-8d89-483d-8303-29274fb13a91","title":"操作：查看 Tutti 积分卡片余额 → 到云端房间打开模型下拉查看余额 → 选 Tutti API 下的模型发起任务 → 回到弹窗与模型下拉再看余额"},{"parent":"46c9a182-443c-4668-b309-58378868ae6d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5d00d4d8-a189-4f56-a3c9-8e73b2dfc6e3","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 卡片显示「Tutti 积分 ✓ 内置」「余额 <积分>」与「升级会员」\n2) 等价性 ｜ 弹窗余额与模型下拉中 Tutti API 的余额一致\n3) 列表展示 ｜ 关闭弹窗后「Codex」行的模型来源数随之更新\n4) 环境隔离 ｜ 本地电脑上 Codex 的模型来源与登录状态不受影响\n5) 结果回传 ｜ 在云端房间选「我的云端 Codex」，模型下拉选「Tutti API」下的模型发起任务，正常收到回复\n6) 用量 ｜ 积分按本次用量从当前 Tutti 账号扣除，弹窗与模型下拉中的余额同步更新\n7) 持久化 ｜ 刷新页面、换浏览器后弹窗中的状态不变\n8) 登录状态 ｜ 云端电脑重启后仍保持，无需重新配置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"46c9a182-443c-4668-b309-58378868ae6d","title":"🔴【P0】用 Tutti 积分在云端执行并核对余额"},{"parent":"0d348691-fe2d-404a-8341-176370d3fc74","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"34b777f3-3eeb-4c7e-8ad1-ef67fec05de9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6d5bd948-8514-4493-841a-3c35249b5650","title":"前置：角色：账号所有者；入口：Tutti 积分卡片「升级会员」、模型下拉余额旁的「>」"},{"parent":"34b777f3-3eeb-4c7e-8ad1-ef67fec05de9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a1cd6539-e201-47fa-83b3-75ac650ed5f4","title":"操作：点「升级会员」→ 回来点模型下拉余额旁的「>」"},{"parent":"34b777f3-3eeb-4c7e-8ad1-ef67fec05de9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2b1cd7fb-c914-428d-bc76-092386590c1e","title":"预期：\n1) 跳转定位 ｜ 「升级会员」打开 https://tutti.sh/profile/plan，可选择套餐升级\n2) 跳转定位 ｜ 「>」打开 https://tutti.sh/profile/usage"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"34b777f3-3eeb-4c7e-8ad1-ef67fec05de9","title":"🟠【P1】升级会员与用量跳转"}],"id":"0d348691-fe2d-404a-8341-176370d3fc74","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"ff6b961a-a0fd-4be3-ba0d-a449e4355b6a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b3b8449d-1160-4554-b70f-82bb07a5e062","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"18230a14-1a0e-40de-82cd-1c41e17b2e16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d027cc2e-213e-4cfc-b602-d02ab022bf22","title":"前置：云端 Claude Code 使用 Tutti 积分，账号余额不足；角色：账号所有者；入口：Claude Code 详情弹窗与云端房间"},{"parent":"18230a14-1a0e-40de-82cd-1c41e17b2e16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"27c71460-ad39-4ba5-8f13-e71c91e3574a","title":"操作：查看余额 → 发起任务 → 充值后再发起"},{"parent":"18230a14-1a0e-40de-82cd-1c41e17b2e16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"95e5ce66-b136-4f37-afac-319504048977","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 显示「余额 <积分> · 不足」\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 余额不足时任务不执行并给出余额不足的提示，不产生扣费记录\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 充值后任务正常完成并按用量扣积分"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"18230a14-1a0e-40de-82cd-1c41e17b2e16","title":"🟡【P2】Tutti 积分不足"},{"parent":"b3b8449d-1160-4554-b70f-82bb07a5e062","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"69d72223-af8e-4264-bcc6-f27647020948","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6514ebac-43e2-408a-95c9-88ebf15fed45","title":"前置：云端 Agent 的 Tutti 积分来源尚在准备中；角色：账号所有者；入口：该 Agent 的详情弹窗"},{"parent":"69d72223-af8e-4264-bcc6-f27647020948","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eeb1470f-1ab7-45b3-bede-98d8334b29fa","title":"操作：查看 Tutti 积分卡片 → 等待就绪后重新打开"},{"parent":"69d72223-af8e-4264-bcc6-f27647020948","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d41b3157-f4ff-4653-b710-06b27ab094d5","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 显示「模型配置尚未就绪，请查看配置详情。」，不显示「✓」\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 就绪后显示「✓ 内置」，可正常用于任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"69d72223-af8e-4264-bcc6-f27647020948","title":"🟡【P2】积分来源未就绪"}],"id":"b3b8449d-1160-4554-b70f-82bb07a5e062","title":"异常场景"}],"id":"ff6b961a-a0fd-4be3-ba0d-a449e4355b6a","title":"Agent 详情 · Tutti 积分"},{"parent":"df0be4cf-9b29-4f4f-8e65-41d9d5f74939","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e6b950bd-44d4-471e-83de-fa19fdb2fe90","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"04f97d74-5269-43f8-bf2c-37242171ecb3","title":"说明：详情弹窗「模型来源」第三块，标注「自定义」，说明「用你自己的服务密钥」，右侧「新建」。表单字段：名称（如 DeepSeek）、服务地址（https://）、API Key（sk-...）、认证方式（Bearer token / x-api-key，默认 Bearer token）；编辑时还有「模型 · 获取模型 / 刷新」与「测试连接」「取消」「保存」，API Key 显示「已保存，不修改请留空」。已保存的配置按「名称 · 域名」列出，悬停显示「编辑」「移除」；不可用的 Key 显示黄色感叹号。已定口径：逻辑同「Tutti API 与自定义模型」——同协议的 Agent 之间同步：本地电脑添加的 Key 会出现在云端电脑同协议 Agent 下，云端添加的也会出现在本地电脑同协议 Agent 下，同步过去的默认不开启；Claude Code 为 Anthropic Messages，Codex 为 OpenAI Responses，协议不同不同步。来源：tutti-lab/tutti main@fddc82e640 的 apps/web modules/cloud-agent、room、computer 与中文文案，cmd/cloud-agent-worker、cmd/computer-daemon 的 cloud 实现；tutti-lab/tutti-server internal/biz/cloud_agent_*；相关 PR：tutti#3392 #3432 #3445 #3458 #3479"},{"parent":"e6b950bd-44d4-471e-83de-fa19fdb2fe90","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ade992d2-5743-45a4-94d4-7d40d1726a74","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c8926dfe-0596-40a9-8f8b-20ef426cad7b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5c565119-a374-4bae-ab51-d1a957164e9a","title":"前置：云端 Claude Code 未配置 API Key；本地电脑也有 Claude Code（同协议）与 Codex（不同协议）；有可用的服务地址与密钥；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」 卡片 → 点「Claude Code」行打开详情弹窗 → API Key「新建」"},{"parent":"c8926dfe-0596-40a9-8f8b-20ef426cad7b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"21fd726b-2185-4ee1-ba1e-09959c5c3b05","title":"操作：点「新建」→ 填写名称、服务地址、API Key，保持 Bearer token → 获取模型 → 测试连接 → 保存 → 查看列表 → 到云端房间用该配置发任务 → 查看本地电脑 Claude Code 与 Codex 的 API Key 列表"},{"parent":"c8926dfe-0596-40a9-8f8b-20ef426cad7b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3b813d48-ffc7-4ffb-9d2f-8aedfa61246d","title":"预期：\n1) 输入框 ｜ 表单依次为「名称」（占位「如 DeepSeek」）「服务地址」（https://）「API Key」（sk-...）「认证方式」（默认 Bearer token，可选 x-api-key）\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ 获取成功后显示「已获取 N 个模型」与「刷新」\n3) 视觉展示 ｜ 测试连接中显示「正在发送一条小型模…」与「取消测试」，完成后给出连接结果\n4) 列表展示 ｜ 保存后 API Key 卡片下出现「<名称> · <域名>」，没有感叹号\n5) 列表展示 ｜ 关闭弹窗后「Claude Code」行的模型来源数随之更新\n6) 环境隔离 ｜ 本地电脑上 Claude Code 的模型来源与登录状态不受影响\n7) 结果回传 ｜ 在云端房间选「我的云端 Claude Code」，模型下拉选「自定义模型」下的模型发起任务，正常收到回复\n8) 用量 ｜ 用量计入该服务密钥，不扣 Tutti 积分\n9) 持久化 ｜ 刷新页面、换浏览器后弹窗中的状态不变\n10) 登录状态 ｜ 云端电脑重启后仍保持，无需重新配置\n11) 可见范围 ｜ 本地电脑的 Claude Code 下同步出现该配置，默认不开启\n12) 可见范围 ｜ 本地电脑的 Codex（协议不同）下不出现该配置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c8926dfe-0596-40a9-8f8b-20ef426cad7b","title":"🔴【P0】云端新建 API Key 并跨电脑同步 · 全链路"},{"parent":"ade992d2-5743-45a4-94d4-7d40d1726a74","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0b5f99d6-6e86-4df6-95c6-becf4b070e02","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f5c3f7f6-bf60-4fae-9586-988fdaa266f6","title":"前置：本地电脑的 Codex 已有一个可用的 API Key 配置 K；云端 Codex 未配置；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」 卡片 → 点「Codex」行打开详情弹窗"},{"parent":"0b5f99d6-6e86-4df6-95c6-becf4b070e02","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3f7d022b-1a49-4e16-9b02-2588bdceff9c","title":"操作：查看 API Key 列表 → 开启 K → 到云端房间用 K 发起任务"},{"parent":"0b5f99d6-6e86-4df6-95c6-becf4b070e02","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"07371017-6dec-4bce-8f3e-40ba59561599","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 云端 Codex 的 API Key 列表中出现 K，默认不开启，模型下拉的自定义模型中暂不出现\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 开启后模型下拉出现 K 的模型，行的模型来源数 +1\n3) 结果回传 ｜ 用 K 发起任务正常完成\n4) 用量 ｜ 用量计入该服务密钥，不扣 Tutti 积分"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0b5f99d6-6e86-4df6-95c6-becf4b070e02","title":"🟠【P1】本地电脑的 API Key 同步到云端并开启使用"},{"parent":"ade992d2-5743-45a4-94d4-7d40d1726a74","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"37b8aa4d-87ae-41d1-8954-94632b73c4ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"781a7063-e077-4964-918d-2b1eae25190f","title":"前置：云端 Claude Code 已有配置「自定义 - minimax」；角色：账号所有者；入口：该配置行的「编辑」"},{"parent":"37b8aa4d-87ae-41d1-8954-94632b73c4ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3afcc740-cff0-43ea-a357-f88c28cee036","title":"操作：点「编辑」→ 不填 API Key，只改名称和服务地址 → 刷新模型 → 保存 → 到云端房间用该配置发任务"},{"parent":"37b8aa4d-87ae-41d1-8954-94632b73c4ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0e778095-2705-4b42-8793-b93e7691ec63","title":"预期：\n1) 输入框 ｜ 字段回显当前值，API Key 显示「已保存，不修改请留空」\n2) 结果校验 ｜ API Key 留空保存后原密钥保持有效\n3) 列表展示 ｜ 列表中名称与域名更新，模型下拉中的分类与模型同步更新\n4) 结果回传 ｜ 请求发到新的服务地址并正常收到回复\n5) 可见范围 ｜ 本地电脑同协议 Agent 下的这条配置同步更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"37b8aa4d-87ae-41d1-8954-94632b73c4ce","title":"🟠【P1】编辑 API Key"},{"parent":"ade992d2-5743-45a4-94d4-7d40d1726a74","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"41c4a581-f3fb-424a-8697-b374e369030a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"79307a22-d348-4c7a-9b32-735558c55ba6","title":"前置：有一个只接受 x-api-key 头的服务；角色：账号所有者；入口：Claude Code API Key「新建」"},{"parent":"41c4a581-f3fb-424a-8697-b374e369030a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"211930d6-ea21-4d1e-894f-96d8dff58073","title":"操作：认证方式选 x-api-key → 填写并保存 → 发起任务"},{"parent":"41c4a581-f3fb-424a-8697-b374e369030a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c1dd82bb-29bc-402d-ab90-770e36a30256","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 认证方式下拉有「Bearer token」「x-api-key」两项，选中项带「✓」\n2) 结果回传 ｜ 以 x-api-key 认证的请求成功，任务正常完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"41c4a581-f3fb-424a-8697-b374e369030a","title":"🟠【P1】使用 x-api-key 认证方式"},{"parent":"ade992d2-5743-45a4-94d4-7d40d1726a74","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3db96b1a-bf6c-42d8-abbf-59c0585b5ee4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0e913db6-4051-4c71-9f5e-99f78d18cd5e","title":"前置：云端 Claude Code 有一条 API Key 配置正在使用；角色：账号所有者；入口：该配置行的「移除」"},{"parent":"3db96b1a-bf6c-42d8-abbf-59c0585b5ee4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5dfb793-e04e-4dbf-91d9-8c2fa38a7b6c","title":"操作：点「移除」→ 查看列表、行的模型来源数与模型下拉 → 在原会话继续发送"},{"parent":"3db96b1a-bf6c-42d8-abbf-59c0585b5ee4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"55b06c08-c179-47d3-8999-94b0b259eab4","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 配置从列表中消失，模型来源数 -1\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 模型下拉的自定义模型中不再出现该配置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3db96b1a-bf6c-42d8-abbf-59c0585b5ee4","title":"🟠【P1】移除 API Key"}],"id":"ade992d2-5743-45a4-94d4-7d40d1726a74","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"e6b950bd-44d4-471e-83de-fa19fdb2fe90","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"531617e6-e10a-47ed-8129-68c1342498c9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"31b9ca6a-81c4-4bfc-bc3c-c28dbe1a583f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bf9c769e-664c-4e7b-9bcc-238c465c04bd","title":"前置：角色：账号所有者；入口：API Key「新建」"},{"parent":"31b9ca6a-81c4-4bfc-bc3c-c28dbe1a583f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"285f1f9a-7fbe-4875-84d9-01e0e426ef8f","title":"操作：服务地址输入「ht」→ 改为有效地址后保存"},{"parent":"31b9ca6a-81c4-4bfc-bc3c-c28dbe1a583f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"53422f41-2122-44b3-b5c7-e3299e3ab931","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 输入框标红并提示「Base URL 格式无效。请输入包含域名、IP 或 localhost 的 HTTP(S) 地址，例如 http://localhost:12313/v1。」\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ 格式无效时不能保存\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 改为有效地址后可以保存并正常使用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"31b9ca6a-81c4-4bfc-bc3c-c28dbe1a583f","title":"🟡【P2】服务地址格式无效"},{"parent":"531617e6-e10a-47ed-8129-68c1342498c9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a6f39260-389d-4709-b706-d1f08bdf0183","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ff61b78a-7840-4c56-9f50-48f6ad67c804","title":"前置：云端 Claude Code 有一条服务地址不可达或密钥无效的配置；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」 卡片 → 点「Claude Code」行打开详情弹窗"},{"parent":"a6f39260-389d-4709-b706-d1f08bdf0183","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"80260064-7ce2-4b18-a57b-eaf3b3e023c7","title":"操作：查看列表 → 编辑改为可用的地址与密钥并保存"},{"parent":"a6f39260-389d-4709-b706-d1f08bdf0183","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c390ca8f-f246-4642-ac25-29e886a6bcf0","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 不可用的配置在「<名称> · <域名>」后显示黄色感叹号\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 无效密钥显示「密钥无效」\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 修正后感叹号消失，配置可正常用于任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a6f39260-389d-4709-b706-d1f08bdf0183","title":"🟡【P2】不可用的 Key 显示感叹号"},{"parent":"531617e6-e10a-47ed-8129-68c1342498c9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2d525bca-7e82-4cbc-b9a7-4da50b5fbd7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6522f3dc-8cf2-4cf4-93a9-1176054b994e","title":"前置：API Key 表单已填写完整；角色：账号所有者；入口：「测试连接」"},{"parent":"2d525bca-7e82-4cbc-b9a7-4da50b5fbd7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ebdff4f9-6f0c-4b75-a221-6d2880b19a2f","title":"操作：点「测试连接」→ 测试进行中点「取消测试」→ 再测试一次直到完成"},{"parent":"2d525bca-7e82-4cbc-b9a7-4da50b5fbd7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dea0d40c-1ded-4d72-b753-b58aa902630a","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 取消后测试停止，表单内容保留\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 再次测试可正常得到结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2d525bca-7e82-4cbc-b9a7-4da50b5fbd7e","title":"🟡【P2】测试连接中取消"},{"parent":"531617e6-e10a-47ed-8129-68c1342498c9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"15b71502-c8e7-4e67-904d-c377afcb3a7f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7fbc1226-70a1-4e11-bcd6-002c26424887","title":"前置：角色：账号所有者；入口：API Key「新建」"},{"parent":"15b71502-c8e7-4e67-904d-c377afcb3a7f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d95daa5a-17a0-4c3b-abc2-8ca6492ffe99","title":"操作：分别留空名称、服务地址或 API Key 后尝试保存 → 补全后保存"},{"parent":"15b71502-c8e7-4e67-904d-c377afcb3a7f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e6109a0-d4cd-4305-aac5-030fcee66284","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 必填项为空时不能保存，并标出缺少的字段\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 补全后可以保存"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"15b71502-c8e7-4e67-904d-c377afcb3a7f","title":"🟡【P2】必填项为空不能保存"},{"parent":"531617e6-e10a-47ed-8129-68c1342498c9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"994a4149-37d5-4aca-aad9-0d4e430d74ee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"759630c5-1673-4c4b-b7b0-8dede6161701","title":"前置：角色：账号所有者；入口：API Key 表单「取消」"},{"parent":"994a4149-37d5-4aca-aad9-0d4e430d74ee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"50e842b6-d530-4708-869f-b866de30b8d1","title":"操作：新建填写一半点「取消」；编辑修改后点「取消」"},{"parent":"994a4149-37d5-4aca-aad9-0d4e430d74ee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"206f9d6f-b24a-4403-b3b5-abc70ef10b02","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 新建不产生配置，编辑不修改原配置，列表与模型下拉保持不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"994a4149-37d5-4aca-aad9-0d4e430d74ee","title":"🟡【P2】取消新建或编辑不生效"}],"id":"531617e6-e10a-47ed-8129-68c1342498c9","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"e6b950bd-44d4-471e-83de-fa19fdb2fe90","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0fd56fa0-1f44-4dab-a313-484cf0339e12","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a7e13d62-00f7-47b6-b682-171dc2e3a6bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c7fcd41-b007-4f52-9cc0-375ad2094813","title":"前置：云端 Claude Code 下有十条以上 API Key 配置，其中一条名称很长；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」 卡片 → 点「Claude Code」行打开详情弹窗"},{"parent":"a7e13d62-00f7-47b6-b682-171dc2e3a6bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5ad765c9-2b01-421f-8d8b-49c960196a37","title":"操作：查看并滚动列表"},{"parent":"a7e13d62-00f7-47b6-b682-171dc2e3a6bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7de3b8a1-35e6-4911-87ee-51f672b4b485","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 所有配置都能看到，超长名称省略显示，不挤压感叹号与操作按钮\n2) 可见范围 ｜ 每条配置的编辑、移除都能正常操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a7e13d62-00f7-47b6-b682-171dc2e3a6bf","title":"🟡【P2】大量 API Key 与超长名称"}],"id":"0fd56fa0-1f44-4dab-a313-484cf0339e12","title":"边界场景"}],"id":"e6b950bd-44d4-471e-83de-fa19fdb2fe90","title":"Agent 详情 · API Key"},{"parent":"df0be4cf-9b29-4f4f-8e65-41d9d5f74939","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"614abd02-a324-45f7-bdc2-3288f0adab17","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"be5d3684-54f0-4378-9330-8877c4560ce3","title":"说明：详情弹窗底部红色「移除」，点击后在底部确认「移除 <Agent>? 会话会保留」与「取消」「移除」。已定口径：移除后该 Agent 行显示「安装」，用它跑过的会话保留可查看；重新安装后需要重新配置模型来源。来源：tutti-lab/tutti main@fddc82e640 的 apps/web modules/cloud-agent、room、computer 与中文文案，cmd/cloud-agent-worker、cmd/computer-daemon 的 cloud 实现；tutti-lab/tutti-server internal/biz/cloud_agent_*；相关 PR：tutti#3392 #3432 #3445 #3458 #3479"},{"parent":"614abd02-a324-45f7-bdc2-3288f0adab17","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"686530f7-aded-42f3-b0fa-bb4aa8256761","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"08772a85-6a08-4bfc-95c1-c89c6e9bee19","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea958df2-f8da-4869-9c5d-b1f097c33183","title":"前置：云端 Codex 已登录官方订阅并配置了 API Key，云端房间里有它的历史会话 S；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」 卡片 → 点「Codex」行打开详情弹窗 → 底部「移除」"},{"parent":"08772a85-6a08-4bfc-95c1-c89c6e9bee19","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb51baa0-eeec-4f52-9947-d448667e0fdd","title":"操作：点「移除」→ 查看确认 → 先取消 → 再点「移除」并确认 → 查看 Agent 行与云端房间 → 查看会话 S → 重新安装 Codex"},{"parent":"08772a85-6a08-4bfc-95c1-c89c6e9bee19","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5998cc7a-0299-4561-9664-0e3f5fc6600d","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 底部显示「移除 Codex? 会话会保留」与「取消」「移除」\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 点「取消」后不移除，弹窗内容不变\n3) 列表展示 ｜ 确认移除后 Codex 行只显示名称与「安装」\n4) 可见范围 ｜ 云端房间的 Agent 列表中不再出现「我的云端 Codex」\n5) 持久化 ｜ 会话 S 仍保留，可以查看内容与产物\n6) 列表展示 ｜ 重新安装后显示「● 可用」「1 个模型来源」，官方订阅需要重新登录\n7) 环境隔离 ｜ 本地电脑上的 Codex 不受影响"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"08772a85-6a08-4bfc-95c1-c89c6e9bee19","title":"🔴【P0】移除云端 Agent 后重新安装 · 全链路"}],"id":"686530f7-aded-42f3-b0fa-bb4aa8256761","title":"正常场景"}],"id":"614abd02-a324-45f7-bdc2-3288f0adab17","title":"Agent 详情 · 移除 Agent"},{"parent":"df0be4cf-9b29-4f4f-8e65-41d9d5f74939","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"afcc8503-8e4d-4ad1-92fe-c31d36465219","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"074f4f54-c1eb-4180-84ab-ff41fb87993c","title":"说明：云端电脑上的 Agent 只能在云端房间使用，在 Agent 选择中显示为「我的云端 <Agent>」。未创建云端电脑时，Agent 选择里仍可选「<Agent> · 云端」，首次发送会自动准备云端电脑，见「首次使用 · 在云端房间直接选云端 Agent」。一台云端电脑可同时服务多个云端房间，每个房间使用各自的工作区。已定口径：本地房间不出现云端 Agent；不写并发任务数上限，只验证多房间同时运行互不影响。与本地同名区分、云端电脑不可用时的表现、本机离线执行、文件隔离已由 Agent 接入核心回归集〔A-08〕〔B-32〕覆盖，本组不重复。来源：tutti-lab/tutti main@fddc82e640 的 apps/web modules/cloud-agent、room、computer 与中文文案，cmd/cloud-agent-worker、cmd/computer-daemon 的 cloud 实现；tutti-lab/tutti-server internal/biz/cloud_agent_*；相关 PR：tutti#3392 #3432 #3445 #3458 #3479"},{"parent":"afcc8503-8e4d-4ad1-92fe-c31d36465219","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6b8a869a-1163-4435-8dd7-d33b8bb877dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"45358ac5-1d52-411f-be81-3cbcc7dfbc68","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"97dda460-d1be-4d92-8f02-51a82b58b1e0","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，Claude Code 已登录；本地电脑离线；角色：账号所有者；入口：云端房间会话输入框的 Agent 选择"},{"parent":"45358ac5-1d52-411f-be81-3cbcc7dfbc68","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9c4e4d8a-ca04-4626-9931-184f9540c477","title":"操作：新建云端房间 → 打开 Agent 选择 → 选「我的云端 Claude Code」→ 发送一个会写文件、运行命令的任务 → 查看执行过程与结果 → 打开产物文件 → 邀请成员 M 进入房间查看 → 换一台设备打开同一会话继续"},{"parent":"45358ac5-1d52-411f-be81-3cbcc7dfbc68","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7441a84-c6c6-47b9-86a4-f5bdd137ba56","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ Agent 列表中显示「我的云端 Claude Code」，与本地电脑的 Claude Code 分开列出\n2) 结果回传 ｜ 本地电脑离线时任务仍能正常执行并回复\n3) 消息渲染 ｜ 流式输出、思考状态与工具调用折叠正常展示\n4) 文件落盘 ｜ 任务写的文件出现在云端房间的文件中，可预览与下载\n5) 可见范围 ｜ 成员 M 可以看到该会话与产物\n6) 上下文 ｜ 换设备打开同一会话可以继续对话，上下文连续\n7) 用量 ｜ 用量按 Claude Code 当前的登录方式计入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"45358ac5-1d52-411f-be81-3cbcc7dfbc68","title":"🔴【P0】在云端房间用云端 Agent 完成任务 · 全链路"},{"parent":"6b8a869a-1163-4435-8dd7-d33b8bb877dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d17b5630-424a-4cce-9bf0-6bcf09ca7aa1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae32022f-8c58-4f17-9b5b-568348827b94","title":"前置：云端 Codex 已登录官方订阅、内置 Tutti 积分可用并开启了一条 API Key；角色：账号所有者；入口：云端房间输入框选「我的云端 Codex」后的模型下拉"},{"parent":"d17b5630-424a-4cce-9bf0-6bcf09ca7aa1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d521c35b-9ef5-418a-8f70-296a4f2167a8","title":"操作：打开模型下拉 → 依次查看三个分类 → 搜索模型 → 点刷新 → 选一个模型并调整速度 → 发送"},{"parent":"d17b5630-424a-4cce-9bf0-6bcf09ca7aa1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"30b3f8e7-e0f3-44ab-bb5e-53bdf9244e17","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 下拉标题「模型选择」，带搜索框与刷新按钮\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 左侧分类为「厂商提供」「Tutti API」与底部「自定义模型 >」，右侧数字为各分类模型数，当前分类带「✓」\n3) 列表展示 ｜ Tutti API 分类右侧显示余额与「>」，模型列表带倍率（如 0.11x）\n4) 等价性 ｜ 「厂商提供」的模型数与官方订阅登录状态对应：未登录时为 0，登录后显示官方可用模型\n5) 搜索筛选 ｜ 输入关键字后只显示匹配的模型\n6) 视觉展示 ｜ 底部「速度」显示当前值（如「标准」），可切换\n7) 结果校验 ｜ 选中后输入框显示「<模型名> · <来源>」，发送后由该模型回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d17b5630-424a-4cce-9bf0-6bcf09ca7aa1","title":"🔴【P0】云端 Agent 的模型选择下拉"},{"parent":"6b8a869a-1163-4435-8dd7-d33b8bb877dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"56a2b003-521b-402a-9e1b-c082b13e303c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"207fe203-1351-41b6-8931-74fd339b5c5d","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，Claude Code 与 Codex 已登录；云端房间 R1、R2；角色：账号所有者；入口：两个房间的会话输入框"},{"parent":"56a2b003-521b-402a-9e1b-c082b13e303c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0b2f11c4-1069-499f-a0be-6693347f1d8e","title":"操作：R1 用云端 Claude Code、R2 用云端 Codex 同时发起写文件任务 → 等待都完成 → 分别查看文件与会话"},{"parent":"56a2b003-521b-402a-9e1b-c082b13e303c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"04ed37dd-e4e6-470d-86eb-08da1986fb69","title":"预期：\n1) 结果回传 ｜ 两个任务同时运行并各自完成\n2) 环境隔离 ｜ R1 的文件只出现在 R1，R2 的文件只出现在 R2，互不可见\n3) 上下文 ｜ 两个会话互不串上下文"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"56a2b003-521b-402a-9e1b-c082b13e303c","title":"🟠【P1】多个云端房间同时使用同一台云端电脑"},{"parent":"6b8a869a-1163-4435-8dd7-d33b8bb877dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e5c761ab-a01e-456c-8ed2-1a34e47e0421","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c01046e5-10d3-4a7d-8889-8f81439bfff3","title":"前置：云端电脑在线；本地电脑在线并接入 Codex；云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"e5c761ab-a01e-456c-8ed2-1a34e47e0421","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8382bf5a-c3ea-4a4c-a201-fa67cd1d55b3","title":"操作：用云端 Claude Code 生成一个文件 → 新开会话用本地电脑的 Codex 读取并修改该文件 → 回到云端会话读取修改结果"},{"parent":"e5c761ab-a01e-456c-8ed2-1a34e47e0421","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1398b5e1-460a-4e80-beea-cae6ad823995","title":"预期：\n1) 结果回传 ｜ 两个 Agent 都能正常完成任务\n2) 文件落盘 ｜ 两者读写的是同一个房间工作区，修改对另一方可见\n3) 列表展示 ｜ 会话中的 Agent 名称能区分云端与本地"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e5c761ab-a01e-456c-8ed2-1a34e47e0421","title":"🟠【P1】同一云端房间里云端 Agent 与本地 Agent 协作"},{"parent":"6b8a869a-1163-4435-8dd7-d33b8bb877dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0a5ff87b-371b-4f3c-b674-719a4ab35368","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4c7976ff-2bed-4632-b9c0-1b71f8e8f10a","title":"前置：云端电脑长时间没有任务，已被自动暂停，状态显示「在线」；角色：账号所有者；入口：云端房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"0a5ff87b-371b-4f3c-b674-719a4ab35368","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b8aadb98-a67e-424d-b356-b2eaf4a477c9","title":"操作：选择云端 Agent 发送任务"},{"parent":"0a5ff87b-371b-4f3c-b674-719a4ab35368","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9d1db4f0-fa27-43ec-bb5d-7c23a6f01b1b","title":"预期：\n1) 设备状态 ｜ 发送前后状态都显示「在线」，不需要手动启动\n2) 结果回传 ｜ 云端电脑自动恢复并完成任务，文件与登录状态保持不变"},{"parent":"0a5ff87b-371b-4f3c-b674-719a4ab35368","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e42c7374-6cfa-4783-ac84-60ec01e04129","title":"备注：已定口径：空闲暂停后自动恢复是预期行为"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0a5ff87b-371b-4f3c-b674-719a4ab35368","title":"🟠【P1】空闲后自动恢复执行"}],"id":"6b8a869a-1163-4435-8dd7-d33b8bb877dd","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"afcc8503-8e4d-4ad1-92fe-c31d36465219","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9180e6d1-1a81-4652-bf13-6c186a8b570d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e4688e5b-ac5e-486b-9299-71fa141e7b7a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"88962bd8-b606-4a5a-bf93-deaafcf93f57","title":"前置：主人在云端房间 R 使用自己的云端 Claude Code，未共享；成员 M 在 R 中；角色：成员 M；入口：R 的会话输入框与主人的会话"},{"parent":"e4688e5b-ac5e-486b-9299-71fa141e7b7a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8d59d4ea-2a5b-4200-a7a4-5e7739d5bc79","title":"操作：M 打开 Agent 列表 → M 在主人的会话里尝试继续发送"},{"parent":"e4688e5b-ac5e-486b-9299-71fa141e7b7a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d7065176-7dad-44ec-aebc-fb34dc785bcb","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ M 的 Agent 列表中不出现主人的云端 Claude Code\n2) 权限授权 ｜ M 不能借主人的会话驱动主人的云端 Agent，按「进入他人的会话」的权限规则处理\n3) 用量 ｜ 主人的用量不因 M 的操作增加"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e4688e5b-ac5e-486b-9299-71fa141e7b7a","title":"🟠【P1】房间成员不能使用未共享的云端 Agent"},{"parent":"9180e6d1-1a81-4652-bf13-6c186a8b570d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bb3ddaef-6aff-40eb-9a05-bd92d3981f89","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7be55f95-7d2c-4019-b24c-050777a4b350","title":"前置：云端任务正在运行；角色：账号所有者；入口：当前会话"},{"parent":"bb3ddaef-6aff-40eb-9a05-bd92d3981f89","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09fbf285-67ac-493a-b330-054114d644d4","title":"操作：刷新页面 → 回到会话等待完成"},{"parent":"bb3ddaef-6aff-40eb-9a05-bd92d3981f89","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5448364-1624-4afa-8fe5-a82e0edd88cd","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 刷新后显示真实的运行状态与已输出内容，任务不因刷新中断\n2) 结果回传 ｜ 任务正常完成并显示结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bb3ddaef-6aff-40eb-9a05-bd92d3981f89","title":"🟡【P2】任务运行中刷新页面"}],"id":"9180e6d1-1a81-4652-bf13-6c186a8b570d","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"afcc8503-8e4d-4ad1-92fe-c31d36465219","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4f068ba5-fd6a-4bff-be42-956bcd59a825","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cfe256b5-faf3-4a07-88c9-d5c6b4db0b93","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1a10966c-8ba3-435f-8dc7-0339735fea82","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，有已登录的云端 Agent；角色：账号所有者；入口：本地房间会话输入框的 Agent 选择"},{"parent":"cfe256b5-faf3-4a07-88c9-d5c6b4db0b93","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f85b5928-5988-42cf-80d3-1fe451bbbd07","title":"操作：打开 Agent 列表"},{"parent":"cfe256b5-faf3-4a07-88c9-d5c6b4db0b93","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6194ea4e-acbd-47ae-8fbd-2e6ac7e8e374","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 只列出本地电脑上的 Agent，不出现「我的云端 <Agent>」；出现即视为缺陷"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cfe256b5-faf3-4a07-88c9-d5c6b4db0b93","title":"🟡【P2】本地房间不出现云端 Agent"}],"id":"4f068ba5-fd6a-4bff-be42-956bcd59a825","title":"边界场景"}],"id":"afcc8503-8e4d-4ad1-92fe-c31d36465219","title":"在云端房间里使用"},{"parent":"df0be4cf-9b29-4f4f-8e65-41d9d5f74939","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"15f192ad-6a65-40e6-97a1-59156dde71af","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"985aec0f-9850-4a55-8eab-906ba7ce36cc","title":"说明：云端 Agent 可以共享给云端房间，成员看到的名称是「<主人> 的云端 <Agent>」。共享开关与范围的完整规则见「共享管理」，成员侧的会话能力主干见「Computer 与 Agent 管理 / Tutti API 与自定义模型 / 会话模型选择与执行 / 会话执行 · 他人共享的 Agent」，本组只写云端差异。已定口径：用量记在主人名下；只有主人能管理云端电脑（重启、删除、升级、登录），成员看不到主人的账号与凭据。来源：tutti-lab/tutti main@fddc82e640 的 apps/web modules/cloud-agent、room、computer 与中文文案，cmd/cloud-agent-worker、cmd/computer-daemon 的 cloud 实现；tutti-lab/tutti-server internal/biz/cloud_agent_*；相关 PR：tutti#3392 #3432 #3445 #3458 #3479"},{"parent":"15f192ad-6a65-40e6-97a1-59156dde71af","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"17f14694-edee-4795-9bbd-3ba77a4dd2a9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c4f09ca8-93ef-4268-9dee-4da9d7fe0a4d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0f93816f-9cce-44ee-abb5-c38eb84cb164","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，Codex 已用官方账号登录；云端房间 R 有成员 M；角色：账号所有者、成员 M；入口：共享管理 → 云端 Codex 的共享设置"},{"parent":"c4f09ca8-93ef-4268-9dee-4da9d7fe0a4d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7db814a6-e194-4411-b2ed-9f01fdb2a4e5","title":"操作：把云端 Codex 共享给 R → M 在 R 的 Agent 列表查看并发起任务 → 主人查看 M 的会话与用量 → 取消共享 → M 再次查看并尝试继续原会话"},{"parent":"c4f09ca8-93ef-4268-9dee-4da9d7fe0a4d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c99da14-4ca0-4c2d-8e27-be415611996d","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 共享管理中该 Agent 显示为云端 Codex，与本地 Codex 分开设置\n2) 列表展示 ｜ M 的 Agent 列表中显示「<主人> 的云端 Codex」\n3) 等价性 ｜ M 的会话能力逐项与「会话执行 · 他人共享的 Agent」主干一致\n4) 结果回传 ｜ M 发起的任务由主人的云端电脑执行并正常回复，M 不需要登录 Codex\n5) 用量 ｜ 用量记在主人名下，主人的使用概览中能看到\n6) 可见范围 ｜ 取消共享后 M 的列表中不再出现，原会话不能继续发起新任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c4f09ca8-93ef-4268-9dee-4da9d7fe0a4d","title":"🔴【P0】把云端 Agent 共享给房间成员使用 · 全链路"},{"parent":"17f14694-edee-4795-9bbd-3ba77a4dd2a9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5d0684b2-701c-4e89-9a58-7222c1434527","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e05b7a4c-f610-4f7a-b871-72ce3ce4677b","title":"前置：主人把云端 Claude Code 共享给云端房间 R1、R2；角色：账号所有者、R1 成员、R2 成员；入口：共享管理"},{"parent":"5d0684b2-701c-4e89-9a58-7222c1434527","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7c49b46d-0116-4bdf-9084-b2a450da7e0e","title":"操作：取消对 R1 的共享 → 两个房间的成员分别查看并发起任务"},{"parent":"5d0684b2-701c-4e89-9a58-7222c1434527","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"00daaf7b-24ec-44e4-b304-46a851e235ec","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ R1 成员看不到该 Agent，R2 成员仍可正常使用\n2) 结果回传 ｜ R2 成员的任务正常完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5d0684b2-701c-4e89-9a58-7222c1434527","title":"🟠【P1】分房间共享互不影响"},{"parent":"17f14694-edee-4795-9bbd-3ba77a4dd2a9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"db655d56-a383-4d61-9e3f-4be0a3e12b40","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"263b5267-c634-4982-8725-d97686e9ccce","title":"前置：主人 A 与主人 B 都把自己的云端 Codex 共享给云端房间 R；角色：成员 M；入口：R 的 Agent 列表"},{"parent":"db655d56-a383-4d61-9e3f-4be0a3e12b40","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a874c084-2124-42fa-a467-0ab4a9346b07","title":"操作：M 查看列表并分别用两个 Agent 发起任务"},{"parent":"db655d56-a383-4d61-9e3f-4be0a3e12b40","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3dff4baf-3e15-4818-8cd2-6e4c05ceb304","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 显示「A 的云端 Codex」与「B 的云端 Codex」两项，可区分\n2) 用量 ｜ 各自的用量分别记在 A、B 名下，不串记"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"db655d56-a383-4d61-9e3f-4be0a3e12b40","title":"🟠【P1】多个主人的云端 Agent 在同一房间区分"},{"parent":"17f14694-edee-4795-9bbd-3ba77a4dd2a9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b22b4af7-7e31-41b9-986c-04d60ce54084","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e27459cc-298e-4e0d-9026-73ecc181bf6b","title":"前置：主人的云端 Codex 用官方账号登录并共享给云端房间 R，成员 M 在 R 中有进行过的会话；角色：账号所有者、成员 M；入口：主人的 Codex →「设置」"},{"parent":"b22b4af7-7e31-41b9-986c-04d60ce54084","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"21535ce0-0c38-4558-9499-55052a12c3f5","title":"操作：主人把 Codex 切到 Tutti 积分 → M 在原会话继续发送 → 主人查看积分与使用概览"},{"parent":"b22b4af7-7e31-41b9-986c-04d60ce54084","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aa226740-b718-4c0a-8d4f-835d938d5b87","title":"预期：\n1) 结果回传 ｜ M 无需任何操作即可继续使用，上下文连续\n2) 用量 ｜ 切换后 M 的用量按 Tutti 积分从主人账号扣除，不扣 M 的积分"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b22b4af7-7e31-41b9-986c-04d60ce54084","title":"🟠【P1】主人切换登录方式后成员继续使用"},{"parent":"17f14694-edee-4795-9bbd-3ba77a4dd2a9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"37a0d0f1-cbf3-4029-8aa1-9f25db5bb8fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ea8d824-3ab5-4f6b-afdc-cde6a7558a28","title":"前置：主人为云端 Claude Code 在共享管理中设置了额度保护，并共享给云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者、成员 M；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"37a0d0f1-cbf3-4029-8aa1-9f25db5bb8fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8ef48340-f57c-474f-a558-8eace11d3b1a","title":"操作：M 持续使用直到触达额度上限 → 主人调高额度后 M 再发送"},{"parent":"37a0d0f1-cbf3-4029-8aa1-9f25db5bb8fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"08a0a49a-5d10-46b2-9951-b6fd39e8a213","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 触达上限时的拦截与提示逐项与「共享管理 / 额度保护」对本地 Agent 的预期一致\n2) 用量 ｜ 拦截后不再产生用量，不扣主人额外的额度\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 主人调高额度后 M 可以继续使用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"37a0d0f1-cbf3-4029-8aa1-9f25db5bb8fc","title":"🟠【P1】额度保护对共享的云端 Agent 生效"}],"id":"17f14694-edee-4795-9bbd-3ba77a4dd2a9","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"15f192ad-6a65-40e6-97a1-59156dde71af","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a63324c6-1db2-44e2-8d66-b20b98f4af67","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"31d5740f-8a09-4168-b3e7-b838c9a58869","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"012f155d-cab8-4658-aa4a-602b623e0d67","title":"前置：主人的云端 Agent 已共享给成员 M 所在的房间；角色：成员 M；入口：M 的「我的Agent → 云端房间配置」与房间内 Agent 详情"},{"parent":"31d5740f-8a09-4168-b3e7-b838c9a58869","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"af1da526-ee39-450e-9663-7cefe0fd8ead","title":"操作：M 查看自己的云端房间配置与共享来的 Agent 详情"},{"parent":"31d5740f-8a09-4168-b3e7-b838c9a58869","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"027df949-8373-4c2f-9747-956f475f7cb6","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ M 看不到主人的云端电脑卡片\n2) 权限授权 ｜ M 没有重启、删除、升级、登录主人云端电脑的入口，直接调用接口同样被拒绝\n3) 可见范围 ｜ M 看不到主人的登录账号、API Key 或积分余额"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"31d5740f-8a09-4168-b3e7-b838c9a58869","title":"🟠【P1】成员不能管理主人的云端电脑"},{"parent":"a63324c6-1db2-44e2-8d66-b20b98f4af67","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ba32da5f-6c81-47a7-8624-6f85f5423824","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"94632792-bd19-406f-a879-57f9d072d187","title":"前置：主人的云端电脑处于重启中或「需要处理」；角色：成员 M；入口：R 的 Agent 列表与会话输入框"},{"parent":"ba32da5f-6c81-47a7-8624-6f85f5423824","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4c89586c-6bfb-4558-8cca-0cef42d19a69","title":"操作：M 选择「<主人> 的云端 Codex」发送 → 主人恢复后 M 再发送"},{"parent":"ba32da5f-6c81-47a7-8624-6f85f5423824","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1265fe39-fbf1-485b-a1dd-39db9381bc8a","title":"预期：\n1) 可用状态 ｜ 不可用期间显示不可用并给出提示，不生成卡住的会话\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 恢复后 M 发送正常完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ba32da5f-6c81-47a7-8624-6f85f5423824","title":"🟡【P2】主人云端电脑不可用时成员侧的表现"}],"id":"a63324c6-1db2-44e2-8d66-b20b98f4af67","title":"异常场景"}],"id":"15f192ad-6a65-40e6-97a1-59156dde71af","title":"共享给房间成员"},{"parent":"df0be4cf-9b29-4f4f-8e65-41d9d5f74939","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"074e750d-3e1f-4eac-8f49-ecb35582e1f9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aa1c56e1-efec-4c9d-85ac-62ae58cf98ed","title":"说明：主干为「Computer 与 Agent 管理 / Tutti API 与自定义模型 / 会话模型选择与执行 / 会话执行 · 自己的 Agent」（本地 Agent 的会话能力，按 GUI-2 功能区组织）。本组镜像主干的分类，每条的第一条断言是「逐项与主干一致」，后面只写云端特有的地方；末尾一条为两者逐项对照。已定口径（本批按推荐口径出稿，待 QA 在确认页核对）：斜杠命令、MCP 与连接器、Skill、子 Agent、图片输入、AskUserQuestion、上下文用量、使用概览、Handoff、Fork 与本地一致；云端电脑不同步本地的 skill / 插件（需求文档已答复）；云端不提供 /computer use、/browser（出稿假设）。来源：tutti-lab/tutti main@fddc82e640 的 apps/web modules/cloud-agent、room、computer 与中文文案，cmd/cloud-agent-worker、cmd/computer-daemon 的 cloud 实现；tutti-lab/tutti-server internal/biz/cloud_agent_*；相关 PR：tutti#3392 #3432 #3445 #3458 #3479"},{"parent":"074e750d-3e1f-4eac-8f49-ecb35582e1f9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"06b1223c-f786-4d93-bd7e-382422029fd0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b7ac3238-7392-40bf-bba8-1ac97a925efa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1eddbe69-c39e-455b-a375-8297e6202cb3","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 已登录；云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"b7ac3238-7392-40bf-bba8-1ac97a925efa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"409293f7-ba18-4380-89c0-5e566997a47a","title":"操作：按主干「Computer 与 Agent 管理 / Tutti API 与自定义模型 / 会话模型选择与执行 / 会话执行 · 自己的 Agent / 来源切换与模型抽检」中的用例，分别用云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 各执行一遍"},{"parent":"b7ac3238-7392-40bf-bba8-1ac97a925efa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4d6209e9-eefd-4b66-95de-724c4cce5fa4","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 逐项与主干「来源切换与模型抽检」的预期一致\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 模型下拉左侧为「厂商提供」「Tutti API」与「自定义模型」，数量只统计云端电脑上已开启的来源，同步过来但未开启的 API Key 不出现\n3) 用量 ｜ 切换来源后各轮用量按对应来源计入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b7ac3238-7392-40bf-bba8-1ac97a925efa","title":"🟠【P1】模型来源切换与抽检（云端差异）"},{"parent":"06b1223c-f786-4d93-bd7e-382422029fd0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f4ed4d26-a5b1-4f51-9584-9b12d13e8acf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8351329e-67d9-42d0-888b-9a29f40679b8","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 已登录；云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"f4ed4d26-a5b1-4f51-9584-9b12d13e8acf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd32f6c2-b23b-46bd-876c-b8df78991e03","title":"操作：按主干「Computer 与 Agent 管理 / Tutti API 与自定义模型 / 会话模型选择与执行 / 会话执行 · 自己的 Agent / 消息输入与发送」中的用例，分别用云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 各执行一遍"},{"parent":"f4ed4d26-a5b1-4f51-9584-9b12d13e8acf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f678c092-a1e8-4113-9886-a0026b09fc5e","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 逐项与主干「消息输入与发送」的预期一致\n2) 文件落盘 ｜ 粘贴转成的文件、上传的图片与文件保存在云端房间的文件中\n3) 消息渲染 ｜ 图片与文字一起发送后，云端 Agent 能识别图片内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f4ed4d26-a5b1-4f51-9584-9b12d13e8acf","title":"🟠【P1】消息输入与发送（云端差异）"},{"parent":"06b1223c-f786-4d93-bd7e-382422029fd0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"caa203bf-0a78-4f41-9332-660b48616f26","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bb0f4846-cdb1-439d-a788-fe8788d4c76a","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 已登录；云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"caa203bf-0a78-4f41-9332-660b48616f26","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"91a84820-e75e-4e86-903c-39462278829b","title":"操作：按主干「Computer 与 Agent 管理 / Tutti API 与自定义模型 / 会话模型选择与执行 / 会话执行 · 自己的 Agent / 输入框命令」中的用例，分别用云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 各执行一遍"},{"parent":"caa203bf-0a78-4f41-9332-660b48616f26","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6cd18358-4a95-4fb0-b4ab-39854ff1fe15","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 逐项与主干「输入框命令」的预期一致\n2) 命令执行 ｜ /status、/compact、/plan、/goal、/review、/init 在云端 Agent 上都可用\n3) 文件落盘 ｜ /init 生成的项目说明文件写入云端房间工作区\n4) 上下文 ｜ /compact 后继续对话，上下文用量下降且对话连续"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"caa203bf-0a78-4f41-9332-660b48616f26","title":"🟠【P1】输入框命令（云端差异）"},{"parent":"06b1223c-f786-4d93-bd7e-382422029fd0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2c50b9c4-1bc3-4b6d-a861-914204337492","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"17738d77-637f-4391-9d01-7b7e6862027a","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 已登录；云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"2c50b9c4-1bc3-4b6d-a861-914204337492","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b9767f9b-2044-4523-a22b-607fca7dfc46","title":"操作：按主干「Computer 与 Agent 管理 / Tutti API 与自定义模型 / 会话模型选择与执行 / 会话执行 · 自己的 Agent / 排队、取消与暂停」中的用例，分别用云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 各执行一遍"},{"parent":"2c50b9c4-1bc3-4b6d-a861-914204337492","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"19390d2a-60fa-47d3-bb24-e80490d6aa15","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 逐项与主干「排队、取消与暂停」的预期一致\n2) 排队 ｜ 云端电脑重启或升级导致中断时，排队消息同样保留（见「重启」「版本与升级」）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2c50b9c4-1bc3-4b6d-a861-914204337492","title":"🟠【P1】排队、取消与暂停（云端差异）"},{"parent":"06b1223c-f786-4d93-bd7e-382422029fd0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6075ca0c-f84a-464c-9880-8ae6f4603d96","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"889038e9-9ba2-4341-a9b6-00bfcd84e8b8","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 已登录；云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"6075ca0c-f84a-464c-9880-8ae6f4603d96","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dcf1a24f-da40-4189-9654-38630b62adaa","title":"操作：按主干「Computer 与 Agent 管理 / Tutti API 与自定义模型 / 会话模型选择与执行 / 会话执行 · 自己的 Agent / 消息渲染」中的用例，分别用云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 各执行一遍"},{"parent":"6075ca0c-f84a-464c-9880-8ae6f4603d96","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c818f975-513b-4272-a0ef-3d8c79881456","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 逐项与主干「消息渲染」的预期一致\n2) 消息渲染 ｜ 工具调用中的路径显示为云端工作区路径，不出现本地电脑路径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6075ca0c-f84a-464c-9880-8ae6f4603d96","title":"🟠【P1】消息渲染（云端差异）"},{"parent":"06b1223c-f786-4d93-bd7e-382422029fd0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2425a2ea-8360-4b35-959a-940e6ad8f3e3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"01880cc0-ad42-4d18-9f31-77157fe29481","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 已登录；云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"2425a2ea-8360-4b35-959a-940e6ad8f3e3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d749c0be-487f-4113-8067-1f94cc4b4fc0","title":"操作：按主干「Computer 与 Agent 管理 / Tutti API 与自定义模型 / 会话模型选择与执行 / 会话执行 · 自己的 Agent / 会话状态、历史与恢复」中的用例，分别用云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 各执行一遍"},{"parent":"2425a2ea-8360-4b35-959a-940e6ad8f3e3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"903634d3-e97d-4840-bd03-255eb3dbb356","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 逐项与主干「会话状态、历史与恢复」的预期一致\n2) 持久化 ｜ 云端电脑重启、升级后历史会话可恢复并继续\n3) 会话状态 ｜ 云端电脑删除后历史会话只读，不能继续（见「删除」）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2425a2ea-8360-4b35-959a-940e6ad8f3e3","title":"🟠【P1】会话状态、历史与恢复（云端差异）"},{"parent":"06b1223c-f786-4d93-bd7e-382422029fd0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dcc85149-b9f7-4892-a83f-6532250abd72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2367fe2c-0679-4580-bb0a-a07667a49243","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 已登录；云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"dcc85149-b9f7-4892-a83f-6532250abd72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"10907d09-65e1-415d-abde-3b16000172f3","title":"操作：按主干「Computer 与 Agent 管理 / Tutti API 与自定义模型 / 会话模型选择与执行 / 会话执行 · 自己的 Agent / 引用与输入增强」中的用例，分别用云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 各执行一遍"},{"parent":"dcc85149-b9f7-4892-a83f-6532250abd72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5222019e-b7e9-4bc9-8f05-6bda5c2fa61a","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 逐项与主干「引用与输入增强」的预期一致\n2) 跳转定位 ｜ @ 文件与工作区引用只列出云端房间的文件\n3) 结果回传 ｜ @ 另一个智能体时可以 @ 本地电脑的 Agent，两者协作正常完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dcc85149-b9f7-4892-a83f-6532250abd72","title":"🟠【P1】引用与输入增强（云端差异）"},{"parent":"06b1223c-f786-4d93-bd7e-382422029fd0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5fb45cfc-91d2-4038-9a86-1f2f84b140b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"25e3844e-5fca-4dd0-ae8e-af9127e276e0","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 已登录；云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"5fb45cfc-91d2-4038-9a86-1f2f84b140b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0bde8467-13c5-4ba6-ba5f-482c81176b7d","title":"操作：按主干「Computer 与 Agent 管理 / Tutti API 与自定义模型 / 会话模型选择与执行 / 会话执行 · 自己的 Agent / Agent 执行能力」中的用例，分别用云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 各执行一遍"},{"parent":"5fb45cfc-91d2-4038-9a86-1f2f84b140b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ccef8389-bd69-4594-8757-43a4d76a8dba","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 逐项与主干「Agent 执行能力」的预期一致\n2) 命令执行 ｜ 命令与脚本在云端 Linux 环境中执行\n3) 权限授权 ｜ 需要 sudo 的操作取决于房间创建时的「允许 root」（见「云端房间规格」）\n4) 结果回传 ｜ 子 Agent 派发与结果汇总正常"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5fb45cfc-91d2-4038-9a86-1f2f84b140b1","title":"🔴【P0】Agent 执行能力（云端差异）"},{"parent":"06b1223c-f786-4d93-bd7e-382422029fd0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b4998c3b-4470-4dde-abea-23f25f6c1c81","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8ea566d0-bfa2-4577-b22f-665165a17c5f","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 已登录；云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"b4998c3b-4470-4dde-abea-23f25f6c1c81","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4a3061f-f813-4992-b429-8c1428e1c26c","title":"操作：按主干「Computer 与 Agent 管理 / Tutti API 与自定义模型 / 会话模型选择与执行 / 会话执行 · 自己的 Agent / 工具能力矩阵」中的用例，分别用云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 各执行一遍"},{"parent":"b4998c3b-4470-4dde-abea-23f25f6c1c81","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3b517ad4-b6b7-4bf4-9dce-398bf57823fe","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 逐项与主干「工具能力矩阵」的预期一致\n2) 环境隔离 ｜ Bash、读取、编辑、检索等工具只作用于云端工作区，读不到本地电脑的文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b4998c3b-4470-4dde-abea-23f25f6c1c81","title":"🔴【P0】工具能力矩阵（云端差异）"},{"parent":"06b1223c-f786-4d93-bd7e-382422029fd0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1e36c49c-6af4-4985-a3c7-86352b509d82","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5e163985-523e-4c1c-9169-e8665771670c","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 已登录；云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"1e36c49c-6af4-4985-a3c7-86352b509d82","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"40686856-5adc-4d15-874d-c216271b5165","title":"操作：按主干「Computer 与 Agent 管理 / Tutti API 与自定义模型 / 会话模型选择与执行 / 会话执行 · 自己的 Agent / 扩展生态」中的用例，分别用云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 各执行一遍"},{"parent":"1e36c49c-6af4-4985-a3c7-86352b509d82","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d44103d1-8e38-4fc3-ab5b-6d447dfcf8fd","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 逐项与主干「扩展生态」的预期一致\n2) 结果回传 ｜ 通过连接器接入的 MCP 在云端会话中可被调用并返回结果\n3) 结果回传 ｜ 从 Skill 市场安装的 Skill 在云端会话中可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1e36c49c-6af4-4985-a3c7-86352b509d82","title":"🟠【P1】MCP、连接器与 Skill（云端差异）"},{"parent":"06b1223c-f786-4d93-bd7e-382422029fd0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"78d80e9d-535e-41eb-bbb9-7c208a16cd31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e2c9c96-9bcb-4fbf-ad62-8fda559833dd","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 已登录；云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"78d80e9d-535e-41eb-bbb9-7c208a16cd31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a02c9999-d1a4-4ea3-841b-96b32303ce31","title":"操作：按主干「Computer 与 Agent 管理 / Tutti API 与自定义模型 / 会话模型选择与执行 / 会话执行 · 自己的 Agent / 产物的输出、预览与下载」中的用例，分别用云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 各执行一遍"},{"parent":"78d80e9d-535e-41eb-bbb9-7c208a16cd31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8b3a9033-8e71-4f0d-b062-dabd76e1ff72","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 逐项与主干「产物的输出、预览与下载」的预期一致\n2) 预览 ｜ 产物卡片打开、预览与下载的都是云端房间中的文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"78d80e9d-535e-41eb-bbb9-7c208a16cd31","title":"🟠【P1】产物的输出、预览与下载（云端差异）"},{"parent":"06b1223c-f786-4d93-bd7e-382422029fd0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"41348fad-067c-4bd7-82f6-6e28b8c2256a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a2c552f5-c8ab-45fb-8ff6-ba32961804e4","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 已登录；云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"41348fad-067c-4bd7-82f6-6e28b8c2256a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b7570111-253f-468a-b7bb-f6cf8ffdc771","title":"操作：按主干「Computer 与 Agent 管理 / Tutti API 与自定义模型 / 会话模型选择与执行 / 会话执行 · 自己的 Agent / 多会话与多 Agent」中的用例，分别用云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 各执行一遍"},{"parent":"41348fad-067c-4bd7-82f6-6e28b8c2256a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"62f6023a-572a-494f-a516-0898b2e21c44","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 逐项与主干「多会话与多 Agent」的预期一致\n2) 结果回传 ｜ 云端会话可以 Fork，新会话仍由云端 Agent 执行\n3) 结果回传 ｜ 云端会话与本地 Agent 会话之间可以 Handoff，交接后上下文完整"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"41348fad-067c-4bd7-82f6-6e28b8c2256a","title":"🟠【P1】多会话、Fork 与 Handoff（云端差异）"},{"parent":"06b1223c-f786-4d93-bd7e-382422029fd0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3e65d317-2421-4787-851a-d909d197db8e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6700a533-8e7d-4b22-9907-7d88f468ad3a","title":"前置：云端 Claude Code 与 Codex 已完成若干轮对话；角色：账号所有者；入口：会话中的上下文用量、共享管理 → 使用概览"},{"parent":"3e65d317-2421-4787-851a-d909d197db8e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7338d4c4-3942-424e-bc4a-cbaa34e633ee","title":"操作：查看会话的上下文用量 → 查看使用概览"},{"parent":"3e65d317-2421-4787-851a-d909d197db8e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"53e534b1-37b2-492f-be1e-6125c0db16c4","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 上下文用量展示逐项与本地 Agent 一致\n2) 用量 ｜ 使用概览中云端 Claude Code、云端 Codex 与本地同名 Agent 分开统计，数据与实际对话一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3e65d317-2421-4787-851a-d909d197db8e","title":"🟠【P1】上下文用量与使用概览（云端差异）"}],"id":"06b1223c-f786-4d93-bd7e-382422029fd0","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"074e750d-3e1f-4eac-8f49-ecb35582e1f9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b5bdd902-142a-433b-8887-f1a9f9cefbce","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8f17d797-0afe-483e-a341-ae5c56756f28","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"506f16d0-a9ce-4439-a9cb-87ff7f9bd8d1","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 已登录；云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"8f17d797-0afe-483e-a341-ae5c56756f28","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"75e496dc-a831-4d6c-b899-886c39cd4ca8","title":"操作：按主干「Computer 与 Agent 管理 / Tutti API 与自定义模型 / 会话模型选择与执行 / 会话执行 · 异常与恢复」中的用例，分别用云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 各执行一遍"},{"parent":"8f17d797-0afe-483e-a341-ae5c56756f28","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0ecfffca-6150-49a0-bec0-66db6e3e5fac","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 逐项与主干「会话执行 · 异常与恢复」的预期一致\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 云端电脑不可用导致的失败，在云端电脑恢复后可在原会话重试成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8f17d797-0afe-483e-a341-ae5c56756f28","title":"🟡【P2】会话执行异常与恢复（云端差异）"},{"parent":"b5bdd902-142a-433b-8887-f1a9f9cefbce","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"42d779eb-eef7-4753-b764-9813f5988b87","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c9ee3744-b54c-4ea0-a5c8-3112ba63aaf7","title":"前置：云端电脑在线，云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 已登录；云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"42d779eb-eef7-4753-b764-9813f5988b87","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"423dec9a-45f4-4cc7-b5c6-46ce42cf47fd","title":"操作：按主干「Computer 与 Agent 管理 / Tutti API 与自定义模型 / 会话模型选择与执行 / 模型失效后的会话」中的用例，分别用云端 Claude Code 与云端 Codex 各执行一遍"},{"parent":"42d779eb-eef7-4753-b764-9813f5988b87","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"34bfcaf3-3a21-4786-9223-caebbf7197d7","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 逐项与主干「模型失效后的会话」的预期一致\n2) 登录状态 ｜ 云端 Agent 的登录失效时提示需要重新登录云端电脑上的该 Agent，而不是本地电脑"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"42d779eb-eef7-4753-b764-9813f5988b87","title":"🟡【P2】模型失效后的会话（云端差异）"}],"id":"b5bdd902-142a-433b-8887-f1a9f9cefbce","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"074e750d-3e1f-4eac-8f49-ecb35582e1f9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c3889a42-ba43-47e5-8895-28b14adddc4d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fbae27ea-f1f1-4a96-b759-c3e17197c7e1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5c05ade1-5f12-432f-aaa6-ab70ed269007","title":"前置：本地电脑上配置了 Plugin、MCP、Skill 并已同步给本地 Agent；云端电脑在线；角色：账号所有者；入口：云端会话的 Skill / MCP 列表"},{"parent":"fbae27ea-f1f1-4a96-b759-c3e17197c7e1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e937828b-8298-4798-876c-7bc47f92e08c","title":"操作：在云端会话中查看可用的 Skill 与 MCP → 与本地会话对照"},{"parent":"fbae27ea-f1f1-4a96-b759-c3e17197c7e1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cd5037d6-b543-4b82-ac67-2007e6310faa","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 云端会话中不出现从本地电脑同步来的 Plugin、MCP、Skill；出现即视为缺陷\n2) 等价性 ｜ 通过连接器与 Skill 市场添加的仍然可用（正向对照）"},{"parent":"fbae27ea-f1f1-4a96-b759-c3e17197c7e1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"03de59fb-029e-45f9-87e2-e5db4eebb328","title":"备注：已定口径：需求文档答复「点击同步不会把本地的 skill/插件同步到云端，目前不会」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fbae27ea-f1f1-4a96-b759-c3e17197c7e1","title":"🟡【P2】云端电脑不提供本地配置同步"},{"parent":"c3889a42-ba43-47e5-8895-28b14adddc4d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1dc68558-f8d2-4f78-b207-1a86b856c134","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"be6082f9-602b-44cb-9e1e-8371ee1e2b9b","title":"前置：云端电脑在线；角色：账号所有者；入口：云端会话输入框的命令列表"},{"parent":"1dc68558-f8d2-4f78-b207-1a86b856c134","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6160d8f9-e2e5-482f-bd02-a1bbc34a9d66","title":"操作：输入 / 查看命令列表并尝试 /computer use、/browser"},{"parent":"1dc68558-f8d2-4f78-b207-1a86b856c134","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e3f05a8-6cd6-42a0-baec-e3868b69759f","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 命令列表中不出现，或选择后给出不支持的提示，不发起执行"},{"parent":"1dc68558-f8d2-4f78-b207-1a86b856c134","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"82c841dc-a1a6-4ecc-a983-ce08fd2a494f","title":"备注：出稿假设：云端沙箱没有桌面，不提供这两项，待 QA 在确认页核对"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1dc68558-f8d2-4f78-b207-1a86b856c134","title":"🟡【P2】云端 Agent 不提供 /computer use 与 /browser"},{"parent":"c3889a42-ba43-47e5-8895-28b14adddc4d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1d914cdb-3748-4eb9-bb3c-0536fef3f79e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7d1d39b3-4e3b-4c1c-8949-ae36c0ae3f9b","title":"前置：同一房间分别准备云端 Claude Code 与本地 Claude Code；角色：账号所有者；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"1d914cdb-3748-4eb9-bb3c-0536fef3f79e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a352f862-4fe6-48f9-a81b-d082bac03559","title":"操作：按主干的全部分类逐项对照两者"},{"parent":"1d914cdb-3748-4eb9-bb3c-0536fef3f79e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c1310db8-f9ee-4d68-a2a0-f24285e200df","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 除工作区位置、本地配置同步、/computer use 与 /browser 外，其余能力两者一致\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 任何一项只在其中一方缺失且不在上述差异内，即视为缺陷"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1d914cdb-3748-4eb9-bb3c-0536fef3f79e","title":"🟡【P2】云端与本地 Agent 会话能力逐项对照"}],"id":"c3889a42-ba43-47e5-8895-28b14adddc4d","title":"边界场景"}],"id":"074e750d-3e1f-4eac-8f49-ecb35582e1f9","title":"会话能力 · 云端 Agent（差异）"},{"parent":"df0be4cf-9b29-4f4f-8e65-41d9d5f74939","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"651722c5-5069-42d4-9ada-161be7fa96e8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1dcc259f-1592-45cc-88ab-63011172c38d","title":"说明：新建云端房间时在「选择云端电脑」中选规格：轻享型（2 核 CPU · 4 GB 内存，适合日常办公、小型软件开发，默认选中）、性能型（4 核 CPU · 8 GB 内存，适合5人以上办公、中大型软件开发）。弹窗底部有「允许 root」，默认勾选。进入云端房间后可在「云端电脑 · 资源用量」中查看 CPU、内存与磁盘用量。已定口径：规格只能在创建时选择，创建后不能修改；规格选择由实验开关「云端房间配置」控制，本组前置默认已开启。来源：tutti-lab/tutti main@fddc82e640 的 apps/web modules/cloud-agent、room、computer 与中文文案，cmd/cloud-agent-worker、cmd/computer-daemon 的 cloud 实现；tutti-lab/tutti-server internal/biz/cloud_agent_*；相关 PR：tutti#3392 #3432 #3445 #3458 #3479"},{"parent":"651722c5-5069-42d4-9ada-161be7fa96e8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e2f2cb2f-36f5-4229-a81e-13babbe8c78b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"29ad97ec-19cb-4827-88bc-4c3e2f3ffaa4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"49ba0b10-9816-481c-8133-6c602bb535d4","title":"前置：账号未达房间创建上限；角色：账号所有者；入口：新建房间 →「选择房间类型」→ 云端 →「创建云端房间」"},{"parent":"29ad97ec-19cb-4827-88bc-4c3e2f3ffaa4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"11fa3d87-e0ee-4233-b36f-45317581eb6a","title":"操作：查看规格选项 → 选择「性能型」→ 保持「允许 root」勾选 → 填写房间信息并创建 → 进入房间打开资源用量 → 让 Agent 执行 sudo 命令与一个多进程构建任务 → 再刷新资源用量"},{"parent":"29ad97ec-19cb-4827-88bc-4c3e2f3ffaa4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b2f6550c-24fc-43df-bf74-2c2d2f6b5924","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 显示「选择云端电脑」与「根据任务规模，选择合适的配置。」\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 两个选项分别为「轻享型」（2 核 CPU、4 GB 内存及适合的任务）与「性能型」（4 核 CPU、8 GB 内存及适合的任务），默认选中轻享型\n3) 按钮状态 ｜ 「允许 root」默认勾选，悬停说明为「开启后，房间协作者的 Agent 可以通过 sudo 在该房间的云端环境中执行 root 命令。」\n4) 结果校验 ｜ 创建成功并进入房间\n5) 视觉展示 ｜ 资源用量面板标题为「云端电脑」，CPU 显示为「<百分比>% · 4 核」，内存总量为 8 GB\n6) 命令执行 ｜ Agent 执行 sudo 命令成功\n7) 性能 ｜ 构建任务运行时资源用量随之上升，刷新后显示新的采样时间"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"29ad97ec-19cb-4827-88bc-4c3e2f3ffaa4","title":"🔴【P0】创建性能型云端房间并核对资源 · 全链路"},{"parent":"e2f2cb2f-36f5-4229-a81e-13babbe8c78b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ee0012f4-70fb-4eee-9d22-62449075ae4d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d38fdf75-efa8-451b-b1a9-48fb0393c52e","title":"前置：角色：账号所有者；入口：「创建云端房间」"},{"parent":"ee0012f4-70fb-4eee-9d22-62449075ae4d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2ef62be1-0adb-4386-be1c-99899d363c5c","title":"操作：不改规格，取消勾选「允许 root」→ 创建 → 查看资源用量 → 让 Agent 执行 sudo 命令与普通命令"},{"parent":"ee0012f4-70fb-4eee-9d22-62449075ae4d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7dc3e5a8-e195-4d9d-9e10-4a8751b89d19","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 以轻享型创建，资源用量显示 2 核 CPU、4 GB 内存\n2) 权限授权 ｜ Agent 执行 sudo 命令被拒绝，普通命令正常执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ee0012f4-70fb-4eee-9d22-62449075ae4d","title":"🟠【P1】默认轻享型并关闭 root 创建"},{"parent":"e2f2cb2f-36f5-4229-a81e-13babbe8c78b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3e0dea81-7a03-4a1f-ba9a-64a68c461537","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"58184cf6-f69c-4d7e-80e9-84b05be281cd","title":"前置：主人创建了允许 root 的云端房间 R，成员 M 用自己的 Agent 在 R 中工作；角色：成员 M；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"3e0dea81-7a03-4a1f-ba9a-64a68c461537","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"08ae0fd0-32d4-46f7-9ce2-4e87b04b1f23","title":"操作：M 的 Agent 执行 sudo 命令"},{"parent":"3e0dea81-7a03-4a1f-ba9a-64a68c461537","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f5a59287-8580-4ea3-b9af-c40d8fae57fe","title":"预期：\n1) 命令执行 ｜ M 的 Agent 执行 sudo 命令成功，与弹窗说明一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3e0dea81-7a03-4a1f-ba9a-64a68c461537","title":"🟠【P1】root 权限对房间协作者的 Agent 同样生效"}],"id":"e2f2cb2f-36f5-4229-a81e-13babbe8c78b","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"651722c5-5069-42d4-9ada-161be7fa96e8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bb58680f-1a73-40fe-8449-7b2a474abacc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"20693e8a-0765-466a-8a8a-bb97062d104e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cabd519f-43e4-4761-9eb8-8ca9d3cb67fd","title":"前置：云端房间已创建，模拟资源用量接口失败；角色：房间成员；入口：房间内「资源用量」"},{"parent":"20693e8a-0765-466a-8a8a-bb97062d104e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"801aeaca-ae1f-48be-a3bd-0ecde468974a","title":"操作：打开资源用量 → 点「刷新」→ 恢复后再刷新"},{"parent":"20693e8a-0765-466a-8a8a-bb97062d104e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6159e3c0-9d4d-4ae2-a6ce-7b8505c983a0","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 首次加载失败提示「资源用量加载失败，请尝试刷新。」\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 已有数据时刷新失败提示「刷新失败，继续展示上次结果。」，不清空已显示的数据\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 恢复后刷新显示最新数据与采样时间"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"20693e8a-0765-466a-8a8a-bb97062d104e","title":"🟡【P2】资源用量加载或刷新失败"}],"id":"bb58680f-1a73-40fe-8449-7b2a474abacc","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"651722c5-5069-42d4-9ada-161be7fa96e8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7b3de01a-fc10-4316-804a-4d8853598b16","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"704f8b99-54ba-449b-a7ed-e5430c385bc9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"05da9e2c-f83d-42fb-8a25-253ae13f2290","title":"前置：已有一个轻享型云端房间；角色：房主；入口：房间信息编辑"},{"parent":"704f8b99-54ba-449b-a7ed-e5430c385bc9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6592438d-cc77-4e7a-b361-25e9392aa113","title":"操作：打开房间信息编辑"},{"parent":"704f8b99-54ba-449b-a7ed-e5430c385bc9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e0474452-585b-44b1-94f3-85ee2cd63254","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 编辑界面没有规格选项，房间规格保持不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"704f8b99-54ba-449b-a7ed-e5430c385bc9","title":"🟡【P2】创建后不能修改规格"},{"parent":"7b3de01a-fc10-4316-804a-4d8853598b16","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7ee68d49-6b15-4100-9647-36bde6fbd0d0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c804dfc7-1efa-49ae-ad38-575e6bd82ea5","title":"前置：云端房间已创建；角色：房间成员；入口：「资源用量」"},{"parent":"7ee68d49-6b15-4100-9647-36bde6fbd0d0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fed9bcd7-b87d-45cb-955a-b3d6a6f94747","title":"操作：查看磁盘用量说明"},{"parent":"7ee68d49-6b15-4100-9647-36bde6fbd0d0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d410fda1-0c00-45bb-a0d2-1c53f7a28bb8","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 显示「磁盘用量包含整台云端电脑的文件系统。」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7ee68d49-6b15-4100-9647-36bde6fbd0d0","title":"🟡【P2】磁盘用量的统计范围"}],"id":"7b3de01a-fc10-4316-804a-4d8853598b16","title":"边界场景"}],"id":"651722c5-5069-42d4-9ada-161be7fa96e8","title":"云端房间规格"},{"parent":"df0be4cf-9b29-4f4f-8e65-41d9d5f74939","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"947ade45-de0a-4610-a2d5-82b377e8e32b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"908a3854-58e1-4a9a-9f6a-9efb31991b9d","title":"说明：云端电脑有两个入口：一是「我的Agent」→「云端房间配置」里点「创建云端电脑」（见「页面入口与创建」）；二是在云端房间里直接选云端 Agent 发送，第一次发送时自动准备云端电脑，本组写第二种。已定口径：未创建云端电脑时，云端房间的 Agent 选择里仍可选「Claude Code · 云端」「Codex · 云端」，模型默认显示 Tutti API；发送后会话里显示「正在规划下一步」「正在为你首次准备云端 Computer」，不显示「停止」和「返回」按钮；准备完成后由「我的云端 <Agent>」正常回复。准备界面的样式还在调整，状态文案以截图为准，执行时如有变化按界面核对。"},{"parent":"947ade45-de0a-4610-a2d5-82b377e8e32b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"30c3a524-30d7-4d3e-9ce4-e256defbe0f0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"52914768-1c60-4d94-ba11-41b5dbe5ca1a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b81ebff1-64e3-42ac-864f-bd38480a14b0","title":"前置：账号已登录、有 Tutti 积分，「我的Agent」→「云端房间配置」里还没有云端电脑（未创建）；云端房间 R；本地电脑在线，接入了 Claude Code、Codex（可用）与 WorkBuddy（不可用）；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框旁的 Agent 选择"},{"parent":"52914768-1c60-4d94-ba11-41b5dbe5ca1a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"570e2a89-e507-4aa6-bc0a-1aadfaa7ce5a","title":"操作：打开 Agent 选择查看「我的 Agent」页签 → 选「Claude Code · 云端」→ 查看输入框的模型 → 发送「hi」→ 观察准备过程直到回复 → 追问一轮让它在工作区新建一个文件 → 到左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」查看 → 刷新页面、换浏览器再看"},{"parent":"52914768-1c60-4d94-ba11-41b5dbe5ca1a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4505106-bc4c-463d-bb61-62b9f83d5522","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ Agent 选择顶部为「我的 Agent」「共享 Agent」页签（带数量）与「管理」\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 「我的 Agent」上方列出「Claude Code」「Codex」，带「☁ 云端」标记，未创建云端电脑也可以选；分隔线下方是本地 Agent，显示「我的 <Agent> · 本地 · 电脑名」与「● 可用」，不可用的置灰显示「不可用」\n3) 按钮状态 ｜ 选中「Claude Code · 云端」后打勾，不跳转到「我的Agent」管理页，也不要求先创建云端电脑\n4) 输入框 ｜ 模型默认显示「<模型> · Tutti API」（如「DeepSeek V4.1 Flash · Tutti API」）\n5) 会话状态 ｜ 发送后用户消息正常显示，会话里出现带加载动画的「正在规划下一步」与「正在为你首次准备云端 Computer」\n6) 按钮状态 ｜ 准备过程中不显示「停止」「返回」按钮\n7) 结果回传 ｜ 准备完成后由「我的云端 Claude Code」回复并显示「总用时」，回复中的工作区路径为云端路径（如 /workspace/<房间>）\n8) 输入框 ｜ 输入框占位为「要求 我的云端 Claude Code 继续后续变更」，底部显示「☁ 运行于云端电脑」\n9) 文件落盘 ｜ 追问新建的文件出现在 R 的房间文件中\n10) 用量 ｜ Tutti 积分按本次消耗减少，模型下拉与头像菜单中的余额一致\n11) 设备状态 ｜ 「云端房间配置」出现「云端电脑」卡片：「● 在线」「已是最新版本」「Tutti 托管」，下方 Claude Code 与 Codex 显示「● 可用」「1 个模型来源」\n12) 持久化 ｜ 刷新、换浏览器后是同一台云端电脑，不重复创建"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"52914768-1c60-4d94-ba11-41b5dbe5ca1a","title":"🔴【P0】未创建云端电脑时直接选云端 Agent 发送 · 全链路"},{"parent":"30c3a524-30d7-4d3e-9ce4-e256defbe0f0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"34e8ebce-8b05-463f-a550-5a082d63260e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae7aef77-8482-4f2c-b5e4-d479d8d0dc60","title":"前置：账号已登录、有 Tutti 积分，「我的Agent」→「云端房间配置」里还没有云端电脑（未创建）；云端房间 R；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 里选「Codex · 云端」后的模型下拉"},{"parent":"34e8ebce-8b05-463f-a550-5a082d63260e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"25163280-9237-4ee0-b7e3-cc81bfe50e73","title":"操作：打开模型下拉 → 查看左侧分类与右侧模型 → 换选另一个 Tutti API 模型（如 GLM-5.3 Flash）→ 发送"},{"parent":"34e8ebce-8b05-463f-a550-5a082d63260e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e6278f19-50fe-47ba-a795-c1694fd43ee1","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 左侧为「厂商提供 0」「Tutti API 12」（数字为模型数）与底部「自定义模型 >」，当前分类「Tutti API」带「✓」\n2) 列表展示 ｜ Tutti API 右侧显示积分余额与「>」，模型带倍率（如 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 0.11x），默认选中的模型带「✓」\n3) 视觉展示 ｜ 底部「速度」显示「标准」\n4) 结果回传 ｜ 换选后发送，准备完成后由所选模型回复，输入框显示「GLM-5.3 Flash · Tutti API」"},{"parent":"34e8ebce-8b05-463f-a550-5a082d63260e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4433a190-3452-4a4e-ad39-0f0b9d23739b","title":"备注：已定口径：未创建时厂商提供为 0，是正常状态，不是缺陷"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"34e8ebce-8b05-463f-a550-5a082d63260e","title":"🟠【P1】未创建云端电脑时的模型下拉"},{"parent":"30c3a524-30d7-4d3e-9ce4-e256defbe0f0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"965b917c-8396-4482-9bc5-841e7f288b75","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ad324a29-13f8-4d84-877c-fe691db669ff","title":"前置：已通过云端房间首次使用准备好云端电脑；本地 Codex 已登录官方订阅；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」 →「云端电脑」→ Codex 行"},{"parent":"965b917c-8396-4482-9bc5-841e7f288b75","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2eb89417-2875-4e02-a6fe-114266e2e0dc","title":"操作：打开 Codex 详情弹窗 → 完成官方订阅登录 → 回到 R 选「Codex · 云端」打开模型下拉"},{"parent":"965b917c-8396-4482-9bc5-841e7f288b75","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c2e76ab2-0693-4ed8-96ec-1b9c8b8506da","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 弹窗里官方订阅显示「登录」，Tutti 积分显示「✓ 内置」、余额与「升级会员」，有「启用 Tutti API」，API Key 显示「新建」\n2) 环境隔离 ｜ 本地 Codex 已登录官方订阅，云端官方订阅仍为未登录\n3) 列表展示 ｜ 登录后 Codex 行变为「2 个模型来源」，模型下拉「厂商提供」出现官方模型"},{"parent":"965b917c-8396-4482-9bc5-841e7f288b75","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"278ce5a2-75bb-49bb-9095-5b7049208b32","title":"备注：已定口径：本地已登录、云端仍需登录，不是缺陷"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"965b917c-8396-4482-9bc5-841e7f288b75","title":"🔴【P0】首次准备完成后的模型来源与官方订阅"},{"parent":"30c3a524-30d7-4d3e-9ce4-e256defbe0f0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7e83e6cc-fe6d-4b16-a9b6-c481b0410682","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"86f55825-20d8-4720-9ef9-324e4393c381","title":"前置：已通过云端房间首次使用准备好云端电脑；在另一个云端房间 R2；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框旁的 Agent 选择"},{"parent":"7e83e6cc-fe6d-4b16-a9b6-c481b0410682","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"89818909-b4de-4b31-88b3-0782d227df79","title":"操作：在 R2 选「Codex · 云端」发送一条消息"},{"parent":"7e83e6cc-fe6d-4b16-a9b6-c481b0410682","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9da0f92b-939c-4ef0-9f10-cd879827e0d5","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 不再出现「正在为你首次准备云端 Computer」，直接执行\n2) 结果回传 ｜ 由「我的云端 Codex」正常回复\n3) 结果校验 ｜ 「云端房间配置」里仍只有一台云端电脑"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7e83e6cc-fe6d-4b16-a9b6-c481b0410682","title":"🟠【P1】准备完成后再选另一个云端 Agent 直接执行"},{"parent":"30c3a524-30d7-4d3e-9ce4-e256defbe0f0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e556a14c-3d98-4466-8a02-97a9495e9e2b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"15ee4d00-810d-4fd6-b509-fd8d25a86bf6","title":"前置：账号已登录、有 Tutti 积分，「我的Agent」→「云端房间配置」里还没有云端电脑（未创建）；云端房间 R；已在 R 选云端 Agent 发送，会话正在显示首次准备；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的当前会话"},{"parent":"e556a14c-3d98-4466-8a02-97a9495e9e2b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"571ff107-4a17-4f62-9060-cbb9bd6597c9","title":"操作：刷新页面；再切到其他房间后回到 R，等待完成"},{"parent":"e556a14c-3d98-4466-8a02-97a9495e9e2b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8d0837c2-6b46-4069-bec9-d6f7ec8e5373","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 回来后仍显示真实的准备状态，不回到未发送状态，用户消息不丢\n2) 结果回传 ｜ 准备完成后正常回复，消息只回复一次\n3) 结果校验 ｜ 只有一台云端电脑"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e556a14c-3d98-4466-8a02-97a9495e9e2b","title":"🟠【P1】准备中刷新或离开页面后回来继续"},{"parent":"30c3a524-30d7-4d3e-9ce4-e256defbe0f0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"108c4dd1-8365-4b5c-bfc6-2b98595a8ecd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"08f98272-e954-4ee7-9adf-0392e503aff9","title":"前置：账号已登录、有 Tutti 积分，「我的Agent」→「云端房间配置」里还没有云端电脑（未创建）；云端房间 R；已在 R 选云端 Agent 发送，会话正在显示首次准备；角色：账号所有者；入口：左侧「我的Agent」→ 房间类型「云端房间配置」"},{"parent":"108c4dd1-8365-4b5c-bfc6-2b98595a8ecd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f90ff50d-17a2-4d9f-9295-a748fbb8fd5a","title":"操作：准备过程中打开「云端房间配置」查看「云端电脑」卡片，并尝试点「创建云端电脑」"},{"parent":"108c4dd1-8365-4b5c-bfc6-2b98595a8ecd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0c61bd02-407b-4199-bd6a-e933548e15c7","title":"预期：\n1) 设备状态 ｜ 卡片显示与会话一致的设置进度（「正在设置云端 Agent」的步骤），完成后显示「● 在线」\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ 准备中不能再点「创建云端电脑」发起第二次创建"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"108c4dd1-8365-4b5c-bfc6-2b98595a8ecd","title":"🟠【P1】准备中在管理页查看云端电脑"}],"id":"30c3a524-30d7-4d3e-9ce4-e256defbe0f0","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"947ade45-de0a-4610-a2d5-82b377e8e32b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cc311301-8598-4237-8cae-23c11c2a8eef","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8013f48c-ae96-45c5-af7f-9dfaeee7c508","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d82a7ffa-c961-4cbc-963d-930348437d59","title":"前置：账号已登录、有 Tutti 积分，「我的Agent」→「云端房间配置」里还没有云端电脑（未创建）；云端房间 R；模拟首次准备云端电脑失败；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的会话输入框"},{"parent":"8013f48c-ae96-45c5-af7f-9dfaeee7c508","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"37e518c5-c16a-49f4-849d-8ddd377a58b7","title":"操作：选云端 Agent 发送 → 准备失败 → 按提示重试，或到管理页「云端电脑」卡片点「重试」→ 回到 R 再发送"},{"parent":"8013f48c-ae96-45c5-af7f-9dfaeee7c508","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9bc2b33c-c878-4e58-b2e4-da6ce8322e37","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 会话里给出准备失败的提示，不伪装成 Agent 回复失败，不一直停在准备中\n2) 设备状态 ｜ 管理页卡片显示「需要处理」与失败原因\n3) 恢复重试 ｜ 重试后准备完成，Agent 正常回复\n4) 结果校验 ｜ 不产生第二台云端电脑"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8013f48c-ae96-45c5-af7f-9dfaeee7c508","title":"🟡【P2】首次准备失败后重试"},{"parent":"cc311301-8598-4237-8cae-23c11c2a8eef","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a0649905-b2f6-4ad1-b2ec-cfe8842b51fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"665b7537-ce56-4780-99e5-2bd62864b6be","title":"前置：账号已登录、有 Tutti 积分，「我的Agent」→「云端房间配置」里还没有云端电脑（未创建）；云端房间 R；已在 R 选云端 Agent 发送，会话正在显示首次准备；角色：账号所有者；入口：R 的当前会话"},{"parent":"a0649905-b2f6-4ad1-b2ec-cfe8842b51fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"33824f90-fb03-4ea8-91e8-bed66026591e","title":"操作：断开网络，十秒后恢复"},{"parent":"a0649905-b2f6-4ad1-b2ec-cfe8842b51fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"20743ca4-1e6c-4336-a2e3-c104924c8913","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 断开期间有明确提示，恢复后继续显示准备进度或回复，不一直卡住\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 恢复后只回复一次"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a0649905-b2f6-4ad1-b2ec-cfe8842b51fc","title":"🟡【P2】准备中网络断开后恢复"}],"id":"cc311301-8598-4237-8cae-23c11c2a8eef","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"947ade45-de0a-4610-a2d5-82b377e8e32b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2a21f686-50d1-4c1e-a761-72f8835b7235","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"32b7af1d-3334-4ea8-9053-98042775671f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ead6d0df-0047-4648-9108-40e2a47ad279","title":"前置：账号未创建云端电脑；云端房间 R1、R2；角色：账号所有者；入口：两个房间的会话输入框"},{"parent":"32b7af1d-3334-4ea8-9053-98042775671f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c7959a91-3411-4b90-b481-bf9c8490c550","title":"操作：R1 选「Claude Code · 云端」、R2 选「Codex · 云端」，几乎同时发送"},{"parent":"32b7af1d-3334-4ea8-9053-98042775671f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f2dd0f68-9224-4e82-ada3-7f87243f89fd","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 只准备一台云端电脑，两个会话都在准备完成后正常回复\n2) 环境隔离 ｜ 两个房间使用各自的工作区"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"32b7af1d-3334-4ea8-9053-98042775671f","title":"🟡【P2】两个云端房间同时首次发送"},{"parent":"2a21f686-50d1-4c1e-a761-72f8835b7235","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7e8e09d2-4fd3-4264-9f03-5