02ea094","title":"🔴【P0】进入共享 Agent 页 · 新版","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"a197e177-0fd6-474c-8c3b-38f4cbaedd6b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c30df43a-9730-4e02-852a-222c705dd1cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e647cb3-218c-495f-8c56-04655d87bb0c","title":"前置：已进入共享 Agent 页；角色：账号所有者；入口：页面顶部"},{"parent":"c30df43a-9730-4e02-852a-222c705dd1cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"08688b4a-e961-432c-8ee7-20c46ae61eea","title":"操作：查看横幅内容"},{"parent":"c30df43a-9730-4e02-852a-222c705dd1cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f061394d-dceb-418f-9552-271df12f4e79","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 带锁图标，标题为「共享 Agent，私有信息留在本机」\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 正文说明他人调用时任务仍由自己的电脑发出，账号、凭证与历史记录始终保留在本机\n3) 结果校验 ｜ 横幅常驻展示，不随页签切换消失，也不提供关闭按钮"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c30df43a-9730-4e02-852a-222c705dd1cd","title":"🔴【P0】顶部安全说明横幅","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"a197e177-0fd6-474c-8c3b-38f4cbaedd6b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"44775999-d67a-41e5-89bb-a2c6e18de7d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5b1f447e-26c2-489a-a776-1fe56f39432a","title":"前置：我有 5 个 Agent，房间内他人共享给我 5 个；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享 Agent 页"},{"parent":"44775999-d67a-41e5-89bb-a2c6e18de7d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"59e01d1c-d019-414a-a34a-e9990b277f68","title":"操作：查看两个页签上的数字"},{"parent":"44775999-d67a-41e5-89bb-a2c6e18de7d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"04d0cd09-dfba-4a26-889a-18a10d6c7980","title":"预期：<br>1) 列表展示 ｜ 我的 Agents 的数字等于我已安装的 Agent 条目数<br>2) 列表展示 ｜ 共享给我的数字等于下方各房间的Agent总数"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"44775999-d67a-41e5-89bb-a2c6e18de7d4","title":"🔴【P0】两个页签的计数","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"a197e177-0fd6-474c-8c3b-38f4cbaedd6b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2d9b09a0-fad6-4116-ae59-fd6e1d2fb6e3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ca75c505-42e1-48c0-9774-bfa3961a03be","title":"前置：成员 B 把同一个 Agent 分别共享到了我所在的两个房间；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享给我的页签"},{"parent":"2d9b09a0-fad6-4116-ae59-fd6e1d2fb6e3","callout":[],"