我加入了几十个房间且有多台电脑多个 Agent；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享 Agent 页"},{"parent":"24d68740-c9d5-46f2-b88a-c59ca4b5f5b3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ab40fee9-b9f8-417a-a8f0-e0bc9b5020f7","title":"操作：展开多条并滚动"},{"parent":"24d68740-c9d5-46f2-b88a-c59ca4b5f5b3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a6c05217-a4bf-449a-8dc7-e42c62fd9b3e","title":"预期：\n1) 性能 ｜ 展开与滚动流畅，计数计算不卡顿\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 全部内容可完整浏览"},{"parent":"24d68740-c9d5-46f2-b88a-c59ca4b5f5b3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d3cf8861-cd77-459d-b5e1-9f1e6884993d","title":"备注：共享 Agent 全局 tab：顶部是常驻的安全说明横幅，下面是「我的 Agent」与「共享给我的」两个页签并带计数。我的 Agent 按【电脑】分组成卡片，卡片内每个 Agent 一列，列内自上而下是可用状态、共享到房间的房间开关列表、使用额度区块；共享给我的按房间分组"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"24d68740-c9d5-46f2-b88a-c59ca4b5f5b3","title":"🟡【P2】大量房间与 Agent"},{"parent":"c125735d-a633-4c9a-8fd2-622166665384","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"11a8089f-c4e1-4ea3-af5f-65a7ea17384d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5f7e86d-1869-4009-954c-b078ed6ea8fb","title":"前置：多名成员在短时间内反复开关共享；角色：账号所有者；入口：共享给我的页签"},{"parent":"11a8089f-c4e1-4ea3-af5f-65a7ea17384d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3d6cea0-1eac-4f0f-8a07-a79f6353bee4","title":"操作：持续观察列表"},{"parent":"11a8089f-c4e1-4ea3-af5f-65a7ea17384d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c511f112-9fa1-451f-b0b8-16ebbd7d36fa","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 最终状态与实际一致，不出现条目闪烁或重复\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 各房间数量与页签总数最终正确"},{"parent":"11a8089f-c4e1-4ea3-af5f-65a7ea17384d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"60185861-503c-443a-900a-2525dc0093da","title":"备注：共享 Agent 全局 tab：顶部是常驻的安全说明横幅，下面是「我的 Agent」与「共享给我的」两个页签并带计数。我的 Agent 按【电脑】分组成卡片，卡片内每个 Agent 一列，列内自上而下是可用状态、共享到房间的房间开关列表、使用额度区块；共享给我的按房间分组"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"11a8089f-c4e1-4ea3-af5f-65a7ea17384d","title":"🟡【P2】频繁变更时的稳定性"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c125735d-a633-4c9a-8fd2-622166665384","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"id":"680f7822-2181-429c-ad46-040c71737748","title":"实时同步与一致性"}],"id":"33ef2dcc-efee-44b1-985f-6621b19cc367","title":"页面框架与实时同步"},{"parent":"23b375b8-18db-4126-bfc5-6bea4757c4f1","customWidth":82,"callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7d8de7c4-2dc7-4144-a0a0-bb43791f9977","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c8985d4c-d5ae-430c-928d-3b6f6c6125d5","title":"说明：我共享出去的 Agent。每个已安装的 Agent 一张卡片，卡片内分共享给房间与共享给好友两个子 tab"},{"parent":"7d8de7c4-2dc7-4144-a0a0-bb43791f9977","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c96471d7-31f8-4ad1-85a3-7c686d7ebda9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"03ca8d17-17f7-494d-888a-f47cf5bcaa9a","title":"说明：Agent 卡片的布局与悬浮信息卡。卡片列表、两个子 tab 与计数、空态、同名 Agent 区分，以及悬浮 Agent 头像弹出的信息卡（所在电脑与使用额度）"},{"parent":"c96471d7-31f8-4ad1-85a3-7c686d7ebda9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"60e8cc7f-37ef-4826-8536-9a4374bb2dd3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"60efc948-5e1c-473f-a486-573cd5f2518c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8015c8a4-bebc-462d-9a93-f8b64ae07eac","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0123f7fa-962e-4183-a5a1-40bcce742f76","title":"前置：账号已绑定电脑，电脑上装了 Codex、Claude Code、Tutti Agent 三个 Agent；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：左侧「共享管理」→ 我的 Agent"},{"parent":"8015c8a4-bebc-462d-9a93-f8b64ae07eac","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cbeecd08-e337-46fa-8294-4a30553df8e0","title":"操作：进入页面逐张卡片核对布局，再切换某张卡片内的两个子 tab"},{"parent":"8015c8a4-bebc-462d-9a93-f8b64ae07eac","customWidth":473,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"16817d78-8d10-471c-9ee5-cc8eb84d9ee0","title":"预期：<br>1) 列表展示 ｜ 每个已安装的 Agent 一张独立卡片，卡片头是 Agent 图标与名称<br>2) 列表展示 ｜ 「我的 Agent」页签上的计数等于卡片数<br>3) 菜单展示 ｜ 卡片内有「共享给房间」与「共享给好友」两个子 tab，各自带计数<br>4) 列表展示 ｜ 共享给房间的计数只算开关开启中的房间，已关闭的不计入<br>5) 列表展示 ｜ 共享给好友的计数把已关闭的共享也算进去，只要共享过就计一条<br>6) 结果校验 ｜ 两个子 tab 的计数口径不同，不能用同一套规则算 —— 关掉一个房间共享时房间计数减一，关掉一个好友共享时好友计数不变<br>7) 按钮状态 ｜ 切换子 tab 时另一个 tab 的内容与开关状态不受影响<br>8) 列表展示 ｜ 只展示已安装的 Agent，未安装的不占位"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8015c8a4-bebc-462d-9a93-f8b64ae07eac","title":"🔴【P0】Agent 卡片与两个子 tab","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"60efc948-5e1c-473f-a486-573cd5f2518c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6180bd81-3f1a-40b5-b16f-da6168a77db4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5e185e5c-3dfe-462c-b2f4-d84f613c653d","title":"前置：某个 Agent 有额度数据；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：卡片头的 Agent 头像"},{"parent":"6180bd81-3f1a-40b5-b16f-da6168a77db4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d300d244-1873-406d-8369-1f5398130488","title":"操作：悬浮该 Agent 的头像查看弹出的信息卡"},{"parent":"6180bd81-3f1a-40b5-b16f-da6168a77db4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5fc9cb67-0cfc-49cd-894e-01def32cbacd","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 弹出信息卡，依次展示「所在电脑」与电脑名、「使用额度」与套餐名、「每周额度」进度条与剩余百分比、重置时间、更新时间\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 电脑名与该 Agent 实际所在的设备一致\n3) 用量 ｜ 额度数值与电脑页、Agent 详情处的口径一致\n4) 视觉展示 ｜ 移开鼠标后信息卡关闭，不遮挡下方的房间列表操作"},{"parent":"6180bd81-3f1a-40b5-b16f-da6168a77db4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"053a840a-17f4-40b3-b2c7-467937bf0fc3","title":"备注：额度的三种态、耗尽、检测失败、重置跨天等口径沿用「2.4 使用额度区块」，本条只验证展示位置从卡片底部区块改到了悬浮信息卡"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6180bd81-3f1a-40b5-b16f-da6168a77db4","title":"🔴【P0】悬浮 Agent 头像查看信息卡","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"60efc948-5e1c-473f-a486-573cd5f2518c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dd45d57d-e066-4105-a123-30e36efd1958","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c88b9cc8-d234-497e-b208-01c1279263c9","title":"前置：账号绑定了两台电脑，两台上都装了 Codex；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：我的 Agent"},{"parent":"dd45d57d-e066-4105-a123-30e36efd1958","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"45b76b87-6e7b-475b-a7b7-d016c7529abc","title":"操作：查看卡片列表并分别悬浮两张 Codex 卡片的头像"},{"parent":"dd45d57d-e066-4105-a123-30e36efd1958","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7d79cca4-2318-47db-b260-56ae6c924750","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 两台电脑上的同名 Agent 各占一张卡片，不合并成一张\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 悬浮信息卡里的「所在电脑」分别是各自的设备名，用来区分两张卡\n3) 归属与顺序 ｜ 两张卡的共享设置互不影响"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dd45d57d-e066-4105-a123-30e36efd1958","title":"🟠【P1】多台电脑上的同名 Agent","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"60efc948-5e1c-473f-a486-573cd5f2518c","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"60e8cc7f-37ef-4826-8536-9a4374bb2dd3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"04ec30e8-aa47-4473-ae6e-bcf0e1fbbc40","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7f83b3dd-ac36-4a46-ab04-37b1e356593d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea59619c-9cb3-4118-bdd0-5211decdce64","title":"前置：账号尚未绑定任何电脑；角色：新用户；入口：共享管理页"},{"parent":"7f83b3dd-ac36-4a46-ab04-37b1e356593d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b199439b-59b3-4531-8f25-3cdea7450840","title":"操作：进入页面查看两个页签"},{"parent":"7f83b3dd-ac36-4a46-ab04-37b1e356593d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"80c9bbb2-8ae4-4814-9f15-664d377d441b","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 「我的 Agent」计数为 0，内容区展示「还没有共享agent给别人」\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 切到「共享给我的」计数为 0，两个子 tab 计数都是 0，内容区展示「还没有其他人共享给你的 Agent」\n3) 视觉展示 ｜ 两处空态都是带虚线边框的占位区域，不是空白页\n4) 列表展示 ｜ 顶部的共享 Agent 安全说明区在空态下仍正常展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7f83b3dd-ac36-4a46-ab04-37b1e356593d","title":"🟡【P2】未绑定电脑时的空态","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"04ec30e8-aa47-4473-ae6e-bcf0e1fbbc40","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"930d0f49-c555-4a3a-adfa-c30e35d94aef","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3f2ad6ef-9af5-4f0b-862a-140d27b6f096","title":"前置：已绑定电脑，但电脑上没装任何 Agent；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：我的 Agent"},{"parent":"930d0f49-c555-4a3a-adfa-c30e35d94aef","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"97b98cf7-8331-402b-bb61-ac0a914c5e99","title":"操作：进入页面查看，再与未绑定电脑时的空态逐字对照"},{"parent":"930d0f49-c555-4a3a-adfa-c30e35d94aef","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"676075ef-88d1-46a3-b2d5-80745521c964","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 我的 Agent 计数为 0 并展示空态\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 文案与未绑定电脑时完全相同，都是「还没有共享agent给别人」\n3) 等价性 ｜ 两种前置下的空态展示一致，不做区分"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"930d0f49-c555-4a3a-adfa-c30e35d94aef","title":"🟡【P2】已绑定电脑但未安装任何 Agent","icons":[{"color":"rgb(248, 87, 103)","name":"other","index":"369"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"04ec30e8-aa47-4473-ae6e-bcf0e1fbbc40","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"60e8cc7f-37ef-4826-8536-9a4374bb2dd3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e62e9d2c-09c7-4b81-b39c-ac8f487c0542","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bf78cd52-5f9c-4a6e-928c-aeb4b1937adc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4365bbba-527a-40c5-aa06-714c043b4568","title":"前置：账号下有很多台电脑、很多个 Agent；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：我的 Agent"},{"parent":"bf78cd52-5f9c-4a6e-928c-aeb4b1937adc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d2d2f2b8-db56-42ed-b59a-bb415ecdc3b2","title":"操作：滚动浏览全部卡片并悬浮其中几个头像"},{"parent":"bf78cd52-5f9c-4a6e-928c-aeb4b1937adc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4c7ca476-f54c-4085-852f-4aabab25051e","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 卡片依次纵向排列，长 Agent 名与长电脑名截断可读\n2) 性能 ｜ 滚动流畅，悬浮信息卡跟随正确的卡片弹出，不错位"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bf78cd52-5f9c-4a6e-928c-aeb4b1937adc","title":"🟡【P2】Agent 很多时的卡片布局"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e62e9d2c-09c7-4b81-b39c-ac8f487c0542","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"60e8cc7f-37ef-4826-8536-9a4374bb2dd3","title":"Agent 卡片与共享入口"},{"parent":"c96471d7-31f8-4ad1-85a3-7c686d7ebda9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c38759e5-1cf2-4d5f-b3f6-54a59f8dbf82","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bbe8be31-2c33-4820-b3ab-8eca66092ad9","title":"说明：额度信息由卡片底部区块改到悬浮 Agent 头像弹出的信息卡里，内容含所在电脑、使用额度套餐、每周额度进度条与剩余百分比、重置时间、更新时间。三种态（有额度数据 / 用量检测失败 / 暂无额度信息）的判定口径不变，只是展示位置变了"},{"parent":"c38759e5-1cf2-4d5f-b3f6-54a59f8dbf82","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b9025236-1384-49b2-ae66-0cdb5160281e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"50c34429-d0fc-4bfa-bea6-045baa690a9c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fe2f5297-3f7d-4593-99f4-bd52ae55e727","title":"前置：某个 Agent 能读取到额度；角色：账号所有者；入口：该 Agent 列底部的使用额度"},{"parent":"50c34429-d0fc-4bfa-bea6-045baa690a9c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b45509c2-3855-4d2c-82e7-7db64b253ccc","title":"操作：查看该区块"},{"parent":"50c34429-d0fc-4bfa-bea6-045baa690a9c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"26bb854d-be5d-4066-8c13-a1fe29595dc3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dbf07e68-e84f-467c-ac81-3a0d49928871","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f06c5ec9-4a32-4322-b509-afc797fa82a3","title":"官方账号","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dbf07e68-e84f-467c-ac81-3a0d49928871","title":"codex"},{"parent":"26bb854d-be5d-4066-8c13-a1fe29595dc3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1a9927da-9e66-403d-862c-66e6dffda041","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7dcc00f0-6583-4239-9851-590e09c787dd","title":"官方账号"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1a9927da-9e66-403d-862c-66e6dffda041","title":"Claude","icons":[{"color":"rgb(248, 87, 103)","name":"other","index":"369"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"26bb854d-be5d-4066-8c13-a1fe29595dc3","title":"预期：\n1) 用量 ｜ 展示套餐名、额度周期（如每周额度）、剩余百分比与进度条\n2) 用量 ｜ 展示重置时间，形如「重置于 9月15日 11:55」\n3) 视觉展示 ｜ 进度条长度与剩余百分比一致，不出现数值与图形不符"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"50c34429-d0fc-4bfa-bea6-045baa690a9c","title":"🔴【P0】有额度数据时的展示","icons":[]},{"parent":"b9025236-1384-49b2-ae66-0cdb5160281e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ef6ae6c0-090d-43e8-a3a1-de9a4de62b45","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c6ade0c5-0257-41e9-9851-a5943662551d","title":"前置：某个 Agent 有额度数据；角色：账号所有者；入口：使用额度区块底部"},{"parent":"ef6ae6c0-090d-43e8-a3a1-de9a4de62b45","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1f5600b5-e2c1-445c-8110-36aed75227b3","title":"操作：查看底部的时效说明"},{"parent":"ef6ae6c0-090d-43e8-a3a1-de9a4de62b45","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4ac7cb6c-c3e2-4af0-bf07-5bff2d2a961d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2725fa15-9f05-46ad-ba41-c82bfea53223","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7d1cffcb-d493-4f03-a95a-6de34f5dd8d8","title":"官方账号","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2725fa15-9f05-46ad-ba41-c82bfea53223","title":"codex"},{"parent":"4ac7cb6c-c3e2-4af0-bf07-5bff2d2a961d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a40862ab-b3a1-49e5-ba07-917f59e86742","title":"Claude"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4ac7cb6c-c3e2-4af0-bf07-5bff2d2a961d","title":"预期：<br>1) 提示文案 ｜ 展示数据的记录时间，形如「更新于 9月8日 20:52」<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ef6ae6c0-090d-43e8-a3a1-de9a4de62b45","title":"🔴【P0】数据时效标注","icons":[]},{"parent":"b9025236-1384-49b2-ae66-0cdb5160281e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"166e483f-9b91-4e6a-a245-9d7ff520b296","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"167c9cf5-3836-46e2-978b-7dda9099f839","title":"前置：Tutti Agent 本身不提供额度信息；角色：账号所有者；入口：该 Agent 列的使用额度"},{"parent":"166e483f-9b91-4e6a-a245-9d7ff520b296","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df103c7f-d8fc-448a-8a71-fcc4e7ed06a1","title":"操作：查看该区块"},{"parent":"166e483f-9b91-4e6a-a245-9d7ff520b296","callout":[