x":"368"}]},{"parent":"61d72ec2-c9ed-4d8b-87a5-d1cf79428ee2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c4aa5723-be4a-42a8-920d-d4c786f2eb90","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c6aa89cf-ac74-4130-9917-82bd66b5a9f4","title":"前置：5 小时和每周窗口均可用"},{"parent":"c4aa5723-be4a-42a8-920d-d4c786f2eb90","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eea2d2cd-2862-4480-bbd0-53da8d370a87","title":"操作：开启两项开关；分别输入 10% 和 20%；点击“保存”"},{"parent":"c4aa5723-be4a-42a8-920d-d4c786f2eb90","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9b27911e-43b6-4096-b2b9-7478b3ac799f","title":"预期：两项配置均保存；任一可用窗口剩余额度小于或等于对应阈值时，暂停后续共享使用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c4aa5723-be4a-42a8-920d-d4c786f2eb90","title":"🔴【P0】同时开启两项额度保护","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"61d72ec2-c9ed-4d8b-87a5-d1cf79428ee2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ce0e43b6-8c20-4d1c-8323-1efd4b406d6a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"634d26b3-8af3-451a-b921-d36f5fc56bc9","title":"前置：额度保护已开启；5 小时剩余 50%，阈值 10%；每周剩余 60%，阈值 20%；共享已开启"},{"parent":"ce0e43b6-8c20-4d1c-8323-1efd4b406d6a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"364f20ea-b5d3-4a63-98b0-d315cf3c9143","title":"操作：共享者进入可用 Room，发起一次 Agent 对话"},{"parent":"ce0e43b6-8c20-4d1c-8323-1efd4b406d6a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bb18829a-9454-482c-a593-0b33bf8cb836","title":"预期：共享者可正常使用 Agent；请求成功，不出现额度保护拦截提示<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ce0e43b6-8c20-4d1c-8323-1efd4b406d6a","title":"🔴【P0】额度高于阈值时允许共享使用","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"61d72ec2-c9ed-4d8b-87a5-d1cf79428ee2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"92d5f588-b148-4ab5-94fc-26853c0874a0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5a27f8b-0a41-41a4-91a3-59c9ea8a65c8","title":"前置：额度保护已开启；任一可用窗口剩余额度小于或等于配置阈值；Agent 已共享给 Room"},{"parent":"92d5f588-b148-4ab5-94fc-26853c0874a0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8f78cde9-ed0a-4083-ac78-627d593a838b","title":"操作：共享者进入可用 Room，尝试发起 Agent 对话"},{"parent":"92d5f588-b148-4ab5-94fc-26853c0874a0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cd003a79-7b8a-4af4-8246-26530213a906","title":"预期：后续共享使用被暂停；共享者无法继续发起该 Agent 请求；悬浮卡片显示“已暂停”或等价状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"92d5f588-b148-4ab5-94fc-26853c0874a0","title":"🔴【P0】共享者触发额度保护后被暂停","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"61d72ec2-c9ed-4d8b-87a5-d1cf79428ee2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"273648cc-4ff4-4182-833e-489c9131fcdd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea069f4f-332d-46d8-8a0b-39f2f1bda9d5","title":"前置：额度保护已触发；共享使用已暂停；Agent 所有者仍登录"},{"parent":"273648cc-4ff4-4182-833e-489c9131fcdd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8c3bfbda-9956-4037-8f07-a3cac5afabc6","title":"操作：Agent 所有者直接使用本人 Agent 发起对话"},{"parent":"273648cc-4ff4-4182-833e-489c9131fcdd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0b9ebd12-3c74-4b06-affc-9eb4d270e49d","title":"预期：所有者本人使用不受额度保护规则限制；额度保护仅限制后续共享使用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"273648cc-4ff4-4182-833e-489c9131fcdd","title":"🔴【P0】额度保护不限制 Agent 所有者本人","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"61d72ec2-c9ed-4d8b-87a5-d1cf79428ee2","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"6d35251c-0ca7-4ac7-b42f-b9e2613c311a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d7979398-807c-4905-b2ef-3222a0560b5d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7ac9fe04-80f2-4134-8c63-fd410424688b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"438cddd8-4aea-4637-aa0a-85bc6f1af1ba","title":"前置：当前 Agent 不支持用量，或 5 小时和每周窗口均未取得有效数据；例如 Tutti Agent"},{"parent":"7ac9fe04-80f2-4134-8c63-fd410424688b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1a95d63f-a1ea-4622-b956-037d8d644800","title":"操作：进入共享管理，查看该 Agent 的使用概览和额度信息"},{"parent":"7ac9fe04-80f2-4134-8c63-fd410424688b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"48e6f373-7917-48e6-8abb-6c5dde947363","title":"预期：不显示“设置额度保护”入口；显示“暂无额度信息”及明确原因；不得伪造显示 0%"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7ac9fe04-80f2-4134-8c63-fd410424688b","title":"🔴【P0】无可用额度窗口时不显示“设置额度保护”主题","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"d7979398-807c-4905-b2ef-3222a0560b5d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2332a5a4-038b-490a-b820-ccd73b49a07b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f2cfa734-b9ef-4e45-af45-8fcf8bb937d9","title":"前置：5 小时窗口有有效数据；每周窗口暂无数据"},{"parent":"2332a5a4-038b-490a-b820-ccd73b49a07b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6188fcdf-15e6-4f76-8c3b-53eba92604a0","title":"操作：打开额度保护设置；尝试开启两项额度保护"},{"parent":"2332a5a4-038b-490a-b820-ccd73b49a07b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8cd6456e-0cc0-4e04-802e-f546deea29e3","title":"预期：5 小时保护可开启和保存；每周保护不可开启，并显示“暂未获取到每周额度，无法开启保护”等说明"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2332a5a4-038b-490a-b820-ccd73b49a07b","title":"🟠【P1】仅部分额度窗口可用时允许配置对应保护","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"d7979398-807c-4905-b2ef-3222a0560b5d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e36af6c7-33d1-48fa-9248-1cc73f2495a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"909c6d32-e514-40d1-8771-2697df29433f","title":"前置：额度保护已配置；额度服务请求超时、返回错误或数据暂时缺失"},{"parent":"e36af6c7-33d1-48fa-9248-1cc73f2495a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0c2e004d-56e7-4005-84ba-37fd71e43e1d","title":"操作：刷新共享管理页面，观察 Agent 状态并尝试共享使用"},{"parent":"e36af6c7-33d1-48fa-9248-1cc73f2495a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3b2e1f21-c754-4c99-84f7-bfa5dc3976b5","title":"预期：页面明确显示额度数据暂不可用；不将缺失数据当作 0%；不误暂停或误恢复共享使用；保留可追踪的错误状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e36af6c7-33d1-48fa-9248-1cc73f2495a4","title":"🟠【P1】额度数据获取失败时不误触发保护","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"d7979398-807c-4905-b2ef-3222a0560b5d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a326ce69-9d3d-491c-8565-85e58b48a4a9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7107ace4-b41d-4401-a09a-b49e093f71db","title":"前置：额度保护设置弹窗已打开；模拟保存接口失败或网络中断"},{"parent":"a326ce69-9d3d-491c-8565-85e58b48a4a9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"78394301-5c3a-46e0-b422-0549b7e5f88f","title":"操作：设置有效阈值并点击“保存”"},{"parent":"a326ce69-9d3d-491c-8565-85e58b48a4a9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4305180b-1936-437b-943c-16b415f0642d","title":"预期：提示保存失败；弹窗保留用户输入；悬浮卡片不显示新的已配置或已暂停状态；刷新后仍为保存前状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a326ce69-9d3d-491c-8565-85e58b48a4a9","title":"🟠【P1】保存额度保护配置失败","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"d7979398-807c-4905-b2ef-3222a0560b5d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f844e84c-79fe-455e-ac6c-37ef2aa27a08","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"83d71ef9-2b48-4cd2-a0fb-fa0a6a90dc95","title":"前置：额度保护已配置；Room 共享开关当前关闭，或模拟共享开关接口失败"},{"parent":"f844e84c-79fe-455e-ac6c-37ef2aa27a08","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f875852a-43e2-44a3-8384-8101eafa1fa9","title":"操作：关闭共享开关，或尝试开启共享但接口返回失败；刷新页面"},{"parent":"f844e84c-79fe-455e-ac6c-37ef2aa27a08","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b275593b-d296-4c33-93d6-009bee390f19","title":"预期：共享状态以服务端结果为准；不存在乐观状态残留；未实际共享的 Room 不显示“共享已暂停”或共享额度保护生效状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f844e84c-79fe-455e-ac6c-37ef2aa27a08","title":"🟠【P1】共享开关关闭或失败时不残留额度保护状态","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d7979398-807c-4905-b2ef-3222a0560b5d","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"6d35251c-0ca7-4ac7-b42f-b9e2613c311a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2c0016de-3307-44c0-b4c6-7480241f2754","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c47f4d1f-bc84-49b9-9dc0-a314630c76e7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ee120cc5-2a8c-48ab-a101-e28238a393e7","title":"前置：5 小时窗口可用；额度保护设置弹窗已打开"},{"parent":"c47f4d1f-bc84-49b9-9dc0-a314630c76e7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4bd23c1-cdc3-49ac-bc5d-e5220cb04252","title":"操作：开启 5 小时保护；输入 1%；点击“保存”"},{"parent":"c47f4d1f-bc84-49b9-9dc0-a314630c76e7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ddbfb1c6-69a6-49d3-a7e5-d51b9cb43924","title":"预期：保存成功；剩余额度小于或等于 1% 时暂停共享使用<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c47f4d1f-bc84-49b9-9dc0-a314630c76e7","title":"🔴【P0】5 小时保留比例输入下限 1%"},{"parent":"2c0016de-3307-44c0-b4c6-7480241f2754","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c70296eb-1152-49f1-b345-b6f93214bac9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3241048e-43b3-4352-b51f-d61a74c54c94","title":"前置：每周窗口可用；额度保护设置弹窗已打开"},{"parent":"c70296eb-1152-49f1-b345-b6f93214bac9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"67ef3ed3-d91a-47e2-a335-a7980870234e","title":"操作：开启每周保护；输入 99%；点击“保存”"},{"parent":"c70296eb-1152-49f1-b345-b6f93214bac9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"10d1b266-b097-473a-b2a6-7545da56b25e","title":"预期：保存成功；剩余额度小于或等于 99% 时暂停共享使用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c70296eb-1152-49f1-b345-b6f93214bac9","title":"🔴【P0】每周保留比例输入上限 99%","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"2c0016de-3307-44c0-b4c6-7480241f2754","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"78209644-c0b5-4e4f-b132-a9c8e30ecaee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8219334b-2510-4fee-8572-07c1f5eec22c","title":"前置：额度保护设置弹窗已打开"},{"parent":"78209644-c0b5-4e4f-b132-a9c8e30ecaee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"765ffcd4-1e3c-4478-bbad-fcc32d189722","title":"操作：分别输入 0%、100% 或其他超出范围的数值"},{"parent":"78209644-c0b5-4e4f-b132-a9c8e30ecaee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"00eb0e74-9c55-41b5-9307-fec186a69a14","title":"预期：提示取值范围为 1–99%；禁止保存非法值；不修改已保存配置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"78209644-c0b5-4e4f-b132-a9c8e30ecaee","title":"🟠【P1】输入 0% 或 100% 时校验","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"2c0016de-3307-44c0-b4c6-7480241f2754","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"52bcdd08-9ada-4941-a8b0-f8cecf70f32e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d14e4e0d-10d6-4608-a72c-4fa038153490","title":"前置：额度保护设置弹窗已打开"},{"parent":"52bcdd08-9ada-4941-a8b0-f8cecf70f32e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4f7cc3d6-5a6e-45df-90dc-97be39f54193","title":"操作：输入 -1、1.5、字母、特殊字符、空值或超长数字"},{"parent":"52bcdd08-9ada-4941-a8b0-f8cecf70f32e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4cdd20d8-c56d-44cd-957a-d10a09742ebf","title":"预期：输入框按产品规则限制或提示校验错误；禁止保存无效配置；页面不崩溃"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"52bcdd08-9ada-4941-a8b0-f8cecf70f32e","title":"🟠【P1】输入非整数、负数、字母和空值","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"2c0016de-3307-44c0-b4c6-7480241f2754","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"83b2dc06-84b1-4bf5-b181-35506dc04697","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"280704b1-945c-442c-a05d-fd88acc7a58c","title":"前置：5 小时保护阈值为 10%；5 小时窗口剩余额度恰好为 10%"},{"parent":"83b2dc06-84b1-4bf5-b181-35506dc04697","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"db2e0093-1ff0-417e-89da-8e249428fc6f","title":"操作：共享者发起 Agent 对话"},{"parent":"83b2dc06-84b1-4bf5-b181-35506dc04697","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4d44dd07-7346-47ee-b203-e82bcf0e42a4","title":"预期：按照“小于或等于”规则暂停共享使用，不允许请求继续执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"83b2dc06-84b1-4bf5-b181-35506dc04697","title":"🔴【P0】剩余额度等于阈值时触发暂停","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"2c0016de-3307-44c0-b4c6-7480241f2754","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5c4b7439-d40b-427f-a2ea-a34d530c732f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c6a5e9f4-413c-472c-be62-ca5e24cff52e","title":"前置：5 小时保护阈值为 10%；5 小时窗口剩余额度为 10.01%"},{"parent":"5c4b7439-d40b-427f-a2ea-a34d530c732f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9fddbc16-3ae3-411a-ac8f-1b43f59b5af9","title":"操作：共享者发起 Agent 对话"},{"parent":"5c4b7439-d40b-427f-a2ea-a34d530c732f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"965a5ca5-da75-4fd0-8ad9-4f2ec0d10154","title":"预期：共享请求允许执行，不触发额度保护暂停<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5c4b7439-d40b-427f-a2ea-a34d530c732f","title":"🔴【P0】剩余额度高于阈值 0.01% 时不触发暂停<br>","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"2c0016de-3307-44c0-b4c6-7480241f2754","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2766f652-cbb1-4a52-8973-f468bbd0463d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4f84631-5084-4e3f-bbfb-0655ebbcf310","title":"前置：5 小时剩余 5%，阈值 10%；每周剩余 50%，阈值 20%"},{"parent":"2766f652-cbb1-4a52-8973-f468bbd0463d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9174204c-a26d-4494-9050-dc6df1966cfb","title":"操作：共享者发起 Agent 对话"},{"parent":"2766f652-cbb1-4a52-8973-f468bbd0463d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"33255bef-b47a-4e93-962f-df9328d9b16c","title":"预期：因任一可用窗口低于或等于阈值，暂停共享使用；页面明确展示触发保护的窗口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2766f652-cbb1-4a52-8973-f468bbd0463d","title":"🟠【P1】两个窗口分别处于不同阈值状态<br>","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"2c0016de-3307-44c0-b4c6-7480241f2754","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"83e3b89f-72c2-46f2-9896-7ff5303df01d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"36508b01-6be0-44c9-9445-45ac98b44ea1","title":"前置：此前因 5 小时窗口触发保护而暂停；每周窗口已高于阈值"},{"parent":"83e3b89f-72c2-46f2-9896-7ff5303df01d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6d6f944c-2608-4542-b57a-34a5bd153fce","title":"操作：将 5 小时窗口恢复到阈值以上；共享者重新发起对话"},{"parent":"83e3b89f-72c2-46f2-9896-7ff5303df01d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"14ca522e-cbdb-44a5-8e4b-2218a434098c","title":"预期：共享使用需要手动恢复；配置手动开启；悬浮卡片更新为已配置或可共享状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"83e3b89f-72c2-46f2-9896-7ff5303df01d","title":"🟠【P1】两个窗口均恢复到阈值以上","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"2c0016de-3307-44c0-b4c6-7480241f2754","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"836971e1-086a-42e6-9db5-01ce14babd4a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7b071697-ec3d-433b-ac7a-0d2230961def","title":"前置：5 小时和每周保护均已开启并保存"},{"parent":"836971e1-086a-42e6-9db5-01ce14babd4a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1b6f41ec-7281-46b9-86a7-fb1d5781021d","title":"操作：关闭 5 小时保护，保留每周保护；点击“保存”"},{"parent":"836971e1-086a-42e6-9db5-01ce14babd4a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"99777fb2-3406-498a-af00-77e76e1b3b41","title":"预期：5 小时阈值不再参与拦截；每周保护仍生效；配置展示准确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"836971e1-086a-42e6-9db5-01ce14babd4a","title":"🟠【P1】关闭单项保护不影响另一项保护","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"2c0016de-3307-44c0-b4c6-7480241f2754","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"42fd775b-df61-4cfc-8b56-d76a2bbb2886","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"61a15547-c212-49aa-8bba-f63c431fa567","title":"前置：已有已保存配置；额度保护设置弹窗已打开"},{"parent":"42fd775b-df61-4cfc-8b56-d76a2bbb2886","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09f99c24-947d-4184-85ad-8587cf01f934","title":"操作：修改开关或比例；点击“取消”或右上角关闭按钮"},{"parent":"42fd775b-df61-4cfc-8b56-d76a2bbb2886","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dec1202e-f9bc-46ad-909f-877af97041c9","title":"预期：弹窗关闭；修改内容不生效；重新打开弹窗时展示原已保存配置，悬浮卡片状态不改变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"42fd775b-df61-4cfc-8b56-d76a2bbb2886","title":"🟠【P1】取消、关闭弹窗不保存修改","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 19