letion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"79c70e20-b419-4787-96b3-9f140a0d08ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7a624d64-a23e-4c0e-8fbb-d999b3fcc381","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"279c7afb-e7c8-447f-81ab-c01a503edf42","title":"前置：房间已改过名称；角色：房主；入口：复制邀请信息按钮"},{"parent":"7a624d64-a23e-4c0e-8fbb-d999b3fcc381","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"851cd059-056c-4860-84ad-f87cee38e611","title":"操作：改名后立即复制邀请信息"},{"parent":"7a624d64-a23e-4c0e-8fbb-d999b3fcc381","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e1eceb2b-b03c-4705-bc0d-43d394b678cb","title":"预期：\n1) 分享链接 ｜ 邀请信息中的房间名为最新保存的名称\n2) 分享链接 ｜ 房间链接保持不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7a624d64-a23e-4c0e-8fbb-d999b3fcc381","title":"🔴【P0】改名后复制取最新名称","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"79c70e20-b419-4787-96b3-9f140a0d08ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a4fc7f5b-e7f3-4309-84cc-bd26e171085b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"afefd25a-ea57-4046-9bef-fa4ea4512423","title":"前置：房间已改过密码；角色：房主与新成员；入口：复制邀请信息按钮"},{"parent":"a4fc7f5b-e7f3-4309-84cc-bd26e171085b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dca2c7c2-46c4-4da3-b0f9-49b77439ef32","title":"操作：改密码后复制邀请信息，让新成员分别用其中的密码与旧密码加入"},{"parent":"a4fc7f5b-e7f3-4309-84cc-bd26e171085b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4605dfa3-61ef-4030-a756-f0de27d2fd9d","title":"预期：\n1) 分享链接 ｜ 邀请信息中的密码为新密码\n2) 权限授权 ｜ 新密码可成功加入，旧密码无法加入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a4fc7f5b-e7f3-4309-84cc-bd26e171085b","title":"🔴【P0】改密码后复制取新密码","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"79c70e20-b419-4787-96b3-9f140a0d08ac","title":"正常场景","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"7e029b1f-8446-4859-8865-5d5d98fa4ea2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fde7d7f5-167f-4dd7-ab58-50d1b388f486","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3d32b987-0543-468c-8db9-9fd9339354a7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5bb58380-14e5-4b30-a58f-5f5857871a0c","title":"前置：浏览器已拒绝该站点的剪贴板权限；角色：房主；入口：复制邀请信息按钮"},{"parent":"3d32b987-0543-468c-8db9