-b08235c5308b","title":"🔴【P0】默认全部类型","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"088df6ba-c24a-4602-897c-8d2c243ed325","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ad23fb35-eb50-475f-b699-a0db793177fe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2e1381ba-a13d-4e93-b607-c59ee7a80c6e","title":"前置：当前 tab 下有文档、图片、视频等多种类型；角色：任意用户；入口：类型切换"},{"parent":"ad23fb35-eb50-475f-b699-a0db793177fe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b4fbce2e-fedf-4f30-b0a3-9afe89fcbc6c","title":"操作：依次选择不同类型，文档/图片/视频/网页/其他"},{"parent":"ad23fb35-eb50-475f-b699-a0db793177fe","customWidth":740,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ada8ed8b-509d-4ae1-bd78-11d3d16689cc","title":"预期：<br>1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 列表只展示所选类型，数量与实际相符<br>2) 搜索筛选 ｜ 切回全部类型后恢复完整列表<br><br><b>类型分类：</b><br>全部 不传类型条件 所有文件；允许目录的列表也包含目录<br>文档 document + spreadsheet + presentation + pdf + markdown doc docm docx odt pages rtf txt；csv numbers ods tsv xls&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; xlsm xlsx；key odp ppt pptm pptx；pdf；md markdown mdx<br>图片 image avif bmp gif heic heif ico jpeg jpg png svg tif tiff webp<br>视频 video 3gp avi flv m4v mkv mov mp4 mpeg mpg webm wmv<br>网页 website htm html mhtml url webloc xhtml<br>其他 audio + code + other 见下面说明<br><b><br>其他</b>：<br>音频 aac flac m4a mp3 oga ogg opus wav wma<br>代码 c cc cpp cs css cxx go h hpp java js json jsx kt kts lua php pl py rb rs sh sql swift toml ts tsx vue xml yaml yml<br>压缩包 当前没有单独的展示分类，zip rar 7z tar gz 等最终落入 other<br>未识别文件 扩展名不在分类表中的文件<br>无扩展名文件 例如 LICENSE、Makefile<br>目录 支持目录的资产列表里，目录被归为 other"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ad23fb35-eb50-475f-b699-a0db793177fe","title":"🔴【P0】按类型筛选","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"088df6ba-c24a-4602-897c-8d2c243ed325","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"2a8318a5-5aea-4de1-a0df-5bb8bc23f2c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e02752a8-837c-425a-a7f9-30437fbd6747","title":"前置：已进入某个 tab；角色：任意用户；入口：工具栏的视图切换按钮"},{"parent":"2a8318a5-5aea-4de1-a0df-5bb8bc23f2c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aa5b907c