ts 的静态网站并交付，完成后查看产物 tab"},{"parent":"4e7d392f-c7b8-4c61-a348-cf2c2a22627a","customWidth":515.4,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3a5671bc-a716-40ec-8054-dd355b87dac8","title":"预期：<br>1）列表展示 ｜ 按产品定义以整个产品（文件夹）为一个条目展示，而不是把内部文件平铺成多条<br>2）目录导航 ｜ 双击可进入查看内部文件结构，与工作区中的实际结构一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4e7d392f-c7b8-4c61-a348-cf2c2a22627a","title":"🔴【P0】交付文件夹或多文件产品","icons":[{"color":"rgb(248, 87, 103)","name":"other","index":"369"}]},{"parent":"214405d8-ccb2-4d5f-9f87-7cd96943c5d9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7c3b2e8c-6ae3-46d6-b75d-743580a1b258","customWidth":463.4,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f80f3876-9899-44f8-9d81-d39bd43f2a0e","title":"前置：会话中已完成过一次交付；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"7c3b2e8c-6ae3-46d6-b75d-743580a1b258","customWidth":430.4,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd7c67d2-182d-4d78-a2a1-e487bdc05821","title":"操作：在同一会话中继续追加需求，让 Agent 再次交付一版报告"},{"parent":"7c3b2e8c-6ae3-46d6-b75d-743580a1b258","customWidth":527.4,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7ebc4fee-7730-40fb-8f4d-f177d14aeb73","title":"预期：<br>1）列表展示 ｜ 两次交付都进入产物 tab，可区分先后，均展示在该会话下<br>2）结果校验 ｜ 同名文件按产品定义生成新版本或覆盖，行为一致不随机；覆盖时修改时间更新为最新一次"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7c3b2e8c-6ae3-46d6-b75d-743580a1b258","title":"🟠【P1】同一会话多轮交付","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"214405d8-ccb2-4d5f-9f87-7cd96943c5d9","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"f2f3e6be-56cf-49ba-b3a2-b6e4df57c8e4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3b5788ce-fd86-4e28-a5bf-cd75de8ba169","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"76677d81-0810-4a4c-9231-971f0694dd12","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2c9bb9b4-d31c-443e-b02c-9a27e0084417","title":"前置：曾在某房间产出与分享过文件，随后退出该房间；角色：曾经的房间成员；入口：产物 tab"},{"parent":"76677d81-0810-4a4c-9231-971f0694dd12","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e563698-e5c4-4c8f-a273-a42591574452","title":"操作：查看列表中是否还有该房间的文件"},{"parent":"76677d81-0810-4a4c-9231-971f0694dd12","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eedefef3-ec93-4ae0-bfb0-bff21b093db6","title":"预期：\n1) 权限授权 ｜ 该房间下的文件不再在资产页展示，包括 Agent 产出的与已分享的\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不出现列表中可见但点击报错的条目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"76677d81-0810-4a4c-9231-971f0694dd12","title":"🔴【P0】成员退出房间后该房间的文件不再展示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(248, 87, 103)","name":"other","index":"369"}]},{"parent":"3b5788ce-fd86-4e28-a5bf-cd75de8ba169","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a2ad5104-4743-435e-8d1b-e2307ffc0a21","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a23d1f49-213a-4c71-a0cc-c5de6f0c261c","title":"前置：曾在某房间产出与分享过文件，随后删除该房间；角色：房主；入口：产物 tab"},{"parent":"a2ad5104-4743-435e-8d1b-e2307ffc0a21","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"58a7b4b5-41ca-47ee-aee8-13a8a4a9e7eb","title":"操作：查看列表中是否还有该房间的文件"},{"parent":"a2ad5104-4743-435e-8d1b-e2307ffc0a21","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6b47faf0-3a3d-49c4-a4ae-2f3d8bcf92cb","title":"预期：\n1) 权限授权 ｜ 该房间下的文件不再在资产页展示，包括 Agent 产出的与已分享的\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不出现列表中可见但点击报错的条目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a2ad5104-4743-435e-8d1b-e2307ffc0a21","title":"🔴【P0】房主删除房间后该房间的文件不再展示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(248, 87, 103)","name":"other","index":"369"}]},{"parent":"3b5788ce-fd86-4e28-a5bf-cd75de8ba169","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b7eb3c8c-6f0a-4645-a78b-27cb63b6775c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eb19026d-c6ca-4e42-8dda-a62c73bc5b6d","title":"前置：会话已绑定项目；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"b7eb3c8c-6f0a-4645-a78b-27cb63b6775c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8f598b0c-49d7-492f-ba5c-02ab1e8cb214","title":"操作：构造一个中途执行失败的任务，失败后查看产物 tab"},{"parent":"b7eb3c8c-6f0a-4645-a78b-27cb63b6775c","customWidth":470.4,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"33a25163-23f3-400f-ad27-a400444b0de1","title":"预期：<br>1）列表展示 ｜ 不产生任何产物条目<br>2）副作用 ｜ 失败前生成的半成品文件留在工作区，不被当作交付物收集"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b7eb3c8c-6f0a-4645-a78b-27cb63b6775c","title":"🟠【P1】任务失败时不产生产物","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"3b5788ce-fd86-4e28-a5bf-cd75de8ba169","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c324a312-ae64-44e6-bcd9-cf6729232b7b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"65ef154e-1994-45ec-9bff-5ce79a96e9a9","title":"前置：Agent 正在执行会产出文件的任务；角色：房间成员；入口：会话的停止按钮"},{"parent":"c324a312-ae64-44e6-bcd9-cf6729232b7b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c5c7973a-23f9-4e31-9c14-06648bb35e19","title":"操作：在交付动作发生前取消任务，查看产物 tab"},{"parent":"c324a312-ae64-44e6-bcd9-cf6729232b7b","customWidth":439.4,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3f16cdb0-1df5-4f43-8e5f-e4e84f3b5b09","title":"预期：<br>1）列表展示 ｜ 不产生产物条目<br>2）副作用 ｜ 已写入工作区的半成品不被自动收集，也不被自动删除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c324a312-ae64-44e6-bcd9-cf6729232b7b","title":"🟠【P1】任务被用户取消时不产生产物","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"3b5788ce-fd86-4e28-a5bf-cd75de8ba169","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d925e6f6-5d18-4036-a14b-8b2a1b94892b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"39d62911-080f-46e9-a087-2767292d816d","title":"前置：会话已建立；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"d925e6f6-5d18-4036-a14b-8b2a1b94892b","customWidth":449.4,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"65d0cb50-9e44-444c-831d-92468bb8f8cc","title":"操作：发送一个纯问答型问题（如「解释一下这个项目的架构」），完成后查看产物 tab"},{"parent":"d925e6f6-5d18-4036-a14b-8b2a1b94892b","customWidth":439.4,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"40f67fd0-7aa9-474b-b24e-1e241409d898","title":"预期：<br>1）列表展示 ｜ 不产生产物条目，纯文本回答不被收集为产物"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d925e6f6-5d18-4036-a14b-8b2a1b94892b","title":"🔴【P0】Agent 只回答不产文件","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"3b5788ce-fd86-4e28-a5bf-cd75de8ba169","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"df070750-46ed-4c86-b0c9-4c35c63e68a6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e4202c0f-58ca-4a9c-9180-00592006026e","title":"前置：Agent 在交付前该文件已被删除或路径错误；角色：房间成员；入口：会话"},{"parent":"df070750-46ed-4c86-b0c9-4c35c63e68a6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1022be57-1663-45e1-ab53-87efc6ed7b71","title":"操作：等任务结束后查看产物 tab 与会话中的交付结果"},{"parent":"df070750-46ed-4c86-b0c9-4c35c63e68a6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"497611c6-b2d3-492a-9575-6644e1507cce","title":"预期：<br>1）提示文案 ｜ 会话中给出该文件交付失败的明确说明，指出是哪一个文件<br>2）副作用 ｜ 产物 tab 不出现无法打开的空条目<br>3）列表展示 ｜ 同批次中其他有效文件正常交付，不因一个失败而全部丢弃"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"df070750-46ed-4c86-b0c9-4c35c63e68a6","title":"🟠【P1】交付了不存在或已被删除的文件","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"3b5788ce-fd86-4e28-a5bf-cd75de8ba169","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d74139e9-5a27-423f-9e5c-61495e70f640","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c0210015-8233-462b-9a74-484b450e3e0c","title":"前置：Agent 在同一次任务中对同一个文件发起两次交付；角色：房间成员；入口：会话"},{"parent":"d74139e9-5a27-423f-9e5c-61495e70f640","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"00d7f3cb-0044-4b16-ac89-21fd0f6d2d22","title":"操作：任务完成后查看产物 tab"},{"parent":"d74139e9-5a27-423f-9e5c-61495e70f640","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"809477f9-7a17-4b4c-a906-82dbe41991c7","title":"预期：<br>1）副作用 ｜ 按唯一标识去重，产物 tab 中只出现一条"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d74139e9-5a27-423f-9e5c-61495e70f640","title":"🟡【P2】重复交付同一文件","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"3b5788ce-fd86-4e28-a5bf-cd75de8ba169","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"15a13ad6-7714-46e7-a33d-f9ce54e45edf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a3186046-d817-4854-ab89-2a44274719f2","title":"前置：某产物对应的源文件在房间工作区被删除；角色：房间成员；入口：产物 tab"},{"parent":"15a13ad6-7714-46e7-a33d-f9ce54e45edf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1e6d7314-d428-4142-a005-329f23852387","title":"操作：查看该产物条目并点击打开"},{"parent":"15a13ad6-7714-46e7-a33d-f9ce54e45edf","customWidth":424.4,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e9a6aee-9906-4cbe-8c2d-3b568595c5a4","title":"预期：<br>1）列表展示 ｜ 条目按产品定义同步移除或标记为源文件已删除<br>2）提示文案 ｜ 点击时提示文件已不存在，不打开空白预览"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"15a13ad6-7714-46e7-a33d-f9ce54e45edf","title":"🟡【P2】在工作区删除源文件后的产物条目","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"3b5788ce-fd86-4e28-a5bf-cd75de8ba169","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8402ec05-bf9d-4886-8bc8-a4d331ec746b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5183d10f-2522-4d93-b0ed-cac9cb23150c","title":"前置：某产物对应的源文件在工作区被 Agent 或用户修改；角色：房间成员；入口：产物 tab"},{"parent":"8402ec05-bf9d-4886-8bc8-a4d331ec746b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e5fcb7f5-38bb-4d91-8f8c-a6a934872bff","title":"操作：打开该产物查看内容与修改时间"},{"parent":"8402ec05-bf9d-4886-8bc8-a4d331ec746b","customWidth":416.4,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0fe8bb2f-1177-417f-b22f-dea58402b09e","title":"预期：<br>1）结果校验 ｜ 产物内容与修改时间的口径明确：跟随源文件实时更新，或固化为交付那一刻的快照，两者择一且行为一致<br>2）视觉展示 ｜ 若为快照，界面上能看出这是交付时的版本"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8402ec05-bf9d-4886-8bc8-a4d331ec746b","title":"🟠【P1】在工作区修改源文件后的产物内容","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"3b5788ce-fd86-4e28-a5bf-cd75de8ba169","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d197d962-7f6c-4ca8-84c7-3f0a98ae9247","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5afb88b3-f261-4697-aecb-36a3af483ed4","title":"前置：产物 tab 中有一个交付物；角色：房间成员；入口：产物 tab 的删除操作"},{"parent":"d197d962-7f6c-4ca8-84c7-3f0a98ae9247","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a3508e3b-8d13-4240-86c0-f03d90bff5df","title":"操作：删除该产物，随后查看房间工作区文件"},{"parent":"d197d962-7f6c-4ca8-84c7-3f0a98ae9247","customWidth":440.4,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0f4bdeb8-5edc-4ac7-9a97-719cb92b977f","title":"预期：<br>1）列表展示 ｜ 产物 tab 中该条目移除<br>2）结果校验 ｜ 是否同时删除工作区源文件按产品定义执行，删除前的确认文案要说清影响范围"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d197d962-7f6c-4ca8-84c7-3f0a98ae9247","title":"🟠【P1】在产物 tab 删除产物","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3b5788ce-fd86-4e28-a5bf-cd75de8ba169","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"f2f3e6be-56cf-49ba-b3a2-b6e4df57c8e4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"971e9cb8-d812-4ed0-9bfa-f71c07730398","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"54e8551f-faa5-4f13-8cff-0bf55ff1cc0b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"191c5215-d767-491d-87bc-b68e51cbedca","title":"前置：任务会产出 50 个以上成果文件；角色：房间成员；入口：会话"},{"parent":"54e8551f-faa5-4f13-8cff-0bf55ff1cc0b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1096bd53-b60c-42c6-ae43-8e20807126bc","title":"操作：完成后查看产物 tab"},{"parent":"54e8551f-faa5-4f13-8cff-0bf55ff1cc0b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"67434927-ef0b-4d01-a341-a8bb42a3baf5","title":"预期：<br>1）列表展示 ｜ 数量与实际交付数一致，不重复不遗漏<br>2）性能 ｜ 列表加载与滚动流畅，不卡死"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"54e8551f-faa5-4f13-8cff-0bf55ff1cc0b","title":"🟡【P2】一次交付大量文件","icons":[{"c