0】分享给我的数据来源"},{"parent":"8feb553a-c72e-44ec-becf-1936a97c893c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f2caff81-6658-407a-8050-269731f5b8a3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a87a6f82-469d-4e13-869c-45af741152a0","title":"前置：用户有A/B/C房间，A/B/C房间只有自己分享过文件和文件夹，无成员分享；角色：任意用户；入口：分享给我的 tab"},{"parent":"f2caff81-6658-407a-8050-269731f5b8a3","customWidth":148.2,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"beea2078-9f2d-4014-b720-a8ec411e2df0","title":"操作：查看列表内容"},{"parent":"f2caff81-6658-407a-8050-269731f5b8a3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a848e812-1f38-49ea-afe0-1b9b49951fc8","title":"预期：<br>1) 列表展示 ｜ 不展示文件<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f2caff81-6658-407a-8050-269731f5b8a3","title":"🔴【P0】自己分享的文件不展示"},{"parent":"8feb553a-c72e-44ec-becf-1936a97c893c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"21665630-1c4d-4aca-a0ee-821ea2eb9b00","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"973b69b3-eec0-465c-a0b5-7d317090766a","title":"前置：已分享的文件设置了不同的可见范围；角色：任意用户；入口：分享给我的 tab"},{"parent":"21665630-1c4d-4aca-a0ee-821ea2eb9b00","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3799b68a-cbd2-412a-9db3-80d302059080","title":"操作：查看每行右侧的权限标识"},{"parent":"21665630-1c4d-4aca-a0ee-821ea2eb9b00","customWidth":452.2,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"508a1623-f026-436f-b47d-a342070947f6","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 每行展示该文件当前的可见范围说明，与分享时所选一致\n2) 持久化 ｜ 在分享弹窗中改过范围后，此处标识同步更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"21665630-1c4d-4aca-a0ee-821ea2eb9b00","title":"🔴【P0】展示当前可见范围"},{"parent":"8feb553a-c72e-44ec-becf-1936a97c893c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"21fbc36b-6c10-4531-91d0-38c3d96d5253","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"01111d85-67d3-48d0-a79c-75a6c74bce35","title":"前置：某文件已分享；角色：任意用户；入口：分享弹窗"},{"parent":"21fbc36b-6c10-4531-91d0-38c3d96d5253","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0d342c76-75e1-4406-aeee-f7a7ad9c1a87","title":"操作：成员把该文件的可见范围改为只有我"},{"parent":"21fbc36b-6c10-4531-91d0-38c3d96d5253","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"96defd55-1641-4a94-9105-d1365d214eb9","title":"预期：<br>1) 列表展示 ｜ 按产品定义从我分享的列表移除<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"21fbc36b-6c10-4531-91d0-38c3d96d5253","title":"🟠【P1】取消分享后从列表移除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8feb553a-c72e-44ec-becf-1936a97c893c","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"12df3b17-f672-42ab-a5fb-be3660670cfe","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ecb8f608-425f-45e9-82f2-706b8ab6458a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6de1cbe3-5ebf-4c6b-a3fc-5e614a01015a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"caed95d5-4430-4cc2-bb03-442ed1c30433","title":"前置：已分享的文件在房间中被删除；角色：任意用户；入口：我分享的 tab"},{"parent":"6de1cbe3-5ebf-4c6b-a3fc-5e614a01015a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5309eea3-d9c0-4990-b496-12d2ed0f99b7","title":"操作：查看该条目并点击打开"},{"parent":"6de1cbe3-5ebf-4c6b-a3fc-5e614a01015a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7b879ad-ce0c-4442-b75e-b3efe03afba6","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 条目被移除或标记为源文件已删除\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 点击时提示文件已不存在，不打开空白预览"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6de1cbe3-5ebf-4c6b-a3fc-5e614a01015a","title":"🟠【P1】分享的源文件被删除"},{"parent":"ecb8f608-425f-45e9-82f2-706b8ab6458a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"12ebefbc-def7-4a7b-8698-2b070a3abca8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b83e2664-0cd6-40c7-9d72-8f098cf4f6a5","title":"前置：曾在某房间产出与分享过文件，随后退出该房间；角色：曾经的房间成员；入口：我分享的 tab"},{"parent":"12ebefbc-def7-4a7b-8698-2b070a3abca8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e277603a-1ac4-42b2-9692-0746f3bf29de","title":"操作：查看列表中是否还有该房间的文件"},{"parent":"12ebefbc-def7-4a7b-8698-2b070a3abca8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8981cb0d-1516-4a2e-af5a-94f7f26c73e9","title":"预期：\n1) 权限授权 ｜ 该房间下的文件不再在资产页展示，包括 Agent 产出的与已分享的\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不出现列表中可见但点击报错的条目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"12ebefbc-def7-4a7b-8698-2b070a3abca8","title":"🔴【P0】成员退出房间后该房间的文件不再展示"},{"parent":"ecb8f608-425f-45e9-82f2-706b8ab6458a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"28b8c01d-5c4c-460f-8216-848f1b12e02f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"30bc80ea-aa74-46fb-8ffc-007f502c0e03","title":"前置：曾在某房间产出与分享过文件，随后删除该房间；角色：房主；入口：我分享的 tab"},{"parent":"28b8c01d-5c4c-460f-8216-848f1b12e02f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4c9bd766-d731-4bf6-8215-a55fa814dd96","title":"操作：查看列表中是否还有该房间的文件"},{"parent":"28b8c01d-5c4c-460f-8216-848f1b12e02f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"048fe1bb-7638-48d0-9583-820292497c61","title":"预期：\n1) 权限授权 ｜ 该房间下的文件不再在资产页展示，包括 Agent 产出的与已分享的\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不出现列表中可见但点击报错的条目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"28b8c01d-5c4c-460f-8216-848f1b12e02f","title":"🔴【P0】房主删除房间后该房间的文件不再展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ecb8f608-425f-45e9-82f2-706b8ab6458a","title":"异常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"12df3b17-f672-42ab-a5fb-be3660670cfe","title":"分享给我的 tab 差异"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4413a03b-40aa-46dd-a5e8-3faac11dbba5","title":"My Assets · 分享给我的 tab"},{"parent":"b204cbb8-8c1e-4555-9b5f-4e3b89c7f664","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"33bab9ff-8094-46e2-915e-14bbf584f1f5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5bc96581-76cd-4851-9ff9-5b0b9ee05f9f","title":"说明：分享弹窗从Agent产物tab、我分享过的tab按钮进入，内容一致，本子模块只写一套"},{"parent":"33bab9ff-8094-46e2-915e-14bbf584f1f5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7d17a25e-d421-4262-b4bd-c41ee1bf60e2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"79d45775-2261-42ef-af5c-117b7d9fa29e","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"b446f885-1a75-4be9-99e7-1b8fc81227e2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f0ae4a6a-974f-4dc8-9f3d-9ee534f636f5","title":"前置：产物区或工作区文件列表中存在待分享的文件；角色：房间成员；入口：产物悬浮的分享按钮或我分享的悬浮按钮"},{"parent":"b446f885-1a75-4be9-99e7-1b8fc81227e2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5463dd1d-59c2-40ff-8418-a3941a0f9546","title":"操作：点击分享"},{"parent":"b446f885-1a75-4be9-99e7-1b8fc81227e2","customWidth":452,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"167cfa3b-4ca2-4ea6-90e5-69b9d38e27a2","title":"预期：<br>1) 分享链接 ｜ 弹出分享弹窗，展示可见范围选项与分享按钮<br>2) 关联会话 ｜ 弹窗中展示该文件的关联会话模块，可选我的 和 其他成员的会话"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"b446f885-1a75-4be9-99e7-1b8fc81227e2","title":"🔴【P0】打开分享弹窗"},{"parent":"79d45775-2261-42ef-af5c-117b7d9fa29e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6fd4b860-5bc3-43ba-9f10-7989ca5cc7c5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dcddb417-d2e1-41bf-a0b2-8363c286dc32","title":"前置：同一个文件同时出现在产物区与工作区文件列表；角色：房间成员；入口：产物分享按钮与我分享过的按钮"},{"parent":"6fd4b860-5bc3-43ba-9f10-7989ca5cc7c5","callout"