内一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c068ac81-0ba7-4735-8bf8-80549a9043e9","title":"🟠【P1】关联会话的运行状态同步"},{"parent":"3f1becab-9ef5-4e20-819e-919cde952250","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aaee1cc0-5991-4493-b35e-835688894304","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6882283f-a3fe-4818-94af-7cde28f61c79","title":"前置：该文件所在房间有多名成员用不同 Agent 发起过会话；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗"},{"parent":"aaee1cc0-5991-4493-b35e-835688894304","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"48a56ab5-99dd-491c-a809-808f9a2fb7e1","title":"操作：打开分享链接切换我的 / 其他成员的 tab搜索会话"},{"parent":"aaee1cc0-5991-4493-b35e-835688894304","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1bc11a4f-c02d-4455-bc42-a0cb5f9e4f34","title":"预期：<br>1) 能通过会话标题关键词搜索到会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aaee1cc0-5991-4493-b35e-835688894304","title":"🟠【P1】搜索关联会话"},{"parent":"3f1becab-9ef5-4e20-819e-919cde952250","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2e25892a-af90-43f5-b29b-5864f1617348","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4927aff0-f26b-41fe-9b50-cc5f725425ee","title":"前置：该文件所在房间有多名成员用不同 Agent 发起过会话；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗"},{"parent":"2e25892a-af90-43f5-b29b-5864f1617348","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"033ec2c3-b3c0-482e-b496-338ca0f9dfec","title":"操作：不勾选关联会话点击分享"},{"parent":"2e25892a-af90-43f5-b29b-5864f1617348","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aaa336f9-b3ce-4e82-86f9-2e8bb00baa1b","title":"预期：<br>1) 能成功分享，其他成员可打开分享链接查看文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2e25892a-af90-43f5-b29b-5864f1617348","title":"🔴【P0】不勾选关联会话分享"},{"parent":"3f1becab-9ef5-4e20-819e-919cde952250","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fb10b755-8511-42aa-8cca-4a8bdb81bbcc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f150a512-06b3-4354-a336-ee8acc2c5dbc","title":"前置：该文件所在房间有多名成员用不同 Agent 发起过会话；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗"},{"parent":"fb10b755-8511-42aa-8cca-4a8bdb81bbcc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7941e1e-5a77-4a18-8aa8-4d0bc190e38f","title":"操作：勾选一个关联会话点击分享"},{"parent":"fb10b755-8511-42aa-8cca-4a8bdb81bbcc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3cb0498b-649a-42ab-9756-279feda21638","title":"预期：<br>1) 能成功分享，其他成员可打开分享链接查看文件和关联会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fb10b755-