81c6-f99f0238298d","title":"预期：\n1) 关联会话 ｜ 不展示「关联会话」模块，不出现空标题的空区块"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"80db7c9d-dab7-4b6e-8931-c7734a1cd542","title":"🟠【P1】没有关联会话"},{"parent":"e845a55c-939c-40b4-8aff-b842eec90aaf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5fd7109b-a7d7-466c-8641-56b79884360d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4233e44d-b7cd-4b49-9372-7dabad227553","title":"前置：该文件所在房间有多名成员用不同 Agent 发起过会话；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗"},{"parent":"5fd7109b-a7d7-466c-8641-56b79884360d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f64a2514-de26-4061-a27b-84d453ba3608","title":"操作：打开分享链接切换我的 / 其他成员的 tab搜索会话，输入匹配会话标题不存在的字符"},{"parent":"5fd7109b-a7d7-466c-8641-56b79884360d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df783598-025e-4edb-9fc3-c8691d4db9ac","title":"预期：<br>1) 搜索没结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5fd7109b-a7d7-466c-8641-56b79884360d","title":"🟡【P2】搜索不到关联会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e845a55c-939c-40b4-8aff-b842eec90aaf","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"8340d70f-0ac2-4025-afc9-3ecd5abff210","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"be7f6744-25e9-4ef8-abad-4fc79c138c9a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6b35d22b-0f07-4318-8d16-f33e6bbf2ca4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"07cf2fe2-eb36-472c-82a2-5d41a0f66bcc","title":"前置：待分享的文件关联了 20 条以上会话；角色：任意用户；入口：分享弹窗的关联会话区"},{"parent":"6b35d22b-0f07-4318-8d16-f33e6bbf2ca4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f33836cb-7807-413b-9b32-a20965845644","title":"操作：滚动查看并勾选其中几条"},{"parent":"6b35d22b-0f07-4318-8d16-f33e6bbf2ca4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"58edf3c1-ed30-49d5-ba00-b3799463018b","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 关联会话区可滚动，弹窗高度不被撑破\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ 底部的取消与分享按钮始终可见可点"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6b35d22b-0f07-4318-8d16-f33e6bbf2ca4","title":"🟡【P2】关联会话数量很多"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"be7f6744-25e9-4ef8-abad-4fc79c138c9a","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"8340d70f-0ac2-4025-afc9-3ecd5abff210","title":"关联会话"},{"parent":"33bab9ff-8094-46e2-915e-14bbf584f1f5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cde16640-0bd4-4195-88dd-fbbd9e9afa46","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c