d6d","title":"🔴【P0】「仅自己可见」"},{"parent":"c4cb23a3-5093-4c4b-b137-37e9931a59ca","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3d598840-b2f2-4035-99d7-1a7c6e5ebfe8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c8ea2e5a-882d-4fa6-ac3c-2b70463f76df","title":"前置：分享弹窗已打开并已选好可见范围；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗的分享按钮"},{"parent":"3d598840-b2f2-4035-99d7-1a7c6e5ebfe8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"67c30259-5cdb-4aa2-ac7f-2ef1a422e256","title":"操作：点击分享"},{"parent":"3d598840-b2f2-4035-99d7-1a7c6e5ebfe8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"936cee01-4df2-458f-a1a3-0c6a8ff90636","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示分享链接已更新\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 「我分享的」tab 下新增该文件的分享记录，并显示所选的可见范围"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3d598840-b2f2-4035-99d7-1a7c6e5ebfe8","title":"🔴【P0】分享成功后的反馈与记录"},{"parent":"c4cb23a3-5093-4c4b-b137-37e9931a59ca","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"61d5e3f1-6b4f-4b3a-83ce-7837a907360f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f1d191b2-7da8-486a-9d93-36642d400ad0","title":"前置：已对某文件分享过一次并选择仅房间成员可见；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗"},{"parent":"61d5e3f1-6b4f-4b3a-83ce-7837a907360f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a7ca2d61-848d-4fff-ba2a-a2605deca2ff","title":"操作：第二次分享该文件并改选为任何人可见，让其他人刷新页面"},{"parent":"61d5e3f1-6b4f-4b3a-83ce-7837a907360f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7829c546-a0a3-4b65-a621-d8a2b52f64b9","title":"预期：\n1) 分享链接 ｜ 两次分享的链接地址保持一致\n2) 可见范围 ｜ 第一次其他人打开不可见，第二次刷新后可看到文件\n3) 可见范围 ｜ 以最新一次分享的权限为准"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"61d5e3f1-6b4f-4b3a-83ce-7837a907360f","title":"🔴【P0】同一文件重复分享链接不变"},{"parent":"c4cb23a3-5093-4c4b-b137-37e9931a59ca","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e857a0da-9a57-4b57-8d80-dcc57192963c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"426a2d37-70a6-46ad-9091-235bdb935eee","title":"前置：分享弹窗已打开并改过可见范围与关联会话勾选；角色：任意用户；入口：取消按钮"},{"parent":"e857a0da-9a57-4b57-8d80-dcc57192963c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"23fa62c4-54f2-4656-a350-56f79bb951a0","title":"操作：点击取消"},{"parent":"e857a0da-9a57-4b57-8d80-dcc57192963c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"780404cc-3094-49c6-926d-c344b0a473d2","title":"预期：\n1) 面板开关 ｜ 弹窗关闭\n2) 副作用 ｜ 本次改动全部丢弃，文件的分享状态不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e857a0da-9a57-4b57-8d80-dcc57192963c","title":"🟠【P1】取消分享弹窗"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c4cb23a3-5093-4c4b-b137-37e9931a59ca","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"cde16640-0bd4-4195-88dd-fbbd9e9afa46","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c1c445c1-c4fb-4614-a440-eba3ed1734d3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e4eac12b-b18d-456d-8da4-a7f3325d6b5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c7a2915f-40ec-4587-ba7d-2b9576579a50","title":"前置：已选择仅房间成员可见并分享，该成员随后被移出房间；角色：被移出的成员；入口：分享链接页面"},{"parent":"e4eac12b-b18d-456d-8da4-a7f3325d6b5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c052484-6e6b-4f08-a82d-ebaf4eabc3e8","title":"操作：刷新分享链接页面"},{"parent":"e4eac12b-b18d-456d-8da4-a7f3325d6b5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7511cffb-ac36-4b6e-b269-c15251c1c649","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 刷新后不再可见，权限判定以当前房间成员关系为准"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e4eac12b-b18d-456d-8da4-a7f3325d6b5b","title":"🟠【P1】分享后又移出房间"},{"parent":"c1c445c1-c4fb-4614-a440-eba3ed1734d3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d7652774-b7ea-4de1-ae2f-80a9aad203d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a66fb2cf-dcef-4228-8fba-e69889f098fa","title":"前置：某文件已按仅房间成员可见分享；角色：文件所有者与非房间成员；入口：行内的分享图标"},{"parent":"d7652774-b7ea-4de1-ae2f-80a9aad203d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5cba5ecc-419f-4786-b34d-661a38b650f0","title":"操作：再次打开弹窗改为任何人可用链接访问并分享，让对方刷新页面"},{"parent":"d7652774-b7ea-4de1-ae2f-80a9aad203d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"75ba594a-0231-493e-a7a6-26337f736d68","title":"预期：\n1) 分享链接 ｜ 分享链接地址保持不变\n2) 可见范围 ｜ 以最新一次的可见范围为准，对方刷新后可看到文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d7652774-b7ea-4de1-ae2f-80a9aad203d4","title":"🟠【P1】修改已分享文件的可见范围"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c1c445c1-c4fb-4614-a440-eba3ed1734d3","title":"异常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cde16640-0bd4-4195-88dd-fbbd9e9afa46","title":"可见范围"},{"parent":"33bab9ff-8094-46e2-915e-14bbf584f1f5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7525154e-cc36-463e-86b2-9cc4a6947e4c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fe03f132-d0dd-4dbd-b398-94c181d8e60a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"08376633-8e24-493d-9561-65ab6dad93f7","cal