9f04b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e59a452b-3917-45ce-ab85-9def261db2ab","title":"预期：\n1) 产物预览 ｜ 图片不展示预览图，显示「图片暂时无法预览，请前往房间查看」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c95a9d90-807e-43c0-97af-4fb9afd9f04b","title":"🟠【P1】分享链接中的图片预览"},{"parent":"fe03f132-d0dd-4dbd-b398-94c181d8e60a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"813764c8-5a8d-438b-b29b-abf35a561ecd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a928811a-9e2a-45f3-8ece-8c6f46b75bf8","title":"前置：分享页面评论区可用；角色：房间成员；入口：评论输入框"},{"parent":"813764c8-5a8d-438b-b29b-abf35a561ecd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eeaa5c61-f4ba-4107-b1f6-1bb8c1dc9f08","title":"操作：在评论中输入 @ 并从下拉列表中选人"},{"parent":"813764c8-5a8d-438b-b29b-abf35a561ecd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f8d2b788-1474-4ff1-ab0b-b6f390949cfa","title":"预期：<br>1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 下拉列表不出现自己<br>2) 提示文案 ｜ 只有被 @ 的人能在通知中心看到 @ 卡片"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"813764c8-5a8d-438b-b29b-abf35a561ecd","title":"🟠【P1】评论中 @ 他人"},{"parent":"fe03f132-d0dd-4dbd-b398-94c181d8e60a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ae52d26f-41a8-4997-9ff3-ca2138c79f4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ee936a23-3e60-4fc8-a493-2bab17dc3dd4","title":"前置：文件已分享且有多人参与评论；角色：非房间成员或房间成员；入口：分享链接页面的评论区"},{"parent":"ae52d26f-41a8-4997-9ff3-ca2138c79f4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9b0cf200-fcb0-451b-8bfc-c86be9890e2b","title":"操作：在分享页面发表一条评论"},{"parent":"ae52d26f-41a8-4997-9ff3-ca2138c79f4b","customWidth":428,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"465d8233-6fce-4b55-b458-21b89a33f2a0","title":"预期：<br>1) 提示文案 ｜ 最后一个分享者与被回复者收到对应的评论消息<br>2) 副作用 ｜ 自己的评论不出现在自己的通知中心下"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ae52d26f-41a8-4997-9ff3-ca2138c79f4b","title":"🟠【P1】评论后的消息通知"},{"parent":"fe03f132-d0dd-4dbd-b398-94c181d8e60a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8554399b-693f-480b-a6f8-15edeed77e62","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"79fec8bd-0e9f-4134-9301-ff7cb6c517e9","title":"前置：分享页面评论区可用；角色：房间成员；入口：评论输入框"},{"parent":"8554399b-693f-480b-a6f8-15edeed77e62","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ad478252-0c3c-4156-bc0a-edbba33a54b2","title":"操作：在评论中发送消息后再回复"},{"parent":"8554399b-693f-480b-a6f8-15edeed77e62","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5e2779b8-9b13-4153-b171-af35040685d8","title":"预期：<br>1) 可以回复成功，不会收到通知提醒"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8554399b-693f-480b-a6f8-15edeed77e62","title":"🟠【P1】回复自己的评论"},{"parent":"fe03f132-d0dd-4dbd-b398-94c181d8e60a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0a3bca99-bfa3-47dc-8308-7d95e6c5c12c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ef058d4b-c6a5-420f-99bd-08b8ff2742f1","title":"前置：分享页面评论区可用；角色：房间成员；入口：评论输入框"},{"parent":"0a3bca99-bfa3-47dc-8308-7d95e6c5c12c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"08ad1ad5-0fee-42f2-beea-ee2dee4380d9","title":"操作：A打开评论中发送消息后再回复"},{"parent":"0a3bca99-bfa3-47dc-8308-7d95e6c5c12c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"234ac9f2-5167-4dea-a9ba-1f55e95d72fb","title":"预期：<br>1) 可以回复成功，分享者会收到通知提醒"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0a3bca99-bfa3-47dc-8308-7d95e6c5c12c","title":"🟠【P1】回复他人的评论"},{"parent":"fe03f132-d0dd-4dbd-b398-94c181d8e60a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"89bd2f41-c08d-41fe-81d2-d239c24e3470","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"47de6ca4-05c6-4fd3-849a-b72dc9fde87e","title":"前置：分享页面评论区可用；角色：房间成员；入口：评论输入框"},{"parent":"89bd2f41-c08d-41fe-81d2-d239c24e3470","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"19847788-c739-40ad-832c-93f530e1c814","title":"操作：在分享页面发表一条评论并编辑"},{"parent":"89bd2f41-c08d-41fe-81d2-d239c24e3470","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d49fe820-ecb0-46b6-b83a-7c1e79d79e13","title":"预期：<br>1) 可以编辑成功<br>2) 他人的评论不可以编辑&nbsp;<br>3) 通知下点击查看评论打开查看的是最新消息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"89bd2f41-c08d-41fe-81d2-d239c24e3470","title":"🟠【P1】编辑评论"},{"parent":"fe03f132-d0dd-4dbd-b398-94c181d8e60a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0b93a3c0-43cd-4424-ab42-8abe7a430b9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d773ad0d-39b3-4edf-a3b5-094ad16e2e22","title":"前置：分享页面评论区可用；角色：房间成员；入口：评论输入框"},{"parent":"0b93a3c0-43cd-4424-ab42-8abe7a430b9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8b633853-aa02-40e0-9194-867c0fa58f11","title":"操作：在分享页面发表一条评论并编辑"},{"parent":"0b93a3c0-43cd-4424-ab42-8abe7a430b9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"43327370-47a5-47f2-aecc-daf26df1fbdb","title":"预期：<br>1) 可以删除成功，该评论及其回复都会从列表消失<br>2) 他人的评论不可以删除&nbsp;<br>3) 通知下点击查看评论打开查看不报错"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0b93a3c0-43cd-4424-ab42-8abe7a430b9b","title":"🟠【P1】删除评论"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fe03f132-d0dd-4dbd-b398-94c181d8e60a","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"7525154e-cc36-463e-86b2-9cc4a6947e4c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3a40d283-7a68-4d3f-a5ec-c6c4fc85acb3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f79b2fcf-38e1-481f-81dd-0f2a8e38c5cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0b10214a-9463-4e78-8834-25d972573cd8","title":"前置：分享页面评论区可用；角色：房间成员；入口：评论输入框"},{"parent":"f79b2fcf-38e1-481f-81dd-0f2a8e38c5cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"96176e63-0c49-4b9d-8eca-4086ad58fecc","title":"操作：在评论中输入 @ 成员，并编辑删除@成员消息"},{"parent":"f79b2fcf-38e1-481f-81dd-0f2a8e38c5cd","customWidth":428,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"98d1a194-0c07-4099-bc8f-2e3067badb6c","title":"预期：<br>1) 通知中心下@卡片仍然显示，点击去查看仍然打开分享页面"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f79b2fcf-38e1-481f-81dd-0f2a8e38c5cd","title":"🟡【P2】@后再编辑删掉@消息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3a40d283-7a68-4d3f-a5ec-c6c4fc85acb3","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"7525154e-cc36-463e-86b2-9cc4a6947e4c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2289ec5c-6014-4d38-b406-24f30078c52f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"523acee7-e964-4425-a9d2-42aedb0ba483","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"be5690d7-0c8d-45e1-a8b4-da1b05858dbe","title":"前置：存在总大小超过 300MB 的文件夹；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的分享项"},{"parent":"523acee7-e964-4425-a9d2-42aedb0ba483","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6bd6eaf9-73b7-41e0-bd91-6f7e1fcca14d","title":"操作：对该文件夹点击分享"},{"parent":"523acee7-e964-4425-a9d2-42aedb0ba483","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8ecd2ecf-a94f-429e-bb5d-29f44a809e8d","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示「无法分享：文件或目录总大小不能超过300MB」\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不生成分享记录也不生成半成品链接"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"523acee7-e964-4425-a9d2-42aedb0ba483","title":"🟡【P2】分享的文件夹超过 300MB"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2289ec5c-6014-4d38-b406-24f30078c52f","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7525154e-cc36-463e-86b2-9cc4a6947e4c","title":"分享页面详情"}],