"},{"parent":"a30e6850-fc32-41bd-a89b-3a226280f5c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c3b2c4dc-e950-4751-9452-ecf8f761058e","title":"操作：触发这些事件后查看通知面板"},{"parent":"a30e6850-fc32-41bd-a89b-3a226280f5c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aaedf718-9f11-45ed-8fb1-b94c775aca2c","title":"预期：\n1) 副作用 ｜ 不产生 Agent 进群退群与人员进出房间的通知\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 历史遗留的此类通知按产品定义清理或保留，行为一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a30e6850-fc32-41bd-a89b-3a226280f5c1","title":"🟠【P1】不再产生已下线的通知类型","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"291dfed7-e943-48ee-9595-cafb1e64ee02","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"f4a7e648-d5cf-4d3d-b6fb-42d5871ef454","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"af93914d-eb0b-4067-a671-10a6b745562d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"10d167cb-aaaa-4143-8813-5a8a877bdfe0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"66a47d97-8df1-40b0-9cd0-d48766d8ea7f","title":"前置：成员开启共享后马上收回；角色：房间成员；入口：通知面板"},{"parent":"10d167cb-aaaa-4143-8813-5a8a877bdfe0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"820c1aca-643a-4052-b036-4d32174066cc","title":"操作：查看两条通知"},{"parent":"10d167cb-aaaa-4143-8813-5a8a877bdfe0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a0a70c89-82d8-4f65-bc1d-0c6cfca21279","title":"预期：\n1) 归属与顺序 ｜ 两条事件按真实时间顺序展示\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 共享 Agent 列表中的最终状态为已收回"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"10d167cb-aaaa-4143-8813-5a8a877bdfe0","title":"🟡【P2】共享后立即收回","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"af93914d-eb0b-4067-a671-10a6b745562d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"661ca54c-f544-4aa7-8840-34b153e2cc86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ef94043-bd92-4d87-8c3c-4526cd32ad2d","title":"前置：共享的 Agent 名称或成员昵称很长；角色：房间成员；入口：通知面板"},{"parent":"661ca54c-f544-4aa7-8840-34b153e2cc86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7b98dd1a-7798-477c-8581-feadb12dd373","title":"操作：查看该条通知"},{"parent":"661ca54c-f544-4aa7-8840-34b153e2cc86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"16e29e55-633b-42e2-a335-b2dc7e5ddc1d","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 文案安全换行或截断，完整名称可查看，卡片布局不被撑破"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"661ca54c-f544-4aa7-8840-3