a","title":"操作：新账号在任意房间创建一条会话后返回全局看板"},{"parent":"3ccd5055-dc72-45a5-a7fd-d27994403430","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ec7905c2-b22c-4feb-9027-ca09e28797a8","title":"预期：空态与新建按钮消失，列表展示该条会话，无需手动刷新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3ccd5055-dc72-45a5-a7fd-d27994403430","title":"【P1】产生首条会话后空态自动消失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"72eb699f-4fde-4e58-a70f-8483cba8b5c4","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"89974b23-3e4e-4355-a47d-f29280e1840e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"badb3e3f-f5a8-4e9d-88cb-84b155d68d88","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e51cf7ed-19a2-4457-868f-01d3830b9601","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c61cf19b-33dd-4476-b303-24ddf9ca29f3","title":"操作：账号下存在会话，将时间筛选切换为「今天」且当天无会话"},{"parent":"e51cf7ed-19a2-4457-868f-01d3830b9601","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8a4dcaa3-b772-4289-a332-e6220c51bd91","title":"预期：展示「无匹配结果」空态而非新用户空态，并提供清除筛选入口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e51cf7ed-19a2-4457-868f-01d3830b9601","title":"【P1】已有会话但被筛选条件过滤为空"},{"parent":"badb3e3f-f5a8-4e9d-88cb-84b155d68d88","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b2d2c1aa-b000-4324-91fd-e70dd6d6fb1b","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6d4b9bef-cdd7-45a4-8a2a-dd8df37a8e85","title":"操作：新账号从未主动发起会话，但其 Agent 被他人 @ 执行过会话"},{"parent":"b2d2c1aa-b000-4324-91fd-e70dd6d6fb1b","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"886f2794-ed42-44b1-b341-8d18ad079f1b","title":"预期：按数据范围规则展示由我的 Agent 执行的会话，不显示新用户空态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b2d2c1aa-b000-4324-91fd-e70dd6d6fb1b","title":"【P1】账号仅有他人 @ 我的 Agent 执行的会话"},{"parent":"badb3e3f-f5a8-4e9d-88cb-84b155d68d88","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8445e4a1-0061-457f-8cc8-162aa71e5adb","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"613abb97-dabe-4bde-b673-e91b17278af1","title":"操作：账号未加入或已退出全部房间，点击空态的「新建」按钮"},{"parent":"8445e4a1-0061-457f-8cc8-162aa71e5adb","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9a407c7e-eec0-4156-96ae-40b9bdb122bc","title":"预期：跳转 Onboarding Rooms 并引导创建或加入房间，不出现空白页或报错"}],"collapsed":true,"id":