看板"},{"parent":"8b988f10-8432-4cb3-926a-d6b752b6d34c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5bbaba59-f0ed-44f5-a85d-a9fa64266e45","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44c49017-0112-4831-b919-bb6ef5f032c2","title":"操作：在群聊@我的agent"},{"parent":"5bbaba59-f0ed-44f5-a85d-a9fa64266e45","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f44cb941-392a-46a2-aed0-5313e13cb61a","title":"预期：看板不显示该会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5bbaba59-f0ed-44f5-a85d-a9fa64266e45","title":"【P1】群聊 @我的agent不展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8b988f10-8432-4cb3-926a-d6b752b6d34c","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"457bc96e-d037-4b6d-afc0-81fc10d09c3e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0c059899-d20a-4b85-ae8f-0c1f6467ebc6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"16b90305-a2b0-4585-b1ac-229f05cb4035","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b034f743-d68d-488d-9f10-d3ca855552d4","title":"操作：在看板中定位一条会话后从另一端退出该房间，返回看板刷新"},{"parent":"16b90305-a2b0-4585-b1ac-229f05cb4035","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3fa1158b-31e4-4153-b079-0ad5f34260b0","title":"预期：该房间会话从看板移除，不残留无权访问的卡片"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"16b90305-a2b0-4585-b1ac-229f05cb4035","title":"【P1】会话所属房间已退出"},{"parent":"0c059899-d20a-4b85-ae8f-0c1f6467ebc6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6865154d-2ba4-4aa1-b09e-54262036e9bd","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2588b30d-2b0a-42c7-8352-d8d904f10fdc","title":"操作：他人取消对我共享该 Agent 后刷新看板"},{"parent":"6865154d-2ba4-4aa1-b09e-54262036e9bd","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b222a7a1-c557-4d7d-87c4-a62b46e83a87","title":"预期：历史会话按产品规则保留或移除，展示一致，点击不报错"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6865154d-2ba4-4aa1-b09e-54262036e9bd","title":"【P1】共享 Agent 被取消共享"},{"parent":"0c059899-d20a-4b85-ae8f-0c1f6467ebc6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bc7cbc6e-28d8-4973-9ebc-e5fee0f79e40","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b41a623a-a17d-48f0-903b-0dec6af4f85c","title":"操作：删除自己的 Agent 后进入看板"},{"parent":"bc7cbc6e-28d8-4973-9ebc-e5fee0f79e40","customWidth":460,"callout