gent 数量极多"},{"parent":"4f215097-77d6-4ecf-9526-28607bece3ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"127be198-e703-44f6-a89f-2e15b41ffa0b","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"183fe708-902c-4aeb-a59b-52d1631d50a2","title":"操作：查看新安装且未执行过任何会话的 Agent"},{"parent":"127be198-e703-44f6-a89f-2e15b41ffa0b","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"135ee6a9-2b73-4cf3-bb2e-d6fe64a8445b","title":"预期：计数显示 0，仅勾选该 Agent 时看板展示空结果提示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"127be198-e703-44f6-a89f-2e15b41ffa0b","title":"【P2】Agent 会话数为 0"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4f215097-77d6-4ecf-9526-28607bece3ac","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"79686709-10f5-494e-a78a-2fa1410f5c74","title":"筛选器 · All agents"},{"parent":"42570425-226c-46d1-952e-84297fae579b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"59b42d84-5ec9-4308-82b2-b86bd40c3a2c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"202bcc9b-7ee8-4bcf-887c-e1effa9925e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f71266e2-a1b7-4547-83f9-f554fae6c44f","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ec77e38e-f11d-4c39-be91-829a5d74e59e","title":"操作：展开 All time 筛选面板"},{"parent":"f71266e2-a1b7-4547-83f9-f554fae6c44f","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fe3b5f2d-8141-4805-bc7f-41ea89deded3","title":"预期：显示今天、最近1小时、最近3天、最近7天和超过7天，默认勾选「最近3天」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f71266e2-a1b7-4547-83f9-f554fae6c44f","title":"【P0】时间选项与默认值"},{"parent":"202bcc9b-7ee8-4bcf-887c-e1effa9925e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b0a22624-3af9-4133-aabb-d894eff5390a","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"042e823c-fc90-4142-8abc-d46cd80fa311","title":"操作：对照实际会话核对每个时间档旁的数量"},{"parent":"b0a22624-3af9-4133-aabb-d894eff5390a","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4abf3dbb-a28c-4237-9572-641f3200d6cf","title":"预期：计数为该时间范围内的会话数：自己发起 + 自己用共享 Agent 发起 + 成员发起 + 成员用共享 Agent 发起（所有房间）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b0a22624-3af9-4133-aabb-d894eff5390a","title":"【P0】各时间档会话计数口径正确"},{"parent":"202bcc9b-7ee8-4bcf-887c-e1effa9925e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent"