"预期：范围按新的自然日重新计算，昨日会话被排除且计数同步更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9208b281-972e-4998-bed0-f367e553222f","title":"【P1】跨零点时「今天」的范围变化"},{"parent":"e79163f9-bce4-4278-b485-288b727321ef","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"402fb92a-8912-4de8-b530-cdbe11ae01fe","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"36b1ccef-78da-473c-91a4-a325f506285d","title":"操作：对一条 5 天前的会话追加新回复后查看「最近3天」"},{"parent":"402fb92a-8912-4de8-b530-cdbe11ae01fe","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f6d40ecd-6575-41ff-9c05-49b20b126a8c","title":"预期：该会话按最新更新时间进入「最近3天」，「超过7天」不再重复统计"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"402fb92a-8912-4de8-b530-cdbe11ae01fe","title":"【P1】会话更新后所属时间档变化"},{"parent":"e79163f9-bce4-4278-b485-288b727321ef","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e9e61d4a-7323-4854-8758-7ad8e932bed2","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e03e113e-e660-4fb2-a3fb-1030972af3a9","title":"操作：将本机时区改为其他时区后查看时间筛选"},{"parent":"e9e61d4a-7323-4854-8758-7ad8e932bed2","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"efafb5dd-d21a-4698-b277-c06f490d5135","title":"预期：时间档划分与会话时间展示口径一致，不出现会话跨档错位"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e9e61d4a-7323-4854-8758-7ad8e932bed2","title":"【P1】本机时区与工作区时区不一致"},{"parent":"e79163f9-bce4-4278-b485-288b727321ef","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7898b85e-5d88-40af-9224-95d67e50ff73","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e9b2aa2-d69f-42f0-82ca-6ea9716cb523","title":"操作：将本机时间调快 3 天后刷新看板"},{"parent":"7898b85e-5d88-40af-9224-95d67e50ff73","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b28ea140-e245-42b3-ae69-88dad6247ac4","title":"预期：以服务端时间为准计算，筛选结果不受本机时间影响"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7898b85e-5d88-40af-9224-95d67e50ff73","title":"【P2】本机时间被人为调整"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e79163f9-bce4-4278-b485-288b727321ef","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"59b42d84-5ec9-4308-82b2-b86bd40c3a2c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3884559f-511d-4c9f-ba4c-73d1ac0bc3ce","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9274e861-52cc-4537-8ba0-06bbde8a1ec5","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d3