b86bd40c3a2c","title":"筛选器 · All time"},{"parent":"42570425-226c-46d1-952e-84297fae579b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a251288b-29ec-4b55-a918-e26f83e6b0d7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8eb25fa8-46b3-4435-95d1-316ed62ea26b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4a70bc39-34b0-4a69-8685-47d5041df483","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b1857e4c-450d-4d4c-accc-999c466968ae","title":"操作：勾选一个房间与一名成员"},{"parent":"4a70bc39-34b0-4a69-8685-47d5041df483","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0ae90e3d-fad7-4024-b7a2-0d3de30d0bb4","title":"预期：看板仅展示该成员在该房间内的会话，条数与预期交集一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4a70bc39-34b0-4a69-8685-47d5041df483","title":"【P0】房间与成员两维组合筛选"},{"parent":"8eb25fa8-46b3-4435-95d1-316ed62ea26b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e8d25667-3057-409e-b849-f053d4af47d0","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"78c27eec-a199-4a21-8a22-0ec9f86144b9","title":"操作：同时限定一个房间、一名成员、一个 Agent 和「今天」"},{"parent":"e8d25667-3057-409e-b849-f053d4af47d0","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1eeaf124-1346-4ab0-865e-39f9312adac0","title":"预期：结果为四个条件的交集，与各筛选项计数逻辑自洽"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e8d25667-3057-409e-b849-f053d4af47d0","title":"【P0】四维度组合筛选"},{"parent":"8eb25fa8-46b3-4435-95d1-316ed62ea26b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d9ef1af7-5940-4137-ada3-ed76204b1faa","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1e752e61-3146-4ee9-8bee-596b81223e8a","title":"操作：修改全部四个维度后点击 Reset filters"},{"parent":"d9ef1af7-5940-4137-ada3-ed76204b1faa","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e5dbf754-0213-47ec-9ba9-ca3c8243cf44","title":"预期：房间与 Agent 恢复全选、成员恢复当前用户、时间恢复最近3天，看板同步刷新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d9ef1af7-5940-4137-ada3-ed76204b1faa","title":"【P0】Reset filters 一次性恢复全部维度"},{"parent":"8eb25fa8-46b3-4435-95d1-316ed62ea26b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d83ee901-bdb4-46ad-b0ed-fee6ccd511bc","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b2e5402d-536b-4c3d-9e67-9bee26a92472","title":"操作：保持筛选条件，在另一窗口分别创建符合与不符合