e09173e","title":"预期：卡片按纯文本渲染，不执行脚本，不撑破卡片"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"576906e9-964e-4889-9b4e-77be5ac49f46","title":"【P2】最新回复包含脚本标签"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6482b319-0d4e-4ba1-9084-781555ee3782","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"54a638a3-174e-4a9d-b017-53a563354964","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1d29bc61-4390-4044-a179-bbb4a3863d39","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9c4c7fb7-360b-4b99-b34c-8f4204762cef","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c51dfbf5-10ca-437d-8dbd-760066ca672a","title":"操作：悬浮含一千字符用户名的发起人头像"},{"parent":"9c4c7fb7-360b-4b99-b34c-8f4204762cef","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"47082421-c0d9-48f4-88c6-4ecb5a6ad67b","title":"预期：浮层限制宽度并换行或省略，关键内容可读且不遮挡整屏"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9c4c7fb7-360b-4b99-b34c-8f4204762cef","title":"【P1】超长用户名浮层展示"},{"parent":"1d29bc61-4390-4044-a179-bbb4a3863d39","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"51e0c9aa-6079-4203-9a65-f4ca79ff8c09","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2409b08e-eb5a-47e8-9031-3e0fd8b3c564","title":"操作：查看标题 200 字符且最新回复 2000 字符的会话"},{"parent":"51e0c9aa-6079-4203-9a65-f4ca79ff8c09","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"42bbace0-bae6-4824-9ace-c2744c214a3a","title":"预期：标题单行省略，最新回复按固定行数截断，卡片高度统一"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"51e0c9aa-6079-4203-9a65-f4ca79ff8c09","title":"【P1】超长标题与超长最新回复"},{"parent":"1d29bc61-4390-4044-a179-bbb4a3863d39","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fd3a7c30-4e94-49e7-80e9-a921df73f9bb","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"baf5a1bb-32b4-4e58-892f-3673356f8131","title":"操作：鼠标快速连续划过多张卡片的头像"},{"parent":"fd3a7c30-4e94-49e7-80e9-a921df73f9bb","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a92acca8-d53f-4fcb-be19-1f440fcc7536","title":"预期：浮层跟随正确的卡片，无多个浮层同时残留"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fd3a7c30-4e94-49e7-80e9-a921df73f9bb","title":"【P2】快速划过多个头像"},{"parent":"1d29bc61-4390-4044-a179-bbb4a3863d39","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"55951254-4c77-45e2-9e05-57bafbbe9211","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a05fb3de-6345