f951a92e8792","title":"【P0】数据范围包含我的 Agent 在本房间执行的会话"},{"parent":"3a4e0682-bd6d-494b-9b2d-5f85757693e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0e1af11a-11ef-4987-9965-e26eac606af2","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aaf9c2d5-395d-44ee-b7a3-013420d4fb5a","title":"操作：在本房间使用他人共享给我的 Agent 发起会话"},{"parent":"0e1af11a-11ef-4987-9965-e26eac606af2","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"acec8578-df0d-4c82-a766-1687f3b49a2d","title":"预期：会话出现在本房间看板，Agent 显示为该共享 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0e1af11a-11ef-4987-9965-e26eac606af2","title":"【P0】借用他人共享 Agent 在本房间发起的会话可见"},{"parent":"3a4e0682-bd6d-494b-9b2d-5f85757693e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6bc7f06c-4593-4255-8a13-ca58a6c9d034","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"648f968c-8a51-4503-b076-2719ec5d8bb8","title":"操作：在另一个房间创建符合范围的会话后查看当前房间看板"},{"parent":"6bc7f06c-4593-4255-8a13-ca58a6c9d034","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"17083e80-f622-41bd-a10f-7bd7b5a69a77","title":"预期：当前房间看板不展示其他房间的会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6bc7f06c-4593-4255-8a13-ca58a6c9d034","title":"【P0】其他房间的会话不串场"},{"parent":"3a4e0682-bd6d-494b-9b2d-5f85757693e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ea97f5a7-4062-4269-9c62-77c0552a09a4","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6fd624e5-67a4-429e-a9e1-30b0dfebb3b2","title":"操作：他人在本房间用自己的 Agent 发起会话"},{"parent":"ea97f5a7-4062-4269-9c62-77c0552a09a4","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d6381fc4-640b-4f7c-9342-7442008fe6c0","title":"预期：该会话不出现在我的房间活动看板"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ea97f5a7-4062-4269-9c62-77c0552a09a4","title":"【P1】与我无关的本房间会话不展示"},{"parent":"3a4e0682-bd6d-494b-9b2d-5f85757693e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2a6ba465-df7a-45bf-8a60-d4209761ae41","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4504d8f8-5dc7-4746-82a0-b798059731e5","title":"操作：保持房间看板打开，在该房间另一窗口新建一条符合范围的会话"},{"parent":"2a6ba465-df7a-45bf-8a60-d4209761ae41","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"59d806be-75c5-4eaf-921c-435ad19fe7f2","ti