b121ffe46d5","title":"【P2】会话更新时间恰在最近3天边界"},{"parent":"f6a2393d-d662-4c87-9ae5-5dbda137f32d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d7b96753-d4b4-4b3c-a841-bae7abad9aec","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd5a7f8e-abef-4bba-b9dc-a3358124a141","title":"操作：在本房间短时间内连续创建 10 条会话"},{"parent":"d7b96753-d4b4-4b3c-a841-bae7abad9aec","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"53586121-69ea-4325-8d74-ed24e9aa43a8","title":"预期：全部展示且排序稳定，无卡片丢失或顺序跳变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d7b96753-d4b4-4b3c-a841-bae7abad9aec","title":"【P2】同一时刻批量产生会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f6a2393d-d662-4c87-9ae5-5dbda137f32d","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aec13e0d-6987-4ed5-ae63-01fa748d2685","title":"房间看板默认加载与数据范围"},{"parent":"b28dd53b-820a-409c-b1e7-63a447f137f4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b0ad240f-aa8d-41aa-838f-18ed6a6c15b1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"998a16a1-ba95-445d-b054-94607ad0eaac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e4b16621-ab45-4f3e-a18f-568a2d34e19c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3beb5544-fd3f-45e3-89ec-c5db956786a7","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd5c7c96-74a2-495d-80f2-82971dbe8cd9","title":"操作：在本房间准备一条待授权的会话并打开待处理区域"},{"parent":"3beb5544-fd3f-45e3-89ec-c5db956786a7","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1d3049cf-a175-4519-a57e-19ea7b7fb6cf","title":"预期：决策卡片展示 Agent 头像、名称、我发起、时间、任务标题和「等待中」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3beb5544-fd3f-45e3-89ec-c5db956786a7","title":"【P0】授权卡片基础信息"},{"parent":"e4b16621-ab45-4f3e-a18f-568a2d34e19c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"24783cda-3a01-4a85-836e-91f64c172075","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"faedb170-03f7-454f-a8ba-43b8bca2a7dc","title":"操作：在本房间准备一条 Ask user question 等待回复的会话并打开待处理区域"},{"parent":"24783cda-3a01-4a85-836e-91f64c172075","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4fbe1eb4-2125-46dd-9368-9e657cd4a3a9","title":"预期：决策卡片展示 Agent 头像、名称、来源标签、时间、任务标题和「等待中」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"24783cda-3a01-4a85-836e-91f64c172075","title":"【P0】Ask u