ff-4008-ac81-718b0f50a23e","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2fc5b6c5-7aaa-4166-bde5-5d4e3a3f2916","title":"操作：展开房间看板的 All time 筛选面板"},{"parent":"13ea03d7-a1ff-4008-ac81-718b0f50a23e","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"835e71a4-6978-4ede-9f21-7dc509076b42","title":"预期：显示今天、最近1小时、最近3天、最近7天和超过7天，默认勾选「最近3天」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"13ea03d7-a1ff-4008-ac81-718b0f50a23e","title":"【P0】时间选项与默认值"},{"parent":"d295dd2d-70f7-4f35-b3e3-3c6d78832126","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1e6e9c02-9393-495b-8cec-20f057682c20","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5cd60611-8bbd-4fc4-beb8-8c7487b6d3f3","title":"操作：对照本房间实际会话核对每个时间档旁的数量"},{"parent":"1e6e9c02-9393-495b-8cec-20f057682c20","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0a64d98b-983c-4e43-b513-11b1836c8d68","title":"预期：计数为该时间范围内本房间的会话数：自己发起 + 自己用共享 Agent 发起 + 成员发起 + 成员用共享 Agent 发起"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1e6e9c02-9393-495b-8cec-20f057682c20","title":"【P0】各时间档会话计数口径正确"},{"parent":"d295dd2d-70f7-4f35-b3e3-3c6d78832126","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"06216dc8-0fff-4e43-8afa-10373a8fa55b","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"283da530-c7a1-404d-beb6-94db71a95821","title":"操作：切换勾选不同时间档"},{"parent":"06216dc8-0fff-4e43-8afa-10373a8fa55b","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"64770f40-3ad9-4eae-b146-69059e90c001","title":"预期：看板列表与已选数量同步更新，无需刷新页面"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"06216dc8-0fff-4e43-8afa-10373a8fa55b","title":"【P0】勾选与取消勾选数量同步更新"},{"parent":"d295dd2d-70f7-4f35-b3e3-3c6d78832126","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bb5dbe8d-47fc-4ddf-a9c5-af883c9e9f67","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a4de0230-b291-4881-963d-29bae6fcb23d","title":"操作：勾选其他时间档后点击 Reset filters"},{"parent":"bb5dbe8d-47fc-4ddf-a9c5-af883c9e9f67","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"28aeaad4-84dd-4666-9ff4-657e0803bf9d","title":"预期：恢复为仅勾选「最近3天」，看板结果同步刷新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bb5dbe8d-47fc-4ddf-a9c5-af883c9e9f67","title":"【P1】Reset filters 恢复默认选择"