92cfb279","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6312188b-f453-4ecc-9122-98ed24697654","title":"预期：时间档划分与会话时间展示口径一致，不出现会话跨档错位"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a524601f-1c91-4d30-8855-362e92cfb279","title":"【P1】本机时区与工作区时区不一致"},{"parent":"6f17e5bf-c439-474d-aea1-383795ba6e43","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ae655b95-e1a2-443e-a096-caab08cf552b","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a2c907f2-bf19-4ca9-838c-3477802c72cf","title":"操作：将本机时间调快 3 天后刷新房间看板"},{"parent":"ae655b95-e1a2-443e-a096-caab08cf552b","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2bbd9310-ef1a-4d20-bf40-12f8a457c541","title":"预期：以服务端时间为准计算，筛选结果不受本机时间影响"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ae655b95-e1a2-443e-a096-caab08cf552b","title":"【P2】本机时间被人为调整"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6f17e5bf-c439-474d-aea1-383795ba6e43","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"ead21480-34e3-48a7-ad27-98b338655333","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0064e5a1-7098-44df-975f-2dceb1101cf0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"819f3046-219d-4d95-a747-f960bde38841","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3d8b55f8-f1ef-419f-aeab-195eacdc17bb","title":"操作：取消勾选所有时间选项"},{"parent":"819f3046-219d-4d95-a747-f960bde38841","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3fe0ee64-1b2b-43ad-8111-1edd2e72efb5","title":"预期：按产品定义展示空结果提示或阻止全部取消，交互有明确反馈"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"819f3046-219d-4d95-a747-f960bde38841","title":"【P1】取消勾选全部时间档"},{"parent":"0064e5a1-7098-44df-975f-2dceb1101cf0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b42bf9f9-3d01-4dfb-abff-10f78d91a453","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"15bd85fc-469d-4448-a0e5-0f19eedb74c0","title":"操作：构造更新时间为 1 小时前后各 1 分钟、3 天前后各 1 分钟的会话"},{"parent":"b42bf9f9-3d01-4dfb-abff-10f78d91a453","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1549a89a-4489-46a3-b19a-d5498d41ba27","title":"预期：按定义的开闭区间稳定归档，不同时出现在两个档也不缺失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b42bf9f9-3d01-4dfb-abff-10f78d91a453","title":"【P1】会话时间恰在档位边界"},{"parent":"0064e5a1-7098-44df-975f-2dceb1101cf0","callout":[],"children":[{"