、一个 Agent 和「今天」"},{"parent":"e57a7e26-c8d3-4823-b2cd-1e1d2e98373b","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"304e4093-cb06-453e-aae4-b34d95315189","title":"预期：结果为四个条件的交集，与各筛选项计数逻辑自洽"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e57a7e26-c8d3-4823-b2cd-1e1d2e98373b","title":"【P0】四维度组合筛选"},{"parent":"7f9cc5c1-4883-48ff-9480-50361d3f3081","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f983176e-c9fe-4b48-9f09-c4475746a58a","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd87c619-c1aa-4690-96e4-605bf3e79b3c","title":"操作：修改全部四个维度后点击 Reset filters"},{"parent":"f983176e-c9fe-4b48-9f09-c4475746a58a","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"002ea238-48ba-4e03-b9d9-55b5d005c9f4","title":"预期：项目与 Agent 恢复全选、成员恢复当前用户、时间恢复最近3天，看板同步刷新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f983176e-c9fe-4b48-9f09-c4475746a58a","title":"【P0】Reset filters 一次性恢复全部维度"},{"parent":"7f9cc5c1-4883-48ff-9480-50361d3f3081","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"99f1e15a-b4e1-4057-9e22-f43b1ad3be17","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c8f77d66-4bc9-4a28-bb8b-9825e7622ccd","title":"操作：保持筛选条件，在本房间分别创建符合与不符合条件的会话"},{"parent":"99f1e15a-b4e1-4057-9e22-f43b1ad3be17","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9fee725f-8f7d-4caa-94a4-d85fcae8180c","title":"预期：符合条件的实时进入看板，不符合的不进入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"99f1e15a-b4e1-4057-9e22-f43b1ad3be17","title":"【P1】筛选生效期间新会话按条件进入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7f9cc5c1-4883-48ff-9480-50361d3f3081","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"52eff868-c131-4244-9b43-a8095527f495","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f800109a-af4a-4792-902c-c7591d6699f1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4ec74c32-00de-49e5-b9ea-4efd663dfe32","customWidth":430,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b98acbd4-e834-4827-875d-788821ac7340","title":"操作：选择互不相交的项目与成员组合"},{"parent":"4ec74c32-00de-49e5-b9ea-4efd663dfe32","customWidth":460,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ebd2c4f6-a6a2-4aec-88b7-8cf1a7d2e976","title":"预期：展示空结果提示与清除筛选入口，不展示房间空态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4ec74c32-00de-49e5-b9ea-4efd663dfe32","title":"【P1】组合条件下结果为空"},{"par