"children":[{"parent":"da3ed984-fe8a-4700-bf8f-0a7c3406e6e7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c5e7f29e-04e9-448d-ab38-c8f611b54d04","title":"不过还有几个分支：<br><br>1. Agent 在完成前重新读取状态，发现仍在工作并主动校正：可能先出现 backlog → in_progress → in_review。<br>2. 本轮没有完成、后续仍要继续：Agent 应写回 in_progress。<br>遇到阻塞：Agent 应写成 blocked。<br>3. Agent 失败且没有再写状态：人工设置的 backlog 可能继续保留；4. 平台已明确的失败回滚主要是 in_progress → todo，此时状态已经不是 in_progress"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"da3ed984-fe8a-4700-bf8f-0a7c3406e6e7","title":"agent执行完成后直接变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8f7f0f35-5120-4742-be38-b929a81d1d97","title":"手动更改状态到待办"},{"parent":"f0735305-7932-4742-a999-aca364d33486","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"be13ea52-e10e-430a-b002-b0012b4a39d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3bbb6e95-b8c3-4175-8626-0ce37280aab0","title":"agent执行完成后仍是待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"be13ea52-e10e-430a-b002-b0012b4a39d2","title":"手动更改状态到待验收"},{"parent":"f0735305-7932-4742-a999-aca364d33486","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"024223ff-e354-41d3-b319-4681ca141011","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ac2ec37d-ecbd-4446-958e-221d9713d8fe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"03be3925-80bb-41ca-a068-0881ee0553d6","title":"其他可能分支：<br><br>1. Agent 本轮未完成、工作仍要继续：可能写成 in_progress，形成 done → in_progress。<br>2. Agent 重新读取状态，识别到 done 是人工明确验收，并决定不覆盖：保持 done。<br>3. 本轮只是答疑，没有产生工单交付物：不应改状态，保持 done。<br>4. Agent 失败且没有进行新的状态写入：通常保持人工设置的 done；已知的服务端失败回滚主要针对 in_progress → todo。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ac2ec37d-ecbd-4446-958e-221d9713d8fe","title":"agent执行完成后变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"024223ff-e354-41d3-b319-4681ca141011","title":"手动更改状态到已完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f0735305-7932-4742-a999-aca364d33486","title":"任务为进行中，agent执行时手动更改状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"81de66be-8b73-4eb5-be56-442b145c20b9","title":"任务状态仍是进行中，agent执行完成后再变成待验收"},{"parent":"4844615c-7f56-447d-a3f9-fd721529b4fa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6cc6e767-c419-4d7a-b4f1-b343bc0d9dce","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"49ebdd65-c73b-448a-bcec-8a76baa82ea2","image":{"w":300,"h":45.129469790382245,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb2d79a2bfb3103cb949dd","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7965115b-0b41-4723-8488-49e325595ba2","title":"<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"49ebdd65-c73b-448a-bcec-8a76baa82ea2","title":"任务状态仍是进行中，两个agent执行完成后再变成待验收？"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6cc6e767-c419-4d7a-b4f1-b343bc0d9dce","title":"评论区@agent --&nbsp;多条评论或多个 Agent 同时处理"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4844615c-7f56-447d-a3f9-fd721529b4fa","title":"评论区@agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"48d307b8-a192-44f7-bb8e-9e3e87ac24c5","title":"状态为进行中"},{"parent":"938db555-fd89-4ab3-822d-a5e9b0a1f79d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9b79e94d-be45-4b53-a7a1-2869f1126b79","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"755ed773-2caa-4d96-ae12-6976e02bb4cf","customWidth":744.2,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1e7e182f-c8be-4a8d-8260-28b6e8efb92b","title":"（multica是这样）按评论内容处理：<br><br>1. 审核修改意见，仍属于原任务范围：Agent 收到评论后先将 in_review → in_progress，完成修改并交付后再回到 in_review。<br>2. 只是提问、确认或讨论：Agent 直接回复，状态继续保持 in_review，不应来回切换。<br>3. 全新的、与原任务独立的工作：建议新建工单；原工单继续审核或验收为 done，避免一个工单范围不断膨胀"},{"parent":"755ed773-2caa-4d96-ae12-6976e02bb4cf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c95b72bc-d5c9-4c18-9585-d397a3f7e52c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"91131efe-c38a-45da-b46f-eb25e6da603e","image":{"w":300,"h":165,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb2c2d5ca3ba630e071a50","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0f740c08-7346-4828-b504-72cf4939f69f","title":"<br>"},{"parent":"91131efe-c38a-45da-b46f-eb25e6da603e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7b769e6c-17e1-40bc-88eb-5df8dd4f84bc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5a7838e1-480e-4214-80b3-c9790a61943e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d3b51924-b40f-4cac-bb23-6e159fbe7ffb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d175b3a1-2699-4030-8fa5-e226a5e4f27c","title":"不过还有几个分支：<br><br>1. Agent 在完成前重新读取状态，发现仍在工作并主动校正：可能先出现 backlog → in_progress → in_review。<br>2. 本轮没有完成、后续仍要继续：Agent 应写回 in_progress。<br>遇到阻塞：Agent 应写成 blocked。<br>3. Agent 失败且没有再写状态：人工设置的 backlog 可能继续保留；4. 平台已明确的失败回滚主要是 in_progress → todo，此时状态已经不是 in_progress"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d3b51924-b40f-4cac-bb23-6e159fbe7ffb","title":"agent执行完成后直接变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5a7838e1-480e-4214-80b3-c9790a61943e","title":"手动更改状态到待办"},{"parent":"7b769e6c-17e1-40bc-88eb-5df8dd4f84bc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"78598ed3-ad8a-4779-aaa8-7173abdf7601","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6cf7c74c-e46f-451a-9683-a8a3b56c3e22","title":"agent执行完成后仍是待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"78598ed3-ad8a-4779-aaa8-7173abdf7601","title":"手动更改状态到待验收"},{"parent":"7b769e6c-17e1-40bc-88eb-5df8dd4f84bc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a114dcc8-6347-41b7-a4c5-17f19234b79e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"165b4af6-ef20-41b2-a3c8-618374fea95e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae661418-27f4-4852-86da-93879a11d401","title":"其他可能分支：<br><br>1. Agent 本轮未完成、工作仍要继续：可能写成 in_progress，形成 done → in_progress。<br>2. Agent 重新读取状态，识别到 done 是人工明确验收，并决定不覆盖：保持 done。<br>3. 本轮只是答疑，没有产生工单交付物：不应改状态，保持 done。<br>4. Agent 失败且没有进行新的状态写入：通常保持人工设置的 done；已知的服务端失败回滚主要针对 in_progress → todo。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"165b4af6-ef20-41b2-a3c8-618374fea95e","title":"agent执行完成后变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a114dcc8-6347-41b7-a4c5-17f19234b79e","title":"手动更改状态到已完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7b769e6c-17e1-40bc-88eb-5df8dd4f84bc","title":"任务为进行中，agent执行时手动更改状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"91131efe-c38a-45da-b46f-eb25e6da603e","title":"任务状态改成进行中，agent执行完成后再变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c95b72bc-d5c9-4c18-9585-d397a3f7e52c","title":"继续之前的任务"},{"parent":"755ed773-2caa-4d96-ae12-6976e02bb4cf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"394016fe-87cf-4693-9b98-a50e813ea741","customWidth":335.2,"callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e4392d66-877c-4d16-8fcc-01a17e4883a6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6da3411d-f6c8-4423-bd6d-aeee381ada63","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7a11bcc9-6616-4333-9a05-4b8c7d390f7f","callout":[],"children":[{"p