gent执行中时手动更改状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aff9d8bb-48f2-46a5-a87e-7eabd5c1d664","title":"Agent 直接回复，状态继续保持 待验收，不应来回切换。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e04b930c-b4fa-45fc-b33f-e160bfcc225d","title":"只是提问、确认或讨论"},{"parent":"755ed773-2caa-4d96-ae12-6976e02bb4cf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b7b35bc0-1832-4772-9dd3-ef94f35b9aa2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1cc67c8d-44b5-4bc1-b896-21e5e2a0cfb2","title":"取消工单不会终止已在途的运行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b7b35bc0-1832-4772-9dd3-ef94f35b9aa2","title":"工单改为 cancelled 时 Agent 仍在运行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"755ed773-2caa-4d96-ae12-6976e02bb4cf","title":"评论区@agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9b79e94d-be45-4b53-a7a1-2869f1126b79","title":"状态为待验收"},{"parent":"938db555-fd89-4ab3-822d-a5e9b0a1f79d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"784bcea7-88d2-4f87-82a7-e3e424b3b560","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8f7986d4-3228-475b-84ad-1b59a1fbc44c","customWidth":744,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d474bcd0-ab52-4cda-b543-0368d7046832","title":"（multica是这样）按评论内容处理：<br><br>1. 原任务需要返工或补充：推荐流程是：done → todo → in_progress → in_review → done<br>- 还没启动 Agent：先把 `done` 改成 `todo`，表示重新进入待执行队列。<br>- Agent 已经因为评论等原因开始实际处理：可以直接把 `done` 改成 `in_progress`，不必机械经过 `todo`。<br>- 完成补充后进入 `in_review`，重新验收通过再回 `done`。<br><br>2. 是一个全新的独立任务：不要重开原工单，建议新建工单。这样原工单的完成记录和验收结论不会被覆盖，新任务也能单独跟踪。<br>&nbsp; 需要注意的异常点<br>- 评论可能在 `done` 状态下触发 Agent 运行，但**不会自动把工单改成 `in_progress`**；只有确实开始处理原工单内容时，Agent 才应主动改状态。<br>- 使用 `--no-start` 执行 `done → todo` 时只会改看板，不会启动 Agent。<br>- 工单进入 `done` 后，原有 wakeup 会被禁用；重新打开工单不会自动恢复，需要单独检查并重新启用。<br>- 如果是已完成的子任务被重开，下游阶段不会自动回退。需要人工检查父任务和后续阶段是否也应暂停或退回。<br><br>所以最简单的判断是：**准备重新排队就转 `todo`；已经重新开工就转 `in_progress`；只是提问则继续保持 `done`。** 当前这条属于规则咨询，因此我不会重开本工单。"},{"parent":"8f7986d4-3228-475b-84ad-1b59a1fbc44c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"82601a43-bb31-45a6-af6c-f902c19d49f2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"84bf29cb-9d04-4b76-85e8-21dffd6919cb","image":{"w":300,"h":149.28366762177652,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb2f325ca3ba630e071b3f","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b249ea48-389e-48ed-b3de-6d6d5f74770e","title":"<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"84bf29cb-9d04-4b76-85e8-21dffd6919cb","title":"任务状态改成进行中，agent执行完成后再变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"82601a43-bb31-45a6-af6c-f902c19d49f2","title":"继续之前的任务"},{"parent":"8f7986d4-3228-475b-84ad-1b59a1fbc44c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d15330e5-35e1-4486-8345-d21488ec71ab","customWidth":328.2,"callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b77aef68-ad79-4ded-9ebf-fb688a6de487","image":{"w":300,"h":152.1781219748306,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb2ebdec6bee6425a50125","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c3d01117-235b-46d6-95a9-e093515a114c","title":"<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b77aef68-ad79-4ded-9ebf-fb688a6de487","title":"Agent 直接回复，状态继续保持 已完成，不应来回切换。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d15330e5-35e1-4486-8345-d21488ec71ab","title":"评论提出完全无关的新任务"},{"parent":"8f7986d4-3228-475b-84ad-1b59a1fbc44c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"219c7942-0b83-4988-ba11-011bf4cdea74","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3e860646-166e-4132-a559-5de1bf0c4c72","image":{"w":300,"h":99.20724801812004,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb2de2e0c5ce63ae77c474","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6909064f-c028-4426-b5ae-5bf63dd4c3bb","title":"<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3e860646-166e-4132-a559-5de1bf0c4c72","title":"Agent 直接回复，状态继续保持 已完成，不应来回切换。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"219c7942-0b83-4988-ba11-011bf4cdea74","title":"只是提问、确认或讨论"},{"parent":"8f7986d4-3228-475b-84ad-1b59a1fbc44c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fdedbd80-1801-4807-9936-08f00e402f0d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"685d1b95-7ac9-48bc-a68e-eb4eb407a989","title":"取消工单不会终止已在途的运行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fdedbd80-1801-4807-9936-08f00e402f0d","title":"工单改为 cancelled 时 Agent 仍在运行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8f7986d4-3228-475b-84ad-1b59a1fbc44c","title":"评论区@agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"784bcea7-88d2-4f87-82a7-e3e424b3b560","title":"状态为已完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"938db555-fd89-4ab3-822d-a5e9b0a1f79d","title":"负责人是agent"},{"parent":"6ff4b938-b68f-433f-a79b-a1991fd17865","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"063f3d7f-697f-4d51-8201-3f671e33c820","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ea6a01bb-5294-4de2-a234-f1049cef1943","image":{"w":300,"h":257.59577278731837,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb3d36337b7674f3cb4313","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5e92f77f-9470-4113-bad1-e9788d9c272e","title":"<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ea6a01bb-5294-4de2-a234-f1049cef1943","title":"有执行失败和正在执行中的，卡片会优先显示执行中"},{"parent":"063f3d7f-697f-4d51-8201-3f671e33c820","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c87c42c4-55dd-4fbc-a84e-a4b3bb519a19","title":"卡片优先级显示：执行中 &gt; 执行中断 &gt; 执行完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"063f3d7f-697f-4d51-8201-3f671e33c820","title":"评论区有多个agent执行"},{"parent":"6ff4b938-b68f-433f-a79b-a1991fd17865","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"268c0d92-1e5a-40c1-ba7f-d652bdff0e7a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"efe6aa03-41ee-4c0e-b2fc-e713d86b6f67","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"426ab3d5-dd9c-4e37-aa34-0a92a869017a","title":"执行时任务状态变成进行中，agent执行完成后再变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"efe6aa03-41ee-4c0e-b2fc-e713d86b6f67","title":"初始任务为待办","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"268c0d92-1e5a-40c1-ba7f-d652bdff0e7a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e8860c70-51ab-4366-a66a-ab00de65e1e3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aa98abc3-a819-409e-b32b-ccf439a44535","title":"执行时任务状态变成进行中，agent执行完成后再变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e8860c70-51ab-4366-a66a-ab00de65e1e3","title":"初始任务为进行中","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"268c0d92-1e5a-40c1-ba7f-d652bdff0e7a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5bcc47dc-ffe8-4f25-bd00-9afa20ccf8d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2d262f74-f193-43e5-8f26-1f693b4