","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"01fdf76b-96de-467c-b5ea-71cbd81a2e3a","title":"任务状态仍是进行中，agent执行完成后再变成待验收","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fb93d432-e4a7-4805-8053-57907268cc7c","title":"评论区让agent执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ea4c6c11-85cc-4cec-8114-6c82dd75fe08","title":"未有agent执行"},{"parent":"787aaf8a-fec4-4101-8590-0e21c1caf97f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"facd107c-112d-439f-9323-a8ee0359c273","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"db392cfe-5649-4950-aecf-f2786ebb2f6e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5abf8cba-51df-400e-981c-d9ad7b17ad95","image":{"w":300,"h":45.129469790382245,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb2d79a2bfb3103cb949dd","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"049cdade-ab6c-4da9-81f6-304023f2252c","title":"<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5abf8cba-51df-400e-981c-d9ad7b17ad95","title":"任务状态仍是进行中，两个agent执行完成后再变成待验收？"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"db392cfe-5649-4950-aecf-f2786ebb2f6e","title":"评论区@agent --&nbsp;多条评论或多个 Agent 同时处理"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"facd107c-112d-439f-9323-a8ee0359c273","title":"已有agent执行"},{"parent":"787aaf8a-fec4-4101-8590-0e21c1caf97f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8d6ee32c-ff7e-41e6-9f7e-b4b96cf03da7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7d57760c-c0dc-4ad7-b64a-0d420baf841b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"18fe5059-904c-4bf8-ac10-8fb30fdcb61a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"00ff6383-6453-48de-aaf8-2de1fca64a33","title":"不过还有几个分支：<br><br>1. Agent 在完成前重新读取状态，发现仍在工作并主动校正：可能先出现 backlog → in_progress → in_review。<br>2. 本轮没有完成、后续仍要继续：Agent 应写回 in_progress。<br>遇到阻塞：Agent 应写成 blocked。<br>3. Agent 失败且没有再写状态：人工设置的 backlog 可能继续保留；4. 平台已明确的失败回滚主要是 in_progress → todo，此时状态已经不是 in_progress"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"18fe5059-904c-4bf8-ac10-8fb30fdcb61a","title":"agent执行完成后直接变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7d57760c-c0dc-4ad7-b64a-0d420baf841b","title":"手动更改状态到待办","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"8d6ee32c-ff7e-41e6-9f7e-b4b96cf03da7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"23eb8b74-fbec-4b3b-a5cb-3c430f9f6e68","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"598964f2-c4fa-4b5d-9a66-b1ac27e53501","title":"agent执行完成后仍是待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"23eb8b74-fbec-4b3b-a5cb-3c430f9f6e68","title":"手动更改状态到待验收","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"8d6ee32c-ff7e-41e6-9f7e-b4b96cf03da7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1e23dae8-6eb9-453c-a48b-7eea6bdab4f5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1fa1f733-13cd-419b-b77a-26ef4a66bc40","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f2c54ff9-025d-4fbd-b871-9c8c4af018b1","title":"其他可能分支：<br><br>1. Agent 本轮未完成、工作仍要继续：可能写成 in_progress，形成 done → in_progress。<br>2. Agent 重新读取状态，识别到 done 是人工明确验收，并决定不覆盖：保持 done。<br>3. 本轮只是答疑，没有产生工单交付物：不应改状态，保持 done。<br>4. Agent 失败且没有进行新的状态写入：通常保持人工设置的 done；已知的服务端失败回滚主要针对 in_progress → todo。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1fa1f733-13cd-419b-b77a-26ef4a66bc40","title":"agent执行完成后变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1e23dae8-6eb9-453c-a48b-7eea6bdab4f5","title":"手动更改状态到已完成","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"8d6ee32c-ff7e-41e6-9f7e-b4b96cf03da7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0556dc0a-ef58-47c8-807b-24a0ae9e5982","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c91ef41-7566-4f09-8706-2763361c14be","title":"agent执行完成后变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0556dc0a-ef58-47c8-807b-24a0ae9e5982","title":"手动更改状态到已阻塞","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"8d6ee32c-ff7e-41e6-9f7e-b4b96cf03da7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"60505a70-add6-41f5-a227-5d793b23f511","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bf99737b-84f2-4fa2-bcd1-51c62400fb85","title":"agent执行完成后仍是已关闭"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"60505a70-add6-41f5-a227-5d793b23f511","title":"手动更改状态到已关闭","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8d6ee32c-ff7e-41e6-9f7e-b4b96cf03da7","title":"任务为进行中，agent执行时手动更改状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"787aaf8a-fec4-4101-8590-0e21c1caf97f","title":"状态为进行中"},{"parent":"c36b64fc-a2e0-4c2c-938d-b327a032c23b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d9ba0bcc-a564-4c6d-afc0-de1561a42e80","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b575689e-ae4d-4c1b-b6b4-ee02d01d6a31","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"df7c4f2d-e886-41d9-bc5c-cc0c8836dfed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"53942e15-cae7-45c8-bf84-4aab2da04075","title":"任务状态改成进行中，agent执行完成后再变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"df7c4f2d-e886-41d9-bc5c-cc0c8836dfed","title":"评论区让agent执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b575689e-ae4d-4c1b-b6b4-ee02d01d6a31","title":"分配人是成员","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"d9ba0bcc-a564-4c6d-afc0-de1561a42e80","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"600981f2-5a50-4f1b-8cf6-f39d8a459a37","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f91a87b0-305d-4fad-a378-e2b5b24a9dc8","customWidth":744.2,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d85a4d62-8d5e-420d-99c3-54480e5db635","title":"（multica是这样）按评论内容处理：<br><br>1. 审核修改意见，仍属于原任务范围：Agent 收到评论后先将 in_review → in_progress，完成修改并交付后再回到 in_review。<br>2. 只是提问、确认或讨论：Agent 直接回复，状态继续保持 in_review，不应来回切换。<br>3. 全新的、与原任务独立的工作：建议新建工单；原工单继续审核或验收为 done，避免一个工单范围不断膨胀"},{"parent":"f91a87b0-305d-4fad-a378-e2b5b24a9dc8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2fc20414-40e9-44f1-bf91-f0e8e2dacf19","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"05fec61c-ba6b-4c76-a8d7-9660730bf0f6","image":{"w":300,"h":165,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb2c2d5ca3ba630e071a50","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5907987-2c06-4c2e-b4e5-cef04e49b2da","title":"<br>"},{"parent":"05fec61c-ba6b-4c76-a8d7-9660730bf0f6","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"a898c678-8485-4414-bfe4-6cc0dca1e4eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ba6013ae-a153-4410-b23c-5fc3819f9c3c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e8154a77-5991-4817-9648-c12d7552a8b2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c79c0476-1d66-4