:"未有负责人时创建者收到通知","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"f906e921-81e7-49b5-b174-fdaca3e12749","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"afe818a1-97a3-4348-8a66-9d33eb271af6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"14b2aa5f-3278-4227-9032-20a84d03ead3","title":"当前负责人收到通知","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"afe818a1-97a3-4348-8a66-9d33eb271af6","title":"创建任务选择智能体运行","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"f906e921-81e7-49b5-b174-fdaca3e12749","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b06d65d9-38b9-4adc-95f4-22c37c109452","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1f5e8dee-c804-424f-8149-8bc33cd15dd5","title":"当前负责人收到通知","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b06d65d9-38b9-4adc-95f4-22c37c109452","title":"任务验收中继续评论使用agent运行，变到进行中后再变成验收中","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f906e921-81e7-49b5-b174-fdaca3e12749","title":"Agent自动扭转到验收中"},{"parent":"d9ed41a1-9c0e-47aa-87bc-ffb7c6eac8fd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aa47d6fe-7e26-4cc9-b464-316703376e15","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9d72913e-9964-4d5a-b3f8-ffb294ae0820","title":"当前负责人收到通知"},{"parent":"aa47d6fe-7e26-4cc9-b464-316703376e15","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0752caa8-9f6c-45d7-863b-68f88daa326e","title":"未有负责人时创建者收到通知"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aa47d6fe-7e26-4cc9-b464-316703376e15","title":"手动改成验收中","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d9ed41a1-9c0e-47aa-87bc-ffb7c6eac8fd","title":"任务待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4cc94d6b-267d-451e-986e-f60ec3f0eab4","title":"通知"},{"parent":"1c878525-74ae-455e-913c-71e57bbdaaf4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ed28ceba-0eb5-411b-8f68-5b35c66a8743","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4c91288d-2208-43ff-83c4-10a038a869fb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f4680368-c172-42d1-91c2-3baa7f11e128","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"afd1ffc7-f73a-4c95-8f91-cf1c99498e4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ad103d1c-0270-43eb-94c7-5ba522a6bf8a","title":"agent自动开始执行，执行完成后状态变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"afd1ffc7-f73a-4c95-8f91-cf1c99498e4b","title":"手动改成进行中"},{"parent":"f4680368-c172-42d1-91c2-3baa7f11e128","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dc20fa9b-4a52-45f2-b52b-0f72afb6448d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09a2f168-3b3a-4dc6-8979-2d50b88b4ea7","title":"任务状态变成进行中，agent执行完成后再变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dc20fa9b-4a52-45f2-b52b-0f72afb6448d","title":"评论区@agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f4680368-c172-42d1-91c2-3baa7f11e128","title":"状态为待办"},{"parent":"4c91288d-2208-43ff-83c4-10a038a869fb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"72d28efb-2bf0-4afb-ade2-83442fba1592","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b3a251d2-d474-4b92-8440-452201abf0cb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"722c6587-05c2-460f-b55d-fea0b1cfb8a6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a106f72b-d499-4172-a2fe-4cf8f0e5f7ba","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6a620431-9d2c-475d-925e-087cd38cf2eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"50fb65be-d886-493f-b501-f1e0dddcaf3b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6bb2e038-f421-4158-a4ad-3776b2d84aa5","title":"不过还有几个分支：<br><br>1. Agent 在完成前重新读取状态，发现仍在工作并主动校正：可能先出现 backlog → in_progress → in_review。<br>2. 本轮没有完成、后续仍要继续：Agent 应写回 in_progress。<br>遇到阻塞：Agent 应写成 blocked。<br>3. Agent 失败且没有再写状态：人工设置的 backlog 可能继续保留；4. 平台已明确的失败回滚主要是 in_progress → todo，此时状态已经不是 in_progress"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"50fb65be-d886-493f-b501-f1e0dddcaf3b","title":"agent执行完成后直接变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6a620431-9d2c-475d-925e-087cd38cf2eb","title":"手动更改状态到待办"},{"parent":"a106f72b-d499-4172-a2fe-4cf8f0e5f7ba","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"100aed7e-720a-4b7a-b0b0-e1eeef02f466","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4fa050ea-7a32-433f-a42d-be1cf2f68f5f","title":"agent执行完成后仍是待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"100aed7e-720a-4b7a-b0b0-e1eeef02f466","title":"手动更改状态到待验收"},{"parent":"a106f72b-d499-4172-a2fe-4cf8f0e5f7ba","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3a750f0d-868e-4bbb-86f8-94510b86c1d2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"131bb30c-25cd-4f26-bb2e-07515d963e46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c59045d0-38da-4bb2-b17a-f36c076dda28","title":"其他可能分支：<br><br>1. Agent 本轮未完成、工作仍要继续：可能写成 in_progress，形成 done → in_progress。<br>2. Agent 重新读取状态，识别到 done 是人工明确验收，并决定不覆盖：保持 done。<br>3. 本轮只是答疑，没有产生工单交付物：不应改状态，保持 done。<br>4. Agent 失败且没有进行新的状态写入：通常保持人工设置的 done；已知的服务端失败回滚主要针对 in_progress → todo。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"131bb30c-25cd-4f26-bb2e-07515d963e46","title":"agent执行完成后变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3a750f0d-868e-4bbb-86f8-94510b86c1d2","title":"手动更改状态到已完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a106f72b-d499-4172-a2fe-4cf8f0e5f7ba","title":"任务为进行中，agent执行时手动更改状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"722c6587-05c2-460f-b55d-fea0b1cfb8a6","title":"任务状态仍是进行中，agent执行完成后再变成待验收"},{"parent":"b3a251d2-d474-4b92-8440-452201abf0cb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"287980cd-b5bf-4bf9-99b7-21e49b3de6a0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4955c9cb-4325-4e2b-91aa-21dda80758ee","image":{"w":300,"h":45.129469790382245,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb2d79a2bfb3103cb949dd","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"43f786e0-1cfa-4c71-8172-ac0176e7ccc6","title":"<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4955c9cb-4325-4e2b-91aa-21dda80758ee","title":"任务状态仍是进行中，两个agent执行完成后再变成待验收？"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"287980cd-b5bf-4bf9-99b7-21e49b3de6a0","title":"评论区@agent --&nbsp;多条评论或多个 Agent 同时处理"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b3a251d2-d474-4b92-8440-452201abf0cb","title":"评论区@agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"72d28efb-2bf0-4afb-ade2-83442fba1592","title":"状态为进行中"},{"parent":"4c91288d-2208-43ff-83c4-10a038a869fb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dc364dfa-9776-465d-8f07-a21922261a74","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d8144272-2267-4038-96d9-cd09b6f9ece8","customWidth":744.2,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4447de0-8141-41d9-bbb4-673694ff5c6a","title":"（multica是这样）按评论内容处理：<br><br>1. 审核修改意见，仍属于原任务范围：Agent 收到评论后先将 in_review → in_progress，完成修改并交付后再回到 in_review。<br>2. 只是提问、确认或讨论：Agent 直接回复，状态继续保持 in_review，不应来回切换。<br>3. 全新的、与原任务独立的工作：建议新建工单；原工单继续审核或验收为 done，避免一个工单范围不断膨胀"},{"parent":"d8144272-2267-4038-96d9-cd09b6f9ece8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"19951c67-2a93-4ae7-990b-4efba7e7e3ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"218c6730-5453-4c3f-860a-e10dfbc77f69","image":{"w":300,"h":165,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb2c2d5ca3ba630e071a50","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7fdc472f-6e9a-4122-ad9b-e1eb08825e6e","title":"<br>"},{"parent":"218c6730-5453-4c3f-860a-e10dfbc77f69","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5394d723-9e74-415f-9e4f-f5b5c668725b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"902f3611-7043-45b2-8839-6c1aa14c7c2c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1d2eb248-6813-49e2-a06c-9d1a15b3ffd2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"30cb63ab-b169-4c10-a18b-242ebb06c02f","title":"不过还有几个分支：<br><br>1. Agent 在完成前重新读取状态，发现仍在工作并主动校正：可能先出现 backlog → in_progress → in_review。<br>2. 本轮没有完成、后续仍要继续：Agent 应写回 in_progress。<br>遇到阻塞：Agent 应写成 blocked。<br>3. Agent 失败且没有再写状态：人工设置的 backlog 可能继续保留；4. 平台已明确的失败回滚主要是 in_progress → todo，此时状态已经不是 in_progress"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1d2eb248-6813-49e2-a06c-9d1a15b3ffd2","title":"agent执行完成后直接变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"902f3611-7043-45b2-8839-6c1aa14c7c2c","title":"手动更改状态到待办"},{"parent":"5394d723-9e74-415f-9e4f-f5b5c668725b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8d68ddf5-777c-42d4-9919-926e6a504d34","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e11e37c-c781-4ca4-a8e7-6c8079d2e11a","title":"agent执行完成后仍是待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8d68ddf5-777c-42d4-9919-926e6a504d34","title":"手动更改状态到待验收"},{"parent":"5394d723-9e74-415f-9e4f-f5b5c668725b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d5b1ceb5-1b56-4bc1-97cb-b85b4545655f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d62d951d-4a52-42c7-997f-ed9e12cbad89","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7032aaa6-9faf-4eb2-b58e-23b60ade9024","title":"其他可能分支：<br><br>1. Agent 本轮未完成、工作仍要继续：可能写成 in_progress，形成 done → in_progress。<br>2. Agent 重新读取状态，识别到 done 是人工明确验收，并决定不覆盖：保持 done。<br>3. 本轮只是答疑，没有产生工单交付物：不应改状态，保持 done。<br>4. Agent 失败且没有进行新的状态写入：通常保持人工设置的 done；已知的服务端失败回滚主要针对 in_progress → todo。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d62d951d-4a52-42c7-997f-ed9e12cbad89","title":"agent执行完成后变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d5b1ceb5-1b56-4bc1-97cb-b85b4545655f","title":"手动更改状态到已完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5394d723-9e74-415f-9e4f-f5b5c668725b","title":"任务为进行中，agent执行时手动更改状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"218c6730-5453-4c3f-860a-e10dfbc77f69","title":"任务状态改成进行中，agent执行完成后再变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"19951c67-2a93-4ae7-990b-4efba7e7e3ac","title":"继续之前的任务"},{"parent":"d8144272-2267-4038-96d9-cd09b6f9ece8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c0d17438-b76e-4550-b2fc-5a0e0e7d4b23","customWidth":335.2,"callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"437917d8-b4fe-4c32-b3ac-3baeb253148e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c2f37b90-8f0a-4f41-8149-1e76c56d6727","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f14bd431-c21e-48ee-9b12-48bbbdb6ada9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c274d70a-6143-48bd-a4d4-87dc34d40c09","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e90d6883-aa35-4de1-bc68-4a393cdef272","title":"不过还有几个分支：<br><br>1. Agent 在完成前重新读取状态，发现仍在工作并主动校正：可能先出现 backlog → in_progress → in_review。<br>2. 本轮没有完成、后续仍要继续：Agent 应写回 in_progress。<br>遇到阻塞：Agent 应写成 blocked。<br>3. Agent 失败且没有再写状态：人工设置的 backlog 可能继续保留；4. 平台已明确的失败回滚主要是 in_progress → todo，此时状态已经不是 in_progress"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c274d70a-6143-48bd-a4d4-87dc34d40c09","title":"agent执行完成后直接变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f14bd431-c21e-48ee-9b12-48bbbdb6ada9","title":"手动更改状态到待办"},{"parent":"c2f37b90-8f0a-4f41-8149-1e76c56d6727","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a1de39f2-cfbb-4bab-a9a1-b5316fcc89e4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"88dc25df-cf5d-4405-8ca9-65dfcfd26f94","title":"agent执行完成后变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a1de39f2-cfbb-4bab-a9a1-b5316fcc89e4","title":"手动更改状态到进行中"},{"parent":"c2f37b90-8f0a-4f41-8149-1e76c56d6727","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0359f8dd-797d-4a78-999f-145b2bb8e979","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8b200e66-3d41-4d15-8e6b-9b2b34e83bcc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"92d36921-eb8d-4f78-8f7b-79d49b88190e","title":"其他可能分支：<br><br>1. Agent 本轮未完成、工作仍要继续：可能写成 in_progress，形成 done → in_progress。<br>2. Agent 重新读取状态，识别到 done 是人工明确验收，并决定不覆盖：保持 done。<br>3. 本轮只是答疑，没有产生工单交付物：不应改状态，保持 done。<br>4. Agent 失败且没有进行新的状态写入：通常保持人工设置的 done；已知的服务端失败回滚主要针对 in_progress → todo。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8b200e66-3d41-4d15-8e6b-9b2b34e83bcc","title":"agent执行完成后仍是已完成","icons":[{"color":"rgb(255, 134, 59)","name":"other","index":"375"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0359f8dd-797d-4a78-999f-145b2bb8e979","title":"手动更改状态到已完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c2f37b90-8f0a-4f41-8149-1e76c56d6727","title":"任务为待验收，agent执行中时手动更改状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"437917d8-b4fe-4c32-b3ac-3baeb253148e","title":"Agent 直接回复，状态继续保持 待验收，不应来回切换。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c0d17438-b76e-4550-b2fc-5a0e0e7d4b23","title":"评论提出完全无关的新任务"},{"parent":"d8144272-2267-4038-96d9-cd09b6f9ece8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4eaf109e-9562-422e-b74a-506436fd99b3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b0685cec-10dd-477f-a8c7-5fc39f5548ed","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"588ff2d6-ff66-4d62-8451-9246611a0ec2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"56c1178d-03e2-482d-8435-5096ab7ab00c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a2dd36c5-8c39-4783-9ee7-d0b379bd1488","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"00ba7773-e9ea-4a47-96b8-4e7c7b34ac69","title":"不过还有几个分支：<br><br>1. Agent 在完成前重新读取状态，发现仍在工作并主动校正：可能先出现 backlog → in_progress → in_review。<br>2. 本轮没有完成、后续仍要继续：Agent 应写回 in_progress。<br>遇到阻塞：Agent 应写成 blocked。<br>3. Agent 失败且没有再写状态：人工设置的 backlog 可能继续保留；4. 平台已明确的失败回滚主要是 in_progress → todo，此时状态已经不是 in_progress"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a2dd36c5-8c39-4783-9ee7-d0b379bd1488","title":"agent执行完成后直接变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"56c1178d-03e2-482d-8435-5096ab7ab00c","title":"手动更改状态到待办"},{"parent":"588ff2d6-ff66-4d62-8451-9246611a0ec2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f9055ab2-e433-4fe6-90c7-089062e5ef09","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"af25429c-9712-42a0-a848-2abff7bd9370","title":"agent执行完成后变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f9055ab2-e433-4fe6-90c7-089062e5ef09","title":"手动更改状态到进行中"},{"parent":"588ff2d6-ff66-4d62-8451-9246611a0ec2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d46d2865-38dd-43a7-9411-24e613d8367a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"21942590-b615-4ba2-91dc-e74ecf2fd4b5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"19c4e5cb-30d9-4557-b083-e27c99d85810","title":"其他可能分支：<br><br>1. Agent 本轮未完成、工作仍要继续：可能写成 in_progress，形成 done → in_progress。<br>2. Agent 重新读取状态，识别到 done 是人工明确验收，并决定不覆盖：保持 done。<br>3. 本轮只是答疑，没有产生工单交付物：不应改状态，保持 done。<br>4. Agent 失败且没有进行新的状态写入：通常保持人工设置的 done；已知的服务端失败回滚主要针对 in_progress → todo。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"21942590-b615-4ba2-91dc-e74ecf2fd4b5","title":"agent执行完成后仍保持已完成","icons":[{"color":"rgb(255, 134, 59)","name":"other","index":"375"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d46d2865-38dd-43a7-9411-24e613d8367a","title":"手动更改状态到已完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"588ff2d6-ff66-4d62-8451-9246611a0ec2","title":"任务为待验收，agent执行中时手动更改状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b0685cec-10dd-477f-a8c7-5fc39f5548ed","title":"Agent 直接回复，状态继续保持 待验收，不应来回切换。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4eaf109e-9562-422e-b74a-506436fd99b3","title":"只是提问、确认或讨论"},{"parent":"d8144272-2267-4038-96d9-cd09b6f9ece8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e0f97a77-d1cd-4b2b-a4a4-4d71064af6ca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4f9047e3-e061-4a3b-84d2-1b1f035bbaa3","title":"取消工单不会终止已在途的运行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e0f97a77-d1cd-4b2b-a4a4-4d71064af6ca","title":"工单改为 cancelled 时 Agent 仍在运行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d8144272-2267-4038-96d9-cd09b6f9ece8","title":"评论区@agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dc364dfa-9776-465d-8f07-a21922261a74","title":"状态为待验收"},{"parent":"4c91288d-2208-43ff-83c4-10a038a869fb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"51ff3834-f073-4205-aa8e-6fb2c3bf8198","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"28601e93-4b88-4ad4-b828-58d41673f497","customWidth":744,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1818a56e-030a-4dd8-bbfd-2050164278e1","title":"（multica是这样）按评论内容处理：<br><br>1. 原任务需要返工或补充：推荐流程是：done → todo → in_progress → in_review → done<br>- 还没启动 Agent：先把 `done` 改成 `todo`，表示重新进入待执行队列。<br>- Agent 已经因为评论等原因开始实际处理：可以直接把 `done` 改成 `in_progress`，不必机械经过 `todo`。<br>- 完成补充后进入 `in_review`，重新验收通过再回 `done`。<br><br>2. 是一个全新的独立任务：不要重开原工单，建议新建工单。这样原工单的完成记录和验收结论不会被覆盖，新任务也能单独跟踪。<br>&nbsp; 需要注意的异常点<br>- 评论可能在 `done` 状态下触发 Agent 运行，但**不会自动把工单改成 `in_progress`**；只有确实开始处理原工单内容时，Agent 才应主动改状态。<br>- 使用 `--no-start` 执行 `done → todo` 时只会改看板，不会启动 Agent。<br>- 工单进入 `done` 后，原有 wakeup 会被禁用；重新打开工单不会自动恢复，需要单独检查并重新启用。<br>- 如果是已完成的子任务被重开，下游阶段不会自动回退。需要人工检查父任务和后续阶段是否也应暂停或退回。<br><br>所以最简单的判断是：**准备重新排队就转 `todo`；已经重新开工就转 `in_progress`；只是提问则继续保持 `done`。** 当前这条属于规则咨询，因此我不会重开本工单。"},{"parent":"28601e93-4b88-4ad4-b828-58d41673f497","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0ef68840-d649-44e3-b8ae-117e007322dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bd19686c-abbd-408f-b4a3-649e1f99fd36","image":{"w":300,"h":149.28366762177652,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb2f325ca3ba630e071b3f","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5d282852-cfd8-4929-be42-703d7ddc833d","title":"<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bd19686c-abbd-408f-b4a3-649e1f99fd36","title":"任务状态改成进行中，agent执行完成后再变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0ef68840-d649-44e3-b8ae-117e007322dd","title":"继续之前的任务"},{"parent":"28601e93-4b88-4ad4-b828-58d41673f497","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fdcb50b0-9947-4edd-ae8f-db71e7870f04","customWidth":328.2,"callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a8d61e42-450a-464f-98b0-54d9badae96d","image":{"w":300,"h":152.1781219748306,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb2ebdec6bee6425a50125","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d33ceef1-b132-4c48-a3b0-622a08096432","title":"<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a8d61e42-450a-464f-98b0-54d9badae96d","title":"Agent 直接回复，状态继续保持 已完成，不应来回切换。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fdcb50b0-9947-4edd-ae8f-db71e7870f04","title":"评论提出完全无关的新任务"},{"parent":"28601e93-4b88-4ad4-b828-58d41673f497","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"afd8844b-706c-4965-9ed9-78eadf549474","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a5cc9f93-47d7-4996-a7bd-00b613cd5f0c","image":{"w":300,"h":99.20724801812004,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb2de2e0c5ce63ae77c474","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"45e92407-39bc-4c60-a9ed-eb315138393c","title":"<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a5cc9f93-47d7-4996-a7bd-00b613cd5f0c","title":"Agent 直接回复，状态继续保持 已完成，不应来回切换。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"afd8844b-706c-4965-9ed9-78eadf549474","title":"只是提问、确认或讨论"},{"parent":"28601e93-4b88-4ad4-b828-58d41673f497","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bebe04df-ea9f-4788-8e08-40f0024c784e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"943dc4f3-465f-4d43-8f31-a2a44e4b9cee","title":"取消工单不会终止已在途的运行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bebe04df-ea9f-4788-8e08-40f0024c784e","title":"工单改为 cancelled 时 Agent 仍在运行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"28601e93-4b88-4ad4-b828-58d41673f497","title":"评论区@agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"51ff3834-f073-4205-aa8e-6fb2c3bf8198","title":"状态为已完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4c91288d-2208-43ff-83c4-10a038a869fb","title":"负责人是agent"},{"parent":"ed28ceba-0eb5-411b-8f68-5b35c66a8743","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7bfef80e-7d51-4fb9-b297-6e185c86d98e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e465d9c3-79f2-47fc-87e3-96a5cb9afa3f","image":{"w":300,"h":257.59577278731837,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb3d36337b7674f3cb4313","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ec08d7ec-1d45-487d-9e80-9c9f70705f4b","title":"<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e465d9c3-79f2-47fc-87e3-96a5cb9afa3f","title":"有执行失败和正在执行中的，卡片会优先显示执行中"},{"parent":"7bfef80e-7d51-4fb9-b297-6e185c86d98e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4eb6f5b9-de20-4bf8-9df8-7ed98bc29b36","title":"卡片优先级显示：执行中 &gt; 执行中断 &gt; 执行完成"}],"col