e,"id":"31b73d52-7bc9-4b8b-8377-d25a366c3103","title":"任务状态仍是进行中，两个agent执行完成后再变成待验收？"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dc0b3166-f9d4-4daf-a139-2ef08ad7539a","title":"评论区@agent --&nbsp;多条评论或多个 Agent 同时处理"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f96cae79-d581-4e3c-8ef3-f900a84dea75","title":"已有agent执行"},{"parent":"519133ef-d690-4b3d-a062-6c61abade3de","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"33cae836-4519-4569-add3-08e622f89928","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c80a89b8-3f16-4c0f-835a-e414d6f59533","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"acde44a3-0201-4b73-aad5-ec8978255b7c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2e95ffa8-371c-46e6-9f12-74bd5590557b","title":"不过还有几个分支：<br><br>1. Agent 在完成前重新读取状态，发现仍在工作并主动校正：可能先出现 backlog → in_progress → in_review。<br>2. 本轮没有完成、后续仍要继续：Agent 应写回 in_progress。<br>遇到阻塞：Agent 应写成 blocked。<br>3. Agent 失败且没有再写状态：人工设置的 backlog 可能继续保留；4. 平台已明确的失败回滚主要是 in_progress → todo，此时状态已经不是 in_progress"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"acde44a3-0201-4b73-aad5-ec8978255b7c","title":"agent执行完成后直接变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c80a89b8-3f16-4c0f-835a-e414d6f59533","title":"手动更改状态到待办","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"33cae836-4519-4569-add3-08e622f89928","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b8203041-a85d-45ab-91c5-cfca95404514","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f8e46b77-5ecd-42ca-b354-5836eccecb04","title":"agent执行完成后仍是待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b8203041-a85d-45ab-91c5-cfca95404514","title":"手动更改状态到待验收","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"33cae836-4519-4569-add3-08e622f89928","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8612f82e-1f7f-4804-b0c2-73bd2ecc98ca","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"20552810-45a1-4345-a00a-77bcbec2dfcd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"009c5205-e610-4064-8523-445565af22aa","title":"其他可能分支：<br><br>1. Agent 本轮未完成、工作仍要继续：可能写成 in_progress，形成 done → in_progress。<br>2. Agent 重新读取状态，识别到 done 是人工明确验收，并决定不覆盖：保持 done。<br>3. 本轮只是答疑，没有产生工单交付物：不应改状态，保持 done。<br>4. Agent 失败且没有进行新的状态写入：通常保持人工设置的 done；已知的服务端失败回滚主要针对 in_progress → todo。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"20552810-45a1-4345-a00a-77bcbec2dfcd","title":"agent执行完成后变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8612f82e-1f7f-4804-b0c2-73bd2ecc98ca","title":"手动更改状态到已完成","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"33cae836-4519-4569-add3-08e622f89928","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d7eaf99d-48d8-46ad-81ed-ce9b95404139","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7d3b9ab7-d4ef-465d-990a-40092c598568","title":"agent执行完成后变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d7eaf99d-48d8-46ad-81ed-ce9b95404139","title":"手动更改状态到已阻塞","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"33cae836-4519-4569-add3-08e622f89928","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"974d7548-0745-4419-a147-a61bcf66f440","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"db02162a-01b3-434a-b8b7-64dd72fc94fa","title":"agent执行完成后仍是已关闭"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"974d7548-0745-4419-a147-a61bcf66f440","title":"手动更改状态到已关闭","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"33cae836-4519-4569-add3-08e622f89928","title":"任务为进行中，agent执行时手动更改状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"519133ef-d690-4b3d-a062-6c61abade3de","title":"状态为进行中"},{"parent":"f5df606e-340c-483a-ab39-cd77d7f8fa7f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"380d988d-3c5c-4b81-b9bc-efff43929e89","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f14e1978-652c-425c-b82d-1886f8b86876","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8d0f8536-4e70-4a79-a7ee-a5091100115d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ca4d456e-7895-4ea6-8b4f-f25558e3ef05","title":"任务状态改成进行中，agent执行完成后再变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8d0f8536-4e70-4a79-a7ee-a5091100115d","title":"评论区让agent执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f14e1978-652c-425c-b82d-1886f8b86876","title":"分配人是成员","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"380d988d-3c5c-4b81-b9bc-efff43929e89","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"541591f2-74d8-4718-b159-df86c3782f98","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2c64d184-9580-4c49-856a-643d380d72f3","customWidth":744.2,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d9bf7ea6-3384-4c50-8fb9-20cff9296f51","title":"（multica是这样）按评论内容处理：<br><br>1. 审核修改意见，仍属于原任务范围：Agent 收到评论后先将 in_review → in_progress，完成修改并交付后再回到 in_review。<br>2. 只是提问、确认或讨论：Agent 直接回复，状态继续保持 in_review，不应来回切换。<br>3. 全新的、与原任务独立的工作：建议新建工单；原工单继续审核或验收为 done，避免一个工单范围不断膨胀"},{"parent":"2c64d184-9580-4c49-856a-643d380d72f3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1c6a7895-bda5-4797-9644-56860de4115b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1695f006-f050-47bb-ba25-9f2431c4ce2d","image":{"w":300,"h":165,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb2c2d5ca3ba630e071a50","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bdb66062-a9f5-47a2-b6c0-6162f6e166c5","title":"<br>"},{"parent":"1695f006-f050-47bb-ba25-9f2431c4ce2d","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"f0d0a047-068f-4a7b-aab3-84425040b913","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"665a3c1d-6263-4b29-900f-61215f4774be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3209063c-fb33-44d6-9918-beaf38c6ee4e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0050f2e6-19f3-460b-aa21-dc7673039304","title":"不过还有几个分支：<br><br>1. Agent 在完成前重新读取状态，发现仍在工作并主动校正：可能先出现 backlog → in_progress → in_review。<br>2. 本轮没有完成、后续仍要继续：Agent 应写回 in_progress。<br>遇到阻塞：Agent 应写成 blocked。<br>3. Agent 失败且没有再写状态：人工设置的 backlog 可能继续保留；4. 平台已明确的失败回滚主要是 in_progress → todo，此时状态已经不是 in_progress"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3209063c-fb33-44d6-9918-beaf38c6ee4e","title":"agent执行完成后直接变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"665a3c1d-6263-4b29-900f-61215f4774be","title":"手动更改状态到待办","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"f0d0a047-068f-4a7b-aab3-84425040b913","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cbbc4487-d1e8-473c-8d9f-3d66fc24ce4d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9570779a-061b-418c-b59a-36d275332067","title":"agent执行完成后仍是待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cbbc4487-d1e8-473c-8d9f-3d66fc24ce4d","title":"手动更改状态到待验收"},{"parent":"f0d0a047-068f-4a7b-aab3-84425040b913","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"60ca4fac-ebb8-47bb-8d6b-3e30320148e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"593fbbad-53d1-44f9-84db-0a9986c56b68","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d2195d32-4d2f-421c-83da-f550a2ddc71c","title":"其他可能分支：<br><br>1. Agent 本轮未完成、工作仍要继续：可能写成 in_progress，形成 done → in_progress。<br>2. Agent 重新读取状态，识别到 done 是人工明确验收，并决定不覆盖：保持 done。<br>3. 本轮只是答疑，没有产生工单交付物：不应改状态，保持 done。<br>4. Agent 失败且没有进行新的状态写入：通常保持人工设置的 done；已知的服务端失败回滚主要针对 in_progress → todo。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"593fbbad-53d1-44f9-84db-0a9986c56b68","title":"agent执行完成后变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"60ca4fac-ebb8-47bb-8d6b-3e30320148e9","title":"手动更改状态到已完成","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"f0d0a047-068f-4a7b-aab3-84425040b913","title":"任务为进行中，agent执行时手动更改状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1695f006-f050-47bb-ba25-9f2431c4ce2d","title":"任务状态改成进行中，agent执行完成后再变成待验收","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1c6a7895-bda5-4797-9644-56860de4115b","title":"继续之前的任务"},{"parent":"2c64d184-9580-4c49-856a-643d380d72f3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6b5a62f4-f75b-4ae3-9837-d2586a10b627","customWidth":335,"callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4e05afc3-ed44-4cd0-993a-bd08fceaae3f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2cd2ffaf-0fec-434d-8920-71e83d72de77","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"eae60433-99af-487b-b2b6-447f41a4ff1d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"61d9b9d4-88e8-46d4-a5d4-7e40ef2e26f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2133a935-474f-4999-a00e-29446ace9b0f","title":"不过还有几个分支：<br><br>1. Agent 在完成前重新读取状态，发现仍在工作并主动校正：可能先出现 backlog → in_progress → in_review。<br>2. 本轮没有完成、后续仍要继续：Agent 应写回 in_progress。<br>遇到阻塞：Agent 应写成 blocked。<br>3. Agent 失败且没有再写状态：人工设置的 backlog 可能继续保留；4. 平台已明确的失败回滚主要是 in_progress → todo，此时状态已经不是 in_progress"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"61d9b9d4-88e8-46d4-a5d4-7e40ef2e26f8","title":"agent执行完成后直接变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"eae60433-99af-487b-b2b6-447f41a4ff1d","title":"手动更改状态到待办"},{"parent":"2cd2ffaf-0fec-434d-8920-71e83d72de77","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cb29111d-41c3-4ab2-8182-80f093bb15cb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e4dbe2f1-22d5-4fa1-815e-ede3f837d839","title":"agent执行完成后变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cb29111d-41c3-4ab2-8182-80f093bb15cb","title":"手动更改状态到进行中"},{"parent":"2cd2ffaf-0fec-434d-8920-71e83d72de77","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b4e9a91a-920a-4f71-b087-bb8c7bea24c1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0f5a84dd-abc7-49c6-a693-467752159228","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2d589a5d-bc6e-4ea4-8699-122965f5dee5","title":"其他可能分支：<br><br>1. Agent 本轮未完成、工作仍要继续：可能写成 in_progress，形成 done → in_progress。<br>2. Agent 重新读取状态，识别到 done 是人工明确验收，并决定不覆盖：保持 done。<br>3. 本轮只是答疑，没有产生工单交付物：不应改状态，保持 done。<br>4. Agent 失败且没有进行新的状态写入：通常保持人工设置的 done；已知的服务端失败回滚主要针对 in_progress → todo。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0f5a84dd-abc7-49c6-a693-467752159228","title":"agent执行完成后仍是已完成","icons":[{"color":"rgb(255, 134, 59)","name":"other","index":"375"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b4e9a91a-920a-4f71-b087-bb8c7bea24c1","title":"手动更改状态到已完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2cd2ffaf-0fec-434d-8920-71e83d72de77","title":"任务为待验收，agent执行中时手动更改状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4e05afc3-ed44-4cd0-993a-bd08fceaae3f","title":"Agent 直接回复，状态继续保持 待验收，不应来回切换。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6b5a62f4-f75b-4ae3-9837-d2586a10b627","title":"评论提出完全无关的新任务"},{"parent":"2c64d184-9580-4c49-856a-643d380d72f3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1ce836e4-5040-4b33-ad76-f07f5c2df2aa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7e21e319-55bf-4451-895a-126441270dc0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e62b9305-dd3e-469b-9b69-fcc3b5bcb5f0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3adfd129-5a2d-4bd3-972d-3f3c3579154a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"87cb1dee-ae9c-471f-83ae-fa989de18f86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0d529628-f9d3-4e5e-b2fe-55183dffd0ac","title":"不过还有几个分支：<br><br>1. Agent 在完成前重新读取状态，发现仍在工作并主动校正：可能先出现 backlog → in_progress → in_review。<br>2. 本轮没有完成、后续仍要继续：Agent 应写回 in_progress。<br>遇到阻塞：Agent 应写成 blocked。<br>3. Agent 失败且没有再写状态：人工设置的 backlog 可能继续保留；4. 平台已明确的失败回滚主要是 in_progress → todo，此时状态已经不是 in_progress"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"87cb1dee-ae9c-471f-83ae-fa989de18f86","title":"agent执行完成后直接变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3adfd129-5a2d-4bd3-972d-3f3c3579154a","title":"手动更改状态到待办"},{"parent":"e62b9305-dd3e-469b-9b69-fcc3b5bcb5f0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c0e33d8f-2ec8-46fb-aea6-cbae9918c2bb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"77178d44-9e92-4f5d-b94a-f2e99b06f6e1","title":"agent执行完成后变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c0e33d8f-2ec8-46fb-aea6-cbae9918c2bb","title":"手动更改状态到进行中"},{"parent":"e62b9305-dd3e-469b-9b69-fcc3b5bcb5f0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fa2c96fc-66ec-4c3c-8dcc-cfa376fd2e88","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"84dd9305-f270-4bd2-ac69-8ead6eb0fd54","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dcbe4350-4753-4dcb-b636-97f72b40d86d","title":"其他可能分支：<br><br>1. Agent 本轮未完成、工作仍要继续：可能写成 in_progress，形成 done → in_progress。<br>2. Agent 重新读取状态，识别到 done 是人工明确验收，并决定不覆盖：保持 done。<br>3. 本轮只是答疑，没有产生工单交付物：不应改状态，保持 done。<br>4. Agent 失败且没有进行新的状态写入：通常保持人工设置的 done；已知的服务端失败回滚主要针对 in_progress → todo。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"84dd9305-f270-4bd2-ac69-8ead6eb0fd54","title":"agent执行完成后仍保持已完成","icons":[{"color":"rgb(255, 134, 59)","name":"other","index":"375"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fa2c96fc-66ec-4c3c-8dcc-cfa376fd2e88","title":"手动更改状态到已完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e62b9305-dd3e-469b-9b69-fcc3b5bcb5f0","title":"任务为待验收，agent执行中时手动更改状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7e21e319-55bf-4451-895a-126441270dc0","title":"Agent 直接回复，状态继续保持 待验收，不应来回切换。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1ce836e4-5040-4b33-ad76-f07f5c2df2aa","title":"只是提问、确认或讨论"},{"parent":"2c64d184-9580-4c49-856a-643d380d72f3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c074c4fc-e232-4d73-90a4-b6e5f116386b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a32169bb-8a01-40c4-a442-d6ea61d1d66e","title":"取消工单不会终止已在途的运行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c074c4fc-e232-4d73-90a4-b6e5f116386b","title":"工单改为 cancelled 时 Agent 仍在运行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2c64d184-9580-4c49-856a-643d380d72f3","title":"评论区选择agent执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"541591f2-74d8-4718-b159-df86c3782f98","title":"创建时选择的agent执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"380d988d-3c5c-4b81-b9bc-efff43929e89","title":"状态为待验收"},{"parent":"f5df606e-340c-483a-ab39-cd77d7f8fa7f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0c41e690-275f-4e9e-9ee1-a2f02b4f899a","title":"状态是已阻塞"},{"parent":"f5df606e-340c-483a-ab39-cd77d7f8fa7f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"eced8426-06c1-4fa3-b295-a7973c83a142","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7e7b66a2-34df-4490-87c6-5432c024fa45","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7b58984d-e04d-43b1-a6a4-a678c2b4b016","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a4c13c69-b0b2-495e-898d-b120e7fa2626","title":"任务状态改成进行中，agent执行完成后再变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7b58984d-e04d-43b1-a6a4-a678c2b4b016","title":"评论区@agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7e7b66a2-34df-4490-87c6-5432c024fa45","title":"未有agent执行"},{"parent":"eced8426-06c1-4fa3-b295-a7973c83a142","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"573eaa7c-5254-4660-bc1d-1f3ef6b236fe","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8370cf34-8299-4264-ab3e-3f74240858f7","customWidth":744.2,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f8cd0f5b-38e8-4e0d-927c-c58ec098d2e2","title":"（multica是这样）按评论内容处理：<br><br>1. 原任务需要返工或补充<br><br>推荐流程是：done → todo → in_progress → in_review → done<br><br>- 还没启动 Agent：先把 `done` 改成 `todo`，表示重新进入待执行队列。<br>- Agent 已经因为评论等原因开始实际处理：可以直接把 `done` 改成 `in_progress`，不必机械经过 `todo`。<br>- 完成补充后进入 `in_review`，重新验收通过再回 `done`。<br><br>2. 是一个全新的独立任务：不要重开原工单，建议新建工单。这样原工单的完成记录和验收结论不会被覆盖，新任务也能单独跟踪。<br><br>&nbsp; 需要注意的异常点<br>- 评论可能在 `done` 状态下触发 Agent 运行，但**不会自动把工单改成 `in_progress`**；只有确实开始处理原工单内容时，Agent 才应主动改状态。<br>- 使用 `--no-start` 执行 `done → todo` 时只会改看板，不会启动 Agent。<br>- 工单进入 `done` 后，原有 wakeup 会被禁用；重新打开工单不会自动恢复，需要单独检查并重新启用。<br>- 如果是已完成的子任务被重开，下游阶段不会自动回退。需要人工检查父任务和后续阶段是否也应暂停或退回。<br><br>所以最简单的判断是：**准备重新排队就转 `todo`；已经重新开工就转 `in_progress`；只是提问则继续保持 `done`。** 当前这条属于规则咨询，因此我不会重开本工单。"},{"parent":"8370cf34-8299-4264-ab3e-3f74240858f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2ea2544d-6690-4c19-8a0d-5a91e51f8a47","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4d4d5918-e06e-4c7f-ad1d-4aca7b9109b7","image":{"w":300,"h":149.28366762177652,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb2f325ca3ba630e071b3f","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"294a30fe-4b86-4624-ba0b-e89d367ee556","title":"<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4d4d5918-e06e-4c7f-ad1d-4aca7b9109b7","title":"任务状态改成进行中，agent执行完成后再变成待验收"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2ea2544d-6690-4c19-8a0d-5a91e51f8a47","title":"继续之前的任务"},{"parent":"8370cf34-8299-4264-ab3e-3f74240858f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d090a522-8b97-4f64-8349-b91c1c7b5418","customWidth":328.2,"callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1ede86fb-925f-40e4-8f05-37bb15d033d8","image":{"w":300,"h":152.1781219748306,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb2ebdec6bee6425a50125","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3cc40f41-f6d6-4481-8ee2-73e9099977a5","title":"<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1ede86fb-925f-40e4-8f05-37bb15d033d8","title":"Agent 直接回复，状态继续保持 已完成，不应来回切换。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d090a522-8b97-4f64-8349-b91c1c7b5418","title":"评论提出完全无关的新任务"},{"parent":"8370cf34-8299-4264-ab3e-3f74240858f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a8189fb6-1cab-455d-8ef3-0bd8373714c0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3cc33293-e8b2-4186-bf93-752a66556cbc","image":{"w":300,"h":99.20724801812004,"originalUrl":"","align":"left","url":"https://tc-cdn.processon.com/po/userId2-6abb2de2e0c5ce63ae77c474","direction":"up"},"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a3a925c4-b989-4fda-b370-07264ff3458d","title":"<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3cc33293-e8b2-4186-bf93-752a66556cbc","title":"Agent 直接回复，状态继续保持 已完成，不应来回切换。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a8189fb6-1cab-455d-8ef3-0bd8373714c0","title":"只是提问、确认或讨论"},{"parent":"8370cf34-8299-4264-ab3e-3f74240858f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f722956a-a5f1-4495-92c5-6969de3cd424","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"26d3248b-a94e-47e7-8aec-7dba0806d6c6","title":"取消工单不会终止已在途的运行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f722956a-a5f1-4495-92c5-6969de3cd424","title":"工单改为 cancelled 时 Agent 仍在运行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8370cf34-8299-4264-ab3e-3f74240858f7","title":"评论区@agent"},{"parent":"573eaa7c-5254-4660-bc1d-1f3ef6b236fe","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"07a160d5-e267-41aa-960f-337ae7998132","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c34d7dd1-a587-4f4e-8b56-c6eb0dd72c09","title":"不触发agent执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"07a160d5-e267-41aa-960f-337ae7998132","title":"手动改成待办"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"573eaa7c-5254-4660-bc1d-1f3ef6b236fe","title":"已有agent执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"eced8426-06c1-4fa3-b295-a7973c83a142","title":"状态为已完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f5df606e-340c-483a-ab39-cd77d7f8fa7f","title":"新建任务，负责人是成员"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ed28ceba-0eb5-411b-8f68-5b35c66a8743","title":"卡片状态"},{"parent":"1c878525-74ae-455e-913c-71e57bbdaaf4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"83f01902-c07e-4784-a6f2-2f12c835991f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"87930dfa-96ef-48fe-8fb7-ab6daf0d6541","title":"放在/workspace/generated下"},{"parent":"83f01902-c07e-4784-a6f2-2f12c835991f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a9e3d382-b00c-4ede-bf83-89d54bbb757f","title":"txt"},{"parent":"83f01902-c07e-4784-a6f2-2f12c835991f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6b1b06be-44a9-4ef4-b69c-9466af05328c","title":"word"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"83f01902-c07e-4784-a6f2-2f12c835991f","title":"生成的产物"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1c878525-74ae-455e-913c-71e57bbdaaf4","title":"原始功能点（参考）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a91cde12-392a-4704-8cc7-3c0a85487812","title":"任务看板（房间内）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9a747146-0c0f-4b89-9df2-eb7406543650","_id":"root","title":"活动看板"},{"parent":"root","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"de79807e-910d-408f-a135-d0250b4463cc","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"3235f8c4-8264-4b33-ab74-15b2437c6f14","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"33ade9ee-7a39-457a-a618-b1385e7054c0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3b8a3baf-56a6-4305-b970-bc7c7e15774c","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"d02f5760-28b1-4139-9c36-461320697867","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2a3c4798-9a07-4ae0-af9f-56d7ce33f3f6","title":"前置：已进入房间且左侧 Agents 面板可见；角色：房间成员；入口：Agents 面板中的 Extensions"},{"parent":"d02f5760-28b1-4139-9c36-461320697867","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"894e424d-07a4-4d1c-8a45-f1ce034e3f2e","title":"操作：点击 Extensions 展开二级菜单，查看其中的条目"},{"parent":"d02f5760-28b1-4139-9c36-461320697867","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2d616211-4393-46e8-b06d-a3d9d4a730de","title":"预期：展开后显示 Connectors 与 Skills 两个二级条目；再次点击 Extensions 可收起；收起后 Agents 面板下方的 Projects 与会话列表位置随之上移，不出现遮挡或空白"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"d02f5760-28b1-4139-9c36-461320697867","title":"🔴【P0】Extensions 展开连接器与 Skills 入口"},{"parent":"3b8a3baf-56a6-4305-b970-bc7c7e15774c","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"e515bc32-559a-466b-bab7-bb57a1b7d3c5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"45702e1b-91de-484b-b94f-7eccd22809d5","title":"前置：Extensions 已展开；角色：房间成员；入口：Extensions 下的 Connectors"},{"parent":"e515bc32-559a-466b-bab7-bb57a1b7d3c5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0911e4a1-7bd0-4a4b-848a-b46163703153","title":"操作：点击 Connectors"},{"parent":"e515bc32-559a-466b-bab7-bb57a1b7d3c5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"abb27ebc-3e9d-4e75-9106-0d15922a41b4","title":"预期：Connectors 条目进入选中态并高亮；右侧主区域切换为连接器页，页面标题显示 Connectors；New Session、Agent Management 等其他入口取消选中"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"e515bc32-559a-466b-bab7-bb57a1b7d3c5","title":"🔴【P0】点击 Connectors 打开连接器页"},{"parent":"3b8a3baf-56a6-4305-b970-bc7c7e15774c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aa881687-ae6a-460e-aea7-ba4eb21bebbd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc0ad64d-c343-4646-882e-6af40d0e4424","title":"前置：Extensions 已展开；角色：房间成员；入口：Extensions 下的 Skills"},{"parent":"aa881687-ae6a-460e-aea7-ba4eb21bebbd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5b