"id":"48b94423-10fe-482c-8eee-84b46334c63b","title":"🟡【P2】折叠 Agents 面板后的入口可达性"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a46629d1-73cb-4e76-9ccd-d6c78d1bf838","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"33ade9ee-7a39-457a-a618-b1385e7054c0","title":"扩展入口与二级导航"},{"parent":"3235f8c4-8264-4b33-ab74-15b2437c6f14","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ed2631c0-7e87-434a-979d-bde0f05ad8bc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cb7b637a-ac97-4e4c-a796-8869497c1975","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"73832316-189d-4c1a-8df0-274c038d2b93","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4911bb54-cf1d-44ce-9e52-e09b1d75374e","title":"前置：已打开连接器页；角色：房间成员；入口：Extensions → Connectors"},{"parent":"73832316-189d-4c1a-8df0-274c038d2b93","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c9b87c6-3a13-4849-b962-26fcbf7ca5dd","title":"操作：查看页面自上而下的各区域"},{"parent":"73832316-189d-4c1a-8df0-274c038d2b93","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"490f9145-52ad-45ee-a660-bbcd6743755f","title":"预期：依次展示页面标题 Connectors、宣传横幅（主标题 Unite your apps. Unleash your productivity 与副标题）、Marketplace 与 Installed 两个 Tab、以及当前 Tab 的内容区；默认停留在 Marketplace"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"73832316-189d-4c1a-8df0-274c038d2b93","title":"🔴【P0】连接器页整体框架展示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"cb7b637a-ac97-4e4c-a796-8869497c1975","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c13ab66f-5ccd-49e1-8690-89096e8540fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8189968f-476f-4cc3-a754-4eae0ed3ca85","title":"前置：已打开连接器页；角色：房间成员；入口：页面内 Tab 栏"},{"parent":"c13ab66f-5ccd-49e1-8690-89096e8540fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8b41efa6-5ea2-4285-826c-003f996408a6","title":"操作：点击 Installed 切换，再点回 Marketplace"},{"parent":"c13ab66f-5ccd-49e1-8690-89096e8540fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8386a0b0-eab3-41d4-953f-67d8440a67e6","title":"预期：被选中的 Tab 下方出现下划线且文字加深，另一个 Tab 恢复默认样式；内容区随之切换为对应列表；来回切换时内容正确不串位"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c13ab66f-5ccd-49e1-8690-89096e8540fc","title":"🔴【P0】Marketplace 与 Installed Tab 切换","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{