8425f7b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b11e9370-f8d2-402b-8d30-b74939764ced","title":"预期：两个授权流程互不干扰；各自卡片的状态独立更新；不出现一个授权成功导致另一个也显示已连接"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4f6f73c6-13bf-4fa8-b754-b8e4a8425f7b","title":"🟡【P2】同时对多个连接器发起授权"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d23a4aa8-7960-470c-9050-6a1f8d6c5633","title":"边界场景"}],"id":"5b475919-f3f6-4607-a097-c4734846e958","title":"授权进行中与取消"},{"parent":"70232116-ba28-4f17-bdbe-9816d72005e7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"210162f1-0be7-4b53-8056-2465c47fa115","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8037f7af-c371-42c5-acd9-3c11d4162aa0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9c681910-2936-4614-b1da-63fa0092e836","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"06f73f2e-5621-425e-b568-a72183efbb57","title":"前置：已在授权网页完成登录；角色：房间成员；入口：返回应用后的连接器页"},{"parent":"9c681910-2936-4614-b1da-63fa0092e836","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"12481770-52b8-4675-aa5c-dc1028fa17c5","title":"操作：完成外部授权后返回应用查看"},{"parent":"9c681910-2936-4614-b1da-63fa0092e836","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"42f516d1-c7c5-4213-8153-bcccd6b04c29","title":"预期：该连接器卡片右侧显示 ✓；打开弹窗内显示去试试、解除授权与取消按钮"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9c681910-2936-4614-b1da-63fa0092e836","title":"🔴【P0】授权完成后弹出授权成功弹窗","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"8037f7af-c371-42c5-acd9-3c11d4162aa0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"faa643a6-22d0-4cfc-bee0-197b23b10d99","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6542f89c-e225-40ea-9834-4d980912b78f","title":"前置：某连接器刚授权成功；角色：房间成员；入口：连接器页 Installed Tab"},{"parent":"faa643a6-22d0-4cfc-bee0-197b23b10d99","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a4520fa7-4767-4424-ac9e-3dd171e4f143","title":"操作：切换到 Installed Tab 查找该连接器"},{"parent":"faa643a6-22d0-4cfc-bee0-197b23b10d99","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e97c225c-c9c7-4001-b5df-120fb64de935","title":"预期：该连接器出现在「Installed from marketplace」分组中；行内展示图标、名称、描述、删除入口与开关；开关默认为开启状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"faa643a6-22d0-4cfc-bee0-197b23b10d99","title":"🔴【P0】授权完成后进入已安装 Tab","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":