关将其打开"},{"parent":"8686164c-a17c-4d35-9c3a-01716a350bb0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1d36e7a6-340e-46f9-8c04-32dd81b0ae64","title":"预期：开关立即变为开启态并保持；切换 Tab 或重开房间后仍为开启；输入框连接器面板中该连接器同步显示为已开启"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8686164c-a17c-4d35-9c3a-01716a350bb0","title":"🔴【P0】打开连接器开关"},{"parent":"d195e8e9-0a85-4353-9bb4-27ea386ec883","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e538d8ce-0d23-488f-b648-b73de9e52b4c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0e2161cb-4c1f-4b1b-92b9-d4966951291b","title":"前置：某已安装连接器的开关处于开启状态；角色：房间成员；入口：Installed Tab 行内开关"},{"parent":"e538d8ce-0d23-488f-b648-b73de9e52b4c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e5345b01-40a2-4e2b-94e7-f042b4d4a795","title":"操作：点击开关将其关闭"},{"parent":"e538d8ce-0d23-488f-b648-b73de9e52b4c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"170d0d5f-4a8e-4a3d-9fd3-632432f9db16","title":"预期：开关变为关闭态并保持；连接器仍保留在已安装列表中不被删除；输入框连接器面板中该连接器同步显示为关闭"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e538d8ce-0d23-488f-b648-b73de9e52b4c","title":"🔴【P0】关闭连接器开关"}],"id":"d195e8e9-0a85-4353-9bb4-27ea386ec883","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"7f3204c2-736d-4949-b3c8-5e94ac9e3d83","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"34538f89-39e0-4a7e-b8bb-70a49e36a55d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a21b2870-8192-4986-961b-e55401632eb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4d7ab26d-560c-4c93-845b-dde9d3d21138","title":"前置：某已安装连接器；角色：房间成员；入口：Installed Tab 行内开关"},{"parent":"a21b2870-8192-4986-961b-e55401632eb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1bc0b75f-2049-4d69-961a-01a25c647247","title":"操作：在网络断开时切换开关，等待失败提示后恢复网络重试"},{"parent":"a21b2870-8192-4986-961b-e55401632eb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e4a7a863-a6bb-4819-8555-a240f3e8882a","title":"预期：给出切换失败的明确提示并将开关回滚到操作前的真实状态；不出现界面已切换但实际未生效的不一致；重试后切换成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a21b2870-8192-4986-961b-e55401632eb7","title":"🟠【P1】开关切换失败时状态回滚"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"34538f89-39e0-4a7e-b8bb-70a49e36a55d","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"7f3204c2-736d-4949-b3c8-5e94ac9e3d83","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"132154bc-b63b-472c-9d2f-77947e7a1205","callout":[],"children":[{"pa