c-3916-48a3-9a22-b7836ea44cbe","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"423aa94b-7252-49d9-ae3f-5fba5fec73f2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"eca78a4c-51ed-4feb-920a-fa7acb472776","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fa1a4743-11bd-4731-8196-223b8048a432","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"053bde81-88bb-4cca-968d-f6d8e8b21595","title":"前置：当前网络异常；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框连接器面板"},{"parent":"fa1a4743-11bd-4731-8196-223b8048a432","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e0b74939-dd84-4feb-99f4-22f88813ffcc","title":"操作：在网络断开时展开连接器面板，恢复网络后重新展开"},{"parent":"fa1a4743-11bd-4731-8196-223b8048a432","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ff6276eb-55ae-4cf6-b5cd-95b4be449b02","title":"预期：面板给出加载失败提示与重试入口；不展示为空列表也不长时间停留在加载中；恢复网络后重新展开可正常加载"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fa1a4743-11bd-4731-8196-223b8048a432","title":"🟡【P2】连接器面板加载失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"eca78a4c-51ed-4feb-920a-fa7acb472776","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"423aa94b-7252-49d9-ae3f-5fba5fec73f2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a8a8c75c-4125-489b-b669-214be03fa14a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8739dedb-095c-4359-b7b5-24f601009b44","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d4aef69a-1629-40a1-abee-128ce346038e","title":"前置：应用窗口宽度较小或输入框靠近屏幕边缘；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框连接器面板"},{"parent":"8739dedb-095c-4359-b7b5-24f601009b44","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5ca93cef-dc7d-44a3-9a3d-3deab224544f","title":"操作：在窄窗口下展开连接器面板"},{"parent":"8739dedb-095c-4359-b7b5-24f601009b44","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8689b4f1-78b2-4825-8167-3c83f4c00be0","title":"预期：面板自动调整弹出方向使其完整落在可视区域内；不被窗口边缘裁切；列表可滚动查看全部条目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8739dedb-095c-4359-b7b5-24f601009b44","title":"🟡【P2】面板在窄窗口与页面边缘的展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a8a8c75c-4125-489b-b669-214be03fa14a","title":"边界场景"}],"id":"423aa94b-7252-49d9-ae3f-5fba5fec73f2","title":"面板入口与列表展示"},{"parent":"5bae4cec-8bda-4ba7-a294-b82eb69976e4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"01131b3d-7d5b-4d15-b64e-97fc27258d65","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7c5ccdab-18fe-4a40-9ffb-5a89ab0bdbd2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ed264063-0b11-41ce-b677-f3a195e94ee8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d5a76b9a-aa00-47f3-9680-ed6f41022aed","title":"前置：面板中某连接器显示 Install；角色：房间成员；入口：该条目的 Install 入口"},{"parent":"ed264063-0b11-41ce-b677-f3a195e94ee8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0137df56-b84b-485d-a2cd-a7cb576bb8d6","title":"操作：点击 Install"},{"parent":"ed264063-0b11-41ce-b677-f3a195e94ee8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a4367cb0-8f24-4f73-85b0-a670d071e3f4","title":"预期：弹出安装弹窗；弹窗中展示该连接器的图标、名称与安装说明，底部提供取消与安装两个按钮；弹窗内容对应的是所点击的连接器而非其他条目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ed264063-0b11-41ce-b677-f3a195e94ee8","title":"🔴【P0】点击 Install 弹出安装弹窗"},{"parent":"7c5ccdab-18fe-4a40-9ffb-5a89ab0bdbd2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c94804d1-327c-4613-9f8f-73e6d079e7a8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3f9d6c54-78d2-437f-b66c-e0abc876fec1","title":"前置：安装弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗内的安装按钮"},{"parent":"c94804d1-327c-4613-9f8f-73e6d079e7a8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4cb5744a-9c1c-4850-aa4c-ca717581b79f","title":"操作：点击安装并等待完成"},{"parent":"c94804d1-327c-4613-9f8f-73e6d079e7a8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"104208c7-0354-4adb-b34d-7e830674d69c","title":"预期：安装按钮进入加载态且不可重复点击；安装成功后弹窗关闭，该条目由 Install 变为 Authorize；连接器页 Marketplace 中对应卡片同步变为需要授权，Installed Tab 中出现该连接器"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c94804d1-327c-4613-9f8f-73e6d079e7a8","title":"🔴【P0】弹窗内点击安装完成安装"},{"parent":"7c5ccdab-18fe-4a40-9ffb-5a89ab0bdbd2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"77d2f45b-38b3-4185-acbd-9cbc18a4d2a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d6b2f86e-87dc-4147-a32d-f23d7eb3ee4c","title":"前置：安装弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗内的取消按钮"},{"parent":"77d2f45b-38b3-4185-acbd-9cbc18a4d2a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"008db83c-1176-4d37-89e3-bfe2e02d6f20","title":"操作：点击取消"},{"parent":"77d2f45b-38b3-4185-acbd-9cbc18a4d2a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9616c372-55a2-419e-add9-4f3a22e79745","title":"预期：弹窗关闭且不执行安装；该条目保持 Install 状态；本地不遗留任何运行文件；Marketplace 中该卡片仍为未安装的 + 号"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"77d2f45b-38b3-4185-acbd-9cbc18a4d2a4","title":"🟠【P1】弹窗内点击取消不安装"},{"parent":"7c5ccdab-18fe-4a40-9ffb-5a89ab0bdbd2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"76205ae1-a57b-4bfc-aab9-8d92a35a5d72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c11a690a-01af-4bd7-8e81-40625beda97d","title":"前置：刚在安装弹窗中点击过取消；角色：房间成员；入口：该条目的 Install 入口"},{"parent":"76205ae1-a57b-4bfc-aab9-8d92a35a5d72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b998c966-94eb-45f6-89e4-f96d03b84342","title":"操作：再次点击 Install"},{"parent":"76205ae1-a57b-4bfc-aab9-8d92a35a5d72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7b4a96b2-e4aa-4da5-9d84-18131293cb88","title":"预期：重新弹出安装弹窗且内容与首次一致；点击安装可正常完成安装；不出现点击无反应或弹窗内容为空"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"76205ae1-a57b-4bfc-aab9-8d92a35a5d72","title":"🟠【P1】再次点击 Install 可重新发起"}],"id":"7c5ccdab-18fe-4a40-9ffb-5a89ab0bdbd2","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"01131b3d-7d5b-4d15-b64e-97fc27258d65","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fe3d6c9d-2740-459c-afc4-f512e095cb74","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4249b027-a540-4873-9a09-9eeae4e278f9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"74f45a11-0db1-4545-8d4d-2d404c3694d1","title":"前置：安装弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗内的安装按钮"},{"parent":"4249b027-a540-4873-9a09-9eeae4e278f9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"baf503a6-8701-4266-b6fb-a74175ab498f","title":"操作：在网络断开时点击安装，等待失败提示后恢复网络重新安装"},{"parent":"4249b027-a540-4873-9a09-9eeae4e278f9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"81812f47-eabf-4170-8966-fb63fecfe421","title":"预期：给出安装失败的明确原因与重试入口；按钮从加载态回到可点击的安装态，不残留加载中；本地不遗留半成品运行文件；重试后可安装成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4249b027-a540-4873-9a09-9eeae4e278f9","title":"🟠【P1】弹窗内安装失败"},{"parent":"fe3d6c9d-2740-459c-afc4-f512e095cb74","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"83b81a5c-b8ff-4362-a64f-ec501d618e1e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d805dd7a-5885-4c9f-b281-af2c38fd6579","title":"前置：安装弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗右上角关闭按钮、弹窗外部区域与 Esc 键"},{"parent":"83b81a5c-b8ff-4362-a64f-ec501d618e1e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a8167e80-61de-4cdb-84e7-5b3bf8fc3c04","title":"操作：分别用点击右上角关闭、点击弹窗外部、按 Esc 三种方式关闭弹窗"},{"parent":"83b81a5c-b8ff-4362-a64f-ec501d618e1e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"607087f1-53fe-46e3-9601-41254663c3e8","title":"预期：三种方式均能关闭弹窗且都不执行安装；关闭后条目保持 Install 状态；三种方式的表现一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"83b81a5c-b8ff-4362-a64f-ec501d618e1e","title":"🟡【P2】以其他方式关闭安装弹窗"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fe3d6c9d-2740-459c-afc4-f512e095cb74","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"01131b3d-7d5b-4d15-b64e-97fc27258d65","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c6140f7f-0a0f-4c4d-9ccc-d7bdb2ea78a9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3913ab1e-46bd-4bc5-859b-e2d9a48af5b7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f0b82e93-f09e-46d6-bfc0-0d31803b2d05","title":"前置：已在安装弹窗中点击安装且正在安装中；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗外部区域与面板外部区域"},{"parent":"3913ab1e-46bd-4bc5-859b-e2d9a48af5b7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0c8e2da4-a2fe-4981-883b-0adbba1a9757","title":"操作：在安装进行中关闭弹窗与面板，稍后重新展开面板"},{"parent":"3913ab1e-46bd-4bc5-859b-e2d9a48af5b7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c7266bf8-362e-4c41-8b19-1ae4ead39b2a","title":"预期：安装任务不因关闭弹窗或面板而中断；重新展开后条目展示的是安装完成或失败的真实结果，不停留在旧的加载态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3913ab1e-46bd-4bc5-859b-e2d9a48af5b7","title":"🟡【P2】安装过程中关闭弹窗或面板"},{"parent":"c6140f7f-0a0f-4c4d-9ccc-d7bdb2ea78a9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"207c3760-1538-4e98-b56d-15aafd0f0254","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0cce3f51-ae1e-4b29-bc99-25afd93445ce","title":"前置：安装弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗内的安装按钮"},{"parent":"207c3760-1538-4e98-b56d-15aafd0f0254","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dcb5138d-665f-418d-87f2-a8172183dcd6","title":"操作：连续快速点击安装按钮 10 次"},{"parent":"207c3760-1538-4e98-b56d-15aafd0f0254","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0d43ea6c-236c-40bb-9027-7cf9f7b4f258","title":"预期：只发起一次安装任务；按钮在首次点击后即置为不可点击；Installed Tab 中不出现重复条目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"207c3760-1538-4e98-b56d-15aafd0f0254","title":"🟡【P2】快速连续点击弹窗内安装按钮"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c6140f7f-0a0f-4c4d-9ccc-d7bdb2ea78a9","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"id":"01131b3d-7d5b-4d15-b64e-97fc27258d65","title":"未安装连接器的安装入口"},{"parent":"5bae4cec-8bda-4ba7-a294-b82eb69976e4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c1a7f38b-42a8-4ec5-9085-3c00061d2a13","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f123927d-2a10-45ff-b5b9-f93f5f11f558","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"07e2149f-bd22-4c18-bab7-785cfb75d91b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e5266e67-1e60-4491-b843-e6bfbe19938e","title":"前置：面板中某连接器显示 Authorize；角色：房间成员；入口：该条目的 Authorize 入口"},{"parent":"07e2149f-bd22-4c18-bab7-785cfb75d91b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cb71aa48-e2be-4181-bcc5-26eaa52ff690","title":"操作：点击 Authorize"},{"parent":"07e2149f-bd22-4c18-bab7-785cfb75d91b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c239ed28-6352-40e6-872b-b5c50e9cdd4e","title":"预期：弹出该连接器的授权引导弹窗；弹窗中展示对应产品的图标组、标题（如 Sign in to Lark）与授权范围说明；背景变暗且不可操作下层页面"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"07e2149f-bd22-4c18-bab7-785cfb75d91b","title":"🔴【P0】点击未完成授权的连接器弹出引导弹窗"},{"parent":"f123927d-2a10-45ff-b5b9-f93f5f11f558","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"44b78bf5-600a-41b5-a1b9-164bba8ff58b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3db87bc7-3b98-443c-8911-00418fb514e5","title":"前置：授权引导弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗内容区"},{"parent":"44b78bf5-600a-41b5-a1b9-164bba8ff58b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e6ef7002-3c5e-467e-abba-434a971e1b01","title":"操作：自上而下查看弹窗内的各元素"},{"parent":"44b78bf5-600a-41b5-a1b9-164bba8ff58b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"64d76321-2f09-4c6b-8bc1-3367d9775397","title":"预期：弹窗展示应用图标组、标题、说明文案（说明将通过何种方式连接以及可访问的能力范围，如日历、文档、多维表与会话）、条目说明区与底部主操作按钮；右上角提供关闭按钮"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"44b78bf5-600a-41b5-a1b9-164bba8ff58b","title":"🔴【P0】授权引导弹窗内容完整"},{"parent":"f123927d-2a10-45ff-b5b9-f93f5f11f558","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"adfc9481-97db-45b1-a5b8-e3136c5b31c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"32488478-2317-4214-9983-7da5f4feee5a","title":"前置：授权引导弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗底部主按钮"},{"parent":"adfc9481-97db-45b1-a5b8-e3136c5b31c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bbded06e-d587-46de-9952-30432d4b7c53","title":"操作：点击 Sign in 主按钮"},{"parent":"adfc9481-97db-45b1-a5b8-e3136c5b31c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"852107a8-905c-473f-bbbc-b07f65c24414","title":"预期：打开对应产品的登录授权页；应用内该连接器进入授权中状态；授权页对应的是所点击的连接器而非其他产品"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"adfc9481-97db-45b1-a5b8-e3136c5b31c0","title":"🔴【P0】点击主按钮进入外部授权"},{"parent":"f123927d-2a10-45ff-b5b9-f93f5f11f558","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d6c1bec8-a86e-450a-b16e-db437bd06073","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c52c2fa-aff0-45b7-b6b0-94e641b1dee2","title":"前置：已在外部页面完成登录授权；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框连接器面板"},{"parent":"d6c1bec8-a86e-450a-b16e-db437bd06073","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b9b7a7f8-8976-436e-8360-da6eb1128598","title":"操作：返回应用重新展开连接器面板"},{"parent":"d6c1bec8-a86e-450a-b16e-db437bd06073","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"06131c20-d02c-4fb9-be6f-d8104999f4b0","title":"预期：该条目由 Authorize 变为开关且默认开启；连接器页 Marketplace 与 Installed 中该连接器同步显示为已连接与已安装"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d6c1bec8-a86e-450a-b16e-db437bd06073","title":"🔴【P0】完成授权后条目状态更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f123927d-2a10-45ff-b5b9-f93f5f11f558","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"c1a7f38b-42a8-4ec5-9085-3c00061d2a13","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f849a053-49b0-487f-9ba1-6f23fcabd17f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b6939d32-8b63-452a-9c2c-fb1de5d7e4f7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0a44490d-27e1-4e6e-8d72-04ca42139123","title":"前置：授权引导弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗右上角关闭按钮"},{"parent":"b6939d32-8b63-452a-9c2c-fb1de5d7e4f7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5b034620-3c97-4eb5-87ff-bd256425a794","title":"操作：点击右上角关闭按钮直接退出"},{"parent":"b6939d32-8b63-452a-9c2c-fb1de5d7e4f7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fa3d5539-7467-4775-b81b-5790465fc219","title":"预期：弹窗关闭且不发起授权；条目保持 Authorize 状态；再次点击可重新弹出引导弹窗；不写入任何凭据"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b6939d32-8b63-452a-9c2c-fb1de5d7e4f7","title":"🟠【P1】关闭引导弹窗不完成授权"},{"parent":"f849a053-49b0-487f-9ba1-6f23fcabd17f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8fc63776-14d3-4257-87c4-f58d5d4486fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0ebc86a1-0aa5-4a20-a162-e3fad6c966eb","title":"前置：已从引导弹窗进入外部授权页；角色：房间成员；入口：外部授权页"},{"parent":"8fc63776-14d3-4257-87c4-f58d5d4486fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d8c2b116-1cde-4bf7-bcf8-ad6bc994adab","title":"操作：在授权页选择拒绝或使用无效账号登录，返回应用"},{"parent":"8fc63776-14d3-4257-87c4-f58d5d4486fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ca313ed6-05b6-4e0e-87ee-679339ef1572","title":"预期：条目回到 Authorize 状态并提示授权未通过；不显示为已连接；开关不出现在该条目上"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8fc63776-14d3-4257-87c4-f58d5d4486fc","title":"🟠【P1】外部授权失败或被拒绝"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f849a053-49b0-487f-9ba1-6f23fcabd17f","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"c1a7f38b-42a8-4ec5-9085-3c00061d2a13","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d33e2a31-3f2a-4dbe-a82d-0d64c2cd42d8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"921a9736-8f54-4f95-acde-a45cd5f3b984","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4fb7dd6d-2687-410f-8ffb-f0659e4fc456","title":"前置：应用窗口宽度较小；角色：房间成员；入口：授权引导弹窗"},{"parent":"921a9736-8f54-4f95-acde-a45cd5f3b984","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"32ac74e5-2a3b-4122-b84c-89154c6a4cb2","title":"操作：在窄窗口下打开授权引导弹窗"},{"parent":"921a9736-8f54-4f95-acde-a45cd5f3b984","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"754be5b2-604e-4f43-aff7-778712c1a2f5","title":"预期：弹窗自适应宽度且内容完整不截断；说明文案换行正常；主按钮与关闭按钮均完整可见可点击"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"921a9736-8f54-4f95-acde-a45cd5f3b984","title":"🟡【P2】引导弹窗在窄窗口下的展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d33e2a31-3f2a-4dbe-a82d-0d64c2cd42d8","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c1a7f38b-42a8-4ec5-9085-3c00061d2a13","title":"未授权连接器与授权引导弹窗"},{"parent":"5bae4cec-8bda-4ba7-a294-b82eb69976e4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"259439c1-e438-4d97-bfd4-a8e7f14f2668","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d841f232-efd3-4c6e-81e2-85f61d32084a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9202c24e-0608-45c7-919e-fd933e34399a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"21a417b9-3ef3-46af-8029-843489f499ff","title":"前置：面板中某已授权连接器的开关处于关闭状态；角色：房间成员；入口：该条目的开关"},{"parent":"9202c24e-0608-45c7-919e-fd933e34399a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4513d193-a219-458b-9d4c-c9c7f0d689a8","title":"操作：点击开关将其打开"},{"parent":"9202c24e-0608-45c7-919e-fd933e34399a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2771fca5-9409-4e58-bc3f-5fda5b759cf0","title":"预期：开关变为开启态；关闭面板重新展开后仍为开启；连接器页 Installed Tab 中该连接器开关同步为开启"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9202c24e-0608-45c7-919e-fd933e34399a","title":"🔴【P0】在面板中开启连接器"},{"parent":"d841f232-efd3-4c6e-81e2-85f61d32084a","callout":[],"c