:true,"id":"00c3ece0-3fdc-40dd-b731-1751004efdc5","title":"🟠【P1】开关切换失败时回滚"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"46bda6bc-ea6c-4bda-b28b-63ca89a827e8","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"259439c1-e438-4d97-bfd4-a8e7f14f2668","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6f8a95a5-17ae-4bff-82e4-72ebfb2fcfa3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"20cb6b02-41f5-4338-9f26-a638ce76b025","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0b818f33-eb4f-4581-91e1-a7d1d810871e","title":"前置：面板中某已授权连接器；角色：房间成员；入口：该条目开关"},{"parent":"20cb6b02-41f5-4338-9f26-a638ce76b025","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cafd165b-7c7e-4df0-be4b-f8b3ec6e3c4c","title":"操作：连续快速点击同一开关 10 次"},{"parent":"20cb6b02-41f5-4338-9f26-a638ce76b025","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"04bf2ea3-0445-4864-a258-0db6cebc21e3","title":"预期：最终状态与最后一次点击一致；中间不出现开关闪回；不产生重复请求；与 Installed Tab 中的状态保持一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"20cb6b02-41f5-4338-9f26-a638ce76b025","title":"🟡【P2】快速连续切换面板内开关"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6f8a95a5-17ae-4bff-82e4-72ebfb2fcfa3","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"259439c1-e438-4d97-bfd4-a8e7f14f2668","title":"已授权连接器开关"},{"parent":"5bae4cec-8bda-4ba7-a294-b82eb69976e4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fea0b2f0-3c07-42c0-8434-35457ec61458","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f6211273-288a-427f-98b6-15faa52f0aae","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1ec942fe-6ee5-44f6-b97e-6f9bfd0f42fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"68d69310-a7d9-477d-bdf3-cddfd354017d","title":"前置：连接器面板已展开且底部有「View more connectors」；角色：房间成员；入口：面板底部入口"},{"parent":"1ec942fe-6ee5-44f6-b97e-6f9bfd0f42fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"279203f9-182d-441b-96a7-8239259dc511","title":"操作：点击 View more connectors"},{"parent":"1ec942fe-6ee5-44f6-b97e-6f9bfd0f42fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0b70d517-dea3-40c1-a8a8-372855a29124","title":"预期：跳转到「连接器-市场」Tab 并展示完整连接器列表；面板关闭；输入框中已输入的内容不丢失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1ec942fe-6ee5-44f6-b97e-6f9bfd0f42fd","title":"🔴【P0】点击查看更多跳转市场"},{"parent":"f6211273-288a-427f-98b6-15faa52f0aae","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e1de8375-7726-41f1-870f-514e21de0044","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"878d7764-b749-48a3-a2c6-c6e0ca9efdd5","title":"前置：刚通过查看更多进入连接器市场；角色：房间成员；入口：Agents 面板中的会话"},{"parent":"e1de8375-7726-41f1-870f-514e21de0044","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"14864d3c-f67d-47cf-9fe6-58d5e7812661","title":"操作：在市场中安装并授权一个连接器，然后返回原会话并展开连接器面板"},{"parent":"e1de8375-7726-41f1-870f-514e21de0044","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"01de185b-4254-43d4-bd5f-c689436ce37c","title":"预期：该连接器在面板中显示为开关状态且默认开启；面板列表已按最新状态刷新，不需要重开房间"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e1de8375-7726-41f1-870f-514e21de0044","title":"🟠【P1】从市场返回会话后面板状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f6211273-288a-427f-98b6-15faa52f0aae","title":"正常场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fea0b2f0-3c07-42c0-8434-35457ec61458","title":"查看更多连接器"},{"parent":"5bae4cec-8bda-4ba7-a294-b82eb69976e4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2e27519d-e3bc-47b7-b344-a9300cd6779c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5091e922-d2c2-4086-b6ba-8abb4fe7a9c6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ade57760-6c6e-4ddb-87d7-a6c197c3b5a2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"38a16500-7791-4444-be96-640d6752b022","title":"前置：面板中某已授权连接器的开关刚被打开；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框底部图标区"},{"parent":"ade57760-6c6e-4ddb-87d7-a6c197c3b5a2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"287df96e-4ab0-4a89-915b-3adc2608bd21","title":"操作：关闭面板后查看输入框底部的图标区"},{"parent":"ade57760-6c6e-4ddb-87d7-a6c197c3b5a2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d7b6ac6c-b1ed-4850-93d7-bd005bbc4569","title":"预期：该连接器的图标出现在输入框底部的连接器图标区；图标与该连接器一致不错位；悬浮可见连接器名称"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ade57760-6c6e-4ddb-87d7-a6c197c3b5a2","title":"🔴【P0】开启后图标显示在输入框"},{"parent":"5091e922-d2c2-4086-b6ba-8abb4fe7a9c6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e909f538-a565-4154-b77a-d4535eed1ec4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"07bf34ed-d9ec-48aa-a875-c8be9703f8fc","title":"前置：某连接器已开启且图标显示在输入框；角色：房间成员；入口：连接器面板开关"},{"parent":"e909f538-a565-4154-b77a-d4535eed1ec4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bcffaf9a-6950-4497-a635-5c3d843ec5b2","title":"操作：在面板中关闭该连接器的开关，再查看输入框底部图标区"},{"parent":"e909f538-a565-4154-b77a-d4535eed1ec4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a425e705-6415-45ee-b08b-b386b53e174d","title":"预期：该连接器图标从输入框中移除；其他已开启连接器的图标保留且位置不错乱"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e909f538-a565-4154-b77a-d4535eed1ec4","title":"🔴【P0】关闭后图标从输入框移除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5091e922-d2c2-4086-b6ba-8abb4fe7a9c6","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"2e27519d-e3bc-47b7-b344-a9300cd6779c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5f4111e2-26c9-4944-a802-d090715ac637","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a7aff05f-9019-480e-889b-7da8e485a346","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"00bc1a12-35d3-42ac-b8f9-ce8cd6b38240","title":"前置：已授权并开启 6 个以上连接器；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框底部图标区"},{"parent":"a7aff05f-9019-480e-889b-7da8e485a346","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4777c0f8-7ebf-4c82-9949-e4b6fbeba55a","title":"操作：查看输入框底部的连接器图标展示"},{"parent":"a7aff05f-9019-480e-889b-7da8e485a346","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"68da60ed-0504-4490-a274-91631414ed38","title":"预期：图标区在超出可用宽度时折叠或以数量角标收纳，不挤压输入框其他按钮；折叠后可展开查看全部已开启连接器"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a7aff05f-9019-480e-889b-7da8e485a346","title":"🟡【P2】开启连接器数量较多时的图标区"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5f4111e2-26c9-4944-a802-d090715ac637","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2e27519d-e3bc-47b7-b344-a9300cd6779c","title":"连接器图标与输入框联动"}],"id":"5bae4cec-8bda-4ba7-a294-b82eb69976e4","title":"输入框连接器面板"},{"parent":"de79807e-910d-408f-a135-d0250b4463cc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"41bb55b8-fa39-416f-98b8-2ad992b8d739","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5ceb30af-1e15-4951-9f43-54fdf7830a25","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fb46a69f-4efe-44ca-8b89-184ed4ad5e5a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f2411b3f-e45a-4759-ad91-82c0242ee961","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc8b14ac-0ec1-4ef7-89e3-64bcd864063b","title":"前置：某连接器已授权且开关处于开启；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"f2411b3f-e45a-4759-ad91-82c0242ee961","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6efe6a32-f818-4922-bca6-aa74543709c2","title":"操作：发送一条需要该连接器才能完成的任务，观察工具调用详情"},{"parent":"f2411b3f-e45a-4759-ad91-82c0242ee961","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9013e9da-e7f2-46c5-9947-36912ed9c7ad","title":"预期：Agent 成功调用该连接器并返回真实结果；工具调用详情中可见对该连接器的调用记录与参数；任务正常完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f2411b3f-e45a-4759-ad91-82c0242ee961","title":"🔴【P0】开启后 Agent 可调用连接器能力"},{"parent":"fb46a69f-4efe-44ca-8b89-184ed4ad5e5a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d99fbe1d-4c96-4b4d-ac94-697ccd867df0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df520aed-8996-439d-a9bf-14c6e76f6a76","title":"前置：某连接器已授权但开关处于关闭；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"d99fbe1d-4c96-4b4d-ac94-697ccd867df0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7a11446-9801-41a4-9814-2ced2392762f","title":"操作：发送同一条需要该连接器的任务"},{"parent":"d99fbe1d-4c96-4b4d-ac94-697ccd867df0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1042912e-25d0-493a-95e9-6869f46c796a","title":"预期：Agent 不调用该连接器并明确说明该能力当前不可用或需先开启；不出现调用后长时间无响应；提示中指向开启该连接器的入口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d99fbe1d-4c96-4b4d-ac94-697ccd867df0","title":"🔴【P0】关闭后 Agent 不再调用该连接器"},{"parent":"fb46a69f-4efe-44ca-8b89-184ed4ad5e5a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"caf25fcb-76c9-44e5-a75a-ea2891bdbeaa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"73d7edb1-7e54-4a97-a87d-3a84d1ee7274","title":"前置：会话正在运行且目标连接器处于关闭；角色：房间成员；入口：连接器面板开关"},{"parent":"caf25fcb-76c9-44e5-a75a-ea2891bdbeaa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"924f19ec-a758-4986-ac62-494bc81f9bca","title":"操作：在 Agent 回复过程中打开该连接器开关，等待本轮结束后再发送需要它的任务"},{"parent":"caf25fcb-76c9-44e5-a75a-ea2891bdbeaa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6f79fecc-2cb9-4578-a60d-995e1166068c","title":"预期：开关切换不影响正在进行的回复；下一轮任务中该连接器可被正常调用；界面状态与实际生效范围一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"caf25fcb-76c9-44e5-a75a-ea2891bdbeaa","title":"🟠【P1】会话运行中开启连接器"}],"id":"fb46a69f-4efe-44ca-8b89-184ed4ad5e5a","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"5ceb30af-1e15-4951-9f43-54fdf7830a25","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"63a865a2-58ee-45d7-820b-6610ff61a1bc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0e81e511-fba5-4558-b076-f512ed48d11e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc6d0609-f457-4f60-a02b-eeacfab74e84","title":"前置：某连接器未安装；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"0e81e511-fba5-4558-b076-f512ed48d11e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"baba1502-54ac-489a-ad6f-c2c3f9e1d512","title":"操作：发送一条需要该连接器的任务"},{"parent":"0e81e511-fba5-4558-b076-f512ed48d11e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c16838ac-bc66-4102-a479-628df19b7945","title":"预期：Agent 明确说明该连接器尚未安装并给出前往安装的引导；不返回无信息量的失败；不产生持续等待的僵尸会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0e81e511-fba5-4558-b076-f512ed48d11e","title":"🟠【P1】未安装时要求使用该连接器能力"},{"parent":"63a865a2-58ee-45d7-820b-6610ff61a1bc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6668511e-09eb-41c9-9041-f134ba9e2064","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"71f48e5a-50c4-436b-97ca-241651c0de51","title":"前置：某连接器已安装但未授权；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"6668511e-09eb-41c9-9041-f134ba9e2064","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8a3ef37f-47e7-49a9-b6df-3f789b110ce9","title":"操作：发送一条需要该连接器的任务"},{"parent":"6668511e-09eb-41c9-9041-f134ba9e2064","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8acc8d65-56e0-4e1c-b4fc-d21b911b6eea","title":"预期：Agent 明确说明需要先完成授权并给出授权入口；不静默失败也不返回伪造结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6668511e-09eb-41c9-9041-f134ba9e2064","title":"🟠【P1】已安装未授权时要求使用该连接器能力"},{"parent":"63a865a2-58ee-45d7-820b-6610ff61a1bc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"59103ab4-b080-4d90-a096-2e8d2497c18a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"01c89585-e9e9-488b-91f2-3332cdc6d378","title":"前置：某连接器已授权并可用；角色：房间成员；入口：外部产品的账号设置与会话输入框"},{"parent":"59103ab4-b080-4d90-a096-2e8d2497c18a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"32a96cbf-0071-4845-8826-0d027069b813","title":"操作：在外部产品中撤销该连接器的授权，回到会话再次发送需要它的任务"},{"parent":"59103ab4-b080-4d90-a096-2e8d2497c18a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5e50a7d-ab39-435d-a1aa-6eab696e05c0","title":"预期：给出授权已失效、需要重新授权的明确提示；应用内该连接器状态同步更新为需要授权；重新授权后可恢复调用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"59103ab4-b080-4d90-a096-2e8d2497c18a","title":"🟠【P1】授权在使用过程中失效"},{"parent":"63a865a2-58ee-45d7-820b-6610ff61a1bc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"616174c6-7503-4b08-82ce-f98e99145342","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d12978a9-40a4-483a-b1c6-eac135563332","title":"前置：某连接器已开启但目标服务不可达；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"616174c6-7503-4b08-82ce-f98e99145342","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb96f9ab-5fdf-49cb-9fe5-c12d2d0ea833","title":"操作：发送一条需要该连接器的任务并等待结果"},{"parent":"616174c6-7503-4b08-82ce-f98e99145342","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bbd9f1ce-c537-49b2-86ad-b67766556353","title":"预期：工具调用在合理时间内结束并给出可读的失败原因；会话状态收敛为失败或继续执行其余步骤；不长期停留在调用中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"616174c6-7503-4b08-82ce-f98e99145342","title":"🟡【P2】连接器调用超时或返回错误"}],"id":"63a865a2-58ee-45d7-820b-6610ff61a1bc","title":"异常场景（4）"}],"id":"5ceb30af-1e15-4951-9f43-54fdf7830a25","title":"连接器能力调用"},{"parent":"41bb55b8-fa39-416f-98b8-2ad992b8d739","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d4efc56a-0622-40e3-9775-da6daf2e9e89","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dd5a379d-9f36-41df-a835-1f6a2dad126c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f4c6b3ce-c94e-49ab-8c54-42a61635f111","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ab3bdb5e-2ce9-4e90-8d49-7fa509781398","title":"前置：某连接器刚完成安装与授权；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace、Installed Tab 与输入框连接器面板"},{"parent":"f4c6b3ce-c94e-49ab-8c54-42a61635f111","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7df8196b-8180-4f0b-b9d4-420c912e3a52","title":"操作：依次在三处查看该连接器的状态"},{"parent":"f4c6b3ce-c94e-49ab-8c54-42a61635f111","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"04c5a0a6-71e3-4e40-a8d9-97ee5708acf3","title":"预期：Marketplace 显示已连接与 ✓；Installed Tab 中存在该条目且开关开启；输入框面板中显示为开关且开启；三处描述一致不矛盾"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f4c6b3ce-c94e-49ab-8c54-42a61635f111","title":"🔴【P0】市场、已安装与输入框面板三处状态一致"},{"parent":"dd5a379d-9f36-41df-a835-1f6a2dad126c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b3056b5b-72cc-4f6e-a815-5a9aa2cfe109","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f33c204f-6a63-4adb-b72c-4bea8b745112","title":"前置：某连接器处于已连接且开启；角色：房间成员；入口：Installed Tab 与输入框连接器面板"},{"parent":"b3056b5b-72cc-4f6e-a815-5a9aa2cfe109","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4cedc39e-8341-49bd-a489-a565315a14f2","title":"操作：在 Installed Tab 关闭该连接器开关，再打开输入框连接器面板查看"},{"parent":"b3056b5b-72cc-4f6e-a815-5a9aa2cfe109","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c636dee0-5a68-4cf5-99da-9eb465e9f59d","title":"预期：面板中该连接器同步显示为关闭；反向操作同样同步；无需刷新页面或重开房间"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b3056b5b-72cc-4f6e-a815-5a9aa2cfe109","title":"🔴【P0】一处变更后其余入口同步"},{"parent":"dd5a379d-9f36-41df-a835-1f6a2dad126c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6ccfe46e-afeb-49dd-9468-f2af40e0e660","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"484418b7-408e-4d46-993a-3f18c4b0d410","title":"前置：某连接器处于已连接状态；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 卡片、Installed Tab 与输入框面板"},{"parent":"6ccfe46e-afeb-49dd-9468-f2af40e0e660","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ae8bf64-d686-4e6b-800f-3d83eed76f4b","title":"操作：从 Marketplace 卡片执行卸载，随后查看其余两处"},{"parent":"6ccfe46e-afeb-49dd-9468-f2af40e0e660","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"35213191-8209-43c1-bb03-6cfff4b3d04d","title":"预期：Installed Tab 中该条目移除；输入框面板中该连接器回到 Install 状态；Marketplace 卡片显示 + 号；输入框底部该连接器图标消失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6ccfe46e-afeb-49dd-9468-f2af40e0e660","title":"🟠【P1】卸载后三处状态同步"},{"parent":"dd5a379d-9f36-41df-a835-1f6a2dad126c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0ffbaa47-1867-4d8c-ac1b-00e43b810330","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b38be137-9336-4d6f-b7e5-b9558f0721dc","title":"前置：同一连接器处于未安装状态；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 卡片 + 号与输入框面板 Install"},{"parent":"0ffbaa47-1867-4d8c-ac1b-00e43b810330","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cf3683b1-4379-4ed1-9764-9d6f57fab654","title":"操作：先从输入框面板点击 Install 走安装弹窗完成安装，卸载后再从 Marketplace 点击 + 号安装，对比两次的交互与结果"},{"parent":"0ffbaa47-1867-4d8c-ac1b-00e43b810330","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae456ac5-63c4-41d6-8299-606d39908b03","title":"预期：两个入口安装完成后的最终状态一致：卡片显示需要授权、面板条目显示 Authorize、Installed Tab 中出现该连接器；两处的安装确认交互按产品定义保持一致"},{"parent":"0ffbaa47-1867-4d8c-ac1b-00e43b810330","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd797777-2adc-41dc-abf1-7cd3b178b952","title":"备注：输入框面板已确认为「点安装弹弹窗」；Marketplace 的 + 号是否同样弹确认弹窗待产品确认"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0ffbaa47-1867-4d8c-ac1b-00e43b810330","title":"🟠【P1】两个安装入口的交互与结果一致"}],"id":"dd5a379d-9f36-41df-a835-1f6a2dad126c","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"d4efc56a-0622-40e3-9775-da6daf2e9e89","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"57a57f40-6a60-4cf5-8d47-e5ffdc4de7f3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f5a22c64-72b3-4369-b9d6-06e1788a3391","callout"