回复都展示在同一话题详情内，发送人和顺序正确。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"10341634-5bdb-4f65-8811-68cf8b58e340","title":"多成员回复同一话题","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f7e3c999-4adc-406d-98ed-ca011bd6e824","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a3c19d75-822b-4485-8048-6fc14d34ef53","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f1bbcc95-0134-47e1-8519-3d5062ea85a0","title":"操作：同一用户连续发送 5 条话题回复。"},{"parent":"a3c19d75-822b-4485-8048-6fc14d34ef53","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"834cb80f-ee2e-44b8-b2c2-c968a13512d8","title":"预期：5 条回复均发送成功且不重复，话题总数正确。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a3c19d75-822b-4485-8048-6fc14d34ef53","title":"连续发送多条回复","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f7e3c999-4adc-406d-98ed-ca011bd6e824","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bb6a4eab-453d-4335-9d91-92c9ff2113af","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c298480c-888c-49ac-a4cb-c87926c78c98","title":"操作：发送一条话题回复后观察输入框。"},{"parent":"bb6a4eab-453d-4335-9d91-92c9ff2113af","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"08446760-d594-4ccf-8bbb-bf5be101bee3","title":"预期：输入框清空并保持可继续输入状态。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bb6a4eab-453d-4335-9d91-92c9ff2113af","title":"回复后输入框清空","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f7e3c999-4adc-406d-98ed-ca011bd6e824","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"18935a5b-122d-469f-88fb-c70c5656bbbf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0d9e35e0-350f-4a75-876c-c6f2f901a18c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"95f9a85e-e296-4b8a-bbdf-e6f1503b2fbb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0e15cc9e-17d6-40f9-9844-a9ddd3147bc8","title":"操作：输入空内容、空格或换行后点击发送。"},{"parent":"95f9a85e-e296-4b8a-bbdf-e6f1503b2fbb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b2680a56-a361-443f-a771-436ca168d841","title":"预期：不可发送或提示内容不能为空，回复总数不变。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"95f9a85e-e296-4b8a-bbdf-e6f1503b2fbb","title":"空内容发送","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"0d9e35e0-350f-4a75-876c-c6f2f901a18c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":