b934-7efa233d74c4","title":"🟠【P1】退出房间的成员产生的文件","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"caa71d83-3147-47a7-b63d-d9b838666194","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a7a67c3a-d788-4161-a25f-ff99dea55d3a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dc56907f-23a8-453e-8a4d-06fcee44ed0a","title":"操作：查看文件中心下的文件"},{"parent":"a7a67c3a-d788-4161-a25f-ff99dea55d3a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"303f2db2-8ed8-4c1f-b72a-c035b775afb1","title":"预期：不展示隐藏文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a7a67c3a-d788-4161-a25f-ff99dea55d3a","title":"🟠【P1】隐藏文件不展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"caa71d83-3147-47a7-b63d-d9b838666194","title":"异常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d3aeb2b0-d8db-45ba-af2c-58d3ed4bc73b","title":"全部文件 tab 的数据来源"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bfe4e83a-d544-4a63-a570-6e89c783265a","title":"文件中心入口与数据来源"},{"parent":"45a3c61b-b066-47ee-8c28-ca62c6b56fcc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"873b92fd-e4d1-439c-aa3c-9b9423ade626","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"42c3bbc0-350f-4020-b069-2b9e9a6421e7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a0816698-a57c-4c4f-b911-21c002f2b1d8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"12f1fea0-6c55-49a6-b23e-cec5f93b333c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e7dd8e37-12ae-460a-9097-0b38ba7ec44b","title":"前置：文件中心已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：工具栏的上传按钮"},{"parent":"12f1fea0-6c55-49a6-b23e-cec5f93b333c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d7ec605e-9f47-4cea-829b-051d58b08c30","title":"操作：点击上传，在本地文件窗口中多选文件与文件夹后确认"},{"parent":"12f1fea0-6c55-49a6-b23e-cec5f93b333c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0c7b7d16-3223-45d8-b7ca-f2ce4945a9fe","title":"预期：\n1) 文件落盘 ｜ 支持单选与多选，文件与文件夹都可选\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 选择后在文件传输面板中出现对应条目并显示上传进度\n3) 列表展示 ｜ 上传完成后文件出现在当前目录下"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"12f1fea0-6c55-49a6-b23e-cec5f93b333c","title":"🔴【P0】上传文件与文件夹"},{"parent":"a0816698-a57c-4c4f-b911-21c002f2b1d8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"48e0871f-3782-4078-b112-cef3bdc3bee1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a0a33721-d925-4958-a801-c4625edaa6da","title":"前置：已进入某个文件夹的二级目录；角色：房间成员；入口：工具栏的上传按钮"},{"parent":"48e0871f-3782-4078-b112-cef3bdc3bee1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0e05795b-d122-45f1-97b3-abf3b9e1ece4","title":"操作：上传一个文件"},{"parent":"48e0871f-3782-4078-b112-cef3bdc3bee1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"558916e1-f1c2-46ff-b267-5a0f98bdcaa3","title":"预期：\n1) 文件落盘 ｜ 文件落到当前所在的目录，而不是根目录\n2) 目录导航 ｜ 面包屑与当前目录不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"48e0871f-3782-4078-b112-cef3bdc3bee1","title":"🟠【P1】在子目录中上传"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a0816698-a57c-4c4f-b911-21c002f2b1d8","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"42c3bbc0-350f-4020-b069-2b9e9a6421e7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8744f317-3fee-4037-823c-133c8fd1c6ef","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"84459e37-a11d-4135-ae23-6faefbc1a47b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c51d5291-7fb6-4a14-9a72-b8074fcc7abb","title":"前置：当前目录下已存在同名文件；角色：房间成员；入口：工具栏的上传按钮"},{"parent":"84459e37-a11d-4135-ae23-6faefbc1a47b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"abd6dc26-9da5-4ba2-840a-08fdb83b26f2","title":"操作：上传一个同名文件"},{"parent":"84459e37-a11d-4135-ae23-6faefbc1a47b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"187f8a1d-2cbf-4f22-a287-a57b6d4c8156","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 按产品定义给出覆盖确认或自动重命名，行为一致不随机\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不静默覆盖已有文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"84459e37-a11d-4135-ae23-6faefbc1a47b","title":"🟠【P1】上传同名文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8744f317-3fee-4037-823c-133c8fd1c6ef","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"42c3bbc0-350f-4020-b069-2b9e9a6421e7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dfabd5a9-1e2e-471c-ae15-c80a72d0410f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7fa15e2d-62bb-4f75-b9cd-6e46ccd9dd8b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"03f75d1d-104d-4b14-b626-9ecbab0e2fb9","title":"前置：本地存在超过系统允许最大值的文件；角色：房间成员；入口：工具栏的上传按钮"},{"parent":"7fa15e2d-62bb-4f75-b9cd-6e46ccd9dd8b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b4a457a2-0551-48c6-845a-e0ab97af3fb2","title":"操作：选择该文件上传"},{"parent":"7fa15e2d-62bb-4f75-b9cd-6e46ccd9dd8b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"acf8d227-8200-48b5-971c-2d1dda926a5b","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 给出超出大小限制的明确提示\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不进入传输队列也不产生半成品文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7fa15e2d-62bb-4f75-b9cd-6e46ccd9dd8b","title":"🟡【P2】上传超大文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dfabd5a9-1e2e-471c-ae15-c80a72d0410f","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"42c3bbc0-350f-4020-b069-2b9e9a6421e7","title":"上传"},{"parent":"873b92fd-e4d1-439c-aa3c-9b9423ade626","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"85fb077f-13c1-47c4-90de-9d6aeb43b9dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7cbc0866-e061-4178-9290-6a395df190eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"05dbfe3c-57ae-4ec4-8788-ddb1874a4a7d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"effb0628-acb7-428d-9a12-50c5cf7cdafc","title":"前置：当前目录下有文件与文件夹；角色：房间成员；入口：工具栏的批量选择"},{"parent":"05dbfe3c-57ae-4ec4-8788-ddb1874a4a7d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"72ac49e5-64a3-426c-a28c-335eaf449a99","title":"操作：点击进入批量模式，勾选若干项后再点击退出"},{"parent":"05dbfe3c-57ae-4ec4-8788-ddb1874a4a7d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"735557f9-eb3e-44e8-b4e6-7986f7e28d29","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 进入后按钮变为退出批量选择，每行左侧出现复选框\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 底部出现已选数量条\n3) 副作用 ｜ 退出后勾选状态清空，不残留到下次进入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"05dbfe3c-57ae-4ec4-8788-ddb1874a4a7d","title":"🔴【P0】进入与退出批量模式"},{"parent":"7cbc0866-e061-4178-9290-6a395df190eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b6fe9ac7-8e80-4dcc-bf45-c7bb40738314","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d945344d-a0b0-4947-9046-0909b076cbaf","title":"前置：已进入批量模式；角色：房间成员；入口：行复选框与全选"},{"parent":"b6fe9ac7-8e80-4dcc-bf45-c7bb40738314","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c443efd9-79c0-4b3e-b2cc-2c3975cadb14","title":"操作：先勾选两项，再点全选，再取消全选"},{"parent":"b6fe9ac7-8e80-4dcc-bf45-c7bb40738314","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5f4cf830-0658-4c63-b5f1-a9922151212c","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 底部数量与实际勾选数实时一致\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ 全选与取消全选均生效，勾选状态可视"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b6fe9ac7-8e80-4dcc-bf45-c7bb40738314","title":"🔴【P0】全选与部分勾选"},{"parent":"7cbc0866-e061-4178-9290-6a395df190eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3ea75e48-1cba-4203-8b3d-e360b0aa6478","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"40443a6e-41e5-48fa-96ab-ed917d16e826","title":"前置：批量模式下已勾选多个文件与文件夹；角色：房间成员；入口：底部操作条"},{"parent":"3ea75e48-1cba-4203-8b3d-e360b0aa6478","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e79060f4-97ae-4ce0-b8ef-deac8a618a9f","title":"操作：查看底部提供的操作"},{"parent":"3ea75e48-1cba-4203-8b3d-e360b0aa6478","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"032aa0e5-e21c-4422-a89e-e256ce9b22d7","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 提供下载、复制与删除三项，删除为红色危险样式\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ 不提供批量分享，分享只能在单个文件上进行"},{"parent":"3ea75e48-1cba-4203-8b3d-e360b0aa6478","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"92b6ebcb-5838-4056-b87e-93860198f9eb","title":"备注：批量分享已下线，本条含反向校验"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3ea75e48-1cba-4203-8b3d-e360b0aa6478","title":"🔴【P0】批量操作项"},{"parent":"7cbc0866-e061-4178-9290-6a395df190eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1c4da31b-558c-4626-a86c-139766e01c83","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d0332915-88cd-4db3-9b77-8b622252fa9c","title":"前置：批量模式下已勾选多个条目；角色：房间成员；入口：底部的下载与删除"},{"parent":"1c4da31b-558c-4626-a86c-139766e01c83","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f557de59-3b04-4fb3-8459-a68eb8763894","title":"操作：先批量下载，再批量删除并确认"},{"parent":"1c4da31b-558c-4626-a86c-139766e01c83","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"65907d75-cf6d-43b1-a3a5-960a4d56d1de","title":"预期：\n1) 产物预览 ｜ 下载包含全部所选项，文件夹按打包方式处理\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 删除前给出二次确认并说明影响范围\n3) 列表展示 ｜ 确认后所选项从列表移除，已选数量归零"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1c4da31b-558c-4626-a86c-139766e01c83","title":"🔴【P0】批量下载与删除"},{"parent":"7cbc0866-e061-4178-9290-6a395df190eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"98af5830-13e7-4cfa-940d-2cb2ea2e4a74","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3eceac66-2c78-472b-9455-636fce58c1f4","title":"前置：批量模式下已勾选多个条目；角色：房间成员；入口：底部的复制"},{"parent":"98af5830-13e7-4cfa-940d-2cb2ea2e4a74","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"50217600-4be5-4fa1-8b75-6786478a9f96","title":"操作：点击复制"},{"parent":"98af5830-13e7-4cfa-940d-2cb2ea2e4a74","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"309ebd47-0216-453c-9b17-93cf98712f29","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 复制的目标位置与结果明确，复制后源文件保留\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 复制产生的副本按命名规则出现在目标位置，不与源文件同名冲突"},{"parent":"98af5830-13e7-4cfa-940d-2cb2ea2e4a74","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ef3b04a3-b58e-4ddd-ad53-193c82b997b9","title":"备注：批量复制的目标位置（当前目录、剪贴板还是选择目录）需产品确认"}],"collapse