十七种扩展名的文件，一个不漏\n2) 副作用 ｜ 视频、图片、网页类型的文件不出现"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"63a26463-f64b-466a-8d58-60389ade8806","title":"🔴【P0】文档类型筛选"},{"parent":"3cdff38d-4794-4ea8-8b29-3f989b7fcc71","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0121ae59-a078-42e3-943b-09c3d1cc90ed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f510784d-e7a7-4ac3-8c99-1db3756bb257","title":"前置：当前目录下有 mp4、mov、avi、mkv、webm 各一个文件，另有其他类型文件；角色：房间成员；入口：tab下的类型筛选"},{"parent":"0121ae59-a078-42e3-943b-09c3d1cc90ed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"50ea46a6-006d-4bdc-b226-9b0a69491a40","title":"操作：选择视频"},{"parent":"0121ae59-a078-42e3-943b-09c3d1cc90ed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e5c9bd21-4f9e-4256-a407-756bafc07ee4","title":"预期：\n1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 列表只展示这五种扩展名的文件，数量与实际相符\n2) 副作用 ｜ 其他类型的文件全部被过滤掉"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0121ae59-a078-42e3-943b-09c3d1cc90ed","title":"🔴【P0】视频类型筛选"},{"parent":"3cdff38d-4794-4ea8-8b29-3f989b7fcc71","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"abb237d2-c84b-40a0-ada7-09040db2ac7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a242e1dc-cbf9-40dc-86fd-ddf44db7be05","title":"前置：当前目录下有 png、jpg、jpeg、gif、webp、svg、bmp、ico、heic 各一个文件；角色：房间成员；入口：tab下的类型筛选"},{"parent":"abb237d2-c84b-40a0-ada7-09040db2ac7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"08bfb3e9-3e16-4d47-b9fb-f43d95b93dd3","title":"操作：选择图片"},{"parent":"abb237d2-c84b-40a0-ada7-09040db2ac7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d121425a-e34a-4284-9355-3d17d521a718","title":"预期：\n1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 列表展示这九种扩展名的文件，一个不漏"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"abb237d2-c84b-40a0-ada7-09040db2ac7e","title":"🔴【P0】图片类型筛选"},{"parent":"3cdff38d-4794-4ea8-8b29-3f989b7fcc71","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0cb1f9ce-b229-4328-b1da-2cf57d47eb86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7bbb1eb-be27-4520-9926-a6c68a7446df","title":"前置：当前目录下有 html、htm、mhtml、url、webloc 各一个文件；角色：房间成员；入口：tab下的类型筛选"},{"parent":"0cb1f9ce-b229-4328-b1da-2cf57d47eb86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13fce59c-30be-42db-8b8a-29cc82910328","title":"操作：选择网页"},{"parent":"0cb1f9ce-b229-4328-b1da-2cf57d47eb86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f32f51a1-f902-4fef-94c4