callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8ec651a2-3daa-49cd-a9bf-0fabd9a477ad","title":"前置：当前目录下有文件夹与各类文件；角色：房间成员；入口：类型筛选下拉"},{"parent":"9f5a7760-913c-4cf8-b2ed-c465999a1eb5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f898c925-0832-4be9-b6d3-7278e487eb2a","title":"操作：依次选择各个类型"},{"parent":"9f5a7760-913c-4cf8-b2ed-c465999a1eb5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"af5c61d8-3a4b-4417-9ecc-d3beba298620","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 文件夹在各类型筛选下的展示规则一致且可解释，不出现有时在有时不在"},{"parent":"9f5a7760-913c-4cf8-b2ed-c465999a1eb5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3128410d-4810-4d1d-90f1-7a101bc0f879","title":"备注：文件夹是否参与类型筛选需产品确认"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9f5a7760-913c-4cf8-b2ed-c465999a1eb5","title":"🟡【P2】文件夹在类型筛选中的表现"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a5321b1c-9724-4d3d-94b3-636ab12fed99","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0fa45386-0c8f-405d-9e53-854aa3f010ea","title":"类型筛选"},{"parent":"873b92fd-e4d1-439c-aa3c-9b9423ade626","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"45ce3dd3-ac0d-4aaa-b432-4fcec02b1c19","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"276c4d10-dc92-4db4-a3f2-d0148235e562","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"70cfdfd0-4cd1-4d8f-ab53-201bdbc0edb2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0fb25c04-fbd0-41ce-9044-8d941e30da0e","title":"前置：房间内有多名成员且有多个智能体产生过文件；角色：房间成员；入口：工具栏的全部资源"},{"parent":"70cfdfd0-4cd1-4d8f-ab53-201bdbc0edb2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"37b7cfc6-9629-431f-87ee-d6d4bb6f4c1e","title":"操作：点击全部资源"},{"parent":"70cfdfd0-4cd1-4d8f-ab53-201bdbc0edb2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"570036a8-f452-4d22-b5bc-b0d0bc57005e","title":"预期：\n1) 面板开关 ｜ 展开成员与智能体两组筛选\n2) 搜索筛选 ｜ 默认均为全部，列表不做过滤"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"70cfdfd0-4cd1-4d8f-ab53-201bdbc0edb2","title":"🔴【P0】展开成员与智能体筛选"},{"parent":"276c4d10-dc92-4db4-a3f2-d0148235e562","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fea70265-684f-4bf6-8be3-322c8f78b7d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5fd8efa7-b8be-4c9e-92b4-8549e6108248","title":"前置：房间内成员 A 既用自己的 Agent 发起过会话，也借用他人共享的 Agent 发起过会话；角色：房间成员；入口：全部资源下的成员筛选"},{"parent":"fea70265-684f-4bf6-8be3-322c8f78b7d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a6a0774f-f8ab-4e0f-ba07-665299cd6cfe","title":"操作：筛选成员 A"},{"parent":"fea70265-684f-4bf6-8be3-322c8f78b7d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0c71ab82-746c-4631-bfd6-f9138f6fe113","title":"预期：\n1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 默认筛选全部成员的文件，选中后只展示成员 A 的文件\n2) 搜索筛选 ｜ 包括成员 A 自己发起的，以及成员 A 借用他人 Agent 发起的会话所创建的文件\n3) 提示文案 ｜ 无结果时显示暂无文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fea70265-684f-4bf6-8be3-322c8f78b7d4","title":"🔴【P0】按成员筛选"},{"parent":"276c4d10-dc92-4db4-a3f2-d0148235e562","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cf7d4581-e3b0-4461-ba93-1f1f12a55915","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"24e04c75-6e7f-4f81-a398-22cf49fc87ea","title":"前置：某个智能体既被其所有者使用过，也被其他成员借用过；角色：房间成员；入口：全部资源下的智能体筛选"},{"parent":"cf7d4581-e3b0-4461-ba93-1f1f12a55915","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cc04e472-1b05-49fd-a9be-3f85f842841d","title":"操作：筛选该智能体"},{"parent":"cf7d4581-e3b0-4461-ba93-1f1f12a55915","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"83779b70-a903-4e23-9d34-aa65a45880c6","title":"预期：\n1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 默认筛选全部智能体的文件，选中后只展示该智能体生成的文件\n2) 搜索筛选 ｜ 包括所有者自己发起的，以及其他成员发起的会话产生的文件\n3) 提示文案 ｜ 无结果时显示暂无文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cf7d4581-e3b0-4461-ba93-1f1f12a55915","title":"🔴【P0】按智能体筛选"},{"parent":"276c4d10-dc92-4db4-a3f2-d0148235e562","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"44a5a401-22f0-498f-8ea4-0ec5a08b88dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"224734fe-30d2-4995-8c02-523469a01535","title":"前置：成员或智能体筛选已展开；角色：房间成员；入口：筛选下拉"},{"parent":"44a5a401-22f0-498f-8ea4-0ec5a08b88dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1f3749fc-b42f-4099-a06f-a1dcb436fbd9","title":"操作：按方向键在选项间移动，回车确认"},{"parent":"44a5a401-22f0-498f-8ea4-0ec5a08b88dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"499ec415-6da4-4902-8e81-938c4a2b74be","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 方向键可依次选中各选项并有选中态\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 回车确认后该筛选项生效，列表同步过滤"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"44a5a401-22f0-498f-8ea4-0ec5a08b88dc","title":"🟠【P1】键盘操作筛选项"},{"parent":"276c4d10-dc92-4db4-a3f2-d0148235e562","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"284b0e96-3af8-4054-b0c2-f325f2a581c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f31cd9b3-d1c5-4aac-8be2-3e142ab71bf8","title":"前置：房间内有多名成员与多个智能体；角色：房间成员；入口：全部资源"},{"parent":"284b0e96-3af8-4054-b0c2-f325f2a581c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0d9b2b29-0b85-41cb-af54-c6b0cb7d3eee","title":"操作：同时选中一名成员与一个智能体"},{"parent":"284b0e96-3af8-4054-b0c2-f325f2a581c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"19696e87-b60b-4f84-afe3-5279db126ff0","title":"预期：\n1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 结果为交集，只展示该成员用该智能体产生的文件\n2) 搜索筛选 ｜ 取消其中一个条件后另一个仍生效"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"284b0e96-3af8-4054-b0c2-f325f2a581c1","title":"🟠【P1】成员筛选与智能体筛选组合"},{"parent":"276c4d10-dc92-4db4-a3f2-d0148235e562","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a474e240-7e26-48dc-a904-6b2f6568bce6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd25c9f8-b765-4322-989f-b1336192ae09","title":"前置：当前有多种类型与多个来源的文件；角色：房间成员；入口：类型筛选与资源筛选"},{"parent":"a474e240-7e26-48dc-a904-6b2f6568bce6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"98d4491c-09bb-4862-ab07-82b64c2fa5e2","title":"操作：同时设置类型与成员两个条件"},{"parent":"a474e240-7e26-48dc-a904-6b2f6568bce6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9135ecde-e4b5-455f-a6a4-d787b1dd6981","title":"预期：\n1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 两个筛选器同时生效，结果为交集\n2) 搜索筛选 ｜ 清空其中一个后另一个仍生效"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a474e240-7e26-48dc-a904-6b2f6568bce6","title":"🟠【P1】类型筛选与资源筛选组合"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"276c4d10-dc92-4db4-a3f2-d0148235e562","title":"正常场景（6）"},{"parent":"45ce3dd3-ac0d-4aaa-b432-4fcec02b1c19","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d32d5afd-3879-4268-abd9-4cd6f6317bc4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"45f3e1f7-47b4-4fdf-bf2f-420f43213d30","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cb5f91ab-2f6c-4649-8c23-268b95a62f8c","title":"前置：某成员已退出房间但其产生的文件仍在；角色：房间成员；入口：成员筛选"},{"parent":"45f3e1f7-47b4-4fdf-bf2f-420f43213d30","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4373eaa4-edf5-4dce-a2e5-176fbaedbd4b","title":"操作：查看筛选项列表并尝试筛选该成员"},{"parent":"45f3e1f7-47b4-4fdf-bf2f-420f43213d30","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4aa8c6f0-e68e-45e8-b3ff-131ea18f6651","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 该成员是否仍出现在筛选项中按产品定义一致\n2) 搜索筛选 ｜ 若保留则筛选结果准确，若移除则其文件按无归属或历史身份可被找到"},{"parent":"45f3e1f7-47b4-4fdf-bf2f-420f43213d30","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9ed6adb7-396d-4fac-a58b-ee485d0036cf","title":"备注：已退出成员是否保留在筛选项中需产品确认"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"45f3e1f7-47b4-4fdf-bf2f-420f43213d30","title":"🟠【P1】已退出房间的成员在筛选项中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d32d5afd-3879-4268-abd9-4cd6f6317bc4","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"45ce3dd3-ac0d-4aaa-b432-4fcec02b1c19","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a04948ba-6e6a-4ad4-a699-edc8bde62404","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2b9e568e-c43d-454e-928a-52d61a6fb314","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4489f13a-f5f8-4921-b83a-0434c766156a","title":"前置：房间内有 30 名以上成员或 20 个以上智能体；角色：房间成员；入口：资源筛选"},{"parent":"2b9e568e-c43d-454e-928a-52d61a6fb314","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ad2abc6c-db21-425b-951c-b458a6f4c55c","title":"操作：展开筛选项并滚动查找"},{"parent":"2b9e568e-c43d-454e-928a-52d61a6fb314","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6571ea6f-f072-4de1-ab1e-17934bd08b94","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 筛选面板可滚动或支持搜索定位\n2) 性能 ｜ 展开与筛选响应正常不卡顿"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2b9e568e-c43d-454e-928a-52d61a6fb314","title":"🟡【P2】成员或智能体数量很多"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a04948ba-6e6a-4ad4-a699-edc8bde62404","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"45ce3dd3-ac0d-4aaa-b432-4fcec02b1c19","title":"资源筛选"},{"parent":"873b92fd-e4d1-439c-aa3c-9b9423ade626","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0db9b479-be08-4f4a-bee2-d974b99b70dc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7d7352a1-9acc-4311-9022-2cf19b4654ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"da86dfd9-316b-4d3e-9491-7db5b8832f96","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"46c14c68-d7c2-434f-9ab2-b1f879e14193","title":"前置：当前目录下有多个文件与文件夹；角色：房间成员；入口：工具栏的搜索框"},{"parent":"da86dfd9-316b-4d3e-9491-7db5b8832f96","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"49b853e2-cb73-4b83-8cfd-1e90d530eca4","title":"操作：分别输入文件夹名与文件名的关键词"},{"parent":"da86dfd9-316b-4d3e-9491-7db5b8832f96","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"27c624a9-ab00-48bd-bbdd-e1ac1495b486","title":"预期：\n1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 两类都能被搜到，结果实时过滤\n2) 搜索筛选 ｜ 支持中英文与大小写不敏感匹配"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"da86dfd9-316b-4d3e-9491-7db5b8832f96","title":"🔴【P0】搜索文件与文件夹"},{"parent":"7d7352a1-9acc-4311-9022-2cf19b4654ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7f84af8b-07c1-46d4-adfc-8607ee598986","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"141cec3c-6b82-497c-8128-8e6e968d88f1","title":"前置：当前目录下有多个名称部分命中的文件；角色：房间成员；入口：搜索框"},{"parent":"7f84af8b-07c1-46d4-adfc-8607ee598986","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"20249015-ad5c-4555-a45a-4a3089e6914a","title":"操作：输入一个多字符关键词"},{"parent":"7f84af8b-07c1-46d4-adfc-8607ee598986","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8f245484-19d0-49ea-9c00-d8dfcebaa47d","title":"预期：\n1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 含完整关键词的文件优先展示\n2) 归属与顺序 ｜ 命中多个单字符的排在后面，按命中字符数量从多到少排序"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7f84af8b-07c1-46d4-adfc-8607ee598986","title":"🟠【P1】搜索结果的排序规则"},{"parent":"7d7352a1-9acc-4311-9022-2cf19b4654ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1602ce0a-d301-4da2-84c6-ffec3e617e91","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cdb309c3-f840-4190-8ce2-5a2fd89dbd0f","title":"前置：文件中心已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：工具栏的视图切换按钮"},{"parent":"1602ce0a-d301-4da2-84c6-ffec3e617e91","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3c22e6f-9e60-4b94-a593-da5b37d9ff2f","title":"操作：点击网格图标再点回列表图标"},{"parent":"1602ce0a-d301-4da2-84c6-ffec3e617e91","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"10f84c44-1134-4b63-a050-cf38c5ad02b9","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 默认为列表视图，切换后网格视图展示正确\n2) 持久化 ｜ 切换后的视图在目录切换与刷新后按产品定义保持或复位，行为一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1602ce0a-d301-4da2-84c6-ffec3e617e91","title":"🟠【P1】列表与网格视图切换"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7d7352a1-9acc-4311-9022-2cf19b4654ac","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"0db9b479-be08-4f4a-bee2-d974b99b70dc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"956df2d0-73ad-4ecd-a136-454fc5eaa443","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bf1e896c-0bbe-4933-a7bb-bcd79dd5ed25","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"93c81db6-aa2b-4e8c-ada2-f43414ebfa98","title":"前置：当前目录下没有匹配项；角色：房间成员；入口：搜索框"},{"parent":"bf1e896c-0bbe-4933-a7bb-bcd79dd5ed25","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e0a66cd9-1df5-484a-9bd3-96dac3fd32bd","title":"操作：输入不存在的关键词"},{"parent":"bf1e896c-0bbe-4933-a7bb-bcd79dd5ed25","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"56099ef8-7399-4fd1-9060-b5a80057cde5","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 展示无匹配结果的提示，不清空原始数据也不报错"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bf1e896c-0bbe-4933-a7bb-bcd79dd5ed25","title":"🟠【P1】搜索无结果"},{"parent":"956df2d0-73ad-4ecd-a136-454fc5eaa443","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9664c215-ea0e-4d67-be23-fd2ce556da8c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6977ca34-8171-43b7-8d68-b30deddda2aa","title":"前置：文件中心已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：工具栏与两处右键菜单"},{"parent":"9664c215-ea0e-4d67-be23-fd2ce556da8c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"451cb910-ce1f-4139-8483-59e45e862acd","title":"操作：先查看工具栏中的按钮，再分别右键一个文件夹与列表空白处"},{"parent":"9664c215-ea0e-4d67-be23-fd2ce556da8c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7eecb846-1b08-4280-9e9b-38d42494c992","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 工具栏依次为上传、批量选择、筛选、视图切换与搜索，不出现新建文件夹按钮\n2) 菜单展示 ｜ 文件夹右键菜单与空白处右键菜单中仍保留新建文件夹，可正常创建"},{"parent":"9664c215-ea0e-4d67-be23-fd2ce556da8c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d6e9e045-5a23-4b78-9a75-e5705bdac978","title":"备注：本次只下线工具栏的新建文件夹按钮，右键菜单入口保留"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9664c215-ea0e-4d67-be23-fd2ce556da8c","title":"🔴【P0】工具栏中不再有新建文件夹按钮"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"956df2d0-73ad-4ecd-a136-454fc5eaa443","title":"异常场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0db9b479-be08-4f4a-bee2-d974b99b70dc","title":"搜索与视图"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"873b92fd-e4d1-439c-aa3c-9b9423ade626","title":"工具栏与视图"},{"parent":"45a3c61b-b066-47ee-8c28-ca62c6b56fcc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"483f7a2c-4e3a-4b12-97a7-ea11d4488273","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b12a00ba-7fb5-4791-a9e4-5b37a94bbecc","title":"备注：三个tab下的文件夹与文件的详情面板结构一致，本功能点只写一套，每个tab都需测试一遍"},{"parent":"483f7a2c-4e3a-4b12-97a7-ea11d4488273","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f5bb00f2-0a86-4545-ad2c-1e6bec624021","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8952b0bd-87a8-4bb4-92c6-efc82f751173","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c2cd5e89-5722-4b5c-9644-29d0118bf49f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b2390dd3-3d43-4846-aa82-9f6d257a0cb1","title":"前置：当前目录下有文件夹与文件；角色：房间成员；入口：列表中的某一项"},{"parent":"c2cd5e89-5722-4b5c-9644-29d0118bf49f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eb014a11-95b9-4731-a478-1d00314f946d","title":"操作：分别单击一个文件夹与一个文件"},{"parent":"c2cd5e89-5722-4b5c-9644-29d0118bf49f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c662e0bc-6029-40b5-adc0-62619cf61c5f","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 右侧详情面板展示预览图、名称、路径、修改时间与大小\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ 面板中提供分享、复制、打开、下载与更多按钮，更多下含重命名与删除\n3) 结果校验 ｜ 展示的路径与该项在工作区中的实际路径一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c2cd5e89-5722-4b5c-9644-29d0118bf49f","title":"🔴【P0】单击选中展示详情面板"},{"parent":"8952b0bd-87a8-4bb4-92c6-efc82f751173","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8238d767-52e5-4e60-b2ea-e8f9861f9f83","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fba8c2da-229e-41b5-927c-a0ce47631c71","title":"前置：详情面板已展示某一项；角色：房间成员；入口：列表中的另一项"},{"parent":"8238d767-52e5-4e60-b2ea-e8f9861f9f83","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4dc657ec-eda4-49a6-bc05-6f28209bb03a","title":"操作：单击另一项"},{"parent":"8238d767-52e5-4e60-b2ea-e8f9861f9f83","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5e5b583-dc2d-41d1-9087-050d8ac86017","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 详情面板整体刷新为新选中项，不残留上一项的预览图或大小"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8238d767-52e5-4e60-b2ea-e8f9861f9f83","title":"🟠【P1】切换选中项时详情同步"},{"parent":"8952b0bd-87a8-4bb4-92c6-efc82f751173","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"43c7f90d-8f82-4320-b247-67708b5a63eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"872161e8-60ce-4cf7-a36a-acb2c79d4ee4","title":"前置：详情面板已展示某一项；角色：房间成员；入口：面板中的打开按钮"},{"parent":"43c7f90d-8f82-4320-b247-67708b5a63eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1daaba9c-e923-43fd-8f12-b094d6d3a7e4","title":"操作：点击分享按钮"},{"parent":"43c7f90d-8f82-4320-b247-67708b5a63eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4499ad00-9348-4eaa-b523-5bf658286019","title":"预期：<br>1) 打开分享弹窗，详细校验见文件/文件夹测试用例"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"43c7f90d-8f82-4320-b247-67708b5a63eb","title":"🟠【P1】详情面板的分享"},{"parent":"8952b0bd-87a8-4bb4-92c6-efc82f751173","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7d22e9fd-4d63-4073-9c03-31af996ae6ec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a95282e8-3d35-49e3-a98d-f194966d254e","title":"前置：详情面板已展示某一项；角色：房间成员；入口：面板中的打开按钮"},{"parent":"7d22e9fd-4d63-4073-9c03-31af996ae6ec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e02bcde1-15c0-45f7-b9b6-ded0d0b8692b","title":"操作：点击打开按钮"},{"parent":"7d22e9fd-4d63-4073-9c03-31af996ae6ec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9f1f6804-eacd-488d-8502-668c1cfb84dd","title":"预期：<br>1) 产物预览 ｜ 打开弹窗展示内容，弹窗内可点击分享、下载和放大"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7d22e9fd-4d63-4073-9c03-31af996ae6ec","title":"🟠【P1】详情面板的打开"},{"parent":"8952b0bd-87a8-4bb4-92c6-efc82f751173","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"9eb9532a-b09f-4f11-a33f-b13cd3c01571","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"93f5eca5-1be0-4877-a09f-6e224cd1c319","title":"前置：详情面板已展示某一项；角色：房间成员；入口：更多按钮"},{"parent":"9eb9532a-b09f-4f11-a33f-b13cd3c01571","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2ff6bab9-cf91-4ada-a571-7444f40681c3","title":"操作：展开更多，重命名并确认"},{"parent":"9eb9532a-b09f-4f11-a33f-b13cd3c01571","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b92f8349-278b-4a43-8396-5ae52906fcb3","title":"预期：<br>1) 文件落盘 ｜ 重命名成功后列表与详情面板同步更新为新名称<br>2) 提示文案 ｜ 重命名为同级已有名称时提示已存在同名文件或文件夹<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"background":"#E7EBED"},"id":"9eb9532a-b09f-4f11-a33f-b13cd3c01571","title":"🟠【P1】详情面板的重命名"},{"parent":"8952b0bd-87a8-4bb4-92c6-efc82f751173","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"86614ff6-7807-4976-a211-6a35af095f4d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"536caac0-c444-4a2b-a840-51b3ce93da71","title":"前置：详情面板已展示某一项；角色：房间成员；入口：更多按钮"},{"parent":"86614ff6-7807-4976-a211-6a35af095f4d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eb356430-3980-450b-81f0-d5657b0bd66d","title":"操作：展开更多，删除并确认"},{"parent":"86614ff6-7807-4976-a211-6a35af095f4d","customWidth":438,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1daef459-6df6-41de-bfe4-8975ab16560a","title":"预期：<br>1) 列表展示 ｜ 删除确认后该项从列表移除，详情面板清空或切到相邻项"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"86614ff6-7807-4976-a211-6a35af095f4d","title":"🟠【P1】详情面板的删除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8952b0bd-87a8-4bb4-92c6-efc82f751173","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"f5bb00f2-0a86-4545-ad2c-1e6bec624021","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"825652e5-eb57-4a03-b4eb-4b8064eac999","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"812bc1f3-6c4d-4f65-b694-aeeec0439549","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"68f9e550-a96b-4244-be19-9d74fa053f50","title":"前置：详情面板已展示某一项，随后该项在别处被删除；角色：房间成员；入口：详情面板"}