69144f67554a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cb2b9204-26b6-418f-b781-ab4addc1633b","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 两种方式看到的子项集合完全一致\n2) 目录导航 ｜ 就地展开不改变面包屑，双击进入才追加层级，两者行为可区分"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e27dadcc-bbfe-4140-91e6-69144f67554a","title":"🟠【P1】两种展开方式的一致性"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"57413ebd-f839-4fef-b37a-bde77d94180d","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"add3a476-be0d-4dc3-8d20-cfa8bf6522e4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"860a8e82-5b05-4651-8904-84acff222143","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3818dd5f-d8ca-4959-9acd-3b35bd0a58c5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"070dfe2f-5ec6-4818-946b-4205a6e2cd24","title":"前置：列表已加载，随后该文件夹在别处被删除；角色：房间成员；入口：列表中的该文件夹"},{"parent":"3818dd5f-d8ca-4959-9acd-3b35bd0a58c5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0867811a-bc08-4cf3-a67f-c84441c0ab9d","title":"操作：双击进入"},{"parent":"3818dd5f-d8ca-4959-9acd-3b35bd0a58c5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e2c3962b-7b1b-4389-a943-f90719ab280a","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示文件夹不存在并刷新列表\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不进入空目录，面包屑不停留在无效路径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3818dd5f-d8ca-4959-9acd-3b35bd0a58c5","title":"🟠【P1】进入的文件夹已被删除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"860a8e82-5b05-4651-8904-84acff222143","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"add3a476-be0d-4dc3-8d20-cfa8bf6522e4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3442b947-9667-4300-bf50-a09533b8b8a8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9660307d-f376-453a-9e5a-03d2f1965b2e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ebd4700c-00a4-48cf-815b-f1fe05cefcb2","title":"前置：存在内容很多的文件夹；角色：房间成员；入口：列表中的该文件夹"},{"parent":"9660307d-f376-453a-9e5a-03d2f1965b2e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d352f436-6e11-4fa7-978d-9f2216b8cdab","title":"操作：展开并进入"},{"parent":"9660307d-f376-453a-9e5a-03d2f1965b2e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"23855e43-02ac-421c-a2fe-f164589bef31","title":"预期：\n1) 性能 ｜ 展开或进入时有加载反馈，结束后展示完整内容\n2) 副作用 ｜ 加载期间不重复触发，不出现空列表一闪"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9660307d-f376-453a-9e5a-03d2f1965b2e","title":"🟡【P2】大文件夹展开的加载态"},{"parent":"3442b947-9667-4300-bf50-a09533b8b8a8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3acd5e00-3f46-4f32-8ed5-ce5535db1834","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cea8c009-1751-488c-9daf-aeca457b96ae","title":"前置：某目录下有 1000 个以上条目；角色：房间成员；入口：该目录"},{"parent":"3acd5e00-3f46-4f32-8ed5-ce5535db1834","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"51eca593-b952-4eb7-8eba-d7a2e977966b","title":"操作：滚动查看并选中最下方一项"},{"parent":"3acd5e00-3f46-4f32-8ed5-ce5535db1834","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"62f46be4-1559-4044-bf91-35256b7f6270","title":"预期：\n1) 性能 ｜ 按分页或虚拟滚动加载，滚动流畅不卡死\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 数量与实际一致，选中后详情面板正确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3acd5e00-3f46-4f32-8ed5-ce5535db1834","title":"🟡【P2】单目录条目极多"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3442b947-9667-4300-bf50-a09533b8b8a8","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"add3a476-be0d-4dc3-8d20-cfa8bf6522e4","title":"展开与进入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"483f7a2c-4e3a-4b12-97a7-ea11d4488273","title":"列表与详情面板"},{"parent":"45a3c61b-b066-47ee-8c28-ca62c6b56fcc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3b9add11-653c-4ee1-914f-79bdea58a4fd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1212c4b4-e887-4f21-b797-18fd3a77290a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"19648e2f-6177-4467-830d-4472516f3446","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"af0bf01e-059a-4319-922d-6d96edb39b9e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"08c3e217-b719-44ea-b600-c10637160551","title":"前置：已进入多层子目录；角色：房间成员；入口：顶部面包屑"},{"parent":"af0bf01e-059a-4319-922d-6d96edb39b9e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bd53a0f1-eb56-4c65-bf10-7e27fd32a7c1","title":"操作：查看面包屑的层级"},{"parent":"af0bf01e-059a-4319-922d-6d96edb39b9e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6b8c36ac-ac6f-4730-82ec-5dd47cf3235a","title":"预期：\n1) 目录导航 ｜ 依次展示工作区与各层目录，顺序与实际路径一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"af0bf01e-059a-4319-922d-6d96edb39b9e","title":"🔴【P0】面包屑展示当前路径"},{"parent":"19648e2f-6177-4467-830d-4472516f3446","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b098cf9b-133a-4db0-add0-9a0244075c7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bdb1e606-70d7-4314-b054-c9e740d1be65","title":"前置：已进入多层子目录；角色：房间成员；入口：面包屑"},{"parent":"b098cf9b-133a-4db0-add0-9a0244075c7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76335020-5f15-4612-a5d4-858b69fd93fd","title":"操作：依次点击根目录、中间层级与当前层级"},{"parent":"b098cf9b-133a-4db0-add0-9a0244075c7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9fc93088-a500-4cac-824f-2eec958ab540","title":"预期：\n1) 目录导航 ｜ 跳到对应目录，列表与详情面板同步更新，后续层级从面包屑移除\n2) 副作用 ｜ 点击当前层级时保持不变，不重复加载也不产生错误的导航记录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b098cf9b-133a-4db0-add0-9a0244075c7e","title":"🔴【P0】点击各层级跳转"},{"parent":"19648e2f-6177-4467-830d-4472516f3446","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e6290d52-8e1e-4a8a-885f-ad6894d2d0fb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1cae5cc2-f2ac-465b-b062-a7ae5ebed5e1","title":"前置：已在多个目录间跳转过；角色：房间成员；入口：面包屑左右的前进后退按钮"},{"parent":"e6290d52-8e1e-4a8a-885f-ad6894d2d0fb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"026fef8a-cf68-4b77-96d8-0d1919e30139","title":"操作：连续后退再连续前进"},{"parent":"e6290d52-8e1e-4a8a-885f-ad6894d2d0fb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b034772e-a61e-49f6-8e94-a324128d845d","title":"预期：\n1) 目录导航 ｜ 每一步落到对应目录，面包屑与列表内容同步\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不出现面包屑是 A 目录而列表是 B 目录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e6290d52-8e1e-4a8a-885f-ad6894d2d0fb","title":"🟠【P1】前进后退与面包屑一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"19648e2f-6177-4467-830d-4472516f3446","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"1212c4b4-e887-4f21-b797-18fd3a77290a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8a7fa6f7-4be4-4d69-bfd1-b3cfbe1529d0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2c967845-586b-4562-8872-5edd32332164","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3923c0f0-c006-464f-84e3-0c7da0921e46","title":"前置：面包屑中的某一层已被删除，另有一层无访问权限；角色：房间成员；入口：面包屑"},{"parent":"2c967845-586b-4562-8872-5edd32332164","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c129b07e-b8f1-4cfb-8a06-63f82fec6065","title":"操作：分别点击这两层"},{"parent":"2c967845-586b-4562-8872-5edd32332164","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a6267cd3-5f35-4623-a523-174e2a3ec2be","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 已删除的提示找不到对应文件或文件夹\n2) 权限授权 ｜ 无权限的提示无权访问并停留在当前可访问目录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2c967845-586b-4562-8872-5edd32332164","title":"🔴【P0】点击已删除的层级"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8a7fa6f7-4be4-4d69-bfd1-b3cfbe1529d0","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"1212c4b4-e887-4f21-b797-18fd3a77290a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"da1052ae-cd7f-40ef-adcc-ac37223df954","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f3cf77e3-d924-404d-8f8a-74e77c0ba2f9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6d0f246e-a3b0-4aa4-840b-8716ecccef04","title":"前置：存在 8 层以上目录且其中一层名称很长；角色：房间成员；入口：面包屑"},{"parent":"f3cf77e3-d924-404d-8f8a-74e77c0ba2f9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44ee785f-74f1-4842-b251-28894f14f677","title":"操作：进入最深层查看面包屑并点击中间层级"},{"parent":"f3cf77e3-d924-404d-8f8a-74e77c0ba2f9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e44bf6a6-b7b5-40d9-aa2a-cefbe260f97d","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 面包屑按规则截断、横向滚动或折叠，超长层级名合理省略\n2) 目录导航 ｜ 折叠后关键层级仍可点击跳转，跳转使用完整正确的路径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f3cf77e3-d924-404d-8f8a-74e77c0ba2f9","title":"🟡【P2】深层路径与超长层级名"},{"parent":"da1052ae-cd7f-40ef-adcc-ac37223df954","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7250c0e6-a9e3-4198-b32e-953c3057c43a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ac152c6e-de5e-412e-bf5b-c2fcef39d58a","title":"前置：已进入多层子目录；角色：房间成员；入口：面包屑"},{"parent":"7250c0e6-a9e3-4198-b32e-953c3057c43a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"972c8882-a6fd-46ed-942b-e57ade100d35","title":"操作：缩小窗口宽度，再快速连续点击多个层级"},{"parent":"7250c0e6-a9e3-4198-b32e-953c3057c43a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"68b4fa88-fc6f-4bea-aa8e-ab3057b859a5","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 面包屑不挤压前进后退按钮，必要时折叠中间层级\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 最终停留在最后一次点击的层级，列表与面包屑一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7250c0e6-a9e3-4198-b32e-953c3057c43a","title":"🟡【P2】窗口缩小与快速连续点击"},{"parent":"da1052ae-cd7f-40ef-adcc-ac37223df954","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ff04d8d9-f60b-48a7-b13f-78e99bdcc4d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"345ab127-3748-4603-ba6f-31c379fe7806","title":"前置：目录名中含中文、空格、括号与 Emoji；角色：房间成员；入口：面包屑"},{"parent":"ff04d8d9-f60b-48a7-b13f-78e99bdcc4d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8b738092-74d7-4422-8a1b-5c95e97fd771","title":"操作：进入该目录并从面包屑跳回"},{"parent":"ff04d8d9-f60b-48a7-b13f-78e99bdcc4d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f894a132-9ea6-486c-a58e-45c0720ae44b","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 特殊字符安全展示不乱码\n2) 目录导航 ｜ 跳转使用正确的完整路径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ff04d8d9-f60b-48a7-b13f-78e99bdcc4d4","title":"🟡【P2】层级名含特殊字符"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"da1052ae-cd7f-40ef-adcc-ac37223df954","title":"边界场景（3）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1212c4b4-e887-4f21-b797-18fd3a77290a","title":"面包屑导航"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3b9add11-653c-4ee1-914f-79bdea58a4fd","title":"面包屑与导航"},{"parent":"45a3c61b-b066-47ee-8c28-ca62c6b56fcc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4fc7d457-f3ae-4e72-8554-8693d9c87b41","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0db72af7-93d3-486c-8aaf-825e89999e54","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dfc82c47-3b4e-47e1-bc1e-6d2855e96a4e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"38a844e6-17fa-463d-aa2b-179f213416f6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d7ea2861-1c28-4b07-9e2b-207eb233801a","title":"前置：当前目录下有文件夹；角色：房间成员；入口：列表中的文件夹"},{"parent":"38a844e6-17fa-463d-aa2b-179f213416f6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7d7fd0e0-0ac3-43a0-aabe-28a267b3426f","title":"操作：右键该文件夹并逐项核对菜单"},{"parent":"38a844e6-17fa-463d-aa2b-179f213416f6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"99519c4e-a9bf-45d2-a54e-f1d1f5ae7b78","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 菜单依次包含打开、上传、新建文件、新建文件夹、下载、分享、重命名、删除共八项，无多余项也无缺项\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 删除项使用红色危险样式，其余为普通样式\n3) 按钮状态 ｜ 八项均可点击，不出现无故置灰"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"38a844e6-17fa-463d-aa2b-179f213416f6","title":"🔴【P0】文件夹菜单项完整性"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dfc82c47-3b4e-47e1-bc1e-6d2855e96a4e","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"0db72af7-93d3-486c-8aaf-825e89999e54","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3b46c277-90c2-42fb-a1c4-adc7b7bfd2be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7b36ba9e-3613-4e3e-9b1d-e0ecf2063247","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"520a8b87-72e8-4a4f-b329-e48a5d115a55","title":"前置：文件夹位于窗口右侧或底部边缘；角色：房间成员；入口：列表"},{"parent":"7b36ba9e-3613-4e3e-9b1d-e0ecf2063247","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c48cce70-f45f-458d-b44d-489235bf45c3","title":"操作：在该位置右键文件夹"},{"parent":"7b36ba9e-3613-4e3e-9b1d-e0ecf2063247","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"63b4e6ae-b048-495c-bcf8-f3655a5b1031","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 菜单自动调整展示方向，八项全部完整可见，不被窗口边界或 Dock 遮挡"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7b36ba9e-3613-4e3e-9b1d-e0ecf2063247","title":"🟡【P2】菜单靠近窗口边缘"},{"parent":"3b46c277-90c2-42fb-a1c4-adc7b7bfd2be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b5eb24fd-32a0-49f8-b22b-bcc789881f73","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e1da75fe-4c76-484b-9e16-ff5ca7f708ab","title":"前置：当前目录下有三个文件夹；角色：房间成员；入口：列表"},{"parent":"b5eb24fd-32a0-49f8-b22b-bcc789881f73","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0705876b-8890-4a72-b0d9-d63495c16f15","title":"操作：连续右键三个不同文件夹"},{"parent":"b5eb24fd-32a0-49f8-b22b-bcc789881f73","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8f372590-11e9-4ed5-8b70-b29f2122ec6f","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 同一时间只展示一个菜单\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 菜单操作目标始终为最后右键的那个文件夹"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b5eb24fd-32a0-49f8-b22b-bcc789881f73","title":"🟡【P2】连续右键不同文件夹"},{"parent":"3b46c277-90c2-42fb-a1c4-adc7b7bfd2be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"687d79dd-46d4-4da8-a8ad-ee0df247e7fe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8f5e3b64-51ac-47c7-90c3-f24784d1540b","title":"前置：存在名称超过 100 字符的文件夹与一个软链接文件夹；角色：房间成员；入口：列表"},{"parent":"687d79dd-46d4-4da8-a8ad-ee0df247e7fe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bc95ebf0-271e-46c7-a32f-d49b4930c50b","title":"操作：分别右键这两个文件夹并查看菜单"},{"parent":"687d79dd-46d4-4da8-a8ad-ee0df247e7fe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d76d34f9-8014-446d-9ffc-930ec2850d3f","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 菜单布局不被撑破，八项仍完整可见\n2) 权限授权 ｜ 软链接的各项操作按产品定义处理，不越权访问授权范围外目录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"687d79dd-46d4-4da8-a8ad-ee0df247e7fe","title":"🟡【P2】超长名与软链接文件夹的菜单"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3b46c277-90c2-42fb-a1c4-adc7b7bfd2be","title":"边界场景（3）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0db72af7-93d3-486c-8aaf-825e89999e54","title":"文件夹菜单 · 菜单展示"},{"parent":"4fc7d457-f3ae-4e72-8554-8693d9c87b41","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ce4a6142-aced-49f3-95e9-b135b7509d74","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9e41fa41-6cff-46f7-8439-97fcc435e458","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ef713050-ec93-49bf-826b-aa8f68ca146f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"842fb908-7d99-494b-9f5c-094d543267d1","title":"前置：文件夹右键菜单已弹出；角色：房间成员；入口：菜单的打开项"},{"parent":"ef713050-ec93-49bf-826b-aa8f68ca146f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d0b6