1) 文件落盘 ｜ 打开本地文件选择窗口，支持单选与多选文件和文件夹\n2) 文件落盘 ｜ 文件被上传到被右键的那个文件夹下，而不是当前所在目录\n3) 提示文案 ｜ 传输面板中出现对应条目并显示进度"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0a9fa43f-1263-4167-bc0b-8a86074fa7b7","title":"🔴【P0】上传到指定文件夹"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"422ab936-8b0e-44e2-bf9f-436b7c471e40","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"13ef6cf5-b0a2-4b92-860e-5a6bdcc084d4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2dd84030-242e-4427-8b0e-a96b44a81a6b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e68f1771-6b44-4c0c-bdf6-68b295d5b2ec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ab36d206-87f6-4ff4-86a4-bd1674b8ea3c","title":"前置：目标文件夹下已存在同名文件；角色：房间成员；入口：菜单的上传项"},{"parent":"e68f1771-6b44-4c0c-bdf6-68b295d5b2ec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"30f375e4-6ca8-4de9-a98b-f720ad8f5d85","title":"操作：上传一个同名文件"},{"parent":"e68f1771-6b44-4c0c-bdf6-68b295d5b2ec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9bc1a441-0a66-419e-a594-01b9b20a6850","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 按产品定义给出覆盖确认或自动重命名，行为一致不随机\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不静默覆盖已有文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e68f1771-6b44-4c0c-bdf6-68b295d5b2ec","title":"🟠【P1】上传到该文件夹时同名"},{"parent":"2dd84030-242e-4427-8b0e-a96b44a81a6b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"536307ab-b31f-4095-8eb3-b1dceb8bc83a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1526b9ab-3b65-4898-bf6e-19dca898c390","title":"前置：正在通过该菜单向某文件夹上传；角色：房间成员；入口：文件列表"},{"parent":"536307ab-b31f-4095-8eb3-b1dceb8bc83a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5a0195b4-eaf9-4dc3-a053-589f1eb0bc86","title":"操作：在上传过程中删除该目标文件夹"},{"parent":"536307ab-b31f-4095-8eb3-b1dceb8bc83a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b075487a-2c1d-4462-bc8b-a56a069f7887","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 该任务转为失败并说明目标目录已不存在\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不产生落到根目录的孤儿文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"536307ab-b31f-4095-8eb3-b1dceb8bc83a","title":"🟠【P1】上传过程中目标文件夹被删除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2dd84030-242e-4427-8b0e-a96b44a81a6b","title":"异常场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"background":"#E7EBED"},"id":"13ef6cf5-b0a2-4b92-860e-5a6bdcc084d4","title":"文件夹菜单 · 上传"},{"parent":"4fc7d457-f3ae-4e72-8554-8693d9c87b41","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"0e6575a4-6bb2-4646-bcd0-