 提示文案 ｜ 超长时报错并说明最大长度"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"af52d759-675d-4780-9c66-3f4f92087d44","title":"🟠【P1】当前目录新建文件夹名称为空或超长"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a4bb6b13-503f-453e-862a-afcf47074b17","title":"异常场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"background":"#E7EBED"},"id":"0c8829d5-b940-494a-9a07-7de04701d34d","title":"空白处菜单 · 新建文件夹"},{"parent":"92b10d41-ac1a-4ce0-a197-fa940ffe1996","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2b6529a5-2cf3-4aad-b5ae-c5c04e7ee5e2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f8df3c25-2df3-43a9-ac24-4786c34c86be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"18ec12ef-d640-45df-a3e7-dfe9002b61a7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e1c0ec61-5d58-4e27-9dab-cd1170c7bed4","title":"前置：文件中心已打开且当前处于某个子目录；角色：房间成员；入口：空白处右键的上传项"},{"parent":"18ec12ef-d640-45df-a3e7-dfe9002b61a7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"178fb193-5e9c-45a0-8184-cfde277081eb","title":"操作：点击导入，在本地文件窗口中多选文件与文件夹后确认"},{"parent":"18ec12ef-d640-45df-a3e7-dfe9002b61a7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5959033d-0561-4a57-bfbb-2e4387844038","title":"预期：\n1) 文件落盘 ｜ 打开本地文件选择窗口，支持单选与多选文件和文件夹\n2) 文件落盘 ｜ 内容导入到当前所在目录下\n3) 提示文案 ｜ 传输面板中出现对应条目并显示进度"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"18ec12ef-d640-45df-a3e7-dfe9002b61a7","title":"🔴【P0】上传本地文件"},{"parent":"f8df3c25-2df3-43a9-ac24-4786c34c86be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bbd0aed1-013d-4253-923a-a2586c7afcfc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5accb1d1-fdd8-4fe4-9905-f0e6d5f7aecf","title":"前置：文件中心已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：空白处右键的上传项与工具栏的上传按钮"},{"parent":"bbd0aed1-013d-4253-923a-a2586c7afcfc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"99d7cedd-bc15-4802-8f8d-338c491ba030","title":"操作：分别用两个入口上传同一批文件到同一目录"},{"parent":"bbd0aed1-013d-4253-923a-a2586c7afcfc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"705717f3-1519-4c77-b034-641fae53f646","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 两个入口的选择窗口、落盘目录与传输面板表现完全一致\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 结果文件相同，不出现某一入口少传或落错目录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bbd0aed1-013d-4253-923a-a2586c7afcfc","title":"🟠【P1】上传与工具栏上传的一致性"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f8df3c25-2df3-43a9-ac24-4786c34c86be","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"2b6529a5-2cf3-4aad-b5ae-c5c04e7ee5e2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cfad3058-7a69-443d-afd0-67c4de422a43","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1ebcb5af-b3d8-4573-8433-12929bf06bcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c7bcff3c-cf72-4c62-93b1-803e358cdd42","title":"前置：当前目录下已存在同名文件；角色：房间成员；入口：空白处右键的上传项"},{"parent":"1ebcb5af-b3d8-4573-8433-12929bf06bcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"427d4e75-4006-448a-afbf-32d399d1796d","title":"操作：上传一个同名文件"},{"parent":"1ebcb5af-b3d8-4573-8433-12929bf06bcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9bd01236-e18e-450b-b6e1-0f4d18f4ce19","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 按产品定义给出覆盖确认或自动重命名，行为一致不随机\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不静默覆盖已有文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1ebcb5af-b3d8-4573-8433-12929bf06bcb","title":"🟠【P1】上传同名内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cfad3058-7a69-443d-afd0-67c4de422a43","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"2b6529a5-2cf3-4aad-b5ae-c5c04e7ee5e2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7724a38c-c89e-4dc2-8b2d-0ed791460be1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5aaa5885-6eb0-4db6-9664-292ae46546a6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"da8f0314-1c62-4206-afed-1ff1722ce11b","title":"前置：本地有一个包含 100 个以上文件的文件夹，另有一个超过大小上限的文件；角色：房间成员；入口：空白处右键的上传项"},{"parent":"5aaa5885-6eb0-4db6-9664-292ae46546a6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4298812-8caf-406f-b1b5-ab6d34e9f5de","title":"操作：分别导入这两者"},{"parent":"5aaa5885-6eb0-4db6-9664-292ae46546a6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"52a6958e-36b7-4d0d-a83a-ff2d5d3962c2","title":"预期：\n1) 性能 ｜ 大量文件按队列依次传输，传输面板中条目数量与实际一致\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 超大文件给出大小限制提示且不进入队列"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5aaa5885-6eb0-4db6-9664-292ae46546a6","title":"🟡【P2】上传大量或超大文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7724a38c-c89e-4dc2-8b2d-0ed791460be1","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2b6529a5-2cf3-4aad-b5ae-c5c04e7ee5e2","title":"空白处菜单 · 上传"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"92b10d41-ac1a-4ce0-a197-fa940ffe1996","title":"空白处右键菜单"},{"parent":"45a3c61b-b066-47ee-8c28-ca62c6b56fcc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f598d9fa-aa1f-4369-82cf-86588e114da9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e60a697e-5ff4-487e-9e7c-69c6008a34f2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"621eccf2-ad32-441b-ac47-bd1918ecb308","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7d8bb8e1-f1df-498a-9bcb-d16e4b138234","title":"前置：已通过面包屑从子目录跳回上级；角色：房间成员；入口：列表"},{"parent":"621eccf2-ad32-441b-ac47-bd1918ecb308","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"961f44a8-1217-4e18-81e9-4762008fb96f","title":"操作：在跳转后的目录中右键某一项并执行操作"},{"parent":"621eccf2-ad32-441b-ac47-bd1918ecb308","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"63129591-afe1-4285-94e3-c0045f6fc4cf","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 菜单操作目标为当前目录下的实际选中项，不沿用跳转前的目标"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"621eccf2-ad32-441b-ac47-bd1918ecb308","title":"🔴【P0】跳转后菜单目标正确"},{"parent":"e60a697e-5ff4-487e-9e7c-69c6008a34f2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5b23132d-2892-4fc7-9931-00b220699f46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a1907fdd-65f0-4545-a183-3ed26fa38b0b","title":"前置：当前正处于某个子目录内；角色：房间成员；入口：面包屑上级目录的右键删除"},{"parent":"5b23132d-2892-4fc7-9931-00b220699f46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c14c0eb0-c655-4231-b59a-6423a418db2d","title":"操作：删除当前所在的这一层目录"},{"parent":"5b23132d-2892-4fc7-9931-00b220699f46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"73899505-b943-43e7-886f-26dc6cdd16d2","title":"预期：\n1) 目录导航 ｜ 删除成功后自动跳转到可用的上级目录并更新面包屑\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不停留在已被删除的目录里"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5b23132d-2892-4fc7-9931-00b220699f46","title":"🔴【P0】删除当前所在目录的父级"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e60a697e-5ff4-487e-9e7c-69c6008a34f2","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"f598d9fa-aa1f-4369-82cf-86588e114da9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fc7351bd-47f6-4e19-a4f6-df34a295f6c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fb949916-1ed6-4702-a156-5cb6aa7dfd52","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4969a9fd-442c-43c4-be64-91aa5cf376cd","title":"前置：删除确认弹窗已弹出或上传任务正在进行；角色：房间成员；入口：面包屑"},{"parent":"fb949916-1ed6-4702-a156-5cb6aa7dfd52","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a4f54b85-69ed-48e7-b0e3-1323a95268c3","title":"操作：在确认或传输过程中切换到另一个目录"},{"parent":"fb949916-1ed6-4702-a156-5cb6aa7dfd52","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"52083fea-00e1-4e0f-b520-3f4d028d3b69","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 确认弹窗的目标信息保持明确，确认或取消都作用在原目标上\n2) 文件落盘 ｜ 进行中的上传仍绑定原目标目录，不落到新切换的目录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fb949916-1ed6-4702-a156-5cb6aa7dfd52","title":"🟠【P1】菜单操作进行中切换目录"},{"parent":"fc7351bd-47f6-4e19-a4f6-df34a295f6c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bd4ee36f-186b-4f7f-8260-c0963b1eb250","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a8d0e73a-86c9-4680-a31f-a81b80307437","title":"前置：已复制某一项的路径；角色：房间成员；入口：面包屑"},{"parent":"bd4ee36f-186b-4f7f-8260-c0963b1eb250","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3fd7fcbe-e18a-48ab-b0dd-3be72a8b167f","title":"操作：复制后切换到其他目录再粘贴查看"},{"parent":"bd4ee36f-186b-4f7f-8260-c0963b1eb250","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8f1f6ad0-dca0-47ee-8bff-610424f598c1","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 剪贴板内容仍为复制时的目标路径，不受后续导航影响"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bd4ee36f-186b-4f7f-8260-c0963b1eb250","title":"🟠【P1】复制路径后目录变更"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fc7351bd-47f6-4e19-a4f6-df34a295f6c4","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"f598d9fa-aa1f-4369-82cf-86588e114da9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0b5fbd47-6392-43f3-82d9-12de5aa066cd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ade37f60-e329-4ced-990f-bc433036c844","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dfdeda9b-a3bd-4af3-8675-e3e99c3b6586","title":"前置：已进入多层目录；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单与面包屑"},{"parent":"ade37f60-e329-4ced-990f-bc433036c844","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"47e30861-7730-41a5-9ce3-6702cc84d11a","title":"操作：反复交替执行右键操作与面包屑跳转"},{"parent":"ade37f60-e329-4ced-990f-bc433036c844","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"52a2fde3-1742-4af4-a3cc-ed0c376a3e3e","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 每一步的目录状态、列表内容与任务目标都准确，不出现状态串台"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ade37f60-e329-4ced-990f-bc433036c844","title":"🟡【P2】多次菜单与导航交替"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0b5fbd47-6392-43f3-82d9-12de5aa066cd","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f598d9fa-aa1f-4369-82cf-86588e114da9","title":"菜单与导航联动"},{"parent":"45a3c61b-b066-47ee-8c28-ca62c6b56fcc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"50bf2d85-55e7-42a9-bad2-2fab0f509d8d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"54636cf1-bfa7-4b8a-83cc-fc312385f5c6","title":"说明：分享弹窗从三个tab下文件夹分享按钮、文件分享按钮进入，内容一致，本子模块只写一套"},{"parent":"50bf2d85-55e7-42a9-bad2-2fab0f509d8d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"00c49689-38f0-4715-a3e0-21b0de1e1f1d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9698e9ee-74a4-4821-9459-51798f82c523","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d9bb88f7-bd87-4f0e-9e22-7f5bf22548f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bf42e0f5-9994-45e8-8751-df547b782ddf","title":"入口：文件夹分享按钮、文件分享按钮"},{"parent":"d9bb88f7-bd87-4f0e-9e22-7f5bf22548f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3a1f25a8-9ce2-4d10-b7ae-254fc4c14511","title":"操作：点击分享"},{"parent":"d9bb88f7-bd87-4f0e-9e22-7f5bf22548f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e5f93c12-1634-46af-8c81-44265d08dbfa","title":"预期：<br>1) 分享链接 ｜ 弹出分享弹窗，展示可见范围选项与分享按钮<br>2) 关联会话 ｜ 弹窗中展示该文件的关联会话模块"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d9bb88f7-bd87-4f0e-9e22-7f5bf22548f8","title":"🔴【P0】打开分享弹窗"},{"parent":"9698e9ee-74a4-4821-9459-51798f82c523","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aba5bdbc-2193-4b00-b946-8838c2738578","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c69522fd-b317-4e90-bccd-bbdc0150168c","title":"入口：三个tab下文件夹分享按钮、文件分享按钮"},{"parent":"aba5bdbc-2193-4b00-b946-8838c2738578","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3bdcbe6b-adc1-4894-80a2-96a2829c1e80","title":"操作：分别从两个入口打开分享弹窗"},{"parent":"aba5bdbc-2193-4b00-b946-8838c2738578","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b35933ea-aba2-4b76-8189-b70c22cd8172","title":"预期：\n1) 分享链接 ｜ 两处弹窗内容与可见范围选项完全一致，指向同一条分享记录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aba5bdbc-2193-4b00-b946-8838c2738578","title":"🟠【P1】三个tab下打开的分享弹窗一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9698e9ee-74a4-4821-9459-51798f82c523","title":"正常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"00c49689-38f0-4715-a3e0-21b0de1e1f1d","title":"分享弹窗"},{"parent":"50bf2d85-55e7-42a9-bad2-2fab0f509d8d","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"bb1c2beb-baa9-491e-89ae-8c5998256bfb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cf50b56f-617a-496f-b096-5c4c75c690dc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"08a2bcf0-3483-4644-aa2c-5a9c6064e9af","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b10b4195-7fee-4ec5-91c6-20cf80b05e0b","title":"前置：该文件所在房间有多名成员用不同 Agent 发起过会话；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗"},{"parent":"08a2b