话；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗"},{"parent":"8720d9a3-089d-4df5-8d25-d71d7043c590","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0b106dd5-aaab-41fe-9130-d6edec71e953","title":"操作：勾选全部关联会话点击分享"},{"parent":"8720d9a3-089d-4df5-8d25-d71d7043c590","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3d588e0a-bc4e-40ed-86fe-c55589968b68","title":"预期：<br>1) 能成功分享，其他成员可打开分享链接查看文件和关联会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8720d9a3-089d-4df5-8d25-d71d7043c590","title":"🔴【P0】勾选全部关联会话分享"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cf50b56f-617a-496f-b096-5c4c75c690dc","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"bb1c2beb-baa9-491e-89ae-8c5998256bfb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8e283669-20e1-4f04-96b1-520458761bc3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b5002908-54bd-49b8-9f5d-4c0e72bc6a53","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f162176e-2b89-42e5-a576-1223420fc574","title":"前置：该产物不由任何会话产生；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗"},{"parent":"b5002908-54bd-49b8-9f5d-4c0e72bc6a53","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"41f59b48-ce25-490f-92c7-8157b5ba4996","title":"操作：打开分享弹窗查看"},{"parent":"b5002908-54bd-49b8-9f5d-4c0e72bc6a53","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"562ccada-d06c-4c76-8c01-0679dacbc146","title":"预期：\n1) 关联会话 ｜ 不展示「关联会话」模块，不出现空标题的空区块"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b5002908-54bd-49b8-9f5d-4c0e72bc6a53","title":"🟠【P1】没有关联会话"},{"parent":"8e283669-20e1-4f04-96b1-520458761bc3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"520b9dbb-4eca-4ffa-9ebe-cb2cdca5be3a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0237147d-e04f-4c88-a4d3-1360095b8f4d","title":"前置：该文件所在房间有多名成员用不同 Agent 发起过会话；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗"},{"parent":"520b9dbb-4eca-4ffa-9ebe-cb2cdca5be3a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1ba22801-8490-43c0-874b-20afe3b07985","title":"操作：打开分享链接切换我的 / 其他成员的 tab搜索会话，输入匹配会话标题不存在的字符"},{"parent":"520b9dbb-4eca-4ffa-9ebe-cb2cdca5be3a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6ce35767-c9b1-48d4-adc3-bae70322eee7","title":"预期：<br>1) 搜索没结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"520b9dbb-4eca-4ffa-9ebe-cb2cdca5be3a","title":"🟡【P2】搜索不到关联会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8e283669-20e1-4f04-96b1-520458761bc3","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"bb1c2beb-baa9-491e-89ae-8c5998256bfb","c