4f84-aad2-e1bfcf687cb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"30b3c702-cef4-4c4d-a254-52f68724cdf3","title":"前置：分享弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗的可见范围选项"},{"parent":"e41fd786-e93a-4f84-aad2-e1bfcf687cb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1b937f69-4072-4f0b-b21b-18950a79e2a6","title":"操作：选择任何人可见并点击分享，再用非房间成员账号打开链接"},{"parent":"e41fd786-e93a-4f84-aad2-e1bfcf687cb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9fa4c0a0-053c-4f8b-bd4e-ad7b8aaed7b9","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 非房间成员可以看见具体文件和关联会话\n2) 可见范围 ｜ 分享的是文件夹时不可评论"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e41fd786-e93a-4f84-aad2-e1bfcf687cb7","title":"🔴【P0】任何人可见"},{"parent":"6b7e4d15-3f25-48e0-9cab-29409ea7d141","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cd314ef2-0631-4fa2-b951-b5fb810ef8d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cf93afb8-2eff-42e5-89f0-ca48ef23da76","title":"前置：分享弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗的可见范围选项"},{"parent":"cd314ef2-0631-4fa2-b951-b5fb810ef8d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ba77b96-e8a1-4e36-86c2-d3163c3ca816","title":"操作：选择仅自己可见并点击分享，再用其他账号打开链接"},{"parent":"cd314ef2-0631-4fa2-b951-b5fb810ef8d1","customWidth":424,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4e1fcaf-22d3-4937-b848-03538a7cb0c2","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 除自己之外的所有人打开都不可见，包括房间内其他成员"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cd314ef2-0631-4fa2-b951-b5fb810ef8d1","title":"🔴【P0】仅自己可见"},{"parent":"6b7e4d15-3f25-48e0-9cab-29409ea7d141","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c01ae445-6f1e-4709-b5a5-e9e8fb4f19f4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e0cceb5d-96f7-4a49-a8f5-a3821176cb1c","title":"前置：分享弹窗已打开并已选好可见范围；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗的分享按钮"},{"parent":"c01ae445-6f1e-4709-b5a5-e9e8fb4f19f4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2e5e2bcd-ea7a-4098-bab1-8f88b7283d86","title":"操作：点击分享"},{"parent":"c01ae445-6f1e-4709-b5a5-e9e8fb4f19f4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"05c4f8db-4f20-4d2a-9c17-226c93b538a0","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示分享链接已更新\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 「我分享的」tab 下新增该文件的分享记录，并显示所选的可见范围"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c01ae445-6f1e-4709-b5a5-e9e8fb4f19f4","title":"🔴【P0】分享成功后的反馈与记录"},{"parent":"6b7e4d15-3f25-48e0-9cab-29409ea7d141","callout":[],"children":[{"paren