"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2dc45bbd-6c0f-4f29-954b-a7f6dae06c8f","title":"🟠【P1】分享后又移出房间"},{"parent":"559cb0d4-192f-40d1-98b3-68860cf98b4f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2d24dfa5-10b5-4f79-a147-fd03290b70c2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dacd5001-f302-4790-b8dc-4b1e8aaa0bfa","title":"前置：某文件已按仅房间成员可见分享；角色：文件所有者与非房间成员；入口：行内的分享图标"},{"parent":"2d24dfa5-10b5-4f79-a147-fd03290b70c2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"48a9fe99-cdc2-4e69-b83a-9d3cecc69bd5","title":"操作：再次打开弹窗改为任何人可用链接访问并分享，让对方刷新页面"},{"parent":"2d24dfa5-10b5-4f79-a147-fd03290b70c2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2ef0151d-8f51-4a8c-abba-4e8c053c2d7e","title":"预期：\n1) 分享链接 ｜ 分享链接地址保持不变\n2) 可见范围 ｜ 以最新一次的可见范围为准，对方刷新后可看到文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2d24dfa5-10b5-4f79-a147-fd03290b70c2","title":"🟠【P1】修改已分享文件的可见范围"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"559cb0d4-192f-40d1-98b3-68860cf98b4f","title":"异常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6f9c1b5f-9127-4e0a-8100-bbff3a5b3d0e","title":"可见范围"},{"parent":"50bf2d85-55e7-42a9-bad2-2fab0f509d8d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d8e7fdf9-54ce-4845-b57f-42484a4e3d04","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7ea9a324-339a-42af-994a-1f07434530b5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"59c43c42-6521-42d1-9bc2-d5dba756f0f3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"52119b89-b527-4379-930f-7135ec67d450","title":"前置：分享文件；角色：非房间成员；入口：分享链接页面"},{"parent":"59c43c42-6521-42d1-9bc2-d5dba756f0f3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7bc6118a-3bcc-41e9-a4ac-43ec36ead9c1","title":"操作：打开分享链接"},{"parent":"59c43c42-6521-42d1-9bc2-d5dba756f0f3","customWidth":474.2,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5865f6e-f1fd-4261-9e79-592428a758db","title":"预期：<br>1) 展示分享的文件详情，若文件不支持预览会显示暂时不支持该文件预览<br>2) 左下角展示评论 / 关联会话按钮，若有关联会话会显示关联会话个数，点击打开侧边栏，可评论和查看关联会话<br>3) 查看关联会话，展示会话卡片，包含会话标题/会话状态/最新一条消息/执行Agent，点开会话可查看会话详情，会话流显示正确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"59c43c42-6521-42d1-9bc2-d5dba756f0f3","title":"🔴【P0】打开文件分享链接"},{"parent":"7ea9a324-339a-42af-994a-1f07434530b5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fd33c9fa-4122-42c1-abad-77361b408384","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8e4557d3-dd04-4a31-93e2-72566bdfa8f1","title":"前置：分享文件夹；角色：非房间成员；入口：分享链接页面"},{"parent":"fd33c9fa-4122-42c1-abad-77361b408384","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d1aa8fae-4016-4976-9147-a6579a790e04","title":"操作：打开分享链接"},{"parent":"fd33c9fa-4122-42c1-abad-77361b408384","customWidth":474.2,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ec3cbd61-c0b5-4b86-82b4-96359e391b87","title":"预期：<br>1) 展示分享的文件夹详情，若文件不支持预览会显示暂时不支持该文件预览<br>2) 左下角展示评论 / 关联会话按钮，若有关联会话会显示关联会话个数，点击打开侧边栏，可查看关联会话，无评论入口<br>3) 查看关联会话，展示会话卡片，包含会话标题/会话状态/最新一条消息/执行Agent，点开会话可查看会话详情，会话流显示正确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fd33c9fa-4122-42c1-abad-77361b408384","title":"🔴【P0】打开文件夹分享链接"},{"parent":"7ea9a324-339a-42af-994a-1f07434530b5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dd8dbacb-5d36-4905-b3c0-23d52b4b0d5e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eced76f7-8e56-4946-aec1-cd68efae10e6","title":"前置：关联会话详情中包含图片消息；角色：非房间成员；入口：分享链接页面"},{"parent":"dd8dbacb-5d36-4905-b3c0-23d52b4b0d5e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d4467990-1ea5-4f35-9fce-4e5960067548","title":"操作：打开分享链接并进入关联会话详情"},{"parent":"dd8dbacb-5d36-4905-b3c0-23d52b4b0d5e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"49737811-1df1-411a-8d9a-c40aa543e6c9","title":"预期：\n1) 产物预览 ｜ 图片不展示预览图，显示「图片暂时无法预览，请前往房间查看」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dd8dbacb-5d36-4905-b3c0-23d52b4b0d5e","title":"🟠【P1】分享链接中的图片预览"},{"parent":"7ea9a324-339a-42af-994a-1f07434530b5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5e937e34-0762-4ed3-886a-c935a71f8292","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d5cf2265-c99d-4f88-b29d-258cdcbd7d4e","title":"前置：分享页面评论区可用；角色：房间成员；入口：评论输入框"},{"parent":"5e937e34-0762-4ed3-886a-c935a71f8292","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"98eea6ca-320d-4645-8cec-4c42afa4fc94","title":"操作：在评论中输入 @ 并从下拉列表中选人"},{"parent":"5e937e34-0762-4ed3-886a-c935a71f8292","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5b13f7e4-8fc6-47d8-8822-0e61ae7d3cf3","title":"预期：<br>1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 下拉列表不出现自己<br>2) 提示文案 ｜ 只有被 @ 的人能在通知中心看到 @ 卡片"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5e937e34-0762-4ed3-886a-c935a71f8292","title":"🟠【P1】评论中 @ 他人"},{"parent":"7ea9a324-339a-42af-994a-1f07434530b5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aeac19fd-37a1-4f0d-8959-d9f2fdfb9ec5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3cfcc58a-4cce-4e07-a0ee-31dac7c93155","title":"前置：文件已分享且有多人参与评论；角色：非房间成员或房间成员；入口：分享链接页面的评论区"},{"parent":"aeac19fd-37a1-4f0d-8959-d9f2fdfb9ec5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1e993212-a82e-460f-9b8f-203000cfc7fc","title":"操作：在分享页面发表一条评论"},{"parent":"aeac19fd-37a1-4f0d-8959-d9f2fdfb9ec5","customWidth":428,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a2b3defb-618f-4457-a539-706dc219728c","title":"预期：<br>1) 提示文案 ｜ 最后一个分享者与被回复者收到对应的评论消息<br>2) 副作用 ｜ 自己的评论不出现在自己的通知中心下"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aeac19fd-37a1-4f0d-8959-d9f2fdfb9ec5","title":"🟠【P1】评论后的消息通知"},{"parent":"7ea9a324-339a-42af-994a-1f07434530b5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"147fe9ae-6e5d-437d-ac93-a9bfedfff76c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3db01f08-b89b-4ba4-a495-3a3c5bd4a02c","title":"前置：分享页面评论区可用；角色：房间成员；入口：评论输入框"},{"parent":"147fe9ae-6e5d-437d-ac93-a9bfedfff76c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"351e9a16-a571-4b2c-bc7f-0ba79bbd6ff5","title":"操作：在评论中发送消息后再回复"},{"parent":"147fe9ae-6e5d-437d-ac93-a9bfedfff76c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f45630c5-542b-464e-956f-148726e7a5e4","title":"预期：<br>1) 可以回复成功，不会收到通知提醒"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"147fe9ae-6e5d-437d-ac93-a9bfedfff76c","title":"🟠【P1】回复自己的评论"},{"parent":"7ea9a324-339a-42af-994a-1f07434530b5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e716cc02-ff1f-4a86-813d-40cf104f25f6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2ef8ca0b-4dd3-46a4-925d-1d75f54f49e1","title":"前置：分享页面评论区可用；角色：房间成员；入口：评论输入框"},{"parent":"e716cc02-ff1f-4a86-813d-40cf104f25f6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"02514181-1984-4f7f-b311-20491ca021c7","title":"操作：A打开评论中发送消息后再回复"},{"parent":"e716cc02-ff1f-4a86-813d-40cf104f25f6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"72bc37f0-08a2-45d4-8652-1444adf7c1e1","title":"预期：<br>1) 可以回复成功，分享者会收到通知提醒"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e716cc02-ff1f-4a86-813d-40cf104f25f6","title":"🟠【P1】回复他人的评论"},{"parent":"7ea9a324-339a-42af-994a-1f07434530b5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"14c94a6f-ae6e-4983-9492-eb00b6797d84","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e6b80551-b8fe-40a7-8694-7c78fd3e95b1","title":"前置：分享页面评论区可用；角色：房间成员；入口：评论输入框"},{"parent":"14c94a6f-ae6e-4983-9492-eb00b6797d84","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5f1be061-fdc6-42fa-8cd5-dd075883c34a","title":"操作：在分享页面发表一条评论并编辑"},{"parent":"14c94a6f-ae6e-4983-9492-eb00b6797d84","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"31692fee-b0c6-4cce-bbf7-eba83f825e43","title":"预期：<br>1) 可以编辑成功<br>2) 他人的评论不可以编辑&nbsp;<br>3) 通知下点击查看评论打开查看的是最新消息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"14c94a6f-ae6e-4983-9492-eb00b6797d84","title":"🟠【P1】编辑评论"},{"parent":"7ea9a324-339a-42af-994a-1f07434530b5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6300caf6-fc2d-4c2c-a424-9498bc3c230f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"07fbd323-3a71-4c87-b53f-651ec4c21337","title":"前置：分享页面评论区可用；角色：房间成员；入口：评论输入框"},{"parent":"6300caf6-fc2d-4c2c-a424-9498bc3c230f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d87f4bdf-9d47-433e-8502-3c6f6f78d148","title":"操作：在分享页面发表一条评论并编辑"},{"parent":"6300caf6-fc2d-4c2c-a424-9498bc3c230f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"59804fc9-40b7-413a-adc1-eb31fd81deac","title":"预期：<br>1) 可以删除成功，该评论及其回复都会从列表消失<br>2) 他人的评论不可以删除&nbsp;<br>3) 通知下点击查看评论打开查看不报错"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6300caf6-fc2d-4c2c-a424-9498bc3c230f","title":"🟠【P1】删除评论"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7ea9a324-339a-42af-994a-1f07434530b5","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"d8e7fdf9-54ce-4845-b57f-42484a4e3d04","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2743a093-9097-415d-b093-f68a91b9796e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d3012ed7-0523-4a1f-9b23-06bfd1592fb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bb954525-d343-4f1e-80fc-cac420ece13c","title":"前置：分享页面评论区可用；角色：房间成员；入口：评论输入框"},{"parent":"d3012ed7-0523-4a1f-9b23-06bfd1592fb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fdd64604-064e-40ae-a7c9-5acebf18c131","title":"操作：在评论中输入 @ 成员，并编辑删除@成员消息"},{"parent":"d3012ed7-0523-4a1f-9b23-06bfd1592fb7","customWidth":428,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9ded5e14-6393-4d9a-82a8-acc6dbca2c0e","title":"预期：<br>1) 通知中心下@卡片仍然显示，点击去查看仍然打开分享页面"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d3012ed7-0523-4a1f-9b23-06bfd1592fb7","title":"🟡【P2】@后再编辑删掉@消息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2743a093-9097-415d-b093-f68a91b9796e","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"d8e7fdf9-54ce-4845-b57f-42484a4e3d04","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"093d98ca-8fbc-49c7-8e6d-d71087edfa09","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1f78e09a-fda5-476c-8439-4992dd213fa1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5506be6-89d9-40d2-a398-419e272c33ef","title":"前置：存在总大小超过 300MB 的文件夹；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的分享项"},{"parent":"1f78e09a-fda5-476c-8439-4992dd213fa1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"93345554-4df3-424c-b38d-1aa5fdb541f3","title":"操作：对该文件夹点击分享"},{"parent":"1f78e09a-fda5-476c-8439-4992dd213fa1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"af0b5223-b286-44d8-9008-232a8bb4231c","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示「无法分享：文件或目录总大小不能超过300MB」\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不生成分享记录也不生成半成品链接"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1f78e09a-fda5-476c-8439-4992dd213fa1","title":"🟡【P2】分享的文件夹超过 300MB"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"093d98ca-8fbc-49c7-8e6d-d71087edfa09","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d8e7fdf9-54ce-4845-b57f-42484a4e3d04","title":"分享页面详情"},{"parent":"50bf2d85-55e7-42a9-bad2-2fab0f509d8d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6f7d1e69-3b1d-4328-be63-06ca8b7aed3e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"19fc1004-e8a1-4225-9e74-83803b7761d8","title":"说明：文件分享页面的 URL 换成产品自己的 TTSS 域名"},{"parent":"6f7d1e69-3b1d-4328-be63-06ca8b7aed3e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a370b027-8e93-41e9-a827-d979cb6618f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"873a353a-674c-4517-a442-7a87a0bdc8e0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"25e07e08-35e2-45d7-8134-0d660d330048","title":"前置：已对某个文件生成分享链接；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗"},{"parent":"873a353a-674c-4517-a442-7a87a0bdc8e0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e1df5b74-e3fe-40cf-b122-5717e0eb8611","title":"操作：查看并复制链接"},{"parent":"873a353a-674c-4517-a442-7a87a0bdc8e0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"877febc1-f90f-4eeb-8757-604e292d214d","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 链接域名为产品自己的 TTSS 域名，不再是旧域名\n2) 剪贴板 ｜ 复制出的链接与展示一致"},{"parent":"873a353a-674c-4517-a442-7a87a0bdc8e0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e892fc84-e56d-4df1-9c9d-85816cbaeb35","title":"备注：文件分享页面的 URL 换成产品自己的 TTSS 域名"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"873a353a-674c-4517-a442-7a87a0bdc8e0","title":"🔴【P0】分享链接使用 TTSS 域名"},{"parent":"a370b027-8e93-41e9-a827-d979cb6618f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"03fb3a34-64f5-4dbe-b92d-d11d4c682c2d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"83b77e6d-82e3-4c06-bf19-8045909584aa","title":"前置：已复制新域名的分享链接；角色：链接访问者；入口：浏览器"},{"parent":"03fb3a34-64f5-4dbe-b92d-d11d4c682c2d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b95f57fd-d751-4a99-a703-2e2d8ed23402","title":"操作：打开该链接"},{"parent":"03fb3a34-64f5-4dbe-b92d-d11d4c682c2d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e5d73aa-8527-4349-a9a9-0e58364255dd","title":"预期：\n1) 跳转定位 ｜ 正常打开分享页面，内容与权限判定与旧域名一致\n2) 产物预览 ｜ 可预览与下载的行为不受域名变化影响"},{"parent":"03fb3a34-64f5-4dbe-b92d-d11d4c682c2d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"39d9d097-a553-4aa4-b132-9296efedc5e0","title":"备注：文件分享页面的 URL 换成产品自己的 TTSS 域名"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"03fb3a34-64f5-4dbe-b92d-d11d4c682c2d","title":"🔴【P0】新域名下的分享页可正常访问"},{"parent":"a370b027-8e93-41e9-a827-d979cb6618f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4bb44ff9-c5eb-4d43-b33c-c84dfaf4d255","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eda9922d-a6c0-4f05-bd9a-b5040204200d","title":"前置：文件中心、My Assets、右侧面板三处都能分享文件；角色：房间成员；入口：三处分享弹窗"},{"parent":"4bb44ff9-c5eb-4d43-b33c-c84dfaf4d255","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"12f50cf5-bf48-49da-919e-907df4045a2d","title":"操作：分别生成链接并对照域名"},{"parent":"4bb44ff9-c5eb-4d43-b33c-c84dfaf4d255","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2c1afcb5-e4ee-4d4f-ad24-7d1b1105db04","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 三处生成的链接域名一致，都是新的 TTSS 域名\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 链接结构一致，不出现一处带参数一处不带"},{"parent":"4bb44ff9-c5eb-4d43-b33c-c84dfaf4d255","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0fd9b912-1699-449a-947b-ac807a55b950","title":"备注：文件分享页面的 URL 换成产品自己的 TTSS 域名"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4bb44ff9-c5eb-4d43-b33c-c84dfaf4d255","title":"🔴【P0】三个分享入口的域名一致"},{"parent":"a370b027-8e93-41e9-a827-d979cb6618f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"165d3753-0c82-430d-90f0-ac365021a782","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c169eaf9-c6c5-4435-b00b-245f1ef5c40b","title":"前置：会话分享弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：会话链接"},{"parent":"165d3753-0c82-430d-90f0-ac365021a782","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"779bdfcf-a414-48cb-8026-2da331e496d0","title":"操作：对照会话链接与文件分享链接的域名"},{"parent":"165d3753-0c82-430d-90f0-ac365021a782","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1bdc8ac4-2241-4b53-ad19-e289f1a354c6","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 按产品定义是否统一到同一域名，结论唯一且两处口径一致"},{"parent":"165d3753-0c82-430d-90f0-ac365021a782","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d1928f9c-3aef-44a6-bde3-4b01387b6abd","title":"备注：会话分享链接是否也换到新域名需产品确认；文件分享页面的 URL 换成产品自己的 TTSS 域名"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"165d3753-0c82-430d-90f0-ac365021a782","title":"🟠【P1】会话分享链接的域名口径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a370b027-8e93-41e9-a827-d979cb6618f7","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"6f7d1e69-3b1d-4328-be63-06ca8b7aed3e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"85854dce-29cd-4fbc-abc8-e9f9d775678c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"00ee39a3-bae6-4702-a7af-15e4632d2d3c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b9d88fb8-630f-4c4f-a0a3-3924df00d3e9","title":"前置：存在换域名之前生成的旧分享链接；角色：链接访问者；入口：旧链接"},{"parent":"00ee39a3-bae6-4702-a7af-15e4632d2d3c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5804d68-f788-4470-9c8e-ff6a9209feaa","title":"操作：打开旧链接"},{"parent":"00ee39a3-bae6-4702-a7af-15e4632d2d3c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6f14ffae-0126-49da-a083-fa9a23f2e04e","title":"预期：\n1) 跳转定位 ｜ 按产品定义重定向到新域名或继续可访问，结论唯一\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不出现打不开或跳到错误页"},{"parent":"00ee39a3-bae6-4702-a7af-15e4632d2d3c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f93a636e-2b02-495b-8477-af4b7b16bfe9","title":"备注：文件分享页面的 URL 换成产品自己的 TTSS 域名"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"00ee39a3-bae6-4702-a7af-15e4632d2d3c","title":"🔴【P0】旧域名链接的兼容"},{"parent":"85854dce-29cd-4fbc-abc8-e9f9d775678c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8c9e9e27-000f-4bb3-b663-ad7ebf941465","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"82606957-6471-44a2-bb7a-b62b45b559eb","title":"前置：使用新域名访问分享页；角色：链接访问者；入口：浏览器"},{"parent":"8c9e9e27-000f-4bb3-b663-ad7ebf941465","callo