":"7367668b-d7a7-4a7d-b6f3-a7a420c17e43","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 链接完整可点击，不被截断\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 预览卡片（若有）展示的信息正确"},{"parent":"ab51b3ef-1e20-4142-af4b-b1620114efb2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ab9d3dc8-4943-4bbd-a3e5-7d6881971889","title":"备注：文件分享页面的 URL 换成产品自己的 TTSS 域名"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ab51b3ef-1e20-4142-af4b-b1620114efb2","title":"🟡【P2】链接在各渠道的展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"417665fe-19d0-4d7c-a956-f1b28a289b3e","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6f7d1e69-3b1d-4328-be63-06ca8b7aed3e","title":"分享链接域名"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"50bf2d85-55e7-42a9-bad2-2fab0f509d8d","title":"文件/文件夹分享"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"45a3c61b-b066-47ee-8c28-ca62c6b56fcc","title":"文件中心"},{"parent":"fdfb8ac9-47cd-446a-975f-794544a4b38b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6a59b196-55b3-4d5c-919a-cc3e71851963","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e05fde1e-ce65-4a87-bfa2-be8c950f6cf6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e2ef6d3a-6331-4a85-a640-930d68edaae7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"edd62a19-a497-4e49-ae05-ddf9efc3df7c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"95ecc70d-4889-40b2-9549-fb2fd4af1b61","title":"前置：当前有两个文件正在上传；角色：房间成员；入口：文件中心右上角的文件传输入口"},{"parent":"edd62a19-a497-4e49-ae05-ddf9efc3df7c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"19fc9829-4b9f-4ebd-8b6f-5bf489443749","title":"操作：查看入口的角标"},{"parent":"edd62a19-a497-4e49-ae05-ddf9efc3df7c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"50de57a4-010a-4abc-b092-767c20d3de07","title":"预期：\n1) 未读标识 ｜ 入口展示未完成传输的数量\n2) 未读标识 ｜ 全部完成后角标消失或归零，行为一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"edd62a19-a497-4e49-ae05-ddf9efc3df7c","title":"🔴【P0】入口与未完成计数","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"e2ef6d3a-6331-4a85-a640-930d68edaae7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"59d73444-4039-4573-83f6-79308c7e3e64","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"074f698f-5085-44cb-b436-fa4bdc029e3f","title":"前置：已发起过传输任务；角色：房间成员；入口：文件传输入口"},{"parent":"59d73444-4039-4573-83f6-79308c7e3e64","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7c26d08c-a9b7-4e0b-9ca9-bffe80c54f25","title":"操作：点击打开面板，再点击面板外区域关闭"},{"parent":"59d73444-4039-4573-83f6-79308c7e3e64","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7f0ca9b3-752a-4337-802e-f65ac52a59fe","title":"预期：\n1) 面板开关 ｜ 面板从右上角展开，标题为文件传输\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 按任务列出条目，每条显示图标、名称与当前状态\n3) 面板开关 ｜ 关闭后当前目录与选中态不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"59d73444-4039-4573-83f6-79308c7e3e64","title":"🔴【P0】打开与关闭传输面板","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"e2ef6d3a-6331-4a85-a640-930d68edaae7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9c9a3305-4abe-4798-a76a-e1b04e59d498","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5e013801-78ce-4c25-9eb2-0c10e529b8fc","title":"前置：本次会话尚未发起过任何传输；角色：房间成员；入口：文件传输入口"},{"parent":"9c9a3305-4abe-4798-a76a-e1b04e59d498","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e3a745c-3fed-46ea-ba48-f52c6cbe90a3","title":"操作：打开传输面板"},{"parent":"9c9a3305-4abe-4798-a76a-e1b04e59d498","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ff55cc0-a6ee-4ee9-b0d8-df80a2e2c26f","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 展示暂无文件传输的空态文案\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不出现空白区域或上一次的历史脏数据"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9c9a3305-4abe-4798-a76a-e1b04e59d498","title":"🔴【P0】空态","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e2ef6d3a-6331-4a85-a640-930d68edaae7","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"e05fde1e-ce65-4a87-bfa2-be8c950f6cf6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a116e9ae-ab90-43af-9a92-09e7ce0ab311","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ca841653-c707-48de-8199-123496f11892","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9d709607-b80d-4c95-95ee-3f28b36e9fb8","title":"前置：传输面板已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：右侧详情面板与其他浮层"},{"parent":"ca841653-c707-48de-8199-123496f11892","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3434627a-e0d3-475f-8333-c4ff4f107279","title":"操作：在传输面板打开时点击列表中的文件、切换 tab、再打开其他浮层"},{"parent":"ca841653-c707-48de-8199-123496f11892","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"743781d6-f06a-47c1-bb1a-259be93e6a6f","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 面板不遮挡关键操作区，或按产品的浮层互斥规则切换\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不出现两个浮层重叠且都可操作导致的状态错乱"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ca841653-c707-48de-8199-123496f11892","title":"🟡【P2】面板与其他浮层的关系","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a116e9ae-ab90-43af-9a92-09e7ce0ab311","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e05fde1e-ce65-4a87-bfa2-be8c950f6cf6","title":"传输面板"},{"parent":"6a59b196-55b3-4d5c-919a-cc3e71851963","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"84a86842-0915-403c-8cd6-25c725fceaef","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5280d2d8-282f-4ad9-9c54-5edaa54bec97","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a27a5804-09fc-4b27-a4ac-244f82383144","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"91ecdfaa-7b7e-48a8-a96c-490ea34df09b","title":"前置：正在上传一个较大的文件；角色：房间成员；入口：传输面板"},{"parent":"a27a5804-09fc-4b27-a4ac-244f82383144","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"21afbaab-69ad-45bf-96b4-b32c112069f5","title":"操作：观察该条目"},{"parent":"a27a5804-09fc-4b27-a4ac-244f82383144","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d6e8b27e-df35-4d82-b7c9-6cdfca1833ae","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 展示进度条与百分比，百分比随实际传输推进\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ 条目右侧提供取消按钮"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a27a5804-09fc-4b27-a4ac-244f82383144","title":"🔴【P0】上传中的进度展示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"5280d2d8-282f-4ad9-9c54-5edaa54bec97","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a19d230b-150a-42e6-b546-f303ee20956f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"58796087-b215-4b76-ba3b-f55b9e17aec3","title":"前置：某个文件正在上传；角色：房间成员；入口：该条目的取消按钮"},{"parent":"a19d230b-150a-42e6-b546-f303ee20956f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f2ba63b8-7afd-4ddc-8542-7ae2e46a55fc","title":"操作：点击取消"},{"parent":"a19d230b-150a-42e6-b546-f303ee20956f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"67975b50-1311-475d-b716-a7233e884c24","title":"预期：\n1) 副作用 ｜ 该任务停止传输并从进行中移除或标记为已取消\n2) 文件落盘 ｜ 目标目录下不留下不完整的文件\n3) 未读标识 ｜ 入口角标数量相应减少"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a19d230b-150a-42e6-b546-f303ee20956f","title":"🔴【P0】取消上传中的任务","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"5280d2d8-282f-4ad9-9c54-5edaa54bec97","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"62753d35-1f81-44e8-a985-8993ccb0bc5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4b0555da-63f8-464f-80c