重试继续，或明确提示需要重新发起"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6f090d2b-fbdb-4840-bb2b-9231b67c9c1d","title":"🔴【P0】上传中断网","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"557dbe7e-7d96-441c-8c5a-b753714745c6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c4e16e54-d5da-4ff7-94c2-65489ff90981","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"52a0a853-1b1f-46d8-9582-b0f70b24731a","title":"前置：某个文件正在上传；角色：房间成员；入口：传输面板与左侧菜单"},{"parent":"c4e16e54-d5da-4ff7-94c2-65489ff90981","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a007f37f-0b8f-4308-85fe-b7e5a1053a91","title":"操作：关闭传输面板并切换到其他房间，再切回来打开面板"},{"parent":"c4e16e54-d5da-4ff7-94c2-65489ff90981","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dbb9e6e5-709a-435a-aac5-583357d80bda","title":"预期：\n1) 持久化 ｜ 传输任务在后台继续，不因关闭面板或切换页面而中断\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 切回后面板中该任务的进度或结果仍在"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c4e16e54-d5da-4ff7-94c2-65489ff90981","title":"🔴【P0】上传中关闭面板或切换页面","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"557dbe7e-7d96-441c-8c5a-b753714745c6","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"84a86842-0915-403c-8cd6-25c725fceaef","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d31f2218-ed17-4ea6-ab6b-8dc98df6e5ae","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"580abdaf-3c9b-4428-a2b3-f143c5f827f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"59b00ab9-26b3-4787-a2e7-953df037b8a0","title":"前置：正在向某个文件夹上传文件；角色：房间成员；入口：文件列表"},{"parent":"580abdaf-3c9b-4428-a2b3-f143c5f827f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"02208d4d-c93d-4176-b6f1-5488323f2296","title":"操作：在上传过程中删除该目标文件夹"},{"parent":"580abdaf-3c9b-4428-a2b3-f143c5f827f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"edd17944-df51-4ef5-82fc-4dc372b41412","title":"预期：<br>1) 提示文案 ｜ 该任务转为失败并说明目标目录已不存在<br>2) 副作用 ｜ 不产生落到根目录的孤儿文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"580abdaf-3c9b-4428-a2b3-f143c5f827f8","title":"🟡【P2】上传中删除目标目录","icons":[{"color":"rgb(248, 87, 103)","name":"other","index":"369"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d31f2218-ed17-4ea6-ab6b-8dc98df6e5ae","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"84a86842-0915-403c-8cd6-25c725fceaef","title":"上传中"},{"parent":"6a59b196-55b3-4d5c-919a-cc3e71851963","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"67653d7b-ec63-40f8-b104-9dee86cdc73e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f999b3f6-8b2d-46e0-9dc4-92ad29c1323c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"057f9b8d-0413-4c25-8f31-16e239e2866e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0d8ea387-2f1d-4e40-80c9-4f7107ab71be","title":"前置：存在一个传输失败的任务；角色：房间成员；入口：传输面板"},{"parent":"057f9b8d-0413-4c25-8f31-16e239e2866e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7d500207-a3d2-4e21-a326-5ec379047b20","title":"操作：查看该条目"},{"parent":"057f9b8d-0413-4c25-8f31-16e239e2866e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f41eebaa-50a2-4226-8639-576f1a73151e","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 条目标记为传输失败并带失败图标\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ 提供重试与删除记录两个操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"057f9b8d-0413-4c25-8f31-16e239e2866e","title":"🔴【P0】失败条目的展示与操作","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f999b3f6-8b2d-46e0-9dc4-92ad29c1323c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0296881a-7b37-4fb9-b1a9-8bdc2d5ee12d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb598da9-d708-4ed2-8e70-c4b896fc55fb","title":"前置：存在一个传输失败的任务且失败原因已排除；角色：房间成员；入口：该条目的重试按钮"},{"parent":"0296881a-7b37-4fb9-b1a9-8bdc2d5ee12d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4c88422e-67dd-4c04-9849-30c572530e64","title":"操作：点击重试"},{"parent":"0296881a-7b37-4fb9-b1a9-8bdc2d5ee12d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c49bf385-4010-4ec7-9c4c-70535835bbf9","title":"预期：\n1) 恢复重试 ｜ 任务重新开始传输并展示进度\n2) 副作用 ｜ 重试成功后不产生两份重复文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0296881a-7b37-4fb9-b1a9-8bdc2d5ee12d","title":"🔴【P0】重试失败的任务","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f999b3f6-8b2d-46e0-9dc4-92ad29c1323c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9030bcf7-d8fe-4ae0-be3e-25bfac4e9c92","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"32aa9526-a87b-4b08-8c7c-4fbf8f3327f6","title":"前置：传输面板中有已完成与失败的条目；角色：房间成员；入口：条目的删除按钮"},{"parent":"9030bcf7-d8fe-4ae0-be3e-25bfac4e9c92","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0b736fa1-919f-4788-8555-d0db4113bce9","title":"操作：分别删除一条已完成与一条失败的记录"},{"parent":"9030bcf7-d8fe-4ae0-be3e-25bfac4e9c92","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0cc50e45-97f0-4fe7-a86f-22fc1106b665","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 仅移除该条记录，其他条目不受影响\n2) 副作用 ｜ 删除记录不删除已经上传成功的实际文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9030bcf7-d8fe-4ae0-be3e-25bfac4e9c92","title":"🟠【P1】删除单条传输记录","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f999b3f6-8b2d-46e0-9dc4-92ad29c1323c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"eb900b7f-f9ab-4fe1-9053-5599ef1a2718","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aa42c76d-4db1-40da-a309-d7890bb4e100","title":"前置：传输面板中已有已完成与失败的记录；角色：房间成员；入口：浏览器刷新"},{"parent":"eb900b7f-f9ab-4fe1-9053-5599ef1a2718","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e09df63b-0516-4648-bef4-8df28b3cb1c8","title":"操作：刷新页面后重新打开传输面板"},{"parent":"eb900b7f-f9ab-4fe1-9053-5599ef1a2718","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b205f88d-701c-4769-bba0-90276c5c9a40","title":"预期：\n1) 持久化 ｜ 刷新后传输记录全部清空，面板展示暂无文件传输的空态\n2) 文件落盘 ｜ 已上传成功的文件仍在文件列表中，不随记录清空而消失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"eb900b7f-f9ab-4fe1-9053-5599ef1a2718","title":"🔴【P0】传输记录刷新后清空","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f999b3f6-8b2d-46e0-9dc4-92ad29c1323c","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"67653d7b-ec63-40f8-b104-9dee86cdc73e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7f00f248-1db8-4ecd-bb6f-a8b3d6093847","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"11054c2e-0dec-4e39-b2b9-4e76453d4e1b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0b3693ea-4efd-425b-bf77-2b4449be3672","title":"前置：失败原因未排除（如文件已被本地删除）；角色：房间成员；入口：该条目的重试按钮"},{"parent":"11054c2e-0dec-4e39-b2b9-4e76453d4e1b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"152beb3b-d91a-428f-a7a8-ed87d32141fc","title":"操作：连续重试两次"},{"parent":"11054c2e-0dec-4e39-b2b9-4e76453d4e1b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a58737ed-4730-4058-819c-ee335a7eb050","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 每次都给出可读的失败原因，不出现无声失败\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不无限自动重试，重试次数与状态可见"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"11054c2e-0dec-4e39-b2b9-4e76453d4e1b","title":"🟠【P1】重试仍然失败","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"7f00f248-1db8-4ecd-bb6f-a8b3d6093847","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ae754abe-d832-4061-9ea4-e136254ef1c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fcb1a039-16fd-49ad-a523-59efa7951852","title":"前置：某个文件正在上传中；角色：房间成员；入口：浏览器刷新"},{"parent":"ae754abe-d832-4061-9ea4-e136254ef1c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76d90061-d229-493f-b240-4a4fbcba813c","title":"操作：在上传进行中刷新页面，再查看传输面板与文件列表"},{"parent":"ae754abe-d832-4061-9ea4-e136254ef1c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9336fc40-061d-4b79-aa72-f2b0efe5a62d","title":"预期：<br>1) 提示文案 ｜ 刷新前按产品定义给出会中断上传的提示，或刷新后明确告知该任务已中断<br>2) 文件落盘 ｜ 目标目录下不留下不完整的文件<br>3) 副作用 ｜ 不出现记录已清空但后台仍在写入的情况"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ae754abe-d832-4061-9ea4-e136254ef1c0","title":"🔴【P0】刷新时有任务正在上传","icons":[{"color":"rgb(248, 87, 103)","name":"other","index":"369"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7f00f248-1db8-4ecd-bb6f-a8b3d6093847","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"67653d7b-ec63-40f8-b104-9dee86cdc73e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"10fb7670-27b3-45f7-bd6a-706df992ad3a","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"9dae74f3-b414-4c21-ac89-fff6e86c9988","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bfcfcf4c-fe4b-42bc-94ee-8956ce89bfd9","title":"前置：一次性上传 50 个以上文件；角色：房间成员；入口：传输面板"},{"parent":"9dae74f3-b414-4c21-ac89-fff6e86c9988","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6f478454-b322-4bd8-bc09-8e0c83c4f5fa","title":"操作：滚动查看面板中的任务列表"},{"parent":"9dae74f3-b414-4c21-ac89-fff6e86c9988","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7b1d3fc6-9327-409a-8730-e1baad936414","title":"预期：\n1) 性能 ｜ 面板可滚动，进度更新不卡顿\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 任务数量与实际一致，不重复不遗漏"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"9dae74f3-b414-4c21-ac89-fff6e86c9988","title":"🟡【P2】大量传输任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"10fb7670-27b3-45f7-bd6a-706df992ad3a","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"67653d7b-ec63-40f8-b104-9dee86cdc73e","title":"失败、重试与记录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6a59b196-55b3-4d5c-919a-cc3e71851963","title":"文件传输"},{"parent":"fdfb8ac9-47cd-446a-975f-794544a4b38b","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"df696030-0aa7-4c05-86d4-7cd9e421febb","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"3c9df9bc-c66b-4bd5-b536-374e0cafa30a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fb711167-5cab-42ff-a5ed-2718c5c8fa1e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e68eccfc-25cd-4e3d-8062-ce2430c1fed3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"32b88843-3f35-45be-a0b3-c55835750456","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fae4869a-86ee-433d-9df5-b663ce31a527","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a3efb80c-d4cb-43ef-a6eb-cf86d18e2e84","title":"前置：已进入房间的 Agent 页签"},{"parent":"fae4869a-86ee-433d-9df5-b663ce31a527","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e10fe6e9-b986-4b45-b6fd-14161d17b97b","title":"操作：点击左侧 Agents 列表中的 Agent Management，查看右侧区域"},{"parent":"fae4869a-86ee-433d-9df5-b663ce31a527","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4dd87e87-a352-485a-9f18-76e414d5511a","title":"预期：右侧以卡片形式并列展示 Tutti Agent、Codex、Claude Code；每张卡片自上而下依次为名称与状态、Share Agent access、Usage limit、Availability Check、底部按钮，顺序与结构一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fae4869a-86ee-433d-9df5-b663ce31a527","title":"🔴【P0】Agent Management 页的卡片并列展示"},{"parent":"32b88843-3f35-45be-a0b3-c55835750456","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b3bc4c4e-91dc-41e0-bd29-2be38b270c3e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"24666fd2-d87e-49ad-82ea-849b1859e0d6","title":"前置：已进入 Agent Management 页"},{"parent":"b3bc4c4e-91dc-41e0-bd29-2be38b270c3e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e43fddd-0231-4ff2-9086-9cd27176cebd","title":"操作：查看每张卡片头部区域"},{"parent":"b3bc4c4e-91dc-41e0-bd29-2be38b270c3e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ccd68d59-be32-4f83-bb57-247d9a4fd976","title":"预期：展示该 Agent 的专属图标与名称，名称下方为状态点与状态文案；三张卡片的图标互不相同且与 Agent 实际身份对应"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b3bc4c4e-91dc-41e0-bd29-2be38b270c3e","title":"🔴【P0】卡片头部的名称、图标与状态文案"},{"parent":"32b88843-3f35-45be-a0b3-c55835750456","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9549d26d-cd13-4fc7-82e2-dc57c133531a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b4339a1f-bbbb-47ed-b2e0-4d5bcf17d6cf","title":"前置：存在受支持的 Agent 类型"},{"parent":"9549d26d-cd13-4fc7-82e2-dc57c133531a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f6d680a6-143c-4af4-a0b3-1ceb29fd338b","title":"操作：查看左侧面板中的 Agent 列表"},{"parent":"9549d26d-cd13-4fc7-82e2-dc57c133531a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3b4ed0fb-59bd-45a2-947d-245c029e618e","title":"预期：受支持类型正常展示并可进行安装与登录操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9549d26d-cd13-4fc7-82e2-dc57c133531a","title":"🟠【P1】受支持 Agent 类型正常展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"32b88843-3f35-45be-a0b3-c55835750456","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"e68eccfc-25cd-4e3d-8062-ce2430c1fed3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a9ff5524-fd2f-408e-9a1c-bf0c78cb4037","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"986f8610-422c-4302-a647-82f2bcedef8c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3cc4076a-265f-4217-84b8-604e6f7fffed","title":"前置：存在此前不支持、升级后支持的 Agent 类型"},{"parent":"986f8610-422c-4302-a647-82f2bcedef8c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3b9ecb09-5f31-4e95-b830-430215b0f90c","title":"操作：升级应用后查看该 Agent 类型的状态"},{"parent":"986f8610-422c-4302-a647-82f2bcedef8c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b26cbda7-c273-40ce-aec8-4d2e726d88a2","title":"预期：由不支持切换为可安装，不需要重装应用或清理配置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"986f8610-422c-4302-a647-82f2bcedef8c","title":"🟡【P2】应用升级后新增支持的类型"},{"parent":"a9ff5524-fd2f-408e-9a1c-bf0c78cb4037","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"55142406-2b60-402e-b35f-2ffb7d8de61d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0cb0792a-c047-4dfc-901d-cea5d7350644","title":"前置：支持的 Agent 数量多于当前窗口可并列展示的数量"},{"parent":"55142406-2b60-402e-b35f-2ffb7d8de61d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a3aa9a8d-9bdf-4c2e-8404-62d6984e0d9a","title":"操作：进入 Agent Management 页并调整窗口宽度"},{"parent":"55142406-2b60-402e-b35f-2ffb7d8de61d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"94325f73-cae3-4672-b4e7-d60387c25573","title":"预期：卡片区域按产品规则横向滚动或换行，卡片内部结构不被压缩变形；窗口缩放过程中无内容截断或重叠"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"55142406-2b60-402e-b35f-2ffb7d8de61d","title":"🟡【P2】支持的 Agent 数量超出可视宽度"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a9ff5524-fd2f-408e-9a1c-bf0c78cb4037","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e68eccfc-25cd-4e3d-8062-ce2430c1fed3","title":"0.1 页面布局与卡片列表"},{"parent":"fb711167-5cab-42ff-a5ed-2718c5c8fa1e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8a526991-98d0-4aec-aa15-cf0b5b5a1497","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b49b620b-d742-4717-8056-f24b0f977383","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7b40d9d9-77fe-4da5-805b-c739c364ea4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"530c9e59-4ecb-4265-bf65-943c027a2903","title":"前置：分别准备未安装、已安装未登录、已登录三个 Agent"},{"parent":"7b40d9d9-77fe-4da5-805b-c739c364ea4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cdac1658-a774-4a71-82e4-7de9185122b9","title":"操作：在同一屏内依次对照三张卡片的 Share Agent access、Usage limit、Availability Check 与底部按钮"},{"parent":"7b40d9d9-77fe-4da5-805b-c739c364ea4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d89dd712-df81-4730-82fc-d9834735b800","title":"预期：未安装：开关关闭不可操作，Usage limit 全为 --，检测区为 Not setup yet，底部仅 Install；已安装未登录：开关关闭不可操作，Usage limit 全为 --，检测区展示三步且第三步为 Not signed in，底部为 Re-check 与 Sign in；已登录：开关可操作，Usage limit 展示真实数值，三步均通过，底部为 Re-check 与 Sign in again"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7b40d9d9-77fe-4da5-805b-c739c364ea4b","title":"🔴【P0】三种状态下卡片控件组合的对照"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b49b620b-d742-4717-8056-f24b0f977383","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"8a526991-98d0-4aec-aa15-cf0b5b5a1497","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"266b4d5f-b3b6-435d-8092-5269a3ce5f9b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3907551b-097d-48db-a18d-c857d07d2cb6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"46926854-9971-4c7b-8706-9e92d052028d","title":"前置：前置：Codex 未登录或未安装；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：智能体详情、共享设置弹窗、历史会话输入框"},{"parent":"3907551b-097d-48db-a18d-c857d07d2cb6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5a70b9b8-6bf9-4e6e-88d5-4c4f81721273","title":"操作：分别尝试新建会话、开启共享、在历史会话中发送消息"},{"parent":"3907551b-097d-48db-a18d-c857d07d2cb6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5929c1a6-6c7b-452b-b279-4d3b89c3a84a","title":"预期：智能体右侧详情显示需要设置且不能新建会话；共享设置弹窗中该 Agent 开关不可开启；历史会话输入框禁用并提示需要登录；不出现可发送但随后报错的情况"},{"parent":"3907551b-097d-48db-a18d-c857d07d2cb6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3de7ca63-2582-48fd-b9da-da8730a74f63","title":"备注：#372 #411 #412"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3907551b-097d-48db-a18d-c857d07d2cb6","title":"🔴【P0】未登录未安装时禁止使用与共享"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"266b4d5f-b3b6-435d-8092-5269a3ce5f9b","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"8a526991-98d0-4aec-aa15-cf0b5b5a1497","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"80d5f446-7b65-4eb9-9bff-c77089feb9f4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9213f0c7-4459-4b1a-87f1-2ae6362577b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"42848088-0f62-4c6a-85d0-77f2face08db","title":"前置：三个 Agent 分别处于未安装、已安装未登录、已登录"},{"parent":"9213f0c7-4459-4b1a-87f1-2ae6362577b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7abedea5-6ac7-488c-8460-a0fbc0d667d7","title":"操作：在 Agent Management 页同时查看三张卡片并对其中一张执行操作"},{"parent":"9213f0c7-4459-4b1a-87f1-2ae6362577b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"de2c5d70-43ff-4cf2-ab8b-f2752c5f42c7","title":"预期：各卡片按自身状态独立渲染，操作只影响被操作的卡片；不出现状态串卡或整屏重新加载"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9213f0c7-4459-4b1a-87f1-2ae6362577b4","title":"🟡【P2】同一屏内多个 Agent 处于不同状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"80d5f446-7b65-4eb9-9bff-c77089feb9f4","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8a526991-98d0-4aec-aa15-cf0b5b5a1497","title":"0.2 三种状态的对照与切换"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fb711167-5cab-42ff-a5ed-2718c5c8fa1e","title":"0. 管理页与卡片总览"},{"parent":"3c9df9bc-c66b-4bd5-b536-374e0cafa30a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d89a71df-6968-4fc4-8eeb-8006bc302680","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7e3cc82f-1107-4a46-9c34-7a96e5de30a6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ff09c909-c6f1-4909-b896-a0ee0b9c751f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"09bacd65-32e8-4466-b24d-3b508084ae5d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cf3b9c23-8fac-4bb8-baa6-a8b875beecae","title":"前置：Agent 未安装，已进入 Agent Management 页"},{"parent":"09bacd65-32e8-4466-b24d-3b508084ae5d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"86635555-d0df-4f23-bc9b-c0600bb9b61f","title":"操作：查看该 Agent 卡片的状态点、状态文案与 Availability Check 区域"},{"parent":"09bacd65-32e8-4466-b24d-3b508084ae5d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f0f2425d-4561-4164-853d-628b6cff996b","title":"预期：状态文案为 Unavailable 且状态点样式与 Available 明确区分；Availability Check 区域展示 Not setup yet 占位，不展示 Environment / CLI &amp; Adapter / Signed in 三步明细"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"09bacd65-32e8-4466-b24d-3b508084ae5d","title":"🔴【P0】未安装时的卡片状态与 Not setup yet 占位"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ff09c909-c6f1-4909-b896-a0ee0b9c751f","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"7e3cc82f-1107-4a46-9c34-7a96e5de30a6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"24431d91-0dad-444e-9e30-8804fb5a7470","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"03712b4a-2019-4edb-85eb-879ed6c224fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"85e1050f-6a14-4923-a906-08b99b1049fe","title":"前置：该 Agent 未安装，已点击 Install 且安装即将完成"},{"parent":"03712b4a-2019-4edb-85eb-879ed6c224fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"71e31e2c-7317-4eda-b5ce-4c94d72258d4","title":"操作：停留在卡片上观察从安装完成到状态更新的过程"},{"parent":"03712b4a-2019-4edb-85eb-879ed6c224fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"79afe73a-7e06-47c3-91ae-7985a5b24502","title":"预期：状态文案与检测区域一次性切换到已安装形态，Not setup yet 占位被三步明细替换；过程中不出现未安装与已安装两套控件同时存在"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"03712b4a-2019-4edb-85eb-879ed6c224fd","title":"🟡【P2】安装完成瞬间卡片从未安装态切出"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"24431d91-0dad-444e-9e30-8804fb5a7470","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7e3cc82f-1107-4a46-9c34-7a96e5de30a6","title":"1.1 卡片整体与状态标识"},{"parent":"d89a71df-6968-4fc4-8eeb-8006bc302680","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"36e052a8-de1c-4d02-ae34-9e5711848e9b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9ffcce15-7b35-438d-9a0a-5f3f546142c6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"48496364-c0ee-4875-ba64-5e2621d49748","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"628552bf-25e0-4b6f-a4d4-9798b7c52781","title":"前置：Agent 未安装"},{"parent":"48496364-c0ee-4875-ba64-5e2621d49748","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7f51cfa9-7821-4085-8fb0-b14ae6b1b03d","title":"操作：查看并尝试点击卡片上的 Share Agent access 开关"},{"parent":"48496364-c0ee-4875-ba64-5e2621d49748","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"204ce0bb-4701-407d-8119-f081af24a000","title":"预期：开关仍展示且处于关闭态；点击不能开启并给出需先安装的说明；不出现开关已开启但实际未共享"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"48496364-c0ee-4875-ba64-5e2621d49748","title":"🔴【P0】未安装时 Share Agent access 的展示与可操作性"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9ffcce15-7b35-438d-9a0a-5f3f546142c6","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"36e052a8-de1c-4d02-ae34-9e5711848e9b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"084953be-5529-4b54-86a3-e9c2c7503740","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"18191fb3-c061-4202-a3b0-c6963f162947","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2e6806fd-8032-4349-81b2-801a7ea4155e","title":"前置：该 Agent 未安装，房间内存在另一名成员"},{"parent":"18191fb3-c061-4202-a3b0-c6963f162947","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6b72a83a-4d89-404e-90ec-198773778f38","title":"操作：以另一名成员身份在房间内查看可选 Agent 列表并尝试 @ 该 Agent"},{"parent":"18191fb3-c061-4202-a3b0-c6963f162947","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4a616c0-6909-4b75-8d49-dd0860b43378","title":"预期：该 Agent 不出现在其他成员的可选列表中，也无法被 @ 调用；不因为卡片上保留了 Share Agent access 开关而误判为已共享"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"18191fb3-c061-4202-a3b0-c6963f162947","title":"🟠【P1】未安装的 Agent 在房间内不可被其他成员使用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"084953be-5529-4b54-86a3-e9c2c7503740","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"36e052a8-de1c-4d02-ae34-9e5711848e9b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f03ddd22-59ef-497e-b921-0beb05a746e8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"eb6b21fa-e83a-4e94-b107-d8493d83b931","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1791087a-2a1d-4ba0-bdd9-a4d38dbe1742","title":"前置：该 Agent 未安装"},{"parent":"eb6b21fa-e83a-4e94-b107-d8493d83b931","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f6097c85-9083-4cd7-b221-f4ed888ffef0","title":"操作：连续快速点击该开关十次以上"},{"parent":"eb6b21fa-e83a-4e94-b107-d8493d83b931","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e74a42a-d36c-407a-aac2-5da472f8d7d3","title":"预期：开关始终保持关闭态，不发出共享状态写入请求；提示信息不重复堆叠，界面不卡顿"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"eb6b21fa-e83a-4e94-b107-d8493d83b931","title":"🟡【P2】未安装时反复点击 Share Agent access 开关"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f03ddd22-59ef-497e-b921-0beb05a746e8","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"36e052a8-de1c-4d02-ae34-9e5711848e9b","title":"1.2 Share Agent access"},{"parent":"d89a71df-6968-4fc4-8eeb-8006bc302680","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0b71774f-a5ab-4fff-9543-e9599d4b8a5e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b30f90fc-543e-4aaf-b8bb-ac7451f04435","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3dccc44f-eef5-4cc2-9309-348c3d392159","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"debc6bbb-165c-4a8c-852f-7ee5abecf9ac","title":"前置：Agent 未安装"},{"parent":"3dccc44f-eef5-4cc2-9309-348c3d392159","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"41b59fdd-05f5-4722-8cbf-9693d5211898","title":"操作：查看卡片上的 Usage limit 区域"},{"parent":"3dccc44f-eef5-4cc2-9309-348c3d392159","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cda2b3bd-497e-4ad3-9768-04ade322426e","title":"预期：5h limit 与 7d limit 两行均展示，剩余额度显示为 --% left，重置时间显示为 resets in --；进度条为空态，不显示 0%、100% 或加载中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3dccc44f-eef5-4cc2-9309-348c3d392159","title":"🔴【P0】未安装时 Usage limit 的占位展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b30f90fc-543e-4aaf-b8bb-ac7451f04435","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"0b71774f-a5ab-4fff-9543-e9599d4b8a5e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"30e3440e-8fe2-43c3-88d1-d909ab7283b9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"925a18ee-445b-4ded-ab29-58391f9745d5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb04c424-5a5b-4330-b1a2-3817a71602e6","title":"前置：Agent 未安装"},{"parent":"925a18ee-445b-4ded-ab29-58391f9745d5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"61273d7c-86a0-44a5-baa0-9bd84a884c35","title":"操作：查看卡片 Usage limit 区域并观察是否发起额度请求"},{"parent":"925a18ee-445b-4ded-ab29-58391f9745d5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4f4213be-3355-49d4-b9e3-60cc84cb8a8e","title":"预期：5h limit 与 7d limit 均展示 --% left 与 resets in --，不发起无效的额度请求"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"925a18ee-445b-4ded-ab29-58391f9745d5","title":"🟠【P1】未安装时 Usage limit 的取值来源"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"30e3440e-8fe2-43c3-88d1-d909ab7283b9","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"0b71774f-a5ab-4fff-9543-e9599d4b8a5e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9020f965-0470-4642-b71f-cb6dc0275ec4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2111e035-9b51-4050-9fbb-7cef47afb339","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"12f718c8-7f54-4973-8f2a-73e5afcaf844","title":"前置：该 Agent 未安装，但额度接口对该 Agent 返回了有效百分比"},{"parent":"2111e035-9b51-4050-9fbb-7cef47afb339","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13a100dc-cb4d-41b8-8d63-6c3ee13cdfc4","title":"操作：查看卡片 Usage limit 区域"},{"parent":"2111e035-9b51-4050-9fbb-7cef47afb339","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f16bbffd-2cff-4f03-9906-4868af32da3c","title":"预期：按未安装态的占位规则展示 --% left 与 resets in --，或按产品规则一致地展示真实数值；同一版本内行为固定，不出现同一状态下有时占位有时展示数值"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2111e035-9b51-4050-9fbb-7cef47afb339","title":"🟡【P2】未安装时额度接口意外返回了数据"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9020f965-0470-4642-b71f-cb6dc0275ec4","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0b71774f-a5ab-4fff-9543-e9599d4b8a5e","title":"1.3 Usage limit"},{"parent":"d89a71df-6968-4fc4-8eeb-8006bc302680","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a67f7645-996d-4556-ad19-5af4a7e008ec","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8766fe35-2744-467b-a876-bd750052ef57","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1bbe2143-e92e-4110-a4d4-41cb812f7e34","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f8515dc9-0e29-4e31-ab9a-4668a608d2f9","title":"前置：该 Agent 未安装"},{"parent":"1bbe2143-e92e-4110-a4d4-41cb812f7e34","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d1aa9d69-b014-418b-9e01-d63da36e513f","title":"操作：查看该卡片的 Availability Check 区域"},{"parent":"1bbe2143-e92e-4110-a4d4-41cb812f7e34","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e201aab6-1931-4160-bb2d-79c59a1c5653","title":"预期：区域内展示 Not setup yet 占位文案，不展示 Environment / CLI &amp; Adapter / Signed in 三步明细，也不展示进行中或失败图标"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1bbe2143-e92e-4110-a4d4-41cb812f7e34","title":"🔴【P0】未安装时检测区展示 Not setup yet"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8766fe35-2744-467b-a876-bd750052ef57","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"a67f7645-996d-4556-ad19-5af4a7e008ec","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4430d5a2-8f3e-4723-a20e-bfc03c6333c3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cab1601b-3fa5-4cb2-96fc-bc362ac4a706","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8cdb762d-52b2-466b-ad79-b0ec41abe932","title":"前置：该 Agent 未安装，已开启网络请求抓取"},{"parent":"cab1601b-3fa5-4cb2-96fc-bc362ac4a706","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"60f9eea0-20db-4830-be6c-be1b1c1b10c5","title":"操作：进入 Agent Management 页并观察该卡片对应的请求"},{"parent":"cab1601b-3fa5-4cb2-96fc-bc362ac4a706","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"baf83cd1-3a38-46bb-905d-2aa288042e39","title":"预期：不对该 Agent 发起 CLI、适配器或登录态检测请求；检测区直接展示 Not setup yet；不出现先短暂展示检测中再回落为 Not setup yet"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cab1601b-3fa5-4cb2-96fc-bc362ac4a706","title":"🟠【P1】未安装时不应自动发起检测请求"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4430d5a2-8f3e-4723-a20e-bfc03c6333c3","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"a67f7645-996d-4556-ad19-5af4a7e008ec","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6be5bb34-7ed2-434e-9055-713c058d4f06","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"74e947a4-9ce5-40ad-b007-f63dc5e728bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"92c2aba4-0b79-468e-8ec7-32e6c8baf7a9","title":"前置：该 Agent 未安装"},{"parent":"74e947a4-9ce5-40ad-b007-f63dc5e728bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"55e42318-75dd-411f-93f7-a27947873069","title":"操作：将窗口缩到卡片最小宽度并切换界面语言后查看检测区域"},{"parent":"74e947a4-9ce5-40ad-b007-f63dc5e728bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a08496de-6a17-4231-848c-c378d467d79a","title":"预期：占位文案完整可读，必要时换行；不出现截断成半个词、溢出卡片或展示文案键名"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"74e947a4-9ce5-40ad-b007-f63dc5e728bf","title":"🟡【P2】Not setup yet 占位在窄卡片与多语言下的展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6be5bb34-7ed2-434e-9055-713c058d4f06","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a67f7645-996d-4556-ad19-5af4a7e008ec","title":"1.4 Availability Check 区域"},{"parent":"d89a71df-6968-4fc4-8eeb-8006bc302680","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2d644b95-5c55-4d41-93f5-e0c296ba46b9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3730c04a-02ba-482a-8e7a-4dc3df6e3fda","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f8e77429-f5b3-4898-86ca-69f0be29abcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8f77a9a9-4f55-4810-86a8-17c6a21215f7","title":"前置：Agent 未安装，已进入 Agent Management 页"},{"parent":"f8e77429-f5b3-4898-86ca-69f0be29abcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"97626058-083d-4dae-9219-92a2c048417b","title":"操作：查看该 Agent 卡片底部的按钮组合并点击 Install"},{"parent":"f8e77429-f5b3-4898-86ca-69f0be29abcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c8bf4cc5-fd44-43f4-a38e-8555924dd090","title":"预期：底部仅展示 Install 一个主按钮，不展示 Re-check 或 Sign in；点击后无需任何额外操作即开始自动安装，卡片检测区域由 Not setup yet 切换为安装进度"},{"parent":"f8e77429-f5b3-4898-86ca-69f0be29abcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f6536d4e-0772-421b-85a7-65d63480245d","title":"备注：新版 UI：未安装态检测区展示 Not setup yet；安装过程的完整验证见「4.2 管理页 Install 与自动安装」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f8e77429-f5b3-4898-86ca-69f0be29abcb","title":"🔴【P0】未安装时底部仅展示 Install 主按钮"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3730c04a-02ba-482a-8e7a-4dc3df6e3fda","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"2d644b95-5c55-4d41-93f5-e0c296ba46b9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5d1776d0-e52e-4aeb-829f-14bf8fe10bb6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cffdeebc-9393-4ea4-9cac-5234eb81ab49","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9d977775-0553-4172-8cc2-f2f6a9ca4194","title":"前置：该 Agent 未安装"},{"parent":"cffdeebc-9393-4ea4-9cac-5234eb81ab49","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2dc7b5b2-aa99-45e2-abb0-ff24ceae2ff7","title":"操作：查看卡片底部按钮区域"},{"parent":"cffdeebc-9393-4ea4-9cac-5234eb81ab49","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8b181a65-9aa0-474b-97ec-50055da33f45","title":"预期：底部只有 Install 一个按钮；不出现 Re-check、Sign in 或 Sign in again；也不出现按钮区域为空导致无法发起安装"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cffdeebc-9393-4ea4-9cac-5234eb81ab49","title":"🟠【P1】未安装时底部不应出现 Re-check 或 Sign in"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5d1776d0-e52e-4aeb-829f-14bf8fe10bb6","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"2d644b95-5c55-4d41-93f5-e0c296ba46b9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f9dbb64a-486c-4d58-847b-a761df6d0478","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"349db528-62c2-4312-b767-f600d2099018","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"548a39f6-6ca5-401e-8354-a2b1b3362bfc","title":"前置：该 Agent 未安装"},{"parent":"349db528-62c2-4312-b767-f600d2099018","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3d39bf4b-1707-4cde-b2be-157e5ed4dbf7","title":"操作：点击 Install 后立即再次点击同一按钮"},{"parent":"349db528-62c2-4312-b767-f600d2099018","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"39b74e1d-7597-4b3c-80cb-9198dc5e315c","title":"预期：按钮在首次点击后立刻切换为进行中且不可重复触发，只发起一次安装；不出现两次安装并行或按钮长时间保持可点击"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"349db528-62c2-4312-b767-f600d2099018","title":"🟡【P2】点击 Install 后按钮立即进入进行中态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f9dbb64a-486c-4d58-847b-a761df6d0478","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2d644b95-5c55-4d41-93f5-e0c296ba46b9","title":"1.5 底部按钮（Install）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d89a71df-6968-4fc4-8eeb-8006bc302680","title":"1. 未安装状态"},{"parent":"3c9df9bc-c66b-4bd5-b536-374e0cafa30a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"57eee01a-af6d-416a-a423-9d479134d98f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9b8e05cc-3244-4b01-821d-ce871ce450f8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ec88c198-aa72-4e31-b3fc-d7f75e611e8d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3fff5bdc-4088-42bf-b655-0204e72b204a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cd947617-468c-4176-a1b2-98f920d57c6c","title":"前置：Agent 已安装但未登录"},{"parent":"3fff5bdc-4088-42bf-b655-0204e72b204a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b15846bb-edae-4262-b1a4-09f26fbd163e","title":"操作：查看卡片状态文案与 Availability Check 中的第三步"},{"parent":"3fff5bdc-4088-42bf-b655-0204e72b204a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ddf83315-4720-42c2-9d8d-9fac7f332c6a","title":"预期：状态文案为 Unavailable；Availability Check 展示完整三步，Environment 与 CLI &amp; Adapter 为通过态，第三步展示为 Not signed in 并带告警图标，其下方账号信息显示为 --"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3fff5bdc-4088-42bf-b655-0204e72b204a","title":"🔴【P0】已安装未登录时的卡片状态与 Not signed in 提示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ec88c198-aa72-4e31-b3fc-d7f75e611e8d","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"9b8e05cc-3244-4b01-821d-ce871ce450f8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c32a73c5-3a70-476c-ae49-299276916d13","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"651da7f8-9551-4978-884c-eaed3ed77600","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"81f76d81-6183-451b-80fb-08c5a67057e0","title":"前置：该 Agent 已安装但未登录，Environment 与 CLI &amp; Adapter 均通过"},{"parent":"651da7f8-9551-4978-884c-eaed3ed77600","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"20703a86-b5c9-476f-b9e0-cafce16a923d","title":"操作：查看卡片状态点、状态文案并尝试在会话中选用该 Agent"},{"parent":"651da7f8-9551-4978-884c-eaed3ed77600","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1e29ee30-bcdd-4ea7-aefe-19c1f11e044d","title":"预期：状态文案为 Unavailable；该 Agent 在会话中不可被选用；不因为前两步通过就把整体状态判定为 Available"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"651da7f8-9551-4978-884c-eaed3ed77600","title":"🔴【P0】已安装未登录时状态文案不应显示为 Available"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c32a73c5-3a70-476c-ae49-299276916d13","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"9b8e05cc-3244-4b01-821d-ce871ce450f8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9a613277-2b5f-4410-a230-1762424fc6d8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d476280e-e684-41e1-96ab-b3a376317032","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3da89b3e-dace-4397-8ef2-d522943e8c87","title":"前置：该 Agent 已安装未登录，已在授权页完成登录"},{"parent":"d476280e-e684-41e1-96ab-b3a376317032","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d2404feb-ec6c-4fe7-aca6-5a4c2d9db2c6","title":"操作：返回卡片并观察状态文案、检测第三步与底部按钮的切换过程"},{"parent":"d476280e-e684-41e1-96ab-b3a376317032","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"45d392e8-96d5-459a-afd5-61125ed8e029","title":"预期：三处同步切换到已登录形态；不出现状态已变为 Available 而底部仍是 Sign in 的中间态残留"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d476280e-e684-41e1-96ab-b3a376317032","title":"🟡【P2】登录完成瞬间卡片从未登录态切出"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9a613277-2b5f-4410-a230-1762424fc6d8","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9b8e05cc-3244-4b01-821d-ce871ce450f8","title":"2.1 卡片整体与状态标识"},{"parent":"57eee01a-af6d-416a-a423-9d479134d98f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"780d2537-4304-4ffe-b071-6be7049de377","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"37c6b15d-1948-4164-a10a-77dc81c1e64f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cd6448b0-f33e-4d6f-aa36-37f371d811df","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9d067e2f-a818-459a-9be2-1194a5b990d4","title":"前置：Agent 已安装但未登录"},{"parent":"cd6448b0-f33e-4d6f-aa36-37f371d811df","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"652203e2-f06b-4e9e-bd71-aa97ed8faf2d","title":"操作：查看并尝试点击 Share Agent access 开关"},{"parent":"cd6448b0-f33e-4d6f-aa36-37f371d811df","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ecbcca96-bf49-4fd6-a07f-c839cc7a3258","title":"预期：开关展示为关闭态且不可开启，并说明需先登录；不出现可切换但实际不生效"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cd6448b0-f33e-4d6f-aa36-37f371d811df","title":"🔴【P0】已安装未登录时 Share Agent access 的可操作性"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"37c6b15d-1948-4164-a10a-77dc81c1e64f","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"780d2537-4304-4ffe-b071-6be7049de377","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3c83f642-a515-474f-aa7d-a4f608dace22","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"24f00700-0eda-46fe-8ed1-e26d2c0b2230","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"23b5cc36-472c-40df-a62a-c222109e23c2","title":"前置：该 Agent 已安装未登录，后端共享状态被置为开启"},{"parent":"24f00700-0eda-46fe-8ed1-e26d2c0b2230","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1171da20-9e1b-40b0-bb09-dbb05c022d33","title":"操作：重新进入 Agent Management 页查看该卡片的 Share Agent access 与房间内的可用性"},{"parent":"24f00700-0eda-46fe-8ed1-e26d2c0b2230","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"60cf2a9a-da5e-4c94-8d56-8bc37dd0cac7","title":"预期：界面与实际能力保持一致：要么开关展示为关闭，要么开关开启但明确标注因未登录不可用；其他成员在房间内不能实际调用该 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"24f00700-0eda-46fe-8ed1-e26d2c0b2230","title":"🟠【P1】未登录时通过接口强制开启共享后的界面表现"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3c83f642-a515-474f-aa7d-a4f608dace22","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"780d2537-4304-4ffe-b071-6be7049de377","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d048d842-ed3d-4784-b682-54881de29cb9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4ef8dbdc-6ad5-40d4-8308-f2b61f061d74","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f2653b8d-424e-4a14-bb9f-b50028a160f5","title":"前置：该 Agent 已安装未登录"},{"parent":"4ef8dbdc-6ad5-40d4-8308-f2b61f061d74","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d41bf3e0-334f-4e88-9524-ab02f936cb46","title":"操作：点击 Share Agent access 开关后按提示操作"},{"parent":"4ef8dbdc-6ad5-40d4-8308-f2b61f061d74","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e6bcac7f-b216-4504-8ab8-67e281fadf7a","title":"预期：提示明确说明需先登录，并可从提示直接进入登录流程；登录完成后回到卡片，该开关变为可开启"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4ef8dbdc-6ad5-40d4-8308-f2b61f061d74","title":"🟡【P2】未登录时开关的提示与登录入口衔接"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d048d842-ed3d-4784-b682-54881de29cb9","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"780d2537-4304-4ffe-b071-6be7049de377","title":"2.2 Share Agent access"},{"parent":"57eee01a-af6d-416a-a423-9d479134d98f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"94e55ba0-4bbf-42ae-922d-6e2cc20fb6dc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7b1fb3cd-5430-449d-910e-042642cb3f51","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5cc2be89-e9ad-47bf-b67d-57f1c6d3b4b6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"143af1ae-8d9f-4ff8-bb45-8146aa4d0857","title":"前置：Agent 已安装但未登录"},{"parent":"5cc2be89-e9ad-47bf-b67d-57f1c6d3b4b6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5356f1d2-2c83-4729-af2e-7e069c583292","title":"操作：查看 Usage limit 区域"},{"parent":"5cc2be89-e9ad-47bf-b67d-57f1c6d3b4b6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"333a6fff-5ec3-40fe-a05f-f8960abcd108","title":"预期：5h limit 与 7d limit 均展示 --% left 与 resets in --；不显示为 0% 或异常数值"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5cc2be89-e9ad-47bf-b67d-57f1c6d3b4b6","title":"🔴【P0】已安装未登录时 Usage limit 的占位展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7b1fb3cd-5430-449d-910e-042642cb3f51","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"94e55ba0-4bbf-42ae-922d-6e2cc20fb6dc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"803ad50a-5604-4b8c-9ba9-4398a878cdb1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"989be0fb-d5d5-4750-b37e-ad2e62be4ff9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0555d746-8f23-4308-8c35-3aac559b88bb","title":"前置：Agent 已安装但未登录"},{"parent":"989be0fb-d5d5-4750-b37e-ad2e62be4ff9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"242c8bb9-c4dd-4b95-b819-3d0a23d46c84","title":"操作：查看卡片 Usage limit 区域并观察是否发起额度请求"},{"parent":"989be0fb-d5d5-4750-b37e-ad2e62be4ff9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eeb3b648-2774-47da-8d56-1ead08c6c3cf","title":"预期：5h limit 与 7d limit 均展示 --% left 与 resets in --，不发起无效的额度请求"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"989be0fb-d5d5-4750-b37e-ad2e62be4ff9","title":"🟠【P1】已安装未登录时 Usage limit 的取值来源"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"803ad50a-5604-4b8c-9ba9-4398a878cdb1","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"94e55ba0-4bbf-42ae-922d-6e2cc20fb6dc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2bc1c531-4e28-40b9-b395-0b04802b0059","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"198f5143-95cd-4cc7-9b20-2cda64fd032a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a1a9391d-4981-4dbb-8036-b42228a4fad6","title":"前置：该 Agent 此前已登录且 Usage limit 展示真实数值"},{"parent":"198f5143-95cd-4cc7-9b20-2cda64fd032a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e1695784-b70a-4a26-9c36-3e67bb75310a","title":"操作：退出该 Agent 的登录后停留在卡片上观察 Usage limit"},{"parent":"198f5143-95cd-4cc7-9b20-2cda64fd032a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"95870344-215a-4a27-8405-18ce19d357d6","title":"预期：两行额度回落为 --% left 与 resets in --，进度条清空；不残留上一次的百分比或进度条长度"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"198f5143-95cd-4cc7-9b20-2cda64fd032a","title":"🟡【P2】从已登录退出登录后额度回落为占位"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2bc1c531-4e28-40b9-b395-0b04802b0059","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"94e55ba0-4bbf-42ae-922d-6e2cc20fb6dc","title":"2.3 Usage limit"},{"parent":"57eee01a-af6d-416a-a423-9d479134d98f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b6d0d32d-0075-473c-bafc-6c095d3a6993","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6f5dcab4-5a69-4378-bf0d-e6708d6673f6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"799e190e-4b54-4a53-8195-3b98737672a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44aa56d7-8e7d-4c49-ab10-9b51570ca9bd","title":"前置：该 Agent 已安装但未登录"},{"parent":"799e190e-4b54-4a53-8195-3b98737672a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5235e5d8-2b15-44a1-9f9e-d45e611539fe","title":"操作：查看第三个检测步骤及其下方信息"},{"parent":"799e190e-4b54-4a53-8195-3b98737672a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae8a64d2-f443-4ea3-af8c-3f9dedf64d08","title":"预期：步骤展示为 Not signed in 并带告警图标，其下方账号信息展示为占位符；告警样式与通过态有明确区分且不只依赖颜色"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"799e190e-4b54-4a53-8195-3b98737672a4","title":"🔴【P0】Not signed in 时的告警样式与占位"},{"parent":"6f5dcab4-5a69-4378-bf0d-e6708d6673f6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"410d61b9-267c-4a13-8f64-ad7b2006b393","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f01e690b-fe2f-444b-b80f-d9db69b645bc","title":"前置：Environment 与 CLI &amp; Adapter 正常但未登录"},{"parent":"410d61b9-267c-4a13-8f64-ad7b2006b393","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ba30f7a-4cdf-4f61-b1e0-5d521135816d","title":"操作：触发检测并查看三步状态与卡片状态文案"},{"parent":"410d61b9-267c-4a13-8f64-ad7b2006b393","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"69e0fb30-c0bc-443b-955d-fd820cce2a4f","title":"预期：前两步显示通过图标，Signed in 显示 Not signed in；卡片状态文案为 Unavailable，不因为部分通过而显示 Available"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"410d61b9-267c-4a13-8f64-ad7b2006b393","title":"🔴【P0】已安装未登录时三步的通过与失败组合"},{"parent":"6f5dcab4-5a69-4378-bf0d-e6708d6673f6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f0e62804-b76e-4ca3-900f-a66a043b5e6a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eed84be5-34d7-4c72-800d-773c3dab759e","title":"前置：已清除该 Agent 的本地凭据"},{"parent":"f0e62804-b76e-4ca3-900f-a66a043b5e6a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13f93caf-6c77-41ea-8840-13b6c72cb7c8","title":"操作：触发检测并查看 Signed in 步骤与底部按钮"},{"parent":"f0e62804-b76e-4ca3-900f-a66a043b5e6a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c7bf9ae-61cf-46a4-beea-d6c51d97621f","title":"预期：该步展示为 Not signed in 并带告警图标，账号信息为占位；卡片状态为 Unavailable，底部主按钮为 Sign in，点击可完成登录"},{"parent":"f0e62804-b76e-4ca3-900f-a66a043b5e6a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8b779c1d-7e11-48cf-bdee-16cc9fb0f370","title":"备注：合并自各 Agent 的「未登录」用例"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f0e62804-b76e-4ca3-900f-a66a043b5e6a","title":"🔴【P0】未登录时 Signed in 项的检测结论"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6f5dcab4-5a69-4378-bf0d-e6708d6673f6","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"b6d0d32d-0075-473c-bafc-6c095d3a6993","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d91ac53f-e1a8-48b4-a392-7cfadd26db32","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"42ad8301-10a5-4886-b7cc-5c8d44b6486f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ba84e406-ea02-4d30-9d98-5030ca7bb83a","title":"前置：该 Agent 已安装，本地存在已失效的旧凭据文件"},{"parent":"42ad8301-10a5-4886-b7cc-5c8d44b6486f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b2df7581-64e3-463d-948f-d6c83ab04b16","title":"操作：触发检测并查看第三步的结果与卡片状态文案，随后在会话中尝试使用该 Agent"},{"parent":"42ad8301-10a5-4886-b7cc-5c8d44b6486f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"708db415-ad70-48d8-b82c-8825e3be7d8e","title":"预期：Signed in 判定为未登录并展示 Not signed in，卡片状态为 Unavailable；不出现检测显示已登录但实际调用报未授权"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"42ad8301-10a5-4886-b7cc-5c8d44b6486f","title":"🔴【P0】未登录但 Signed in 被误判为通过"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d91ac53f-e1a8-48b4-a392-7cfadd26db32","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"b6d0d32d-0075-473c-bafc-6c095d3a6993","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a7faed4f-5464-498e-a217-02f58dc9e15c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2abe6ab0-4d41-4030-8016-07cc2e217e6c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e6344642-fab5-4d4c-8952-842643c9bd13","title":"前置：该 Agent 已安装但未登录"},{"parent":"2abe6ab0-4d41-4030-8016-07cc2e217e6c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"65364f7c-6498-4aab-b123-e3fba15de830","title":"操作：展开查看 Environment 与 CLI &amp; Adapter 两步下方的字段"},{"parent":"2abe6ab0-4d41-4030-8016-07cc2e217e6c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"58f0291f-e9a1-4571-8325-05a546076ef3","title":"预期：两步的安装源、服务 API、代理、版本与路径等字段照常展示真实取值；不因为未登录而把这些字段一并置为占位"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2abe6ab0-4d41-4030-8016-07cc2e217e6c","title":"🟡【P2】未登录时前两步的取值仍完整展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a7faed4f-5464-498e-a217-02f58dc9e15c","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b6d0d32d-0075-473c-bafc-6c095d3a6993","title":"2.4 Availability Check 区域"},{"parent":"57eee01a-af6d-416a-a423-9d479134d98f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5e087149-2837-47c4-8585-7237ba463e83","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"21d11bdc-568a-4f55-a272-0539762cf620","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f5dcff00-d23d-4abb-ab55-504eb4224c31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ed24042a-49ef-4a55-98e0-f69d085c4928","title":"前置：Agent 已安装但未登录"},{"parent":"f5dcff00-d23d-4abb-ab55-504eb4224c31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5baf461-8da7-48b6-9125-abe56dccf581","title":"操作：查看卡片底部按钮组合并点击 Sign in"},{"parent":"f5dcff00-d23d-4abb-ab55-504eb4224c31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0179e1a1-cab0-41cc-80e1-d67219e134ba","title":"预期：底部展示 Re-check 次要按钮与 Sign in 主按钮，不展示 Install 或 Sign in again；点击 Sign in 进入该 Agent 的登录流程"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f5dcff00-d23d-4abb-ab55-504eb4224c31","title":"🔴【P0】已安装未登录时底部展示 Re-check 与 Sign in"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"21d11bdc-568a-4f55-a272-0539762cf620","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"5e087149-2837-47c4-8585-7237ba463e83","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5775e04a-350c-4657-b1fb-4e9cbf69ba48","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4bad228c-c6d5-4f8f-91ad-4ca7dad887a5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e11d5125-4747-426d-9680-03fb2d49ae23","title":"前置：该 Agent 已安装但未登录"},{"parent":"4bad228c-c6d5-4f8f-91ad-4ca7dad887a5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5528bea2-99bd-4707-9bf6-b6f51000e586","title":"操作：查看卡片底部按钮区域"},{"parent":"4bad228c-c6d5-4f8f-91ad-4ca7dad887a5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8c80696f-a37f-4c39-9bd2-94e783cca4aa","title":"预期：底部为 Re-check 与 Sign in 两个按钮；不出现 Install，避免用户重复安装；也不出现 Sign in again"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4bad228c-c6d5-4f8f-91ad-4ca7dad887a5","title":"🟠【P1】已安装未登录时底部不应出现 Install"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5775e04a-350c-4657-b1fb-4e9cbf69ba48","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"5e087149-2837-47c4-8585-7237ba463e83","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2865364f-e6b4-466d-bea2-2a189006d7f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"42402944-4063-4e46-832a-4eefc96e78bb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4446091c-e849-472d-a1c7-c8f5671871b3","title":"前置：该 Agent 已安装未登录，已点击 Sign in 且授权尚未完成"},{"parent":"42402944-4063-4e46-832a-4eefc96e78bb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8a595d16-07bb-424f-a4c1-2cde66d64f09","title":"操作：观察按钮状态并尝试再次点击"},{"parent":"42402944-4063-4e46-832a-4eefc96e78bb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e856cbd5-0433-41e0-a608-576f0d9005c3","title":"预期：按钮展示为进行中且不可重复触发，不会拉起第二个授权窗口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"42402944-4063-4e46-832a-4eefc96e78bb","title":"🟡【P2】Sign in 进行中时的按钮状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2865364f-e6b4-466d-bea2-2a189006d7f7","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5e087149-2837-47c4-8585-7237ba463e83","title":"2.5 底部按钮（Re-check + Sign in）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"57eee01a-af6d-416a-a423-9d479134d98f","title":"2. 已安装未登录状态"},{"parent":"3c9df9bc-c66b-4bd5-b536-374e0cafa30a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dde3d537-0aa0-4974-b29f-77b0eccee5e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"824a7438-5860-40aa-950c-a1d67b8e2780","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1966f9f9-4e28-4de2-af9d-ab180e4c4f15","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5660bf04-a2db-4837-b701-fb1f7ac7ed1f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fdee565e-fc22-4e79-a81f-8e571c7dfa98","title":"前置：Agent 已安装且已登录"},{"parent":"5660bf04-a2db-4837-b701-fb1f7ac7ed1f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c291925e-8a26-406c-9681-df00978b75e8"