现检测失败再变为可用；状态切换过程不误导用户去重新登录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"84055f90-7846-4f65-ad40-ed62132b9658","title":"🔴【P0】锁屏唤醒后已登录状态不先闪现检测失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7b18fbde-a529-47c9-b3d3-1a1b7e5434a6","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"824a7438-5860-40aa-950c-a1d67b8e2780","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3688d28c-29c8-4a65-9855-6fb3c85b0f4e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0ddf43f3-5526-4a99-92a7-73ee93511920","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb6121ce-3a3f-459b-a0b8-20a1f34056ef","title":"前置：该 Agent 当前为 Available"},{"parent":"0ddf43f3-5526-4a99-92a7-73ee93511920","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3f31955a-b96f-41a8-aefd-8fd10302cfed","title":"操作：在本地退出该 Agent 登录后停留在 Agent Management 页观察卡片"},{"parent":"0ddf43f3-5526-4a99-92a7-73ee93511920","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cd2ba05d-c853-4716-a662-4650f773910e","title":"预期：卡片状态在检测感知到变化后自动更新为 Unavailable，底部按钮同步切换为 Sign in；无需手动刷新页面，也不出现状态点与状态文案不一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0ddf43f3-5526-4a99-92a7-73ee93511920","title":"🟡【P2】状态在 Available 与 Unavailable 之间切换时的即时刷新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3688d28c-29c8-4a65-9855-6fb3c85b0f4e","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"824a7438-5860-40aa-950c-a1d67b8e2780","title":"3.1 卡片整体与状态标识"},{"parent":"dde3d537-0aa0-4974-b29f-77b0eccee5e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a70816cd-9f77-4073-ba4b-e34c25ce4045","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4a7f35b9-16bc-4ec1-aef6-9edb529faf2f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5c8c3831-aa9a-4178-8234-1684832df415","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8a09ea87-17b2-4d54-9904-c028e74b95e2","title":"前置：Agent 已登录且共享已开启"},{"parent":"5c8c3831-aa9a-4178-8234-1684832df415","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"17a74e8f-8c74-4f31-8989-23e9ca9a4a1f","title":"操作：点击共享开关关闭共享"},{"parent":"5c8c3831-aa9a-4178-8234-1684832df415","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"588fceb8-0a67-4294-bccf-5cf24de77415","title":"预期：开关切换为关闭；其他成员的 @ 面板中不再出现该 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5c8c3831-aa9a-4178-8234-1684832df415","title":"🔴【P0】关闭共享开关"},{"parent":"4a7f35b9-16bc-4ec1-aef6-9edb529faf2f","c