ff37f-6683-4f25-a028-b9d569c978c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"205a95ea-c7b2-4f68-b4b0-29e14f8a865a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"91c061d4-54d3-4538-8370-faa53fdc045e","title":"前置：Agent 已安装，已进入 Agent Management 页"},{"parent":"205a95ea-c7b2-4f68-b4b0-29e14f8a865a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"79006287-19dd-46ac-bda3-3024af767946","title":"操作：将 CLI 安装在包含空格及中文的目录"},{"parent":"205a95ea-c7b2-4f68-b4b0-29e14f8a865a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2ab3769b-da92-4dc0-9b25-6bf5a2a16874","title":"预期：路径正确显示和调用，不因转义问题检测失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"205a95ea-c7b2-4f68-b4b0-29e14f8a865a","title":"🟡【P2】路径包含空格和中文"},{"parent":"a6fff37f-6683-4f25-a028-b9d569c978c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3199ba5b-036e-415d-a006-f111652d8fcd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2eceaa55-e39a-4ef1-bd0f-20fc3524ae70","title":"前置：Agent 已安装，已进入 Agent Management 页"},{"parent":"3199ba5b-036e-415d-a006-f111652d8fcd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d0618c2a-36a7-4495-8a04-05377c3beb21","title":"操作：适配器可加载但未返回版本"},{"parent":"3199ba5b-036e-415d-a006-f111652d8fcd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76185030-c7a5-4100-8167-d2627f4e9e22","title":"预期：按规则判定可用性并显示未知版本，不展示 undefined"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3199ba5b-036e-415d-a006-f111652d8fcd","title":"🟡【P2】适配器版本缺失"},{"parent":"a6fff37f-6683-4f25-a028-b9d569c978c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ea3af138-6839-4c74-bf87-524396b29bb9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3977d1b-c76e-456b-bdb0-a5f1c75558b7","title":"前置：Agent 已安装，已进入 Agent Management 页"},{"parent":"ea3af138-6839-4c74-bf87-524396b29bb9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f079892d-7363-4354-9330-6304036b7e44","title":"操作：CLI 返回 beta、rc 或带构建元数据的语义版本"},{"parent":"ea3af138-6839-4c74-bf87-524396b29bb9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"36f3b2f8-4433-4402-a5fb-1890a311a478","title":"预期：版本可被正确解析，并按兼容策略判定是否可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ea3af138-6839-4c74-bf87-524396b29bb9","title":"🟡【P2】预发布版本"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a6fff37f-6683-4f25-a028-b9d569c978c4","title":"边界场景（10）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9732a8fe-d5f4-44e7-91e4-6fd28b44411e","title":"3.6 Availability Check — CLI &amp; Adapter"},{"parent":"dde3d537-0aa0-4974-b29f-77b0eccee5e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e031d9ee-f203-41e4-86c1-212ac2a39f69","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bc4ae997-96b7-4f4f-be0b-f0badb9a9e27","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"14a33ea2-8a2d-4f4e-b6bc-02a9980418f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0e98aadf-eecf-4f7c-bfc5-fa9b30ba71af","title":"前置：三个 Agent 使用不同账号分别完成登录"},{"parent":"14a33ea2-8a2d-4f4e-b6bc-02a9980418f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3bb42556-b2d0-4033-b38b-866e4afb5020","title":"操作：在同一屏内对照三张卡片 Signed in 步骤下方的账号信息"},{"parent":"14a33ea2-8a2d-4f4e-b6bc-02a9980418f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a973e4ad-69b9-40c1-bf2d-103f6210fd25","title":"预期：每张卡片展示各自 Agent 对应的登录账号，互不串用；某个 Agent 退出登录不影响其他卡片的账号展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"14a33ea2-8a2d-4f4e-b6bc-02a9980418f8","title":"🔴【P0】各卡片分别展示自己的登录账号"},{"parent":"bc4ae997-96b7-4f4f-be0b-f0badb9a9e27","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3c5ea42e-78ae-4995-a1bf-25bc18229eef","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6ace7172-133e-4b27-befb-0192f8ac056d","title":"前置：使用有效账号完成该 Agent 登录"},{"parent":"3c5ea42e-78ae-4995-a1bf-25bc18229eef","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dca4315d-6a77-466a-b232-d73918ebd5db","title":"操作：触发检测并查看 Signed in 步骤"},{"parent":"3c5ea42e-78ae-4995-a1bf-25bc18229eef","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5b976e8d-00df-4b0d-9f48-7313614d8e34","title":"预期：该步显示通过并展示登录账号邮箱；不展示 token、密钥或完整凭据内容"},{"parent":"3c5ea42e-78ae-4995-a1bf-25bc18229eef","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d81982be-e044-4fe6-9830-c9999aea46b1","title":"备注：合并自各 Agent 的「已登录」用例"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3c5ea42e-78ae-4995-a1bf-25bc18229eef","title":"🔴【P0】已登录时 Signed in 项展示账号邮箱"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bc4ae997-96b7-4f4f-be0b-f0badb9a9e27","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"e031d9ee-f203-41e4-86c1-212ac2a39f69","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"08ab4d36-b94e-45c3-bc30-1f7034928408","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8d4d39e9-b576-4652-b424-23014ba579b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c61e18c-16ac-49a5-a231-d637a2f5695e","title":"前置：Agent 已登录，账号信息接口异常"},{"parent":"8d4d39e9-b576-4652-b424-23014ba579b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3365bedb-deca-4cf0-bc99-d6516a59d866","title":"操作：查看该 Agent 条目上的账号信息"},{"parent":"8d4d39e9-b576-4652-b424-23014ba579b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e6e58dbc-98f0-435d-9dee-ad38fd7bcede","title":"预期：展示可读的占位或错误提示并提供刷新入口，不显示空白或 undefined"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8d4d39e9-b576-4652-b424-23014ba579b4","title":"🟠【P1】已登录但账号名获取失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"08ab4d36-b94e-45c3-bc30-1f7034928408","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"e031d9ee-f203-41e4-86c1-212ac2a39f69","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5677df37-cbb7-46b3-9d97-5be59cd0bfec","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bf3fc4aa-13ab-4ba5-b248-adf958708afd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"156ab033-afee-460f-839b-df59adb03dcf","title":"前置：Agent 已安装且已登录，已进入 Agent Management 页"},{"parent":"bf3fc4aa-13ab-4ba5-b248-adf958708afd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d9ca4177-4313-4865-928e-80164a728950","title":"操作：账号包含加号、点号、Unicode 和大小写混合"},{"parent":"bf3fc4aa-13ab-4ba5-b248-adf958708afd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"01b95497-371c-4d62-bb27-3a537822d176","title":"预期：按真实值安全展示，不发生乱码或脚本执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bf3fc4aa-13ab-4ba5-b248-adf958708afd","title":"🟡【P2】特殊字符账号"},{"parent":"5677df37-cbb7-46b3-9d97-5be59cd0bfec","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e4b87e3f-77d8-46e9-9ab9-0ed8cdef206e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"abb21edf-c385-433a-b8d9-fadd6fab9ae1","title":"前置：Agent 已登录且账号名很长"},{"parent":"e4b87e3f-77d8-46e9-9ab9-0ed8cdef206e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9d6603d5-3995-45b5-b508-92c231dbcf21","title":"操作：查看该 Agent 条目上的账号名"},{"parent":"e4b87e3f-77d8-46e9-9ab9-0ed8cdef206e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e5939969-9593-4402-8e81-6c2ea43f94fa","title":"预期：账号名合理截断，悬浮或点击可查看完整名称，不撑破布局"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e4b87e3f-77d8-46e9-9ab9-0ed8cdef206e","title":"🟡【P2】超长账号名的展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5677df37-cbb7-46b3-9d97-5be59cd0bfec","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e031d9ee-f203-41e4-86c1-212ac2a39f69","title":"3.7 Availability Check — Signed in"},{"parent":"dde3d537-0aa0-4974-b29f-77b0eccee5e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1ffe2133-6b66-460d-a6b3-e74267355ebc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f1ac53e4-9d74-42a8-949d-0560ccf4d8e2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"eb6bf755-52e7-48d2-ba4b-dc0d44a35ef7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"55331d70-233e-4ca9-91f7-677abd89efb7","title":"前置：仅 Environment 一步会失败"},{"parent":"eb6bf755-52e7-48d2-ba4b-dc0d44a35ef7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"27549a48-340f-438a-9806-16eec3b30a1d","title":"操作：触发检测并查看三个步骤"},{"parent":"eb6bf755-52e7-48d2-ba4b-dc0d44a35ef7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3cf6ead2-d382-4aef-bd05-940beb678ff4","title":"预期：失败原因展示在 Environment 标题正下方的描述区域内；另外两个步骤的描述区不展示该错误，也不在卡片顶部另行提示"},{"parent":"eb6bf755-52e7-48d2-ba4b-dc0d44a35ef7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e96ba45b-674d-4174-8220-b3eeba7099ed","title":"备注：依据产品备注：登录过程对外只展示环境 / CLI / 注册三步，具体报错原因展示在对应标题下方的描述区域"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"eb6bf755-52e7-48d2-ba4b-dc0d44a35ef7","title":"🔴【P0】单步失败时错误原因展示在该步描述区"},{"parent":"f1ac53e4-9d74-42a8-949d-0560ccf4d8e2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7759cd44-afd6-4261-95f7-6956e5d007c5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"265f428f-61e9-4873-8c02-f83417463975","title":"前置：Environment 与 CLI &amp; Adapter 均会失败"},{"parent":"7759cd44-afd6-4261-95f7-6956e5d007c5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"335bebfe-052e-49d4-adb5-a8e2011a39a7","title":"操作：触发检测并查看两个步骤的描述区"},{"parent":"7759cd44-afd6-4261-95f7-6956e5d007c5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"69ca510a-caff-48eb-95df-54ac545962c6","title":"预期：每个失败步骤在自己的描述区展示与该步对应的原因，内容互不混淆也不重复堆叠"},{"parent":"7759cd44-afd6-4261-95f7-6956e5d007c5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"81274b68-a400-4541-81f1-f3737b48437c","title":"备注：依据产品备注：登录过程对外只展示环境 / CLI / 注册三步，具体报错原因展示在对应标题下方的描述区域"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7759cd44-afd6-4261-95f7-6956e5d007c5","title":"🔴【P0】多步同时失败时各自展示各自原因"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f1ac53e4-9d74-42a8-949d-0560ccf4d8e2","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"1ffe2133-6b66-460d-a6b3-e74267355ebc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c38c5506-2428-47bf-b76a-9e4474858de2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f9ef69c0-36c4-40c8-a010-b1ef552e6138","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1869cff4-fb9b-457a-b810-e2660fa8a629","title":"前置：让检测接口只返回失败标记而不返回原因"},{"parent":"f9ef69c0-36c4-40c8-a010-b1ef552e6138","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d7c6b348-9b86-440a-98b5-9a273b9bebda","title":"操作：触发检测并查看失败步骤的描述区"},{"parent":"f9ef69c0-36c4-40c8-a010-b1ef552e6138","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6a25f988-13dd-4113-a2ec-4a5ad96a15a9","title":"预期：展示可读的兜底说明与下一步建议，不展示空白、错误码原文或 undefined"},{"parent":"f9ef69c0-36c4-40c8-a010-b1ef552e6138","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b663dfc2-2a32-4ea0-bda6-ec93bcef226a","title":"备注：依据产品备注：登录过程对外只展示环境 / CLI / 注册三步，具体报错原因展示在对应标题下方的描述区域"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f9ef69c0-36c4-40c8-a010-b1ef552e6138","title":"🟠【P1】后端未返回具体失败原因时的兜底文案"},{"parent":"c38c5506-2428-47bf-b76a-9e4474858de2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9bcc0de9-97e6-4c91-9171-6bc6bb8df629","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0ef39dfd-b72e-4b6d-b519-2a5a96b35327","title":"前置：让某一步返回很长的失败原因"},{"parent":"9bcc0de9-97e6-4c91-9171-6bc6bb8df629","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea3e7c9f-9c9f-4ac4-9b18-7eaaa6c2c826","title":"操作：查看该步骤的描述区"},{"parent":"9bcc0de9-97e6-4c91-9171-6bc6bb8df629","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bb6f2340-7061-44d9-a62e-1fdfb040a1e0","title":"预期：描述区按产品规则折叠或换行并可查看完整内容，不撑破卡片也不遮挡后续步骤"},{"parent":"9bcc0de9-97e6-4c91-9171-6bc6bb8df629","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"040187e5-a7f4-4502-92b0-2bfbd5b6ef46","title":"备注：依据产品备注：登录过程对外只展示环境 / CLI / 注册三步，具体报错原因展示在对应标题下方的描述区域"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9bcc0de9-97e6-4c91-9171-6bc6bb8df629","title":"🟠【P1】失败原因文本过长时的展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c38c5506-2428-47bf-b76a-9e4474858de2","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"1ffe2133-6b66-460d-a6b3-e74267355ebc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"da0f0763-598d-44a2-9c27-3b23d5fa9f5d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"95cf57f0-747b-405f-a9cd-4c9d05f9becb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"88b024d9-d8fa-41a2-96e7-a857c6e25cbc","title":"前置：某一步此前失败并展示了原因"},{"parent":"95cf57f0-747b-405f-a9cd-4c9d05f9becb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"961dc563-0a0d-4ce2-b691-7ce34a38e0e9","title":"操作：修复该原因后点击 Re-check"},{"parent":"95cf57f0-747b-405f-a9cd-4c9d05f9becb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1fa6c53e-f057-47d2-836b-8034f1f7a480","title":"预期：该步变为通过态且描述区不再残留上一次的错误文案"},{"parent":"95cf57f0-747b-405f-a9cd-4c9d05f9becb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3bba6984-1c39-4100-860d-6d435bfe5c3f","title":"备注：依据产品备注：登录过程对外只展示环境 / CLI / 注册三步，具体报错原因展示在对应标题下方的描述区域"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"95cf57f0-747b-405f-a9cd-4c9d05f9becb","title":"🟡【P2】从失败恢复为通过后描述区清空"},{"parent":"da0f0763-598d-44a2-9c27-3b23d5fa9f5d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"862a507d-3176-4d75-8a1c-33c73aa8c384","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6559e6d2-e20c-45c4-bdac-fb252fd13ff8","title":"前置：让失败原因包含换行、引号与 HTML 片段"},{"parent":"862a507d-3176-4d75-8a1c-33c73aa8c384","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a337e69b-f29f-4f0d-9fd2-f2b3f094b66d","title":"操作：查看该步骤的描述区"},{"parent":"862a507d-3176-4d75-8a1c-33c73aa8c384","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c8ddb84b-0d86-4590-a2e6-226996ac0e7a","title":"预期：内容仅作为纯文本安全展示，不解析为标记也不执行脚本，换行按规则处理"},{"parent":"862a507d-3176-4d75-8a1c-33c73aa8c384","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"de27528f-f1f2-45d9-b969-78edfd7425d5","title":"备注：依据产品备注：登录过程对外只展示环境 / CLI / 注册三步，具体报错原因展示在对应标题下方的描述区域"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"862a507d-3176-4d75-8a1c-33c73aa8c384","title":"🟡【P2】失败原因包含换行与特殊字符"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"da0f0763-598d-44a2-9c27-3b23d5fa9f5d","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1ffe2133-6b66-460d-a6b3-e74267355ebc","title":"3.8 Availability Check — 分步错误信息"},{"parent":"dde3d537-0aa0-4974-b29f-77b0eccee5e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"46eb5ed0-e737-46a3-a4e3-535b37f58976","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"eb35208f-9f5f-4cda-ac88-6d0f00e4333a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"58312261-9855-4efb-9436-913a6916088a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"333e0e2d-fc55-42d3-a50d-bdd51b7a14a3","title":"前置：该 Agent 已安装且已登录"},{"parent":"58312261-9855-4efb-9436-913a6916088a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f1651fb5-1a66-438e-b171-d188cba98513","title":"操作：查看卡片底部按钮"},{"parent":"58312261-9855-4efb-9436-913a6916088a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7f9aaa61-7df5-4a5e-adce-cb848c630ce1","title":"预期：底部展示 Re-check 与 Sign in again 两个按钮，不再展示 Sign in 或 Install"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"58312261-9855-4efb-9436-913a6916088a","title":"🔴【P0】已登录卡片底部展示 Re-check 与 Sign in again"},{"parent":"eb35208f-9f5f-4cda-ac88-6d0f00e4333a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"80246762-e715-4978-9e91-07d5d9540ca0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"68f5142d-11a4-4f45-a413-7e5f478c87de","title":"前置：分别准备已安装未登录与已登录的 Agent"},{"parent":"80246762-e715-4978-9e91-07d5d9540ca0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76989c77-6d35-4c1e-b995-8847f78b3196","title":"操作：在两种状态下分别点击 Re-check"},{"parent":"80246762-e715-4978-9e91-07d5d9540ca0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4c15f38-85e4-4020-b0a2-10986ce173eb","title":"预期：两种状态下 Re-check 均可点击并重新执行三步检测；未安装状态下按产品规则展示或隐藏该按钮"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"80246762-e715-4978-9e91-07d5d9540ca0","title":"🟠【P1】Re-check 在已安装的各状态下均可点击"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"eb35208f-9f5f-4cda-ac88-6d0f00e4333a","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"46eb5ed0-e737-46a3-a4e3-535b37f58976","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"45faf92e-270e-4235-bc00-48168d5b9bb6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7e461b80-5403-4e4a-9b71-7175e6c253a8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a757dca8-fd58-4624-a41e-4f7045c32e30","title":"前置：该 Agent 已安装且已登录"},{"parent":"7e461b80-5403-4e4a-9b71-7175e6c253a8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ee2b87c5-329d-4225-8e08-cabc6d29730b","title":"操作：查看卡片底部按钮区域"},{"parent":"7e461b80-5403-4e4a-9b71-7175e6c253a8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e6b47e3-019e-4439-a583-943d6cd827c4","title":"预期：底部只有 Re-check 与 Sign in again；不出现 Install 或 Sign in，避免用户误以为需要重新安装或重新首次登录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7e461b80-5403-4e4a-9b71-7175e6c253a8","title":"🟠【P1】已登录时底部不应出现 Install 或 Sign in"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"45faf92e-270e-4235-bc00-48168d5b9bb6","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"46eb5ed0-e737-46a3-a4e3-535b37f58976","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"96963deb-be26-4e08-8a9d-23d97c41e824","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0ebfdd21-97a7-4d8d-92d5-3e711b4b0b9a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d7ed2144-7b4e-4dd2-b292-795ca5981a08","title":"前置：点击 Re-check 后检测正在进行"},{"parent":"0ebfdd21-97a7-4d8d-92d5-3e711b4b0b9a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ad4b5cb4-97e6-4235-82f6-9acb5c3277eb","title":"操作：观察按钮状态并尝试再次点击"},{"parent":"0ebfdd21-97a7-4d8d-92d5-3e711b4b0b9a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"26ce6001-67a5-49a8-947d-2e4dad291782","title":"预期：按钮切换为进行中且不可重复触发；检测结束后恢复可点击"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0ebfdd21-97a7-4d8d-92d5-3e711b4b0b9a","title":"🟡【P2】Re-check 执行期间的按钮状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"96963deb-be26-4e08-8a9d-23d97c41e824","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"46eb5ed0-e737-46a3-a4e3-535b37f58976","title":"3.9 底部按钮（Re-check + Sign in again）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dde3d537-0aa0-4974-b29f-77b0eccee5e1","title":"3. 已登录状态"},{"parent":"3c9df9bc-c66b-4bd5-b536-374e0cafa30a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"27763f84-a9f2-4b88-ada1-cb2f3d95c010","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6acd126e-8d5a-4f81-83dd-15da0fceca01","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"36f7f72f-b28c-4b1d-867f-bae3343e7695","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1b14716e-2f4a-4f93-a5d1-79772885527e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"69d82d50-9845-41c2-a6a5-65a87021c2e0","title":"前置：Codex 未安装且已弹出未安装提示气泡"},{"parent":"1b14716e-2f4a-4f93-a5d1-79772885527e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"15ab63e0-eb01-4630-bb23-6b3791d8bf29","title":"操作：点击 Install 按钮"},{"parent":"1b14716e-2f4a-4f93-a5d1-79772885527e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bbafdb65-5dab-4330-9df8-4a0ecfada619","title":"预期：直接开始安装并跳转到该 Agent 的管理详情，就地展示安装进度；全程不需要用户手动离开再返回；安装完成后该 Agent 在会话中变为可选"},{"parent":"1b14716e-2f4a-4f93-a5d1-79772885527e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2c664b5e-db1a-4a58-8a25-c29e992bf00b","title":"备注：依据产品备注：点击安装按钮时自动安装，进入详情页展示进度，不需要用户手动离开一次"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1b14716e-2f4a-4f93-a5d1-79772885527e","title":"🔴【P0】从会话点击 Install 后的跳转与进度"},{"parent":"36f7f72f-b28c-4b1d-867f-bae3343e7695","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"90d04675-595c-4e0f-8b66-38ed46d7fa38","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4e1cafe-d40a-470b-8f39-4aca60923f53","title":"前置：Tutti Agent 已安装且已登录"},{"parent":"90d04675-595c-4e0f-8b66-38ed46d7fa38","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2a71f579-5f18-4feb-9422-296964c2f234","title":"操作：在会话页的 Agent 选择区选中 Tutti Agent"},{"parent":"90d04675-595c-4e0f-8b66-38ed46d7fa38","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c9f6a267-7519-40c7-9c26-e8b37a76a74f","title":"预期：直接选中并可正常发起会话，不弹出未安装提示气泡"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"90d04675-595c-4e0f-8b66-38ed46d7fa38","title":"🔴【P0】已安装的 Agent 不展示未安装气泡"},{"parent":"36f7f72f-b28c-4b1d-867f-bae3343e7695","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ebafa2e9-bb44-4a92-a2b2-168786badfb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c8fda146-d4f3-4aab-ac56-629de22a8434","title":"前置：Codex 未安装，处于新建会话页"},{"parent":"ebafa2e9-bb44-4a92-a2b2-168786badfb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"21f4201b-5ca1-4a8e-abf7-c9c6b56f21ff","title":"操作：在会话页的 Agent 选择区点击选中 Codex"},{"parent":"ebafa2e9-bb44-4a92-a2b2-168786badfb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"16219417-e27c-40f6-869a-4230feca02c6","title":"预期：在该 Agent 位置弹出提示气泡，说明该 Agent 尚未安装并提示可同步已有订阅，气泡内提供 Install 按钮；输入框不允许以该 Agent 发送消息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ebafa2e9-bb44-4a92-a2b2-168786badfb7","title":"🔴【P0】选中未安装的 Agent 时展示未安装提示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"36f7f72f-b28c-4b1d-867f-bae3343e7695","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"6acd126e-8d5a-4f81-83dd-15da0fceca01","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6ac0d08d-33c5-4ef1-88e5-a2dfc036560d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"56a66fc2-65bd-4c1f-b98f-6bb680899922","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7151795c-47aa-4c71-b56c-2bca65e645c1","title":"前置：Codex 未安装且安装源不可达"},{"parent":"56a66fc2-65bd-4c1f-b98f-6bb680899922","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c9a6225f-a4e1-4fea-91ff-daea26065915","title":"操作：在气泡内点击 Install 并等待结果"},{"parent":"56a66fc2-65bd-4c1f-b98f-6bb680899922","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ba006112-f5fe-45ef-b46b-7e5e0e982186","title":"预期：给出可读的失败原因与重试入口；该 Agent 状态回到未安装，不停留在安装中；重试成功后可正常选中使用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"56a66fc2-65bd-4c1f-b98f-6bb680899922","title":"🟠【P1】会话气泡内安装失败的提示与重试"},{"parent":"6ac0d08d-33c5-4ef1-88e5-a2dfc036560d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"42a5aa09-b4a0-42ba-837c-7d131635bcfc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e1345fce-9e01-4252-b52c-601827ecf61e","title":"前置：会话页已弹出 Codex 未安装气泡"},{"parent":"42a5aa09-b4a0-42ba-837c-7d131635bcfc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e2b6d4b9-4abc-4c36-b24c-766d0b0260eb","title":"操作：在 Agent Management 页完成 Codex 安装后回到会话页"},{"parent":"42a5aa09-b4a0-42ba-837c-7d131635bcfc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4036a02d-7615-43aa-af8b-67afbc7fc57f","title":"预期：气泡自动消失或更新为可用状态，该 Agent 变为可选；不出现已安装却仍提示未安装"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"42a5aa09-b4a0-42ba-837c-7d131635bcfc","title":"🟠【P1】气泡展示期间该 Agent 已从其他入口完成安装"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6ac0d08d-33c5-4ef1-88e5-a2dfc036560d","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"6acd126e-8d5a-4f81-83dd-15da0fceca01","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"065ae416-d06c-4162-9e1b-3e8d6e3f420d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"991f2e98-61e7-4b3a-a897-8e5e8a208146","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"59aba6f8-48de-4437-ace0-2b6ec3359986","title":"前置：Codex 与 Claude Code 均未安装"},{"parent":"991f2e98-61e7-4b3a-a897-8e5e8a208146","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"148cfa22-e2bb-4cf7-8cee-819cf6aa4062","title":"操作：在会话页快速交替点击选中这两个 Agent"},{"parent":"991f2e98-61e7-4b3a-a897-8e5e8a208146","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"26e145a1-0a14-4ecf-aa76-9679a0ecf5b4","title":"预期：同一时刻只展示一个气泡且内容与当前选中的 Agent 对应；不出现气泡叠加或内容错配"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"991f2e98-61e7-4b3a-a897-8e5e8a208146","title":"🟡【P2】连续切换选中多个未安装的 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"065ae416-d06c-4162-9e1b-3e8d6e3f420d","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6acd126e-8d5a-4f81-83dd-15da0fceca01","title":"4.1 会话内未安装 Agent 的安装引导"},{"parent":"27763f84-a9f2-4b88-ada1-cb2f3d95c010","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"62741227-0a36-42fa-afa3-9ad3332e310a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"55e8a083-5950-4e2b-8665-9bf6c2d92e0f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"74752c41-21bf-478d-87c6-61e688defb3d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e85bc414-831c-4c26-bf45-5ea7c03f0341","title":"前置：Agent 未安装，网络与安装源可用"},{"parent":"74752c41-21bf-478d-87c6-61e688defb3d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2e581cd2-a7ac-42ee-8f24-1d6cc2aa66b9","title":"操作：在 Agent Management 页点击该卡片的 Install 按钮后不做任何其他操作"},{"parent":"74752c41-21bf-478d-87c6-61e688defb3d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cf708d3f-3547-44fe-aacd-124c79452e34","title":"预期：安装自动执行至结束，期间不要求用户切换页面、手动确认或重新进入；结束后卡片自动进入检测并更新为已安装未登录"},{"parent":"74752c41-21bf-478d-87c6-61e688defb3d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"10297608-d1cf-4a37-b299-d8639988bd9f","title":"备注：依据产品备注：点击安装按钮时自动安装，进入详情页展示进度，不需要用户手动离开一次"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"74752c41-21bf-478d-87c6-61e688defb3d","title":"🔴【P0】点击 Install 后全程自动完成安装"},{"parent":"55e8a083-5950-4e2b-8665-9bf6c2d92e0f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6ebd4f9b-d0e2-4132-b2d2-6eefeda0de6a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b9133d91-841d-4ce8-83c4-8982ce925783","title":"前置：Agent 未安装且已开启自动安装"},{"parent":"6ebd4f9b-d0e2-4132-b2d2-6eefeda0de6a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f34fe86d-dd1e-4556-a912-a74a35e37513","title":"操作：触发自动安装并等待完成"},{"parent":"6ebd4f9b-d0e2-4132-b2d2-6eefeda0de6a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"390ae962-1885-4d2c-be4d-76d5d283fc71","title":"预期：安装完成后状态切换为已安装，检测可继续进行到登录步骤"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6ebd4f9b-d0e2-4132-b2d2-6eefeda0de6a","title":"🔴【P0】自动安装完成后可用"},{"parent":"55e8a083-5950-4e2b-8665-9bf6c2d92e0f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dd380fb9-624e-4720-8eb8-a8dc812f004f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ea429ed-c963-4f96-947c-2a4d04ba2ca9","title":"前置：某个 Agent 正在安装中"},{"parent":"dd380fb9-624e-4720-8eb8-a8dc812f004f","callout":[],"children":