le":"备注：依据新版 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"95495b13-183a-46c1-995b-e3b8c893f32c","title":"🟠【P1】磁盘空间不足时发起安装"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"179a7f21-6129-4a8f-922f-404908fd5177","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"62741227-0a36-42fa-afa3-9ad3332e310a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9cb64e2c-4d46-47f4-9c93-2369ff7af0c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8a9f24f3-13c7-4a15-9c31-41e8926212b7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6cea91b6-a7ae-4eff-9fd7-d40acea1aec2","title":"前置：两个及以上 Agent 均未安装"},{"parent":"8a9f24f3-13c7-4a15-9c31-41e8926212b7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ca6cb62a-e04f-43bc-8a26-dd2d5eaa2399","title":"操作：在短时间内依次点击多张卡片的 Install"},{"parent":"8a9f24f3-13c7-4a15-9c31-41e8926212b7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c5869027-4381-4e5a-8dc6-e3e86627aa78","title":"预期：各卡片独立展示各自的安装进度，互不阻塞也不互相覆盖；全部完成后状态分别正确更新"},{"parent":"8a9f24f3-13c7-4a15-9c31-41e8926212b7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3eef4174-63f3-45e6-a198-30155acd1e4a","title":"备注：依据新版 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8a9f24f3-13c7-4a15-9c31-41e8926212b7","title":"🟡【P2】同时对多个 Agent 发起安装"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9cb64e2c-4d46-47f4-9c93-2369ff7af0c4","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"62741227-0a36-42fa-afa3-9ad3332e310a","title":"4.2 管理页 Install 与自动安装"},{"parent":"27763f84-a9f2-4b88-ada1-cb2f3d95c010","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"361da449-519d-4435-ae60-55de58acd0d9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0e67e313-fd33-42c5-83e2-059024b6a15b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dc693d2a-9102-446e-96f7-177b57de457a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cadab6bf-8ca7-463f-912d-17b23086a103","title":"前置：安装已完成"},{"parent":"dc693d2a-9102-446e-96f7-177b57de457a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"078c2ddc-0678-44e6-a6b6-7178e49979c3","title":"操作：观察卡片从安装完成到检测结束的过程"},{"parent":"dc693d2a-9102-446e-96f7-177b57de457a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"99645db1-9e59-4ae4-afa3-fd2a5db8505d","title":"预期：安装完成后自动触发 Availability Check 三步，无需手动点击 Re-check；检测结束后卡片状态与底部按钮更新为已安装未登录对应形态"},{"parent":"dc693d2a-9102-446e-96f7-177b57de457a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"70a551f2-b60a-4e32-ac61-9c30b071c817","title":"备注：依据产品备注：点击安装按钮时自动安装，进入详情页展示进度，不需要用户手动离开一次"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dc693d2a-9102-446e-96f7-177b57de457a","title":"🔴【P0】安装完成后自动衔接可用性检测"},{"parent":"0e67e313-fd33-42c5-83e2-059024b6a15b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4e0c07ed-1288-417c-b892-4b3e1449e1b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"83222a3c-9204-4623-bf46-d20fbf6f5a46","title":"前置：已点击 Install 开始安装"},{"parent":"4e0c07ed-1288-417c-b892-4b3e1449e1b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"42dcab2a-e1c8-4654-a8cc-1aa33c193f8c","title":"操作：停留在该 Agent 的管理详情观察进度"},{"parent":"4e0c07ed-1288-417c-b892-4b3e1449e1b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"36b2e642-cc21-4448-9240-177aba3fd04a","title":"预期：详情区展示当前安装阶段与进度且随时间推进，不长时间停在同一数值；进度不回退，完成时进度到达终态"},{"parent":"4e0c07ed-1288-417c-b892-4b3e1449e1b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b4fa79ba-e002-4a87-9097-eaa34477bbd6","title":"备注：依据产品备注：点击安装按钮时自动安装，进入详情页展示进度，不需要用户手动离开一次"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4e0c07ed-1288-417c-b892-4b3e1449e1b4","title":"🔴【P0】安装进度在卡片详情区实时更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0e67e313-fd33-42c5-83e2-059024b6a15b","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"361da449-519d-4435-ae60-55de58acd0d9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9ecb154d-fdc2-4a62-a560-7cd01fef932b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1eefa9a7-45f5-4acd-8c3f-a8ae1287752f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"51f047da-6092-408b-b100-ef5b43cc3d55","title":"前置：前置：使用新注册账号；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：管理智能体页面"},{"parent":"1eefa9a7-45f5-4acd-8c3f-a8ae1287752f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dc4c1439-d2ea-4b12-aee3-2dbcdce3ef20","title":"操作：安装 Codex 与 Claude Code 后查看状态"},{"parent":"1eefa9a7-45f5-4acd-8c3f-a8ae1287752f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f791e29b-ddf3-40bd-afa7-eaf9ac644b8e","title":"预期：安装完成后卡片显示已安装并进入登录引导；不出现仍显示未发现配置；完成登录后可正常使用"},{"parent":"1eefa9a7-45f5-4acd-8c3f-a8ae1287752f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"17950910-1255-4dba-baeb-ee633560d72c","title":"备注：#442"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1eefa9a7-45f5-4acd-8c3f-a8ae1287752f","title":"🔴【P0】新账号安装后仍提示未发现配置"},{"parent":"9ecb154d-fdc2-4a62-a560-7cd01fef932b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2e987f65-9175-4125-b9b3-c1c6c5ffd874","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4af5f032-415f-4d4c-8fd9-71fcf4112e9f","title":"前置：安装过程中下载被挂起"},{"parent":"2e987f65-9175-4125-b9b3-c1c6c5ffd874","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6368f065-39ba-4949-afcc-fb9c5b183716","title":"操作：观察进度区域并等待超过超时阈值"},{"parent":"2e987f65-9175-4125-b9b3-c1c6c5ffd874","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b53000a1-e711-4605-b406-bb24ea5d7317","title":"预期：在阈值内结束并标记安装失败，给出原因与重试入口；不无限停留在进行中"},{"parent":"2e987f65-9175-4125-b9b3-c1c6c5ffd874","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"01bcffc8-2785-4fc5-ab87-71876bb82f70","title":"备注：依据新版 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2e987f65-9175-4125-b9b3-c1c6c5ffd874","title":"🟠【P1】安装进度长时间无变化"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9ecb154d-fdc2-4a62-a560-7cd01fef932b","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"361da449-519d-4435-ae60-55de58acd0d9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2b4e2b37-c424-4cfe-ac0e-d83945db42f5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d0c6ac90-47a9-4464-838f-101280e1b318","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1d213ca0-b754-4109-b075-d0e6a98bc239","title":"前置：本地已有缓存使安装几乎瞬时完成"},{"parent":"d0c6ac90-47a9-4464-838f-101280e1b318","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5ce39515-927a-4485-820f-195e0323b7cb","title":"操作：点击 Install 后观察进度区域"},{"parent":"d0c6ac90-47a9-4464-838f-101280e1b318","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b0cb4a98-6732-42ab-96d4-d1b803db473b","title":"预期：进度展示与结束过程不闪烁跳变，最终稳定停留在完成态并进入检测"},{"parent":"d0c6ac90-47a9-4464-838f-101280e1b318","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fae9ebb7-d536-4804-aa37-3b3e2947444d","title":"备注：依据新版 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d0c6ac90-47a9-4464-838f-101280e1b318","title":"🟡【P2】安装在极短时间内完成时的进度展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2b4e2b37-c424-4cfe-ac0e-d83945db42f5","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"361da449-519d-4435-ae60-55de58acd0d9","title":"4.3 安装进度与结果反馈"},{"parent":"27763f84-a9f2-4b88-ada1-cb2f3d95c010","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7b4ff