b5d","title":"操作：点击安装按钮"},{"parent":"f7b36dcb-35d9-4628-8148-cd45e566ccc3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1bf460a5-15b2-4821-870a-84dde6c882ed","title":"预期：给出网络不可用的明确提示与重试入口，不长时间无反馈"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f7b36dcb-35d9-4628-8148-cd45e566ccc3","title":"🟠【P1】无网络时点击安装"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6d9e5292-d5bd-4b94-afc3-f705be889bcc","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"7b4ff552-089c-4e5e-8164-45811969435c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"96f7c16c-a6a0-4668-ac27-a3fae0320252","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"be582a91-eea1-495f-b5db-a4232382a269","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c297cce3-4d41-449f-944e-ba00ae1f9b56","title":"前置：Agent 未安装"},{"parent":"be582a91-eea1-495f-b5db-a4232382a269","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df2b3a11-c630-40bb-b46d-94f40982b180","title":"操作：快速连续点击安装按钮多次"},{"parent":"be582a91-eea1-495f-b5db-a4232382a269","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e77c343a-95eb-428b-b60a-f08c17b23b40","title":"预期：只触发一次安装流程，不产生重复安装任务或多个进度条"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"be582a91-eea1-495f-b5db-a4232382a269","title":"🟡【P2】连续多次点击安装按钮"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"96f7c16c-a6a0-4668-ac27-a3fae0320252","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7b4ff552-089c-4e5e-8164-45811969435c","title":"4.4 安装失败、中断与重试"},{"parent":"27763f84-a9f2-4b88-ada1-cb2f3d95c010","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"157f6201-0214-4b63-ba3a-2155c86e7869","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"634a39a3-027d-4f89-b5a4-8460e333c948","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"87850df3-8336-4b8a-a4bd-e4fac7e4e0b3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0325ea6d-9d6f-4de2-b22d-f01cc76d0f1b","title":"前置：本地已安装该 Agent 且远端存在更高版本"},{"parent":"87850df3-8336-4b8a-a4bd-e4fac7e4e0b3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"17be3d40-577b-44f8-b1bc-8e19c8a9af8a","title":"操作：触发更新并等待完成后查看 CLI &amp; Adapter 步骤"},{"parent":"87850df3-8336-4b8a-a4bd-e4fac7e4e0b3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c26e53a-1407-41b8-8a8f-c0a4e551ad87","title":"预期：更新完成后展示的版本号为新版本，可执行路径与适配器路径同步更新；更新过程不清除已有登录态"},{"parent":"87850df3-8336-4b8a-a4bd-e4fac7e4e0b3","callout":[],"