ef","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"157f6201-0214-4b63-ba3a-2155c86e7869","title":"4.5 版本更新与重复安装"},{"parent":"27763f84-a9f2-4b88-ada1-cb2f3d95c010","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4f7bebe5-26a0-4f8a-89ea-e237e1736e45","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4c6df022-05a0-4a9a-8bf3-5b8870a9c95f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3d45c4c2-c5e5-404a-8f52-f9cb684eb85e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"036bed77-e56b-4109-b62a-e4d349d79c18","title":"前置：Agent 已安装并已登录"},{"parent":"3d45c4c2-c5e5-404a-8f52-f9cb684eb85e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7fe2bc88-4947-4fff-90c9-9af3a20f49ac","title":"操作：从 Set up 弹窗点击 Uninstall managed runtime 卸载该 Agent 后查看左侧面板"},{"parent":"3d45c4c2-c5e5-404a-8f52-f9cb684eb85e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5c2a27d2-4dfc-4289-a0ab-f526af20d338","title":"预期：状态回退为未安装，共享开关与用量限制不再展示，显示安装按钮"},{"parent":"3d45c4c2-c5e5-404a-8f52-f9cb684eb85e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"30e54869-5857-4abf-a7c5-311e5d1bfb99","title":"备注：移除入口为 Set up 弹窗中 Install runtime 行右侧的 Uninstall managed runtime"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3d45c4c2-c5e5-404a-8f52-f9cb684eb85e","title":"🔴【P0】移除 Agent 后面板状态回退"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4c6df022-05a0-4a9a-8bf3-5b8870a9c95f","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"4f7bebe5-26a0-4f8a-89ea-e237e1736e45","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5faa2782-0cf0-47c3-a1a7-f483ae83c0a4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"69cde3a5-7d3e-45c0-9dfb-f6616cdfdeb1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"37912fa8-2da1-47a7-8247-9552226931e5","title":"前置：前置：Agent 已在房间内使用；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：卡片更多 → Set up 弹窗 → Uninstall managed runtime"},{"parent":"69cde3a5-7d3e-45c0-9dfb-f6616cdfdeb1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2d05f769-2201-4ebc-9ebb-1d011ea1b0c5","title":"操作：从 Set up 弹窗点击 Uninstall managed runtime 卸载该 Agent 后回到房间，尝试在历史会话中发送消息、开启共享开关、查看 @ 面板与群聊中的智能体状态"},{"parent":"69cde3a5-7d3e-45c0-9dfb-f6616cdfdeb1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"293eb888-aeeb-4bcd-a34c-f73e7197b8da","title":"预期：历史会话输入框禁用并提示 Agent 已不可用，不能发送后再报错；共享开关不可操作；@ 面板、群聊与共享智能体中该 Agent 均显示为离线或不可用而非可用"},{"parent":"69cde3a5-7d3e-45c0-9dfb-f6616cdfdeb1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3f525e81-ab7e-41ef-83be-6063c8212a00","title":"备注：移除入口为 Set up 弹窗中 Install runtime 行右侧的 Uninstall managed runtime；#338 #414"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"69cde3a5-7d3e-45c0-9dfb-f6616cdfdeb1","title":"🔴【P0】移除 Agent 后不可继续对话"},{"parent":"5faa2782-0cf0-47c3-a1a7-f483ae83c0a4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"86f7e769-f6db-44d0-99f2-c6e84420aab5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"071956a0-dd6b-4c4e-a45b-e121c017e6e2","title":"前置：前置：已在应用外部移除 Codex；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：管理智能体"},{"parent":"86f7e769-f6db-44d0-99f2-c6e84420aab5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"57cc29af-082d-4305-9a62-f0087361dc0b","title":"操作：重新进入应用并对 Codex 发起登录检测"},{"parent":"86f7e769-f6db-44d0-99f2-c6e84420aab5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"62de00d8-9578-4c3a-be4f-b05f753a1549","title":"预期：检测给出该 Agent 未安装的明确结论并引导重新安装；不出现异常报错；重新安装后检测与登录均可正常完成"},{"parent":"86f7e769-f6db-44d0-99f2-c6e84420aab5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8c204f33-5577-499f-9acf-9250fd9c4b15","title":"备注：移除入口为 Set up 弹窗中 Install runtime 行右侧的 Uninstall managed runtime；#335"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"86f7e769-f6db-44d0-99f2-c6e84420aab5","title":"🔴【P0】移除后重新登录检测"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5faa2782-0cf0-47c3-a1a7-f483ae83c0a4","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"4f7bebe5-26a0-4f8a-89ea-e237e1736e45","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4c0abf33-9d12-49b0-a4bf-1406d7e86d61","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7b0aa3a5-03b8-4a6d-b246-17593366e78c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0d6c8f29-1016-4fda-a1ba-6327d01611fe","title":"前置：Agent 已安装未登录且登录窗口已打开"},{"parent":"7b0aa3a5-03b8-4a6d-b246-17593366e78c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8cb85540-2e4f-4c93-81c0-65344866ecf9","title":"操作：在登录未完成时从 Set up 弹窗点击 Uninstall managed runtime 卸载该 Agent"},{"parent":"7b0aa3a5-03b8-4a6d-b246-17593366e78c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44fb063d-4e2f-4142-985b-3eba4f696e79","title":"预期：登录流程被终止，面板状态回到未安装，不残留待回调的登录任务"},{"parent":"7b0aa3a5-03b8-4a6d-b246-17593366e78c","callout":[],"ch