4fb4-8d42-d6acd02fd605","title":"操作：选择 Claude 订阅账号登录，在网页完成授权后返回管理智能体页面"},{"parent":"94bc46fa-1a9f-40b7-bdc6-7514dfb9d088","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"adeb638a-6d2e-425f-a626-4aa409a87bbd","title":"预期：登录成功后管理智能体页面立即显示为已登录并展示当前账号；不再显示未登录或仅显示凭据已配置；进入房间发起会话可正常收到回复，登录态不回退"},{"parent":"94bc46fa-1a9f-40b7-bdc6-7514dfb9d088","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eca67203-d953-4105-afa7-2f294f140e92","title":"备注：#389 #69"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"94bc46fa-1a9f-40b7-bdc6-7514dfb9d088","title":"🔴【P0】订阅账号登录后状态同步"},{"parent":"11f9befa-65de-4f00-8055-cc0597abac6d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7ef4d4d6-61ef-4a8f-999e-26334a4f2753","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3a808231-5b93-4ca2-983d-b17ad5e8953a","title":"前置：Codex 已安装未登录"},{"parent":"7ef4d4d6-61ef-4a8f-999e-26334a4f2753","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"71e07385-99cd-46ec-a461-a624b576873f","title":"操作：点击登录，选择账号方式完成授权"},{"parent":"7ef4d4d6-61ef-4a8f-999e-26334a4f2753","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f1debfe9-6814-4e69-b779-ae9264bff743","title":"预期：登录成功，面板展示账号名，状态切换为可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7ef4d4d6-61ef-4a8f-999e-26334a4f2753","title":"🔴【P0】通过账号登录 Codex"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"11f9befa-65de-4f00-8055-cc0597abac6d","title":"正常场景（5）"},{"parent":"e3cb0b9a-7988-401c-bb3a-4fdbe08d4147","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"afe9210d-73f1-414d-aee3-da21e28d9ce0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c94e610f-f35f-4ab6-9ad4-2c6734ba2655","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"81cbac67-906b-4f4c-b302-aa8d360db395","title":"前置：前置：使用 VM 版应用，Agent 未绑定；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：管理智能体绑定流程"},{"parent":"c94e610f-f35f-4ab6-9ad4-2c6734ba2655","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"da866ab1-549f-4900-aaa4-a53ed8fb3a44","title":"操作：发起绑定，失败后点击重试按钮"},{"parent":"c94e610f-f35f-4ab6-9ad4-2c6734ba2655","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bc3acc09-b93c-4ab8-aff1-622b45bb639e","title":"预期：重试按钮点击后重新发起绑定并给出结果；不出现点击无反应；绑定成功后 Agent 可在房间内正常使用"},{"parent":"c94e610f-f35f-4ab6-9ad4-2c6734ba2655","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"871bab69-f7eb-45b5-a230-a7f6f4078e54","title":"备注：#336"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c94e610f-f35f-4ab6-9ad4-2c6734ba2655","title":"🔴【P0】VM 版无法登录绑定且重试无反应"},{"parent":"afe9210d-73f1-414d-aee3-da21e28d9ce0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"166a5c6e-4f1f-4da7-b469-2d4383785b47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0fe4869c-fdc8-43d1-adab-4a781293bee1","title":"前置：Codex 已安装，当前已退出该 Agent 的登录"},{"parent":"166a5c6e-4f1f-4da7-b469-2d4383785b47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"855a5a3a-a03e-4ad1-a9de-0bb4fdbd3d45","title":"操作：打开codex窗口后退出codex登录，再重新打开应用，并尝试发送消息"},{"parent":"166a5c6e-4f1f-4da7-b469-2d4383785b47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"365cf453-261f-4d57-bc30-4dcdb4b036f9","title":"预期：codex窗口各种按钮不可点击，不可发送消息，显示codex需登录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"166a5c6e-4f1f-4da7-b469-2d4383785b47","title":"🟠【P1】未登录发送消息"},{"parent":"afe9210d-73f1-414d-aee3-da21e28d9ce0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8fd3838f-eabf-42ed-9bd7-5a5accfed4bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0dea2dd6-3497-470e-a8e2-ef960447f6a6","title":"前置：Agent 已安装但未登录"},{"parent":"8fd3838f-eabf-42ed-9bd7-5a5accfed4bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e4b2196-03e2-4be7-b5b1-66fbc5e7913b","title":"操作：在会话中选择该 Agent 并发送消息"},{"parent":"8fd3838f-eabf-42ed-9bd7-5a5accfed4bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3d4f39aa-f975-4bce-ada9-f64039383ab0","title":"预期：拦截并提示需要先登录，提供跳转登录的入口，不发出无效请求"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8fd3838f-eabf-42ed-9bd7-5a5accfed4bf","title":"🟠【P1】未登录状态下尝试发起会话"},{"parent":"afe9210d-73f1-414d-aee3-da21e28d9ce0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cc5b9581-9954-4dfb-8e17-ac00e9908f0c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5166ca32-f327-4525-b6ca-c7f7d472f519","title":"前置：Agent 已安装但未登录"},{"parent":"cc5b9581-9954-4dfb-8e17-ac00e9908f0c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"15fcd531-e61f-41fc-a645-c0c5c7c9af04","title":"操作：输入错误凭证或模拟认证失败"},{"parent":"cc5b9581-9954-4dfb-8e17-ac00e9908f0c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a1ddff1b-3d0c-42a9-b84e-d87a826f0946","title":"预期：提示登录失败原因，可重试"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cc5b9581-9954-4dfb-8e17-ac00e9908f0c","title":"🟠【P1】登录失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"afe9210d-73f1-414d-aee3-da21e28d9ce0","title":"异常场景（4）"},{"parent":"e3cb0b9a-7988-401c-bb3a-4fdbe08d4147","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d1524d29-06e0-4b75-afb4-894df21a2f34","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ee3cfc86-a474-4573-a62d-e25d4bea8e93","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"96ec1f37-ca0d-4621-83a8-bc66adcce1d0","title":"前置：Agent 已完成绑定"},{"parent":"ee3cfc86-a474-4573-a62d-e25d4bea8e93","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ebe5dec7-81c0-40a4-8c7e-5031c159dec2","title":"操作：再次对该 Agent 发起绑定"},{"parent":"ee3cfc86-a474-4573-a62d-e25d4bea8e93","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"764e7347-d3c0-4dc8-bf28-08ad00491b08","title":"预期：提示已绑定或幂等处理，不产生重复绑定记录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ee3cfc86-a474-4573-a62d-e25d4bea8e93","title":"🟡【P2】重复绑定同一 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d1524d29-06e0-4b75-afb4-894df21a2f34","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e3cb0b9a-7988-401c-bb3a-4fdbe08d4147","title":"5.1 Sign in 发起与登录成功"},{"parent":"204384d9-744c-42f7-96a0-aa8d73804a15","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"60ed7bee-736a-4f9c-8604-c4e2ae19407d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"58a224d6-f93f-434c-9756-8221a4507bb0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"205f56d7-d2cf-42b8-9af0-61e82dfce9e9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b4d19728-3051-4612-a5ad-075c4730a468","title":"前置：Agent 已安装未登录"},{"parent":"205f56d7-d2cf-42b8-9af0-61e82dfce9e9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6032a212-5ca5-4364-b9b8-071a84d6d369","title":"操作：点击 Sign in 后在授权页取消，返回卡片再次点击 Sign in"},{"parent":"205f56d7-d2cf-42b8-9af0-61e82dfce9e9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"11de7317-00ec-4e1a-907f-1b75d25260de","title":"预期：第一次取消后卡片回到未登录态且按钮恢复可点击；第二次点击可正常拉起登录流程并完成登录"},{"parent":"205f56d7-d2cf-42b8-9af0-61e82dfce9e9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8e826e75-4173-457d-b973-9463f31eed0f","title":"备注：依据新版 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"205f56d7-d2cf-42b8-9af0-61e82dfce9e9","title":"🔴【P0】取消登录后可再次发起"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"58a224d6-f93f-434c-9756-8221a4507bb0","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"60ed7bee-736a-4f9c-8604-c4e2ae19407d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2384e0cd-49f1-4160-b4f2-3800c27ca3e0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1eb16ef6-5115-4d93-b7e9-376d528a21ca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7a695f16-c9c8-4e98-9b65-bed54e90e910","title":"前置：前置：已进入 Anthropic Console 账号登录流程；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：登录弹窗中的取消登录"},{"parent":"1eb16ef6-5115-4d93-b7e9-376d528a21ca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c23d28ac-a513-4983-a085-29c1301553b7","title":"操作：点击取消登录"},{"parent":"1eb16ef6-5115-4d93-b7e9-376d528a21ca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"79b92672-1b05-44fe-9d3e-b7e68189800e","title":"预期：登录流程被取消并回到未登录状态；不出现「出错了，请重试」；账号未被写入任何凭据"},{"parent":"1eb16ef6-5115-4d93-b7e9-376d528a21ca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4c1b0d8e-ef60-42f5-9bec-00d0c5d9028f","title":"备注：#298"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1eb16ef6-5115-4d93-b7e9-376d528a21ca","title":"🔴【P0】取消 Console 账号登录报错"},{"parent":"2384e0cd-49f1-4160-b4f2-3800c27ca3e0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5aa26002-ec52-4574-a5bf-5567cadc3d8a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c8027ad-701b-4f8b-ac5d-63bed08a06c9","title":"前置：前置：已进入 Claude 订阅账号登录流程；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：登录弹窗中的取消登录"},{"parent":"5aa26002-ec52-4574-a5bf-5567cadc3d8a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"281f1ab9-3a4e-44e7-89c0-547a722bad6a","title":"操作：点击取消登录"},{"parent":"5aa26002-ec52-4574-a5bf-5567cadc3d8a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"97f81260-8355-4af8-80a2-ba6b2a429d3b","title":"预期：登录流程被取消，弹窗关闭并回到未登录状态；不出现点击无反应；可再次发起登录"},{"parent":"5aa26002-ec52-4574-a5bf-5567cadc3d8a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6ea536e8-4382-470a-9f60-3889d7bd519b","title":"备注：#297"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5aa26002-ec52-4574-a5bf-5567cadc3d8a","title":"🔴【P0】取消订阅账号登录无反应"},{"parent":"2384e0cd-49f1-4160-b4f2-3800c27ca3e0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d108fb15-988d-4d89-adad-3d254b9f0595","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"614232ae-54ac-4b2e-b588-3e433823ed9f","title":"前置：前置：本地已安装 Claude Code；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：管理智能体"},{"parent":"d108fb15-988d-4d89-adad-3d254b9f0595","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7b8186c2-02bd-4655-94b2-c52f84779225","title":"操作：点击登录按钮但不完成登录流程，直接在 Set up 弹窗中点击 Uninstall managed runtime"},{"parent":"d108fb15-988d-4d89-adad-3d254b9f0595","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a1808e2f-857f-4673-b214-873525f5b80e","title":"预期：移除操作正常执行并给出结果提示；不出现报错；移除后卡片回到未安装状态，未完成的登录流程被终止"},{"parent":"d108fb15-988d-4d89-adad-3d254b9f0595","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a0985fb7-03b1-4652-9175-a39d93745ea7","title":"备注：移除入口为 Set up 弹窗中 Install runtime 行右侧的 Uninstall managed runtime；#299"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d108fb15-988d-4d89-adad-3d254b9f0595","title":"🔴【P0】未走完登录流程即移除 Agent"},{"parent":"2384e0cd-49f1-4160-b4f2-3800c27ca3e0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"70e03700-3476-4bf5-a077-a82a4fb808f6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f768afe8-a310-4524-83ad-5adac7232b8b","title":"前置：前置：本地已安装 Agent；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：管理智能体登录按钮"},{"parent":"70e03700-3476-4bf5-a077-a82a4fb808f6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"12434b98-0f3a-4de1-b094-7a417ff8b7d2","title":"操作：点击登录后不进行任何网页操作，等待数分钟观察按钮状态"},{"parent":"70e03700-3476-4bf5-a077-a82a4fb808f6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3db24b4c-d175-43be-b03d-07a6dc83ab04","title":"预期：按钮在等待超时后回到可点击的登录态并给出未完成登录的提示；不会长时间停留在检查中；可再次点击重新发起登录"},{"parent":"70e03700-3476-4bf5-a077-a82a4fb808f6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd7519bd-4cb5-4f0b-810d-7b4788a548c1","title":"备注：#68"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"70e03700-3476-4bf5-a077-a82a4fb808f6","title":"🔴【P0】点击登录后不操作时按钮长时间检查中"},{"parent":"2384e0cd-49f1-4160-b4f2-3800c27ca3e0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"819232e8-d021-4a4e-ac43-c1e121d18bec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6b1763ab-9fa3-46dc-b67c-6b657a166740","title":"前置：Codex 已安装未登录"},{"parent":"819232e8-d021-4a4e-ac43-c1e121d18bec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3300244b-e559-4179-b7b6-877d82fe5140","title":"操作：点击登录后在授权页面直接关闭窗口"},{"parent":"819232e8-d021-4a4e-ac43-c1e121d18bec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"180c3bb1-8a3a-46ac-a405-df47c14dc666","title":"预期：回到未登录态且按钮可再次点击，不停留在检查中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"819232e8-d021-4a4e-ac43-c1e121d18bec","title":"🟡【P2】登录流程中途关闭窗口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2384e0cd-49f1-4160-b4f2-3800c27ca3e0","title":"异常场景（5）"},{"parent":"60ed7bee-736a-4f9c-8604-c4e2ae19407d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1867f1a6-0fa8-44d4-9ae7-d378fc3d745e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6ecf89e7-f103-4edd-b5a9-4f1b9cfac789","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e5f65812-efd8-4668-ad3e-07b753625405","title":"前置：Claude Code 已安装未登录"},{"parent":"6ecf89e7-f103-4edd-b5a9-4f1b9cfac789","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"806b596a-5e46-4bf6-9674-e038fc36984a","title":"操作：连续快速点击登录按钮多次"},{"parent":"6ecf89e7-f103-4edd-b5a9-4f1b9cfac789","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4c86254f-d177-42b4-ba3c-1080a9637743","title":"预期：只拉起一个登录流程，不打开多个授权窗口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6ecf89e7-f103-4edd-b5a9-4f1b9cfac789","title":"🟡【P2】连续点击登录按钮"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1867f1a6-0fa8-44d4-9ae7-d378fc3d745e","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"60ed7bee-736a-4f9c-8604-c4e2ae19407d","title":"5.2 登录流程的取消与中断"},{"parent":"204384d9-744c-42f7-96a0-aa8d73804a15","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"611a5260-cccc-4c7f-a942-277c99c50664","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1838e6f6-b1aa-41d1-97ba-3f6c465872eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"63b09adb-7de3-4e1a-8cd1-6dac7125df47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"37203405-2221-4200-98dd-7aa0f7a74b4c","title":"前置：Agent 已安装未登录且该 Agent 支持多种登录方式"},{"parent":"63b09adb-7de3-4e1a-8cd1-6dac7125df47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a7b3be6a-8faa-492c-aacb-75d2b2da2405","title":"操作：点击 Sign in 查看登录方式选择入口并选择其中一种"},{"parent":"63b09adb-7de3-4e1a-8cd1-6dac7125df47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d6347bde-83e8-4695-9f52-9de6a73f5d21","title":"预期：列出该 Agent 支持的全部登录方式且各自可点击；选中后进入对应方式的登录流程，可返回重新选择其他方式"},{"parent":"63b09adb-7de3-4e1a-8cd1-6dac7125df47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bea902c1-c26c-473d-b466-8ee26b9a91bb","title":"备注：依据新版 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"63b09adb-7de3-4e1a-8cd1-6dac7125df47","title":"🔴【P0】登录方式选择入口的展示与选择"},{"parent":"1838e6f6-b1aa-41d1-97ba-3f6c465872eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b8298b0e-1eff-4ceb-9af6-e039837f6c12","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df05ed9e-9d28-4300-8973-e21408c1bbe8","title":"前置：已在登录窗口中完成授权"},{"parent":"b8298b0e-1eff-4ceb-9af6-e039837f6c12","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3fdc291c-f66d-4be6-98a3-527c703c5717","title":"操作：完成授权后不做任何操作，观察登录窗口"},{"parent":"b8298b0e-1eff-4ceb-9af6-e039837f6c12","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"50a6d00d-d686-4a12-91a3-310d5ebbd37c","title":"预期：窗口在拿到结果后自动关闭或提供明确的关闭入口，并把结果同步回卡片"},{"parent":"b8298b0e-1eff-4ceb-9af6-e039837f6c12","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9ab1c22e-9f9f-46fd-8253-f935d160cfd8","title":"备注：依据新版 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b8298b0e-1eff-4ceb-9af6-e039837f6c12","title":"🟠【P1】登录窗口在授权完成后自动收起"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1838e6f6-b1aa-41d1-97ba-3f6c465872eb","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"611a5260-cccc-4c7f-a942-277c99c50664","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b1e58367-9760-4f27-b8af-8b1c162b9541","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6a8c5e3b-cd95-498f-bc8a-56157adfba3f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"42be51c5-0b74-4a54-9bec-76525f749ec2","title":"前置：前置：本地已安装 Claude Code；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：登录弹窗"},{"parent":"6a8c5e3b-cd95-498f-bc8a-56157adfba3f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"41b36249-efbe-4230-9b65-5563c0cd10d9","title":"操作：完成网页登录后返回应用查看弹窗"},{"parent":"6a8c5e3b-cd95-498f-bc8a-56157adfba3f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c2363ad-32b9-4877-a790-658fa892f391","title":"预期：弹窗状态随登录完成而更新为已登录并自动关闭或提供关闭入口；不会一直停留在正在打开登录；关闭后卡片显示已登录"},{"parent":"6a8c5e3b-cd95-498f-bc8a-56157adfba3f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"650cc273-08f0-4bf7-9243-ffdd7e9129b5","title":"备注：#41"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6a8c5e3b-cd95-498f-bc8a-56157adfba3f","title":"🔴【P0】登录完成后弹窗仍显示正在打开登录"},{"parent":"b1e58367-9760-4f27-b8af-8b1c162b9541","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c119a7fd-dd10-4d76-9a28-9f50822eac4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2a24d7d8-f863-4527-94f6-68b705d1b141","title":"前置：前置：本地已安装 Claude Code 未登录；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：Agent 卡片悬浮弹出的登录弹窗"},{"parent":"c119a7fd-dd10-4d76-9a28-9f50822eac4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8e1ba880-f6ce-4c23-aab0-25ebf214d2f1","title":"操作：将鼠标从卡片移动到弹窗中的登录按钮"},{"parent":"c119a7fd-dd10-4d76-9a28-9f50822eac4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8d7ad5ed-ee79-40ec-808e-42cbf0c5339b","title":"预期：鼠标移入弹窗时弹窗保持展示；登录按钮可被点击并触发登录流程；不出现移动过程中弹窗消失"},{"parent":"c119a7fd-dd10-4d76-9a28-9f50822eac4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1df69401-7998-4e2f-935b-2747fcf1339d","title":"备注：#363"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c119a7fd-dd10-4d76-9a28-9f50822eac4b","title":"🔴【P0】登录弹窗悬浮即消失导致无法点击"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b1e58367-9760-4f27-b8af-8b1c162b9541","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"611a5260-cccc-4c7f-a942-277c99c50664","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7a6a66b0-e8cf-4ba9-b2db-f201a43a7993","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e7353da6-100f-43e4-b05c-78151206ab4a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d6124b32-8152-406d-b946-91fc88623bdb","title":"前置：两个 Agent 均已安装未登录"},{"parent":"e7353da6-100f-43e4-b05c-78151206ab4a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3025080d-83ae-45bf-ba05-12f63bdfaa16","title":"操作：先后对两张卡片点击 Sign in"},{"parent":"e7353da6-100f-43e4-b05c-78151206ab4a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a58781ed-f71a-4f43-9fd4-0a3096429dcb","title":"预期：两个登录流程各自独立且结果写回各自的卡片；不出现凭据互相覆盖或状态串卡"},{"parent":"e7353da6-100f-43e4-b05c-78151206ab4a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b124f44d-c69a-493e-8290-6b72ecf3bac2","title":"备注：依据新版 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e7353da6-100f-43e4-b05c-78151206ab4a","title":"🟡【P2】同时对多个 Agent 发起登录"},{"parent":"7a6a66b0-e8cf-4ba9-b2db-f201a43a7993","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a195b091-2679-4c04-8da6-f61a8fe22c22","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"75eac854-09ec-4451-8def-271bbffc3623","title":"前置：登录窗口已拉起"},{"parent":"a195b091-2679-4c04-8da6-f61a8fe22c22","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"64dbb22e-5c1e-4f44-847f-35d1c3e80eb1","title":"操作：将应用切到后台一段时间后切回"},{"parent":"a195b091-2679-4c04-8da6-f61a8fe22c22","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"34e67ecf-5051-44a9-9a99-64b3d50722b6","title":"预期：登录窗口与其中的授权流程保持有效，切回后可继续完成；不出现窗口消失但按钮仍停在进行中"},{"parent":"a195b091-2679-4c04-8da6-f61a8fe22c22","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9843a523-495f-41ba-8788-e0bd3baecebe","title":"备注：依据新版 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a195b091-2679-4c04-8da6-f61a8fe22c22","title":"🟡【P2】登录窗口被系统置于后台"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7a6a66b0-e8cf-4ba9-b2db-f201a43a7993","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"611a5260-cccc-4c7f-a942-277c99c50664","title":"5.3 登录弹窗与入口交互"},{"parent":"204384d9-744c-42f7-96a0-aa8d73804a15","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fde3f374-e4b1-48c3-866d-c69223284eb8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bc7eed06-537f-43dd-a9ca-aa514c22e83e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"feae5325-9d11-424f-8e98-9d3ca933a4a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"862c4032-9fef-4e9b-9e24-f98f1f3a551d","title":"前置：该 Agent 此前已完成登录"},{"parent":"feae5325-9d11-424f-8e98-9d3ca933a4a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"030862a9-a8c0-4468-958b-a062cf355efb","title":"操作：已登录状态启动 Codex"},{"parent":"feae5325-9d11-424f-8e98-9d3ca933a4a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4d6c7b9b-12ec-4809-b3d9-664702e24a34","title":"预期：直接进入会话首页，账号相关功能可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"feae5325-9d11-424f-8e98-9d3ca933a4a4","title":"🟠【P1】登录状态打开应用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bc7eed06-537f-43dd-a9ca-aa514c22e83e","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"fde3f374-e4b1-48c3-866d-c69223284eb8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"98ed402a-e2ce-4089-b73e-4f0797df3f7a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a6eb156a-575e-4fcf-8661-cb5d086fdee7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6f61c1ba-8fad-45a3-854e-4ce2798e1821","title":"前置：前置：安装新版本应用且此前已登录 Tutti Agent；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间内设置与 Agent 列表"},{"parent":"a6eb156a-575e-4fcf-8661-cb5d086fdee7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eb3fc988-0abd-481e-8e69-e867bbca3e07","title":"操作：安装完成后进入房间查看 Tutti Agent"},{"parent":"a6eb156a-575e-4fcf-8661-cb5d086fdee7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"508b6a76-bb22-4a03-bd6d-73ae1a65ab98","title":"预期：Tutti Agent 出现在 Agent 列表中且登录态被正确继承；房间内设置不显示安装失败；不出现列表中查不到 Tutti Agent"},{"parent":"a6eb156a-575e-4fcf-8661-cb5d086fdee7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0c01a20a-b892-4bfe-9f18-6d4be3908001","title":"备注：#392 #391"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a6eb156a-575e-4fcf-8661-cb5d086fdee7","title":"🔴【P0】安装新包后自动安装未取到登录态"},{"parent":"98ed402a-e2ce-4089-b73e-4f0797df3f7a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0302f769-2865-4c04-9f5c-b37f9276cf52","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"59f83e77-7ecd-4141-b238-ba856cbbc8ff","title":"前置：前置：本地已安装 Codex；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：管理智能体"},{"parent":"0302f769-2865-4c04-9f5c-b37f9276cf52","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"349b67ea-d659-436f-a875-c59f118d6cf2","title":"操作：完成 Codex 登录后立即查看运行时检测结果"},{"parent":"0302f769-2865-4c04-9f5c-b37f9276cf52","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3f42c418-bb3e-48e2-b59d-c1bc4e879912","title":"预期：登录完成后运行时检测直接通过；不需要手动刷新才恢复；若检测确实失败给出具体原因与重试入口而非笼统的运行时设置失败"},{"parent":"0302f769-2865-4c04-9f5c-b37f9276cf52","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a3fd0226-f8d3-4291-bae4-0f1eb96b0e80","title":"备注：#377 #259"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0302f769-2865-4c04-9f5c-b37f9276cf52","title":"🔴【P0】登录账户后显示检测运行时失败"},{"parent":"98ed402a-e2ce-4089-b73e-4f0797df3f7a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"368b8b23-4e43-42f0-97dc-648560cf915d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ce4aac15-ddc8-4751-ba19-8fdd8538d4e9","title":"前置：Claude Code 已安装未登录，已从 Set up 弹窗发起登录"},{"parent":"368b8b23-4e43-42f0-97dc-648560cf915d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df3dd7cf-67f6-4151-89cd-bb71e3a34594","title":"操作：在网页端完成授权后返回 Set up 弹窗，观察 Signed in 步骤的结果"},{"parent":"368b8b23-4e43-42f0-97dc-648560cf915d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c00c599d-641b-4f40-b125-78493016c3b1","title":"预期：Signed in 在网页授权完成后转为通过并展示账号；不出现 context deadline exceeded 之类的登录失败；若检测超时则给出可重试说明，点击 Check again 后能读到真实登录态"},{"parent":"368b8b23-4e43-42f0-97dc-648560cf915d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"84f4c0eb-7c22-4f4b-822d-27b343a6fa46","title":"备注：#19"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"368b8b23-4e43-42f0-97dc-648560cf915d","title":"🔴【P0】网页授权完成后 Signed in 仍判定失败"},{"parent":"98ed402a-e2ce-4089-b73e-4f0797df3f7a","callout":[],"childr