},{"parent":"49c56508-9bdd-4b48-9548-caf948ff24ae","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ad94ca20-671c-42d4-b409-5f6a6de369a6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ec7c114b-306a-4003-9dd5-4ca336f9e4a7","title":"前置：已存在多套第三方配置"},{"parent":"ad94ca20-671c-42d4-b409-5f6a6de369a6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bbc95db4-f03e-48ee-8bd1-3ca1bf9bdf23","title":"操作：从一套配置切换到另一套并发送消息"},{"parent":"ad94ca20-671c-42d4-b409-5f6a6de369a6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2974e0bd-ca59-425a-9da5-0ae469bded60","title":"预期：切换后模型列表与实际请求均使用新配置，/status 中可核对"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ad94ca20-671c-42d4-b409-5f6a6de369a6","title":"🟠【P1】切换第三方配置后生效"},{"parent":"49c56508-9bdd-4b48-9548-caf948ff24ae","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a65fd0a1-b02e-454b-9e19-760fffcf0c1a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fdb30767-337a-4bd3-89ae-2ba1b5102104","title":"前置：该 Agent 支持通过 API Key 配置且已准备有效 Key"},{"parent":"a65fd0a1-b02e-454b-9e19-760fffcf0c1a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8945ceda-efac-4423-952b-5461ae5cfec0","title":"操作：agent配置了API key后启动 Codex"},{"parent":"a65fd0a1-b02e-454b-9e19-760fffcf0c1a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"88460bb5-0fd2-484b-96c0-897b74ae3a99","title":"预期：直接进入会话首页，账号相关功能可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a65fd0a1-b02e-454b-9e19-760fffcf0c1a","title":"🟠【P1】本地未登录官方账号但正常配置API Key（通过cc-switch）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"49c56508-9bdd-4b48-9548-caf948ff24ae","title":"正常场景（7）"},{"parent":"be3de6b8-e879-44dd-90e6-b4a76485da2c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c110ece9-c115-4e25-9f58-021e4f075676","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d25627f8-4617-4061-9718-20864e6d3034","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eb4c3ff2-4636-4474-bab4-5f6d50bdad3d","title":"前置：前置：Codex 已通过 API Key 配置；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：新建会话输入框"},{"parent":"d25627f8-4617-4061-9718-20864e6d3034","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"93e87acf-b45b-4026-90f0-4833fbbbcf8b","title":"操作：发送一条普通文本消息"},{"parent":"d25627f8-4617-4061-9718-20864e6d3034","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6dbe5b1e-69af-4b5c-a9c3-85ae165089d8","title":"预期：消息正常发送并收到回复；不出现 something went wrong 类无信息量报错；若确有失败，错误提示需说明失败环节并提供重试"},{"parent":"d25627f8-4617-4061-9718-20864e6d3034","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6adf4643-048a-42ad-8679-1179fb66ad0c","title":"备注：#20 #319"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d25627f8-4617-4061-9718-20864e6d3034","title":"🔴【P0】API Key 配置下发消息报错"},{"parent":"c110ece9-c115-4e25-9f58-021e4f075676","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c2ab8d34-685e-48d2-b3af-07dd9a39fcb0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"66195025-07fc-4f1a-9f99-91cd0e7be91a","title":"前置：前置：通过 API Key 配置 Codex 与 Claude；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：会话输入框模型下拉"},{"parent":"c2ab8d34-685e-48d2-b3af-07dd9a39fcb0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"69c9b68e-d9fb-45af-8e80-b82d28693270","title":"操作：打开模型下拉查看列表"},{"parent":"c2ab8d34-685e-48d2-b3af-07dd9a39fcb0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"571a314a-b72c-4d07-a8f2-331c48e89bf2","title":"预期：模型列表能正常拉取并展示该配置下全部可用模型，包含通过 API 新增的模型；不出现列表为空或一直加载；选中后可正常发送消息"},{"parent":"c2ab8d34-685e-48d2-b3af-07dd9a39fcb0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"77f4c8c8-8d33-40fb-9ba0-656251f1b41d","title":"备注：#317 #275"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c2ab8d34-685e-48d2-b3af-07dd9a39fcb0","title":"🔴【P0】API Key 配置下模型列表拉取失败"},{"parent":"c110ece9-c115-4e25-9f58-021e4f075676","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bd732d2f-25f4-44d1-823a-3f5359b01953","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f03776e4-bc19-469b-9787-3a815e39cdea","title":"前置：前置：先通过 cc-switch 配置 API Key 并可正常使用；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：cc-switch 切换到官方配置后打开管理智能体"},{"parent":"bd732d2f-25f4-44d1-823a-3f5359b01953","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"52a43c7e-7395-4ff2-9370-7153f9e390aa","title":"操作：切换后刷新管理智能体页面"},{"parent":"bd732d2f-25f4-44d1-823a-3f5359b01953","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f96f3737-cc20-4f7b-9853-34e2a76f2630","title":"预期：管理智能体页面显示的登录状态与本地实际状态一致：本地未登录时显示未登录；不出现本地未登录而页面仍显示已登录，也不出现刷新后仍显示旧状态"},{"parent":"bd732d2f-25f4-44d1-823a-3f5359b01953","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"15b53669-1617-4254-906b-01637231425b","title":"备注：#30 #384"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bd732d2f-25f4-44d1-823a-3f5359b01953","title":"🔴【P0】cc-switch 切到官方配置后状态未同步"},{"parent":"c110ece9-c115-4e25-9f58-021e4f075676","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8ee9f39b-cd87-4931-a82a-90697650599f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2977f469-e446-426e-9865-494d0880943f","title":"前置：前置：已通过 cc-switch 配置过一套 API Key；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：cc-switch 切换配置后进入房间打开模型下拉"},{"parent":"8ee9f39b-cd87-4931-a82a-90697650599f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c99844fc-dacb-4d47-b57e-eedca3de9d59","title":"操作：切换到另一套配置后查看模型列表"},{"parent":"8ee9f39b-cd87-4931-a82a-90697650599f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0788405d-b1e6-4cc8-8967-5276fe2279fd","title":"预期：模型列表按当前生效配置刷新，展示新配置下可用的模型；不沿用切换前缓存的旧配置；选择模型后发送消息由新配置的网关处理并能正常回复"},{"parent":"8ee9f39b-cd87-4931-a82a-90697650599f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5d5b4cc9-8145-4ac2-944d-5f88a4832e23","title":"备注：#7 #317"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8ee9f39b-cd87-4931-a82a-90697650599f","title":"🔴【P0】切换配置后模型未及时更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c110ece9-c115-4e25-9f58-021e4f075676","title":"异常场景（4）"},{"parent":"be3de6b8-e879-44dd-90e6-b4a76485da2c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"332c6373-d0e5-4de1-8065-371c2d6f2b59","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9f84f5bb-7423-436b-8271-f3206e913e4a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9379c3e6-d092-4a89-8076-c4931704b912","title":"前置：持有有效 API Key"},{"parent":"9f84f5bb-7423-436b-8271-f3206e913e4a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c18dc804-e488-467f-ba04-cd51c5bd8de0","title":"操作：粘贴带有首尾空格的 Key 并保存"},{"parent":"9f84f5bb-7423-436b-8271-f3206e913e4a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"77638699-511f-43ed-b383-bcaedbf31473","title":"预期：自动去除首尾空格后正常生效，不因空格判定为无效"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9f84f5bb-7423-436b-8271-f3206e913e4a","title":"🟡【P2】API Key 含首尾空格"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"332c6373-d0e5-4de1-8065-371c2d6f2b59","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"be3de6b8-e879-44dd-90e6-b4a76485da2c","title":"5.7 API Key 与第三方配置"},{"parent":"204384d9-744c-42f7-96a0-aa8d73804a15","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bada5cc0-0f4c-4671-95bc-2a24ab7e1db7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7762ba7a-a1d0-43b5-92cd-00cc5e3ab29b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0180f6f3-a56f-403d-8e79-7a3e05b19e2b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0cf5f234-a014-48b8-b75f-690b287d07d6","title":"前置：该 Agent 已掉登录态"},{"parent":"0180f6f3-a56f-403d-8e79-7a3e05b19e2b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"da22d167-e755-482e-92a0-28262f8bc0d7","title":"操作：按提示重新完成登录"},{"parent":"0180f6f3-a56f-403d-8e79-7a3e05b19e2b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cfe11af8-2b48-40b2-979e-867458454707","title":"预期：状态恢复为可用；此前中断的会话可继续或有明确的处理说明"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0180f6f3-a56f-403d-8e79-7a3e05b19e2b","title":"🟠【P1】重新登录后恢复可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7762ba7a-a1d0-43b5-92cd-00cc5e3ab29b","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"bada5cc0-0f4c-4671-95bc-2a24ab7e1db7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"de3b057d-a973-48b9-be09-63283ce42b55","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"86eebc5c-6d7a-41ef-a2f7-13057d1a6d3b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a1d2c493-7d03-42a9-85f0-eb9482a064e4","title":"前置：前置：Agent 已登录并在会话中运行；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"86eebc5c-6d7a-41ef-a2f7-13057d1a6d3b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"059c2eb5-f314-4983-a3e7-78ae56a5c202","title":"操作：在对话过程中让 Agent 所有者本地退出登录，观察会话内提示"},{"parent":"86eebc5c-6d7a-41ef-a2f7-13057d1a6d3b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c59d9d2a-5284-42e0-b41e-5a6dee139aa0","title":"预期：会话给出明确提示，说明需要 Agent 所有者在本地登录后重试；不返回 Unknown 或无信息量报错；重新登录后可继续对话，历史消息不丢失"},{"parent":"86eebc5c-6d7a-41ef-a2f7-13057d1a6d3b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"05caa0e0-167e-4338-800d-a7cc6902bfe5","title":"备注：#91 #373 #309"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"86eebc5c-6d7a-41ef-a2f7-13057d1a6d3b","title":"🔴【P0】使用过程中掉登录态的提示"},{"parent":"de3b057d-a973-48b9-be09-63283ce42b55","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3b408338-3f1f-4e7e-9449-e8ab65ea2ee3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0361782d-1107-45c6-b0cd-ee1afee2736e","title":"前置：Agent 此前已完成登录"},{"parent":"3b408338-3f1f-4e7e-9449-e8ab65ea2ee3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7b60749b-d591-4f0c-858f-effa33c45e40","title":"操作：使用已过期 token 检测"},{"parent":"3b408338-3f1f-4e7e-9449-e8ab65ea2ee3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"669e9b7e-feb2-46c2-8c39-f9706da215b8","title":"预期：识别登录失效并提示重新登录，卡片状态不显示为 Available"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3b408338-3f1f-4e7e-9449-e8ab65ea2ee3","title":"🟠【P1】凭据过期"},{"parent":"de3b057d-a973-48b9-be09-63283ce42b55","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b6adb936-f1b2-4901-8609-4f24b075b728","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"58072824-e4a1-47e3-911f-0ca411ccb890","title":"前置：Agent 此前已完成登录"},{"parent":"b6adb936-f1b2-4901-8609-4f24b075b728","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"abdeaeb4-c358-4594-9d3a-84de2b8d7d3b","title":"操作：模拟 token 过期后发送消息"},{"parent":"b6adb936-f1b2-4901-8609-4f24b075b728","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e8c259a-0081-4196-b149-2690cc3eaf85","title":"预期：提示重新登录，登录成功后可继续会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b6adb936-f1b2-4901-8609-4f24b075b728","title":"🟠【P1】登录过期重新认证"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"de3b057d-a973-48b9-be09-63283ce42b55","title":"异常场景（3）"},{"parent":"bada5cc0-0f4c-4671-95bc-2a24ab7e1db7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"52aeec46-41c2-48a0-b769-3236d9f69340","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2530fc69-fb43-4152-91ab-e44fee00002c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fce3bb2c-abba-4675-9a2f-4fb35be2cc62","title":"前置：会话正在执行中"},{"parent":"2530fc69-fb43-4152-91ab-e44fee00002c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d170bdbf-8f99-44a3-a451-d644df3b9e5d","title":"操作：在执行过程中使登录态失效"},{"parent":"2530fc69-fb43-4152-91ab-e44fee00002c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b29a72e0-b9f0-4d6c-9b3f-86d024f95e7b","title":"预期：当前轮次给出明确的中断说明与重新登录入口，已产生的输出保留"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2530fc69-fb43-4152-91ab-e44fee00002c","title":"🟡【P2】会话执行中掉登录态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"52aeec46-41c2-48a0-b769-3236d9f69340","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bada5cc0-0f4c-4671-95bc-2a24ab7e1db7","title":"5.8 掉登录态与凭据失效"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"204384d9-744c-42f7-96a0-aa8d73804a15","title":"5. 登录流程"},{"parent":"3c9df9bc-c66b-4bd5-b536-374e0cafa30a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e59291a7-9863-46da-87a8-1daefecc4841","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"47461b77-2f42-4ab0-bb47-56eee4695000","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"23151489-9c4e-48e3-acb5-6e8ed12d7d36","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a4cd8e14-c3b9-42d4-a409-90d3eb8cf3b6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"154250cc-9a90-4a2d-9212-12dbf3832567","title":"前置：Agent 已安装，已进入 Agent Management 页"},{"parent":"a4cd8e14-c3b9-42d4-a409-90d3eb8cf3b6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"045e779e-84b4-4335-bc57-9692fac52f06","title":"操作：点击该卡片右上角的更多按钮"},{"parent":"a4cd8e14-c3b9-42d4-a409-90d3eb8cf3b6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d1b77c83-4878-4052-be81-b642d45912da","title":"预期：直接弹出标题为 Set up 加该 Agent 名称的弹窗，不先展示下拉菜单；弹窗内自上而下展示各检测步骤、每步的取值明细与底部操作按钮"},{"parent":"a4cd8e14-c3b9-42d4-a409-90d3eb8cf3b6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6192a792-af28-4f75-b72f-e2e25e49b717","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a4cd8e14-c3b9-42d4-a409-90d3eb8cf3b6","title":"🔴【P0】从卡片右上角更多直接打开 Set up 弹窗"},{"parent":"23151489-9c4e-48e3-acb5-6e8ed12d7d36","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"69d6fd72-f268-4e70-a02a-3f2d1e70efbd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fbf7befe-3e78-4991-98bb-fe5b29d3dab7","title":"前置：Agent 已安装，Set up 弹窗已打开"},{"parent":"69d6fd72-f268-4e70-a02a-3f2d1e70efbd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3e1a0eb2-2521-46f8-adba-5146ce7e395f","title":"操作：对照弹窗内的步骤列表与卡片上的 Availability Check 三步"},{"parent":"69d6fd72-f268-4e70-a02a-3f2d1e70efbd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aef47e47-f373-43ac-8df3-1de11857c532","title":"预期：弹窗展示的是同一套检测的明细视图，卡片三步能在弹窗中找到对应步骤；两处对同一步骤的通过与失败结论一致"},{"parent":"69d6fd72-f268-4e70-a02a-3f2d1e70efbd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d948599f-7e94-4e87-9f09-17a2337dd851","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"69d6fd72-f268-4e70-a02a-3f2d1e70efbd","title":"🔴【P0】弹窗步骤与卡片三步的对应关系"},{"parent":"23151489-9c4e-48e3-acb5-6e8ed12d7d36","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"995b4234-8b50-492d-b5fb-1bcc4a686d0e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae99b13e-09b5-46bf-9cfa-5ade3f649f86","title":"前置：Set up 弹窗已打开且检测已完成"},{"parent":"995b4234-8b50-492d-b5fb-1bcc4a686d0e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7bf3846-3df4-4715-808f-cd1d817c1669","title":"操作：点击弹窗右上角的关闭按钮"},{"parent":"995b4234-8b50-492d-b5fb-1bcc4a686d0e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3290cb33-7064-4adf-b9bf-f6ea6f13472e","title":"预期：弹窗关闭并回到 Agent Management 页；卡片保留本次检测的结果，不被重置为未知；再次打开弹窗展示的仍是最新结果"},{"parent":"995b4234-8b50-492d-b5fb-1bcc4a686d0e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e5ef0337-71ce-45c8-a5af-4f2558b035de","title":"备注：卡片右上角更多入口打开的 Set up 弹窗"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"995b4234-8b50-492d-b5fb-1bcc4a686d0e","title":"🟠【P1】点击 X 关闭 Set up 弹窗"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"23151489-9c4e-48e3-acb5-6e8ed12d7d36","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"47461b77-2f42-4ab0-bb47-56eee4695000","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"64f5d740-55ce-493e-8fd9-e006c43b4973","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f57aa606-2cbe-4cd6-9011-93716e5d99eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9abb50fd-6664-4d4c-be6e-446ead2a1fdb","title":"前置：Set up 弹窗已打开且检测正在进行中"},{"parent":"f57aa606-2cbe-4cd6-9011-93716e5d99eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"692b58f1-b6a3-4169-8585-8d5a524bf2d6","title":"操作：在检测未完成时点击右上角 X 关闭弹窗，稍后重新打开"},{"parent":"f57aa606-2cbe-4cd6-9011-93716e5d99eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e0c0c031-fcd9-4448-a36f-47da6f60cea4","title":"预期：关闭后不再更新已销毁的界面且无未处理异常；重新打开时展示真实的检测结果或可重新触发检测，不停留在永久进行中"},{"parent":"f57aa606-2cbe-4cd6-9011-93716e5d99eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5e6fbe1-e9ac-47d3-abb5-8ec7410ce07c","title":"备注：卡片右上角更多入口打开的 Set up 弹窗"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f57aa606-2cbe-4cd6-9011-93716e5d99eb","title":"🟠【P1】检测未完成时关闭 Set up 弹窗"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"64f5d740-55ce-493e-8fd9-e006c43b4973","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"47461b77-2f42-4ab0-bb47-56eee4695000","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"353202ab-8f28-4352-b183-7acc7ade7dde","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"906e5ea3-d9e7-4fb4-9d1d-1ed516a05dce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a49e7fad-d668-4ac7-a02c-8592872b493b","title":"前置：两个 Agent 均已安装"},{"parent":"906e5ea3-d9e7-4fb4-9d1d-1ed516a05dce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e7e4954a-3839-475d-b73f-1047b8dee850","title":"操作：打开其中一个 Agent 的 Set up 弹窗后，不关闭直接点击另一张卡片的更多按钮"},{"parent":"906e5ea3-d9e7-4fb4-9d1d-1ed516a05dce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"15152c13-21e1-4339-821b-307bfafc5774","title":"预期：同一时刻只保留一个弹窗，且弹窗标题与内容与最后点击的 Agent 一致；不出现弹窗叠加或标题与内容分属两个 Agent"},{"parent":"906e5ea3-d9e7-4fb4-9d1d-1ed516a05dce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0de6da96-4b0a-4549-8fb2-b43094e1fc9f","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"906e5ea3-d9e7-4fb4-9d1d-1ed516a05dce","title":"🟡【P2】同时对多个卡片打开 Set up 弹窗"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"353202ab-8f28-4352-b183-7acc7ade7dde","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"47461b77-2f42-4ab0-bb47-56eee4695000","title":"6.1 弹窗入口与整体框架"},{"parent":"e59291a7-9863-46da-87a8-1daefecc4841","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a375ad57-5878-4701-9947-53e50ac93ecb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"878c4073-8583-48fc-af4f-ba273bdb91b9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bff20da8-3c0b-40a4-b9a5-f80dc47d1a4e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ab7db79e-afe2-40fc-92d2-9da0855bf538","title":"前置：Agent 已安装且已登录，Set up 弹窗已打开"},{"parent":"bff20da8-3c0b-40a4-b9a5-f80dc47d1a4e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a805272e-6ab5-47a9-bf18-93dae33001a1","title":"操作：依次查看每个步骤下方展示的字段"},{"parent":"bff20da8-3c0b-40a4-b9a5-f80dc47d1a4e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5f4480d3-a8eb-418b-b95a-0bc739ed7d98","title":"预期：环境相关步骤展示安装源、服务 API 与代理；运行时步骤展示版本与安装路径；登录相关步骤展示登录方式与当前账号；各字段取值与本机实际情况一致"},{"parent":"bff20da8-3c0b-40a4-b9a5-f80dc47d1a4e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5269874a-01ca-4703-8eab-2fecbd6ce34a","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bff20da8-3c0b-40a4-b9a5-f80dc47d1a4e","title":"🔴【P0】各步骤在弹窗内展示完整取值明细"},{"parent":"878c4073-8583-48fc-af4f-ba273bdb91b9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"223789d3-93cf-4783-9fa3-1abd536f0d81","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"db75246a-83e8-4749-82ca-a148910cd564","title":"前置：Agent 已安装，Set up 弹窗刚打开"},{"parent":"223789d3-93cf-4783-9fa3-1abd536f0d81","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bdbcc347-296b-4a36-a5c9-7b315d9029aa","title":"操作：观察各步骤从进行中到出结果的过程"},{"parent":"223789d3-93cf-4783-9fa3-1abd536f0d81","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2567466e-1297-48c1-aa47-45d7817501d4","title":"预期：无需手动点击即自动执行，各步骤按顺序由进行中变为通过或失败；已出结果的步骤不被后续步骤覆盖"},{"parent":"223789d3-93cf-4783-9fa3-1abd536f0d81","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"55fdbfcb-9376-4998-a4da-3e2418ab9fad","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"223789d3-93cf-4783-9fa3-1abd536f0d81","title":"🔴【P0】打开弹窗后自动执行检测并逐步更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"878c4073-8583-48fc-af4f-ba273bdb91b9","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"a375ad57-5878-4701-9947-53e50ac93ecb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"27fc3547-e9ec-453b-b121-33c8403c2969","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e6931458-4dcb-4a15-bc84-4cf07e20670f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"02e829cb-f631-46ad-a77f-1bb29a853a2d","title":"前置：Agent 已安装且其中一步会失败，Set up 弹窗已打开"},{"parent":"e6931458-4dcb-4a15-bc84-4cf07e20670f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea19f00e-65d2-4978-98dc-9ff3acd28890","title":"操作：查看失败步骤的图标与其下方的描述区域"},{"parent":"e6931458-4dcb-4a15-bc84-4cf07e20670f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b350adbb-2b6b-44e2-90f5-defb8bd93cd9","title":"预期：该步标记为失败并在自己的描述区给出具体原因与恢复建议；其余步骤不展示该错误，也不在弹窗顶部另行汇总报错"},{"parent":"e6931458-4dcb-4a15-bc84-4cf07e20670f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"081ed810-d693-4fd9-be50-85985a231745","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e6931458-4dcb-4a15-bc84-4cf07e20670f","title":"🔴【P0】某一步失败时在弹窗内的原因展示"},{"parent":"27fc3547-e9ec-453b-b121-33c8403c2969","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b9b5db55-c86b-4f1b-be43-72965661e7dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2c8fe3cc-8a70-4525-a9f8-6886a94fb6d8","title":"前置：Agent 已安装但取不到版本号或安装路径，Set up 弹窗已打开"},{"parent":"b9b5db55-c86b-4f1b-be43-72965661e7dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"442510f4-2654-4508-8021-1bf03a74703d","title":"操作：查看该步骤下方的字段"},{"parent":"b9b5db55-c86b-4f1b-be43-72965661e7dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d275deed-290d-498e-a722-540ce93cf252","title":"预期：缺失字段展示为安全占位；不展示 undefined、null 或空行，也不导致该步骤整块不渲染"},{"parent":"b9b5db55-c86b-4f1b-be43-72965661e7dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fbb64b81-bce5-427a-aaac-6a98c944ab69","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b9b5db55-c86b-4f1b-be43-72965661e7dc","title":"🟠【P1】取值缺失时字段的占位展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"27fc3547-e9ec-453b-b121-33c8403c2969","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"a375ad57-5878-4701-9947-53e50ac93ecb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bc4794d1-0eb7-41ea-8a3e-60ab4ec5a903","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fd0001c5-a86f-40cb-90a1-f3e4f92163f9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a0f8f8b7-7aa1-4028-98ba-b4301c5fae88","title":"前置：多个步骤均失败并展示了较长的失败原因，Set up 弹窗已打开"},{"parent":"fd0001c5-a86f-40cb-90a1-f3e4f92163f9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bb81a6b3-942c-4f8e-ba7f-4cf005bbb6ce","title":"操作：在弹窗内上下滚动查看全部内容"},{"parent":"fd0001c5-a86f-40cb-90a1-f3e4f92163f9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7d808c7d-2189-4cd1-85df-c9b08cd6489a","title":"预期：内容区可滚动且底部操作按钮保持可见可点击；滚动过程中标题与按钮不错位"},{"parent":"fd0001c5-a86f-40cb-90a1-f3e4f92163f9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"601a4647-7970-4249-ba42-0dd90fdedbdd","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fd0001c5-a86f-40cb-90a1-f3e4f92163f9","title":"🟡【P2】弹窗内容超出高度时的滚动"},{"parent":"bc4794d1-0eb7-41ea-8a3e-60ab4ec5a903","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9da1696a-a4a7-4b9d-8f7f-b04a55791cde","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fe411028-4bb0-4f29-bdbc-842336c00070","title":"前置：该 Agent 的安装路径或安装源地址超过弹窗宽度，Set up 弹窗已打开"},{"parent":"9da1696a-a4a7-4b9d-8f7f-b04a55791cde","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ec689ac9-5615-4a3f-b347-8dd0e49cf514","title":"操作：查看对应字段"},{"parent":"9da1696a-a4a7-4b9d-8f7f-b04a55791cde","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"984c48d7-ba42-4775-b2b6-9b5cc2db5ebf","title":"预期：文本截断或换行且可查看完整值；不撑破弹窗宽度，也不把底部按钮挤出可视区域"},{"parent":"9da1696a-a4a7-4b9d-8f7f-b04a55791cde","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e45febb-ef46-4904-9a6d-19c4d60731a9","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9da1696a-a4a7-4b9d-8f7f-b04a55791cde","title":"🟡【P2】超长路径与地址在弹窗内的展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bc4794d1-0eb7-41ea-8a3e-60ab4ec5a903","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a375ad57-5878-4701-9947-53e50ac93ecb","title":"6.2 检测步骤与取值展示"},{"parent":"e59291a7-9863-46da-87a8-1daefecc4841","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5e798ce6-eca8-4811-908e-d6dacf7af58f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"54f0bdf1-508f-4188-aac1-a6edd58c6cf1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9e5b2b17-1041-4cf7-8c35-12a5acc00609","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fed6ab5f-f4e0-490b-8c7c-64eb71d14bd5","title":"前置：Agent 已安装，Set up 弹窗已打开"},{"parent":"9e5b2b17-1041-4cf7-8c35-12a5acc00609","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ec04f481-4040-4cbe-aaad-db44747f498d","title":"操作：查看 Sign-in method 步骤下方列出的登录方式"},{"parent":"9e5b2b17-1041-4cf7-8c35-12a5acc00609","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"78df8259-da5c-4f71-8783-cf03e1356e5d","title":"预期：列出该 Agent 实际支持的登录方式，各项可点击；已登录时标注当前使用的方式与账号；不同 Agent 展示各自支持的方式，互不串用"},{"parent":"9e5b2b17-1041-4cf7-8c35-12a5acc00609","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"216171a4-a872-4b93-be2e-4aee060f27d0","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9e5b2b17-1041-4cf7-8c35-12a5acc00609","title":"🔴【P0】Sign-in method 展示该 Agent 支持的登录方式"},{"parent":"54f0bdf1-508f-4188-aac1-a6edd58c6cf1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f716516b-e0b7-48c9-b358-4040bf1f5d2b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"caa005f8-efbf-40b3-9f9e-bf39ccea8faa","title":"前置：Agent 已安装但未登录，Set up 弹窗已打开"},{"parent":"f716516b-e0b7-48c9-b358-4040bf1f5d2b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"62afc65f-7d62-4066-a9ce-31d5628bd058","title":"操作：在 Sign-in method 下选择一种登录方式并完成授权"},{"parent":"f716516b-e0b7-48c9-b358-4040bf1f5d2b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"94a10998-1056-4b13-b0b3-7a7f9ea2e5a6","title":"预期：拉起对应方式的登录流程；完成后弹窗内该步骤变为已登录并展示账号，同时卡片上的 Signed in 与状态文案同步更新为 Available"},{"parent":"f716516b-e0b7-48c9-b358-4040bf1f5d2b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f00be0c1-7684-4457-a9e7-e71e8acd059a","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f716516b-e0b7-48c9-b358-4040bf1f5d2b","title":"🔴【P0】从 Sign-in method 直接发起登录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"54f0bdf1-508f-4188-aac1-a6edd58c6cf1","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"5e798ce6-eca8-4811-908e-d6dacf7af58f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"96779785-8810-4bdc-8710-24b0ee48b11a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cc6ee489-5f16-4fde-a534-5959f8192e6f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4134151b-a68f-427c-a9f0-bd55943fcb2f","title":"前置：前置：本地已安装 Claude Code 且未登录；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：管理智能体登录选项中的第三方平台"},{"parent":"cc6ee489-5f16-4fde-a534-5959f8192e6f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"84944f92-e865-4098-8437-cdb960b99fd1","title":"操作：点击第三方平台登录选项"},{"parent":"cc6ee489-5f16-4fde-a534-5959f8192e6f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2beb019a-2db7-4284-b750-7a1bf28971e7","title":"预期：点击后打开对应的第三方登录流程或明确提示不可用；不出现点击无任何反应；返回后可继续选择其他登录方式"},{"parent":"cc6ee489-5f16-4fde-a534-5959f8192e6f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5f4ec5ad-90cb-4828-b7d0-88dde7f3c919","title":"备注：#9"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cc6ee489-5f16-4fde-a534-5959f8192e6f","title":"🔴【P0】第三方平台登录入口点击无反应"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"96779785-8810-4bdc-8710-24b0ee48b11a","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"5e798ce6-eca8-4811-908e-d6dacf7af58f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"544faa50-9695-4c4c-b9bb-a7eb91534415","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"44c2d87f-069e-4f1d-86f2-b94fd78cc617","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aae5ca96-4555-4243-852f-c12738338307","title":"前置：Agent 已通过其中一种方式登录，Set up 弹窗已打开"},{"parent":"44c2d87f-069e-4f1d-86f2-b94fd78cc617","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"17094640-1063-4096-97ee-40d0c02533c9","title":"操作：在 Sign-in method 下改选另一种登录方式并完成授权"},{"parent":"44c2d87f-069e-4f1d-86f2-b94fd78cc617","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"187c92a0-ab29-48b6-b60f-91555154bee5","title":"预期：登录方式与账号按最后一次授权结果更新，旧方式的凭据被正确替换或按规则保留；不出现两种方式同时标记为当前生效"},{"parent":"44c2d87f-069e-4f1d-86f2-b94fd78cc617","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c0a8de9a-94ed-45a1-bcb8-57b2beb37ffa","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"44c2d87f-069e-4f1d-86f2-b94fd78cc617","title":"🟡【P2】在 Sign-in method 中切换到另一种登录方式"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"544faa50-9695-4c4c-b9bb-a7eb91534415","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5e798ce6-eca8-4811-908e-d6dacf7af58f","title":"6.3 Sign-in method 登录方式"},{"parent":"e59291a7-9863-46da-87a8-1daefecc4841","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cb0af99b-9e38-438f-bab8-f85d51e1cf77","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9794193f-965f-4e3d-90d9-82e968ff6da8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0dd57815-f47e-4c66-8bd5-0b43acd94172","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ff161738-843b-43bb-b536-41924afdb446","title":"前置：Agent 已安装，Set up 弹窗已打开"},{"parent":"0dd57815-f47e-4c66-8bd5-0b43acd94172","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c63cba76-e8b7-4b91-8c7b-65fc379c5956","title":"操作：点击运行时安装行右侧的 Uninstall managed runtime 并确认"},{"parent":"0dd57815-f47e-4c66-8bd5-0b43acd94172","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c162edf5-8694-40be-93a0-1264a93e7b61","title":"预期：该 Agent 的托管运行时被卸载；关闭弹窗后卡片回退为未安装态，检测区变为 Not setup yet，底部按钮变为 Install"},{"parent":"0dd57815-f47e-4c66-8bd5-0b43acd94172","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"02aeda33-b231-406c-bfc6-e36243d7b6ca","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0dd57815-f47e-4c66-8bd5-0b43acd94172","title":"🔴【P0】从弹窗点击 Uninstall managed runtime 卸载运行时"},{"parent":"9794193f-965f-4e3d-90d9-82e968ff6da8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9532a3e7-5e42-46d7-8250-f0f298349313","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"02326d02-c5bf-4918-b61c-6c68d1c90315","title":"前置：Agent 已安装，Set up 弹窗已打开且检测已完成"},{"parent":"9532a3e7-5e42-46d7-8250-f0f298349313","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6943f4e2-5be7-4877-b6ba-e00f375d3c65","title":"操作：修复某一失败项后点击弹窗内的 Check again"},{"parent":"9532a3e7-5e42-46d7-8250-f0f298349313","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"99f26d37-8e1f-4c59-9515-bfa5b8050058","title":"预期：全部步骤重新执行且过程中有明确的进行中态；完成后按最新结果更新各步状态，已修复的步骤由失败变为通过且描述区错误被清除"},{"parent":"9532a3e7-5e42-46d7-8250-f0f298349313","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"56cfe0e5-628d-45b8-86aa-9d09125f1caa","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9532a3e7-5e42-46d7-8250-f0f298349313","title":"🔴【P0】在弹窗内点击 Check again 重新执行检测"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9794193f-965f-4e3d-90d9-82e968ff6da8","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"cb0af99b-9e38-438f-bab8-f85d51e1cf77","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2e7e3f64-8674-40a3-a6a6-f9798209d43f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"19942e6e-38ed-4bd0-8e77-bb22551892c6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ffce79d-4226-4c07-9b69-79f89c57f82b","title":"前置：Agent 已安装，运行时文件被占用导致无法删除"},{"parent":"19942e6e-38ed-4bd0-8e77-bb22551892c6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f0798e28-993b-48a5-a975-4337a0db97f4","title":"操作：在 Set up 弹窗中点击 Uninstall managed runtime 并等待结果"},{"parent":"19942e6e-38ed-4bd0-8e77-bb22551892c6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13daf6f7-4d03-4c92-838b-4c94ba85847c","title":"预期：给出可读的失败原因与重试入口；卡片状态保持为卸载前的已安装态，不出现界面显示已卸载但本地文件仍在"},{"parent":"19942e6e-38ed-4bd0-8e77-bb22551892c6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5f151d63-ffec-4ca9-abb4-cb48680a9afa","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"19942e6e-38ed-4bd0-8e77-bb22551892c6","title":"🟠【P1】卸载运行时失败时的提示与状态"},{"parent":"2e7e3f64-8674-40a3-a6a6-f9798209d43f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f5af80c2-f002-4a3b-9b47-3507546876f4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c743af23-06e9-4d9a-a19e-890e559e5ba8","title":"前置：Set up 弹窗已打开且检测正在进行"},{"parent":"f5af80c2-f002-4a3b-9b47-3507546876f4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c92c24c8-a3b9-464a-ad01-58794c242a9e","title":"操作：在检测未结束时点击 Check again"},{"parent":"f5af80c2-f002-4a3b-9b47-3507546876f4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5d34375-ee05-4635-9b03-cb5c4b438a8d","title":"预期：按钮处于进行中且不可重复触发，或以最后一次触发为准；不出现两轮检测结果交叉写入导致步骤状态错乱"},{"parent":"f5af80c2-f002-4a3b-9b47-3507546876f4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f705af91-0321-46ac-be1e-3c0614900691","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f5af80c2-f002-4a3b-9b47-3507546876f4","title":"🟠【P1】检测进行中点击 Check again"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2e7e3f64-8674-40a3-a6a6-f9798209d43f","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"cb0af99b-9e38-438f-bab8-f85d51e1cf77","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e46fadb7-80c8-4e1c-9604-89d415cfd707","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ae9c7f34-3b97-4c6f-8840-cedddb30bda3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c11acd71-e2ee-492d-ac38-e584b2f03bfe","title":"前置：该 Agent 未安装"},{"parent":"ae9c7f34-3b97-4c6f-8840-cedddb30bda3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"446bf933-85b3-4805-b298-8d7091cf7472","title":"操作：打开该卡片的 Set up 弹窗并查看底部与各行的操作按钮"},{"parent":"ae9c7f34-3b97-4c6f-8840-cedddb30bda3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb6c1ec4-7b27-44f5-a72e-e2f47139daaa","title":"预期：按产品规则提供安装入口，且不展示 Uninstall managed runtime；不出现可点击但实际无对应运行时可卸载的按钮"},{"parent":"ae9c7f34-3b97-4c6f-8840-cedddb30bda3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aea81fed-62e5-4414-ae2e-bcaef751a026","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ae9c7f34-3b97-4c6f-8840-cedddb30bda3","title":"🟡【P2】未安装状态下弹窗内按钮的组合"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e46fadb7-80c8-4e1c-9604-89d415cfd707","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cb0af99b-9e38-438f-bab8-f85d51e1cf77","title":"6.4 弹窗内操作按钮"},{"parent":"e59291a7-9863-46da-87a8-1daefecc4841","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0b8a9906-df20-41b5-92b9-62860a774fd2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5fd13e05-6af5-4331-9ca9-dc02f5369ad7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6c706ba6-a158-468f-9539-24c482465360","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"97fbd956-ced2-4274-8241-6d1a295f83b7","title":"前置：Agent 已安装，卡片与 Set up 弹窗可同时对照"},{"parent":"6c706ba6-a158-468f-9539-24c482465360","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d3fb2c29-63e8-4ba9-95cb-2a59890894cf","title":"操作：对照卡片 CLI &amp; Adapter 下的版本与路径和弹窗内运行时步骤展示的版本与路径"},{"parent":"6c706ba6-a158-468f-9539-24c482465360","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b949edea-5eb4-48b0-879d-f12de20bd76b","title":"预期：两处展示的版本号与路径完全一致；不出现一处为旧值一处为新值"},{"parent":"6c706ba6-a158-468f-9539-24c482465360","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d61c1216-65f6-40a9-aac0-8d6bde7ed600","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6c706ba6-a158-468f-9539-24c482465360","title":"🔴【P0】卡片与弹窗展示的版本与路径一致"},{"parent":"5fd13e05-6af5-4331-9ca9-dc02f5369ad7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5a6e1a6a-29dd-4fa7-95fa-d8931fcb4eb8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"89541b96-4d7f-4f9f-a892-2e035ec9ffe8","title":"前置：Agent 已安装，某一步此前在卡片上为失败"},{"parent":"5a6e1a6a-29dd-4fa7-95fa-d8931fcb4eb8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13ae9911-ae1e-4f78-aafa-d41034f3aa4a","title":"操作：在弹窗内修复并点击 Check again 通过后关闭弹窗，查看卡片"},{"parent":"5a6e1a6a-29dd-4fa7-95fa-d8931fcb4eb8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"46e71b64-c9b4-4634-8bdf-01c586e58014","title":"预期：卡片上对应步骤同步变为通过，状态文案与底部按钮按最新结果重新计算；不需要再手动点击卡片上的 Re-check"},{"parent":"5a6e1a6a-29dd-4fa7-95fa-d8931fcb4eb8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5ebc4e2f-b221-47a5-940b-e9837d08c2c0","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5a6e1a6a-29dd-4fa7-95fa-d8931fcb4eb8","title":"🔴【P0】弹窗内检测结果同步回卡片"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5fd13e05-6af5-4331-9ca9-dc02f5369ad7","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"0b8a9906-df20-41b5-92b9-62860a774fd2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"89d5e50b-83b9-47d0-9fc9-a23aee67daf5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"90771922-92db-447e-af6a-3a2980294cb0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"418ed70e-6a50-4d6d-8515-00aee0af05f4","title":"前置：Set up 弹窗已打开，同时在终端登出该 Agent"},{"parent":"90771922-92db-447e-af6a-3a2980294cb0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d2be6429-cb93-46c2-99b7-e47d08ae716e","title":"操作：在弹窗内点击 Check again 后关闭弹窗查看卡片"},{"parent":"90771922-92db-447e-af6a-3a2980294cb0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b7bca236-5882-49e5-82ff-869836b07557","title":"预期：弹窗与卡片都更新为未登录，卡片状态变为 Unavailable；不出现弹窗显示已登录而卡片显示未登录的两处不一致"},{"parent":"90771922-92db-447e-af6a-3a2980294cb0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a814aeda-9dd4-42dd-9d37-f15b413d885f","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"90771922-92db-447e-af6a-3a2980294cb0","title":"🟠【P1】弹窗打开期间登录态在外部发生变化"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"89d5e50b-83b9-47d0-9fc9-a23aee67daf5","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"0b8a9906-df20-41b5-92b9-62860a774fd2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"022d7876-a134-4e41-9391-8bd33ada3a91","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6ae3bd3b-2429-482c-82e3-460451156c1d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a7a353f0-2061-45b4-9920-8ac2d6700666","title":"前置：Agent 已安装且检测已完成"},{"parent":"6ae3bd3b-2429-482c-82e3-460451156c1d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"48710c95-4b7d-4f61-a0e2-570249b996c7","title":"操作：连续多次打开并关闭 Set up 弹窗"},{"parent":"6ae3bd3b-2429-482c-82e3-460451156c1d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6fb24c80-2c4f-4a73-b49a-82255cea652d","title":"预期：每次打开展示的都是最新一次的检测结果，卡片状态始终保持不变；不出现每次打开都从零重新检测导致卡片状态短暂回落为未知"},{"parent":"6ae3bd3b-2429-482c-82e3-460451156c1d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"88435632-0292-440f-92d1-2f2ea28752fc","title":"备注：依据卡片右上角更多打开的 Set up 弹窗 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6ae3bd3b-2429-482c-82e3-460451156c1d","title":"🟡【P2】反复开关弹窗时结果不被重置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"022d7876-a134-4e41-9391-8bd33ada3a91","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0b8a9906-df20-41b5-92b9-62860a774fd2","title":"6.5 弹窗与卡片的数据一致性"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e59291a7-9863-46da-87a8-1daefecc4841","title":"6. Set up 弹窗（卡片更多入口）"},{"parent":"3c9df9bc-c66b-4bd5-b536-374e0cafa30a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"05575282-8bf6-45ee-96ee-f7db1f55de8b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0a1fd9c1-c04c-4819-80e9-469c9e34005b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cdb8806a-d751-4dd7-823b-a28fe85ceff4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bb95272c-4e2a-48e8-a11f-583641c49718","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb646e2c-b3a0-48fb-9ae4-f6be9c9f8c10","title":"前置：三个 Agent 均已登录"},{"parent":"bb95272c-4e2a-48e8-a11f-583641c49718","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8cad25ce-0ea0-4927-854f-5620eef58f8a","title":"操作：查看各卡片上的账号、路径、代理与额度信息"},{"parent":"bb95272c-4e2a-48e8-a11f-583641c49718","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9805612e-0675-47d3-9baa-f4af6f7e81c6","title":"预期：只展示账号邮箱、文件路径与代理地址等必要信息；不展示 token、API Key、密码或完整凭据内容"},{"parent":"bb95272c-4e2a-48e8-a11f-583641c49718","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"18be1964-b1da-45d6-8b96-a8ac3384cf02","title":"备注：依据新版 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bb95272c-4e2a-48e8-a11f-583641c49718","title":"🟠【P1】正常状态下卡片不展示敏感凭据"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cdb8806a-d751-4dd7-823b-a28fe85ceff4","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"0a1fd9c1-c04c-4819-80e9-469c9e34005b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c47f461a-a50b-479f-b840-3f05f930b3fb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e20e32d4-acdf-46f2-8598-93831489c83f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b35590b7-5781-445c-905d-3672512ec7bc","title":"前置：已进入 Agent Management 页"},{"parent":"e20e32d4-acdf-46f2-8598-93831489c83f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ff19d94-9739-4f93-b7e9-05e4b77c9350","title":"操作：在 PATH 前置同名但非目标 CLI 的程序"},{"parent":"e20e32d4-acdf-46f2-8598-93831489c83f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5d198f6b-757d-44b8-996d-808a79933ed6","title":"预期：通过可信特征校验，不将伪造程序判定为合法 CLI"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e20e32d4-acdf-46f2-8598-93831489c83f","title":"🔴【P0】伪造同名程序"},{"parent":"c47f461a-a50b-479f-b840-3f05f930b3fb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1bcaad6f-b9eb-4bef-a45a-36fb2dde2ae3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b10da13b-1a6d-473f-8acc-ba513fecc76e","title":"前置：账号 A 已在管理页查看过各 Agent 状态"},{"parent":"1bcaad6f-b9eb-4bef-a45a-36fb2dde2ae3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f4514c8a-8544-4ebd-956e-dc3c6f7cd83a","title":"操作：退出账号 A 并登录账号 B，重新进入 Agent Management 页"},{"parent":"1bcaad6f-b9eb-4bef-a45a-36fb2dde2ae3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d26a455f-addc-427a-8fb5-a35c1eaa1fb9","title":"预期：不短暂闪现账号 A 的邮箱、CLI 路径、代理地址或额度数据"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1bcaad6f-b9eb-4bef-a45a-36fb2dde2ae3","title":"🟠【P1】切换账号后重新进入管理页的数据残留"},{"parent":"c47f461a-a50b-479f-b840-3f05f930b3fb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"18a27d06-148f-4d57-bc81-83e77f504151","