：已登录且卡片上展示了路径与账号信息"},{"parent":"7db8467a-ecbc-4f85-839b-585312a544c4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5ac1eb7d-67f0-40ed-bd5f-015280dfdd97","title":"操作：尝试选中并复制卡片上的检测信息"},{"parent":"7db8467a-ecbc-4f85-839b-585312a544c4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5e66008c-2b24-4c87-b59d-a6bfe8f441c4","title":"预期：复制到的内容与界面展示一致，不额外带出未展示的凭据字段"},{"parent":"7db8467a-ecbc-4f85-839b-585312a544c4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"88bd593e-2826-4c77-8230-0d1ec7455d6e","title":"备注：依据新版 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7db8467a-ecbc-4f85-839b-585312a544c4","title":"🟡【P2】复制卡片信息时的内容范围"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f9af14a3-576c-45e9-bb11-3aa77fb83f60","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0a1fd9c1-c04c-4819-80e9-469c9e34005b","title":"7.1 敏感信息与安全"},{"parent":"05575282-8bf6-45ee-96ee-f7db1f55de8b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"70f059d9-b8c4-4308-aa36-3a155d3d4a80","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0e653e64-a16f-4cc2-a6c9-451f683a684c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f0b06701-963a-491a-be55-6e374f100d43","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0a1db675-a244-42ce-bdf5-e9dd0893daef","title":"前置：已进入 Agent Management 页"},{"parent":"f0b06701-963a-491a-be55-6e374f100d43","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d758e6e5-5935-4cfe-ad91-4d09ff4c0d1a","title":"操作：使用屏幕阅读器浏览额度和检测项"},{"parent":"f0b06701-963a-491a-be55-6e374f100d43","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae530954-533c-42cb-8c19-f92f6c52ee0e","title":"预期：可朗读周期、百分比、重置时间、检测状态及按钮名称"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f0b06701-963a-491a-be55-6e374f100d43","title":"🟠【P1】读屏语义"},{"parent":"0e653e64-a16f-4cc2-a6c9-451f683a684c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4241e69d-3b2f-4e23-a331-e7dd5f566e5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"adf4c206-df64-41e3-b74f-a5fafcd50365","title":"前置：已进入 Agent Management 页"},{"parent":"4241e69d-3b2f-4e23-a331-e7dd5f566e5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b22ba5b0-6c36-4412-b168-2d60fa6c7ec4","title":"操作：使用 Tab、Enter、Space 和 Esc 操作入口、复制、登录、重检和关闭"},{"parent":"4241e69d-3b2f-4e23-a331-e7dd5f566e5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e723