"},{"parent":"bf1761c2-1f1c-4be5-a89c-98be18b5430d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"abae569c-3f41-4096-be7d-6e17bdbf228e","title":"操作：查看卡片各区域的标题与按钮"},{"parent":"bf1761c2-1f1c-4be5-a89c-98be18b5430d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7d5119cc-916b-4bfc-85eb-f6a95a41caab","title":"预期：缺失项回退到默认语言并可读，不展示文案键名或空白"},{"parent":"bf1761c2-1f1c-4be5-a89c-98be18b5430d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3bcb2e36-45ff-4891-b6ba-07e69a79d83e","title":"备注：依据新版 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bf1761c2-1f1c-4be5-a89c-98be18b5430d","title":"🟠【P1】语言包缺失时的文案兜底"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"176a5a5f-72f4-4eef-9587-745b201b3fb4","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"7e1a79c6-67fb-430f-a8e7-59d6757651d4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1eb77a80-6b9d-4e87-90a3-5ac92fa54d1f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a68cf4d0-ff2b-463c-9987-5faaf6e7a1b6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5508560f-7fc5-479d-a4cb-e9d04c63c8a9","title":"前置：已进入 Agent Management 页"},{"parent":"a68cf4d0-ff2b-463c-9987-5faaf6e7a1b6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eee0f4dc-a3ec-410e-9cf9-b8a5cd9d92ca","title":"操作：在 macOS、Windows 和 Linux 路径格式下检测"},{"parent":"a68cf4d0-ff2b-463c-9987-5faaf6e7a1b6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c009a767-6a07-4191-9752-fb468e95504e","title":"预期：路径识别和展示符合平台规则，不硬编码 macOS 路径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a68cf4d0-ff2b-463c-9987-5faaf6e7a1b6","title":"🟡【P2】不同系统路径格式"},{"parent":"1eb77a80-6b9d-4e87-90a3-5ac92fa54d1f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f68934a0-9c6d-4da2-a4d6-d0c6cc661420","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"032c276e-3c15-4c15-8c3c-7e5079563bcc","title":"前置：已进入 Agent Management 页"},{"parent":"f68934a0-9c6d-4da2-a4d6-d0c6cc661420","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c95fdf5-7f31-4382-a45c-afb33f996a8b","title":"操作：在不同语言、地区和时区环境检测"},{"parent":"f68934a0-9c6d-4da2-a4d6-d0c6cc661420","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0fcdbc75-fc7c-4701-8520-40666e28d9f3","title":"预期：环境识别不受显示语言影响，错误文案正确本地化"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f68934a0-9c6d-4da2-a4d6-d0c6cc661420","title":"🟡【P2】系统区域与语言"},{"parent":"1eb77a80-6b9d-4e87-90a3-5ac92fa54d1f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"30ffc43c-ba7f-4517-94b5-a70086bf9b8c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c9f459c7-252d-475a-a0d8-a37ca7d144a0","title":"前置：已进入 Agent Management 页"},{"parent":"30ffc43c-ba7f-4517-94b5-a70086bf9b8c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6cadb054-8bce-48e4-aa38-16cffe9b942a","title":"操作：使用长度约中文三倍的语言包"},{"parent":"30ffc43c-ba7f-4517-94b5-a70086bf9b8c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0fa19cdb-5c9b-4240-b8f8-4a1fb75e353b","title":"预期：标题、说明、按钮和检查项不重叠，必要时换行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"30ffc43c-ba7f-4517-94b5-a70086bf9b8c","title":"🟡【P2】超长本地化文案"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1eb77a80-6b9d-4e87-90a3-5ac92fa54d1f","title":"边界场景（3）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7e1a79c6-67fb-430f-a8e7-59d6757651d4","title":"7.3 多平台与本地化"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"05575282-8bf6-45ee-96ee-f7db1f55de8b","title":"7. 通用质量"},{"parent":"3c9df9bc-c66b-4bd5-b536-374e0cafa30a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8d536672-7281-4fa8-a20a-924824f503ee","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"73af46d7-ffc6-4b9c-9cfb-a64e5522bdeb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"667ae211-ebec-437f-9ea2-a4e9b988bd6c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e7085870-96d6-48ae-be6a-174148a6ac2c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4ceaa30b-0bea-4430-aae6-a085bb645969","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"80448eba-2a91-4df6-b0b8-19faf723d6d6","title":"前置：设备上存在两个可登录的平台账号且各自配置不同"},{"parent":"4ceaa30b-0bea-4430-aae6-a085bb645969","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"da0ee620-81d9-46a9-a711-a8c521d4f25b","title":"操作：退出当前平台账号并登录另一个账号，再进入 Agent Management 页与会话"},{"parent":"4ceaa30b-0bea-4430-aae6-a085bb645969","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"42688a5a-d7d8-4b53-aadf-36caf35cd80f","title":"预期：会话权限、模型额度与历史数据按账号隔离，不串用上一个账号的数据"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4ceaa30b-0bea-4430-aae6-a085bb645969","title":"🔴【P0】切换平台账号后的数据隔离"},{"parent":"e7085870-96d6-48ae-be6a-174148a6ac2c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c43fa717-157a-4dda-8c3c-f0510d814146","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"89a48f67-0a4d-438e-ae9b-557a3cb63e6f","title":"前置：前置：设备上先后使用过两个账号且各自配置不同凭据；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：切换账号后进入房间"},{"parent":"c43fa717-157a-4dda-8c3c-f0510d814146","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4b259d5c-b435-497b-a16f-ca01c8e09679","title":"操作：切换账号后查看模型列表、会话列表与用量"},{"parent":"c43fa717-157a-4dda-8c3c-f0510d814146","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"32547b5c-fd4e-4996-8ef4-511d18fa8f59","title":"预期：模型列表与凭据按当前账号加载；会话列表只展示当前账号可见的会话；用量统计归属当前账号；不出现上一个账号的配置或会话残留"},{"parent":"c43fa717-157a-4dda-8c3c-f0510d814146","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a68fa0fd-5c67-431f-823b-a19e3ea28f17","title":"备注：#384 #30"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c43fa717-157a-4dda-8c3c-f0510d814146","title":"🔴【P0】切换账号后配置与会话不串用"},{"parent":"e7085870-96d6-48ae-be6a-174148a6ac2c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b119204d-7911-4eef-8a78-f0724df8b08d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"75bd7f65-0dc8-4144-b863-d14a9f534179","title":"前置：存在两个账号且各自有不同配置"},{"parent":"b119204d-7911-4eef-8a78-f0724df8b08d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"20db051b-9ae8-498c-ab48-c80267734832","title":"操作：在两个账号间切换并分别查看 Agent 配置与会话列表"},{"parent":"b119204d-7911-4eef-8a78-f0724df8b08d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0aa48fd4-dba6-44ca-8853-71effcd38311","title":"预期：各账号的配置与会话相互独立，不串用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b119204d-7911-4eef-8a78-f0724df8b08d","title":"🔴【P0】切换账号后配置独立"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e7085870-96d6-48ae-be6a-174148a6ac2c","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"667ae211-ebec-437f-9ea2-a4e9b988bd6c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4af7a909-60f4-45d0-b71c-0a30b8c9ea9a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"30be8811-ef44-4bea-9516-9518ef96f68c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7138667b-86f5-4dac-966d-4cf80c5cbb04","title":"前置：设备上存在两个可登录账号且各自配置不同"},{"parent":"30be8811-ef44-4bea-9516-9518ef96f68c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a307094c-d279-45d7-9db4-4d65a18923d8","title":"操作：登录成功但账号信息接口失败"},{"parent":"30be8811-ef44-4bea-9516-9518ef96f68c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8369afa7-0828-4bbe-a0da-567a46fcc20a","title":"预期：会话基础功能按产品定义降级，账号区显示加载失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"30be8811-ef44-4bea-9516-9518ef96f68c","title":"🟠【P1】账号数据加载失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4af7a909-60f4-45d0-b71c-0a30b8c9ea9a","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"667ae211-ebec-437f-9ea2-a4e9b988bd6c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"41362104-e59a-4728-b6f4-31166b31f620","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6c76dd1b-58ca-4a83-83b8-fbff8f90e740","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"26752ccb-ac43-48fd-9a0e-05b9c252c9d6","title":"前置：前置：存在两个账号且各自有独立项目与额度；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：账号与项目切换入口"},{"parent":"6c76dd1b-58ca-4a83-83b8-fbff8f90e740","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b55d92a1-166a-43e0-88fb-00d701359746","title":"操作：切换账号后依次查看配置、会话列表、额度与调用日志"},{"parent":"6c76dd1b-58ca-4a83-83b8-fbff8f90e740","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c0269fe0-9367-4e3e-923e-6af0645d4000","title":"预期：配置、会话、额度与日志均按当前账号加载且互不串用；切回原账号后其数据完整恢复；不出现跨账号可见他人会话或额度"},{"parent":"6c76dd1b-58ca-4a83-83b8-fbff8f90e740","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"691538c5-eb5f-4d06-9132-7993119931b3","title":"备注：附件3 CC-046"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6c76dd1b-58ca-4a83-83b8-fbff8f90e740","title":"🟡【P2】切换账号项目租户后的隔离"},{"parent":"41362104-e59a-4728-b6f4-31166b31f620","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e6e97a57-3c69-4aa6-88e2-76aa582aa4c9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c3ff5b03-10f8-485b-b0a1-10be18b6de98","title":"前置：同时打开了两个应用窗口且均已登录"},{"parent":"e6e97a57-3c69-4aa6-88e2-76aa582aa4c9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"91766dbb-9f47-4be3-bae1-049d6fe4eab7","title":"操作：一个窗口退出账号，另一个窗口仍打开会话"},{"parent":"e6e97a57-3c69-4aa6-88e2-76aa582aa4c9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d4095449-2fbf-4657-9368-2551e1c2eb1c","title":"预期：所有窗口同步登录状态或提示刷新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e6e97a57-3c69-4aa6-88e2-76aa582aa4c9","title":"🟡【P2】多窗口账号切换"},{"parent":"41362104-e59a-4728-b6f4-31166b31f620","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"90093ae6-5c47-4e76-b8b2-f076dccc17a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c25a35b-9cf8-49a2-b5b3-7d74b55b0aa8","title":"前置：应用此前已登录，当前设备处于离线"},{"parent":"90093ae6-5c47-4e76-b8b2-f076dccc17a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"25a6eff0-9bef-4bca-a987-bb83d873a996","ti