":"3392b5bc-63a8-46c9-839d-10debc94ff1c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"45f50aae-cead-4060-8da4-460e30d8c13c","title":"操作：分别用三种无效凭证配置后发送一条消息"},{"parent":"3392b5bc-63a8-46c9-839d-10debc94ff1c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"47260b1c-f58f-4349-b2fa-3293b85c2c02","title":"预期：三种情况请求均被拒绝并给出清晰的鉴权失败原因；错误信息与日志中不回显完整密钥；配置回退为可重新填写状态，不影响其他已配置 Agent"},{"parent":"3392b5bc-63a8-46c9-839d-10debc94ff1c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"62dc0ad2-b496-48d9-b545-c1b034592e96","title":"备注：附件3 CC-045"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3392b5bc-63a8-46c9-839d-10debc94ff1c","title":"🟠【P1】使用过期或已撤销凭证"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"847f4a6b-1d79-417f-b13f-42f1d7f0c3fe","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"515b364a-026b-472c-9fe2-5fe43e952068","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"427fc673-a417-4e07-8bed-dcfc96b88a90","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c4fe8dfa-60d5-471d-b607-3e9c96e7644c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3933caa3-a042-400a-afd2-149c55ab0dfd","title":"前置：平台凭证接近过期时间"},{"parent":"c4fe8dfa-60d5-471d-b607-3e9c96e7644c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2ed434b8-7f17-47b4-93ae-8c7ecc354da9","title":"操作：在临近过期时发起一次请求"},{"parent":"c4fe8dfa-60d5-471d-b607-3e9c96e7644c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd8ec7e7-6d97-4dd3-91d8-fdb66f3adfb2","title":"预期：自动续期或提前提示重新登录，不在请求中途因过期直接失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c4fe8dfa-60d5-471d-b607-3e9c96e7644c","title":"🟡【P2】凭证即将过期时的请求"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"427fc673-a417-4e07-8bed-dcfc96b88a90","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"515b364a-026b-472c-9fe2-5fe43e952068","title":"2.1 凭证鉴权与网关路由"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"72b0551c-b001-4012-94f5-2ec90fbe40ae","title":"2. 平台凭证鉴权与路由"},{"parent":"8d536672-7281-4fa8-a20a-924824f503ee","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a686b54c-ba86-4b13-815b-e21fee9fd65c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"94875e9b-9875-4268-8d3d-7d7dcb6abb9c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"43b75397-8386-4820-8471-736a68c6420e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"787f5bfb-6dca-4362-b6d7-1563dc59a09f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cbeb0766-ff53-4818-a16d-29dae4ae4321","title":"前置：Agent 已登录且额度充足"},{"parent":"787f5bfb-6dca-4362-b6d7-1563dc59a09f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"35e2aa52-c2e5-4d88-9169-22ae00da1d57","title":"操作：在会话中发送一条消息"},{"parent":"787f5bfb-6dca-4362-b6d7-1563dc59a09f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"51466c3c-4bf3-4d1d-aba1-e1ddd2dac8f6","title":"预期：消息正常发送并收到回复；用量按本次调用相应扣减并可在卡片上看到变化"},{"parent":"787f5bfb-6dca-4362-b6d7-1563dc59a09f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e0e9465a-4941-4bba-9490-25ba8360f222","title":"备注：依据新版 UI 图新增"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"787f5bfb-6dca-4362-b6d7-1563dc59a09f","title":"🟠【P1】额度充足时的正常调用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"43b75397-8386-4820-8471-736a68c6420e","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"94875e9b-9875-4268-8d3d-7d7dcb6abb9c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5a58d621-1138-4eb5-b3cc-1610cf05e350","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c63f95af-ad12-41d9-9470-5e7259c1d252","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d2798c2f-7d87-41ec-850b-1f336e66256e","title":"前置：Agent 已登录并已进入会话"},{"parent":"c63f95af-ad12-41d9-9470-5e7259c1d252","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ec890f9-439b-45d9-8a22-892e48e2dd7a","title":"操作：账号无权限使用某模型时选择并发送"},{"parent":"c63f95af-ad12-41d9-9470-5e7259c1d252","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b62d7a84-4af2-4b8c-865f-4d6aad603865","title":"预期：提示权限不足并建议切换模型或升级"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c63f95af-ad12-41d9-9470-5e7259c1d252","title":"🟠【P1】权限不足使用模型"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5a58d621-1138-4eb5-b3cc-1610cf05e350","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"94875e9b-9875-4268-8d3d-7d7dcb6abb9c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4a8c8d55-a935-4708-8270-68f1de2dbec1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cfa2e9d1-f8cd-4fcd-aa3d-3229bafedd31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"92c6034e-8f93-457f-b6df-6aacab7b9936","title":"前置：Tutti Agent 已登录且积分为 0"},{"parent":"cfa2e9d1-f8cd-4fcd-aa3d-3229bafedd31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c4c9f6e-6073-4111-af09-6018f52e25ec","title":"操作：发送一条消息"},{"parent":"cfa2e9d1-f8cd-4fcd-aa3d-3229bafedd31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"882903b1-ba4c-455b-b577-1dc9594fb334","title":"预期：拦截并提示积分不足，升级入口指向正确页面，不发出无效请求"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cfa2e9d1-f8cd-4fcd-aa3d-3229bafedd31","title":"🟡【P2】积分恰好为 0 时发起会话"},{"parent":"4a8c8d55-a935-4708-8270-68f1de2dbec1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6ad2ee37-95de-4ae8-bc10-db2aee25b366","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"97f12e2a-3eb7-4066-8650-b2838a5c2168","title":"前置：Agent 已登录并已进入会话"},{"parent":"6ad2ee37-95de-4ae8-bc10-db2aee25b366","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bf48fa16-28e4-4260-bc78-23362066c08f","title":"操作：剩余额度为 0 时发送消息"},{"parent":"6ad2ee37-95de-4ae8-bc10-db2aee25b366","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"36f5a681-0c62-4b5b-beac-eafb1f66543c","title":"预期：阻止或排队到额度恢复，提示清晰"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6ad2ee37-95de-4ae8-bc10-db2aee25b366","title":"🟡【P2】额度刚好用尽"},{"parent":"4a8c8d55-a935-4708-8270-68f1de2dbec1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"19afc0cb-fbac-485e-bdff-0160a9256a56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c9ab36a7-11c8-413e-a938-fa028f1da621","title":"前置：Agent 已登录并已进入会话"},{"parent":"19afc0cb-fbac-485e-bdff-0160a9256a56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"090aa28a-f1b6-44bb-879b-e5b707bf47fc","title":"操作：额度重置时间点前后发送消息"},{"parent":"19afc0cb-fbac-485e-bdff-0160a9256a56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aa09166d-4073-4048-8c6c-6e335c5f531c","title":"预期：额度状态刷新准确，不错误拒绝可用请求"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"19afc0cb-fbac-485e-bdff-0160a9256a56","title":"🟡【P2】额度重置瞬间"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4a8c8d55-a935-4708-8270-68f1de2dbec1","title":"边界场景（3）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"94875e9b-9875-4268-8d3d-7d7dcb6abb9c","title":"3.1 额度耗尽与权限不足"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a686b54c-ba86-4b13-815b-e21fee9fd65c","title":"3. 会话内额度与权限"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8d536672-7281-4fa8-a20a-924824f503ee","title":"账号隔离与凭证路由"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"3c9df9bc-c66b-4bd5-b536-374e0cafa30a","title":"Agent 管理"},{"parent":"df696030-0aa7-4c05-86d4-7cd9e421febb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1f3e577f-f87b-460e-9473-33c399fd28eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"af92e045-89ac-47c2-b8bf-c67ee7f61115","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"28f5bad0-4dcf-4734-a1b3-9bba79647780","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4ada8fd0-31a3-4f1c-ac47-6990a3a5bcba","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a3accf03-de52-4d0b-a9b7-7ff4ef38f15f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"27c7cf98-a339-4128-8bd3-24f0d8cc2a6f","title":"前置：已进入房间且左侧 Agents 面板可见；角色：房间成员；入口：Agents 面板中的 Extensions"},{"parent":"a3accf03-de52-4d0b-a9b7-7ff4ef38f15f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"56d70cab-63ea-4e66-97aa-3efd1acde6b0","title":"操作：点击 Extensions 展开二级菜单，查看其中的条目"},{"parent":"a3accf03-de52-4d0b-a9b7-7ff4ef38f15f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3fea0b99-300c-42a1-9e37-32a088cdd575","title":"预期：展开后显示 Connectors 与 Skills 两个二级条目；再次点击 Extensions 可收起；收起后 Agents 面板下方的 Projects 与会话列表位置随之上移，不出现遮挡或空白"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a3accf03-de52-4d0b-a9b7-7ff4ef38f15f","title":"🔴【P0】Extensions 展开连接器与 Skills 入口"},{"parent":"4ada8fd0-31a3-4f1c-ac47-6990a3a5bcba","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1957597d-f658-49ab-9981-7439a1c45faa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"30407b4f-8355-45d3-9948-c90d055794a6","title":"前置：Extensions 已展开；角色：房间成员；入口：Extensions 下的 Connectors"},{"parent":"1957597d-f658-49ab-9981-7439a1c45faa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"21338c46-e499-4efc-8161-205e98b22831","title":"操作：点击 Connectors"},{"parent":"1957597d-f658-49ab-9981-7439a1c45faa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"665fa244-e2cf-4ea2-bd9a-6ddbd123c84d","title":"预期：Connectors 条目进入选中态并高亮；右侧主区域切换为连接器页，页面标题显示 Connectors；New Session、Agent Management 等其他入口取消选中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1957597d-f658-49ab-9981-7439a1c45faa","title":"🔴【P0】点击 Connectors 打开连接器页"},{"parent":"4ada8fd0-31a3-4f1c-ac47-6990a3a5bcba","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"063db1bd-c154-4ad6-ae26-4b9beffe14fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0bc08f7c-7e68-4a40-af06-d5fc191519bc","title":"前置：Extensions 已展开；角色：房间成员；入口：Extensions 下的 Skills"},{"parent":"063db1bd-c154-4ad6-ae26-4b9beffe14fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6dc2517a-cd85-4aeb-8f3d-3ba188045c2b","title":"操作：点击 Skills"},{"parent":"063db1bd-c154-4ad6-ae26-4b9beffe14fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9717c8ec-7041-4752-8946-cbd242bdac81","title":"预期：按一期范围给出不可用或敬请期待的明确表现（置灰不可点或点击后展示占位说明）；不进入空白页也不报错；Connectors 的选中态不被影响"},{"parent":"063db1bd-c154-4ad6-ae26-4b9beffe14fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"660314e5-8378-4baf-83bb-b130f5d16b7e","title":"备注：需求标注「Skill 一期暂不做」，具体交互形态待产品确认"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"063db1bd-c154-4ad6-ae26-4b9beffe14fd","title":"🟠【P1】Skills 入口本期不可用"},{"parent":"4ada8fd0-31a3-4f1c-ac47-6990a3a5bcba","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3e9014f3-e5dd-4cbb-a835-12dbf2e93b46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"00d63d7a-c5cf-4d48-b208-6c559be26a49","title":"前置：当前停留在连接器页且此前有打开过的会话；角色：房间成员；入口：Agents 面板中的会话条目"},{"parent":"3e9014f3-e5dd-4cbb-a835-12dbf2e93b46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"547eb671-506b-4381-8370-754c23ed8eb6","title":"操作：在连接器页点击左侧任意一条历史会话"},{"parent":"3e9014f3-e5dd-4cbb-a835-12dbf2e93b46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5c74fac-b517-4d96-bf01-2b948ab66778","title":"预期：主区域切换回该会话详情且内容完整；Connectors 取消选中；再次点击 Connectors 可回到连接器页并保持此前所在的 Tab"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3e9014f3-e5dd-4cbb-a835-12dbf2e93b46","title":"🟠【P1】从连接器页返回会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4ada8fd0-31a3-4f1c-ac47-6990a3a5bcba","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"28f5bad0-4dcf-4734-a1b3-9bba79647780","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d51413c5-706e-4f8a-8294-31edd975bf35","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5e6f65fe-5dd2-411b-9915-be6586336f26","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5421b633-fce5-4127-902e-3331636b5eb9","title":"前置：Extensions 已展开；角色：房间成员；入口：Agents 面板右上角折叠按钮"},{"parent":"5e6f65fe-5dd2-411b-9915-be6586336f26","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5256f821-f375-41ea-8e7c-a075f6a43375","title":"操作：点击折叠按钮收起 Agents 面板，再展开"},{"parent":"5e6f65fe-5dd2-411b-9915-be6586336f26","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df278458-6ab2-4bce-b4c9-5d6bdbe6977e","title":"预期：折叠后主区域宽度扩展且连接器页内容随之自适应不截断；展开后 Extensions 的展开状态与 Connectors 选中态保持不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5e6f65fe-5dd2-411b-9915-be6586336f26","title":"🟡【P2】折叠 Agents 面板后的入口可达性"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d51413c5-706e-4f8a-8294-31edd975bf35","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"28f5bad0-4dcf-4734-a1b3-9bba79647780","title":"扩展入口与二级导航"},{"parent":"af92e045-89ac-47c2-b8bf-c67ee7f61115","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"84b35740-7be4-4e4a-a3d7-cde198e6508f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1b4fe6a8-1f52-4084-b7ef-c970737620d9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cd853615-24eb-423c-b48d-51de9ad9414b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"86aa6471-a370-4c05-a467-d90e5989e316","title":"前置：已打开连接器页；角色：房间成员；入口：Extensions → Connectors"},{"parent":"cd853615-24eb-423c-b48d-51de9ad9414b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b648812a-27a4-4184-b294-cb9d7b33f17d","title":"操作：查看页面自上而下的各区域"},{"parent":"cd853615-24eb-423c-b48d-51de9ad9414b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"40f40cb4-cbea-43eb-af0a-8a587d709e9c","title":"预期：依次展示页面标题 Connectors、宣传横幅（主标题 Unite your apps. Unleash your productivity 与副标题）、Marketplace 与 Installed 两个 Tab、以及当前 Tab 的内容区；默认停留在 Marketplace"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cd853615-24eb-423c-b48d-51de9ad9414b","title":"🔴【P0】连接器页整体框架展示"},{"parent":"1b4fe6a8-1f52-4084-b7ef-c970737620d9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ca0f8c74-b626-423b-8ef7-6c1770e9bf5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"15ea27dd-65d2-466f-a84d-64974f047a72","title":"前置：已打开连接器页；角色：房间成员；入口：页面内 Tab 栏"},{"parent":"ca0f8c74-b626-423b-8ef7-6c1770e9bf5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d29a994c-ee85-449d-a8d6-a31705e3a626","title":"操作：点击 Installed 切换，再点回 Marketplace"},{"parent":"ca0f8c74-b626-423b-8ef7-6c1770e9bf5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"12f3c7ee-a5e2-436b-a666-ca26f3c58324","title":"预期：被选中的 Tab 下方出现下划线且文字加深，另一个 Tab 恢复默认样式；内容区随之切换为对应列表；来回切换时内容正确不串位"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ca0f8c74-b626-423b-8ef7-6c1770e9bf5b","title":"🔴【P0】Marketplace 与 Installed Tab 切换"},{"parent":"1b4fe6a8-1f52-4084-b7ef-c970737620d9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6e0066fd-2cdb-4db5-aafc-6953b51bb430","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"98b43c94-aad5-4904-b0fc-0aec6ae461f9","title":"前置：当前处于 Installed Tab；角色：房间成员；入口：Agents 面板"},{"parent":"6e0066fd-2cdb-4db5-aafc-6953b51bb430","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f068d4a7-437d-4343-be0e-08219cbf9e6e","title":"操作：切换到任一会话后再点击 Connectors 返回"},{"parent":"6e0066fd-2cdb-4db5-aafc-6953b51bb430","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"01e0799d-2923-4d4d-b717-76286f8a14a4","title":"预期：返回后仍停留在 Installed Tab；列表内容为最新状态；不重置回 Marketplace"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6e0066fd-2cdb-4db5-aafc-6953b51bb430","title":"🟠【P1】Tab 选中状态在页面间保持"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1b4fe6a8-1f52-4084-b7ef-c970737620d9","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"84b35740-7be4-4e4a-a3d7-cde198e6508f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"09348a7a-5e31-406e-a7bd-a17632333e14","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1c095af8-63ad-41d8-b372-c09f645dee68","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f8fbc4aa-ac56-45d4-a4e2-a0208b54d819","title":"前置：已打开连接器页；角色：房间成员；入口：应用窗口边缘"},{"parent":"1c095af8-63ad-41d8-b372-c09f645dee68","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b37904eb-4bac-49be-815e-fdf3228feec4","title":"操作：将应用窗口宽度缩到最小"},{"parent":"1c095af8-63ad-41d8-b372-c09f645dee68","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ab3ed695-b55f-4c1e-b452-5dd0029f3795","title":"预期：横幅、Tab 与卡片区自适应换行或缩放，内容不重叠不截断；卡片上的状态控件仍完整可见可点击；页面不出现横向滚动条"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1c095af8-63ad-41d8-b372-c09f645dee68","title":"🟡【P2】窄窗口下的页面布局"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"09348a7a-5e31-406e-a7bd-a17632333e14","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"84b35740-7be4-4e4a-a3d7-cde198e6508f","title":"连接器页面框架与 Tab 切换"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"af92e045-89ac-47c2-b8bf-c67ee7f61115","title":"扩展入口与页面框架"},{"parent":"1f3e577f-f87b-460e-9473-33c399fd28eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"156e656a-7a77-45b9-a939-f9ebed7729f1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3fdd63f3-c229-49b1-adec-80ce1d73cbe3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7d2920f9-008d-47ed-8b15-bee86ef0028b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6a49674e-7a29-4763-88b3-fb3de1912c48","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c29d4136-d204-4c98-adf0-474d209157e3","title":"前置：连接器页停留在 Marketplace Tab；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 内容区"},{"parent":"6a49674e-7a29-4763-88b3-fb3de1912c48","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0d6130e1-1083-42ac-b726-a3b4cc1fbf11","title":"操作：自上而下浏览整个市场列表"},{"parent":"6a49674e-7a29-4763-88b3-fb3de1912c48","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"75c3bc04-0182-46cb-bef3-a3c623dbbf7a","title":"预期：连接器按类型分组展示，各组有分类标题（如 Communication & Collaboration、Project Management、Knowledge & Docs）；同一连接器只出现在一个分类下；分类内卡片按栅格排列对齐"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6a49674e-7a29-4763-88b3-fb3de1912c48","title":"🔴【P0】按连接器类型分类展示"},{"parent":"7d2920f9-008d-47ed-8b15-bee86ef0028b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e88e86ed-0f43-4c17-8085-592b63e7c387","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"54e8befd-0808-410d-92d2-09afcd881e65","title":"前置：Marketplace 中已加载出卡片；角色：房间成员；入口：任一连接器卡片"},{"parent":"e88e86ed-0f43-4c17-8085-592b63e7c387","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"423711e0-b839-4681-b21a-b2a616c0d2f7","title":"操作：查看单张卡片上的各元素"},{"parent":"e88e86ed-0f43-4c17-8085-592b63e7c387","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"78157ff3-405a-4481-9ce5-205cbf59b522","title":"预期：卡片展示连接器图标、名称与描述；右侧展示当前状态控件；名称与描述超长时省略显示并可悬浮查看完整内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e88e86ed-0f43-4c17-8085-592b63e7c387","title":"🔴【P0】连接器卡片信息完整"},{"parent":"7d2920f9-008d-47ed-8b15-bee86ef0028b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d936e74d-4bcf-4e24-8043-59f0fc11049d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2e073448-6506-4e76-85c1-e0b2c1d8ea44","title":"前置：市场中同时存在未安装、安装中与已安装的连接器；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 卡片右侧控件"},{"parent":"d936e74d-4bcf-4e24-8043-59f0fc11049d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6df3ac7a-1ce5-4d55-844f-fbc97742db4b","title":"操作：分别查看三种状态的卡片右侧控件"},{"parent":"d936e74d-4bcf-4e24-8043-59f0fc11049d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7211ff1f-bab4-4e77-b00b-6c54a142a394","title":"预期：未安装显示 + 号；安装或处理中显示加载态图标且不可重复点击；已安装并完成连接显示 ✓；三种状态在视觉上可清晰区分"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d936e74d-4bcf-4e24-8043-59f0fc11049d","title":"🔴【P0】卡片状态控件三态区分"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7d2920f9-008d-47ed-8b15-bee86ef0028b","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"3fdd63f3-c229-49b1-adec-80ce1d73cbe3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b02ea1bd-851a-4406-85d9-2bdc5bbfc32f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e4724623-d48b-4435-874d-3f75dcd39596","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ac66832a-a31e-45bb-8e4f-06cc4bca34f0","title":"前置：连接器页首次打开；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 内容区"},{"parent":"e4724623-d48b-4435-874d-3f75dcd39596","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"56eca7da-be20-4569-afc8-a9e14b27c0fd","title":"操作：在网络断开状态下打开 Marketplace，恢复网络后点击重试"},{"parent":"e4724623-d48b-4435-874d-3f75dcd39596","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1458ae32-b5a5-4838-9b6f-c64812f83cee","title":"预期：给出加载失败的明确提示与重试入口，不长时间停留在骨架屏；不误展示为「暂无连接器」空态；重试后列表正常加载"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e4724623-d48b-4435-874d-3f75dcd39596","title":"🟠【P1】市场列表加载失败"},{"parent":"b02ea1bd-851a-4406-85d9-2bdc5bbfc32f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ef079a33-f8c3-482b-a00e-5f16383c077c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d845cda7-7192-4bf8-86bf-0df3a88d26a0","title":"前置：某一分类当前没有可上架的连接器；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 内容区"},{"parent":"ef079a33-f8c3-482b-a00e-5f16383c077c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9b932fa0-c7c9-44a4-9850-65667646c6c4","title":"操作：浏览该分类区域"},{"parent":"ef079a33-f8c3-482b-a00e-5f16383c077c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"851e8e47-85b0-4e37-867c-9e283d65bed8","title":"预期：该分类不展示空的标题占位，或展示明确的空态说明；其他分类正常展示不受影响"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ef079a33-f8c3-482b-a00e-5f16383c077c","title":"🟡【P2】某个分类下无可用连接器"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b02ea1bd-851a-4406-85d9-2bdc5bbfc32f","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"3fdd63f3-c229-49b1-adec-80ce1d73cbe3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"97591339-6077-4aa0-8651-cfd23a646231","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"49f4795e-18a4-43bf-bd79-4dfbce454545","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d28b4b2c-0c4c-400a-a743-e3691ef25ee9","title":"前置：市场中连接器数量超过一屏；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 内容区"},{"parent":"49f4795e-18a4-43bf-bd79-4dfbce454545","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b4e611ab-1387-49af-9fd4-ca56c4ecb203","title":"操作：向下滚动浏览到列表底部"},{"parent":"49f4795e-18a4-43bf-bd79-4dfbce454545","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"815facd6-3055-4184-8768-efdbc4789e69","title":"预期：滚动流畅且分类标题与卡片对应关系正确；分批加载时有加载反馈；滚动到底部有明确的结束表现，不重复渲染已展示的卡片"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"49f4795e-18a4-43bf-bd79-4dfbce454545","title":"🟡【P2】连接器数量较多时的浏览"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"97591339-6077-4aa0-8651-cfd23a646231","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3fdd63f3-c229-49b1-adec-80ce1d73cbe3","title":"市场分类与卡片展示"},{"parent":"156e656a-7a77-45b9-a939-f9ebed7729f1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f8a7ac87-f164-492e-bb81-d91bbe737a23","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e7c0a5c9-3659-4e83-9682-07c1dd77813e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"27887d10-2374-4395-bef3-b0a1914bd2a0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9fc3a4d4-cd88-4a59-ba8c-1e4ecc3034da","title":"前置：目标连接器处于未安装状态；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 卡片右侧 + 号"},{"parent":"27887d10-2374-4395-bef3-b0a1914bd2a0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fe2d1f71-50aa-412b-bcbe-7c038bda7b70","title":"操作：点击 + 号并等待安装完成"},{"parent":"27887d10-2374-4395-bef3-b0a1914bd2a0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ff372e77-b25d-4a58-8105-f8d0f0612f86","title":"预期：按钮立即变为加载态且不可重复点击；安装完成后 + 号变为授权按钮，卡片左下方显示「需要授权」；该连接器此时尚未出现在已授权可用列表中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"27887d10-2374-4395-bef3-b0a1914bd2a0","title":"🔴【P0】点击 + 号安装连接器"},{"parent":"e7c0a5c9-3659-4e83-9682-07c1dd77813e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"65fd0d10-61a5-42db-913b-00fd0dcd7115","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"115562f9-0c2e-4a6a-8391-85673e2ebd56","title":"前置：某连接器刚安装成功；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 卡片"},{"parent":"65fd0d10-61a5-42db-913b-00fd0dcd7115","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"21626d57-0134-4608-b568-c28f8f06e2ca","title":"操作：查看该卡片的按钮与左下角状态文案"},{"parent":"65fd0d10-61a5-42db-913b-00fd0dcd7115","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7ce98bd0-f09d-494c-9f30-6d37e283840c","title":"预期：卡片右侧为授权按钮，左下方显示「需要授权」；刷新页面或切换 Tab 后再回到市场，该状态保持不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"65fd0d10-61a5-42db-913b-00fd0dcd7115","title":"🔴【P0】安装成功后的卡片状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e7c0a5c9-3659-4e83-9682-07c1dd77813e","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"f8a7ac87-f164-492e-bb81-d91bbe737a23","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bd084aa5-634b-4203-926e-2310a0fd02c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"97569b97-9c2d-43f7-8a0d-3f94972ad904","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e067a47f-253c-426b-bed7-1e03eca059f1","title":"前置：目标连接器未安装；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 卡片 + 号"},{"parent":"97569b97-9c2d-43f7-8a0d-3f94972ad904","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9d31f1a5-a512-4a6c-8c22-76a40475148a","title":"操作：在安装过程中断开网络，等待失败提示后恢复网络并重新点击 + 号"},{"parent":"97569b97-9c2d-43f7-8a0d-3f94972ad904","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bc66aec9-2cc4-42b4-a710-cc05bcd5f67e","title":"预期：给出安装失败的明确原因与可重试的入口；卡片回到未安装的 + 号状态，不残留加载态；本地不遗留半成品运行文件；重试后可安装成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"97569b97-9c2d-43f7-8a0d-3f94972ad904","title":"🟠【P1】安装失败的处理"},{"parent":"bd084aa5-634b-4203-926e-2310a0fd02c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0025979f-d3eb-4dc4-afb6-a8fb7a008ef2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7d081c3-76ad-4ec9-bd27-93eb427736fb","title":"前置：某连接器正在安装中；角色：房间成员；入口：Agents 面板与连接器页"},{"parent":"0025979f-d3eb-4dc4-afb6-a8fb7a008ef2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c6e0dcd4-4714-4458-9283-ac334feaf8c4","title":"操作：在安装进行中切换到会话页，稍后再回到连接器页"},{"parent":"0025979f-d3eb-4dc4-afb6-a8fb7a008ef2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4af02884-0c94-4ef0-91b3-ffdad8ebabc6","title":"预期：安装任务不因页面切换而中断；返回后卡片展示的是安装完成或失败的真实结果，不停留在旧的加载态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0025979f-d3eb-4dc4-afb6-a8fb7a008ef2","title":"🟡【P2】安装过程中离开页面"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bd084aa5-634b-4203-926e-2310a0fd02c4","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"f8a7ac87-f164-492e-bb81-d91bbe737a23","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"06d6ee2a-8a90-46ba-8035-f3759e579b7e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8e559e9a-87bc-40a0-9935-211b5c7efe29","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0a4f78da-1d8c-4ed9-949b-0c474a80e536","title":"前置：目标连接器处于未安装状态；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 卡片 + 号"},{"parent":"8e559e9a-87bc-40a0-9935-211b5c7efe29","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"571e8814-c1a1-4e26-bb71-4aecd52b6807","title":"操作：连续快速点击 + 号 10 次"},{"parent":"8e559e9a-87bc-40a0-9935-211b5c7efe29","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd3f896e-2fa4-49cc-8f20-63bd1c0149ea","title":"预期：只发起一次安装任务；按钮在首次点击后即置为不可点击；已安装列表中不出现重复条目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8e559e9a-87bc-40a0-9935-211b5c7efe29","title":"🟡【P2】快速连续点击 + 号"},{"parent":"06d6ee2a-8a90-46ba-8035-f3759e579b7e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ddd85f91-2c02-4236-b63f-7417759be402","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"260ab988-ee82-485d-bb13-c3dae3ea972b","title":"前置：市场中有多个未安装连接器；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 多张卡片的 + 号"},{"parent":"ddd85f91-2c02-4236-b63f-7417759be402","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"93afcba6-bef4-4022-b586-9a376cc470d4","title":"操作：依次快速点击 3 个不同连接器的 + 号"},{"parent":"ddd85f91-2c02-4236-b63f-7417759be402","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2ba5c9d0-1b51-44ed-807e-3a399cd69634","title":"预期：3 个安装任务互不干扰且各自展示自身进度；完成后 3 张卡片分别变为需要授权状态；不出现进度或结果串到其他卡片"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ddd85f91-2c02-4236-b63f-7417759be402","title":"🟡【P2】同时安装多个连接器"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"06d6ee2a-8a90-46ba-8035-f3759e579b7e","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f8a7ac87-f164-492e-bb81-d91bbe737a23","title":"安装连接器"},{"parent":"156e656a-7a77-45b9-a939-f9ebed7729f1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8e7181b7-36c7-4d1c-a047-d984445b5346","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cc465e35-ccf3-46de-934f-a56817858f4f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"62fc5455-4b3d-4c8a-80da-82d30ee6f79d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e6261cea-f08b-491b-9ebf-3d9e937b8421","title":"前置：某连接器已安装但未授权；角色：房间成员；入口：卡片右上方 ... 按钮"},{"parent":"62fc5455-4b3d-4c8a-80da-82d30ee6f79d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4b7f28e7-30cb-4d85-902f-2b18afd1ec51","title":"操作：点击卡片右上方的 ... 按钮"},{"parent":"62fc5455-4b3d-4c8a-80da-82d30ee6f79d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ed48aaab-95d0-43aa-86f3-262b138911da","title":"预期：弹出菜单并展示卸载选项；点击菜单外部或按 Esc 可关闭且不执行任何操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"62fc5455-4b3d-4c8a-80da-82d30ee6f79d","title":"🔴【P0】卡片更多菜单展示卸载选项"},{"parent":"cc465e35-ccf3-46de-934f-a56817858f4f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"91273c86-9904-4c0d-abdf-6f200e300b06","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c0b5f54-688c-4b87-a09e-d757925aca02","title":"前置：某连接器已安装但未授权；角色：房间成员；入口：卡片 ... 菜单中的卸载"},{"parent":"91273c86-9904-4c0d-abdf-6f200e300b06","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7fa47dd4-6c27-4c02-8634-75349180050f","title":"操作：点击卸载并等待完成，随后查看卡片状态与本地运行文件"},{"parent":"91273c86-9904-4c0d-abdf-6f200e300b06","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"05f23ea1-c3e8-4e43-b368-33e9fb527225","title":"预期：卸载成功；本地运行文件与已安装的 CLI 被删除；卡片回到 + 号状态；该连接器不再出现在 Installed Tab"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"91273c86-9904-4c0d-abdf-6f200e300b06","title":"🔴【P0】卸载未授权的连接器"},{"parent":"cc465e35-ccf3-46de-934f-a56817858f4f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fc10c7b9-98ad-439f-af61-bfbe8dbec082","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4d500383-5b23-4701-9a15-952a3e9b6b86","title":"前置：某未授权连接器刚被卸载；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 卡片 + 号"},{"parent":"fc10c7b9-98ad-439f-af61-bfbe8dbec082","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"674a2e17-d8d7-412d-9b17-55b0aa9ffa92","title":"操作：再次点击该卡片的 + 号"},{"parent":"fc10c7b9-98ad-439f-af61-bfbe8dbec082","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d1b7b2c4-0b62-49c4-97b3-392a70378099","title":"预期：重新安装成功并回到「需要授权」状态，而不是直接变为已连接；卡片左下方重新出现需要授权文案"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fc10c7b9-98ad-439f-af61-bfbe8dbec082","title":"🔴【P0】卸载后重新安装"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cc465e35-ccf3-46de-934f-a56817858f4f","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"8e7181b7-36c7-4d1c-a047-d984445b5346","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3c45b2ee-c3e3-42ac-8544-a7c112c3b41e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a3b90cf0-67c3-4af4-b4b8-c49900b797e5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"18e64784-5180-40f3-a714-e9748d6a8484","title":"前置：某已安装未授权连接器的运行文件被其他进程占用；角色：房间成员；入口：卡片 ... 菜单中的卸载"},{"parent":"a3b90cf0-67c3-4af4-b4b8-c49900b797e5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2679fb08-a8db-4b1a-8ae8-dfcbe5dbcac0","title":"操作：执行卸载并观察结果"},{"parent":"a3b90cf0-67c3-4af4-b4b8-c49900b797e5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"71acea58-3147-47d7-9a3a-5b8e6c53d850","title":"预期：给出卸载失败的明确原因与重试入口；卡片保持已安装状态不变为 + 号；不出现界面显示已卸载但本地文件仍在的不一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a3b90cf0-67c3-4af4-b4b8-c49900b797e5","title":"🟡【P2】卸载失败的处理"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3c45b2ee-c3e3-42ac-8544-a7c112c3b41e","title":"异常场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8e7181b7-36c7-4d1c-a047-d984445b5346","title":"未授权状态下的卸载"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"156e656a-7a77-45b9-a939-f9ebed7729f1","title":"连接器市场（Marketplace）"},{"parent":"1f3e577f-f87b-460e-9473-33c399fd28eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fc3b96fb-fdd0-49e8-9c0a-cf787c5b1053","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d9abcb29-8b60-4543-8e8b-e14e92fb6e2c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"831ce848-b076-46ad-b01e-25e1ad711807","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2298c661-7a35-4834-97ff-6c97b29703ae","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b008f8fb-a803-4077-bb5a-b5057f338d42","title":"前置：某连接器已安装未授权，卡片左下方显示需要授权；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 卡片上的授权按钮"},{"parent":"2298c661-7a35-4834-97ff-6c97b29703ae","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9cef7b55-cdf6-412d-a70d-3affde04d6dd","title":"操作：点击授权按钮"},{"parent":"2298c661-7a35-4834-97ff-6c97b29703ae","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4fce1e94-28a5-4a61-b61e-2b16ad6f3696","title":"预期：弹出该连接器的授权弹窗；弹窗中展示连接器图标、授权说明与授权入口；背景变暗且不可操作下层页面"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2298c661-7a35-4834-97ff-6c97b29703ae","title":"🔴【P0】点击授权按钮弹出授权弹窗"},{"parent":"831ce848-b076-46ad-b01e-25e1ad711807","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6e92ea4a-1512-4bd9-8845-317e3f5cec32","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5b2c8e28-67fb-4097-b93d-d6bd2847ceed","title":"前置：授权弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：授权弹窗"},{"parent":"6e92ea4a-1512-4bd9-8845-317e3f5cec32","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f65234e3-2411-41b4-8df2-32c765ab5020","title":"操作：查看弹窗内的各元素"},{"parent":"6e92ea4a-1512-4bd9-8845-317e3f5cec32","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"893a05d4-2cd7-4113-aa99-85080fbdc3bf","title":"预期：弹窗展示应用图标组、标题、授权范围说明（如可访问的日历、文档、多维表、会话等能力）、可展开的条目说明与主操作按钮；右上角提供关闭按钮"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6e92ea4a-1512-4bd9-8845-317e3f5cec32","title":"🔴【P0】授权弹窗内容完整"},{"parent":"831ce848-b076-46ad-b01e-25e1ad711807","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a64a2752-8a58-4574-a073-e5948c4f9715","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a82a4158-d0fe-4209-88b5-401404d2e1ff","title":"前置：授权弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗内主授权按钮"},{"parent":"a64a2752-8a58-4574-a073-e5948c4f9715","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e5a8d60-9cbb-46b7-867e-5b5fd6dbb18f","title":"操作：点击授权按钮"},{"parent":"a64a2752-8a58-4574-a073-e5948c4f9715","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4316ee3a-6db5-43cb-b92c-eedb591b8ca6","title":"预期：打开该连接器的授权网页链接；网页中展示的是所点击连接器的授权页而非其他连接器；应用内同步进入授权中状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a64a2752-8a58-4574-a073-e5948c4f9715","title":"🔴【P0】点击授权打开网页链接"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"831ce848-b076-46ad-b01e-25e1ad711807","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"d9abcb29-8b60-4543-8e8b-e14e92fb6e2c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"30fee031-3486-4453-9051-f118825a76eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"baca0a81-fd21-44b5-a6a1-f898e8948980","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bb338ccc-ccca-40af-b12f-ec0c28a81058","title":"前置：某连接器已安装未授权且当前网络异常；角色：房间成员；入口：卡片授权按钮"},{"parent":"baca0a81-fd21-44b5-a6a1-f898e8948980","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c449148-71ec-44eb-9025-a4c7951ad21c","title":"操作：在网络断开时点击授权按钮，恢复网络后重试"},{"parent":"baca0a81-fd21-44b5-a6a1-f898e8948980","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76550bf6-7703-42f6-8a01-f9eb279881d8","title":"预期：给出无法发起授权的明确提示与重试入口；不弹出空白弹窗；卡片仍保持需要授权状态；恢复网络后重试可正常弹出弹窗"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"baca0a81-fd21-44b5-a6a1-f898e8948980","title":"🟡【P2】授权弹窗打开失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"30fee031-3486-4453-9051-f118825a76eb","title":"异常场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d9abcb29-8b60-4543-8e8b-e14e92fb6e2c","title":"授权入口与授权弹窗"},{"parent":"fc3b96fb-fdd0-49e8-9c0a-cf787c5b1053","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dca04f85-8b8a-443c-a6a2-e337d2d24a50","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0b4681c9-fb30-4f86-be6b-3fcdc8bd4447","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"37ff1324-e7e0-420d-b8db-4537c05178a8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e1186a5-2007-45a3-bb31-f91c77162b97","title":"前置：已点击授权并打开授权网页；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 卡片"},{"parent":"37ff1324-e7e0-420d-b8db-4537c05178a8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c5ea044f-4cb1-4a1b-8fe5-a2c3290fd982","title":"操作：返回应用查看该卡片的按钮状态"},{"parent":"37ff1324-e7e0-420d-b8db-4537c05178a8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0e964593-c2ed-491a-ba23-ee9ed3d0978d","title":"预期：授权按钮变为「授权中」且不可点击；按钮旁新增取消按钮；卡片其他信息保持不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"37ff1324-e7e0-420d-b8db-4537c05178a8","title":"🔴【P0】授权中状态与取消按钮"},{"parent":"0b4681c9-fb30-4f86-be6b-3fcdc8bd4447","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6967fdd0-644c-4037-b217-1392c1a1fa2c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4f634c4c-aafa-4393-a6ae-a66bd10e3895","title":"前置：连接器处于授权中状态；角色：房间成员；入口：授权中状态旁的取消按钮"},{"parent":"6967fdd0-644c-4037-b217-1392c1a1fa2c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7cf3afcc-eb36-4836-94b9-ea53668585f9","title":"操作：点击取消"},{"parent":"6967fdd0-644c-4037-b217-1392c1a1fa2c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e34175d-c1b2-432e-b660-5ac84661b226","title":"预期：关闭弹窗并取消本次授权；卡片回到「授权」按钮与「需要授权」文案；连接器未被启用，也不出现在已授权列表"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6967fdd0-644c-4037-b217-1392c1a1fa2c","title":"🔴【P0】点击取消终止授权"},{"parent":"0b4681c9-fb30-4f86-be6b-3fcdc8bd4447","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bfd1fd66-7aa7-442e-a7a9-04c066bac883","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b3bdd8da-cf15-4540-9803-9bec71991f0a","title":"前置：连接器处于授权中状态且授权弹窗仍打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗右上角 X"},{"parent":"bfd1fd66-7aa7-442e-a7a9-04c066bac883","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"afbb9d57-7b27-4030-b91a-2708964aeec2","title":"操作：点击弹窗右上角的 X"},{"parent":"bfd1fd66-7aa7-442e-a7a9-04c066bac883","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d921ba2e-3876-4dad-93af-9d539af11d5a","title":"预期：弹窗关闭并取消本次授权；卡片回到授权按钮状态；再次点击授权可重新发起流程"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bfd1fd66-7aa7-442e-a7a9-04c066bac883","title":"🔴【P0】点击弹窗右上角 X 终止授权"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0b4681c9-fb30-4f86-be6b-3fcdc8bd4447","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"dca04f85-8b8a-443c-a6a2-e337d2d24a50","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"db7e58cd-185b-424b-9250-5253b58d3645","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a5e10a05-7a49-4edc-9134-b6581a9a971b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"45adf489-a4ed-4d20-ba2f-7e89b8b28874","title":"前置：已点击授权并打开授权网页；角色：房间成员；入口：浏览器授权页"},{"parent":"a5e10a05-7a49-4edc-9134-b6581a9a971b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1d925e48-33a9-439d-b65c-345c559262c1","title":"操作：直接关闭授权网页而不完成登录，回到应用等待若干分钟"},{"parent":"a5e10a05-7a49-4edc-9134-b6581a9a971b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8cffa848-53cb-445e-8e2a-b9c575f45857","title":"预期：授权中状态在超时后回到需要授权状态并给出未完成授权的说明；不长期停留在授权中；卡片可再次发起授权"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a5e10a05-7a49-4edc-9134-b6581a9a971b","title":"🟠【P1】外部授权页未完成即关闭"},{"parent":"db7e58cd-185b-424b-9250-5253b58d3645","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"32be5ebe-aee0-4ef7-b0c5-9d7c0055b10b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4d034240-5a6f-4fac-80a8-a2dbbee8b6a1","title":"前置：已进入外部授权页；角色：房间成员；入口：授权页的拒绝入口"},{"parent":"32be5ebe-aee0-4ef7-b0c5-9d7c0055b10b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c7fd5e61-b096-4ffb-a7f1-5ba21106836b","title":"操作：在授权页选择拒绝或取消授权，返回应用"},{"parent":"32be5ebe-aee0-4ef7-b0c5-9d7c0055b10b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"45af901a-13a7-4922-b0e5-60873758af0a","title":"预期：应用侧回到需要授权状态并提示授权未通过；不展示为已连接；本地不写入任何凭据"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"32be5ebe-aee0-4ef7-b0c5-9d7c0055b10b","title":"🟠【P1】外部授权被拒绝"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"db7e58cd-185b-424b-9250-5253b58d3645","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"dca04f85-8b8a-443c-a6a2-e337d2d24a50","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6e5dae09-43a3-4690-b8d6-9c48f082d676","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a4bb0341-c471-4ebe-8786-08a36d80981d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e99e6b6e-07e4-4c48-8dbe-27b1b2dabc41","title":"前置：连接器处于授权中状态；角色：房间成员；入口：Agents 面板与房间关闭入口"},{"parent":"a4bb0341-c471-4ebe-8786-08a36d80981d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8d3ec064-10b9-44dd-9167-c8b14880dc4d","title":"操作：在授权中切换到会话页，再返回连接器页；另一次在授权中关闭房间后重新进入"},{"parent":"a4bb0341-c471-4ebe-8786-08a36d80981d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7419356a-c81c-4ede-8b39-7454f9c27270","title":"预期：两种情况下返回后展示的都是授权的真实结果（已连接、需要授权或授权中）；不出现状态回退到安装前，也不出现一直卡在授权中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a4bb0341-c471-4ebe-8786-08a36d80981d","title":"🟡【P2】授权中切换页面或关闭房间"},{"parent":"6e5dae09-43a3-4690-b8d6-9c48f082d676","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f04d8fbd-e953-4959-af74-274cff385218","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"83ff95d2-820a-4858-a849-cc6430dfc024","title":"前置：存在多个已安装未授权的连接器；角色：房间成员；入口：多张卡片的授权按钮"},{"parent":"f04d8fbd-e953-4959-af74-274cff385218","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"294d275c-1955-4057-8bef-ddecf91482e3","title":"操作：依次对两个连接器点击授权，分别在两个网页中完成登录"},{"parent":"f04d8fbd-e953-4959-af74-274cff385218","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5ebbf90a-18a4-4e94-b889-892d6e5801e2","title":"预期：两个授权流程互不干扰；各自卡片的状态独立更新；不出现一个授权成功导致另一个也显示已连接"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f04d8fbd-e953-4959-af74-274cff385218","title":"🟡【P2】同时对多个连接器发起授权"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6e5dae09-43a3-4690-b8d6-9c48f082d676","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dca04f85-8b8a-443c-a6a2-e337d2d24a50","title":"授权进行中与取消"},{"parent":"fc3b96fb-fdd0-49e8-9c0a-cf787c5b1053","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"09f9df1b-3aa1-4ebc-9c9c-c4a90578d7ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7eb192b2-2365-4d21-a26a-45bc9dff158f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3ec39e21-865a-4786-acb4-01e6fd33c967","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"80dbb571-91fe-4f11-b470-1d10a5f577ad","title":"前置：已在授权网页完成登录；角色：房间成员；入口：返回应用后的连接器页"},{"parent":"3ec39e21-865a-4786-acb4-01e6fd33c967","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ee6bf0df-ea90-4463-93e4-1f06e99f466a","title":"操作：完成外部授权后返回应用"},{"parent":"3ec39e21-865a-4786-acb4-01e6fd33c967","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ce5ebe03-77c2-4c4d-aadc-ff57c090d895","title":"预期：弹出授权成功弹窗并说明该连接器已可用；弹窗内提供去试试、解除授权与卸载入口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3ec39e21-865a-4786-acb4-01e6fd33c967","title":"🔴【P0】授权完成后弹出授权成功弹窗"},{"parent":"7eb192b2-2365-4d21-a26a-45bc9dff158f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"935a9a70-b01f-443b-8dff-c8fdacc215cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e8824d6e-6268-4d2e-a5f7-da9bf26f3abf","title":"前置：某连接器刚授权成功且已关闭成功弹窗；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 卡片"},{"parent":"935a9a70-b01f-443b-8dff-c8fdacc215cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5e630ea0-b202-4d6b-b0f3-03d4b70bc398","title":"操作：查看该卡片左下角、右下角与右上角状态控件"},{"parent":"935a9a70-b01f-443b-8dff-c8fdacc215cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"10a885e7-d37e-498a-8df6-5b82d5685b35","title":"预期：卡片左下角显示「已连接」；右下角显示「解除授权」按钮；右上角原 + 号位置变为 ✓；刷新后状态保持"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"935a9a70-b01f-443b-8dff-c8fdacc215cd","title":"🔴【P0】授权完成后卡片状态"},{"parent":"7eb192b2-2365-4d21-a26a-45bc9dff158f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"abb86199-6f9c-4a0f-a714-f4ee27908796","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5c1c0ee4-529a-4629-9a15-0dbb16e2795d","title":"前置：某连接器刚授权成功；角色：房间成员；入口：连接器页 Installed Tab"},{"parent":"abb86199-6f9c-4a0f-a714-f4ee27908796","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"90f75d58-54ce-4d84-baff-e0cf9c55f544","title":"操作：切换到 Installed Tab 查找该连接器"},{"parent":"abb86199-6f9c-4a0f-a714-f4ee27908796","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4117e49e-e332-42df-b63b-c7479cda3c9e","title":"预期：该连接器出现在「Installed from marketplace」分组中；行内展示图标、名称、描述、删除入口与开关；开关默认为开启状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"abb86199-6f9c-4a0f-a714-f4ee27908796","title":"🔴【P0】授权完成后进入已安装 Tab"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7eb192b2-2365-4d21-a26a-45bc9dff158f","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"09f9df1b-3aa1-4ebc-9c9c-c4a90578d7ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1af9340c-8b04-4654-9fcd-9376ea8678a3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a29d52ba-e114-4f83-9579-f39fe042f6c3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8fb61691-7292-40eb-b23d-91fe976f2b76","title":"前置：已在授权网页完成登录并返回应用；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 卡片与 Installed Tab"},{"parent":"a29d52ba-e114-4f83-9579-f39fe042f6c3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"25751112-0340-427a-b13f-4f1828978175","title":"操作：返回后不手动刷新，直接查看卡片状态与已安装列表"},{"parent":"a29d52ba-e114-4f83-9579-f39fe042f6c3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"063f8b56-e7fd-4781-9868-18e69eb3946c","title":"预期：两处状态在返回后自动更新为已连接与已安装；无需手动刷新页面或重开房间才能看到；若确需刷新，界面给出明确的刷新入口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a29d52ba-e114-4f83-9579-f39fe042f6c3","title":"🟠【P1】授权成功但状态未刷新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1af9340c-8b04-4654-9fcd-9376ea8678a3","title":"异常场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"09f9df1b-3aa1-4ebc-9c9c-c4a90578d7ac","title":"授权成功后的状态展示"},{"parent":"fc3b96fb-fdd0-49e8-9c0a-cf787c5b1053","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"327b41c8-2e88-430f-9c8d-23d0a9a440ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c918684d-4361-4144-86ee-f019a3d2225b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"718affb1-99b5-48bc-b533-7bffbad659d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c84a8160-2b03-462a-9ee1-4f0d9046eed0","title":"前置：授权成功弹窗已展示；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗内「解除授权」"},{"parent":"718affb1-99b5-48bc-b533-7bffbad659d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a126401d-dd42-4a96-a7cc-3fc61db6ada0","title":"操作：点击解除授权并等待完成"},{"parent":"718affb1-99b5-48bc-b533-7bffbad659d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"10908f36-3545-4d07-aff7-79229b8ddc24","title":"预期：解除授权成功；卡片回到授权按钮与需要授权状态；该连接器从已授权可用列表中移除，但仍保留在已安装状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"718affb1-99b5-48bc-b533-7bffbad659d1","title":"🔴【P0】在成功弹窗中解除授权"},{"parent":"c918684d-4361-4144-86ee-f019a3d2225b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1e48c1e3-08ee-4b63-ab88-80cb311bcd41","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a0894544-69fd-40d5-a641-1f26d1741349","title":"前置：授权成功弹窗已展示；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗内卸载入口"},{"parent":"1e48c1e3-08ee-4b63-ab88-80cb311bcd41","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f604c7af-7e11-4ecc-819a-b26da646e40c","title":"操作：点击卸载弹出二次确认弹窗，先点取消，再重新进入并点击卸载"},{"parent":"1e48c1e3-08ee-4b63-ab88-80cb311bcd41","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"277e9cfa-a13a-40f9-b893-b8eb58cfcf98","title":"预期：点取消时二次确认关闭且连接器保持已连接；点卸载后卸载成功，删除本地运行文件与已安装的 CLI，弹窗关闭，卡片显示 + 号"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1e48c1e3-08ee-4b63-ab88-80cb311bcd41","title":"🔴【P0】在成功弹窗中卸载并二次确认"},{"parent":"c918684d-4361-4144-86ee-f019a3d2225b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d00433ed-2ef1-4be5-8068-b2b02ccdc74c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a36208f0-16a3-4c61-b6b8-e79b959f54b3","title":"前置：某已授权连接器刚被卸载且卡片显示 + 号；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 卡片 + 号"},{"parent":"d00433ed-2ef1-4be5-8068-b2b02ccdc74c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"03e5e8c8-b26e-4a2c-af3a-ca91fb79e109","title":"操作：再次点击该卡片的 + 号"},{"parent":"d00433ed-2ef1-4be5-8068-b2b02ccdc74c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"514bcce8-21bc-4f9f-af6c-c91421c69713","title":"预期：直接变为已连接状态而不再要求重新授权；卡片左下角显示已连接；该连接器重新出现在 Installed Tab 且开关为开启"},{"parent":"d00433ed-2ef1-4be5-8068-b2b02ccdc74c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"72fd9626-8438-4992-9f8e-f45e6e312ef4","title":"备注：与「未授权时卸载后重装需重新授权」形成对照，两条需一起执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d00433ed-2ef1-4be5-8068-b2b02ccdc74c","title":"🔴【P0】授权后卸载再重新添加直接已连接"},{"parent":"c918684d-4361-4144-86ee-f019a3d2225b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e2a655af-ed48-4fa9-bb85-e3452c00e053","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6f1b3348-651a-401d-8422-bb93183cb23f","title":"前置：授权成功弹窗已展示；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗内「去试试」"},{"parent":"e2a655af-ed48-4fa9-bb85-e3452c00e053","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e9735c6-7a46-4262-87c8-5dac4529f96d","title":"操作：点击去试试"},{"parent":"e2a655af-ed48-4fa9-bb85-e3452c00e053","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb1438f2-13c0-4fa5-a966-84920016035e","title":"预期：弹窗关闭并回到连接器页或进入可使用该连接器的会话入口；连接器保持已连接状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e2a655af-ed48-4fa9-bb85-e3452c00e053","title":"🟠【P1】点击去试试关闭弹窗"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c918684d-4361-4144-86ee-f019a3d2225b","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"327b41c8-2e88-430f-9c8d-23d0a9a440ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"64ec8ec8-fc41-442f-a3e7-a8747b34dd7d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b2b1fc27-5685-4b6e-9376-c913ee87cdc2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd05e3d7-e65b-470f-b429-5b03e1eca433","title":"前置：授权成功弹窗已展示；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗右上角 X、弹窗外部区域与 Esc 键"},{"parent":"b2b1fc27-5685-4b6e-9376-c913ee87cdc2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d3890ad3-75ff-48e7-9add-68a64045cca2","title":"操作：分别用点击 X、点击弹窗外部、按 Esc 三种方式关闭弹窗"},{"parent":"b2b1fc27-5685-4b6e-9376-c913ee87cdc2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5179d6f6-34c6-4fc0-ab7e-9a0a61adc93a","title":"预期：三种方式均能关闭弹窗且都不会撤销已完成的授权；关闭后卡片均为已连接状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b2b1fc27-5685-4b6e-9376-c913ee87cdc2","title":"🟡【P2】成功弹窗的关闭方式一致性"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"64ec8ec8-fc41-442f-a3e7-a8747b34dd7d","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"327b41c8-2e88-430f-9c8d-23d0a9a440ac","title":"授权成功弹窗操作"},{"parent":"fc3b96fb-fdd0-49e8-9c0a-cf787c5b1053","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"acd6abcb-529a-4de0-ba32-81763f840eca","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b08ccfb2-6c93-4494-ae22-cf8b627d7f01","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"df520d6d-1667-478c-8978-39cbe0db2a55","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"86586d6b-d46d-4f50-a501-cf23f167b58f","title":"前置：某连接器处于已连接状态；角色：房间成员；入口：卡片右下角「解除授权」按钮"},{"parent":"df520d6d-1667-478c-8978-39cbe0db2a55","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5acfec5e-b272-4305-925a-a21086b93438","title":"操作：点击解除授权并观察按钮变化直到完成"},{"parent":"df520d6d-1667-478c-8978-39cbe0db2a55","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"55cad2c7-7f70-4195-aa70-cd6295000a38","title":"预期：按钮先显示「解除中」且不可重复点击；完成后按钮变回「授权」，卡片左下角由已连接变为需要授权；连接器保持已安装未被卸载"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"df520d6d-1667-478c-8978-39cbe0db2a55","title":"🔴【P0】从卡片解除授权"},{"parent":"b08ccfb2-6c93-4494-ae22-cf8b627d7f01","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e1c0b2e0-2c44-4413-84e9-3188045d3fa1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"35114ed7-b460-4b8f-919b-4f9f3161ab24","title":"前置：某连接器刚被解除授权；角色：房间成员；入口：卡片授权按钮"},{"parent":"e1c0b2e0-2c44-4413-84e9-3188045d3fa1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c2efe7b6-eaa6-4f0b-ae75-91b1ce495f0e","title":"操作：再次点击授权并完成外部登录"},{"parent":"e1c0b2e0-2c44-4413-84e9-3188045d3fa1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c93aa022-2a21-41a8-afc1-516c51b067df","title":"预期：授权流程可正常走完；授权成功后卡片重新显示已连接；不出现因残留旧凭据导致授权失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e1c0b2e0-2c44-4413-84e9-3188045d3fa1","title":"🔴【P0】解除授权后可再次授权"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b08ccfb2-6c93-4494-ae22-cf8b627d7f01","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"acd6abcb-529a-4de0-ba32-81763f840eca","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"532324eb-7c29-47d0-b7ed-4135723e8ca2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c3047f32-b666-47fc-9109-df671466c040","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2bd3c3f3-d98a-4a0c-ab84-0e3c0706e15b","title":"前置：某连接器处于已连接状态且网络异常；角色：房间成员；入口：卡片解除授权按钮"},{"parent":"c3047f32-b666-47fc-9109-df671466c040","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"902c3c6e-9908-496f-90e1-a5b490a08717","title":"操作：在网络断开时点击解除授权，恢复网络后重试"},{"parent":"c3047f32-b666-47fc-9109-df671466c040","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d5446bb1-5cdd-4649-bf80-804bbe3ef754","title":"预期：给出解除失败的明确提示与重试入口；按钮从解除中回到解除授权状态；连接器仍为已连接可用；重试后可成功解除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c3047f32-b666-47fc-9109-df671466c040","title":"🟠【P1】解除授权失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"532324eb-7c29-47d0-b7ed-4135723e8ca2","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"acd6abcb-529a-4de0-ba32-81763f840eca","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"21bc8542-0967-418f-94c9-b165301c81f5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"037bfac7-4dc7-448a-a2da-d7e5fe5f0fcf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1f0c6242-8543-46cc-933a-9234543e825c","title":"前置：某连接器处于已连接状态；角色：房间成员；入口：卡片解除授权按钮"},{"parent":"037bfac7-4dc7-448a-a2da-d7e5fe5f0fcf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a4034b93-1e0c-4881-8a92-2e72e5c041c3","title":"操作：连续快速点击解除授权按钮 10 次"},{"parent":"037bfac7-4dc7-448a-a2da-d7e5fe5f0fcf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"371efcb8-9ae1-40fd-9b85-deb659b1f161","title":"预期：只发起一次解除请求；按钮在首次点击后即进入解除中且不可点击；不出现重复请求或状态来回跳动"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"037bfac7-4dc7-448a-a2da-d7e5fe5f0fcf","title":"🟡【P2】快速连续点击解除授权"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"21bc8542-0967-418f-94c9-b165301c81f5","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"acd6abcb-529a-4de0-ba32-81763f840eca","title":"解除授权"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fc3b96fb-fdd0-49e8-9c0a-cf787c5b1053","title":"连接器授权"},{"parent":"1f3e577f-f87b-460e-9473-33c399fd28eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c67eb785-44f7-4042-853e-58b786c1890d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aee28bdf-6d7a-4e6d-a071-dffaf5c9aebd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"658ebf63-a63e-4fe5-96a7-932ceb36c723","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b00b5366-23a4-4111-a3ad-3e98786ad8e9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b6ce6f42-c72a-4a2e-83de-d51e7269f3f6","title":"前置：已从市场安装过多个连接器；角色：房间成员；入口：连接器页 Installed Tab"},{"parent":"b00b5366-23a4-4111-a3ad-3e98786ad8e9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4359bf29-0cfc-4744-b2cf-fd0d38720941","title":"操作：切换到 Installed Tab 查看列表"},{"parent":"b00b5366-23a4-4111-a3ad-3e98786ad8e9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"75b19360-2e2c-492a-ba16-a2b01f8a7b4a","title":"预期：展示「Installed from marketplace」分组并列出所有从市场安装的连接器；每行展示图标、名称与描述；数量与市场中处于已安装状态的连接器一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b00b5366-23a4-4111-a3ad-3e98786ad8e9","title":"🔴【P0】已安装列表内容与分组"},{"parent":"658ebf63-a63e-4fe5-96a7-932ceb36c723","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"07379a50-615a-4648-ab6f-091a7641f48b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2f7d66b3-769d-487a-beb0-abe2cc9e5a3b","title":"前置：Installed Tab 中存在连接器；角色：房间成员；入口：任一已安装连接器行"},{"parent":"07379a50-615a-4648-ab6f-091a7641f48b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bda8ce44-16ce-4582-ba00-043213ffc828","title":"操作：将鼠标悬浮到某一行，再移开"},{"parent":"07379a50-615a-4648-ab6f-091a7641f48b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5331e4f0-3c33-47f7-8e73-b6a0ade14295","title":"预期：悬浮时该行右侧展示删除图标与启用开关；移开后按设计保留开关、删除图标隐藏或保持可见，行为在各行之间一致；控件不遮挡名称与描述"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"07379a50-615a-4648-ab6f-091a7641f48b","title":"🔴【P0】已安装行内的操作控件"},{"parent":"658ebf63-a63e-4fe5-96a7-932ceb36c723","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d61677b3-2e22-4251-90a5-25da84f4d4fe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea4e057d-b679-48b8-800e-de254c1ebe15","title":"前置：账号下未从市场安装过任何连接器；角色：新用户；入口：连接器页 Installed Tab"},{"parent":"d61677b3-2e22-4251-90a5-25da84f4d4fe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"50366df5-da7f-44f4-80b3-539795667a80","title":"操作：切换到 Installed Tab"},{"parent":"d61677b3-2e22-4251-90a5-25da84f4d4fe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7144378c-df7f-4ec2-8ce4-6bfaf8d6e8b2","title":"预期：展示明确的空态说明并提供前往 Marketplace 的引导；不展示空的分组标题；不出现一直加载中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d61677b3-2e22-4251-90a5-25da84f4d4fe","title":"🟠【P1】未安装任何连接器时的空态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"658ebf63-a63e-4fe5-96a7-932ceb36c723","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"aee28bdf-6d7a-4e6d-a071-dffaf5c9aebd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e1e6b2cc-f336-4e1a-ae8a-3536c6feff14","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"83ff0f95-96d2-47b0-8d92-92dac5e1f9d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d58201a6-9932-4349-990c-04e6a0babc5f","title":"前置：连接器页已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：Installed Tab"},{"parent":"83ff0f95-96d2-47b0-8d92-92dac5e1f9d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"146f92ae-d0fb-4229-b92f-5ee0c9737e74","title":"操作：在网络断开时切换到 Installed Tab，恢复网络后重试"},{"parent":"83ff0f95-96d2-47b0-8d92-92dac5e1f9d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44205da0-ebcb-4dcc-9548-deeedd8573ec","title":"预期：给出加载失败提示与重试入口；不误展示为无已安装连接器的空态；重试后列表正常展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"83ff0f95-96d2-47b0-8d92-92dac5e1f9d1","title":"🟡【P2】已安装列表加载失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e1e6b2cc-f336-4e1a-ae8a-3536c6feff14","title":"异常场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aee28bdf-6d7a-4e6d-a071-dffaf5c9aebd","title":"已安装列表展示"},{"parent":"c67eb785-44f7-4042-853e-58b786c1890d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a8baa6ab-8723-4b56-9976-0f993f6589c8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fba79364-f082-4eda-a75a-0cbef24db242","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"44f1da72-fc2b-4c2a-89b3-69a080f2cf07","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"52d954fd-88fd-492c-85d2-98f52b7ed09b","title":"前置：某已安装连接器的开关处于关闭状态；角色：房间成员；入口：Installed Tab 行内开关"},{"parent":"44f1da72-fc2b-4c2a-89b3-69a080f2cf07","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"55796bc4-140c-42ac-af48-268423d529fd","title":"操作：点击开关将其打开"},{"parent":"44f1da72-fc2b-4c2a-89b3-69a080f2cf07","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dbff2216-c165-4a49-9fa5-1055f48a1293","title":"预期：开关立即变为开启态并保持；切换 Tab 或重开房间后仍为开启；输入框连接器面板中该连接器同步显示为已开启"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"44f1da72-fc2b-4c2a-89b3-69a080f2cf07","title":"🔴【P0】打开连接器开关"},{"parent":"fba79364-f082-4eda-a75a-0cbef24db242","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9c78bc2b-5047-4ed9-a54e-0545656f4652","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"599c14c0-c394-426a-a303-6cf74e2233ff","title":"前置：某已安装连接器的开关处于开启状态；角色：房间成员；入口：Installed Tab 行内开关"},{"parent":"9c78bc2b-5047-4ed9-a54e-0545656f4652","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4a72acc-d7e8-419c-9e3c-01c93aa74673","title":"操作：点击开关将其关闭"},{"parent":"9c78bc2b-5047-4ed9-a54e-0545656f4652","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d45ddf86-5608-4017-a9cd-602f16e5f9e2","title":"预期：开关变为关闭态并保持；连接器仍保留在已安装列表中不被删除；输入框连接器面板中该连接器同步显示为关闭"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9c78bc2b-5047-4ed9-a54e-0545656f4652","title":"🔴【P0】关闭连接器开关"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fba79364-f082-4eda-a75a-0cbef24db242","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"a8baa6ab-8723-4b56-9976-0f993f6589c8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d6bc1b01-08b7-4e27-bc85-09bb328f808c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6d17bb3f-44fb-4a4c-b89e-47b68ca0cc10","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"82af9be1-949f-49b7-927a-85857ba4406d","title":"前置：某已安装连接器；角色：房间成员；入口：Installed Tab 行内开关"},{"parent":"6d17bb3f-44fb-4a4c-b89e-47b68ca0cc10","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c2007cb1-2baa-411a-ab26-e4d67f422d4b","title":"操作：在网络断开时切换开关，等待失败提示后恢复网络重试"},{"parent":"6d17bb3f-44fb-4a4c-b89e-47b68ca0cc10","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5b92302a-e9b3-4d17-9b3d-e289971b3927","title":"预期：给出切换失败的明确提示并将开关回滚到操作前的真实状态；不出现界面已切换但实际未生效的不一致；重试后切换成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6d17bb3f-44fb-4a4c-b89e-47b68ca0cc10","title":"🟠【P1】开关切换失败时状态回滚"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d6bc1b01-08b7-4e27-bc85-09bb328f808c","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"a8baa6ab-8723-4b56-9976-0f993f6589c8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c158ed1e-3b02-4196-8ba5-84cca0db9851","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"77706ee3-c750-426e-9c33-d440aaffcc4d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bbf72c5d-e71e-49b9-8bcd-ace02f9c9ee8","title":"前置：某已安装连接器；角色：房间成员；入口：Installed Tab 行内开关"},{"parent":"77706ee3-c750-426e-9c33-d440aaffcc4d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d08304ae-3bc6-41d9-af0a-e025b9ad0c18","title":"操作：连续快速点击同一个开关 10 次"},{"parent":"77706ee3-c750-426e-9c33-d440aaffcc4d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"24bfa119-1eab-4bcd-96cf-84132c93a65e","title":"预期：最终状态与最后一次点击一致且与服务端一致；中间过程不出现开关来回闪回；不产生多余的重复请求"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"77706ee3-c750-426e-9c33-d440aaffcc4d","title":"🟡【P2】快速连续切换开关"},{"parent":"c158ed1e-3b02-4196-8ba5-84cca0db9851","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0ed90246-3b6d-4ec1-9e29-2368396e9d68","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f00aaee6-0874-450b-9ee1-444389008cbe","title":"前置：Installed Tab 中存在 3 个以上连接器；角色：房间成员；入口：各行开关"},{"parent":"0ed90246-3b6d-4ec1-9e29-2368396e9d68","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a2a29510-a1b2-4b66-a530-553f27e3b6fd","title":"操作：依次打开其中两个、关闭一个，然后刷新页面"},{"parent":"0ed90246-3b6d-4ec1-9e29-2368396e9d68","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6819df5e-a6de-47eb-86ef-d980b8f8d03c","title":"预期：每个连接器的开关状态独立且与操作一致；刷新后三者状态均保持；不出现一个开关影响另一行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0ed90246-3b6d-4ec1-9e29-2368396e9d68","title":"🟡【P2】多个连接器开关互不影响"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c158ed1e-3b02-4196-8ba5-84cca0db9851","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a8baa6ab-8723-4b56-9976-0f993f6589c8","title":"启用与停用开关"},{"parent":"c67eb785-44f7-4042-853e-58b786c1890d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"75c14a10-3c17-4f7d-8706-7ed69bf32408","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"07598c57-87dd-40f5-aa0a-25f06a9c6df8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d024c2af-798e-4798-af8d-09f73c7cfde2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c9d7259-b839-42b7-b6be-7a68d3de267b","title":"前置：某连接器出现在 Installed Tab 中；角色：房间成员；入口：行内删除图标"},{"parent":"d024c2af-798e-4798-af8d-09f73c7cfde2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"603f5932-a159-4333-96fd-5acef0297f6c","title":"操作：点击删除图标并完成确认，随后分别查看 Installed Tab 与 Marketplace"},{"parent":"d024c2af-798e-4798-af8d-09f73c7cfde2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5a2ff6d1-1deb-4f04-af25-5c05823526c0","title":"预期：该连接器从 Installed Tab 中移除；Marketplace 中对应卡片回到需要重新安装的状态（显示 + 号）；本地运行文件与已安装的 CLI 被删除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d024c2af-798e-4798-af8d-09f73c7cfde2","title":"🔴【P0】删除已安装连接器"},{"parent":"07598c57-87dd-40f5-aa0a-25f06a9c6df8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"68db0131-4731-4136-ab35-8689a11b2b1f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0ba9324e-0668-422f-a6f4-3b10ec61bc8d","title":"前置：某连接器刚从 Installed Tab 中删除；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 卡片 + 号"},{"parent":"68db0131-4731-4136-ab35-8689a11b2b1f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3f758b58-1082-4ede-9be8-57144f1769cb","title":"操作：在 Marketplace 中重新点击该连接器的 + 号"},{"parent":"68db0131-4731-4136-ab35-8689a11b2b1f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8f767c71-7e42-4266-abca-ee905fa7db69","title":"预期：重新安装成功并按其此前的授权情况进入对应状态；重新出现在 Installed Tab 中；不出现重复条目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"68db0131-4731-4136-ab35-8689a11b2b1f","title":"🟠【P1】删除后重新安装"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"07598c57-87dd-40f5-aa0a-25f06a9c6df8","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"75c14a10-3c17-4f7d-8706-7ed69bf32408","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f6aa4b75-65ab-43e1-855a-06dda6e679a5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aa5e764b-3737-44b3-970a-4e2035eb7285","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6385edea-58c6-4bd6-bce2-afccaac53848","title":"前置：某连接器出现在 Installed Tab 中；角色：房间成员；入口：行内删除图标"},{"parent":"aa5e764b-3737-44b3-970a-4e2035eb7285","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a09abe7e-cc3c-4474-a102-2214855fd91f","title":"操作：在网络断开时执行删除，恢复网络后重试"},{"parent":"aa5e764b-3737-44b3-970a-4e2035eb7285","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e6cba242-0ec1-4aeb-987f-3f9cfa55854d","title":"预期：给出删除失败的明确提示；该连接器仍保留在已安装列表且开关状态不变；重试后删除成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aa5e764b-3737-44b3-970a-4e2035eb7285","title":"🟡【P2】删除请求失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f6aa4b75-65ab-43e1-855a-06dda6e679a5","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"75c14a10-3c17-4f7d-8706-7ed69bf32408","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"eaaa0ed4-d529-4669-9788-7b8ab5deaedc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"eb9a0674-6ddf-424e-99c9-4816ea43ed54","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9c8403dd-0e6a-4bfe-a676-bd38aa054eeb","title":"前置：某连接器已开启且当前会话中 Agent 正在调用它；角色：房间成员；入口：Installed Tab 行内删除图标"},{"parent":"eb9a0674-6ddf-424e-99c9-4816ea43ed54","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"742a4237-63f8-45df-a8ef-f77bc80308f1","title":"操作：在 Agent 调用过程中删除该连接器"},{"parent":"eb9a0674-6ddf-424e-99c9-4816ea43ed54","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2b1c70cd-093b-418e-ae45-a2be11fa3070","title":"预期：给出该连接器正在使用中的提示或在本轮调用结束后再生效；正在进行的调用不出现无说明的中断报错；删除完成后 Agent 明确说明该能力已不可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"eb9a0674-6ddf-424e-99c9-4816ea43ed54","title":"🟡【P2】删除正在被会话使用的连接器"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"eaaa0ed4-d529-4669-9788-7b8ab5deaedc","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"75c14a10-3c17-4f7d-8706-7ed69bf32408","title":"删除已安装连接器"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c67eb785-44f7-4042-853e-58b786c1890d","title":"已安装连接器管理（Installed）"},{"parent":"1f3e577f-f87b-460e-9473-33c399fd28eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"752b6db1-5254-48d3-8164-91340fea30a2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fb43e18c-b2c0-4635-a2f3-85fc0d911f3f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6bd8750b-c3ff-405a-84af-f93e390dcc69","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5efdadc5-d14c-4651-a4c0-252323ad098f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3773ac71-94d0-4eae-8fe5-fcd0137cff53","title":"前置：已进入会话且输入框可用；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框上方 Agent 名称旁的菜单"},{"parent":"5efdadc5-d14c-4651-a4c0-252323ad098f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"80568a99-38c4-4132-aeb3-aaf11125e3d7","title":"操作：点击 Agent 菜单，将鼠标移到 Connectors 一项"},{"parent":"5efdadc5-d14c-4651-a4c0-252323ad098f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"43fdbe1d-f109-4ea9-8e9e-0e20cb982cc6","title":"预期：菜单中展示 Connectors 与 Skills 两项且均带展开箭头；悬浮或点击 Connectors 后在其右侧展开连接器二级面板；面板标题为 Connectors"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5efdadc5-d14c-4651-a4c0-252323ad098f","title":"🔴【P0】从 Agent 菜单展开连接器二级面板"},{"parent":"6bd8750b-c3ff-405a-84af-f93e390dcc69","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a4f5807f-8e8c-440d-9b1c-4b4b51c5adbf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"660bf65d-055b-4e6f-b6bd-9d2ffa5af74f","title":"前置：账号下可用连接器数量超过默认展示数；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框连接器面板"},{"parent":"a4f5807f-8e8c-440d-9b1c-4b4b51c5adbf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b0cd00ec-9cab-4186-950a-e7f0142abebe","title":"操作：打开连接器面板，清点列表中的条目数量"},{"parent":"a4f5807f-8e8c-440d-9b1c-4b4b51c5adbf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"149df5bc-d228-450c-89bc-840a9f58092a","title":"预期：面板默认展示 10 个连接器，底部提供「View more connectors」入口；不一次性铺开全部连接器"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a4f5807f-8e8c-440d-9b1c-4b4b51c5adbf","title":"🔴【P0】连接器面板默认展示数量"},{"parent":"6bd8750b-c3ff-405a-84af-f93e390dcc69","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8083952e-8bb4-46f3-b136-c98432e50db7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e0dafe21-301a-46db-927c-dea5e030c61b","title":"前置：账号下同时存在未安装、已安装未授权与已授权的连接器；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框连接器面板"},{"parent":"8083952e-8bb4-46f3-b136-c98432e50db7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a4fce1e0-6e17-41a6-9126-da55ce48556a","title":"操作：逐条查看面板中各连接器右侧的控件"},{"parent":"8083952e-8bb4-46f3-b136-c98432e50db7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9152369a-190c-4bc4-a6d9-1e6b6735ce1a","title":"预期：每条展示连接器图标与名称；已授权的显示开关，已安装未授权的显示 Authorize 文字入口，未安装的显示 Install 文字入口；三种状态在同一列表中可清晰区分"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8083952e-8bb4-46f3-b136-c98432e50db7","title":"🔴【P0】面板内条目信息与状态区分"},{"parent":"6bd8750b-c3ff-405a-84af-f93e390dcc69","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"028c56ad-5473-4c5e-b3fa-0b259788b541","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"62e7ef71-377f-4093-b1e4-c0e70a0d9a8a","title":"前置：连接器面板已展开；角色：房间成员；入口：面板外部区域与 Esc 键"},{"parent":"028c56ad-5473-4c5e-b3fa-0b259788b541","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ed2c2af-c960-49af-8a55-3fbfbdb66d76","title":"操作：分别点击面板外部区域与按 Esc 关闭面板"},{"parent":"028c56ad-5473-4c5e-b3fa-0b259788b541","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"05ee36c5-5f64-42d8-bd33-0f7ab0208d9f","title":"预期：两种方式均能关闭面板并回到输入框；已做出的开关变更保持生效；输入框中已输入的内容不丢失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"028c56ad-5473-4c5e-b3fa-0b259788b541","title":"🟠【P1】关闭连接器面板"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6bd8750b-c3ff-405a-84af-f93e390dcc69","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"fb43e18c-b2c0-4635-a2f3-85fc0d911f3f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"89b0df73-075b-43e1-b96a-0543a2dba911","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a9e9a1f6-015e-485f-97a4-ee81150ea798","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0dac451e-5093-4cf3-bfd7-e74a1212b838","title":"前置：当前网络异常；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框连接器面板"},{"parent":"a9e9a1f6-015e-485f-97a4-ee81150ea798","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e008254-b6ed-4aaa-93f8-619261befb18","title":"操作：在网络断开时展开连接器面板，恢复网络后重新展开"},{"parent":"a9e9a1f6-015e-485f-97a4-ee81150ea798","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"043fa555-1f55-4296-acb8-25a0603c5d35","title":"预期：面板给出加载失败提示与重试入口；不展示为空列表也不长时间停留在加载中；恢复网络后重新展开可正常加载"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a9e9a1f6-015e-485f-97a4-ee81150ea798","title":"🟡【P2】连接器面板加载失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"89b0df73-075b-43e1-b96a-0543a2dba911","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"fb43e18c-b2c0-4635-a2f3-85fc0d911f3f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"29e45530-33f7-4bd1-9acc-d18d36c2eb4b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"27b714f1-c2a8-4253-8556-289cf8cfe866","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"92c7f539-e59f-4b47-b8a3-238c2c50a63e","title":"前置：应用窗口宽度较小或输入框靠近屏幕边缘；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框连接器面板"},{"parent":"27b714f1-c2a8-4253-8556-289cf8cfe866","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bbfa8aed-2e8f-4e34-9c26-4d06616b8a79","title":"操作：在窄窗口下展开连接器面板"},{"parent":"27b714f1-c2a8-4253-8556-289cf8cfe866","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ca6da5c1-d6b4-44c8-8df0-f2b43289d932","title":"预期：面板自动调整弹出方向使其完整落在可视区域内；不被窗口边缘裁切；列表可滚动查看全部条目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"27b714f1-c2a8-4253-8556-289cf8cfe866","title":"🟡【P2】面板在窄窗口与页面边缘的展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"29e45530-33f7-4bd1-9acc-d18d36c2eb4b","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fb43e18c-b2c0-4635-a2f3-85fc0d911f3f","title":"面板入口与列表展示"},{"parent":"752b6db1-5254-48d3-8164-91340fea30a2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"45eff09a-cde8-4138-9b1a-c896e70e7961","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0cd8038c-06bf-4076-9b61-f6becebb2eea","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ffbf1d3b-e82e-46fd-9386-0adf0daf6289","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6423eeed-a861-40e1-8f6e-342939b703b0","title":"前置：面板中某连接器显示 Install；角色：房间成员；入口：该条目的 Install 入口"},{"parent":"ffbf1d3b-e82e-46fd-9386-0adf0daf6289","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"88b8a90b-65d7-44d7-a733-60c28d276ee1","title":"操作：点击 Install"},{"parent":"ffbf1d3b-e82e-46fd-9386-0adf0daf6289","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76d904f9-3604-4eba-9cd2-2667ba858890","title":"预期：弹出安装弹窗；弹窗中展示该连接器的图标、名称与安装说明，底部提供取消与安装两个按钮；弹窗内容对应的是所点击的连接器而非其他条目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ffbf1d3b-e82e-46fd-9386-0adf0daf6289","title":"🔴【P0】点击 Install 弹出安装弹窗"},{"parent":"0cd8038c-06bf-4076-9b61-f6becebb2eea","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6a2a4abb-a400-4c3b-aec1-254638c5b153","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"57e1565a-0594-4632-a5c8-11d344e09b7c","title":"前置：安装弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗内的安装按钮"},{"parent":"6a2a4abb-a400-4c3b-aec1-254638c5b153","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b695c1fe-705d-4b5f-82ea-6d55b17fa864","title":"操作：点击安装并等待完成"},{"parent":"6a2a4abb-a400-4c3b-aec1-254638c5b153","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f29ec146-eee0-431f-87c5-f6672764912f","title":"预期：安装按钮进入加载态且不可重复点击；安装成功后弹窗关闭，该条目由 Install 变为 Authorize；连接器页 Marketplace 中对应卡片同步变为需要授权，Installed Tab 中出现该连接器"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6a2a4abb-a400-4c3b-aec1-254638c5b153","title":"🔴【P0】弹窗内点击安装完成安装"},{"parent":"0cd8038c-06bf-4076-9b61-f6becebb2eea","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7443b896-80ce-453f-9959-cc3ccf336084","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b319bc59-360e-4570-8a93-93537e7ff885","title":"前置：安装弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗内的取消按钮"},{"parent":"7443b896-80ce-453f-9959-cc3ccf336084","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"28875a1c-eed0-4c97-884a-6833bf7156f0","title":"操作：点击取消"},{"parent":"7443b896-80ce-453f-9959-cc3ccf336084","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"349390b4-7c78-4aa0-9109-ca8a745dabe8","title":"预期：弹窗关闭且不执行安装；该条目保持 Install 状态；本地不遗留任何运行文件；Marketplace 中该卡片仍为未安装的 + 号"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7443b896-80ce-453f-9959-cc3ccf336084","title":"🟠【P1】弹窗内点击取消不安装"},{"parent":"0cd8038c-06bf-4076-9b61-f6becebb2eea","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d521767c-04dd-49a2-9340-b2e341a1b7fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"25bc8c5d-3899-4193-bbbb-80177de6c4a2","title":"前置：刚在安装弹窗中点击过取消；角色：房间成员；入口：该条目的 Install 入口"},{"parent":"d521767c-04dd-49a2-9340-b2e341a1b7fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"366a86b2-30df-4103-a344-78fa6d879980","title":"操作：再次点击 Install"},{"parent":"d521767c-04dd-49a2-9340-b2e341a1b7fd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b772dadd-8922-404c-aa20-4accbb60bf87","title":"预期：重新弹出安装弹窗且内容与首次一致；点击安装可正常完成安装；不出现点击无反应或弹窗内容为空"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d521767c-04dd-49a2-9340-b2e341a1b7fd","title":"🟠【P1】再次点击 Install 可重新发起"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0cd8038c-06bf-4076-9b61-f6becebb2eea","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"45eff09a-cde8-4138-9b1a-c896e70e7961","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2aa890b0-a65e-4bab-b58d-f3432af34b5c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dd8b2ed5-20d0-4a9e-8c04-167d5e7015c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d26c1c19-5d0a-4ca3-b86a-195ff59e9719","title":"前置：安装弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗内的安装按钮"},{"parent":"dd8b2ed5-20d0-4a9e-8c04-167d5e7015c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"895c7049-d1a5-4aa7-9f3a-7c3e9767e28a","title":"操作：在网络断开时点击安装，等待失败提示后恢复网络重新安装"},{"parent":"dd8b2ed5-20d0-4a9e-8c04-167d5e7015c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"00c2e869-33c0-4e02-976b-3c118b6930ef","title":"预期：给出安装失败的明确原因与重试入口；按钮从加载态回到可点击的安装态，不残留加载中；本地不遗留半成品运行文件；重试后可安装成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dd8b2ed5-20d0-4a9e-8c04-167d5e7015c1","title":"🟠【P1】弹窗内安装失败"},{"parent":"2aa890b0-a65e-4bab-b58d-f3432af34b5c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0798ae40-f660-403f-ae4c-86dc93ce1ecc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"816aa4fe-7f40-4eed-97f7-b5511fd4fe17","title":"前置：安装弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗右上角关闭按钮、弹窗外部区域与 Esc 键"},{"parent":"0798ae40-f660-403f-ae4c-86dc93ce1ecc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7655428f-a848-4d2f-9169-d3a27d5de97c","title":"操作：分别用点击右上角关闭、点击弹窗外部、按 Esc 三种方式关闭弹窗"},{"parent":"0798ae40-f660-403f-ae4c-86dc93ce1ecc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cccee6ed-7f33-427a-af38-4fdb5aefaa18","title":"预期：三种方式均能关闭弹窗且都不执行安装；关闭后条目保持 Install 状态；三种方式的表现一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0798ae40-f660-403f-ae4c-86dc93ce1ecc","title":"🟡【P2】以其他方式关闭安装弹窗"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2aa890b0-a65e-4bab-b58d-f3432af34b5c","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"45eff09a-cde8-4138-9b1a-c896e70e7961","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"40f601c8-4ad5-4c0b-a0bb-236404bd7624","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"206434a7-4c8b-4d98-81f2-0902340956db","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b0e5f6b0-2c70-4351-b223-1750ea618fae","title":"前置：已在安装弹窗中点击安装且正在安装中；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗外部区域与面板外部区域"},{"parent":"206434a7-4c8b-4d98-81f2-0902340956db","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2ef7a59d-534e-45f5-9cdf-a06bb5943a57","title":"操作：在安装进行中关闭弹窗与面板，稍后重新展开面板"},{"parent":"206434a7-4c8b-4d98-81f2-0902340956db","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7f3d8853-e8a3-4823-bd43-339410f514a1","title":"预期：安装任务不因关闭弹窗或面板而中断；重新展开后条目展示的是安装完成或失败的真实结果，不停留在旧的加载态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"206434a7-4c8b-4d98-81f2-0902340956db","title":"🟡【P2】安装过程中关闭弹窗或面板"},{"parent":"40f601c8-4ad5-4c0b-a0bb-236404bd7624","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7713188e-f578-47bc-bf77-073ca3157819","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb9547a4-c382-4b57-9786-2672a579e894","title":"前置：安装弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗内的安装按钮"},{"parent":"7713188e-f578-47bc-bf77-073ca3157819","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aa09a727-9d03-4462-9ea3-86ea33c4559c","title":"操作：连续快速点击安装按钮 10 次"},{"parent":"7713188e-f578-47bc-bf77-073ca3157819","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5d411f6a-ec45-4e26-ad81-c6d05ec9d990","title":"预期：只发起一次安装任务；按钮在首次点击后即置为不可点击；Installed Tab 中不出现重复条目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7713188e-f578-47bc-bf77-073ca3157819","title":"🟡【P2】快速连续点击弹窗内安装按钮"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"40f601c8-4ad5-4c0b-a0bb-236404bd7624","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"45eff09a-cde8-4138-9b1a-c896e70e7961","title":"未安装连接器的安装入口"},{"parent":"752b6db1-5254-48d3-8164-91340fea30a2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b21fe64e-555f-4c32-ab24-7ceb141a3b3d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"db0e8e0f-297c-4812-9fb9-8b40b07e7f9b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b8b59d5a-0bbf-4c32-9e98-c4bed985390c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"67867e79-fcce-433d-88bf-89442e3437b4","title":"前置：面板中某连接器显示 Authorize；角色：房间成员；入口：该条目的 Authorize 入口"},{"parent":"b8b59d5a-0bbf-4c32-9e98-c4bed985390c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df06d401-6131-4f4c-9064-a365934fa249","title":"操作：点击 Authorize"},{"parent":"b8b59d5a-0bbf-4c32-9e98-c4bed985390c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"845d8b88-9a4b-4245-8486-93a49b42a54f","title":"预期：弹出该连接器的授权引导弹窗；弹窗中展示对应产品的图标组、标题（如 Sign in to Lark）与授权范围说明；背景变暗且不可操作下层页面"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b8b59d5a-0bbf-4c32-9e98-c4bed985390c","title":"🔴【P0】点击未完成授权的连接器弹出引导弹窗"},{"parent":"db0e8e0f-297c-4812-9fb9-8b40b07e7f9b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cf1a07bf-b4e3-428b-8e41-9ec39331e303","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b57b1e03-125b-4f01-b251-80c25bcbc8f3","title":"前置：授权引导弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗内容区"},{"parent":"cf1a07bf-b4e3-428b-8e41-9ec39331e303","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2c12082b-8769-4cdd-adeb-d8e3069c29dd","title":"操作：自上而下查看弹窗内的各元素"},{"parent":"cf1a07bf-b4e3-428b-8e41-9ec39331e303","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ffb69f78-5cba-440c-811a-7999c950c5ab","title":"预期：弹窗展示应用图标组、标题、说明文案（说明将通过何种方式连接以及可访问的能力范围，如日历、文档、多维表与会话）、条目说明区与底部主操作按钮；右上角提供关闭按钮"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cf1a07bf-b4e3-428b-8e41-9ec39331e303","title":"🔴【P0】授权引导弹窗内容完整"},{"parent":"db0e8e0f-297c-4812-9fb9-8b40b07e7f9b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bab955f8-5869-499d-bc5c-f19b70a4b06b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d4a7048e-dc46-4393-bf3a-20675bf55490","title":"前置：授权引导弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗底部主按钮"},{"parent":"bab955f8-5869-499d-bc5c-f19b70a4b06b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d5459ebe-80c7-4dc9-9e60-dd4d0286360c","title":"操作：点击 Sign in 主按钮"},{"parent":"bab955f8-5869-499d-bc5c-f19b70a4b06b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"97dc35b0-c361-4339-97fd-1708473c0de1","title":"预期：打开对应产品的登录授权页；应用内该连接器进入授权中状态；授权页对应的是所点击的连接器而非其他产品"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bab955f8-5869-499d-bc5c-f19b70a4b06b","title":"🔴【P0】点击主按钮进入外部授权"},{"parent":"db0e8e0f-297c-4812-9fb9-8b40b07e7f9b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"79fa3620-655a-4ed2-a97c-2d5cea979c76","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"67586568-41f9-47ac-87d7-d4e0616d860a","title":"前置：已在外部页面完成登录授权；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框连接器面板"},{"parent":"79fa3620-655a-4ed2-a97c-2d5cea979c76","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"823e916b-643f-410c-b6ca-b2cd46f837b7","title":"操作：返回应用重新展开连接器面板"},{"parent":"79fa3620-655a-4ed2-a97c-2d5cea979c76","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1705ee1e-b955-434b-ab47-22bde7e68135","title":"预期：该条目由 Authorize 变为开关且默认开启；连接器页 Marketplace 与 Installed 中该连接器同步显示为已连接与已安装"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"79fa3620-655a-4ed2-a97c-2d5cea979c76","title":"🔴【P0】完成授权后条目状态更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"db0e8e0f-297c-4812-9fb9-8b40b07e7f9b","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"b21fe64e-555f-4c32-ab24-7ceb141a3b3d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1abb1676-57ee-4921-89c5-95561931cd0f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"50bbdbb6-dfb9-44d1-842a-6a0bd5d74214","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"88b4d773-c212-4327-aef7-b88f75855395","title":"前置：授权引导弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗右上角关闭按钮"},{"parent":"50bbdbb6-dfb9-44d1-842a-6a0bd5d74214","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fed17aec-4752-46fe-adb9-aac4f39cf644","title":"操作：点击右上角关闭按钮直接退出"},{"parent":"50bbdbb6-dfb9-44d1-842a-6a0bd5d74214","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7778963-65b2-45d4-83ea-463357225216","title":"预期：弹窗关闭且不发起授权；条目保持 Authorize 状态；再次点击可重新弹出引导弹窗；不写入任何凭据"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"50bbdbb6-dfb9-44d1-842a-6a0bd5d74214","title":"🟠【P1】关闭引导弹窗不完成授权"},{"parent":"1abb1676-57ee-4921-89c5-95561931cd0f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"63e524de-69c6-45af-9b0a-5c45730d7ee3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f2faf51d-7dba-4f07-9736-7908f167165d","title":"前置：已从引导弹窗进入外部授权页；角色：房间成员；入口：外部授权页"},{"parent":"63e524de-69c6-45af-9b0a-5c45730d7ee3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6755a5d7-1da1-4c4a-bca6-85c20d13230f","title":"操作：在授权页选择拒绝或使用无效账号登录，返回应用"},{"parent":"63e524de-69c6-45af-9b0a-5c45730d7ee3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f29a7cda-ed47-49b4-9c0c-584e0033c478","title":"预期：条目回到 Authorize 状态并提示授权未通过；不显示为已连接；开关不出现在该条目上"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"63e524de-69c6-45af-9b0a-5c45730d7ee3","title":"🟠【P1】外部授权失败或被拒绝"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1abb1676-57ee-4921-89c5-95561931cd0f","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"b21fe64e-555f-4c32-ab24-7ceb141a3b3d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4d37a4b0-0f91-4952-a6cf-4b0716eb1a6f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7c125f2d-8124-4f1d-acfa-fddbc8650498","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f92eeb63-617d-4b30-af9e-04773ab02a88","title":"前置：应用窗口宽度较小；角色：房间成员；入口：授权引导弹窗"},{"parent":"7c125f2d-8124-4f1d-acfa-fddbc8650498","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7ec7660a-ebf5-4290-b55c-aa954789ffae","title":"操作：在窄窗口下打开授权引导弹窗"},{"parent":"7c125f2d-8124-4f1d-acfa-fddbc8650498","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"99bbc7dc-b7c2-44dd-9018-0d6bee05d563","title":"预期：弹窗自适应宽度且内容完整不截断；说明文案换行正常；主按钮与关闭按钮均完整可见可点击"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7c125f2d-8124-4f1d-acfa-fddbc8650498","title":"🟡【P2】引导弹窗在窄窗口下的展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4d37a4b0-0f91-4952-a6cf-4b0716eb1a6f","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b21fe64e-555f-4c32-ab24-7ceb141a3b3d","title":"未授权连接器与授权引导弹窗"},{"parent":"752b6db1-5254-48d3-8164-91340fea30a2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"17cbf9ce-2745-4213-894b-220f595f1d3f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"03b2d7b9-0391-406e-a63f-5a58d07593b0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8695c27a-4e43-4d87-a46b-de4ac45fa734","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7a958d5f-96c1-4035-94a4-0310884e0791","title":"前置：面板中某已授权连接器的开关处于关闭状态；角色：房间成员；入口：该条目的开关"},{"parent":"8695c27a-4e43-4d87-a46b-de4ac45fa734","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3248e824-57e7-4b9d-8e18-f5b4d1cb4641","title":"操作：点击开关将其打开"},{"parent":"8695c27a-4e43-4d87-a46b-de4ac45fa734","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df6286b2-8846-4ba9-ab1f-18d034dbb09b","title":"预期：开关变为开启态；关闭面板重新展开后仍为开启；连接器页 Installed Tab 中该连接器开关同步为开启"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8695c27a-4e43-4d87-a46b-de4ac45fa734","title":"🔴【P0】在面板中开启连接器"},{"parent":"03b2d7b9-0391-406e-a63f-5a58d07593b0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"046b321b-217c-467f-92ab-a4c2132cdd95","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d0686989-4609-4ed6-8c64-217616c5ea59","title":"前置：面板中某已授权连接器的开关处于开启状态；角色：房间成员；入口：该条目的开关"},{"parent":"046b321b-217c-467f-92ab-a4c2132cdd95","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df17e59b-287f-4bf3-b634-340f661742a1","title":"操作：点击开关将其关闭"},{"parent":"046b321b-217c-467f-92ab-a4c2132cdd95","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aa85c482-3bb3-4024-bc6e-eb02e6a1f8f2","title":"预期：开关变为关闭态且状态保持；连接器仍保留在面板与已安装列表中；Installed Tab 中的开关同步为关闭"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"046b321b-217c-467f-92ab-a4c2132cdd95","title":"🔴【P0】在面板中关闭连接器"},{"parent":"03b2d7b9-0391-406e-a63f-5a58d07593b0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"990e8cfa-200d-4b0e-bb23-d646f88d6fd3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"162a57f4-7c