开关闪回；不产生重复请求；与 Installed Tab 中的状态保持一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ffcb532e-4bf3-48e8-a67a-7db8bbbcf9e3","title":"🟡【P2】快速连续切换面板内开关"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"af006342-90b6-422f-8489-76810c4ea1ce","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"17cbf9ce-2745-4213-894b-220f595f1d3f","title":"已授权连接器开关"},{"parent":"752b6db1-5254-48d3-8164-91340fea30a2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e7070574-bcf7-458d-99f2-0ce3960adf64","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cdeaf738-5059-4a6d-8205-49dbb20fb8ee","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"062e02bd-9b78-4845-8ffd-68557d8c2f33","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c0283425-b95e-404f-9292-11d3c5b69797","title":"前置：连接器面板已展开且底部有「View more connectors」；角色：房间成员；入口：面板底部入口"},{"parent":"062e02bd-9b78-4845-8ffd-68557d8c2f33","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"185e02cc-3193-469b-bbdd-07af7b09a8a9","title":"操作：点击 View more connectors"},{"parent":"062e02bd-9b78-4845-8ffd-68557d8c2f33","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2d3d5253-e169-4318-bd8f-efa258eae5e0","title":"预期：跳转到「连接器-市场」Tab 并展示完整连接器列表；面板关闭；输入框中已输入的内容不丢失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"062e02bd-9b78-4845-8ffd-68557d8c2f33","title":"🔴【P0】点击查看更多跳转市场"},{"parent":"cdeaf738-5059-4a6d-8205-49dbb20fb8ee","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3eee2c68-31ff-4024-8c0f-c598fec18c25","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e883664-ef3d-4182-bf02-1227e2d73232","title":"前置：刚通过查看更多进入连接器市场；角色：房间成员；入口：Agents 面板中的会话"},{"parent":"3eee2c68-31ff-4024-8c0f-c598fec18c25","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7b3970b1-fbbe-4603-92a6-fc27a4b2b713","title":"操作：在市场中安装并授权一个连接器，然后返回原会话并展开连接器面板"},{"parent":"3eee2c68-31ff-4024-8c0f-c598fec18c25","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6bc36318-95e3-4414-b3cd-2a8d944f6095","title":"预期：该连接器在面板中显示为开关状态且默认开启；面板列表已按最新状态刷新，不需要重开房间"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3eee2c68-31ff-4024-8c0f-c598fec18c25","title":"🟠【P1】从市场返回会话后面板状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cdeaf738-5059-4a6d-8205-49dbb20fb8ee","title":"正常场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e7070574-bcf7-458d-99f2-0ce3960adf64","title":"查看更多连接器"},{"parent":"752b6db1-5254-48d3-8164-91340fea30a2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3d9ce278-b7da-481f-8b19-757e939361fb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5cb9eda5-8727-4cae-9dd5-e2a5e6969f4a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"04c328a2-6069-4556-8032-3b9bc8a89b22","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0f25298e-3bed-479f-9ed7-45929d713f29","title":"前置：面板中某已授权连接器的开关刚被打开；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框底部图标区"},{"parent":"04c328a2-6069-4556-8032-3b9bc8a89b22","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ef110739-c1de-4350-98d8-3d58f23b4706","title":"操作：关闭面板后查看输入框底部的图标区"},{"parent":"04c328a2-6069-4556-8032-3b9bc8a89b22","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e74022b6-802a-432c-ac07-eaeeef5ad4ea","title":"预期：该连接器的图标出现在输入框底部的连接器图标区；图标与该连接器一致不错位；悬浮可见连接器名称"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"04c328a2-6069-4556-8032-3b9bc8a89b22","title":"🔴【P0】开启后图标显示在输入框"},{"parent":"5cb9eda5-8727-4cae-9dd5-e2a5e6969f4a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e144df7d-9f78-42a9-862b-9ab2e3606fed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c309ac4b-691d-44aa-b5e1-614629f75ce7","title":"前置：某连接器已开启且图标显示在输入框；角色：房间成员；入口：连接器面板开关"},{"parent":"e144df7d-9f78-42a9-862b-9ab2e3606fed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"525ecfdb-0130-40f8-be68-4c6e0eee2660","title":"操作：在面板中关闭该连接器的开关，再查看输入框底部图标区"},{"parent":"e144df7d-9f78-42a9-862b-9ab2e3606fed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ac285562-44b7-4b3c-bf89-78c6588e8c9c","title":"预期：该连接器图标从输入框中移除；其他已开启连接器的图标保留且位置不错乱"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e144df7d-9f78-42a9-862b-9ab2e3606fed","title":"🔴【P0】关闭后图标从输入框移除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5cb9eda5-8727-4cae-9dd5-e2a5e6969f4a","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"3d9ce278-b7da-481f-8b19-757e939361fb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"33c2a33a-8565-4f1f-8e41-71bebff01908","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"622b2619-378f-42a0-849a-460ca8661701","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8b43cbe7-8a1f-46ec-86e8-dada407c0e7c","title":"前置：已授权并开启 6 个以上连接器；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框底部图标区"},{"parent":"622b2619-378f-42a0-849a-460ca8661701","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7a5226c3-b111-404b-8fc0-77be634993d5","title":"操作：查看输入框底部的连接器图标展示"},{"parent":"622b2619-378f-42a0-849a-460ca8661701","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"45ca8051-fd2e-4ff5-a079-bf494d1691a6","title":"预期：图标区在超出可用宽度时折叠或以数量角标收纳，不挤压输入框其他按钮；折叠后可展开查看全部已开启连接器"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"622b2619-378f-42a0-849a-460ca8661701","title":"🟡【P2】开启连接器数量较多时的图标区"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"33c2a33a-8565-4f1f-8e41-71bebff01908","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3d9ce278-b7da-481f-8b19-757e939361fb","title":"连接器图标与输入框联动"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"752b6db1-5254-48d3-8164-91340fea30a2","title":"输入框连接器面板"},{"parent":"1f3e577f-f87b-460e-9473-33c399fd28eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c6cb00ed-d1d5-4e8a-bb2c-04512334fe2c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bd753bcb-2244-424a-81b8-6afb569c8228","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2fc1a892-44c9-42a6-9196-5af0d6647e17","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7350cab6-b670-4fc0-bb80-8eac7c325b62","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"593e8329-62d5-4ae9-8d2b-ff49249e24e4","title":"前置：某连接器已授权且开关处于开启；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"7350cab6-b670-4fc0-bb80-8eac7c325b62","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e0064b1-272f-41bd-9c2e-d44170c8f2c1","title":"操作：发送一条需要该连接器才能完成的任务，观察工具调用详情"},{"parent":"7350cab6-b670-4fc0-bb80-8eac7c325b62","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1abe8341-83d2-46de-9a80-2986d25d7063","title":"预期：Agent 成功调用该连接器并返回真实结果；工具调用详情中可见对该连接器的调用记录与参数；任务正常完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7350cab6-b670-4fc0-bb80-8eac7c325b62","title":"🔴【P0】开启后 Agent 可调用连接器能力"},{"parent":"2fc1a892-44c9-42a6-9196-5af0d6647e17","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4fb24110-58f1-41a5-803b-ee78c25ef72f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e2266434-3dad-4b05-b0bc-35384aa701d2","title":"前置：某连接器已授权但开关处于关闭；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"4fb24110-58f1-41a5-803b-ee78c25ef72f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ba1868da-773b-4fea-888f-71803b759e30","title":"操作：发送同一条需要该连接器的任务"},{"parent":"4fb24110-58f1-41a5-803b-ee78c25ef72f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ad2e4864-c974-43d3-be88-0ecc3a7cc0a9","title":"预期：Agent 不调用该连接器并明确说明该能力当前不可用或需先开启；不出现调用后长时间无响应；提示中指向开启该连接器的入口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4fb24110-58f1-41a5-803b-ee78c25ef72f","title":"🔴【P0】关闭后 Agent 不再调用该连接器"},{"parent":"2fc1a892-44c9-42a6-9196-5af0d6647e17","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a845e7b4-c391-41cf-a590-ea2570cb5d5e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d5ae5d72-0893-428c-a3fe-37772f56a45c","title":"前置：会话正在运行且目标连接器处于关闭；角色：房间成员；入口：连接器面板开关"},{"parent":"a845e7b4-c391-41cf-a590-ea2570cb5d5e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f8eb2f52-6def-49ed-9aea-eb2b799e67da","title":"操作：在 Agent 回复过程中打开该连接器开关，等待本轮结束后再发送需要它的任务"},{"parent":"a845e7b4-c391-41cf-a590-ea2570cb5d5e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"493c825a-0abf-4fc3-ba3c-4fcd9d98f8fb","title":"预期：开关切换不影响正在进行的回复；下一轮任务中该连接器可被正常调用；界面状态与实际生效范围一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a845e7b4-c391-41cf-a590-ea2570cb5d5e","title":"🟠【P1】会话运行中开启连接器"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2fc1a892-44c9-42a6-9196-5af0d6647e17","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"bd753bcb-2244-424a-81b8-6afb569c8228","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9a834e83-eecb-4a3b-9ea7-1b12a86fccaf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c48f9984-e3e7-4c4d-8892-127cf60298bc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6356babe-5adb-4cda-a3e1-bce2542e4c66","title":"前置：某连接器未安装；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"c48f9984-e3e7-4c4d-8892-127cf60298bc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c08f858b-fa2a-4374-8860-31f22a9190f7","title":"操作：发送一条需要该连接器的任务"},{"parent":"c48f9984-e3e7-4c4d-8892-127cf60298bc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"87e4128e-2337-416d-828d-d8f3285f9e51","title":"预期：Agent 明确说明该连接器尚未安装并给出前往安装的引导；不返回无信息量的失败；不产生持续等待的僵尸会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c48f9984-e3e7-4c4d-8892-127cf60298bc","title":"🟠【P1】未安装时要求使用该连接器能力"},{"parent":"9a834e83-eecb-4a3b-9ea7-1b12a86fccaf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5d7215a5-98e8-4d11-b6ac-548e683b7b34","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2d1bdd4f-d3db-49f8-ac08-2ab641691713","title":"前置：某连接器已安装但未授权；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"5d7215a5-98e8-4d11-b6ac-548e683b7b34","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cbc771c7-b860-4f7c-9942-90ddd1c61e09","title":"操作：发送一条需要该连接器的任务"},{"parent":"5d7215a5-98e8-4d11-b6ac-548e683b7b34","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b6db0c73-ab8e-424e-ae11-6118200c22bf","title":"预期：Agent 明确说明需要先完成授权并给出授权入口；不静默失败也不返回伪造结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5d7215a5-98e8-4d11-b6ac-548e683b7b34","title":"🟠【P1】已安装未授权时要求使用该连接器能力"},{"parent":"9a834e83-eecb-4a3b-9ea7-1b12a86fccaf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c11994dd-b88b-4f01-8729-ec1b6fb75133","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"73b034cd-e32e-4366-9f9e-a1d3eaf6bbdb","title":"前置：某连接器已授权并可用；角色：房间成员；入口：外部产品的账号设置与会话输入框"},{"parent":"c11994dd-b88b-4f01-8729-ec1b6fb75133","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3d10893f-1430-41e8-a15a-376795d84520","title":"操作：在外部产品中撤销该连接器的授权，回到会话再次发送需要它的任务"},{"parent":"c11994dd-b88b-4f01-8729-ec1b6fb75133","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1ba0820c-b58e-49d0-bf99-017448b584d9","title":"预期：给出授权已失效、需要重新授权的明确提示；应用内该连接器状态同步更新为需要授权；重新授权后可恢复调用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c11994dd-b88b-4f01-8729-ec1b6fb75133","title":"🟠【P1】授权在使用过程中失效"},{"parent":"9a834e83-eecb-4a3b-9ea7-1b12a86fccaf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a9b947dc-3d87-4fc8-9107-f233c5c30bba","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"efd88f99-97c2-4aea-99d4-bfd362e4ce40","title":"前置：某连接器已开启但目标服务不可达；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"a9b947dc-3d87-4fc8-9107-f233c5c30bba","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"53e36a9d-f938-4ed7-829b-1ff63b9b1cdf","title":"操作：发送一条需要该连接器的任务并等待结果"},{"parent":"a9b947dc-3d87-4fc8-9107-f233c5c30bba","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"929a0b26-8a8a-460b-bda1-70eba0b38275","title":"预期：工具调用在合理时间内结束并给出可读的失败原因；会话状态收敛为失败或继续执行其余步骤；不长期停留在调用中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a9b947dc-3d87-4fc8-9107-f233c5c30bba","title":"🟡【P2】连接器调用超时或返回错误"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9a834e83-eecb-4a3b-9ea7-1b12a86fccaf","title":"异常场景（4）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bd753bcb-2244-424a-81b8-6afb569c8228","title":"连接器能力调用"},{"parent":"c6cb00ed-d1d5-4e8a-bb2c-04512334fe2c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e53486c6-4b1e-4366-9c1f-e04ccc5b5a04","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3a8cfc45-4a97-4f3b-91fe-64607c1a4b97","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b94195f8-4837-406d-9663-dad4c21cf4d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c678317-aefa-4d42-883b-726c7264c015","title":"前置：某连接器刚完成安装与授权；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace、Installed Tab 与输入框连接器面板"},{"parent":"b94195f8-4837-406d-9663-dad4c21cf4d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6b8e692a-77fc-45a7-b6b7-1490e9ac18ce","title":"操作：依次在三处查看该连接器的状态"},{"parent":"b94195f8-4837-406d-9663-dad4c21cf4d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"73dc1d6d-ebf7-4611-984f-1b6e2d30e206","title":"预期：Marketplace 显示已连接与 ✓；Installed Tab 中存在该条目且开关开启；输入框面板中显示为开关且开启；三处描述一致不矛盾"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b94195f8-4837-406d-9663-dad4c21cf4d2","title":"🔴【P0】市场、已安装与输入框面板三处状态一致"},{"parent":"3a8cfc45-4a97-4f3b-91fe-64607c1a4b97","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"400e1383-879d-4217-9c24-3126038f0761","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"af904c7c-d789-4138-b07e-9fe69fa0396c","title":"前置：某连接器处于已连接且开启；角色：房间成员；入口：Installed Tab 与输入框连接器面板"},{"parent":"400e1383-879d-4217-9c24-3126038f0761","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dfdea561-67a3-414d-bc88-a79c584bc4c0","title":"操作：在 Installed Tab 关闭该连接器开关，再打开输入框连接器面板查看"},{"parent":"400e1383-879d-4217-9c24-3126038f0761","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eb0e42fc-a839-46e6-b08b-ce8314b7f710","title":"预期：面板中该连接器同步显示为关闭；反向操作同样同步；无需刷新页面或重开房间"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"400e1383-879d-4217-9c24-3126038f0761","title":"🔴【P0】一处变更后其余入口同步"},{"parent":"3a8cfc45-4a97-4f3b-91fe-64607c1a4b97","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3048eeec-ac6c-4516-97b0-2419eecb8711","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7f0434b-acd5-4cdc-ac17-e4bc26aa13bc","title":"前置：某连接器处于已连接状态；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 卡片、Installed Tab 与输入框面板"},{"parent":"3048eeec-ac6c-4516-97b0-2419eecb8711","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"946119f5-4c74-40b1-8272-37d474578806","title":"操作：从 Marketplace 卡片执行卸载，随后查看其余两处"},{"parent":"3048eeec-ac6c-4516-97b0-2419eecb8711","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ee1c7349-bc19-4c00-91ec-de5a9c075c72","title":"预期：Installed Tab 中该条目移除；输入框面板中该连接器回到 Install 状态；Marketplace 卡片显示 + 号；输入框底部该连接器图标消失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3048eeec-ac6c-4516-97b0-2419eecb8711","title":"🟠【P1】卸载后三处状态同步"},{"parent":"3a8cfc45-4a97-4f3b-91fe-64607c1a4b97","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e94212a5-247d-4c31-ba9f-d9e788f5d49a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e1fa072-d021-46a1-a2d6-4706dae1135a","title":"前置：同一连接器处于未安装状态；角色：房间成员；入口：Marketplace 卡片 + 号与输入框面板 Install"},{"parent":"e94212a5-247d-4c31-ba9f-d9e788f5d49a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"39521e6d-ddcd-4c07-8427-d42878bb33a9","title":"操作：先从输入框面板点击 Install 走安装弹窗完成安装，卸载后再从 Marketplace 点击 + 号安装，对比两次的交互与结果"},{"parent":"e94212a5-247d-4c31-ba9f-d9e788f5d49a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b571288e-0f65-4ad6-949c-45d94bf0d4c7","title":"预期：两个入口安装完成后的最终状态一致：卡片显示需要授权、面板条目显示 Authorize、Installed Tab 中出现该连接器；两处的安装确认交互按产品定义保持一致"},{"parent":"e94212a5-247d-4c31-ba9f-d9e788f5d49a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"80253918-1115-4d8e-b145-372652d6fefc","title":"备注：输入框面板已确认为「点安装弹弹窗」；Marketplace 的 + 号是否同样弹确认弹窗待产品确认"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e94212a5-247d-4c31-ba9f-d9e788f5d49a","title":"🟠【P1】两个安装入口的交互与结果一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3a8cfc45-4a97-4f3b-91fe-64607c1a4b97","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"e53486c6-4b1e-4366-9c1f-e04ccc5b5a04","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d24c02e3-4d0a-4942-887e-2a41e055645c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"edbbfbcb-1555-45d0-885a-1d4ba73a4f80","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f1ff7d1f-1131-4202-8d62-4d16ec415c25","title":"前置：同一账号在两个应用窗口打开同一房间；角色：房间成员；入口：两个窗口的连接器入口"},{"parent":"edbbfbcb-1555-45d0-885a-1d4ba73a4f80","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4a58f576-9275-414a-b27c-5a597fba0340","title":"操作：在窗口 A 开启某连接器，切到窗口 B 查看连接器页与输入框面板"},{"parent":"edbbfbcb-1555-45d0-885a-1d4ba73a4f80","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f4a66b6d-45d6-40a8-8a6d-e3ecb81829e1","title":"预期：窗口 B 的状态与窗口 A 一致；不需要重开窗口；两窗口不出现一个显示开启一个显示关闭"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"edbbfbcb-1555-45d0-885a-1d4ba73a4f80","title":"🟡【P2】多窗口下的状态同步"},{"parent":"d24c02e3-4d0a-4942-887e-2a41e055645c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c26e485f-8de6-4c87-89e6-55a174d60d82","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"68932e31-c27f-4a4c-85b3-9227bc363759","title":"前置：已完成若干连接器的安装、授权与开关设置；角色：房间成员；入口：关闭房间或退出应用后重新进入"},{"parent":"c26e485f-8de6-4c87-89e6-55a174d60d82","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09c95ebb-e691-44a1-bf1c-8c5bd45fceee","title":"操作：关闭房间重新打开，再退出应用重新打开并进入房间，查看三处状态"},{"parent":"c26e485f-8de6-4c87-89e6-55a174d60d82","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"514e34d6-b092-418b-872d-f2f490dd4e1f","title":"预期：所有连接器的安装、授权与开关状态与操作前完全一致；不出现开关重置为默认值或已授权连接器回退为需要授权"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c26e485f-8de6-4c87-89e6-55a174d60d82","title":"🟡【P2】重开房间与重启应用后的状态保持"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d24c02e3-4d0a-4942-887e-2a41e055645c","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e53486c6-4b1e-4366-9c1f-e04ccc5b5a04","title":"多入口状态同步"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c6cb00ed-d1d5-4e8a-bb2c-04512334fe2c","title":"连接器能力生效与状态同步"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1f3e577f-f87b-460e-9473-33c399fd28eb","title":"连接器"},{"parent":"df696030-0aa7-4c05-86d4-7cd9e421febb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3bc688f1-4a63-47ad-917e-88c2f92b0aff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5fb35fc3-9e42-4fab-91fd-d5e6e78c85dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6d0e1102-5f9a-46e0-a0c7-a4109ffcd426","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"72aba606-ed79-4228-b9cd-2bfe6ff3af5a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d4a5f308-35e7-4bd9-a5f5-71e50f0780e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"59292543-4469-424b-a691-b4c9f095e250","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aacf92fc-a774-48e1-8ac3-8a89881c3df5","title":"操作：点击项目标题旁的加号"},{"parent":"59292543-4469-424b-a691-b4c9f095e250","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dc119930-2827-4c89-97e1-b3237278cad5","title":"预期：显示「关联已有项目文件」和「新建项目」两项"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"59292543-4469-424b-a691-b4c9f095e250","title":"🔴【P0】打开项目菜单"},{"parent":"d4a5f308-35e7-4bd9-a5f5-71e50f0780e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4e39605e-142b-44c1-868a-f54437c30ffe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9103b0f7-ddda-43ae-8dfa-9fb43b2ab40e","title":"操作：点击关联已有项目文件"},{"parent":"4e39605e-142b-44c1-868a-f54437c30ffe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd035275-a85b-4556-aef6-02d931fa5e84","title":"预期：\n1. 打开系统文件夹选择流程，只能选择文件夹\n2. 选择成功后项目：显示在侧边栏项目列表第一位；显示在输入框左下角下拉菜单项目列表第一位并处于选中态；同步显示在其他 Agent 的项目下"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4e39605e-142b-44c1-868a-f54437c30ffe","title":"🔴【P0】关联已有项目文件"},{"parent":"d4a5f308-35e7-4bd9-a5f5-71e50f0780e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a119242c-c241-48f9-b897-b89625ed2dec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7f250c1b-8b93-4c03-be7a-ff6a9ffeff58","title":"操作：关联已有项目文件后点击项目旁会话加号"},{"parent":"a119242c-c241-48f9-b897-b89625ed2dec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"269f8f37-08a4-4fda-aef1-736012d176cf","title":"预期：新会话默认绑定该项目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a119242c-c241-48f9-b897-b89625ed2dec","title":"🔴【P0】关联已有项目后新建会话"},{"parent":"d4a5f308-35e7-4bd9-a5f5-71e50f0780e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"97623ffb-7be0-42aa-aeb3-de4a61f0a3b3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b74ba523-7aa2-4640-aa6d-11c72aabb35e","title":"操作：打开系统选择器后取消"},{"parent":"97623ffb-7be0-42aa-aeb3-de4a61f0a3b3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f057a0ea-5a35-4ca0-b3f1-40f98274378e","title":"预期：不新增项目，原列表不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"97623ffb-7be0-42aa-aeb3-de4a61f0a3b3","title":"🟠【P1】取消选择"},{"parent":"d4a5f308-35e7-4bd9-a5f5-71e50f0780e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"96c406a6-7567-4b6f-a4c4-e3c8b8b4f16e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"862241da-920b-43fa-9469-4adff1227288","title":"操作：点击新建项目"},{"parent":"96c406a6-7567-4b6f-a4c4-e3c8b8b4f16e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e86058e7-59ae-43f0-92c1-b12240cf9ca8","title":"预期：\n1. 显示项目名称输入框、取消和创建按钮，并说明在 /workspace 下 创建文件夹；\n2. 创建成功后项目：显示在侧边栏项目列表第一位；显示在输入框左下角下拉菜单项目列表第一位并处于选中态；同步显示在其他 Agent 的项目下"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"96c406a6-7567-4b6f-a4c4-e3c8b8b4f16e","title":"🔴【P0】新建项目"},{"parent":"d4a5f308-35e7-4bd9-a5f5-71e50f0780e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"da287a43-b402-4d92-b8b4-8b504ffc6c86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3fe32411-df1f-46a2-acbc-8034d9aab471","title":"操作：点击新建项目，输入名称后点击取消"},{"parent":"da287a43-b402-4d92-b8b4-8b504ffc6c86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a26743dd-61be-4eb9-93b4-9e7b2bd6a507","title":"预期：关闭弹窗，不创建目录或项目记录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"da287a43-b402-4d92-b8b4-8b504ffc6c86","title":"🟠【P1】取消创建"},{"parent":"d4a5f308-35e7-4bd9-a5f5-71e50f0780e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e5514421-a444-4540-bd83-8556afcc5d6f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13483329-2625-4d57-a793-2da2c5ec1109","title":"操作：点击新建项目，输入框为空后输入合法名称"},{"parent":"e5514421-a444-4540-bd83-8556afcc5d6f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c12ec026-6598-4367-9abf-4412064258f5","title":"预期：空值时创建禁用，合法值时按钮可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e5514421-a444-4540-bd83-8556afcc5d6f","title":"🔴【P0】创建按钮状态"},{"parent":"d4a5f308-35e7-4bd9-a5f5-71e50f0780e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aecaf75c-d8eb-49b7-8121-8a32bcbec56c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fa6dd21b-339a-40e1-8b85-295be0293b46","title":"操作：新建项目后点击项目旁会话加号"},{"parent":"aecaf75c-d8eb-49b7-8121-8a32bcbec56c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b8bd80b0-281d-42b6-99b1-38f644e025c5","title":"预期：新会话默认绑定该项目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aecaf75c-d8eb-49b7-8121-8a32bcbec56c","title":"🔴【P0】创建后新建会话"},{"parent":"d4a5f308-35e7-4bd9-a5f5-71e50f0780e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"700f00fc-b657-46a9-8280-9ef21bebb13f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7b79fc36-7342-42a8-9d16-4a66ab204b7f","title":"操作：点击新建项目，打开菜单后点击空白区域"},{"parent":"700f00fc-b657-46a9-8280-9ef21bebb13f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"307a8b66-18fc-40d6-ac49-f7727190a0a9","title":"预期：菜单关闭且不执行任何项目操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"700f00fc-b657-46a9-8280-9ef21bebb13f","title":"🟠【P1】点击外部关闭"},{"parent":"d4a5f308-35e7-4bd9-a5f5-71e50f0780e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"25635020-85cb-4fd5-8cd8-3cb1b166468d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c254606b-88d7-4a86-8eb5-3c70c44edaf8","title":"操作：点击新建项目或关联已有项目，打开菜单后按 Esc"},{"parent":"25635020-85cb-4fd5-8cd8-3cb1b166468d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fca38336-2190-48fd-beeb-731b06b93795","title":"预期：菜单关闭并将焦点返回加号按钮"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"25635020-85cb-4fd5-8cd8-3cb1b166468d","