d-8f01-c8be68e7d8a0","title":"🟠【P1】重复关联"},{"parent":"4b19cb92-ac4e-4396-ac6e-ebe8a9fedde5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"94ebb664-0600-4318-aa72-9da7e34b677c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"17a541f8-ceab-448c-afb4-81c3ae683f79","title":"操作：选择后目录被删除再确认"},{"parent":"94ebb664-0600-4318-aa72-9da7e34b677c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a000e7bd-e016-4ad7-ac7e-3c7360c7a2c3","title":"预期：关联失败，列表不新增项目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"94ebb664-0600-4318-aa72-9da7e34b677c","title":"🟠【P1】目录不存在"},{"parent":"4b19cb92-ac4e-4396-ac6e-ebe8a9fedde5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a78cf0ac-d599-4bb9-b4a8-0e193a722ea5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"88b1ec05-9ecc-4271-a21a-98fdcc3c6edd","title":"操作：快速点击加号 20 次"},{"parent":"a78cf0ac-d599-4bb9-b4a8-0e193a722ea5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"93b08aef-7f61-4d0f-9610-48788dd8494c","title":"预期：只显示一个菜单且状态稳定"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a78cf0ac-d599-4bb9-b4a8-0e193a722ea5","title":"🟠【P1】菜单重复点击"},{"parent":"4b19cb92-ac4e-4396-ac6e-ebe8a9fedde5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b4428a10-f75e-4e15-b34f-789654017b20","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ef53cbaa-1770-4d8f-be98-11c0a763ad03","title":"操作：在窄窗口或滚动位置打开菜单"},{"parent":"b4428a10-f75e-4e15-b34f-789654017b20","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fbf8243b-ea43-4a68-a525-9575a3b24a6c","title":"预期：菜单自动定位在可视区域，不被窗口裁切"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b4428a10-f75e-4e15-b34f-789654017b20","title":"🟡【P2】菜单被遮挡"},{"parent":"4b19cb92-ac4e-4396-ac6e-ebe8a9fedde5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a10f46f6-d3fc-49d3-a7a4-0739805e56cf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f0743b36-4648-41bf-b7b7-b04c6a4353ec","title":"操作：模拟项目接口返回 500"},{"parent":"a10f46f6-d3fc-49d3-a7a4-0739805e56cf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4cfdc2f2-3cb3-4c1d-804b-c9e78d859962","title":"预期：显示加载失败和重试，不误显示无项目空态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a10f46f6-d3fc-49d3-a7a4-0739805e56cf","title":"🟡【P2】项目列表加载失败"},{"parent":"4b19cb92-ac4e-4396-ac6e-ebe8a9fedde5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"94070838-9fe7-4581-98ab-91c79912b664","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e72d4301-20c2-4e14-bb61-a66831d40829","title":"操作：项目仍在列表但本地文件夹被删除"},{"parent":"94070838-9fe7-4581-98ab-91c79912b664","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"876f64c6-c66a-4194-a635-2ba03f954fa2","title":"预期：标记目录不可用并提供恢复或移除方式，不影响其他项目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"94070838-9fe7-4581-98ab-91c79912b664","title":"🟠【P1】本地目录已删除"},{"parent":"4b19cb92-ac4e-4396-ac6e-ebe8a9fedde5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a53133e7-aea9-4abb-8afc-85de9b3cb1d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f909030b-6bb7-4984-8130-df2b47b19ac0","title":"操作：通过侧边栏「+」号 -&gt; 新建项目 入口，输入包含 /、路径穿越或系统非法字符的项目名称并提交"},{"parent":"a53133e7-aea9-4abb-8afc-85de9b3cb1d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ef4f2f44-2958-44a3-b79c-1280c1f7d9ac","title":"预期：两个入口均阻止创建并给出一致提示，不得在目标目录外写入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a53133e7-aea9-4abb-8afc-85de9b3cb1d1","title":"🟠【P1】非法路径字符"},{"parent":"4b19cb92-ac4e-4396-ac6e-ebe8a9fedde5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"49b15b00-3d85-4888-8710-c268cfd5edb6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44a38480-298a-4fcd-bbd4-f7a21b802587","title":"操作：通过侧边栏「+」号 -&gt; 新建项目 入口，创建与已有项目同名的新项目"},{"parent":"49b15b00-3d85-4888-8710-c268cfd5edb6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e0ef829f-aea5-49a4-9a82-63aa453dc56f","title":"预期：两个入口均提示无法创建，不产生重复项目记录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"49b15b00-3d85-4888-8710-c268cfd5edb6","title":"🟡【P2】重复名称"},{"parent":"4b19cb92-ac4e-4396-ac6e-ebe8a9fedde5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a917a9b0-38b9-42cb-a687-65c1cfeebae8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"be6a386b-cf24-4e06-add4-17178b35814b","title":"操作：通过侧边栏「+」号 -&gt; 新建项目 入口，输入合法名称后快速连续点击创建按钮"},{"parent":"a917a9b0-38b9-42cb-a687-65c1cfeebae8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f52191c2-b595-4452-81d9-9656a60e1856","title":"预期：两个入口均只创建一个目录和一条项目记录，不重复发起创建任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a917a9b0-38b9-42cb-a687-65c1cfeebae8","title":"🟡【P2】快速连续点击创建"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4b19cb92-ac4e-4396-ac6e-ebe8a9fedde5","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"72aba606-ed79-4228-b9cd-2bfe6ff3af5a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"00754798-