-e673-428e-ba67-12f7186e03ca","title":"预期：依据统一时间源排序，不受本地显示时区影响"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5a6a42b6-337a-4d1f-b376-e319119d7dfa","title":"🟡【P2】跨时区创建"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"00754798-eb12-4e64-aabe-dd4afe09138a","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"72aba606-ed79-4228-b9cd-2bfe6ff3af5a","title":"侧边栏项目添加与排序"},{"parent":"6d0e1102-5f9a-46e0-a0c7-a4109ffcd426","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e676067b-6e14-4cc3-8f81-ab6ae0d650ae","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"81085da1-34f0-42d4-bc49-e89d8c874614","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"563aedbb-0f72-4230-ad7f-ded7a7900a87","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"de7bd57d-dac9-456b-b11f-11bd82f09c29","title":"操作：点击输入框左下角的项目"},{"parent":"563aedbb-0f72-4230-ad7f-ded7a7900a87","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3bbcbaa5-1af3-4e12-a930-2528d91afdd6","title":"预期：下拉列表显示「新建项目」、「使用房间项目」、「上传本地项目」和 「不使用项目」四项"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"563aedbb-0f72-4230-ad7f-ded7a7900a87","title":"🔴【P0】打开项目菜单"},{"parent":"81085da1-34f0-42d4-bc49-e89d8c874614","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"31c40aa0-d88b-4228-b1b6-7b4b780ead45","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8010c205-c891-48c5-8746-c823ee772875","title":"操作：点击新建项目"},{"parent":"31c40aa0-d88b-4228-b1b6-7b4b780ead45","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e6908bc7-61e8-4f83-9058-5431664e0b79","title":"预期：\n1. 显示项目名称输入框、取消和创建按钮，并说明在 /workspace下 创建文件夹，\n2. 创建成功后项目：显示在侧边栏项目列表第一位；显示在输入框左下角下拉菜单项目列表第一位并处于选中态；同步显示在其他 Agent 的项目下"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"31c40aa0-d88b-4228-b1b6-7b4b780ead45","title":"🔴【P0】新建项目"},{"parent":"81085da1-34f0-42d4-bc49-e89d8c874614","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"78010fba-2721-492b-998f-0315de87b0ad","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3e8a9e9b-84bd-4490-99c7-eacc9a9b0381","title":"操作：点击新建项目，输入名称后点击取消"},{"parent":"78010fba-2721-492b-998f-0315de87b0ad","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a3014b83-0d0e-44c6-82ac-e2254f39a515","title":"预期：关闭弹窗，不创建目录或项目记录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"78010fba-2721-492b-998f-0315de87b0ad","title":"🟠【P1】取消创建"},{"parent":"81085da1-34f0-42d4-bc49-e89d8c874614","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3a44f447-e78a-4dfb-810c-a365f81b8e5d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5865f0e3-04cb-4ffd-868b-abbd8e2e6a52","title":"操作：点击新建项目，输入框为空后输入合法名称"},{"parent":"3a44f447-e78a-4dfb-810c-a365f81b8e5d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7f43c7a2-d3e0-4c9a-b7e7-c4c1c350d1d3","title":"预期：空值时创建禁用，合法值时按钮可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3a44f447-e78a-4dfb-810c-a365f81b8e5d","title":"🔴【P0】创建按钮状态"},{"parent":"81085da1-34f0-42d4-bc49-e89d8c874614","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0da655a9-366e-4b32-9e07-6624166130c2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"452dc03c-7d51-4a61-a3e0-54681a8c629a","title":"操作：新建项目后点击项目旁会话加号"},{"parent":"0da655a9-366e-4b32-9e07-6624166130c2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1b909804-18b9-4e2a-8433-f0d12f1bf7c3","title":"预期：新会话默认绑定该项目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0da655a9-366e-4b32-9e07-6624166130c2","title":"🔴【P0】创建后新建会话"},{"parent":"81085da1-34f0-42d4-bc49-e89d8c874614","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0ba00866-fd75-4d65-b948-8e57e22e0f16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1133de6a-81b3-4435-a6f5-bcf5c95c25d2","title":"操作：点击使用房间项目"},{"parent":"0ba00866-fd75-4d65-b948-8e57e22e0f16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fa76cae5-5ed9-4bcd-beaf-399e617dd5b7","title":"预期：\n1. 打开选择项目目录弹窗，只能选择单个文件夹\n2. 可点击文件夹进入二级/三级...，右侧显示文件夹名称、路径、修改时间和大小\n3. 选择成功后项目：显示在侧边栏项目列表第一位；显示在输入框左下角下拉菜单项目列表第一位并处于选中态；同步显示在其他 Agent 的项目下"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0ba00866-fd75-4d65-b948-8e57e22e0f16","title":"🔴【P0】使用房间项目"},{"parent":"81085da1-34f0-42d4-bc49-e89d8c874614","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c440cc8f-fa36-4e72-bd4b-bd5e2e85aa66","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8ab3cc84-8fc4-4aeb-bd54-17588bd84f37","title":"操作：点击使用房间项目，选择从本地上传"},{"parent":"c440cc8f-fa36-4e72-bd4b-bd5e2e85aa66","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c395deb-1438-432b-b548-f3379b1959c7","title":"预期：\n1. 打开本地文件窗口选择流程，只能选择文件夹\n2. 选择后会在传输中心显示进度\n3. 上传成功后项目：显示在侧边栏项目列表第一位；显示在输入框左下角下拉菜单项目列表第一位并处于选中态；同步显示在其他 Agent 的项目下"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c440cc8f-fa36-4e72-bd4b-bd5e2e85aa66","title":"🔴【P0】使用房间项目，选择从本地上传"},{"parent":"81085da1-34f0-42d4-bc49-e89d8c874614","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fac326ca-7951-4ea4-8471-a03fd8549f26","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9fc86ae9-a690-42ef-aa1b-65e53fa7e936","title":"操作：点击使用房间项目，搜索"},{"parent":"fac326ca-7951-4ea4-8471-a03fd8549f26","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e99b356-7b2c-4db3-acae-4d75f1ac3b8a","title":"预期：\n1. 输入关键词能匹配到对应文件夹\n2. 搜索后选择，项目显示在侧边栏项目列表第一位；显示在输入框左下角下拉菜单项目列表第一位并处于选中态；同步显示在其他 Agent 的项目下"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fac326ca-7951-4ea4-8471-a03fd8549f26","title":"🔴【P0】使用房间项目，搜索"},{"parent":"81085da1-34f0-42d4-bc49-e89d8c874614","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"decdc34d-6305-4398-b7a9-36d45af886bc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eec9156e-04be-46c2-b31e-ae2158db1158","title":"操作：点击使用房间项目，筛选类型"},{"parent":"decdc34d-6305-4398-b7a9-36d45af886bc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a3a05eac-5c5d-4ee0-b439-428b1790beac","title":"预期：\n1. 筛选正确\n2. 选择后项目显示在侧边栏项目列表第一位；显示在输入框左下角下拉菜单项目列表第一位并处于选中态；同步显示在其他 Agent 的项目下"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"decdc34d-6305-4398-b7a9-36d45af886bc","title":"🔴【P0】使用房间项目，筛选类型"},{"parent":"81085da1-34f0-42d4-bc49-e89d8c874614","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d1e32af0-3b55-4949-89c9-e9e8980e8773","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b627753f-116a-4507-ac67-c55d4a72ea1c","title":"操作：点击使用房间项目，筛选来源，选择成员和智能体"},{"parent":"d1e32af0-3b55-4949-89c9-e9e8980e8773","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a816dd5c-9ef4-460a-8526-49ead92bfeb0","title":"预期：\n1. 筛选结果正确\n2. 项目显示在侧边栏项目列表第一位；显示在输入框左下角下拉菜单项目列表第一位并处于选中态；同步显示在其他 Agent 的项目下"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d1e32af0-3b55-4949-89c9-e9e8980e8773","title":"🔴【P0】使用房间项目，筛选来源"},{"parent":"81085da1-34f0-42d4-bc49-e89d8c874614","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e3985621-fb2d-4500-a97e-a8ce43a5d4e3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f1c3171e-c1e7-4ebe-804a-6282ca5a02fc","title":"操作：选择房间项目后点击项目旁会话加号"},{"parent":"e3985621-fb2d-4500-a97e-a8ce43a5d4e3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a18ad76f-3012-4256-a670-dcb324d01fe2","title":"预期：新会话默认绑定该项目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e39