-434a-a69e-629f565daf51","title":"操作：前置：已关联已有项目文件夹；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区引用面板新建文件夹；步骤：新建一个文件夹并观察提示与列表"},{"parent":"66a5e882-d134-4151-95a2-1f8ad72e218f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44a264da-fbc8-44ae-915c-e5f64b48d8b8","title":"预期：创建成功时给出成功提示且文件夹出现在列表中；不出现提示「出了点问题，请稍后重试」但实际已创建的矛盾结果；创建失败时列表中不遗留半成品目录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"66a5e882-d134-4151-95a2-1f8ad72e218f","title":"工作区内新建文件夹提示失败但实际成功【Bug 回归：#47】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5ac21205-dc60-40b5-8fa2-e4c6e571a8cf","title":"异常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e8d5326a-cc43-4ac8-a8dd-5dc5bf94d062","title":"新建项目"},{"parent":"6d0e1102-5f9a-46e0-a0c7-a4109ffcd426","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"59fdba9c-f6eb-4d8d-a240-69116bbe5137","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e336d605-93ab-4914-850a-74aabd3cb850","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"07df582b-4a25-4603-b7b2-4f1749a26bed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e497952-b4ce-4398-ac50-0dce85a1ed91","title":"操作：前置：新建会话页；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框项目下拉中的使用本地项目；步骤：选择本地文件夹并确认上传"},{"parent":"07df582b-4a25-4603-b7b2-4f1749a26bed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b053914f-37fb-4758-a766-8ca2dd219a7a","title":"预期：上传完成后项目下拉显示该项目为选中态且出现在项目列表中；页面不再显示不使用项目；项目入口下拉包含新建项目、使用房间项目、使用本地项目、不使用项目四个选项"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"07df582b-4a25-4603-b7b2-4f1749a26bed","title":"选择本地文件夹后未添加成功【Bug 回归：#270 #446】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e336d605-93ab-4914-850a-74aabd3cb850","title":"异常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"59fdba9c-f6eb-4d8d-a240-69116bbe5137","title":"使用本地项目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6d0e1102-5f9a-46e0-a0c7-a4109ffcd426","title":"项目创建与关联"},{"parent":"5fb35fc3-9e42-4fab-91fd-d5e6e78c85dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f7260109-0f68-457a-ad44-448a8fff8163","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"753a81a6-2216-496b-a74b-1a7a8cbdd652","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"faff50b6-66f9-4dc8-b856-1341db8a72e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ce5c90f8-ed60-49e4-b26d-25a5c252b35e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c29e52ea-d72e-4e47-91f0-9abb9fd9b981","title":"操作：点击项目行更多按钮"},{"parent":"ce5c90f8-ed60-49e4-b26d-25a5c252b35e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0c8f990a-bb7c-4b72-8e38-0ac60c4d81cf","title":"预期：显示打开文件夹、批量删除会话、移除三项"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ce5c90f8-ed60-49e4-b26d-25a5c252b35e","title":"🔴【P0】项目更多菜单"},{"parent":"faff50b6-66f9-4dc8-b856-1341db8a72e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"09bd082a-9ab8-4695-88b7-734c5eb1fe89","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a1d8d838-809f-4f01-ac54-73b4df61c470","title":"操作：点击打开文件夹"},{"parent":"09bd082a-9ab8-4695-88b7-734c5eb1fe89","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"98ab9b25-2848-42e6-a9e2-0c1fc97ba022","title":"预期：打开的文件中心直接定位到该项目所在的具体位置；不停留在根目录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"09bd082a-9ab8-4695-88b7-734c5eb1fe89","title":"🔴【P0】打开文件夹"},{"parent":"faff50b6-66f9-4dc8-b856-1341db8a72e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"937f2688-0d86-4e7a-9f37-093239b8c47e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ec19aa7a-32ee-4484-a3f3-4b042843dd4a","title":"前置：房间内有多个项目；角色：成员 A 与成员 B；入口：项目更多操作的置顶"},{"parent":"937f2688-0d86-4e7a-9f37-093239b8c47e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"71c240a6-5558-4f66-88e1-4c18638bf392","title":"操作：成员 A 置顶项目 P，成员 B 查看项目列表"},{"parent":"937f2688-0d86-4e7a-9f37-093239b8c47e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"57031eca-c1b1-45f7-bcfe-2fc180a66349","title":"预期：<br>1) 列表展示 ｜ 成员 A 侧项目 P 被置顶，其下会话跟随项目一起上移<br>2) 权限授权 ｜ 成员 B 侧项目顺序不变<br>3) 该成员所有Agent分类下该项目都被置顶"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"937f2688-0d86-4e7a-9f37-093239b8c47e","title":"🔴【P0】置顶项目只对自己生效"},{"parent":"faff50b6-66f9-4dc8-b856-1341db8a72e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"701bc77e-e24e-4890-962a-c17877933568","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9de7463b-2294-475a-bef2-da150580a78d","title":"操作：置顶项目后取消置顶项目"},{"parent":"701bc77e-e24e-4890-962a-c17877933568","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5dedce8-77c2-4baa-8e62-28e46fc629f0","title":"预期：<br>1) 列表展示 ｜ 成员 A 侧项目 P 取消置顶，其下会话跟随项目一起下移<br>2) 权限授权 ｜ 成员 B 侧项目顺序不变<br>3) 该成员所有Agent分类下该项目都被取消置顶"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"701bc77e-e24e-4890-962a-c17877933568","title":"🔴【P0】取消置顶项目"},{"parent":"faff50b6-66f9-4dc8-b856-1341db8a72e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8ed62b98-1589-4823-9781-f177c3f670ac","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"64f4c2ca-40f3-4271-82df-384eb7ebde89","title":"操作：置顶项目后再置顶会话"},{"parent":"8ed62b98-1589-4823-9781-f177c3f670ac","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5e1aaf0-bfa1-4f7b-a51c-7b87b29073c5","title":"预期：置顶项目显示在置顶会话下面"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8ed62b98-1589-4823-9781-f177c3f670ac","title":"🔴【P0】置顶项目显示在置顶会话下面"},{"parent":"faff50b6-66f9-4dc8-b856-1341db8a72e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4a854f7d-e9cc-4654-bdd8-52eb0291a65a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"075c2f6c-3e23-46de-aa14-bc31779842bd","title":"前置：项目 P 下有多名成员发起的会话；角色：成员 A 与成员 B；入口：项目更多菜单的批量删除会话"},{"parent":"4a854f7d-e9cc-4654-bdd8-52eb0291a65a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"40689dac-cbb2-4470-911b-76b1bb720b54","title":"操作：成员 A 执行批量删除，成员 B 查看列表"},{"parent":"4a854f7d-e9cc-4654-bdd8-52eb0291a65a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d66c3f73-73ea-4644-82e1-71c0d089bc95","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 该项目内所有成员的会话都被删除，不只是成员 A 自己的\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 成员 B 侧实时同步移除，项目本身与本地文件保留\n3) 提示文案 ｜ 删除前的确认中说明会删除全部成员在该项目下的会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4a854f7d-e9cc-4654-bdd8-52eb0291a65a","title":"🔴【P0】批量删除项目会话的房间级生效"},{"parent":"faff50b6-66f9-4dc8-b856-1341db8a72e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fa63488e-9c53-44f5-a1e2-e2be87b708c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6a7a81e5-159d-4b7f-b860-c31917e3a6d6","title":"操作：点击移除"},{"parent":"fa63488e-9c53-44f5-a1e2-e2be87b708c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0e3b76f8-df58-46d2-a6c1-b8c7a6f66f15","title":"预期：弹窗显示目标项目名并明确只从列表移除、不删除本地文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fa63488e-9c53-44f5-a1e2-e2be87b708c1","title":"🔴【P0】移除确认弹窗"},{"parent":"faff50b6-66f9-4dc8-b856-1341db8a72e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b29933da-492c-45ea-82a0-15e3c18615c4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"462f0b2a-913c-45ae-a44f-8ecbcdff9a6e","title":"操作：新建项目，点击移除，在移除弹窗点击移除"},{"parent":"b29933da-492c-45ea-82a0-15e3c18615c4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4d2eb4ab-a8e6-490b-95a3-f17e911ecc6d","title":"预期：整个项目从列表消失，本地文件夹和文件保持存在，该项目下的会话都不会显示在列表上"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b29933da-492c-45ea-82a0-15e3c18615c4","title":"🔴【P0】移除新建的项目"},{"parent":"faff50b6-66f9-4dc8-b856-1341db8a72e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a513a811-bdaa-45d6-bb22-c28220739f88","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6f9e0cba-118d-4574-b6dc-80d1e1c71e00","title":"操作：关联已有的项目，新建会话后点击移除"},{"parent":"a513a811-bdaa-45d6-bb22-c28220739f88","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5d262a4d-bae1-49ea-ac7d-092911a5f8b9","title":"预期：整个项目从列表消失，本地文件夹和文件保持存在，该项目下的会话都不会显示在列表上"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a513a811-bdaa-45d6-bb22-c28220739f88","title":"🔴【P0】移除关联已有的项目"},{"parent":"faff50b6-66f9-4dc8-b856-1341db8a72e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"76d8766e-a449-4fc5-b2dd-af48b54bbdaa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1f83039f-0a25-47aa-a064-ec95f5fd9af7","title":"前置：项目 P 下有会话且已产生过文件与产物；角色：房间成员；入口：消息中心、文件中心的文件 tab 与产物列表"},{"parent":"76d8766e-a449-4fc5-b2dd-af48b54bbdaa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"27ea4261-ca9a-47bc-9a82-bf4853facff5","title":"操作：移除项目 P 后立即查看消息中心、文件中心与产物列表"},{"parent":"76d8766e-a449-4fc5-b2dd-af48b54bbdaa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"69d23c8a-8f8a-4f47-a541-3aaa69fd1ae0","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 这些会话的消息在消息中心中仍可见，可正常打开\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 这些会话产生的文件与产物在文件中心与产物列表中仍可见，可下载与打开\n3) 持久化 ｜ 会话数据未被删除，只是不在项目分组中展示"},{"parent":"76d8766e-a449-4fc5-b2dd-af48b54bbdaa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f65f0378-3732-49cf-98f7-86cf6b4bb9b9","title":"备注：个人执行的删除会话与移除项目在整个房间内生效，所有成员的列表都会受影响。成员可以删除他人发起的会话；移除项目是隐藏而非删除，重新添加项目后其会话会重新出现"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"76d8766e-a449-4fc5-b2dd-af48b54bbdaa","title":"🔴【P0】移除期间会话在消息中心与文件产物中仍可见"},{"parent":"faff50b6-66f9-4dc8-b856-1341db8a72e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"499ca92a-d78d-4f4a-8b21-1a29b2b32283","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"748743d6-1a0d-4a1d-91bd-fd02953219f7","title":"前置：项目 P 下有一条标题与内容都可被搜索命中的会话；角色：房间成员；入口：会话搜索"},{"parent":"499ca92a-d78d-4f4a-8b21-1a29b2b32283","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"66920d3b-b9b7-4369-8637-16f65bc74829","title":"操作：先搜索确认能命中，移除项目 P 后用同样的关键词再搜一次"},{"parent":"499ca92a-d78d-4f4a-8b21-1a29b2b32283","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0f0c39e4-8064-4b34-8a40-27cef74b19a2","title":"预期：\n1) 搜索匹配 ｜ 移除后该会话不出现在搜索结果中\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 搜索与消息中心的可见性差异是产品定义，不是数据丢失\n3) 持久化 ｜ 重新添加项目后同样的关键词又能搜到"},{"parent":"499ca92a-d78d-4f4a-8b21-1a29b2b32283","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8032924b-33e5-4b57-9022-3db879860d6e","title":"备注：个人执行的删除会话与移除项目在整个房间内生效，所有成员的列表都会受影响。成员可以删除他人发起的会话；移除项目是隐藏而非删除，重新添加项目后其会话会重新出现"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"499ca92a-d78d-4f4a-8b21-1a29b2b32283","title":"🔴【P0】移除期间会话搜索不到"},{"parent":"faff50b6-66f9-4dc8-b856-1341db8a72e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"073dd6bf-6527-413f-9c1e-bc692e66fb1e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a1bed80f-3389-44c2-85a1-bd6361b3c823","title":"操作：关联已有的项目，新建会话后点击移除，再重新关联"},{"parent":"073dd6bf-6527-413f-9c1e-bc692e66fb1e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6ec9df46-228b-42a9-86c3-44eb04e298e0","title":"预期：项目重新显示第一位，该项目下的原有会话重新展示在该项目下，会话内容与历史完整；不需要重开房间才恢复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"073dd6bf-6527-413f-9c1e-bc692e66fb1e","title":"🟠【P1】移除关联已有的项目再重新关联"},{"parent":"faff50b6-66f9-4dc8-b856-1341db8a72e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4bb89f04-ed8c-4d0f-9b6d-17ff410359d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"22620f98-3ce9-4fac-ab43-d56cba3d9fa0","title":"操作：在移除弹窗点击取消"},{"parent":"4bb89f04-ed8c-4d0f-9b6d-17ff410359d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3b0871de-41b9-45d0-ae68-a3c95c42b7ef","title":"预期：项目、会话和本地文件均保持不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4bb89f04-ed8c-4d0f-9b6d-17ff410359d4","title":"🔴【P0】取消移除"},{"parent":"faff50b6-66f9-4dc8-b856-1341db8a72e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1d65fd11-7d4f-4592-a25f-4cb520220d84","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"373d3976-9a2a-4296-81dd-7348b9c6186d","title":"前置：同时存在被置顶的会话与被置顶的项目；角色：房间成员；入口：会话列表"},{"parent":"1d65fd11-7d4f-4592-a25f-4cb520220d84","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cebf4737-f887-458b-a8c7-a307749c22ab","title":"操作：查看列表顶部的排列"},{"parent":"1d65fd11-7d4f-4592-a25f-4cb520220d84","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6f8709bf-8e92-4d67-b1d8-6aec67139832","title":"预期：\n1) 归属与顺序 ｜ 置顶项目展示在置顶会话下面，规则与产品定义一致\n2) 归属与顺序 ｜ 刷新后相对顺序不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1d65fd11-7d4f-4592-a25f-4cb520220d84","title":"🟡【P2】置顶项目与置顶会话的相对顺序"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"faff50b6-66f9-4dc8-b856-1341db8a72e9","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"753a81a6-2216-496b-a74b-1a7a8cbdd652","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d0567b55-aff7-47a1-96af-20f6d961a380","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6433a027-580c-4e7f-9eb3-a6b65b661c4a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dcdda8bb-7661-43f8-acfd-44c155e0653d","title":"操作：项目关联的本地文件夹已被改名或删除，点击打开文件夹"},{"parent":"6433a027-580c-4e7f-9eb3-a6b65b661c4a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0ceeec8a-4832-4f98-9956-91dcfd0ac024","title":"预期：提示目录不存在，不打开错误位置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6433a027-580c-4e7f-9eb3-a6b65b661c4a","title":"🟠【P1】打开目录不存在"},{"parent":"d0567b55-aff7-47a1-96af-20f6d961a380","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ab7823e3-c9da-4aea-803a-66cde6cf4663","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1411dc79-821c-4b59-b40f-f0c3674b2f4e","title":"操作：移除项目后检查原目录内容"},{"parent":"ab7823e3-c9da-4aea-803a-66cde6cf4663","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bd6f2dc5-1201-4b04-a71a-f5f4f862d197","title":"预期：所有本地文件完整，任何删除均视为失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ab7823e3-c9da-4aea-803a-66cde6cf4663","title":"🟡【P2】移除后误删本地文件"},{"parent":"d0567b55-aff7-47a1-96af-20f6d961a380","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"867ea024-a18b-4e70-944b-e3846e4ef812","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2f3f1689-de2f-42ab-8b45-b2b325660e21","title":"前置：项目 P 下有一条会话的 Agent 正在执行任务；角色：房间成员；入口：项目更多操作的移除"},{"parent":"867ea024-a18b-4e70-944b-e3846e4ef812","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"daabde0c-7472-4667-831d-beffd2e728a7","title":"操作：移除该项目，等待该任务跑完"},{"parent":"867ea024-a18b-4e70-944b-e3846e4ef812","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"01dd07b4-a7fa-4397-a47f-44c094c2f56c","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 运行中的任务继续执行到完成，不被移除操作中断\n2) 持久化 ｜ 任务产出的内容与产物完整保留，在文件中心与产物列表中可见\n3) 列表展示 ｜ 重新添加该项目后，这条会话及其完整结果都能看到"},{"parent":"867ea024-a18b-4e70-944b-e3846e4ef812","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9de3579e-f920-4b7b-835d-529c659e0aee","title":"备注：个人执行的删除会话与移除项目在整个房间内生效，所有成员的列表都会受影响。成员可以删除他人发起的会话；移除项目是隐藏而非删除，重新添加项目后其会话会重新出现"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"867ea024-a18b-4e70-944b-e3846e4ef812","title":"🟡【P2】移除时项目下有会话正在运行"},{"parent":"d0567b55-aff7-47a1-96af-20f6d961a380","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f254636f-d058-4b46-8c65-de3e4e9b2046","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"40cdf605-7331-4e21-934f-76453e09d163","title":"前置：成员 B 正在项目 P 下准备发送首条消息；角色：成员 A 与成员 B；入口：成员 A 的移除项目"},{"parent":"f254636f-d058-4b46-8c65-de3e4e9b2046","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"096c2257-297b-4947-8f86-8cebf19c191d","title":"操作：成员 A 在成员 B 发送前移除该项目"},{"parent":"f254636f-d058-4b46-8c65-de3e4e9b2046","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5a2bad42-699f-4bb3-b63d-10e97a110f41","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 成员 B 侧提示项目不可用并要求重新选择，不错误绑定到已移除的项目\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不产生归属到已移除项目的会话"},{"parent":"f254636f-d058-4b46-8c65-de3e4e9b2046","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"699c6c8f-c25e-440f-ab39-a68e6f7f501b","title":"备注：个人执行的删除会话与移除项目在整个房间内生效，所有成员的列表都会受影响。成员可以删除他人发起的会话；移除项目是隐藏而非删除，重新添加项目后其会话会重新出现"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f254636f-d058-4b46-8c65-de3e4e9b2046","title":"🟠【P1】移除时他人正在该项目下新建会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d0567b55-aff7-47a1-96af-20f6d961a380","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"753a81a6-2216-496b-a74b-1a7a8cbdd652","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d7f9782e-969a-487c-9603-9c08fd6bae1f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"874a0d1e-3021-46b0-b849-0179a16fe151","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a19ff8df-4de0-4428-b435-6e7990c13fed","title":"操作：新建项目，发起一个会话，置顶该会话，再批量删除该项目下的会话"},{"parent":"874a0d1e-3021-46b0-b849-0179a16fe151","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"73ebeb27-5fea-426f-bbf6-eb482a59c36d","title":"预期：批量删除会话应不可点击"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"874a0d1e-3021-46b0-b849-0179a16fe151","title":"🟡【P2】项目下只有一个会话，置顶后再批量删除会话"},{"parent":"d7f9782e-969a-487c-9603-9c08fd6bae1f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7d2b139b-ccbb-465d-8989-7d20fdc9c47e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bae9463d-ad47-455c-9ef5-8b5b8e8fc549","title":"操作：新建项目，发起一个会话，置顶该会话，再移除项目"},{"parent":"7d2b139b-ccbb-465d-8989-7d20fdc9c47e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"49e3d3aa-770e-41b2-a450-ab78087bafee","title":"预期：置顶的会话仍会显示，取消置顶后会话消失在列表"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7d2b139b-ccbb-465d-8989-7d20fdc9c47e","title":"🟡【P2】项目下只有一个会话，置顶后再移除项目"},{"parent":"d7f9782e-969a-487c-9603-9c08fd6bae1f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bcee56af-6bd5-4b1c-a6a2-7332c5f9bbd0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"92e205b7-41f5-489e-b13e-2596a2610ed5","title":"操作：对无会话项目执行批量删除"},{"parent":"bcee56af-6bd5-4b1c-a6a2-7332c5f9bbd0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8118c3b6-124b-4157-95c1-000c0e277f3f","title":"预期：批量删除会话选择不显示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bcee56af-6bd5-4b1c-a6a2-7332c5f9bbd0","title":"🟡【P2】空项目批量删除"},{"parent":"d7f9782e-969a-487c-9603-9c08fd6bae1f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"32262056-de80-4d2d-915c-6383a8a8c7b9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"281786ef-50fd-4e9a-a688-67485e1f74a0","title":"操作：项目含 1000 条会话时批量删除"},{"parent":"32262056-de80-4d2d-915c-6383a8a8c7b9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c28e3d1-afca-446e-af46-edb627a85c65","title":"预期：全部删除且界面可恢复，不超时停留半删除状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"32262056-de80-4d2d-915c-6383a8a8c7b9","title":"🟡【P2】千条会话批量删除"},{"parent":"d7f9782e-969a-487c-9603-9c08fd6bae1f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6b2d82a5-70bd-4990-a61d-0724f14b53fb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6fa54add-e17d-4db1-a333-a75f00fbdb7d","title":"操作：项目存在正在执行或等待会话时批量删除"},{"parent":"6b2d82a5-70bd-4990-a61d-0724f14b53fb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9177be2a-4b8a-4185-b2a8-284acfa17ec5","title":"预期：按产品规则确认并处理运行状态，不能留下无主任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6b2d82a5-70bd-4990-a61d-0724f14b53fb","title":"🟡【P2】执行中会话批量删除"},{"parent":"d7f9782e-969a-487c-9603-9c08fd6bae1f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b3f753ec-c9a2-449a-88f0-e0d5b29ca054","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"18cd5c7b-ece5-4218-85cb-ef69c35f4bb8","title":"操作：连续确认移除同一项目"},{"parent":"b3f753ec-c9a2-449a-88f0-e0d5b29ca054","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c014e609-56f8-4f2f-bd97-b815b83eacca","title":"预期：操作幂等，只移除一次"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b3f753ec-c9a2-449a-88f0-e0d5b29ca054","title":"🟡【P2】快速重复移除"},{"parent":"d7f9782e-969a-487c-9603-9c08fd6bae1f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0da81b1e-8e38-4e5f-abf9-e06009ae6e5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c244184-a62b-46c3-a176-1f8aaae98562","title":"前置：项目 P 已被移除；角色：房间成员；入口：项目添加入口"},{"parent":"0da81b1e-8e38-4e5f-abf9-e06009ae6e5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"736bc22f-671f-42c6-9b21-610361d705fd","title":"操作：添加一个与 P 同名但路径不同的项目"},{"parent":"0da81b1e-8e38-4e5f-abf9-e06009ae6e5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c028ad1-4ca4-4caa-9d3a-b09dd8b0a193","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 按新路径创建一个全新的项目节点，不恢复原项目 P 的会话\n2) 归属与顺序 ｜ 原项目 P 的会话仍处于隐藏状态，需添加原路径才能恢复"},{"parent":"0da81b1e-8e38-4e5f-abf9-e06009ae6e5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e15e264b-bf2b-44f7-b5f6-c460199a2ec2","title":"备注：个人执行的删除会话与移除项目在整个房间内生效，所有成员的列表都会受影响。成员可以删除他人发起的会话；移除项目是隐藏而非删除，重新添加项目后其会话会重新出现"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0da81b1e-8e38-4e5f-abf9-e06009ae6e5b","title":"🟡【P2】移除后添加不同路径的同名项目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d7f9782e-969a-487c-9603-9c08fd6bae1f","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"753a81a6-2216-496b-a74b-1a7a8cbdd652","title":"项目更多操作菜单"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f7260109-0f68-457a-ad44-448a8fff8163","title":"项目更多操作"},{"parent":"5fb35fc3-9e42-4fab-91fd-d5e6e78c85dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"192809e0-8431-49a9-9468-b8dbe0a823fc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b30cc512-2b63-4fec-91a7-d41c88cbe137","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"770c8a45-04fb-49d8-8afc-0ee2f229905e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"65fb2003-9fec-4f02-bc3d-de52b79936fb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7d25d37-0d66-48ae-af73-4e42f1272c6c","title":"操作：点击项目 A 行旁的新建会话图标"},{"parent":"65fb2003-9fec-4f02-bc3d-de52b79936fb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8bffdd04-c5b1-4a31-85e7-e432094748e4","title":"预期：右侧打开新会话，输入框左下角默认显示项目 A"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"65fb2003-9fec-4f02-bc3d-de52b79936fb","title":"🔴【P0】点击项目会话加号"},{"parent":"770c8a45-04fb-49d8-8afc-0ee2f229905e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cf565fa1-37ca-461e-a5bb-6e70ca762cfa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4be2aaf3-c8fe-444a-8d70-013523334e0b","title":"操作：在项目 A 新会话发送首条消息"},{"parent":"cf565fa1-37ca-461e-a5bb-6e70ca762cfa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"19cc3089-5400-45ee-b7e1-ce2e9e75d70a","title":"预期：会话创建并显示在项目 A 下"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cf565fa1-37ca-461e-a5bb-6e70ca762cfa","title":"🔴【P0】发送后归入项目"},{"parent":"770c8a45-04fb-49d8-8afc-0ee2f229905e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"972c16b6-f998-4298-9a19-367fb70050a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"044a8b33-49bb-4e60-b5ca-551fe69cd509","title":"操作：分别从项目 A、B 新建会话"},{"parent":"972c16b6-f998-4298-9a19-367fb70050a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"20d3c06c-936a-4469-8fe0-bf98ea98acbb","title":"预期：每个新会话默认绑定对应项目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"972c16b6-f998-4298-9a19-367fb70050a4","title":"🔴【P0】不同项目新建"},{"parent":"770c8a45-04fb-49d8-8afc-0ee2f229905e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b5c19330-95e0-4584-bcfe-c994d834d79d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"26335de6-8c26-4488-b7da-5a43d2954d70","title":"操作：新建后未发送消息直接切换会话"},{"parent":"b5c19330-95e0-4584-bcfe-c994d834d79d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"51f3b863-f2c4-4c10-966d-a7e0dcd2a622","title":"预期：不生成无内容历史会话或按既定草稿规则处理"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b5c19330-95e0-4584-bcfe-c994d834d79d","title":"🔴【P0】取消空白会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"770c8a45-04fb-49d8-8afc-0ee2f229905e","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"b30cc512-2b63-4fec-91a7-d41c88cbe137","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f5992e96-1d64-4546-b0d0-99d5ef52aa92","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f273bfd5-9784-428c-894b-96425614b06c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a8b46038-3de1-4616-81cb-edb42f96e833","title":"操作：打开新会话后由另一端移除项目再发送"},{"parent":"f273bfd5-9784-428c-894b-96425614b06c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dbf76a8e-bc96-4f24-9b59-c5c59d2649c6","title":"预期：提示项目不可用并要求重新选择，不错误绑定"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f273bfd5-9784-428c-894b-96425614b06c","title":"🟠【P1】项目已移除"},{"parent":"f5992e96-1d64-4546-b0d0-99d5ef52aa92","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"27e39f90-d59e-4197-9114-3557392cced5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e45fad73-ce64-4a1e-8bab-062961ebbbcd","title":"操作：项目目录被删除后点击会话加号"},{"parent":"27e39f90-d59e-4197-9114-3557392cced5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d23ecaa2-675c-4317-9b54-0fcbafb72bb4","title":"预期：发送后显示该路径失效，不创建失效会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"27e39f90-d59e-4197-9114-3557392cced5","title":"🟠【P1】目录已删除"},{"parent":"f5992e96-1d64-4546-b0d0-99d5ef52aa92","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1f188015-a3c0-4b53-9d37-3dd745338bf7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6a58d71f-b8c0-4e72-bf31-7b76810d8e8d","title":"操作：发送前让当前 Agent 被解绑或离线"},{"parent":"1f188015-a3c0-4b53-9d37-3dd745338bf7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e4beb1b-0959-498a-8e42-0e7f806aa219","title":"预期：发送被阻止并提示重新选择或绑定，不自动改投其他 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1f188015-a3c0-4b53-9d37-3dd745338bf7","title":"🟠【P1】选中 Agent 突然不可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f5992e96-1d64-4546-b0d0-99d5ef52aa92","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"b30cc512-2b63-4fec-91a7-d41c88cbe137","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4c5a8d35-5d36-4170-9ed1-f162319a91ff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"84985350-15d5-457e-90db-a817e7abbf29","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7a1efa4d-4207-4d76-8f20-d91996a0aaa8","title":"操作：前置：存在标题很长的会话；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧会话列表与会话详情顶部；步骤：查看列表条目与详情顶部标题"},{"parent":"84985350-15d5-457e-90db-a817e7abbf29","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"357b673d-088c-4c63-b848-daae60a7cf65","title":"预期：两处标题超长时均省略显示并可悬浮查看全称；不与操作图标重叠；窗口缩窄后仍正确省略"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"84985350-15d5-457e-90db-a817e7abbf29","title":"🟡【P2】会话标题展示"},{"parent":"4c5a8d35-5d36-4170-9ed1-f162319a91ff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"08a05025-c2f2-4ab6-87c5-66c18a7969b0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ce2fd27-c7be-46ba-ad9a-8ce887f164ba","title":"操作：连续点击项目会话加号 20 次"},{"parent":"08a05025-c2f2-4ab6-87c5-66c18a7969b0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ee0e572f-0e4d-4cc2-8809-afe199b144da","title":"预期：只打开一个预期新会话草稿"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"08a05025-c2f2-4ab6-87c5-66c18a7969b0","title":"🟡【P2】快速点击加号"},{"parent":"4c5a8d35-5d36-4170-9ed1-f162319a91ff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7b7b79ee-88a0-4d37-a4bb-4d226de0065e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"45909eb6-d04b-435b-a32d-82b908fa245a","title":"操作：超长项目下新建会话"},{"parent":"7b7b79ee-88a0-4d37-a4bb-4d226de0065e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a8240341-9e83-4741-89bf-29903ea26078","title":"预期：输入框项目标识截断合理且绑定 ID 正确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7b7b79ee-88a0-4d37-a4bb-4d226de0065e","title":"🟡【P2】项目名称超长"},{"parent":"4c5a8d35-5d36-4170-9ed1-f162319a91ff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7881bcfc-0271-43fb-b947-0eeb24870f61","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aa61294c-2fef-4619-bb00-d733022e49fd","title":"操作：从项目 A 新建后手动改选项目 B 再发送"},{"parent":"7881bcfc-0271-43fb-b947-0eeb24870f61","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd42a589-6c8e-4cee-ad42-7b8c65b957e0","title":"预期：会话按最终明确选择归属 B；若不允许切换则保持 A"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7881bcfc-0271-43fb-b947-0eeb24870f61","title":"🟡【P2】切换项目后发送"},{"parent":"4c5a8d35-5d36-4170-9ed1-f162319a91ff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c6015ee0-ba3c-4bb1-a731-3db0ec0e76f4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cc61aa8e-beb6-4410-97d1-514f1ef85b28","title":"操作：两个窗口从同一项目同时新建会话"},{"parent":"c6015ee0-ba3c-4bb1-a731-3db0ec0e76f4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9edbb1f4-68ec-4514-8268-614b7aa15e29","title":"预期：生成两个独立会话且都正确归属项目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c6015ee0-ba3c-4bb1-a731-3db0ec0e76f4","title":"🟡【P2】多窗口同时新建"},{"parent":"4c5a8d35-5d36-4170-9ed1-f162319a91ff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4db241cf-9ee4-433e-aa0d-4bd991b4aeae","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"56f51142-6b78-4a0b-b0f8-37709ca09db9","title":"操作：首条消息发送前切换 Agent 20 次"},{"parent":"4db241cf-9ee4-433e-aa0d-4bd991b4aeae","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8d72d912-03e0-40b3-89bb-f66663881fec","title":"预期：不创建会话，最终发送时只绑定最后选中的 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4db241cf-9ee4-433e-aa0d-4bd991b4aeae","title":"🟡【P2】创建前可多次切换"},{"parent":"4c5a8d35-5d36-4170-9ed1-f162319a91ff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1acdc38d-41d7-4729-904b-94354e453013","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c2af08a6-a2cb-492f-a1fe-1f0380415784","title":"操作：不输入内容直接点击发送"},{"parent":"1acdc38d-41d7-4729-904b-94354e453013","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6916ea36-bf49-446e-b8ff-0cb1648a5291","title":"预期：不创建会话，发送按钮保持禁用或给出明确提示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1acdc38d-41d7-4729-904b-94354e453013","title":"🟡【P2】空消息发送"},{"parent":"4c5a8d35-5d36-4170-9ed1-f162319a91ff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1d6d3392-9500-4fbb-a445-ed44ce59ab6c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b13d5128-777f-4b24-9cd4-6da8aaffe1f9","title":"操作：输入空格、换行和制表符后发送"},{"parent":"1d6d3392-9500-4fbb-a445-ed44ce59ab6c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"244e3db3-7dd0-4577-ab5f-1d693149972d","title":"预期：按空消息处理，不创建会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1d6d3392-9500-4fbb-a445-ed44ce59ab6c","title":"🟡【P2】仅空白字符"},{"parent":"4c5a8d35-5d36-4170-9ed1-f162319a91ff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9fc1452e-e922-41be-b318-52698078f190","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b9bc0be1-5258-45db-891e-9afdac5300d4","title":"操作：输入达到允许上限和超过上限的文本"},{"parent":"9fc1452e-e922-41be-b318-52698078f190","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae5995af-1aac-41d7-8444-347ab37030aa","title":"预期：上限内成功创建会话，超限时明确提示且不截断误发"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9fc1452e-e922-41be-b318-52698078f190","title":"🟡【P2】超长首条消息"},{"parent":"4c5a8d35-5d36-4170-9ed1-f162319a91ff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e716de6c-9034-4f23-a5b1-dba58a8d78ac","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"72884c56-292f-4399-bf44-1384f0cabf66","title":"操作：点击发送同时快速切换 Agent"},{"parent":"e716de6c-9034-4f23-a5b1-dba58a8d78ac","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"258690d1-71ec-4c45-952d-d7780e6eb28c","title":"预期：会话归属与实际接收消息的 Agent 一致，状态原子确定"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e716de6c-9034-4f23-a5b1-dba58a8d78ac","title":"🟡【P2】发送瞬间切换 Agent"},{"parent":"4c5a8d35-5d36-4170-9ed1-f162319a91ff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d01b76d2-976c-40f5-811f-0a5e0faa9e15","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c90ec211-9b0d-4645-b1b0-97f5d363b12d","title":"操作：快速点击新建会话 10 次"},{"parent":"d01b76d2-976c-40f5-811f-0a5e0faa9e15","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9a1d1905-7e43-4eff-9a96-ecb463e5bc31","title":"预期：只保留预期空白草稿或按规则创建多个草稿，不产生无内容历史会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d01b76d2-976c-40f5-811f-0a5e0faa9e15","title":"🟡【P2】连续新建会话"},{"parent":"4c5a8d35-5d36-4170-9ed1-f162319a91ff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2d4a59dd-48a4-4b3b-a765-3239f0a87887","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d51430ad-a6b4-45dd-92c8-5a90bddfc86f","title":"操作：两个窗口对同一新建草稿同时发送"},{"parent":"2d4a59dd-48a4-4b3b-a765-3239f0a87887","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"110a1b09-30a6-4453-8c31-f0034eeec97a","title":"预期：按幂等规则避免重复会话，或生成两个归属明确的独立会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2d4a59dd-48a4-4b3b-a765-3239f0a87887","title":"🟡【P2】并发创建同一草稿"},{"parent":"4c5a8d35-5d36-4170-9ed1-f162319a91ff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e3127864-2153-4b94-8d1f-724cfed6962c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1433e084-9073-4140-9c21-0917f2a9756a","title":"操作：同时让多个不同 Agent 的多个会话并行执行任务"},{"parent":"e3127864-2153-4b94-8d1f-724cfed6962c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b27ab188-c6ab-4d6a-a549-7dbfcd654b7c","title":"预期：各会话各自回复正常，互不干扰，不出现状态串线"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e3127864-2153-4b94-8d1f-724cfed6962c","title":"🟡【P2】同时运行多个Agent的多个会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4c5a8d35-5d36-4170-9ed1-f162319a91ff","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b30cc512-2b63-4fec-91a7-d41c88cbe137","title":"项目内新建会话"},{"parent":"192809e0-8431-49a9-9468-b8dbe0a823fc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9d92d846-8356-4b2b-8ad5-d5a97300ff91","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"acf82452-01e8-490b-aafe-e8ca803c5bf2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b781fe7c-37d1-4775-a95c-d077e577bc45","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"63eabf12-27ea-4f5c-b5d2-9a47f007ece5","title":"前置：房间内成员 A、B、C 都在项目 P 下发起过会话；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧项目分组"},{"parent":"b781fe7c-37d1-4775-a95c-d077e577bc45","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"08f7a3ac-5a1a-45f4-8b0c-3052529c35fe","title":"操作：展开项目 P 查看会话列表"},{"parent":"b781fe7c-37d1-4775-a95c-d077e577bc45","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2d5b3424-75ce-43f3-92c9-e4e021bf8db9","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 项目 P 下展示三名成员的全部会话，不只是自己的\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 会话数量与三人在该项目下的实际会话数之和一致\n3) 权限授权 ｜ 房间内任意成员看到的项目 P 会话集合一致"},{"parent":"b781fe7c-37d1-4775-a95c-d077e577bc45","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b4bc382d-f7dc-49d2-8f77-6ed661860bbe","title":"备注：项目下由只展示自己的会话改为展示房间内所有成员的会话；同一项目在不同成员侧合并为一个项目节点"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b781fe7c-37d1-4775-a95c-d077e577bc45","title":"🔴【P0】项目下展示全部成员的会话"},{"parent":"acf82452-01e8-490b-aafe-e8ca803c5bf2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e42683b2-f061-41b3-bb6b-474c56edfdd9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0bbe3b73-f77b-4762-8716-834e8887eb60","title":"前置：成员 A 与成员 B 各自关联了路径完全相同的同一个项目；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧项目列表"},{"parent":"e42683b2-f061-41b3-bb6b-474c56edfdd9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d7ce3ed8-e079-4858-89c3-818dd456cd8f","title":"操作：查看项目列表中该项目的展示"},{"parent":"e42683b2-f061-41b3-bb6b-474c56edfdd9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bf70a401-44d1-49f9-b1c7-8cfdbb48ed64","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 该项目只出现一个节点，不按成员重复展示\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 两人在其下的会话都归到这一个节点里"},{"parent":"e42683b2-f061-41b3-bb6b-474c56edfdd9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"043d8609-e5ad-4d18-92e7-420835132e7e","title":"备注：项目下由只展示自己的会话改为展示房间内所有成员的会话；同一项目在不同成员侧合并为一个项目节点"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e42683b2-f061-41b3-bb6b-474c56edfdd9","title":"🔴【P0】同路径项目在成员间合并"},{"parent":"acf82452-01e8-490b-aafe-e8ca803c5bf2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5f6120f2-667d-4bf1-9e53-fc1f02bdcace","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"14f5ff28-0d8f-4de9-9548-fcd818a004d8","title":"前置：成员 A 与成员 B 各自关联了名称相同但本地路径不同的项目；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧项目列表"},{"parent":"5f6120f2-667d-4bf1-9e53-fc1f02bdcace","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ba56eb77-7c9a-4001-a6fe-10db8a3afda9","title":"操作：查看项目列表中这两个项目的展示"},{"parent":"5f6120f2-667d-4bf1-9e53-fc1f02bdcace","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"566e3409-6921-4e6b-abe2-62afb3ba7311","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 两个项目各自独立成节点，不因为同名而被合并\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 同名的两个节点可通过路径或所属成员区分，不让人误以为是重复项\n3) 归属与顺序 ｜ 两人的会话分别归入各自的项目节点，不互相串入"},{"parent":"5f6120f2-667d-4bf1-9e53-fc1f02bdcace","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4ada3a84-709d-40db-9878-ac587f084b51","title":"备注：合并的判定依据是本地路径，名称相同不构成合并条件；项目下由只展示自己的会话改为展示房间内所有成员的会话；同一项目在不同成员侧合并为一个项目节点"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5f6120f2-667d-4bf1-9e53-fc1f02bdcace","title":"🔴【P0】同名不同路径的项目不合并"},{"parent":"acf82452-01e8-490b-aafe-e8ca803c5bf2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"59867ec2-731d-43a2-aa78-fdaf34a03d8c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c6ef0b16-519d-40fa-8bfe-9a9727be7d42","title":"前置：项目下有多名成员发起的会话；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧会话列表"},{"parent":"59867ec2-731d-43a2-aa78-fdaf34a03d8c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0a4e92fd-7866-4310-8852-e50a9497ae4f","title":"操作：查看各条会话的条目信息"},{"parent":"59867ec2-731d-43a2-aa78-fdaf34a03d8c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c44da93a-766c-4ad6-8bb2-ecbcc3777d35","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 每条会话展示发起人的头像或名称，能一眼区分是谁发起的\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 同时展示所用 Agent 的标识，发起人与 Agent 归属可以不是同一个人"},{"parent":"59867ec2-731d-43a2-aa78-fdaf34a03d8c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f803d624-1e28-4dfc-bdf7-d4327ec4b672","title":"备注：项目下由只展示自己的会话改为展示房间内所有成员的会话；同一项目在不同成员侧合并为一个项目节点"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"59867ec2-731d-43a2-aa78-fdaf34a03d8c","title":"🔴【P0】会话条目展示发起人"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"acf82452-01e8-490b-aafe-e8ca803c5bf2","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"9d92d846-8356-4b2b-8ad5-d5a97300ff91","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8c72c98d-9f77-4ae0-ad36-9c443a260608","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5498e656-e63a-43b1-8036-12abff8eef99","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76b6690c-d6cc-4dc6-853f-33831e81b3cc","title":"前置：某成员在项目下有会话，随后退出房间；角色：仍在房间的成员；入口：左侧项目分组"},{"parent":"5498e656-e63a-43b1-8036-12abff8eef99","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"48701c45-5d2b-4086-b521-029019f01fd0","title":"操作：查看该项目下的会话列表"},{"parent":"5498e656-e63a-43b1-8036-12abff8eef99","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a2b2d1c0-8375-4e12-9703-209597620b78","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 该成员的会话仍留在项目下，不随成员退出而消失\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 发起人按产品定义展示为历史身份或已退出标记，不显示为空"},{"parent":"5498e656-e63a-43b1-8036-12abff8eef99","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4ec35fae-ace0-4600-a82a-32894d54cfb1","title":"备注：成员退出后其会话的归属展示与可操作性需产品确认；项目下由只展示自己的会话改为展示房间内所有成员的会话；同一项目在不同成员侧合并为一个项目节点"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5498e656-e63a-43b1-8036-12abff8eef99","title":"🟠【P1】成员退出房间后其会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8c72c98d-9f77-4ae0-ad36-9c443a260608","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"9d92d846-8356-4b2b-8ad5-d5a97300ff91","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9df63755-6cde-4c6c-baf1-77a3555d7379","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"45794453-408b-49bc-937a-68145dd70c80","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4acee3dd-ca3c-48ee-a882-72d1e01a525c","title":"前置：项目 P 下有多名成员共产生 500 条以上会话；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧项目分组"},{"parent":"45794453-408b-49bc-937a-68145dd70c80","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2af1eea4-6a53-49b6-bdbb-ce3e5d29e70d","title":"操作：展开该项目并滚动到底"},{"parent":"45794453-408b-49bc-937a-68145dd70c80","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"448055fb-4d94-473e-b87d-017d6bd10cc6","title":"预期：\n1) 性能 ｜ 按分页或显示更多加载，滚动流畅不卡死\n2) 归属与顺序 ｜ 按更新时间倒序，顺序准确无断层"},{"parent":"45794453-408b-49bc-937a-68145dd70c80","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6371ac84-be3b-417d-b46d-9e8e604144ff","title":"备注：项目下由只展示自己的会话改为展示房间内所有成员的会话；同一项目在不同成员侧合并为一个项目节点"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"45794453-408b-49bc-937a-68145dd70c80","title":"🟡【P2】项目下会话数量很多"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9df63755-6cde-4c6c-baf1-77a3555d7379","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9d92d846-8356-4b2b-8ad5-d5a97300ff91","title":"项目下的会话聚合（房间内全员）"},{"parent":"192809e0-8431-49a9-9468-b8dbe0a823fc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1a1059a9-93d1-46af-8c47-a676428e257f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d9686115-e413-4bb4-b320-7f0658b6bf95","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d57417b4-dba4-4e73-848d-48a76b851784","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2c4cb73c-3cbc-4a1b-a40a-5ecbb7155f77","title":"操作：在项目 A 下新建会话并发送消息"},{"parent":"d57417b4-dba4-4e73-848d-48a76b851784","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7302e196-f768-4860-9fa8-771d997d4cd3","title":"预期：会话立即出现在项目 A 下，安装新版本后重新进入房间时项目下会话仍完整展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d57417b4-dba4-4e73-848d-48a76b851784","title":"🟠【P1】会话归入所选项目"},{"parent":"d9686115-e413-4bb4-b320-7f0658b6bf95","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c03baab2-3c9e-4574-97c5-0953746514f5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9fa95895-b6a8-4386-8af4-51ff7cd43dd3","title":"操作：项目内会话 A、B、C 依次更新"},{"parent":"c03baab2-3c9e-4574-97c5-0953746514f5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c0f7ae23-4790-4614-94bc-d53352835e07","title":"预期：按更新时间倒序显示最后更新的会话在最前"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c03baab2-3c9e-4574-97c5-0953746514f5","title":"🟠【P1】项目内更新时间倒序"},{"parent":"d9686115-e413-4bb4-b320-7f0658b6bf95","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8899230f-63a1-4612-8fc0-f0fe1d5b4239","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6f71ae18-776d-40a6-b5f1-3e3781b5b4b8","title":"操作：向项目内旧会话发送新消息"},{"parent":"8899230f-63a1-4612-8fc0-f0fe1d5b4239","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5749acc-7708-48cc-8a94-aa8932cca700","title":"预期：该会话更新时间更新并移动到项目内第一位"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8899230f-63a1-4612-8fc0-f0fe1d5b4239","title":"🟠【P1】新消息后重排"},{"parent":"d9686115-e413-4bb4-b320-7f0658b6bf95","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bf4f7aee-6ca0-4b24-a281-8e924e2d84a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c868b61-264b-4bc8-805f-5dcbf233d2a7","title":"操作：项目 A 和 B 各创建会话"},{"parent":"bf4f7aee-6ca0-4b24-a281-8e924e2d84a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"33732bce-2bee-4fe8-99ca-0e59bedce981","title":"预期：会话只出现在各自项目，不跨项目重复展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bf4f7aee-6ca0-4b24-a281-8e924e2d84a4","title":"🟠【P1】不同项目隔离"},{"parent":"d9686115-e413-4bb4-b320-7f0658b6bf95","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9f7b2734-0d32-45c0-bb0d-58f24a82ce91","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"65f739f8-becf-4060-ab70-3218fd82a15c","title":"操作：点击项目折叠箭头后再次点击"},{"parent":"9f7b2734-0d32-45c0-bb0d-58f24a82ce91","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"46e33311-013d-4207-b4f7-0f11969aed00","title":"预期：先隐藏项目会话，再恢复并保持正确顺序"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9f7b2734-0d32-45c0-bb0d-58f24a82ce91","title":"🟠【P1】项目折叠展开"},{"parent":"d9686115-e413-4bb4-b320-7f0658b6bf95","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3ca0875a-b360-4237-9133-8346dca34d82","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8651d851-8e91-4e2a-8270-6388fd85dbdb","title":"操作：在同一个项目下新建10+条会话"},{"parent":"3ca0875a-b360-4237-9133-8346dca34d82","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a44a8a4c-d8c2-4cf4-ac60-7c844574e525","title":"预期：展示5条最近的会话，其余会话放到显示更多，点击显示接下来5条会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3ca0875a-b360-4237-9133-8346dca34d82","title":"🟠【P1】项目下会话展示数量"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d9686115-e413-4bb4-b320-7f0658b6bf95","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"1a1059a9-93d1-46af-8c47-a676428e257f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ea5bb2cc-78ac-423a-a087-7e7b53e5a592","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8f6cedf7-0830-4984-b651-adf5995971ec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"846c929a-04cd-42e1-a1a6-80c6b3018293","title":"操作：会话引用已移除或不存在项目 ID"},{"parent":"8f6cedf7-0830-4984-b651-adf5995971ec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"63e30dca-716c-4641-8744-fabd6ba57f32","title":"预期：按无项目会话处理或提示异常，不阻塞列表"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8f6cedf7-0830-4984-b651-adf5995971ec","title":"🟡【P2】会话归属项目不存在"},{"parent":"ea5bb2cc-78ac-423a-a087-7e7b53e5a592","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a4ff6213-44c9-433e-aa39-948f93ef0ed1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a10c1741-96be-4714-9691-6f9caf58cf20","title":"操作：分页重复返回相同 session_id"},{"parent":"a4ff6213-44c9-433e-aa39-948f93ef0ed1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bc741124-f6fc-47a4-9f59-d0dd70a62d13","title":"预期：同一会话仅展示一次"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a4ff6213-44c9-433e-aa39-948f93ef0ed1","title":"🟡【P2】重复会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ea5bb2cc-78ac-423a-a087-7e7b53e5a592","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"1a1059a9-93d1-46af-8c47-a676428e257f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"97e9b432-6426-4b3b-bbdd-d5d64da1a964","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c870eca0-6cd0-4e50-9b56-9585c491722c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"287175cd-4de6-4884-ab85-86eb8b6851a4","title":"操作：多个会话更新时间完全相同"},{"parent":"c870eca0-6cd0-4e50-9b56-9585c491722c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae759346-78de-477c-9994-c8184a45dd08","title":"预期：采用稳定次级排序，刷新前后顺序不随机"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c870eca0-6cd0-4e50-9b56-9585c491722c","title":"🟡【P2】相同更新时间"},{"parent":"97e9b432-6426-4b3b-bbdd-d5d64da1a964","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7de9a318-fc70-417f-99ed-ecdc70d1af86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c4363d1-9666-41b1-a353-a2e52308b286","title":"操作：创建项目但不创建会话"},{"parent":"7de9a318-fc70-417f-99ed-ecdc70d1af86","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aa99851f-1214-48dd-b292-c2a845d159c9","title":"预期：项目仍可展示，展开后显示暂无对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7de9a318-fc70-417f-99ed-ecdc70d1af86","title":"🟡【P2】项目无会话"},{"parent":"97e9b432-6426-4b3b-bbdd-d5d64da1a964","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c94f2384-a6b0-4c4f-ab5e-c9c2b6c62bbf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d224a7e8-61f5-49d5-81e7-7da7ce3536ea","title":"操作：单项目准备 1000 条会话"},{"parent":"c94f2384-a6b0-4c4f-ab5e-c9c2b6c62bbf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4799eef5-f251-4df3-bafd-a33b620be690","title":"预期：使用分页和「显示更多」，排序准确且操作流畅"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c94f2384-a6b0-4c4f-ab5e-c9c2b6c62bbf","title":"🟡【P2】项目千条会话"},{"parent":"97e9b432-6426-4b3b-bbdd-d5d64da1a964","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b3587b71-9c9e-45c6-a090-c0d5fa269b02","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"17e415a2-6d9c-4c63-86b6-add1839c865a","title":"操作：1 秒内让多个会话连续更新"},{"parent":"b3587b71-9c9e-45c6-a090-c0d5fa269b02","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5eff8622-7fc2-491a-ae40-6c68381c0604","title":"预期：最终顺序与最新更新时间一致，无重复和跳错项目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b3587b71-9c9e-45c6-a090-c0d5fa269b02","title":"🟡【P2】快速连续更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"97e9b432-6426-4b3b-bbdd-d5d64da1a964","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1a1059a9-93d1-46af-8c47-a676428e257f","title":"会话归属与更新时间排序"},{"parent":"192809e0-8431-49a9-9468-b8dbe0a823fc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0f62b27b-5e47-49fc-a813-5d4f68a5859e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"40cc6609-f947-43c5-ad99-077c416e79b4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c9c7f24f-e7da-47fb-ac2f-119739939235","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c958833e-eb2d-425a-8b2c-dd3e9b7a9d8a","title":"操作：在一个 Agent 窗口选择 skills 项目后，新开另一个 Agent 会话窗口"},{"parent":"c9c7f24f-e7da-47fb-ac2f-119739939235","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"99d6ae34-6f09-4322-8666-e7c9c4fcc087","title":"预期：新窗口输入框左下角默认显示 skills，项目上下文默认带入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c9c7f24f-e7da-47fb-ac2f-119739939235","title":"新窗口默认带入上次项目"},{"parent":"40cc6609-f947-43c5-ad99-077c416e79b4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f250f0a3-c3dd-40d3-b792-dfa896c9b655","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0fea7ea6-95ad-4438-8dc6-9feb940090ce","title":"操作：窗口 A 将项目从 skills 切换为 test-project codex，然后新开窗口 B"},{"parent":"f250f0a3-c3dd-40d3-b792-dfa896c9b655","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5ac558a7-bb17-4121-90ed-94e398e4c477","title":"预期：窗口 B 默认显示 test-project codex"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f250f0a3-c3dd-40d3-b792-dfa896c9b655","title":"切换项目后影响后续新窗口"},{"parent":"40cc6609-f947-43c5-ad99-077c416e79b4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1020ef88-725f-432f-ad33-1b05b9ac228a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a7f386f8-178a-4984-926f-c0802639f202","title":"操作：选择 test-project codex 后退出并重新打开应用"},{"parent":"1020ef88-725f-432f-ad33-1b05b9ac228a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ba3d4594-c2a3-4d8c-a773-fd164fb20a04","title":"预期：新会话入口默认显示 test-project codex 或产品定义的最近项目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1020ef88-725f-432f-ad33-1b05b9ac228a","title":"重启应用后保留最近项目"},{"parent":"40cc6609-f947-43c5-ad99-077c416e79b4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2ad23d3a-e20e-41d5-9794-3d33baeb61e1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"75fbe338-9fa8-4d9d-9c49-5cdad72b2ec7","title":"操作：在窗口 A 选择「不使用项目」后新开窗口 B"},{"parent":"2ad23d3a-e20e-41d5-9794-3d33baeb61e1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e1bd4d8a-a82d-4ba7-9826-973766186405","title":"预期：窗口 B 默认显示「不使用项目」，不再沿用更早的项目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2ad23d3a-e20e-41d5-9794-3d33baeb61e1","title":"显式选择不使用项目也被记住"},{"parent":"40cc6609-f947-43c5-ad99-077c416e79b4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"08dc77a8-3cbf-45f8-a716-1037a5a5f58d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"34dd6f79-2031-4407-a812-54069c7be93c","title":"操作：窗口 A 已选择 skills，窗口 B 切换为 test-project codex"},{"parent":"08dc77a8-3cbf-45f8-a716-1037a5a5f58d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"caa48784-6cfd-48c0-9b6d-7966184a6021","title":"预期：窗口 A 的底部项目仍保持 skills，只有新开的窗口默认使用最