径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fbd5bb67-7f87-422a-965d-b2b3be10747d","title":"会话工作目录正确"},{"parent":"613390a6-8787-4918-95f8-5cc84e998d2b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5c8b0ba6-46df-45a4-b8e1-00276de1f2f0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"053b18cc-61a8-436c-8120-67def8e4f075","title":"操作：选择项目后要求 Agent 在项目中创建 notes.md"},{"parent":"5c8b0ba6-46df-45a4-b8e1-00276de1f2f0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b488002b-dfec-41a0-847c-921e692b8754","title":"预期：文件创建在所选项目目录下，不写入上一次项目或 Documents 根目录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5c8b0ba6-46df-45a4-b8e1-00276de1f2f0","title":"新建文件写入项目"},{"parent":"613390a6-8787-4918-95f8-5cc84e998d2b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b233cb8c-6ff4-4b23-9fc9-47c87f221096","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"411a7947-758b-4450-a9f9-c320820c7a59","title":"操作：新会话选择项目 A 提问，再新建会话选择项目 B 提问"},{"parent":"b233cb8c-6ff4-4b23-9fc9-47c87f221096","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae5e0fb9-8c62-4cb0-818a-c928d90d38b9","title":"预期：两个会话分别读取各自项目文件，不交叉使用上下文"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b233cb8c-6ff4-4b23-9fc9-47c87f221096","title":"项目切换后上下文更新"},{"parent":"613390a6-8787-4918-95f8-5cc84e998d2b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c3ba7d95-cbee-47de-8c71-a696b58fa52e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1b6e8330-9e16-4135-a586-f8636e9b1fd6","title":"操作：选择项目 A 后在输入框 @ 引用项目外某文件并提问"},{"parent":"c3ba7d95-cbee-47de-8c71-a696b58fa52e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"273bca52-41fd-4694-b008-f71d2adfb154","title":"预期：Agent 同时理解项目 A 上下文和显式引用文件，冲突时按产品定义优先级处理"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c3ba7d95-cbee-47de-8c71-a696b58fa52e","title":"显式引用文件优先"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"613390a6-8787-4918-95f8-5cc84e998d2b","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"e3548e30-114f-4a03-8767-cfb6f35c4ad1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f85d666f-1a8a-4706-b696-e11cffa6c8d3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1fa06d7b-ca55-4d2c-884e-897a5d7ff725","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3e1e7315-0e82-4b6b-a474-59078ead925a","title":"操作：会话开始后本地修改 README.md，再询问最新内容"},{"parent":"1fa06d7b-ca55-4d2c-884e-897a5d7ff725","callout":[],"chi