:"会话读取 CLAUDE.md 规则"},{"parent":"878943d1-3fe8-4bf5-8aff-46043395614c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"20e579f3-bdcd-4eb7-94c0-6643a603c849","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2b1b5bfd-f05e-45d9-8255-aa93fa622c7a","title":"操作：项目根目录已有 AGENTS.md，选择该项目使用 Codex 发起会话并提问规则相关问题"},{"parent":"20e579f3-bdcd-4eb7-94c0-6643a603c849","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"20ce804e-5b5d-436b-b266-db3ea0778b13","title":"预期：Codex 按已知项目能力读取 AGENTS.md 中适用规则并据此回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"20e579f3-bdcd-4eb7-94c0-6643a603c849","title":"Codex 读取 AGENTS.md"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"878943d1-3fe8-4bf5-8aff-46043395614c","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"7fbdbc2c-9f8a-4ec1-bf27-46adb7ad84b2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b9a649ea-a111-4315-a31e-17d7e848d1e2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"80f33728-f9b8-44f5-9888-3ab74c1f2f1d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"893fa73c-f373-49bf-a917-18155f8733d0","title":"操作：项目中 CLAUDE.md 文件为只读时新起 Claude 类 Agent 会话"},{"parent":"80f33728-f9b8-44f5-9888-3ab74c1f2f1d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76809dc9-d65b-4381-a530-334c6d630593","title":"预期：不覆盖文件，提示规则写入失败或降级为仅读取现有规则"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"80f33728-f9b8-44f5-9888-3ab74c1f2f1d","title":"CLAUDE.md 只读"},{"parent":"b9a649ea-a111-4315-a31e-17d7e848d1e2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0d784326-841d-4eff-bc52-6ef1a8b7a6ea","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"80d21141-1d9f-4933-a418-f19d90189031","title":"操作：项目中 CLAUDE.md 使用异常编码或损坏内容"},{"parent":"0d784326-841d-4eff-bc52-6ef1a8b7a6ea","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"30f46918-08f4-4541-b8dd-75a2ae2eb941","title":"预期：更新前安全处理编码，失败时提示，不破坏原文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0d784326-841d-4eff-bc52-6ef1a8b7a6ea","title":"CLAUDE.md 编码异常"},{"parent":"b9a649ea-a111-4315-a31e-17d7e848d1e2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f6e4b059-1ed1-483e-b445-50d40690a88e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e9855a1c-e6b5-4662-92d9-fc8145032cd3","title":"操作：创建或更新 CLAUDE.md 过程中强制关闭应用"},{"parent":"f6e4b059-1ed1-483e-b445-50d40690a88e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6992d418-e2d2-4eb8-badc-e9d8883d5e6c","title":"预期：不会留下半截 JSON 或损坏规则文件，重启后可恢复或重试"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f6e4b059-1ed1-483e-b445-50d40690a88e","title":"规则写入中断"},{"parent":"b9a649ea-a111-4315-a31e-17d7e848d1e2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9007cfd9-ebb1-448c-92b8-791523334922","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5b24a14-4a8b-428f-9303-1fe3875abf06","title":"操作：CLAUDE.md 中有用户自定义规则，发起会话后检查文件内容"},{"parent":"9007cfd9-ebb1-448c-92b8-791523334922","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4f424239-6b60-409d-baab-fc790f3d4644","title":"预期：用户规则完整保留，新增规则有明确边界或追加位置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9007cfd9-ebb1-448c-92b8-791523334922","title":"用户规则被误覆盖"},{"parent":"b9a649ea-a111-4315-a31e-17d7e848d1e2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"999c6683-46d3-4cfb-8745-6b197bc20238","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"63396eae-6ce7-4a2a-b3a3-36f74d9b5892","title":"操作：使用 Codex 发起会话后检查项目根目录"},{"parent":"999c6683-46d3-4cfb-8745-6b197bc20238","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d20dfbeb-0125-41b6-8508-70fa414ae6cd","title":"预期：不应出现由 Codex 自动创建或覆盖的 CLAUDE.md 文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"999c6683-46d3-4cfb-8745-6b197bc20238","title":"Codex 误写 CLAUDE.md"},{"parent":"b9a649ea-a111-4315-a31e-17d7e848d1e2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"99424b0a-3fa5-4bf5-b624-05eebb56759e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1bf87a29-f988-416e-99c7-9e1e48a6ce33","title":"操作：项目根目录已有 AGENTS.md，选择该项目使用 Codex 发起会话并提问规则相关问题，修改AGENTS.md文件"},{"parent":"99424b0a-3fa5-4bf5-b624-05eebb56759e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"93259ba3-ef73-4273-bdb6-476dc5a45213","title":"预期：Codex 不会根据最新修改的AGENTS.md文件去使用规则"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"99424b0a-3fa5-4bf5-b624-05eebb56759e","title":"会话过程中修改Codex AGENTS.md文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b9a649ea-a111-4315-a31e-17d7e848d1e2","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"7fbdbc2c-9f8a-4ec1-bf27-46adb7ad84b2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6c198b14-714d-4cd9-a1c4-66ea950f4df2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"494a4525-1789-4c2f-afa1-e384e3999b73","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"45dd63b5-becb-4d79-b86d-553996cf7e8f","title":"操作：项目中存在 claude.md 但不存在 CLAUDE.md 时发起会话"},{"parent":"494a4525-1789-4c2f-afa1-e384e3999b73","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"731d26d1-c7cc-44fe-b040-a2e48ce194d5","title":"预期：按产品大小写约定处理，不在大小写敏感文件系统中产生冲突或误读"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"494a4525-1789-4c2f-afa1-e384e3999b73","title":"已有 lowercase claude.md"},{"parent":"6c198b14-714d-4cd9-a1c4-66ea950f4df2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"782ae2e7-26bf-4528-8745-353d55e909f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8283074d-a152-457a-906d-666cbe672c5a","title":"操作：CLAUDE.md 超过 1MB 且包含大量规则时发起会话"},{"parent":"782ae2e7-26bf-4528-8745-353d55e909f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"53bf9056-6464-4771-80a8-221cdcfec582","title":"预期：Agent 能读取关键规则或提示规则过大，不因读取规则导致会话失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"782ae2e7-26bf-4528-8745-353d55e909f8","title":"大型规则文件"},{"parent":"6c198b14-714d-4cd9-a1c4-66ea950f4df2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c54233c7-350f-4e3b-935a-92be5843b650","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"55602d75-09a5-4aba-bc40-4385a68cc9d9","title":"操作：CLAUDE.md 与 AGENTS.md 中存在相互冲突规则，使用 Codex 或 Claude 分别发起会话"},{"parent":"c54233c7-350f-4e3b-935a-92be5843b650","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"49145fd5-618a-4dd6-b5e3-d0e06c9cfc78","title":"预期：各 Agent 按自身规则文件优先级处理，并避免跨 Agent 误用规则"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c54233c7-350f-4e3b-935a-92be5843b650","title":"规则冲突"},{"parent":"6c198b14-714d-4cd9-a1c4-66ea950f4df2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5fe17185-7741-4181-aa8e-3785bd399ee2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"49787596-9aba-4ca2-acf0-5e4119e9857e","title":"操作：CLAUDE.md 或 AGENTS.md 中包含代码块、中文、emoji 和尖括号"},{"parent":"5fe17185-7741-4181-aa8e-3785bd399ee2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"894ab033-8516-48e4-bf97-e2b35ca1a80d","title":"预期：规则文件被正确读取和显示，不触发注入或格式损坏"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5fe17185-7741-4181-aa8e-3785bd399ee2","title":"规则包含特殊字符"},{"parent":"6c198b14-714d-4cd9-a1c4-66ea950f4df2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"247f2b12-2035-4f65-8094-973c5e2b3b94","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13628a18-88d4-48c2-ac6d-412b2780aa9a","title":"操作：项目根目录和子目录都存在规则文件，在子目录任务中发起会话"},{"parent":"247f2b12-2035-4f65-8094-973c5e2b3b94","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0784b9ae-7c1f-4ae9-a97a-cf9f93b2d201","title":"预期：按产品定义合并或覆盖规则，优先级清晰且回复遵守有效规则"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"247f2b12-2035-4f65-8094-973c5e2b3b94","title":"嵌套目录规则"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6c198b14-714d-4cd9-a1c4-66ea950f4df2","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7fbdbc2c-9f8a-4ec1-bf27-46adb7ad84b2","title":"项目规则文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"79ff98d6-620b-4f47-9e54-df9e654d19e5","title":"项目规则与上下文"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5fb35fc3-9e42-4fab-91fd-d5e6e78c85dd","title":"项目与工作区管理"},{"parent":"3bc688f1-4a63-47ad-917e-88c2f92b0aff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"12cf330e-dfd0-43cc-92f2-5b12970ba34f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6dd6284b-04c3-43d1-b24e-2cd95cf46c7d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d13d40d6-1759-4eb5-9eba-3362c6fa9213","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"159db839-9a34-4089-861b-4dcf81dba5dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f72461f0-f006-4a93-96ed-65da989c8ba4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5802ca9b-a844-475f-8a16-de56fb49881c","title":"操作：前置：新注册用户，未发起过任何会话，已在设置中配置默认 Agent；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧会话列表顶部「新建会话」按钮；步骤：点击新建会话"},{"parent":"f72461f0-f006-4a93-96ed-65da989c8ba4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"01d3e84a-7ca6-4c69-87c4-76a4bcc846f3","title":"预期：右侧展示新建会话详情页，输入框上方选中的是设置中配置的默认 Agent；输入框可编辑；刷新页面后再次点击新建会话，仍默认选中该 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f72461f0-f006-4a93-96ed-65da989c8ba4","title":"新用户首次新建会话默认 Agent"},{"parent":"159db839-9a34-4089-861b-4dcf81dba5dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ba85861f-e5b9-421d-b174-6fa38c38182c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8af0cf39-8da5-4aa3-a380-847455a8c85a","title":"操作：前置：账号已用 Codex 发起过最近一次会话；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧会话列表顶部「新建会话」按钮；步骤：点击新建会话"},{"parent":"ba85861f-e5b9-421d-b174-6fa38c38182c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"18b1ba5b-fb81-48c6-9ad5-dd1e292c1c6a","title":"预期：右侧新建会话详情默认选中 Codex，而非设置中的默认 Agent；输入框上方 Agent 名称与最近一次会话一致；退出房间重进后再新建会话，仍带入最近使用的 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ba85861f-e5b9-421d-b174-6fa38c38182c","title":"老用户新建会话带入最近使用的 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"159db839-9a34-4089-861b-4dcf81dba5dd","title":"正常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d13d40d6-1759-4eb5-9eba-3362c6fa9213","title":"新建会话默认 Agent 带入"},{"parent":"6dd6284b-04c3-43d1-b24e-2cd95cf46c7d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f4c3eb70-0f50-4091-b6e2-2b02527c46fc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1f6bc41f-7e35-4f6c-afa0-c9a7a45d06cb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6bac2e5b-e788-468f-891d-a55f4a5b3c9a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c7536a2-85be-483b-8c6a-989920e6a866","title":"操作：前置：房间内有多个可用 Agent；角色：房间成员；入口：新建会话页输入框上方 Agent 切换；步骤：切换到 Codex 后发送一条消息"},{"parent":"6bac2e5b-e788-468f-891d-a55f4a5b3c9a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d3528d10-8f77-4de1-b805-05b29396b62f","title":"预期：会话由 Codex 发起并出现在左侧列表中，条目 Agent 图标为 Codex；Agent 筛选器中 Codex 的会话数量加一；刷新后归属不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6bac2e5b-e788-468f-891d-a55f4a5b3c9a","title":"会话归属于所选 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1f6bc41f-7e35-4f6c-afa0-c9a7a45d06cb","title":"正常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f4c3eb70-0f50-4091-b6e2-2b02527c46fc","title":"切换 Agent 后新建会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6dd6284b-04c3-43d1-b24e-2cd95cf46c7d","title":"新建会话入口"},{"parent":"12cf330e-dfd0-43cc-92f2-5b12970ba34f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5a5f703b-3908-4fa1-841b-ef0fe785e53a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"37735917-91c5-453f-95f0-1c659b0c00e0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ac5e3915-2e44-4ab4-ae06-521b85ed63b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d04149a3-58c7-4b3c-8fe3-0327f0de5bfb","title":"操作：进入房间，点击左侧右上角顶部的搜索按钮"},{"parent":"ac5e3915-2e44-4ab4-ae06-521b85ed63b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e047228b-60c1-46d2-a82a-0fa9e52563b4","title":"预期：弹出搜索弹窗"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ac5e3915-2e44-4ab4-ae06-521b85ed63b1","title":"点击左侧顶部的搜索按钮"},{"parent":"37735917-91c5-453f-95f0-1c659b0c00e0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"120f9a29-9131-471e-8da3-5989f4c19664","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e25622e6-2b45-4eb8-8460-df81f68676ae","title":"操作：前置：当前 Agent 下存在标题为「Design Review」和「设计评审」的会话；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧会话列表搜索按钮；步骤：依次输入 design、DESIGN、设计"},{"parent":"120f9a29-9131-471e-8da3-5989f4c19664","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f32772d3-689c-49fb-b4af-eab726a9b7e1","title":"预期：三次输入均能匹配到对应会话；大小写不影响结果；中英文关键词均按会话标题模糊匹配；结果中不出现其他 Agent 的会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"120f9a29-9131-471e-8da3-5989f4c19664","title":"搜索大小写与中英文兼容"},{"parent":"37735917-91c5-453f-95f0-1c659b0c00e0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"67af3b07-2475-4e1b-b9ec-fb616764bf17","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f627208e-2508-4995-84bf-495534664737","title":"操作：前置：存在若干已完成会话；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧搜索框；步骤：输入任意关键词，查看结果条目"},{"parent":"67af3b07-2475-4e1b-b9ec-fb616764bf17","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44ef2009-495e-4cf2-b350-90ae6a94b0c7","title":"预期：输入后实时匹配出会话；每条结果显示会话所在项目、发起该会话的 Agent、会话标题和最近更新时间四项信息，均与会话列表中一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"67af3b07-2475-4e1b-b9ec-fb616764bf17","title":"搜索结果条目信息完整"},{"parent":"37735917-91c5-453f-95f0-1c659b0c00e0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a6cc46bd-35dd-444a-b369-a5101505dc7a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ddb08baa-0cca-46aa-a2fc-cc34ed9bbc72","title":"操作：前置：搜索出至少一条会话；角色：房间成员；入口：搜索结果条目；步骤：鼠标悬浮该条结果，点击出现的定位按钮"},{"parent":"a6cc46bd-35dd-444a-b369-a5101505dc7a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f759bd0e-fbf5-417d-aa26-1835e30e7a09","title":"预期：悬浮时条目右侧出现定位按钮；点击后搜索框收起，左侧列表滚动并高亮该会话，右侧打开该会话详情，消息内容与该会话一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a6cc46bd-35dd-444a-b369-a5101505dc7a","title":"搜索结果定位到会话"},{"parent":"37735917-91c5-453f-95f0-1c659b0c00e0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e5d10031-6945-402b-8e1f-15c22723f7d9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"72f995f8-4671-4314-99eb-70cf3de2cc13","title":"操作：选择{Agent}分类，搜索"},{"parent":"e5d10031-6945-402b-8e1f-15c22723f7d9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b9a888cc-5969-4b52-8696-0af7e228f378","title":"预期：搜索大小写兼容，支持中英文搜索，只能搜索到 {Agent} 的会话消息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e5d10031-6945-402b-8e1f-15c22723f7d9","title":"{Agent}分类下搜索"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"37735917-91c5-453f-95f0-1c659b0c00e0","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"5a5f703b-3908-4fa1-841b-ef0fe785e53a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f159ecb7-3584-41ba-a499-de43f61e920b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"92520e8c-4363-4b2f-8ab2-f4e004285d47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"320c7b17-9b66-48b8-8a6e-1c7ea5ed009c","title":"操作：搜索框输入不存在的关键字"},{"parent":"92520e8c-4363-4b2f-8ab2-f4e004285d47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"941e8cbd-6c9c-4a9a-8807-6f075412449a","title":"预期：显示空结果提示，不清空原始历史数据"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"92520e8c-4363-4b2f-8ab2-f4e004285d47","title":"🟠【P1】搜索无结果"},{"parent":"f159ecb7-3584-41ba-a499-de43f61e920b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"486f47f0-d0ad-45c0-beff-0fc71c69ff17","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"89599c52-c6fd-4a32-9d84-9a0e4a564d39","title":"操作：搜索框输入多个空格"},{"parent":"486f47f0-d0ad-45c0-beff-0fc71c69ff17","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e2e490e-562e-45b5-890b-92d6645bc65c","title":"预期：按空查询处理或提示无效输入，列表不出现异常刷新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"486f47f0-d0ad-45c0-beff-0fc71c69ff17","title":"🟠【P1】搜索仅空格"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f159ecb7-3584-41ba-a499-de43f61e920b","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"5a5f703b-3908-4fa1-841b-ef0fe785e53a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3d901d34-bebc-4dbb-8f92-3901bc5a795d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dac4cf2e-2ed9-4777-ade5-d1622fdc4771","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8a346566-0a54-46da-a5d3-670aaea5430d","title":"操作：筛选 {Agent} 时 {Agent} 会话收到新消息"},{"parent":"dac4cf2e-2ed9-4777-ade5-d1622fdc4771","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"79a2c4fe-1e7c-482d-9277-16f70f9227d8","title":"预期：当前列表不混入 {Agent}，会话排序数据在切回后正确更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dac4cf2e-2ed9-4777-ade5-d1622fdc4771","title":"🟡【P2】切换筛选时新消息到达"},{"parent":"3d901d34-bebc-4dbb-8f92-3901bc5a795d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1ab0ab91-d6f6-4294-b77f-91b2964b8f52","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3660070-bf05-4874-bd19-a2f302bc89ed","title":"操作：准备 10000 条跨 Agent 历史会话"},{"parent":"1ab0ab91-d6f6-4294-b77f-91b2964b8f52","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8be473d8-2983-419c-8697-63d88d934560","title":"预期：每条归属准确，筛选和切换不发生串线"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1ab0ab91-d6f6-4294-b77f-91b2964b8f52","title":"🟡【P2】大量历史会话归属"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3d901d34-bebc-4dbb-8f92-3901bc5a795d","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5a5f703b-3908-4fa1-841b-ef0fe785e53a","title":"会话搜索"},{"parent":"12cf330e-dfd0-43cc-92f2-5b12970ba34f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4eb15a80-6ede-40b2-9b4a-c427a728538b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7ac48e16-4f8e-41aa-b579-893c2e7c010c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8980c182-973e-4bc1-a7d4-7299b9a9b13d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"578aae3f-c37d-441f-87ca-5e30529a3ddf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8cb9edf9-7366-4cf3-843e-0ddbd8e3bc80","title":"操作：不选择任何项目创建并发送会话"},{"parent":"578aae3f-c37d-441f-87ca-5e30529a3ddf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd1aa83f-d31d-43d2-a1e3-7d4eaf14498b","title":"预期：会话显示在项目列表最后的「对话」分组"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"578aae3f-c37d-441f-87ca-5e30529a3ddf","title":"🔴【P0】无项目会话归入对话"},{"parent":"8980c182-973e-4bc1-a7d4-7299b9a9b13d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"660a7aa1-e2dc-4632-9b16-6545c510425f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d7ce2524-7a9d-4a12-849f-712b7d5bba7a","title":"操作：存在多个项目和无项目会话"},{"parent":"660a7aa1-e2dc-4632-9b16-6545c510425f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b1c088cf-4cd4-43ec-a2d0-9e09c133e0e6","title":"预期：所有项目之后显示「对话」，不参与项目创建时间排序"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"660a7aa1-e2dc-4632-9b16-6545c510425f","title":"🟠【P1】对话分组固定末尾"},{"parent":"8980c182-973e-4bc1-a7d4-7299b9a9b13d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"37366206-2a53-464d-9f04-767518762448","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2944a2b3-3e75-40d0-a0a5-8c248ca3b0c3","title":"操作：更新多个无项目会话"},{"parent":"37366206-2a53-464d-9f04-767518762448","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8770f17a-bbf2-49f5-81cc-90cdc4546815","title":"预期：按会话更新时间倒序显示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"37366206-2a53-464d-9f04-767518762448","title":"🔴【P0】对话内更新时间倒序"},{"parent":"8980c182-973e-4bc1-a7d4-7299b9a9b13d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3118007d-9f88-429d-aeaa-b2bb769bef4f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c0d9fb3-aa1b-4f26-a7a1-bebf430e4b07","title":"操作：点击对话旁新建会话按钮"},{"parent":"3118007d-9f88-429d-aeaa-b2bb769bef4f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"56010f69-d2d7-4694-b75c-9ce6a7c0cce5","title":"预期：打开未绑定任何项目的新会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3118007d-9f88-429d-aeaa-b2bb769bef4f","title":"🔴【P0】对话新建会话"},{"parent":"8980c182-973e-4bc1-a7d4-7299b9a9b13d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8646be4b-3add-4ead-894e-676982630463","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"03180e96-3465-4f9a-b9e0-8f77d360bf51","title":"操作：点击对话更多并选择批量删除对话后确认"},{"parent":"8646be4b-3add-4ead-894e-676982630463","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d6fa550d-2af8-47f4-b7f5-4f2db558e27d","title":"预期：删除所有的无项目会话，不影响任何项目会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8646be4b-3add-4ead-894e-676982630463","title":"🔴【P0】对话批量删除"},{"parent":"8980c182-973e-4bc1-a7d4-7299b9a9b13d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8b95fd95-273a-4154-b9c7-94548c6978b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ca18152-ed3f-48f6-b2e3-7a6487726be5","title":"操作：打开对话分组操作"},{"parent":"8b95fd95-273a-4154-b9c7-94548c6978b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5856d70f-37da-445e-bd61-a39c11e65c84","title":"预期：只提供新建会话和批量删除对话，不显示打开文件夹或移除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8b95fd95-273a-4154-b9c7-94548c6978b1","title":"🔴【P0】对话操作范围"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8980c182-973e-4bc1-a7d4-7299b9a9b13d","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"7ac48e16-4f8e-41aa-b579-893c2e7c010c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5bd0e762-06c8-4a6d-bcc7-d0f9fce9d7d9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"44879fe3-ec20-4d36-ada6-f021353e5e97","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e8da1f25-772f-4869-8803-1702c38f1ca2","title":"操作：加载 project_id 为空的会话"},{"parent":"44879fe3-ec20-4d36-ada6-f021353e5e97","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4a1c1aad-5494-4dda-84da-39eea0364c67","title":"预期：不得归到最近使用项目或首个项目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"44879fe3-ec20-4d36-ada6-f021353e5e97","title":"🟡【P2】无项目会话误入项目"},{"parent":"5bd0e762-06c8-4a6d-bcc7-d0f9fce9d7d9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bc6a594b-f0ea-408a-8b06-d51e6b68ec04","callout":[],"child