态为失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6a1fdf49-4a70-4ace-a464-6393437f07d6","title":"🟡【P2】会话过程中额度刚好用尽","icons":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b2766e99-5bb6-4b70-9bd8-b14ac4ae5b4f","title":"正常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"73084db4-7cf4-4f42-aa28-5c5383c131ba","title":"额度耗尽"},{"parent":"edd3ac7b-9e5d-49a5-abe5-5099c34a21b0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fe4c92c2-a44d-4efc-84b7-8b81430ee813","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b610ce94-c95f-4953-9583-5065bd2f9029","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6970114e-4918-4948-90eb-b6d2e402c55d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f4c16622-38c0-441b-99b7-bba8bd856733","title":"前置：Agent 此前已完成登录"},{"parent":"6970114e-4918-4948-90eb-b6d2e402c55d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6113c720-dc75-4af4-92e1-da097d0200de","title":"操作：登录过期后发送消息"},{"parent":"6970114e-4918-4948-90eb-b6d2e402c55d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f60bdd1f-5059-449e-ae9e-a126e18fb9a6","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示重新登录，登录成功后可继续会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6970114e-4918-4948-90eb-b6d2e402c55d","title":"🟠【P1】登录过期后发送消息"},{"parent":"b610ce94-c95f-4953-9583-5065bd2f9029","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ef390eaa-ef7f-41ca-8b0d-3cc5001399bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"79906895-f8a8-44b8-bd47-880bc4d52a22","title":"前置：前置：Agent 已登录并在会话中运行；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"ef390eaa-ef7f-41ca-8b0d-3cc5001399bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"31357709-2ba2-4d49-924c-a13f7763d621","title":"操作：在对话过程中让 Agent 所有者本地退出登录，观察会话内提示"},{"parent":"ef390eaa-ef7f-41ca-8b0d-3cc5001399bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"61fab822-9643-48c6-ad09-b3f83c72b652","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 会话给出明确提示，说明需要 Agent 所有者在本地登录后重试\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 不返回 Unknown 或无信息量报错\n3) 持久化 ｜ 重新登录后可继续对话，历史消息不丢失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ef390eaa-ef7f-41ca-8b0d-3cc5001399bf","title":"🔴【P0】使用过程中掉登录态的提示"},{"parent":"b610ce94-c95f-4953-9583-5065bd2f9029","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"00d7e0f7-35e2-4b71-9172-233c7426c340","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"afbf351f-be3d-4552-9a84-43ea2673ac0b","title":"前置：该 Agent 已掉登录态"},{"parent"