6c8a4416139","title":"前置：前置：工作区内存在图片、文档、视频等多类文件；角色：房间成员；入口：面板类型筛选"},{"parent":"26774c1e-b293-4dc0-bc13-260780d664dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a56a080c-b955-40da-a864-58705b5abd8d","title":"操作：依次筛选图片、文档、视频，并在结果列表中向下滚动"},{"parent":"26774c1e-b293-4dc0-bc13-260780d664dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ccc5e36d-3fb4-4626-a714-c76ccb92d705","title":"预期：每种类型都能筛选出对应文件且图片类筛选覆盖工作区内全部图片；左侧本地文件目录在筛选时保持展示；向下滚动加载更多不报加载失败；不出现一直加载中或全部无结果"},{"parent":"26774c1e-b293-4dc0-bc13-260780d664dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e7c715b1-7e24-4379-aef1-a9a4bf67455d","title":"备注：#70 #261 #56"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"26774c1e-b293-4dc0-bc13-260780d664dc","title":"🔴【P0】类型筛选无结果或滚动加载失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a1f6ca37-4a3a-4e74-9619-ef69f4e0ab83","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"79f694db-89fc-454b-a8ad-17a908e189f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cd0e2594-a299-4784-a3c1-16631d3fda30","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bf124bc7-fd0b-49a9-93be-7ed38111409f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ac85998d-1902-4a80-9fa0-c23899a799dd","title":"前置：引用面板已打开"},{"parent":"bf124bc7-fd0b-49a9-93be-7ed38111409f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c3b265d7-275d-4662-9937-8a3d262db95a","title":"操作：同时勾选多个文件类型"},{"parent":"bf124bc7-fd0b-49a9-93be-7ed38111409f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e49308b8-e692-4a71-a743-ababf4f0d7d0","title":"预期：结果为所选类型的并集，数量与实际一致，取消勾选后结果同步更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bf124bc7-fd0b-49a9-93be-7ed38111409f","title":"🟡【P2】同时选择多个类型筛选"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cd0e2594-a299-4784-a3c1-16631d3fda30","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"79f694db-89fc-454b-a8ad-17a908e189f7","title":"类型筛选"},{"parent":"81e7db44-d1c6-4a04-a149-c60952bd3d6d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e79795de-d463-468d-890b-1dffc79878bc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e9af8add-ab2d-416d-8145-cc3ee707aea1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e49f32ed-022a-4efb-8052-1c68430fc074","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a564e055-caa8-4751-bd71-3b4e4eaf095c","title":"前置：前置：成员 A 与成员 B 均使用过 Codex 与 Claude Code；