ent":"08375336-ae29-409e-8bbb-9cafcfe07162","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5bd827a-bf0f-491e-8ea5-c685729b106c","title":"备注：#304"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"08375336-ae29-409e-8bbb-9cafcfe07162","title":"🔴【P0】@ 面板常驻顶层遮挡其他应用"},{"parent":"4dbf08c5-f20d-447c-878f-a73571a14a57","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3fa23138-1477-46f1-a4f4-49e7e32470f5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"33da4999-d9cb-495d-ab97-9de872d0a9ed","title":"前置：前置：@ 面板已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板顶部 Tab 栏"},{"parent":"3fa23138-1477-46f1-a4f4-49e7e32470f5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"217a46c0-5707-45cb-89a7-e9b6060d3f4c","title":"操作：查看第一个 Tab 文案，并将窗口缩窄到出现翻页箭头"},{"parent":"3fa23138-1477-46f1-a4f4-49e7e32470f5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9d6b4880-4abb-474a-b3fd-15c014381d1a","title":"预期：第一个 Tab 文案显示为 Members；窄屏下翻页箭头与 Tab 文字垂直居中对齐不偏移；点击箭头可正常翻页"},{"parent":"3fa23138-1477-46f1-a4f4-49e7e32470f5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bd146d59-0106-44b2-837c-22f8bdff7ce6","title":"备注：#240"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3fa23138-1477-46f1-a4f4-49e7e32470f5","title":"🔴【P0】Tab 文案与窄屏翻页箭头"},{"parent":"4dbf08c5-f20d-447c-878f-a73571a14a57","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"90be2675-1f82-4c97-bfd2-fec75711a215","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"124ee2bb-390b-4fd6-b5b9-4f6c9e8620f8","title":"前置：前置：会话输入框可用；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"90be2675-1f82-4c97-bfd2-fec75711a215","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2c0b18ff-b762-4156-8ef4-2030688143ae","title":"操作：输入 @ 唤起面板后再输入一个空格"},{"parent":"90be2675-1f82-4c97-bfd2-fec75711a215","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c2a27d77-6341-4ade-871f-a3162e2a8620","title":"预期：输入空格后面板按空格作为普通字符处理或自动关闭并保留已输入文本；不提示无法搜索工作区文件；继续输入关键词仍能正常搜索"},{"parent":"90be2675-1f82-4c97-bfd2-fec75711a215","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0c8b0f1e-0a1a-4568-a4e4-d237b937047d","title":"备注：#61"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"90be2675-1f82-4c97-bfd2-fec75711a215","title":"🔴【P0】输入 @ 后再输空格提示无法搜索"},{"parent":"4dbf08c5-f20d-447c-878f-a73571a14a57","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c3fb1b6b-142d-42a7-8034-d688c4e81043","callout":