97dbc7cd-a4a5-49a0-8eb1-2c84508b0c4e","title":"操作：选中第一条或最后一条，继续按 ↑ 或 ↓ 行为符合设计"},{"parent":"b517bb02-772b-4546-8c41-c6806a414ed4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e97fa068-96c0-4e8c-b38a-4e18e231f1af","title":"预期：循环切换，不异常"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b517bb02-772b-4546-8c41-c6806a414ed4","title":"🟡【P2】列表边界切换"},{"parent":"677f8f3f-d5d1-435b-8eb2-b194cfd8cd96","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"99af6257-6a80-4637-9e6c-cd0ea5f34766","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c6380fe1-5079-45f2-a0ac-6b1231a1998a","title":"操作：同一消息中引用文件、会话和 Issue"},{"parent":"99af6257-6a80-4637-9e6c-cd0ea5f34766","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"12df57d8-fbf3-4e51-9a99-c6e8e3660149","title":"预期：引用顺序和类型清晰，各自独立；发送后 AI 可处理多个引用Agent 能按产品优先级读取"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"99af6257-6a80-4637-9e6c-cd0ea5f34766","title":"🟡【P2】多个引用混合"},{"parent":"677f8f3f-d5d1-435b-8eb2-b194cfd8cd96","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ebc7508d-6514-4ff2-9886-95dec5c73a1c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"315c494d-07d9-4d11-b86d-4236efb9c3a0","title":"操作：引用超长文件名或 Issue 标题"},{"parent":"ebc7508d-6514-4ff2-9886-95dec5c73a1c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"28d64bc9-e583-421f-acbf-8efec46c90c6","title":"预期：标签合理截断，完整名称可查看"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ebc7508d-6514-4ff2-9886-95dec5c73a1c","title":"🟡【P2】长引用标签"},{"parent":"677f8f3f-d5d1-435b-8eb2-b194cfd8cd96","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0b12d01d-074f-4d25-873b-63a698fdf9e6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e779cd3a-1df8-48f1-830a-5c782b936153","title":"操作：存在超长名称，打开面板"},{"parent":"0b12d01d-074f-4d25-873b-63a698fdf9e6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"384e8b2b-fcd3-4eca-95be-24764ffce10b","title":"预期：文本不溢出布局，按设计截断或换行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0b12d01d-074f-4d25-873b-63a698fdf9e6","title":"🟡【P2】长标题展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"677f8f3f-d5d1-435b-8eb2-b194cfd8cd96","title":"边界场景（4）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5701d169-c2c6-45e5-b475-0f3380048dfa","title":"@ 面板唤起与 Tab 切换"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f2258013-9021-4072-8ecb-764dd7c0a361","title":"4.2 @ 面板基础交互"},{"parent":"c4ef9eaa-cda4-4bc6-ac33-0871edb469d9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f4d875c7-5afb-4ea1-8bb2-b173b5815d3e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7e6cbc9c-0059-49ae-a653-996604acb456","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f95c490a-b955-4fbd-9a36-be994025050a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e283f641-e259-44ff-820a-0d6d0f8fc8e0","title":"前置：前置：房间内存在超过 30 条会话，且有正在运行的会话与刚删除的会话；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板会话 Tab"},{"parent":"f95c490a-b955-4fbd-9a36-be994025050a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a8d873e8-68e5-43f5-aca8-07500eb2dcac","title":"操作：查看列表内容、排序与状态，新建一条会话后再次查看"},{"parent":"f95c490a-b955-4fbd-9a36-be994025050a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"94d464fa-0880-47fd-ade7-3ced474f3061","title":"预期：列表展示最近 30 条会话并按时间倒序；正在运行的会话及时出现且状态显示为运行中；已完成与已删除的会话状态及时更新；条目显示会话标题而非会话 id；首次新建会话后即出现在面板中"},{"parent":"f95c490a-b955-4fbd-9a36-be994025050a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bfa3834d-e505-413f-b637-cef930574f50","title":"备注：#330 #437 #438 #300"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f95c490a-b955-4fbd-9a36-be994025050a","title":"🔴【P0】会话列表条数、排序与实时性"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3fde3848-d141-4af9-9bc8-19a75eb53423","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"55abc738-ebb1-4786-b20c-72f6842d04ca","title":"操作：输入 @ 查看会话列表"},{"parent":"3fde3848-d141-4af9-9bc8-19a75eb53423","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3b9928b0-5332-48e0-9c24-9fc789a43da9","title":"预期：运行中的会话展示“运行中”状态，执行完成的会话展示“已完成”状态，失败的会话展示“错误”状态，样式和颜色显示正确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3fde3848-d141-4af9-9bc8-19a75eb53423","title":"🔴【P0】会话状态展示"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b05db404-6dbb-4a5e-8129-7a0f13a8c18a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cef4a3f0-74a4-44ea-b84b-c04cfc14422b","title":"操作：删除会话，查看面板"},{"parent":"b05db404-6dbb-4a5e-8129-7a0f13a8c18a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"88b6d9fc-87ae-49fc-ac3d-e6b91a0716a4","title":"预期：不显示该会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b05db404-6dbb-4a5e-8129-7a0f13a8c18a","title":"🔴【P0】会话被删除后不展示在面板上"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"db81eb3b-1df0-41e8-8bbe-ec6de622368c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aa6262ff-c18e-4498-b8cc-3c51c804561d","title":"操作：输入@，从会话列表选中一个共享Agent的会话"},{"parent":"db81eb3b-1df0-41e8-8bbe-ec6de622368c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4201e7a6-d518-4bf0-9104-9e5b82d22117","title":"预期：插入 token 成功，发送消息后agent能识别到该会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"db81eb3b-1df0-41e8-8bbe-ec6de622368c","title":"🔴【P0】引用共享Agent的会话"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c38dafe4-e3b5-425b-bb9c-277a8c93ad6f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"87aab604-20f5-467e-bb9f-f2a66c429316","title":"操作：输入@，从会话列表选中一个失败的会话"},{"parent":"c38dafe4-e3b5-425b-bb9c-277a8c93ad6f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6913369a-f552-476a-b33a-03e405ffd751","title":"预期：插入 token 成功，发送消息后agent能识别到该会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c38dafe4-e3b5-425b-bb9c-277a8c93ad6f","title":"🔴【P0】引用失败的会话"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"942eabd1-b319-48bc-bab0-6a8ab1d40c5d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a48bcada-8f51-4afc-b47b-31ba523fc16c","title":"操作：输入@，从会话列表选中一个已完成的会话"},{"parent":"942eabd1-b319-48bc-bab0-6a8ab1d40c5d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3693b3f-ac8b-4ae7-a26d-68a68b810cc4","title":"预期：插入 token 成功，发送消息后agent能识别到该会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"942eabd1-b319-48bc-bab0-6a8ab1d40c5d","title":"🔴【P0】引用已完成的会话"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"12136b11-e23f-40a8-bacc-dd7a01560c9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2a27bb45-a4a3-48e5-b40d-62d47e552f57","title":"操作：房间内已有成员的agent发起过会话，从列表选择该会话"},{"parent":"12136b11-e23f-40a8-bacc-dd7a01560c9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b222c283-a2ac-4e5c-890a-7f826b72e37e","title":"预期：插入 token 成功，发送消息后agent能识别到该会话内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"12136b11-e23f-40a8-bacc-dd7a01560c9b","title":"🔴【P0】引用成员的 AI 会话（@peer）"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7222f3bf-4b18-4151-85d2-1b421fb45153","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8dc71bcb-94dc-4c2c-9b54-51242dc1310c","title":"操作：输入@，从会话列表选中一个执行中的会话"},{"parent":"7222f3bf-4b18-4151-85d2-1b421fb45153","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"452f6e07-bb4d-444c-adc8-8990fca4495b","title":"预期：插入 token 成功，发送消息后agent只能识别到该会话已完成的部分，不会进行多余操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7222f3bf-4b18-4151-85d2-1b421fb45153","title":"🔴【P0】引用正在执行中的会话"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f9e5ceaa-2f8c-4c0e-bef6-d04711981977","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cebcbf3a-c651-42d5-906e-51d0ee4fb00e","title":"操作：输入\"@agent:\"，从列表选择会话"},{"parent":"f9e5ceaa-2f8c-4c0e-bef6-d04711981977","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a2b7ab29-ca55-46ef-aa3f-3eedca80e796","title":"预期：插入 token 成功，发送消息后agent能识别到该会话内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f9e5ceaa-2f8c-4c0e-bef6-d04711981977","title":"🔴【P0】引用自己的另一个 AI 会话"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bcbcc787-1328-4b86-8961-eff732f47e84","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"68c823a3-b269-4487-828c-84fcabc40bb0","title":"操作：输入 @ 查看成员的会话"},{"parent":"bcbcc787-1328-4b86-8961-eff732f47e84","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2a0264ad-02ce-47aa-8db1-8c26f2ad99a0","title":"预期：运行中的会话展示“执行中”状态，执行完成的会话展示“空闲”状态，样式正确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bcbcc787-1328-4b86-8961-eff732f47e84","title":"🔴【P0】成员会话状态展示"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e1742bc9-b948-4912-b506-0306b547f2e6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2b78bdaf-1349-4dd2-8b9f-0f7a73375a2c","title":"前置：前置：多名成员发起过会话；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板会话 Tab"},{"parent":"e1742bc9-b948-4912-b506-0306b547f2e6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f68074df-8683-441d-83a6-fd484279b4ea","title":"操作：查看分组方式与条目信息"},{"parent":"e1742bc9-b948-4912-b506-0306b547f2e6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a099d260-c3d1-4a90-8a91-9d600973deb3","title":"预期：会话按发起人分组，悬浮可显示成员全称；发起人与 Agent 名称不重复展示；群聊会话不出现在会话列表中"},{"parent":"e1742bc9-b948-4912-b506-0306b547f2e6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"06e52070-c844-44a7-86b5-987bf1022766","title":"备注：#331 #325 #345 #344"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e1742bc9-b948-4912-b506-0306b547f2e6","title":"🔴【P0】按发起人分组与去重展示"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"248462a6-90ff-4253-adc4-0951e1bec15e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ac698bcf-6d70-493b-94c5-fef30678c996","title":"操作：存在中文标题，输入中文关键词"},{"parent":"248462a6-90ff-4253-adc4-0951e1bec15e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ccd85f9e-91dd-4757-b231-437841101a4a","title":"预期：正确匹配中文内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"248462a6-90ff-4253-adc4-0951e1bec15e","title":"🔴【P0】搜索中文关键词"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"162dc1ec-c06b-42eb-b239-77e734d7e932","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9461eb9a-b4d5-4bfb-96ec-9b72ed74a17c","title":"操作：输入\"@ + 会话部分关键词\""},{"parent":"162dc1ec-c06b-42eb-b239-77e734d7e932","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"525ed6ee-f56a-4c49-8084-8535c3947dd0","title":"预期：实时过滤匹配会话，搜索会话的标题/内容/项目名？；无结果时显示\"暂无会话\"；按方向键可选中；回车确认插入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"162dc1ec-c06b-42eb-b239-77e734d7e932","title":"🔴【P0】搜索会话"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f7d2734a-1d8e-4d17-bb44-dde4e8702f64","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d6012adc-9f2d-4304-b26d-3795dd7bd75c","title":"操作：存在英文结果，输入大小写不同的关键词"},{"parent":"f7d2734a-1d8e-4d17-bb44-dde4e8702f64","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8660cb49-e01e-4ef2-80aa-9f26996b6dfe","title":"预期：能匹配对应结果，除非产品明确区分大小写"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f7d2734a-1d8e-4d17-bb44-dde4e8702f64","title":"🔴【P0】搜索大小写兼容"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f38b0c5d-c200-4ebd-90e6-2bed85dcf369","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a577d2d1-50ad-4242-b12c-268373c7bb0c","title":"操作：输入@，点击\"会话\"，点击全部来源，筛选成员"},{"parent":"f38b0c5d-c200-4ebd-90e6-2bed85dcf369","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6fdefde5-68a4-41b4-8435-c71477949607","title":"预期：默认筛选全部成员的会话，筛选能过滤匹配出对应成员的会话，包括成员自己发起的和成员借用他人Agent发起的会话；无结果时显示\"暂无会话\"；按方向键可选中；回车确认插入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f38b0c5d-c200-4ebd-90e6-2bed85dcf369","title":"🔴【P0】筛选成员"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0c543185-785c-4858-b8e3-f68203b56611","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"49cbe9f9-5a6e-4cfb-8fb9-65f32a4d2d3d","title":"操作：输入@，点击\"会话\"，点击全部来源，筛选成员和智能体"},{"parent":"0c543185-785c-4858-b8e3-f68203b56611","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"07821f7f-ac33-4ed5-b338-29d256f6813d","title":"预期：筛选能过滤匹配出对应成员和智能体的会话；无结果时显示\"暂无会话\"；按方向键可选中；回车确认插入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0c543185-785c-4858-b8e3-f68203b56611","title":"🔴【P0】筛选成员和智能体"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f52e001d-6aa2-4f51-8295-2411ae7b6006","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5e3e7e8f-f629-4c35-b39f-72eadbb5a1c1","title":"操作：输入@，点击\"会话\"，点击全部来源，筛选智能体"},{"parent":"f52e001d-6aa2-4f51-8295-2411ae7b6006","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4bda0159-d0bd-446a-89bf-6549601c8820","title":"预期：默认筛选全部智能体的会话，筛选能过滤匹配出对应智能体的会话，包括自己发起的和成员发起的会话；无结果时显示\"暂无会话\"；按方向键可选中；回车确认插入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f52e001d-6aa2-4f51-8295-2411ae7b6006","title":"🔴【P0】筛选智能体"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"21028a2f-00b3-4c1a-854d-8eeb61bcaa09","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ca9d9547-c811-4cb7-9148-12d35a38da08","title":"操作：输入@，从会话列表选中会话，在输入框悬浮会话"},{"parent":"21028a2f-00b3-4c1a-854d-8eeb61bcaa09","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"40a8e45d-3fa9-4104-8097-5685ff0fef7c","title":"预期：会显示会话的全部标题"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"21028a2f-00b3-4c1a-854d-8eeb61bcaa09","title":"🔴【P0】选择会话，在输入框悬浮标题过长的会话"},{"parent":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8692c3ac-c487-493a-aecf-31ac56cf0c5c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3b8c9fcb-e9b0-48c3-8001-e6ebc693cfdc","title":"操作：面板已展示，点击\"会话\""},{"parent":"8692c3ac-c487-493a-aecf-31ac56cf0c5c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bcd83a7a-3a31-4425-8b11-a4286f08782e","title":"预期：“会话”分类高亮，显示所有agent和共享agent会话，根据用户分组（格式： Agent图标+Agent所属用户头像+Agent名称+最新prompt），默认显示10条记录（按照会话创建时间倒序显示），可点击“展开更多10条\"，最多显示30条记录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8692c3ac-c487-493a-aecf-31ac56cf0c5c","title":"🔴【P0】鼠标点击会话分类"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c59b9f2b-bd2d-4a2c-a9b1-dc13d070ada0","title":"正常场景（19）"},{"parent":"7e6cbc9c-0059-49ae-a653-996604acb456","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a32d3fd3-16d8-4521-8026-84375b35f6cd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2e6bff2e-f43e-4760-a6c4-49e26169498a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7925c3e8-4c7b-41aa-a339-443a4019f0cc","title":"前置：前置：房间内多名成员使用多个 Agent 产生过会话；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板会话 Tab 筛选"},{"parent":"2e6bff2e-f43e-4760-a6c4-49e26169498a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"71773854-67c2-48c9-9934-f61e73dbb1eb","title":"操作：先筛选人类成员再叠加筛选该成员的 Agent，并在成员与 Agent 数量较多时查看列表完整性"},{"parent":"2e6bff2e-f43e-4760-a6c4-49e26169498a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"16c54ad9-39f2-4356-9d68-6717c3387dd4","title":"预期：组合筛选返回该成员使用该 Agent 的会话，结果非空且正确；筛选后不再展示其他成员的会话；成员与 Agent 较多时筛选列表可滚动查看全部选项"},{"parent":"2e6bff2e-f43e-4760-a6c4-49e26169498a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"80f12327-a050-4781-a113-740a7dca390e","title":"备注：#71 #279 #294 #331"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2e6bff2e-f43e-4760-a6c4-49e26169498a","title":"🔴【P0】按成员与智能体组合筛选无结果"},{"parent":"a32d3fd3-16d8-4521-8026-84375b35f6cd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"36d0b893-8a19-49e4-b683-fe1fe03fd050","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d6037aac-2686-4ec2-b487-d8fa47947904","title":"前置：前置：会话详情中存在 @ 自己与 @ 他人的会话引用；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情中的引用条目"},{"parent":"36d0b893-8a19-49e4-b683-fe1fe03fd050","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"89de286d-8406-4e19-b5f7-3ba608fbc90f","title":"操作：分别点击自己的会话与他人的会话"},{"parent":"36d0b893-8a19-49e4-b683-fe1fe03fd050","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e4a4f6c1-62b0-4324-98d6-0e2fbc16c25a","title":"预期：点击自己的会话打开 Agent GUI 对应会话；点击他人的会话打开活动中心并展示该会话；不提示该会话已不可用或无权访问"},{"parent":"36d0b893-8a19-49e4-b683-fe1fe03fd050","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"22c23703-67bc-4b1b-aa67-f16fdf17a5e2","title":"备注：#33"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"36d0b893-8a19-49e4-b683-fe1fe03fd050","title":"🔴【P0】点击 @ 的会话跳转错误"},{"parent":"a32d3fd3-16d8-4521-8026-84375b35f6cd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9f381173-c6bd-42f3-9423-26ce34c9a99d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"efa0e963-7952-4ec8-9a0f-548cbf4d31af","title":"前置：前置：@ 面板会话 Tab 已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：来源筛选中的全部来源"},{"parent":"9f381173-c6bd-42f3-9423-26ce34c9a99d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df983347-d9b9-4cd0-92f9-f5d7aed74680","title":"操作：点击全部来源选项"},{"parent":"9f381173-c6bd-42f3-9423-26ce34c9a99d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ccc6dbe4-a33f-4ce2-b8fb-8a76a7003d3d","title":"预期：筛选面板保持展开并应用该筛选；不出现点击后面板自动收起；可继续选择其他筛选条件"},{"parent":"9f381173-c6bd-42f3-9423-26ce34c9a99d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c9730842-6c13-4bad-a013-91dbc69adea3","title":"备注：#60"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9f381173-c6bd-42f3-9423-26ce34c9a99d","title":"🔴【P0】点击来源筛选面板自动收起"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a32d3fd3-16d8-4521-8026-84375b35f6cd","title":"异常场景（3）"},{"parent":"7e6cbc9c-0059-49ae-a653-996604acb456","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8a3d5d9c-c2b3-44ab-a001-ae11490d9fb1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8b000672-3918-4086-bbc3-e491e8df2357","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fbcc016e-a290-49c6-820c-94adc6ce6354","title":"前置：账号下存在数百个历史会话"},{"parent":"8b000672-3918-4086-bbc3-e491e8df2357","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"634bf0eb-542d-4087-a522-4c7c22ba15ed","title":"操作：在 @ 会话面板中滚动并搜索定位某个会话"},{"parent":"8b000672-3918-4086-bbc3-e491e8df2357","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"24f3e593-e2fe-4b04-b35e-fcd9bc820b44","title":"预期：列表分页加载流畅，搜索结果准确，排序规则稳定不跳变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8b000672-3918-4086-bbc3-e491e8df2357","title":"🟡【P2】会话数量极多时的列表与搜索"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8a3d5d9c-c2b3-44ab-a001-ae11490d9fb1","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7e6cbc9c-0059-49ae-a653-996604acb456","title":"会话引用与筛选"},{"parent":"f4d875c7-5afb-4ea1-8bb2-b173b5815d3e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aa075ca7-3ea6-4596-9a78-5319d7e4bdd9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"91ec7440-bc72-458d-aaac-394b6cd3f21d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"09e745bc-1f84-4331-8eb0-9310b8729d7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13c9f1f5-ac02-497f-8773-019f106771db","title":"操作：Agent 生成文件后，指令「引用刚才创建的文件」"},{"parent":"09e745bc-1f84-4331-8eb0-9310b8729d7e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"38d368c7-5096-4f26-876e-90ad038ab8a7","title":"预期：会话内引用文件可点击，跳转至文件预览 / 编辑器页面"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"09e745bc-1f84-4331-8eb0-9310b8729d7e","title":"🔴【P0】会话引用生成文件"},{"parent":"91ec7440-bc72-458d-aaac-394b6cd3f21d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"748e7e53-6470-4b92-9e13-2c4d16b84de1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"99ce1957-5885-45dd-b1d0-bd1d41a636eb","title":"操作：先让 Agent 生成一个 个人主页网站，再艾特会话总结，输出链接"},{"parent":"748e7e53-6470-4b92-9e13-2c4d16b84de1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e3459e90-5018-4aea-83d4-c309d2856e01","title":"预期：引用后的链接仍为可点击状态，跳转逻辑正常"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"748e7e53-6470-4b92-9e13-2c4d16b84de1","title":"🔴【P0】会话引用生成网站"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"91ec7440-bc72-458d-aaac-394b6cd3f21d","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"aa075ca7-3ea6-4596-9a78-5319d7e4bdd9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9d4a16dd-9b5f-465a-8711-cd0c22d01245","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2d46560a-d391-4f5f-be5e-7fdf56bdebcd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9592dc13-d3fa-4c7a-bfaf-1450fb8d8226","title":"前置：已引用某个会话的产物"},{"parent":"2d46560a-d391-4f5f-be5e-7fdf56bdebcd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1b20c3b5-c1e5-4f1c-9edc-89a64dbb386f","title":"操作：删除该会话后点击引用链接"},{"parent":"2d46560a-d391-4f5f-be5e-7fdf56bdebcd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0a34eca8-30fb-4fa3-9788-97cc9045d63a","title":"预期：提示来源会话已不存在，不跳转到空白页面"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2d46560a-d391-4f5f-be5e-7fdf56bdebcd","title":"🟠【P1】被引用会话已删除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9d4a16dd-9b5f-465a-8711-cd0c22d01245","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"aa075ca7-3ea6-4596-9a78-5319d7e4bdd9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"76273c6b-dbd4-40b4-9250-2a8ea5d1e329","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1d3c4a67-437e-4717-90f2-8b797864aa27","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fe4ffa73-7066-476f-9100-031939029446","title":"前置：被引用会话产出了大量文件与链接"},{"parent":"1d3c4a67-437e-4717-90f2-8b797864aa27","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d49155c5-7621-411b-85f2-1f286b688112","title":"操作：引用该会话并查看产物列表"},{"parent":"1d3c4a67-437e-4717-90f2-8b797864aa27","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7f1cfe79-5631-4d07-8915-60a8e63ac79d","title":"预期：产物折叠展示可展开查看全部，逐项可点击跳转不丢失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1d3c4a67-437e-4717-90f2-8b797864aa27","title":"🟡【P2】引用产物数量很多的会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"76273c6b-dbd4-40b4-9250-2a8ea5d1e329","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aa075ca7-3ea6-4596-9a78-5319d7e4bdd9","title":"引用会话产物"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f4d875c7-5afb-4ea1-8bb2-b173b5815d3e","title":"4.3 @ 会话"},{"parent":"c4ef9eaa-cda4-4bc6-ac33-0871edb469d9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4e463b2b-c21b-4f24-81f1-b67420742ff7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e42a7f26-aa6e-4369-8da3-7795fd6b8b08","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e51c8107-9e9f-4110-8ab0-cf97d386dfe7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"793f523a-bec5-44b2-86de-833ea6ef3948","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3c3e179-f8e9-4313-995a-f8251a5b4238","title":"操作：从补全列表选中Agent创建的一个文件"},{"parent":"793f523a-bec5-44b2-86de-833ea6ef3948","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2405cf32-d9c0-4b74-a793-47008d0cd06e","title":"预期：插入 token 成功，发送消息后agent能识别到该文件内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"793f523a-bec5-44b2-86de-833ea6ef3948","title":"🔴【P0】引用Agent创建的文件"},{"parent":"e51c8107-9e9f-4110-8ab0-cf97d386dfe7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a107970d-aa93-4065-a721-9c2ba1a94cee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"449757e9-e013-4c7c-92e8-518b5526d2ba","title":"操作：从补全列表选中文件/文件夹"},{"parent":"a107970d-aa93-4065-a721-9c2ba1a94cee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"61016f4c-1d3d-4e33-be40-626ddb7e071d","title":"预期：插入 token 成功，发送消息后agent能识别到该文件内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a107970d-aa93-4065-a721-9c2ba1a94cee","title":"🔴【P0】引用文件/文件夹"},{"parent":"e51c8107-9e9f-4110-8ab0-cf97d386dfe7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c0ba731a-207f-4df2-8338-0bbcf2715d23","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"270edffc-6641-4749-86e3-8b85e8540839","title":"操作：输入\"@ + 文件名部分关键词\""},{"parent":"c0ba731a-207f-4df2-8338-0bbcf2715d23","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b1d1bfa5-1bd3-44a4-a78b-9c8405413f20","title":"预期：实时过滤匹配文件；无结果时显示\"无匹配文件\"；按方向键可选中；回车确认插入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c0ba731a-207f-4df2-8338-0bbcf2715d23","title":"🔴【P0】搜索我的Agent生成的文件"},{"parent":"e51c8107-9e9f-4110-8ab0-cf97d386dfe7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"deb91fab-503d-42da-bf37-1bee7434156e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2eae0bed-79e9-4bf2-aa12-ddaffbb64c03","title":"操作：输入\"@ + 文件名部分关键词\""},{"parent":"deb91fab-503d-42da-bf37-1bee7434156e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd119800-572a-43e1-a756-478f928b3864","title":"预期：实时过滤匹配文件（规则：文件夹下的各种文件和命中单个或多个字符的文件，含关键字的文件优先展示，命中多个单字符的后展示，根据命中字符数量排序，多的优先展示）；无结果时显示\"无匹配文件\"；按方向键可选中；回车确认插入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"deb91fab-503d-42da-bf37-1bee7434156e","title":"🔴【P0】搜索文件"},{"parent":"e51c8107-9e9f-4110-8ab0-cf97d386dfe7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aa43e8ec-6218-467f-8a0e-04d250edaf52","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6539433a-c6e5-4b1c-8b39-cdaf35487ff0","title":"操作：输入@，点击\"文件\"，筛选成员"},{"parent":"aa43e8ec-6218-467f-8a0e-04d250edaf52","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4b5c0696-159b-485a-be10-9053884715d0","title":"预期：默认筛选全部成员的文件，筛选能过滤匹配出对应成员的文件，包括成员自己发起的和成员借用他人Agent发起的会话创建的文件；无结果时显示\"暂无文件\"；按方向键可选中；回车确认插入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aa43e8ec-6218-467f-8a0e-04d250edaf52","title":"🔴【P0】筛选成员"},{"parent":"e51c8107-9e9f-4110-8ab0-cf97d386dfe7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2b5983f6-fe38-41b8-8c75-73c765dc0935","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b79fccee-c753-4805-b98a-16f28d31474a","title":"操作：输入@，点击\"文件\"，点击全部来源，筛选智能体"},{"parent":"2b5983f6-fe38-41b8-8c75-73c765dc0935","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bc455a13-c482-4ec4-8cc8-297aea538588","title":"预期：默认筛选全部智能体的文件，筛选能过滤匹配出对应智能体生成的文件，包括自己发起的和成员发起的会话产生的文件；无结果时显示\"暂无文件\"；按方向键可选中；回车确认插入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2b5983f6-fe38-41b8-8c75-73c765dc0935","title":"🔴【P0】筛选智能体"},{"parent":"e51c8107-9e9f-4110-8ab0-cf97d386dfe7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"34f6c3c1-fe0e-45eb-9ea9-e8372dca4963","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d71122b8-5ecb-4787-a01f-6869cc8bcc00","title":"操作：面板已展示，点击“文件\""},{"parent":"34f6c3c1-fe0e-45eb-9ea9-e8372dca4963","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dedb078b-13ab-4fbe-b2fe-88c48be17d2e","title":"预期：“文件”分类高亮，显示房间内文件中心的文件 和 近期Agent生成的文件，不展示点文件/点目录和macOS元数据"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"34f6c3c1-fe0e-45eb-9ea9-e8372dca4963","title":"🔴【P0】鼠标点击文件分类"},{"parent":"e51c8107-9e9f-4110-8ab0-cf97d386dfe7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"77a23345-85cc-4508-bd03-f9d2902260ad","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bc9e5ed1-dfd3-45c1-a504-f27da84982e1","title":"前置：前置：房间内存在已打开文件与当前目录文件；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框输入 @ 打开面板并切换到文件 Tab"},{"parent":"77a23345-85cc-4508-bd03-f9d2902260ad","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f6dbeefd-5abf-4b6c-996d-340e0fc7b891","title":"操作：查看文件分类列表并多次点击展开"},{"parent":"77a23345-85cc-4508-bd03-f9d2902260ad","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4261e96-99b4-40cf-aa69-5dec8e8f9628","title":"预期：已打开文件排在最前，其后为当前目录内容并按名称升序排列；相同路径只出现一次；首次显示 10 条，每次展开增加 10 条，最多展示 30 条"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"77a23345-85cc-4508-bd03-f9d2902260ad","title":"🟠【P1】文件分类排序与分页展示"},{"parent":"e51c8107-9e9f-4110-8ab0-cf97d386dfe7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ed323c7b-86f4-4ec6-960c-8dfdc10f22b2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4c777da3-39b8-4636-951f-bf3c0ab9a097","title":"前置：前置：@ 面板文件 Tab 中存在文件夹；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板文件 Tab"},{"parent":"ed323c7b-86f4-4ec6-960c-8dfdc10f22b2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3bc1b87c-b9b3-4988-aac1-791fdf5a8175","title":"操作：查看文件夹条目"},{"parent":"ed323c7b-86f4-4ec6-960c-8dfdc10f22b2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b3a34f33-8a11-486d-9ec5-cfc64b4f0292","title":"预期：文件夹旁显示所在路径以及「包含 N 项」的子项数量；N 与进入该文件夹后的直属子项数量一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ed323c7b-86f4-4ec6-960c-8dfdc10f22b2","title":"🟠【P1】文件夹条目信息展示"},{"parent":"e51c8107-9e9f-4110-8ab0-cf97d386dfe7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b0aba588-bb66-46a3-ae6d-59ae22288c23","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1ad7bf5c-db1f-4f26-8629-daa692bd40cf","title":"前置：前置：@ 面板文件 Tab 中存在文件；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板文件 Tab"},{"parent":"b0aba588-bb66-46a3-ae6d-59ae22288c23","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"de0f20bf-8623-486f-8ad3-e314a268584d","title":"操作：查看文件条目"},{"parent":"b0aba588-bb66-46a3-ae6d-59ae22288c23","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"96c84d07-c2f8-43ea-9604-054f68cfa520","title":"预期：文件条目旁显示所在路径；路径与工作区文件中的实际路径一致；中文文件名完整展示且不带多余前缀字符"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b0aba588-bb66-46a3-ae6d-59ae22288c23","title":"🟠【P1】文件条目信息展示"},{"parent":"e51c8107-9e9f-4110-8ab0-cf97d386dfe7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"233400cf-251f-4edb-bb62-1f82d9d8c6d3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0db24de8-6544-4e53-b3c1-9ca475ec690e","title":"前置：前置：房间内多个 Agent 会话已产生 added 或 modified 文件；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板文件 Tab 的近期 Agent 生成文件分类"},{"parent":"233400cf-251f-4edb-bb62-1f82d9d8c6d3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"191fe37f-c0e4-47c4-871b-8bfdd10ec0d6","title":"操作：不输入搜索词直接查看列表并展开"},{"parent":"233400cf-251f-4edb-bb62-1f82d9d8c6d3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d6f1e9ee-4f09-4978-823f-d185388d95fd","title":"预期：列表包含整个房间下 Agent 新增或修改的文件；按最近完成的会话倒序汇总并按路径去重；无搜索词时按目录聚合再按文件夹与文件名称升序展示；首次 10 条、每次展开 10 条、最多 30 条，取最近 100 个会话；已删除的文件不展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"233400cf-251f-4edb-bb62-1f82d9d8c6d3","title":"🟠【P1】近期 Agent 生成文件分类"},{"parent":"e51c8107-9e9f-4110-8ab0-cf97d386dfe7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f5e67b24-35b2-4b30-a900-c23a2d2e3bc8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e8f4fec6-3366-46e0-8ecc-4296f66a30c4","title":"前置：前置：@ 面板文件 Tab 中存在多级目录；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板文件 Tab"},{"parent":"f5e67b24-35b2-4b30-a900-c23a2d2e3bc8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4d55a117-6ff2-4e7b-b872-8ca85831b419","title":"操作：点击文件夹进入二级、再进入三级目录，然后点击返回"},{"parent":"f5e67b24-35b2-4b30-a900-c23a2d2e3bc8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cd78dd36-f438-41d8-b4a8-5855462fa6f5","title":"预期：每次点击进入下一级并展示该级直属子项；点击返回回到上一级目录且列表内容正确；返回到顶层后不再显示返回入口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f5e67b24-35b2-4b30-a900-c23a2d2e3bc8","title":"🟠【P1】进入多级目录与返回"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e51c8107-9e9f-4110-8ab0-cf97d386dfe7","title":"正常场景（12）"},{"parent":"e42a7f26-aa6e-4369-8da3-7795fd6b8b08","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f97350a2-4229-443f-ac62-069ebfd136a9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8ed6dbfc-a167-4a4c-ad9b-ec86bb0be60a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b3990c90-8763-4dda-92c6-152db69e467d","title":"前置：前置：Agent 已生成文件且工作区存在多级目录；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板文件 Tab"},{"parent":"8ed6dbfc-a167-4a4c-ad9b-ec86bb0be60a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f2d6ccd1-5c2e-4d5f-b152-12c68cde0b86","title":"操作：查看 Agent 生成的文件分类，并点击文件夹进入下一级"},{"parent":"8ed6dbfc-a167-4a4c-ad9b-ec86bb0be60a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"30d0ec0e-1795-419c-ba2e-99b78af8225f","title":"预期：Agent 生成的文件分类展示实际产出文件而非为空；点击文件夹能稳定展示其中文件；@ 面板会话与文件列表均能正常加载"},{"parent":"8ed6dbfc-a167-4a4c-ad9b-ec86bb0be60a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6b7733b0-35b7-4ab3-8325-1e7337534563","title":"备注：#407 #332 #406"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8ed6dbfc-a167-4a4c-ad9b-ec86bb0be60a","title":"🔴【P0】Agent 生成文件分类为空或无法展开"},{"parent":"f97350a2-4229-443f-ac62-069ebfd136a9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5c954c72-668a-4478-93bb-1c1f51d242be","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ed221253-08e6-41d2-9f80-ef688bfad5de","title":"前置：前置：工作区中存在中文名称的文件；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板文件 Tab"},{"parent":"5c954c72-668a-4478-93bb-1c1f51d242be","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e54bf7bc-01b6-4420-86cf-c17156a6c145","title":"操作：查看文件条目名称与图标"},{"parent":"5c954c72-668a-4478-93bb-1c1f51d242be","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"320ed406-b8b1-41eb-a8fe-a848c5eace19","title":"预期：中文文件名完整展示且前面不出现 ._ 等多余字符；文件图标按类型显示且带有正确配色"},{"parent":"5c954c72-668a-4478-93bb-1c1f51d242be","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"adb62106-2eab-4b41-8ba2-7041952e428b","title":"备注：#415 #249"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5c954c72-668a-4478-93bb-1c1f51d242be","title":"🔴【P0】中文文件名前显示多余字符"},{"parent":"f97350a2-4229-443f-ac62-069ebfd136a9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5c2e67a8-57f3-49c5-b2e2-5e524520fa9a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e597cbc0-7568-44b3-bc5f-61587d9d82c9","title":"前置：前置：多名成员的多个 Agent 产生过文件；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板文件 Tab 筛选"},{"parent":"5c2e67a8-57f3-49c5-b2e2-5e524520fa9a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2750df97-dac5-4444-8dfe-97cf0cf6e9d0","title":"操作：分别按成员、按智能体、按两者组合筛选"},{"parent":"5c2e67a8-57f3-49c5-b2e2-5e524520fa9a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2f2991f0-e1a3-4b9a-b942-596180343cbe","title":"预期：三种筛选均能返回对应文件；结果非空且与实际产出一致；清除筛选后恢复完整列表"},{"parent":"5c2e67a8-57f3-49c5-b2e2-5e524520fa9a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"63532eef-7d7a-412c-977d-e2c917c8b58f","title":"备注：#283"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5c2e67a8-57f3-49c5-b2e2-5e524520fa9a","title":"🔴【P0】按成员与智能体筛选文件无数据"},{"parent":"f97350a2-4229-443f-ac62-069ebfd136a9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"14661e17-da7b-456f-b5db-1c445b0b38ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8beeb0b3-b5ec-4229-b630-7a2542f4a19c","title":"操作：选择候选后文件被删除，再发送消息"},{"parent":"14661e17-da7b-456f-b5db-1c445b0b38ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f289186e-ea55-4fd9-9cd1-e27c1cda7fcf","title":"预期：可以正常发送，agent会显示找不到该文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"14661e17-da7b-456f-b5db-1c445b0b38ce","title":"🟠【P1】引用失效文件"},{"parent":"f97350a2-4229-443f-ac62-069ebfd136a9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a42fbb4b-1be4-4ed2-82d5-62e3df2e6906","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"54d22edf-e42e-4ce4-86d0-b414cb0a1df4","title":"操作：输入 @ 后搜索不存在的文件名"},{"parent":"a42fbb4b-1be4-4ed2-82d5-62e3df2e6906","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c5103f77-af7f-4924-b9fb-06d8837db86a","title":"预期：显示无匹配结果，不清空已输入内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a42fbb4b-1be4-4ed2-82d5-62e3df2e6906","title":"🟠【P1】引用无结果"},{"parent":"f97350a2-4229-443f-ac62-069ebfd136a9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"748217fd-02bc-4228-b966-a645ba3e904e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0cdbb995-f4e7-419c-98e8-c3bc3afa5f0b","title":"操作：尝试引用无读取权限文件"},{"parent":"748217fd-02bc-4228-b966-a645ba3e904e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b69d8286-e573-42b7-b8fc-ecc426f4d56a","title":"预期：阻止选择或发送时提示无权限"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"748217fd-02bc-4228-b966-a645ba3e904e","title":"🟡【P2】引用无权限文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f97350a2-4229-443f-ac62-069ebfd136a9","title":"异常场景（6）"},{"parent":"e42a7f26-aa6e-4369-8da3-7795fd6b8b08","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"69c1bacd-eb1a-4bb4-84df-8dd5df600d73","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"005189de-db60-411a-98b3-215f4049b333","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ce3ef7ee-c11b-45f7-b212-9433df715d54","title":"操作：@ 搜索命中 500 个文件"},{"parent":"005189de-db60-411a-98b3-215f4049b333","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"36d6b759-c05c-4344-ad14-de3a08861af5","title":"预期：候选列表分页或虚拟滚动，输入不卡顿"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"005189de-db60-411a-98b3-215f4049b333","title":"🟡【P2】大量候选结果"},{"parent":"69c1bacd-eb1a-4bb4-84df-8dd5df600d73","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b2d925d1-566b-47a9-bb80-60cede2f2277","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e0f45bb-8cc2-4c89-ac6d-27ab4edddc21","title":"操作：引用含空格、中文、emoji 的文件"},{"parent":"b2d925d1-566b-47a9-bb80-60cede2f2277","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"96227bd0-13a5-422d-a9ed-cc4947c60f49","title":"预期：引用标签显示正确，发送后路径解析准确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b2d925d1-566b-47a9-bb80-60cede2f2277","title":"🟡【P2】引用名称特殊字符"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"69c1bacd-eb1a-4bb4-84df-8dd5df600d73","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e42a7f26-aa6e-4369-8da3-7795fd6b8b08","title":"文件引用与筛选"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4e463b2b-c21b-4f24-81f1-b67420742ff7","title":"4.4 @ 文件"},{"parent":"c4ef9eaa-cda4-4bc6-ac33-0871edb469d9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1e9fabff-fcae-44bd-b657-d857cc09c783","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0228acd8-535d-4b2a-bd99-15a061df50e8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f0d8f004-df29-483b-b987-afff5596ded6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"daa93be2-0cef-457d-ba51-f9ea2ccbebeb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"48231b13-0cf3-4bc7-8f2e-c5bddfb1d2fa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c56bec6c-bafd-4250-a51e-c03dd2027043","title":"前置：房间内存在多名成员且各自有 Agent；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"48231b13-0cf3-4bc7-8f2e-c5bddfb1d2fa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7aa0e37f-ff62-4b61-8799-3a9b2ea54ef2","title":"操作：在输入框输入 @ 唤起面板，点击切换到「智能体」Tab"},{"parent":"48231b13-0cf3-4bc7-8f2e-c5bddfb1d2fa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9b5ef5d3-a58c-4406-b812-bc10f1de0dac","title":"预期：面板切换到智能体 Tab 并高亮；列出房间内所有成员的 Agent；按成员分组展示，每组以成员名称为标题；每个 Agent 标识可用与不可用状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"48231b13-0cf3-4bc7-8f2e-c5bddfb1d2fa","title":"🔴【P0】输入 @ 切换到智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"daa93be2-0cef-457d-ba51-f9ea2ccbebeb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fd3584e3-2303-446f-a1e4-2aa2cfadb44b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"60899b63-ce60-42fe-9cbc-0bc5f01b39dd","title":"前置：智能体 Tab 已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：智能体列表条目"},{"parent":"fd3584e3-2303-446f-a1e4-2aa2cfadb44b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b64502be-9091-4fe6-bfa9-bba78f85dd5f","title":"操作：逐条查看列表中的 Agent 条目"},{"parent":"fd3584e3-2303-446f-a1e4-2aa2cfadb44b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"192c99a0-b8c9-43f3-ac05-b38d6dfe3559","title":"预期：每条展示 Agent 图标、Agent 名称与所属成员；自己的 Agent 归入自己的分组，他人共享的 Agent 归入对应成员分组；可用与不可用在视觉上可区分"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fd3584e3-2303-446f-a1e4-2aa2cfadb44b","title":"🔴【P0】智能体条目信息完整"},{"parent":"daa93be2-0cef-457d-ba51-f9ea2ccbebeb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c499f5b6-bca6-4e05-8114-37b7fceb5d0a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3d470530-0507-4a50-867c-05a449dadba8","title":"前置：自己已安装并登录至少一个 Agent；角色：房间成员；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"c499f5b6-bca6-4e05-8114-37b7fceb5d0a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e7898772-0bbd-4a85-ba94-465a448d0a6a","title":"操作：在列表中查找自己名下的 Agent"},{"parent":"c499f5b6-bca6-4e05-8114-37b7fceb5d0a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a6ca967e-cf52-4002-8944-ac45583d94de","title":"预期：自己的 Agent 正常出现在列表中且可被选择；不因是本人而被过滤掉；分组标题能区分出「我的」与其他成员"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c499f5b6-bca6-4e05-8114-37b7fceb5d0a","title":"🔴【P0】自己的 Agent 出现在列表中"},{"parent":"daa93be2-0cef-457d-ba51-f9ea2ccbebeb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"04037a5a-81ef-4ec8-8916-7a41da2c1451","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"96d5618b-d8cc-413c-9a42-e31870b71620","title":"前置：房间内存在头像为字母的成员与有自定义头像的成员；角色：房间成员；入口：智能体 Tab 分组标题"},{"parent":"04037a5a-81ef-4ec8-8916-7a41da2c1451","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e4a6a8c6-f415-4a19-b66b-8c3076e30a32","title":"操作：查看各成员分组标题处的头像展示"},{"parent":"04037a5a-81ef-4ec8-8916-7a41da2c1451","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd016f21-eed5-49b5-bc80-7431f9a8c440","title":"预期：两类成员的头像均正常展示，字母头像显示为默认头像或字母底图；不出现头像位置空白"},{"parent":"04037a5a-81ef-4ec8-8916-7a41da2c1451","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4abd9f17-127b-472b-913c-98d867425986","title":"备注：#95 #166 #356"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"04037a5a-81ef-4ec8-8916-7a41da2c1451","title":"🟠【P1】成员头像正常展示"},{"parent":"daa93be2-0cef-457d-ba51-f9ea2ccbebeb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"766a4e17-f41e-4018-ae89-ea0a2038d808","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"972c35ca-3e77-482a-882a-1824ae42df90","title":"前置：@ 面板已打开且智能体 Tab 中已做过筛选或搜索；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板 Tab 栏"},{"parent":"766a4e17-f41e-4018-ae89-ea0a2038d808","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"103b45bf-e798-4acd-b22d-5e68581b219b","title":"操作：在智能体 Tab 输入搜索词后切换到文件或会话 Tab，再切回智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"766a4e17-f41e-4018-ae89-ea0a2038d808","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"05dd5425-cadd-46fe-8e41-4d2da1babbc5","title":"预期：其他 Tab 保持默认全部展示，不继承智能体 Tab 的搜索词；切回智能体 Tab 时按产品定义保留或清空搜索，行为在多次切换中一致"},{"parent":"766a4e17-f41e-4018-ae89-ea0a2038d808","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"87513bac-79e2-4a69-8761-761598ce3bfb","title":"备注：#353"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"766a4e17-f41e-4018-ae89-ea0a2038d808","title":"🟠【P1】Tab 之间筛选条件相互独立"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"daa93be2-0cef-457d-ba51-f9ea2ccbebeb","title":"正常场景（5）"},{"parent":"f0d8f004-df29-483b-b987-afff5596ded6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0757f1dd-b171-42ac-928b-aa9a8a5fe3ca","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d5370039-686a-41ab-ae4e-59e884d743a7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7d1e6f57-9799-4e00-8af1-b57564fef06a","title":"前置：当前网络异常；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"d5370039-686a-41ab-ae4e-59e884d743a7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a7d3d775-8500-4441-b9ae-8ecbeb48eadc","title":"操作：在网络断开时输入 @ 并切换到智能体 Tab，恢复网络后重新唤起面板"},{"parent":"d5370039-686a-41ab-ae4e-59e884d743a7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eb026090-4913-406a-975a-26256f436e42","title":"预期：提示加载失败并保留普通文本输入能力，输入框中已有内容不丢失；提供重试或重新唤起入口；恢复网络后重新唤起可正常加载列表"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d5370039-686a-41ab-ae4e-59e884d743a7","title":"🟡【P2】智能体列表加载失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0757f1dd-b171-42ac-928b-aa9a8a5fe3ca","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"f0d8f004-df29-483b-b987-afff5596ded6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"96e13b8e-3501-4826-a5f9-77d083c283c3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"943f8554-fede-4719-9e80-73e3ca1bf588","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8242d482-2955-4031-bd60-451ec74282e6","title":"前置：新用户账号下仅有系统默认的 Tutti Agent，房间内暂无其他成员共享；角色：新用户；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"943f8554-fede-4719-9e80-73e3ca1bf588","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"82035d83-48d9-4739-bb19-1b6de1e537a1","title":"操作：打开智能体 Tab 查看列表"},{"parent":"943f8554-fede-4719-9e80-73e3ca1bf588","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"38057ad5-1c00-4918-a280-f407e67077af","title":"预期：只展示 Tutti Agent；未绑定或未安装的 Agent 不伪装为可用；列表不展示空的成员分组"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"943f8554-fede-4719-9e80-73e3ca1bf588","title":"🟡【P2】仅一个可用 Agent"},{"parent":"96e13b8e-3501-4826-a5f9-77d083c283c3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"26ccd23c-5cb8-4e0c-af1c-d1d84f9b8dde","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6321e703-6e78-48c4-9210-cd8c963ff0aa","title":"前置：房间内成员与共享 Agent 合计达到 100 个；角色：房间成员；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"26ccd23c-5cb8-4e0c-af1c-d1d84f9b8dde","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8f8c0964-843e-4c3a-9cd3-743adace9261","title":"操作：打开智能体 Tab 并从头滚动到底部，再用搜索定位其中一个"},{"parent":"26ccd23c-5cb8-4e0c-af1c-d1d84f9b8dde","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a171e34d-a4fe-458a-97ae-61e39fecee1a","title":"预期：列表支持搜索或虚拟滚动，滚动流畅无明显卡顿；分组标题在滚动中正确对应；搜索能快速定位到目标 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"26ccd23c-5cb8-4e0c-af1c-d1d84f9b8dde","title":"🟡【P2】大量 Agent 时的列表性能"},{"parent":"96e13b8e-3501-4826-a5f9-77d083c283c3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"49f8ab4b-9704-45b7-8ff9-2f44036bde3f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8a170e75-5a3d-4301-8098-2a6e27da2ebc","title":"前置：存在名称很长的成员与 Agent；角色：房间成员；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"49f8ab4b-9704-45b7-8ff9-2f44036bde3f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ad31b72f-feb1-4490-8a63-6930ee66d65b","title":"操作：查看该成员分组标题与 Agent 条目"},{"parent":"49f8ab4b-9704-45b7-8ff9-2f44036bde3f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"774478da-e04f-458c-8993-6a49e2f344bc","title":"预期：超长名称省略显示并可悬浮查看全称；不撑破面板宽度；可用状态标识仍完整可见"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"49f8ab4b-9704-45b7-8ff9-2f44036bde3f","title":"🟡【P2】成员或 Agent 名称超长"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"96e13b8e-3501-4826-a5f9-77d083c283c3","title":"边界场景（3）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f0d8f004-df29-483b-b987-afff5596ded6","title":"Tab 唤起与列表结构"},{"parent":"0228acd8-535d-4b2a-bd99-15a061df50e8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"55c0dc43-c9d4-4202-bda8-e72a1be4cb0f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"89034aed-3249-43b9-859e-9febe27c9ed9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fcfd0586-8c28-4640-84c2-cf8e3a8a40e2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"26c467c7-9a60-42b8-8aae-072885d5b57b","title":"前置：智能体 Tab 已打开且列表中有多个 Agent；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板搜索输入"},{"parent":"fcfd0586-8c28-4640-84c2-cf8e3a8a40e2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dfa9dd54-a82b-457d-9e6b-b6471ec09833","title":"操作：输入 @ 后继续输入 Agent 名称的部分字符，用方向键选中目标后回车"},{"parent":"fcfd0586-8c28-4640-84c2-cf8e3a8a40e2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"35c3bbf2-04e7-48f9-9d78-83c6b1df193f","title":"预期：列表实时过滤出匹配的智能体；方向键可在结果中移动且选中项高亮；回车确认后引用被插入到输入框"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fcfd0586-8c28-4640-84c2-cf8e3a8a40e2","title":"🔴【P0】搜索智能体并插入引用"},{"parent":"89034aed-3249-43b9-859e-9febe27c9ed9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9ff3b114-9fe3-41c9-9569-9ab27042e5cc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09693572-773e-4778-b856-42b93eac3dab","title":"前置：智能体 Tab 已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板搜索输入"},{"parent":"9ff3b114-9fe3-41c9-9569-9ab27042e5cc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7185a1f3-355b-4451-be73-8068e86113ea","title":"操作：输入某成员名称的部分字符"},{"parent":"9ff3b114-9fe3-41c9-9569-9ab27042e5cc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae23e984-0e69-4e23-8a4a-4629026a2356","title":"预期：匹配出该成员名下的全部 Agent；结果仍保留成员分组信息；其他成员的 Agent 不出现在结果中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9ff3b114-9fe3-41c9-9569-9ab27042e5cc","title":"🟠【P1】按成员名称搜索"},{"parent":"89034aed-3249-43b9-859e-9febe27c9ed9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6835b800-d2c9-4b51-a12f-b3bc0d13d669","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bae90a1d-e986-4c20-a5a9-fcde6eac2a08","title":"前置：房间内存在中文名与英文名的 Agent；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板搜索输入"},{"parent":"6835b800-d2c9-4b51-a12f-b3bc0d13d669","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"84511a51-9a19-472e-92cf-65bf51920356","title":"操作：分别输入中文关键词、英文小写与英文大写关键词"},{"parent":"6835b800-d2c9-4b51-a12f-b3bc0d13d669","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e62a7881-2d47-4e5d-ab1c-222b9eefe604","title":"预期：三种输入均能匹配到对应的 Agent；大小写不影响匹配结果；中英文混排名称可被任一部分命中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6835b800-d2c9-4b51-a12f-b3bc0d13d669","title":"🟠【P1】中英文与大小写兼容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"89034aed-3249-43b9-859e-9febe27c9ed9","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"55c0dc43-c9d4-4202-bda8-e72a1be4cb0f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9c753f07-9922-4425-b4b3-1997b8e39668","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ab49eef6-cf19-4e81-a67c-ab0ad3fb458b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3367bc79-47ab-4784-8a83-2bad6cdd0072","title":"前置：智能体 Tab 已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板搜索输入"},{"parent":"ab49eef6-cf19-4e81-a67c-ab0ad3fb458b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f8fb8205-83cd-4dd2-9903-f1764bac6e03","title":"操作：输入一段不匹配任何 Agent 或成员的关键词"},{"parent":"ab49eef6-cf19-4e81-a67c-ab0ad3fb458b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"50db5604-cab9-44cf-8b47-f35e2d07fcf5","title":"预期：展示无匹配结果的空态提示；不显示加载中也不报错；退格删除关键词后列表恢复完整"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ab49eef6-cf19-4e81-a67c-ab0ad3fb458b","title":"🟡【P2】搜索无匹配结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9c753f07-9922-4425-b4b3-1997b8e39668","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"55c0dc43-c9d4-4202-bda8-e72a1be4cb0f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"452a5e24-c9bd-42f8-995b-0d413dbbc6e4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8ff614ce-14d7-4704-bdd6-4455ae67f11f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"56a24a84-2aba-4833-8083-96841d281f01","title":"前置：智能体 Tab 已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板搜索输入"},{"parent":"8ff614ce-14d7-4704-bdd6-4455ae67f11f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7c536c7-946a-49da-a763-46ac0a53891f","title":"操作：在 @ 之后依次输入空格、特殊字符与纯数字"},{"parent":"8ff614ce-14d7-4704-bdd6-4455ae67f11f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e7faae93-c65f-401b-9fbe-8ac7d2347f2e","title":"预期：输入空格时面板按产品定义关闭或将空格作为普通字符处理，不提示无法搜索；特殊字符与数字按字面匹配，无匹配时展示空态"},{"parent":"8ff614ce-14d7-4704-bdd6-4455ae67f11f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a06273e6-6eae-4a81-9166-18a94b56dd0a","title":"备注：参考历史问题：输入 @ 后再输空格曾提示无法搜索工作区文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8ff614ce-14d7-4704-bdd6-4455ae67f11f","title":"🟡【P2】搜索特殊字符与空格"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"452a5e24-c9bd-42f8-995b-0d413dbbc6e4","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"55c0dc43-c9d4-4202-bda8-e72a1be4cb0f","title":"智能体搜索"},{"parent":"0228acd8-535d-4b2a-bd99-15a061df50e8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f569e41f-46d2-4922-9366-657e300cd860","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ed59dacd-ee75-4745-a343-f766ef1b7dcf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6ee4e27a-b49b-4aba-bf5a-d6ed57577e84","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d115079f-3699-41fa-a6e3-20a5b88c92d2","title":"前置：智能体 Tab 已打开且列表中有多个 Agent；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板"},{"parent":"6ee4e27a-b49b-4aba-bf5a-d6ed57577e84","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0a788f32-0b36-47d9-a81c-b9766a652082","title":"操作：使用上下方向键在列表中移动，跨分组移动后回车确认"},{"parent":"6ee4e27a-b49b-4aba-bf5a-d6ed57577e84","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c1a0734a-7f85-4603-9527-ac47fa069e1c","title":"预期：选中项高亮随方向键移动并可跨成员分组连续移动；列表随选中项自动滚动保证可见；回车插入当前选中的 Agent 引用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6ee4e27a-b49b-4aba-bf5a-d6ed57577e84","title":"🟠【P1】方向键与回车选择"},{"parent":"ed59dacd-ee75-4745-a343-f766ef1b7dcf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"563dff88-c559-45aa-aa5c-117714ba8e24","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"53723d06-e7a1-434e-be24-a054d24746b1","title":"前置：智能体 Tab 已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板"},{"parent":"563dff88-c559-45aa-aa5c-117714ba8e24","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dbd270e3-6938-45fc-baac-11d616cd6547","title":"操作：按 Esc 键关闭面板"},{"parent":"563dff88-c559-45aa-aa5c-117714ba8e24","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d2c19daa-80e8-4377-ab41-ac6065aec7ec","title":"预期：面板关闭并保留输入框中已输入的 @ 字符与其他文本；未插入任何引用；再次输入可重新唤起面板"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"563dff88-c559-45aa-aa5c-117714ba8e24","title":"🟠【P1】Esc 关闭面板"},{"parent":"ed59dacd-ee75-4745-a343-f766ef1b7dcf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e9d88e5d-e0be-4c1f-ac85-a16e54d009d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5ef6695a-e2d1-4435-ac20-a9647af1aa1e","title":"前置：智能体 Tab 已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：面板外部区域"},{"parent":"e9d88e5d-e0be-4c1f-ac85-a16e54d009d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8d3469cb-b502-41d7-a599-bf3a66eb8d03","title":"操作：点击面板外部的会话区域"},{"parent":"e9d88e5d-e0be-4c1f-ac85-a16e54d009d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"82ab610d-f9fe-4d46-a0f6-b2c9772ebe4f","title":"预期：面板关闭且不插入引用；输入框内容保持不变；面板不常驻在页面顶层遮挡其他内容"},{"parent":"e9d88e5d-e0be-4c1f-ac85-a16e54d009d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c37db431-6fcc-49b3-a017-ceac241575df","title":"备注：#304"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e9d88e5d-e0be-4c1f-ac85-a16e54d009d1","title":"🟠【P1】点击外部关闭面板"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ed59dacd-ee75-4745-a343-f766ef1b7dcf","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"f569e41f-46d2-4922-9366-657e300cd860","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2b6c0249-14a4-456c-9e62-75b603f980b1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d1459d14-ed5d-4e15-b890-b580c673ee72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1b98e86f-99cb-482c-8429-deb72a3015ab","title":"前置：应用窗口宽度较小或输入框贴近屏幕边缘；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板"},{"parent":"d1459d14-ed5d-4e15-b890-b580c673ee72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09a58acf-d754-4f16-a92d-0a878c0b9721","title":"操作：在窄窗口下唤起智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"d1459d14-ed5d-4e15-b890-b580c673ee72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d5268928-51e0-4d2b-b5ab-a00fb378a2d3","title":"预期：面板自动调整弹出方向使其完整落在可视区域内；不被窗口边缘裁切；列表可滚动查看全部条目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d1459d14-ed5d-4e15-b890-b580c673ee72","title":"🟡【P2】窄窗口与页面边缘下的面板"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2b6c0249-14a4-456c-9e62-75b603f980b1","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f569e41f-46d2-4922-9366-657e300cd860","title":"键盘导航与面板关闭"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0228acd8-535d-4b2a-bd99-15a061df50e8","title":"智能体 Tab 与列表展示"},{"parent":"1e9fabff-fcae-44bd-b657-d857cc09c783","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"045a4a46-8957-49b6-bbd5-b7893d75bb45","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"eaa4848f-be69-4218-a3e7-c7bca40f42cc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8c5957b6-5866-49ed-97a2-ba185d9d8c25","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6dac90b4-5de8-4883-b11c-5134c90fb9c7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd33d97f-d44f-42fe-8ef0-a00692060da0","title":"前置：本地 Claude Code、Codex、Tutti Agent 均已安装并登录；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"6dac90b4-5de8-4883-b11c-5134c90fb9c7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a47d16cd-eabd-4cc8-b74d-ece977d40c50","title":"操作：在自己的分组下查看三个 Agent 的状态并各选择一次"},{"parent":"6dac90b4-5de8-4883-b11c-5134c90fb9c7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9234a4da-675b-4d9c-a7e6-ba692ad2b1b0","title":"预期：三个 Agent 均显示为可用；点击可成功插入引用；发送后能正常接收指令并回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6dac90b4-5de8-4883-b11c-5134c90fb9c7","title":"🔴【P0】我的 Agent 已安装已登录时可选"},{"parent":"8c5957b6-5866-49ed-97a2-ba185d9d8c25","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c97667f1-ca4d-4ccc-be52-37ef86eb8db6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"00940bc6-2406-4feb-8594-61af35f0d2a8","title":"前置：会话中已出现「需要认证或配置」提示；角色：Agent 所有者与发起会话的成员；入口：原会话输入框"},{"parent":"c97667f1-ca4d-4ccc-be52-37ef86eb8db6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3350ac51-8b2a-4beb-a8a6-2de65514159a","title":"操作：Agent 所有者在本地完成安装或登录后，发起方在原会话继续发送一条消息"},{"parent":"c97667f1-ca4d-4ccc-be52-37ef86eb8db6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"380898f9-75b8-4a25-a295-cad5a9e94f39","title":"预期：该 Agent 正常接收请求并回复；此前的提示不再重复出现；原会话的历史消息完整保留可继续对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c97667f1-ca4d-4ccc-be52-37ef86eb8db6","title":"🟠【P1】认证配置提示后的恢复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8c5957b6-5866-49ed-97a2-ba185d9d8c25","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"eaa4848f-be69-4218-a3e7-c7bca40f42cc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ba6a48cc-0f89-4ebf-8876-caa18f79401e","callout"