],"collapsed":true,"id":"a6d7ca98-4a6d-44b9-b542-fc1db5b8f3fb","title":"🔴【P0】未安装的 Agent 在他人视角下可选"},{"parent":"ba6a48cc-0f89-4ebf-8876-caa18f79401e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"454b6c31-eac6-4b59-8b56-9e0c8af3a329","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4691b3f8-4126-499b-8b9b-9d538ff73fa0","title":"前置：成员 A 的 Claude Code 已安装未登录但曾开启过共享；角色：房间其他成员；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"454b6c31-eac6-4b59-8b56-9e0c8af3a329","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b71a0b03-788b-4e97-833c-ec84fbbaa62c","title":"操作：在共享agent下新建会话，在成员 A 的分组下选择该 Agent，输入指令并发送"},{"parent":"454b6c31-eac6-4b59-8b56-9e0c8af3a329","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"732814a7-3f8b-4e82-b71d-5f1e08a3ee61","title":"预期：该Agent可以选择，会话详情给出「{Agent} 需要认证或配置」的明确提示；指令未被执行也不产生持续等待的僵尸会话；提示中说明需要该 Agent 的所有者完成本地配置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"454b6c31-eac6-4b59-8b56-9e0c8af3a329","title":"🔴【P0】已安装未登录的 Agent 在他人视角下可选"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ba6a48cc-0f89-4ebf-8876-caa18f79401e","title":"异常场景（3）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"eaa4848f-be69-4218-a3e7-c7bca40f42cc","title":"我的 Agent 可用状态"},{"parent":"045a4a46-8957-49b6-bbd5-b7893d75bb45","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e014317b-d4d7-42a4-a1ec-e965b88fae0b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"36fc9410-f9cd-497a-b496-4122ff22c53e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6b67b114-4518-4b7d-afea-0aa3af2fde82","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c853510b-1df2-45d6-9e0d-d1af7b09628d","title":"前置：成员 A 已开启共享且已打开 Tutti 客户端；角色：房间其他成员；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"6b67b114-4518-4b7d-afea-0aa3af2fde82","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"25ebbdd6-0d0f-4f4e-b5c3-3e06ec49a270","title":"操作：在成员 A 的分组下查看其共享 Agent 状态并选择一个发送指令"},{"parent":"6b67b114-4518-4b7d-afea-0aa3af2fde82","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a90e11f6-3c87-4a85-b7b8-45a19d584b60","title":"预期：该共享 Agent 显示为可用并可选择；引用插入成功；指令正常送达并收到回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6b67b114-4518-4b7d-afea-0aa3af2fde82","title":"🔴【P0】所属成员在线时显示可用"},{"parent":"36fc9410-f9cd-497a-b496-4122ff22c53e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"208310dc-25de-4d2c-be28-9ad95b01c1e4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76c3e037-393b-40b5-a83f-e081d5e0beb0","title":"前置：成员 A 已开启共享但未打开 Tutti 客户端；角色：房间其他成员；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"208310dc-25de-4d2c-be28-9ad95b01c1e4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4f3e4b20-b88f-462d-bdba-1eeab267707a","title":"操作：在成员 A 的分组下查看其共享 Agent 状态"},{"parent":"208310dc-25de-4d2c-be28-9ad95b01c1e4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"32eaeb86-1ff7-4e26-ab83-2bf71909e07a","title":"预期：该共享 Agent 显示为不可用；不可被选择插入引用；成员 A 打开客户端后重新唤起面板即恢复可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"208310dc-25de-4d2c-be28-9ad95b01c1e4","title":"🔴【P0】所属成员未打开客户端时显示不可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"36fc9410-f9cd-497a-b496-4122ff22c53e","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"e014317b-d4d7-42a4-a1ec-e965b88fae0b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cf85f9b2-241f-4ef1-b52d-e151e4dcb45f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8488112c-514e-435a-89d8-ca8c82714474","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bb79bdaa-f323-45b1-b760-229a26b35e7f","title":"前置：成员 A 此前开启过共享，当前已关闭共享开关；角色：房间其他成员；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"8488112c-514e-435a-89d8-ca8c82714474","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1006e2ec-f1b7-4d45-936f-226445e92222","title":"操作：在成员 A 关闭共享后重新唤起智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"8488112c-514e-435a-89d8-ca8c82714474","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c663fdfe-e53c-4495-b963-6b13c8bfabaf","title":"预期：该 Agent 不再出现在成员 A 的分组下或明确标记为已停止共享；不可被选择；此前已 @ 过它的历史消息仍可正常查看"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8488112c-514e-435a-89d8-ca8c82714474","title":"🟠【P1】所属成员收回共享后从列表移除"},{"parent":"cf85f9b2-241f-4ef1-b52d-e151e4dcb45f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9866347c-264e-4461-a60b-e39ba8807ce4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ff178dba-7842-4858-937a-aa71c3fdd493","title":"前置：成员 A 曾共享 Agent 并已退出房间；角色：房间其他成员；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"9866347c-264e-4461-a60b-e39ba8807ce4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3292190f-5595-4e71-bcd5-d31f043a9ac0","title":"操作：在成员 A 退出后重新唤起智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"9866347c-264e-4461-a60b-e39ba8807ce4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b429f492-aaeb-4e1a-8351-019e248f171a","title":"预期：成员 A 的分组与其 Agent 不再出现在列表中；已存在的历史 @ 记录仍可读；在群聊中引用该历史消息时输入框不再带出该 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9866347c-264e-4461-a60b-e39ba8807ce4","title":"🟠【P1】所属成员退出房间后的列表变化"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cf85f9b2-241f-4ef1-b52d-e151e4dcb45f","title":"异常场景（3）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e014317b-d4d7-42a4-a1ec-e965b88fae0b","title":"共享 Agent 可用状态"},{"parent":"045a4a46-8957-49b6-bbd5-b7893d75bb45","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d4ad9764-a59f-4d60-9450-dea929b228b1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"76615d0c-6a46-42d5-9a03-5cc1ac64ae80","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"02509dcf-2653-4aa5-a868-110a685ad3fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"50226ce8-a69a-47fa-8137-c029e372dbdd","title":"前置：成员 A 的某共享 Agent 当前不可用；角色：成员 A 与房间其他成员；入口：两个账号的智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"02509dcf-2653-4aa5-a868-110a685ad3fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"02ffe3cd-d1ef-4b10-886e-a244d3b662b8","title":"操作：成员 A 完成登录使该 Agent 变为可用，另一名成员重新唤起智能体 Tab 查看"},{"parent":"02509dcf-2653-4aa5-a868-110a685ad3fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"78da20ba-7d31-4c28-82ec-dd4e75147270","title":"预期：另一名成员看到的状态在合理时间内同步为可用，无需重开房间；成员 A 侧同步显示为可用；两侧不出现长时间不一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"02509dcf-2653-4aa5-a868-110a685ad3fc","title":"🟠【P1】状态变化后两侧同步刷新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"76615d0c-6a46-42d5-9a03-5cc1ac64ae80","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"d4ad9764-a59f-4d60-9450-dea929b228b1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2cec4b3a-4983-42c6-9aaf-9966d9be097d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1ae86d12-ef63-48f6-b9c0-730c6b302557","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7af39124-3812-46c5-ad0d-c07bb749c6db","title":"前置：成员 A 的某 Agent 在本地未登录或未安装，但共享开关此前已开启；角色：成员 A 本人与房间其他成员；入口：两个账号各自的智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"1ae86d12-ef63-48f6-b9c0-730c6b302557","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e759136c-9a4b-480b-995b-73f35ae24eb6","title":"操作：成员 A 在自己的智能体 Tab 中查看该 Agent，另一名成员在其分组下查看同一个 Agent，并各自尝试选择发送"},{"parent":"1ae86d12-ef63-48f6-b9c0-730c6b302557","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9bb23c32-cafb-46ab-b7fe-baae65f61790","title":"预期：两个视角看到的可用状态一致，均展示为不可用且不可选择；不出现所有者看不可用而协作者看可用；若产品定义为协作者可选，则选中后必须立即给出「需要认证或配置」提示且不产生僵尸会话"},{"parent":"1a