-14f5-4365-aa74-8fd9739dc1b4","title":"预期：引用成功插入到输入框；引用块显示 Claude Code 的图标与名称；面板关闭且光标回到引用之后可继续输入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c82b072a-95dc-466a-ab2d-90cda0eb78bb","title":"🔴【P0】@ 自己的 Claude Code"},{"parent":"d29aff3d-8dd7-4f25-9941-3c9b70d1dbbd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"be28e1ae-7fd7-4eb2-9a5c-e830c19fbd9d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9739b8e7-29ed-4d69-af75-0c02a7601ef6","title":"前置：本地 Codex 已安装并登录；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：智能体应用的 @ 面板-智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"be28e1ae-7fd7-4eb2-9a5c-e830c19fbd9d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ee43d993-ace6-446d-ab08-906edbdd8845","title":"操作：在智能体 Tab 下点击自己名下的 Codex"},{"parent":"be28e1ae-7fd7-4eb2-9a5c-e830c19fbd9d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"00fa2a0a-b071-4952-9245-d384b2a217c4","title":"预期：引用成功插入到输入框；引用块显示 Codex 的图标与名称，不显示为其他 Agent 的图标"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"be28e1ae-7fd7-4eb2-9a5c-e830c19fbd9d","title":"🔴【P0】@ 自己的 Codex"},{"parent":"d29aff3d-8dd7-4f25-9941-3c9b70d1dbbd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b5759e08-e746-43b2-9e54-1d1d1c0553d0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eeeb1ee1-aa4b-4548-8c83-23630a621c29","title":"前置：本地 Tutti Agent 已安装并登录；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：智能体应用的 @ 面板-智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"b5759e08-e746-43b2-9e54-1d1d1c0553d0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7354bac4-741c-439a-bd10-80bead5c3511","title":"操作：在智能体 Tab 下点击自己名下的 Tutti Agent"},{"parent":"b5759e08-e746-43b2-9e54-1d1d1c0553d0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0abcdf38-7b73-4a9e-a935-defb8d6a763d","title":"预期：引用成功插入到输入框；引用块显示 Tutti Agent 的图标与名称；可正常继续输入指令"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b5759e08-e746-43b2-9e54-1d1d1c0553d0","title":"🔴【P0】@ 自己的 Tutti Agent"},{"parent":"d29aff3d-8dd7-4f25-9941-3c9b70d1dbbd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a570e7f3-b189-4e01-b39a-eb6343a9ca9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d62c0a5e-fda8-4904-8342-a538a4e8c25a","title":"前置：已 @ 自己的一个 Agent 且该 Agent 可用；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"a570e7f3-b189-4e01-b39a-eb6343a9ca9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cf005f5e-04c8-45e1-be08-a6c1a1e1531a","title":"操作：在引用之后输入一条明确的指令并发送"},