5-4d19-8798-2146479e18d2","title":"前置：会话详情中存在 Agent 引用块；角色：房间成员；入口：引用块"},{"parent":"6214eab8-7c61-418f-b9bd-c511815ad424","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"026f48e9-f54d-42a8-87d7-e19b7ceb89b7","title":"操作：点击该引用块"},{"parent":"6214eab8-7c61-418f-b9bd-c511815ad424","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"186f5111-a8cc-4412-8649-085044f00e5b","title":"预期：按产品定义打开该 Agent 的详情或跳转到对应位置；行为在自己的 Agent 与他人共享 Agent 上保持一致；不提示无权访问"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6214eab8-7c61-418f-b9bd-c511815ad424","title":"🟠【P1】点击会话详情中的 Agent 引用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d29aff3d-8dd7-4f25-9941-3c9b70d1dbbd","title":"正常场景（7）"},{"parent":"4e5eb7a1-4d3f-4854-ba0a-1bd37b8ea9a1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"198b83ee-f4c2-4905-bf5f-be15487e44ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"39c20c4f-d3d2-49d4-9a15-cca3d3e6b265","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8d196b9e-2cbb-42f4-9904-d149dca6d6c1","title":"前置：已 @ 自己的一个 Agent；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"39c20c4f-d3d2-49d4-9a15-cca3d3e6b265","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d5a770d7-ae5e-4d27-b17b-386a396e2c40","title":"操作：下发一条会导致执行失败的指令（如读取不存在的路径）并等待结束"},{"parent":"39c20c4f-d3d2-49d4-9a15-cca3d3e6b265","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f52b0f02-2cd7-41e8-9240-73b609a823d1","title":"预期：原会话中收到明确的失败状态与失败原因，并提供可重试信息；发起会话的主 Agent 归属不被改变；会话状态收敛为失败不停留在运行中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"39c20c4f-d3d2-49d4-9a15-cca3d3e6b265","title":"🔴【P0】@ 后 Agent 执行失败"},{"parent":"198b83ee-f4c2-4905-bf5f-be15487e44ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fd5384bf-7b82-4fe0-8de1-39b5afe12300","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"37f3b9d4-b96e-4f5e-8b6b-3d77c6eee8b3","title":"前置：已 @ 自己的 Agent 并发送指令，该 Agent 正在执行；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：取消按钮"},{"parent":"fd5384bf-7b82-4fe0-8de1-39b5afe12300","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c661eba5-4ece-4ffe-a736-82d756a95de1","title":"操作：在执行过程中点击取消"},{"parent":"fd5384bf-7b82-4fe0-8de1-39b5afe12300","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7c858a0d-bbe8-4f34-b173-7f7e18610c54","title":"预期：被 @ 的 Agent 停止执行且不残留后台任务；会话状态收敛为已取消；取消后可继续在同一会话发送新消息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fd5384bf-7b82-4fe0-8de1-39b5afe12300","title":"🟠【P1】@ 后立即取消"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"198b83ee-f4c2-4905-bf5f-be15487e44ac","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"4e5eb7a1-4d3f-4854-ba0a-1bd37b8ea9a1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5f015f7a-78ab-4575-b206-9f5a4c859178","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fb6f85c8-a4dd-4f16-9c6a-ba4ce66b316f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"20968673-0517-4fde-bd11-3e343a9f710d","title":"前置：已 @ 自己的一个 Agent；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"fb6f85c8-a4dd-4f16-9c6a-ba4ce66b316f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"51914949-02b2-42d8-a80e-29825c802376","title":"操作：在引用之后输入达到消息长度上限的内容并发送，再输入超过上限的内容发送"},{"parent":"fb6f85c8-a4dd-4f16-9c6a-ba4ce66b316f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b7e8e94c-f1d0-46c5-8a0a-9b0957a76860","title":"预期：上限内的指令完整下发且 Agent 收到全部内容；超限时给出明确提示或转为附件，不产生被截断的半截任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fb6f85c8-a4dd-4f16-9c6a-ba4ce66b316f","title":"🟡【P2】超长协作指令"},{"parent":"5f015f7a-78ab-4575-b206-9f5a4c859178","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c49fad2d-6628-4e81-a296-2f82c94568df","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"12511a5c-4831-42fe-8799-aa56eed6d88a","title":"前置：会话输入框可用；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"c49fad2d-6628-4e81-a296-2f82c94568df","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"88d410ea-f40f-4bcd-a861-64cf1cb4c64c","title":"操作：在同一条消息中连续 @ 两个以上不同的 Agent 后发送"},{"parent":"c49fad2d-6628-4e81-a296-2f82c94568df","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cdaaea07-3620-4156-a787-28ee4592765c","title":"预期：按一期定义给出明确限制或逐个处理；若限制则在插入第二个时给出提示且不插入；若支持则各 Agent 分别接收指令，不隐式创建群聊也不互相覆盖"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c49fad2d-6628-4e81-a296-2f82c94568df","title":"🟡【P2】连续 @ 多个 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5f015f7a-78ab-4575-b206-9f5a4c859178","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4e5eb7a1-4d3f-4854-ba0a-1bd37b8ea9a1","title":"@ 自己的 Agent"},{"parent":"1e9fabff-fcae-44bd-b657-d857cc09c783","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1e226549-c2a2-402e-aa73-8d177c5f6d97","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f24b85b5-ba84-411b-a4d3-7e16537a6063","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1ff30836-b1a9-48c8-928d-1de88eae579a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3d591f24-1344-4b89-b4c1-3847e1b4731f","title":"前置：成员 A 已共享 Claude Code 且设备在线；角色：房间其他成员；入口：智能体应用的 @ 面板-智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"1ff30836-b1a9-48c8-928d-1de88eae579a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5bed7d97-37eb-48d7-99f1-132aec74de3b","title":"操作：在成员 A 的分组下点击其 Claude Code"},{"parent":"1ff30836-b1a9-48c8-928d-1de88eae579a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2c01185c-b526-428a-bb04-a62c50065ca9","title":"预期：引用成功插入到输入框；引用块显示 Claude Code 的图标、名称与所属成员；不显示为自己的 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1ff30836-b1a9-48c8-928d-1de88eae579a","title":"🔴【P0】@ 成员的 Claude Code"},{"parent":"f24b85b5-ba84-411b-a4d3-7e16537a6063","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2028b304-67f4-43cc-936e-d7d37131fc98","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ebc94923-a910-4392-952f-2e9bbea8b03d","title":"前置：成员 A 已共享 Codex 且设备在线；角色：房间其他成员；入口：智能体应用的 @ 面板-智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"2028b304-67f4-43cc-936e-d7d37131fc98","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"58b881ca-2a1c-4fe6-9ed0-95dfc44095b3","title":"操作：在成员 A 的分组下点击其 Codex"},{"parent":"2028b304-67f4-43cc-936e-d7d37131fc98","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9508fabf-1b62-4b15-a06a-63443b82a8e9","title":"预期：引用成功插入；引用块图标与 Codex 对应，所属成员显示为成员 A"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2028b304-67f4-43cc-936e-d7d37131fc98","title":"🔴【P0】@ 成员的 Codex"},{"parent":"f24b85b5-ba84-411b-a4d3-7e16537a6063","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d986e349-96c1-4c57-9ae5-c4cdb03420de","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bd96917f-f3f6-4325-a4b6-972711bba297","title":"前置：成员 A 已共享 Tutti Agent 且设备在线；角色：房间其他成员；入口：智能体应用的 @ 面板-智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"d986e349-96c1-4c57-9ae5-c4cdb03420de","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7a392ce-5b0b-4436-ab0d-88c036b8408d","title":"操作：在成员 A 的分组下点击其 Tutti Agent"},{"parent":"d986e349-96c1-4c57-9ae5-c4cdb03420de","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"271c9ca2-4a41-4077-b278-854e6be363f8","title":"预期：引用成功插入；引用块图标与 Tutti Agent 对应，所属成员显示为成员 A"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d986e349-96c1-4c57-9ae5-c4cdb03420de","title":"🔴【P0】@ 成员的 Tutti Agent"},{"parent":"f24b85b5-ba84-411b-a4d3-7e16537a6063","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9ed11b40-a7fa-4f4f-b6e5-31a898369132","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f589f846-1c7d-4c6c-9962-0ea6030ea0f7","title":"前置：已 @ 成员 A 的某个 Agent；角色：房间其他成员；入口：输入框与会话详情"},{"parent":"9ed11b40-a7fa-4f4f-b6e5-31a898369132","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"27e6da6d-30d3-4282-ade1-f0755624c9f8","title":"操作：发送该消息后分别查看输入框中的引用块与会话详情中的展示"},{"parent":"9ed11b40-a7fa-4f4f-b6e5-31a898369132","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1fe21cd2-4ef8-4b55-af88-4191acfd6dc6","title":"预期：两处均在 Agent 名称旁展示所属成员（{owner}）；不出现所属为空或显示为当前用户自己"},{"parent":"9ed11b40-a7fa-4f4f-b6e5-31a898369132","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc4b7f4c-50ed-4d4f-a358-8afdb7152d8f","title":"备注：#190 #184"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9ed11b40-a7fa-4f4f-b6e5-31a898369132","title":"🔴【P0】引用块展示所属成员"},{"parent":"f24b85b5-ba84-411b-a4d3-7e16537a6063","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9b2f847d-84e6-4acf-8f0d-39e35a8963bc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cfc54450-ee11-4f51-865c-b561cbcc58a5","title":"前置：会话详情中存在 Agent 引用块；角色：房间成员；入口：引用块"},{"parent":"9b2f847d-84e6-4acf-8f0d-39e35a8963bc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc16211b-edf7-4b1c-bfc0-0b3cfe715446","title":"操作：点击该引用块"},{"parent":"9b2f847d-84e6-4acf-8f0d-39e35a8963bc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b81bf79e-6768-4ef6-9f19-19fe3d6ce6ce","title":"预期：按产品定义打开该 Agent 的详情或跳转到对应位置；行为在自己的 Agent 与他人共享 Agent 上保持一致；不提示无权访问"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9b2f847d-84e6-4acf-8f0d-39e35a8963bc","title":"🟠【P1】点击会话详情中的 Agent 引用"},{"parent":"f24b85b5-ba84-411b-a4d3-7e16537a6063","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0ae1867f-3c3b-4033-aeb9-481f034f9c65","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"94d3a72b-0d90-4343-839f-dcb7c594c5f4","title":"前置：已 @ 一个 Agent 并发送消息；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"0ae1867f-3c3b-4033-aeb9-481f034f9c65","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c672023-5926-4aa2-a55f-1a4294d84019","title":"操作：查看该条消息在会话详情中的展示，以及会话标题与左上角图标"},{"parent":"0ae1867f-3c3b-4033-aeb9-481f034f9c65","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cb7fb724-b9bc-46ec-ab98-db5420043ff3","title":"预期：消息中的引用块展示被 @ Agent 的图标与名称；共享 Agent 另外展示所属成员；会话标题与左上角图标对应实际执行的 Agent，不显示为全部分类图标或其他 Agent 的图标"},{"parent":"0ae1867f-3c3b-4033-aeb9-481f034f9c65","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7d41c6ce-bf20-4a15-b057-18cebd7e69e1","title":"备注：#46 #184 #209"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0ae1867f-3c3b-4033-aeb9-481f034f9c65","title":"🔴【P0】会话详情中的引用与归属展示"},{"parent":"f24b85b5-ba84-411b-a4d3-7e16537a6063","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4a6351b8-3b0e-4aae-a7f9-49b1f93a7315","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6abdcab5-74ca-4c6b-b98d-1c5723780510","title":"前置：已 @ 成员 A 的 Agent 并下发指令；角色：房间其他成员；入口：当前会话详情"},{"parent":"4a6351b8-3b0e-4aae-a7f9-49b1f93a7315","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5665bed4-7b4b-4261-a732-77d2753dc040","title":"操作：等待该 Agent 执行完成后查看结果展示位置"},{"parent":"4a6351b8-3b0e-4aae-a7f9-49b1f93a7315","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"12e2765f-a063-43d6-93f1-7e53100cd9aa","title":"预期：执行结果与回复展示在当前发起的会话中而不是成员 A 的会话列表里；结果对应所 @ 的 Agent；会话状态收敛为已完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4a6351b8-3b0e-4aae-a7f9-49b1f93a7315","title":"🔴【P0】成员 Agent 的结果回到当前会话"},{"parent":"f24b85b5-ba84-411b-a4d3-7e16537a6063","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"da1f6a13-6965-4675-89a9-f9f36995f40f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"236dcaf9-0370-4529-98da-733eeed878b6","title":"前置：房间其他成员已 @ 成员 A 的 Agent 并完成一次任务；角色：成员 A；入口：成员 A 的活动看板或会话列表"},{"parent":"da1f6a13-6965-4675-89a9-f9f36995f40f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"27bb054f-b488-4350-a54d-b9d921dfd339","title":"操作：在成员 A 的账号下查看该次协作产生的记录"},{"parent":"da1f6a13-6965-4675-89a9-f9f36995f40f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fe6f50d9-75ca-461f-80dd-ffa6ba3c295d","title":"预期：成员 A 能看到自己的 Agent 被协作调用的记录与状态；点击可查看详情且不提示无权访问"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"da1f6a13-6965-4675-89a9-f9f36995f40f","title":"🟠【P1】所有者侧可见该协作会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f24b85b5-ba84-411b-a4d3-7e16537a6063","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"1e226549-c2a2-402e-aa73-8d177c5f6d97","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"40ef5d6e-cc0d-47b8-b139-c42c8caa53fd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"19187b6c-6421-4808-9209-a18d0b4debf9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"838f06d7-4387-4db9-bd52-67b56f3d23e9","title":"前置：已 @ 成员 A 的共享 Agent 并下发指令，任务正在执行；角色：成员 A 与发起方；入口：成员 A 的移除或关闭共享入口"},{"parent":"19187b6c-6421-4808-9209-a18d0b4debf9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"977a9965-fdec-4312-9e35-55748fb32973","title":"操作：在任务执行过程中由成员 A 移除该 Agent 或关闭共享，发起方观察会话"},{"parent":"19187b6c-6421-4808-9209-a18d0b4debf9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2eaf9e6e-9580-45ab-917d-e259c257d025","title":"预期：任务按明确规则收敛为失败或跑完当前轮次后结束，不长期停留在运行中；会话归属仍是发起方的主会话不被污染；给出该 Agent 已不可用的说明"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"19187b6c-6421-4808-9209-a18d0b4debf9","title":"🔴【P0】协作 Agent 中途解绑或离线"},{"parent":"40ef5d6e-cc0d-47b8-b139-c42c8caa53fd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1fdeeb25-5d6f-4b1d-b5c9-c9c16e64b73b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd44a7eb-fa94-4e60-870c-7c9f40fa7a16","title":"前置：已 @ 成员 A 的共享 Agent 并下发指令；角色：房间其他成员；入口：当前会话详情"},{"parent":"1fdeeb25-5d6f-4b1d-b5c9-c9c16e64b73b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ac29701a-a92f-404f-a2cf-cdd3013282ad","title":"操作：下发一条会导致该 Agent 执行失败的指令并等待结束"},{"parent":"1fdeeb25-5d6f-4b1d-b5c9-c9c16e64b73b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b388635b-7884-4a3c-9156-57f61f823184","title":"预期：原会话收到明确的失败状态与可重试信息；发起会话的主 Agent 归属不被改变；失败提示中说明是被 @ 的哪个 Agent 失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1fdeeb25-5d6f-4b1d-b5c9-c9c16e64b73b","title":"🟠【P1】协作 Agent 执行失败"},{"parent":"40ef5d6e-cc0d-47b8-b139-c42c8caa53fd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"15a1c861-984b-48e7-87a7-92ce772e6937","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"02290a10-8114-450f-9227-c62769973a5e","title":"前置：已 @ 成员 A 的共享 Agent 并下发指令；角色：成员 A 与发起方；入口：成员 A 的本地登录状态"},{"parent":"15a1c861-984b-48e7-87a7-92ce772e6937","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a33738c2-3f1f-4a90-874a-e12b707ca430","title":"操作：在执行过程中让成员 A 在本地退出该 Agent 的登录"},{"parent":"15a1c861-984b-48e7-87a7-92ce772e6937","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e603e109-af6f-456a-a196-be2752753835","title":"预期：会话给出需要 Agent 所有者在本地登录后重试的明确提示；不返回 Unknown 或无信息量报错；成员 A 重新登录后可重试并继续"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"15a1c861-984b-48e7-87a7-92ce772e6937","title":"🟠【P1】所属成员在执行中退出登录"},{"parent":"40ef5d6e-cc0d-47b8-b139-c42c8caa53fd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a054dbdf-664e-4402-b6a1-f445375b5376","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8ca9c9d5-3026-4c35-9b38-aab5db635fe6","title":"前置：成员 A 的 Agent 处于不可用状态但仍可被选中（若产品允许）；角色：房间其他成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"a054dbdf-664e-4402-b6a1-f445375b5376","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3604b99e-5763-4e1d-80df-fe7a0e2c4cf6","title":"操作：选中该 Agent 输入指令并发送"},{"parent":"a054dbdf-664e-4402-b6a1-f445375b5376","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a7a93ea6-39ec-468a-ad44-a6451068c051","title":"预期：会话立即给出该 Agent 当前不可用或需要认证配置的提示；不产生持续等待的会话；提示中指明所属成员与需要的操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a054dbdf-664e-4402-b6a1-f445375b5376","title":"🟠【P1】@ 不可用的成员 Agent 后发送"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"40ef5d6e-cc0d-47b8-b139-c42c8caa53fd","title":"异常场景（4）"},{"parent":"1e226549-c2a2-402e-aa73-8d177c5f6d97","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3283c235-d758-4e42-b44e-9dff45281949","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6707dd5b-e9b7-4bad-a7d1-e5e63dd2f440","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6f0a6e7b-b8ef-4391-90f9-0c6ceab44bcc","title":"前置：已 @ 自己的一个 Agent；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"6707dd5b-e9b7-4bad-a7d1-e5e63dd2f440","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b88555af-988d-4146-ae77-09e24ba1162f","title":"操作：在引用之后输入达到消息长度上限的内容并发送，再输入超过上限的内容发送"},{"parent":"6707dd5b-e9b7-4bad-a7d1-e5e63dd2f440","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4514b4b1-86b4-434b-a4b6-3ffaa2635c21","title":"预期：上限内的指令完整下发且 Agent 收到全部内容；超限时给出明确提示或转为附件，不产生被截断的半截任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6707dd5b-e9b7-4bad-a7d1-e5e63dd2f440","title":"🟡【P2】超长协作指令"},{"parent":"3283c235-d758-4e42-b44e-9dff45281949","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0ec90e82-4e57-468b-b46d-ef651e33b35e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"02231ad0-79bb-45cd-83c4-f70af797e429","title":"前置：会话输入框可用；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"0ec90e82-4e57-468b-b46d-ef651e33b35e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e9e80248-c7a2-4923-afeb-ee0dbfd62d5b","title":"操作：在同一条消息中连续 @ 两个以上不同的 Agent 后发送"},{"parent":"0ec90e82-4e57-468b-b46d-ef651e33b35e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"17c99646-eb4a-479e-8918-07d1c9fed134","title":"预期：按一期定义给出明确限制或逐个处理；若限制则在插入第二个时给出提示且不插入；若支持则各 Agent 分别接收指令，不隐式创建群聊也不互相覆盖"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0ec90e82-4e57-468b-b46d-ef651e33b35e","title":"🟡【P2】连续 @ 多个 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3283c235-d758-4e42-b44e-9dff45281949","title":"异常场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1e226549-c2a2-402e-aa73-8d177c5f6d97","title":"@ 成员的共享 Agent"},{"parent":"1e9fabff-fcae-44bd-b657-d857cc09c783","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"907beb4d-b439-4cec-afda-66b1b9de8ac3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bbfef539-b183-48bf-af7d-d4a50957493f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2741236c-0b05-4823-98fd-e32e6fe49cdf","customWidth":432.7384615384615,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8cc99211-3d44-4a77-83ce-996de0ebaa06","title":"操作：在一条消息中任意组合两种不同类型的@引用（会话、文件、智能体三类两两组合，共 C(3,2)=3 种：会话+文件、会话+智能体、文件+智能体）"},{"parent":"2741236c-0b05-4823-98fd-e32e6fe49cdf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7a0686ec-a846-410e-9e4e-e18a0d1d58a0","title":"预期：每一种两两组合下，两个引用均能正确插入并被 Agent 正确解析执行，不因组合的类型不同出现某一类引用失效或互相覆盖"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2741236c-0b05-4823-98fd-e32e6fe49cdf","title":"🔴【P0】任意两类引用组合（矩阵用例，需覆盖会话/文件/智能体两两组合共10种）"},{"parent":"bbfef539-b183-48bf-af7d-d4a50957493f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9efe4929-13fa-47d0-a53c-540127adc00a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8851d7c9-5b00-4419-9d42-890a11bb245e","title":"操作：在一条消息中同时 @ 一个 Agent、@ 文件夹、并 @ 引用一段历史会话作为上下文"},{"parent":"9efe4929-13fa-47d0-a53c-540127adc00a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d321f98f-7d3e-4f2e-ba52-eba468ff2344","title":"预期：三类引用均正确插入且互不干扰，Agent 执行时能综合三者信息（自身身份、文件、引用会话提供的上下文）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9efe4929-13fa-47d0-a53c-540127adc00a","title":"🔴【P0】@Agent+文件+会话三者组合"},{"parent":"bbfef539-b183-48bf-af7d-d4a50957493f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5a4139da-8b22-486f-a2bd-761324353c44","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"430d3106-d838-4c9b-ad3a-ec37ab424254","title":"操作：调整消息中 @Agent、@文件、@会话 的先后顺序后发送"},{"parent":"5a4139da-8b22-486f-a2bd-761324353c44","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0f7c4a7e-4436-41ea-bfb5-55ee054a19cb","title":"预期：无论顺序如何，各引用都能被正确解析，不因顺序变化导致某个引用失效"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5a4139da-8b22-486f-a2bd-761324353c44","title":"🟠【P1】引用顺序不影响解析"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bbfef539-b183-48bf-af7d-d4a50957493f","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"907beb4d-b439-4cec-afda-66b1b9de8ac3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d1a4e2fc-95d8-4be4-b0b2-f15676d33701","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"92fee1eb-4124-487f-aaa0-de34b530a229","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"88fbbda3-9480-44bb-b904-3095c0458d5b","title":"操作：组合消息中某个被 @ 的文件被删除/Agent 在发送时已不可用"},{"parent":"92fee1eb-4124-487f-aaa0-de34b530a229","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9b5a70bf-b89d-432d-aa30-612f52cc8198","title":"预期：明确提示哪一个引用失效，其余有效引用是否仍可执行/是否整体阻止发送，需与产品确认具体策略"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"92fee1eb-4124-487f-aaa0-de34b530a229","title":"🟠【P1】组合引用中某一项失效"},{"parent":"d1a4e2fc-95d8-4be4-b0b2-f15676d33701","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cfa30933-c025-40b6-bfb6-5508d9be5ff3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fe54d540-2cbd-4c2f-8434-36a61375f30d","title":"操作：单条消息中 @ 的对象数量较多（Agent+会话+文件等混合引用叠加）"},{"parent":"cfa30933-c025-40b6-bfb6-5508d9be5ff3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e45491e1-504e-4a57-a331-c0166d852f1a","title":"预期：是否有数量上限、超限后如何处理需与产品确认"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cfa30933-c025-40b6-bfb6-5508d9be5ff3","title":"🟠【P1】引用数量超限【待确认】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d1a4e2fc-95d8-4be4-b0b2-f15676d33701","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"907beb4d-b439-4cec-afda-66b1b9de8ac3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"168e6955-ff96-459a-8f75-e58aa37e283b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a8d53bd7-355e-4b04-9352-491c5367f6ee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c8cf9288-58c5-4a76-80f9-d57ad13df102","title":"操作：一条消息中 @ 两个不同的 Agent（如同时 @Claude Code 和 @Codex）"},{"parent":"a8d53bd7-355e-4b04-9352-491c5367f6ee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"afc7f3d3-4f8d-45d0-a9d6-943d3accd6da","title":"预期：是否支持多 Agent 协同响应同一条消息、还是仅最后一个生效，需与产品确认"}],"col