序模式后条目可拖动；点击完成保存新顺序并退出排序模式；重新打开弹窗顺序保持为调整后的顺序"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2c030e64-10ab-422b-8ef7-2c978a4aa994","title":"🟠【P1】拖动排序并保存"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"edf11fab-ed0c-4d95-b906-54fc76db9a1a","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"d28a88fb-a8da-4ec7-8305-f2bcc981f666","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e18957a5-3392-40bc-a6fb-e79af2ccedc1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cb384eae-15f4-4739-87f7-02cf4256af64","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a7977994-ee1f-4fb8-9e17-78a34c2ffb5a","title":"前置：前置：搜索框中已输入关键词；角色：房间成员；入口：提示词弹窗排序入口"},{"parent":"cb384eae-15f4-4739-87f7-02cf4256af64","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3a6a9dd4-ade3-47e0-a9bf-044ad6e6c306","title":"操作：悬浮并点击排序按钮，再清空搜索内容"},{"parent":"cb384eae-15f4-4739-87f7-02cf4256af64","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"958ea258-3e60-48f0-81ea-4d85e2164438","title":"预期：搜索状态下排序按钮置灰不可点击，悬浮提示需清空搜索内容后才能调整顺序；清空搜索后按钮恢复可点击并能进入排序模式"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cb384eae-15f4-4739-87f7-02cf4256af64","title":"🟠【P1】搜索状态下不可排序"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e18957a5-3392-40bc-a6fb-e79af2ccedc1","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"d28a88fb-a8da-4ec7-8305-f2bcc981f666","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c958e26c-84b2-485d-9646-0602bef6ec32","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7ee2b153-734b-41f9-a67f-bb25759e0a1f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"32689bb9-2131-44b0-a7b0-80d72a634baf","title":"前置：前置：账号下只保存了一个提示词；角色：房间成员；入口：提示词弹窗排序入口"},{"parent":"7ee2b153-734b-41f9-a67f-bb25759e0a1f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"979e855a-b16c-457d-a329-5dfd15a57ffb","title":"操作：查看并点击排序按钮"},{"parent":"7ee2b153-734b-41f9-a67f-bb25759e0a1f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a33b9a6d-c7a7-476e-ac73-c71b16d0cc48","title":"预期：排序按钮不可点击且置灰；点击无任何响应，不进入排序模式"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7ee2b153-734b-41f9-a67f-bb25759e0a1f","title":"🟡【P2】仅一个提示词时不可排序"},{"parent":"c958e26c-84b2-485d-9646-0602bef6ec32","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4d3182cd-837c-4024-a875-662357e8340d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7640474d-52e1-44ee-b6f0-fe87075d4962","title":"前置：已保存多条提示词"},{"parent":"4d3182cd-837c-4024-a875-662357e8340d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6506f643-e14d-4d74-851c-6456be9e64b0","title":"操作：将一条提示词拖到列表最顶部和最底部"},{"parent":"4d3182cd-837c-4024-a875-662357e8340d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"777b2110-ee76-4427-bdb0-33e814beb25e","title":"预期：顺序正确保存，刷新后保持，不出现位置回弹"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4d3182cd-837c-4024-a875-662357e8340d","title":"🟡【P2】拖动到列表首尾位置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c958e26c-84b2-485d-9646-0602bef6ec32","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d28a88fb-a8da-4ec7-8305-f2bcc981f666","title":"调整提示词顺序"},{"parent":"bbe35e49-d37c-4322-8786-a8f34cef0cc5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ca446d8b-4009-4459-90fe-0d5713c30834","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fc112434-13db-49d6-a847-299f7df881b0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"361b4e32-bf94-4b25-9d02-db7253731ac7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d7971c18-009a-4cf3-bd7b-4788f248f397","title":"前置：前置：已保存提示词；角色：房间成员；入口：悬浮提示词条目出现的删除按钮"},{"parent":"361b4e32-bf94-4b25-9d02-db7253731ac7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3e4f5c12-211c-4363-92fd-ca2c826e0f6d","title":"操作：点击删除弹出二次确认，先点取消再点删除"},{"parent":"361b4e32-bf94-4b25-9d02-db7253731ac7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3345ff4b-3c4d-43ed-820a-45de7d392ec7","title":"预期：点击取消时弹窗关闭且提示词保留；点击删除后该提示词从列表移除，条数减一；重新打开弹窗不再出现该提示词"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"361b4e32-bf94-4b25-9d02-db7253731ac7","title":"🟠【P1】删除提示词二次确认"},{"parent":"fc112434-13db-49d6-a847-299f7df881b0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"81f90ee0-67f2-46f0-855c-ebd5c9e93006","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"be9d5f63-159b-4b8e-8d2c-383ff1a74a23","title":"前置：前置：已保存提示词；角色：房间成员；入口：悬浮提示词条目出现的编辑按钮"},{"parent":"81f90ee0-67f2-46f0-855c-ebd5c9e93006","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0fba79d0-0251-41a4-9f88-ad02a042028a","title":"操作：点击编辑，修改标题与内容后保存，再尝试清空内容保存"},{"parent":"81f90ee0-67f2-46f0-855c-ebd5c9e93006","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d5cb9aad-2c99-4b3f-8efb-71216d94db3b","title":"预期：编辑弹窗内标题与内容可修改并保存成功，列表展示更新后的标题；清空内容后保存按钮不可用；取消编辑不影响原提示词"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"81f90ee0-67f2-46f0-855c-ebd5c9e93006","title":"🟠【P1】编辑提示词"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fc112434-13db-49d6-a847-299f7df881b0","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"ca446d8b-4009-4459-90fe-0d5713c30834","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a472bcd2-ddf9-4a8f-826c-0fd02b47ff93","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"32edddeb-62a0-4639-9590-dc9a3f2f8dec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"65c68fa4-e55c-4001-9de3-c12726bb00f3","title":"前置：输入框中已插入某提示词内容"},{"parent":"32edddeb-62a0-4639-9590-dc9a3f2f8dec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ba8ab1da-4284-4b43-9d49-290838e1492f","title":"操作：删除该提示词模板"},{"parent":"32edddeb-62a0-4639-9590-dc9a3f2f8dec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e68ca91f-8c6f-474b-93f9-05756be70a4a","title":"预期：已插入输入框的内容不受影响；模板列表中该条被移除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"32edddeb-62a0-4639-9590-dc9a3f2f8dec","title":"🟠【P1】删除正在使用的提示词"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a472bcd2-ddf9-4a8f-826c-0fd02b47ff93","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"ca446d8b-4009-4459-90fe-0d5713c30834","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"43831aa9-3548-4585-9b50-fb7fa0d487fb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e69dece3-4951-40fe-b6f9-f7e6491e011b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"afdbeca7-7e3e-4f7e-9ad5-36e70d34615e","title":"前置：已打开某提示词的编辑界面"},{"parent":"e69dece3-4951-40fe-b6f9-f7e6491e011b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d60289d3-e393-4ce1-a75f-342a81488ec2","title":"操作：修改内容后取消退出，再重新打开该提示词"},{"parent":"e69dece3-4951-40fe-b6f9-f7e6491e011b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3bf8427a-f5e7-41ac-99e0-49ed8e3e1c85","title":"预期：内容保持修改前的状态，未保存的改动不生效"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e69dece3-4951-40fe-b6f9-f7e6491e011b","title":"🟡【P2】编辑后取消不保存"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"43831aa9-3548-4585-9b50-fb7fa0d487fb","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ca446d8b-4009-4459-90fe-0d5713c30834","title":"编辑与删除提示词"},{"parent":"bbe35e49-d37c-4322-8786-a8f34cef0cc5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c61e8e97-fe13-429d-bedc-03b1ff6552e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"025d2231-aa73-4a60-8bf9-442cf866f94e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"348edeee-ee86-46ad-9e02-6ccbc9d90cbf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c15d4b5-0f61-4c51-8937-645b107e8d4f","title":"前置：前置：已进入推荐模板二级面板；角色：房间成员；入口：任一推荐模板"},{"parent":"348edeee-ee86-46ad-9e02-6ccbc9d90cbf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bb2b0427-07f1-4024-972e-d44d3ddcbb03","title":"操作：点击该模板，在自动填入内容的新增弹窗中点击保存"},{"parent":"348edeee-ee86-46ad-9e02-6ccbc9d90cbf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9c14e0ba-169e-4eac-942e-1ae1a1c221e8","title":"预期：新增提示词弹窗自动填入模板标题与内容；保存后提示词填入会话输入框，并出现在一级面板最近使用列表中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"348edeee-ee86-46ad-9e02-6ccbc9d90cbf","title":"🟠【P1】保存推荐模板并填入输入框"},{"parent":"025d2231-aa73-4a60-8bf9-442cf866f94e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6647adea-6c69-4793-9098-6d85257236db","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c24ab357-638f-4418-a0b7-a80b6c746172","title":"前置：前置：账号已有最近使用的提示词；角色：房间成员；入口：提示词弹窗内「推荐」"},{"parent":"6647adea-6c69-4793-9098-6d85257236db","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"129f5e9e-3e38-4dd3-834e-de595708e251","title":"操作：点击推荐"},{"parent":"6647adea-6c69-4793-9098-6d85257236db","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0326e793-14a9-4c89-b384-54397d2c47e4","title":"预期：进入二级面板并展示推荐提示词模板列表；提供返回入口可回到一级面板"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6647adea-6c69-4793-9098-6d85257236db","title":"🟠【P1】进入推荐模板二级面板"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"025d2231-aa73-4a60-8bf9-442cf866f94e","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"c61e8e97-fe13-429d-bedc-03b1ff6552e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"afabedb2-14cb-430b-b6d6-760ffd70c154","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"854da51b-8664-43d4-a4bc-f1294af729b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d48e4da2-e9a5-4784-9625-cfc51b168069","title":"前置：推荐提示词接口异常"},{"parent":"854da51b-8664-43d4-a4bc-f1294af729b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c68d5541-31f9-445d-92ac-9eca46bd017a","title":"操作：查看推荐提示词区域"},{"parent":"854da51b-8664-43d4-a4bc-f1294af729b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0210941e-1e22-4dcf-b5cc-5edb14048775","title":"预期：展示失败提示与重试入口，不显示空白区域也不影响已保存提示词的使用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"854da51b-8664-43d4-a4bc-f1294af729b1","title":"🟠【P1】推荐列表加载失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"afabedb2-14cb-430b-b6d6-760ffd70c154","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"c61e8e97-fe13-429d-bedc-03b1ff6552e3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9cb48df2-ba58-4457-923a-3e012e543bc4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b49b7bfa-db67-4fc9-acc5-5ffd50cfc77f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9f160a98-4559-4d55-a17b-f4c9142cc757","title":"前置：推荐列表正常展示"},{"parent":"b49b7bfa-db67-4fc9-acc5-5ffd50cfc77f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3f8cf8b1-4431-4cbb-b221-ac615297444d","title":"操作：把一条推荐提示词保存到自己的模板列表"},{"parent":"b49b7bfa-db67-4fc9-acc5-5ffd50cfc77f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e437eab-b868-45b4-9dbc-bb8171a48e55","title":"预期：保存成功且内容完整，出现在自有列表中并可继续编辑"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b49b7bfa-db67-4fc9-acc5-5ffd50cfc77f","title":"🟡【P2】将推荐提示词保存为自有模板"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9cb48df2-ba58-4457-923a-3e012e543bc4","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c61e8e97-fe13-429d-bedc-03b1ff6552e3","title":"推荐提示词模板"},{"parent":"bbe35e49-d37c-4322-8786-a8f34cef0cc5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8b27f7ba-68de-4469-bb59-7c1ce58c21e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b29fc577-a344-497f-a0c6-960d20cbba08","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1e6c7d9f-e6d6-46aa-bcd8-3c6e8fd47295","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"700f22f7-527b-42f9-bb4a-82e1cc419c1f","title":"前置：前置：一级面板存在已保存提示词；角色：房间成员；入口：提示词列表条目"},{"parent":"1e6c7d9f-e6d6-46aa-bcd8-3c6e8fd47295","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0c1f1f72-f81d-47b3-914b-132a4c8eef64","title":"操作：点击其中一条提示词"},{"parent":"1e6c7d9f-e6d6-46aa-bcd8-3c6e8fd47295","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4469aeb6-9747-4f24-ab39-be4f2c329987","title":"预期：提示词内容自动填入会话输入框且弹窗关闭；输入框中原有内容与提示词内容按插入位置正确拼接，不覆盖已输入文字"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1e6c7d9f-e6d6-46aa-bcd8-3c6e8fd47295","title":"🟠【P1】一级面板点击提示词填入输入框"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b29fc577-a344-497f-a0c6-960d20cbba08","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"8b27f7ba-68de-4469-bb59-7c1ce58c21e9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9abbc80e-5cd9-469a-bd2a-5c336fa9fd36","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b7e84496-558d-43cd-9679-73f5c92c3e3a","callo