3a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea26c0f3-0501-4aa4-aef0-c6a11695dab6","title":"操作：输入指令/init触发环境初始化"},{"parent":"d5da0dae-8df4-4314-862d-21c6a20df63a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"14fcd40e-edc6-470d-a392-548f06eef6c8","title":"预期：Agent 完成会话环境、工作目录初始化，返回初始化成功提示，工作空间就绪"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d5da0dae-8df4-4314-862d-21c6a20df63a","title":"🔴【P0】/init"},{"parent":"72dbfe22-a095-4c1d-bba5-8a03e9e3d852","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4ff132d6-caf7-41df-a462-7d0752d3a41a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a878d7f1-1327-4a72-aaef-d392efbe36d2","title":"操作：切换 {Agent} Agent，下发绘图提示词「生成一张风景插画」"},{"parent":"4ff132d6-caf7-41df-a462-7d0752d3a41a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d4644b59-9f3c-4edd-b846-ab6ec2adfdbd","title":"预期：{Agent} 正常生成图片并在对话展示；Nexight 等其他 Agent 下发同指令无法生成图片，不生成空白 / 破损图片"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4ff132d6-caf7-41df-a462-7d0752d3a41a","title":"🔴【P0】Agent 生成图片"},{"parent":"72dbfe22-a095-4c1d-bba5-8a03e9e3d852","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"477c043f-e558-4c8a-97e4-ca6f5d78aa0b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"901fe1ec-ced6-4675-8fec-98cb7377ecf6","title":"操作：Agent 完成任务后查看最终回复"},{"parent":"477c043f-e558-4c8a-97e4-ca6f5d78aa0b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"74a4549b-66c4-4d19-af58-92b0ddeec204","title":"预期：输出完成摘要、变更文件和后续建议"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"477c043f-e558-4c8a-97e4-ca6f5d78aa0b","title":"🔴【P0】任务完成总结"},{"parent":"72dbfe22-a095-4c1d-bba5-8a03e9e3d852","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6c88e898-772c-4f2f-8271-b1678ff4eec6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f52cdfab-2750-4207-929e-717a25c1bfb9","title":"操作：让 Agent 总结项目 README"},{"parent":"6c88e898-772c-4f2f-8271-b1678ff4eec6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e4e01585-8b18-472e-8dd8-cbcead56d302","title":"预期：Agent 正常读取文件并输出总结，任务状态完整流转"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6c88e898-772c-4f2f-8271-b1678ff4eec6","title":"🔴【P0】执行普通任务"},{"parent":"72dbfe22-a095-4c1d-bba5-8a03e9e3d852","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"815a0031-7988-47f0-aa70-8155428b6968","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d452bcfd-6500-455e-b287-a35b47672994","title":"操作：任务执行中点击停止/取消按钮"},{"parent":"815a0031-7988-47f0-aa70-8155428b6968","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"72fcc455-2325-419b-aa00-e1083f46f3c5","title":"预期：任务立即停止，已产生的变更保留，状态更新为已中断，不残留后台进程"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"815a0031-7988-47f0-aa70-8155428b6968","title":"🔴【P0】用户主动停止正在执行的任务"},{"parent":"72dbfe22-a095-4c1d-bba5-8a03e9e3d852","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"139ff64d-f199-4db5-91fa-2caa9883ccce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"043e0c9d-f503-496b-9ead-98286f619c92","title":"操作：指令「新建 3 条不同内容的待办任务，标题，描述」"},{"parent":"139ff64d-f199-4db5-91fa-2caa9883ccce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d63c2d2a-bea6-4a35-a6e9-d5e9ff96c693","title":"预期：任务中心自动生成对应任务，任务标题、描述、属性和需求描述匹配"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"139ff64d-f199-4db5-91fa-2caa9883ccce","title":"🔴【P0】让Agent创建多个任务"},{"parent":"72dbfe22-a095-4c1d-bba5-8a03e9e3d852","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"593ab9de-7b47-4df1-94f1-2ecd8950802a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"444d556b-fcea-4fd3-bff9-446d062e83e6","title":"操作：先让 Agent 执行任务 A，再基于 A 的结果让其执行任务 B"},{"parent":"593ab9de-7b47-4df1-94f1-2ecd8950802a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5b1bc1e2-70a6-41d6-bd28-3f02bc7ed337","title":"预期：Agent 正确复用 A 的执行结果作为 B 的上下文，不重新计算或丢失上下文"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"593ab9de-7b47-4df1-94f1-2ecd8950802a","title":"🔴【P0】连续依赖任务执行"},{"parent":"72dbfe22-a095-4c1d-bba5-8a03e9e3d852","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"63a6baee-ba8f-414c-bcd5-d2bb6e8e7002","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7397767b-df93-4b29-ac83-852b72a2fc8a","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行多步骤任务"},{"parent":"63a6baee-ba8f-414c-bcd5-d2bb6e8e7002","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c745498c-1abc-4ac8-b891-e883b4ad9959","title":"预期：消息区持续展示阶段性进度，不长时间无反馈"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"63a6baee-ba8f-414c-bcd5-d2bb6e8e7002","title":"🔴【P0】长任务进度展示"},{"parent":"72dbfe22-a095-4c1d-bba5-8a03e9e3d852","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5361c3a9-8718-4687-8aec-7c8b859a428f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9a64b3da-6adb-4287-a591-e5268131675c","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个耗时接近但未超过系统设定超时阈值的任务"},{"parent":"5361c3a9-8718-4687-8aec-7c8b859a428f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"78639c17-845b-492c-ac9e-9ed9b695ee44","title":"预期：任务正常执行完成，不被误判超时提前中断（与「异常场景-任务超时」互为正反验证）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5361c3a9-8718-4687-8aec-7c8b859a428f","title":"🔴【P0】长时间任务在超时阈值内正常完成"},{"parent":"72dbfe22-a095-4c1d-bba5-8a03e9e3d852","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2629a982-9412-4294-8737-059cd0fb6ef9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb5067f0-d565-4c12-b4db-50cfa39d1f11","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行需要授权的命令"},{"parent":"2629a982-9412-4294-8737-059cd0fb6ef9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6d10cf0f-70ea-401a-bc1a-58be37c0fa29","title":"预期：弹出确认或权限选择，用户确认后继续执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2629a982-9412-4294-8737-059cd0fb6ef9","title":"🔴【P0】需要用户确认的任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"72dbfe22-a095-4c1d-bba5-8a03e9e3d852","title":"正常场景（10）"},{"parent":"5550d7bc-b616-4834-961f-fedf7e3124a7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3f03c6e2-a030-487f-b8af-8894ab6066fa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"09207a7c-78c2-4a57-b9d4-c51965d811dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5ef1fa06-5278-4ad7-9849-0a47aa34f2e7","title":"操作：任务执行过程中强制退出应用"},{"parent":"09207a7c-78c2-4a57-b9d4-c51965d811dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bf9f0d07-ee84-4550-8ca5-2b8985ed52d8","title":"预期：重新打开后任务状态可恢复为已中断，不产生数据损坏的半成品文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"09207a7c-78c2-4a57-b9d4-c51965d811dc","title":"🔴【P0】任务执行中应用崩溃"},{"parent":"3f03c6e2-a030-487f-b8af-8894ab6066fa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0db41728-c08b-480e-8da6-79c3ffddf985","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e7a21cce-5f99-4f87-ae0c-f85964540550","title":"前置：前置：Agent 已登录且环境正常；角色：房间成员；入口：新建会话与已有会话"},{"parent":"0db41728-c08b-480e-8da6-79c3ffddf985","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c71bd5ae-f6cb-40db-8576-2e222accf2e5","title":"操作：在新建房间、新建会话与 @ 自己的 Agent 三种情形下各发送一条消息"},{"parent":"0db41728-c08b-480e-8da6-79c3ffddf985","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6ab4b0a2-4cec-43a1-b929-8c57a1870229","title":"预期：三种情形均能在合理时间内收到回复；不出现长时间无响应后提示消息未能发送或 something went wrong；失败时给出具体环节与重试入口"},{"parent":"0db41728-c08b-480e-8da6-79c3ffddf985","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"16a7246f-929e-4374-a85b-5de51f56d706","title":"备注：#15 #254 #277 #322 #323 #367 #374"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0db41728-c08b-480e-8da6-79c3ffddf985","title":"🔴【P0】消息发送后长时间无回复"},{"parent":"3f03c6e2-a030-487f-b8af-8894ab6066fa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"484908b9-6b72-4b8a-a5b1-bfc0ff4d32c4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3a277b80-9413-4935-8782-437d3977ef17","title":"操作：模拟 Agent 步骤超过超时时间"},{"parent":"484908b9-6b72-4b8a-a5b1-bfc0ff4d32c4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"648d422c-7d09-4e15-a29a-09c073c27469","title":"预期：提示超时并提供停止或重试入口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"484908b9-6b72-4b8a-a5b1-bfc0ff4d32c4","title":"🟡【P2】任务超时"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3f03c6e2-a030-487f-b8af-8894ab6066fa","title":"异常场景（3）"},{"parent":"5550d7bc-b616-4834-961f-fedf7e3124a7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"180eb475-8a65-4c9d-8a3a-fb4993b49fe9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cb44dff9-f533-4ead-8729-fc3492ade260","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8956ba92-51e5-427a-b6aa-771761a97e89","title":"操作：运行中暂停任务后点击重试"},{"parent":"cb44dff9-f533-4ead-8729-fc3492ade260","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e5e475c7-fb83-47e4-9fc7-8445ea48fcad","title":"预期：重试从明确状态开始，不重复破坏性操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cb44dff9-f533-4ead-8729-fc3492ade260","title":"🔴【P0】任务中断后重试"},{"parent":"180eb475-8a65-4c9d-8a3a-fb4993b49fe9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e45e7639-ddcf-49b2-9ab6-d5917873967f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"47c059e8-26cc-4ecb-b6a0-5f3e421e9ef6","title":"操作：让 Agent 生成大量日志或长回复"},{"parent":"e45e7639-ddcf-49b2-9ab6-d5917873967f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9f3214b1-934e-4b56-99d6-85c7f5b3321e","title":"预期：输出支持折叠或滚动，界面不卡死"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e45e7639-ddcf-49b2-9ab6-d5917873967f","title":"🟡【P2】多步骤大量输出"},{"parent":"180eb475-8a65-4c9d-8a3a-fb4993b49fe9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"245c44ed-2259-41e1-915f-189aeefd99af","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3d5e7e44-bbaf-4390-bdef-f0f5f93e9409","title":"操作：多个会话同时执行文件任务"},{"parent":"245c44ed-2259-41e1-915f-189aeefd99af","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c3e81139-dd7e-484c-acb6-1d67d77dee39","title":"预期：各任务隔离执行，状态和文件改动不串台"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"245c44ed-2259-41e1-915f-189aeefd99af","title":"🟡【P2】并发执行多个任务"},{"parent":"180eb475-8a65-4c9d-8a3a-fb4993b49fe9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"18972164-72f0-4bab-b592-9b2345ddc1cc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"18844026-c593-441f-adb3-1d730dcbc731","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行预计耗时超过 30 分钟的任务"},{"parent":"18972164-72f0-4bab-b592-9b2345ddc1cc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb28a752-7248-49cd-ae04-4a39b2052e48","title":"预期：任务持续正常运行，进度可查看，不因超时被系统误杀"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"18972164-72f0-4bab-b592-9b2345ddc1cc","title":"🟡【P2】超长单次任务执行时间"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"180eb475-8a65-4c9d-8a3a-fb4993b49fe9","title":"边界场景（4）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5550d7bc-b616-4834-961f-fedf7e3124a7","title":"任务执行流程"},{"parent":"86e969fc-fc1b-411a-b7db-50a598adfdd9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b1af2c2b-e3b9-425e-8683-fd8b177ac740","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"90952039-1d1f-4327-9bf9-a4de55bf5661","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d3e520e5-bb07-459c-b91a-6ca4bef70d83","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0a307a09-55ca-4608-90b2-8b1715a9c1f1","title":"操作：下发指令「修复 xxx 报错」并提供报错信息"},{"parent":"d3e520e5-bb07-459c-b91a-6ca4bef70d83","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"feaa121f-2c1c-4bba-863b-398498252078","title":"预期：Agent 定位问题代码并给出修改，修改后代码可正常运行，文件改动卡片展示变更"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d3e520e5-bb07-459c-b91a-6ca4bef70d83","title":"🔴【P0】让Agent修复代码bug"},{"parent":"90952039-1d1f-4327-9bf9-a4de55bf5661","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"89c4b08b-6aca-4105-9c50-63b6c5d0eb8e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4c7264a-717d-442b-83cd-3b8245601d33","title":"操作：指令「生成一个 个人主页网站」"},{"parent":"89c4b08b-6aca-4105-9c50-63b6c5d0eb8e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c968f38e-c55c-4653-956d-d0730964613c","title":"预期：对话内生成可点击超链接，点击唤起默认浏览器跳转对应网址，网站能正常打开"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"89c4b08b-6aca-4105-9c50-63b6c5d0eb8e","title":"🔴【P0】让Agent生成网站"},{"parent":"90952039-1d1f-4327-9bf9-a4de55bf5661","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"122da316-43aa-452a-821e-a36e903e8b89","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e8411c77-7159-494c-8e78-b9eeb807174a","title":"操作：下发指令「实现一个 xxx 功能」"},{"parent":"122da316-43aa-452a-821e-a36e903e8b89","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bf8f8178-29cf-4a7a-b824-cc6af53f27e8","title":"预期：Agent 生成代码文件，逻辑符合需求描述，代码可正常运行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"122da316-43aa-452a-821e-a36e903e8b89","title":"🔴【P0】让Agent编写新功能代码"},{"parent":"90952039-1d1f-4327-9bf9-a4de55bf5661","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"62e81caa-f73c-4702-a76b-099d7c53270a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44869871-b531-40c7-855b-d24e4e478190","title":"操作：下发指令「重构 xxx 模块，不改变功能」"},{"parent":"62e81caa-f73c-4702-a76b-099d7c53270a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"32eda474-02ff-4270-99bf-75c675335275","title":"预期：功能行为保持一致，代码结构按要求调整，文件改动卡片展示改动"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"62e81caa-f73c-4702-a76b-099d7c53270a","title":"🔴【P0】让Agent重构代码"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"90952039-1d1f-4327-9bf9-a4de55bf5661","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"b1af2c2b-e3b9-425e-8683-fd8b177ac740","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"caf8625b-2586-4e1b-a14a-5d499d744178","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"afb7ad92-f2d8-4def-9d1f-10b426a925e8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"50cc096e-43e5-4341-8e60-0ae11e2ecbcb","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行的代码存在语法错误"},{"parent":"afb7ad92-f2d8-4def-9d1f-10b426a925e8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"265fdf91-8d2c-43c1-9efc-66ebab319798","title":"预期：Agent 能捕获错误并尝试自动修复或明确报告，不静默失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"afb7ad92-f2d8-4def-9d1f-10b426a925e8","title":"🔴【P0】代码本身包含语法错误"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"caf8625b-2586-4e1b-a14a-5d499d744178","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"b1af2c2b-e3b9-425e-8683-fd8b177ac740","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"55a0fbc3-bcbc-4ecc-93aa-78a3c954cd5b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d47cc0a0-4be7-4918-9919-101d7a0cde8b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ed5f70af-68a0-44f3-a5fd-45f9f2ea907d","title":"前置：项目中存在数千行的源文件"},{"parent":"d47cc0a0-4be7-4918-9919-101d7a0cde8b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b3f90d9a-51d1-4ec1-b2d6-2fd9595e696c","title":"操作：让 Agent 在该文件中新增并修改代码"},{"parent":"d47cc0a0-4be7-4918-9919-101d7a0cde8b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3f3db9a0-544f-4a41-90f8-efc69c801aba","title":"预期：改动准确定位，未涉及部分不变，diff 与卡片正常生成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d47cc0a0-4be7-4918-9919-101d7a0cde8b","title":"🟡【P2】在超大文件中生成与修改代码"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"55a0fbc3-bcbc-4ecc-93aa-78a3c954cd5b","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b1af2c2b-e3b9-425e-8683-fd8b177ac740","title":"代码生成与修改"},{"parent":"86e969fc-fc1b-411a-b7db-50a598adfdd9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"81ee2c1f-7656-403b-a673-184391298f8c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f389779b-5fd2-48c0-9446-b97fe22e0e12","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a3454f61-aae9-407f-96d4-76fa0947166f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea3cd633-e83d-431c-8c81-0e01ed09cce8","title":"操作：让 Agent 编写并运行一段 Node.js 脚本"},{"parent":"a3454f61-aae9-407f-96d4-76fa0947166f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"97b762e3-bc87-444d-887a-12ed8702e2f6","title":"预期：脚本正确执行，输出结果符合预期"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a3454f61-aae9-407f-96d4-76fa0947166f","title":"🔴【P0】执行 JavaScript/Node.js 脚本"},{"parent":"f389779b-5fd2-48c0-9446-b97fe22e0e12","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bd1beaae-d37e-488d-8ad2-579c30663def","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5cf31ab1-7c5f-42bf-9ecd-3405cc9fdc19","title":"操作：让 Agent 编写并运行一段 Python 脚本（如打印结果或做简单计算）"},{"parent":"bd1beaae-d37e-488d-8ad2-579c30663def","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"efc23044-1560-4a5b-8186-289c5a70aa46","title":"预期：脚本正确执行，输出结果符合预期，执行过程和输出在对话中可见"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bd1beaae-d37e-488d-8ad2-579c30663def","title":"🔴【P0】执行 Python 脚本"},{"parent":"f389779b-5fd2-48c0-9446-b97fe22e0e12","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"de30509d-5387-494c-838e-94df0ede1e90","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"25b9a040-fc0e-4b30-b56d-17472a2837c8","title":"操作：让 Agent 运行一个需要传入命令行参数的程序/脚本（如指定输入文件路径、指定运行模式）"},{"parent":"de30509d-5387-494c-838e-94df0ede1e90","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d5951217-8c9d-4731-b1f0-08d6bf18a84c","title":"预期：参数正确传递并生效，程序按参数执行相应逻辑，结果与参数匹配"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"de30509d-5387-494c-838e-94df0ede1e90","title":"🔴【P0】执行带参数的程序"},{"parent":"f389779b-5fd2-48c0-9446-b97fe22e0e12","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"071edbd9-6180-468c-a18e-83d278bd6be6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f6ad13a3-fb27-4c02-8d64-f853252e53e0","title":"操作：下发指令「运行单元测试」"},{"parent":"071edbd9-6180-468c-a18e-83d278bd6be6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"99167dc1-29d4-45c6-afa1-ae4948a10b19","title":"预期：Agent 执行测试命令，输出测试结果（通过/失败数量），失败用例有具体报错定位"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"071edbd9-6180-468c-a18e-83d278bd6be6","title":"🔴【P0】让Agent运行项目测试"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f389779b-5fd2-48c0-9446-b97fe22e0e12","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"81ee2c1f-7656-403b-a673-184391298f8c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"798ced7a-4b65-4dfe-88ae-547159bcf0f3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"260ffb79-a5d6-473c-a69a-828232c81c9f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4057224f-9070-4b65-9d4a-188f6affc14e","title":"前置：前置：使用 VM 版应用；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"260ffb79-a5d6-473c-a69a-828232c81c9f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"012a5dd2-cde5-450e-a28e-30f2048b0101","title":"操作：发送需要执行命令的任务并观察执行结果"},{"parent":"260ffb79-a5d6-473c-a69a-828232c81c9f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"48f1d2b9-59aa-4ead-8d44-fe978e91ae81","title":"预期：命令在 VM 环境中正常执行并返回结果；不出现 sandbox ssh endpoint not ready、权限错误或执行 tsh-router 失败等底层报错直接抛给用户；确有环境问题时给出可读提示与重试入口"},{"parent":"260ffb79-a5d6-473c-a69a-828232c81c9f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e1bd5257-fb51-4d51-acfb-35a0e57354ee","title":"备注：#265 #255 #435 #264"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"260ffb79-a5d6-473c-a69a-828232c81c9f","title":"🔴【P0】VM 环境下会话执行报错"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"798ced7a-4b65-4dfe-88ae-547159bcf0f3","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"81ee2c1f-7656-403b-a673-184391298f8c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0fc88dcb-5768-4ca4-87bc-fcd7b7acf90d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9e4deef2-3880-4dfa-805c-fac6dc9d0e11","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"88956ac5-2e3a-4290-9911-92574466bd96","title":"操作：让 Agent 在同时包含 Python/JS/Go 等多语言的项目中执行任务"},{"parent":"9e4deef2-3880-4dfa-805c-fac6dc9d0e11","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c87c498-c25f-4c2e-8214-56cf55f3f19d","title":"预期：正确识别并使用对应语言的工具链"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9e4deef2-3880-4dfa-805c-fac6dc9d0e11","title":"🟡【P2】多语言混合项目执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0fc88dcb-5768-4ca4-87bc-fcd7b7acf90d","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"81ee2c1f-7656-403b-a673-184391298f8c","title":"命令与脚本执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"86e969fc-fc1b-411a-b7db-50a598adfdd9","title":"5.1 任务执行与代码生成"},{"parent":"676dc7a3-3959-4469-a5c5-68898be80f72","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e01300ea-6038-48b5-a280-56af554ad348","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ca5d398c-30d0-498f-b8a4-4ad6c68a3126","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b78bd080-a737-4024-9623-4ea11717b4e5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6127443b-e35b-4249-8647-e1c998600f85","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"36cde66e-c64f-45cf-8f8f-ad59a97d5910","title":"操作：给 Agent 一个需要读文件+搜索+改写的复合任务（如「找到所有包含 TODO 的文件并汇总」）"},{"parent":"6127443b-e35b-4249-8647-e1c998600f85","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e70ea9df-7ae3-4196-9717-b716a8f48f56","title":"预期：Agent 依次选择搜索工具与文件写入工具，未跳过必要步骤或调用无关工具"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6127443b-e35b-4249-8647-e1c998600f85","title":"🔴【P0】Agent正确识别所需工具"},{"parent":"b78bd080-a737-4024-9623-4ea11717b4e5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"77fcc74d-05d5-4339-ae6e-87725934f5f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"80889307-4241-41cd-8c77-b5f35a9f7886","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个需要明确参数的工具调用（如指定路径的文件搜索、指定分支的 Git 操作）"},{"parent":"77fcc74d-05d5-4339-ae6e-87725934f5f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6ae1e6c1-0436-4689-83cb-fe7937bee8e9","title":"预期：工具调用参数与用户意图一致，无路径/分支等参数误填"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"77fcc74d-05d5-4339-ae6e-87725934f5f8","title":"🔴【P0】工具调用参数生成正确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b78bd080-a737-4024-9623-4ea11717b4e5","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"ca5d398c-30d0-498f-b8a4-4ad6c68a3126","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"04d95c3d-5644-4714-bc90-87b7f7712db2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f72920df-40d0-418a-910c-9242b24d34e5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dc3cf3a9-22c3-46cc-9cb0-b403a0601ad4","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"f72920df-40d0-418a-910c-9242b24d34e5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"48092ddc-8caf-426d-8d06-e6fb290fc692","title":"操作：下发一个目标不明确的指令（如「处理一下这个文件」但未说明如何处理）"},{"parent":"f72920df-40d0-418a-910c-9242b24d34e5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"832ca2b5-e984-46e5-96e9-6e7e587ab635","title":"预期：Agent 先澄清意图或说明自身理解再执行，不直接猜测并执行破坏性操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f72920df-40d0-418a-910c-9242b24d34e5","title":"🟠【P1】任务描述含歧义时的工具选择"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"04d95c3d-5644-4714-bc90-87b7f7712db2","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"ca5d398c-30d0-498f-b8a4-4ad6c68a3126","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"80540f4d-20fc-40be-b288-0a0854fced9c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aad45cd9-1e30-4c7a-8657-f7d18b2f1913","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f6c2b1bc-b144-4d43-8a77-d2f40f849f62","title":"前置：项目中存在超长路径且含特殊字符的文件"},{"parent":"aad45cd9-1e30-4c7a-8657-f7d18b2f1913","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c473f20d-18b6-47f1-bf98-11ffbe2429b8","title":"操作：让 Agent 对该文件执行读取与修改"},{"parent":"aad45cd9-1e30-4c7a-8657-f7d18b2f1913","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d2779a53-c4b3-4ac0-9461-22fd3d5a2b24","title":"预期：参数被正确转义与传递，操作命中目标文件，不因特殊字符解析失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aad45cd9-1e30-4c7a-8657-f7d18b2f1913","title":"🟡【P2】参数中含特殊字符与超长路径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"80540f4d-20fc-40be-b288-0a0854fced9c","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ca5d398c-30d0-498f-b8a4-4ad6c68a3126","title":"工具选择与参数生成"},{"parent":"e01300ea-6038-48b5-a280-56af554ad348","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d1cb456d-7a3a-4a2e-915b-f199faabd7a9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a843386b-a24f-451c-93bd-5cc38015acd3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ac75bba2-60c6-4933-8344-e468444ee9bb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ad45971f-3e1e-4fa6-aca3-92061f981b53","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行「先搜索再写入结果文件」这类需要多个工具按顺序配合的任务"},{"parent":"ac75bba2-60c6-4933-8344-e468444ee9bb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6a612c27-df44-4379-8b8a-370fa51f4d64","title":"预期：工具调用顺序符合任务逻辑（先搜索后写入），不出现空写入或搜索结果丢失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ac75bba2-60c6-4933-8344-e468444ee9bb","title":"🔴【P0】多工具链式调用顺序合理"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a843386b-a24f-451c-93bd-5cc38015acd3","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"d1cb456d-7a3a-4a2e-915b-f199faabd7a9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"07d8d1e3-c3ef-4e64-9ec2-866c4da6a3de","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"afec6de5-22e5-4fdb-b6bd-2b5ba72401b6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"982408f6-ef8c-4f32-9d37-7894f5d37222","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"afec6de5-22e5-4fdb-b6bd-2b5ba72401b6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bdd9ada6-7760-4de0-b859-37d85e4fc37a","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行「先搜索再写入」的任务，并使搜索步骤失败"},{"parent":"afec6de5-22e5-4fdb-b6bd-2b5ba72401b6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9300591b-9415-4944-a41b-54bf5bd7e39c","title":"预期：不带着空结果继续写入；明确报告在哪一步失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"afec6de5-22e5-4fdb-b6bd-2b5ba72401b6","title":"🟠【P1】链路中间步骤失败时的中止"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"07d8d1e3-c3ef-4e64-9ec2-866c4da6a3de","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"d1cb456d-7a3a-4a2e-915b-f199faabd7a9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c725ebbc-7706-4d34-b784-42a26741d08a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0a8ed16d-b60b-44b9-b3b5-73b436600a3e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"63369c07-7c3d-4205-a7de-5db2591a3233","title":"操作：让 Agent 连续读取多个小文件"},{"parent":"0a8ed16d-b60b-44b9-b3b5-73b436600a3e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bb8edac0-5e89-4882-8785-264d801751a6","title":"预期：工具调用结果稳定，界面进度可追踪"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0a8ed16d-b60b-44b9-b3b5-73b436600a3e","title":"🟡【P2】高频工具调用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c725ebbc-7706-4d34-b784-42a26741d08a","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d1cb456d-7a3a-4a2e-915b-f199faabd7a9","title":"工具链式调用"},{"parent":"e01300ea-6038-48b5-a280-56af554ad348","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bdf85b19-101d-40e8-bf6d-fcc3cc0166f0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"07eb28a0-23dc-4832-ab8b-b3768c83dea0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1c499260-9832-4d6b-8176-2e52a54557b9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4021a952-bbdb-4b6f-bbaf-6c4079e81751","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"1c499260-9832-4d6b-8176-2e52a54557b9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b2d51175-1d8f-46d1-9c77-01d017a994c7","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个首选工具不可用但存在替代方案的任务"},{"parent":"1c499260-9832-4d6b-8176-2e52a54557b9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"67d04b44-a383-4ce2-97ae-4de7e68494f2","title":"预期：Agent 说明首选方案不可用并改用替代方案完成，最终结果正确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1c499260-9832-4d6b-8176-2e52a54557b9","title":"🟠【P1】失败后改用替代方案完成任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"07eb28a0-23dc-4832-ab8b-b3768c83dea0","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"bdf85b19-101d-40e8-bf6d-fcc3cc0166f0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7f478be5-2bcd-47fb-95e6-125344cb757e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9ab6e6ed-c52b-4710-a11c-2651649786db","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ebbc384c-044b-4f04-bdd0-aefe3aaec85a","title":"前置：前置：会话已绑定项目；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"9ab6e6ed-c52b-4710-a11c-2651649786db","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b14e1df4-9e75-4eb7-9e08-0efdd8cde0f2","title":"操作：发送引用消息或执行 /review uncommitted，观察 bash、ls、python3、git 等命令的执行结果"},{"parent":"9ab6e6ed-c52b-4710-a11c-2651649786db","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e0d784df-bfc8-4cf7-83a8-3989ef0b0807","title":"预期：命令能在环境中正常执行并返回结果；不出现 cannot execute 或命令在这个环境里不可用；执行失败时输出完整的错误信息，工具调用之间间距正常"},{"parent":"9ab6e6ed-c52b-4710-a11c-2651649786db","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"931b4c40-000d-4e37-ae86-f524aba7355d","title":"备注：#251 #424 #264 #267"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9ab6e6ed-c52b-4710-a11c-2651649786db","title":"🔴【P0】命令执行返回 cannot execute"},{"parent":"7f478be5-2bcd-47fb-95e6-125344cb757e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3d835062-e312-48b8-9de8-17a4a5788388","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bacd3e4d-2dbf-441d-8446-04e192881d6b","title":"操作：让某个工具调用刻意失败（如网络工具断网、命令不存在），观察 Agent 后续处理"},{"parent":"3d835062-e312-48b8-9de8-17a4a5788388","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f8837040-74ef-405c-af3f-d0f428368c59","title":"预期：Agent 采取合理回退（换用替代工具/告知用户/降级处理），不是原地卡死或静默重复报错"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3d835062-e312-48b8-9de8-17a4a5788388","title":"🔴【P0】工具调用失败后的回退策略"},{"parent":"7f478be5-2bcd-47fb-95e6-125344cb757e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c6c3b9e0-4c56-40fc-bc09-3f6deeb6d624","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2eb7e2c5-0907-49ca-8d93-58979bc56d05","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行的操作会持续失败"},{"parent":"c6c3b9e0-4c56-40fc-bc09-3f6deeb6d624","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cb272e2a-11ee-43a9-9915-9c5c7e5caf7b","title":"预期：达到重试上限后停止并报告失败，不无限循环消耗资源"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c6c3b9e0-4c56-40fc-bc09-3f6deeb6d624","title":"🟠【P1】Agent反复尝试同一失败操作"},{"parent":"7f478be5-2bcd-47fb-95e6-125344cb757e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8c72e3e0-61df-4e1c-9f1a-5ad88feaffa0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c6b31656-8183-477a-8fbf-4dcee57f5e61","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行不存在的命令"},{"parent":"8c72e3e0-61df-4e1c-9f1a-5ad88feaffa0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"04d3c9d2-2283-4446-be66-225381dc52c4","title":"预期：显示命令失败原因和退出码，不伪装成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8c72e3e0-61df-4e1c-9f1a-5ad88feaffa0","title":"🟠【P1】命令执行失败"},{"parent":"7f478be5-2bcd-47fb-95e6-125344cb757e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0dee40a1-7547-4067-b5ab-70cca297c6c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9d168a03-77f4-430d-b12d-9f71df177c0f","title":"操作：模拟文件读取或浏览器工具失败"},{"parent":"0dee40a1-7547-4067-b5ab-70cca297c6c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"92142a79-608b-4952-ad67-9fe38d80fd75","title":"预期：Agent 说明工具失败并尝试合理恢复或请求用户介入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0dee40a1-7547-4067-b5ab-70cca297c6c1","title":"🟡【P2】工具调用失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7f478be5-2bcd-47fb-95e6-125344cb757e","title":"异常场景（5）"},{"parent":"bdf85b19-101d-40e8-bf6d-fcc3cc0166f0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aa13bddf-3f61-4a7c-8d54-058b7cf71a2e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"189fe7b8-de00-4ef1-86d0-a44ea1f37dca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4b91f2d1-ba17-45d0-884f-57eddbd0c018","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"189fe7b8-de00-4ef1-86d0-a44ea1f37dca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e0439a2f-3d2d-466e-94b4-b0a8d0722801","title":"操作：构造一个多个工具都会失败的任务"},{"parent":"189fe7b8-de00-4ef1-86d0-a44ea1f37dca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"47c7f2c8-ba52-41a7-9e1a-93de2c8c5082","title":"预期：在达到重试上限后停止并汇总失败原因，不无限循环消耗额度"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"189fe7b8-de00-4ef1-86d0-a44ea1f37dca","title":"🟡【P2】连续多个工具相继失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aa13bddf-3f61-4a7c-8d54-058b7cf71a2e","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bdf85b19-101d-40e8-bf6d-fcc3cc0166f0","title":"工具调用失败与回退"},{"parent":"e01300ea-6038-48b5-a280-56af554ad348","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8364ff7a-a797-4792-a8ac-336162d8000c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0ee6e7a1-1d28-4db4-a155-1ed5b8b82efd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d3bf0f08-d024-432f-8204-e5fad1cdf468","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f0f37039-a0cc-4ac6-a850-2ebf0ae621d4","title":"前置：当前权限模式下部分工具在白名单内"},{"parent":"d3bf0f08-d024-432f-8204-e5fad1cdf468","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b02f16a4-edff-42d9-820b-7f4e12010b27","title":"操作：让 Agent 调用一个白名单内的工具"},{"parent":"d3bf0f08-d024-432f-8204-e5fad1cdf468","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"78a28574-6ec4-4352-a832-529f0b24c33e","title":"预期：调用直接执行不额外拦截，结果正常返回"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d3bf0f08-d024-432f-8204-e5fad1cdf468","title":"🔴【P0】白名单内工具正常调用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0ee6e7a1-1d28-4db4-a155-1ed5b8b82efd","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"8364ff7a-a797-4792-a8ac-336162d8000c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5f2464c9-c02f-4328-a5b5-cc21ba2a35d7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6ace0b4c-8f4b-4c2d-b2a9-aa94b4d4ca14","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9cb73f47-e1e5-4057-85a2-db372500aef7","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行删除大量文件/目录的指令"},{"parent":"6ace0b4c-8f4b-4c2d-b2a9-aa94b4d4ca14","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1f194f89-c538-420a-b4f1-d9d2b122ac6d","title":"预期：执行前有明确的风险提示或权限确认，不在无感知情况下批量删除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6ace0b4c-8f4b-4c2d-b2a9-aa94b4d4ca14","title":"🔴【P0】破坏性操作缺少二次确认"},{"parent":"5f2464c9-c02f-4328-a5b5-cc21ba2a35d7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"35895234-39be-40d7-8899-5172aa146e5f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"699b309f-caea-45ab-9c9f-3932355bf4c4","title":"操作：让 Agent 尝试调用超出当前权限/白名单范围的工具（如受限环境下的网络请求工具）"},{"parent":"35895234-39be-40d7-8899-5172aa146e5f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"043d83b5-d85e-441a-ab80-610c25751b87","title":"预期：受限工具调用被拦截并提示原因，不静默失败或绕过限制"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"35895234-39be-40d7-8899-5172aa146e5f","title":"🟡【P2】工具白名单限制生效"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5f2464c9-c02f-4328-a5b5-cc21ba2a35d7","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"8364ff7a-a797-4792-a8ac-336162d8000c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0167e69e-c7ac-4def-a2f6-80d00084c99a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2a433966-fb8b-4296-8796-2cacdae0c819","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"74fc9d0b-d753-4d00-af57-6dbad766d552","title":"前置：会话正在执行且已授权若干工具"},{"parent":"2a433966-fb8b-4296-8796-2cacdae0c819","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e6577321-4be6-4f70-aa09-97fdcf70cacf","title":"操作：在执行过程中把权限模式切换为更严格的模式"},{"parent":"2a433966-fb8b-4296-8796-2cacdae0c819","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ee29b931-576b-46cc-aced-e09b43281968","title":"预期：后续调用按新模式判定，已在执行的调用有明确的完成或中止结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2a433966-fb8b-4296-8796-2cacdae0c819","title":"🟡【P2】会话中途收紧权限模式"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0167e69e-c7ac-4def-a2f6-80d00084c99a","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8364ff7a-a797-4792-a8ac-336162d8000c","title":"工具权限与白名单"},{"parent":"e01300ea-6038-48b5-a280-56af554ad348","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7027f397-4512-4615-bf90-de6492a74ae5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"764d5fb0-3b44-4204-b45a-5fdf90e7b7f5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7d03b313-1075-411e-9f53-3a14bc2b7923","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d6a1e5a9-c016-417d-89e7-0b55797dc0f6","title":"前置：Agent 已完成若干次工具调用"},{"parent":"7d03b313-1075-411e-9f53-3a14bc2b7923","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ffee8467-4802-48f6-9f56-b55e22179280","title":"操作：在会话详情中展开某次工具调用"},{"parent":"7d03b313-1075-411e-9f53-3a14bc2b7923","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dca4aafe-8c63-45eb-9472-dc5d2824328f","title":"预期：展示工具名、入参与返回结果，层级清晰内容可读"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7d03b313-1075-411e-9f53-3a14bc2b7923","title":"🔴【P0】工具调用详情展开查看"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"764d5fb0-3b44-4204-b45a-5fdf90e7b7f5","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"7027f397-4512-4615-bf90-de6492a74ae5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5da516b2-102d-42d1-89e6-3f85d9fe56bc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0ece6d88-d8cf-40bc-b6df-25ad0cea3b39","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4c2ea003-5720-4e96-9d44-c3eacb5618cf","title":"前置：前置：会话可正常执行；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情工具调用区"},{"parent":"0ece6d88-d8cf-40bc-b6df-25ad0cea3b39","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"38a7d866-bf4b-4910-ba6e-d481e03ba27d","title":"操作：让 Agent 读取被 @ 的他人会话中的文件并展开工具调用详情"},{"parent":"0ece6d88-d8cf-40bc-b6df-25ad0cea3b39","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a7540a3e-fc76-4513-9fb2-f32f9c2ff8d7","title":"预期：工具调用层级与内容正常展示；参数与结果可读；不出现层级错乱或内容截断"},{"parent":"0ece6d88-d8cf-40bc-b6df-25ad0cea3b39","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2c66dd77-f6ce-4769-9d80-e39f9c961aea","title":"备注：#266"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0ece6d88-d8cf-40bc-b6df-25ad0cea3b39","title":"🔴【P0】工具层展示异常"},{"parent":"5da516b2-102d-42d1-89e6-3f85d9fe56bc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bf9f5daa-2549-4a63-b007-d955664027ae","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0949d6e1-e373-43fe-bc7b-6187e1f47ea4","title":"操作：Agent 执行一系列工具调用后，查看是否有调用记录（内部日志或可展示的操作记录）"},{"parent":"bf9f5daa-2549-4a63-b007-d955664027ae","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aec17d4b-a2c2-43d2-841b-89d63fa0426c","title":"预期：关键工具调用（尤其写入/删除/执行类）留有可追溯记录，记录内容包含工具名、参数、结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bf9f5daa-2549-4a63-b007-d955664027ae","title":"🟠【P1】工具调用审计日志可追溯"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5da516b2-102d-42d1-89e6-3f85d9fe56bc","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"7027f397-4512-4615-bf90-de6492a74ae5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b222a8f1-dc44-4e7d-92c5-be0c8a94e89e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"74ce3a22-0464-4758-bbdb-bdfc549d7880","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"becfcd70-1ef0-411b-9e55-a8894d018466","t