],"id":"b3d72d63-1d96-439c-a45d-9c1d01f539c8","title":"操作：让 Agent 编辑该文件"},{"parent":"809c896d-d363-43f0-b9cb-8cccda097b29","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0dfb9fba-d79f-4ea9-8299-2e2bbc5953c1","title":"预期：给出结构异常的明确提示，不产生进一步损坏，不静默写入"},{"parent":"809c896d-d363-43f0-b9cb-8cccda097b29","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6842e9e9-1ec2-4395-b19e-dad256404783","title":"备注：附件3 CC-018"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"809c896d-d363-43f0-b9cb-8cccda097b29","title":"🟡【P2】编辑结构损坏的 Notebook"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4bc6b859-53fa-4fcf-b138-0ea44fbde021","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"fd0341fb-55d7-45e1-a165-04e5f0a69a33","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2e9dc908-b710-4441-94c9-0cdee72dbe4e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a2e38d19-fadc-48e8-a671-2191ef85f32a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2641efa9-cefa-4ed2-844f-7ed371424133","title":"前置：存在包含数百个单元格的 ipynb"},{"parent":"a2e38d19-fadc-48e8-a671-2191ef85f32a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"824eaf3a-6f6c-4935-8185-0d44e2809d1a","title":"操作：让 Agent 在该 Notebook 中新增与修改单元格"},{"parent":"a2e38d19-fadc-48e8-a671-2191ef85f32a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dca33f6b-bf55-4127-8400-c8d865f8ca19","title":"预期：定位准确，操作只影响目标单元格，文件保存后结构完整"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a2e38d19-fadc-48e8-a671-2191ef85f32a","title":"🟡【P2】编辑单元格数量很多的 Notebook"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2e9dc908-b710-4441-94c9-0cdee72dbe4e","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fd0341fb-55d7-45e1-a165-04e5f0a69a33","title":"NotebookEdit 工具"},{"parent":"863084f9-96ed-43ab-a63c-b5b45a8604d6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5ace1f6e-bd4d-4c6f-98b1-a1d318a32a28","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0df305e4-10cf-40cc-a363-9f3b402f61ea","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ed9acd8e-a461-46ce-b2df-ef64e953cbbc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9439c724-ef44-40a8-93ac-baf5f312f589","title":"操作：让 Agent 在项目中查找包含特定关键字的所有文件（如「找出所有调用了 fetchUser 的地方」）"},{"parent":"ed9acd8e-a461-46ce-b2df-ef64e953cbbc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"604b1835-4144-42c8-87a2-fe8a1a821752","title":"预期：Agent 正确调用文件搜索类工具（grep/find等），返回结果与实际匹配一致，不遗漏不误报"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ed9acd8e-a461-46ce-b2df-ef64e953cbbc","title":"🔴【P0】Agent使用文件搜索工具定位代码（grep/find）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0df305e4-10cf-40cc-a363-9f3b402f61ea","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"5ace1f6e-bd4d-4c6f-98b1-a1d318a32a28","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"420d663c-b128-462b-87fc-1222bb9f0336","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1bcaca43-5bc6-45f6-a081-67e355a569bb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"57ce7577-8365-40cf-8e4b-0f722f701fbe","title":"前置：项目已打开"},{"parent":"1bcaca43-5bc6-45f6-a081-67e355a569bb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09a69dca-ce5d-4c04-b42f-0dda461862f0","title":"操作：让 Agent 检索一个项目中不存在的关键字"},{"parent":"1bcaca43-5bc6-45f6-a081-67e355a569bb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1a3f1466-a491-4de3-885d-0a0b28191a9d","title":"预期：如实返回无匹配，不编造文件路径也不返回不相关结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1bcaca43-5bc6-45f6-a081-67e355a569bb","title":"🟠【P1】检索无匹配结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"420d663c-b128-462b-87fc-1222bb9f0336","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"5ace1f6e-bd4d-4c6f-98b1-a1d318a32a28","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d88529ce-133e-4e06-a1dd-aac5007186dc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"db4d4eca-4296-4afe-a1cc-879934d2aca5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c2c17616-af76-4ac2-8940-a92d1bfc14b8","title":"前置：项目中某关键字匹配数千处"},{"parent":"db4d4eca-4296-4afe-a1cc-879934d2aca5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3f63ce8-6f81-4c20-8386-83e64f4f994c","title":"操作：让 Agent 检索该关键字"},{"parent":"db4d4eca-4296-4afe-a1cc-879934d2aca5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e2a83a64-1b62-40f7-a527-9224e659a4f5","title":"预期：结果被合理截断或分页并说明总数，不因结果过大卡死"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"db4d4eca-4296-4afe-a1cc-879934d2aca5","title":"🟡【P2】检索结果数量极大"},{"parent":"d88529ce-133e-4e06-a1dd-aac5007186dc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5c93dc60-ba84-4e80-91fc-ebb76f9e8c28","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"438cc50d-c75f-43d9-806f-e28522513ddf","title":"操作：让 Agent 在包含数万文件的项目中查找并修改指定文件"},{"parent":"5c93dc60-ba84-4e80-91fc-ebb76f9e8c28","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e27c1d6c-9854-4376-a294-9ae45a86be2c","title":"预期：定位准确，响应时间在可接受范围"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5c93dc60-ba84-4e80-91fc-ebb76f9e8c28","title":"🟡【P2】超大代码仓库中定位文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d88529ce-133e-4e06-a1dd-aac5007186dc","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5ace1f6e-bd4d-4c6f-98b1-a1d318a32a28","title":"Grep/Glob 检索工具"},{"parent":"863084f9-96ed-43ab-a63c-b5b45a8604d6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d9259a08-c595-4c5b-9b90-531dba592f3e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3b883437-dfeb-4ed2-a015-97ddc2fb8dfb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"92dfbef6-4b09-4651-9087-0195c963aeb8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b4ea42cc-dad7-4aa6-880a-caff5ab78e13","title":"操作：在消息中粘贴一个 URL 并让 Agent 基于其内容回答问题"},{"parent":"92dfbef6-4b09-4651-9087-0195c963aeb8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d7503a9d-bd24-4673-ac87-5b9c1d65d05c","title":"预期：Agent 能获取/理解 URL 指向的内容并据此作答（若不支持网络访问，应明确告知而非编造内容）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"92dfbef6-4b09-4651-9087-0195c963aeb8","title":"🔴【P0】引用URL内容"},{"parent":"3b883437-dfeb-4ed2-a015-97ddc2fb8dfb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4bcc6662-af69-46ac-8ebb-6e3eab53372f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"132c695d-23bf-4fb7-9d24-fe144975b7d1","title":"前置：网络可用"},{"parent":"4bcc6662-af69-46ac-8ebb-6e3eab53372f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e79695d9-1435-42ca-a371-76cbbb8dc8e3","title":"操作：让 Agent 抓取一个内容结构正常的页面"},{"parent":"4bcc6662-af69-46ac-8ebb-6e3eab53372f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3e4047a4-0d5d-4fa6-a545-72c64b157dbb","title":"预期：解析出可读正文；Agent 回答中引用的内容来自该页面实际内容"},{"parent":"4bcc6662-af69-46ac-8ebb-6e3eab53372f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a763d2e7-bc55-47a4-811c-a2ea48891275","title":"备注：来源 附件3 CC-022；附件3 CC-022"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4bcc6662-af69-46ac-8ebb-6e3eab53372f","title":"🟠【P1】正常页面抓取与正文解析"},{"parent":"3b883437-dfeb-4ed2-a015-97ddc2fb8dfb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e052eda1-42b5-412b-b87c-06deabae313f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a88409c1-567e-4076-9368-ac15b0bf1e8c","title":"前置：存在一个会发生跳转的地址"},{"