":"操作：让 Agent 抓取该页面"},{"parent":"43c51455-8da0-4110-bd74-39c6fa150a77","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"22754658-9b7c-484b-b033-ad42a0dfe452","title":"预期：不卡死，返回提取后的摘要或截断内容并说明已截断"},{"parent":"43c51455-8da0-4110-bd74-39c6fa150a77","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"28f7ae2b-9bb0-4d9f-a2dc-25b2feb57ffe","title":"备注：来源 附件3 CC-022；附件3 CC-022"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"43c51455-8da0-4110-bd74-39c6fa150a77","title":"🟡【P2】超大页面抓取"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bedf7ad3-e9ed-414a-971e-758c4f6d5168","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d9259a08-c595-4c5b-9b90-531dba592f3e","title":"WebFetch 工具"},{"parent":"863084f9-96ed-43ab-a63c-b5b45a8604d6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7849d3d1-c143-47f6-9b33-a504e3a3fcbe","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"849e437e-b8be-4c93-92c6-bf8a3ff59408","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"90cba12f-68e5-4443-9e96-9ae05fb17ae5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3fed1af2-d9fa-4513-a458-be1618657989","title":"操作：下发指令「搜索 xxx 最新信息」"},{"parent":"90cba12f-68e5-4443-9e96-9ae05fb17ae5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"35ff4eb7-8043-4dad-837e-0be17a60b76c","title":"预期：Agent 调用联网搜索工具，返回带来源引用的结果，不编造无来源信息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"90cba12f-68e5-4443-9e96-9ae05fb17ae5","title":"🔴【P0】Agent联网搜索信息"},{"parent":"849e437e-b8be-4c93-92c6-bf8a3ff59408","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f3f44630-8215-424f-a997-1ce78fa9570c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b6a9ea96-d45c-4772-a45f-ce4ad184c6f4","title":"前置：网络可用"},{"parent":"f3f44630-8215-424f-a997-1ce78fa9570c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f6eb5014-5a6f-46a4-8e9e-bfba46400cc0","title":"操作：让 Agent 分别用中文和英文关键词搜索，并打开其中一条结果"},{"parent":"f3f44630-8215-424f-a997-1ce78fa9570c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5d40d401-ce68-4073-9f4e-195226301ccb","title":"预期：两种语言均返回相关结果并附引用链接；链接可打开且与结果对应；回答内容来自搜索结果不编造"},{"parent":"f3f44630-8215-424f-a997-1ce78fa9570c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0a3865f9-933c-49b3-a9a9-ee7cbc02e7d6","title":"备注：来源 附件3 CC-023；附件3 CC-023"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f3f44630-8215-424f-a997-1ce78fa9570c","title":"🟠【P1】中英文关键词搜索与引用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"849e437e-b8be-4c93-92c6-bf8a3ff59408","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"7849d3d1-c143-47f6-9b33-a504e3a3fcbe","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a6150902-1431-480a-8142-30c388520235","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cafc713e-1cb2-4d13-acf7-a01b8d4f19b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"53ef412f-4293-486d-b16e-01c521ff770a","title":"前置：网络可用"},{"parent":"cafc713e-1cb2-4d13-acf7-a01b8d4f19b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7beed536-ea38-41bf-8211-cc51194b6994","title":"操作：让 Agent 搜索一个几乎不可能有结果的随机字符串"},{"parent":"cafc713e-1cb2-4d13-acf7-a01b8d4f19b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a7da80da-08ab-49b1-9554-d0b4a88be7d7","title":"预期：明确告知未找到相关结果，不编造内容也不返回无关结果冒充"},{"parent":"cafc713e-1cb2-4d13-acf7-a01b8d4f19b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a9e71b2e-e69c-4c14-ae09-9279c0733f2d","title":"备注：附件3 CC-023"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cafc713e-1cb2-4d13-acf7-a01b8d4f19b1","title":"🟠【P1】无结果关键词的处理"},{"parent":"a6150902-1431-480a-8142-30c388520235","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b539424c-3d82-4e81-a556-7841e3630923","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"782ddb59-3d57-4785-a530-a6712fba7e62","title":"前置：断开网络连接"},{"parent":"b539424c-3d82-4e81-a556-7841e3630923","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5aad7469-88d7-48d6-a4d0-4a0bb45c9b24","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一次联网搜索"},{"parent":"b539424c-3d82-4e81-a556-7841e3630923","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a3bfa7bd-3000-4e46-9b9a-929b9a2a2e32","title":"预期：明确提示网络不可用并给出重试入口，不长时间无响应也不编造结果"},{"parent":"b539424c-3d82-4e81-a556-7841e3630923","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4762114f-21e4-47bf-b5f4-2c40c1f1d324","title":"备注：附件3 CC-023"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b539424c-3d82-4e81-a556-7841e3630923","title":"🟠【P1】网络不可用时的搜索"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a6150902-1431-480a-8142-30c388520235","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"7849d3d1-c143-47f6-9b33-a504e3a3fcbe","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"41326c40-5730-4c4b-9408-f035debf8f9d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"de45c142-843a-4109-b2f8-5b0fe3a144d6","call