-2b6d-4159-baad-11ba6db85084","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"43950009-896e-4904-838d-6e39fae8e488","title":"预期：各步骤均成功；任务状态按创建到运行正确流转；列表中能查到该任务"},{"parent":"ca08ce87-2b6d-4159-baad-11ba6db85084","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ccc7ed9d-22d3-4117-9972-2c42bf095a13","title":"备注：来源 附件3 CC-021；附件3 CC-021"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ca08ce87-2b6d-4159-baad-11ba6db85084","title":"🟠【P1】任务创建、查询与更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b55dc792-a3d6-4c3b-836c-2d8f3c846bee","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"8b8c776a-0b16-411c-876d-c04047eb70ed","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6e7138f7-3704-4568-8e0a-30a8a5fb76c8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ac56e5d5-9af1-4c59-80d8-a5055c0f6797","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cea2349e-325f-43d9-a7fc-d2b425a987a8","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"ac56e5d5-9af1-4c59-80d8-a5055c0f6797","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a27c49a2-c4a8-4f2c-ac7c-e696a6fcc3f1","title":"操作：让 Agent 查询或停止一个不存在的任务 ID"},{"parent":"ac56e5d5-9af1-4c59-80d8-a5055c0f6797","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a38c662c-505c-4c90-b243-864869a32d94","title":"预期：返回任务不存在的明确提示，不报未捕获的底层错误"},{"parent":"ac56e5d5-9af1-4c59-80d8-a5055c0f6797","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ba256620-7d83-495b-b3af-82a1c28e1918","title":"备注：附件3 CC-021"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ac56e5d5-9af1-4c59-80d8-a5055c0f6797","title":"🟠【P1】操作不存在的任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6e7138f7-3704-4568-8e0a-30a8a5fb76c8","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"8b8c776a-0b16-411c-876d-c04047eb70ed","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b4e10800-6f87-4eb4-965c-418555aaf630","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4bb9d8db-397c-4321-92e1-ce1ed24bacd2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5e004f36-ec0a-4759-8f93-db4c058309e4","title":"前置：已创建数十个任务"},{"parent":"4bb9d8db-397c-4321-92e1-ce1ed24bacd2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9fa464ff-3ca6-4d89-b42f-2c37ea8d6281","title":"操作：让 Agent 列出并查询其中指定任务"},{"parent":"4bb9d8db-397c-4321-92e1-ce1ed24bacd2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0f109fca-18a1-42a3-8a6f-d02c0acb96dc","title":"预期：列表可完整获取，指定任务能被准确查到，不出现遗漏或串号"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4bb9d8db-397c-4321-92e1-ce1ed24bacd2","title":"🟡【P2】大量任务并存时的列表与查询"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b4e10800-6f87-4eb4-965c-418555aaf630","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8b8c776a-0b16-411c-876d-c04047eb70ed","title":"Task 任务生命周期"},{"parent":"863084f9-96ed-43ab-a63c-b5b45a8604d6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"201a388c-1d61-4f3b-9ea2-7801224864c3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a5a8ce12-41ca-4f6b-bee1-c751e27557a8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"05b3ccad-1a83-42c7-be6b-8c949eeb1ff3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5f83e941-4705-470c-bd21-6f8fd948db2e","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"05b3ccad-1a83-42c7-be6b-8c949eeb1ff3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bf389189-6159-461c-9418-961966ac09db","title":"操作：让 Agent 创建一个定时任务并查看任务列表"},{"parent":"05b3ccad-1a83-42c7-be6b-8c949eeb1ff3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"02acde35-067e-4061-be01-a0a894c48589","title":"预期：任务创建成功；列表中任务状态与下次触发时间展示准确"},{"parent":"05b3ccad-1a83-42c7-be6b-8c949eeb1ff3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0e4883c5-48b0-460b-ad08-e189f8016bd9","title":"备注：来源 附件3 CC-015；附件3 CC-015"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"05b3ccad-1a83-42c7-be6b-8c949eeb1ff3","title":"🟠【P1】定时任务创建与查看"},{"parent":"a5a8ce12-41ca-4f6b-bee1-c751e27557a8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"caecc0eb-6ee5-42d5-9f3e-1addb2095419","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ab3a2be4-3d13-49aa-bcfc-321b6fc2a04e","title":"前置：已存在定时任务"},{"parent":"caecc0eb-6ee5-42d5-9f3e-1addb2095419","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"336db489-f71d-4318-be17-897c6bdb9343","title":"操作：触发一次唤醒后删除该任务"},{"parent":"caecc0eb-6ee5-42d5-9f3e-1addb2095419","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"11ee3299-b5cd-4087-a7a4-4e79f645e26a","title":"预期：唤醒按预期执行；删除后任务从列表移除且不再触发"},{"parent":"caecc0eb-6ee5-42d5-9f3e-1addb2095419","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ac23a7f6-435f-4ce5-8420-3dfb93642ccb","title":"备注：来源 附件3 CC-015；附件3 CC-015"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"caecc0eb-6ee5-42d5-9f3e-1addb2095419","title":"🟠【P1】定时任务触发与删除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a5a8ce12-41ca-4f6b-bee1-c751e27557a8","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"201a388c-1d61-4f3b-9ea2-7801224864c3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4fc9fe58-ffbb-4d88-9605-e1f5c6001e7f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1530db97-65ce-4698-bbaf-7ba96299c9c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0d918d0d-1dd2-43f5-90dc-c390d3434edb","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"1530db97-65ce-4698-bbaf-7ba96299c9c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1dd4eda7-284a-4379-9371-3c16305c59d6","title":"操作：让 Agent 用一个非法的时间表达式创建定时任务"},{"parent":"1530db97-65ce-4698-bbaf-7ba96299c9c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cf479963-7acb-44b0-a965-711f8762d587","title":"预期：创建被拒绝并提示表达式非法，不创建出永不触发或立即狂触发的任务"},{"parent":"1530db97-65ce-4698-bbaf-7ba96299c9c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d1b41a2a-deed-45ff-9624-f52c1c41d7bd","title":"备注：附件3 CC-015"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1530db97-65ce-4698-bbaf-7ba96299c9c1","title":"🟡【P2】非法定时表达式"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4fc9fe58-ffbb-4d88-9605-e1f5c6001e7f","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"201a388c-1d61-4f3b-9ea2-7801224864c3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e65fa61a-bae0-44f2-b1d8-a46a3e4f5007","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"62ccbf45-15f5-4c1d-a51a-dbe6a77d052f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"74058d47-a169-45c8-8c2e-73a1a94ed590","title":"前置：已创建一个触发间隔很短的定时任务"},{"parent":"62ccbf45-15f5-4c1d-a51a-dbe6a77d052f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0b5744c7-cc73-4d15-b795-9acf25b74bcc","title":"操作：观察连续多次触发的执行情况"},{"parent":"62ccbf45-15f5-4c1d-a51a-dbe6a77d052f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5dc7ed74-e32c-438d-87d1-31b74331c0b5","title":"预期：按预期频率触发，不堆积未完成的执行，可随时删除停止"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"62ccbf45-15f5-4c1d-a51a-dbe6a77d052f","title":"🟡【P2】高频定时任务的触发"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e65fa61a-bae0-44f2-b1d8-a46a3e4f5007","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"201a388c-1d61-4f3b-9ea2-7801224864c3","title":"Cron 定时任务"},{"parent":"863084f9-96ed-43ab-a63c-b5b45a8604d6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d9b0e89d-2c87-4e14-b577-90463fdf7de1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6afe9306-930d-49b8-85ce-bccfdbd97a7f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f9507be5-522b-4b51-a5f6-47b15d48027e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4bb47b0f-7242-45dd-9ab1-cac9a96b9c02","title":"前置：工作流中包含人工确认节点"},{"parent":"f9507be5-522b-4b51-a5f6-47b15d48027e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"48b5e030-5cda-4b4e-ad2d-24a67d7a4e39","title":"操作：执行到确认节点时先不操作，观察一段时间后再确认"},{"parent":"f9507be5-522b-4b51-a5f6-47b15d48027e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a201c198-bef7-447b-93a4-9b1009d88162","title":"预期：确认节点持续等待用户操作不自动放行；确认后从该节点继续执行"},{"parent":"f9507be5-522b-4b51-a5f6-47b15d48027e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"87d0023a-f15f-475e-b352-4bf97a7f4e28","title":"备注：来源 附件3 CC-024；附件3 CC-024"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f9507be5-522b-4b51-a5f6-47b15d48027e","title":"🟠【P1】人工确认节点的等待与放行"},{"parent":"6afe9306-930d-49b8-85ce-bccfdbd97a7f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"93a863a2-4e81-4fff-a067-7cce6823d1bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f1a4cea7-9630-4e49-a99f-3e4a67e43a8d","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"93a863a2-4e81-4fff-a067-7cce6823d1bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7a383331-d7b1-40e9-a3b4-f524c3d292ec","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个包含多步骤与工具调用的工作流"},{"parent":"93a863a2-4e81-4fff-a067-7cce6823d1bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a6eef6b2-cd6e-4e1b-b40a-09b05eb59498","title":"预期：步骤按顺序执行，进度可见，每步的输入输出可查看"},{"parent":"93a863a2-4e81-4fff-a067-7cce6823d1bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0773cf3f-bbb3-49f7-abb9-65fba0ba1be6","title":"备注：来源 附件3 CC-024；附件3 CC-024"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"93a863a2-4e81-4fff-a067-7cce6823d1bf","title":"🟠【P1】多步骤工作流执行与进度"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6afe9306-930d-49b8-85ce-bccfdbd97a7f","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"d9b0e89d-2c87-4e14-b577-90463fdf7de1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7cfc3639-13f4-4cf6-aa34-d42f02502a2c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8be346b5-67a5-416a-973a-ac561208d19d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"393e703e-a004-4406-9d62-2c2338385139","title":"前置：工作流执行中"},{"parent":"8be346b5-67a5-416a-973a-ac561208d19d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"50a0feb8-9445-4161-b73c-acd07c4673d4","title":"操作：在其中一步故意拒绝，随后从该步重试"},{"parent":"8be346b5-67a5-416a-973a-ac561208d19d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09fb862c-d163-4001-b525-b05bbfcc4515","title":"预期：给出明确的失败步骤；可从该步恢复继续，不需要整体重跑"},{"parent":"8be346b5-67a5-416a-973a-ac561208d19d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5c512a2e-d7d2-4745-a4d4-07b1bbd3f880","title":"备注：来源 附件3 CC-024；附件3 CC-024"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8be346b5-67a5-416a-973a-ac561208d19d","title":"🟠【P1】步骤被拒绝后的恢复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7cfc3639-13f4-4cf6-aa34-d42f02502a2c","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"d9b0e89d-2c87-4e14-b577-90463fdf7de1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c03c8644-3a34-4583-9142-6dcf77b71684","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b14a1ff8-cdb7-4f8e-be1b-1d76c0301bf5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"10bb1b7e-648e-4d7d-b655-86b2f239bb91","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"b14a1ff8-cdb7-4f8e-be1b-1d76c0301bf5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"462f7f48-bc24-49d3-929f-7aef540d199d","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个包含数十个步骤的工作流"},{"parent":"b14a1ff8-cdb7-4f8e-be1b-1d76c0301bf5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bc0435dd-eabf-4ef7-9a69-0e0eb1e0cfa8","title":"预期：全部步骤按序完成，进度可查看，长列表可折叠不卡死"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b14a1ff8-cdb7-4f8e-be1b-1d76c0301bf5","title":"🟡【P2】步骤数很多的工作流"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c03c8644-3a34-4583-9142-6dcf77b71684","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d9b0e89d-2c87-4e14-b577-90463fdf7de1","title":"Workflow 工具"},{"parent":"863084f9-96ed-43ab-a63c-b5b45a8604d6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"56de0fca-5cba-419d-88a7-433d28f76ced","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"64fef463-39b5-4388-986f-e64e138b8596","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dd55d9c0-b254-4a8b-8383-49f3a9d4553e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"880ea88e-0840-403c-940c-5cb07af2464c","title":"前置：系统通知权限已开启"},{"parent":"dd55d9c0-b254-4a8b-8383-49f3a9d4553e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"acdf30cc-6383-4c06-b0f9-f99f4b738571","title":"操作：让 Agent 分别在应用前台和后台状态下触发通知"},{"parent":"dd55d9c0-b254-4a8b-8383-49f3a9d4553e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e8a7a594-48a8-4c83-a831-a9139ee630f4","title":"预期：两种状态下通知均及时送达且内容正确；点击通知能回到对应会话"},{"parent":"dd55d9c0-b254-4a8b-8383-49f3a9d4553e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"40ca5343-dfbb-4be8-b413-72310eaf8fd0","title":"备注：来源 附件3 CC-019；附件3 CC-019"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dd55d9c0-b254-4a8b-8383-49f3a9d4553e","title":"🟠【P1】前台与后台通知送达"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"64fef463-39b5-4388-986f-e64e138b8596","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"56de0fca-5cba-419d-88a7-433d28f76ced","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"169f65e5-4325-422b-b5d4-948fd6a2e8e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"72853b91-df4a-4e20-b802-3308b754c275","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7ce34c62-48b3-4657-a737-7e6de710a1cc","title":"前置：系统通知权限已关闭"},{"parent":"72853b91-df4a-4e20-b802-3308b754c275","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6cfb4904-0c60-4f99-b1a3-aab5244ded26","title":"操作：让 Agent 触发一次通知"},{"parent":"72853b91-df4a-4e20-b802-3308b754c275","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d5f4a41d-1b6b-4257-85a7-13b6b851372d","title":"预期：应用内仍有可见提示，并引导用户开启系统通知权限，不静默丢失"},{"parent":"72853b91-df4a-4e20-b802-3308b754c275","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"325d2007-6a47-4aa6-b4eb-63d5e749ec2f","title":"备注：附件3 CC-019"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"72853b91-df4a-4e20-b802-3308b754c275","title":"🟠【P1】系统通知权限关闭时"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"169f65e5-4325-422b-b5d4-948fd6a2e8e1","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"56de0fca-5cba-419d-88a7-433d28f76ced","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a852ca3c-be96-4ccc-980c-1fbddc47ff5f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"19ea2443-569e-43cd-af14-145096c0dc44","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"905d52bc-26c0-4e18-8d70-3ba869b33440","title":"前置：系统通知权限已开启"},{"parent":"19ea2443-569e-43cd-af14-145096c0dc44","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"687e699e-a279-4b7c-87a9-6badecdf6712","title":"操作：连续触发两次同类通知"},{"parent":"19ea2443-569e-43cd-af14-145096c0dc44","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"68a6615a-8a2a-4359-9a6f-4676edf47e9c","title":"预期：同类通知合并或抑制，不重复轰炸用户"},{"parent":"19ea2443-569e-43cd-af14-145096c0dc44","c