"children":[],"id":"266078b6-7f63-4814-88d4-c0bff02166fb","title":"备注：来源 附件3 CC-017；附件3 CC-017"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"94490d54-2377-4201-af85-fb7db4e6ed46","title":"🟠【P1】进入隔离工作区并隔离改动"},{"parent":"3e4fe8c2-2383-4c43-bcb1-c27abb4c0a3d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"84fde96d-4986-4f92-928b-6f31b4cc66cb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e2734df-09f9-46f9-a5ea-cce55851b454","title":"前置：Agent 处于隔离 worktree 中且已有改动"},{"parent":"84fde96d-4986-4f92-928b-6f31b4cc66cb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5ba49f18-c042-4fba-8b92-1b3e77a621e7","title":"操作：让 Agent 退出隔离工作区，查看分支与改动"},{"parent":"84fde96d-4986-4f92-928b-6f31b4cc66cb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8552c843-6249-461a-a415-8856ac987380","title":"预期：退出后分支与改动可追踪，状态明确；界面隔离标识同步消失"},{"parent":"84fde96d-4986-4f92-928b-6f31b4cc66cb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"53aaca3b-7c72-4be6-9bf5-eba591d53db3","title":"备注：来源 附件3 CC-017；附件3 CC-017"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"84fde96d-4986-4f92-928b-6f31b4cc66cb","title":"🟠【P1】退出隔离工作区与改动追踪"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3e4fe8c2-2383-4c43-bcb1-c27abb4c0a3d","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"3d8e5a41-52c5-4a0b-a511-60becd56bc36","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ca20f1e0-8dea-4de8-9138-a800fd4c261e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f704543b-22e3-4beb-ab7b-96a8f82c1ecf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"81cd0655-f40f-4238-97c5-0307f824f69f","title":"前置：Agent 处于隔离 worktree 中"},{"parent":"f704543b-22e3-4beb-ab7b-96a8f82c1ecf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d254b274-ab7e-4747-9ae6-0e45260856ca","title":"操作：在隔离执行期间从外部修改主工作区的同名文件"},{"parent":"f704543b-22e3-4beb-ab7b-96a8f82c1ecf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"341fa759-71f8-4cdf-9faf-37672a2304e8","title":"预期：两处改动互不覆盖；退出时对冲突有明确提示而非静默丢弃"},{"parent":"f704543b-22e3-4beb-ab7b-96a8f82c1ecf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"022ccd7a-0513-4561-b9d1-c284d8b2db60","title":"备注：附件3 CC-017"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f704543b-22e3-4beb-ab7b-96a8f82c1ecf","title":"🟡【P2】隔离期间主工作区被修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ca20f1e0-8dea-4de8-9138-a800fd4c261e","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"3d8e5a41-52c5-4a0b-a511-60becd56bc36","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"227c87c8-8009-4ed6-ae62-faf78f1fb4a1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8534a84c-efb5-4970-a59d-0af6ea50d72e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"721811da-1298-464a-bc11-e3abd0f2ba5a","title":"前置：Agent 处于隔离 worktree 中且有未提交改动"},{"parent":"8534a84c-efb5-4970-a59d-0af6ea50d72e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7df7312d-e4c4-4198-9ece-8ff5bf5770fc","title":"操作：退出应用后重新打开并查看该会话"},{"parent":"8534a84c-efb5-4970-a59d-0af6ea50d72e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eead2de4-bb64-48eb-8a9b-6537fcd7d226","title":"预期：隔离状态与改动可恢复或有明确说明，不产生无法清理的残留 worktree"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8534a84c-efb5-4970-a59d-0af6ea50d72e","title":"🟡【P2】隔离状态下应用退出后恢复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"227c87c8-8009-4ed6-ae62-faf78f1fb4a1","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3d8e5a41-52c5-4a0b-a511-60becd56bc36","title":"Worktree 隔离"},{"parent":"863084f9-96ed-43ab-a63c-b5b45a8604d6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"604e6184-56d6-4684-9cbe-008c3092787b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"55aaf806-8a90-49ae-bed3-4bfb420b3670","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e212a3df-75ea-4afc-994d-05d7b733e83f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"99e07330-fd81-49e9-8aa1-28e1c38841c7","title":"前置：前置：会话可正常执行；角色：房间成员；入口：Agent GUI 会话详情"},{"parent":"e212a3df-75ea-4afc-994d-05d7b733e83f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae5564d7-ae48-4dd2-a988-b18fdd726987","title":"操作：在 GUI 内触发提问并作答"},{"parent":"e212a3df-75ea-4afc-994d-05d7b733e83f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8087c50a-5b13-4267-a533-827d04e049ce","title":"预期：问题卡片在会话详情中展示并可作答；答案被正确的 Agent 接收并继续执行；调用详情中展示用户选择的选项"},{"parent":"e212a3df-75ea-4afc-994d-05d7b733e83f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e2ab4b0d-1480-45e7-866c-7404469d5ea6","title":"备注：附件3 CC-010"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e212a3df-75ea-4afc-994d-05d7b733e83f","title":"🟠【P1】在 Agent GUI 内作答"},{"parent":"55aaf806-8a90-49ae-bed3-4bfb420b3670","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4990c509-5060-470e-bf6b-b60b3082c8c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8abe0bee-7a2c-4b44-9940-ab2c6ad7c6cf","title":"前置：前置：会话可正常执行；角色：房间成员；入口：通知中心"},{"parent":"4990c509-5060-470e-bf6b-b60b3082c8c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"40bb465b-6b34-4d0e-a62b-aa3c0444cc24","title":"操作：让主会话触发提问，在通知中心查看等待卡片并作答"},{"parent":"4990c509-5060-470e-bf6b-b60b3082c8c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"01e3b186-791b-41c4-8546-6c0de27d0dea","title":"预期：通知中心的等待卡片完整展示问题与全部选项；作答后答案正确回传主会话；调用详情中展示用户实际选择的选项"},{"parent":"4990c509-5060-470e-bf6b-b60b3082c8c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0bbf7f54-5c96-41fd-a538-ef2113a7f8a5","title":"备注：附件3 CC-009"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4990c509-5060-470e-bf6b-b60b3082c8c0","title":"🟠【P1】在通知中心作答"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"55aaf806-8a90-49ae-bed3-4bfb420b3670","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"604e6184-56d6-4684-9cbe-008c3092787b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a8e86e89-5da9-4a52-b762-6995f82bb80a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9aa0bca3-cf1e-48e5-b505-25357a467864","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9941bab2-e7f9-4911-8681-e588c50da830","title":"前置：已触发提问卡片"},{"parent":"9aa0bca3-cf1e-48e5-b505-25357a467864","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e2d8769-6ad7-4067-845f-e56078c4c304","title":"操作：长时间不作答，观察会话与卡片状态"},{"parent":"9aa0bca3-cf1e-48e5-b505-25357a467864","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"241e0f0d-9452-4485-aecd-3a0d3fe1c9f7","title":"预期：会话保持等待且状态标识明确，不误判为已完成也不静默跳过提问"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9aa0bca3-cf1e-48e5-b505-25357a467864","title":"🟠【P1】长时间不作答的等待状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a8e86e89-5da9-4a52-b762-6995f82bb80a","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"604e6184-56d6-4684-9cbe-008c3092787b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7264e8f1-fafc-42a2-b499-6e7aebfd3680","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"79cf5a84-8dc3-4a24-a4a6-bc22998e9431","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4ca1d50-7839-4b9d-b6e3-dcf858708035","title":"前置：已触发含多个长文本选项的提问卡片"},{"parent":"79cf5a84-8dc3-4a24-a4a6-bc22998e9431","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e3f95e6-51f5-4e69-8ffa-b053f464d559","title":"操作：查看并选择其中一项"},{"parent":"79cf5a84-8dc3-4a24-a4a6-bc22998e9431","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1dae1ab3-55ba-469a-b8c6-667f7849300b","title":"预期：选项完整可读，超长文本合理换行或截断，选择结果准确回传"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"79cf5a84-8dc3-4a24-a4a6-bc22998e9431","title":"🟡【P2】选项数量多或选项文本超长"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7264e8f1-fafc-42a2-b499-6e7aebfd3680","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"604e6184-56d6-4684-9cbe-008c3092787b","title":"AskUserQuestion 工具"},{"parent":"863084f9-96ed-43ab-a63c-b5b45a8604d6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"37c1205a-6ef2-43cf-bd22-19e050126580","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"858f1815-2370-46b0-a61d-501ec9a4f0c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e259a648-076f-48d4-baae-ccee6e817d72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f5c42e36-c8c5-4bd1-b727-663263471d0d","title":"操作：下发指令「打开 xxx 网站并截图/提取信息」"},{"parent":"e259a648-076f-48d4-baae-ccee6e817d72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cf222e04-df9e-41bb-989b-e280a884a07b","title":"预期：Agent 正确调用浏览器工具完成操作，返回执行结果或截图"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e259a648-076f-48d4-baae-ccee6e817d72","title":"🔴【P0】Agent执行浏览器自动化操作"},{"parent":"858f1815-2370-46b0-a61d-501ec9a4f0c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1c499f68-7410-4504-bd41-24c6dc66f0c3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"73849d36-a55e-4992-9443-431829c081e8","title":"操作：在会话输入 /computer use 并发送"},{"parent":"1c499f68-7410-4504-bd41-24c6dc66f0c3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3a48453-577a-46f4-868d-8fc0d5e1cb49","title":"预期：能控制电脑做相关操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1c499f68-7410-4504-bd41-24c6dc66f0c3","title":"🔴【P0】输入 /computer use"},{"parent":"858f1815-2370-46b0-a61d-501ec9a4f0c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d245d7cf-3c14-4eaf-b7ea-7bc676a93824","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"84c28b31-9728-42be-96bd-f0563bc9db72","title":"操作：在会话输入 /browser 并发送"},{"parent":"d245d7cf-3c14-4eaf-b7ea-7bc676a93824","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"04ef845d-efd9-4c4e-bca1-b8883757342d","title":"预期：Agent 唤起浏览器相关能力（如打开/操作浏览器执行任务），对话内有对应的执行反馈；具体触发后的 UI 呈现方式（是否弹出确认、是否显示浏览器画面等）需与产品确认后补充更细的验证点"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d245d7cf-3c14-4eaf-b7ea-7bc676a93824","title":"🔴【P0】输入 /browser 触发浏览器能力"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"858f1815-2370-46b0-a61d-501ec9a4f0c4","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"37c1205a-6ef2-43cf-bd22-19e050126580","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"40b5fbb2-7489-4c6a-b52e-e3b3c78cf927","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7919fef7-3a2f-4978-9786-d370e9143568","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bc1aa175-2776-4d05-884e-0e919fa684a9","title":"前置：前置：共享 Claude 在线；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框工具选择与设置入口"},{"parent":"7919fef7-3a2f-4978-9786-d370e9143568","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cce8a73f-af36-44a8-a6de-b0cb852b5ccc","title":"操作：尝试选中 browser-use 并打开其设置"},{"parent":"7919fef7-3a2f-4978-9786-d370e9143568","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2be5e2a1-e6f7-4b82-a947-a39f6a311f5e","title":"预期：browser-use 可被选中且设置入口可点击；选中后共享 Agent 能使用该工具完成浏览任务；不支持时给出明确说明而非入口不可点击"},{"parent":"7919fef7-3a2f-4978-9786-d370e9143568","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aba2ce72-9c46-4298-b704-3224891b1bdf","title":"备注：#274 #87"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7919fef7-3a2f-4978-9786-d370e9143568","title":"🔴【P0】无法选中或配置浏览器工具"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"40b5fbb2-7489-4c6a-b52e-e3b3c78cf927","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"37c1205a-6ef2-43cf-bd22-19e050126580","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1e4952b4-e30f-4189-bb8f-a05d48d1daf6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ee390668-8481-4398-b70d-f7e6fea40fb1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4d48487e-c18d-4210-89ba-5027c2c1fec5","title":"前置：浏览器工具可用"},{"parent":"ee390668-8481-4398-b70d-f7e6fea40fb1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"898bcc22-4f49-487b-bb9f-5dd271baad8b","title":"操作：让 Agent 打开一个需要登录才能访问的页面"},{"parent":"ee390668-8481-4398-b70d-f7e6fea40fb1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c76e36d8-079c-45a5-9e26-4f69b4a8b89b","title":"预期：明确说明需要登录无法继续，不反复重试也不编造页面内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ee390668-8481-4398-b70d-f7e6fea40fb1","title":"🟡【P2】目标页面需要登录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1e4952b4-e30f-4189-bb8f-a05d48d1daf6","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"37c1205a-6ef2-43cf-bd22-19e050126580","title":"浏览器工具"},{"parent":"863084f9-96ed-43ab-a63c-b5b45a8604d6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7b275f03-fca7-4653-af76-c725f7c3ebca","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ae2ec988-b56a-4542-8f6d-2e22d9c5b41a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"baefa4b8-027c-41f2-9e4b-a9f47c4cd63f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ccba149a-290d-4cda-bd88-d1b003191627","title":"操作：让 Agent 将改动提交到本地 Git 仓库并生成提交信息"},{"parent":"baefa4b8-027c-41f2-9e4b-a9f47c4cd63f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bdd22e98-2cde-42c0-be31-0a6216790836","title":"预期：提交成功，commit message 合理反映改动内容，可在 git log 中查到"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"baefa4b8-027c-41f2-9e4b-a9f47c4cd63f","title":"🔴【P0】Agent执行Git提交（git commit）"},{"parent":"ae2ec988-b56a-4542-8f6d-2e22d9c5b41a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"92e05c7b-c0e8-44e0-9726-87cc0384904c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44b8b979-d2a1-494f-9d2e-03e6ae138641","title":"操作：下发指令「提交当前改动并写 commit message」"},{"parent":"92e05c7b-c0e8-44e0-9726-87cc0384904c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"838deb58-0863-469f-b2ca-946684c91512","title":"预期：Agent 正确执行 git add/commit，commit message 符合规范，可在 git log 中查看到"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"92e05c7b-c0e8-44e0-9726-87cc0384904c","title":"🔴【P0】Agent执行Git操作"},{"parent":"ae2ec988-b56a-4542-8f6d-2e22d9c5b41a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aff00a97-4be8-40a3-9ee1-2424b5e119c2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"93266b3a-1665-4330-af9d-774a09dbd90a","title":"操作：让 Agent 查看当前项目的改动状态和具体差异"},{"parent":"aff00a97-4be8-40a3-9ee1-2424b5e119c2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c5b9a422-63ee-4b1f-8716-ae774e9aea6c","title":"预期：返回结果与实际 git status / git diff 输出一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aff00a97-4be8-40a3-9ee1-2424b5e119c2","title":"🔴【P0】Agent执行Git状态与差异查看（git status/diff）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ae2ec988-b56a-4542-8f6d-2e22d9c5b41a","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"7b275f03-fca7-4653-af76-c725f7c3ebca","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5835b7a2-c86c-4c88-977f-5a107a937c32","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"066de3b0-909d-45cb-abf9-588be03a3b72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0d698e25-cddd-4079-812c-1e9973a81b0d","title":"操作：让 Agent 提交时远端存在冲突的改动"},{"parent":"066de3b0-909d-45cb-abf9-588be03a3b72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ad48b0d0-94e9-426c-895a-1104f7e48ef3","title":"预期：明确提示冲突，不强制覆盖，需要用户介入解决"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"066de3b0-909d-45cb-abf9-588be03a3b72","title":"🟠【P1】Git操作产生冲突"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5835b7a2-c86c-4c88-977f-5a107a937c32","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"7b275f03-fca7-4653-af76-c725f7c3ebca","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dee08120-d10f-4335-ba96-70722d90b9f6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0391711e-b6ed-456c-b130-f182d8bfab09","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"19deb578-2eee-4325-a30e-4e12dfaffff7","title":"前置：当前项目不是 Git 仓库"},{"parent":"0391711e-b6ed-456c-b130-f182d8bfab09","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c5e06c0e-e822-4974-ab90-3eb631c02fd0","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行 git status 或提交操作"},{"parent":"0391711e-b6ed-456c-b130-f182d8bfab09","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"967c7f21-832e-44c1-8251-e81fc4056eef","title":"预期：明确提示当前目录不是 Git 仓库，不报未捕获的底层错误"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0391711e-b6ed-456c-b130-f182d8bfab09","title":"🟡【P2】在非 Git 目录执行 Git 操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dee08120-d10f-4335-ba96-70722d90b9f6","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7b275f03-fca7-4653-af76-c725f7c3ebca","title":"Git 操作"},{"parent":"863084f9-96ed-43ab-a63c-b5b45a8604d6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ab7eebbd-b4ae-41bb-8fe1-7be092f6efd8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"32aa0b19-7037-49c9-871a-2eeb0bca04f2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1133b436-bbfa-4c62-9fca-6052640c1f7d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c1f7676d-5789-46a7-8adb-511fb3aad01b","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行 npm install / pip install 安装项目依赖"},{"parent":"1133b436-bbfa-4c62-9fca-6052640c1f7d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd0190c8-de55-48e9-8979-0f1cf9eb58ca","title":"预期：Agent 正确选择包管理器工具并执行，安装结果（成功/失败、新增依赖版本）在对话中如实反馈"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1133b436-bbfa-4c62-9fca-6052640c1f7d","title":"🔴【P0】Agent执行包管理器命令"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"32aa0b19-7037-49c9-871a-2eeb0bca04f2","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"ab7eebbd-b4ae-41bb-8fe1-7be092f6efd8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c50127e4-7771-42a8-a65e-8213d2f41c67","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6602b560-6243-4976-b3c3-ace7251e0153","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aab52949-6b4d-4618-ada3-1c5966c5f7be","title":"前置：项目已打开"},{"parent":"6602b560-6243-4976-b3c3-ace7251e0153","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2097c0a8-4e61-4971-9d8b-d6172a5a7f3f","title":"操作：让 Agent 安装一个不存在的包名"},{"parent":"6602b560-6243-4976-b3c3-ace7251e0153","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5065d572-b9fe-4a8a-bee1-af2b5c3edc01","title":"预期：如实返回安装失败与错误输出，不谎称安装成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6602b560-6243-4976-b3c3-ace7251e0153","title":"🟠【P1】安装不存在的依赖包"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c50127e4-7771-42a8-a65e-8213d2f41c67","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"ab7eebbd-b4ae-41bb-8fe1-7be092f6efd8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a9f4d8a3-3542-424a-b0e2-36903c9aac2a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d6372ea4-40a5-451b-9abb-0f139a504517","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ec3391a3-c95c-4bd4-9b32-24b0f51066ec","title":"前置：项目同时存在多种锁文件"},{"parent":"d6372ea4-40a5-451b-9abb-0f139a504517","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a80d6fc2-75c7-4e08-bdd8-463576a25874","title":"操作：让 Agent 安装依赖"},{"parent":"d6372ea4-40a5-451b-9abb-0f139a504517","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6d908c7a-edd4-4283-9131-99fa9f72b2f7","title":"预期：选择与锁文件一致的包管理器，或明确询问用户，不随意混用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d6372ea4-40a5-451b-9abb-0f139a504517","title":"🟡【P2】项目中存在多种包管理器"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a9f4d8a3-3542-424a-b0e2-36903c9aac2a","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ab7eebbd-b4ae-41bb-8fe1-7be092f6efd8","title":"包管理器操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"863084f9-96ed-43ab-a63c-b5b45a8604d6","title":"5.3 工具能力矩阵"},{"parent":"676dc7a3-3959-4469-a5c5-68898be80f72","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dce6d73e-0640-4114-a53b-3114047ed1ec","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"28a7f955-b4df-4273-85a3-bd7b1aff9ace","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ff6d5347-c23c-4ce8-8412-149f56785939","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5e2d2057-05a8-439f-9093-069f25cdb858","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e300ec0-13bd-4157-9858-e41f0264d4ed","title":"操作：指令「在 workspace 新建 a/b 文件夹，内部创建 test.txt、data.csv」"},{"parent":"5e2d2057-05a8-439f-9093-069f25cdb858","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0a825852-63c0-4263-9742-83de1eed5778","title":"预期：房间文件目录生成对应层级文件夹与文件，路径结构符合要求"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5e2d2057-05a8-439f-9093-069f25cdb858","title":"🔴【P0】让Agent创建多个文件和文件夹"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ff6d5347-c23c-4ce8-8412-149f56785939","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"28a7f955-b4df-4273-85a3-bd7b1aff9ace","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"44f64879-b017-461d-8b53-ad70d453becc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"613679e7-6b9a-49b5-8ccc-66b50c429306","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"034e0747-bff8-4269-acc6-27b587d1a99b","title":"前置：会话已绑定项目"},{"parent":"613679e7-6b9a-49b5-8ccc-66b50c429306","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f1ba77b2-0192-4f9c-9fe7-7ad467374690","title":"操作：让 Agent 在一个不存在的多层目录下创建文件"},{"parent":"613679e7-6b9a-49b5-8ccc-66b50c429306","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"34a7e529-cd9d-4624-bef1-382c0af03e80","title":"预期：自动创建父目录后写入，或明确提示目录不存在，不静默失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"613679e7-6b9a-49b5-8ccc-66b50c429306","title":"🟠【P1】目标目录不存在时创建文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"44f64879-b017-461d-8b53-ad70d453becc","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"28a7f955-b4df-4273-85a3-bd7b1aff9ace","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2abfe97c-92f2-412d-9483-1165b98783e7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"57dc8196-2f19-44b1-abf2-edf645c82fc2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"90e83d17-03b7-4d8e-83b7-2c6e5ec775f9","title":"前置：会话已绑定项目"},{"parent":"57dc8196-2f19-44b1-abf2-edf645c82fc2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5dd41938-735b-4286-914d-a15360187c53","title":"操作：让 Agent 一次性创建上百个文件"},{"parent":"57dc8196-2f19-44b1-abf2-edf645c82fc2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"435935f4-c16e-4dab-9eaa-23d1e6b6673e","title":"预期：全部按预期创建，卡片可折叠展示，界面不卡死"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"57dc8196-2f19-44b1-abf2-edf645c82fc2","title":"🟡【P2】一次创建大量文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2abfe97c-92f2-412d-9483-1165b98783e7","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"28a7f955-b4df-4273-85a3-bd7b1aff9ace","title":"文件创建与修改"},{"parent":"dce6d73e-0640-4114-a53b-3114047ed1ec","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b3c34daa-e67a-484b-9c41-c819eced2f1a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dbec0660-e4fb-4662-b548-89636fae032b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2aea0cd7-f131-4e67-9d5e-b589bb3bf91d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6171809b-111f-40ad-b7cf-c5c56d36a835","title":"操作：依次下发指令生成 ppt、pdf、excel、csv、doc、zip 等格式文件"},{"parent":"2aea0cd7-f131-4e67-9d5e-b589bb3bf91d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cf12131a-145b-4797-91ac-da68dbc5813c","title":"预期：每种格式文档均可生成，会话出现文件卡片，支持预览、下载、跳转文件目录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2aea0cd7-f131-4e67-9d5e-b589bb3bf91d","title":"🔴【P0】Agent 生成文档"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dbec0660-e4fb-4662-b548-89636fae032b","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"b3c34daa-e67a-484b-9c41-c819eced2f1a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cc2794a1-e494-49d8-8290-7dcacb8a900a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"856d37a7-caf9-4808-83e5-0f3f88a9411d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"26cec212-7ec3-4cd5-8017-38fe09a89da7","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"856d37a7-caf9-4808-83e5-0f3f88a9411d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"178716c4-7dbe-4242-938f-c99221a33f48","title":"操作：让 Agent 生成一种不支持的文档格式"},{"parent":"856d37a7-caf9-4808-83e5-0f3f88a9411d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"338e10c3-fbc0-42d9-a18a-4f52b77eec5a","title":"预期：明确说明不支持并给出可用的替代格式，不产出损坏文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"856d37a7-caf9-4808-83e5-0f3f88a9411d","title":"🟠【P1】生成不支持格式的文档"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cc2794a1-e494-49d8-8290-7dcacb8a900a","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"b3c34daa-e67a-484b-9c41-c819eced2f1a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"37412f07-903c-4061-8fe6-868fc46f1262","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0f501194-89ec-4d2e-bd3d-355bfa17203f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6028bda2-a0ed-4ae1-b77b-a12730b5f85a","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"0f501194-89ec-4d2e-bd3d-355bfa17203f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a0974a83-898b-4df0-9cff-13bfbd84ee7d","title":"操作：让 Agent 生成一个包含大量内容的文档"},{"parent":"0f501194-89ec-4d2e-bd3d-355bfa17203f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d1e761c0-2c57-4bc2-bad7-d8e1f8e2e857","title":"预期：文档完整生成可预览与下载，内容不截断，生成过程有进度反馈"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0f501194-89ec-4d2e-bd3d-355bfa17203f","title":"🟡【P2】生成内容体量很大的文档"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"37412f07-903c-4061-8fe6-868fc46f1262","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b3c34daa-e67a-484b-9c41-c819eced2f1a","title":"文档格式生成"},{"parent":"dce6d73e-0640-4114-a53b-3114047ed1ec","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"56a2c319-f44b-45b3-9291-3a9d33d27ed1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c6d31313-28fc-45cd-9ce2-75245999a441","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b60f4543-20a4-4ec1-b1ae-1ee8cee1ab72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"281c5482-c6db-4233-af22-87a9dfc6f32e","title":"操作：在不是git目录的项目下让 Agent 同时修改多个文件，完成后在文件卡片上点击撤销"},{"parent":"b60f4543-20a4-4ec1-b1ae-1ee8cee1ab72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4de19dd6-f347-4b5a-99f6-04a9a6e1246c","title":"预期：显示当前目录不是 Git 仓库，无法撤销变更 可以撤销成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b60f4543-20a4-4ec1-b1ae-1ee8cee1ab72","title":"🔴【P0】在不是git目录下点击撤销"},{"parent":"c6d31313-28fc-45cd-9ce2-75245999a441","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4ff9b46b-ed8f-4321-9504-3487ebcce1c7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c9e3ef3a-dd7d-4178-8dec-16704fb9dc7e","title":"操作：在是git目录的项目下让 Agent 同时修改多个文件，完成后在文件卡片上点击撤销"},{"parent":"4ff9b46b-ed8f-4321-9504-3487ebcce1c7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f87a4b29-affb-4b5d-a057-d244df08e51a","title":"预期：可以撤销成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4ff9b46b-ed8f-4321-9504-3487ebcce1c7","title":"🔴【P0】在是git目录下点击撤销"},{"parent":"c6d31313-28fc-45cd-9ce2-75245999a441","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4c0c1969-e7dd-4616-b962-f5ac907c0466","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"97f57725-aa8b-4c0a-a5ec-ffe3a3335019","title":"操作：在是git目录的项目下让 Agent 同时修改多个文件，完成后在文件卡片上点击撤销，撤销成功后点击重新应用"},{"parent":"4c0c1969-e7dd-4616-b962-f5ac907c0466","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ee32c42c-505a-469b-8ab4-615d0f8efb23","title":"预期：可以撤销成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4c0c1969-e7dd-4616-b962-f5ac907c0466","title":"🔴【P0】撤销后点击重新应用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c6d31313-28fc-45cd-9ce2-75245999a441","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"56a2c319-f44b-45b3-9291-3a9d33d27ed1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"15a428d6-206b-4c5f-8051-65e432457f33","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e8a63636-6634-4005-a1cd-5122f72f972f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ab081c22-9859-4b40-8b97-0e0853ef42f3","title":"前置：Agent 已产生文件改动"},{"parent":"e8a63636-6634-4005-a1cd-5122f72f972f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bea013b7-04b2-42c0-a532-e8aad09c1119","title":"操作：在外部编辑器中修改该文件后再点击撤销"},{"parent":"e8a63636-6634-4005-a1cd-5122f72f972f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"23d97b70-3ed2-434e-8c51-4856a7ddb4d1","title":"预期：给出冲突提示并让用户确认，不直接覆盖外部改动"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e8a63636-6634-4005-a1cd-5122f72f972f","title":"🟠【P1】撤销时文件已被外部修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"15a428d6-206b-4c5f-8051-65e432457f33","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"56a2c319-f44b-45b3-9291-3a9d33d27ed1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d5100c3f-fd4c-4acb-b037-f7ea301b9918","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b2b7f278-7a98-4b6a-8a02-5f9b39c0b5b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"538526e1-bd34-4ad0-abbb-69191032f37e","title":"前置：Agent 对同一文件产生了多次改动"},{"parent":"b2b7f278-7a98-4b6a-8a02-5f9b39c0b5b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3e4cd7be-b11e-4b8e-9fca-970f5428f348","title":"操作：在多张卡片上依次点击撤销"},{"parent":"b2b7f278-7a98-4b6a-8a02-5f9b39c0b5b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f5fadcf3-5615-4b5a-8377-c3d4c5b087cb","title":"预期：每次撤销只回退对应那次改动，顺序正确，最终状态与预期一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b2b7f278-7a98-4b6a-8a02-5f9b39c0b5b1","title":"🟡【P2】多次改动后逐次撤销"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d5100c3f-fd4c-4acb-b037-f7ea301b9918","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"56a2c319-f44b-45b3-9291-3a9d33d27ed1","title":"撤销与重新应用"},{"parent":"dce6d73e-0640-4114-a53b-3114047ed1ec","callout":[],"children":[{"pa