有明确提示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e3be55f9-f1cf-486c-868d-732df1dced04","title":"🟡【P2】同一项目多个会话并发改同一文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"435eb4e0-28bd-4b51-8937-0986c1a4efb3","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"696d86a2-b4d0-43bc-b6df-8ce256ec912e","title":"执行环境隔离"},{"parent":"dce6d73e-0640-4114-a53b-3114047ed1ec","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8141d1d0-b18a-405e-92af-79c1fd13edff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8b242505-c0be-4062-ba95-55a3bb13c8c6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f4b307c5-29d7-4cd4-95f8-2c62a87372ad","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7f4126b8-fc45-435e-8484-05461b4b9f38","title":"前置：会话处于需要授权的权限模式"},{"parent":"f4b307c5-29d7-4cd4-95f8-2c62a87372ad","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"213048e4-01aa-436d-a753-7f1633636528","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一次需要授权的文件写入并同意授权"},{"parent":"f4b307c5-29d7-4cd4-95f8-2c62a87372ad","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6b80e680-5042-432b-aff2-aed9eb0353f6","title":"预期：授权后操作正常执行，文件按预期落盘并生成变更卡片"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f4b307c5-29d7-4cd4-95f8-2c62a87372ad","title":"🔴【P0】授权后的敏感文件操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8b242505-c0be-4062-ba95-55a3bb13c8c6","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"8141d1d0-b18a-405e-92af-79c1fd13edff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"37652f24-2738-460a-9d71-dd20781b0673","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e6eda22f-8236-4d42-ba9b-c50052165fa1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0713b152-ef41-41bd-b0a4-6a0a63321410","title":"操作：拒绝 Agent 的敏感操作授权"},{"parent":"e6eda22f-8236-4d42-ba9b-c50052165fa1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"279b68e0-d1ac-45ac-93a4-b294a7910728","title":"预期：任务停止或等待，明确说明未执行该操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e6eda22f-8236-4d42-ba9b-c50052165fa1","title":"🔴【P0】权限被拒绝"},{"parent":"37652f24-2738-460a-9d71-dd20781b0673","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"375a8851-ef37-409d-9691-b1ca55a81065","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b4fb5c84-5f1d-408f-ace2-dba774ed3935","title":"操作：让 Agent 写入无权限目录"},{"parent":"375a8851-ef37-409d-9691-b1ca55a81065","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ddcc8c10-d958-4f68-b64b-169da41f43ba","title":"预期：操作被阻止并提示权限限制，不绕过安全边界"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"375a8851-ef37-409d-9691-b1ca55a81065","title":"🟡【P2】沙箱限制"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"37652f24-2738-460a-9d71-dd20781b0673","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"8141d1d0-b18a-405e-92af-79c1fd13edff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5ba429bf-aa18-4cee-89ad-6f986ac562bf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fdd3551d-98ef-4f39-81e2-69ecac127764","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e13c21aa-c8e6-4485-8abd-981493b5f963","title":"前置：会话已绑定项目"},{"parent":"fdd3551d-98ef-4f39-81e2-69ecac127764","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e69dca6a-e159-4bdb-b4d7-d5406fa134e1","title":"操作：让 Agent 读写项目目录之外的文件"},{"parent":"fdd3551d-98ef-4f39-81e2-69ecac127764","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a30d5017-2ab3-4569-afb2-32c4e7fa1552","title":"预期：按当前权限模式拦截或要求授权，不静默越界操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fdd3551d-98ef-4f39-81e2-69ecac127764","title":"🟡【P2】操作项目根目录之外的路径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5ba429bf-aa18-4cee-89ad-6f986ac562bf","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8141d1d0-b18a-405e-92af-79c1fd13edff","title":"文件操作权限边界"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dce6d73e-0640-4114-a53b-3114047ed1ec","title":"5.4 文件读写行为"},{"parent":"676dc7a3-3959-4469-a5c5-68898be80f72","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4aceadef-608c-41d4-82e5-5d01e5df8495","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"38e1c5f1-d7c5-44eb-9e21-489b2eeb9309","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dfcdc524-7e97-4946-ba45-efdde41725b5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f5cb93e5-8cc3-4162-818f-cff4c5d52ea5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b8c01e94-9e71-4221-b544-9a452673f7df","title":"操作：让 Agent 修改已有 README.md"},{"parent":"f5cb93e5-8cc3-4162-818f-cff4c5d52ea5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"461e6e8a-a6e6-49c3-a832-94bf827d91e9","title":"预期：展示 diff 或变更摘要，能打开查看具体改动"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f5cb93e5-8cc3-4162-818f-cff4c5d52ea5","title":"🔴【P0】修改文件卡片"},{"parent":"dfcdc524-7e97-4946-ba45-efdde41725b5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5efcb22a-03d9-403d-9ab4-a6f38364b92f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"88498ba