"parent":"7ef9b5b0-9c35-4463-b0b0-832fbe083db7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b984b5d5-3872-46c1-849c-51064e4e362e","title":"预期：消息区出现新增文件卡片，展示文件名、路径和变更状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7ef9b5b0-9c35-4463-b0b0-832fbe083db7","title":"🔴【P0】新增文件卡片"},{"parent":"dfcdc524-7e97-4946-ba45-efdde41725b5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6992c96b-d80f-4802-b51f-0324083c11cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"78c5bc35-f14c-4470-a9bd-d5734382ccfc","title":"操作：让 Agent 新建并编辑 notes.md，claude使用write / edit ，codex使用 apply_patch工具"},{"parent":"6992c96b-d80f-4802-b51f-0324083c11cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"87ac1c1e-96ba-49f0-ab69-169ced7248f0","title":"预期：消息区出现新增文件卡片，展示文件名、路径和变更状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6992c96b-d80f-4802-b51f-0324083c11cd","title":"🔴【P0】调用 write / edit / apply_patch工具显示文件卡片"},{"parent":"dfcdc524-7e97-4946-ba45-efdde41725b5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1281ff0e-fd3a-4bf8-b806-748de828f2fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"af298b3e-837c-4da4-804e-ee73a1dd6784","title":"前置：前置：会话已绑定项目；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"1281ff0e-fd3a-4bf8-b806-748de828f2fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a0f6f573-1f4a-4813-97e9-812a67ba16cd","title":"操作：先让 Agent 修改单个文件，再让其一次修改多个文件，查看文件变更卡片"},{"parent":"1281ff0e-fd3a-4bf8-b806-748de828f2fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"45a0ea0c-d8c0-45ec-b60b-3030b17e9995","title":"预期：两种情况均生成变更卡片并准确展示变更文件、diff 与状态；多文件时逐个可展开；卡片中的文件数量与实际变更一致"},{"parent":"1281ff0e-fd3a-4bf8-b806-748de828f2fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a7cc160c-fb77-4fb5-94fd-b154feddf9a3","title":"备注：附件3 CC-027"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1281ff0e-fd3a-4bf8-b806-748de828f2fc","title":"🟠【P1】单文件与多文件变更展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dfcdc524-7e97-4946-ba45-efdde41725b5","title":"正常场景（8）"},{"parent":"38e1c5f1-d7c5-44eb-9e21-489b2eeb9309","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"428740ee-41a6-45a2-8a4b-63c7a556abd6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7617c388-02df-4ac4-ba0b-53b8993ec49b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a44aaafe-61c3-4404-bdc6-5edab9daa3f7","title":"前置：目标目录无写权限"},{"parent":"7617c388-02df-4ac4-ba0b-53b8993ec49b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6d87ff31-f9f8-49ca-a783-9f1ae9072c85","title":"操作：让 Agent 向该目录写入文件"},{"parent":"7617c388-02df-4ac4-ba0b-53b8993ec49b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea1263fc-88f7-479d-90b5-636ecb9c8f93","title":"预期：不生成表示成功的变更卡片；以失败信息呈现实际结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7617c388-02df-4ac4-ba0b-53b8993ec49b","title":"🟠【P1】写入失败时不生成成功卡片"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"428740ee-41a6-45a2-8a4b-63c7a556abd6","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"38e1c5f1-d7c5-44eb-9e21-489b2eeb9309","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9aea6782-8703-45bd-97d8-ffc02e0277eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e3e80cb1-1ffa-4b41-b730-f83420df9e56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c55c56db-fe84-469f-a3e1-054673e2ea91","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"e3e80cb1-1ffa-4b41-b730-f83420df9e56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb71d120-2c09-4391-a19d-0d39b09ef78f","title":"操作：让 Agent 在同一轮中创建一个文件随后删除它"},{"parent":"e3e80cb1-1ffa-4b41-b730-f83420df9e56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44acfc9e-9151-478e-b3c0-05e616786e4d","title":"预期：卡片最终状态与实际文件状态一致，不残留指向不存在文件的卡片"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e3e80cb1-1ffa-4b41-b730-f83420df9e56","title":"🟡【P2】创建后立即删除的文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9aea6782-8703-45bd-97d8-ffc02e0277eb","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"38e1c5f1-d7c5-44eb-9e21-489b2eeb9309","title":"卡片生成规则"},{"parent":"4aceadef-608c-41d4-82e5-5d01e5df8495","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"37449029-6004-40fa-b5c9-2236edc5cfdf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"684b278b-7266-4399-9fd3-66c1730d19e8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ea06acc7-4b77-4514-aed1-07e8e5cdc273","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7ab519c2-ad05-4d8e-906a-54513fae19c9","title":"前置：Agent 已修改文件并生成卡片"},{"parent":"ea06acc7-4b77-4514-aed1-07e8e5cdc273","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d9437b55-b1c1-4e94-999d-79fbe9ba249e","title":"操作：展开卡片查看具体变更内容"},{"parent":"ea06acc7-4b77-4514-aed1-07e8e5cdc273","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bf46252e-0015-4804-a6f6-938aa1a3cf1e","title":"预期：展示实际的新增与删除行数及内容，与文件实际改动一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ea06acc7-4b77-4514-aed1-07e8e5cdc273","title":"🔴【P0】展开查看变更 diff"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"684b278b-7266-4399-9fd3-66c1730d19e8","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"37449029-6004-40fa-b5c9-2236edc5cfdf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"139822e4-df05-40b2-9edc-2d3bb3ad28f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"47be28a4-217b-456f-a668-1889f3174796","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"232ef290-0e62-4f9d-8720-7e35d97321d5","title":"前置：前置：会话可正常执行；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"47be28a4-217b-456f-a668-1889f3174796","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"78dd2865-fb33-4d3c-b727-2071175fdcf6","title":"操作：让 Agent 批量写入一组包含空格路径与中文名的文件，核对文件变更卡片中的数量"},{"parent":"47be28a4-217b-456f-a668-1889f3174796","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e8c91a7-16be-4283-9afb-4f08697ed0ce","title":"预期：卡片中的文件数量与实际写入的文件数量一致，含空格与中文路径的文件均被计入；点击每个文件均可打开对应内容"},{"parent":"47be28a4-217b-456f-a668-1889f3174796","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a670d040-1019-4574-8ccb-e47a10d1c5a4","title":"备注：附件3 CC-014"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"47be28a4-217b-456f-a668-1889f3174796","title":"🔴【P0】卡片文件数量与实际写入不一致"},{"parent":"139822e4-df05-40b2-9edc-2d3bb3ad28f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"29a74323-eac1-472e-b450-8c9d988260b2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"720a3801-23d2-4420-a6bc-69cf7af29ea3","title":"前置：前置：会话可正常执行；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"29a74323-eac1-472e-b450-8c9d988260b2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ed3ec9d2-a8b8-47c2-8097-89c99fed2392","title":"操作：让 Agent 使用写入与编辑工具各修改一个文件，查看文件卡片及其变更详情，隔较长时间后重新打开该会话"},{"parent":"29a74323-eac1-472e-b450-8c9d988260b2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"452fb5bd-8fe5-4d99-86dd-9ad82e999df7","title":"预期：每次文件写入与编辑都生成文件卡片；卡片显示实际的新增与删除行数而非 +0 -0；可展开查看具体变更内容；再次打开历史会话时卡片与变更详情仍然存在"},{"parent":"29a74323-eac1-472e-b450-8c9d988260b2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"67d0c426-10e5-4085-8ece-9837aaf19046","title":"备注：#38 #52 #66 #49 #81"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"29a74323-eac1-472e-b450-8c9d988260b2","title":"🔴【P0】文件卡片缺失或变更数字为空"},{"parent":"139822e4-df05-40b2-9edc-2d3bb3ad28f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1d26f2a9-3d06-458a-8522-3f8870a91780","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3692bac2-bc0d-431c-a37b-df1834620d06","title":"前置：前置：Agent 在执行过程中创建后又删除了某文件；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情文件卡片"},{"parent":"1d26f2a9-3d06-458a-8522-3f8870a91780","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0f498046-1a18-49be-ae41-743341952a77","title":"操作：任务结束后查看文件卡片列表"},{"parent":"1d26f2a9-3d06-458a-8522-3f8870a91780","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"822a70c9-ab46-4f5b-b8f5-23385ebf8205","title":"预期：已被删除的文件不再展示在文件卡片中，或明确标记为已删除；点击时不出现读取不到文件的报错"},{"parent":"1d26f2a9-3d06-458a-8522-3f8870a91780","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"86d353cb-3bf2-45e1-9da7-dfcd461dc4d9","title":"备注：#29"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1d26f2a9-3d06-458a-8522-3f8870a91780","title":"🔴【P0】运行中被删除的文件仍显示在卡片上"},{"parent":"139822e4-df05-40b2-9edc-2d3bb3ad28f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e70efae1-7971-42d4-9f3b-5f9a921819fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c02a162f-2df0-4b52-a680-7196e13cd108","title":"操作：让 Agent 修改图片或二进制文件"},{"parent":"e70efae1-7971-42d4-9f3b-5f9a921819fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c5a5301a-27eb-4330-b336-71f900847731","title":"预期：不展示乱码 diff，显示二进制文件变更提示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e70efae1-7971-42d4-9f3b-5f9a921819fc","title":"🟠【P1】二进制文件变更"},{"parent":"139822e4-df05-40b2-9edc-2d3bb3ad28f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e991cf68-bae8-40d7-9842-ba7d6ec0d786","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5d1f8454-7691-4ddc-bc5b-bbcb8c92188d","title":"操作：模拟 diff 解析异常"},{"parent":"e991cf68-bae8-40d7-9842-ba7d6ec0d786","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"795381f6-cec8-4d29-b381-bb80f43c2bd2","title":"预期：展示原始变更摘要或错误提示，不影响对话继续"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e991cf68-bae8-40d7-9842-ba7d6ec0d786","title":"🟡【P2】变更解析失败"},{"parent":"139822e4-df05-40b2-9edc-2d3bb3ad28f7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6ad35e25-1d7e-4209-90d3-70884f24b70f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ce144fc3-26bd-4f8b-ac5d-bd9001753acf","title":"操作：文件无读取权限时点击 diff"},{"parent":"6ad35e25-1d7e-4209-90d3-70884f24b70f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"486cecfa-df47-44de-a145-94e4741f216e","title":"预期：提示无权限，不泄露文件内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6ad35e25-1d7e-4209-90d3-70884f24b70f","title":"🟡【P2】无权限查看 diff"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"139822e4-df05-40b2-9edc-2d3bb3ad28f7","title":"异常场景（6）"},{"parent":"37449029-6004-40fa-b5c9-2236edc5cfdf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bb3ebaa0-2eb9-43c8-809f-f9ce1e129ec2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9c265388-0088-4ec5-a09d-de7aa0f654a8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fba3e145-e7ea-4202-8223-37ce810bf1c6","title":"操作：修改超过 5000 行的文件"},{"parent":"9c265388-0088-4ec5-a09d-de7aa0f654a8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cc0aa30e-07a7-4753-879d-a9ab9ad89881","title":"预期：diff 支持折叠、懒加载或提示过大，页面不卡死"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9c265388-0088-4ec5-a09d-de7aa0f654a8","title":"🟡【P2】超大 diff"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bb3ebaa0-2eb9-43c8-809f-f9ce1e129ec2","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"37449029-6004-40fa-b5c9-2236edc5cfdf","title":"卡片内容与 diff"},{"parent":"4aceadef-608c-41d4-82e5-5d01e5df8495","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d3fc53ce-6740-4156-86a8-fa7229061862","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"acb2c9a9-b0c1-494e-8648-9b19b3ba648a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8461e08d-6a84-4e0c-9744-39968e6f67b5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f60ff6e4-9413-4690-ab0d-aedca8242a16","title":"操作：1.先打开文件系统窗口 → 2.点击 AI 对话中的文件卡片"},{"parent":"8461e08d-6a84-4e0c-9744-39968e6f67b5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"095a3235-8a84-4a57-ac39-dbaf1f9a735e","title":"预期：文件系统窗口激活并置顶；自动定位到对应文件并高亮；若支持 diff 则打开 diff 视图"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8461e08d-6a84-4e0c-9744-39968e6f67b5","title":"🔴【P0】点击卡片跳转（文件窗口已开）"},{"parent":"acb2c9a9-b0c1-494e-8648-9b19b3ba648a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4ed4ea2d-3ad2-4a68-90b4-ba53483375aa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"583840fd-ca00-41bb-805b-47e6b6c2470c","title":"操作：1.关闭所有文件系统窗口 → 2.点击文件卡片"},{"parent":"4ed4ea2d-3ad2-4a68-90b4-ba53483375aa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f541a271-6016-4be8-be52-053c768ae490","title":"预期：文件系统窗口打开并置顶；自动定位到对应文件并高亮；若支持 diff 则打开 diff 视图"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4ed4ea2d-3ad2-4a68-90b4-ba53483375aa","title":"🔴【P0】点击卡片跳转（文件窗口未开）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"acb2c9a9-b0c1-494e-8648-9b19b3ba648a","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"d3fc53ce-6740-4156-86a8-fa7229061862","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d9bb3259-c853-4350-9267-1a1af577b355","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"761d5005-3ada-4886-8ce3-1f82ab25e2c7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"de430f4a-0dfe-4b6d-a737-0663f641e7c9","title":"操作：卡片生成后在本地删除目标文件，再点击打开"},{"parent":"761d5005-3ada-4886-8ce3-1f82ab25e2c7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"46bab809-4c98-4b33-abe5-6c1381a1d05a","title":"预期：提示无法打开文件夹 这个会话原本的工作目录在本机上已经找不到了"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"761d5005-3ada-4886-8ce3-1f82ab25e2c7","title":"🟠【P1】文件已不存在"},{"parent":"d9bb3259-c853-4350-9267-1a1af577b355","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"abab2f08-d7a1-473f-8c96-1017210f4055","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"08be43b0-2a60-4f46-9bb6-8e506ebbfa06","title":"操作：卡片生成后在本地删除目标文件，再点击打开"},{"parent":"abab2f08-d7a1-473f-8c96-1017210f4055","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1f40cb02-f835-4a81-b910-1407148f5430","title":"预期：提示文件不存在并刷新卡片状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"abab2f08-d7a1-473f-8c96-1017210f4055","title":"🟠【P1】文件已不存在"},{"parent":"d9bb3259-c853-4350-9267-1a1af577b355","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b0bd1db6-b1a8-4f2b-92c2-bde241669aca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bb3ada11-12f1-478a-85a9-66f49eb7b9a4","title":"操作：让 AI 操作路径含中文或空格的文件"},{"parent":"b0bd1db6-b1a8-4f2b-92c2-bde241669aca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b85be77d-f9a0-4c4d-bf10-8eadf6f04ffb","title":"预期：卡片正确显示完整路径；点击跳转不因路径解析失败而报错"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b0bd1db6-b1a8-4f2b-92c2-bde241669aca","title":"🟠【P1】文件路径含特殊字符或中文"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d9bb3259-c853-4350-9267-1a1af577b355","title":"异常场景（3）"},{"parent":"d3fc53ce-6740-4156-86a8-fa7229061862","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e20e262c-fde6-470d-b6e3-cea0cb4509ba","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e72eda3b-8f42-4951-90a3-a58a7a6575c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"34b00913-9b8b-4eee-9af2-b61d17849e21","title":"操作：同时修改 src/config.json 和 test/config.json"},{"parent":"e72eda3b-8f42-4951-90a3-a58a7a6575c1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"34c4908a-c8de-4041-867a-eaa9c9e35bc1","title":"预期：卡片能区分完整路径，不混淆文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e72eda3b-8f42-4951-90a3-a58a7a6575c1","title":"🟡【P2】同名不同目录文件"},{"parent":"e20e262c-fde6-470d-b6e3-cea0cb4509ba","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c8a30e46-0e5b-40c5-97be-973b8eb0a846","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5905607-0ce3-41bb-91f7-dcd6a0155b94","title":"操作：变更深层目录中的长路径文件"},{"parent":"c8a30e46-0e5b-40c5-97be-973b8eb0a846","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d261a176-3795-4af2-8df9-986ce8d4d94f","title":"预期：路径合理截断，完整路径可复制或查看"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c8a30e46-0e5b-40c5-97be-973b8eb0a846","title":"🟡【P2】超长路径文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e20e262c-fde6-470d-b6e3-cea0cb4509ba","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d3fc53ce-6740-4156-86a8-fa7229061862","title":"卡片跳转"},{"parent":"4aceadef-608c-41d4-82e5-5d01e5df8495","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"afaff4e8-8694-4556-8cca-236e8afec40a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"febd9bf7-f87b-480c-a92a-3ecbcaee22c3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f57c2228-4df4-4acc-a859-a0bf626acb77","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44fd8685-b412-450f-ad1b-9dfbf6fabb09","title":"前置：Agent 依次修改了多个文件"},{"parent":"f57c2228-4df4-4acc-a859-a0bf626acb77","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"95e8d7ab-5b67-44b1-8d1a-f4d1cfcc33bf","title":"操作：查看消息区中的卡片列表"},{"parent":"f57c2228-4df4-4acc-a859-a0bf626acb77","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cce5d6af-6392-4db4-8153-a0a1f012f8ec","title":"预期：每个文件各一张卡片，顺序与实际操作顺序一致，内容互不覆盖"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f57c2228-4df4-4acc-a859-a0bf626acb77","title":"🟠【P1】多个卡片的顺序与独立性"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"febd9bf7-f87b-480c-a92a-3ecbcaee22c3","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"afaff4e8-8694-4556-8cca-236e8afec40a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ec1a2748-6102-4d00-a35f-c57f17fe68dc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"90b7403f-8dcd-4ab5-bc7a-2a68cc5d0fdd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0b979002-e6b1-4a22-8747-315fed87ad58","title":"操作：让 AI 执行一个涉及多文件修改的任务"},{"parent":"90b7403f-8dcd-4ab5-bc7a-2a68cc5d0fdd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c6f8c394-15c3-4570-8a1c-e02d35e851d4","title":"预期：每个文件各有一张卡片；卡片不重叠不错乱；顺序与 AI 操作顺序一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"90b7403f-8dcd-4ab5-bc7a-2a68cc5d0fdd","title":"🟡【P2】AI 快速连续改多个文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ec1a2748-6102-4d00-a35f-c57f17fe68dc","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"afaff4e8-8694-4556-8cca-236e8afec40a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4d03990b-2f4c-441d-a0eb-b7ecc123cb16","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a35d9cfd-e05d-4a63-b814-2649cd3d3aed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0f3bceb8-ba14-42ee-8623-4a0b56fa1762","title":"操作：让 AI 多次修改同一文件"},{"parent":"a35d9cfd-e05d-4a63-b814-2649cd3d3aed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2d580848-bb16-4104-8fd4-10d0ea2dc4b7","title":"预期：每次修改各产生一张卡片；历史卡片不被覆盖；各卡片 diff 内容独立"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a35d9cfd-e05d-4a63-b814-2649cd3d3aed","title":"🟡【P2】同一文件被 AI 改动多次"},{"parent":"4d03990b-2f4c-441d-a0eb-b7ecc123cb16","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4f6705ba-7942-4317-b486-17fa4d268c66","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d23c9864-dc0f-4074-bdba-f3aad506f3fa","title":"操作：一次任务变更 100 个文件"},{"parent":"4f6705ba-7942-4317-b486-17fa4d268c66","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ada246d4-e34c-4512-a961-2575233686b0","title":"预期：卡片列表可折叠和滚动，性能稳定"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4f6705ba-7942-4317-b486-17fa4d268c66","title":"🟡【P2】大量文件卡片"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4d03990b-2f4c-441d-a0eb-b7ecc123cb16","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"afaff4e8-8694-4556-8cca-236e8afec40a","title":"卡片异常与边界"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4aceadef-608c-41d4-82e5-5d01e5df8495","title":"5.5 变更卡片展示"},{"parent":"676dc7a3-3959-4469-a5c5-68898be80f72","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5b219c48-e6a2-4097-94f2-1d1abc7518cf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f3cc8292-a307-41e1-a8eb-f142f87bd816","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b1e96193-f4ab-4568-b269-d7bd483e407d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"12f689e9-a3dd-48fd-896f-d26c015c53bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bf20bda9-d368-437b-80a5-993a381a5bdb","title":"操作：让 Agent 分析项目中模块间的引用/依赖关系（如某文件 import 了哪些模块）"},{"parent":"12f689e9-a3dd-48fd-896f-d26c015c53bf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b8553831-d48d-4e2c-998f-c2954f993c18","title":"预期：Agent 给出的依赖关系与实际代码引用一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"12f689e9-a3dd-48fd-896f-d26c015c53bf","title":"🔴【P0】理解项目依赖关系"},{"parent":"b1e96193-f4ab-4568-b269-d7bd483e407d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f4c3e788-0ee2-497f-8ffb-eadce7dc49ab","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2dc2cc51-6552-4ee8-bcd3-902a61ab15cc","title":"操作：打开一个多层级目录的项目，让 Agent 描述项目结构"},{"parent":"f4c3e788-0ee2-497f-8ffb-eadce7dc49ab","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c65f0e85-4e22-4bcb-85ff-f8730f11697a","title":"预期：Agent 准确描述实际目录/文件结构，未遗漏关键目录或编造不存在的文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f4c3e788-0ee2-497f-8ffb-eadce7dc49ab","title":"🔴【P0】理解项目目录结构"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b1e96193-f4ab-4568-b269-d7bd483e407d","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"f3cc8292-a307-41e1-a8eb-f142f87bd816","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c3547011-c165-483e-8944-fa1b6fbf2bdf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5e1852c4-6f3d-412d-ab7a-e7b4b0b54907","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"409d39bb-91a0-47cb-82e2-7b0c83dfe253","title":"前置：打开一个空目录作为项目"},{"parent":"5e1852c4-6f3d-412d-ab7a-e7b4b0b54907","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e982d1d9-ab37-4364-815c-8560101b9be4","title":"操作：让 Agent 描述项目结构"},{"parent":"5e1852c4-6f3d-412d-ab7a-e7b4b0b54907","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ca4d9ddd-cd28-4b4c-9442-0b7bc58cdbcb","title":"预期：如实说明项目为空，不编造不存在的目录与文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5e1852c4-6f3d-412d-ab7a-e7b4b0b54907","title":"🟠【P1】空项目或无源码目录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c3547011-c165-483e-8944-fa1b6fbf2bdf","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"f3cc8292-a307-41e1-a8eb-f142f87bd816","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2960f128-56bf-479f-a6e1-b21c616c3ba6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aa5fb076-7e4c-4a34-b790-5327fe4bb59d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1f2249a2-7e3f-4ced-a5ee-09767499cb2c","title":"前置：打开一个包含数万文件的项目"},{"parent":"aa5fb076-7e4c-4a34-b790-5327fe4bb59d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"608e90e1-7280-49d9-ab70-e5d301ac98c8","title":"操作：让 Agent 描述项目整体结构"},{"parent":"aa5fb076-7e4c-4a34-b790-5327fe4bb59d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b0b496cb-3618-41a2-9839-ce38bbcec767","title":"预期：给出分层的结构概览且关键目录不遗漏，响应时间可接受"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aa5fb076-7e4c-4a34-b790-5327fe4bb59d","title":"🟡【P2】超大规模项目的结构描述"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2960f128-56bf-479f-a6e1-b21c616c3ba6","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f3cc8292-a307-41e1-a8eb-f142f87bd816","title":"项目结构与依赖识别"},{"parent":"5b219c48-e6a2-4097-94f2-1d1abc7518cf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"24741b20-8c85-40ec-b3b5-67253aff2a0b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f8868caf-e063-460e-ac9d-5383074512bc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bfd8f3d4-ba79-46f8-81e4-dc4a614a33e2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e734b64d-f9d8-42d7-8ba8-70f2218a29a0","title":"操作：让 Agent 阅读 package.json/requirements.txt 等配置文件并回答其中的依赖或脚本配置"},{"parent":"bfd8f3d4-ba79-46f8-81e4-dc4a614a33e2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"21fc510c-bc5f-4e01-9bbc-1bdf3ab30dbb","title":"预期：回答内容与配置文件实际内容一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bfd8f3d4-ba79-46f8-81e4-dc4a614a33e2","title":"🔴【P0】理解项目配置文件"},{"parent":"f8868caf-e063-460e-ac9d-5383074512bc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"62b06948-8cc5-4096-baf5-feb840f8a745","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c8c35343-0040-4a28-af6e-77a2c8df73cc","title":"操作：打开不同语言的项目（如 Python/Node/Go），让 Agent 判断项目使用的语言和框架"},{"parent":"62b06948-8cc5-4096-baf5-feb840f8a745","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"849c8a82-d44f-4fd7-82a1-16da12d0f8c2","title":"预期：Agent 正确识别语言和主要框架/技术栈"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"62b06948-8cc5-4096-baf5-feb840f8a745","title":"🔴【P0】识别项目编程语言与技术栈"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f8868caf-e063-460e-ac9d-5383074512bc","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"24741b20-8c85-40ec-b3b5-67253aff2a0b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8585d399-be09-4ab6-ac1b-07ad5712981c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0521ee42-493e-4c93-84c3-d99db9f3364a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8565df42-da48-47b8-9c1b-eb5a46854ee3","title":"前置：项目中的依赖配置文件存在语法错误"},{"parent":"0521ee42-493e-4c93-84c3-d99db9f3364a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e2e56b5b-fab8-419e-9db4-b7b52c43df20","title":"操作：让 Agent 读取该配置文件并回答依赖信息"},{"parent":"0521ee42-493e-4c93-84c3-d99db9f3364a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a2fa140c-e163-498d-a32c-9abb735385e6","title":"预期：指出配置文件存在语法问题，不猜测或编造依赖内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0521ee42-493e-4c93-84c3-d99db9f3364a","title":"🟠【P1】配置文件损坏时的识别"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8585d399-be09-4ab6-ac1b-07ad5712981c","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"24741b20-8c85-40ec-b3b5-67253aff2a0b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"070a3ead-cf65-4e4a-a5d1-21edfdae2ff1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6379ae00-fcc3-4c1c-aa79-2d8497d53251","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6360359e-4924-4118-b1d1-fd9e025e1985","title":"前置：项目同时包含多种语言与框架"},{"parent":"6379ae00-fcc3-4c1c-aa79-2d8497d53251","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f9a3b778-1a6f-46d1-9c79-30de08bfe920","title":"操作：让 Agent 判断项目使用的语言与技术栈"},{"parent":"6379ae00-fcc3-4c1c-aa79-2d8497d53251","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0fe00f05-6414-4106-b99d-0915846d6faa","title":"预期：识别出主要语言与框架并说明各自占比或用途，不只报其中一种"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6379ae00-fcc3-4c1c-aa79-2d8497d53251","title":"🟡【P2】多语言混合项目的技术栈识别"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"070a3ead-cf65-4e4a-a5d1-21edfdae2ff1","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"24741b20-8c85-40ec-b3b5-67253aff2a0b","title":"技术栈与配置识别"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5b219c48-e6a2-4097-94f2-1d1abc7518cf","title":"5.6 项目理解与代码分析"},{"parent":"676dc7a3-3959-4469-a5c5-68898be80f72","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"91704de5-c843-4a6d-a2e7-c5452d2a5dcb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d78a9216-3a23-436d-a15e-5acbdc7864aa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c80403ee-cbf6-4d42-a2e8-d0b7d086cdd2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"65239542-9477-4729-a9db-09b2a7b0a485","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e950ad9-bc84-413c-8fb8-dce45d49d311","title":"操作：连续发送多条有上下文关联的指令（如「生成一个函数」→「再给它加个参数」→「现在测试一下」）"},{"parent":"65239542-9477-4729-a9db-09b2a7b0a485","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"483c2e91-d8f4-46d0-b30b-b5bd42d0f744","title":"预期：每一轮都基于前文正确理解指代对象，不出现「不知道指的是什么」的情况"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"65239542-9477-4729-a9db-09b2a7b0a485","title":"🔴【P0】保持多轮对话连贯性"},{"parent":"c80403ee-cbf6-4d42-a2e8-d0b7d086cdd2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"18e420de-b6c3-4277-a220-e0689ca218ee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"49e0656a-a8b3-43d4-8f99-77d99853b17e","title":"操作：先让 Agent 创建一个变量/文件，再追问「我刚才创建的是什么」"},{"parent":"18e420de-b6c3-4277-a220-e0689ca218ee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8c0cb15c-1204-4451-bbd8-b726cd9d9555","title":"预期：Agent 能正确引用之前消息中的内容作答，不需要重复说明"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"18e420de-b6c3-4277-a220-e0689ca218ee","title":"🔴【P0】跨消息引用之前的对话内容"},{"parent":"c80403ee-cbf6-4d42-a2e8-d0b7d086cdd2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2e031a8a-5abf-4f5d-b015-f4e337afe50b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"526d6b89-ae66-4ea7-83b0-fd6522a39617","title":"操作：进行超长对话直到接近/超出上下文窗口上限"},{"parent":"2e031a8a-5abf-4f5d-b015-f4e337afe50b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"73ddec62-8e13-483c-8633-143b429d9b3c","title":"预期：应用有合理降级策略（如提示需要新会话/自动摘要旧上下文），不静默丢失关键信息导致答非所问"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2e031a8a-5abf-4f5d-b015-f4e337afe50b","title":"🔴【P0】上下文窗口溢出后的降级处理"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c80403ee-cbf6-4d42-a2e8-d0b7d086cdd2","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"d78a9216-3a23-436d-a15e-5acbdc7864aa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f730f1ec-b154-4a11-a494-a799a35a8b7f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e3f46a43-7d92-4cd5-9bd9-d71b3a73bf19","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1e8fb84a-332e-42b9-9fc8-59da86543be2","title":"操作：恢复一个历史会话后，追问此前对话中提到的内容"},{"parent":"e3f46a43-7d92-4cd5-9bd9-d71b3a73bf19","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"02998793-874c-4a09-8c0e-dbc0beca34dd","title":"预期：resume 后 Agent 仍能正确引用会话历史中的信息（与「会话历史与Resume恢复」用例联动校验）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e3f46a43-7d92-4cd5-9bd9-d71b3a73bf19","title":"🟠【P1】跨会话resume后上下文记忆保留"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f730f1ec-b154-4a11-a494-a799a35a8b7f","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"d78a9216-3a23-436d-a15e-5acbdc7864aa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d718922a-7d82-425c-a52d-4ba790aecf30","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ee23ee53-76a7-42f8-8754-f7f79bba2052","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8c320548-d171-4f9e-9dd4-ad855252c033","title":"操作：在同一会话中频繁切换完全不相关的话题"},{"parent":"ee23ee53-76a7-42f8-8754-f7f79bba2052","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e97d9bc-76d4-49d0-8286-6a8ec69b7751","title":"预期：Agent 不会将无关话题的上下文错误关联，各主题回答互不干扰"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ee23ee53-76a7-42f8-8754-f7f79bba2052","title":"🟡【P2】多轮对话频繁切换主题"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d718922a-7d82-425c-a52d-4ba790aecf30","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d78a9216-3a23-436d-a15e-5acbdc7864aa","title":"多轮上下文保持"},{"parent":"91704de5-c843-4a6d-a2e7-c5452d2a5dcb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"80e0e320-d49d-4732-a857-5a8d21fe84b7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"04a8b2b6-ea5d-478a-bfd4-5ecb8531f051","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7902c183-cae3-4920-a32b-37b044484539","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76c398bc-991c-4551-9ffa-320d6e3da7a2","title":"操作：会话进行过程中插入/compact"},{"parent":"7902c183-cae3-4920-a32b-37b044484539","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d7a52ccd-8dfa-45a3-8878-67e12941b8f0","title":"预期：前面回复暂停，开始压缩，压缩完后显示已压缩上下文"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7902c183-cae3-4920-a32b-37b044484539","title":"🔴【P0】会话进行过程中插入/compact"},{"parent":"04a8b2b6-ea5d-478a-bfd4-5ecb8531f051","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d8e26a39-6895-4e9f-ad87-3b3bb0ea5ef0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c22463eb-8a95-48b8-9640-99223e3454a9","title":"操作：会话进行过程中输入/compact"},{"parent":"d8e26a39-6895-4e9f-ad87-3b3bb0ea5ef0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6bdc35b2-3b13-4857-b781-050f245d2100","title":"预期：进入排队状态，会话完成自动发送出去压缩"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d8e26a39-6895-4e9f-ad87-3b3bb0ea5ef0","title":"🔴【P0】会话进行过程中输入/compact"},{"parent":"04a8b2b6-ea5d-478a-bfd4-5ecb8531f051","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2d38ed77-a916-4fff-b85d-fe8c9a25b0bb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7b15b529-98ef-45a1-aea1-49fa5d2557e9","title":"操作：压缩后再次压缩"},{"parent":"2d38ed77-a916-4fff-b85d-fe8c9a25b0bb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c86f74f7-1aee-419c-87d5-c82d29d8909b","title":"预期：显示没有足够的上下文压缩"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2d38ed77-a916-4fff-b85d-fe8c9a25b0bb","title":"🔴【P0】压缩后再次压缩"},{"parent":"04a8b2b6-ea5d-478a-bfd4-5ecb8531f051","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d1014e4a-c3f4-4bc1-a7ff-ce9d881c091a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e82e3fa-d913-4a19-9018-88c204c0c91e","title":"操作：新建会话，匹配/compact"},{"parent":"d1014e4a-c3f4-4bc1-a7ff-ce9d881c091a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eb769b11-3675-4d9c-978b-a31d27310b00","title":"预期：新建会话无法匹配出这个命令"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d1014e4a-c3f4-4bc1-a7ff-ce9d881c091a","title":"🟠【P1】新建会话匹配/compact"},{"parent":"04a8b2b6-ea5d-478a-bfd4-5ecb8531f051","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b4b4a7ac-5b6c-4f3f-8047-ebf759441cbe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"56d43711-e103-4597-815b-c9da42d77bc8","title":"操作：输入/compact并发送"},{"parent":"b4b4a7ac-5b6c-4f3f-8047-ebf759441cbe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3e612cf3-f939-49df-a911-00b63240c9cf","title":"预期：正确压缩上下文用量"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b4b4a7ac-5b6c-4f3f-8047-ebf759441cbe","title":"🟠【P1】输入/compact并发送"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"04a8b2b6-ea5d-478a-bfd4-5ecb8531f051","title":"正常场景（5）"},{"parent":"80e0e320-d49d-4732-a857-5a8d21fe84b7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2088861a-9658-47b9-9139-755e543116aa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"058960ca-8cce-47ff-bdd4-892805f0ba27","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"84f00cc2-4e3e-47f9-9c7f-8b6af28d6850","title":"前置：前置：会话已进行多轮且包含明确目标、约束与已做修改；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"058960ca-8cce-47ff-bdd4-892805f0ba27","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b9548f08-3183-4180-afcb-48248f532bd5","title":"操作：执行 /compact 后提问引用压缩前约定的目标与约束"},{"parent":"058960ca-8cce-47ff-bdd4-892805f0ba27","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2cb14952-a16a-4bfd-9f3b-d94ea0b9efed","title":"预期：压缩后 Agent 仍能准确复述关键目标、约束与已完成的修改；上下文用量明显下降；压缩过程不中断会话"},{"parent":"058960ca-8cce-47ff-bdd4-892805f0ba27","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e4c8f12-19e3-48b2-a431-7d9c48e85259","title":"备注：附件3 CC-034"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"058960ca-8cce-47ff-bdd4-892805f0ba27","title":"🟡【P2】长会话压缩后关键上下文保留"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2088861a-9658-47b9-9139-755e543116aa","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"80e0e320-d49d-4732-a857-5a8d21fe84b7","title":"上下文压缩（/compact）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"91704de5-c843-4a6d-a2e7-c5452d2a5dcb","title":"5.7 上下文保持与压缩"},{"parent":"676dc7a3-3959-4469-a5c5-68898be80f72","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dac10429-4703-4fe7-a3cc-abfa9b8ed9c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c7d81d26-3679-4943-abab-eeb7d69d6b2e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e10d7bed-23ec-4a73-b175-ff80d9a1fd39","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"77c9456d-e990-4e34-93c4-758054681d4d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"96c24153-f93a-4ef0-9285-dbb6a9d2cc04","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个适合拆解的复合任务（如「搜索项目里所有涉及支付逻辑的文件并总结」），观察是否派生内部子代理处理子任务"},{"parent":"77c9456d-e990-4e34-93c4-758054681d4d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1ac4e43b-69c7-4b47-8edd-ac5f7e89e33b","title":"预期：主Agent能将子任务委派给内部子Agent（如 Claude Code 的 Task/通用子代理机制）执行，过程对用户可感知或有相应提示，不是主Agent独自逐步手动完成；子 Agent 在任务结束后状态收敛为已完成或失败；不长时间停留在未完成；失败时给出原因并可重试"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"77c9456d-e990-4e34-93c4-758054681d4d","title":"🔴【P0】Agent派发内部子任务给子Agent执行"},{"parent":"e10d7bed-23ec-4a73-b175-ff80d9a1fd39","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"15a46a1f-7b7a-437e-b4fd-8f30b7d56092","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2bd7883b-7dab-493d-99ce-43f71ef71151","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个可拆分为多个独立子任务的复合任务"},{"parent":"15a46a1f-7b7a-437e-b4fd-8f30b7d56092","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd5ac8a2-1542-4560-b43e-e149eef61690","title":"预期：多个子Agent可并行执行且互不干扰，结果分别正确合并"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"15a46a1f-7b7a-437e-b4fd-8f30b7d56092","title":"🔴【P0】多个子Agent并行处理不同子任务"},{"parent":"e10d7bed-23ec-4a73-b175-ff80d9a1fd39","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"334e7fbb-f945-495d-b502-b47647f5825f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d7c45dff-c858-4259-aa28-7ee63544baff","title":"操作：子Agent完成子任务后，观察主Agent如何呈现结果"},{"parent":"334e7fbb-f945-495d-b502-b47647f5825f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2beec42b-c796-446d-b1d8-5b1c4c761bf0","title":"预期：子Agent的执行结果被主Agent正确汇总、引用或据此继续后续步骤，不丢失子任务产出"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"334e7fbb-f945-495d-b502-b47647f5825f","title":"🔴【P0】子Agent执行结果正确汇总回主对话"},{"parent":"e10d7bed-23ec-4a73-b175-ff80d9a1fd39","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4e25fa1d-3d8f-4046-a52d-c3e4447a39f2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"582ae162-2f72-4e07-a484-2779ddefce20","title":"操作：触发一个会派生子Agent执行的任务（尤其涉及写入/执行类子任务）"},{"parent":"4e25fa1d-3d8f-4046-a52d-c3e4447a39f2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f2c81794-4424-40aa-bd26-f171b78653a6","title":"预期：派发子Agent执行写入/执行类操作时，仍遵循当前会话的权限模式（如需询问则询问），不会因为是「子Agent」身份而绕过权限确认"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4e25fa1d-3d8f-4046-a52d-c3e4447a39f2","title":"🔴【P0】派发子Agent前的确认/授权提示"},{"parent":"e10d7bed-23ec-4a73-b175-ff80d9a1fd39","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"39a2dbc4-9afe-41a1-b0a6-8bafbf2360a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c93f28bb-13c4-4b51-83f3-3cfbd7ab7596","title":"前置：前置：会话可正常执行；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"39a2dbc4-9afe-41a1-b0a6-8bafbf2360a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bab78496-d9b4-46af-9c80-c613da1c8764","title":"操作：启动单个子 Agent 执行任务，由主 Agent 向其发送一条补充要求，等待结果回传"},{"parent":"39a2dbc4-9afe-41a1-b0a6-8bafbf2360a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"250f529f-b55e-4fff-9f48-6965015f325d","title":"预期：子 Agent 生命周期完整可见；补充要求送达指定子 Agent 而非其他 Agent；多条子 Agent 消息在 GUI 中折叠展示；结果进入主会话上下文并被主 Agent 汇总为最终答案"},{"parent":"39a2dbc4-9afe-41a1-b0a6-8bafbf2360a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"734c86cb-3bc3-4b6f-9ec1-5901cc7fea76","title":"备注：附件3 CC-007"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"39a2dbc4-9afe-41a1-b0a6-8bafbf2360a1","title":"🟠【P1】单子 Agent 与补充要求下发"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e10d7bed-23ec-4a73-b175-ff80d9a1fd39","title":"正常场景（5）"},{"parent":"c7d81d26-3679-4943-abab-eeb7d69d6b2e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6e8207af-edde-406e-8d62-348420d3e0dc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"40ba6f48-0ca8-4e86-9043-6a4d56c4c49b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e7e2f284-a08a-49b1-955e-1cc56082ff9f","title":"操作：让某个子任务在子Agent执行阶段刻意失败（如访问不存在的文件）"},{"parent":"40ba6f48-0ca8-4e86-9043-6a4d56c4c49b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"daad390b-852e-4149-9018-46572b23ffa6","title":"预期：主Agent能感知子Agent失败并做出合理处理（重试/降级/告知用户），不会静默忽略失败结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"40ba6f48-0ca8-4e86-9043-6a4d56c4c49b","title":"🟡【P2】子Agent执行失败后主Agent的处理"},{"parent":"6e8207af-edde-406e-8d62-348420d3e0dc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7dd96b03-f917-4b76-b814-f62f31384d41","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1351a566-409b-43ba-b81c-918ff6eabd90","title":"操作：在权限模式限制较严格（如只读模式）下触发需要派生子Agent执行写入类子任务的场景"},{"parent":"7dd96b03-f917-4b76-b814-f62f31384d41","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d6d0e1b7-5f34-4e8c-9186-e5cb16b51846","title":"预期：子Agent派发因权限受限被拒绝时有明确提示，不会静默失败或绕过限制执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7dd96b03-f917-4b76-b814-f62f31384d41","title":"🟡【P2】子Agent派发被拒绝或受限时的提示"},{"parent":"6e8207af-edde-406e-8d62-348420d3e0dc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4f18f0b7-4a05-41b2-9817-7de0bf74814a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"41046be3-94c9-4572-b565-54a221aef65c","title":"操作：主任务限定在项目 A 目录内，观察派生的子Agent是否会访问项目 A 之外的路径"},{"parent":"4f18f0b7-4a05-41b2-9817-7de0bf74814a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"12820362-cf5b-43aa-b1ce-5dcb57b3a567","title":"预期：子Agent的文件/项目访问范围继承主Agent当前的权限与项目作用域，不出现越权访问"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4f18f0b7-4a05-41b2-9817-7de0bf74814a","title":"🟡【P2】子Agent越权访问主任务作用域之外的文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6e8207af-edde-406e-8d62-348420d3e0dc","title":"异常场景（7）"},{"parent":"c7d81d26-3679-4943-abab-eeb7d69d6b2e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"202c34c8-7623-4e8b-a25b-7a567767e733","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4c297b96-56d0-47e9-aeb1-6e6f1e6f051d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e7ef5e75-6ac0-4c0d-8716-942b37bfa9a1","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个会拆解出大量子任务（如超过10个）的复合任务"},{"parent":"4c297b96-56d0-47e9-aeb1-6e6f1e6f051d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7f27d70d-cba9-4d97-b39e-142230d6b18a","title":"预期：子Agent数量可控或有合理限流提示，不会因过量派发导致资源耗尽或状态错乱"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4c297b96-56d0-47e9-aeb1-6e6f1e6f051d","title":"🟡【P2】大量子Agent同时派发"},{"parent":"202c34c8-7623-4e8b-a25b-7a567767e733","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"66d2ae2b-8546-4e46-ad71-92cfa90147f2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4fc9b89c-20a9-4a24-a19c-d55e65647e6e","title":"操作：观察子Agent执行过程中是否会再派发下一层子Agent"},{"parent":"66d2ae2b-8546-4e46-ad71-92cfa90147f2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"72d51a8c-6848-4e28-9e2d-eb74c2758403","title":"预期：若支持嵌套派发，层级和结果汇总关系清晰可追踪；若不支持，应有明确边界而非无限递归"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"66d2ae2b-8546-4e46-ad71-92cfa90147f2","title":"🟡【P2】子Agent嵌套派发"},{"parent":"202c34c8-7623-4e8b-a25b-7a567767e733","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"212a8d30-5fb5-4eef-8237-613461bb8ab0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7bcbaf04-1521-43a2-bbec-4ce0a8caa76a","title":"前置：前置：会话可正常执行；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"212a8d30-5fb5-4eef-8237-613461bb8ab0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"43a32964-a30b-4142-b498-a413b02b6f73","title":"操作：让第一层 Agent 再启动子 Agent，核对各层级的启动、消息、完成与用量"},{"parent":"212a8d30-5fb5-4eef-8237-613461bb8ab0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7f606d2e-2789-4b86-b831-004ba64baa8d","title":"预期：各层级 Agent 的启动、消息、完成状态均纳入统一状态展示；用量按层级汇总不遗漏；顶层任务在所有层级结束后才标记完成"},{"parent":"212a8d30-5fb5-4eef-8237-613461bb8ab0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"754cb10f-8ac7-4b14-b936-a32c8dbbbe8d","title":"备注：附件3 CC-042"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"212a8d30-5fb5-4eef-8237-613461bb8ab0","title":"🟡【P2】嵌套子 Agent 生命周期"},{"parent":"202c34c8-7623-4e8b-a25b-7a567767e733","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6a869017-316d-4f50-9d59-4110b4a54acc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3cb6c45e-f76c-4e5b-a433-6ffcdc2183c6","title":"操作：让某个子任务本身是长耗时任务（如遍历超大代码库）"},{"parent":"6a869017-316d-4f50-9d59-4110b4a54acc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"68acea42-5144-4eaf-a324-00a3e54631bb","title":"预期：子Agent任务的超时/进度反馈机制与主任务一致，不会无提示地长时间挂起"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6a869017-316d-4f50-9d59-4110b4a54acc","title":"🟡【P2】长时间运行的子Agent任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"202c34c8-7623-4e8b-a25b-7a567767e733","title":"边界场景（4）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c7d81d26-3679-4943-abab-eeb7d69d6b2e","title":"子 Agent 派发与结果汇总"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dac10429-4703-4fe7-a3cc-abfa9b8ed9c4","title":"5.8 子 Agent 派发"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"676dc7a3-3959-4469-a5c5-68898be80f72","title":"Agent 执行能力"},{"parent":"2c72769a-edab-4380-9807-95c83d5881ee","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6de9ccf7-4098-46c8-a3cd-c4dde95deb4d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"07ba8261-5d56-4c55-b049-5c8ad967ebb4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"49a1ceb1-7cdb-4b95-be36-84686a119ffa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f16f56f1-d5b3-410c-a3e2-1326588fb240","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4c949263-78a5-4800-a64e-750b630ec533","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"752df8c1-8414-41fe-af6f-dbe1fece4631","title":"操作：将推理强度从默认切换到高"},{"parent":"4c949263-78a5-4800-a64e-750b630ec533","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"34ec78a6-3f2b-4f9a-b941-da128bcab72c","title":"预期：底栏显示高，新会话使用对应推理强度"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4c949263-78a5-4800-a64e-750b630ec533","title":"🔴【P0】切换推理强度","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f16f56f1-d5b3-410c-a3e2-1326588fb240","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"796bdf85-aae6-4687-bd4a-47d0a90ce93a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c3bba120-c7b7-4fc2-bc14-3d209ad9a246","title":"操作：将速度从标准切换到快速"},{"parent":"796bdf85-aae6-4687-bd4a-47d0a90ce93a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a461f70d-59b1-4a19-bd78-72074fa28daf","title":"预期：底栏显示快速，新会话使用对应速度"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"796bdf85-aae6-4687-bd4a-47d0a90ce93a","title":"🔴【P0】切换速度","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f16f56f1-d5b3-410c-a3e2-1326588fb240","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8598aab0-85cf-4b2b-9623-9b514f230a16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c9206ec-3974-46c2-bf9b-e60d65c24bd9","title":"操作：展开模型菜单后点击空白处"},{"parent":"8598aab0-85cf-4b2b-9623-9b514f230a16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7a8e1753-a390-45fc-8407-b1e5c1815840","title":"预期：菜单关闭，当前模型不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8598aab0-85cf-4b2b-9623-9b514f230a16","title":"🔴【P0】模型菜单关闭","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f16f56f1-d5b3-410c-a3e2-1326588fb240","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fd6b5989-ac3b-4134-bf5c-a55617742758","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7dc131b6-3112-4688-89fd-562eab942eb3","title":"操作：切换模型后新建会话"},{"parent":"fd6b5989-ac3b-4134-bf5c-a55617742758","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"db4525ea-0ff3-4e28-8b75-dc298c2c2ebc","title":"预期：新会话保留上次模型"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fd6b5989-ac3b-4134-bf5c-a55617742758","title":"🔴【P0】模型选择持久化","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f16f56f1-d5b3-410c-a3e2-1326588fb240","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7c6c2fb7-aae0-44d8-a5fd-28c6bfe0ce9f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8a56022e-33b2-4383-a70d-59a13e3d4343","title":"操作：打开新会话观察底栏模型选择"},{"parent":"7c6c2fb7-aae0-44d8-a5fd-28c6bfe0ce9f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0229dc3d-8f3c-4ee9-b4d3-7d02812538ec","title":"预期：显示本地默认模型名称，当前推理强度显示清晰"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7c6c2fb7-aae0-44d8-a5fd-28c6bfe0ce9f","title":"🔴【P0】默认模型展示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f16f56f1-d5b3-410c-a3e2-1326588fb240","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"96bf1b3a-b237-49a7-bb9e-48628a2e1578","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ef33ecce-1c99-43e3-a388-177c1c2a41bc","title":"操作：在发送前切换为另一个可用模型"},{"parent":"96bf1b3a-b237-49a7-bb9e-48628a2e1578","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1a5bb044-c514-4b14-affe-e46e6e29f96c","title":"预期：底栏展示新模型，发送后请求使用该模型"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"96bf1b3a-b237-49a7-bb9e-48628a2e1578","title":"🟡【P2】发送前切换模型"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f16f56f1-d5b3-410c-a3e2-1326588fb240","title":"正常场景（6）"},{"parent":"49a1ceb1-7cdb-4b95-be36-84686a119ffa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e65f403c-495a-476f-8dc8-bfd8c6994502","callout":[],"child