：点击「查看工作区文件」"},{"parent":"1353d94e-b45e-4ecd-a29c-196721a25e91","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6b940a19-45b5-4ce0-a6f1-82b7ef0a455a","title":"预期：\n1) 标签页 ｜ 在新标签页打开工作区文件列表，标签名为工作区文件\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 列表展示该会话所属项目下的所有文件与文件夹"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1353d94e-b45e-4ecd-a29c-196721a25e91","title":"🔴【P0】点击查看工作区文件"},{"parent":"3b4d6c10-dfbc-47d5-92c2-029c919283c4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"59d5b458-b7c7-44e2-b1bf-e4dd309e78b8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bd30660d-b6e0-4a34-aeaa-29f7035e2d10","title":"前置：右侧面板已展开；角色：房间成员；入口：总览的工具分组"},{"parent":"59d5b458-b7c7-44e2-b1bf-e4dd309e78b8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4972e694-ef7b-4a3a-bdc1-a89564141130","title":"操作：查看并分别点击终端与浏览器"},{"parent":"59d5b458-b7c7-44e2-b1bf-e4dd309e78b8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8560152a-b821-4a97-b329-6156ffa1f635","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 工具分组下展示终端与浏览器两项\n2) 标签页 ｜ 点击后各自在新标签页打开对应工具"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"59d5b458-b7c7-44e2-b1bf-e4dd309e78b8","title":"🔴【P0】工具分组入口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3b4d6c10-dfbc-47d5-92c2-029c919283c4","title":"正常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a2779357-baf6-4928-8e4a-f5865ec548a2","title":"工作区文件与工具入口"},{"parent":"df51990e-dac8-4730-a539-8c097aac03ee","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c4216f36-1a1d-4a55-b8f4-180ac52d492b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8e12abb2-d838-4ebb-8074-10ebde44aab4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1e2383f1-dce4-499e-85e0-671af29195bd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"de633b17-a772-4f55-91f2-bf0f2ea2cb35","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"af1356ab-96c1-4de6-bba2-30064fb0cc1b","title":"前置：会话已绑定项目且项目中有多层目录；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件标签页"},{"parent":"de633b17-a772-4f55-91f2-bf0f2ea2cb35","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"05e2dc2b-d82d-4cb8-bdc3-92b13e322dce","title":"操作：查看文件列表"},{"parent":"de633b17-a772-4f55-91f2-bf0f2ea2cb35","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4060db48-47c1-47a8-a72f-a78f6855b421","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 展示该会话所属项目下的所有文件与文件夹\n2) 归属与顺序 ｜ 文件夹排在文件之前，同类按名称排序\n3) 视觉展示 ｜ 不同类型文件显示对应图标"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"de633b17-a772-4f55-91f2-bf0f2ea2cb35","title":"🔴【P0】展示项目下全部文件"},{"parent":"1e2383f1-dce4-499e-85e0-671af29195bd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a7230cf1-208d-49ff-aecb-c3695301f7e6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"02dd270d-7792-46e7-9626-c548f97acb1a","title":"前置：工作区文件列表已打开且存在多个文件夹；角色：房间成员；入口：文件夹左侧的展开箭头"},{"parent":"a7230cf1-208d-49ff-aecb-c3695301f7e6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9a75c8db-1435-4166-bb91-b491342a7dcb","title":"操作：点击文件夹左侧的 &gt; 箭头"},{"parent":"a7230cf1-208d-49ff-aecb-c3695301f7e6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4a830590-7d56-4031-82d6-215d128ca5bd","title":"预期：\n1) 目录导航 ｜ 就地展开显示该文件夹下的内容，箭头转为展开态\n2) 目录导航 ｜ 再次点击可收起，收起后子项不残留"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a7230cf1-208d-49ff-aecb-c3695301f7e6","title":"🔴【P0】展开文件夹查看下级"},{"parent":"1e2383f1-dce4-499e-85e0-671af29195bd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"737a781f-5a97-465e-a008-1530cc1cd73b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"de9bc2ab-a43b-4ee0-b401-8b267083693f","title":"前置：工作区文件列表中存在 Report.jpg 与 Guide.jpg；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"737a781f-5a97-465e-a008-1530cc1cd73b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b8dc1112-5c60-48fe-bbcc-3bcd5b14e3f1","title":"操作：点击其中一个可预览文件"},{"parent":"737a781f-5a97-465e-a008-1530cc1cd73b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b955b95a-31e7-4c08-b8ae-34054da08e96","title":"预期：\n1) 标签页 ｜ 在新标签页打开详情预览，行为与产物区预览一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"737a781f-5a97-465e-a008-1530cc1cd73b","title":"🟠【P1】工作区文件预览"},{"parent":"1e2383f1-dce4-499e-85e0-671af29195bd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2af58161-6cdf-4bab-aabc-35545eb27864","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"360c3496-7379-4028-bd88-948b7bd8022e","title":"前置：工作区文件列表已打开且终端可用；角色：房间成员；入口：终端与工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"2af58161-6cdf-4bab-aabc-35545eb27864","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e453b893-68ee-4a32-83cd-ddaa30f30cdd","title":"操作：在终端执行 touch test.txt 后回到文件列表"},{"parent":"2af58161-6cdf-4bab-aabc-35545eb27864","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1dd8618e-1549-4104-ad1d-467249720697","title":"预期：\n1) 文件落盘 ｜ 列表中同步出现新建的文件\n2) 文件落盘 ｜ 在终端删除该文件后，列表中对应项同步消失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2af58161-6cdf-4bab-aabc-35545eb27864","title":"🟠【P1】终端改动实时反映到列表"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1e2383f1-dce4-499e-85e0-671af29195bd","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"8e12abb2-d838-4ebb-8074-10ebde44aab4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2c0988ac-cd56-4e74-a870-bdfb567ee9ed","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5babb0c4-c216-4530-8a48-f1f4833a21a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"27d3715c-c34b-4f62-8dcf-e22286606f5f","title":"前置：会话绑定的项目目录已被删除或改名；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件标签页"},{"parent":"5babb0c4-c216-4530-8a48-f1f4833a21a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e194e2cf-69e9-4a8f-8563-6dd411775c3d","title":"操作：打开工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"5babb0c4-c216-4530-8a48-f1f4833a21a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76fc08d2-f7b3-4a79-bcbb-b25fe601e433","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示原目录不存在并给出重新选择目录的处理方式\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不展示上一次的缓存文件树误导用户"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5babb0c4-c216-4530-8a48-f1f4833a21a1","title":"🟠【P1】项目目录已失效"},{"parent":"2c0988ac-cd56-4e74-a870-bdfb567ee9ed","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1ea9b773-a942-49d2-b363-0bec68ca9c9e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"74f44e49-b331-421d-a25d-e887bb377b8a","title":"前置：项目下存在当前用户无读取权限的目录；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"1ea9b773-a942-49d2-b363-0bec68ca9c9e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cd977506-093e-4da6-aaf8-710e1f56ff45","title":"操作：展开该目录"},{"parent":"1ea9b773-a942-49d2-b363-0bec68ca9c9e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e5759273-8858-44d5-922a-bf68b532d7c4","title":"预期：\n1) 权限授权 ｜ 提示无权限，不展示目录内容也不泄露文件名"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1ea9b773-a942-49d2-b363-0bec68ca9c9e","title":"🟠【P1】无权限访问的目录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2c0988ac-cd56-4e74-a870-bdfb567ee9ed","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"8e12abb2-d838-4ebb-8074-10ebde44aab4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6a96efbf-56bd-4163-a859-70c5eda0402b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"de682e0f-492b-4e04-aefc-656fb1f697fb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c79e8663-6780-43e2-8567-50b31a46685c","title":"前置：项目中存在 10 层以上嵌套目录；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"de682e0f-492b-4e04-aefc-656fb1f697fb","callout":