9-8c097aac03ee","title":"总览"},{"parent":"d86c0b06-382c-42cc-8248-f58542b33936","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3b13d72c-b1b6-42c7-9ddd-e712a94214dd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e1d565a-af24-4167-8957-ae43274537f1","title":"说明：本子模块的用例在产物区与工作区文件列表两个入口下行为一致；前置中的「入口」指明本次从哪一处触发，回归时两个入口各跑一遍"},{"parent":"3b13d72c-b1b6-42c7-9ddd-e712a94214dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"14036703-53cf-40e6-ad72-841c8322834c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0edf1de3-f693-4a80-92d7-ffa29ca3e7f3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"45eeeb42-75cc-43b1-b4c9-165f69de255a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b35daa4f-61f3-4027-b414-45c1318b6d36","title":"前置：工作区文件列表已打开且存在文件夹 html-anything；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"45eeeb42-75cc-43b1-b4c9-165f69de255a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cfa7bd18-fe08-4433-acbc-d420c7d6830c","title":"操作：右键该文件夹"},{"parent":"45eeeb42-75cc-43b1-b4c9-165f69de255a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2d3fdd1b-b44a-43ec-b6ba-82f9e08e2105","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 在鼠标位置附近弹出菜单，包含打开、上传、新建文件、新建文件夹、下载、分享、重命名、删除\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 删除项使用红色危险样式"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"45eeeb42-75cc-43b1-b4c9-165f69de255a","title":"🔴【P0】右键文件夹弹出菜单"},{"parent":"0edf1de3-f693-4a80-92d7-ffa29ca3e7f3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bfc7aa80-93c7-4e0a-af51-85ef8502a8d7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"078191ba-c9ea-4f75-80bf-5f924f85e1d0","title":"前置：文件夹右键菜单已弹出；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的打开项"},{"parent":"bfc7aa80-93c7-4e0a-af51-85ef8502a8d7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"607dc42b-77ed-4b83-b5f5-9bdcae4b9047","title":"操作：点击打开"},{"parent":"bfc7aa80-93c7-4e0a-af51-85ef8502a8d7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c3a5315-19b1-4095-a432-785bc8f85208","title":"预期：\n1) 目录导航 ｜ 进入该文件夹目录，列表刷新为目标文件夹内容\n2) 目录导航 ｜ 面包屑更新到目标路径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bfc7aa80-93c7-4e0a-af51-85ef8502a8d7","title":"🔴【P0】打开文件夹"},{"parent":"0edf1de3-f693-4a80-92d7-ffa29ca3e7f3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"55482311-a0de-4a39-b011-5609d138e975","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b8ad554f-abfe-4d65-b177-76e16514e273","title":