-4889-afa2-45bb753f2ac1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"627c5aae-1594-4b2f-a75c-655edc0c1917","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e4c0d366-ea00-41e3-ac19-a34a09bc8b25","title":"前置：新建弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：新建文件或文件夹的名称输入框"},{"parent":"627c5aae-1594-4b2f-a75c-655edc0c1917","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"245a03e6-2292-4ebf-a367-fec458c2a8cc","title":"操作：先留空直接确认，再输入超过 255 个 UTF-8 字节的名称确认"},{"parent":"627c5aae-1594-4b2f-a75c-655edc0c1917","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2c346c58-2a11-4183-aa18-a16c8494b3da","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 名称为空时不可提交\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 超长时报错并说明最大长度为 255 个 UTF-8 字节"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"627c5aae-1594-4b2f-a75c-655edc0c1917","title":"🟠【P1】名称为空或超长"},{"parent":"ef56e48a-11a3-4889-afa2-45bb753f2ac1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a5c120e8-2454-4247-a466-85200f787f62","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"65f80279-1407-4ca1-b59d-c87fe4c28ac1","title":"前置：存在包含受保护文件的非空文件夹；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的删除项"},{"parent":"a5c120e8-2454-4247-a466-85200f787f62","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e879ff2a-8456-476e-bf87-ad98748d6d8e","title":"操作：右键该文件夹并点击删除"},{"parent":"a5c120e8-2454-4247-a466-85200f787f62","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"abb5b8cf-f65f-4ab3-861d-99fedc7e9dc3","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 删除失败时提示具体原因\n2) 副作用 ｜ 未删除内容仍完整保留，列表状态准确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a5c120e8-2454-4247-a466-85200f787f62","title":"🟠【P1】删除非空文件夹失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ef56e48a-11a3-4889-afa2-45bb753f2ac1","title":"异常场景（5）"},{"parent":"14036703-53cf-40e6-ad72-841c8322834c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ee55aee1-4aa2-4493-89e5-9a51f9a052a6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"160a09d3-96ea-414e-a257-c1410a394839","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"07cb738f-45c9-4c9c-a0f6-53b57e1a511e","title":"前置：本地存在超过 5GB 的文件；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的上传项"},{"parent":"160a09d3-96ea-414e-a257-c1410a394839","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3dda9a9b-3864-4ddf-83e4-d535a06cead5","title":"操作：选择该文件上传"},{"parent":"160a09d3-96ea-414e-a257-c1410a394839","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9bbe1f23-9d50-41b9-aded-6ec3041eed57","title":