398-473d-80d5-fc1833a806a0","title":"🟡【P2】打开大文件"},{"parent":"d404f9fd-6226-4ede-a932-8fb3be286dd8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"288fedd5-18a2-494d-899d-ec3ead1af53b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e1aa3538-b786-4053-bf29-d965760fd37d","title":"前置：存在 0 字节文件；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的打开项"},{"parent":"288fedd5-18a2-494d-899d-ec3ead1af53b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2222d003-5fca-45fb-94bc-ce96d581aac4","title":"操作：右键该文件后点击打开"},{"parent":"288fedd5-18a2-494d-899d-ec3ead1af53b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"225a8052-f22e-4a89-8458-f846e26c2dad","title":"预期：\n1) 产物预览 ｜ 打开空内容视图或提示文件为空，文件状态正常"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"288fedd5-18a2-494d-899d-ec3ead1af53b","title":"🟡【P2】打开零字节文件"},{"parent":"d404f9fd-6226-4ede-a932-8fb3be286dd8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"724eaa22-306a-4def-951c-a28821ea78f5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"199858be-44f0-4e7d-80c3-5be1ace97f4b","title":"前置：存在包含中文、空格、括号、井号与 emoji 的文件；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"724eaa22-306a-4def-951c-a28821ea78f5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c620ab7d-fbf8-4604-b198-d0f2ce2ff5a3","title":"操作：右键该文件并依次执行打开、复制路径、删除"},{"parent":"724eaa22-306a-4def-951c-a28821ea78f5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"374d0e1c-15d9-4ba8-946f-3bdc87e5759b","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 菜单正常展示不乱码\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 三项操作均使用正确完整的路径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"724eaa22-306a-4def-951c-a28821ea78f5","title":"🟡【P2】特殊字符文件名"},{"parent":"d404f9fd-6226-4ede-a932-8fb3be286dd8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8484d9ba-9aef-43b4-b6b1-23f56e1d194f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8fa4ef3f-f837-4b8e-bf3f-10959224fdb3","title":"前置：列表中有多个文件；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"8484d9ba-9aef-43b4-b6b1-23f56e1d194f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"71836bd5-9e53-458c-a96c-5dba8897a481","title":"操作：快速连续右键多个文件后点击打开"},{"parent":"8484d9ba-9aef-43b4-b6b1-23f56e1d194f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1cb0555c-4b8c-4b6e-b4f0-950b1b702684","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 菜单目标与最终点击项一致，不打开之前右键过的文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8484d9ba-9aef-43b4-b6b1-23f56e1d194f","title":"🟡【P2】快速连续右键多个文件"},{"parent":"d404f9fd-6226-4ede-a932-8fb3be286dd8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"937b6105-3401-42b7-942c-d297e4626039","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2e4ea878-3d72-43d6-b996-5e64e09a8bbc","title":"前置：项目中存在 .env 与 .gitignore；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"937b6105-3401-42b7-942c-d297e4626039","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"986034ea-f82f-4043-a6f2-2923dcf000c9","title":"操作：右键这两个文件"},{"parent":"937b6105-3401-42b7-942c-d297e4626039","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"463b306f-12f4-4f95-ac41-378cc963f603","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 按产品设置展示菜单\n2) 权限授权 ｜ 敏感文件的打开与复制路径符合安全策略，不明文暴露密钥"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"937b6105-3401-42b7-942c-d297e4626039","title":"🟡【P2】隐藏文件右键菜单"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d404f9fd-6226-4ede-a932-8fb3be286dd8","title":"边界场景（5）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"78a37deb-0290-414f-8014-f53b813e4fc4","title":"文件更多菜单"},{"parent":"3b13d72c-b1b6-42c7-9ddd-e712a94214dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fa1c716e-5950-4a7d-bea6-defc4760664a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e89816a0-5cc7-4dfa-b861-f2a3f3b839a1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7294d60a-c3bd-4aa6-a855-6849ba6f1dbb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b34668ad-0002-4f46-b4e3-28c5f86b0ef6","title":"前置：同一个文件同时出现在产物区与工作区文件列表；角色：房间成员；入口：产物区与工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"7294d60a-c3bd-4aa6-a855-6849ba6f1dbb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b3975787-c62d-471f-bdd5-e1642bb1b5c8","title":"操作：在两处分别右键该文件"},{"parent":"7294d60a-c3bd-4aa6-a855-6849ba6f1dbb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c2eef1b2-9e0f-4ae5-beea-85ededdf7414","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 两处菜单项完全一致，不出现某一处少了分享或复制路径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7294d60a-c3bd-4aa6-a855-6849ba6f1dbb","title":"🟠【P1】同一文件在两处的右键菜单一致"},{"parent":"e89816a0-5cc7-4dfa-b861-f2a3f3b839a1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c2287b5d-b9cf-45b6-9b0c-4ebb083d0b73","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"63f75866-2059-4c94-ac69-d4255c4c8c3b","title":"前置：同一个文件同时出现在产物区与工作区文件列表；角色：房间成员；入口：产物区"},{"parent":"c2287b5d-b9cf-45b6-9b0c-4ebb083d0b73","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e3b6599f-d8bf-40d8-95d4-ca5309c08641","title":"操作：在产物区重命名该文件，再切到工作区文件列表刷新"},{"parent":"c2287b5d-b9cf-45b6-9b0c-4ebb083d0b73","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"17b06704-cfe5-4299-946e-ccbae51256e0","title":"预期：\n1) 文件落盘 ｜ 工作区文件列表中的名称同步更新\n2) 归属与顺序 ｜ 不出现一处已改名另一处仍是旧名的不一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c2287b5d-b9cf-45b6-9b0c-4ebb083d0b73","title":"🟠【P1】一处操作后另一处同步"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e89816a0-5cc7-4dfa-b861-f2a3f3b839a1","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"fa1c716e-5950-4a7d-bea6-defc4760664a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"19d3d47d-6f4a-490f-adfa-7d9539cf77a2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1d472376-51e7-4b13-a631-93ae7a825895","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ff199872-813d-4292-ac0b-52e8d4a7f50b","title":"前置：同一个文件同时出现在两处且两个标签页都已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"1d472376-51e7-4b13-a631-93ae7a825895","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a3b73702-bd07-48f4-ad14-e0de1a3df65f","title":"操作：在工作区文件列表删除该文件，再切回产物区"},{"parent":"1d472376-51e7-4b13-a631-93ae7a825895","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"808facdb-874b-4d1c-92ae-d041f0905d66","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 产物区刷新后移除该项或标记为已删除\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 点击已删除项时提示文件不存在，不打开空白预览"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1d472376-51e7-4b13-a631-93ae7a825895","title":"🟡【P2】一处删除后另一处的表现"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"19d3d47d-6f4a-490f-adfa-7d9539cf77a2","title":"异常场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fa1c716e-5950-4a7d-bea6-defc4760664a","title":"两个入口的一致性"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3b13d72c-b1b6-42c7-9ddd-e712a94214dd","title":"文件树更多操作"},{"parent":"d86c0b06-382c-42cc-8248-f58542b33936","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fa194a4c-6f09-4e5c-a921-22f08bae21d5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d8de27d3-3b17-4755-bd8e-87d8c782fc76","title":"说明：分享弹窗从产物悬浮按钮、文件右键菜单、文件夹右键菜单三处进入，内容一致，本子模块只写一套"},{"parent":"fa194a4c-6f09-4e5c-a921-22f08bae21d5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"76cc7d75-ddae-478e-bbc7-a17c02b25233","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e948465d-dfc2-4dc2-a230-f9a985734099","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"20fa91c3-dc3e-4cff-902a-34e6c6945b65","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1240f7d8-9f4e-4500-885f-0272da54c0af","title":"前置：产物区或工作区文件列表中存在待分享的文件；角色：房间成员；入口：产物悬浮的分享按钮或右键菜单的分享项"},{"parent":"20fa91c3-dc3e-4cff-902a-34e6c6945b65","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"add41385-e1d1-41b1-a8a7-4be72854de8a","title":"操作：点击分享"},{"parent":"20fa91c3-dc3e-4cff-902a-34e6c6945b65","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"97968400-bff4-446d-9b74-0e063fef23d2","title":"预期：<br>1) 分享链接 ｜ 弹出分享弹窗，展示可见范围选项与分享按钮<br>2) 关联会话 ｜ 弹窗中展示该文件的关联会话模块"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"20fa91c3-dc3e-4cff-902a-34e6c6945b65","title":"🔴【P0】打开分享弹窗"},{"parent":"e948465d-dfc2-4dc2-a230-f9a985734099","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f82b7cd1-2a84-42b4-b322-06ed8417da13","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"117e4267-17cb-49b4-a61f-410d496b9223","title":"前置：同一个文件同时出现在产物区与工作区文件列表；角色：房间成员；入口：产物悬浮分享按钮与右键菜单分享项"},{"parent":"f82b7cd1-2a84-42b4-b322-06ed8417da13","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"25c07343-8fb2-4671-94e1-9f689fc621d5","title":"操作：分别从两个入口打开分享弹窗"},{"parent":"f82b7cd1-2a84-42b4-b322-06ed8417da13","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d1496166-2f5a-44cb-94d2-c924b1264ac3","title":"预期：\n1) 分享链接 ｜ 两处弹窗内容与可见范围选项完全一致，指向同一条分享记录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f82b7cd1-2a84-42b4-b322-06ed8417da13","title":"🟠【P1】两个入口打开的分享弹窗一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e948465d-dfc2-4dc2-a230-f9a985734099","title":"正常场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"76cc7d75-ddae-478e-bbc7-a17c02b25233","title":"分享弹窗"},{"parent":"fa194a4c-6f09-4e5c-a921-22f08bae21d5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"977055ac-2e22-4d7a-b297-3777d0dc93ae","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2370e53d-e49f-4520-ba26-2934c5130337","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6ba28862-8225-42e1-bf01-4d0b1d678557","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8aa656c0-7b67-4f74-9908-53c7a46d14b2","title":"前置：该文件所在房间有多名成员用不同 Agent 发起过会话；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗"},{"parent":"6ba28862-8225-42e1-bf01-4d0b1d678557","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"08a6f2e2-700f-48b6-8349-5796ebb059a5","title":"操作：查看关联会话模块"},{"parent":"6ba28862-8225-42e1-bf01-4d0b1d678557","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8287785e-5589-4a8a-afdb-077aa7120aed","title":"预期：\n1) 关联会话 ｜ 显示该文件所在房间成员发起过的所有会话，包括使用自己的和其他成员 Agent 的会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6ba28862-8225-42e1-bf01-4d0b1d678557","title":"🔴【P0】展示全部关联会话"},{"parent":"2370e53d-e49f-4520-ba26-2934c5130337","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fe3b6fe6-fce4-44cd-bb83-78c337046aaa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3e5fe6c-066d-4ef2-9f92-5bfbc6880e6e","title":"前置：关联会话中有一条正在运行中；角色：非房间成员；入口：分享链接页面"},{"parent":"fe3b6fe6-fce4-44cd-bb83-78c337046aaa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0720f361-aeac-4da4-bd50-dc4146eba613","title":"操作：打开分享链接查看该会话状态"},{"parent":"fe3b6fe6-fce4-44cd-bb83-78c337046aaa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"11b3154b-71c7-4621-9d4a-ab4f53a37faa","title":"预期：\n1) 关联会话 ｜ 分享链接里的关联会话状态同样显示为运行中，与房间内一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fe3b6fe6-fce4-44cd-bb83-78c337046aaa","title":"🟠【P1】关联会话的运行状态同步"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2370e53d-e49f-4520-ba26-2934c5130337","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"977055ac-2e22-4d7a-b297-3777d0dc93ae","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c1a335ea-0e70-46a5-9b33-6b181a8f4f5f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5a712d0f-4089-4c7e-8f57-92fb24c7bec3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"af1eb7e1-8d26-42fa-b100-1f28d0a761c1","title":"前置：该产物不由任何会话产生；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗"},{"parent":"5a712d0f-4089-4c7e-8f57-92fb24c7bec3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0367c969-64ea-4143-b8f3-074c14d67cc4","title":"操作：打开分享弹窗查看"},{"parent":"5a712d0f-4089-4c7e-8f57-92fb24c7bec3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"48a2fa59-526a-4b45-ba40-083dc45d504b","title":"预期：\n1) 关联会话 ｜ 不展示「关联会话」模块，不出现空标题的空区块"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5a712d0f-4089-4c7e-8f57-92fb24c7bec3","title":"🟠【P1】没有关联会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c1a335ea-0e70-46a5-9b33-6b181a8f4f5f","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"977055ac-2e22-4d7a-b297-3777d0dc93ae","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"da63dcfd-dadf-4a20-ba65-f95d2efd58e6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"97daaf9a-ef27-4797-a544-238535508f40","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8c0be544-c46b-4c47-8168-36e796c99dcf","title":"前置：关联会话详情中包含图片消息；角色：非房间成员；入口：分享链接页面"},{"parent":"97daaf9a-ef27-4797-a544-238535508f40","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"52ad5650-1d2d-4afe-b8f3-923862ae2c59","title":"操作：打开分享链接并进入关联会话详情"},{"parent":"97daaf9a-ef27-4797-a544-238535508f40","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5dc7f25-36d8-4400-b280-a3c3427f577e","title":"预期：\n1) 产物预览 ｜ 图片不展示预览图，显示「图片暂时无法预览，请前往房间查看」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"97daaf9a-ef27-4797-a544-238535508f40","title":"🟡【P2】分享链接中的图片预览"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"da63dcfd-dadf-4a20-ba65-f95d2efd58e6","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"977055ac-2e22-4d7a-b297-3777d0dc93ae","title":"关联会话"},{"parent":"fa194a4c-6f09-4e5c-a921-22f08bae21d5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1844dbac-ceb6-4eb2-8c95-ddadfc228d8a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5eac0781-5589-49f5-ad2b-4ba9bd0eddcd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a974ec17-bf71-470a-92d3-ce3e0fdb3919","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"da265563-5703-434b-a7f9-720f277d228f","title":"前置：分享弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗的可见范围选项"},{"parent":"a974ec17-bf71-470a-92d3-ce3e0fdb3919","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5df0ddde-16e7-469a-9f5f-d53976a84969","title":"操作：选择仅房间成员可见并点击分享，再用非房间成员账号打开链接"},{"parent":"a974ec17-bf71-470a-92d3-ce3e0fdb3919","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"369447b2-afc3-4a24-89b9-2e435704ef9c","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 非房间成员打开不可见，页面显示「仅房间成员可见」\n2) 可见范围 ｜ 房间成员打开可正常查看文件与关联会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a974ec17-bf71-470a-92d3-ce3e0fdb3919","title":"🔴【P0】仅房间成员可见"},{"parent":"5eac0781-5589-49f5-ad2b-4ba9bd0eddcd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"92922b7c-cb88-49e3-8a58-af4048dee2f3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c7792d7-08b2-488a-831c-bc840e0890eb","title":"前置：分享弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗的可见范围选项"},{"parent":"92922b7c-cb88-49e3-8a58-af4048dee2f3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"019054ac-8b99-423b-a5d1-563f432aa389","title":"操作：选择任何人可见并点击分享，再用非房间成员账号打开链接"},{"parent":"92922b7c-cb88-49e3-8a58-af4048dee2f3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"65014143-cde7-4c95-85fb-6e3945455222","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 非房间成员可以看见具体文件和关联会话\n2) 可见范围 ｜ 分享的是文件夹时不可评论"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"92922b7c-cb88-49e3-8a58-af4048dee2f3","title":"🔴【P0】任何人可见"},{"parent":"5eac0781-5589-49f5-ad2b-4ba9bd0eddcd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"803ca252-5585-478f-b47a-d238143fb2ca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5c009341-2647-454c-88f5-9218a04065c2","title":"前置：分享弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗的可见范围选项"},{"parent":"803ca252-5585-478f-b47a-d238143fb2ca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a9682fa1-5308-403f-8789-358a9f675536","title":"操作：选择只有我并点击分享，再用其他账号打开链接"},{"parent":"803ca252-5585-478f-b47a-d238143fb2ca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4befa39c-86d7-4525-8eaf-bae8afff32f7","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 除自己之外的所有人打开都不可见，包括房间内其他成员"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"803ca252-5585-478f-b47a-d238143fb2ca","title":"🔴【P0】只有我"},{"parent":"5eac0781-5589-49f5-ad2b-4ba9bd0eddcd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f5c036f9-4db1-4993-a205-5b640fc09e98","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c92436de-1dc4-449b-9401-0be70aa51eca","title":"前置：分享弹窗已打开并已选好可见范围；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗的分享按钮"},{"parent":"f5c036f9-4db1-4993-a205-5b640fc09e98","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"666b8303-86c3-42ee-b349-39b87b6e59b8","title":"操作：点击分享"},{"parent":"f5c036f9-4db1-4993-a205-5b640fc09e98","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ef92c5de-8c48-4d22-8e7d-9718f54f297e","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示分享链接已更新\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 「我分享的」tab 下新增该文件的分享记录，并显示所选的可见范围"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f5c036f9-4db1-4993-a205-5b640fc09e98","title":"🔴【P0】分享成功后的反馈与记录"},{"parent":"5eac0781-5589-49f5-ad2b-4ba9bd0eddcd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5bfb82a9-b1f3-49c6-a90e-d6c1f9e96368","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"30f33b42-2607-47b0-9e33-01d4ae685c3e","title":"前置：已对某文件分享过一次并选择仅房间成员可见；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗"},{"parent":"5bfb82a9-b1f3-49c6-a90e-d6c1f9e96368","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2caac156-db6a-4ea9-803b-79610b4e1e01","title":"操作：第二次分享该文件并改选为任何人可见，让其他人刷新页面"},{"parent":"5bfb82a9-b1f3-49c6-a90e-d6c1f9e96368","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dc8e8f91-8dca-4d67-80f1-2fffcbc1ffc6","title":"预期：\n1) 分享链接 ｜ 两次分享的链接地址保持一致\n2) 可见范围 ｜ 第一次其他人打开不可见，第二次刷新后可看到文件\n3) 可见范围 ｜ 以最新一次分享的权限为准"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5bfb82a9-b1f3-49c6-a90e-d6c1f9e96368","title":"🔴【P0】同一文件重复分享链接不变"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5eac0781-5589-49f5-ad2b-4ba9bd0eddcd","title":"正常场景（5）"},{"parent":"1844dbac-ceb6-4eb2-8c95-ddadfc228d8a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"eed6a045-f0d5-42ef-958e-5fe448c07a65","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"26a06330-00f1-4c1f-8ac1-a430935f769a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f96be0af-59ee-4efa-a5e1-ed243b1bb3ce","title":"前置：已选择仅房间成员可见并分享，该成员随后被移出房间；角色：被移出的成员；入口：分享链接页面"},{"parent":"26a06330-00f1-4c1f-8ac1-a430935f769a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"820ec75d-0dd4-460f-94b4-3ce3ce525944","title":"操作：刷新分享链接页面"},{"parent":"26a06330-00f1-4c1f-8ac1-a430935f769a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3fd663c-0a43-41c2-b6e0-bb3511ebff5c","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 刷新后不再可见，权限判定以当前房间成员关系为准"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"26a06330-00f1-4c1f-8ac1-a430935f769a","title":"🟠【P1】分享后又移出房间"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"eed6a045-f0d5-42ef-958e-5fe448c07a65","title":"异常场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1844dbac-ceb6-4eb2-8c95-ddadfc228d8a","title":"可见范围"},{"parent":"fa194a4c-6f09-4e5c-a921-22f08bae21d5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"adcdd014-9d4e-462d-b73b-627f1623cb92","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"531f823b-9d1a-4c07-8e57-54d4cf32c016","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3116c5bf-8a1b-44ac-ade1-bda960ca50e0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"43350c37-3fe1-4987-ab83-49133e788298","title":"前置：文件已分享且有多人参与评论；角色：非房间成员或房间成员；入口：分享链接页面的评论区"},{"parent":"3116c5bf-8a1b-44ac-ade1-bda960ca50e0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"78764b24-9936-41bb-a1a3-c255649e3706","title":"操作：在分享页面发表一条评论"},{"parent":"3116c5bf-8a1b-44ac-ade1-bda960ca50e0","customWidth":428.4,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"877788cd-7f6b-4972-ac85-3901e9cbf950","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 最后一个分享者与被回复者收到对应的评论消息\n2) 副作用 ｜ 自己的评论不出现在自己的消息中心"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3116c5bf-8a1b-44ac-ade1-bda960ca50e0","title":"🟠【P1】评论后的消息通知"},{"parent":"531f823b-9d1a-4c07-8e57-54d4cf32c016","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ff09d8ef-3319-4369-8e8a-c3236882661d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"96c12e04-138d-4995-a548-1982307960fe","title":"前置：分享页面评论区可用；角色：房间成员；入口：评论输入框"},{"parent":"ff09d8ef-3319-4369-8e8a-c3236882661d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c85b1ef-3921-470b-9bfa-379a4a0a0fec","title":"操作：在评论中输入 @ 并从下拉列表中选人"},{"parent":"ff09d8ef-3319-4369-8e8a-c3236882661d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"20321bf3-517a-4318-8d89-a7d1235cd5c1","title":"预期：<br>1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 下拉列表不出现自己<br>2) 提示文案 ｜ 只有被 @ 的人能在通知中心看到 @ 卡片"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ff09d8ef-3319-4369-8e8a-c3236882661d","title":"🟠【P1】评论中 @ 他人"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"531f823b-9d1a-4c07-8e57-54d4cf32c016","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"adcdd014-9d4e-462d-b73b-627f1623cb92","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"91623e06-67be-4d19-9adb-03e100c98be0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"35d2c9b8-94b0-455b-a838-9dbd6e59cc15","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2719492d-dfce-48be-aada-e9d72535ffcd","title":"前置：存在总大小超过 300MB 的文件夹；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的分享项"},{"parent":"35d2c9b8-94b0-455b-a838-9dbd6e59cc15","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"34d296a6-605b-4a53-bc3f-f36bb00a4b87","title":"操作：对该文件夹点击分享"},{"parent":"35d2c9b8-94b0-455b-a838-9dbd6e59cc15","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"61c86d2c-c11a-42fa-812a-f507bb242d10","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示「无法分享：文件或目录总大小不能超过300MB」\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不生成分享记录也不生成半成品链接"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"35d2c9b8-94b0-455b-a838-9dbd6e59cc15","title":"🟠【P1】分享的文件夹超过 300MB"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"91623e06-67be-4d19-9adb-03e100c98be0","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"adcdd014-9d4e-462d-b73b-627f1623cb92","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b4e04d1d-6952-4012-92dc-9a19076dd511","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5928fae2-6f3f-446c-821b-db2512760020","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a0f755e3-82ee-469c-83b7-c8437e7420b2","title":"前置：已按任何人可见分享一个文件夹；角色：非房间成员；入口：分享链接页面"},{"parent":"5928fae2-6f3f-446c-821b-db2512760020","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"69b66423-843b-457d-9516-193a08230cf1","title":"操作：打开该文件夹的分享页面并查找评论入口"},{"parent":"5928fae2-6f3f-446c-821b-db2512760020","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5cbde71-ae17-44b2-a9e2-773f722cc41f","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 文件夹分享页不提供评论功能，不出现可点但无效的评论框"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5928fae2-6f3f-446c-821b-db2512760020","title":"🟡【P2】文件夹分享页不可评论"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b4e04d1d-6952-4012-92dc-9a19076dd511","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"adcdd014-9d4e-462d-b73b-627f1623cb92","title":"分享限制与评论"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fa194a4c-6f09-4e5c-a921-22f08bae21d5","title":"分享与访问权限"},{"parent":"d86c0b06-382c-42cc-8248-f58542b33936","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"084ecc0f-ff1c-4ba3-b90b-cafce8d10c15","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ccdaaf3d-9114-4f86-8ab4-fc397b59f01b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3bbee06d-3904-4aa8-976b-a20af9e9d766","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e56ab6a1-249a-4aa1-be1d-751f5bbf3a15","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fa4663b3-b0d8-4db1-a31f-a23f43c91951","title":"前置：右侧面板已展开；角色：房间成员；入口：总览的终端入口或标签栏 + 号"},{"parent":"e56ab6a1-249a-4aa1-be1d-751f5bbf3a15","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dbbf00d8-674a-4445-9c69-5601efab294b","title":"操作：从总览点击终端，再用标签栏 + 号点击终端各打开一次"},{"parent":"e56ab6a1-249a-4aa1-be1d-751f5bbf3a15","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fe0f95e7-c203-456a-8be6-2ed2887c5d0b","title":"预期：\n1) 标签页 ｜ 两个入口都能打开终端标签页\n2) 标签页 ｜ 重复打开时按产品定义复用已有终端或新建，行为一致不随入口变化"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e56ab6a1-249a-4aa1-be1d-751f5bbf3a15","title":"🔴【P0】打开终端"},{"parent":"3bbee06d-3904-4aa8-976b-a20af9e9d766","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"66a1a1a1-4336-4e4f-909e-5565e79eb1b0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"61f42c90-a124-4ca1-b9ec-e6401e3313e9","title":"前置：终端标签页已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：终端内的新建窗口按钮"},{"parent":"66a1a1a1-4336-4e4f-909e-5565e79eb1b0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3afa9004-5c34-4cf1-b70d-de737d994102","title":"操作：点击新建窗口"},{"parent":"66a1a1a1-4336-4e4f-909e-5565e79eb1b0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"91ff4f1c-b59a-4912-a391-f61b7eda99b3","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 成功创建终端窗口，默认命名为 Terminal-N\n2) 命令执行 ｜ 新窗口可立即输入命令"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"66a1a1a1-4336-4e4f-909e-5565e79eb1b0","title":"🔴【P0】新建终端窗口"},{"parent":"3bbee06d-3904-4aa8-976b-a20af9e9d766","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0de692cc-7aad-42e8-9b95-e911c7ddf59a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2811a07a-c6ff-4dc8-aa40-57de24400785","title":"前置：至少存在一个终端窗口；角色：房间成员；入口：终端窗口的关闭按钮"},{"parent":"0de692cc-7aad-42e8-9b95-e911c7ddf59a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"298de0e2-92f6-4da6-8d28-da18093218c6","title":"操作：点击关闭"},{"parent":"0de692cc-7aad-42e8-9b95-e911c7ddf59a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4ad184a-3e1d-4f9f-88a1-bcde9eb2d046","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 窗口关闭并从窗口列表移除\n2) 副作用 ｜ 无残留进程，关闭后该窗口的命令不再继续执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0de692cc-7aad-42e8-9b95-e911c7ddf59a","title":"🔴【P0】关闭终端窗口"},{"parent":"3bbee06d-3904-4aa8-976b-a20af9e9d766","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"389ce268-24ed-495c-a5ee-8c142f947ddb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1a6d64b6-cc8a-44bc-970b-a53320a8f92e","title":"前置：终端标签页已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：终端内的新建窗口按钮"},{"parent":"389ce268-24ed-495c-a5ee-8c142f947ddb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e8ca674-7fc0-4582-9516-972d4cb9b759","title":"操作：连续创建 3 个以上终端窗口，在其中一个执行 cd 后查看其他窗口"},{"parent":"389ce268-24ed-495c-a5ee-8c142f947ddb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"813d22eb-0e1a-489e-8242-c4b906077d59","title":"预期：\n1) 环境隔离 ｜ 多个终端独立运行，互不干扰\n2) 环境隔离 ｜ 一个窗口切换目录不影响其他窗口的当前目录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"389ce268-24ed-495c-a5ee-8c142f947ddb","title":"🟠【P1】同时创建多个终端"},{"parent":"3bbee06d-3904-4aa8-976b-a20af9e9d766","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2ab0e1df-6711-4c30-a297-c8bb1da8596a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6ce2dcf6-d63f-4952-b859-a876afbc2853","title":"前置：已创建多个终端窗口且各自执行过命令；角色：房间成员；入口：终端窗口列表"},{"parent":"2ab0e1df-6711-4c30-a297-c8bb1da8596a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a8307a6b-899d-4ea0-930b-447d238f849e","title":"操作：查看窗口列表"},{"parent":"2ab0e1df-6711-4c30-a297-c8bb1da8596a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f2a6f5c9-bb25-453c-a8a4-723ec2a04c88","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 每条显示窗口名 Terminal-N 与最近一条命令\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 当前活跃窗口有选中标识"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2ab0e1df-6711-4c30-a297-c8bb1da8596a","title":"🟠【P1】终端窗口列表展示"},{"parent":"3bbee06d-3904-4aa8-976b-a20af9e9d766","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"215c5a8b-8263-4bf4-a73e-e63ecdcf9462","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4c7dbbe2-3f8d-434a-a6a5-214f680b81ba","title":"前置：已创建多个终端窗口；角色：房间成员；入口：房间"},{"parent":"215c5a8b-8263-4bf4-a73e-e63ecdcf9462","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7df0dd6-5d84-4f35-854f-c7ae9bdb3186","title":"操作：关闭房间后再次进入同一房间并打开终端"},{"parent":"215c5a8b-8263-4bf4-a73e-e63ecdcf9462","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"94600efd-0f18-4436-99ff-2c2c23f005c4","title":"预期：\n1) 持久化 ｜ 已创建的终端窗口列表保留\n2) 持久化 ｜ 各窗口状态恢复，历史输出可查看"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"215c5a8b-8263-4bf4-a73e-e63ecdcf9462","title":"🔴【P0】重开房间后终端恢复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3bbee06d-3904-4aa8-976b-a20af9e9d766","title":"正常场景（6）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ccdaaf3d-9114-4f86-8ab4-fc397b59f01b","title":"终端窗口管理"},{"parent":"084ecc0f-ff1c-4ba3-b90b-cafce8d10c15","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8d6a0622-ee38-483a-ba21-9f76e6dcf86a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"49be1df2-9e10-4dc4-adcb-1413142ae7be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8d6e57e3-9b4d-44ed-a245-a1192a4925f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"52031744-5e31-4e98-9890-d284a30d3018","title":"前置：终端窗口已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：终端输入区"},{"parent":"8d6e57e3-9b4d-44ed-a245-a1192a4925f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5319fab6-d142-436d-90bd-65814c60f755","title":"操作：依次输入 ls、ls -a、rm 等基础命令"},{"parent":"8d6e57e3-9b4d-44ed-a245-a1192a4925f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"215c8b9a-ae37-46b5-a2aa-5db92238780d","title":"预期：\n1) 命令执行 ｜ 命令正常执行，返回结果正确显示\n2) 消息渲染 ｜ 中文与特殊字符输出不乱码"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8d6e57e3-9b4d-44ed-a245-a1192a4925f8","title":"🔴【P0】基础命令执行"},{"parent":"49be1df2-9e10-4dc4-adcb-1413142ae7be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a92c2712-39ef-4fcc-becb-be1a569b6b9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c4294bb-61dd-4340-a035-ce9a3c2c1344","title":"前置：同一房间的另一名成员已进入该终端；角色：协作者；入口：终端输入区"},{"parent":"a92c2712-39ef-4fcc-becb-be1a569b6b9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"49cd4513-1309-4848-9d6c-47d2e15d5b3e","title":"操作：协作者输入 ls、ls -a、rm 等基础命令"},{"parent":"a92c2712-39ef-4fcc-becb-be1a569b6b9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d34f79fc-85b4-42aa-a616-67f9e7b68f27","title":"预期：\n1) 命令执行 ｜ 命令正常执行并返回结果\n2) 权限授权 ｜ 协作者的可执行范围与所有者一致或按产品定义受限，行为明确不含糊"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a92c2712-39ef-4fcc-becb-be1a569b6b9b","title":"🟠【P1】协作者执行基础命令"},{"parent":"49be1df2-9e10-4dc4-adcb-1413142ae7be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1115e356-1c9f-4b5f-81b9-3ec7498008cf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"16c699c7-369e-4aad-8679-b4982433ad01","title":"前置：终端中已执行过多条命令；角色：房间成员；入口：终端输入区"},{"parent":"1115e356-1c9f-4b5f-81b9-3ec7498008cf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7d26a4d-9153-4cce-88d6-bf22ac8c1c5b","title":"操作：按上下方向键切换历史命令"},{"parent":"1115e356-1c9f-4b5f-81b9-3ec7498008cf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc315e15-eddb-46b7-a3a6-5e8dd490a6e5","title":"预期：\n1) 命令执行 ｜ 历史命令正确显示且顺序正确，可直接回车重复执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1115e356-1c9f-4b5f-81b9-3ec7498008cf","title":"🟠【P1】命令历史记录"},{"parent":"49be1df2-9e10-4dc4-adcb-1413142ae7be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"758bfae4-5b34-4494-8d40-ebda3f6207d7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"582c83c2-20b8-4f19-b348-733878b5779c","title":"前置：会话已绑定项目；角色：房间成员；入口：新打开的终端窗口"},{"parent":"758bfae4-5b34-4494-8d40-ebda3f6207d7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3aa11c04-24c0-4f2a-be4d-1833a1804059","title":"操作：查看默认工作目录并执行 pwd"},{"parent":"758bfae4-5b34-4494-8d40-ebda3f6207d7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1614ce43-004c-478e-90e9-68ee6b8e31a2","title":"预期：\n1) 环境隔离 ｜ 默认进入该会话所属项目的工作目录，如 /workspace/xxx\n2) 环境隔离 ｜ 不落在用户主目录或上一个项目的目录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"758bfae4-5b34-4494-8d40-ebda3f6207d7","title":"🔴【P0】默认工作目录正确"},{"parent":"49be1df2-9e10-4dc4-adcb-1413142ae7be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"10b60ed7-331f-47f2-a5ed-eab86d909ad6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8a323fea-b99b-4334-b04c-96d70655fedb","title":"前置：终端窗口与工作区文件列表都已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：终端输入区"},{"parent":"10b60ed7-331f-47f2-a5ed-eab86d909ad6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"784b1dd6-4d84-46f4-aed1-2254b2be2523","title":"操作：执行 touch test.txt 后查看文件列表，再执行 rm test.txt 后再次查看"},{"parent":"10b60ed7-331f-47f2-a5ed-eab86d909ad6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9f9af2bb-fdff-4c49-9c52-d93081cddc5e","title":"预期：\n1) 文件落盘 ｜ 文件列表中同步出现新建文件\n2) 文件落盘 ｜ 删除后文件列表中对应项同步消失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"10b60ed7-331f-47f2-a5ed-eab86d909ad6","title":"🔴【P0】终端创建删除文件与文件列表联动"},{"parent":"49be1df2-9e10-4dc4-adcb-1413142ae7be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"65ca7b67-7069-43c6-bf02-06e8076a914c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1ccfe5a8-c189-401f-9a33-46e2da7583a7","title":"前置：刚通过右键菜单上传了一个文件；角色：房间成员；入口：终端输入区"},{"parent":"65ca7b67-7069-43c6-bf02-06e8076a914c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"34b5c67a-f023-48eb-84ce-96b7596e67fd","title":"操作：在对应目录执行 ls"},{"parent":"65ca7b67-7069-43c6-bf02-06e8076a914c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"184870a5-7374-4c2e-a784-fd18ac448a9d","title":"预期：\n1) 文件落盘 ｜ 终端输出中包含新上传的文件，大小与本地一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"65ca7b67-7069-43c6-bf02-06e8076a914c","title":"🟠【P1】上传的文件在终端可见"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"49be1df2-9e10-4dc4-adcb-1413142ae7be","title":"正常场景（6）"},{"parent":"8d6a0622-ee38-483a-ba21-9f76e6dcf86a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bdeea624-1b20-4ed6-8e90-19de51259f65","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f222f81a-b78b-451a-9545-8b7ceb659664","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0405f0d5-15c7-4a70-8db9-fe9efb12ad87","title":"前置：终端窗口已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：终端输入区"},{"parent":"f222f81a-b78b-451a-9545-8b7ceb659664","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8de8a8e9-4975-4e0d-b8bb-e7aa7a8a6b18","title":"操作：输入不存在的命令与错误参数"},{"parent":"f222f81a-b78b-451a-9545-8b7ceb659664","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d5b0fb12-655d-44aa-befc-80669f1bedeb","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 终端返回可读的错误信息\n2) 副作用 ｜ 终端不崩溃，仍可继续输入下一条命令"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f222f81a-b78b-451a-9545-8b7ceb659664","title":"🟠【P1】错误命令处理"},{"parent":"bdeea624-1b20-4ed6-8e90-19de51259f65","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6c6a4bbe-0167-4740-9f32-7a48c03b7188","callout"