:"🟡【P2】超大输出"},{"parent":"0e371153-877f-4a97-b71c-f8932e42896b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"40bc4b7f-ea3d-4953-b5a3-4a1bcfd86cfb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"619aebd1-8bc5-464c-a747-9af1e923a3f2","title":"前置：终端窗口已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：终端输入区"},{"parent":"40bc4b7f-ea3d-4953-b5a3-4a1bcfd86cfb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"53cc0006-1e64-4c91-be9e-7e902990049d","title":"操作：执行需要确认或输入密码的交互式命令"},{"parent":"40bc4b7f-ea3d-4953-b5a3-4a1bcfd86cfb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e6102055-6ac7-4cb9-8f79-d1b2f4be34bf","title":"预期：\n1) 命令执行 ｜ 命令不无限挂起，支持交互输入或超时后以非交互方式处理并给出说明"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"40bc4b7f-ea3d-4953-b5a3-4a1bcfd86cfb","title":"🟡【P2】需要交互输入的命令"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0e371153-877f-4a97-b71c-f8932e42896b","title":"边界场景（3）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8d6a0622-ee38-483a-ba21-9f76e6dcf86a","title":"命令执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"084ecc0f-ff1c-4ba3-b90b-cafce8d10c15","title":"终端"},{"parent":"d86c0b06-382c-42cc-8248-f58542b33936","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1dcd1cd4-bea3-4db8-b659-65718e6aeb8f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b6c9dd55-8ec8-4990-bfab-36b1f38e1ce6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7da49f77-3c5f-4396-bbae-56a647faa088","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8d92ce5a-306e-4b76-ba5f-367071df8e2c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e3fd851a-97c7-40da-a7fe-914f4551d341","title":"前置：右侧面板已展开；角色：房间成员；入口：总览的浏览器入口或标签栏 + 号"},{"parent":"8d92ce5a-306e-4b76-ba5f-367071df8e2c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3e9c4857-b8d2-499e-8612-f784d1b301ec","title":"操作：从总览点击浏览器，再用标签栏 + 号点击浏览器各打开一次"},{"parent":"8d92ce5a-306e-4b76-ba5f-367071df8e2c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0c58fe55-1f55-4291-a645-ad0c91aaad8f","title":"预期：\n1) 标签页 ｜ 两个入口都能打开浏览器标签页\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 打开后展示地址栏与本地端口列表"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8d92ce5a-306e-4b76-ba5f-367071df8e2c","title":"🔴【P0】打开浏览器"},{"parent":"7da49f77-3c5f-4396-bbae-56a647faa088","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ee7378fe-8290-4d74-9419-eacf5ea2141c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a111dddf-48ac-4d9a-89fa-98359b1ced1f","title":"前置：浏览器标签页已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：新建窗口按钮"},{"parent":"ee7378fe-8290-4d74-9419-eacf5ea2141c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"493d7080-0243-4e44-975d-d3458b704e6d","title":"操作：点击新建窗口"},{"parent":"ee7378fe-8290-4d74-9419-eacf5ea2141c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"585d6aa1-612c-4575-b7e3-33cfbcc3bd60","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 成功创建新的浏览器窗口，默认页按产品定义"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ee7378fe-8290-4d74-9419-eacf5ea2141c","title":"🔴【P0】新建网页窗口"},{"parent":"7da49f77-3c5f-4396-bbae-56a647faa088","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cae16f36-b808-48b8-b87a-578685cd011b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6dda2e52-c9f9-4a6a-9cc4-acae9ce69821","title":"前置：至少存在一个网页窗口；角色：房间成员；入口：窗口关闭按钮"},{"parent":"cae16f36-b808-48b8-b87a-578685cd011b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5db19fd1-c303-4c6e-95ba-3e278f5d5105","title":"操作：点击关闭按钮"},{"parent":"cae16f36-b808-48b8-b87a-578685cd011b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ac558e03-2827-4419-8f6c-f81dd02d9926","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 窗口正常关闭并从列表移除\n2) 副作用 ｜ 无残留进程，页面中的定时任务停止"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cae16f36-b808-48b8-b87a-578685cd011b","title":"🔴【P0】关闭网页窗口"},{"parent":"7da49f77-3c5f-4396-bbae-56a647faa088","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a63cbd3c-34c1-4b9d-a039-215d3d899188","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5948cde6-23e4-4222-942f-e6d4d9ddf4d1","title":"前置：浏览器标签页已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：新建窗口按钮"},{"parent":"a63cbd3c-34c1-4b9d-a039-215d3d899188","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"60c40606-e8cd-42c8-86f3-e4b3a737441c","title":"操作：连续新建 3 个以上窗口并分别访问不同网页"},{"parent":"a63cbd3c-34c1-4b9d-a039-215d3d899188","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c3d09b6f-9705-48a4-8902-eab591688671","title":"预期：\n1) 环境隔离 ｜ 多个窗口独立运行，互不干扰\n2) 环境隔离 ｜ 一个窗口崩溃或卡住不影响其他窗口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a63cbd3c-34c1-4b9d-a039-215d3d899188","title":"🟠【P1】同时创建多个网页窗口"},{"parent":"7da49f77-3c5f-4396-bbae-56a647faa088","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a6fe2466-27b6-4a90-a214-710f9c711705","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9a680578-114e-4dea-b9bf-830463569fb4","title":"前置：已创建多个网页窗口；角色：房间成员；入口：浏览器窗口列表"},{"parent":"a6fe2