】浏览器文件下载"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7e17dff1-ce16-45ac-8ecc-813dc8053ef1","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"c6f5352d-7753-45e2-9d21-c5885f7368b6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cc78adcb-5608-4323-bb71-63545118fd66","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"eebc3152-6036-47d7-81f2-94f97f693e0e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8bf81ec6-e345-40d6-aa64-eeb6bec40e3c","title":"前置：浏览器窗口已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：地址栏"},{"parent":"eebc3152-6036-47d7-81f2-94f97f693e0e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9433c7d3-1842-4b5b-9f3e-2236091a7e9b","title":"操作：输入不存在的域名与不存在的页面路径"},{"parent":"eebc3152-6036-47d7-81f2-94f97f693e0e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"570978ed-8ad0-4cac-be4c-607d92c150fe","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 显示友好的错误提示页面，说明是域名无法解析还是页面不存在"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"eebc3152-6036-47d7-81f2-94f97f693e0e","title":"🟠【P1】访问无效 URL 或 404"},{"parent":"cc78adcb-5608-4323-bb71-63545118fd66","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9f6fc734-062d-4e1a-a37f-3287858027e2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a9f7bfc0-9154-405a-940a-edca9ac58218","title":"前置：浏览器窗口已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：地址栏"},{"parent":"9f6fc734-062d-4e1a-a37f-3287858027e2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c459245d-e740-4787-ba78-09336cd492ef","title":"操作：断开网络后访问网页，恢复网络后刷新"},{"parent":"9f6fc734-062d-4e1a-a37f-3287858027e2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13e1ae12-27be-4d6c-afd1-771786c8e22d","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 显示网络错误提示\n2) 恢复重试 ｜ 恢复网络后刷新可正常访问，不需要重建窗口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9f6fc734-062d-4e1a-a37f-3287858027e2","title":"🟠【P1】断网时访问网页"},{"parent":"cc78adcb-5608-4323-bb71-63545118fd66","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"180e069e-ce1a-4a0e-8905-60764978267b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ecac568a-4cad-40c5-b004-98cb7c2e51f2","title":"前置：当前依赖 VPN 才能访问目标站点；角色：房间成员；入口：地址栏"},{"parent":"180e069e-ce1a-4a0e-8905-60764978267b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ca3f4fb5-b4b6-4fb8-a70f-743c4205e707","title":"操作：关闭 VPN 后访问该站点，再重新开启 VPN 刷新"},{"parent":"180e069e-ce1a-4a0e-8905-60764978267b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3fa0ae69-4877-474e-b9d6-9ec158792824","ti