f24d-f257-482f-a3b2-1b6ba543d01f","title":"前置：端口列表已加载，随后 Agent 新起了一个服务；角色：房间成员；入口：端口列表右上角的 Refresh"},{"parent":"4e130cca-9cb7-46b1-937b-7505aadc1407","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9b092708-0a92-4723-a0cf-04aa3d26bf2f","title":"操作：点击 Refresh"},{"parent":"4e130cca-9cb7-46b1-937b-7505aadc1407","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ba44db99-3a73-4f8b-b1a6-c730c3271aa4","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 实时同步端口状态，新起的端口出现在列表中\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 已关闭的端口从列表移除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4e130cca-9cb7-46b1-937b-7505aadc1407","title":"🔴【P0】刷新端口状态"},{"parent":"a1bfb219-abd7-4b36-ac15-f9fda76f9e99","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fb20a3d4-913d-48a4-8db5-622b938e97ed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"63f27d29-3f92-45c2-ba83-8b8f050146d9","title":"前置：端口列表中至少有一个可用端口；角色：房间成员；入口：端口卡片上的分享按钮"},{"parent":"fb20a3d4-913d-48a4-8db5-622b938e97ed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1d2460ac-e50e-487b-9e67-fd26ce5c5124","title":"操作：点击该按钮"},{"parent":"fb20a3d4-913d-48a4-8db5-622b938e97ed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"221c921c-4ea0-48c5-8be7-c0817d54d34f","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 剪贴板内容为该端口对应的可访问链接\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 给出复制成功反馈"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fb20a3d4-913d-48a4-8db5-622b938e97ed","title":"🟠【P1】复制网页链接"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a1bfb219-abd7-4b36-ac15-f9fda76f9e99","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"cacd01ad-b1ea-4c3c-8be0-d1c5d81d3c2d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5330eb76-39c7-4db4-9f41-2bb4dd742bda","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fb992d9f-793e-419d-bcf5-22360748efb8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f12f66b1-6ec5-44c5-8a87-8d6714e7a5d7","title":"前置：当前项目下没有任何 Agent 起的服务；角色：房间成员；入口：浏览器标签页的 Localhost 区"},{"parent":"fb992d9f-793e-419d-bcf5-22360748efb8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"805ca66d-2e8e-4946-b2c9-79348fa2c42a","title":"操作：查看端口列表"},{"parent":"fb992d9f-793e-419d-bcf5-22360748efb8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9abb517e-0556-4b64-868c-7d07bd083c64","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 显示「暂未发现可用本地端口」，不显示空列表或一直加载中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fb992d9f-793e-419d-bcf5-22360748efb8","title":"🟠【P1】无可用端口"},{"parent":"