 ｜ 路径合理截断，悬浮或复制可得完整路径\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 截断不影响端口号与分享按钮的展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dacba9ed-ea4f-49ed-bca0-de1e7e9e1c2c","title":"🟡【P2】超长 workspace 路径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a15acbd9-219c-411f-885d-1872b71ad4ad","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cacd01ad-b1ea-4c3c-8be0-d1c5d81d3c2d","title":"本地端口列表"},{"parent":"1dcd1cd4-bea3-4db8-b659-65718e6aeb8f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"87084c56-a968-4f4a-8ff1-a5946ebb3af6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"63940880-1218-4323-a302-129fc934d182","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4083c82d-df08-410a-b39e-e58f0a06aadc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f2d861f1-3c62-4b44-9ac4-b691730d5c6b","title":"前置：本机安装了 Chrome 且有已登录的 profile；角色：房间成员；入口：浏览器标签页底部的 Choose Profile"},{"parent":"4083c82d-df08-410a-b39e-e58f0a06aadc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d6205165-3a73-4b7e-b80f-a4f38f022394","title":"操作：点击 Choose Profile"},{"parent":"4083c82d-df08-410a-b39e-e58f0a06aadc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"84444b49-4ae8-4f53-9715-ff19c49f67b5","title":"预期：\n1) 登录导入 ｜ 弹出 Import login state 弹窗\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 弹窗说明只导入登录 Cookie，不导入密码、书签与历史\n3) 列表展示 ｜ 列出本机 Chrome 与 Dia 中登录过的 profile，每条显示头像、名称、邮箱与所属浏览器"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4083c82d-df08-410a-b39e-e58f0a06aadc","title":"🔴【P0】打开导入登录状态弹窗"},{"parent":"63940880-1218-4323-a302-129fc934d182","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"db70e035-1a58-4e4f-81b7-6a4faaef2cb2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7959266-62ec-4cd6-af07-a2b996fa9c17","title":"前置：Import login state 弹窗已打开且列出多个 profile；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗中的 profile 列表"},{"parent":"db70e035-1a58-4e4f-81b7-6a4faaef2cb2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fa72d12d-eaaf-4395-8f03-c30771f7611d","title":"操作：选中一个 profile 后点击 Import Cookies"},{"parent":"db70e035-1a58-4e4f-81b7-6a4faaef2cb2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ed90dcd-0917-43f8-afdc-9f2884180452","title":"预期：\n1) 登录导入 ｜ 导入成功并给出结果反馈\n2) 登录状态 ｜ 在浏览器中打开对应站点时已是登录态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"db70e035-1a58-4e4f-81b7-6a4faaef2cb2","title":"🔴【P0】选择 profile 导入 Cookie"},{"parent":"63940880-1218-4323-a302-129fc934d182","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c327a8ce-5db8-45fc-99f1-2707c7c658ec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5840c043-96e3-4d3a-a764-41c8cb653d65","title":"前置：已成功导入某个 Google 账号的登录状态；角色：房间成员；入口：新建网页窗口"},{"parent":"c327a8ce-5db8-45fc-99f1-2707c7c658ec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dcfadf08-69d5-4090-bb22-d0cee59afafc","title":"操作：新建一个网页窗口并访问同一站点"},{"parent":"c327a8ce-5db8-45fc-99f1-2707c7c658ec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"97f709ce-c3a8-48d3-81b1-ef4e7625f3e8","title":"预期：\n1) 登录状态 ｜ 新窗口仍保持登录状态，不需要重新导入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c327a8ce-5db8-45fc-99f1-2707c7c658ec","title":"🔴【P0】导入后新窗口保持登录"},{"parent":"63940880-1218-4323-a302-129fc934d182","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b8b72bcd-fe31-4998-824f-99bb037c69d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5a7ae2e5-8d45-47d3-9291-6b165061380e","title":"前置：已成功导入登录状态；角色：房间成员；入口：应用"},{"parent":"b8b72bcd-fe31-4998-824f-99bb037c69d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"729ecc5b-e6e4-4567-8e79-47c8e912eb66","title":"操作：退出应用后重新打开并访问同一站点"},{"parent":"b8b72bcd-fe31-4998-824f-99bb037c69d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"73154583-cae8-40fa-9fbc-1b7ad6081ef1","title":"预期：\n1) 持久化 ｜ 账号仍处于登录中\n2) 登录状态 ｜ 后续新开的窗口同样保持登录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b8b72bcd-fe31-4998-824f-99bb037c69d4","title":"🔴【P0】退出应用后登录状态保持"},{"parent":"63940880-1218-4323-a302-129fc934d182","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8f8a3cb9-12f0-4449-aa0b-09bddbb2df00","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"90ec7f5d-2c70-42ca-97a0-d9d586ebe8c8","title":"前置：Import login state 弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗的 Cancel 按钮"},{"parent":"8f8a3cb9-12f0-4449-aa0b-09bddbb2df00","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ac416b0b-a388-4566-bce1-66332041b62b","title":"操作：点击 Cancel"},{"parent":"8f8a3cb9-12f0-4449-aa0b-09bddbb2df00","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"70ccb5f9-0be9-429b-ae53-9b49cc14917d","title":"预期：\n1) 登录导入 ｜ 弹窗关闭且不导入任何 Cookie\n2) 副作用 ｜ 浏览器登录状态与打开弹窗前一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8f8a3cb9-12f0-4449-aa0b-09bddbb2df00","title":"🟠【P1】取消导入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"63940880-1218-4323-a302-129fc934d182","title":"正常场景（5）"},{"parent":"87084c56-a968-4f4a-8ff1-a5946ebb3af6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f3ffce53-030d-490d-a2a2-0f871d628c22","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a0cbe9f2-12d5-4bdd-92a9-47b935c2a60b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bf474fa0-d6d0-4c83-9162-38dc0f419d6e","title":"前置：Import login state 弹窗已打开且未选中任何 profile；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗的 Import Cookies 按钮"},{"parent":"a0cbe9f2-12d5-4bdd-92a9-47b935c2a60b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"be8be311-cf25-4b8e-b3c9-f4fd6fa0e531","title":"操作：直接点击 Import Cookies"},{"parent":"a0cbe9f2-12d5-4bdd-92a9-47b935c2a60b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"83f29aa8-0575-4a2e-99c2-58302953120e","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 按钮为不可用态，点击无响应，不发起导入请求"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a0cbe9f2-12d5-4bdd-92a9-47b935c2a60b","title":"🟠【P1】未选中 profile 时不可导入"},{"parent":"f3ffce53-030d-490d-a2a2-0f871d628c22","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"132493ce-a754-4ad7-bf4e-8dba348e46ea","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"86afd356-93d9-4c77-93c5-aad493016282","title":"前置：本机未安装 Chrome 与 Dia 或没有已登录的 profile；角色：房间成员；入口：Choose Profile"},{"parent":"132493ce-a754-4ad7-bf4e-8dba348e46ea","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2bad9a5f-8244-4dbb-83e5-235292a00db4","title":"操作：点击 Choose Profile"},{"parent":"132493ce-a754-4ad7-bf4e-8dba348e46ea","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"40139686-0024-4f06-908d-f646aa40f926","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 弹窗给出没有可导入 profile 的说明与处理建议，不显示空列表"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"132493ce-a754-4ad7-bf4e-8dba348e46ea","title":"🟠【P1】本机没有可导入的 profile"},{"parent":"f3ffce53-030d-490d-a2a2-0f871d628c22","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0c048e1f-215a-4d71-8d57-4c953f041054","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d9e60235-1e96-44bb-b5e7-b3147efa1599","title":"前置：目标 profile 正被本机 Chrome 占用或无读取权限；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗的 Import Cookies 按钮"},{"parent":"0c048e1f-215a-4d71-8d57-4c953f041054","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c15253a6-ca13-4610-916e-858019bf73fa","title":"操作：选中该 profile 后点击 Import Cookies"},{"parent":"0c048e1f-215a-4d71-8d57-4c953f041054","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4d64d90a-8b44-4fd7-b3fd-3ba7fd4ae27f","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示导入失败并说明原因\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不产生半导入状态，原有登录状态不被破坏"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0c048e1f-215a-4d71-8d57-4c953f041054","title":"🟠【P1】导入过程中读取失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f3ffce53-030d-490d-a2a2-0f871d628c22","title":"异常场景（3）"},{"parent":"87084c56-a968-4f4a-8ff1-a5946ebb3af6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b9d73201-f5bb-43db-95e4-44251112dab5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"66a01b66-1698-47f1-b311-b598a51184f0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5b6c5494-7862-4c29-bf08-19d06a95a54f","title":"前置：所选 profile 中有保存的密码、书签与历史记录；角色：房间成员；入口：弹窗的 Import Cookies 按钮"},{"parent":"66a01b66-1698-47f1-b311-b598a51184f0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c05c5c29-2c20-44be-9ee0-76c271bb900e","title":"操作：完成导入后在面板浏览器中查看书签、历史与密码管理"},{"parent":"66a01b66-1698-47f1-b311-b598a51184f0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e8a2647f-f689-4dd9-a9a2-d4a01f4b8ab9","title":"预期：\n1) 审计脱敏 ｜ 只导入登录 Cookie，书签、历史与密码均未被导入\n2) 权限授权 ｜ 不在界面或日志中展示 Cookie 明文"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"66a01b66-1698-47f1-b311-b598a51184f0","title":"🟡【P2】只导入 Cookie 不导入其他数据"},{"parent":"b9d73201-f5bb-43db-95e4-44251112dab5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"108cf9df-8775-4fdc-a28b-679e54631f99","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"52372b4e-ae5f-4c3a-9694-9c8a6a140ba5","title":"前置：已导入过某个 profile；角色：房间成员；入口：Choose Profile"},{"parent":"108cf9df-8775-4fdc-a28b-679e54631f99","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fad8ea3a-6576-4145-af7e-e078d19945ff","title":"操作：再次选择同一 profile 导入"},{"parent":"108cf9df-8775-4fdc-a28b-679e54631f99","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"64469c26-11fa-4f26-a1ab-30ec168ff4b4","title":"预期：\n1) 登录导入 ｜ 覆盖为最新的 Cookie，不产生重复记录\n2) 登录状态 ｜ 登录状态仍然有效"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"108cf9df-8775-4fdc-a28b-679e54631f99","title":"🟡【P2】重复导入同一 profile"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b9d73201-f5bb-43db-95e4-44251112dab5","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"87084c56-a968-4f4a-8ff1-a5946ebb3af6","title":"导入登录状态"},{"parent":"1dcd1cd4-bea3-4db8-b659-65718e6aeb8f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4a302ebe-4ded-4d89-82d2-f1e4dfc8e3c9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"60a45b6c-2ba1-4fa9-8a9a-2afc5070abda","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"41b7e45d-5522-4b83-bb02-c46067156013","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b321ba16-0106-48ed-9e8f-dce05921cc17","title":"前置：同时启动多个 Agent 且各自会起服务；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"41b7e45d-5522-4b83-bb02-c46067156013","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cf40f0a0-5c66-4374-8116-70d7e0fda6ae","title":"操作：让多个 Agent 并行执行会起服务的任务，查看各自端口与会话可用性"},{"parent":"41b7e45d-5522-4b83-bb02-c46067156013","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f16cfd5f-9ed1-42ce-92ef-dbc3c16ce33e","title":"预期：\n1) 端口 ｜ 各 Agent 分配到独立端口，互不抢占\n2) 会话状态 ｜ 各会话均可正常执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"41b7e45d-5522-4b83-bb02-c46067156013","title":"🔴【P0】多个 Agent 并行时端口独立"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"60a45b6c-2ba1-4fa9-8a9a-2afc5070abda","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"4a302ebe-4ded-4d89-82d2-f1e4dfc8e3c9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9884b39a-234a-41b7-bbf2-ab1e17d32316","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"231f8735-de8c-4cde-a1df-e528c1323000","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6cf4141b-c502-4495-b9b1-51aea5bffd9c","title":"前置：Codex 已启动两个不同端口的服务；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"231f8735-de8c-4cde-a1df-e528c1323000","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"54b21248-e8ed-414b-b101-7deaf3666f0e","title":"操作：让 Tutti Agent 再启动一个新端口，随后访问前两个端口"},{"parent":"231f8735-de8c-4cde-a1df-e528c1323000","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13bae69c-d30d-4d76-a25b-be2e28626468","title":"预期：\n1) 端口 ｜ 新端口启动成功且原有两个端口继续可访问，不出现前面的端口被关闭\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 浏览器首页同时列出三个端口"},{"parent":"231f8735-de8c-4cde-a1df-e528c1323000","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b116d9ae-7e13-47fd-abf2-ff8e90a62a14","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#219】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"231f8735-de8c-4cde-a1df-e528c1323000","title":"🔴【P0】新 Agent 启动端口不会关闭已有端口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9884b39a-234a-41b7-bbf2-ab1e17d32316","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"4a302ebe-4ded-4d89-82d2-f1e4dfc8e3c9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7d55bf8f-c201-4f24-b030-a895eeecfcb2","c