入口：共享 Agent 的历史记录页"},{"parent":"be242651-b943-4183-b9d8-55792d50aa0e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"08801d51-4a86-4c21-ac16-bb621192ff65","title":"操作：停留在历史记录页并尝试发送消息"},{"parent":"be242651-b943-4183-b9d8-55792d50aa0e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c9323d24-44d5-4b61-b154-8d88a0c8b9b6","title":"预期：\n1) 持久化 ｜ 历史记录保留可读\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 提示设备已离线不能再发消息，不允许静默发送后失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"be242651-b943-4183-b9d8-55792d50aa0e","title":"🟠【P1】关闭后共享应用中的历史记录表现"},{"parent":"ec98ef63-4ae4-42a5-923e-c051101e85cf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"07404cae-92f8-454e-8477-5a040d3476c4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"60648968-3c72-4a42-9a78-8779cdad19dd","title":"前置：群聊中曾 @ 过该 Agent，随后共享被关闭；角色：房间其他成员；入口：群聊输入框"},{"parent":"07404cae-92f8-454e-8477-5a040d3476c4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"92c77005-9388-4e54-91ad-758e46ced3ca","title":"操作：引用一条历史 @ 记录并发送消息"},{"parent":"07404cae-92f8-454e-8477-5a040d3476c4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4bfc6e6e-0106-4ebb-931f-5ef17d34d8eb","title":"预期：\n1) 持久化 ｜ 历史记录保留，消息完整可读\n2) 输入框 ｜ 输入框不自动 @ 上该 Agent，不再触发该 Agent 的调用\n3) 结果校验 ｜ 可 @ 其他成员和 Agent，消息正常发送"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"07404cae-92f8-454e-8477-5a040d3476c4","title":"🟠【P1】关闭后群聊中的历史 @ 记录表现"},{"parent":"ec98ef63-4ae4-42a5-923e-c051101e85cf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2b2329b3-1c3a-4627-9630-6dc041513e52","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"58c1bab9-db02-451f-93b8-d347298fb26f","title":"前置：该 Agent 曾开启共享后被关闭；角色：Agent 所有者与房间其他成员；入口：共享设置弹窗"},{"parent":"2b2329b3-1c3a-4627-9630-6dc041513e52","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd46c2d6-9813-47b1-8e08-473cfe029064","title":"操作：重新打开共享开关，其他成员查看各入口与历史会话"},{"parent":"2b2329b3-1c3a-4627-9630-6dc041513e52","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"357f0518-a180-45eb-8433-6c050650e632","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 群聊、应用、共享 Agent 列表恢复正常展示与 @ 能力\n2) 持久化 ｜ 历史会话重新显示并可继续对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2b2329b3-1c3a-4627-9630-6dc041513e52","title":"🔴【P0】重新开启后恢复","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ec98ef63-4ae4-42a5-923e-c051101e85cf","title":"正常场景（7）"},{"parent":"43c57036-a14c-41d2-9aa5-de12ce822f38","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"93c18df0-dde4-4bec-bd54-ed18718d6a4a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"90803109-c881-4d60-8e9e-6c4fdd48d263","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e9dee386-7a6d-4385-8d33-49fa0e59b0db","title":"前置：其他成员正在用共享 Agent 执行任务且 Agent 正在回复；角色：Agent 所有者与房间其他成员；入口：共享设置弹窗"},{"parent":"90803109-c881-4d60-8e9e-6c4fdd48d263","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b3e9e937-6340-4d42-ad97-cd63414e9457","title":"操作：所有者在回复过程中关闭共享开关，使用者观察会话"},{"parent":"90803109-c881-4d60-8e9e-6c4fdd48d263","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"487d9bff-dd47-4f8b-b9ef-ecf147fbb688","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 会话状态在数秒内收敛为明确终态（已中断或已完成），不停留在运行中\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 给出该 Agent 已停止共享导致中断的明确说明，而不是笼统的会话不可用\n3) 副作用 ｜ 已产生的产物与历史记录保留可查"},{"parent":"90803109-c881-4d60-8e9e-6c4fdd48d263","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5dce718c-a1d5-417c-b7c3-25e8a84f2f25","title":"备注：「立即停止生成」还是「跑完当前轮次再失效」需产品确认；本条只校验状态必须收敛且提示明确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"90803109-c881-4d60-8e9e-6c4fdd48d263","title":"🔴【P0】运行中关闭共享时会话收敛"},{"parent":"93c18df0-dde4-4bec-bd54-ed18718d6a4a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d23922b2-8131-462f-8c9f-4a5657a5032f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b02097a4-a7b1-49df-b166-55dd955e90e5","title":"前置：共享已被关闭或所有者设备已离线；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享 Agent 会话"},{"parent":"d23922b2-8131-462f-8c9f-4a5657a5032f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c3761d9d-8e40-4c34-9ff8-c10591be8c87","title":"操作：点击进入该会话"},{"parent":"d23922b2-8131-462f-8c9f-4a5657a5032f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a8b0c840-0611-46a3-9e9c-0223589f4ed8","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 点击后立即提示该 Agent 已停止共享或设备已离线，无需先手动发消息才提示\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 运行中被关闭时给出会话中断的明确说明"},{"parent":"d23922b2-8131-462f-8c9f-4a5657a5032f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e05c7916-fbc8-44d7-bd5b-57330f93c775","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#182 #96 #126】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d23922b2-8131-462f-8c9f-4a5657a5032f","title":"🟠【P1】关闭共享后状态即时同步","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"93c18df0-dde4-4bec-bd54-ed18718d6a4a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"61a8158c-ee3c-4c74-bdc2-9a21508f7185","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c95011ba-87fc-468b-91e8-5adbfdbef051","title":"前置：关闭共享确认弹窗已弹出；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：确认按钮"},{"parent":"61a8158c-ee3c-4c74-bdc2-9a21508f7185","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1277adb0-1d7f-4594-a79d-687e4abad692","title":"操作：点击确认时构造请求失败"},{"parent":"61a8158c-ee3c-4c74-bdc2-9a21508f7185","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"46bd3b25-fcec-4039-a83b-014c3bdc75d0","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 维持开启状态并提示失败\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不产生前端已关闭而服务端仍开启的分裂状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"61a8158c-ee3c-4c74-bdc2-9a21508f7185","title":"🟠【P1】关闭请求失败时维持原状"},{"parent":"93c18df0-dde4-4bec-bd54-ed18718d6a4a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"62b699b9-44d9-4f93-9b66-4b2ae901903b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"256c5e3b-d938-4f1a-9af8-fa863260eef7","title":"前置：所有者在多端登录且确认弹窗已弹出；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：确认弹窗"},{"parent":"62b699b9-44d9-4f93-9b66-4b2ae901903b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ba90eab2-84ef-4ca6-9ce0-8a5af7acfc28","title":"操作：在另一端先行改变共享状态，再在本端点击确认"},{"parent":"62b699b9-44d9-4f93-9b66-4b2ae901903b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6ff548a9-f1f5-4d0f-a941-b46684d86772","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 刷新为真实状态，不重复提交\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 状态已变化时给出说明而不是静默覆盖"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"62b699b9-44d9-4f93-9b66-4b2ae901903b","title":"🟠【P1】确认期间状态被其他端修改"},{"parent":"93c18df0-dde4-4bec-bd54-ed18718d6a4a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9da735ba-d450-4b81-8baf-5865f7ef397d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4a029d15-a6d5-4055-8171-743947a358aa","title":"前置：共享已开启；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：关闭共享的接口调用"},{"parent":"9da735ba-d450-4b81-8baf-5865f7ef397d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f5ecfc96-c5cc-4298-9ac2-3149b59e8a2a","title":"操作：跳过前端确认直接触发关闭"},{"parent":"9da735ba-d450-4b81-8baf-5865f7ef397d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bed85052-8364-4a8b-b4e5-5244b380b10f","title":"预期：\n1) 权限授权 ｜ 服务端仍执行权限校验\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 前端不误报确认过程已完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9da735ba-d450-4b81-8baf-5865f7ef397d","title":"🟠【P1】绕过确认直接调用关闭"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"93c18df0-dde4-4bec-bd54-ed18718d6a4a","title":"异常场景（5）"},{"parent":"43c57036-a14c-41d2-9aa5-de12ce822f38","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"39436b27-a42d-4f32-9670-fbaf92e253b7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"621fbd2c-4ac7-41a1-bb06-002ab53977ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1436306c-cfda-475d-806b-84bf918497a9","title":"前置：共享设置弹窗已打开；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：共享开关"},{"parent":"621fbd2c-4ac7-41a1-bb06-002ab53977ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3a3704f0-6035-4a25-866b-f532ebb10642","title":"操作：快速连续开启与关闭多次"},{"parent":"621fbd2c-4ac7-41a1-bb06-002ab53977ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e1ff0477-8a06-488d-97a5-11f7f78f221a","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 最终状态与最后一次有效操作一致\n2) 副作用 ｜ 确认弹窗不叠加"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"621fbd2c-4ac7-41a1-bb06-002ab53977ce","title":"🟡【P2】快速连续开关","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"39436b27-a42d-4f32-9670-fbaf92e253b7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aab7dcee-ffb2-4242-a678-85c807eb57b6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"74194118-28ba-4154-ae81-fe7cc96d47b6","title":"前置：共享已开启且有成员正准备在群聊 @ 该 Agent；角色：Agent 所有者与房间其他成员；入口：共享开关与群聊输入框"},{"parent":"aab7dcee-ffb2-4242-a678-85c807eb57b6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"231e214c-d852-417d-aa38-848005bc4752","title":"操作：所有者关闭共享的同时成员在群聊 @ 该 Agent 并发送"},{"parent":"aab7dcee-ffb2-4242-a678-85c807eb57b6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fda48658-a2e4-4742-a45e-b39457832c6b","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 两端最终状态一致：关闭先生效时 @ 请求被拒绝并提示 Agent 已不可用，不产生僵尸会话；@ 先生效时会话正常创建且关闭在本轮结束后生效\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 不出现开关状态与列表展示相反的情况"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aab7dcee-ffb2-4242-a678-85c807eb57b6","title":"🟡【P2】关闭开关与群聊 @ 并发","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"39436b27-a42d-4f32-9670-fbaf92e253b7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a0d6b949-bcf1-474d-911c-16566664f29b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a2526107-f0ed-498c-afd5-123bbfaa1134","title":"前置：所有者设备处于离线；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：共享开关"},{"parent":"a0d6b949-bcf1-474d-911c-16566664f29b","callout":[],