：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 可使用此前成员共享的所有 Agent\n2) 会话状态 ｜ 可正常新建会话并收到回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8264a741-94bc-45e1-96ad-0c8a407ef82c","title":"🟠【P1】新成员进入可用已有共享","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"44fa8624-3c01-4145-9547-670a3603d9d2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8a27cd8f-fa77-419a-94dc-3d78fee2aaed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76dd1e87-ed01-4df9-b064-783f21909921","title":"前置：成员 A 已共享 Agent 并随后退出房间；角色：房间其他成员；入口：群聊 Agent 列表、应用 @ 列表、共享 Agent 应用"},{"parent":"8a27cd8f-fa77-419a-94dc-3d78fee2aaed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3d1b4756-c89d-45a5-81c3-2276b375e68a","title":"操作：在三个入口查看该 Agent"},{"parent":"8a27cd8f-fa77-419a-94dc-3d78fee2aaed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"97b83610-488f-48be-ad80-63734e9a8df2","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 该 Agent 自动取消共享，三个入口均不再展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8a27cd8f-fa77-419a-94dc-3d78fee2aaed","title":"🔴【P0】成员退出房间后自动取消共享","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"44fa8624-3c01-4145-9547-670a3603d9d2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"66315b27-0869-4af0-b2cc-432ec5e5b40f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3de87a0-3e9a-47f3-8907-2b1cbe6c5b39","title":"前置：成员 A 退出房间前其 Agent 曾被使用；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享 Agent 应用、群聊"},{"parent":"66315b27-0869-4af0-b2cc-432ec5e5b40f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"06f702c2-983c-41f5-9106-6b56b1cac6c0","title":"操作：分别查看历史会话"},{"parent":"66315b27-0869-4af0-b2cc-432ec5e5b40f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"61402007-a581-42d4-bd20-1f8d1d5e94a5","title":"预期：<br>1) 持久化 ｜ 历史记录均保留且消息完整可读<br>2) 按钮状态 ｜ 不能再向该 Agent 发送新消息，可切换到其他可用 Agent 继续"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"66315b27-0869-4af0-b2cc-432ec5e5b40f","title":"🟠【P1】退出后历史记录保留","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"44fa8624-3c01-4145-9547-670a3603d9d2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b5461338-1f9b-48d8-a107-b2b3aaca9c63","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e972b96-0fa0-41a5-add4-0916502a61c9","title":"前置：房主已共享 Agent；角色：房主与房间其他成员；入口：房间设置"},{"parent":"b5461338-1f9b-48d8-a107-b2b3aaca9c63","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd4970e4-425c-425e-b7fe-6b6782589180","title":"操作：房主删除房间并退出"},{"parent":"b5461338-1f9b-48d8-a107-b2b3aaca9c63","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c1fbabf0-faaf-4dbc-8daa-25eea3853610","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 该 Agent 自动取消共享\n2) 副作用 ｜ 房主与 Agent 均退出房间，其他成员的房间卡片同步移除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b5461338-1f9b-48d8-a107-b2b3aaca9c63","title":"🟠【P1】房主删除并退出房间","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"44fa8624-3c01-4145-9547-670a3603d9d2","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"8ea0d7a6-2aca-4d85-a5c4-42c9922b2aff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"41b1ae08-91b6-4310-ab06-e74ce76e20e0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7f0e8c35-dc87-418d-b08f-8389d1e08004","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ae2027f-b3e3-447d-8e25-d2a83a263178","title":"前置：成员正在用共享 Agent 执行任务且 Agent 正在回复；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间退出入口"},{"parent":"7f0e8c35-dc87-418d-b08f-8389d1e08004","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fa08786b-202e-4449-ba14-6975e6d6dc58","title":"操作：所有者在回复过程中退出房间，使用者观察会话"},{"parent":"7f0e8c35-dc87-418d-b08f-8389d1e08004","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"85b7ea74-2227-46f5-ba7c-6c2240c931ae","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 会话状态在数秒内收敛为已中断或已完成，不停留在运行中\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 退出提示只针对确实由自己发起且仍在运行的 Agent，不对无关成员误报仍有 Agent 在运行\n3) 持久化 ｜ 已产生的产物与历史记录保留可查"},{"parent":"7f0e8c35-dc87-418d-b08f-8389d1e08004","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5f37432c-43a4-4d72-b567-65f90b605567","title":"备注：「立即停止生成」还是「跑完当前轮次再失效」需产品确认；本条只校验状态必须收敛且提示明确【Bug 回归：#183 #96】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7f0e8c35-dc87-418d-b08f-8389d1e08004","title":"🔴【P0】运行中退出房间时会话收敛","icons":[{"color":"rgb(248, 87, 103)","name":"other","index":"369"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"41b1ae08-91b6-4310-ab06-e74ce76e20e0","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"8ea0d7a6-2aca-4d85-a5c4-42c9922b2aff","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fddabd9c-6261-4004-a85a-dab5b36888f2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b7c8e754-5122-448f-b01d-af729ce21c46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9d7e23a1-03a5-49c3-a98a-71485653882f","title":"前置：成员 A 曾开启共享后退出房间；角色：成员 A；入口：共享设置弹窗"},{"parent":"b7c8e754-5122-448f-b01d-af729ce21c46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3f867844-5d62-4231-97d4-659beb5eceb3","title":"操作：重新进入该房间查看开关"},{"parent":"b7c8e754-5122-448f-b01d-af729ce21c46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"18cfd7f2-ea2a-408a-bd44-10413e4b08c7","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 开关为关闭态，不自动恢复共享"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b7c8e754-5122-448f-b01d-af729ce21c46","title":"🟡【P2】成员退出后再进入不自动开启共享","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"fddabd9c-6261-4004-a85a-dab5b36888f2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e915914f-13ba-44d1-bd7b-bb18737a5ba4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a895e6a4-e343-494c-8253-9647d152951f","title":"前置：所有者已共享但设备离线；角色：房间其他成员；入口：群聊与共享列表"},{"parent":"e915914f-13ba-44d1-bd7b-bb18737a5ba4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aa664856-7b41-4f65-b933-077166060c0f","title":"操作：查看该 Agent 的状态与提示"},{"parent":"e915914f-13ba-44d1-bd7b-bb18737a5ba4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7f9d2d4a-9741-443c-a8dd-b9b515f2a4f8","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 按在线状态提示暂不可用，不等同于已停止共享\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 该 Agent 仍在共享列表中，只是状态为离线"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e915914f-13ba-44d1-bd7b-bb18737a5ba4","title":"🟡【P2】所有者离线与停止共享的区分","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"fddabd9c-6261-4004-a85a-dab5b36888f2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"af2e9f6a-7881-4595-b5a1-d7f1873e17cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"94483931-183e-4d36-9cd6-b7cf2e58d1c3","title":"前置：多名成员同时在群聊 @ 同一个共享 Agent；角色：房间其他成员；入口：群聊输入框"},{"parent":"af2e9f6a-7881-4595-b5a1-d7f1873e17cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c722208-e15e-4040-9665-597b2c4ba734","title":"操作：多人几乎同时发出指令"},{"parent":"af2e9f6a-7881-4595-b5a1-d7f1873e17cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"659ae8f4-12bf-41b8-bad8-183c955c8dd4","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 各自任务独立创建，不互相覆盖\n2) 排队 ｜ 超出并发能力时按排队规则处理并给出等待提示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"af2e9f6a-7881-4595-b5a1-d7f1873e17cd","title":"🟡【P2】多人同时 @ 同一共享 Agent","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 