t":[],"children":[],"id":"b16e2b7d-3eae-45d3-808a-6c2423901bd7","title":"预期：\n1) 上下文 ｜ 能读取被引用会话内容并完成应用操作\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 不提示读取不到会话、守护进程不可用或无法 cd 到当前项目\n3) 命令执行 ｜ 命令在项目目录下执行"},{"parent":"15bd4d31-fccc-421b-a654-3a2053395b73","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4b655dbc-5c49-432f-ae00-3208ef472cdc","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#63 #146 #149 #276 #269】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"15bd4d31-fccc-421b-a654-3a2053395b73","title":"🔴【P0】共享 Agent 读取被引用会话并操作应用","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"3bb230ef-b4ef-480a-889d-f318ac5cf214","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2d849f85-d0db-403c-8d2a-35e05953c398","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b6fd0b60-8beb-4b42-b87a-b9026a8c9c61","title":"前置：共享会话中的任务会触发 AskUserQuestion；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享会话"},{"parent":"2d849f85-d0db-403c-8d2a-35e05953c398","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5e243a39-82bf-496b-9d9b-a78e85632d3a","title":"操作：等待任务触发问题卡片并作答"},{"parent":"2d849f85-d0db-403c-8d2a-35e05953c398","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8121f6f9-3112-4407-b7e2-c6d12512ca5b","title":"预期：\n1) 卡片交互 ｜ 会话中展示问题卡片与选项并可作答，作答后 Agent 继续执行\n2) 会话状态 ｜ 不出现卡片不展示导致会话卡住，也不出现会话已报失败而问题卡片仍显示等待中"},{"parent":"2d849f85-d0db-403c-8d2a-35e05953c398","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ebe13884-2e1b-4499-adcf-181d44c34418","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#63 #195】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2d849f85-d0db-403c-8d2a-35e05953c398","title":"🔴【P0】问题卡片正常展示并可作答","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"3bb230ef-b4ef-480a-889d-f318ac5cf214","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7c75793b-3371-4a07-9727-9c70258615e2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e71a4b7d-de1b-4bd1-991f-b4c83486a054","title":"前置：共享 Agent 可用；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享应用的新建会话"},{"parent":"7c75793b-3371-4a07-9727-9c70258615e2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b3577705-34c9-4c96-a183-b6258a141961","title":"操作：短时间内连续创建多个共享会话"},{"parent":"7c75793b-3371-4a07-9727-9c70258615e2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"75e78b70-2c90-4cad-8c0e-0e22856757ed","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 每个会话均正常创建并进入可用状态\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不出现闪现报错，也不自动加载出持续加载中的未命名对话"},{"parent":"7c75793b-3371-4a07-9727-9c70258615e2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dbf65205-519d-4d6e-a201-e7103ae33a9a","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#157 #178】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7c75793b-3371-4a07-9727-9c70258615e2","title":"🟠【P1】连续开启多个共享会话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"3bb230ef-b4ef-480a-889d-f318ac5cf214","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bd67ea0b-cb9a-4d86-85b8-65ad7ea59f69","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6702aee0-a646-4347-b9c2-71e21459fc40","title":"前置：共享会话已进入实施计划环节；角色：房间其他成员；入口：计划卡片的自定义输入"},{"parent":"bd67ea0b-cb9a-4d86-85b8-65ad7ea59f69","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3b8bfd92-02a6-4ce0-9487-c39cc13889f3","title":"操作：输入自定义内容并提交"},{"parent":"bd67ea0b-cb9a-4d86-85b8-65ad7ea59f69","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"47be17d3-241d-4265-864f-274b536024b5","title":"预期：\n1) 卡片交互 ｜ 自定义内容被正确提交，Agent 按其继续执行\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 不出现 something went wrong，会话保持可继续对话"},{"parent":"bd67ea0b-cb9a-4d86-85b8-65ad7ea59f69","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7bc0302f-e744-45c2-b495-01b0d67efad5","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#122】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bd67ea0b-cb9a-4d86-85b8-65ad7ea59f69","title":"🟠【P1】实施计划自定义输入后继续执行"},{"parent":"3bb230ef-b4ef-480a-889d-f318ac5cf214","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0967065f-d7cb-4f15-9af0-ff3f15603288","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d31e857d-011b-4cd5-b0da-7e2b1bdcc598","title":"前置：共享会话正在执行会产出文件的任务；角色：房间其他成员与 Agent 所有者；入口：共享会话与房间入口"},{"parent":"0967065f-d7cb-4f15-9af0-ff3f15603288","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"abf417e4-8535-4022-b869-abe6bd9ba97b","title":"操作：任务执行期间持续观察产物写入，所有者同时进入房间"},{"parent":"0967065f-d7cb-4f15-9af0-ff3f15603288","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b633d19a-99a3-4847-bdee-82d09d018dea","title":"预期：\n1) 文件落盘 ｜ 工作区挂载保持有效，产物正常写入\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不出现本次运行环境的工作区挂载突然失效，所有者仍可正常进入房间"},{"parent":"0967065f-d7cb-4f15-9af0-ff3f15603288","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2559a333-9e7a-4389-9648-9be039349bb0","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#381】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0967065f-d7cb-4f15-9af0-ff3f15603288","title":"🔴【P0】共享会话工作区挂载保持有效","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"3bb230ef-b4ef-480a-889d-f318ac5cf214","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8130f2b7-2f2a-4af9-8109-fb69cf43b88c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4ef35983-62af-44c3-910b-fd4d9715b475","title":"前置：Tutti Agent 已共享且在列表中显示可用；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享会话输入框"},{"parent":"8130f2b7-2f2a-4af9-8109-fb69cf43b88c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5e382702-18ea-4404-ac84-41f38806fadf","title":"操作：向共享的 Tutti Agent 发送一条消息"},{"parent":"8130f2b7-2f2a-4af9-8109-fb69cf43b88c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4290eafb-798f-4311-9da7-c6f4a51cd1d1","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ Tutti Agent 正常启动并返回回复，不出现未被启动或启动失败\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 状态与列表中的可用状态一致"},{"parent":"8130f2b7-2f2a-4af9-8109-fb69cf43b88c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cde22b31-59dd-4990-a41f-4e92fc312749","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#225 #151】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8130f2b7-2f2a-4af9-8109-fb69cf43b88c","title":"🟠【P1】共享 Tutti Agent 正常启动","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3bb230ef-b4ef-480a-889d-f318ac5cf214","title":"异常场景（9）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"30fab6cf-fff7-49e2-b056-29a31b685d4e","title":"共享 Agent 执行"},{"parent":"33ab66a1-c6ea-47ea-8e30-2439fed2008f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f312fad8-29a4-4d54-9bfe-684ced6734c1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"09220cd6-7da8-4fe1-ba81-a4d1793dc604","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0248b271-ef38-47ee-97c4-076bcb1d9fe5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"008eaaaa-e9a2-4624-8d61-cf06adcf82d2","title":"前置：共享会话已建立；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享应用与群聊两处的输入框"},{"parent":"0248b271-ef38-47ee-97c4-076bcb1d9fe5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df4429ec-df0c-41ff-b329-6b39230c4d3f","title":"操作：在两处输入内容并点击 @ 按钮后发送"},{"parent":"0248b271-ef38-47ee-97c4-076bcb1d9fe5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2ed6d8c7-51b5-4f90-83f3-4c76d6c57695","title":"预期：\n1) 输入框 ｜ 两处输入框均可输入且 @ 按钮可点击，不出现输入框禁用或 @ 按钮置灰\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 输入内容可正常发送"},{"parent":"0248b271-ef38-47ee-97c4-076bcb1d9fe5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9744ed75-2634-479c-b6b4-ecfddfef85dd","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#110 #114 #118】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0248b271-ef38-47ee-97c4-076bcb1d9fe5","title":"🔴【P0】共享会话输入框与 @ 按钮可用","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"09220cd6-7da8-4fe1-ba81-a4d1793dc604","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5b92b3d2-1dc4-43ff-83df-62619a97fc41","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4401df15-f54d-41fe-9305-47e6333b8d88","title":"前置：共享 Agent 下已有多条历史会话，其中包含执行失败的会话；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享应用"},{"parent":"5b92b3d2-1dc4-43ff-83df-62619a97fc41","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0d5224ba-0e5a-4e98-adbc-d05f8ee1e5af","title":"操作：查看会话列表并逐条打开，包括失败的那条"},{"parent":"5b92b3d2-1dc4-43ff-83df-62619a97fc41","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e3e5f38-43ae-4306-8245-4e06e4f32c32","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 会话列表完整展示历史会话不被截断\n2) 会话状态 ｜ 失败会话同样可打开并展示对话详情与失败原因\n3) 性能 ｜ 不出现会话突然加载不出来"},{"parent":"5b92b3d2-1dc4-43ff-83df-62619a97fc41","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d6035550-bbd6-4ff3-9b87-07bddf857362","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#108 #194 #116 #127】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5b92b3d2-1dc4-43ff-83df-62619a97fc41","title":"🔴【P0】共享会话列表与详情完整加载","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"09220cd6-7da8-4fe1-ba81-a4d1793dc604","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4f00d4a3-0c73-49af-8086-1bae4651167e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"99f018fc-0d9d-4dbc-aeeb-64ce0f9cc7dd","title":"前置：共享会话已有多轮对话；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享会话详情"},{"parent":"4f00d4a3-0c73-49af-8086-1bae4651167e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"78226854-74bf-4695-bd27-f97f6012a201","title":"操作：打开会话详情，退出房间后再重进查看"},{"parent":"4f00d4a3-0c73-49af-8086-1bae4651167e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c7a3e5bc-1ff0-4d6e-bd7a-1ce88311edca","title":"预期：\n1) 消息渲染 ｜ 会话详情始终展示完整消息内容，不出现变为空白\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 输入框上方不出现 signal time out\n3) 持久化 ｜ 重进房间后历史消息完整恢复"},{"parent":"4f00d4a3-0c73-49af-8086-1bae4651167e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e5bfb656-731b-4a5d-9297-116e645b64f4","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#124 #143 #152 #200 #205 #147】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4f00d4a3-0c73-49af-8086-1bae4651167e","title":"🔴【P0】共享会话详情完整展示消息","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"09220cd6-7da8-4fe1-ba81-a4d1793dc604","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4ddd5fb4-6234-45a7-b888-cba288eeda3e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"591fe591-8da3-4851-b604-0016bbf2ba96","title":"前置：共享会话中连续发送多条消息，其中一条带图片进入排队；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享会话"},{"parent":"4ddd5fb4-6234-45a7-b888-cba288eeda3e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bebf4f26-4195-41e6-be23-7878e4452364","title":"操作：连续发送多条消息并观察对话流与排队区"},{"parent":"4ddd5fb4-6234-45a7-b888-cba288eeda3e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9a247f46-4ffb-430d-a8c2-19e1597b545d","title":"预期：\n1) 归属与顺序 ｜ 所有消息与回复按发送顺序展示，不出现后发消息显示在最上方\n2) 排队 ｜ 插入的排队消息不出现在回复上方后又消失\n3) 消息渲染 ｜ 带图片的消息在排队队列中可见并在发送后正常渲染"},{"parent":"4ddd5fb4-6234-45a7-b888-cba288eeda3e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b0bed36d-eb4c-42a8-a1cd-65f20abbb2df","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#88 #101 #181 #198 #272 #284】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4ddd5fb4-6234-45a7-b888-cba288eeda3e","title":"🔴【P0】共享会话消息按发送顺序展示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"09220cd6-7da8-4fe1-ba81-a4d1793dc604","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"046fb079-80e0-463a-988e-b6a116f2f60f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2fb934b5-b66e-4b49-98bf-c931cb23d8f0","title":"前置：共享会话正在执行；角色：房间其他成员与 Agent 所有者；入口：会话列表、会话详情、活动看板"},{"parent":"046fb079-80e0-463a-988e-b6a116f2f60f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5db671fa-9dce-4f34-b082-a73f56429657","title":"操作：任务完成后在三处查看状态，再取消一次任务观察收敛速度"},{"parent":"046fb079-80e0-463a-988e-b6a116f2f60f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd22a12f-1cf4-4115-beef-c3e1814a0421","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 三处状态同步为已完成\n2) 未读标识 ｜ 会话完成后列表出现未读蓝点\n3) 性能 ｜ 取消后状态在数秒内收敛为已完成"},{"parent":"046fb079-80e0-463a-988e-b6a116f2f60f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e3c5af19-4bf2-44fd-9b39-71efcdf077ff","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#188 #199 #206 #98 #191】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"046fb079-80e0-463a-988e-b6a116f2f60f","title":"🟠【P1】共享会话状态与看板同步"},{"parent":"09220cd6-7da8-4fe1-ba81-a4d1793dc604","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"54cf45be-e7f1-48ef-996c-9e9e15d0e1d9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"19b7eebb-0b66-413e-a019-6ba9632902af","title":"前置：共享会话已建立；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享会话输入框"},{"parent":"54cf45be-e7f1-48ef-996c-9e9e15d0e1d9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"450e60bb-bde9-43bf-8836-971ea27fb242","title":"操作：发送一条消息并观察按钮，等回复结束后再观察"},{"parent":"54cf45be-e7f1-48ef-996c-9e9e15d0e1d9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4d1d39af-f487-4d31-be05-05e6f43eb525","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 发送后按钮立即变为运行中状态，回复结束后立即恢复为发送状态，不出现延迟数秒才切换"},{"parent":"54cf45be-e7f1-48ef-996c-9e9e15d0e1d9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eeeae847-18c6-40d8-84b3-9421a2ab5896","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#93 #187】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"54cf45be-e7f1-48ef-996c-9e9e15d0e1d9","title":"🟠【P1】发送按钮状态即时切换"},{"parent":"09220cd6-7da8-4fe1-ba81-a4d1793dc604","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7da59d04-b3df-4eb3-aee4-b0d66342fb00","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"febd2c3c-0ef1-4202-a9e0-a07ac7452a9f","title":"前置：房间内已关联多个项目；角色：房间其他成员；入口：项目分组下的新建会话"},{"parent":"7da59d04-b3df-4eb3-aee4-b0d66342fb00","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e30cb4fd-2d39-4198-aa8c-a577319692e8","title":"操作：在某个项目下新建共享会话并发送消息，再显式指定项目后重复一次"},{"parent":"7da59d04-b3df-4eb3-aee4-b0d66342fb00","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e4dc717f-113b-4bad-8363-d66c5f96db75","title":"预期：\n1) 归属与顺序 ｜ 会话归属该项目并展示在项目分组下，不自动落到无项目的对话分组\n2) 归属与顺序 ｜ 指定项目后归属仍然正确"},{"parent":"7da59d04-b3df-4eb3-aee4-b0d66342fb00","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fed490fa-c183-454b-8ce2-108424e5df22","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#164 #204】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7da59d04-b3df-4eb3-aee4-b0d66342fb00","title":"🟠【P1】项目下新建会话归属正确","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"09220cd6-7da8-4fe1-ba81-a4d1793dc604","title":"异常场景（7）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f312fad8-29a4-4d54-9bfe-684ced6734c1","title":"共享会话加载与展示"},{"parent":"33ab66a1-c6ea-47ea-8e30-2439fed2008f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3d108edf-afc8-40bc-ac54-ad94e1e38990","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e516e11e-501f-4df2-a82a-1f4e0b545ef6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4e39461c-34fd-48bf-9e72-7760cbcd2305","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"21316e0e-e869-41e8-8361-089d23254fa4","title":"前置：房间内存在其他成员的会话；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享会话输入框的 @ 面板"},{"parent":"4e39461c-34fd-48bf-9e72-7760cbcd2305","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7a052e77-640f-494f-a23a-0a6f298703c2","title":"操作：在 @ 面板的会话分类中搜索并选择一条协作者会话后发送消息"},{"parent":"4e39461c-34fd-48bf-9e72-7760cbcd2305","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d3669fae-95e4-453b-be05-a17521e7cdbc","title":"预期：\n1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 实时过滤匹配会话，无结果时显示暂无会话，方向键可选中、回车确认插入\n2) 上下文 ｜ 插入 token 成功，发送后 Agent 能识别该会话内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4e39461c-34fd-48bf-9e72-7760cbcd2305","title":"🟠【P1】引用协作者的会话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"e516e11e-501f-4df2-a82a-1f4e0b545ef6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"df0fe828-f2dc-4f8b-af20-5930599dfc3a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c022c8dd-c13a-4db9-8f7c-1b35ee14e91f","title":"前置：协作者的 Agent 已在工作区创建过文件；角色：房间其他成员；入口：@ 面板的文件分类"},{"parent":"df0fe828-f2dc-4f8b-af20-5930599dfc3a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b7ac644a-cad3-4344-b0a6-94bf52a1fd14","title":"操作：搜索该文件并插入后发送消息"},{"parent":"df0fe828-f2dc-4f8b-af20-5930599dfc3a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4d1d7a4d-e1b8-449f-9f7f-227a63575cc0","title":"预期：\n1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 实时过滤匹配文件，无结果时显示无匹配文件\n2) 上下文 ｜ Agent 能读取该文件内容并据此作答"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"df0fe828-f2dc-4f8b-af20-5930599dfc3a","title":"🟠【P1】引用协作者 Agent 创建的文件","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e516e11e-501f-4df2-a82a-1f4e0b545ef6","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"3d108edf-afc8-40bc-ac54-ad94e1e38990","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c2949d5d-5284-4c91-bde7-cb5b53ea845d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"68e29715-b769-490d-a895-38979da42671","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a246e2e7-9541-4303-821e-578e1