sed":true,"id":"6b2b69fe-ddfa-46f0-aa62-5b80824a933a","title":"🟠【P1】熄屏与关闭房间后恢复"},{"parent":"06e872de-2ef1-4c10-89a4-426f72b86236","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"41d69d2b-5cf3-4a8a-88eb-2da4c1c301a7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"53b3d9c2-b69e-4940-a31d-9c72895b9959","title":"前置：共享会话已触发 Agent 权限弹窗；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享会话"},{"parent":"41d69d2b-5cf3-4a8a-88eb-2da4c1c301a7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"470043b8-6f25-406b-accc-894c73a6fb33","title":"操作：熄屏后重新打开，查看权限弹窗并作答"},{"parent":"41d69d2b-5cf3-4a8a-88eb-2da4c1c301a7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"854404d7-126f-4d72-a681-a54e65e26ad5","title":"预期：\n1) 权限授权 ｜ 权限弹窗仍正常显示，可正常选择后继续回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"41d69d2b-5cf3-4a8a-88eb-2da4c1c301a7","title":"🟠【P1】权限弹窗在熄屏恢复后仍可用","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"06e872de-2ef1-4c10-89a4-426f72b86236","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"bdb1aa68-4f09-4772-b41f-72ac7028741b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"69a85810-dd5f-4344-98bf-297bad38526c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e985a26a-3499-43e5-abb9-5b8f0570966e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7555feee-1486-42d2-86ee-55d530da8185","title":"前置：房间内有可用的共享 Agent，另有一个房间没有任何共享；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享 Agent 应用"},{"parent":"e985a26a-3499-43e5-abb9-5b8f0570966e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"495891f5-bd8c-48ec-bc4f-cc873fd979ab","title":"操作：打开共享应用观察连接过程，再打开无共享的房间查看"},{"parent":"e985a26a-3499-43e5-abb9-5b8f0570966e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"764945d1-7876-40de-b1cd-de60ad586af4","title":"预期：\n1) 性能 ｜ 在合理时间内完成连接并展示可用的共享 Agent，不长时间停留在连接中或加载失败\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 无可用共享时展示稳定的空态提示而非闪现报错"},{"parent":"e985a26a-3499-43e5-abb9-5b8f0570966e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a2466d70-eb1b-48d2-bdce-50c2cfde5153","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#153 #161 #138 #165 #154】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e985a26a-3499-43e5-abb9-5b8f0570966e","title":"🔴【P0】共享 Agent 在合理时间内完成连接","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"69a85810-dd5f-4344-98bf-297bad38526c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"60084562-6c79-4a3b-968a-09e1791db81d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d4a618b4-1e29-4e91-a066-2ae0b19094ad","title":"前置：成员 A 的设备断开后重新连接；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享 Agent 列表"},{"parent":"60084562-6c79-4a3b-968a-09e1791db81d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eef66d00-064f-407f-a2c6-809eea496371","title":"操作：不重开房间，查看成员 A 的 Agent 状态"},{"parent":"60084562-6c79-4a3b-968a-09e1791db81d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"07054867-68a8-402a-b40f-ef62f827a760","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 其他成员能获取到成员 A 重连后的在线状态并展示为可用，不长期停留在离线\n2) 性能 ｜ 无需重开房间"},{"parent":"60084562-6c79-4a3b-968a-09e1791db81d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"04e7e489-8eb4-40ca-af72-37a0b53eff3c","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#163】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"60084562-6c79-4a3b-968a-09e1791db81d","title":"🔴【P0】重连后在线状态同步刷新","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"69a85810-dd5f-4344-98bf-297bad38526c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"592b3fd9-ef96-4eef-98f2-bf8a905fa473","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"04438ea3-6f41-4748-b1b8-0d5a07f84858","title":"前置：所有者已在本地退出该 Agent 的登录；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享会话输入框"},{"parent":"592b3fd9-ef96-4eef-98f2-bf8a905fa473","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"84a58ee0-8d3e-4c0f-b88d-36a042ed2f19","title":"操作：发送一条消息"},{"parent":"592b3fd9-ef96-4eef-98f2-bf8a905fa473","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"89dd17eb-a173-49ff-aa65-9d66d6498c84","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示需要 Agent 所有者在本地登录后重试，文案位置在输入框上方且不覆盖已发送消息\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 不返回 Unknown 请求失败\n3) 视觉展示 ｜ Agent 名称与图标正常展示"},{"parent":"592b3fd9-ef96-4eef-98f2-bf8a905fa473","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fe26e751-d654-4552-8fda-ef032b67c7c1","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#79 #175 #91】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"592b3fd9-ef96-4eef-98f2-bf8a905fa473","title":"🔴【P0】所有者退出登录时的提示文案","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"69a85810-dd5f-4344-98bf-297bad38526c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f1120bac-5db8-4bb1-b078-ca867ad7384a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1a90941a-f22c-4e65-ad5e-868af650b830","title":"前置：成员设备已确认离线；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享会话与 Agent 列表"},{"parent":"f1120bac-5db8-4bb1-b078-ca867ad7384a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5852417b-97b4-40fd-91e3-fc9cc5dbf5fe","title":"操作：观察提示与图标，再切换到另一个在线 Agent"},{"parent":"f1120bac-5db8-4bb1-b078-ca867ad7384a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"271660fc-60c0-4b7f-9acb-871554f88b86","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示由正在重新连接切换为离线状态\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 左侧图标同步显示为离线而非高亮\n3) 副作用 ｜ 切换 Agent 时离线提示只出现在真正离线的 Agent 上，不残留到新切换的 Agent"},{"parent":"f1120bac-5db8-4bb1-b078-ca867ad7384a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d361dffb-0eae-4e10-95cb-010ffa5491ba","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#169 #177 #153 #172】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f1120bac-5db8-4bb1-b078-ca867ad7384a","title":"🔴【P0】设备离线后提示切换为离线状态","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"69a85810-dd5f-4344-98bf-297bad38526c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"54e11b50-b784-484c-a737-da71feb0c9ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b6d0d9fc-b988-4799-8c1e-ff0aeaf0e25a","title":"前置：设备曾离线导致会话中断，随后恢复在线；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享会话"},{"parent":"54e11b50-b784-484c-a737-da71feb0c9ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e020768-f2a0-4117-a284-cbf31f4d726a","title":"操作：恢复在线后观察会话"},{"parent":"54e11b50-b784-484c-a737-da71feb0c9ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6cf665bb-8161-4845-969d-d08332d67417","title":"预期：\n1) 恢复重试 ｜ 会话自动重试并在对话流中体现进展，或给出需要手动重发的明确提示\n2) 提示文案 ｜ Agent 在线时不再误报共享 Agent 暂时不可用或同步超时"},{"parent":"54e11b50-b784-484c-a737-da71feb0c9ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5edb58dc-5187-44a6-9d6f-fe04aaf2d7b0","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#171 #85 #89】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"54e11b50-b784-484c-a737-da71feb0c9ce","title":"🔴【P0】自动重试有进展或给出手动重发提示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"69a85810-dd5f-4344-98bf-297bad38526c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ce46f2a1-59fe-4890-99f7-a21444df8fbd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"45dc6314-bd08-4512-b3c9-7d0da05837a0","title":"前置：成员显示在线；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享 Agent 列表与会话详情"},{"parent":"ce46f2a1-59fe-4890-99f7-a21444df8fbd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e88cd17-2a88-4dc0-b4fc-a4da058aa413","title":"操作：在两处对比该 Agent 的状态，再让成员恢复在线后重看"},{"parent":"ce46f2a1-59fe-4890-99f7-a21444df8fbd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"433a2685-956e-44e9-8e39-5256ee6d2bef","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 共享 Agent 的在线状态与成员设备实际状态一致\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 不出现列表显示在线而会话详情提示设备离线"},{"parent":"ce46f2a1-59fe-4890-99f7-a21444df8fbd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1d8637c5-227c-4962-a48f-ef3b9d1b4643","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#132 #142 #155 #179 #125 #126】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ce46f2a1-59fe-4890-99f7-a21444df8fbd","title":"🔴【P0】共享 Agent 在线状态与成员设备一致","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"69a85810-dd5f-4344-98bf-297bad38526c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"15f8cb95-9c2d-4628-abda-a345ee527c56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2f116080-eda6-488b-8ace-6e7456edf191","title":"前置：所有者设备处于锁屏或屏保；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享 Agent 列表"},{"parent":"15f8cb95-9c2d-4628-abda-a345ee527c56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"92cdacc0-b3fe-4068-85c9-9667f02da639","title":"操作：查看状态并尝试新建会话"},{"parent":"15f8cb95-9c2d-4628-abda-a345ee527c56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d4cc11c6-deb6-41a8-846f-9f9ee69325df","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 成员在线状态与共享 Agent 可用状态判定一致\n2) 会话状态 ｜ 设备仍可服务时新建会话成功；判定为不可用时列表同步展示离线并禁止新建\n3) 提示文案 ｜ 不出现成员显示在线而新建会话直接报错"},{"parent":"15f8cb95-9c2d-4628-abda-a345ee527c56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"380e5ed0-cd82-476e-82c7-18e88d8cafba","title":"备注：【Bug 回归：#102 #133】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"15f8cb95-9c2d-4628-abda-a345ee527c56","title":"🟠【P1】锁屏或屏保时的状态判定","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"69a85810-dd5f-4344-98bf-297bad38526c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"93738c0c-22ab-4e17-8d4e-6a4c0ceb9411","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8f14e85a-32c7-461d-9e06-53805473502d","title":"前置：网络长时间不可用；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享会话"},{"parent":"93738c0c-22ab-4e17-8d4e-6a4c0ceb9411","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2d5bfe36-fb7c-48bf-8f87-d7029aec2f46","title":"操作：保持断网观察重连行为"},{"parent":"93738c