立且权限模式需要授权；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享会话"},{"parent":"cfe22ea7-469c-4b46-924e-5bce5ceade2d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e2030afb-4a10-49ce-b61a-1991c86a9007","title":"操作：发起一个会触发授权的任务并完成授权"},{"parent":"cfe22ea7-469c-4b46-924e-5bce5ceade2d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9bc0dabc-70ad-4bbd-a8d7-fa1fd3393d9d","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 授权卡片的展示、选择与授权后继续执行与自有 Agent 一致\n2) 权限授权 ｜ 授权范围以所有者的权限模式为准"},{"parent":"cfe22ea7-469c-4b46-924e-5bce5ceade2d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"18751ed4-54c8-425b-85e2-d45da8701955","title":"备注：共享身份下跑一遍主库的 E2E 主干；只校验两件事：与自有 Agent 行为一致，以及共享特有的那一条断言。行为细节本身在 Agent GUI 模块验，不在这里重复"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"border-radius":"6px","color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","background":"rgba(33, 41, 48, 0.25)","text-decoration":"line-through","border-color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","border-width":"0px","border-style":"none"},"id":"cfe22ea7-469c-4b46-924e-5bce5ceade2d","title":"🔴【P0】共享身份下需要授权的任务闭环"},{"parent":"430b000f-95c2-49e2-bdd9-5a52d73656c6","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"a4d7d452-ee8b-4fd1-b708-0250402dcebe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c5ffa7f7-d190-40fe-b606-4145ca3c77de","title":"前置：共享会话正在执行任务；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享会话"},{"parent":"a4d7d452-ee8b-4fd1-b708-0250402dcebe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b168dddc-0d19-4575-9091-f1353f66f2b6","title":"操作：中断任务后重新进入并继续同一任务"},{"parent":"a4d7d452-ee8b-4fd1-b708-0250402dcebe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1fc98349-f06a-4eca-8019-d413e182a308","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 中断、状态收敛与 Resume 继续的行为与自有 Agent 一致"},{"parent":"a4d7d452-ee8b-4fd1-b708-0250402dcebe","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3f77d659-484e-40f5-b0f2-09831228eeda","title":"备注：共享身份下跑一遍主库的 E2E 主干；只校验两件事：与自有 Agent 行为一致，以及共享特有的那一条断言。行为细节本身在 Agent GUI 模块验，不在这里重复"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"border-radius":"6px","color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","background":"rgba(33, 41, 48, 0.25)","text-decoration":"line-through","border-color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","border-width":"0px","border-style":"none"},"id":"a4d7d452-ee8b-4fd1-b708-0250402dcebe","title":"🔴【P0】共享身份下中断后 Resume"},{"parent":"430b000f-95c2-49e2-bdd9-5a52d73656c6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a59c2208-ea56-4854-9d4d-2abbd8d595b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a7dabde3-a880-4f55-8b15-35abd5d6c226","title":"前置：共享会话已建立；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享会话"},{"parent":"a59c2208-ea56-4854-9d4d-2abbd8d595b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"60f09d42-1faa-45ec-b983-2b91de570f03","title":"操作：发起一个会多次调用工具的任务，查看过程区与调用详情"},{"parent":"a59c2208-ea56-4854-9d4d-2abbd8d595b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"beab03a3-7089-4ccc-a65c-55762246489a","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 工具调用详情、归属顺序与过程折叠与自有 Agent 一致\n2) 审计脱敏 ｜ 调用详情中不展示所有者的凭证与 Token"},{"parent":"a59c2208-ea56-4854-9d4d-2abbd8d595b1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"82dae71c-0ea0-4f8d-9bd4-a67145d5a556","title":"备注：共享身份下跑一遍主库的 E2E 主干；只校验两件事：与自有 Agent 行为一致，以及共享特有的那一条断言。行为细节本身在 Agent GUI 模块验，不在这里重复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a59c2208-ea56-4854-9d4d-2abbd8d595b1","title":"🟠【P1】共享身份下的工具调用与过程折叠","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"430b000f-95c2-49e2-bdd9-5a52d73656c6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"85fd7103-839e-4b6e-ac08-2a6c4f7b6bff","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6508b24f-0e7f-4ee0-bd0b-98a1311908dd","title":"前置：共享会话已建立；角色：房间其他成员；入口：共享会话"},{"parent":"85fd7103-839e-4b6e-ac08-2a6c4f7b6bff","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"408ba1b3-3a8c-478e-98ae-a1d54eccd82f","title":"操作：发起一个会派发子 Agent 的任务"},{"parent":"85fd7103-839e-4b6e-ac08-2a6c4f7b6bff","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"91e2f046-cf83-496d-ae7f-a8ba5d484f08","title":"预期：\n1) 等价性 ｜ 子 Agent 派发、结果回传与汇总与自有 Agent 一致\n2) 权限授权 ｜ 子 Agent 的访问范围继承所有者的权限与项目作用域"},{"parent":"85fd7103-839e-4b6e-ac08-2a6c4f7b6bff","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ad73dbc7-1b6b-4e7d-8f27-b139a3254b6f","title":"备注：共享身份下跑一遍主库的 E2E 主干；只校验两件事：与自有 Agent 行为一致，以及共享特有的那一条断言。行为细节本身在 Agent GUI 模块验，不在这里重复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"85fd7103-839e-4b6e-ac08-2a6c4f7b6bff","title":"🟠【P1】共享身份下派发子 Agent","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"430b000f-95c2-49e2