id":"2cc10081-106a-4a48-90ad-8e643f71ccc1","title":"🟡【P2】特殊字符搜索","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8a2ad4f5-9557-4919-b176-a694d3c30aad","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"170a2af0-0eab-40f2-864e-d6c93fbcf9e7","title":"显示更多与搜索兼容"},{"parent":"18e89ce6-5f5b-4a83-bdf0-63e323db885f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ada3ffb8-8a8b-4a5f-94ff-4ac3b7d5fffa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a7c66eda-471d-4b87-b799-11e273d65380","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"307ff30f-c58c-4396-a125-86705281df6d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"274d7a04-ac61-427b-ba3b-5ad32420c076","title":"操作：前置：房间内存在至少两个项目且各有会话；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧会话列表分组下拉；步骤：首次进入房间查看左侧会话列表"},{"parent":"307ff30f-c58c-4396-a125-86705281df6d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"009afdd2-7fa5-4509-a732-9b48406c5f13","title":"预期：分组下拉默认选中「默认」，会话按所属项目分组展示，未选择项目的会话归入「对话」分组；刷新页面后仍保持项目分组"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"307ff30f-c58c-4396-a125-86705281df6d","title":"默认按项目分组显示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a7c66eda-471d-4b87-b799-11e273d65380","title":"正常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ada3ffb8-8a8b-4a5f-94ff-4ac3b7d5fffa","title":"分组方式切换","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"18e89ce6-5f5b-4a83-bdf0-63e323db885f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f20073ca-ef95-43b7-849a-af3da10be632","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d2955eae-a3da-4d21-87fb-ff0eef2f4c32","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b535ac4b-c951-4874-aeb2-7360c7671385","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2cd5399e-af0c-4c8d-b8e3-7bd91bde245f","title":"操作：前置：存在多条更新时间不同的会话；角色：房间成员；入口：分组下拉切换为「最新」；步骤：切换后查看列表顺序"},{"parent":"b535ac4b-c951-4874-aeb2-7360c7671385","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fa18e9b9-d8ad-4e07-b853-e0e52b26eb8d","title":"预期：会话按最近更新时间由新到旧排列；新产生消息的会话立即移动到列表首位；刷新后顺序保持一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b535ac4b-c951-4874-aeb2-7360c7671385","title":"按更新时间倒序展示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"d2955eae-a3da-4d21-87fb-ff0eef2f4c32","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5e594cfa-d614-4440-aa00-41ff1b1b508c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"34f806d4-74d0-422b-90b2-0bffb078f780","title":"操作：前置：最新分组下存在多条会话；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧会话列表；步骤：查看任一会话条目"},{"parent":"5e594cfa-d614-4440-aa00-41ff1b1b508c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"25c48d7b-9789-479e-90dd-7b02179e53c6","title":"预期：每条会话显示发起该会话的 Agent 图标与名称、会话标题和会话更新时间"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5e594cfa-d614-4440-aa00-41ff1b1b508c","title":"最新分组下会话条目信息","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d2955eae-a3da-4d21-87fb-ff0eef2f4c32","title":"正常场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f20073ca-ef95-43b7-849a-af3da10be632","title":"最新排序"},{"parent":"18e89ce6-5f5b-4a83-bdf0-63e323db885f","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"2d917437-3700-4323-8a42-b0b422f2c1dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5cc32da1-4a68-46d7-83b6-810c28c358c7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"213d877d-76b2-4807-97c6-77f9409dbd3b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c347c3ef-10ad-46c2-a831-eb6ef3f81531","title":"操作：前置：房间内存在我的 Agent 与共享 Agent；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧会话列表 Agent 筛选器；步骤：首次点击展开筛选器"},{"parent":"213d877d-76b2-4807-97c6-77f9409dbd3b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f02695b8-e188-41db-9bad-b7c85bbb2c12","title":"预期：筛选器内所有 Agent 均为勾选状态，会话列表展示全部 Agent 的会话；筛选器按钮不显示已筛选数量角标"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"213d877d-76b2-4807-97c6-77f9409dbd3b","title":"默认选中全部 Agent"},{"parent":"5cc32da1-4a68-46d7-83b6-810c28c358c7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"63a26736-ffeb-44cb-82bb-881021a3c941","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8676e275-0dec-46c2-9f88-043f5c6a7f00","title":"操作：前置：我的 Agent 与共享 Agent 各有若干会话；角色：房间成员；入口：Agent 筛选器；步骤：点击展开列表，逐个核对每个 Agent 右侧的会话数量"},{"parent":"63a26736-ffeb-44cb-82bb-881021a3c941","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"af2d474c-1abe-4431-8e1f-ada68b2f30a5","title":"预期：列表分「我的 Agent」和「共享 Agent」两组；每个 Agent 右侧数量与该 Agent 在会话列表中的实际会话条数一致；新建一条会话后重新展开，对应 Agent 数量加一"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"63a26736-ffeb-44cb-82bb-881021a3c941","title":"展开 Agent 列表并核对会话数量"},{"parent":"5cc32da1-4a68-46d7-83b6-810c28c358c7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"242a1db7-ec1c-4472-aff7-2bcb7b6e184b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae87333f-57d4-4183-b497-54126d20211e","title":"操作：前置：筛选器内全部勾选；角色：房间成员；入口：Agent 筛选器；步骤：取消勾选其中两个 Agent"},{"parent":"242a1db7-ec1c-4472-aff7-2bcb7b6e184b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3856eb88-03db-4ff3-9117-c4014935a82e","title":"预期：被取消的 Agent 会话从列表中移除，其余会话保留；筛选器按钮上显示剩余已勾选 Agent 的图标，勾选数量同步更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"242a1db7-ec1c-4472-aff7-2bcb7b6e184b","title":"取消勾选部分 Agent"},{"parent":"5cc32da1-4a68-46d7-83b6-810c28c358c7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"87736354-625d-4b62-9443-2e59b35b8c13","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"931faeea-b21c-4e4d-a68b-44a6915e670c","title":"操作：前置：筛选器展开；角色：房间成员；入口：Agent 筛选器；步骤：只勾选 Claude Code"},{"parent":"87736354-625d-4b62-9443-2e59b35b8c13","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"24b2f4f6-636d-4fc2-8a0b-1b617f1622f7","title":"预期：会话列表仅展示 Claude Code 发起的会话，条数与筛选器中该 Agent 的数量一致；其他 Agent 的会话不出现在列表中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"87736354-625d-4b62-9443-2e59b35b8c13","title":"仅勾选一个 Agent"},{"parent":"5cc32da1-4a68-46d7-83b6-810c28c358c7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8dd0a6b0-775b-48e0-8ecb-d0e1e1d9094b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"870e0c08-4dd2-4a87-95ba-ead0f0060cf9","title":"操作：前置：已取消部分 Agent 勾选；角色：房间成员；入口：Agent 筛选器内「重置选项」按钮；步骤：点击重置"},{"parent":"8dd0a6b0-775b-48e0-8ecb-d0e1e1d9094b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"86f91961-3cff-485c-b722-aafe20af6984","title":"预期：所有 Agent 恢复勾选，会话列表恢复展示全部会话；筛选器按钮上的筛选角标消失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8dd0a6b0-775b-48e0-8ecb-d0e1e1d9094b","title":"点击重置恢复全选"},{"parent":"5cc32da1-4a68-46d7-83b6-810c28c358c7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e1196a42-5c58-4b09-8857-673d12f97157","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"045d3975-4829-41d1-891b-f42f58de4ef9","title":"操作：前置：分组方式为项目分组，存在多个项目；角色：房间成员；入口：Agent 筛选器；步骤：仅勾选 Codex"},{"parent":"e1196a42-5c58-4b09-8857-673d12f97157","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44a6935f-f38f-4077-8fa3-d487a74c73bd","title":"预期：各项目分组内只保留 Codex 的会话；不含 Codex 会话的项目分组显示为空或不展示，项目本身不消失；切回全选后各分组会话完整恢复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e1196a42-5c58-4b09-8857-673d12f97157","title":"项目分组下按 Agent 筛选"},{"parent":"5cc32da1-4a68-46d7-83b6-810c28c358c7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f923e10a-b1e8-44c0-b772-2841f0519b98","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"42d30204-45cd-48dc-8a79-3533a8f44bf5","title":"操作：前置：分组方式为活跃优先级；角色：房间成员；入口：Agent 筛选器；步骤：仅勾选一个 Agent"},{"parent":"f923e10a-b1e8-44c0-b772-2841f0519b98","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"99a8b437-81ec-4958-9d03-aa3177479829","title":"预期：列表仅保留该 Agent 的会话且仍按更新时间倒序排列；筛选条件在切换分组方式后依然生效"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f923e10a-b1e8-44c0-b772-2841f0519b98","title":"活跃优先级分组下按 Agent 筛选"},{"parent":"5cc32da1-4a68-46d7-83b6-810c28c358c7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f7b93103-5a50-4086-9caf-18c760d1f74e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"57f26028-ff0a-4ed2-8334-0cf0a74af5fb","title":"操作：前置：已仅勾选 Claude Code；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧搜索按钮；步骤：点击搜索并输入其他 Agent 会话中存在的关键词"},{"parent":"f7b93103-5a50-4086-9caf-18c760d1f74e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"41180930-d32f-4a66-aa70-ea0c9410d71e","title":"预期：搜索结果只包含 Claude Code 的会话；其他 Agent 中含该关键词的会话不出现；清空搜索后列表回到仅 Claude Code 的筛选结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f7b93103-5a50-4086-9caf-18c760d1f74e","title":"筛选 Agent 后再搜索"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5cc32da1-4a68-46d7-83b6-810c28c358c7","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"2d917437-3700-4323-8a42-b0b422f2c1dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6687d4bc-47c9-4a8b-b1f0-fafa56c1ee20","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e6f678cb-b120-49b2-a90a-1170e52df6cc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ad21b55f-4db2-4664-a304-408377a35112","title":"操作：前置：筛选器内全部勾选；角色：房间成员；入口：Agent 筛选器；步骤：逐个取消所有 Agent 的勾选"},{"parent":"e6f678cb-b120-49b2-a90a-1170e52df6cc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bb2767ed-7a90-4b5b-abe1-db12ebb4aefb","title":"预期：会话列表不展示任何会话并显示空态提示；不出现加载中不结束或报错；重新勾选任一 Agent 后对应会话立即恢复展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e6f678cb-b120-49b2-a90a-1170e52df6cc","title":"全部取消勾选"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6687d4bc-47c9-4a8b-b1f0-fafa56c1ee20","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"none"},"id":"2d917437-3700-4323-8a42-b0b422f2c1dd","title":"Agent 筛选"},{"parent":"18e89ce6-5f5b-4a83-bdf0-63e323db885f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"30bc39c0-82e5-4bae-bf81-1e437df7d734","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e7188aeb-ebc2-4bf3-941e-25399e1dafa2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9ad586ca-1bcc-4014-8cf6-43d80ff668d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"765c49db-56b3-4e71-b4ee-9c1468f3cc4f","title":"前置：房间内多名成员都发起过会话；角色：房间成员；入口：会话列表的人员筛选器"},{"parent":"9ad586ca-1bcc-4014-8cf6-43d80ff668d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8bb6f903-4be6-4226-b5cd-c8396957653f","title":"操作：查看筛选器的默认状态"},{"parent":"9ad586ca-1bcc-4014-8cf6-43d80ff668d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"330cac01-a75c-430b-83e1-57ff8da4d336","title":"预期：\n1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 默认全部成员均为选中，会话列表展示全部成员的会话\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 筛选器按钮不显示已筛选角标"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9ad586ca-1bcc-4014-8cf6-43d80ff668d1","title":"🔴【P0】默认展示全部成员","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"e7188aeb-ebc2-4bf3-941e-25399e1dafa2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"02d15347-8ccf-4838-aa7b-c0bb9aed1cdc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a63ddf63-b25b-46ec-ba24-20d953dbd097","title":"前置：人员筛选器已展开；角色：房间成员；入口：筛选器中的成员项"},{"parent":"02d15347-8ccf-4838-aa7b-c0bb9aed1cdc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"42b057bc-d62f-4069-858f-d3f14e9b5048","title":"操作：只勾选成员 A"},{"parent":"02d15347-8ccf-4838-aa7b-c0bb9aed1cdc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9cbd2866-ff75-45df-a359-2fc53a8e1002","title":"预期：\n1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 列表只展示成员 A 发起的会话\n2) 搜索筛选 ｜ 包括成员 A 自己发起的，以及成员 A 借用他人 Agent 发起的会话\n3) 视觉展示 ｜ 筛选器按钮显示已筛选角标"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"02d15347-8ccf-4838-aa7b-c0bb9aed1cdc","title":"🔴【P0】筛选单个成员","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"e7188aeb-ebc2-4bf3-941e-25399e1dafa2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8a323938-1275-4515-ab33-b87abf3263a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aa891aff-925f-4051-ab72-01b58888341f","title":"前置：人员筛选器已展开；角色：房间成员；入口：筛选器"},{"parent":"8a323938-1275-4515-ab33-b87abf3263a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c7eae635-e85e-4a89-b8d2-338361408e70","title":"操作：勾选两名成员，再点击重置"},{"parent":"8a323938-1275-4515-ab33-b87abf3263a4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5213ae9f-706b-495d-bfd1-9c8117453d72","title":"预期：\n1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 列表展示这两名成员的会话并集，数量正确\n2) 搜索筛选 ｜ 重置后恢复全选并展示全部会话，角标消失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8a323938-1275-4515-ab33-b87abf3263a4","title":"🔴【P0】多选成员与重置","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"e7188aeb-ebc2-4bf3-941e-25399e1dafa2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e2069baa-0441-4728-bfc7-77510230d204","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b7dadb91-8750-438d-98d9-573bc3ba5edd","title":"前置：房间内有多名成员与多个 Agent；角色：房间成员；入口：人员筛选与 Agent 筛选"},{"parent":"e2069baa-0441-4728-bfc7-77510230d204","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e777ef53-60d9-4ba8-938d-7df78ee5de1e","title":"操作：同时选中一名成员与一个 Agent"},{"parent":"e2069baa-0441-4728-bfc7-77510230d204","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09b98b45-749f-4848-941b-730609e70296","title":"预期：\n1) 搜索筛选 ｜ 结果为交集，只展示该成员用该 Agent 发起的会话\n2) 搜索筛选 ｜ 取消其中一个条件后另一个仍生效"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e2069baa-0441-4728-bfc7-77510230d204","title":"🟠【P1】人员筛选与 Agent 筛选组合","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"e7188aeb-ebc2-4bf3-941e-25399e1dafa2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"10044513-45cc-44dc-996e-9254fb1becbc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8c8623bf-e990-4059-96e8-8c354b899e60","title":"前置：多个项目下都有多名成员的会话；角色：房间成员；入口：人员筛选器"},{"parent":"10044513-45cc-44dc-996e-9254fb1becbc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"493122aa-e6b3-4761-a42f-fce4594e6923","title":"操作：只筛选成员 A，查看项目分组"},{"parent":"10044513-45cc-44dc-996e-9254fb1becbc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"548938c2-0db9-4398-9961-ee6b07bc82b9","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 各项目分组只展示成员 A 的会话\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 筛选后为空的项目分组按产品定义隐藏或显示空态，行为一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"10044513-45cc-44dc-996e-9254fb1becbc","title":"🟠【P1】筛选后的项目分组表现","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 