2-b175-a6e8d5d4d8cf","title":"🟠【P1】标记他人的会话为未读","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"1b5cd70b-8df9-4aef-9673-396d3859d986","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dc82f88a-ad74-45d9-b3f4-78ff1e320d8a","customWidth":461,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"832308a7-f4d8-4684-b143-9c9f951865e2","title":"前置：他人发起的会话正在运行；角色：非发起人但有取消会话权限的人；入口：停止按钮"},{"parent":"dc82f88a-ad74-45d9-b3f4-78ff1e320d8a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aa766f25-0ec8-4a23-bdba-db4c5a67502a","title":"操作：点击停止"},{"parent":"dc82f88a-ad74-45d9-b3f4-78ff1e320d8a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"613e937b-d331-4561-aa1b-2608d92bc7e1","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 任务终止，双方状态同时收敛\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 双方都能看到中断说明与操作来源"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dc82f88a-ad74-45d9-b3f4-78ff1e320d8a","title":"🟠【P1】取消他人的会话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1b5cd70b-8df9-4aef-9673-396d3859d986","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"454565e0-631c-4bc7-a61d-ccd866fe3baf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2aa6e6f1-ae19-4bf2-94f1-16227a0c33a6","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"20e078e1-cea8-4394-8741-76f7a42a68e4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"68902c60-2514-428f-a0da-3910974ae52c","title":"前置：他人发起的会话正在运行且发起人已追加消息进入排队；角色：非发起人；入口：该会话"},{"parent":"20e078e1-cea8-4394-8741-76f7a42a68e4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c07ed60e-11d6-475c-b0a9-203d58c36577","title":"操作：查看排队区"},{"parent":"20e078e1-cea8-4394-8741-76f7a42a68e4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3a3a09c5-ea9c-49b9-a147-f293123311cc","title":"预期：\n1) 权限授权 ｜ 看不到发起人排队的消息，排队区不展示或展示为空\n2) 排队 ｜ 排队消息发出后进入对话流，此时才能看到内容"},{"parent":"20e078e1-cea8-4394-8741-76f7a42a68e4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a81e3545-25b7-4615-883c-4fe415db609d","title":"备注：会话悬浮操作共七项：置顶、删除、重命名、复制为 Markdown、复制为引用、标记为未读、取消会话。前六项的具体交互与文案已在「左侧会话列表与导航 · 会话条目状态与操作 · 会话悬浮操作」里覆盖，本子模块不重复，只验证本次变更带来的两件事：对自己发起的会话和对他人发起的会话各是一份、以及每一项的生效范围是个人级还是房间级"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"20e078e1-cea8-4394-8741-76f7a42a68e4","title":"🔴【P0】他人会话的排队区不可见"},{"parent":"2aa6e6f1-ae19-4bf2-94f1-16227a0c33a6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"83016d23-390f-43b3-ab8b-3d8cbc5955d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bbad50c6-95a2-4bfc-b89e-7f7214367d4f","title":"前置：某会话的发起人已退出房间；角色：仍在房间的成员；入口：该会话的操作菜单"},{"parent":"83016d23-390f-43b3-ab8b-3d8cbc5955d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"166cdf79-8b2e-46fb-ad97-d11832046e3a","title":"操作：展开操作菜单并逐项尝试"},{"parent":"83016d23-390f-43b3-ab8b-3d8cbc5955d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"82855609-3205-43a0-9ae3-d7a50d22ec8e","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 置顶与删除仍可用\n2) 权限授权 ｜ 继续对话相关的入口不可用并说明原因是创建人已退出房间"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"83016d23-390f-43b3-ab8b-3d8cbc5955d2","title":"🔴【P0】发起人已退出房间的会话操作","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"2aa6e6f1-ae19-4bf2-94f1-16227a0c33a6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ace0c839-8c2b-4862-a3ca-e0fbe38a008f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ab921e07-e42a-419d-9bbc-385a77308e11","title":"前置：成员 A 已置顶一条会话，成员 B 随后删除了该会话；角色：成员 A；入口：会话列表"},{"parent":"ace0c839-8c2b-4862-a3ca-e0fbe38a008f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9d11b61d-f45f-4078-a5e7-16ea25e39ce0","title":"操作：查看列表中的置顶区"},{"parent":"ace0c839-8c2b-4862-a3ca-e0fbe38a008f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6633a36c-50c0-48ec-8402-05ffb50bf9fb","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 该会话从成员 A 的置顶区移除，置顶区不遗留空位\n2) 副作用 ｜ 成员 A 的其他置顶项顺序不受影响"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ace0c839-8c2b-4862-a3ca-e0fbe38a008f","title":"🟠【P1】置顶的会话被他人删除","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"2aa6e6f1-ae19-4bf2-94f1-16227a0c33a6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2a04d774-623b-4ddd-b333-ef787ae42e29","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"99f9cc9e-e874-4187-a25b-89a678d7dac7","title":"前置：已置顶的会话数达到系统允许的最大值；角色：房间成员；入口：另一条会话的置顶操作"},{"parent":"2a04d774-623b-4ddd-b333-ef787ae42e29","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"70f3f0c6-3dec-4406-86ce-c0a883807c94","title":"操作：再置顶一条"},{"parent":"2a04d774-623b-4ddd-b333-ef787ae42e29","callou