 /plan"},{"parent":"4448077f-059c-41b9-bed5-d7c58b2506cb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"80d15244-57b2-4ea3-b431-071eb4a33975","title":"预期：@图标旁边显示计划模式，可点击清除，退出计划模式"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4448077f-059c-41b9-bed5-d7c58b2506cb","title":"🔴【P0】输入 /plan","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"590ad53c-0c53-479a-808b-acfeeec20307","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e5051833-62f0-4e85-b666-0463b6b56e57","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7d28ef1f-9b2d-4fab-a550-0bd3ae7490f0","title":"操作：在新会话输入 /plan，发送消息，等待askuseqution卡片，在会话详情点击选择，选择完所有问题卡片，在执行方案卡片上输入调整的执行方式"},{"parent":"e5051833-62f0-4e85-b666-0463b6b56e57","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e955768f-eb64-4a81-baae-345212b459d4","title":"预期：可成功发送出去，agent根据最新的调整询问，会话状态重新变成进行中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e5051833-62f0-4e85-b666-0463b6b56e57","title":"🔴【P0】输入调整执行方式","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"590ad53c-0c53-479a-808b-acfeeec20307","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1261416b-721e-46f1-a40d-0615940e4286","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fa3520d0-0fd0-4fbc-ab41-a0770e249542","title":"前置：前置：Agent 在计划模式下生成计划文件；角色：房间成员；入口：文件卡片与文件中心"},{"parent":"1261416b-721e-46f1-a40d-0615940e4286","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"689860b1-43c0-4442-a4a1-9760d67f242a","title":"操作：查看计划文件的生成路径并点击文件卡片打开"},{"parent":"1261416b-721e-46f1-a40d-0615940e4286","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7a8bd127-0fb2-4b03-a2ad-4679f61ad435","title":"预期：计划文件生成在约定的会话目录下且 Agent 有权限读取；点击文件卡片可在文件中心打开；位于临时目录下的文件同样能正常打开预览；.claude 目录下的中间文件不混入对话流文件卡片"},{"parent":"1261416b-721e-46f1-a40d-0615940e4286","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4edaedc3-23f5-4c22-95c8-2176cf80ea44","title":"备注：#295 #436 #192"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1261416b-721e-46f1-a40d-0615940e4286","title":"🟡【P2】计划文件生成位置与可访问性"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"590ad53c-0c53-479a-808b-acfeeec20307","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"86aca328-1f98-4dea-a3f0-b99fd7be2c9d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ed74f445-93e3-4d24-9a11-aebf73aeb080"