：Agent 正在回复；成员 A、B、C 同时在线"},{"parent":"b2a2fbf1-9629-492c-8f26-2144f0032038","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd3b1222-a20d-4cf8-8a08-1ce0f8b95d54","title":"操作：多人同时发送文字或附件消息"},{"parent":"b2a2fbf1-9629-492c-8f26-2144f0032038","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ee12a80e-abae-4f11-85b2-d9037e55bf00","title":"预期：所有消息均不丢失、不重复；按照服务端确认顺序生成稳定顺序；每条消息显示正确发送者；各成员视图一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b2a2fbf1-9629-492c-8f26-2144f0032038","title":"🔴【P0】多人同时追加排队消息","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"53e4d5b6-60d1-412b-91ac-37b40e32704d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f95d4c04-424a-4861-af16-e9c25418af1e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d69f1dcf-4d40-47ff-86d8-cbca70dd7d8c","title":"前置：成员 A、B 均具备删除权限"},{"parent":"f95d4c04-424a-4861-af16-e9c25418af1e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"39286f6c-383c-4c67-b631-34e5e2a044e0","title":"操作：A、B 同时删除同一条消息"},{"parent":"f95d4c04-424a-4861-af16-e9c25418af1e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"38dc0d4c-34d3-402f-8e92-e3ea75dbdb73","title":"预期：消息只删除一次；排队数量只减少一次；不会出现删除成功但消息仍可发送的情况"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f95d4c04-424a-4861-af16-e9c25418af1e","title":"🔴【P0】多人同时删除同一条排队消息","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"53e4d5b6-60d1-412b-91ac-37b40e32704d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5a9b648d-33d8-41a7-8921-1dd8093a99de","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13e816fb-1823-4ba1-977b-f4781046f844","title":"前置：排队消息刚从队列进入发送流程"},{"parent":"5a9b648d-33d8-41a7-8921-1dd8093a99de","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"62162de6-8a82-4c2c-b18c-b6b32b780f8a","title":"操作：在发送临界点编辑或删除该消息"},{"parent":"5a9b648d-33d8-41a7-8921-1dd8093a99de","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fe347cbb-a5b3-45a4-b11c-ad445ff8f4dc","title":"预期：系统明确返回成功或失败结果；若已发送则禁止再次编辑、删除或重复发送；消息状态和提示在所有成员侧一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5a9b648d-33d8-41a7-8921-1dd8093a99de","title":"🔴【P0】编辑或删除已被自动发送的排队消息"},{"parent":"53e4d5b6-60d1-412b-91ac-37b40e32704d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"18520ddc-acf8-4726-b377-f8617933c875","callout