话输入框"},{"parent":"de135d5f-dfe8-433f-8be6-a23a7d92022d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b09520cf-aa7f-4773-9d87-85edb51779a4","title":"操作：连续追加 10 条以上排队消息，查看排队区展示与滚动"},{"parent":"de135d5f-dfe8-433f-8be6-a23a7d92022d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"650f5a21-15f4-4c69-86c0-1d5bf8c8909e","title":"预期：排队区可滚动查看全部条目或折叠展示并给出总数；每条的编辑、删除、继续入口均可用；发送顺序与追加顺序一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"de135d5f-dfe8-433f-8be6-a23a7d92022d","title":"🟡【P2】排队消息数量较多时的展示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"a8373c92-9ba0-4eb4-b1bc-394e4b9b195f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"701c8def-2341-4a5b-8d6f-37a86d18a621","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a9e5ac6a-f73c-409e-9760-77e39ecbfa86","title":"前置：支持文字、多个图片、多个文件和多个 @ 引用"},{"parent":"701c8def-2341-4a5b-8d6f-37a86d18a621","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bfd7c275-3524-4e32-8ef7-15efac2f8d31","title":"操作：在同一条消息中组合发送"},{"parent":"701c8def-2341-4a5b-8d6f-37a86d18a621","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c36ff558-fd50-4eef-a1d6-1ae8a0b46407","title":"预期：消息仍作为一个队列条目；文字、图片、文件和引用均正确展示；编辑回填后内容不拆分、不丢失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"701c8def-2341-4a5b-8d6f-37a86d18a621","title":"🟡【P2】单条排队消息包含多种内容","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"a8373c92-9ba0-4eb4-b1bc-394e4b9b195f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b571d19a-6464-4bc4-8836-f5520a3e0cc5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c85d8dc-ec23-4887-9b3e-4fbe1a1c2d69","title":"前置：输入框无文字，仅存在空附件或无效附件"},{"parent":"b571d19a-6464-4bc4-8836-f5520a3e0cc5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"589048b6-cea5-4a32-bbd4-4763734ff1a0","title":"操作：尝试发送"},{"parent":"b571d19a-6464-4bc4-8836-f5520a3e0cc5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09f5cc48-6264-4c7c-a501-8ca17bd1090d","title":"预期：禁止生成空排队消息；给出明确提示；排队数量不增加"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b571d19a-6464-4bc4-8836-f5520a3e0cc5","title":"🟡【P2】空文字或空附件排队","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"a8373c92-9ba0-4eb4-b1bc-394e4b9b195f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"24fbcc6b-b717-4164-84cd-86acca07e8fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4f191048-9ea9-4154-a2c9-cf5e03ec4083","title":"前置：准备超过大小限制或不支持格式的图片"},{"parent":"24fbcc6b-b717-4164-84cd-86acca07e8fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"864f6f6e-d2a1-41d7-88a8-af76fa9e4a54","title":"操作：粘贴并发送"},{"parent":"24fbcc6b-b717-4164-84cd-86acca07e8fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"52a929bb-35a5-4a41-825e-592592994f8e","title":"预期：发送前明确提示限制；不生成裂图或无效排队条目；当前 Agent 回复不受影响"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"24fbcc6b-b717-4164-84cd-86acca07e8fc","title":"🟡【P2】超大图片或不支持的图片格式排队","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"a8373c92-9ba0-4eb4-b1bc-394e4b9b195f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3bf9f093-ab01-4a1a-8509-a247c60d889c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fa6c7fa6-46c4-4076-820e-3273bd62af10","title":"前置：成员 A、B 交替追加、编辑、删除和继续插入消息"},{"parent":"3bf9f093-ab01-4a1a-8509-a247c60d889c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"51ca842d-1d7c-46b4-ada8-db01575ee70c","title":"操作：连续执行多次操作"},{"parent":"3bf9f093-ab01-4a1a-8509-a247c60d889c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f8b596a4-d4d6-4c1a-8852-c81764abeb17","title":"- 预期：服务端顺序、客户端展示顺序和最终发送顺序一致；编辑不改变原位置，继续插入才改变回合位置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3bf9f093-ab01-4a1a-8509-a247c60d889c","title":"🟡【P2】排队消息顺序在多人操作下保持稳定","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"a8373c92-9ba0-4eb4-b1bc-394e4b9b195f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"48c1f96c-70a0-4737-80c1-e51f976b5515","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f83e2a95-0119-4255-8776-5e63547ea01d","title":"前置：任务因超时、撤权、删除等系统动作被中止；排队区仍有消息"},{"parent":"48c1f96c-70a0-4737-80c1-e51f976b5515","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3e38b515-bcc3-4521-8744-9f2432e7e32b","title":"操作：查看排队区和会话详情"},{"parent":"48c1f96c-70a0-4737-80c1-e51f976b5515","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d0b99559-1f17-471e-b747-a64229035b92","title":"- 预期：系统中止原因标记为 system reason；排队消息不被误认为已发送；排队状态暂停并对所有成员可见；恢复或重新执行前不得自动发送"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"48c1f96c-70a0-4737-80c1-e51f976b5515","title":"🟡【P2】系统中止时的排队消息处理","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"a8373c92-9ba0-4eb4-b1bc-394e4b9b195f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"84243059-19e2-40ea-a705-51bd44c7ae66","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cf688dab-b6a6-4c67-8b1f-3d1450fb6da6","title":"前置：成员已打开排队区，期间房间权限发生变化"},{"parent":"84243059-19e2-40ea-a705-51bd44c7ae66","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"db81c36d-66a1-4a5c-a66c-d840e0951571","title":"操作：先获得编辑、删除或插入权限，再被撤销权限，分别尝试操作"},{"parent":"84243059-19e2-40ea-a705-51bd44c7ae66","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6aa4bee7-023b-49eb-baa9-d429c7cf93f0","title":"预期：前端入口与服务端权限同步更新；撤权后的操作被拒绝；已完成的合法操作不被回滚；所有成员状态一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"84243059-19e2-40ea-a705-51bd44c7ae66","title":"🟡【P2】权限变化中的排队操作"},{"parent":"a8373c92-9ba0-4eb4-b1bc-394e4b9b195f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ec5b1b4a-ccba-4291-b1d5-0af7881b598d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"173bba73-3eea-48de-938e-3a48d55d15a3","title":"前置：连续追加至队列数量、单条消息长度或附件数量达到限制"},{"parent":"ec5b1b4a-ccba-4291-b1d5-0af7881b598d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"039ec988-2002-44f5-b282-adbb746d778f","title":"操作：继续追加消息或附件"},{"parent":"ec5b1b4a-ccba-4291-b1d5-0af7881b598d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cdc4910b-70fb-42d4-a34b-376781cebd83","title":"预期：达到上限后明确提示；已存在消息不受影响；不会部分入队、重复入队或错误增加排队数量。"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ec5b1b4a-ccba-4291-b1d5-0af7881b598d","title":"🟡【P2】排队消息达到系统上限"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a8373c92-9ba0-4eb4-b1bc-394e4b9b195f","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0cc7e24d-068f-418e-8188-ab3609dd81c7","title":"运行中追加消息排队"},{"parent":"b9bdc15e-7a11-47bb-abc1-243eaf674b25","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3fb7cf89-2a3b-4af0-b94f-385a64599559","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9b8a017a-00bf-4e5a-8cdb-6b6a00576317","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8a74644c-7827-498f-a927-0f7db2cfe8ca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f69fe848-4e32-4e1b-bbfe-9b4ed5ef431d","title":"前置：Agent 正在回复；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框取消按钮"},{"parent":"8a74644c-7827-498f-a927-0f7db2cfe8ca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"038cab5c-6b19-4413-a288-45ed17215040","title":"操作：点击取消按钮"},{"parent":"8a74644c-7827-498f-a927-0f7db2cfe8ca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d6e43bcd-8877-4899-a7b7-d13596a32d73","title":"预期：会话立即停止输出，停止后续工具调用；按钮在数秒内恢复为可发送状态；已产生的输出内容保留在对话流中；会话状态收敛为已取消"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8a74644c-7827-498f-a927-0f7db2cfe8ca","title":"🔴【P0】运行中取消会话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"9b8a017a-00bf-4e5a-8cdb-6b6a00576317","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4800f0e6-a438-4d26-b772-884ea172a45f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5a3134da-0880-45e2-8bfa-f6fbc59585be","title":"前置：刚点击发送，Agent 尚未开始输出；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框取消按钮"},{"parent":"4800f0e6-a438-4d26-b772-884ea172a45f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cdf69d21-d12b-44f2-822a-0437df9d8713","title":"操作：发送后立即点击取消"},{"parent":"4800f0e6-a438-4d26-b772-884ea172a45f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"021226e8-3aef-4b9b-8a98-3803e00c3ef4","title":"预期：会话回到可编辑状态，刚输入的提示词重新回填到输入框；不产生只有用户消息没有回复的空会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4800f0e6-a438-4d26-b772-884ea172a45f","title":"🔴【P0】会话刚发出即取消"},{"parent":"9b8a017a-00bf-4e5a-8cdb-6b6a00576317","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"36e66a68-4c9d-4efa-b0d4-c79574608dbb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1ea46a8b-776f-4d50-95b7-9bba7c6d6fc7","title":"前置：排队消息刚被发出；角色：房间成员；入口：取消按钮与输入框"},{"parent":"36e66a68-4c9d-4efa-b0d4-c79574608dbb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bd3d7ba0-0275-4f43-a15e-7ab456504e0c","title":"操作：取消会话后再发送一条新消息"},{"parent":"36e66a68-4c9d-4efa-b0d4-c79574608dbb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4b100a1b-4d37-442c-85e1-a9c667e53686","title":"预期：新消息按时间顺序追加在对话流末尾并能收到回复；不出现新消息插到之前消息前面或长时间无回复"},{"parent":"36e66a68-4c9d-4efa-b0d4-c79574608dbb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fec0033c-d7c3-4ca7-b5b4-ecd5c453a1e8","title":"备注：#284"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"36e66a68-4c9d-4efa-b0d4-c79574608dbb","title":"🔴【P0】取消后再发消息","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"9b8a017a-00bf-4e5a-8cdb-6b6a00576317","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"65836ce6-e2cb-4588-9389-f2b2e7b809c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ca99b79b-0872-49e3-bade-bd0fa180452c","title":"前置：分别构造模型输出中、工具调用中、子 Agent 运行中三种状态；角色：房间成员；入口：取消按钮"},{"parent":"65836ce6-e2cb-4588-9389-f2b2e7b809c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c592791-0d7e-40b4-9c05-908731a01b5d","title":"操作：在三种状态下各执行一次取消"},{"parent":"65836ce6-e2cb-4588-9389-f2b2e7b809c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ef820852-eaee-42d8-8bcf-7612f0762c17","title":"预期：三种情况均及时停止并将会话状态收敛为已取消；不残留仍在后台运行的工具或子 Agent；取消后可继续发送新消息"},{"parent":"65836ce6-e2cb-4588-9389-f2b2e7b809c0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eb7cbf27-3620-43f5-8c3c-ceb16882901b","title":"备注：附件3 CC-041"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"65836ce6-e2cb-4588-9389-f2b2e7b809c0","title":"🟠【P1】输出、工具与子 Agent 运行中分别取消","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9b8a017a-00bf-4e5a-8cdb-6b6a00576317","title":"正常场景（4）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3fb7cf89-2a3b-4af0-b94f-385a64599559","title":"取消会话"},{"parent":"b9bdc15e-7a11-47bb-abc1-243eaf674b25","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"12e1f296-ceaf-40ef-be32-843b010f5faa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3358106d-cd8a-4b9d-a7ec-0ad32d006e4b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d94db0d5-2550-4317-b758-4ba2d9f42af6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"87cf711d-6a0d-413f-9b2b-f47cd4a3dce8","title":"前置：Agent 正在回复且排队区中有一条由我发起的消息；角色：Turn caller；入口：排队条目继续箭头"},{"parent":"d94db0d5-2550-4317-b758-4ba2d9f42af6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7cce4764-a57f-4059-ad47-d5fea6c3f54c","title":"操作：点击该排队消息的继续箭头"},{"parent":"d94db0d5-2550-4317-b758-4ba2d9f42af6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a046fdee-17f3-40a8-81e7-1941eaec1e47","title":"预期：<br>1) 权限授权 ｜ 允许插入<br>2) 当前任务 ｜ 当前 Turn 停止回复<br>3) 消息处理 ｜ 被插入消息立即作为新的 Turn 执行<br>4) 排队处理 ｜ 其他排队消息保留且顺序不变<br>5) 状态同步 ｜ 其他成员可以看到当前 Turn 被插入消息接管<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d94db0d5-2550-4317-b758-4ba2d9f42af6","title":"🔴【P0】Turn caller 插入自己发起的排队消息","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"3358106d-cd8a-4b9d-a7ec-0ad32d006e4b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"50e0871b-3f18-42b5-bf46-00f86a697be5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"606cc5ff-6676-4d9b-81b1-e7e152d5eaa5","title":"前置：会话由我创建，当前排队消息由成员 B 发起；角色：Session creator；入口：排队条目继续箭头"},{"parent":"50e0871b-3f18-42b5-bf46-00f86a697be5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c90e177-6c01-4d26-a14f-41f3781110df","title":"操作：点击成员 B 的排队消息继续箭头"},{"parent":"50e0871b-3f18-42b5-bf46-00f86a697be5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e698ed04-c05e-4669-89a2-6ef8eb384a31","title":"预期：<br>1) 权限授权 ｜ 允许插入该会话中的排队消息<br>2) 当前任务 ｜ 当前 Turn 停止并切换到被插入消息<br>3) 消息归属 ｜ 记录插入操作来源为会话创建者<br>4) 状态同步 ｜ 所有有权成员可以看到插入结果<br>5) 排队顺序 ｜ 未插入消息继续保留<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"50e0871b-3f18-42b5-bf46-00f86a697be5","title":"🔴【P0】Session creator 插入他人发起的排队消息","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"3358106d-cd8a-4b9d-a7ec-0ad32d006e4b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cd5283d4-6130-4778-ad55-0a9ab8dfa341","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"98bb5cea-5cde-4c2d-99d2-ad24cfbe8528","title":"前置：当前 Turn 使用我的 Agent 或 Computer 执行；排队区存在待处理消息；角色：Executor owner"},{"parent":"cd5283d4-6130-4778-ad55-0a9ab8dfa341","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"85338fa5-abc9-4db8-a017-8fde341f8ad2","title":"操作：点击排队消息继续箭头"},{"parent":"cd5283d4-6130-4778-ad55-0a9ab8dfa341","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"19702f8f-6331-4c35-a8b9-63a48de2ad98","title":"预期：<br>1) 权限授权 ｜ 允许执行插入操作<br>2) 执行状态 ｜ 当前执行资源停止当前任务并处理被插入消息<br>3) 进程清理 ｜ 不残留旧任务、工具进程或后台执行<br>4) 操作记录 ｜ 记录插入操作来源为 Executor owner<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cd5283d4-6130-4778-ad55-0a9ab8dfa341","title":"🟠【P1】Executor owner 插入排队消息","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3358106d-cd8a-4b9d-a7ec-0ad32d006e4b","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"12e1f296-ceaf-40ef-be32-843b010f5faa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"65422461-0225-4362-a3e4-aa61dd046855","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6015479c-9087-4722-9019-1df4bab9540f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eea3e6b3-ebf2-4c69-b10d-8fada5ee6beb","title":"前置：成员 B 发起排队消息；成员 A 有会话写权限，但不是消息发起人、Session creator 或 Executor owner；角色：writable member"},{"parent":"6015479c-9087-4722-9019-1df4bab9540f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"008ab3f6-97d2-4d9c-b467-de1a878d0e0c","title":"操作：成员 A 点击继续箭头尝试插入该消息"},{"parent":"6015479c-9087-4722-9019-1df4bab9540f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"45b02cdf-c346-48d5-b392-960880883f21","title":"预期：<br>1) 权限授权 ｜ 不允许插入他人发起的排队消息<br>2) 按钮状态 ｜ 继续箭头不展示或置灰不可点击<br>3) 提示文案 ｜ 提示只能插入自己发起的排队消息<br>4) 当前任务 ｜ 当前回复不被打断<br>5) 排队消息 ｜ 原消息继续保留<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6015479c-9087-4722-9019-1df4bab9540f","title":"🔴【P0】有写权限的成员不能插入他人排队消息","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"65422461-0225-4362-a3e4-aa61dd046855","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"55f99c45-b04f-487e-8426-2fbed3d7ba3a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"001b6244-acd2-41ef-ad2b-46b253974d62","title":"前置：成员 A 对会话只有只读权限；会话中存在排队消息；角色：read-only member"},{"parent":"55f99c45-b04f-487e-8426-2fbed3d7ba3a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dbdf96f7-d91c-423c-88c3-43b4790385fc","title":"操作：查看排队消息并点击继续箭头"},{"parent":"55f99c45-b04f-487e-8426-2fbed3d7ba3a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cc6a5e67-dabc-45bc-9044-98a1dd4f28e5","title":"预期：<br>1) 可见性 ｜ 可以查看排队消息<br>2) 权限授权 ｜ 不允许插入<br>3) 当前任务 ｜ 当前回复不受影响<br>4) 提示文案 ｜ 明确说明只读成员无操作权限<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"55f99c45-b04f-487e-8426-2fbed3d7ba3a","title":"🔴【P0】只读成员不能插入排队消息","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"65422461-0225-4362-a3e4-aa61dd046855","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e0b0c6bd-6e73-4533-9ccf-ebbea3ea6970","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3bb66e6-a903-4360-a138-84a0c8900920","title":"前置：房主不是消息发起人、Session creator 或 Executor owner；角色：Room owner"},{"parent":"e0b0c6bd-6e73-4533-9ccf-ebbea3ea6970","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"20d3c4bb-fa4f-4a80-a564-aad925414fc8","title":"操作：尝试插入成员 B 的排队消息"},{"parent":"e0b0c6bd-6e73-4533-9ccf-ebbea3ea6970","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ce4c35f2-0bb1-4236-bb15-cfea7a885a3d","title":"预期：<br>1) 权限授权 ｜ 不因房主身份获得插入权限<br>2) 任务状态 ｜ 当前任务继续执行<br>3) 消息状态 ｜ 排队消息保持不变<br>4) 操作记录 ｜ 不产生有效插入记录<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e0b0c6bd-6e73-4533-9ccf-ebbea3ea6970","title":"🔴【P0】Room owner 不能隐式插入他人消息","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"65422461-0225-4362-a3e4-aa61dd046855","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6ce7b7b3-8fdb-4cc5-9375-fa74140c0e1a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"295bca0a-6b45-4178-805a-9abea9b3e7f2","title":"前置：排队消息显示继续箭头；当前 Turn 即将结束；角色：有插入权限的成员"},{"parent":"6ce7b7b3-8fdb-4cc5-9375-fa74140c0e1a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ee9cae8f-b312-4b1e-92c8-556b9d473562","title":"操作：在当前 Turn 完成的同时点击继续箭头"},{"parent":"6ce7b7b3-8fdb-4cc5-9375-fa74140c0e1a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0ba1b0de-1b29-4a17-b690-45107f49845d","title":"预期：<br>1) 状态处理 ｜ 只执行一次有效操作<br>2) 消息顺序 ｜ 消息作为下一条 Turn 处理<br>3) 状态收敛 ｜ 不出现已结束 Turn 又被停止的错误状态<br>4) 页面同步 ｜ 所有成员看到一致的 Turn 顺序<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6ce7b7b3-8fdb-4cc5-9375-fa74140c0e1a","title":"🟠【P1】插入时当前 Turn 已结束","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"65422461-0225-4362-a3e4-aa61dd046855","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"27f21966-06c1-4cac-8cb4-5b00f4dec524","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d9570531-61c6-41dc-bbdf-148e613b71e8","title":"前置：当前 Turn 正在运行；成员 A 具备插入权限；成员 B 具备中止权限"},{"parent":"27f21966-06c1-4cac-8cb4-5b00f4dec524","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"46e526e7-1c6e-47ed-bce5-aba5cd4705a8","title":"操作：成员 A 点击插入，成员 B 同时点击中止"},{"parent":"27f21966-06c1-4cac-8cb4-5b00f4dec524","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4f871c03-d03f-488a-948e-23df98826d4b","title":"预期：<br>1) 并发控制 ｜ 只产生一个最终有效状态<br>2) 状态唯一 ｜ 不出现既已中止又已插入的冲突状态<br>3) 消息处理 ｜ 被插入消息不丢失、不重复<br>4) 操作记录 ｜ 记录实际先成功的操作及操作来源<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"27f21966-06c1-4cac-8cb4-5b00f4dec524","title":"🟠【P1】插入时当前 Turn 已被其他人中止","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"65422461-0225-4362-a3e4-aa61dd046855","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e8593f3a-14e7-4371-bcdc-bba764ddb02c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1ab3e185-4c79-4858-9614-1a9098c1f614","title":"前置：会话可正常发送；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"e8593f3a-14e7-4371-bcdc-bba764ddb02c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d0f6e217-858f-4b7b-845b-d14d59b20e90","title":"操作：发出一条消息后立即再插入一条新消息，观察对话流顺序与工具调用归属"},{"parent":"e8593f3a-14e7-4371-bcdc-bba764ddb02c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ac397077-a1ad-44f2-bbbb-28e29074f394","title":"预期：多条插入消息可以由 Agent 分别回复，也可以合并为一次回复；关键是消息不能丢失、不能重复执行，且所有有效意图都被处理。"},{"parent":"e8593f3a-14e7-4371-bcdc-bba764ddb02c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1f156590-d0cc-4359-afd3-d48fc490cd60","title":"备注：#78 #88 #181 #282"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e8593f3a-14e7-4371-bcdc-bba764ddb02c","title":"🟠【P1】发出一条消息后立即再插入一条新消息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"65422461-0225-4362-a3e4-aa61dd046855","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"12e1f296-ceaf-40ef-be32-843b010f5faa","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4c175ed0-fb4b-4c01-ac0a-ba1cbc758d02","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c7f230d3-855d-4423-8972-bcc3d7fbb56a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"097b4fb7-35d5-43ae-b3f3-dd371590c5e0","title":"前置：排队区中存在 3 条以上消息；角色：有插入权限的成员"},{"parent":"c7f230d3-855d-4423-8972-bcc3d7fbb56a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd44502a-c6e9-4669-ab4b-241ee8b15bb4","title":"操作：依次对不同排队消息点击继续箭头"},{"parent":"c7f230d3-855d-4423-8972-bcc3d7fbb56a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"43f704e2-c82c-445b-aa6e-6b55682d4c29","title":"预期：<br>多条插入消息可以由 Agent 分别回复，也可以合并为一次回复；关键是消息不能丢失、不能重复执行，且所有有效意图都被处理。<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c7f230d3-855d-4423-8972-bcc3d7fbb56a","title":"🟡【P2】多个排队消息连续插入"},{"parent":"4c175ed0-fb4b-4c01-ac0a-ba1cbc758d02","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2fec73de-b8d4-4e08-be41-1e79785d5852","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8c415c94-e151-465c-814b-464fee54abc0","title":"前置：排队区分别存在纯图片、带文件和带 @ 引用的消息；角色：有插入权限的成员"},{"parent":"2fec73de-b8d4-4e08-be41-1e79785d5852","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ec532f20-8fae-48db-9be3-f8c60c23f5de","title":"操作：分别点击继续箭头插入三类消息"},{"parent":"2fec73de-b8d4-4e08-be41-1e79785d5852","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1f43253d-8791-4393-a49e-d23c6d5370ca","title":"预期：<br>1) 消息处理 ｜ 三类消息均能正常作为新的 Turn 执行<br>2) 内容完整 ｜ 图片、文件和 @ 引用均不丢失<br>3) 权限校验 ｜ 引用对象仍按原有权限校验<br>4) 状态同步 ｜ 其他成员看到的消息内容与执行结果一致<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2fec73de-b8d4-4e08-be41-1e79785d5852","title":"🟡【P2】插入包含图片、文件和 @ 引用的消息","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4c175ed0-fb4b-4c01-ac0a-ba1cbc758d02","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"12e1f296-ceaf-40ef-be32-843b010f5faa","title":"插入"},{"parent":"b9bdc15e-7a11-47bb-abc1-243eaf674b25","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"8fd91945-babc-4472-b78c-a0af3fc4090c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"18a9fc4a-325d-40af-bf30-512ac054f4f2","title":"说明：需求变更：会话暂停改为只有会话发起人才能暂停"},{"parent":"8fd91945-babc-4472-b78c-a0af3fc4090c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2d8eddb4-b214-4ddb-81d6-32604e458511","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"920e4b44-b30b-470f-acdb-83bb2db5a544","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7ea79ac4-0f19-4bdc-80ba-eff9dd2db4c4","title":"前置：我发起的会话正在运行；角色：会话发起人；入口：会话的暂停入口"},{"parent":"920e4b44-b30b-470f-acdb-83bb2db5a544","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e986be4-ee8a-4851-a39b-33c86413cfc7","title":"操作：点击暂停"},{"parent":"920e4b44-b30b-470f-acdb-83bb2db5a544","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"59e41629-ab1d-4384-acb9-5f35580e6255","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 会话进入暂停状态，输出停止\n2) 按钮状态 ｜ 暂停后入口变为继续或恢复，可以再次运行"},{"parent":"920e4b44-b30b-470f-acdb-83bb2db5a544","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dbce7149-e2d3-4024-b60f-a0a94bb2fe78","title":"备注：需求变更：会话暂停改为只有会话发起人才能暂停，其他成员不能暂停他人发起的会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"920e4b44-b30b-470f-acdb-83bb2db5a544","title":"🔴【P0】发起人可以暂停自己的会话"},{"parent":"2d8eddb4-b214-4ddb-81d6-32604e458511","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f15ba69f-3eb5-4cec-aafb-7bf211475f46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4a3bf0ab-6acc-4137-9d4a-3acd5ceeb50f","title":"前置：成员 B 发起的会话正在运行；角色：非发起人的成员 A；入口：该会话"},{"parent":"f15ba69f-3eb5-4cec-aafb-7bf211475f46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f22b7cb2-9a7e-4f6b-8362-fa8863821495","title":"操作：分别查看暂停与取消两个入口"},{"parent":"f15ba69f-3eb5-4cec-aafb-7bf211475f46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"601dd532-6f41-4618-abe5-a3a900aebc46","title":"预期：\n1) 权限授权 ｜ 暂停只有发起人可用；取消是否同样收紧要与产品口径一致\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 两个操作的权限边界能明确区分，不共用一个按钮"},{"parent":"f15ba69f-3eb5-4cec-aafb-7bf211475f46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eb5049dd-1346-47e3-8042-6e91dd1f88fd","title":"备注：现有用例里有一条「其他成员可以取消他人的会话」，与本次暂停只允许发起人的口径不同，需确认取消是否也要一并收紧；需求变更：会话暂停改为只有会话发起人才能暂停，其他成员不能暂停他人发起的会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f15ba69f-3eb5-4cec-aafb-7bf211475f46","title":"🔴【P0】暂停与取消的权限区分"},{"parent":"2d8eddb4-b214-4ddb-81d6-32604e458511","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"551068d7-ed71-4630-ac9f-66fdafee8312","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fbd57629-a8f0-4c2a-8a95-f2683f868fc8","title":"前置：我暂停了自己发起的会话；角色：其他房间成员；入口：该会话与会话列表"},{"parent":"551068d7-ed71-4630-ac9f-66fdafee8312","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cd4c9dc9-cd6d-44c5-a561-1f8e9cc87a79","title":"操作：其他成员查看该会话"},{"parent":"551068d7-ed71-4630-ac9f-66fdafee8312","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0d53814b-feb6-484f-bac4-2a719bcacb71","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 其他成员看到的状态同步为已暂停\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 能看出是被发起人暂停的，而不是异常中断"},{"parent":"551068d7-ed71-4630-ac9f-66fdafee8312","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5ea2aac-3baf-4472-9e94-ba424cc6d256","title":"备注：需求变更：会话暂停改为只有会话发起人才能暂停，其他成员不能暂停他人发起的会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"551068d7-ed71-4630-ac9f-66fdafee8312","title":"🟠【P1】暂停后其他成员看到的状态"},{"parent":"2d8eddb4-b214-4ddb-81d6-32604e458511","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bde14fc6-4e13-4f96-948b-0b95e518b903","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5a2432ee-8e4d-4b59-8a5d-b39c448b040a","title":"前置：我发起的会话处于暂停状态；角色：会话发起人；入口：该会话"},{"parent":"bde14fc6-4e13-4f96-948b-0b95e518b903","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5b19f696-df87-4deb-a660-6d40d42648d3","title":"操作：点击继续"},{"parent":"bde14fc6-4e13-4f96-948b-0b95e518b903","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"65cf61bf-de20-4869-8184-210151a8c374","title":"预期：\n1) 会话状态 ｜ 从暂停处继续执行，不重头开始\n2) 上下文 ｜ 上下文完整保留，已产生的输出与产物不丢失"},{"parent":"bde14fc6-4e13-4f96-948b-0b95e518b903","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c8936758-49bc-4163-a8aa-1f8117238e6b","title":"备注：需求变更：会话暂停改为只有会话发起人才能暂停，其他成员不能暂停他人发起的会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bde14fc6-4e13-4f96-948b-0b95e518b903","title":"🟠【P1】暂停后恢复运行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2d8eddb4-b214-4ddb-81d6-32604e458511","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"8fd91945-babc-4472-b78c-a0af3fc4090c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ca6c7d5a-de44-4017-9d43-60a1f2dc979b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7939ba42-e7b4-4540-b0bf-19e1a3e6d806","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc487402-fd37-467b-afd2-bb760e91e3d7","title":"前置：成员 B 发起的会话正在运行；角色：非发起人的成员 A；入口：该会话"},{"parent":"7939ba42-e7b4-4540-b0bf-19e1a3e6d806","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"af2afbfc-e43d-4273-814a-237e969f5735","title":"操作：查看并尝试点击暂停"},{"parent":"7939ba42-e7b4-4540-b0bf-19e1a3e6d806","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"03edb289-8891-40ab-8b6b-fd29e6eb0ddf","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 暂停入口不展示或置灰不可点击\n2) 权限授权 ｜ 不允许非发起人暂停他人发起的会话\n3) 提示文案 ｜ 若展示为置灰，要说明只有发起人可以暂停"},{"parent":"7939ba42-e7b4-4540-b0bf-19e1a3e6d806","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b94e4082-f274-4ae6-80ca-d78dc5da9e3f","title":"备注：需求变更：会话暂停改为只有会话发起人才能暂停，其他成员不能暂停他人发起的会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7939ba42-e7b4-4540-b0bf-19e1a3e6d806","title":"🔴【P0】非发起人不能暂停他人的会话"},{"parent":"ca6c7d5a-de44-4017-9d43-60a1f2dc979b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a0f75590-ed2f-475b-b132-e3efe09013ff","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aae97ae3-afe2-43f0-a731-34d8058bc9fb","title":"前置：成员 B 发起的会话处于暂停状态；角色：成员 A；入口：该会话的输入框"},{"parent":"a0f75590-ed2f-475b-b132-e3efe09013ff","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"da7f638a-df94-416c-9b48-1aa37ce45b03","title":"操作：成员 A 尝试发送一条指令"},{"parent":"a0f75590-ed2f-475b-b132-e3efe09013ff","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"65a90472-581b-4371-abf3-c9ce30566a81","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 按产品定义拦截或进入排队，结论唯一\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 说明会话已被发起人暂停"},{"parent":"a0f75590-ed2f-475b-b132-e3efe09013ff","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"098055ca-a301-47b0-ac17-a612df6bb07e","title":"备注：暂停期间他人能否发消息需产品确认；需求变更：会话暂停改为只有会话发起人才能暂停，其他成员不能暂停他人发起的会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a0f75590-ed2f-475b-b132-e3efe09013ff","title":"🟠【P1】暂停期间其他成员发消息"},{"parent":"ca6c7d5a-de44-4017-9d43-60a1f2dc979b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a62403cc-d7a3-433b-963f-97bea2df8800","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f9f49a28-e58c-4947-b58d-a79815313096","title":"前置：某会话的发起人已退出房间且会话仍在运行；角色：仍在房间的成员；入口：该会话"},{"parent":"a62403cc-d7a3-433b-963f-97bea2df8800","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d397bcec-5c29-4cde-98db-0e3eb06e3d16","title":"操作：尝试暂停该会话"},{"parent":"a62403cc-d7a3-433b-963f-97bea2df8800","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b49e2617-d029-4c15-88e7-2a264de3d035","title":"预期：\n1) 权限授权 ｜ 按产品定义处理，结论唯一并有说明\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不留下一个谁都停不下来的运行中任务"},{"parent":"a62403cc-d7a3-433b-963f-97bea2df8800","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"22af74de-3587-4bf9-af6c-85f1b11bb0c2","title":"备注：发起人退出后由谁来暂停需产品确认；需求变更：会话暂停改为只有会话发起人才能暂停，其他成员不能暂停他人发起的会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a62403cc-d7a3-433b-963f-97bea2df8800","title":"🟠【P1】发起人退出房间后的暂停权限"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ca6c7d5a-de44-4017-9d43-60a1f2dc979b","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"8fd91945-babc-4472-b78c-a0af3fc4090c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"420d1f3a-7d8d-49b0-89a0-6f0e1d36f77d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"47e199ce-2ef4-450a-872c-1abbd31a0b31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7054c1d9-a309-41dc-a3cc-d295144184d8","title":"前置：我发起的会话正在运行；角色：会话发起人；入口：暂停按钮"},{"parent":"47e199ce-2ef4-450a-872c-1abbd31a0b31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13bd954d-8be4-47e8-84e0-a4de1800dea3","title":"操作：连续快速点击暂停多次"},{"parent":"47e199ce-2ef4-450a-872c-1abbd31a0b31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a1d47a86-a159-456a-8011-55b521fbac5a","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 操作幂等，只暂停一次\n2) 会话状态 ｜ 状态不反复横跳"},{"parent":"47e199ce-2ef4-450a-872c-1abbd31a0b31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"14060675-dc3a-46ea-8653-cb412f22ea0b","title":"备注：需求变更：会话暂停改为只有会话发起人才能暂停，其他成员不能暂停他人发起的会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"47e199ce-2ef4-450a-872c-1abbd31a0b31","title":"🟡【P2】连续点击暂停"},{"parent":"420d1f3a-7d8d-49b0-89a0-6f0e1d36f77d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"75cbf5e7-199a-464a-a865-7d469db1cac5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ce694ac0-8ecb-49f9-a752-0a4ef8242aca","title":"前置：我发起的会话正在运行且排队区有消息；角色：会话发起人；入口：该会话"},{"parent":"75cbf5e7-199a-464a-a865-7d469db1cac5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4fc68aff-7ce7-4fb5-8eac-7a5ad1c925cc","title":"操作：暂停会话后查看排队区"},{"parent":"75cbf5e7-199a-464a-a865-7d469db1cac5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5cb07b1a-2169-4d89-862c-b5c5ba802108","title":"预期：\n1) 排队 ｜ 排队消息保留，恢复运行后按顺序发出\n2) 副作用 ｜ 暂停期间不自动发出排队消息"},{"parent":"75cbf5e7-199a-464a-a865-7d469db1cac5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f19a1ad0-da97-4026-a694-747c500d2ccc","title":"备注：需求变更：会话暂停改为只有会话发起人才能暂停，其他成员不能暂停他人发起的会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"75cbf5e7-199a-464a-a865-7d469db1cac5","title":"🟡【P2】暂停与排队消息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"420d1f3a-7d8d-49b0-89a0-6f0e1d36f77d","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"border-radius":"6px","color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","background":"rgba(33, 41, 48, 0.25)","text-decoration":"line-through","border-color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","border-width":"0px","border-style":"none"},"id":"8fd91945-babc-4472-b78c-a0af3fc4090c","title":"暂停权限（仅发起人）"},{"parent":"b9bdc15e-7a11-47bb-abc1-243eaf674b25","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"49b58f5d-685e-4a82-8022-8ad3e23d65c8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0268e901-aeb5-40bf-ae5a-3a1f31475e72","title":"说明：中止权限口径：只有 Turn caller（发起当前 Turn 的人）、Session creator（创建会话的人）、Executor owner（Agent 或 Computer 的实际拥有者）三种身份可以中止；有写权限的其他成员默认只能中止自己发起的 Turn，只读成员不能中止；Room owner 不隐式获得中止权，系统中止必须标记为 system reason"},{"parent":"49b58f5d-685e-4a82-8022-8ad3e23d65c8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"405acda4-caf8-4114-9e4e-80844aa1f8d1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6cae2536-1066-4f35-b970-a21f0abd15b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"96deb438-3b53-4931-800b-431399e88cbb","title":"前置：我发起了一个正在执行的 Turn；角色：Turn caller；入口：停止按钮"},{"parent":"6cae2536-1066-4f35-b970-a21f0abd15b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"69c96a4e-57a4-4310-81f8-05839a621908","title":"操作：点击停止"},{"parent":"6cae2536-1066-4f35-b970-a21f0abd15b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b7190ea0-7d2a-43b2-b62b-8545f959a873","title":"预期：<br>1) 权限授权 ｜ 允许中止<br>2) 会话状态 ｜ 该 Turn 收敛为已中断，中止来源记录为发起人本人"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6cae2536-1066-4f35-b970-a21f0abd15b4","title":"🔴【P0】Turn 发起人中止自己的 Turn","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"405acda4-caf8-4114-9e4e-80844aa1f8d1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9cabf2ab-c798-48a3-891d-f7161d2852da","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0b75969d-b391-4f6e-9884-6c1ff91bcb5e","title":"前置：会话由我创建，当前正在执行的 Turn 由成员 B 发起；角色：Session creator；入口：停止按钮"},{"parent":"9cabf2ab-c798-48a3-891d-f7161d2852da","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0632d0ce-f47c-4976-ad8e-77e0f4ae36b7","title":"操作：点击停止"},{"parent":"9cabf2ab-c798-48a3-891d-f7161d2852da","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9f8212ce-ae2a-44af-b8a7-3b14c491f225","title":"预期：<br>1) 权限授权 ｜ 允许中止该会话下的任意 Turn<br>2) 提示文案 ｜ 双方都能看到中断说明与操作来源"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9cabf2ab-c798-48a3-891d-f7161d2852da","title":"🔴【P0】会话创建者中止任意 Turn","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"405acda4-caf8-4114-9e4e-80844aa1f8d1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1ba8d9c0-83f2-4ffb-a515-02902ddb8e71","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"195ebe52-1ce0-4b92-b110-8d225172e51a","title":"前置：正在执行的 Turn 用的是我的 Agent，会话由他人创建、Turn 也由他人发起；角色：Executor owner；入口：停止按钮"},{"parent":"1ba8d9c0-83f2-4ffb-a515-02902ddb8e71","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a23fec26-0e50-461c-9eb6-0c4644e0a8bf","title":"操作：点击停止"},{"parent":"1ba8d9c0-83f2-4ffb-a515-02902ddb8e71","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b08b8430-06ad-4b64-a554-d385d535bcf6","title":"预期：<br>1) 权限授权 ｜ 允许中止，作为执行资源拥有者的 kill switch<br>2) 会话状态 ｜ 任务在我的设备上被终止，不遗留后台进程，中止来源记录为中止用户"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1ba8d9c0-83f2-4ffb-a515-02902ddb8e71","title":"🔴【P0】Agent 的拥有者中止","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"405acda4-caf8-4114-9e4e-80844aa1f8d1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d33bff0c-59ae-4560-89d5-73d943ce9e06","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0cd60d69-4c3b-42ff-8a69-e144d1dd48c0","title":"前置：我在他人创建的会话里发起了一个 Turn；角色：writable member；入口：停止按钮"},{"parent":"d33bff0c-59ae-4560-89d5-73d943ce9e06","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e1aafc8a-cd29-4a52-a5d4-028de1b38639","title":"操作：点击停止"},{"parent":"d33bff0c-59ae-4560-89d5-73d943ce9e06","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"735f1378-13ab-4df8-bc3e-38c6c3d1377c","title":"预期：<br>1) 权限授权 ｜ 允许中止自己发起的这个 Turn<br>2) 会话状态 ｜ 该 Turn 收敛为已中断"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d33bff0c-59ae-4560-89d5-73d943ce9e06","title":"🟠【P1】有写权限的成员可以中止自己发起的 Turn","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"405acda4-caf8-4114-9e4e-80844aa1f8d1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fdb14a02-a67e-4cc4-97e1-26831a0e6f7f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3e2da87-5a31-41f2-a48b-74a0545a6458","title":"前置：任务因为超时、撤权、删除等系统动作被中止；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"fdb14a02-a67e-4cc4-97e1-26831a0e6f7f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e859415-b522-4e9c-ac34-cfab6f91943d","title":"操作：查看中断说明"},{"parent":"fdb14a02-a67e-4cc4-97e1-26831a0e6f7f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2d166ac5-076c-4c42-a1b5-01718f85ac31","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 中止来源标记为系统，不冒充成任何一个用户\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 与用户手动中止的说明可区分"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fdb14a02-a67e-4cc4-97e1-26831a0e6f7f","title":"🟠【P1】系统中止要标记为系统原因","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"405acda4-caf8-4114-9e4e-80844aa1f8d1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"60de769d-f794-44a7-89f1-8b6c8b3f544f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f53b3e5b-6ee9-45c4-984b-4e9bcaee1c65","title":"前置：我同时是 Turn 发起人、会话创建者与 Agent 拥有者；角色：房间成员；入口：停止按钮"},{"parent":"60de769d-f794-44a7-89f1-8b6c8b3f544f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"71eca07a-9ab0-4b95-9e10-ee19fb1a9090","title":"操作：点击停止"},{"parent":"60de769d-f794-44a7-89f1-8b6c8b3f544f","callout":[],"children