llout":[],"children":[],"id":"1a7b3544-c5b9-48f5-94c0-6d51aadccb75","title":"操作：发送一个复杂任务，观察思考区域从思考中到折叠再到完成的过程"},{"parent":"420b618d-eae5-4b43-b51d-7c24e3a4684c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df1c8d94-7d80-49e6-9464-2e13697485dc","title":"预期：思考状态按思考中、可折叠、已完成正确切换；折叠后可再次展开查看；不展示不应对外暴露的内部推理内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"420b618d-eae5-4b43-b51d-7c24e3a4684c","title":"🟠【P1】思考中、折叠与完成状态切换","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bdaa2b1f-5757-4a44-82d4-25a568354eb4","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"19c5c286-9d26-4bea-adce-1ed03014de6c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"957b2856-4a10-438f-8b67-10c465d0edb2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"79ed48fd-a88f-45c2-b0d4-836f1961add8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"33a638c7-318c-4e11-ba84-0ed458b61578","title":"前置：Agent 处于思考中状态；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"79ed48fd-a88f-45c2-b0d4-836f1961add8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"01d03c65-d759-4930-b1c5-e430ba0c97c9","title":"操作：断开网络让本轮请求失败，等待界面反馈"},{"parent":"79ed48fd-a88f-45c2-b0d4-836f1961add8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1f884c94-8ab1-4468-af49-b4817928770b","title":"预期：思考状态收敛为失败并给出失败原因与重试入口；不长时间停留在思考中；恢复网络后重试可继续"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"79ed48fd-a88f-45c2-b0d4-836f1961add8","title":"🟠【P1】思考中途失败时状态收敛","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"957b2856-4a10-438f-8b67-10c465d0edb2","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"19c5c286-9d26-4bea-adce-1ed03014de6c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"454d7f44-f138-443f-8ceb-d8d9955a42a2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bd5a8e45-a6b0-44a4-92b1-f03981fc0be0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"916cf527-0704-4fb3-855d-5f36f09f90dd","title":"前置：会话可正常执行；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"bd5a8e45-a6b0-44a4-92b1-f03981fc0be0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d1f71b77-71c4-4025-a9a6-88f519ed60dc","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个需要长时间思考的任务并持续观察"},{"parent":"bd5a8e45-a6b0-44a4-92b1-f03981fc0be0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fcaadc63-9b18-44c5-b877-98daee75440a","title":"预期：思考状态持续可见并有时长或进度提示；不被误判为无响应；期间取消按钮始终可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bd5a8e45-a6b0-44a4-92b1-f03981fc0be0","title":"🟡【P2】长时间思考时的状态维持","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"454d7f44-f138-443f-8ceb-d8d9955a42a2","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"19c5c286-9d26-4bea-adce-1ed03014de6c","title":"思考状态展示"},{"parent":"27c0fd14-4b54-4b24-97d1-83764b53cfe3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ab2baa09-58c1-41f8-a051-f378e6f0d5b1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"07f1936b-6677-4c2a-b124-ccaa1d9d6b2a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7c8faed8-4032-4e3c-a103-89ac5bb9575d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aaef45e4-94fe-445c-9de6-c67913ef8801","title":"前置：一条会话中有成员 A 与成员 B 发过消息；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情的对话流"},{"parent":"7c8faed8-4032-4e3c-a103-89ac5bb9575d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4763b838-2490-4561-ae01-238f8c661c61","title":"操作：逐条查看用户消息气泡"},{"parent":"7c8faed8-4032-4e3c-a103-89ac5bb9575d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8d2a8673-b946-40ba-9a39-ac0bc3bf5332","title":"预期：<br>1) 列表展示 ｜ 展示该成员的名称与房间内的身份标识，房主为房主、其余为 Room 成员<br>2) 结果校验 ｜ 与房间成员面板里的标识一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7c8faed8-4032-4e3c-a103-89ac5bb9575d","title":"🔴【P0】用户消息气泡展示头像与昵称","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"07f1936b-6677-4c2a-b124-ccaa1d9d6b2a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ab9d4397-a19a-41c2-af49-0e472f45b33c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b56b15bb-ab41-4016-90ed-9685d0da9209","title":"前置：会话中有 Agent 的回复；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"ab9d4397-a19a-41c2-af49-0e472f45b33c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b86a53b8-5cff-4b84-99cd-2e460a94f80e","title":"操作：查看 Agent 回复的展示"},{"parent":"ab9d4397-a19a-41c2-af49-0e472f45b33c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3eb88077-3702-4a06-9b3e-dc238d28adf8","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ Agent 回复展示 Agent 的图标与名称，与用户消息的发送人标识可区分\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 借用他人 Agent 时同时可看出该 Agent 的所属成员"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ab9d4397-a19a-41c2-af49-0e472f45b33c","title":"🟠【P1】Agent 回复的标识","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"07f1936b-6677-4c2a-b124-ccaa1d9d6b2a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"207b5d58-28f6-4fbe-9134-6f0ed00d0c67","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b910745c-3971-4cc8-9a9b-d1312a23096d","title":"前置：会话中有 Agent 的回复；角色：房间成员；入口：Agent 消息的头像"},{"parent":"207b5d58-28f6-4fbe-9134-6f0ed00d0c67","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8c52dd1f-bc1d-4c5b-8451-28b9e4a84837","title":"操作：点击该头像"},{"parent":"207b5d58-28f6-4fbe-9134-6f0ed00d0c67","customWidth":461.2,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ecf30583-2d5d-4de0-abb8-bfaa3ef583b0","title":"预期：\n1) 跳转定位 ｜ 在头像附近弹出 Agent 卡片\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 展示「{用户} 的 {Agent}」与「智能体」标识，以及 Provider 与 Computer 两行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"207b5d58-28f6-4fbe-9134-6f0ed00d0c67","title":"🔴【P0】点击 Agent 头像展示卡片","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"07f1936b-6677-4c2a-b124-ccaa1d9d6b2a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a6475995-1783-4f77-91e6-e8c99128f78e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"26e29e1a-9af2-4756-a581-bf2e7aa3e1dc","title":"前置：Agent 卡片已展开；角色：房间成员；入口：卡片"},{"parent":"a6475995-1783-4f77-91e6-e8c99128f78e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0bad8320-20f3-48b2-93e2-b4bce321a6dd","title":"操作：核对两行取值"},{"parent":"a6475995-1783-4f77-91e6-e8c99128f78e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae49bfe3-4788-4e60-bbf5-c523d178cd98","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ Provider 与该 Agent 的实际类型一致，Computer 与其所在电脑名一致\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 与电脑页、共享 Agent 页展示的电脑名写法一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a6475995-1783-4f77-91e6-e8c99128f78e","title":"🔴【P0】Agent卡片内的 Provider 与 Computer 取值","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"07f1936b-6677-4c2a-b124-ccaa1d9d6b2a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d4d957d3-8100-4ce8-af63-6595b6a06c56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5a76baa4-f36f-40da-91cc-d6c5caf114b2","title":"前置：会话用的是他人共享给我的 Agent；角色：房间成员；入口：Agent 头像"},{"parent":"d4d957d3-8100-4ce8-af63-6595b6a06c56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9cbb13a1-62e4-4b28-8cda-eef91940aa68","title":"操作：点击头像查看卡片"},{"parent":"d4d957d3-8100-4ce8-af63-6595b6a06c56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"371e6747-00cf-4083-9cd4-68907661defa","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 标题展示为所有者的名字加 Agent 名，Computer 展示的是所有者的电脑\n2) 权限授权 ｜ 不展示所有者的敏感信息，只到电脑名这一层"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d4d957d3-8100-4ce8-af63-6595b6a06c56","title":"🟠【P1】共享 Agent 的卡片","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"07f1936b-6677-4c2a-b124-ccaa1d9d6b2a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b02ad7a6-f5d1-4487-a518-7e576a9e23f0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0899228c-967b-43f3-ad57-e8decb015469","title":"前置：会话中既有 Agent 消息也有用户消息；角色：房间成员；入口：两种头像"},{"parent":"b02ad7a6-f5d1-4487-a518-7e576a9e23f0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"983198dc-4b0c-410e-96e6-c99d12ce173e","title":"操作：分别点击并对照两个卡片"},{"parent":"b02ad7a6-f5d1-4487-a518-7e576a9e23f0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"65605cd6-6dff-4ddb-ae83-2465b271d457","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ Agent 卡片有智能体标识与 Provider/Computer，用户卡片只有名称与身份标识\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 两者结构不同，不出现互相串用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b02ad7a6-f5d1-4487-a518-7e576a9e23f0","title":"🟠【P1】两种卡片可区分","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"07f1936b-6677-4c2a-b124-ccaa1d9d6b2a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"086088a9-2a89-4426-a638-d8d30e6e8fb3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8d12f015-5ec8-4ada-9ad0-c347baae3155","title":"前置：同一成员连续发送了三条消息；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"086088a9-2a89-4426-a638-d8d30e6e8fb3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f39455a2-0d73-4a3f-868c-3b8f8f5fc7fa","title":"操作：查看这三条气泡"},{"parent":"086088a9-2a89-4426-a638-d8d30e6e8fb3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3858f9c2-3598-47d9-a568-a4a0a5eab09f","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 按产品定义每条都展示或只在首条展示发送人，规则一致不随机\n2) 归属与顺序 ｜ 无论是否合并展示，每条消息的归属都能被准确判断"},{"parent":"086088a9-2a89-4426-a638-d8d30e6e8fb3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8ba245df-7756-4269-8024-4b8818727ac1","title":"备注：连续消息是否合并展示发送人需产品确认；会话流详情中每条用户消息气泡都要标明是谁发的，带用户头像与昵称。这是多人同处一条会话后的必需信息，否则分不清哪句是谁说的"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"086088a9-2a89-4426-a638-d8d30e6e8fb3","title":"🟠【P1】连续多条同一人的消息","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"07f1936b-6677-4c2a-b124-ccaa1d9d6b2a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cb7a1c44-2435-4525-b1e2-11b64b1ba704","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"007dc473-b90b-4e1f-9ffa-ba79c2bd8f5d","title":"前置：存在改版前产生的历史会话；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"cb7a1c44-2435-4525-b1e2-11b64b1ba704","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"45711e33-0278-42d9-abfa-1c5a26dae59b","title":"操作：打开历史会话查看用户消息气泡"},{"parent":"cb7a1c44-2435-4525-b1e2-11b64b1ba704","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a67e1918-d820-4f10-8e6c-5aaaf60dd01c","title":"预期：\n1) 持久化 ｜ 历史消息同样能展示发送人头像与昵称\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 若历史数据缺少发送人信息，给出可理解的占位而不是显示为空或未知"},{"parent":"cb7a1c44-2435-4525-b1e2-11b64b1ba704","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"40159f04-bbab-43fa-8214-565d82029bd0","title":"备注：会话流详情中每条用户消息气泡都要标明是谁发的，带用户头像与昵称。这是多人同处一条会话后的必需信息，否则分不清哪句是谁说的"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cb7a1c44-2435-4525-b1e2-11b64b1ba704","title":"🔴【P0】历史会话的发送人标识","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"07f1936b-6677-4c2a-b124-ccaa1d9d6b2a","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"ab2baa09-58c1-41f8-a051-f378e6f0d5b1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"729b8863-d9e6-4aae-91e8-09cca683b266","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c93779c3-d6f7-4106-9132-e98ed12567a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"39676610-e0f4-4ff1-b62f-a057479a1df8","title":"前置：某成员发过消息后退出了房间；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"c93779c3-d6f7-4106-9132-e98ed12567a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea817f7b-f248-4a31-af91-1abe16e2d00c","title":"操作：查看该成员的历史消息和头像"},{"parent":"c93779c3-d6f7-4106-9132-e98ed12567a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"221294d2-ba79-4b8e-a548-97c922ce0bd4","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 展示其历史身份或已退出标记，不显示为空白或未知用户\n2) 消息渲染 ｜ 消息内容完整保留可读"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c93779c3-d6f7-4106-9132-e98ed12567a1","title":"🟠【P1】已退出房间成员的消息和头像","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"729b8863-d9e6-4aae-91e8-09cca683b266","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aceb961f-6c73-40ce-b98b-e19e32c46f0c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5bfdb9af-0106-4588-9fe6-e0a222933796","title":"前置：Agent 已被卸载或其电脑已解绑；角色：房间成员；入口：历史消息的 Agent 头像"},{"parent":"aceb961f-6c73-40ce-b98b-e19e32c46f0c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"03f733bf-f790-4d46-8f22-9962d5b64119","title":"操作：点击头像"},{"parent":"aceb961f-6c73-40ce-b98b-e19e32c46f0c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a1d8d552-1cc1-407b-a48d-a95ae217160c","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 卡片仍能展示历史的 Provider 与 Computer 信息\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 按产品定义标注该 Agent 当前不可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aceb961f-6c73-40ce-b98b-e19e32c46f0c","title":"🟠【P1】Agent 已被卸载或解绑","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"729b8863-d9e6-4aae-91e8-09cca683b266","title":"异常场景"},{"parent":"ab2baa09-58c1-41f8-a051-f378e6f0d5b1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c95f2cdb-972b-4b38-9444-075694446d6a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5f26da68-7286-4f53-9fb2-a71a4787f614","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2d85ee50-b67f-477b-86a2-a20ec57269a6","title":"前置：某成员在会话中发过多条消息，随后修改了头像与昵称；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"5f26da68-7286-4f53-9fb2-a71a4787f614","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7729425f-34c2-4bd2-9e06-516b49af03fd","title":"操作：重新打开该会话查看其全部历史消息"},{"parent":"5f26da68-7286-4f53-9fb2-a71a4787f614","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df9fae03-d15b-4f6d-8307-4388e98dea04","title":"预期：\n1) 持久化 ｜ 历史消息上的头像与昵称统一更新为最新资料，不保留发送时的快照\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 该成员在本会话中的所有消息一起更新，不出现新旧混杂\n3) 性能 ｜ 在合理时间内生效，不需要重新登录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5f26da68-7286-4f53-9fb2-a71a4787f614","title":"🟠【P1】成员改头像昵称后历史消息取最新资料","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"c95f2cdb-972b-4b38-9444-075694446d6a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"62a06bce-f44f-4d42-ac15-56119c3f4e56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e65958e0-38f3-4a11-b070-44e469173526","title":"前置：存在昵称超过 30 字符的成员，以及两名重名成员；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"62a06bce-f44f-4d42-ac15-56119c3f4e56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ff24c0d5-d844-42ef-8552-a82b50d4a828","title":"操作：查看这几人的消息气泡"},{"parent":"62a06bce-f44f-4d42-ac15-56119c3f4e56","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13b12224-4e51-49b2-8d28-ab29c334804a","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 超长昵称截断并可悬浮查看完整值，气泡布局不被撑破\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 重名成员通过头像区分，各自的消息归属正确不混淆"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"62a06bce-f44f-4d42-ac15-56119c3f4e56","title":"🟠【P1】超长昵称与重名成员","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"c95f2cdb-972b-4b38-9444-075694446d6a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6cd3ae72-f890-466c-b94c-e6bcb1747d23","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7b587caf-afe2-4b39-a6f9-a1218ec9af09","title":"前置：某个头像卡片已展开；角色：房间成员；入口：卡片外部、Esc、另一个头像"},{"parent":"6cd3ae72-f890-466c-b94c-e6bcb1747d23","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d18a1516-0b04-415c-9d1b-e8c25d141bd3","title":"操作：分别用三种方式操作"},{"parent":"6cd3ae72-f890-466c-b94c-e6bcb1747d23","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"939c4aa4-3ad4-4e07-8450-27b3afcad894","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 点击外部与 Esc 都能关闭；点另一个头像切换为对应卡片，不叠加\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 内容与所点头像一一对应，不串人"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6cd3ae72-f890-466c-b94c-e6bcb1747d23","title":"🟡【P2】卡片的关闭与切换","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"c95f2cdb-972b-4b38-9444-075694446d6a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"28d6c602-c377-45e7-bf91-640bc76740cb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1d297b2b-bb6e-434f-a490-14ce00264ffb","title":"前置：目标头像位于对话流顶部或底部边缘；角色：房间成员；入口：该头像"},{"parent":"28d6c602-c377-45e7-bf91-640bc76740cb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e6198ade-ccfb-4798-98f8-4dc83a22a727","title":"操作：点击头像"},{"parent":"28d6c602-c377-45e7-bf91-640bc76740cb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6e898eaa-625b-4c8c-b5e5-38e83202b826","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 卡片自动翻转位置，不被窗口边缘截断\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 超长用户名与电脑名截断合理"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"28d6c602-c377-45e7-bf91-640bc76740cb","title":"🟡【P2】卡片在消息流边缘的展示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"c95f2cdb-972b-4b38-9444-075694446d6a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0f90b383-edaf-407f-b55b-d06a7651c1eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eaecd2e3-5ca6-4f5a-9338-f301ed989d32","title":"前置：对话流中有多条不同发送人的消息；角色：房间成员；入口：多个头像"},{"parent":"0f90b383-edaf-407f-b55b-d06a7651c1eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c5e8be05-3702-41ae-9e10-0a07b9390022","title":"操作：连续快速点击不同头像"},{"parent":"0f90b383-edaf-407f-b55b-d06a7651c1eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a9d9bd8c-b7c4-4975-ac47-ed876cb14976","title":"预期：\n1) 性能 ｜ 切换流畅不闪烁\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 最终展示的是最后点击的那一个"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0f90b383-edaf-407f-b55b-d06a7651c1eb","title":"🟡【P2】连续点击多个头像","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"c95f2cdb-972b-4b38-9444-075694446d6a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"265de889-b264-4089-956c-3e83c87570c7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5c4f4732-5989-4b45-864b-f5a6b36eb7d1","title":"前置：会话中有图片、附件与引用类型的用户消息；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"265de889-b264-4089-956c-3e83c87570c7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"29b98ed4-6b5b-42bc-93f9-b03c9c6e320d","title":"操作：查看这几类消息的气泡"},{"parent":"265de889-b264-4089-956c-3e83c87570c7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f41c13cf-02ee-4754-8f04-202ac136106e","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 三类消息同样展示发送人头像与昵称\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 标识不遮挡图片预览或附件信息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"265de889-b264-4089-956c-3e83c87570c7","title":"🟡【P2】非文本消息的发送人标识","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"c95f2cdb-972b-4b38-9444-075694446d6a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c2123036-9684-4209-b089-bcb1aa5daa34","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"15390b1e-50e4-4a1a-9a02-fdb0528c3cf4","title":"前置：会话运行中有多人的消息进入排队区；角色：房间成员；入口：排队区"},{"parent":"c2123036-9684-4209-b089-bcb1aa5daa34","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1a985905-50f6-4ad9-af53-6b81587110df","title":"操作：查看排队区中的条目"},{"parent":"c2123036-9684-4209-b089-bcb1aa5daa34","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aea09aea-e22e-49a7-96f8-5b2cc4299d05","title":"预期：\n1) 排队 ｜ 排队条目同样展示发送人，能看出这条是谁排的\n2) 归属与顺序 ｜ 发出后气泡上的发送人与排队时一致"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"c2123036-9684-4209-b089-bcb1aa5daa34","title":"🟡【P2】排队中消息的发送人标识"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c95f2cdb-972b-4b38-9444-075694446d6a","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ab2baa09-58c1-41f8-a051-f378e6f0d5b1","title":"对话流消息气泡的标识"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"27c0fd14-4b54-4b24-97d1-83764b53cfe3","title":"消息渲染与展示"},{"parent":"00aef705-0ca9-4f82-be13-4329bd40abd6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9ccf6db7-34e5-42bc-aa5f-1262c8510e41","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"258e8efd-168b-4bab-9eb0-1937240bf2c1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"66b6644b-d926-405c-8e65-3d7cb80e045e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f8342fae-164b-4d6d-ac46-75fcc7931eb4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"67dd9e31-a9db-4fb1-b327-4543ea6fb52b","title":"前置：新建会话且尚无标题；角色：房间成员；入口：会话列表与会话详情"},{"parent":"f8342fae-164b-4d6d-ac46-75fcc7931eb4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"71aa0234-778b-46e1-a950-63edec1e8abb","title":"操作：发送首条消息并等待回复完成，查看两处标题"},{"parent":"f8342fae-164b-4d6d-ac46-75fcc7931eb4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"576ce8c8-1263-4602-9d44-735cf7bca1c3","title":"预期：标题在合理时间内自动生成且与对话主题相关；列表与详情标题一致；不长期停留在未命名"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f8342fae-164b-4d6d-ac46-75fcc7931eb4","title":"🔴【P0】首轮对话后自动生成标题","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"66b6644b-d926-405c-8e65-3d7cb80e045e","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"258e8efd-168b-4bab-9eb0-1937240bf2c1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"16a12289-ca23-46a6-9691-47a034d8fb23","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5417c66c-14f1-4b0f-89a9-532698aeeee3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2b6e29c5-7372-42ba-87ab-6d53a93d1d1d","title":"前置：新建会话并发送首条消息；角色：房间成员；入口：会话列表与会话详情"},{"parent":"5417c66c-14f1-4b0f-89a9-532698aeeee3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d87ec9df-aa35-4f56-a1eb-2d8742f1057e","title":"操作：等待回复完成后查看列表标题，隔较长时间后再次打开该会话"},{"parent":"5417c66c-14f1-4b0f-89a9-532698aeeee3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b287e385-d5e8-4f18-9101-6d85b38084c8","title":"预期：回复完成后标题由首条真实用户输入生成并同步到列表与详情；不长期显示未命名会话；再次打开或跨天查看标题保持不变，不出现列表未命名而详情正常的不一致"},{"parent":"5417c66c-14f1-4b0f-89a9-532698aeeee3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"05b8ee25-385e-4ac1-b1d7-7c36c4e2e38e","title":"备注：#64 #65 #99 #129 #124"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5417c66c-14f1-4b0f-89a9-532698aeeee3","title":"🔴【P0】会话标题长时间显示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"16a12289-ca23-46a6-9691-47a034d8fb23","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b5a24eeb-5020-429a-be6c-9586995fa3ba","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e32b3254-38bf-4097-8eec-8471c58bdfb1","title":"前置：新建会话；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"b5a24eeb-5020-429a-be6c-9586995fa3ba","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3affa0f4-808e-40f5-a67f-df2e80e823b2","title":"操作：新会话先触发一次自动 /model，再输入 /review 或一段自然语言并发送"},{"parent":"b5a24eeb-5020-429a-be6c-9586995fa3ba","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5a21a23f-22cc-4592-a4fb-83a123f1aa88","title":"预期：会话标题优先采用首条真实用户 prompt 生成；不被自动执行的本地命令覆盖为命令名；标题在列表与详情中一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b5a24eeb-5020-429a-be6c-9586995fa3ba","title":"🔴【P0】本地命令不覆盖会话标题","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"16a12289-ca23-46a6-9691-47a034d8fb23","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"258e8efd-168b-4bab-9eb0-1937240bf2c1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5652d91e-7dd8-40f4-b1fd-b50daa381cea","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f4f2654d-cd17-46cd-8878-fc06ca1a7e05","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e2723f7-9d19-4403-b598-165b2ec992f6","title":"前置：新建会话；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"f4f2654d-cd17-46cd-8878-fc06ca1a7e05","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"daf7cc0c-8b41-48d1-b4e2-7669b0f3b458","title":"操作：分别以一段超长文本、一张纯图片作为首条消息各新建一条会话"},{"parent":"f4f2654d-cd17-46cd-8878-fc06ca1a7e05","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4769f0e-c00e-46c9-9ea8-48680f0ea9da","title":"预期：超长文本生成的标题被截断并省略显示，悬浮可见完整内容；纯图片会话标题按约定生成为 [image]；两者在列表中均不出现空标题"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f4f2654d-cd17-46cd-8878-fc06ca1a7e05","title":"🟡【P2】首条消息为超长文本或纯图片时的标题","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5652d91e-7dd8-40f4-b1fd-b50daa381cea","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"258e8efd-168b-4bab-9eb0-1937240bf2c1","title":"会话标题自动生成"},{"parent":"9ccf6db7-34e5-42bc-aa5f-1262c8510e41","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"92770fec-cd13-477a-b106-d652dc8a62ec","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f1fb2b1a-2a7c-45b1-92ca-990c0aae715c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5a453409-b793-4c83-b4e4-0093c78ba71d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"02c60483-1148-4637-81c5-41eac8fb5b86","title":"前置：新建会话且 Agent 可用；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"5a453409-b793-4c83-b4e4-0093c78ba71d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fd46a4c4-418e-41bf-9b75-b99fa4b33801","title":"操作：输入「解释这个项目结构」并点击发送"},{"parent":"5a453409-b793-4c83-b4e4-0093c78ba71d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a6238f9b-2a2e-4519-9a14-1f253045d717","title":"预期：用户消息进入对话流；发送按钮进入运行态；Agent 开始流式回复；会话状态显示进行中；会话标题取首条消息内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5a453409-b793-4c83-b4e4-0093c78ba71d","title":"🔴【P0】发送首条消息后的状态流转","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f1fb2b1a-2a7c-45b1-92ca-990c0aae715c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"410dc4d2-854d-443f-9268-5b5d8b8e76fa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd09fcfa-1a4a-4f37-a7ae-0f21eda8c7d4","title":"前置：Agent 正在回复；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"410dc4d2-854d-443f-9268-5b5d8b8e76fa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ea8873c-9727-412d-9453-0f3976763ad0","title":"操作：等待 Agent 回复完成"},{"parent":"410dc4d2-854d-443f-9268-5b5d8b8e76fa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9af9149b-dfce-4ca1-844a-1603a6059e10","title":"预期：loading 消失；发送按钮恢复可点击；会话状态在列表、详情与活动看板三处同步变为已完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"410dc4d2-854d-443f-9268-5b5d8b8e76fa","title":"🔴【P0】回复完成后状态恢复","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f1fb2b1a-2a7c-45b1-92ca-990c0aae715c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a3e24ac2-bb2c-49f9-abaf-f157ebe43189","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"da01e67f-90f6-4fb1-abf0-3664e00c1c4d","title":"前置：Agent 正在回复且已产出部分内容；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框暂停按钮"},{"parent":"a3e24ac2-bb2c-49f9-abaf-f157ebe43189","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3615fbb6-87c6-4bca-a478-12d92c55a5f9","title":"操作：在回复过程中点击暂停按钮"},{"parent":"a3e24ac2-bb2c-49f9-abaf-f157ebe43189","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5b60f63d-f8be-40d7-b79b-73816e77a829","title":"预期：消息停止回复；暂停按钮变回发送按钮并置灰；已回复部分保留并标记为思考失败或已中断；若尚未开始输出则本轮消息清空；房间状态同步更新为完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a3e24ac2-bb2c-49f9-abaf-f157ebe43189","title":"🔴【P0】运行中点击暂停回复","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f1fb2b1a-2a7c-45b1-92ca-990c0aae715c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a5a65994-8e8f-4307-911a-7d2cb46d6202","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5cc6b2be-3930-497f-9c70-f74ddc55ffc8","title":"前置：刚点击发送，Agent 尚未开始输出；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框暂停按钮"},{"parent":"a5a65994-8e8f-4307-911a-7d2cb46d6202","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c449e97f-11bc-49c4-84b9-9c00c7ee7195","title":"操作：发送后立即点击暂停回复"},{"parent":"a5a65994-8e8f-4307-911a-7d2cb46d6202","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8c23a860-3c50-4702-94e8-ee0dc3df18b0","title":"预期：回到新建会话页面；刚输入的提示词重新显示到输入框中；不生成只有用户消息的空会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a5a65994-8e8f-4307-911a-7d2cb46d6202","title":"🔴【P0】会话刚发送即点击暂停","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f1fb2b1a-2a7c-45b1-92ca-990c0aae715c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0af5f54b-8f3d-4004-887e-87b29b18b2de","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3aa9ada8-de9c-4268-b909-c7d3bc01ea1b","title":"前置：会话可正常执行；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"0af5f54b-8f3d-4004-887e-87b29b18b2de","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"15179cd3-c734-4c54-985b-cabe87897669","title":"操作：在同一会话连续发送 3 条上下文相关的消息"},{"parent":"0af5f54b-8f3d-4004-887e-87b29b18b2de","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3707e0eb-72aa-47bb-b636-24235340da0b","title":"预期：历史消息完整保留且顺序正确；Agent 能基于上下文连续回复；每轮结束后状态在进行中与已完成之间正确切换"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0af5f54b-8f3d-4004-887e-87b29b18b2de","title":"🔴【P0】连续多轮对话的上下文与状态","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f1fb2b1a-2a7c-45b1-92ca-990c0aae715c","title":"正常场景（5）"},{"parent":"92770fec-cd13-477a-b106-d652dc8a62ec","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"33689e27-0ff7-4ded-a625-31a827a17c41","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1edc293e-8fdc-4668-a8ac-a76162d2371d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a55d368b-74f2-419c-ba09-3882a7d68342","title":"前置：会话正在运行中；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框模型下拉"},{"parent":"1edc293e-8fdc-4668-a8ac-a76162d2371d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0341728e-8c63-4bbb-922b-9341493e7eb2","title":"操作：在 Agent 回复过程中切换到另一个可用模型"},{"parent":"1edc293e-8fdc-4668-a8ac-a76162d2371d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7fe90513-bce6-44dd-96f3-952feafea974","title":"预期：模型可正常切换且界面同步展示新模型；本轮回复按产品定义继续或收敛后由新模型接续，行为一致可预期；不出现提示无法在运行过程中切换权限之类与操作不符的报错"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1edc293e-8fdc-4668-a8ac-a76162d2371d","title":"🟠【P1】运行过程中切换模型"},{"parent":"33689e27-0ff7-4ded-a625-31a827a17c41","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cb3fa202-60c7-4bb3-8768-bca6857966a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"25af1d2c-b05e-4717-8d2c-0e8ab0dbcbb1","title":"前置：构造一个会失败的任务，例如让 Agent 读取一个不存在的路径；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"cb3fa202-60c7-4bb3-8768-bca6857966a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"23fdffa2-d961-4838-a543-77b0bc897010","title":"操作：发送该任务并等待执行结束"},{"parent":"cb3fa202-60c7-4bb3-8768-bca6857966a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3fd5b75f-2abe-4d35-aae9-441e35309f26","title":"预期：消息区展示失败原因与重试入口；会话状态收敛为失败；不长期停留在 loading；点击重试可重新执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cb3fa202-60c7-4bb3-8768-bca6857966a1","title":"🟡【P2】Agent 执行失败时的状态与重试"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"33689e27-0ff7-4ded-a625-31a827a17c41","title":"异常场景（5）"},{"parent":"92770fec-cd13-477a-b106-d652dc8a62ec","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cb627961-3910-416b-a76d-541fe7d168b3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8d676245-8675-4046-b007-43014c57d6f7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"638be1f2-6e33-4188-9747-eddde774324f","title":"前置：同时开启 5 条以上运行中的会话；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧会话列表"},{"parent":"8d676245-8675-4046-b007-43014c57d6f7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cd7e4b26-414c-4e06-9a5d-3a9fc55e2568","title":"操作：在列表中查看各会话的运行状态并来回切换查看详情"},{"parent":"8d676245-8675-4046-b007-43014c57d6f7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c8ca8d3a-8b20-4f12-acc3-f42faa41d715","title":"预期：各会话状态独立准确不串台；列表滚动流畅；切换详情时展示的是对应会话的实际状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8d676245-8675-4046-b007-43014c57d6f7","title":"🟡【P2】大量会话同时运行时的状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cb627961-3910-416b-a76d-541fe7d168b3","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"92770fec-cd13-477a-b106-d652dc8a62ec","title":"会话运行状态展示"},{"parent":"9ccf6db7-34e5-42bc-aa5f-1262c8510e41","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6a1e1a4f-53fd-49ec-892e-3b0e768a9e66","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"48b44897-9609-4245-b63c-2808a27880d1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"552d5cc7-d307-4939-97c0-bf4f3eb821a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"69745294-7965-4fa9-96a9-b5b2aaa45f3d","title":"前置：Agent 正在运行任务；角色：房间成员；入口：系统强制退出应用"},{"parent":"552d5cc7-d307-4939-97c0-bf4f3eb821a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a8baffed-d541-48d9-a5e1-eac2023330d7","title":"操作：在运行中强制关闭应用，重新打开应用并进入房间查看该会话"},{"parent":"552d5cc7-d307-4939-97c0-bf4f3eb821a1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8e25c0ec-5586-4cb2-b581-d4c8d0f7dcd6","title":"预期：应用关闭且 Agent 终止，会话存入历史；重新打开后会话状态显示已完成或已中断；对该会话继续发消息可正常收到回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"552d5cc7-d307-4939-97c0-bf4f3eb821a1","title":"🟠【P1】运行中强制关闭应用","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"48b44897-9609-4245-b63c-2808a27880d1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6aeafcee-261b-4c1f-994c-a855fc5b5728","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6abe1569-ef64-4abc-8876-f87652e5c9ac","title":"前置：Agent 正在运行任务；角色：房间成员；入口：房间关闭入口"},{"parent":"6aeafcee-261b-4c1f-994c-a855fc5b5728","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a2fd7c69-c7e1-4042-9353-94334246dd45","title":"操作：在运行中点击关闭房间，先点取消再点确认"},{"parent":"6aeafcee-261b-4c1f-994c-a855fc5b5728","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"26a32a3c-1809-465e-8356-7edcbeae3f4a","title":"预期：弹出确认对话框且文案包含「这个房间里仍有 Agent 在工作。离开会停止 Agent 进程，并将 Issue 标记为已中断。」；点取消后窗口继续存在且任务继续；点确认后窗口关闭、Agent 终止、会话存入历史，房间卡片不再显示运行状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6aeafcee-261b-4c1f-994c-a855fc5b5728","title":"🟠【P1】运行中强制关闭房间","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"48b44897-9609-4245-b63c-2808a27880d1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5bf88a82-03a6-44bb-a753-ff666530bfc4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1538d7d3-764e-4514-a65c-b74592051b3e","title":"前置：曾在运行中强制关闭房间；角色：房间成员；入口：重新打开房间后的该会话"},{"parent":"5bf88a82-03a6-44bb-a753-ff666530bfc4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"95bbd17d-efb8-4352-9ddf-6a374b7a8278","title":"操作：重新打开房间，找到被中断的会话并发送一条新消息"},{"parent":"5bf88a82-03a6-44bb-a753-ff666530bfc4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4eb54414-d24c-446b-be17-8b7a3178bfba","title":"预期：该会话的 Agent 状态由进行中变为空闲；消息正常发送并收到回复；中断前已产生的内容完整保留"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5bf88a82-03a6-44bb-a753-ff666530bfc4","title":"🟠【P1】中断后重进房间给中断会话发消息","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"48b44897-9609-4245-b63c-2808a27880d1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1dfa7aa8-b3e1-4661-9a8e-1dd29ca5fb31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"edb707f5-1e2f-4ca4-83bf-0f329fe6b91e","title":"前置：曾在运行中强制关闭房间；角色：房间成员；入口：重新打开房间后的新建会话入口"},{"parent":"1dfa7aa8-b3e1-4661-9a8e-1dd29ca5fb31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"372f4503-bb46-4a5e-89c2-859a79471d21","title":"操作：重新打开房间后新建一条会话并发送消息"},{"parent":"1dfa7aa8-b3e1-4661-9a8e-1dd29ca5fb31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bdfe6024-7e05-4ed2-bc8a-67f009d4e78a","title":"预期：新会话正常创建并收到回复；不报 cli not found 或当前目录不存在；不受被中断会话的影响"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1dfa7aa8-b3e1-4661-9a8e-1dd29ca5fb31","title":"🟠【P1】中断后重进房间新建会话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"48b44897-9609-4245-b63c-2808a27880d1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"654f4992-95a3-4d41-b5dc-462e7fee32ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"35319dab-2c67-4a52-bc98-0fad7ecbc3b1","title":"前置：房间内有任务正在运行；角色：房间成员；入口：重启后重新进入房间"},{"parent":"654f4992-95a3-4d41-b5dc-462e7fee32ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9ab37844-73cc-49ac-ba00-99737e9f108a","title":"操作：在任务运行时重启电脑，重新进入房间后分别给被中断的会话与其他历史会话发送消息"},{"parent":"654f4992-95a3-4d41-b5dc-462e7fee32ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"656f880b-d370-4fe5-8953-34807f046213","title":"预期：两类会话均能正常发送并收到回复；被中断会话的状态收敛为已中断或已完成，不长期停留在运行中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"654f4992-95a3-4d41-b5dc-462e7fee32ce","title":"🟠【P1】任务运行时重启电脑"},{"parent":"48b44897-9609-4245-b63c-2808a27880d1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bbd86af7-841d-4297-92c1-a420cb41a306","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d1ddc77f-bce2-49a0-8863-530b5eaa1426","title":"前置：会话可正常发送；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"bbd86af7-841d-4297-92c1-a420cb41a306","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b281a355-1be1-4070-87a4-33beec746281","title":"操作：点击发送后立即断开网络，等待提示出现后恢复网络并重试发送"},{"parent":"bbd86af7-841d-4297-92c1-a420cb41a306","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ce3665f3-0a63-4d7a-9341-4ecb155076f7","title":"预期：断网时给出明确的网络异常提示，消息可重试或保留为草稿不丢失；恢复网络后重试可成功发送并收到回复；不出现重复发送两条相同消息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bbd86af7-841d-4297-92c1-a420cb41a306","title":"🟠【P1】发送过程中网络断开","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"48b44897-9609-4245-b63c-2808a27880d1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f159adf9-828e-421b-b25f-cdd052572dbc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e42748a3-348f-4d91-91a8-5043046049e5","title":"前置：Agent 正在运行该会话；角色：房间成员；入口：会话悬浮操作中的删除"},{"parent":"f159adf9-828e-421b-b25f-cdd052572dbc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b52699fd-ee6b-4eef-ba8c-c2db31c367f1","title":"操作：在运行过程中删除该会话"},{"parent":"f159adf9-828e-421b-b25f-cdd052572dbc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d51c4790-f085-491b-974a-446ad2c6f9a9","title":"预期：会话从列表中移除且房间面板同步移除；正在运行的任务被终止不再产生输出；不遗留仍在后台运行的任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f159adf9-828e-421b-b25f-cdd052572dbc","title":"🟠【P1】Agent 运行中删除会话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"48b44897-9609-4245-b63c-2808a27880d1","title":"异常场景（7）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6a1e1a4f-53fd-49ec-892e-3b0e768a9e66","title":"会话中断与恢复"},{"parent":"9ccf6db7-34e5-42bc-aa5f-1262c8510e41","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b84403da-92ca-4990-a13f-cc2d47b408e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e7d338ca-dc39-42bf-a3c5-40d97ba609b7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8200b0f5-b2cc-4511-8074-9e89d68e0c81","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8c306c9a-8bf5-4f55-b7d4-8db3dd5f1685","title":"前置：存在一条会话；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情标题旁更多按钮"},{"parent":"8200b0f5-b2cc-4511-8074-9e89d68e0c81","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"982196f2-94c4-4885-b160-37129656ba33","title":"操作：点击更多按钮查看菜单项"},{"parent":"8200b0f5-b2cc-4511-8074-9e89d68e0c81","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b211bcf0-d054-4730-8ae0-cdad1201fadd","title":"预期：菜单展示重命名会话、复制为 Markdown 与复制为引用三项；点击外部可关闭菜单且不执行任何操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8200b0f5-b2cc-4511-8074-9e89d68e0c81","title":"🔴【P0】标题旁更多按钮的操作项","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"e7d338ca-dc39-42bf-a3c5-40d97ba609b7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b507c762-7649-43c7-a5d2-796bcec3b66d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"982d5872-fe4f-47b2-be50-8ecb72e644d4","title":"前置：存在进行中、已完成、失败、等待四种状态的会话；角色：房间成员；入口：会话标题更多菜单"},{"parent":"b507c762-7649-43c7-a5d2-796bcec3b66d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"87aac2a3-99f4-477b-b80b-881cd60e0542","title":"操作：分别悬浮四种状态的会话行，点击更多后点击复制为 Markdown，并粘贴到其他输入框与本地文件"},{"parent":"b507c762-7649-43c7-a5d2-796bcec3b66d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7660199f-94b3-4f60-aff9-d6302487134c","title":"预期：四种状态均提示已复制；粘贴到输入框与本地文件时均为 Markdown 格式且内容完整"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b507c762-7649-43c7-a5d2-796bcec3b66d","title":"🔴【P0】复制为 Markdown","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"e7d338ca-dc39-42bf-a3c5-40d97ba609b7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a33ec769-0ac3-4240-8686-2eb40e3b6a87","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"deb8a930-9c4b-4792-9828-9efc552ecfa4","title":"前置：存在进行中、已完成、失败、等待四种状态的会话；角色：房间成员；入口：会话标题更多菜单"},{"parent":"a33ec769-0ac3-4240-8686-2eb40e3b6a87","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"24f67cac-f485-4acb-a075-7983762267ba","title":"操作：分别对四种状态的会话执行复制为引用，并粘贴发送到群聊与其他 Agent 的会话"},{"parent":"a33ec769-0ac3-4240-8686-2eb40e3b6a87","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb98026a-b8a2-48b9-8c10-025ca2c92fe0","title":"预期：四种状态均提示已复制；群聊与其他 Agent 均能识别该引用并可点击跳转到源会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a33ec769-0ac3-4240-8686-2eb40e3b6a87","title":"🔴【P0】复制为引用","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"e7d338ca-dc39-42bf-a3c5-40d97ba609b7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8480cefc-5fc3-44f0-82fa-9b2e205cd6c2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fbef1a14-d3aa-49ac-b315-7ea37d1097bc","title":"前置：存在一条进行中的会话；角色：房间成员；入口：会话标题更多菜单中的重命名"},{"parent":"8480cefc-5fc3-44f0-82fa-9b2e205cd6c2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9c1f6525-6fb2-4c94-8cc5-aebd101e0515","title":"操作：点击更多后点击重命名会话，先点取消再输入新名称保存"},{"parent":"8480cefc-5fc3-44f0-82fa-9b2e205cd6c2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4554dfba-52fb-4f9d-8f5c-c53a1f2b23af","title":"预期：弹出重命名弹窗且输入框最大字符限制为 120；点取消关闭弹窗且名称不变；保存后会话列表与会话详情顶部标题同步更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8480cefc-5fc3-44f0-82fa-9b2e205cd6c2","title":"🔴【P0】重命名刚发出去的会话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"e7d338ca-dc39-42bf-a3c5-40d97ba609b7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"85db734e-4308-4a5a-ad35-00537900e564","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3fd23ee-aba4-404e-9c81-6a18caa38f99","title":"前置：存在一条进行中的会话；角色：房间成员；入口：会话标题更多菜单中的重命名"},{"parent":"85db734e-4308-4a5a-ad35-00537900e564","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eab5886c-791b-473e-b0dc-ecd3af48044c","title":"操作：悬浮进行中的会话行，点击更多后点击重命名会话，先点取消再输入新名称保存"},{"parent":"85db734e-4308-4a5a-ad35-00537900e564","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"91487b46-8b22-4505-8267-4ac91d55c853","title":"预期：弹出重命名弹窗且输入框最大字符限制为 120；点取消关闭弹窗且名称不变；保存后会话列表与会话详情顶部标题同步更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"85db734e-4308-4a5a-ad35-00537900e564","title":"🔴【P0】重命名进行中的会话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"e7d338ca-dc39-42bf-a3c5-40d97ba609b7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c967d14e-7292-4860-8af5-fcbcd0994135","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5716073c-7532-433c-8fea-058cfc9f9b79","title":"前置：存在已完成、失败、等待中的会话；角色：房间成员；入口：会话行更多菜单中的重命名"},{"parent":"c967d14e-7292-4860-8af5-fcbcd0994135","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bdb21557-ca74-4cf3-b63d-87df9e72e939","title":"操作：分别对三种状态的会话执行重命名并保存"},{"parent":"c967d14e-7292-4860-8af5-fcbcd0994135","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"845b41f8-5409-4e7d-a55b-ed8fe06eacff","title":"预期：三种状态均可重命名成功；输入框最大字符限制为 120；列表与详情标题同步更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c967d14e-7292-4860-8af5-fcbcd0994135","title":"🔴【P0】重命名非进行中的会话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e7d338ca-dc39-42bf-a3c5-40d97ba609b7","title":"正常场景（5）"},{"parent":"b84403da-92ca-4990-a13f-cc2d47b408e1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f5ee1311-8c9d-4ce3-a8be-dc1d61e2482f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"db83523c-8c6f-40c7-bf82-5fced5202362","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"50e90e05-84bb-4d6b-8659-0d4f8a4fe91b","title":"前置：会话正在执行中；角色：房间成员；入口：会话行更多菜单"},{"parent":"db83523c-8c6f-40c7-bf82-5fced5202362","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"022d14f2-0943-4c9d-a8cd-e064964e7191","title":"操作：在运行过程中依次尝试重命名、复制为 Markdown、复制为引用"},{"parent":"db83523c-8c6f-40c7-bf82-5fced5202362","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"33a2f3a3-90f6-473c-a952-2835e12607fd","title":"预期：三项操作在运行中均可正常执行；复制内容为当前已产生的部分；操作不影响任务继续执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"db83523c-8c6f-40c7-bf82-5fced5202362","title":"🟡【P2】运行中会话的操作入口可用性","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f5ee1311-8c9d-4ce3-a8be-dc1d61e2482f","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b84403da-92ca-4990-a13f-cc2d47b408e1","title":"会话内操作入口"},{"parent":"9ccf6db7-34e5-42bc-aa5f-1262c8510e41","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"64d5eada-e210-474b-8af0-859c70ae31f9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"39dce67a-52d6-426d-902a-c8c8e5254968","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"77e54f27-7b49-4b57-a288-5dea3eb62605","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e140ab9e-7fc6-4266-97c7-85d8b793fd47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0e48c3e4-ccc2-4244-abfa-0a1e6dd152ef","title":"前置：成员 A 创建了一条会话，随后成员 B 与成员 C 都在其中发过消息；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情与会话列表"},{"parent":"e140ab9e-7fc6-4266-97c7-85d8b793fd47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5b2c42c2-5826-425d-8d44-44e798ee905a","title":"操作：查看该会话的 Owner 标识"},{"parent":"e140ab9e-7fc6-4266-97c7-85d8b793fd47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"501c28a4-1864-48e4-9879-843b3538fe1e","title":"预期：\n1) 归属与顺序 ｜ Owner 始终是创建人成员 A，不因为后来者发言而变化\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 会话列表条目上的归属信息与详情页一致"},{"parent":"e140ab9e-7fc6-4266-97c7-85d8b793fd47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7dfc81de-0ab6-4ca3-9ee6-f68266e4f878","title":"备注：Session Owner 是创建该会话的人，不随参与者变化；一个会话允许多个参与者，前端展示最后一个参与者"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e140ab9e-7fc6-4266-97c7-85d8b793fd47","title":"🔴【P0】Owner 是创建人","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"77e54f27-7b49-4b57-a288-5dea3eb62605","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c53e704f-47f4-438a-94fd-e5ec62a6a807","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4b139a2e-a848-47e6-a014-17ea26bf5ecc","title":"前置：成员 A 退出房间后其会话处于不可继续状态，随后成员 A 重新加入该房间；角色：房间成员；入口：该会话"},{"parent":"c53e704f-47f4-438a-94fd-e5ec62a6a807","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f9d48731-5237-43a1-9452-b0904304f01c","title":"操作：成员 A 重新加入后，其他成员打开该会话并发送消息"},{"parent":"c53e704f-47f4-438a-94fd-e5ec62a6a807","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c22756fa-4539-4dae-9ebc-61e073c2491e","title":"预期：\n1) 权限授权 ｜ 会话恢复为可继续状态，输入框可正常发送\n2) 上下文 ｜ 在原有上下文基础上继续，不新建会话也不丢失此前的对话\n3) 性能 ｜ 恢复为实时生效，不需要重开房间或刷新"},{"parent":"c53e704f-47f4-438a-94fd-e5ec62a6a807","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"823183ea-d293-4778-9fca-54910bb0a00b","title":"备注：Session Owner 是创建该会话的人，不随参与者变化；一个会话允许多个参与者，前端展示最后一个参与者"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c53e704f-47f4-438a-94fd-e5ec62a6a807","title":"🔴【P0】Owner 重新加入后可继续会话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"77e54f27-7b49-4b57-a288-5dea3eb62605","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"39dce67a-52d6-426d-902a-c8c8e5254968","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"97feb9fd-9c8e-42e6-a9d8-6bd4adc37423","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a5982c52-4c43-4109-ba55-df8a63912f6c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3fbdd98e-834e-41d9-aeb1-4833efd86f2b","title":"前置：成员 A 创建的会话已有其他参与者，随后成员 A 退出房间；角色：仍在房间的成员；入口：会话列表与详情"},{"parent":"a5982c52-4c43-4109-ba55-df8a63912f6c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ad5cb3a9-4e4c-41a6-8901-93551189d422","title":"操作：查看该会话在列表中的展示，打开详情并尝试发送消息"},{"parent":"a5982c52-4c43-4109-ba55-df8a63912f6c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6bed30bb-3e3d-4bda-a403-3bb16a48b477","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 该会话的历史记录仍显示在会话列表上，不随 Owner 退出而消失\n2) 消息渲染 ｜ 打开后可查看完整的历史对话内容\n3) 权限授权 ｜ 其他成员不能继续对话，输入框不可发送或发送前给出拦截提示\n4) 提示文案 ｜ 明确说明是因为该会话的创建人已退出房间，与设备离线的提示可区分"},{"parent":"a5982c52-4c43-4109-ba55-df8a63912f6c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a2b75a2a-7828-4b77-869c-f4eeb21d0cb1","title":"备注：Session Owner 是创建该会话的人，不随参与者变化；一个会话允许多个参与者，前端展示最后一个参与者"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a5982c52-4c43-4109-ba55-df8a63912f6c","title":"🔴【P0】Owner 退出房间后历史仍在但不可继续","icons":[{"color":"rgb(248, 87, 103)","name":"other","index":"369"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"97feb9fd-9c8e-42e6-a9d8-6bd4adc37423","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"39dce67a-52d6-426d-902a-c8c8e5254968","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8af0e410-20c9-4ae4-be53-1b308e30ad1f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2daca8f0-39d3-481f-bd65-180fa8a6d28f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dddfdd01-5845-4733-a696-f6065cde4dc7","title":"前置：某会话的 Owner 已退出房间；角色：仍在房间的成员；入口：该会话的悬浮操作"},{"parent":"2daca8f0-39d3-481f-bd65-180fa8a6d28f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"39f9ca21-5591-4302-8cf6-748c4c688bff","title":"操作：尝试置顶与删除该会话"},{"parent":"2daca8f0-39d3-481f-bd65-180fa8a6d28f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea53b845-edaa-45b4-9f0a-bef6d9c40201","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 置顶与删除仍可正常执行，不因为不可继续对话而一并禁用\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 删除后房间内所有成员同步移除"},{"parent":"2daca8f0-39d3-481f-bd65-180fa8a6d28f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4ec7ac3c-27f3-4474-ae51-d5c62df28a61","title":"备注：Session Owner 是创建该会话的人，不随参与者变化；一个会话允许多个参与者，前端展示最后一个参与者"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2daca8f0-39d3-481f-bd65-180fa8a6d28f","title":"🟡【P2】Owner 退出期间的置顶与删除","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8af0e410-20c9-4ae4-be53-1b308e30ad1f","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"39dce67a-52d6-426d-902a-c8c8e5254968","title":"Owner 归属"},{"parent":"64d5eada-e210-474b-8af0-859c70ae31f9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"32a45f9c-d018-4e3b-ad6e-5f33a931cfac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"36c15244-405d-428c-8a02-f6ebcec5f9c8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4f29e5ab-08b8-4a80-a732-50e29137ce31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d982ae45-b468-4dbc-bf3a-f019c2f2879b","title":"前置：一条会话中先后有成员 A、B、C 发过消息；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"4f29e5ab-08b8-4a80-a732-50e29137ce31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8c6d52a8-5aee-4c6a-801a-249e242e1f84","title":"操作：查看参与者展示位"},{"parent":"4f29e5ab-08b8-4a80-a732-50e29137ce31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"29818711-0280-4121-b353-3e1b86da559b","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 展示最后一个参与者为成员 C\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 与 Owner 的展示位可区分，不让人误以为 Owner 变了"},{"parent":"4f29e5ab-08b8-4a80-a732-50e29137ce31","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2658a689-dc09-4f8d-996a-480b3c58431c","title":"备注：展示位置与形态（头像、名称还是\"最后由 X 参与\"文案）需产品确认；Session Owner 是创建该会话的人，不随参与者变化；一个会话允许多个参与者，前端展示最后一个参与者"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4f29e5ab-08b8-4a80-a732-50e29137ce31","title":"🔴【P0】展示最后一个参与者"},{"parent":"36c15244-405d-428c-8a02-f6ebcec5f9c8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c2ec4e31-7ecb-4f99-aebc-31bf58454cd9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"18c22636-7bdc-4306-98fe-a82a097a3ab2","title":"前置：当前最后一个参与者是成员 C；角色：成员 D；入口：该会话的输入框"},{"parent":"c2ec4e31-7ecb-4f99-aebc-31bf58454cd9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8063ba91-786a-49f5-a637-fcc845520ed3","title":"操作：成员 D 发送一条消息，各方查看参与者展示位"},{"parent":"c2ec4e31-7ecb-4f99-aebc-31bf58454cd9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"75666563-285f-410c-ba61-04e080156462","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 展示位更新为成员 D\n2) 性能 ｜ 其他成员侧实时更新，无需刷新"},{"parent":"c2ec4e31-7ecb-4f99-aebc-31bf58454cd9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"90f3f4ff-26af-4b6c-8974-febde1782215","title":"备注：Session Owner 是创建该会话的人，不随参与者变化；一个会话允许多个参与者，前端展示最后一个参与者"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c2ec4e31-7ecb-4f99-aebc-31bf58454cd9","title":"🟠【P1】新参与者加入后展示更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"36c15244-405d-428c-8a02-f6ebcec5f9c8","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"32a45f9c-d018-4e3b-ad6e-5f33a931cfac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"07c1c180-7e93-4a0a-8140-6fd404280935","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4385ec38-7ef6-4153-b368-32198907c102","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"32000555-a732-4da4-b3b5-70db5bfa11ff","title":"前置：会话中只有创建人发过消息；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"4385ec38-7ef6-4153-b368-32198907c102","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f5518797-231c-49fe-a039-de5dfb1d8c40","title":"操作：查看参与者展示位"},{"parent":"4385ec38-7ef6-4153-b368-32198907c102","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"61ad8a59-4a4a-400a-8528-364953ea2ca6","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 按产品定义隐藏参与者展示位或展示为 Owner 本人，不出现空占位"},{"parent":"4385ec38-7ef6-4153-b368-32198907c102","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1876862e-2e27-4b1c-aa31-c7d636f8f3fc","title":"备注：Session Owner 是创建该会话的人，不随参与者变化；一个会话允许多个参与者，前端展示最后一个参与者"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4385ec38-7ef6-4153-b368-32198907c102","title":"🟡【P2】只有 Owner 一人参与","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"07c1c180-7e93-4a0a-8140-6fd404280935","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"679537d1-8c19-4c94-b09a-9e6c3f0cce22","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"598fd3c0-df05-4d35-95a6-2774a8ab2d23","title":"前置：最后一个参与者已退出房间；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"679537d1-8c19-4c94-b09a-9e6c3f0cce22","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1899d6d1-cbbc-4141-bd5f-312566d68836","title":"操作：查看参与者展示位"},{"parent":"679537d1-8c19-4c94-b09a-9e6c3f0cce22","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8f6e4ad4-13ec-4abb-932c-e7f00da76d40","title":"预期：\n1) 视觉展示 ｜ 展示历史身份或已退出标记，不显示为空白或未知用户"},{"parent":"679537d1-8c19-4c94-b09a-9e6c3f0cce22","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"035638af-43f2-4058-bff5-b97bcfc391a9","title":"备注：Session Owner 是创建该会话的人，不随参与者变化；一个会话允许多个参与者，前端展示最后一个参与者"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"679537d1-8c19-4c94-b09a-9e6c3f0cce22","title":"🟡【P2】参与者已退出房间","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"07c1c180-7e93-4a0a-8140-6fd404280935","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"32a45f9c-d018-4e3b-ad6e-5f33a931cfac","title":"参与者展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"64d5eada-e210-474b-8af0-859c70ae31f9","title":"Session Owner 与参与者"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9ccf6db7-34e5-42bc-aa5f-1262c8510e41","title":"会话状态与标题"},{"parent":"00aef705-0ca9-4f82-be13-4329bd40abd6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"954d5d5f-45e8-448e-b07b-35f18e2bf2c0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e2b1a352-7e07-4057-8299-8ccbd538225a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"78ec7cad-c3da-45fb-ae91-967bc25879c2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"66891ffa-3542-471b-bdb3-03559b4113c2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9be72ae7-eac1-407a-bb9e-f82464857841","title":"前置：存在多条历史会话；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧历史会话列表"},{"parent":"66891ffa-3542-471b-bdb3-03559b4113c2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f812914d-0c15-4a35-b7ca-091becc8972b","title":"操作：点击一条历史会话，查看消息区与滚动位置，再点击另一条切换"},{"parent":"66891ffa-3542-471b-bdb3-03559b4113c2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9b23666a-4e1e-456d-9e14-674203c570d7","title":"预期：消息区切换为选中会话的完整历史内容；用户未滚动过时定位到最后一条消息，已滚动过时保持上次滚动位置；输入框可继续提问"},{"parent":"66891ffa-3542-471b-bdb3-03559b4113c2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"63f41305-8fac-4b7e-a354-bfc39da1255d","title":"备注：合并原「从历史列表切换会话」「从历史列表恢复历史会话」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"66891ffa-3542-471b-bdb3-03559b4113c2","title":"🔴【P0】从历史列表切换并恢复会话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"78ec7cad-c3da-45fb-ae91-967bc25879c2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"80027d75-d7f6-41a6-95bf-5c655fd14849","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76709785-ce62-43af-a0f0-093d7414798b","title":"前置：存在一条已完成的历史会话；角色：房间成员；入口：该会话输入框"},{"parent":"80027d75-d7f6-41a6-95bf-5c655fd14849","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4a0345af-b08d-464c-a948-715a4e684c73","title":"操作：打开该历史会话并发送一条与此前内容相关的新消息"},{"parent":"80027d75-d7f6-41a6-95bf-5c655fd14849","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c552aec-a6d3-4330-9319-74b887aa01f9","title":"预期：Agent 基于历史上下文继续回复；新消息与回复追加保存到该会话；会话更新时间刷新并在列表中前移"},{"parent":"80027d75-d7f6-41a6-95bf-5c655fd14849","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3f362c54-482c-4b0f-bcb8-62ccc733cddc","title":"备注：合并原「Resume继续对话」「点击历史会话发送消息」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"80027d75-d7f6-41a6-95bf-5c655fd14849","title":"🔴【P0】恢复历史会话后继续对话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"78ec7cad-c3da-45fb-ae91-967bc25879c2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2730f39f-0978-4671-9276-8e99555648ca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"33a8cdbd-0fc3-43b0-8632-7d807316339f","title":"前置：存在多条历史会话；角色：房间成员；入口：会话搜索框"},{"parent":"2730f39f-0978-4671-9276-8e99555648ca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2723fb91-68f0-49d6-a141-a66168e724bf","title":"操作：搜索历史会话并点击搜索结果，再在该会话中发送一条消息"},{"parent":"2730f39f-0978-4671-9276-8e99555648ca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"906b4180-9999-402a-9520-4b3b0bc39121","title":"预期：打开的是搜索命中的目标会话而不是列表第一条；消息正常发送并收到回复"},{"parent":"2730f39f-0978-4671-9276-8e99555648ca","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"edfb54fc-8bc5-495d-b5e2-307c6e95f339","title":"备注：合并原「搜索后恢复会话」「搜索历史会话后再发送消息」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2730f39f-0978-4671-9276-8e99555648ca","title":"🔴【P0】搜索后恢复目标会话并继续对话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"78ec7cad-c3da-45fb-ae91-967bc25879c2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"51b52ee6-ec78-45b8-be14-b0fc044f5739","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9f444ffd-a280-4d2d-a980-41f9e1d47efa","title":"前置：Claude Code 的某会话正在等待授权；角色：房间成员；入口：Codex 的历史会话"},{"parent":"51b52ee6-ec78-45b8-be14-b0fc044f5739","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"98a6528f-8ea6-490c-8db7-407865dc6304","title":"操作：在 Claude Code 等待授权期间，打开 Codex 的历史会话并发送消息"},{"parent":"51b52ee6-ec78-45b8-be14-b0fc044f5739","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2a1c84cf-18e9-4349-a105-9d6e490e0028","title":"预期：Codex 会话正常发送并收到回复；Claude Code 的授权等待状态不受影响，返回后仍可继续授权"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"51b52ee6-ec78-45b8-be14-b0fc044f5739","title":"🔴【P0】等待授权期间切到其他 Agent 的历史会话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"78ec7cad-c3da-45fb-ae91-967bc25879c2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d7585557-a14d-4512-9ba0-2942ba462ed8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1f293288-d1ac-405c-9a36-df5064daa537","title":"前置：会话中 Agent 已生成文件并展示文件卡片；角色：房间成员；入口：该会话输入框"},{"parent":"d7585557-a14d-4512-9ba0-2942ba462ed8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bf3f4f57-74ea-4655-b21a-94e89b8f348b","title":"操作：在生成文件后继续发送一条消息"},{"parent":"d7585557-a14d-4512-9ba0-2942ba462ed8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a9656d3b-a706-4ba5-a5a3-a68fc689b01e","title":"预期：消息正常发送并收到回复；此前的文件卡片保持展示且仍可点击打开"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d7585557-a14d-4512-9ba0-2942ba462ed8","title":"🔴【P0】生成文件后继续对话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"78ec7cad-c3da-45fb-ae91-967bc25879c2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"42213f73-a2ae-4cbd-96a1-864123a014c3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c6a4471-7baf-4de2-9a4d-19bae5313b0b","title":"前置：历史列表中存在会话条目；角色：房间成员；入口：历史列表条目删除入口"},{"parent":"42213f73-a2ae-4cbd-96a1-864123a014c3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ddec397d-eb0c-4412-86cc-ca1791476adc","title":"操作：对某条历史记录执行删除，随后在历史列表与 Dock 弹窗中查找该会话"},{"parent":"42213f73-a2ae-4cbd-96a1-864123a014c3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b77ca9db-d5d8-4587-b504-120037671206","title":"预期：条目从历史列表中消失；Dock 弹窗中也不再显示；刷新或重开房间后不再出现，且无法通过其他入口恢复"},{"parent":"42213f73-a2ae-4cbd-96a1-864123a014c3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4f0b93d8-32f5-4780-84f3-4e77ddf84119","title":"备注：合并原重复的两条「删除历史条目」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"42213f73-a2ae-4cbd-96a1-864123a014c3","title":"🔴【P0】删除历史条目","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"78ec7cad-c3da-45fb-ae91-967bc25879c2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"70