4c29-bda8-92ebb2b3f46b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"850b12d9-c236-4c17-8e44-9a13d8c08fcf","title":"操作：打开该历史会话并尝试继续对话"},{"parent":"71ae1a36-edb5-4c29-bda8-92ebb2b3f46b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"20a9cad4-4a0c-4836-b700-992f2c0d1843","title":"预期：提示原项目目录不存在并给出重新选择目录或不使用项目的处理方式；继续对话时不读取到错误的项目；不进入不可用的会话界面"},{"parent":"71ae1a36-edb5-4c29-bda8-92ebb2b3f46b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5ca2b4a6-2b72-4a0a-8e3a-5378f8d81c2a","title":"备注：合并原「Resume时项目路径失效」「恢复目标会话已不可用」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"71ae1a36-edb5-4c29-bda8-92ebb2b3f46b","title":"🟠【P1】恢复目标会话的工作目录已失效","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ed535247-ac14-4bb4-b1d0-8a4e88df050c","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"e2b1a352-7e07-4057-8299-8ccbd538225a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e8bbae0c-8376-4283-b65a-94f5e0ab3652","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"205b70f7-4ef8-4b2d-8e1c-3b0f8c3b1e6c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7134e7fd-cb38-4faf-ba51-721f5350162f","title":"前置：存在包含数百轮对话的历史会话；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧会话列表"},{"parent":"205b70f7-4ef8-4b2d-8e1c-3b0f8c3b1e6c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3bb4953d-d4ca-46e7-b9b9-dd8245e55909","title":"操作：恢复该会话并向上滚动查看历史"},{"parent":"205b70f7-4ef8-4b2d-8e1c-3b0f8c3b1e6c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bcbeeafc-c95e-4422-a459-42ca3cc29c4c","title":"预期：会话可正常恢复；历史分页加载流畅且有加载反馈；内容完整不丢失也不重复"},{"parent":"205b70f7-4ef8-4b2d-8e1c-3b0f8c3b1e6c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"41d7189b-1945-4a1a-b0d8-9154853fd267","title":"备注：合并原「超长历史会话」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"205b70f7-4ef8-4b2d-8e1c-3b0f8c3b1e6c","title":"🟡【P2】恢复消息量极大的历史会话"},{"parent":"e8bbae0c-8376-4283-b65a-94f5e0ab3652","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"552c6219-1ac2-4637-9d00-90cb1106a1ec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dbb60973-c930-412f-8e4d-ea77b3997b7d","title":"前置：存在多天前创建的历史会话；角色：房间成员；入口：左侧会话列表"},{"parent":"552c6219-1ac2-4637-9d00-90cb1106a1ec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"732bf167-e3a3-403c-973f-50201719b9f9","title":"操作：恢复该会话并查看时间显示与消息内容"},{"parent":"552c6