话窗口，并在各窗口分别发送消息"},{"parent":"8b692b3f-b110-4152-8257-f9cdcf159e95","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f54404a4-f196-48c3-b4e9-5addfe3506e4","title":"预期：各窗口为独立会话且 session_id 不同；消息互不干扰；Dock 弹窗卡片显示正确的窗口数量"},{"parent":"8b692b3f-b110-4152-8257-f9cdcf159e95","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a4982ad3-0dab-49a3-b8ad-84a5b1d66c25","title":"备注：合并原「同时打开Agent 的多个会话窗口」「新建多个同一 Agent 的多个窗口」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8b692b3f-b110-4152-8257-f9cdcf159e95","title":"🟡【P2】同时打开同一 Agent 的多个会话窗口","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"5c09e386-1025-4529-8a71-06328185523b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c3d27856-48b2-4fd8-9744-90c733183f16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"40ca07eb-fc56-4896-a5b6-c68b4cff124c","title":"前置：已打开 3 个 AI 窗口；角色：房间成员；入口：关闭房间后重新打开"},{"parent":"c3d27856-48b2-4fd8-9744-90c733183f16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4fc4195b-a3ef-4821-9e3f-d7c6928dd2ea","title":"操作：打开 3 个 AI 窗口后关闭房间，再重新打开房间"},{"parent":"c3d27856-48b2-4fd8-9744-90c733183f16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9fe8a64a-2c01-4550-8783-4948d51423b3","title":"预期：所有窗口按关闭前的位置和大小恢复；每个窗口独立加载对应的历史会话；窗口之间不相互干扰"},{"parent":"c3d27856-48b2-4fd8-9744-90c733183f16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ad89ea2d-61bc-4dfd-82f4-e7c03e38b376","title":"备注：原 3.2 边界迁入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c3d27856-48b2-4fd8-9744-90c733183f16","title":"🟡【P2】多个 AI 窗口在关房间后全部恢复","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"5c09e386-1025-4529-8a71-06328185523b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"587b2c3b-2a83-467f-acc0-b629ffbefc88","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"60dc6297-1d1d-4236-910a-30da89720647","title":"前置：同一账号打开了两个窗口；角色：房间成员；入口：两个窗口的同一条历史会话"},{"parent":"587b2c3b-2a83-467f-acc0-b629ffbefc88","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09f5b89b-3648-47d6-9ed0-8ff1730e8e84","title":"操作：在两个窗口同时恢复同一会话并各发送一条消息"},{"parent":"587b2c3b-2a83-467f-acc0-b629ffbefc88","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6572b12f-6e36-4503-8bc3-59813840dc6e","title":"预期：两端最终消息顺序一致且不覆盖；后发消息按时间追加；刷新后两端展示相同的历史内容"},{"parent":"587b2c3b-2a83-467f-acc0-b629ffbefc88","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b6b9ada0-3be2-450c-9c95-ccddf5b8cf7e","title":"备注：原 3.2 边界「多窗口打开同一历史」迁入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"587b2c3b-2a83-467f-acc0-b629ffbefc88","title":"🟡【P2】两个窗口打开同一条历史会话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5c09e386-1025-4529-8a71-06328185523b","title":"边界场景（3）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bc851bd8-8c1b-4a24-9b47-cb6397f853f8","title":"会话窗口与多窗口恢复"},{"parent":"954d5d5f-45e8-448e-b07b-35f18e2bf2c0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c0935154-ceef-422e-a414-40d013461934","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e3d40c38-d540-460d-90fa-96588747cf62","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0db34bcd-66a8-483c-9065-c56a7e0f74f2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"38369dd2-0175-4a87-8d14-1e1be32c1e5a","title":"前置：存在用旧版本应用创建的历史会话；角色：房间成员；入口：升级后的会话列表"},{"parent":"0db34bcd-66a8-483c-9065-c56a7e0f74f2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aec6f379-7938-4b4d-8734-6a5d2c246cf4","title":"操作：升级应用后打开该历史会话并继续对话"},{"parent":"0db34bcd-66a8-483c-9065-c56a7e0f74f2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5ac3abb-9653-4456-b7ec-67f5a582fe48","title":"预期：历史会话可正常打开且主要内容不丢失；字段缺失时有兼容处理或迁移提示；可继续正常对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0db34bcd-66a8-483c-9065-c56a7e0f74f2","title":"🟠【P1】版本升级后恢复历史会话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"e3d40c38-d540-460d-90fa-96588747cf62","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cd42285f-5579-466a-9049-43797a8b52f0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc8b8ec8-ac6a-4587-b59f-ab8238408f58","title":"前置：房间关闭时曾打开该会话窗口；角色：房间成员；入口：历史列表删除入口"},{"parent":"cd42285f-5579-466a-9049-43797a8b52f0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d76d0f0b-a3f0-4c07-b23a-bd22c22031b8","title":"操作：删除某条历史条目后关闭房间，再重新打开房间"},{"parent":"cd42285f-5579-466a-9049-43797a8b52f0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d11c2036-0c66-4e29-905e-5196c41c1489","title":"预期：该会话对应的窗口不被自动恢复；不出现恢复失败的报错弹窗；其他窗口正常恢复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cd42285f-5579-466a-9049-43797a8b52f0","title":"🟠【P1】删除历史后窗口快照不再恢复"},{"parent":"e3d40c38-d540-460d-90fa-96588747cf62","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4c4c7d2d-3e50-4a93-86d0-afb68138fc5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4612d4df-61e7-49ad-8527-888a49180301","title":"前置：同一账号在两台设备登录，其中一台已在该房间发送过消息；角色：账号所有者；入口：另一台设备的该会话"},{"parent":"4c4c7d2d-3e50-4a93-86d0-afb68138fc5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"38cea726-00dd-4d52-b244-1ad9b1953361","title":"操作：在另一台设备进入该房间并尝试在该历史会话中发送消息"},{"parent":"4c4c7d2d-3e50-4a93-86d0-afb68138fc5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e64792b5-dce4-4bd8-97a4-e87939186cd9","title":"预期：历史会话区域禁止输入或允许输入但发送前给出提示，文案说明该会话无法在本设备继续、需新建会话并 @ 该会话继续；不出现允许发送后静默失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4c4c7d2d-3e50-4a93-86d0-afb68138fc5b","title":"🟠【P1】同一账号跨设备访问同一会话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"e3d40c38-d540-460d-90fa-96588747cf62","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0ac4363d-7cff-4a0f-8cfd-b56cb1fcac7d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"91ed1cb6-3582-42a5-88c2-c5d6e4d40d6b","title":"前置：本地历史缓存文件已损坏；角色：房间成员；入口：该历史会话"},{"parent":"0ac4363d-7cff-4a0f-8cfd-b56cb1fcac7d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f728b97a-caaf-4e39-8de0-4f9f4abc7d4e","title":"操作：打开该历史会话"},{"parent":"0ac4363d-7cff-4a0f-8cfd-b56cb1fcac7d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"11651ef3-22b5-4126-b114-472028f2eeb8","title":"预期：提示恢复失败或改用云端备份加载；应用不崩溃；清除缓存后重新加载可正常恢复"},{"parent":"0ac4363d-7cff-4a0f-8cfd-b56cb1fcac7d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8b5750df-7f68-4d1f-8fbe-6dd53a7d859a","title":"备注：原 3.2 迁入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0ac4363d-7cff-4a0f-8cfd-b56cb1fcac7d","title":"🟡【P2】本地历史缓存损坏","icons":[]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e3d40c38-d540-460d-90fa-96588747cf62","title":"异常场景（5）"},{"parent":"c0935154-ceef-422e-a414-40d013461934","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bd35f38a-cd91-4a0a-b081-a310a95aa9f6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ac5c2969-3016-4118-adcb-65b94c910753","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2e731d74-9297-41b7-856f-bd4de268bb57","title":"前置：存在包含大量附件与文件卡片的历史会话；角色：房间成员；入口：该历史会话"},{"