7d7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a1e23117-4778-4f37-913e-ba20f614db56","title":"操作：在两种系统设置下分别查看会话列表、会话详情与弹窗"},{"parent":"294ab4b1-6e61-4c38-b505-62c0189ca7d7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"57ca413f-71ff-4764-ad7b-2c68f247bc59","title":"预期：文字与图标随缩放正确放大不截断；高对比度下状态区分不只依赖颜色，完成、失败、等待均可辨识"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"294ab4b1-6e61-4c38-b505-62c0189ca7d7","title":"🟡【P2】系统缩放与高对比度模式","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"448b501c-02de-443b-b56b-41ddebefa3ce","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"837a2fe9-446c-498c-8624-95f9202dabb4","title":"界面样式与图标一致性"},{"parent":"ae3b6555-06bb-462b-b4a0-34940daf3e3b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8f0b284a-b10a-4283-9f7f-8cd410a30267","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5d33b316-1ac1-43dd-8692-e31792afdf18","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"95e9cfb3-f4fc-4186-8726-20f32f5cf870","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0c52e1c5-4151-4b88-8e9b-aa664fbd088a","title":"前置：已进入某条会话且会话列表按项目分组；角色：房间成员；入口：浏览器刷新"},{"parent":"95e9cfb3-f4fc-4186-8726-20f32f5cf870","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6a69d749-a20d-49e2-b89e-3d34d076dbdb","title":"操作：刷新页面"},{"parent":"95e9cfb3-f4fc-4186-8726-20f32f5cf870","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0c499ea0-9fbf-4bee-8cf7-608d867d3886","title":"预期：\n1) 持久化 ｜ 刷新后仍停留在同一条会话，左侧列表选中态与分组方式不变\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 置顶与人员筛选等个人设置在刷新后保持"},{"parent":"95e9cfb3-f4fc-4186-8726-20f32f5cf870","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"efb49ca1-7cd6-4492-b567-f42bebf03dc2","title":"备注：形态由桌面端改为 Web，同一账号可在同一浏览器开多个标签页。项目与会话的列表、置顶、删除等都是跨标签页共享的状态，必须收敛一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"95e9cfb3-f4fc-4186-8726-20f32f5cf870","title":"🔴【P0】刷新后保持当前会话与分组","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"5d33b316-1ac1-43dd-8692-e31792afdf18","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"868d68c9-4321-40ec-9880-1fd1ac124ec5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f331232d-e1c8-439d-be0f-9ecc12a4ae46","title":"前置：已登录且是该房间成员；角色：房间成员；入口：浏览器地址栏"},{"parent":"868d68c9-4321-40ec-9880-1fd1ac124ec5","callo