多创建一个新会话<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e3486b34-17fe-4dfb-b693-3a4002017769","title":"🔴【P0】Fork 过程中重复点击<br>","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"a4895009-1091-4fd3-b191-0bc3e64eddd3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6b0ca16e-3bc3-4cc1-b0cf-e3a026d6a383","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"62839710-4830-425f-afba-b6bd71f1711f","title":"前置：服务端已创建 S2；模拟前端路由异常"},{"parent":"6b0ca16e-3bc3-4cc1-b0cf-e3a026d6a383","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c42e177e-7bb9-45d8-845b-fa88163496da","title":"操作：执行 Fork<br>"},{"parent":"6b0ca16e-3bc3-4cc1-b0cf-e3a026d6a383","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1bdc17c2-0459-4153-afc0-1d6742e93ca1","title":"预期：提示创建结果；刷新后可在会话列表找到 S2；不得再次创建重复会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6b0ca16e-3bc3-4cc1-b0cf-e3a026d6a383","title":"🔴【P0】Fork 成功但页面跳转失败<br>","icons":[]},{"parent":"a4895009-1091-4fd3-b191-0bc3e64eddd3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bdab2c25-580e-49cc-976b-dc5763858906","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"811f4792-0926-4a4f-a579-168f1f51fdca","title":"前置：S1 含普通消息、附件和工具调用<br>"},{"parent":"bdab2c25-580e-49cc-976b-dc5763858906","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0ce898f0-5374-422b-9b03-6bcf22e13a99","title":"操作：执行 Fork 并对比消息数量"},{"parent":"bdab2c25-580e-49cc-976b-dc5763858906","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"95e1f13a-cc18-40c0-9d3f-ab7bc2068897","title":"预期：发现缺失时 Fork 应整体失败或明确标识异常，不得静默生成不完整会话<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bdab2c25-580e-49cc-976b-dc5763858906","title":"🔴【P0】历史消息复制不完整","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"a4895009-1091-4fd3-b191-0bc3e64eddd3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ebd45cd9-8885-4574-9c40-249447229b90","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4fb894b7-4fda-49d8-85ed-b36d1aefcd76","title":"前置：S1 包含多轮快速发送的消息<br>"},{"parent":"ebd45cd9-8885-4574-9c40-249447229b90","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a9702529-e908-4592-8197-33bce762cb3b","title":"操作：执行 Fork，核对消息时间和父子关系<br>"},{"parent":"ebd45cd9-8885-4574-9c40-249447229b90","callout":[],"children":[],