<br>"},{"parent":"54b7f66f-851e-4abb-8b7e-e3a81f88db70","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"172dd839-ae8a-449a-9bc3-c6af71f2e70f","title":"预期：Fork 成功；创建新会话；消息复制逻辑与 Codex 消息插入逻辑一致；新旧会话相互独立"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"54b7f66f-851e-4abb-8b7e-e3a81f88db70","title":"🟠【P1】共享 Agent 的用户 Fork 会话<br>","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"a4895009-1091-4fd3-b191-0bc3e64eddd3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a853817b-efca-4f7d-8af9-d36ee28744d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"60589a3e-96e8-4d9e-80f0-2ebf4c9d07ca","title":"前置：用户未被 Agent 所有者共享该 Agent"},{"parent":"a853817b-efca-4f7d-8af9-d36ee28744d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"791d3566-c24d-48b3-aff0-1bdcf3f00391","title":"操作：通过会话页面、旧链接或直接调用 Fork 接口尝试 Fork<br>"},{"parent":"a853817b-efca-4f7d-8af9-d36ee28744d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9cdcf875-c341-480d-a7ec-61ef6ae6e5b5","title":"预期：UI 不展示或禁用 Fork 入口；服务端返回无权限；不创建新会话；不泄露消息、附件地址或会话元数据"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a853817b-efca-4f7d-8af9-d36ee28744d2","title":"🟠【P1】未共享 Agent 的用户 Fork 会话<br>","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"a4895009-1091-4fd3-b191-0bc3e64eddd3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"54dc4a1d-7576-4811-9622-7b6bfdb247fa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ef02f3af-981a-48c9-8bdd-bc712b04acad","title":"前置：S2 已创建；随后删除 S1<br>"},{"parent":"54dc4a1d-7576-4811-9622-7b6bfdb247fa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b4a73068-bc43-4bc6-bb6a-07f7b223d2b2","title":"操作：刷新并进入 S2<br>"},{"parent":"54dc4a1d-7576-4811-9622-7b6bfdb247fa","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"663da104-36c8-48a8-8e7c-3e78b77f5354","title":"预期：根据数据模型独立保留 S2；不得因 S1 删除导致 S2 消息丢失<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"54dc4a1d-7576-4811-9622-7b6bfdb247fa","title":"🟠【P1】原会话被删除后打开分叉","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"a4895009-1091-4fd3-b191-0bc3e64eddd3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"30027cfc-35ab-4e0a-8fc2-d17d16f869ba","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e4aeeca2-13b1-4c06-ad2b-