9dd","title":"🔴【P0】在用户消息上尝试 Fork<br>","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"2f3bf89d-b04a-496e-a7dd-019e46255da8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6735b1c2-6412-4dc8-8e72-74417d6f0c11","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f9d085bb-c066-4caa-9344-0cb759b92c51","title":"前置：检查产品是否定义“从会话开始 Fork”"},{"parent":"6735b1c2-6412-4dc8-8e72-74417d6f0c11","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5bc2558-5317-4620-95d3-670e8e815a1b","title":"操作：查看会话菜单并尝试对应接口<br>"},{"parent":"6735b1c2-6412-4dc8-8e72-74417d6f0c11","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"42911ca6-6bf7-4855-9872-8449c3419bf3","title":"预期：若不支持则不展示入口；若支持则创建空会话或仅含系统消息，并与产品定义一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6735b1c2-6412-4dc8-8e72-74417d6f0c11","title":"🔴【P0】从会话开始位置 Fork<br>","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"2f3bf89d-b04a-496e-a7dd-019e46255da8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"11b600de-890c-44c1-80a6-4924bbc839a2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"98ab7840-6e0e-407d-aad3-c110b09472f6","title":"前置：S1 已成功创建 S2<br>"},{"parent":"11b600de-890c-44c1-80a6-4924bbc839a2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"84348309-29cc-4033-8ab2-0a370d4a0b89","title":"操作：依次执行 S1→S2→S3→S4"},{"parent":"11b600de-890c-44c1-80a6-4924bbc839a2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c31daad3-e2a8-409f-85b6-9ff1108275e9","title":"预期：每一代均有唯一会话 ID；内容按 Fork 点截断；父子关系正确；不得点击无响应<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"11b600de-890c-44c1-80a6-4924bbc839a2","title":"🔴【P0】连续多代 Fork<br>","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"2f3bf89d-b04a-496e-a7dd-019e46255da8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f2d783f6-6d45-4073-8333-1e48569f5c23","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e94c7d9c-b347-4411-a637-639a76f3ae03","title":"前置：S1 中存在可 Fork 的 M4<br>"},{"parent":"f2d783f6-6d45-4073-8333-1e48569f5c23","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"37b08785-f810-406d-8cfe-314fbfac8d82","title":"操作：分别从 M4 创建 S2、S3、S4"},{"parent":"f2d783f6-6d45-4073-8333-1e48569f5c23","callout":[],"children":[],"id":