、斜杠、引号及超长字符<br>"},{"parent":"39c06889-f157-4ac7-a4ba-6c47f5c01d5f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"adcc653a-c4d0-47ca-8ca3-98688ea3dc83","title":"操作：执行 Fork"},{"parent":"39c06889-f157-4ac7-a4ba-6c47f5c01d5f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d3a95019-e4a6-4661-9605-e372b0dcc650","title":"预期：新会话列表正常展示；标题不乱码；不影响打开和搜索<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"39c06889-f157-4ac7-a4ba-6c47f5c01d5f","title":"🟡【P2】特殊字符标题会话 Fork","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2f3bf89d-b04a-496e-a7dd-019e46255da8","title":"边界场景"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4eb570de-2878-4317-93ef-2e77f9959583","title":"会话fork"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"00aef705-0ca9-4f82-be13-4329bd40abd6","title":"会话与消息交互"},{"parent":"28a940bb-0eef-4cac-8062-351774ac194f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a0b6f3c0-e11a-40fc-bcce-3f235b8e114f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b964a26c-6f57-4ae1-a20a-7eac9d159534","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"906492ae-c0c8-4a92-8058-5851eb6aec1a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b7830683-9c64-4cab-91ff-a77b82a25df8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2b616520-3c25-4cef-adeb-ebe5523773b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d115bbf7-f805-4eb8-8be5-8a3f6e0f759b","title":"前置：已打开会话；角色：房间成员；入口：输入框左下角的加号"},{"parent":"2b616520-3c25-4cef-adeb-ebe5523773b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5eab36f6-69b6-48ff-8f1e-c2412dcd9194","title":"操作：点击加号"},{"parent":"2b616520-3c25-4cef-adeb-ebe5523773b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dab9ca59-bf9b-4761-9773-205e5e851ddd","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 展开后展示「上传本地文件」与「选择房间文件」两项\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 两项各有图标与说明，不再是单一的上传动作"},{"parent":"2b616520-3c25-4cef-adeb-ebe5523773b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"50db3601-b968-47e0-b674-3016fd5987ca","title":"备注：「+」按钮拆分为两个入口：上传本地文件、选择房间文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2b616520-3c25-4cef-adeb-ebe5523773b4","title":"🔴【P0】加号展开后的两个入口","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"b7830683-9c64-4cab-91ff-a77b82a25df8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cd