 包含整个房间下Agent added或modified 的文件；<br>2. 先按最新完成的Agent 会话倒序汇总并按路径去重；但无搜索词界&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 面会按目录聚合，再按文件夹/文件名称升序展示；<br>3. 首次10条，每次展开10条，最多取30条（取最近100个会话）；<br>4. 已删除文件不展示"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"none"},"id":"817487be-1634-478c-98a6-7cb25c2e8f1e","title":"🔴【P0】查看近期Agent生成的文件分类","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f834b7b8-759d-42b4-ac04-0cc1d73a2ce5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1e2676ae-6c66-46ed-a863-788996ffff9a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bbb56dfa-4beb-4d6f-8b9f-7b166f06d646","title":"操作：我不可见的会话产生了一个文件，我输入@查看文件tab"},{"parent":"1e2676ae-6c66-46ed-a863-788996ffff9a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"20d2a905-21bb-4c66-a223-843c58cbbcd8","title":"预期：该文件不显示在近期Agent生成的文件下，会话改成我可见或我编辑后才会显示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1e2676ae-6c66-46ed-a863-788996ffff9a","title":"🔴【P0】我不可见的会话产生的文件不显示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f834b7b8-759d-42b4-ac04-0cc1d73a2ce5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b592517e-5578-4884-94fb-56f98786ca80","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"94fc2e75-732c-4722-863c-f5600afe314c","title":"操作：从补全列表选中Agent创建的一个文件"},{"parent":"b592517e-5578-4884-94fb-56f98786ca80","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e433c386-717d-40ec-bf75-1ee16ae2e058","title":"预期：插入 token 成功，发送消息后agent能识别到该文件内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b592517e-5578-4884-94fb-56f98786ca80","title":"🔴【P0】引用Agent创建的文件","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f834b7b8-759d-42b4-ac04-0cc1d73a2ce5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"79fe4b4c-63fc-4d42-b4ee-473a66e54124","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0b999f6b-df99-4887-94cc-48fd021f4232","title":"操作：从补全列表选中文件/文件夹"},{"parent":"79fe4b4c-63fc-4d42-b4ee-473a66e54124","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c038afd6-1783-4b44-bdcc-07e156081df7","title":"预期：插入 token 成功，发送消息后agent能识别到该文件内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"79fe4b4c-63fc-4d42-b4ee-473a66e54124","title":"🔴【P0】引用文件/文件夹","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 9