6-645d-483f-8650-9c075a33a2f9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"09c65c06-00d8-4b19-b336-41b4c00f6a6d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c0407461-2b94-49db-9b47-ce5a866419f3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cb9a3fa2-2cba-4129-a601-b89e45f6bad3","title":"前置：当前网络异常；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"c0407461-2b94-49db-9b47-ce5a866419f3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4ee9739b-01d0-4b3a-858c-1559362e1908","title":"操作：在网络断开时输入 @ 并切换到智能体 Tab，恢复网络后重新唤起面板"},{"parent":"c0407461-2b94-49db-9b47-ce5a866419f3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"56480929-a169-4a06-afc5-81ce5daf0ba0","title":"预期：提示加载失败并保留普通文本输入能力，输入框中已有内容不丢失；提供重试或重新唤起入口；恢复网络后重新唤起可正常加载列表"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c0407461-2b94-49db-9b47-ce5a866419f3","title":"🟡【P2】智能体列表加载失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"09c65c06-00d8-4b19-b336-41b4c00f6a6d","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"71a98c26-645d-483f-8650-9c075a33a2f9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7c5a2acd-9307-41f7-a4aa-de7859c86dba","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4731ea19-59fb-47ea-aa9b-264a56560071","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"01332f8a-0d88-4d88-bfcf-1e450609315c","title":"前置：新用户账号下仅有系统默认的 Tutti Agent，房间内暂无其他成员共享；角色：新用户；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"4731ea19-59fb-47ea-aa9b-264a56560071","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fe4f13bf-840f-4686-b068-707940c8c7ff","title":"操作：打开智能体 Tab 查看列表"},{"parent":"4731ea19-59fb-47ea-aa9b-264a56560071","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"53a46da6-d310-44c6-b91f-6192d754238a","title":"预期：只展示 Tutti Agent；未绑定或未安装的 Agent 不伪装为可用；列表不展示空的成员分组"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4731ea19-59fb-47ea-aa9b-264a56560071","title":"🟡【P2】仅一个可用 Agent"},{"parent":"7c5a2acd-9307-41f7-a4aa-de7859c86dba","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5b22cb0a-41ef-445b-a098-b39326b72808","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f20de3bb-8ecf-426c-8db7-e61cfe69c01c","title":"前置：房间内成员与共享 Agent 合计达到 100 个；角色：房间成员；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"5b22cb0a-41ef-445b-a098-b39326b72808","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bd3888a0-ab49-40f8-8723-072ddc38d957","title":"操作：打开智能体 Tab 并从头滚动到底部，再用搜索定位其中一个"},{"parent":"5b22cb0a-41ef-445b-a098-b39326b72808","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d911a23f-a8a6-4abf-a8b5-1aff3310951c","title":"预期：列表支持搜索或虚拟滚动，滚动流畅无明显卡顿；分组标题在滚动中正确对应；搜索能快速定位到目标 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5b22cb0a-41ef-445b-a098-b39326b72808","title":"🟡【P2】大量 Agent 时的列表性能"},{"parent":"7c5a2acd-9307-41f7-a4aa-de7859c86dba","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3c2d772a-d58c-4b99-81b9-1d73e92aa932","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b2052ed9-3b62-44ca-ad12-b578bd27cf6d","title":"前置：存在名称很长的成员与 Agent；角色：房间成员；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"3c2d772a-d58c-4b99-81b9-1d73e92aa932","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4d5580ae-4a48-42d9-8db6-09de905ec7cf","title":"操作：查看该成员分组标题与 Agent 条目"},{"parent":"3c2d772a-d58c-4b99-81b9-1d73e92aa932","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"543c9252-2cff-4fd5-9e43-0c118c6e2f2a","title":"预期：超长名称省略显示并可悬浮查看全称；不撑破面板宽度；可用状态标识仍完整可见"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3c2d772a-d58c-4b99-81b9-1d73e92aa932","title":"🟡【P2】成员或 Agent 名称超长"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7c5a2acd-9307-41f7-a4aa-de7859c86dba","title":"边界场景（3）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"71a98c26-645d-483f-8650-9c075a33a2f9","title":"Tab 唤起与列表结构"},{"parent":"205cba06-9a83-4989-a19c-109c4175ea98","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"296e0633-4ff6-4a2e-8367-7f7745379ef8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c3c4df88-b2d0-42b3-a1b1-7f896337fbaf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"59ecc177-415e-4510-ae90-0fb68f1c6a79","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a04b4b7f-0515-4a5c-ad0e-444ed7995aad","title":"前置：智能体 Tab 已打开且列表中有多个 Agent；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板搜索输入"},{"parent":"59ecc177-415e-4510-ae90-0fb68f1c6a79","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5b229ad2-ac4d-4fce-abff-0fc05a8dfff7","title":"操作：输入 @ 后继续输入 Agent 名称的部分字符，用方向键选中目标后回车"},{"parent":"59ecc177-415e-4510-ae90-0fb68f1c6a79","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"37e48d7e-db56-49d5-8ec3-04d7a14e101f","title":"预期：列表实时过滤出匹配的智能体；方向键可在结果中移动且选中项高亮；回车确认后引用被插入到输入框"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"59ecc177-415e-4510-ae90-0fb68f1c6a79","title":"🔴【P0】搜索智能体并插入引用"},{"parent":"c3c4df88-b2d0-42b3-a1b1-7f896337fbaf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b9856de8-68a0-4d0b-90d5-ae2c120374f7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f5dbd083-20ed-46de-b044-11e4a898d919","title":"前置：智能体 Tab 已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板搜索输入"},{"parent":"b9856de8-68a0-4d0b-90d5-ae2c120374f7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9fac4a6c-bb3d-4d9b-b404-229e8eba3ee0","title":"操作：输入某成员名称的部分字符"},{"parent":"b9856de8-68a0-4d0b-90d5-ae2c120374f7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"17870c20-2569-4a0a-b5b3-1f14c026d9bd","title":"预期：匹配出该成员名下的全部 Agent；结果仍保留成员分组信息；其他成员的 Agent 不出现在结果中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b9856de8-68a0-4d0b-90d5-ae2c120374f7","title":"🟠【P1】按成员名称搜索"},{"parent":"c3c4df88-b2d0-42b3-a1b1-7f896337fbaf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0f251c12-8bfb-44e0-a15c-2d8b59398401","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"79e70abd-49cc-48cd-8a05-d875c6eb82a1","title":"前置：房间内存在中文名与英文名的 Agent；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板搜索输入"},{"parent":"0f251c12-8bfb-44e0-a15c-2d8b59398401","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"307463da-76e0-4b26-95fb-bbb431ca0da5","title":"操作：分别输入中文关键词、英文小写与英文大写关键词"},{"parent":"0f251c12-8bfb-44e0-a15c-2d8b59398401","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ad79a4d-0aee-4d21-b26c-6315ff17219f","title":"预期：三种输入均能匹配到对应的 Agent；大小写不影响匹配结果；中英文混排名称可被任一部分命中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0f251c12-8bfb-44e0-a15c-2d8b59398401","title":"🟠【P1】中英文与大小写兼容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c3c4df88-b2d0-42b3-a1b1-7f896337fbaf","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"296e0633-4ff6-4a2e-8367-7f7745379ef8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2211c812-f341-4d8f-96b7-f45d7ab547d3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"abbe94c5-e697-44a4-8196-38eb9fd34e08","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e9dbea1d-8e38-4598-8726-1092108b78c8","title":"前置：智能体 Tab 已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板搜索输入"},{"parent":"abbe94c5-e697-44a4-8196-38eb9fd34e08","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3b5e267e-227a-43e0-8190-7d2e600054f1","title":"操作：输入一段不匹配任何 Agent 或成员的关键词"},{"parent":"abbe94c5-e697-44a4-8196-38eb9fd34e08","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"153274fe-4a75-4ee5-992d-c85612d9760c","title":"预期：展示无匹配结果的空态提示；不显示加载中也不报错；退格删除关键词后列表恢复完整"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"abbe94c5-e697-44a4-8196-38eb9fd34e08","title":"🟡【P2】搜索无匹配结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2211c812-f341-4d8f-96b7-f45d7ab547d3","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"296e0633-4ff6-4a2e-8367-7f7745379ef8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c36fba94-f7a4-42f4-b482-0c93ab0e4f36","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5b6cd3f6-f72e-4bed-802e-c98a4ac4ebcc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b4ba7b93-7e02-4666-8435-2b39298e9675","title":"前置：智能体 Tab 已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板搜索输入"},{"parent":"5b6cd3f6-f72e-4bed-802e-c98a4ac4ebcc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bc638726-aaed-448e-9664-9734f4d2e49a","title":"操作：在 @ 之后依次输入空格、特殊字符与纯数字"},{"parent":"5b6cd3f6-f72e-4bed-802e-c98a4ac4ebcc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"37db233f-41cb-4425-ae9d-fb2e9d9980a6","title":"预期：输入空格时面板按产品定义关闭或将空格作为普通字符处理，不提示无法搜索；特殊字符与数字按字面匹配，无匹配时展示空态"},{"parent":"5b6cd3f6-f72e-4bed-802e-c98a4ac4ebcc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3dc98500-9491-4b53-afe1-6a235eb4a7b3","title":"备注：参考历史问题：输入 @ 后再输空格曾提示无法搜索工作区文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5b6cd3f6-f72e-4bed-802e-c98a4ac4ebcc","title":"🟡【P2】搜索特殊字符与空格"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c36fba94-f7a4-42f4-b482-0c93ab0e4f36","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"296e0633-4ff6-4a2e-8367-7f7745379ef8","title":"智能体搜索"},{"parent":"205cba06-9a83-4989-a19c-109c4175ea98","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8b101f59-3c9c-449d-bff4-5ebb6774a35f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3a43bce1-b9f9-4a87-b3ce-606336fa64bd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9361cf0f-34a5-4dfc-b3a8-293989f1ba81","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"16cbc0f9-aa01-4b11-ae04-aa93c2eabf52","title":"前置：智能体 Tab 已打开且列表中有多个 Agent；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板"},{"parent":"9361cf0f-34a5-4dfc-b3a8-293989f1ba81","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f335d040-e738-4fb6-8e7d-52fb6b09df77","title":"操作：使用上下方向键在列表中移动，跨分组移动后回车确认"},{"parent":"9361cf0f-34a5-4dfc-b3a8-293989f1ba81","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e912248d-c039-4160-b62b-f0b3a67a341a","title":"预期：选中项高亮随方向键移动并可跨成员分组连续移动；列表随选中项自动滚动保证可见；回车插入当前选中的 Agent 引用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9361cf0f-34a5-4dfc-b3a8-293989f1ba81","title":"🟠【P1】方向键与回车选择"},{"parent":"3a43bce1-b9f9-4a87-b3ce-606336fa64bd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0dca35ef-92f4-454d-8125-c98f63a596a3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"260c3751-0f93-4aa5-849b-0b57620cea32","title":"前置：智能体 Tab 已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板"},{"parent":"0dca35ef-92f4-454d-8125-c98f63a596a3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"24a0d16e-e5d1-4a81-b4f1-434ea35f97cc","title":"操作：按 Esc 键关闭面板"},{"parent":"0dca35ef-92f4-454d-8125-c98f63a596a3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"46df4c35-9704-4468-956a-e4cfd1937034","title":"预期：面板关闭并保留输入框中已输入的 @ 字符与其他文本；未插入任何引用；再次输入可重新唤起面板"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0dca35ef-92f4-454d-8125-c98f63a596a3","title":"🟠【P1】Esc 关闭面板"},{"parent":"3a43bce1-b9f9-4a87-b3ce-606336fa64bd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"89151a9a-4a96-4287-a1b4-05b40179edc5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"06a12080-94a9-4d51-b8f4-daa2a80883cc","title":"前置：智能体 Tab 已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：面板外部区域"},{"parent":"89151a9a-4a96-4287-a1b4-05b40179edc5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"733bf594-5da0-48d2-acb3-8ab1538abb38","title":"操作：点击面板外部的会话区域"},{"parent":"89151a9a-4a96-4287-a1b4-05b40179edc5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ab60dd52-b857-4544-a3a5-87a6925cd906","title":"预期：面板关闭且不插入引用；输入框内容保持不变；面板不常驻在页面顶层遮挡其他内容"},{"parent":"89151a9a-4a96-4287-a1b4-05b40179edc5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"97a3437e-c38c-454a-823e-099c4819c9d6","title":"备注：#304"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"89151a9a-4a96-4287-a1b4-05b40179edc5","title":"🟠【P1】点击外部关闭面板"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3a43bce1-b9f9-4a87-b3ce-606336fa64bd","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"8b101f59-3c9c-449d-bff4-5ebb6774a35f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c79deec9-4623-44e9-a817-b45af448d746","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"efc959d7-8351-4c96-9133-5741f2f17216","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f1c8f390-3c3a-4dbf-b845-7d1fbd938be3","title":"前置：应用窗口宽度较小或输入框贴近屏幕边缘；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板"},{"parent":"efc959d7-8351-4c96-9133-5741f2f17216","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"add860dd-47e4-4aa6-a1b2-4a36a047bed7","title":"操作：在窄窗口下唤起智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"efc959d7-8351-4c96-9133-5741f2f17216","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"04549f2b-6bf7-476d-b055-dac2f0d45953","title":"预期：面板自动调整弹出方向使其完整落在可视区域内；不被窗口边缘裁切；列表可滚动查看全部条目"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"efc959d7-8351-4c96-9133-5741f2f17216","title":"🟡【P2】窄窗口与页面边缘下的面板"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c79deec9-4623-44e9-a817-b45af448d746","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8b101f59-3c9c-449d-bff4-5ebb6774a35f","title":"键盘导航与面板关闭"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"205cba06-9a83-4989-a19c-109c4175ea98","title":"智能体 Tab 与列表展示"},{"parent":"f3ec9241-cfff-4c41-ab3f-6709e6e0842d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"65aefe5d-69e4-4d5c-a362-b1d548fdead0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3a3a8c67-3c68-474f-b072-2a0d9c5b7536","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5ae8e7f9-24d4-46df-9296-ec5c73737c67","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"035acc64-2880-4690-8760-a0ad234af21f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"eb4ff2b6-fab8-4c6a-b415-feb10c0d068e","title":"前置：本地 Claude Code、Codex、Tutti Agent 均已安装并登录；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"035acc64-2880-4690-8760-a0ad234af21f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5c79e42b-f30d-47c6-8e99-aba4a0ca7739","title":"操作：在自己的分组下查看三个 Agent 的状态并各选择一次"},{"parent":"035acc64-2880-4690-8760-a0ad234af21f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"158103fc-5f99-4b5e-bb1a-31fd8427453c","title":"预期：三个 Agent 均显示为可用；点击可成功插入引用；发送后能正常接收指令并回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"035acc64-2880-4690-8760-a0ad234af21f","title":"🔴【P0】我的 Agent 已安装已登录时可选"},{"parent":"5ae8e7f9-24d4-46df-9296-ec5c73737c67","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a8ce40cd-676f-4b1d-8eaf-2f07280f589c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ab55f645-251b-4cf9-93ca-c47b7143a392","title":"前置：会话中已出现「需要认证或配置」提示；角色：Agent 所有者与发起会话的成员；入口：原会话输入框"},{"parent":"a8ce40cd-676f-4b1d-8eaf-2f07280f589c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"80d3af43-274b-4dbb-a436-5a76fc7aa075","title":"操作：Agent 所有者在本地完成安装或登录后，发起方在原会话继续发送一条消息"},{"parent":"a8ce40cd-676f-4b1d-8eaf-2f07280f589c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e9f83ed-c7f9-4e75-a6bf-95c225c52f1c","title":"预期：该 Agent 正常接收请求并回复；此前的提示不再重复出现；原会话的历史消息完整保留可继续对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a8ce40cd-676f-4b1d-8eaf-2f07280f589c","title":"🟠【P1】认证配置提示后的恢复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5ae8e7f9-24d4-46df-9296-ec5c73737c67","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"3a3a8c67-3c68-474f-b072-2a0d9c5b7536","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bc1701f0-ddad-43a4-8df7-fd861be927ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0e89fed7-4bfd-43d2-a090-fa7f8fa6da2c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d2521892-0adf-4dc0-aced-97fc85f0235f","title":"前置：本地未安装 Claude Code；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"0e89fed7-4bfd-43d2-a090-fa7f8fa6da2c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"da917131-d29c-4cd9-80e3-7709b7c13413","title":"操作：在自己的agent新建会话，自己的分组下找到该 Agent 并尝试点击选择"},{"parent":"0e89fed7-4bfd-43d2-a090-fa7f8fa6da2c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ccf4fece-9407-44a2-b0ef-af07685317cc","title":"预期：该 Agent 在 @ 面板中置灰显示为不可用且不可选择；点击无法插入引用；不出现选中后发送才报错"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0e89fed7-4bfd-43d2-a090-fa7f8fa6da2c","title":"🔴【P0】我的 Agent 未安装时置灰不可选"},{"parent":"bc1701f0-ddad-43a4-8df7-fd861be927ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4df1ed54-1a4a-4b27-8533-3201a95e779a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e6b73250-7b46-47a1-aeff-6c2eaeb7a280","title":"前置：本地已安装 Codex 但未登录；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"4df1ed54-1a4a-4b27-8533-3201a95e779a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09f5c9aa-195d-48d2-b7cf-985b21efc5ce","title":"操作：自己的agent新建会话，在自己的分组下找到该 Agent 并尝试点击选择"},{"parent":"4df1ed54-1a4a-4b27-8533-3201a95e779a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a938de9a-7a4b-45f2-8f10-769c44862bf4","title":"预期：该 Agent 置灰显示为不可用且不可选择；完成登录后重新唤起面板，该 Agent 恢复为可用可选"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4df1ed54-1a4a-4b27-8533-3201a95e779a","title":"🔴【P0】我的 Agent 未登录时置灰不可选"},{"parent":"bc1701f0-ddad-43a4-8df7-fd861be927ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"171ad991-4099-4706-bec4-ce6c8aacb729","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bc9b7f9d-6ba1-4ad3-8d2f-f2bd31edaa34","title":"前置：成员 A 的 Claude Code 未安装但曾开启过共享；角色：房间其他成员；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"171ad991-4099-4706-bec4-ce6c8aacb729","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea0fda70-41cf-4bdd-bafe-d49f4bb2b43b","title":"操作：在共享agent下新建会话，成员 A 的分组下选择该 Agent，输入指令并发送"},{"parent":"171ad991-4099-4706-bec4-ce6c8aacb729","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"083d08ba-c9c8-418f-abbd-1d451d058edb","title":"预期：该Agent可以选择，会话详情给出「{Agent} 需要认证或配置」的明确提示；指令未被执行也不产生持续等待的僵尸会话；提示中说明需要该 Agent 的所有者完成本地配置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"171ad991-4099-4706-bec4-ce6c8aacb729","title":"🔴【P0】未安装的 Agent 在他人视角下可选"},{"parent":"bc1701f0-ddad-43a4-8df7-fd861be927ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b93e0dfd-bb64-4f24-9797-496e9922061a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8a634445-76ae-457d-8449-3e18e07194a3","title":"前置：成员 A 的 Claude Code 已安装未登录但曾开启过共享；角色：房间其他成员；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"b93e0dfd-bb64-4f24-9797-496e9922061a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b6a1699e-7574-4e04-8820-8ab537becd7a","title":"操作：在共享agent下新建会话，在成员 A 的分组下选择该 Agent，输入指令并发送"},{"parent":"b93e0dfd-bb64-4f24-9797-496e9922061a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e064310-ff27-41cd-847e-598c4aa678b4","title":"预期：该Agent可以选择，会话详情给出「{Agent} 需要认证或配置」的明确提示；指令未被执行也不产生持续等待的僵尸会话；提示中说明需要该 Agent 的所有者完成本地配置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b93e0dfd-bb64-4f24-9797-496e9922061a","title":"🔴【P0】已安装未登录的 Agent 在他人视角下可选"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bc1701f0-ddad-43a4-8df7-fd861be927ac","title":"异常场景（3）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3a3a8c67-3c68-474f-b072-2a0d9c5b7536","title":"我的 Agent 可用状态"},{"parent":"65aefe5d-69e4-4d5c-a362-b1d548fdead0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"72ba1e90-4938-496c-b175-1fbdefd3ae13","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f7275a7e-494a-4fe8-b81e-582f6e9183a1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5be82b34-3f2a-4e50-a4dc-cd776a4e8f66","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"13a0bb85-d6ca-4b2a-a4af-664239d5b0a2","title":"前置：成员 A 已开启共享且已打开 Tutti 客户端；角色：房间其他成员；入口：智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"5be82b34-3f2a-4e50-a4dc-cd776a4e8f66","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1abe8551-401d-4253-878f-34cf4a084a14","title":"操作：在成员 A 的分组下查看其共享 Agent 状态并选择