b-1da0c591ea4a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bbc56db9-c361-44f2-97c7-dca69c063bbb","title":"前置：本地 Claude Code 已安装并登录；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：智能体应用的 @ 面板-智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"3dbc7f45-9bfd-4264-910b-1da0c591ea4a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1be53e27-5d3e-4459-9c2b-924ba9f5a4e4","title":"操作：在智能体 Tab 下点击自己名下的 Claude Code"},{"parent":"3dbc7f45-9bfd-4264-910b-1da0c591ea4a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c0f9e630-6405-49c8-bcdf-f178d4b3f477","title":"预期：引用成功插入到输入框；引用块显示 Claude Code 的图标与名称；面板关闭且光标回到引用之后可继续输入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3dbc7f45-9bfd-4264-910b-1da0c591ea4a","title":"🔴【P0】@ 自己的 Claude Code"},{"parent":"7d981865-dcb8-446d-ab8e-f11550a4b05e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"29045e40-b748-4ad3-9138-d9f70dbc1c5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ebeeea7b-35f5-468a-b417-ec9eb249d932","title":"前置：本地 Codex 已安装并登录；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：智能体应用的 @ 面板-智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"29045e40-b748-4ad3-9138-d9f70dbc1c5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ed0241c7-02a3-4a2b-bb45-7070f909423b","title":"操作：在智能体 Tab 下点击自己名下的 Codex"},{"parent":"29045e40-b748-4ad3-9138-d9f70dbc1c5b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9fbb0f3f-3fb4-48c8-9cba-7b32f0c235f7","title":"预期：引用成功插入到输入框；引用块显示 Codex 的图标与名称，不显示为其他 Agent 的图标"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"29045e40-b748-4ad3-9138-d9f70dbc1c5b","title":"🔴【P0】@ 自己的 Codex"},{"parent":"7d981865-dcb8-446d-ab8e-f11550a4b05e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"138f474e-f36e-4e9b-8526-e58e79c88558","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8248b100-3822-4b70-8f64-0dbba407f614","title":"前置：本地 Tutti Agent 已安装并登录；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：智能体应用的 @ 面板-智能体 Tab"},{"parent":"138f474e-f36e-4e9b-8526-e58e79c88558","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b50f1caa-7c5d-4d38-9dd9-36cfc71a853d","title":"操作：在智能体 Tab 下点击自己名下的 Tutti Agent"},{"parent":"138f474e-f36e-4e9b-8526-e58e79c88558","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5bed3ca-9854-4930-bcd2-80dfb77dce4f","title":"预期：引用成功插入到输入框；引用块显示 Tutti Agent 的图标与名称；可正常继续输入指令"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"138f474e-f36e-4e9b-8526-e58e79c88558","title":"🔴【P0】@ 自己的 Tutti Agent