-fc0cc5f7dd87","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4c55d640-751e-402e-95dd-942dd565f9b4","title":"操作：组合消息中某个被 @ 的文件被删除/Agent 在发送时已不可用"},{"parent":"4304c4c7-e561-4fa4-852e-fc0cc5f7dd87","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"741dc85e-e7e4-4aec-9fbb-1c4a807d80a2","title":"预期：明确提示哪一个引用失效，其余有效引用是否仍可执行/是否整体阻止发送，需与产品确认具体策略"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4304c4c7-e561-4fa4-852e-fc0cc5f7dd87","title":"🟠【P1】组合引用中某一项失效"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a3fc5420-c56f-4fb2-a089-be6547347fa1","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"12d7c782-6cf5-4bbf-9110-911a5cd3d840","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e811a893-b300-4cbe-a886-2efc05067633","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2a367b1c-d9b7-44ff-91b1-40d443a2c185","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"058ac929-738b-43d3-abbe-acf2228d4510","title":"操作：一条消息中 @ 两个不同的 Agent（如同时 @Claude Code 和 @Codex）"},{"parent":"2a367b1c-d9b7-44ff-91b1-40d443a2c185","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d1e6e833-ac13-4799-8b30-39dcdcd7b469","title":"预期：是否支持多 Agent 协同响应同一条消息、还是仅最后一个生效，需与产品确认"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2a367b1c-d9b7-44ff-91b1-40d443a2c185","title":"🟡【P2】同类型多次@【待确认】"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e811a893-b300-4cbe-a886-2efc05067633","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"id":"12d7c782-6cf5-4bbf-9110-911a5cd3d840","title":"多类型组合引用"},{"parent":"ed4a227a-122a-4668-9563-c0ed856fda65","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8879302c-85fa-4a8a-bd3a-5a9978c4a107","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f4504c86-b5dd-4db6-945f-0ef620736af4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"80c672de-b313-4096-964d-6fbb08afa5ee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0a8c1fb1-f8f7-4050-ad4e-a4418b535e51","title":"操作：输入 @ 查看任务列表"},{"parent":"80c672de-b313-4096-964d-6fbb08afa5ee","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5986364b-85ed-42dc-8778-58cd65035c80","title":"预期：各状态和颜色显示正确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"80c672de-b313-4096-964d-6fbb08afa5ee","title":"🟠【P1】任务状态展示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"f4504c86-b5dd-4db6-945f-0ef620736af4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fcc14338-f9bb-4d5c-aab7-64ea26