":true,"id":"f4504c86-b5dd-4db6-945f-0ef620736af4","title":"正常场景（5）"},{"parent":"8879302c-85fa-4a8a-bd3a-5a9978c4a107","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3d2a394e-ce19-47f8-8ec6-0cac16a28d3f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"66950d42-43c1-4549-aa05-df89ea5526e8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b2a81877-421d-41a3-9dbc-1715a609c93c","title":"前置：前置：房间内存在任务且任务中心已安装；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板任务条目"},{"parent":"66950d42-43c1-4549-aa05-df89ea5526e8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6ea26787-741b-4539-bd42-f8f919d5ed87","title":"操作：@ 一个任务并发送，点击会话详情中的任务条目"},{"parent":"66950d42-43c1-4549-aa05-df89ea5526e8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b32ce76f-2a97-4943-88dd-350705696b72","title":"预期：@ 面板中展示任务条目且 Agent 能识别被 @ 的任务；任务图标按类型正常着色不显示为黑色；点击任务可跳转到任务详情；不提示该应用未安装在工作区中"},{"parent":"66950d42-43c1-4549-aa05-df89ea5526e8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2fe22e78-d32a-453c-86b8-6d8613bc3675","title":"备注：#25 #241 #243 #134 #350"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"66950d42-43c1-4549-aa05-df89ea5526e8","title":"🔴【P0】任务无法识别与跳转","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3d2a394e-ce19-47f8-8ec6-0cac16a28d3f","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"8879302c-85fa-4a8a-bd3a-5a9978c4a107","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2748db72-4527-4101-a9ba-4e28ab3d0f70","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"52b40943-c977-4cce-82e4-777fe8afe260","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d4e50114-9a4d-492d-a49a-aa576d653bf2","title":"前置：被引用任务在引用后状态发生变化"},{"parent":"52b40943-c977-4cce-82e4-777fe8afe260","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bc177a5a-5d2b-448d-be9b-03543ca5dbef","title":"操作：查看该任务引用并点击跳转"},{"parent":"52b40943-c977-4cce-82e4-777fe8afe260","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76929939-5158-4150-bc50-aba15d62e3db","title":"预期：引用展示的状态与任务实际状态一致，跳转到正确的任务详情"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"52b40943-c977-4cce-82e4-777fe8afe260","title":"🟡【P2】引用状态已变更的任务","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2748db72-4527-4101-a9ba-4e28ab3d0f70","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"