"},{"parent":"d03aae9d-e122-4399-85a2-15dc986477fc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"24ffba80-4060-4a52-b9f9-0d9864c85a7c","title":"预期：“应用”分类高亮，显示所有应用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d03aae9d-e122-4399-85a2-15dc986477fc","title":"🟠【P1】鼠标点击应用分类"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"158b2856-dfc1-42ad-8253-47e546d88893","title":"正常场景（4）"},{"parent":"4fe14cc4-4244-497c-bffa-07a5dd7578be","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9367053a-7fba-47f6-8244-faf2c1047882","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a021ce2b-8235-40ab-8c91-4c4ddf79adcc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"385ed2f7-1f81-4e61-a2d7-c3b3a57c4085","title":"前置：前置：房间内已安装群聊与相关应用；角色：房间成员；入口：@ 面板应用条目"},{"parent":"a021ce2b-8235-40ab-8c91-4c4ddf79adcc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc8f9363-28ae-4d54-a1da-09c5ac1a292b","title":"操作：依次 @ 群聊与其他应用并发送，再连续 @ 多个应用打开"},{"parent":"a021ce2b-8235-40ab-8c91-4c4ddf79adcc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fcd2b505-3cad-48cf-9c8f-8d921fca521f","title":"预期：发送后各应用图标与其实际类型一致；点击可正常打开对应应用；连续打开多个应用时每个页面展示自身内容，不出现空白或显示上一个应用的页面"},{"parent":"a021ce2b-8235-40ab-8c91-4c4ddf79adcc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3151008c-ee53-4d3c-95a2-e3ff0d7aa7c9","title":"备注：#97 #307 #341 #286"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a021ce2b-8235-40ab-8c91-4c4ddf79adcc","title":"🔴【P0】@ 应用图标与打开行为异常"},{"parent":"9367053a-7fba-47f6-8244-faf2c1047882","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6ba74743-d30e-499a-ac0b-f6947d477e0b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b31133d5-4130-4838-8097-73d6c38ae5ec","title":"前置：前置：房间内已安装相关应用；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"6ba74743-d30e-499a-ac0b-f6947d477e0b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3f5031c9-4989-497e-8da2-29afa8babadc","title":"操作：让 Agent 分别 @ VibeDesign 生成网站、@ AI Doc 生成文档，并让 Agent 提供网页链接后打开"},{"parent":"6ba74743-d30e-499a-ac0b-f6947d477e0b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44179b66-10ad-4c51-9970-0fd46a8b8991","title":"预期：应用任务在合理时间内完成并返回结果；不出现服务超时或中途意外停止；应用内界面展示自身内容，不被浏览器端口检测界面覆盖"},{"parent":"6ba74743-d30e-499a-ac0b-f6947d477e0b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c94bc2eb-4f45-4aad-9bff-eb86fc2aa482","tit