-f9a4-447a-846d-89b2ce6d7f37","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4f60835c-6bdc-45ab-80ce-015a01003965","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e94e4bf3-3b43-4b94-99ae-1f91d722a63c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"53851460-e48f-4d3a-a3f2-eb4d468fef20","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6c3484e8-c510-424a-aa24-3fa569c72fd2","title":"操作：给 Agent 一个需要读文件+搜索+改写的复合任务（如「找到所有包含 TODO 的文件并汇总」）"},{"parent":"53851460-e48f-4d3a-a3f2-eb4d468fef20","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"48747bdf-4d0d-4362-9a4c-5a33d73450c3","title":"预期：Agent 依次选择搜索工具与文件写入工具，未跳过必要步骤或调用无关工具"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"53851460-e48f-4d3a-a3f2-eb4d468fef20","title":"🔴【P0】Agent正确识别所需工具"},{"parent":"e94e4bf3-3b43-4b94-99ae-1f91d722a63c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0f282587-ef63-4552-8c52-dbeb884e0e48","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1ca5ec02-e302-4886-8bf9-2dabaa13e1e5","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个需要明确参数的工具调用（如指定路径的文件搜索、指定分支的 Git 操作）"},{"parent":"0f282587-ef63-4552-8c52-dbeb884e0e48","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7fd8fc7f-045c-468e-80a9-0cca0902e2fd","title":"预期：工具调用参数与用户意图一致，无路径/分支等参数误填"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0f282587-ef63-4552-8c52-dbeb884e0e48","title":"🔴【P0】工具调用参数生成正确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e94e4bf3-3b43-4b94-99ae-1f91d722a63c","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"4f60835c-6bdc-45ab-80ce-015a01003965","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8998f059-e375-4e52-980c-c44a8fd3ee34","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5684c14d-f48c-41e7-9d58-2dd0f5a6483d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"37f3c733-8ed6-46d2-b19f-b8986c4df426","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"5684c14d-f48c-41e7-9d58-2dd0f5a6483d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"515b6c6d-84c3-4727-a2b3-309f5d99eff5","title":"操作：下发一个目标不明确的指令（如「处理一下这个文件」但未说明如何处理）"},{"parent":"5684c14d-f48c-41e7-9d58-2dd0f5a6483d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"63b256ba-b8e2-4236-9f7f-0299ae7f955f","title":"预期：Agent 先澄清意图或说明自身理解再执行，不直接猜测并执行破坏性操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5684c14d-f48c-41e7-9d58-2dd0f5a6483d","title":"🟠【P1】任务描述含歧义时的工具选择"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8998f059-e375-4e52-980c-c44a8fd3ee34","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"4f60835c-6bdc-45ab-80ce-015a01003965","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dd3be277-1977-4252-96d0-cfe794ee9132","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"31724242-9dae-4c77-a8c2-3256fdb398f0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"701f8e1c-3e65-45e1-ac17-b5767bd92017","title":"前置：项目中存在超长路径且含特殊字符的文件"},{"parent":"31724242-9dae-4c77-a8c2-3256fdb398f0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f35a43cb-8c78-4820-8cad-06ccf9f436d5","title":"操作：让 Agent 对该文件执行读取与修改"},{"parent":"31724242-9dae-4c77-a8c2-3256fdb398f0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"efa8ba89-2613-4de4-b1da-de1d8c73e540","title":"预期：参数被正确转义与传递，操作命中目标文件，不因特殊字符解析失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"31724242-9dae-4c77-a8c2-3256fdb398f0","title":"🟡【P2】参数中含特殊字符与超长路径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dd3be277-1977-4252-96d0-cfe794ee9132","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4f60835c-6bdc-45ab-80ce-015a01003965","title":"工具选择与参数生成"},{"parent":"7937081b-f9a4-447a-846d-89b2ce6d7f37","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"86ca638e-2783-466f-86ca-af0efbc403a0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"78be2dad-8494-4a42-90d3-f43b1cb746ab","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ea512bb3-6ae7-41ca-a90a-a7ad7e0f570c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b25b1c69-cf3d-44d2-9b6d-224914ff5f9d","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行「先搜索再写入结果文件」这类需要多个工具按顺序配合的任务"},{"parent":"ea512bb3-6ae7-41ca-a90a-a7ad7e0f570c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"241fd6af-135a-4987-b4a6-4e1c1abc5805","title":"预期：工具调用顺序符合任务逻辑（先搜索后写入），不出现空写入或搜索结果丢失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ea512bb3-6ae7-41ca-a90a-a7ad7e0f570c","title":"🔴【P0】多工具链式调用顺序合理"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"78be2dad-8494-4a42-90d3-f43b1cb746ab","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"86ca638e-2783-466f-86ca-af0efbc403a0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"717ace28-975a-4d5c-aee8-aa929b605f76","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0824477d-e602-4ac0-bdd9-e27ebb618937","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9f85887b-2819-4134-9846-fc5af5a1bd37","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"0824477d-e602-4ac0-bdd9-e27ebb618937","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b3fa5c02-02d0-4b9b-970b-2ce8e68758d3","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行「先搜索再写入」的任务，并使搜索步骤失败"},{"parent":"0824477d-e602-4ac0-bdd9-e27ebb618937","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e8f53e48-11f1-4755-92c7-ea9754aff02d","title":"预期：不带着空结果继续写入；明确报告在哪一步失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0824477d-e602-4ac0-bdd9-e27ebb618937","title":"🟠【P1】链路中间步骤失败时的中止"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"717ace28-975a-4d5c-aee8-aa929b605f76","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"86ca638e-2783-466f-86ca-af0efbc403a0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d709af86-2bc9-4480-8005-9b03afd0df45","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8683d9e1-d9cb-4edf-a627-08f278208e4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4044001-5ffe-4261-bebe-6ee986eeca0a","title":"操作：让 Agent 连续读取多个小文件"},{"parent":"8683d9e1-d9cb-4edf-a627-08f278208e4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ed66bc50-c263-4835-bd13-1d1647df6856","title":"预期：工具调用结果稳定，界面进度可追踪"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8683d9e1-d9cb-4edf-a627-08f278208e4b","title":"🟡【P2】高频工具调用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d709af86-2bc9-4480-8005-9b03afd0df45","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"86ca638e-2783-466f-86ca-af0efbc403a0","title":"工具链式调用"},{"parent":"7937081b-f9a4-447a-846d-89b2ce6d7f37","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e83de5e6-3b54-4139-9f88-bc575f2485b4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"facb3e48-34bc-472c-856b-c627c6bc5433","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"09cb45e1-017d-4eb8-8c7b-f31134554632","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9f440f57-735f-436c-bda4-5538c2b612cc","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"09cb45e1-017d-4eb8-8c7b-f31134554632","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a2041b61-8750-4654-85dd-ae46d657c208","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个首选工具不可用但存在替代方案的任务"},{"parent":"09cb45e1-017d-4eb8-8c7b-f31134554632","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d9673322-e26a-4086-b629-0dd6e5431974","title":"预期：Agent 说明首选方案不可用并改用替代方案完成，最终结果正确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"09cb45e1-017d-4eb8-8c7b-f31134554632","title":"🟠【P1】失败后改用替代方案完成任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"facb3e48-34bc-472c-856b-c627c6bc5433","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"e83de5e6-3b54-4139-9f88-bc575f2485b4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"24c1d364-9434-46ca-af62-127f11882b8f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"19a8799f-c6b5-4379-8a3a-13eaa7158306","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3037526d-aa46-44ec-a5e7-b9c233479580","title":"前置：前置：会话已绑定项目；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"19a8799f-c6b5-4379-8a3a-13eaa7158306","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e8487b28-5293-4842-82f0-198ea779de65","title":"操作：发送引用消息或执行 /review uncommitted，观察 bash、ls、python3、git 等命令的执行结果"},{"parent":"19a8799f-c6b5-4379-8a3a-13eaa7158306","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b584ff6b-96a2-4dc3-878b-8cc5649a12c8","title":"预期：命令能在环境中正常执行并返回结果；不出现 cannot execute 或命令在这个环境里不可用；执行失败时输出完整的错误信息，工具调用之间间距正常"},{"parent":"19a8799f-c6b5-4379-8a3a-13eaa7158306","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b61b1fee-5db0-490e-ac15-1cb39d5a3cc9","title":"备注：#251 #424 #264 #267"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"19a8799f-c6b5-4379-8a3a-13eaa7158306","title":"🔴【P0】命令执行返回 cannot execute"},{"parent":"24c1d364-9434-46ca-af62-127f11882b8f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d8fa82ce-1d16-4db1-9209-1fab927862c8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e9d57c5-a299-4119-abcd-40b31aed3e71","title":"操作：让某个工具调用刻意失败（如网络工具断网、命令不存在），观察 Agent 后续处理"},{"parent":"d8fa82ce-1d16-4db1-9209-1fab927862c8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"716c34a5-6d0d-4a61-ab00-bb5d4ac83155","title":"预期：Agent 采取合理回退（换用替代工具/告知用户/降级处理），不是原地卡死或静默重复报错"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d8fa82ce-1d16-4db1-9209-1fab927862c8","title":"🔴【P0】工具调用失败后的回退策略"},{"parent":"24c1d364-9434-46ca-af62-127f11882b8f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c10f2d94-9ff2-478c-9b4b-678e7d469b06","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e154f40-19b0-4c24-ad77-22fdb3076832","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行的操作会持续失败"},{"parent":"c10f2d94-9ff2-478c-9b4b-678e7d469b06","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"141af7b4-675b-46f4-b47a-a02683a4952b","title":"预期：达到重试上限后停止并报告失败，不无限循环消耗资源"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c10f2d94-9ff2-478c-9b4b-678e7d469b06","title":"🟠【P1】Agent反复尝试同一失败操作"},{"parent":"24c1d364-9434-46ca-af62-127f11882b8f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e73a692e-12e3-47a4-bed8-3e98638487ea","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"da049dfd-2d0e-4705-baf7-f4140ba012e8","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行不存在的命令"},{"parent":"e73a692e-12e3-47a4-bed8-3e98638487ea","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5930512-7c1c-4232-9d08-e9f070066bd6","title":"预期：显示命令失败原因和退出码，不伪装成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e73a692e-12e3-47a4-bed8-3e98638487ea","title":"🟠【P1】命令执行失败"},{"parent":"24c1d364-9434-46ca-af62-127f11882b8f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"05288e99-41d3-4170-a995-e8c657bdbba8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f53cca4c-bd37-4bf2-8bce-800a0c211c69","title":"操作：模拟文件读取或浏览器工具失败"},{"parent":"05288e99-41d3-4170-a995-e8c657bdbba8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cc2ffae8-7a84-4be0-8e38-301b87ceeb6a","title":"预期：Agent 说明工具失败并尝试合理恢复或请求用户介入"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"05288e99-41d3-4170-a995-e8c657bdbba8","title":"🟡【P2】工具调用失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"24c1d364-9434-46ca-af62-127f11882b8f","title":"异常场景（5）"},{"parent":"e83de5e6-3b54-4139-9f88-bc575f2485b4","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f2605c72-9360-4fd3-8fcb-c57e8eb65686","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9f7cb4d5-affb-4408-8881-ba80dbfd36b8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7446b1e0-1ace-4ab9-acf7-aee964f9a99f","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"9f7cb4d5-affb-4408-8881-ba80dbfd36b8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"79f9c55c-903b-42af-823a-b88b5091b06c","title":"操作：构造一个多个工具都会失败的任务"},{"parent":"9f7cb4d5-affb-4408-8881-ba80dbfd36b8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7ca7c760-1b8f-4a08-a104-b1f416af95e7","title":"预期：在达到重试上限后停止并汇总失败原因，不无限循环消耗额度"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9f7cb4d5-affb-4408-8881-ba80dbfd36b8","title":"🟡【P2】连续多个工具相继失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f2605c72-9360-4fd3-8fcb-c57e8eb65686","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e83de5e6-3b54-4139-9f88-bc575f2485b4","title":"工具调用失败与回退"},{"parent":"7937081b-f9a4-447a-846d-89b2ce6d7f37","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aa74120a-375d-4eea-8438-6610af6853f1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6b061728-7553-4a64-b013-7aef4e314def","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2b8b5984-c850-4143-a5b6-2d591998b762","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d633fdb9-645e-4edd-8f0d-c1f18ea58d4d","title":"前置：当前权限模式下部分工具在白名单内"},{"parent":"2b8b5984-c850-4143-a5b6-2d591998b762","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5de85779-292a-4e58-a5fc-c2dd39d7d549","title":"操作：让 Agent 调用一个白名单内的工具"},{"parent":"2b8b5984-c850-4143-a5b6-2d591998b762","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5d36ead8-1075-449f-ab51-4294416e149b","title":"预期：调用直接执行不额外拦截，结果正常返回"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2b8b5984-c850-4143-a5b6-2d591998b762","title":"🔴【P0】白名单内工具正常调用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6b061728-7553-4a64-b013-7aef4e314def","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"aa74120a-375d-4eea-8438-6610af6853f1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"33ea26d0-489c-43bd-a9f5-41004eee2bca","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"037ada7f-7578-4a8b-890f-9bb97cdd63d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"10f066b0-e775-4dc4-a2d2-ac49ead8cdbe","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行删除大量文件/目录的指令"},{"parent":"037ada7f-7578-4a8b-890f-9bb97cdd63d4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4dddd49f-a15d-454d-bcbc-4a5fc70e3448","title":"预期：执行前有明确的风险提示或权限确认，不在无感知情况下批量删除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"037ada7f-7578-4a8b-890f-9bb97cdd63d4","title":"🔴【P0】破坏性操作缺少二次确认"},{"parent":"33ea26d0-489c-43bd-a9f5-41004eee2bca","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b826d9e8-8dcd-435e-b8f4-7e89ea2ec0b8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"30875eb7-2d8e-4f54-b39b-3694081d8a8e","title":"操作：让 Agent 尝试调用超出当前权限/白名单范围的工具（如受限环境下的网络请求工具）"},{"parent":"b826d9e8-8dcd-435e-b8f4-7e89ea2ec0b8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5db9721e-481c-4cfe-8f4c-8261208f4b72","title":"预期：受限工具调用被拦截并提示原因，不静默失败或绕过限制"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b826d9e8-8dcd-435e-b8f4-7e89ea2ec0b8","title":"🟡【P2】工具白名单限制生效"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"33ea26d0-489c-43bd-a9f5-41004eee2bca","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"aa74120a-375d-4eea-8438-6610af6853f1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"85d4ba3d-4587-4cdf-9f0f-4757060b21f1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6e3e3c7b-031d-40e2-a223-f87fa52466bd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7849251d-1512-4c2d-9260-e89897a06f7f","title":"前置：会话正在执行且已授权若干工具"},{"parent":"6e3e3c7b-031d-40e2-a223-f87fa52466bd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae1f542f-3095-4021-8e53-db0ee5c613ff","title":"操作：在执行过程中把权限模式切换为更严格的模式"},{"parent":"6e3e3c7b-031d-40e2-a223-f87fa52466bd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9077d47c-a8e9-4f01-b781-ef684c217f32","title":"预期：后续调用按新模式判定，已在执行的调用有明确的完成或中止结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6e3e3c7b-031d-40e2-a223-f87fa52466bd","title":"🟡【P2】会话中途收紧权限模式"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"85d4ba3d-4587-4cdf-9f0f-4757060b21f1","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aa74120a-375d-4eea-8438-6610af6853f1","title":"工具权限与白名单"},{"parent":"7937081b-f9a4-447a-846d-89b2ce6d7f37","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4f0071f6-b3b3-4e55-ba30-99f7f5cd7f6c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4b262dec-fd23-4690-8351-e8ebcc23ef1c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ff41e281-b769-4144-84cc-300f75e340cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f6cb80e8-3732-488b-bf9e-78ddd0fa62e5","title":"前置：Agent 已完成若干次工具调用"},{"parent":"ff41e281-b769-4144-84cc-300f75e340cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b76c8918-9b2f-43d7-9f67-a7c147639f9e","title":"操作：在会话详情中展开某次工具调用"},{"parent":"ff41e281-b769-4144-84cc-300f75e340cd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"189f09e9-9fc3-4090-949d-4213b3b90a6b","title":"预期：展示工具名、入参与返回结果，层级清晰内容可读"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ff41e281-b769-4144-84cc-300f75e340cd","title":"🔴【P0】工具调用详情展开查看"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4b262dec-fd23-4690-8351-e8ebcc23ef1c","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"4f0071f6-b3b3-4e55-ba30-99f7f5cd7f6c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ec82c20d-5b8e-4ab6-a08b-c694ba7e773e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c3c6cd21-a1c1-44ad-8bde-a5d323fe3ee7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6886847a-1351-4050-9b08-c85ac3a1eeb7","title":"前置：前置：会话可正常执行；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情工具调用区"},{"parent":"c3c6cd21-a1c1-44ad-8bde-a5d323fe3ee7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8550414c-0252-490e-9adb-c870e77901e6","title":"操作：让 Agent 读取被 @ 的他