乎不可能有结果的随机字符串"},{"parent":"182dcbfb-046a-47f3-8b85-4678274991b3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5dc94f1a-00c3-452e-a06e-8f1b70fa97d2","title":"预期：明确告知未找到相关结果，不编造内容也不返回无关结果冒充"},{"parent":"182dcbfb-046a-47f3-8b85-4678274991b3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"73b8bb61-4e2f-4ed0-9723-86dada131663","title":"备注：附件3 CC-023"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"182dcbfb-046a-47f3-8b85-4678274991b3","title":"🟠【P1】无结果关键词的处理","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"b07c5521-8bf0-4c88-b41a-aa3f99f068b9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9669ac3a-124f-4739-baa9-1878a1c92dbb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c56c9fb-d30b-42fd-a8b8-413df0efe4de","title":"前置：断开网络连接"},{"parent":"9669ac3a-124f-4739-baa9-1878a1c92dbb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a6945f0c-7287-4832-910d-ed59a97b178d","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一次联网搜索"},{"parent":"9669ac3a-124f-4739-baa9-1878a1c92dbb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c1315155-f8a0-45ce-9c77-4ebaced3b4bc","title":"预期：明确提示网络不可用并给出重试入口，不长时间无响应也不编造结果"},{"parent":"9669ac3a-124f-4739-baa9-1878a1c92dbb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e86d54ae-03bc-4601-9080-d31e80ce7031","title":"备注：附件3 CC-023"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9669ac3a-124f-4739-baa9-1878a1c92dbb","title":"🟠【P1】网络不可用时的搜索","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b07c5521-8bf0-4c88-b41a-aa3f99f068b9","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"bf3461fb-fbb0-4ba6-9079-a90d91ba753d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a1e09c58-387b-4d7f-87b0-134678423579","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f2b7c937-39b7-417c-b573-a9d15a0a3ff2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"beb47470-0f75-481c-90c3-ea1ad23aa3d5","title":"前置：网络可用"},{"parent":"f2b7c937-39b7-417c-b573-a9d15a0a3ff2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3eb53e44-3a3d-4c6b-b365-bd7ba7c6bc46","title":"操作：让 Agent 用一段很长且含特殊符号的关键词搜索"},{"parent":"f2b7c937-39b7-417c-b573-a9d15a0a3ff2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4562158c-53ba-4ec8-88e8-8014f1598038","title":"预期：正常发起搜索并返回结果或明确说明无结果，不因关键词格式报错"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f2b7c937-39b7-417c-b573-a9d15a0a3ff2","title":"🟡【P2】超长或含特殊字符的搜索词","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a1e09c58-387b-4d7f-87b0-134678423579","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bf3461fb-fbb0-4ba6-9079-a90d91ba753d","title":"WebSearch 工具"},{"parent":"d1ae4c91-ed42-444f-810d-b3929b2656c5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5a5bb2fd-c531-4690-ae22-91539b1efbc5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ca77f9d2-7361-4900-a1c0-de3045a55007","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"90fb99a7-476f-477a-b750-a6368f13ae16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"557a8592-c737-4381-bea2-08cd30dfb8ee","title":"前置：已存在一个运行中的任务"},{"parent":"90fb99a7-476f-477a-b750-a6368f13ae16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"90da9616-ac42-4584-84b4-fb627c0b32cf","title":"操作：让 Agent 停止该任务并读取任务输出"},{"parent":"90fb99a7-476f-477a-b750-a6368f13ae16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d94acaed-a308-4f34-aadc-349671b5bbb3","title":"预期：停止后不再产生新输出；已产生的任务输出可完整读取"},{"parent":"90fb99a7-476f-477a-b750-a6368f13ae16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"021d11d9-a4f4-4d08-b7b2-4bb22ed0e26c","title":"备注：来源 附件3 CC-021；附件3 CC-021"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"90fb99a7-476f-477a-b750-a6368f13ae16","title":"🟠【P1】任务停止与输出读取"},{"parent":"ca77f9d2-7361-4900-a1c0-de3045a55007","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2a2ac267-0d8f-468a-95f7-d05790a1aced","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9ee4b49a-44c7-42d2-a470-39a61dd88c0d","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"2a2ac267-0d8f-468a-95f7-d05790a1aced","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c93c3528-0621-421a-9a82-7efa56a7764b","title":"操作：让 Agent 依次创建任务、查询该任务、列出任务列表、更新任务属性"},{"parent":"2a2ac267-0d8f-468a-95f7-d05790a1aced","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d14800dc-b8dc-4da3-b4a2-3524c6fb8f94","title":"预期：各步骤均成功；任务状态按创建到运行正确流转；列表中能查到该任务"},{"parent":"2a2ac267-0d8f-468a-95f7-d05790a1aced","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ab1dab48-7945-436a-aa7e-8ad88efa201b","title":"备注：来源 附件3 CC-021；附件3 CC-021"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2a2ac267-0d8f-468a-95f7-d05790a1aced","title":"🟠【P1】任务创建、查询与更新","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ca77f9d2-7361-4900-a1c0-de3045a55007","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"5a5bb2fd-c531-4690-ae22-91539b1efbc5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6d74b871-dcff-4d13-8040-153870740e45","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"56fac678-da8e-440c-97ca-5056c8b83271","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1e6349d6-2e6c-43ea-b2f7-1a33378afda9","title":"前置：会话可正常执行"},{"parent":"56fac678-da8e-440c-97ca-5056c8b83271","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"16833118-411f-4e6e-8eff-485b90851e75","title":"操作：让 Agent 查询或停止一个不存在的任务 ID"},{"parent":"56fac678-da8e-440c-97ca-5056c8b83271","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1f84fad3-457a-44f2-934f-27b2942d9e2a","title":"预期：返回任务不存在的明确提示，不报未捕获的底层错误"},{"parent":"56fac678-da8e-440c-97ca-5056c8b83271","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7a7a6f69-a46f-4cb7-b937-ac604bff6a55","title":"备注：附件3 CC-021"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"56fac678-da8e-440c-97ca-5056c8b83271","title":"🟠【P1】操作不存在的任务","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6d74b871-dcff-4d13-8040-153870740e45","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"5a5bb2fd-c531-4690-ae22-91539b1efbc5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bb198fde-1057-43b5-b936-9578b13db822","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0d687a1d-62d1-4f83-b1fd-6c7d3831ff0a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2022f790-e82e-4368-9e6e-9c232f98d632","title":"前置：已创建数十个任务"},{"parent":"0d687a1d-62d1-4f83-b1fd-6c7d3831ff0a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fee185e1-c0d8-44c1-98a6-8ed0719403a5","title":"操作：让 Agent 列出并查询其中指定任务"},{"parent":"0d687a1d-62d1-4f83-b1fd-6c7d3831ff0a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ec5968ca-d466-4923-9a2b-658b9d6fdce6","title":"预期：列表可完整获取，指定任务能被准确查到，不出现遗漏或串号"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0d687a1d-62d1-4f83-b1fd-6c7d3831ff0a","title":"🟡【P2】大量任务并存时的列表与查询"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bb198fde-1057-43b5-b936-9578b13db822","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5a