],"collapsed":true,"id":"16edeb58-90ce-46e8-a7cc-d64424c8f24e","title":"🔴【P0】调用 write / edit / apply_patch工具显示文件卡片"},{"parent":"76b9c860-b540-4eb0-b62e-a4dff10fa059","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2d94d97a-2a69-416e-8c18-3608b0243296","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aac69768-c6c8-4443-92bd-d01f1ff466a2","title":"前置：前置：会话已绑定项目；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"2d94d97a-2a69-416e-8c18-3608b0243296","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8329422a-5143-4d82-a91d-4ae2a5fbc6d3","title":"操作：先让 Agent 修改单个文件，再让其一次修改多个文件，查看文件变更卡片"},{"parent":"2d94d97a-2a69-416e-8c18-3608b0243296","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5ba671be-c9f4-444f-b7d5-a7dc29d37eb7","title":"预期：两种情况均生成变更卡片并准确展示变更文件、diff 与状态；多文件时逐个可展开；卡片中的文件数量与实际变更一致"},{"parent":"2d94d97a-2a69-416e-8c18-3608b0243296","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e35dc581-2ab2-4f25-b23a-0495a40fb4ec","title":"备注：附件3 CC-027"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2d94d97a-2a69-416e-8c18-3608b0243296","title":"🟠【P1】单文件与多文件变更展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"76b9c860-b540-4eb0-b62e-a4dff10fa059","title":"正常场景（8）"},{"parent":"02facafd-11a2-4efa-ae59-0830e28f5b76","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"adc154fa-a969-4858-a966-7d3956b9e7bc","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c1764970-72a8-494f-b2dc-9affdb514deb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"832b24e5-7dce-41d8-9603-9729485fcd7a","title":"前置：目标目录无写权限"},{"parent":"c1764970-72a8-494f-b2dc-9affdb514deb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1855de21-d6fd-4cff-ba59-84b845b52384","title":"操作：让 Agent 向该目录写入文件"},{"parent":"c1764970-72a8-494f-b2dc-9affdb514deb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f530f7c2-973d-4c4d-adb0-3cbc9532a58d","title":"预期：不生成表示成功的变更卡片；以失败信息呈现实际结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c1764970-72a8-494f-b2dc-9affdb514deb","title":"🟠【P1】写入失败时不生成成功卡片"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"adc154fa-a969-4858-a966-7d3956b9e7bc","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"02facafd-11a2-4efa-ae59-0830e28f5b76","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"916f175d-075a-476a-9bcb-35285b405f7b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8159add6-84b8-4a32-ae06-6d1f730ef27a","