{"parent":"bbb47d50-446b-4a4a-a8f1-71361e6139de","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6776e210-280d-489a-9a29-06681e668fa0","title":"预期：卡片中的文件数量与实际写入的文件数量一致，含空格与中文路径的文件均被计入；点击每个文件均可打开对应内容"},{"parent":"bbb47d50-446b-4a4a-a8f1-71361e6139de","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e14af6a1-7d25-41d3-aae9-e187fb4bfecb","title":"备注：附件3 CC-014"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bbb47d50-446b-4a4a-a8f1-71361e6139de","title":"🔴【P0】卡片文件数量与实际写入不一致"},{"parent":"4fd41b72-0b56-489b-b313-e6ef6f4eca7d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9684fced-2f55-4de4-932a-be4340cf3bd5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"69500fb9-34fd-4622-b11e-05d7d4c9d2e7","title":"前置：前置：会话可正常执行；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情"},{"parent":"9684fced-2f55-4de4-932a-be4340cf3bd5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cd23b5b9-a72a-4ff4-a2f9-44172e42ff11","title":"操作：让 Agent 使用写入与编辑工具各修改一个文件，查看文件卡片及其变更详情，隔较长时间后重新打开该会话"},{"parent":"9684fced-2f55-4de4-932a-be4340cf3bd5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"24537b0c-9fa9-4418-879b-ff48385d527c","title":"预期：每次文件写入与编辑都生成文件卡片；卡片显示实际的新增与删除行数而非 +0 -0；可展开查看具体变更内容；再次打开历史会话时卡片与变更详情仍然存在"},{"parent":"9684fced-2f55-4de4-932a-be4340cf3bd5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"245d8188-b178-4541-a869-fdf15f7978dc","title":"备注：#38 #52 #66 #49 #81"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9684fced-2f55-4de4-932a-be4340cf3bd5","title":"🔴【P0】文件卡片缺失或变更数字为空"},{"parent":"4fd41b72-0b56-489b-b313-e6ef6f4eca7d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"280daf12-0a1a-4c49-a9ae-ef9ce2b73260","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6b7ffa8f-f333-49ae-8072-c79c84d7933c","title":"前置：前置：Agent 在执行过程中创建后又删除了某文件；角色：房间成员；入口：会话详情文件卡片"},{"parent":"280daf12-0a1a-4c49-a9ae-ef9ce2b73260","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"830247bf-4313-42d3-8e91-4e409c120c99","title":"操作：任务结束后查看文件卡片列表"},{"parent":"280daf12-0a1a-4c49-a9ae-ef9ce2b73260","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"32ccffca-19b3-4f96-8692-0a3860c447c5","title":"预期：已被删除的文件不再展示在文件卡片中，或明确标记为已删除；点击时不出现读取不到文件的报错"},{"parent":"280daf12-0a1a-4c49-a9ae-ef9ce2b73260","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f0a8d761-e643-4fc1-849c-32c36a2317f7","title":"备注：#29"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"280daf12-0a1a-4c49-a9ae-ef9ce2b73260","title":"🔴【P0】运行中被删除的文件仍显示在卡片上"},{"parent":"4fd41b72-0b56-489b-b313-e6ef6f4eca7d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"010a9679-cdb7-4bc4-a5b0-20a99a6f9116","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"efd04d50-bce7-4950-be10-08660ec2f8e4","title":"操作：让 Agent 修改图片或二进制文件"},{"parent":"010a9679-cdb7-4bc4-a5b0-20a99a6f9116","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ca7f1925-226f-40f0-80cc-111a7aaa68a9","title":"预期：不展示乱码 diff，显示二进制文件变更提示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"010a9679-cdb7-4bc4-a5b0-20a99a6f9116","title":"🟠【P1】二进制文件变更"},{"parent":"4fd41b72-0b56-489b-b313-e6ef6f4eca7d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0a8727c0-c34b-4f39-915d-0cee76227a8c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5943e7bf-5d5c-4b54-8ea6-c7c8c2a305b3","title":"操作：模拟 diff 解析异常"},{"parent":"0a8727c0-c34b-4f39-915d-0cee76227a8c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1a2d5a61-ddfe-404e-aa18-25ba9061c282","title":"预期：展示原始变更摘要或错误提示，不影响对话继续"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0a8727c0-c34b-4f39-915d-0cee76227a8c","title":"🟡【P2】变更解析失败"},{"parent":"4fd41b72-0b56-489b-b313-e6ef6f4eca7d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b41cfe29-f1d8-4aeb-9b9e-b011d7796bad","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"35c460f8-0e70-4899-aa7c-95c413402f66","title":"操作：文件无读取权限时点击 diff"},{"parent":"b41cfe29-f1d8-4aeb-9b9e-b011d7796bad","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"254a2040-4f50-42cd-97c4-bf2ecfe217b1","title":"预期：提示无权限，不泄露文件内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b41cfe29-f1d8-4aeb-9b9e-b011d7796bad","title":"🟡【P2】无权限查看 diff"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4fd41b72-0b56-489b-b313-e6ef6f4eca7d","title":"异常场景（6）"},{"parent":"44fc2f1d-8fec-412a-8492-c65ac40e881a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9b502476-a4ee-46b6-9b2e-016e878b4ee3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8cfe695b-2fb7-41ce-b908-c8efe2ee4d88","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f6d30ffe-fc07-4a55-9293-f0d43c8b6d8c","title":"操作：修改超过 5000 行的文件"},{"parent":"8cfe695b-2fb7-41ce-b908-c8efe2ee4d88","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bc256d2e-5b2f-4069-81c7-520106b59173","title":"预期：diff 支持折叠、懒加载或提示过大，页面不卡死"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8cfe695b-2fb7-41ce-b908-c8efe2ee4d88","title":"🟡【P2】超大 diff"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9b502476-a4ee-46b6-9b2e-016e878b4ee3","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"44fc2f1d-8fec-412a-8492-c65ac40e881a","title":"卡片内容与 diff"},{"parent":"e9e5f9ed-3b8e-462f-a34e-04401755a2b8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9fd06faa-277a-44f6-9ad8-4225bb5c5556","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6704a567-de5b-4fe0-8b84-a6d9b7134e41","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5ff5cb33-3ed4-402b-af6a-a59fc60bf714","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09174d79-5c51-4868-af26-ada9918b0c13","title":"操作：1.先打开文件系统窗口 → 2.点击 AI 对话中的文件卡片"},{"parent":"5ff5cb33-3ed4-402b-af6a-a59fc60bf714","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9ddc3e42-b640-49a3-86fd-43547f6717c1","title":"预期：文件系统窗口激活并置顶；自动定位到对应文件并高亮；若支持 diff 则打开 diff 视图"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5ff5cb33-3ed4-402b-af6a-a59fc60bf714","title":"🔴【P0】点击卡片跳转（文件窗口已开）"},{"parent":"6704a567-de5b-4fe0-8b84-a6d9b7134e41","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5cae8bff-c116-4efe-866b-e8439868c715","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e8e541a-2113-438d-87e3-e92da8a0076c","title":"操作：1.关闭所有文件系统窗口 → 2.点击文件卡片"},{"parent":"5cae8bff-c116-4efe-866b-e8439868c715","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5ab81e8c-3683-4b09-ab72-2382ee750309","title":"预期：文件系统窗口打开并置顶；自动定位到对应文件并高亮；若支持 diff 则打开 diff 视图"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5cae8bff-c116-4efe-866b-e8439868c715","title":"🔴【P0】点击卡片跳转（文件窗口未开）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6704a567-de5b-4fe0-8b84-a6d9b7134e41","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"9fd06faa-277a-44f6-9ad8-4225bb5c5556","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4f77d857-2b35-4aa8-94a8-9a9bf96baf0e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"65cca2d5-0834-4c67-b8cc-7f8d42841398","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1f847a3c-b444-4512-9488-5bd6176b4072","title":"操作：卡片生成后在本地删除目标文件，再点击打开"},{"parent":"65cca2d5-0834-4c67-b8cc-7f8d42841398","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b2b1cf80-72b4-47e7-bbf8-5cc7db6ec150","title":"预期：提示无法打开文件夹 这个会话原本的工作目录在本机上已经找不到了"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"65cca2d5-0834-4c67-b8cc-7f8d42841398","title":"🟠【P1】文件已不存在"},{"parent":"4f77d857-2b35-4aa8-94a8-9a9bf96baf0e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2dd0616b-1a20-4f89-9e20-1954d064053c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea7c5928-24d2-496c-b7d2-9e96ce53a63b","title":"操作：卡片生成后在本地删除目标文件，再点击打开"},{"parent":"2dd0616b-1a20-4f89-9e20-1954d064053c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bb96161d-828b-44e7-972b-9b58d455c357","title":"预期：提示文件不存在并刷新卡片状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2dd0616b-1a20-4f89-9e20-1954d064053c","title":"🟠【P1】文件已不存在"},{"parent":"4f77d857-2b35-4aa8-94a8-9a9bf96baf0e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"861be11c-941c-4282-9e55-861740445ad9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"742f2ed0-1070-4628-84f5-3fd2a006bc74","title":"操作：让 AI 操作路径含中文或空格的文件"},{"parent":"861be11c-941c-4282-9e55-861740445ad9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"138be82b-d779-42bc-8f97-08da87b8af27","title":"预期：卡片正确显示完整路径；点击跳转不因路径解析失败而报错"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"861be11c-941c-4282-9e55-861740445ad9","title":"🟠【P1】文件路径含特殊字符或中文"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4f77d857-2b35-4aa8-94a8-9a9bf96baf0e","title":"异常场景（3）"},{"parent":"9fd06faa-277a-44f6-9ad8-4225bb5c5556","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7bdebb38-36d9-4b7a-969c-26d0de59ff40","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"456c962d-90a2-4231-ac06-b14e948bdd01","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"685cacb0-77e2-4ea6-a1f1-d1336cec7638","title":"操作：同时修改 src/config.json 和 test/config.json"},{"parent":"456c962d-90a2-4231-ac06-b14e948bdd01","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"65c89d76-cd87-4d5f-b58d-09f71cde2b9e","title":"预期：卡片能区分完整路径，不混淆文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"456c962d-90a2-4231-ac06-b14e948bdd01","title":"🟡【P2】同名不同目录文件"},{"parent":"7bdebb38-36d9-4b7a-969c-26d0de59ff40","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bf810449-4b92-4968-823a-606c654cba83","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4367a142-560e-484f-a924-b7971d3877da","title":"操作：变更深层目录中的长路径文件"},{"parent":"bf810449-4b92-4968-823a-606c654cba83","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2e376103-4883-4442-84d0-087404f45dea","title":"预期：路径合理截断，完整路径可复制或查看"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bf810449-4b92-4968-823a-606c654cba83","title":"🟡【P2】超长路径文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7bdebb38-36d9-4b7a-969c-26d0de59ff40","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9fd06faa-277a-44f6-9ad8-4225bb5c5556","title":"卡片跳转"},{"parent":"e9e5f9ed-3b8e-462f-a34e-04401755a2b8","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"acfa0b25-34f8-4089-951e-0b31e07ab1b7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ecd374d4-675c-4dae-bed8-d547d5a3ed7b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5b44948a-7383-4100-a723-663afb728fa7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6ad8f723-39ba-4ea5-b127-fe622e0ea362","title":"前置：Agent 依次修改了多个文件"},{"parent":"5b44948a-7383-4100-a723-663afb728fa7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"954f3bb5-1fdf-4ee5-b042-ee3742e38041","title":"操作：查看消息区中的卡片列表"},{"parent":"5b44948a-7383-4100-a723-663afb728fa7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2dae2b16-3604-4ce1-9fbd-fa72edcf9e2f","title":"预期：每个文件各一张卡片，顺序与实际操作顺序一致，内容互不覆盖"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5b44948a-7383-4100-a723-663afb728fa7","title":"🟠【P1】多个卡片的顺序与独立性"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ecd374d4-675c-4dae-bed8-d547d5a3ed7b","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"acfa0b25-34f8-4089-951e-0b31e07ab1b7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"20cc598e-5d9b-461c-8747-d12046881004","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f6002900-f6be-410a-86f9-06a2f03f8c21","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a124ac08-d6d2-4ff6-a9ae-d1c4706613f0","title":"操作：让 AI 执行一个涉及多文件修改的任务"},{"parent":"f6002900-f6be-410a-86f9-06a2f03f8c21","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"93588906-c4cd-4c2c-867c-bbc5fd11468e","title":"预期：每个文件各有一张卡片；卡片不重叠不错乱；顺序与 AI 操作顺序一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f6002900-f6be-410a-86f9-06a2f03f8c21","title":"🟡【P2】AI 快速连续改多个文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"20cc598e-5d9b-461c-8747-d12046881004","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"acfa0b25-34f8-4089-951e-0b31e07ab1b7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"39291df3-9bac-46b6-92ae-67ca32d2c034","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6e4dfdd6-0315-4cb5-af18-ed7b35fe0ede","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4721b759-34bb-4299-82cf-7592532a0350","title":"操作：让 AI 多次修改同一文件"},{"parent":"6e4dfdd6-0315-4cb5-af18-ed7b35fe0ede","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7cade6c9-49ca-4276-b848-2fd411849920","title":"预期：每次修改各产生一张卡片；历史卡片不被覆盖；各卡片 diff 内容独立"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6e4dfdd6-0315-4cb5-af18-ed7b35fe0ede","title":"🟡【P2】同一文件被 AI 改动多次"},{"parent":"39291df3-9bac-46b6-92ae-67ca32d2c034","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4d26889a-b31d-4c86-affe-762bc7427458","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6709f658-b845-4904-9ef2-19dd0840bf74","title":"操作：一次任务变更 100 个文件"},{"parent":"4d26889a-b31d-4c86-affe-762bc7427458","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"94468c1e-4fe8-4bc2-a99f-75501d9c44b1","title":"预期：卡片列表可折叠和滚动，性能稳定"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4d26889a-b31d-4c86-affe-762bc7427458","title":"🟡【P2】大量文件卡片"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"39291df3-9bac-46b6-92ae-67ca32d2c034","title":"边界场景（2）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"acfa0b25-34f8-4089-951e-0b31e07ab1b7","title":"卡片异常与边界"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"e9e5f9ed-3b8e-462f-a34e-04401755a2b8","title":"5.5 变更卡片展示"},{"parent":"bdf50357-f876-4ee3-b76a-bbe899c8ccbd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"395c7549-fb8d-4ef7-9463-7dd722756e54","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6b11e99b-8fe9-4138-a175-825980797681","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"450f1ceb-0421-4beb-85a8-8206aa34066e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"50a205b9-cbd5-4c35-acec-a720c2731f85","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3a7a00b4-b8d9-49a9-98e5-1f798cf03b71","title":"操作：让 Agent 分析项目中模块间的引用/依赖关系（如某文件 import 了哪些模块）"},{"parent":"50a205b9-cbd5-4c35-acec-a720c2731f85","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5272d749-6c8b-4191-88af-c69596cca3e9","title":"预期：Agent 给出的依赖关系与实际代码引用一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"50a205b9-cbd5-4c35-acec-a720c2731f85","title":"🔴【P0】理解项目依赖关系"},{"parent":"450f1ceb-0421-4beb-85a8-8206aa34066e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"41412228-7b65-44c5-b631-9c52d9ac198a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6aa98072-ec7d-416d-a0e5-732432d0435b","title":"操作：打开一个多层级目录的项目，让 Agent 描述项目结构"},{"parent":"41412228-7b65-44c5-b631-9c52d9ac198a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9a40eb55-608c-4845-bd5e-824166ae2305","title":"预期：Agent 准确描述实际目录/文件结构，未遗漏关键目录或编造不存在的文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"41412228-7b65-44c5-b631-9c52d9ac198a","title":"🔴【P0】理解项目目录结构"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"450f1ceb-0421-4beb-85a8-8206aa34066e","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"6b11e99b-8fe9-4138-a175-825980797681","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c3992833-8b90-41f5-93f5-a9dedae05842","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8dae94aa-74dc-48c6-9219-bc9b284bbe03","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc09fe18-32f7-4f1f-8c85-767fb41ba1f9","title":"前置：打开一个空目录作为项目"},{"parent":"8dae94aa-74dc-48c6-9219-bc9b284bbe03","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1fdb58cc-ddd9-4224-b8ad-4d7500be000b","title":"操作：让 Agent 描述项目结构"},{"parent":"8dae94aa-74dc-48c6-9219-bc9b284bbe03","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"beba0551-7368-4b13-89a2-8ccde17ae1df","title":"预期：如实说明项目为空，不编造不存在的目录与文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8dae94aa-74dc-48c6-9219-bc9b284bbe03","title":"🟠【P1】空项目或无源码目录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c3992833-8b90-41f5-93f5-a9dedae05842","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"6b11e99b-8fe9-4138-a175-825980797681","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e2f1d31e-4a15-4695-9210-05edf02466dd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7b543542-deba-460c-ac1d-d2d2d341bef5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"15ea9c1d-ca57-4d76-92ac-dadb4e3d1840","title":"前置：打开一个包含数万文件的项目"},{"parent":"7b543542-deba-460c-ac1d-d2d2d341bef5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d523b72a-d8b8-45e2-9dca-073d2c196054","title":"操作：让 Agent 描述项目整体结构"},{"parent":"7b543542-deba-460c-ac1d-d2d2d341bef5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"513800a5-7948-45aa-bf83-b66d1cda576d","title":"预期：给出分层的结构概览且关键目录不遗漏，响应时间可接受"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7b543542-deba-460c-ac1d-d2d2d341bef5","title":"🟡【P2】超大规模项目的结构描述"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e2f1d31e-4a15-4695-9210-05edf02466dd","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6b11e99b-8fe9-4138-a175-825980797681","title":"项目结构与依赖识别"},{"parent":"395c7549-fb8d-4ef7-9463-7dd722756e54","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7b83ed37-44ce-4126-bf5d-c49899510b75","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"77e54056-fd0a-4ce8-bc49-3cf175d65305","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a32ce539-e75a-4bfc-932a-e02290913f72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"da71fc8a-8663-4253-8b5b-eb26629efb6d","title":"操作：让 Agent 阅读 package.json/requirements.txt 等配置文件并回答其中的依赖或脚本配置"},{"parent":"a32ce539-e75a-4bfc-932a-e02290913f72","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"46e9f1dc-4d0d-4c36-ba43-838e54a6287b","title":"预期：回答内容与配置文件实际内容一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a32ce539-e75a-4bfc-932a-e02290913f72","title":"🔴【P0】理解项目配置文件"},{"parent":"77e54056-fd0a-4ce8-bc49-3cf175d65305","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"fbaa0a4f-e7a6-445b-a509-e56e1c763bdd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5fa8694b-0329-419b-92a8-b95361f8c447","title":"操作：打开不同语言的项目（如 Python/Node/Go），让 Agent 判断项目使用的语言和框架"},{"parent":"fbaa0a4f-e7a6-445b-a509-e56e1c763bdd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e0738240-b1f4-4c78-81d3-f655712ece7e","title":"预期：Agent 正确识别语言和主要框架/技术栈"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"fbaa0a4f-e7a6-445b-a509-e56e1c763bdd","title":"🔴【P0】识别项目编程语言与技术栈"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"77e54056-fd0a-4ce8-bc49-3cf175d65305","title":"正常场景（2）"},{"parent":"7b83ed37-44ce-4126-bf5d-c49899510b75","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d3c1ae9a-fe69-4928-b874-9ed26bd2d290","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3e2d289c-d3c0-4b04-bc31-72d121659597","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"103f27c3-7fbc-441f-b7ce-4e96e37e8ce1","title":"前置：项目中的依赖配置文件存在语法错误"},{"parent":"3e2d289c-d3c0-4b04-bc31-72d121659597","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9c2c434b-98ae-4a05-a0d3-4caea5f61b4d","title":"操作：让 Agent 读取该配置文件并回答依赖信息"},{"parent":"3e2d289c-d3c0-4b04-bc31-72d121659597","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d278ee0d-028d-41e2-8dae-2a3b303fd0b1","title":"预期：指出配置文件存在语法问题，不猜测或编造依赖内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3e2d289c-d3c0-4b04-bc31-72d121659597","title":"🟠【P1】配置文件损坏时的识别"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d3c1ae9a-fe69-4928-b874-9ed26bd2d290","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"7b83ed37-44ce-4126-bf5d-c49899510b75","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b4d8a010-f4ce-4eda-954d-525d1093a329","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c523249b-4184-4c38-92e5-40cad0901bf5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"963371b1-be87-4fce-b82f-c0f04beec9a7","title":"前置：项目同时包含多种语言与框架"},{"parent":"c523249b-4184-4c38-92e5-40cad0901bf5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3367626b-aedf-4853-b991-1af80ce0a8c3","title":"操作：让 Agent 判断项目使用的语言与技术栈"},{"parent":"c523249b-4184-4c38-92e5-40cad0901bf5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c343b93b-d597-42df-ab30-3964568d0f90","title":"预期：识别出主要语言与框架并说明各自占比或用途，不只报其中一种"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c523249b-4184-4c38-92e5-40cad0901bf5","title":"🟡【P2】多语言混合项目的技术栈识别"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b4d8a010-f4ce-4eda-954d-525d1093a329","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7b83ed37-44ce-4126-bf5d-c49899510b75","title":"技术栈与配置识别"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"395c7549-fb8d-4ef7-9463-7dd722756e54","title":"5.6 项目理解与代码分析"},{"parent":"bdf50357-f876-4ee3-b76a-bbe899c8ccbd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"04fa8f62-1777-4184-9ee5-ebf3ea4f45de","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"83af91d1-232e-4f5f-8f03-f2e63df3090b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"843da076-4a34-419d-9870-43e43e5fec43","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"895b93ff-656e-4a1d-8bac-c5b43d1bdb96","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7f6ffa6-2733-4f42-acf2-046fca768e00","title":"操作：连续发送多条有上下文关联的指令（如「生成一个函数」→「再给它加个参数」→「现在测试一下」）"},{"parent":"895b93ff-656e-4a1d-8bac-c5b43d1bdb96","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9fd25b97-7144-45d8-a678-435854f40f23","title":"预期：每一轮都基于前文正确理解指代对象，不出现「不知道指的是什么」的情况"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"895b93ff-656e-4a1d-8bac-c5b43d1bdb96","title":"🔴【P0】保持多轮对话连贯性","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"843da076-4a34-419d-9870-43e43e5fec43","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"be2f5330-1e60-4f07-99ad-78fff0523730","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1312d58a-429f-4ab2-9e79-69f1e15635c3","title":"操作：先让 Agent 创建一个变量/文件，再追问「我刚才创建的是什么」"},{"parent":"be2f5330-1e60-4f07-99ad-78fff0523730","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"68b9b6c1-e52c-4aa4-9f31-a73856a08e21","title":"预期：Agent 能正确引用之前消息中的内容作答，不需要重复说明"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"be2f5330-1e60-4f07-99ad-78fff0523730","title":"🔴【P0】跨消息引用之前的对话内容","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"843da076-4a34-419d-9870-43e43e5fec43","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6949e902-1db4-40f5-ab4c-35072fb4adbd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0fe239ef-919c-4253-bd85-c467c75ffc76","title":"操作：进行超长对话直到接近/超出上下文窗口上限"},{"parent":"6949e902-1db4-40f5-ab4c-35072fb4adbd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e7097b51-8bb8-452f-bb4d-f062e8ee7d6f","title":"预期：应用有合理降级策略（如提示需要新会话/自动摘要旧上下文），不静默丢失关键信息导致答非所问"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6949e902-1db4-40f5-ab4c-35072fb4adbd","title":"🔴【P0】上下文窗口溢出后的降级处理"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"843da076-4a34-419d-9870-43e43e5fec43","title":"正常场景（3）"},{"parent":"83af91d1-232e-4f5f-8f03-f2e63df3090b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4e7e2237-34ae-41bb-b655-98dacec1711a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bc6b1a49-f496-4928-8093-57e62554d1f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"200ab971-5a6e-46c0-a66f-9ee8fedcc320","title":"操作：恢复一个历史会话后，追问此前对话中提到的内容"},{"parent":"bc6b1a49-f496-4928-8093-57e62554d1f8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1179ae7f-f8cc-44ab-a271-60a549df3a61","title":"预期：resume 后 Agent 仍能正确引用会话历史中的信息（与「会话历史与Resume恢复」用例联动校验）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bc6b1a49-f496-4928-8093-57e62554d1f8","title":"🟠【P1】跨会话resume后上下文记忆保留","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4e7e2237-34ae-41bb-b655-98dacec1711a","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"83af91d1-232e-4f5f-8f03-f2e63df3090b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"601a7a2f-3198-40d3-b2f3-f95b361cee64","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"58fe0678-7ffd-456a-99c6-3d693e242acc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"907e8311-0d0b-4961-bcdd-d1c67a0897f8","title":"操作：在同一会话中频繁切换完全不相关的话题"},{"parent":"58fe0678-7ffd-456a-99c6-3d693e242acc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9df14ee9-3bd9-405d-bc5e-a150e96d10ad","title":"预期：Agent 不会将无关话题的上下文错误关联，各主题回答互不干扰"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"58fe0678-7ffd-456a-99c6-3d693e242acc","title":"🟡【P2】多轮对话频繁切换主题","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"601a7a2f-3198-40d3-b2f3-f95b361cee64","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"83af91d1-232e-4f5f-8f03-f2e63df3090b","title":"多轮上下文保持"},{"parent":"04fa8f62-1777-4184-9ee5-ebf3ea4f45de","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0ff3e6d3-5d32-44f0-ae78-6e55abdc9241","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b2d5d6f0-2c2e-4781-9d38-93887a6464ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2b9174ac-be84-4208-ab3f-5f036d59966a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"20793638-1095-4330-a99d-fa4fead2a9a8","title":"操作：会话进行过程中插入/compact"},{"parent":"2b9174ac-be84-4208-ab3f-5f036d59966a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c599e57-65c8-4205-802d-47ceb2fb4365","title":"预期：前面回复暂停，开始压缩，压缩完后显示已压缩上下文"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2b9174ac-be84-4208-ab3f-5f036d59966a","title":"🔴【P0】会话进行过程中插入/compact","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"b2d5d6f0-2c2e-4781-9d38-93887a6464ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"095d3a5e-1929-42bc-a302-a4e278a43ff4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"33ba3a12-6d29-4d53-b642-b295613e5b5b","title":"操作：会话进行过程中输入/compact"},{"parent":"095d3a5e-1929-42bc-a302-a4e278a43ff4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6d7dbbe2-f0eb-4752-aab4-2c6a8ecbc365","title":"预期：进入排队状态，会话完成自动发送出去压缩"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"095d3a5e-1929-42bc-a302-a4e278a43ff4","title":"🔴【P0】会话进行过程中输入/compact"},{"parent":"b2d5d6f0-2c2e-4781-9d38-93887a6464ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e49856d5-d0e7-40fc-bbf5-08b3808167b9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"543f3def-a8a6-4d52-887f-718cb2b1fedc","title":"操作：压缩后再次压缩"},{"parent":"e49856d5-d0e7-40fc-bbf5-08b3808167b9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9d49b1eb-897c-4889-aec1-fac6bf32400e","title":"预期：显示没有足够的上下文压缩"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e49856d5-d0e7-40fc-bbf5-08b3808167b9","title":"🔴【P0】压缩后再次压缩","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"b2d5d6f0-2c2e-4781-9d38-93887a6464ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e7776c39-14b6-48d6-9cea-8a59bbddfb4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c5aa675e-fcf8-4d53-9e31-4b5f9ff01a69","title":"操作：新建会话，匹配/compact"},{"parent":"e7776c39-14b6-48d6-9cea-8a59bbddfb4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"17495c9d-d84e-40ad-ba8a-1ae3f8d8aa28","title":"预期：新建会话无法匹配出这个命令"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e7776c39-14b6-48d6-9cea-8a59bbddfb4b","title":"🟠【P1】新建会话匹配/compact","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"b2d5d6f0-2c2e-4781-9d38-93887a6464ac","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d6ae2121-4ed3-4d1d-8e31-312b87f0f862","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"145f9114-71c0-47c4-9d53-558893b7e5a9","title":"操作：输入/compact并发送"},{"parent":"d6ae2121-4ed3-4d1d-8e31-312b87f0f862","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7810a823-d661-4c3f-9042-e1410c25219a","title":"预期：正确压缩上下文用量"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d6ae2121-4ed3-4d1d-8e31-312b87f0f862","title":"🟠【P1】输入/compact并发送","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b2d5d6f0-2c2e-4781-9d38-93887a6464ac","title":"正常场景（5）"},{"parent":"0ff3e6d3-5d32-44f0-ae78-6e55abdc9241","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ada36e93-094d-4f5a-a9b5-c2de75e0a530","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d2cdda61-ae49-4482-9efd-f34a84dc6da6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dca79118-9ced-4310-894d-2407e69694e6","title":"前置：前置：会话已进行多轮且包含明确目标、约束与已做修改；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"d2cdda61-ae49-4482-9efd-f34a84dc6da6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"be528f49-0208-4028-8100-b0ba948e0a95","title":"操作：执行 /compact 后提问引用压缩前约定的目标与约束"},{"parent":"d2cdda61-ae49-4482-9efd-f34a84dc6da6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bff0e4f0-4878-4ef7-b097-2bfcf91c885b","title":"预期：压缩后 Agent 仍能准确复述关键目标、约束与已完成的修改；上下文用量明显下降；压缩过程不中断会话"},{"parent":"d2cdda61-ae49-4482-9efd-f34a84dc6da6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0165e144-0b76-4bd2-8a98-15cd73412628","title":"备注：附件3 CC-034"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d2cdda61-ae49-4482-9efd-f34a84dc6da6","title":"🟡【P2】长会话压缩后关键上下文保留","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ada36e93-094d-4f5a-a9b5-c2de75e0a530","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0ff3e6d3-5d32-44f0-ae78-6e55abdc9241","title":"上下文压缩（/compact）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"04fa8f62-1777-4184-9ee5-ebf3ea4f45de","title":"5.7 上下文保持与压缩"},{"parent":"bdf50357-f876-4ee3-b76a-bbe899c8ccbd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f6e755bf-d9fe-4f67-a313-4028c5810bc1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d0c032ab-cc21-42f4-8eba-5eef93735735","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d1c30a2d-11dd-4ebc-b009-384faf6853db","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"33c89605-4f22-40cd-80d6-6ef36926a180","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"946747af-6067-43be-b53e-490a5297088f","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个适合拆解的复合任务（如「搜索项目里所有涉及支付逻辑的文件并总结」），观察是否派生内部子代理处理子任务"},{"parent":"33c89605-4f22-40cd-80d6-6ef36926a180","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1e5ac94d-a5f6-4931-a6bd-e467405e6d59","title":"预期：主Agent能将子任务委派给内部子Agent（如 Claude Code 的 Task/通用子代理机制）执行，过程对用户可感知或有相应提示，不是主Agent独自逐步手动完成；子 Agent 在任务结束后状态收敛为已完成或失败；不长时间停留在未完成；失败时给出原因并可重试"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"33c89605-4f22-40cd-80d6-6ef36926a180","title":"🔴【P0】Agent派发内部子任务给子Agent执行","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"d1c30a2d-11dd-4ebc-b009-384faf6853db","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0978f27d-f6e3-45e4-8412-af0c787420cf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d9442cf0-ae8a-4a40-8f12-0e56b3d468a9","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个可拆分为多个独立子任务的复合任务"},{"parent":"0978f27d-f6e3-45e4-8412-af0c787420cf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7dd8aaaa-eaab-4ac3-b61e-1eeb2bbb656a","title":"预期：多个子Agent可并行执行且互不干扰，结果分别正确合并"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0978f27d-f6e3-45e4-8412-af0c787420cf","title":"🔴【P0】多个子Agent并行处理不同子任务","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"d1c30a2d-11dd-4ebc-b009-384faf6853db","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6bec9e3f-6d54-4b92-8efd-55ce0ad1fe30","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9677b288-3511-4034-b8ad-5b216d2ec3ef","title":"操作：子Agent完成子任务后，观察主Agent如何呈现结果"},{"parent":"6bec9e3f-6d54-4b92-8efd-55ce0ad1fe30","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"246fc2e4-a490-4fc0-9e38-4c844cd51cf1","title":"预期：子Agent的执行结果被主Agent正确汇总、引用或据此继续后续步骤，不丢失子任务产出"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6bec9e3f-6d54-4b92-8efd-55ce0ad1fe30","title":"🔴【P0】子Agent执行结果正确汇总回主对话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"d1c30a2d-11dd-4ebc-b009-384faf6853db","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"02c85d1e-c956-4e36-b4a0-7658d049ef3d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd560c56-c291-4562-a3a8-1b7dba382ea2","title":"操作：触发一个会派生子Agent执行的任务（尤其涉及写入/执行类子任务）"},{"parent":"02c85d1e-c956-4e36-b4a0-7658d049ef3d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a341e976-aea8-46ac-99c5-76f15812cefb","title":"预期：派发子Agent执行写入/执行类操作时，仍遵循当前会话的权限模式（如需询问则询问），不会因为是「子Agent」身份而绕过权限确认"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"02c85d1e-c956-4e36-b4a0-7658d049ef3d","title":"🔴【P0】派发子Agent前的确认/授权提示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"d1c30a2d-11dd-4ebc-b009-384faf6853db","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d7aa85ce-02bf-4988-89a6-6da3ab171f9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aee30e43-ed28-4502-b964-13f9bcd23262","title":"前置：前置：会话可正常执行；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"d7aa85ce-02bf-4988-89a6-6da3ab171f9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d9e0f524-1ed5-4b2d-bf2c-62b60a019ecd","title":"操作：启动单个子 Agent 执行任务，由主 Agent 向其发送一条补充要求，等待结果回传"},{"parent":"d7aa85ce-02bf-4988-89a6-6da3ab171f9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a80c115a-2560-4b4b-8aea-449a9f03577f","title":"预期：子 Agent 生命周期完整可见；补充要求送达指定子 Agent 而非其他 Agent；多条子 Agent 消息在 GUI 中折叠展示；结果进入主会话上下文并被主 Agent 汇总为最终答案"},{"parent":"d7aa85ce-02bf-4988-89a6-6da3ab171f9b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"16335981-f501-4eb8-9f55-40d10845cd55","title":"备注：附件3 CC-007"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d7aa85ce-02bf-4988-89a6-6da3ab171f9b","title":"🟠【P1】单子 Agent 与补充要求下发"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d1c30a2d-11dd-4ebc-b009-384faf6853db","title":"正常场景（5）"},{"parent":"d0c032ab-cc21-42f4-8eba-5eef93735735","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"53bca221-18f4-4310-b363-f10cf4f86397","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e2a591a4-cfca-49f1-868a-cbb7954c1aa6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6de061c3-0b4d-48de-94c8-1241e5638ed4","title":"操作：让某个子任务在子Agent执行阶段刻意失败（如访问不存在的文件）"},{"parent":"e2a591a4-cfca-49f1-868a-cbb7954c1aa6","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"51baaeae-3c6c-4b56-b000-7edff1d5447d","title":"预期：主Agent能感知子Agent失败并做出合理处理（重试/降级/告知用户），不会静默忽略失败结果"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e2a591a4-cfca-49f1-868a-cbb7954c1aa6","title":"🟡【P2】子Agent执行失败后主Agent的处理","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"53bca221-18f4-4310-b363-f10cf4f86397","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"ec8c3b4c-07f1-4b54-b337-8df3d34a1b57","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a1eec7df-f8e4-4295-a729-ca10ca3d4d5e","title":"操作：在权限模式限制较严格（如只读模式）下触发需要派生子Agent执行写入类子任务的场景"},{"parent":"ec8c3b4c-07f1-4b54-b337-8df3d34a1b57","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fe429ee3-4e38-4b79-ba2f-a22b2e10b639","title":"预期：子Agent派发因权限受限被拒绝时有明确提示，不会静默失败或绕过限制执行"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"border-radius":"6px","color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","background":"rgba(33, 41, 48, 0.25)","text-decoration":"line-through","border-color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","border-width":"0px","border-style":"none"},"id":"ec8c3b4c-07f1-4b54-b337-8df3d34a1b57","title":"🟡【P2】子Agent派发被拒绝或受限时的提示"},{"parent":"53bca221-18f4-4310-b363-f10cf4f86397","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"86c4357a-b264-4e3d-afe2-3a0175a8ec37","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bef4d956-be57-4660-97a6-1bcbf6e175c2","title":"操作：主任务限定在项目 A 目录内，观察派生的子Agent是否会访问项目 A 之外的路径"},{"parent":"86c4357a-b264-4e3d-afe2-3a0175a8ec37","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c5603ddb-3823-4739-9017-642a33244f14","title":"预期：子Agent的文件/项目访问范围继承主Agent当前的权限与项目作用域，不出现越权访问"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"86c4357a-b264-4e3d-afe2-3a0175a8ec37","title":"🟡【P2】子Agent越权访问主任务作用域之外的文件","icons":[{"color":"rgb(248, 87, 103)","name":"other","index":"369"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"53bca221-18f4-4310-b363-f10cf4f86397","title":"异常场景（7）"},{"parent":"d0c032ab-cc21-42f4-8eba-5eef93735735","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5d18ca26-3540-40ba-be1e-25819dd7b9a0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"50c3690e-cda4-4e7a-987d-637c57a38aa3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a0f20bdb-3aa7-4868-b01f-e68b5da65690","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个会拆解出大量子任务（如超过10个）的复合任务"},{"parent":"50c3690e-cda4-4e7a-987d-637c57a38aa3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"41b49ed7-9b9c-4a19-9850-6ebc9a81d7d5","title":"预期：子Agent数量可控或有合理限流提示，不会因过量派发导致资源耗尽或状态错乱"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"50c3690e-cda4-4e7a-987d-637c57a38aa3","title":"🟡【P2】大量子Agent同时派发","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"5d18ca26-3540-40ba-be1e-25819dd7b9a0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"359805d2-5b40-40e1-a6a6-640ed68984ef","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"afda9117-3e0e-42b9-9c9d-944fa4b9b213","title":"操作：观察子Agent执行过程中是否会再派发下一层子Agent"},{"parent":"359805d2-5b40-40e1-a6a6-640ed68984ef","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8872d943-2c42-48d7-b4dd-81f48a134917","title":"预期：若支持嵌套派发，层级和结果汇总关系清晰可追踪；若不支持，应有明确边界而非无限递归"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"359805d2-5b40-40e1-a6a6-640ed68984ef","title":"🟡【P2】子Agent嵌套派发","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"5d18ca26-3540-40ba-be1e-25819dd7b9a0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4c53692c-9b1f-4985-a2ad-b544610405bd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"979904f3-486a-46a4-b702-a40c92d4447f","title":"前置：前置：会话可正常执行；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"4c53692c-9b1f-4985-a2ad-b544610405bd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dedab9ba-00e4-4012-b84f-600e5707ad1f","title":"操作：让第一层 Agent 再启动子 Agent，核对各层级的启动、消息、完成与用量"},{"parent":"4c53692c-9b1f-4985-a2ad-b544610405bd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"476157f3-b922-4a88-8495-0b7cc82e9ad9","title":"预期：各层级 Agent 的启动、消息、完成状态均纳入统一状态展示；用量按层级汇总不遗漏；顶层任务在所有层级结束后才标记完成"},{"parent":"4c53692c-9b1f-4985-a2ad-b544610405bd","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2d873dba-a752-4437-a467-01f906535860","title":"备注：附件3 CC-042"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4c53692c-9b1f-4985-a2ad-b544610405bd","title":"🟡【P2】嵌套子 Agent 生命周期","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"5d18ca26-3540-40ba-be1e-25819dd7b9a0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b6477752-1c3a-421a-af82-3c91230b172d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d323c6a1-b49b-488e-b3c2-8b2f5a51bae9","title":"操作：让某个子任务本身是长耗时任务（如遍历超大代码库）"},{"parent":"b6477752-1c3a-421a-af82-3c91230b172d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a31dd69c-6ca1-4cd7-abec-6431832bff5e","title":"预期：子Agent任务的超时/进度反馈机制与主任务一致，不会无提示地长时间挂起"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b6477752-1c3a-421a-af82-3c91230b172d","title":"🟡【P2】长时间运行的子Agent任务"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5d18ca26-3540-40ba-be1e-25819dd7b9a0","title":"边界场景（4）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d0c032ab-cc21-42f4-8eba-5eef93735735","title":"子 Agent 派发与结果汇总"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f6e755bf-d9fe-4f67-a313-4028c5810bc1","title":"5.8 子 Agent 派发"}],"id":"bdf50357-f876-4ee3-b76a-bbe899c8ccbd","title":"Agent 执行能力"},{"parent":"28a940bb-0eef-4cac-8062-351774ac194f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8050891e-2be5-487a-bbc4-adae6168d4a5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7d3fe8b3-ac29-49a5-b55d-9dbcd5b9cd55","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aa9b4305-e237-46b3-b99e-94bc6b8ea9f9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e92cf233-a02a-43dd-9c30-fe71a0d18768","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"95313bad-0c9b-4b97-b56a-1ba7c8c635be","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"86042c78-00b5-4118-96a7-e37e9265155d","title":"操作：将推理强度从默认切换到高"},{"parent":"95313bad-0c9b-4b97-b56a-1ba7c8c635be","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2fa4ae4f-60f3-4fde-9fa4-1e1d1b1548dd","title":"预期：底栏显示高，新会话使用对应推理强度"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"95313bad-0c9b-4b97-b56a-1ba7c8c635be","title":"🔴【P0】切换推理强度","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"