，用户能暂停或取消"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d06c9199-e56e-485b-b74a-5339b37b3cb6","title":"🟡【P2】高推理长任务","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a83c82b8-4ecd-4f03-9d6c-c58d657616fe","title":"边界场景（5）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"aa9b4305-e237-46b3-b99e-94bc6b8ea9f9","title":"模型与推理强度选择"},{"parent":"7d3fe8b3-ac29-49a5-b55d-9dbcd5b9cd55","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"260b5f85-5f56-4440-96ae-39823ac59612","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"489db0b0-b2d2-4dc0-b106-12c392165e72","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"23c2bf7c-b472-4be7-a697-86400de2e6eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8f6ee683-4aad-455f-b3f0-c3d38a027fd5","title":"前置：前置：平台已授权多个模型；角色：房间成员；入口：会话输入框"},{"parent":"23c2bf7c-b472-4be7-a697-86400de2e6eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f64c399e-c42d-4799-9a70-b11101eedd3a","title":"操作：执行 /model 查看列表并逐一切换后各发送一条消息"},{"parent":"23c2bf7c-b472-4be7-a697-86400de2e6eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4574d6c-a4dd-43e2-b797-a1cc7105ad6d","title":"预期：模型列表完整且名称正确；每次切换后选择项真实生效，回复由所选模型产生；切换记录在 /status 中可核对"},{"parent":"23c2bf7c-b472-4be7-a697-86400de2e6eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"077ba6b0-b465-489b-8779-e1845501b4b8","title":"备注：附件3 CC-002"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"23c2bf7c-b472-4be7-a697-86400de2e6eb","title":"🟠【P1】查看并逐一切换授权模型"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"489db0b0-b2d2-4dc0-b106-12c392165e72","title":"正常场景（1）"},{"parent":"260b5f85-5f56-4440-96ae-39823ac59612","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b3b785e7-1361-46f9-9030-cb0db8bfddb8","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"c68e39df-f3df-40f4-b40f-8ab5ccc743a9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ba777ca6-91ca-447a-afef-f95a81d21e27","title":"前置：会话正在执行中"},{"parent":"c68e39df-f3df-40f4-b40f-8ab5ccc743a9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"56768946-7cb1-452b-b1f8-4b05f096dbfd","title":"操作：在执行过程中切换模型"},{"parent":"c68e39df-f3df-40f4-b40f-8ab5ccc743a9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b6629180-cf94-4cf0-92d3-26b9f