cdb9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e2c5d03c-dc48-4d32-aae2-57eed4db403b","title":"操作：安装 20+ 个 Plugin/MCP/Skill 后启动 Nextop"},{"parent":"4abf1ee1-c59f-4fa9-b3df-063b1c61cdb9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"57af96cc-021d-4138-948c-1e15a4b5a902","title":"预期：全部正确同步；管理面板列表可滚动显示；同步时间在合理范围内（不长时间卡顿）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4abf1ee1-c59f-4fa9-b3df-063b1c61cdb9","title":"🟡【P2】本地配置包含大量 Plugin/MCP/Skill（30 个以上）"},{"parent":"8833223f-ac8c-44f0-accf-fb41ab915346","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ba5e3bc9-d674-4c2d-980a-4de7743b590b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"544f3e02-3d63-4b38-9fe8-cbfa7ba842f9","title":"操作：断网后修改本地配置"},{"parent":"ba5e3bc9-d674-4c2d-980a-4de7743b590b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0f2a7a22-68dc-47e6-a3f1-f69242f11ab8","title":"预期：本地配置可保存，需要远程校验的项给出提示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ba5e3bc9-d674-4c2d-980a-4de7743b590b","title":"🟡【P2】离线配置使用"},{"parent":"8833223f-ac8c-44f0-accf-fb41ab915346","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b549a1f5-24b0-49a1-bd2d-d02d3b52610e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b3ce2f5f-b49c-426d-86ce-fb4e02616d3f","title":"操作：项目历史过多导致配置文件较大"},{"parent":"b549a1f5-24b0-49a1-bd2d-d02d3b52610e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9c44c08e-cd48-4e6f-ac18-49071a153877","title":"预期：读取和写入性能可接受，菜单不卡顿"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b549a1f5-24b0-49a1-bd2d-d02d3b52610e","title":"🟡【P2】配置内容超大"},{"parent":"8833223f-ac8c-44f0-accf-fb41ab915346","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1b218bae-888e-4113-8393-9df3c0fad3d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"86867561-a145-492d-be6d-6714874d49bf","title":"操作：快速切换模型、权限和项目 20 次"},{"parent":"1b218bae-888e-4113-8393-9df3c0fad3d1","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8db983cb-ff7a-4467-aeb2-09b7f004efdb","title":"预期：最终状态为最后一次成功选择，配置文件未损坏"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1b218bae-888e-4113-8393-9df3c0fad3d1","title":"🟡【P2】频繁切换配置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8833223f-ac8c-44f0-accf-fb41ab915346","title":"边界场景（5）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1a4bb8ac-166b-402a-a2af-96d5940893f4","title":"Plugin/MCP/Skill 本地同步"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"97c842af-2bd4-40a7-8cca-69468db4b125","title":"本地配置同步"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"62682c4a-dd61-4564-bd98-9723aa83584a","title":"扩展生态与本地同步"},{"parent":"28a940bb-0eef-4cac-8062-351774ac194f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"48b94977-fd2b-424c-8111-6d77d3db1d79","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"61a82245-6e68-4cd8-906e-c3b22c44700a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"19bf21aa-6ef7-4f7a-9568-81998207ea04","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dcac1259-7ef6-4bc0-888f-49062dce9074","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8e198aad-3211-4c65-812f-b50863e88d0c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2a35b0d9-4477-4595-9328-87d19e352a49","title":"操作：在 {SourceAgent} 的会话（进行中/等待中/已完成/失败任一状态）下点击 Handoff"},{"parent":"8e198aad-3211-4c65-812f-b50863e88d0c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b391b720-ebaa-4505-a000-528adb71eb82","title":"预期：菜单展示除 {SourceAgent} 本身外的其他可用 Agent（如 Claude Code/Codex/Tutti），包括我的和共享agent，标识可用和不可用状态。需对每个 SourceAgent 分别验证一次"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8e198aad-3211-4c65-812f-b50863e88d0c","title":"🔴【P0】Handoff菜单展示其他可用Agent","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"dcac1259-7ef6-4bc0-888f-49062dce9074","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5b08b8ab-b1fa-4cae-aa99-8c6426b97286","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"27420592-730c-4043-9088-2e6f7a408155","title":"操作：在 {SourceAgent} 的会话下点击 Handoff，选择 {TargetAgent}；分别对进行中/等待中/已完成/失败四种会话状态执行本操作"},{"parent":"5b08b8ab-b1fa-4cae-aa99-8c6426b97286","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"009f5dcc-d3af-499e-a6cc-0b45353bb588","title":"预期：跳转至该 Agent 的新建会话窗口，选中 {TargetAgent} 分类，新建会话窗口里填充显示「{SourceAgent} + 原会话标题」，项目与原会话一致，权限/模型/推理强度/速度显示 {TargetAgent} 上一次的会话配置，发送后 {TargetAgent} 能识别该会话内容并正确回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5b08b8ab-b1fa-4cae-aa99-8c6426b97286","title":"🔴【P0】交接执行与结果同步","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"dcac1259-7ef6-4bc0-888f-49062dce9074","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"077ea079-c9f9-4e78-94a4-3f472f367a29","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d05f39fb-0158-43df-a2c8-f8e2e4aa43cd","title":"操作：在 {AgentA} 下新建会话，handoff 给 {AgentB}，{AgentB} 处理完后再 handoff 给 {AgentC}，{AgentC} 处理完后再 handoff 给 {AgentD}"},{"parent":"077ea079-c9f9-4e78-94a4-3f472f367a29","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e858dc69-2324-40a1-a865-baf01b084896","title":"预期：各 Agent 能基于会话历史上下文继续回复，历史记录追加保存"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"077ea079-c9f9-4e78-94a4-3f472f367a29","title":"🔴【P0】多次Handoff（链式交接）","icons":[{"color":"rgb(0, 186, 74)","name":"completion","index":"317"}]},{"parent":"dcac1259-7ef6-4bc0-888f-49062dce9074","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d48b9f3c-731a-47ed-a00e-2fad7d8056fb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"51f8f3b7-2465-456f-8a3b-08786cd17394","title":"前置：前置：共享 Agent 会话已报错；角色：房间成员；入口：会话中的 Handoff 按钮"},{"parent":"d48b9f3c-731a-47ed-a00e-2fad7d8056fb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"66dc90ff-df8b-458d-b9e9-b8d7b4a53277","title":"操作：在报错状态下查看并点击 Handoff"},{"parent":"d48b9f3c-731a-47ed-a00e-2fad7d8056fb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"378b0bbc-33c5-4c4c-ac80-cfffeaa3f491","title":"预期：Handoff 按钮在报错状态下高亮可点击；菜单中同时包含自己的 Agent 与房间内其他可用 Agent；选择后会话可被接管并继续"},{"parent":"d48b9f3c-731a-47ed-a00e-2fad7d8056fb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1638c379-3085-4a2e-beb3-5c49563d730f","title":"备注：#173"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d48b9f3c-731a-47ed-a00e-2fad7d8056fb","title":"🔴【P0】错误态下 Handoff 入口可用","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"dcac1259-7ef6-4bc0-888f-49062dce9074","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cc09b3dc-f287-4e9a-87db-e6eb394a99d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c5b64a16-9b06-4a2d-8a36-e72f1f6a72a0","title":"操作：鼠标悬浮Handoff"},{"parent":"cc09b3dc-f287-4e9a-87db-e6eb394a99d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2c35bb7f-3861-488e-97d3-affd21b57a66","title":"预期：显示交接给其他Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cc09b3dc-f287-4e9a-87db-e6eb394a99d2","title":"🔴【P0】鼠标悬浮Handoff","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"dcac1259-7ef6-4bc0-888f-49062dce9074","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4b1d6