d48-356582a84ce1","title":"预期：自己的 Claude Code 显示为不可用并置灰不可选择；两个入口下的状态展示一致，不出现一处可选一处不可选"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a31655de-1db3-4b30-af07-9440850ef77d","title":"🟠【P1】成员会话中我的未安装 Agent 同样不可选","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"dcac1259-7ef6-4bc0-888f-49062dce9074","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"72fee16c-524f-425e-af64-029852ad1377","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6025dae8-bd59-4d94-8b16-3bf42f9aee8b","title":"前置：前置：本地 Codex 已安装且已登录；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：自己 Agent 的会话中点击 Handoff"},{"parent":"72fee16c-524f-425e-af64-029852ad1377","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b29f1838-84c5-4d09-96bf-716d4f54dc06","title":"操作：查看菜单并选择该 Agent 完成交接"},{"parent":"72fee16c-524f-425e-af64-029852ad1377","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6630a3fd-a0bc-4255-82d0-c6ae02f76465","title":"预期：该 Agent 显示为可用状态可选择；交接后会话归属变更为目标 Agent，输入框上方 Agent 名称同步更新，历史上下文完整保留"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"72fee16c-524f-425e-af64-029852ad1377","title":"🟠【P1】我的 Agent 已安装已登录时可选","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"dcac1259-7ef6-4bc0-888f-49062dce9074","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c781d7b2-16bb-4323-8f31-02ebd54bafab","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9724f5ac-083a-4668-a322-c438752a6b3a","title":"前置：前置：本地未安装 Claude Code；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：自己 Agent 的会话中点击 Handoff 按钮"},{"parent":"c781d7b2-16bb-4323-8f31-02ebd54bafab","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"37a3e3a6-545e-4ca3-9586-090c6ebb028b","title":"操作：查看菜单中该 Agent 的状态"},{"parent":"c781d7b2-16bb-4323-8f31-02ebd54bafab","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e23d89a-02e3-4b60-bf5f-1120ec97ae6c","title":"预期：该 Agent 在 Handoff 菜单中显示为不可用并置灰；点击无法选中，不发起交接请求；菜单中其他已安装 Agent 仍可正常选择"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c781d7b2-16bb-4323-8f31-02ebd54bafab","title":"🟠【P1】我的 Agent 未安装时在 Handoff 菜单中不可选","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"dcac1259-7ef6-4bc0-888f-49062dce9074","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"953f36c9-e658-45e9-8d92-cec38fc47056","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f55c48d4-a9df-41f3-9b8e-a1e1473252ce","title":"前置：前置：本地已安装 Codex 但未登录；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：自己 Agent 的会话中点击 Handoff"},{"parent":"953f36c9-e658-45e9-8d92-cec38fc47056","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e9f891a8-6be1-4755-bd32-af6174638992","title":"操作：查看菜单中该 Agent 状态"},{"parent":"953f36c9-e658-45e9-8d92-cec38fc47056","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"651bf719-dade-4395-ae54-b5e730d83996","title":"预期：该 Agent 显示为不可用并置灰不可选择；登录后重新打开菜单该 Agent 恢复可选"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"953f36c9-e658-45e9-8d92-cec38fc47056","title":"🟠【P1】我的 Agent 未登录时不可选","icons":[{"color":"rgb(248, 87, 103)","name":"other","index":"369"}]},{"parent":"dcac1259-7ef6-4bc0-888f-49062dce9074","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"607088bd-07e8-4b11-a511-e0a4c2f432b5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c0ff796a-fc00-4ef0-bbb0-4a1cb1633e6a","title":"前置：前置：房间内 Claude Code、Codex、Tutti Agent 均可用；角色：房间成员；入口：会话 Handoff 菜单"},{"parent":"607088bd-07e8-4b11-a511-e0a4c2f432b5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2bb10631-f01e-4e22-be3a-8a9afcdccc82","title":"操作：按矩阵逐格执行所有 SourceAgent→TargetAgent 组合（不含自己交接给自己），每个组合分别在会话未开始、运行中、已完成、失败四种状态下各执行一次"},{"parent":"607088bd-07e8-4b11-a511-e0a4c2f432b5","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6d1707fa-779d-4961-b757-ddfca71fe66e","title":"预期：每个组合交接后，目标 Agent 名称与实际选择的 Agent 一致，不出现预期文案残留其他 Agent 名称；会话历史与附件完整继承；运行中交接时源任务先收敛再由目标 Agent 接管，不出现双方同时输出"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"607088bd-07e8-4b11-a511-e0a4c2f432b5","title":"🟠【P1】跨 Agent 两两交接矩阵执行","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dcac1259-7ef6-4bc0-888f-49062dce9074","title":"正常场景（12）"},{"parent":"19bf21aa-6ef7-4f7a-9568-81998207ea04","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d6d5495f-445a-41c2-8edd-4481ffa0374a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6313998f-8fbb-43e1-9737-6107dd387b53","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e1bfbe8d-6958-44da-ae54-066b221fcea9","title":"操作：在 {SourceAgent} 下新建会话，handoff 给 {TargetAgent}，不发送，删除该会话，再在 {TargetAgent} 下发送该会话"},{"parent":"6313998f-8fbb-43e1-9737-6107dd387b53","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"24cec5d6-6b2d-458c-ad5d-37e83106bd24","title":"预期：可正常发送，但在 {TargetAgent} 详情点击该会话会打开一个新窗口，并显示该会话不可用"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6313998f-8fbb-43e1-9737-6107dd387b53","title":"🟠【P1】Handoff后删除会话","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d6d5495f-445a-41c2-8edd-4481ffa0374a","title":"异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"19bf21aa-6ef7-4f7a-9568-81998207ea04","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5d5a8cc4-aa78-4abc-91ad-799ecd86bc79","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"53358cee-06cc-4100-a5af-71f9b110e416","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"acb50b28-6006-4a5c-881b-fe502561c677","title":"前置：目标设备处于离线状态"},{"parent":"53358cee-06cc-4100-a5af-71f9b110e416","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b9384063-39da-4e19-8c6c-2371f27e305e","title":"操作：发起会话交接到该设备"},{"parent":"53358cee-06cc-4100-a5af-71f9b110e416","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"88145a9a-5ee6-4683-9ea7-0b2186238bf6","title":"预期：明确提示目标不可用并可重新选择，不产生无法恢复的中间态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"53358cee-06cc-4100-a5af-71f9b110e416","title":"🟡【P2】交接给已离线的目标设备","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5d5a8cc4-aa78-4abc-91ad-799ecd86bc79","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"19bf21aa-6ef7-4f7a-9568-81998207ea04","title":"会话交接"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"61a82245-6e68-4cd8-906e-c3b22c44700a","title":"会话交接（Handoff）"},{"parent":"48b94977-fd2b-424c-8111-6d77d3db1d79","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"87fca23f-a4d3-46fc-8a5a-03f4c924573c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4d4c6836-b651-454e-93af-9b5441e8cc0f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2bb8f1bc-72d8-4f22-97cb-2a4ef946d7a5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1ebfc225-1e05-4340-9c61-aa11c6e6ab26","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a96a8d1a-6163-4fb9-b289-8141238890db","title":"前置：前置：任务 B 最后一条消息已完成；角色：房间成员；入口：最后一条消息上的 Fork 操作"},{"parent":"1ebfc225-1e05-4340-9c61-aa11c6e6ab26","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d12fbabd-fa94-4be6-a433-1f3b93ac7d7b","title":"操作：在末尾消息处 Fork 并逐项核对上下文"},{"parent":"1ebfc225-1e05-4340-9c61-aa11c6e6ab26","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ae18e649-a9b1-4c45-a761-f8e0957bb149","title":"预期：分支继承源任务全部消息与上下文；在分支中提问引用早期内容时 Agent 能正确回答；源任务不受影响"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1ebfc225-1e05-4340-9c61-aa11c6e6ab26","title":"🟠【P1】从任务末尾 Fork"},{"parent":"2bb8f1bc-72d8-4f22-97cb-2a4ef946d7a5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"154ecb96-ba13-48a9-b7b4-4c3d7d9a4359","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b0fa4e7d-74c7-4ab5-a8f4-09930b19f70d","title":"前置：前置：任务 B 至少有 5 轮对话；角色：房间成员；入口：第 3 轮消息上的 Fork 操作"},{"parent":"154ecb96-ba13-48a9-b7b4-4c3d7d9a4359","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8ae4043e-7e43-4d42-a06e-98dcbb049d86","title":"操作：选择第 3 轮消息作为 Fork 点创建分支，逐条对比源任务与分支的消息序列"},{"parent":"154ecb96-ba13-48a9-b7b4-4c3d7d9a4359","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1fd65b29-878d-467e-80bd-58ff20695819","title":"预期：分支只包含第 1 至第 3 轮消息且顺序与源任务一致；第 4 轮及以后的消息不出现在分支中；源任务的 5 轮消息保持完整"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"154ecb96-ba13-48a9-b7b4-4c3d7d9a4359","title":"🟠【P1】从多轮对话中间节点 Fork"},{"parent":"2bb8f1bc-72d8-4f22-97cb-2a4ef946d7a5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3db72ee6-ca50-426e-a9c9-4c218d32ba5d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9c9615c2-29a5-4880-8fe2-8fdded46f20a","title":"前置：前置：任务 A 中存在已完成的普通文本消息；角色：房间成员；入口：目标消息上的 Fork 操作"},{"parent":"3db72ee6-ca50-426e-a9c9-4c218d32ba5d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3a9d0016-f627-44c6-88cd-b2dd59a675de","title":"操作：打开任务 A，在该消息上执行 Fork，等待新任务打开或出现在任务列表"},{"parent":"3db72ee6-ca50-426e-a9c9-4c218d32ba5d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"711ab4bd-eb10-4abc-b8bc-0f5a2d20193c","title":"预期：创建出新分支任务并自动打开或出现在任务列表中；分支包含 Fork 点及之前的全部消息，不包含其后的消息；源任务内容不发生变化"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3db72ee6-ca50-426e-a9c9-4c218d32ba5d","title":"🟠【P1】从普通文本消息 Fork"},{"parent":"2bb8f1bc-72d8-4f22-97cb-2a4ef946d7a5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5a08592c-a16a-46ff-bb40-3fc61d852240","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a5b47adc-a36a-4851-80d6-658c92e439c1","title":"前置：前置：已创建分支；角色：房间成员；入口：任务列表与分支详情"},{"parent":"5a08592c-a16a-46ff-bb40-3fc61d852240","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"33d8376b-ccb6-4a1a-9bbd-4c37b3cae9f6","title":"操作：Fork 后检查分支标题、创建时间、来源入口与列表排序，并点击返回源任务"},{"parent":"5a08592c-a16a-46ff-bb40-3fc61d852240","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6f634428-2a96-41b1-a448-3f37b2af7c47","title":"预期：分支标题可识别且不为空；创建时间为 Fork 时刻；详情中展示来源任务入口并可点击跳回源任务；列表按更新时间排序，分支位置正确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5a08592c-a16a-46ff-bb40-3fc61d852240","title":"🟠【P1】分支名称、时间与来源展示"},{"parent":"2bb8f1bc-72d8-4f22-97cb-2a4ef946d7a5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bca32f98-2fbb-492a-b477-faf865af1390","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c2981520-e972-414b-9aa0-10070705151c","title":"前置：前置：已从任务 A 创建分支 B1；角色：房间成员；入口：分支 B1 输入框"},{"parent":"bca32f98-2fbb-492a-b477-faf865af1390","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"be127db2-b294-4c21-a651-e87a2952cd67","title":"操作：在分支发送一条新消息并等待回复，然后返回源任务查看"},{"parent":"bca32f98-2fbb-492a-b477-faf865af1390","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ddc23e61-80a8-4e8c-bb05-5844c0a90fa7","title":"预期：分支正常收到回复并新增消息；源任务的消息数量与内容不发生变化；左侧列表中两条任务分别更新各自的时间"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bca32f98-2fbb-492a-b477-faf865af1390","title":"🟠【P1】分支继续对话不影响源任务"},{"parent":"2bb8f1bc-72d8-4f22-97cb-2a4ef946d7a5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"addcaf28-f6a1-4ecd-8e48-b1159ef91e78","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"12ff7430-cf97-4f76-9d21-a4fd6302bd99","title":"前置：前置：已创建分支 B1；角色：房间成员；入口：分支的更多操作菜单"},{"parent":"addcaf28-f6a1-4ecd-8e48-b1159ef91e78","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c6386347-1bf7-4b9d-8a48-a08c7dbe7af2","title":"操作：依次对 B1 执行重命名、归档，若环境允许再执行删除，然后查看源任务"},{"parent":"addcaf28-f6a1-4ecd-8e48-b1159ef91e78","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0249cb15-615e-4d80-a3a2-db0835905214","title":"预期：重命名与归档只作用于分支；源任务标题、状态与消息均不变；删除分支后源任务仍存在且可继续对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"addcaf28-f6a1-4ecd-8e48-b1159ef91e78","title":"🟠【P1】分支重命名归档删除不影响源任务"},{"parent":"2bb8f1bc-72d8-4f22-97cb-2a4ef946d7a5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"04128178-b8c9-49b9-9cd0-be2557e21b3c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f29566c9-b748-4296-b8e7-7a50a6f672a6","title":"前置：前置：任务 A 存在某一目标节点；角色：房间成员；入口：该节点的 Fork 操作"},{"parent":"04128178-b8c9-49b9-9cd0-be2557e21b3c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2ea0795e-a1fb-423d-8586-4e521dbfab30","title":"操作：从同一节点依次创建 3 个分支，并分别发送不同指令"},{"parent":"04128178-b8c9-49b9-9cd0-be2557e21b3c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"73f9e3c0-dbd3-477c-bdb9-d65080046459","title":"预期：3 个分支均创建成功且互不影响；各自继承相同的历史上下文；各分支的新消息只出现在自身会话中"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"04128178-b8c9-49b9-9cd0-be2557e21b3c","title":"🟠【P1】同一节点创建多个分支"},{"parent":"2bb8f1bc-72d8-4f22-97cb-2a4ef946d7a5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a3d59d70-868c-4002-ade8-e50cc934ab04","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ce123b2f-77a4-414f-a09b-989b688f05e9","title":"前置：前置：任务 A 已有若干轮对话；角色：房间成员；入口：Fork 操作"},{"parent":"a3d59d70-868c-4002-ade8-e50cc934ab04","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6540a816-a415-4e03-bdf1-8b9b3b7fbea6","title":"操作：从源任务创建分支 B1，再从 B1 创建 B2，分别在 B1 与 B2 继续对话"},{"parent":"a3d59d70-868c-4002-ade8-e50cc934ab04","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9ff6bd97-41d3-4899-854d-e97440239a3c","title":"预期：B1 继承源任务上下文，B2 继承 B1 上下文；三条任务各自独立可继续对话；任务详情中能看到各自的来源任务，来源指向正确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a3d59d70-868c-4002-ade8-e50cc934ab04","title":"🟠【P1】多级 Fork"},{"parent":"2bb8f1bc-72d8-4f22-97cb-2a4ef946d7a5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bde27990-8167-4223-91ec-6a907129e275","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0cc1f84a-cae0-4297-a7a3-77492df7ea92","title":"前置：前置：已从任务 A 创建分支 B1；角色：房间成员；入口：任务列表"},{"parent":"bde27990-8167-4223-91ec-6a907129e275","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"287fd2e7-6be8-4d13-a06a-da9ac5ba00c5","title":"操作：归档源任务 A，再打开分支 B1 并继续对话"},{"parent":"bde27990-8167-4223-91ec-6a907129e275","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"41f44473-5236-4aa4-871b-cd77bb666893","title":"预期：分支 B1 仍可打开且历史完整；可继续发送消息并收到回复；分支详情中来源任务标记为已归档但入口仍可查看"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bde27990-8167-4223-91ec-6a907129e275","title":"🟠【P1】源任务归档后查看既有分支"},{"parent":"2bb8f1bc-72d8-4f22-97cb-2a4ef946d7a5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ea0fc877-8823-4373-abb6-18f90f92ab45","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea598795-a2bf-4c14-8e76-57db5ca3bd49","title":"前置：前置：已从任务 A 创建分支 B1；角色：房间成员；入口：源任务输入框"},{"parent":"ea0fc877-8823-4373-abb6-18f90f92ab45","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b95bcc74-cbfe-4a3a-948a-6b13bd7591ce","title":"操作：在源任务发送新消息并等待回复，然后查看分支"},{"parent":"ea0fc877-8823-4373-abb6-18f90f92ab45","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b452cb61-44f4-4a2c-9a14-fdb0da112e91","title":"预期：源任务新增消息与回复；分支消息保持 Fork 时的状态不变，不出现源任务新消息串入分支"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ea0fc877-8823-4373-abb6-18f90f92ab45","title":"🟠【P1】源任务继续对话不影响分支"},{"parent":"2bb8f1bc-72d8-4f22-97cb-2a4ef946d7a5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e52372fb-287f-4e10-a828-3deaf9dfa2d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bb7ee569-66bf-4bb5-bc10-c0ac6289627c","title":"前置：前置：源任务某节点前包含图片、文档、代码块、引用消息和工具调用结果；角色：房间成员；入口：该节点上的 Fork 操作"},{"parent":"e52372fb-287f-4e10-a828-3deaf9dfa2d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bd7fb47a-1ca9-4286-847e-6744dd2c55bc","title":"操作：Fork 后在分支中查看并尝试打开每类内容"},{"parent":"e52372fb-287f-4e10-a828-3deaf9dfa2d2","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"805a9b5e-a900-4a92-89f1-70de08e1e5d0","title":"预期：分支中图片可正常预览、文档可点击打开、代码块渲染正常、引用消息可跳转、工具调用结果可展开；不出现附件裂图或无法加载预览"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e52372fb-287f-4e10-a828-3deaf9dfa2d2","title":"🟠【P1】附件与富内容继承"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2bb8f1bc-72d8-4f22-97cb-2a4ef946d7a5","title":"正常场景（11）"},{"parent":"4d4c6836-b651-454e-93af-9b5441e8cc0f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c07dcea4-de78-4f43-8c3f-6e64afef467e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1754c7ab-12fd-4d3f-a3a8-1a20a595adcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3b7fd2f8-57c8-413e-8912-dfd03ea052aa","title":"前置：前置：任务处于可 Fork 状态；角色：房间成员；入口：Fork 操作"},{"parent":"1754c7ab-12fd-4d3f-a3a8-1a20a595adcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"86148450-ff0e-4372-8bc3-724253b54f83","title":"操作：点击 Fork 后立即断开网络，等待若干秒后恢复网络"},{"parent":"1754c7ab-12fd-4d3f-a3a8-1a20a595adcb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"63c526ba-9ef5-4ce9-ab41-8277ed6ab9bc","title":"预期：断网期间给出请求失败或重试提示而非一直加载；恢复网络后重试可成功创建分支；不产生重复分支或空白分支"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1754c7ab-12fd-4d3f-a3a8-1a20a595adcb","title":"🟠【P1】Fork 请求期间断网"},{"parent":"c07dcea4-de78-4f43-8c3f-6e64afef467e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"80efc766-ed93-48a1-bfff-60ec0c08788b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"568aa809-0bcc-4456-8f65-48cb89b45038","title":"前置：前置：任务正在执行工具调用；角色：房间成员；入口：工具调用节点"},{"parent":"80efc766-ed93-48a1-bfff-60ec0c08788b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5bee2e28-4b28-4535-9104-ad662ac7fcbe","title":"操作：在工具调用执行期间 Fork，观察源任务与分支中的运行状态"},{"parent":"80efc766-ed93-48a1-bfff-60ec0c08788b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9f6080a1-3771-4b08-bf5d-72262fea9ee0","title":"预期：源任务的工具调用继续执行并正常收敛；分支中该工具调用不显示为持续进行中；两边状态最终一致，无长期卡在执行中的记录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"80efc766-ed93-48a1-bfff-60ec0c08788b","title":"🟠【P1】从正在执行工具调用的任务 Fork"},{"parent":"c07dcea4-de78-4f43-8c3f-6e64afef467e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"92b7a7a0-6405-4db7-8dbf-4fb31de5b3cf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"062b4f49-ed94-473d-8683-579137deae6c","title":"前置：前置：任务 D 正在生成回复；角色：房间成员；入口：正在生成的消息节点"},{"parent":"92b7a7a0-6405-4db7-8dbf-4fb31de5b3cf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d68ab172-7163-4f69-ad0f-0feeb638e848","title":"操作：在生成过程中尝试 Fork"},{"parent":"92b7a7a0-6405-4db7-8dbf-4fb31de5b3cf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bee90759-040a-44ee-add5-50c6e118b1fb","title":"预期：要么 Fork 入口在生成中不可用并给出说明，要么以已生成的完整消息为界创建分支；不出现分支内容截断到一半或分支与源任务同时继续输出同一段内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"92b7a7a0-6405-4db7-8dbf-4fb31de5b3cf","title":"🟠【P1】从正在生成回复的节点 Fork"},{"parent":"c07dcea4-de78-4f43-8c3f-6e64afef467e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bb9bdbe7-eb90-4cce-91b5-78e8f89747ae","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ce614470-87e8-49b1-b8cc-13512111eb74","title":"前置：前置：任务处于可 Fork 状态；角色：房间成员；入口：Fork 操作"},{"parent":"bb9bdbe7-eb90-4cce-91b5-78e8f89747ae","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5ac8ba6c-b6d6-4eae-b409-b80d84aef009","title":"操作：快速双击 Fork 按钮，并在请求未结束时再次触发"},{"parent":"bb9bdbe7-eb90-4cce-91b5-78e8f89747ae","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7def6f69-a75f-44c8-b48a-6547b9b6087d","title":"预期：只创建一个分支；按钮在请求期间置为不可点击；任务列表中不出现两条内容相同的分支"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bb9bdbe7-eb90-4cce-91b5-78e8f89747ae","title":"🟠【P1】连续双击或重复提交 Fork"},{"parent":"c07dcea4-de78-4f43-8c3f-6e64afef467e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ba163d78-25d2-460e-b5b9-3b80924d5653","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f5070bf0-2683-4bda-b6a1-7d91948f5e4a","title":"前置：前置：源任务中某附件已被删除或不可访问；角色：房间成员；入口：该附件之后节点的 Fork 操作"},{"parent":"ba163d78-25d2-460e-b5b9-3b80924d5653","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"19326348-8f33-419f-becc-ac9fea5404b4","title":"操作：执行 Fork 并在分支中点击该附件"},{"parent":"ba163d78-25d2-460e-b5b9-3b80924d5653","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dcf6ab4a-24f5-4ac4-8e63-b64447bd91bc","title":"预期：分支创建成功且文本消息完整；失效附件在分支中显示明确的不可用提示而非空白或崩溃；其他附件仍可正常打开"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ba163d78-25d2-460e-b5b9-3b80924d5653","title":"🟠【P1】附件源失效时 Fork"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c07dcea4-de78-4f43-8c3f-6e64afef467e","title":"异常场景（5）"},{"parent":"4d4c6836-b651-454e-93af-9b5441e8cc0f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"494d4516-6493-4ef6-b7e3-eb044b418208","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"95b789cb-7f49-49c5-b891-3bb1f3ff2b44","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b249b252-cb10-426a-9a9b-736808aa9637","title":"前置：前置：同一账号在两个客户端打开同一任务；角色：房间成员；入口：同一节点的 Fork 操作"},{"parent":"95b789cb-7f49-49c5-b891-3bb1f3ff2b44","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b87942ab-7f42-4d81-9025-f2e9ee0a21f0","title":"操作：两端几乎同时从该节点执行 Fork"},{"parent":"95b789cb-7f49-49c5-b891-3bb1f3ff2b44","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"391232a5-535c-4601-ac74-f87987312385","title":"预期：两端各自的操作结果一致：要么生成两条互相独立的分支，要么后发起的一次收到明确提示；不出现一端显示成功另一端一直加载，刷新后两端列表内容相同"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"95b789cb-7f49-49c5-b891-3bb1f3ff2b44","title":"🟡【P2】两端同时 Fork 同一节点"},{"parent":"494d4516-6493-4ef6-b7e3-eb044b418208","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"55ad7fc5-04eb-4025-ab1e-48f84b6f4863","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9432eb66-3720-4491-924b-c750d7ca6288","title":"前置：前置：任务仅包含一条用户消息；角色：房间成员；入口：该消息的 Fork 操作"},{"parent":"55ad7fc5-04eb-4025-ab1e-48f84b6f4863","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e99b522-274b-483c-9a9e-f3b6022eeb5e","title":"操作：从系统允许的最早节点执行 Fork"},{"parent":"55ad7fc5-04eb-4025-ab1e-48f84b6f4863","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"91e7c0e4-0ae5-4e44-8674-6b632dfeaa99","title":"预期：分支创建成功并包含该条消息；分支可继续对话；不出现空会话或创建失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"55ad7fc5-04eb-4025-ab1e-48f84b6f4863","title":"🟡【P2】最小内容任务 Fork"},{"parent":"494d4516-6493-4ef6-b7e3-eb044b418208","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1fdc372b-8f4e-4ed0-bbf1-b450cdbe22dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c89c0a0-fbee-4af0-97d8-9bb090ada231","title":"前置：前置：源任务正在对话中；角色：房间成员；入口：Fork 操作"},{"parent":"1fdc372b-8f4e-4ed0-bbf1-b450cdbe22dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fb548186-d1ff-4684-81c7-1cfacb21d232","title":"操作：提交 Fork 的同时在源任务继续发送消息"},{"parent":"1fdc372b-8f4e-4ed0-bbf1-b450cdbe22dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5880c4f5-3a88-4863-b46d-6c2b09117ae3","title":"预期：分支内容以 Fork 点为界，不包含 Fork 之后源任务新增的消息；源任务新消息正常展示；两条任务的消息顺序均正确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1fdc372b-8f4e-4ed0-bbf1-b450cdbe22dc","title":"🟡【P2】源任务在 Fork 期间继续产生消息"},{"parent":"494d4516-6493-4ef6-b7e3-eb044b418208","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a6ad3c47-eb5b-475b-a115-633c3a7244d0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"953033fd-d96b-4534-81f4-1e40d58e0e10","title":"前置：前置：源任务包含中文、英文、Emoji、RTL 文本、Markdown、超长 URL 和特殊字符；角色：房间成员；入口：Fork 操作"},{"parent":"a6ad3c47-eb5b-475b-a115-633c3a7244d0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"483210e5-8bbf-468c-8824-7dcec0794a43","title":"操作：执行 Fork 后逐条查看分支中的消息渲染"},{"parent":"a6ad3c47-eb5b-475b-a115-633c3a7244d0","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"16c7a26f-f97e-4f64-a8f9-02dbb2fc3e47","title":"预期：分支中各类字符与格式渲染与源任务一致，无乱码、截断或转义异常；超长 URL 换行展示且可点击"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a6ad3c47-eb5b-475b-a115-633c3a7244d0","title":"🟡【P2】特殊字符与多语言内容 Fork"},{"parent":"494d4516-6493-4ef6-b7e3-eb044b418208","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f91be598-0d67-41b9-adb2-64609bd6ab78","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6661de78-b647-48dd-9f08-d04456fe0f2d","title":"前置：前置：任务 C 的消息数量达到系统允许的较大规模；角色：房间成员；入口：Fork 操作"},{"parent":"f91be598-0d67-41b9-adb2-64609bd6ab78","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ce6e8028-2803-49de-bf98-57addd953402","title":"操作：分别从任务前部、中部、末尾各执行一次 Fork，核对继承内容与创建耗时"},{"parent":"f91be598-0d67-41b9-adb2-64609bd6ab78","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d62045d0-4697-4d55-9029-07130e7848fe","title":"预期：三次 Fork 均成功；分支继承的消息范围与 Fork 点一致；创建耗时在可接受范围内且界面不卡死"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f91be598-0d67-41b9-adb2-64609bd6ab78","title":"🟡【P2】超长任务在不同位置 Fork"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"494d4516-6493-4ef6-b7e3-eb044b418208","title":"边界场景（5）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4d4c6836-b651-454e-93af-9b5441e8cc0f","title":"会话分支"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"87fca23f-a4d3-46fc-8a5a-03f4c924573c","title":"会话分支（Fork）"},{"parent":"48b94977-fd2b-424c-8111-6d77d3db1d79","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"896675a0-1d3f-4da1-a749-c0fea396cff3","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"691e777a-ebe2-43be-b9e5-f7e31ba09d7c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"db85f7ab-742b-46be-9b26-695a868d7415","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e096f56f-404d-41db-83d4-c10d5eed018d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ca3fd591-5dcd-4cf5-9aaa-4423af6fd1b1","title":"操作：两个 Agent 选择同一项目分别执行读写任务"},{"parent":"e096f56f-404d-41db-83d4-c10d5eed018d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b377af05-173c-41fb-88a7-49589708587f","title":"预期：两个 Agent 可同时处于 running 状态；各自修改不同文件，不产生文件冲突；各自的文件卡片正确展示；两个任务均能独立完成"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e096f56f-404d-41db-83d4-c10d5eed018d","title":"🔴【P0】同项目不同Agent协作","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"db85f7ab-742b-46be-9b26-695a868d7415","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"850857a2-00eb-4437-a1bd-9f3d0ff4c3ea","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1b198c9c-f967-4131-8832-9c813f3391db","title":"操作：打开两个标签页，同时发起 {Agent} 和 {Agent} 会话"},{"parent":"850857a2-00eb-4437-a1bd-9f3d0ff4c3ea","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b0b7d39d-e817-4d91-8e60-3cd782af9cf8","title":"预期：各自会话独立运行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"850857a2-00eb-4437-a1bd-9f3d0ff4c3ea","title":"🔴【P0】相同多个Agent窗口并行","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"db85f7ab-742b-46be-9b26-695a868d7415","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"cb9bd7e2-f07b-4a46-b754-14d1ad14ea46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"774380e0-afd0-4060-90be-db54e67221f7","title":"操作：打开两个标签页，同时发起 {Agent1} 和 {Agent2} 会话"},{"parent":"cb9bd7e2-f07b-4a46-b754-14d1ad14ea46","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ee4ad109-2a43-4a36-a87f-3ea52b6e42a9","title":"预期：各自会话独立运行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"cb9bd7e2-f07b-4a46-b754-14d1ad14ea46","title":"🔴【P0】不同多个Agent窗口并行","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"db85f7ab-742b-46be-9b26-695a868d7415","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a635bfb6-58a0-434b-93d4-bac510b4b846","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76470bd7-9451-4491-a0be-721237a3a222","title":"操作：1.房主 Agent 修改 a.js → 2.协作者 Agent 同时修改 b.js → 3.查看文件系统窗口"},{"parent":"a635bfb6-58a0-434b-93d4-bac510b4b846","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c722d48c-1e0e-4bd9-8069-b841a75a0607","title":"预期：两个文件独立被修改，内容互不干扰；文件系统窗口显示两者的最新变更；各自的 Agent 窗口对话流中各有对应的文件改动卡片"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a635bfb6-58a0-434b-93d4-bac510b4b846","title":"🔴【P0】房主和协作者的 Agent 同时修改不同文件","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"db85f7ab-742b-46be-9b26-695a868d7415","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"81fc3f99-8522-4b36-abf7-02b5c739093d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fbcc52ed-b3ca-4702-a517-538c98be828f","title":"操作：一个 Agent 运行中，另一个 Agent 空闲"},{"parent":"81fc3f99-8522-4b36-abf7-02b5c739093d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"af2c28df-bff5-434b-b9e2-60a4c7ad8cf0","title":"预期：状态指示分别准确，不把运行状态串到其他 Agent"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"81fc3f99-8522-4b36-abf7-02b5c739093d","title":"🔴【P0】跨Agent状态展示","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"db85f7ab-742b-46be-9b26-695a868d7415","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dc39ed4f-4079-46ce-b278-2f3f6bb43a7f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f3a9c1ac-f77b-4af7-aabc-7a613039019d","title":"操作：1.房主给 {Agent} 发送\"实现 login 接口\" → 2.协作