-c146-4cb6-9a2a-8b11ba34a435","title":"🟠【P1】下载文件夹","icons":[{"color":"rgb(248, 87, 103)","name":"other","index":"369"}]},{"parent":"5630c861-10f6-4bca-9a9a-81480c54871a","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"84795290-2013-440a-9afe-bae224ab55c3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"00ee719f-f191-40c5-98c8-a26c3bcf6677","title":"前置：文件夹右键菜单已弹出；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的重命名项"},{"parent":"84795290-2013-440a-9afe-bae224ab55c3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"581698c2-9699-4d96-a117-b0ad40f07547","title":"操作：点击重命名并输入新名称后确认"},{"parent":"84795290-2013-440a-9afe-bae224ab55c3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9dcf8121-929f-46b8-895d-56cf62d2f58a","title":"预期：\n1) 文件落盘 ｜ 重命名成功，列表与本地目录同步更新"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"84795290-2013-440a-9afe-bae224ab55c3","title":"🟠【P1】重命名文件夹","icons":[{"color":"rgb(248, 87, 103)","name":"other","index":"369"}]},{"parent":"5630c861-10f6-4bca-9a9a-81480c54871a","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"53880bd4-a3e9-4e34-8267-23e3a8446fec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"80e529ff-12b1-4b2c-8c7e-41db36f8f53f","title":"前置：文件夹右键菜单已弹出；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的删除项"},{"parent":"53880bd4-a3e9-4e34-8267-23e3a8446fec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"12c95157-2d67-43d5-a247-d01d71b5a749","title":"操作：点击删除并完成确认"},{"parent":"53880bd4-a3e9-4e34-8267-23e3a8446fec","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2843d030-b1e9-4733-b20b-cb938494ac43","title":"预期：\n1) 文件落盘 ｜ 目标文件夹被删除或移入回收站，文件列表同步刷新\n2) 副作用 ｜ 本地对应目录按产品定义同步删除"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"53880bd4-a3e9-4e34-8267-23e3a8446fec","title":"🔴【P0】删除文件夹","icons":[{"color":"rgb(248, 87, 103)","name":"other","index":"369"}]}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5630c861-10f6-4bca-9a9a-81480c54871a","title":"正常场景（8）"},{"parent":"0abf6256-c5c6-4fbf-9d97-a19b7bbcdf63","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"9e94739f-03de-4456-bb8a-51e4a86d06f5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9f435483-2771-47b3-b344-2394cecdf130","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c6ba3c85-7616-4477-8259-b537a6838f65","title":"前置：同级目录下已