":[],"children":[],"id":"2a959f36-0d46-4642-985c-5e1b2c01f21f","title":"前置：新建弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：新建文件或文件夹的名称输入框"},{"parent":"a5c7ae2e-34cd-4bd6-80b7-62ef44fb69ff","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d0df5138-5568-48ee-be3f-ecb4ab8a9ad6","title":"操作：先留空直接确认，再输入超过 255 个 UTF-8 字节的名称确认"},{"parent":"a5c7ae2e-34cd-4bd6-80b7-62ef44fb69ff","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"96e04be8-eac6-41c8-8c6e-b084eb968493","title":"预期：\n1) 按钮状态 ｜ 名称为空时不可提交\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 超长时报错并说明最大长度为 255 个 UTF-8 字节"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a5c7ae2e-34cd-4bd6-80b7-62ef44fb69ff","title":"🟠【P1】名称为空或超长"},{"parent":"9e94739f-03de-4456-bb8a-51e4a86d06f5","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3ff68556-e298-4732-a413-23e1e6e91afb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"22c8e71d-c65b-4b5d-acd8-6a631a44427a","title":"前置：存在包含受保护文件的非空文件夹；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的删除项"},{"parent":"3ff68556-e298-4732-a413-23e1e6e91afb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7b495031-ce5e-4ce0-a47e-bb394d2d0037","title":"操作：右键该文件夹并点击删除"},{"parent":"3ff68556-e298-4732-a413-23e1e6e91afb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"67321288-5ace-49a3-b4f3-a4d0143008cc","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 删除失败时提示具体原因\n2) 副作用 ｜ 未删除内容仍完整保留，列表状态准确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3ff68556-e298-4732-a413-23e1e6e91afb","title":"🟠【P1】删除非空文件夹失败"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"9e94739f-03de-4456-bb8a-51e4a86d06f5","title":"异常场景（5）"},{"parent":"0abf6256-c5c6-4fbf-9d97-a19b7bbcdf63","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"855387d1-0b64-43f2-b5e4-b70ca26514ad","callout":[],"lineStyle":{},"children":[{"parent":"32f4ec1b-f99c-41de-8286-cde6a8a2f023","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4c40aed4-e98a-4bdc-9e20-279220062bf1","title":"前置：本地存在超过 5GB 的文件；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的上传项"},{"parent":"32f4ec1b-f99c-41de-8286-cde6a8a2f023","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc3a0c4b-0b68-4e54-8c7f-730dd5011558","title":"操作：选择该文件上传"},{"parent":"32f4ec1b-f99c-41de-8286-cde6a8a2f023","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"401028f9-3813-4260-b4d6-89c63cd2afa2","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 给出超出大小限制的明确提示，不静默失败也不卡住传输中心"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"32f4ec1b-f99c-41de-8286-cde6a8a2f023","title":"🟡【P2】上传超过 5GB"},{"parent":"855387d1-0b64-43f2-b5e4-b70ca26514ad","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7b8b015e-3252-485d-84ab-ab71afe0e84c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e4596d04-52f5-4644-a5f5-341c6cd46630","title":"前置：文件列表中的文件夹位于窗口右侧或底部边缘；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"7b8b015e-3252-485d-84ab-ab71afe0e84c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c12982b8-73a8-41ea-947d-331e685b94c9","title":"操作：在该位置右键文件夹"},{"parent":"7b8b015e-3252-485d-84ab-ab71afe0e84c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f1dbb049-ceb6-493b-99b1-a6b2b95ba283","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 菜单自动调整展示方向，完整显示所有菜单项，不被窗口边界或 Dock 遮挡"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7b8b015e-3252-485d-84ab-ab71afe0e84c","title":"🟡【P2】菜单靠近窗口边缘"},{"parent":"855387d1-0b64-43f2-b5e4-b70ca26514ad","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e16853b3-f7d6-45e5-807e-9475f49ff17f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e3c9c3cc-3f97-4514-88b6-e0a18ec30f08","title":"前置：列表中存在 folder-a、folder-b、folder-c；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"e16853b3-f7d6-45e5-807e-9475f49ff17f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3b108296-933a-4959-8116-efeb7a03b2db","title":"操作：连续右键这三个文件夹"},{"parent":"e16853b3-f7d6-45e5-807e-9475f49ff17f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4989875-35da-43e5-a6b8-d4c1e52b0fd0","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 同一时间只展示一个菜单\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 菜单操作目标始终为最后右键的文件夹"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e16853b3-f7d6-45e5-807e-9475f49ff17f","title":"🟡【P2】连续右键不同文件夹"},{"parent":"855387d1-0b64-43f2-b5e4-b70ca26514ad","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8ab40263-be1e-49a9-84c8-58363cf7b751","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9d32c527-15a7-4609-bb11-183eca30dbec","title":"前置：存在名称超过 100 字符的文件夹；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"8ab40263-be1e-49a9-84c8-58363cf7b751","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f268d096-5f7f-4689-a233-9db80bdf087d","title":"操作：右键该文件夹并执行打开"},{"parent":"8ab40263-be1e-49a9-84c8-58363cf7b751","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"29be2647-bf01-46b7-983f-0265261a5a54","titl