b3-435c-8214-f3fd522ae88e","title":"前置：工作区文件列表已打开且存在 CHANGELOG.md；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"1f6c4654-622b-4132-9362-87c1ea31fa03","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"67e6e5ca-fac7-4e5d-87d0-6e0807e85ef2","title":"操作：右键该文件"},{"parent":"1f6c4654-622b-4132-9362-87c1ea31fa03","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"092c25ee-0404-4abc-80a2-44f749e2c5e3","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 在鼠标位置附近弹出菜单，包含打开、下载、分享、重命名、复制路径、删除\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 删除项使用红色危险样式"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1f6c4654-622b-4132-9362-87c1ea31fa03","title":"🔴【P0】右键文件弹出菜单"},{"parent":"f4ba9c8f-995f-4623-99c8-409948e12b79","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ca77a8a0-616d-4b03-85bb-08ca43403b7a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a6ac06eb-0685-4449-8694-3cf288c5b42a","title":"前置：文件右键菜单已弹出；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的打开项"},{"parent":"ca77a8a0-616d-4b03-85bb-08ca43403b7a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2015c46d-b00b-4b9c-b2b2-99c39c2be7b4","title":"操作：右键 README.md 后点击打开"},{"parent":"ca77a8a0-616d-4b03-85bb-08ca43403b7a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9b22795b-05ab-4cfe-9b1e-3d48a954cd23","title":"预期：\n1) 标签页 ｜ 使用产品定义的查看器或编辑器打开该文件\n2) 目录导航 ｜ 保持当前目录状态，关闭后可返回原位置"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ca77a8a0-616d-4b03-85bb-08ca43403b7a","title":"🔴【P0】打开文件"},{"parent":"f4ba9c8f-995f-4623-99c8-409948e12b79","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8b90cfd5-465e-4ef5-bfc2-094e4d26e3d8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0ed8b4d5-931c-47d3-90c7-39adf39ae76a","title":"前置：文件右键菜单已弹出；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的下载项"},{"parent":"8b90cfd5-465e-4ef5-bfc2-094e4d26e3d8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8aad1b22-69e3-4706-a9e5-d5605d83f759","title":"操作：点击下载，在保存弹窗中修改名称、标签与位置后保存"},{"parent":"8b90cfd5-465e-4ef5-bfc2-094e4d26e3d8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ef45556-be7c-4185-bb8e-357a7b77322c","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 弹出保存弹窗，可修改下载的名称、标签和位置\n2) 产物预览 ｜ 保存后下载成功，文件内容与线上一致"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8b90cfd5-465e-4ef5-bfc2-094e4d26e3d8","title":"🟠【P1】下载文件"},{"parent":"f4ba9c8f-995f-4623-99c8-409948e12b79","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"42667b14-1c01-441a-b0b4-df1b9dbd56b2","callout":[],