b79","title":"正常场景（6）"},{"parent":"9b9066bb-565b-4710-93d4-6939139ad429","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"30bea319-68ec-4ac0-a7ad-ae74d4ad27d2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"bdc4b523-11e1-4fbd-9b92-123836810c6f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f95e4371-c8e6-4ccc-ada5-c6550a71aafa","title":"前置：存在损坏文件或不支持预览格式的文件；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的打开项"},{"parent":"bdc4b523-11e1-4fbd-9b92-123836810c6f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"297226b8-03a1-4ad0-958e-9ce63258ed5e","title":"操作：右键该文件后点击打开"},{"parent":"bdc4b523-11e1-4fbd-9b92-123836810c6f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c9fbfd40-03da-4841-88c1-ee4f18683139","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 展示无法打开或不支持预览提示\n2) 菜单展示 ｜ 菜单关闭，文件列表保持可操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"bdc4b523-11e1-4fbd-9b92-123836810c6f","title":"🟠【P1】文件打开失败"},{"parent":"30bea319-68ec-4ac0-a7ad-ae74d4ad27d2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"623120bb-9708-4ea9-a54e-abec0e6f23eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f89059ee-b877-4d13-9eb5-60513e491489","title":"前置：右键菜单已弹出，随后该文件在本地被删除；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的打开项"},{"parent":"623120bb-9708-4ea9-a54e-abec0e6f23eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7f571013-ab4b-490d-ba1f-9c6c198f2b89","title":"操作：点击打开"},{"parent":"623120bb-9708-4ea9-a54e-abec0e6f23eb","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc970126-7f7e-4824-a4cc-374ba6f25725","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示文件不存在并刷新列表\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 详情面板清空或更新为当前实际状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"623120bb-9708-4ea9-a54e-abec0e6f23eb","title":"🟠【P1】打开时文件已不存在"},{"parent":"30bea319-68ec-4ac0-a7ad-ae74d4ad27d2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"42d30272-0541-48e8-8dcd-65c32f85623a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"23ea9b11-b9b7-4fa7-9314-334b74d71cc6","title":"前置：存在只读文件；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的删除项"},{"parent":"42d30272-0541-48e8-8dcd-65c32f85623a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1bc32410-2240-408f-8069-e0092a93e5d2","title":"操作：右键该文件并点击删除"},{"parent":"42d30272-0541-48e8-8dcd-65c32f85623a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"31917210-fbb3-4a51-97b3-f98b3165051e","title":"预期：\n1) 权限授权 ｜ 无删除权限时提示失败原因\n2) 副作用 ｜ 不从工作区列表中错误移除"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"42d30272-0541-48e8-8dcd-65c32f85623a","title":"🟠【P1】删除只读文件"},{"parent":"30bea319-68ec-4ac0-a7ad-ae74d4ad27d2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6c5ccbaf-39e0-4c78-a544-a4470b64747d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4909d17b-4fee-40c1-a178-3140b22f9952","title":"前置：系统已拒绝该应用的剪贴板访问；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的复制路径项"},{"parent":"6c5ccbaf-39e0-4c78-a544-a4470b64747d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c314d6b3-c2e9-48f9-a8c3-a77e1ecfc91f","title":"操作：点击复制路径"},{"parent":"6c5ccbaf-39e0-4c78-a544-a4470b64747d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"86e869d9-09df-4b3f-8be5-0b8c8def8f4a","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 提示复制失败，并给出手动复制入口或错误说明"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6c5ccbaf-39e0-4c78-a544-a4470b64747d","title":"🟠【P1】剪贴板权限被拒绝"},{"parent":"30bea319-68ec-4ac0-a7ad-ae74d4ad27d2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"68ce6ad1-d744-4190-93eb-84eb317fa066","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e140da9a-11d8-429a-a753-753860277cbf","title":"前置：构造本地删除成功但工作区同步失败的场景；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的删除项"},{"parent":"68ce6ad1-d744-4190-93eb-84eb317fa066","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"aa539679-0d5d-434f-b5fe-8b5405033b31","title":"操作：右键文件点击删除并确认"},{"parent":"68ce6ad1-d744-4190-93eb-84eb317fa066","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a421d92f-758c-4082-8e5f-51d3ea397c09","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 展示同步失败状态，可点击刷新或重试\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 重试或刷新后两侧校准为一致状态"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"68ce6ad1-d744-4190-93eb-84eb317fa066","title":"🟠【P1】删除过程中同步失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"30bea319-68ec-4ac0-a7ad-ae74d4ad27d2","title":"异常场景（5）"},{"parent":"9b9066bb-565b-4710-93d4-6939139ad429","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"85566e94-56dc-48c0-bd0c-0caed9265d73","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5a834c54-aa25-4e2c-99c1-d32645348c7a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a191177a-9744-4462-9674-40e75dda54b0","title":"前置：存在大于 1GB 的文件；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的打开项"},{"parent":"5a834c54-aa25-4e2c-99c1-d32645348c7a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ce875caf-cb3d-4870-90fe-3b4da46a3208","title":"操作：右键该文件后点击打开"},{"parent":"5a834c54-aa25-4e2c-99c1-d32645348c7a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"de18eba0-8065-45fd-b82f-9c7fef992485","title":"预期：\n1) 性能 ｜ 按产品定义提示大文件处理方式，不阻塞整个文件窗口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5a834c54-aa25-4e2c-99c1-d32645348c7a","title":"🟡【P2】打开大文件"},{"parent":"85566e94-56dc-48c0-bd0c-0caed9265d73","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0f6d3df2-87c3-48af-8a8b-85c49d7b65ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8c39a2b3-edc6-4afd-b830-a6b99ae726ce","title":"前置：存在 0 字节文件；角色：房间成员；入口：右键菜单的打开项"},{"parent":"0f6d3df2-87c3-48af-8a8b-85c49d7b65ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c4265da9-b408-4542-aceb-45bf500a875e","title":"操作：右键该文件后点击打开"},{"parent":"0f6d3df2-87c3-48af-8a8b-85c49d7b65ce","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9e7195a5-daff-476d-8940-6c649ee0988b","title":"预期：\n1) 产物预览 ｜ 打开空内容视图或提示文件为空，文件状态正常"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0f6d3df2-87c3-48af-8a8b-85c49d7b65ce","title":"🟡【P2】打开零字节文件"},{"parent":"85566e94-56dc-48c0-bd0c-0caed9265d73","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0c8b36f3-3b9c-43fe-a4a2-a6667c2eb27c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"49fd7512-daf3-4dfe-8caa-42b816658867","title":"前置：存在包含中文、空格、括号、井号与 emoji 的文件；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"0c8b36f3-3b9c-43fe-a4a2-a6667c2eb27c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"14c77ead-fac2-45c3-911b-9d68c976a7ba","title":"操作：右键该文件并依次执行打开、复制路径、删除"},{"parent":"0c8b36f3-3b9c-43fe-a4a2-a6667c2eb27c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2f9a1818-51ca-4428-bd32-627e6ddd6591","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 菜单正常展示不乱码\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 三项操作均使用正确完整的路径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0c8b36f3-3b9c-43fe-a4a2-a6667c2eb27c","title":"🟡【P2】特殊字符文件名"},{"parent":"85566e94-56dc-48c0-bd0c-0caed9265d73","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"faccec68-3bec-4db5-97dd-5d194b6d7b4c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"872186e4-653d-4398-b674-3f500f92c114","title":"前置：列表中有多个文件；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"faccec68-3bec-4db5-97dd-5d194b6d7b4c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b3835a89-71ca-449e-93c8-1a74d6afd25d","title":"操作：快速连续右键多个文件后点击打开"},{"parent":"faccec68-3bec-4db5-97dd-5d194b6d7b4c","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1ae05b71-2186-4f08-9849-9aff5a8c63ca","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 菜单目标与最终点击项一致，不打开之前右键过的文件"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"faccec68-3bec-4db5-97dd-5d194b6d7b4c","title":"🟡【P2】快速连续右键多个文件"},{"parent":"85566e94-56dc-48c0-bd0c-0caed9265d73","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"54599123-e7a0-49ba-9247-4d68e5c2fc76","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"def96395-4b71-4767-ba32-6220ad30469b","title":"前置：项目中存在 .env 与 .gitignore；角色：房间成员；入口：工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"54599123-e7a0-49ba-9247-4d68e5c2fc76","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6ecacc46-5df3-4309-8b33-833c505e86db","title":"操作：右键这两个文件"},{"parent":"54599123-e7a0-49ba-9247-4d68e5c2fc76","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"787b1414-60ce-4908-923d-16646eef1d77","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 按产品设置展示菜单\n2) 权限授权 ｜ 敏感文件的打开与复制路径符合安全策略，不明文暴露密钥"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"54599123-e7a0-49ba-9247-4d68e5c2fc76","title":"🟡【P2】隐藏文件右键菜单"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"85566e94-56dc-48c0-bd0c-0caed9265d73","title":"边界场景（5）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"9b9066bb-565b-4710-93d4-6939139ad429","title":"文件更多菜单"},{"parent":"11a156a2-0a09-4a9e-b981-bf040e1857eb","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"aa45178d-c6e5-4dde-bb78-b73f5fc3e025","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"047b0f7a-9579-4532-92cf-158035be3e24","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5c411350-09ee-40cd-9165-22da7f9fb607","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"113763d8-a08d-4c40-8df8-25e6b8dd8fb5","title":"前置：同一个文件同时出现在产物区与工作区文件列表；角色：房间成员；入口：产物区与工作区文件列表"},{"parent":"5c411350-09ee-40cd-9165-22da7f9fb607","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"49dfd632-37a7-490a-b1cb-38fb72974fb4","title":"操作：在两处分别右键该文件"},{"parent":"5c411350-09ee-40cd-9165-22da7f9fb607","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5258bee9-3145-4953-baca-80b6ecfea7f2","title":"预期：\n1) 菜单展示 ｜ 两处菜单项完全一致，不出现某一处少了分享或复制路径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5c411350-09ee-40cd-9165-22da7f9fb607","title":"🟠【P1】同一文件在两处的右键菜单一致"},{"parent":"047b0f7a-9579-4532-92cf-158035be3e24","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dab88be9-2894-463b-8489-f20adcf003ea","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f8416d31-c34c-4b5b-b1ea-1dd21db1c7f5","title":"前置：同一个文件同时出现在