异常场景（1）"},{"parent":"67faa061-486d-490e-99b2-cdcf76ec4a1b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1af60fd1-a579-41fd-bcae-31504646eac9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5592850f-93d4-4a22-ae08-6547e9daae4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"cba897b3-a63d-4cef-9c2d-2b73a1f9cbbc","title":"前置：关联会话详情中包含图片消息；角色：非房间成员；入口：分享链接页面"},{"parent":"5592850f-93d4-4a22-ae08-6547e9daae4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d61b8dcb-2a0a-40e7-8cd0-ceb2ad28a881","title":"操作：打开分享链接并进入关联会话详情"},{"parent":"5592850f-93d4-4a22-ae08-6547e9daae4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bbf0bf8c-e8cc-4307-9dd6-074b707705a9","title":"预期：\n1) 产物预览 ｜ 图片不展示预览图，显示「图片暂时无法预览，请前往房间查看」"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5592850f-93d4-4a22-ae08-6547e9daae4b","title":"🟡【P2】分享链接中的图片预览"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1af60fd1-a579-41fd-bcae-31504646eac9","title":"边界场景（1）"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"text-decoration":"line-through"},"id":"67faa061-486d-490e-99b2-cdcf76ec4a1b","title":"关联会话"},{"parent":"b137e92d-b3ee-4cbc-87f3-dab75739cd13","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"236e8cb2-94cd-4958-b859-400992e726b0","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0288c248-9afd-437c-b479-56cd7ac8a646","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"01aa1aef-0af1-4620-aca2-e47f1cc52897","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1a126695-4ccd-4147-85ab-a3977e7c266a","title":"前置：分享弹窗已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：分享弹窗的可见范围选项"},{"parent":"01aa1aef-0af1-4620-aca2-e47f1cc52897","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8f493607-f8ed-4bd9-8a98-bb9c4e19a2bf","title":"操作：选择仅房间成员可见并点击分享，再用非房间成员账号打开链接"},{"parent":"01aa1aef-0af1-4620-aca2-e47f1cc52897","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0516e0ab-355b-4283-8697-19ca06f813b5","title":"预期：\n1) 可见范围 ｜ 非房间成员打开不可见，页面显示「仅房间成员可见」\n2) 可见范围 ｜ 房间成员打开可正常查看文件与关联会话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"01aa1aef-0af1-4620-aca2-e47f1cc52897","title":"🔴【P0】仅房间成员可见","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"0288c248-9afd-437c-b479-56cd7ac8a646","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a9aa31a4-a926-473c-8800-115affa93eb3","callout":[],"children":[],"id