置：终端中已执行过多条命令；角色：房间成员；入口：终端输入区"},{"parent":"42ecc59d-7437-42e8-830c-71b88067b156","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e4d419d5-c1b5-4ff1-8282-7428c6fe24f7","title":"操作：按上下方向键切换历史命令"},{"parent":"42ecc59d-7437-42e8-830c-71b88067b156","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dcc1cccd-ad2a-48b4-93e1-b01a131ab0ac","title":"预期：\n1) 命令执行 ｜ 历史命令正确显示且顺序正确，可直接回车重复执行"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"42ecc59d-7437-42e8-830c-71b88067b156","title":"🟠【P1】命令历史记录"},{"parent":"c1557beb-cfad-415c-8979-e63002a0c56e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c375a576-7431-4672-8a5d-2529371d8efc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8eb6b4bb-a3d4-499c-aa4b-0db9645c0cad","title":"前置：会话已绑定项目；角色：房间成员；入口：新打开的终端窗口"},{"parent":"c375a576-7431-4672-8a5d-2529371d8efc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f432b295-d06c-4c7a-9f41-3e4f799dc472","title":"操作：查看默认工作目录并执行 pwd"},{"parent":"c375a576-7431-4672-8a5d-2529371d8efc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2773d8ad-6ef4-4596-a251-8e00df29b11f","title":"预期：\n1) 环境隔离 ｜ 默认进入该会话所属项目的工作目录，如 /workspace/xxx\n2) 环境隔离 ｜ 不落在用户主目录或上一个项目的目录"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c375a576-7431-4672-8a5d-2529371d8efc","title":"🔴【P0】默认工作目录正确","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"c1557beb-cfad-415c-8979-e63002a0c56e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4c93649f-6b55-4402-8030-ce003411dbc9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f31af479-7b0f-4b33-b828-b6212520ce77","title":"前置：终端窗口与工作区文件列表都已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：终端输入区"},{"parent":"4c93649f-6b55-4402-8030-ce003411dbc9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9c7da4a8-edf2-4f26-93de-bb0fdca0fcf8","title":"操作：执行 touch test.txt 后查看文件列表，再执行 rm test.txt 后再次查看"},{"parent":"4c93649f-6b55-4402-8030-ce003411dbc9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea0f23c3-048f-4d50-a1d0-092842def105","title":"预期：\n1) 文件落盘 ｜ 文件列表中同步出现新建文件\n2) 文件落盘 ｜ 删除后文件列表中对应项同步消失"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4c93649f-6b55-4402-8030-ce003411dbc9","title":"🔴【P0】终端创建删除文件与文件列表联动","icons":[{"color":"rgb(40, 191, 90)","name":"other","index":"368"}]},{"parent":"c1557beb-cfad-415c-8979-e63002a