e,"id":"8a0302c5-0f75-4482-8d19-dd87db4a96b7","title":"🟠【P1】断网时使用终端"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0b2d4131-933d-4120-9dfd-70c113f6848e","title":"异常场景（2）"},{"parent":"8750647a-39f3-454e-99a8-9a358d9d4a2c","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ccd9a564-4ffd-47d2-8420-ec3c41d4257b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"663aacea-2cfd-4e4d-be36-2030270c1a1b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"51d469b7-4af0-45f6-a356-47e69ad20fbb","title":"前置：终端窗口已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：终端输入区"},{"parent":"663aacea-2cfd-4e4d-be36-2030270c1a1b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5043f2f-aec1-4894-b5b2-d9db829a29cc","title":"操作：执行一个持续数分钟的命令并在过程中切到其他标签再切回"},{"parent":"663aacea-2cfd-4e4d-be36-2030270c1a1b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"77efe934-362a-4458-bd6a-bca548e0bce1","title":"预期：\n1) 命令执行 ｜ 命令持续运行不被切换标签打断\n2) 列表展示 ｜ 切回后输出完整，不丢失中间内容"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"663aacea-2cfd-4e4d-be36-2030270c1a1b","title":"🟡【P2】长时间运行的命令"},{"parent":"ccd9a564-4ffd-47d2-8420-ec3c41d4257b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d58e95e3-bb89-4bc4-b424-c1ab6b5736b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6b1dd895-43c0-456a-8d20-905be1848c40","title":"前置：终端窗口已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：终端输入区"},{"parent":"d58e95e3-bb89-4bc4-b424-c1ab6b5736b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"09942430-e1ca-40a8-a699-d0940ad3b833","title":"操作：执行会产生数万行输出的命令"},{"parent":"d58e95e3-bb89-4bc4-b424-c1ab6b5736b4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5797080a-b762-4186-b8bc-6f2c640efac1","title":"预期：\n1) 性能 ｜ 输出按产品定义截断或分段展示并给出提示，界面不卡死\n2) 提示文案 ｜ 明确给出查看完整输出的方式"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d58e95e3-bb89-4bc4-b424-c1ab6b5736b4","title":"🟡【P2】超大输出"},{"parent":"ccd9a564-4ffd-47d2-8420-ec3c41d4257b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"750d9d0f-a205-43d2-a23c-8ba583ced8ed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b7608c57-569b-4811-b37c-788675927def","title":"前置：终端窗口已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：终端输入区"},{"parent":"750d9d0f-a205-43d2-a23c-8ba583ced8ed","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"757b440d-f5aa-40d2-8a01-e90306f3d626","title":"操作：执行需要确认或输入密码的交互式命令"},{"parent":"750d9d0f-a205-43d2-a23c-8ba583ced8ed","callout":[],