6","title":"🔴【P0】新建网页窗口"},{"parent":"c102e147-2a33-4991-a021-825e242694a7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"d6488b41-0a0f-4da0-8f09-8b8207bc6c62","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"97666951-730e-4adf-b1c7-6d2d4b59d967","title":"前置：至少存在一个网页窗口；角色：房间成员；入口：窗口关闭按钮"},{"parent":"d6488b41-0a0f-4da0-8f09-8b8207bc6c62","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7b57df9c-70d7-44f0-9e96-945335dd2286","title":"操作：点击关闭按钮"},{"parent":"d6488b41-0a0f-4da0-8f09-8b8207bc6c62","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2572c5c6-6971-4562-b7c1-681e8e346419","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 窗口正常关闭并从列表移除\n2) 副作用 ｜ 无残留进程，页面中的定时任务停止"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"d6488b41-0a0f-4da0-8f09-8b8207bc6c62","title":"🔴【P0】关闭网页窗口"},{"parent":"c102e147-2a33-4991-a021-825e242694a7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0650a460-98de-4d18-8ee3-587727224b39","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4ed37813-5eec-4dee-965e-fe9bd8e7b167","title":"前置：浏览器标签页已打开；角色：房间成员；入口：新建窗口按钮"},{"parent":"0650a460-98de-4d18-8ee3-587727224b39","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"df15624e-4e8d-4092-9f7a-4f6013109430","title":"操作：连续新建 3 个以上窗口并分别访问不同网页"},{"parent":"0650a460-98de-4d18-8ee3-587727224b39","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f9b0d944-f800-4d00-b537-53791bc46d77","title":"预期：\n1) 环境隔离 ｜ 多个窗口独立运行，互不干扰\n2) 环境隔离 ｜ 一个窗口崩溃或卡住不影响其他窗口"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0650a460-98de-4d18-8ee3-587727224b39","title":"🟠【P1】同时创建多个网页窗口"},{"parent":"c102e147-2a33-4991-a021-825e242694a7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"409a61ff-58a7-4698-bea5-81babc4eae16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a218b533-ca5f-40eb-8a13-bd2e097682da","title":"前置：已创建多个网页窗口；角色：房间成员；入口：浏览器窗口列表"},{"parent":"409a61ff-58a7-4698-bea5-81babc4eae16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"21e35dd2-5318-4881-abd3-dbb349ccd6f9","title":"操作：查看窗口列表并点击其中一条"},{"parent":"409a61ff-58a7-4698-bea5-81babc4eae16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3debc784-edb2-4a2d-8d4a-967fd2a17a8d","title":"预期：\n1) 列表展示 ｜ 已创建窗口在列表中展示，名称与预览正确\n2) 跳转定位 ｜ 点击后快速切换到对应窗口，页面状态保持"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"409a61ff-58a7-4698-bea5-81babc4eae16","title":"🟠【P1】窗口列表展示与切换"},{"parent":"c102e147-2a33-4991-a021-825e242694a7","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a4f41542-e1e0-4c89-a089-ad1351e5ae47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"180555ea-5a88-4bcf-ad27-6595b19d8c4a","title":"前置：已创建多个网页窗口；角色：房间成员；入口：房间"},{"parent":"a4f41542-e1e0-4c89-a089-ad1351e5ae47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d1642197-4fea-4ae4-96be-32e14d95c10b","title":"操作：关闭房间后重新进入并打开浏览器"},{"parent":"a4f41542-e1e0-4c89-a089-ad1351e5ae47","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d5eaf645-c906-4e47-89b7-e2f2dd07d1ac","title":"预期：\n1) 持久化 ｜ 已创建的网页窗口列表保留，状态恢复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a4f41542-e1e0-4c89-a089-ad1351e5ae47","title":"🔴【P0】重开房间后窗口恢复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c102e147-2a33-4991-a021-825e242694a7","title":"正常场景（6）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"dde6f780-12f1-4dc7-bf48-7392b9ecf21a","title":"浏览器窗口管理"},{"parent":"c6c5be0e-c7a7-4f52-a4b9-62b991770990","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"9a96fbb6-3ea4-4f4a-ba24-ac28260d9ab9","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"83cf8413-48db-4c96-9370-c8d7a8964ef1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"ed5df984-69f4-4282-b67c-35dcf9700e48","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4a84dd8f-d3c2-40f4-964e-2818be00a0f4","title":"前置：浏览器窗口已打开且地址栏可输入；角色：房间成员；入口：地址栏"},{"parent":"ed5df984-69f4-4282-b67c-35dcf9700e48","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"96f1349d-65a8-4561-b857-71bbfca25f0d","title":"操作：输入完整 URL 并回车"},{"parent":"ed5df984-69f4-4282-b67c-35dcf9700e48","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4c96b439-0e8a-426c-8c18-1d2a666d2dee","title":"预期：\n1) 性能 ｜ 网页正常加载，不出现白屏或长时间卡顿\n2) 视觉展示 ｜ 加载过程有进度反馈"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"ed5df984-69f4-4282-b67c-35dcf9700e48","title":"🔴【P0】输入 URL 访问网页"},{"parent":"83cf8413-48db-4c96-9370-c8d7a8964ef1","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"85237fc5-5dfa-4b5a-9569-956961261b50","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"71441da0-97fb-4610-bbb2-dec31234a2bd","title":"前置：已在同一窗口浏览过多个页面；角色：房间成员；入口：地址栏左侧的导航按钮"},{"parent":"85237fc5-5dfa-4b5a-9569-956961261b50","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1c3c0238-9c7c-4f7c-9690-4339d4326048","title":"操作：依次点击后退、