allout":[],"children":[{"parent":"909c5f80-6438-4518-8e2d-a9869bc99850","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"45dd4c76-c601-442a-a8f4-9c89827728ef","title":"前置：项目甲、乙均有同名测试技能，分别返回 SKILL-A 和 SKILL-B；个人技能可用。"},{"parent":"909c5f80-6438-4518-8e2d-a9869bc99850","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9f7f087e-0f39-4c11-9d12-dc8d21b03331","title":"操作：<br>1) 在项目甲调用测试技能。<br>2) 在项目乙调用同名技能，再返回项目甲原会话调用。"},{"parent":"909c5f80-6438-4518-8e2d-a9869bc99850","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e773b302-4d02-40fa-ba16-4d06d9295cea","title":"预期：<br>1) 调用结果｜甲始终返回 SKILL-A，乙返回 SKILL-B。<br>2) 配置保留｜不串用其他项目指令，不改写个人技能来源。"},{"parent":"909c5f80-6438-4518-8e2d-a9869bc99850","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fa87ff19-1bd3-41c0-ae66-5bc8ba152c32","title":"待确认：Q14 各 Agent 的功能支持范围"}],"id":"909c5f80-6438-4518-8e2d-a9869bc99850","title":"🟠【P1】同名项目技能按项目分别生效"},{"parent":"69e13b07bf2d7982","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"dcaa60eb-55e3-45a9-8294-5c2038bfb541","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9c582426-292f-4630-956a-657641c9314c","title":"前置：当前 Agent 和系统版本已确认支持此功能；项目甲会话可用，授权有效。"},{"parent":"dcaa60eb-55e3-45a9-8294-5c2038bfb541","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3045c868-3758-4e8f-ae55-a4989b2b6b4b","title":"操作：<br>1) 从实际菜单选择模型并发送测试消息。<br>2) 重新进入或恢复对应会话核对。"},{"parent":"dcaa60eb-55e3-45a9-8294-5c2038bfb541","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"38ff47ae-5332-4fe6-9948-5ca263f5c814","title":"预期：<br>1) 功能结果｜实际执行使用所选模型。<br>2) 执行归属｜仍使用绑定电脑和项目甲，已确认的设置或交互记录保留，不重复提交。"},{"parent":"dcaa60eb-55e3-45a9-8294-5c2038bfb541","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"96ac0728-2b0b-4e76-87e3-89ecdf6d1b14","title":"待确认：Q14 各 Agent 的功能支持范围"}],"id":"dcaa60eb-55e3-45a9-8294-5c2038bfb541","title":"🟠【P1】选择模型"},{"parent":"69e13b07bf2d7982","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8529b045-7508-466f-8b6c-954b81334d60","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"03ec8b8a-03fa-4bdd-9836-f4e97db3d9e8","title":"前置：当前 Agent 和系统版本已确认支持此功能；项目甲会话可用，授权有效。"},{"parent":"8529b045-7508-466f-8b6c-954b81334d60","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"654613e9-e592-45f4-ab63-6e18e7389d41","title"