,"id":"585df2b6-149e-4f99-9cbb-e933a0d1776f","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.3 工具能力矩阵 › 浏览器工具（d84d0472）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c4ba9930-b870-435c-9b42-f3139c4f2311","title":"🔴【P0】Agent执行浏览器自动化操作"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"254d03e0-28c3-4302-93d1-4f9d902cb10b","title":"【B-07】/computer use、/browser 与浏览器工具"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"76850d41-6237-4be4-b9be-e080b41c6594","title":"B1 命令（按能力声明执行，不支持的跑反向断言）"},{"parent":"9bb33e50-0811-4f75-99cd-9eba287ea89f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"48a73728-705d-4198-8ae3-80ed016ea51e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a6000c1e-36d2-4498-b854-f55ae5c5f81f","customWidth":520,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44d035db-ec95-464e-8758-25fa8bc23b87","title":"说明：优先级 P0（取源用例最高级）｜部署：全部｜依赖能力：无，所有 Agent 必须具备｜必跑理由：工具映射"},{"parent":"a6000c1e-36d2-4498-b854-f55ae5c5f81f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2b9bc582-44e1-459a-9e53-a1591f0a8b76","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3ad5aae4-8587-4817-95ce-53f737365f58","title":"操作：让 Agent 在项目中查找包含特定关键字的所有文件（如「找出所有调用了 fetchUser 的地方」）"},{"parent":"2b9bc582-44e1-459a-9e53-a1591f0a8b76","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"237cfa7e-45ee-4c17-b6c6-da6d03b855f1","title":"预期：Agent 正确调用文件搜索类工具（grep/find等），返回结果与实际匹配一致，不遗漏不误报"},{"parent":"2b9bc582-44e1-459a-9e53-a1591f0a8b76","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"568c3a7f-dbb4-443a-bf1c-99dae73f0cb8","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.3 工具能力矩阵 › Grep/Glob 检索工具（3511754c）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2b9bc582-44e1-459a-9e53-a1591f0a8b76","title":"🔴【P0】Agent使用文件搜索工具定位代码（grep/find）"},{"parent":"a6000c1e-36d2-4498-b854-f55ae5c5f81f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c82eefed-91e9-447a-a2e7-125fed4f952a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"61fb0056-78a6-4b27-a8f0-e7edeb69b336","title":"操作：让 Agent 查看当前项目的改动状态和具体差异"},{"parent":"c82eefed-91e9-447a-a2e7-125fed4f952a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e5df8c53-b245-42a9-9a0f-492d12bd23c4","title":"预期：返回结果与实际 git status / git diff 输出一致"},{"parent":"c82eefed-91e9-447a-a2e7-125fed4f952a","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"845c8f0e-1c05-4aba-997b-89772835ab02","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.3 工具能力矩阵 › Git 操作（c2abe144）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c82eefed-91e9-447a-a2e7-125fed4f952a","title":"🔴【P0】Agent执行Git状态与差异查看（git status/diff）"},{"parent":"a6000c1e-36d2-4498-b854-f55ae5c5f81f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5adcb81e-6a7c-4196-86cd-ac3aa607c51b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"95f581f0-5160-47cc-bf37-ff3121f1b34c","title":"操作：让 Agent 将改动提交到本地 Git 仓库并生成提交信息"},{"parent":"5adcb81e-6a7c-4196-86cd-ac3aa607c51b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"275e9996-fe9b-4799-bd45-ee3fc7145a1d","title":"预期：提交成功，commit message 合理反映改动内容，可在 git log 中查到"},{"parent":"5adcb81e-6a7c-4196-86cd-ac3aa607c51b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f1271747-0315-4ec1-84d4-a653c0ffafda","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.3 工具能力矩阵 › Git 操作（f0e37b3b）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5adcb81e-6a7c-4196-86cd-ac3aa607c51b","title":"🔴【P0】Agent执行Git提交（git commit）"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a6000c1e-36d2-4498-b854-f55ae5c5f81f","title":"【B-08】检索与 Git 工具"},{"parent":"48a73728-705d-4198-8ae3-80ed016ea51e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"45c34559-e1ad-47d9-8792-666dc5f005ae","customWidth":520,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1a071756-6b59-45c0-ad8d-eaae85743f63","title":"说明：优先级 P0（取源用例最高级）｜部署：全部｜依赖能力：无，所有 Agent 必须具备｜必跑理由：联网工具因 Agent 而异"},{"parent":"45c34559-e1ad-47d9-8792-666dc5f005ae","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"8cc879d5-290c-4db6-8fc9-74de8a15a726","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e78bca12-7f54-4447-bae1-cb80725b5278","title":"操作：在消息中粘贴一个 URL 并让 Agent 基于其内容回答问题"},{"parent":"8cc879d5-290c-4db6-8fc9-74de8a15a726","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"33faaa0f-1715-4719-ba84-25eb7c58bfed","title":"预期：Agent 能获取/理解 URL 指向的内容并据此作答（若不支持网络访问，应明确告知而非编造内容）"},{"parent":"8cc879d5-290c-4db6-8fc9-74de8a15a726","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"59f5f031-aa93-487b-8609-5b3d1b25cb37","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.3 工具能力矩阵 › WebFetch 工具（aeaf8a55）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"8cc879d5-290c-4db6-8fc9-74de8a15a726","title":"🔴【P0】引用URL内容"},{"parent":"45c34559-e1ad-47d9-8792-666dc5f005ae","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7000eb72-6c58-4505-b9a0-1fe8bcb31d36","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a11108ce-5fa7-4378-a4cd-54b0a1f65c4b","title":"操作：下发指令「搜索 xxx 最新信息」"},{"parent":"7000eb72-6c58-4505-b9a0-1fe8bcb31d36","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c5bd62f2-7bea-43bf-bde3-75288f13d2fd","title":"预期：Agent 调用联网搜索工具，返回带来源引用的结果，不编造无来源信息"},{"parent":"7000eb72-6c58-4505-b9a0-1fe8bcb31d36","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e4423447-f613-493f-8ca9-b8d94e2d0876","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.3 工具能力矩阵 › WebSearch 工具（3bad8da3）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7000eb72-6c58-4505-b9a0-1fe8bcb31d36","title":"🔴【P0】Agent联网搜索信息"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"45c34559-e1ad-47d9-8792-666dc5f005ae","title":"【B-09】WebFetch / WebSearch"},{"parent":"48a73728-705d-4198-8ae3-80ed016ea51e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a85714b9-6f7f-4867-abbe-617919dd8d37","customWidth":520,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7ae64e33-ec88-4835-ab37-c90e0ca9348d","title":"说明：优先级 P0（取源用例最高级）｜部署：全部｜依赖能力：无，所有 Agent 必须具备｜必跑理由：工具映射"},{"parent":"a85714b9-6f7f-4867-abbe-617919dd8d37","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5b9521a2-6def-4d7e-90eb-4faba9ba7467","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1ceac306-6e92-456c-9c10-40687171a03e","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行 npm install / pip install 安装项目依赖"},{"parent":"5b9521a2-6def-4d7e-90eb-4faba9ba7467","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"05a9c6c4-00d5-467f-9d17-bbd5c9cd4e9e","title":"预期：Agent 正确选择包管理器工具并执行，安装结果（成功/失败、新增依赖版本）在对话中如实反馈"},{"parent":"5b9521a2-6def-4d7e-90eb-4faba9ba7467","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"42d99473-917e-44c9-8674-9f5dee415f36","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.3 工具能力矩阵 › 包管理器操作（de88695d）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5b9521a2-6def-4d7e-90eb-4faba9ba7467","title":"🔴【P0】Agent执行包管理器命令"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a85714b9-6f7f-4867-abbe-617919dd8d37","title":"【B-10】包管理器命令"},{"parent":"48a73728-705d-4198-8ae3-80ed016ea51e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"a6615936-16b1-437c-85af-b84ede7e9155","customWidth":520,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d3dfc7b3-fd5d-44b4-9424-2621f870be87","title":"说明：优先级 P1（取源用例最高级）｜部署：全部｜依赖能力：AskUserQuestion｜必跑理由：交互事件接入"},{"parent":"a6615936-16b1-437c-85af-b84ede7e9155","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b2f32fc7-30df-4f35-870e-7e3738019cb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1200afdf-e558-4c28-9c03-cb1a2bdb36ee","title":"前置：前置：会话可正常执行；角色：房间成员；入口：Agent GUI 会话详情"},{"parent":"b2f32fc7-30df-4f35-870e-7e3738019cb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5a7c5164-b51f-4403-9fe7-a5d1e30dea06","title":"操作：在 GUI 内触发提问并作答"},{"parent":"b2f32fc7-30df-4f35-870e-7e3738019cb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f7b3cbff-b881-4321-9af5-6cf5fa28fccc","title":"预期：问题卡片在会话详情中展示并可作答；答案被正确的 Agent 接收并继续执行；调用详情中展示用户选择的选项"},{"parent":"b2f32fc7-30df-4f35-870e-7e3738019cb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ca6e13db-89a9-4f3d-8679-6ce6af65284d","title":"备注：附件3 CC-010"},{"parent":"b2f32fc7-30df-4f35-870e-7e3738019cb7","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2f6fe805-ca44-454d-adb1-f2d40f1c38d4","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.3 工具能力矩阵 › AskUserQuestion 工具（989a7e5b）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b2f32fc7-30df-4f35-870e-7e3738019cb7","title":"🟠【P1】在 Agent GUI 内作答"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"a6615936-16b1-437c-85af-b84ede7e9155","title":"【B-11】AskUserQuestion 作答"},{"parent":"48a73728-705d-4198-8ae3-80ed016ea51e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"791ed158-c9cf-43ef-9e5f-986064221e9f","customWidth":520,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"19890fba-e64a-4c68-91a9-0a36f3206cd0","title":"说明：优先级 P0（取源用例最高级）｜部署：全部｜依赖能力：无，所有 Agent 必须具备｜必跑理由：多步事件顺序"},{"parent":"791ed158-c9cf-43ef-9e5f-986064221e9f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f5e59afb-db70-46eb-8be5-800556d07801","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"27e8a52b-6586-4e90-b1d8-0b625358eb90","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行「先搜索再写入结果文件」这类需要多个工具按顺序配合的任务"},{"parent":"f5e59afb-db70-46eb-8be5-800556d07801","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6171bdf9-d2b6-40a7-8d49-cd40fae226bb","title":"预期：工具调用顺序符合任务逻辑（先搜索后写入），不出现空写入或搜索结果丢失"},{"parent":"f5e59afb-db70-46eb-8be5-800556d07801","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7bfa231c-311e-4792-9acc-e3695e768d42","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.2 工具调用通用规则 › 工具链式调用（ea512bb3）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f5e59afb-db70-46eb-8be5-800556d07801","title":"🔴【P0】多工具链式调用顺序合理"},{"parent":"791ed158-c9cf-43ef-9e5f-986064221e9f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"482808ff-56fd-4f3f-850a-55979916ed9f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"76412253-427a-48ca-b225-551d7c3af5cf","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个需要明确参数的工具调用（如指定路径的文件搜索、指定分支的 Git 操作）"},{"parent":"482808ff-56fd-4f3f-850a-55979916ed9f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b2fc0204-f723-4dcc-b2c1-db40376d1985","title":"预期：工具调用参数与用户意图一致，无路径/分支等参数误填"},{"parent":"482808ff-56fd-4f3f-850a-55979916ed9f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9100a326-e2be-43cd-b151-7de41c68a8a7","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.2 工具调用通用规则 › 工具选择与参数生成（0f282587）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"482808ff-56fd-4f3f-850a-55979916ed9f","title":"🔴【P0】工具调用参数生成正确"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"791ed158-c9cf-43ef-9e5f-986064221e9f","title":"【B-12】工具链式调用与参数生成"},{"parent":"48a73728-705d-4198-8ae3-80ed016ea51e","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"06d52ed9-8969-4a8f-85ed-649ba07a7384","customWidth":520,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8d17a94d-b742-4c22-8c1e-222462a30db1","title":"说明：优先级 P0（取源用例最高级）｜部署：全部｜依赖能力：子 Agent｜必跑理由：子 Agent 事件嵌套展示"},{"parent":"06d52ed9-8969-4a8f-85ed-649ba07a7384","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"2e496eca-096a-4c4e-9e99-98e085c8cf1e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"15407ad1-43c7-4372-abf6-433f6ca8a423","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个适合拆解的复合任务（如「搜索项目里所有涉及支付逻辑的文件并总结」），观察是否派生内部子代理处理子任务"},{"parent":"2e496eca-096a-4c4e-9e99-98e085c8cf1e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1cd43407-7690-4383-bf25-c17954a73ee8","title":"预期：主Agent能将子任务委派给内部子Agent（如 Claude Code 的 Task/通用子代理机制）执行，过程对用户可感知或有相应提示，不是主Agent独自逐步手动完成；子 Agent 在任务结束后状态收敛为已完成或失败；不长时间停留在未完成；失败时给出原因并可重试"},{"parent":"2e496eca-096a-4c4e-9e99-98e085c8cf1e","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f00aa60b-8377-4aa9-a83f-87a9bf4f2ff7","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.8 子 Agent 派发 › 子 Agent 派发与结果汇总（33c89605）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"2e496eca-096a-4c4e-9e99-98e085c8cf1e","title":"🔴【P0】Agent派发内部子任务给子Agent执行"},{"parent":"06d52ed9-8969-4a8f-85ed-649ba07a7384","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"96e37309-09f6-475b-8c93-0a291dc93682","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a047d7ec-241a-49ed-a875-076f248e2d18","title":"操作：子Agent完成子任务后，观察主Agent如何呈现结果"},{"parent":"96e37309-09f6-475b-8c93-0a291dc93682","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b5458d50-11eb-47b4-88d9-18470893e578","title":"预期：子Agent的执行结果被主Agent正确汇总、引用或据此继续后续步骤，不丢失子任务产出"},{"parent":"96e37309-09f6-475b-8c93-0a291dc93682","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f381a831-1d04-4478-982a-f9dea0404397","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.8 子 Agent 派发 › 子 Agent 派发与结果汇总（6bec9e3f）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"96e37309-09f6-475b-8c93-0a291dc93682","title":"🔴【P0】子Agent执行结果正确汇总回主对话"},{"parent":"06d52ed9-8969-4a8f-85ed-649ba07a7384","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"330fc94f-880f-41ff-9bb5-0de5152c4eff","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"7e14a6f6-33bc-4b3f-8ff1-331885955e5f","title":"操作：触发一个会派生子Agent执行的任务（尤其涉及写入/执行类子任务）"},{"parent":"330fc94f-880f-41ff-9bb5-0de5152c4eff","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0bf3a4be-b6db-4e1e-b7df-01af35c4069d","title":"预期：派发子Agent执行写入/执行类操作时，仍遵循当前会话的权限模式（如需询问则询问），不会因为是「子Agent」身份而绕过权限确认"},{"parent":"330fc94f-880f-41ff-9bb5-0de5152c4eff","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fc5c6049-0a97-414f-b4d3-e9724f5a70e2","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.8 子 Agent 派发 › 子 Agent 派发与结果汇总（02c85d1e）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"330fc94f-880f-41ff-9bb5-0de5152c4eff","title":"🔴【P0】派发子Agent前的确认/授权提示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"06d52ed9-8969-4a8f-85ed-649ba07a7384","title":"【B-13】子 Agent 派发、授权与汇总"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"48a73728-705d-4198-8ae3-80ed016ea51e","title":"B2 工具与子 Agent"},{"parent":"9bb33e50-0811-4f75-99cd-9eba287ea89f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6c6f9fe7-53f3-401b-8ac7-2bcb084f8b71","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"3394ae53-4bd7-48fd-a3d8-01c318a2952b","customWidth":520,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c1cb98d8-0930-467d-b774-536d29d0d327","title":"说明：优先级 P0（取源用例最高级）｜部署：全部｜依赖能力：无，所有 Agent 必须具备｜必跑理由：超时与心跳按 Agent 调"},{"parent":"3394ae53-4bd7-48fd-a3d8-01c318a2952b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"7df9d572-bd58-4fa6-aaa7-3dc112b69dd8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2ea022e8-c184-4613-975c-5e0c06a6e285","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行一个耗时接近但未超过系统设定超时阈值的任务"},{"parent":"7df9d572-bd58-4fa6-aaa7-3dc112b69dd8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6b7aa57b-bfc2-43d8-801b-579ed1c8efde","title":"预期：任务正常执行完成，不被误判超时提前中断（与「异常场景-任务超时」互为正反验证）"},{"parent":"7df9d572-bd58-4fa6-aaa7-3dc112b69dd8","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"edd8ab95-969e-4f69-a901-c7d6e3af7843","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.1 任务执行与代码生成 › 任务执行流程（c380ce3f）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"7df9d572-bd58-4fa6-aaa7-3dc112b69dd8","title":"🔴【P0】长时间任务在超时阈值内正常完成"},{"parent":"3394ae53-4bd7-48fd-a3d8-01c318a2952b","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"c5484424-94ba-4f61-8354-8c015f731f95","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"536e9cd1-8064-461a-bf14-08865927a8b0","title":"操作：让 Agent 执行多步骤任务"},{"parent":"c5484424-94ba-4f61-8354-8c015f731f95","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b485e073-e04c-4d8c-b5ba-d0a56b4f526d","title":"预期：消息区持续展示阶段性进度，不长时间无反馈"},{"parent":"c5484424-94ba-4f61-8354-8c015f731f95","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"65162adb-123b-4ab8-ad4d-ec9c49afc024","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.1 任务执行与代码生成 › 任务执行流程（a95d54b6）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c5484424-94ba-4f61-8354-8c015f731f95","title":"🔴【P0】长任务进度展示"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"3394ae53-4bd7-48fd-a3d8-01c318a2952b","title":"【B-14】长任务进度与超时阈值内完成"},{"parent":"6c6f9fe7-53f3-401b-8ac7-2bcb084f8b71","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"1d4b739a-f721-4672-8f01-45c46688b3cf","customWidth":520,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3affe87d-d94e-434a-ab2f-ce02450594e6","title":"说明：优先级 P0（取源用例最高级）｜部署：全部｜依赖能力：无，所有 Agent 必须具备｜必跑理由：异常收敛"},{"parent":"1d4b739a-f721-4672-8f01-45c46688b3cf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e7d61d01-88c0-4652-b08a-d3ff64dac462","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"d6d6651a-0b8e-41ac-b6d1-e96c26a92054","title":"操作：运行中暂停任务后点击重试"},{"parent":"e7d61d01-88c0-4652-b08a-d3ff64dac462","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dde73547-3cbc-41e9-8e08-042468130314","title":"预期：重试从明确状态开始，不重复破坏性操作"},{"parent":"e7d61d01-88c0-4652-b08a-d3ff64dac462","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5fe25323-2604-4593-ac97-0521adfaee05","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.1 任务执行与代码生成 › 任务执行流程（bf2bafc6）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e7d61d01-88c0-4652-b08a-d3ff64dac462","title":"🔴【P0】任务中断后重试"},{"parent":"1d4b739a-f721-4672-8f01-45c46688b3cf","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"50641e8e-f1e8-44a0-a073-3045942c5caf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"558bd55a-817a-441c-80b0-43673f6935b6","title":"前置：前置：Agent 已登录且环境正常；角色：房间成员；入口：新建会话与已有会话"},{"parent":"50641e8e-f1e8-44a0-a073-3045942c5caf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b91f263c-ee17-4516-9ac3-1da9b17ae47b","title":"操作：在新建房间、新建会话与 @ 自己的 Agent 三种情形下各发送一条消息"},{"parent":"50641e8e-f1e8-44a0-a073-3045942c5caf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4893b4f7-78ae-419b-827b-81fcf086a243","title":"预期：三种情形均能在合理时间内收到回复；不出现长时间无响应后提示消息未能发送或 something went wrong；失败时给出具体环节与重试入口"},{"parent":"50641e8e-f1e8-44a0-a073-3045942c5caf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4e2a799c-5b71-4606-a9b0-7c39a1c3e3a9","title":"备注：#15 #254 #277 #322 #323 #367 #374"},{"parent":"50641e8e-f1e8-44a0-a073-3045942c5caf","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f082e8a2-901b-41af-800b-e1fe7d29a31e","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.1 任务执行与代码生成 › 任务执行流程（4997246c）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"50641e8e-f1e8-44a0-a073-3045942c5caf","title":"🔴【P0】消息发送后长时间无回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1d4b739a-f721-4672-8f01-45c46688b3cf","title":"【B-15】中断后重试与长时间无回复"},{"parent":"6c6f9fe7-53f3-401b-8ac7-2bcb084f8b71","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"70280873-41e4-49ec-a51b-fd9a0d6d3698","customWidth":520,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"6d2a78e7-7abc-4f86-af2f-7f4c1ea82a3f","title":"说明：优先级 P0（取源用例最高级）｜部署：全部｜依赖能力：无，所有 Agent 必须具备｜必跑理由：各 Agent 上限不同"},{"parent":"70280873-41e4-49ec-a51b-fd9a0d6d3698","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"b4b81741-3877-4c52-a45d-deae9cb8e88d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c754a73-6195-4e68-9f52-002446b7f970","title":"操作：进行超长对话直到接近/超出上下文窗口上限"},{"parent":"b4b81741-3877-4c52-a45d-deae9cb8e88d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"1646943a-1aa5-4cbe-bf5c-bbfda4490d43","title":"预期：应用有合理降级策略（如提示需要新会话/自动摘要旧上下文），不静默丢失关键信息导致答非所问"},{"parent":"b4b81741-3877-4c52-a45d-deae9cb8e88d","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"fa34f48b-f6fd-4cf0-9cfb-9cc70c905f9c","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › Agent 执行能力 › 5.7 上下文保持与压缩 › 多轮上下文保持（6949e902）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"b4b81741-3877-4c52-a45d-deae9cb8e88d","title":"🔴【P0】上下文窗口溢出后的降级处理"},{"parent":"70280873-41e4-49ec-a51b-fd9a0d6d3698","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"4e12d4a0-70c2-4214-b08c-8e3fd0ae5e4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e611afe3-9e5c-4fd8-b85f-0ee450cea12f","title":"操作：上下文用量已达当前模型上限时继续发送消息"},{"parent":"4e12d4a0-70c2-4214-b08c-8e3fd0ae5e4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"b774ce92-288a-432a-96dc-84e1fc0fba86","title":"预期：明确提示已达上下文上限并给出处理建议（如新建会话/压缩上下文），不静默截断或报错崩溃"},{"parent":"4e12d4a0-70c2-4214-b08c-8e3fd0ae5e4b","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ad70eca6-130c-4fb3-a8bf-a746cee35165","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › 模型、用量与上下文额度 › 上下文用量 › 上下文用量展示（edabbdf1）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"4e12d4a0-70c2-4214-b08c-8e3fd0ae5e4b","title":"🟠【P1】用量超出上限不可继续对话"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"70280873-41e4-49ec-a51b-fd9a0d6d3698","title":"【B-16】上下文溢出降级与用量超限"},{"parent":"6c6f9fe7-53f3-401b-8ac7-2bcb084f8b71","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"882d4fe0-92de-40f6-b111-c36cd9e0187f","customWidth":520,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0a2ecfd6-1d62-4948-be6b-375a4790e771","title":"说明：优先级 P1（取源用例最高级）｜部署：仅本地｜依赖能力：无，所有 Agent 必须具备｜必跑理由：本地进程恢复"},{"parent":"882d4fe0-92de-40f6-b111-c36cd9e0187f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"83b4bdc0-c08e-4073-854e-4a51ce6ce5a3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"33f84550-fe7e-4505-ba8a-8c21b0cca6e1","title":"前置：Agent 正在运行任务；角色：房间成员；入口：系统强制退出应用"},{"parent":"83b4bdc0-c08e-4073-854e-4a51ce6ce5a3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"045af484-75ad-43e4-9640-5aaa83e0ac20","title":"操作：在运行中强制关闭应用，重新打开应用并进入房间查看该会话"},{"parent":"83b4bdc0-c08e-4073-854e-4a51ce6ce5a3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0f294793-60e6-4a09-b862-d84a163272f4","title":"预期：应用关闭且 Agent 终止，会话存入历史；重新打开后会话状态显示已完成或已中断；对该会话继续发消息可正常收到回复"},{"parent":"83b4bdc0-c08e-4073-854e-4a51ce6ce5a3","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ab62690b-0e87-46f3-9ca3-d815167b9ef1","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › 会话与消息交互 › 会话状态与标题 › 会话中断与恢复（552d5cc7）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"83b4bdc0-c08e-4073-854e-4a51ce6ce5a3","title":"🟠【P1】运行中强制关闭应用"},{"parent":"882d4fe0-92de-40f6-b111-c36cd9e0187f","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"5093dae9-4b1d-44cc-8ff7-f51fe2f652e4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"caf42044-dcb0-4463-b271-96a51c1e53f3","title":"前置：房间内有任务正在运行；角色：房间成员；入口：重启后重新进入房间"},{"parent":"5093dae9-4b1d-44cc-8ff7-f51fe2f652e4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"73b488bf-a784-44f3-a2b2-930fd9cbe3e3","title":"操作：在任务运行时重启电脑，重新进入房间后分别给被中断的会话与其他历史会话发送消息"},{"parent":"5093dae9-4b1d-44cc-8ff7-f51fe2f652e4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dd20fdc2-db36-461b-8c7d-82becdc8b72d","title":"预期：两类会话均能正常发送并收到回复；被中断会话的状态收敛为已中断或已完成，不长期停留在运行中"},{"parent":"5093dae9-4b1d-44cc-8ff7-f51fe2f652e4","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"3c559db6-0467-4469-8578-9fa061c8c8cf","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › 会话与消息交互 › 会话状态与标题 › 会话中断与恢复（654f4992）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"5093dae9-4b1d-44cc-8ff7-f51fe2f652e4","title":"🟠【P1】任务运行时重启电脑"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"882d4fe0-92de-40f6-b111-c36cd9e0187f","title":"【B-17】运行中强制关闭应用 / 重启电脑后恢复"},{"parent":"6c6f9fe7-53f3-401b-8ac7-2bcb084f8b71","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"25cd57ff-9ed2-48dd-9cbb-47cc5c358c69","customWidth":520,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c60bdbb2-8134-4c45-b50b-ba574f18a3bd","title":"说明：优先级 P1（取源用例最高级）｜部署：仅本地｜依赖能力：无，所有 Agent 必须具备｜必跑理由：本地进程异常"},{"parent":"25cd57ff-9ed2-48dd-9cbb-47cc5c358c69","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"684783a7-1135-4c79-935f-7ab57a94bb16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"64f0803a-5aa5-4f86-9852-0b0047a0efa1","title":"前置：Agent 正在执行任务，执行者设备断开或进程异常退出"},{"parent":"684783a7-1135-4c79-935f-7ab57a94bb16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"92ef5521-f4c0-4e2f-a17f-24077e90d8ab","title":"操作：观察排队区及当前 Turn 状态"},{"parent":"684783a7-1135-4c79-935f-7ab57a94bb16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8f33992b-3dbe-4215-abd6-a7d9cb148973","title":"预期：当前 Turn 状态可收敛为异常中断或待恢复；排队消息不丢失、不自动重复发送；所有成员看到异常原因<br>"},{"parent":"684783a7-1135-4c79-935f-7ab57a94bb16","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a0ea93a7-e320-4303-85ab-1fee24752766","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › 会话与消息交互 › 消息排队与取消 › 运行中追加消息排队（917a6b79）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"684783a7-1135-4c79-935f-7ab57a94bb16","title":"🟠【P1】执行者设备异常退出"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"25cd57ff-9ed2-48dd-9cbb-47cc5c358c69","title":"【B-18】执行者设备异常退出时的排队消息"},{"parent":"6c6f9fe7-53f3-401b-8ac7-2bcb084f8b71","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0a625003-6958-4af9-8ac6-e269792b45fd","customWidth":520,"callout":[],"children":[],"id":"23d15d7e-1b6a-431c-aa5e-ae1d58f7e30c","title":"说明：优先级 P0（取源用例最高级）｜部署：全部｜依赖能力：无，所有 Agent 必须具备｜必跑理由：中止信号与权限"},{"parent":"0a625003-6958-4af9-8ac6-e269792b45fd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"88817d55-cb89-4944-ab3e-c837341e52dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5c728582-7beb-40b6-86fe-c7a1f5e3b3d4","title":"前置：正在执行的 Turn 用的是我的 Agent，会话由他人创建、Turn 也由他人发起；角色：Executor owner；入口：停止按钮"},{"parent":"88817d55-cb89-4944-ab3e-c837341e52dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"dabfb3be-0c07-4bcc-a72d-72aa127cd79e","title":"操作：点击停止"},{"parent":"88817d55-cb89-4944-ab3e-c837341e52dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a51f3e4e-50a5-4780-8a03-822f7f5ddbb9","title":"预期：<br>1) 权限授权 ｜ 允许中止，作为执行资源拥有者的 kill switch<br>2) 会话状态 ｜ 任务在我的设备上被终止，不遗留后台进程，中止来源记录为中止用户"},{"parent":"88817d55-cb89-4944-ab3e-c837341e52dc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4c09c8ba-52e2-4dc3-8f7c-4a256ad1d3e2","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › 会话与消息交互 › 消息排队与取消 › 中止权限（1ba8d9c0）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"88817d55-cb89-4944-ab3e-c837341e52dc","title":"🔴【P0】Agent 的拥有者中止"},{"parent":"0a625003-6958-4af9-8ac6-e269792b45fd","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"0dc0bc68-bf9d-48e9-aac0-f58070365c11","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"05a1fd48-f14a-4636-8cd7-89cc8e644ba4","title":"前置：我发起了一个正在执行的 Turn；角色：Turn caller；入口：停止按钮"},{"parent":"0dc0bc68-bf9d-48e9-aac0-f58070365c11","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"2018a8dc-8d40-48c5-920d-5036d4962ddb","title":"操作：点击停止"},{"parent":"0dc0bc68-bf9d-48e9-aac0-f58070365c11","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"a2edb74b-b251-4d10-9474-9000f4ee7fef","title":"预期：<br>1) 权限授权 ｜ 允许中止<br>2) 会话状态 ｜ 该 Turn 收敛为已中断，中止来源记录为发起人本人"},{"parent":"0dc0bc68-bf9d-48e9-aac0-f58070365c11","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ce0f601b-54f2-4481-a78e-6b1b0301c53d","title":"备注：源用例：房间 › 最终Agent GUI - 2 › 中间区域 › 会话与消息交互 › 消息排队与取消 › 中止权限（6cae2536）。本条为执行用副本，源用例改动时须同步修改"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0dc0bc68-bf9d-48e9-aac0-f58070365c11","title":"🔴【P0】Turn 发起人中止自己的 Turn"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"0a625003-6958-4af9-8ac6-e269792b45fd","title":"【B-19】Agent 拥有者与 Turn 发起人中止"}],"collapsed":true