uddy 桌面已登录且 token 为明文；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：WorkBuddy 的模型来源弹窗"},{"parent":"6d8e8a4b-f257-4cf0-9cc3-476c6a041ed9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"ea40c77b-8c02-4170-89a4-6c077418dc81","title":"操作：授权借用后发一轮"},{"parent":"6d8e8a4b-f257-4cf0-9cc3-476c6a041ed9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"0bee6355-26cb-4af8-9e37-ceb1c183633a","title":"预期：\n1) 结果回传 ｜ 正常回复"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6d8e8a4b-f257-4cf0-9cc3-476c6a041ed9","title":"🟠【P1】WorkBuddy 桌面明文 token 可借用"}],"id":"7a74c85c-8777-47cd-b513-a2c2252a36b2","title":"正常场景"},{"parent":"9b09e720-ecaa-4682-9ee5-b3f1369055ae","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6d1bb6f9-470e-4181-8b45-a7b994863cb6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"e69f6833-b6be-42f3-aca9-fed1b51cc64f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"5c2c502d-71c9-43a2-a177-d287a6234ea9","title":"前置：「模型路由」已打开；Codex 运行在隔离的空 Home；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"e69f6833-b6be-42f3-aca9-fed1b51cc64f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"f8703c69-19e1-41d2-a60d-96262e7c6d23","title":"操作：让配置指向网关自身、再制造歧义配置，各发一轮"},{"parent":"e69f6833-b6be-42f3-aca9-fed1b51cc64f","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"9d9ad85f-daea-44ce-81ee-d24497563fa2","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 明确失败"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"e69f6833-b6be-42f3-aca9-fed1b51cc64f","title":"🟡【P2】本机配置指向网关自身或有歧义"},{"parent":"6d1bb6f9-470e-4181-8b45-a7b994863cb6","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6e4c55ef-bae5-4920-9e97-98284bf4c1bc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"bcc3e660-5556-45f7-88f0-6351ad031e46","title":"前置：「模型路由」已打开；本机 WorkBuddy 的 token 已加密；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：WorkBuddy 的模型来源弹窗"},{"parent":"6e4c55ef-bae5-4920-9e97-98284bf4c1bc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"62680559-f450-49b7-985c-95a467eecebb","title":"操作：尝试借用"},{"parent":"6e4c55ef-bae5-4920-9e97-98284bf4c1bc","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"c11e7fd6-7f2e-48e4-9206-b85a3f60747c","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 明确拒绝并给出浏览器登录路径"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6e4c55ef-bae5-4920-9e97-98284bf4c1bc","title":"🟡【P2】WorkBuddy 加密 token 拒绝借用"}],"id":"6d1bb6f9-470e-4181-8b45-a7b994863cb6","title":"异常场景"},{"parent