-53d5cf3a1dd6","title":"预期：\n1) 提示文案 ｜ 每类错误都有对应卡片，说明哪个来源、原因与处理办法，不只写「请求失败」"},{"parent":"1b5cbcf4-007b-4375-b902-a968f4da0810","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"4c2113f9-ed02-422f-b8de-c04476dd6861","title":"备注：PRD 列为 M5 主链路，执行主链路时一并跑"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"1b5cbcf4-007b-4375-b902-a968f4da0810","title":"🟡【P2】错误卡片说明谁、为什么、怎么办"}],"id":"babc88d8-faa1-472f-915b-95e4520a6adf","title":"异常场景"}],"id":"f298483f-eb7f-4750-a695-b5329fa8f467","title":"解释与观测"},{"parent":"c5287df9-439a-472a-98a6-6ca05611f6ad","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"16bd7b84-8a69-4987-a2cf-497b17e228b2","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"73d66176-a3b6-4e86-bb52-545e03abce9d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"6a36ccbb-ed6e-4b42-b040-f67c9deaf4a9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"75da1cab-5f5f-4712-af3b-b634d3eb1ce3","title":"前置：「模型路由」已打开；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"6a36ccbb-ed6e-4b42-b040-f67c9deaf4a9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"44f12bd7-2419-48f9-9369-945ae40c19ba","title":"操作：同一 Agent 分别选 Responses、Chat Completions、Anthropic Messages 协议的上游，各测流式与非流式"},{"parent":"6a36ccbb-ed6e-4b42-b040-f67c9deaf4a9","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"e44cbe02-a3c0-463e-9aa8-4574818b18e7","title":"预期：\n1) 结果回传 ｜ 回答、结束原因、错误与用量语义正确\n2) 结果校验 ｜ 同协议原样转发，跨协议经转换，加密推理内容保留"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"6a36ccbb-ed6e-4b42-b040-f67c9deaf4a9","title":"🔴【P0】经网关调用不同协议的上游"},{"parent":"73d66176-a3b6-4e86-bb52-545e03abce9d","callout":[],"children":[{"parent":"f87e1949-89a3-43c2-89aa-2ecbff06ba23","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"863cdf4e-ea50-4dec-9b58-d4c77448914c","title":"前置：「模型路由」已打开；角色：Agent 所有者；入口：房间会话输入框"},{"parent":"f87e1949-89a3-43c2-89aa-2ecbff06ba23","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"facc9400-7c18-4a62-99c4-98325e6ab0c9","title":"操作：让 Agent 并行调用多个工具，其中一个失败"},{"parent":"f87e1949-89a3-43c2-89aa-2ecbff06ba23","callout":[],"children":[],"id":"8377c781-8df4-4840-9913-8ba47514a6b9","title":"预期：\n1) 结果校验 ｜ 调用 id、名称、参数、事件顺序与结果归属正确\n2) 消息渲染 ｜ 失败不会中途变成成功"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f87e1949-89a3-43c2-89aa-2ecbff06ba23","title